(7133, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco VKII-220 VariKwik High Speed Countertop Convection Oven, 220v\\/1ph123\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"cadco-vkii-220-varikwik-high-speed-countertop-convection-oven-220v1ph\",\"slug_id\":\"2829\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco VKII-220 VariKwik High Speed Countertop Convection Oven is engineered for rapid cooking and versatile food preparation in commercial kitchens. With its innovative combination of conduction, convection, and infrared heating technologies, this oven can significantly reduce cooking times while delivering consistent results. Its spacious cooking chamber, measuring 14 3\\/4 inches wide, 14 1\\/4 inches deep, and 7 1\\/2 inches high, allows for various culinary applications, from baking to broiling. The independent door design ensures easy access and efficient operation, making it an excellent choice for busy food service environments. Built with a robust stainless steel construction, the VKII-220 not only looks sleek but is also durable and easy to maintain.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<h2><strong>Key Features<\\/strong><\\/h2><ul><li>High Speed Cooking: Utilizes conduction, convection, and infrared heating.<\\/li><li>Spacious Cooking Chamber: Measures 14 3\\/4\\\"\\\" W x 14 1\\/4\\\"\\\" D x 7 1\\/2\\\"\\\" H.<\\/li><li>Independent Door Design: Facilitates easy access and operation.<\\/li><li>Powerful Output: 4,200 watts for efficient cooking performance.<\\/li><li>Stainless Steel Construction: Ensures durability and ease of cleaning.<\\/li><li>Energy Efficient: Operates on 220V, 60 Hz, 1-phase electrical supply.<\\/li><li>Compact Footprint: Overall dimensions of 23 1\\/4\\\"\\\" W x 26 3\\/4\\\"\\\" D x 12 1\\/2\\\"\\\" H.<\\/li><li>CrisPlate Size: Fits a 14\\\"\\\" W x 14\\\"\\\" D cooking surface.<\\/li><li>One-Year Warranty: Covers parts and labor for peace of mind.<\\/li><li>NEMA 5-15P Plug: Standard plug type for easy connection.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"