(7148, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Midea 1034N0A 21.75\\\"  Commercial Microwave Oven with Dial Control, Stainless Steel, 120v\\/1ph, 1000W, 1.2 cu. ft.\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-12\",\"slug_id\":\"2858\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Midea 1034N0A 21.75\\\" Stainless Steel Commercial Microwave Oven offers a robust 1.2 cu. ft. capacity, making it ideal for high-volume use in commercial kitchens. Powered by 1,000 watts, it operates on 120 volts and features a user-friendly dial control for precise cooking. With a compact footprint of 21.75\\\" in width, 13.5\\\" in height, and 19.25\\\" in depth, this microwave is designed to fit into tight spaces while providing efficient heating. Weighing 45.6 lbs, it combines durability with convenience and is backed by certifications, including a 5-15P plug, ensuring safe and reliable performance.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>5-15P: This microwave is UL and ETL certified, ensuring it meets commercial safety and performance standards.<br>Interior Space of 1.2 cu. ft.: Offers ample interior space for heating large plates, meals, or multiple items at once.<br>120 Volts: Designed to work with standard household voltage for ease of use in most commercial environments.<br>1,000 Watts: Provides powerful and efficient heating, suitable for most food preparation tasks in a fast-paced setting.<br>Width: The width of 21.75 inches makes it compact and suitable for tight kitchen spaces.<br>Height: The height of 13.5 inches provides easy placement on countertops or within kitchen shelving.<br>Depth: The compact depth of 19.25 inches for space efficiency while still providing adequate interior space.<br>Weight: The lightweight of 45.6 lbs makes it for easy installation and movement within a commercial setting.<br>Stainless Steel Exterior: Built with durable, easy-to-clean stainless steel, providing a sleek, professional appearance while withstanding high-volume commercial use.<br>Dial Control: Traditional dial control provides simple, mechanical operation for precise cooking settings.<br>Even Heating: This microwave is designed to provide consistent and even heat distribution for reliable cooking performance.<br>Quick Start: The 1000-watt power ensures fast heating, reducing wait times in a busy kitchen environment.<br>Space-Saving Design: Ideal for compact kitchens or counters, offering the benefits of large-scale cooking capacity without taking up too much space.<br>Stainless Steel Interior: Offers a non-porous, easy-to-clean surface, reducing food residue buildup and simplifying regular maintenance.<br>Durable Construction: Designed for heavy-duty use, the microwave can withstand the demands of a commercial kitchen.<br>Commercial Use: Suitable for restaurants, cafes, or food service operations needing a durable, efficient, and easy-to-use microwave for heating a variety of dishes.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>1 Year Limited Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/admin.horecastore.sa\\/storage\\/products\\/1034N0A.jpg\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"1034N0A\",\"price\":\"483.21\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":null,\"margin\":\"100.00%\",\"product_id\":\"1730\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"product_quantity\":null,\"discount\":null,\"price_after_discount\":null,\"margin\":null,\"discount_from_date\":null,\"discount_to_date\":null},{\"product_quantity\":null,\"discount\":null,\"price_after_discount\":null,\"margin\":null,\"discount_from_date\":null,\"discount_to_date\":null}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"46\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"19\",\"height\":\"14\",\"width\":\"22\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0\",\"shipping_depth\":\"19