(8030, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Atosa SBB48GRAUS1 48\\\" Shallow Depth Back Bar Cooler 11.5 Cu.Ft\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-27\",\"slug_id\":\"2873\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>&nbsp;<br>The Atosa SBB48GRAUS1 48\\\" Shallow Depth Back Bar Cooler is tailored for commercial environments requiring efficient beverage storage and display. Its design prioritizes functionality and space-saving features, making it ideal for bars, restaurants, or anywhere that requires quick access to chilled drinks without occupying excessive floor space. With a capacity of 11.5 cubic feet, it strikes a balance between compact size and ample storage capacity.<\\/p><p>Constructed with a sturdy stainless steel exterior, the SBB48GRAUS1 is built to withstand the rigors of daily use in busy establishments while ensuring durability and easy maintenance. It features double-pane glass doors that not only provide a clear view of the stored beverages but also offer insulation to maintain consistent cooling temperatures inside. The interior is equipped with adjustable shelves, allowing for flexible organization of different-sized bottles and cans. This ensures efficient use of space and easy customization according to specific storage needs.<\\/p><p>Internally, the cooler utilizes a forced air cooling system, which ensures even distribution of cold air throughout the cabinet. This system helps maintain optimal temperatures for beverages, keeping them refreshingly cold and ready for serving. The digital temperature control panel provides precise temperature management, allowing operators to monitor and adjust settings as needed to ensure beverages are kept at their ideal cooling point. Overall, the Atosa SBB48GRAUS1 combines practical design with reliable performance, making it a valuable asset in any commercial setting where efficient beverage storage is essential.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Designed with a 48-inch width and a shallow depth of 24.5 inches, this back bar cooler maximizes storage capacity in kitchens with limited floor space. This is particularly beneficial for establishments prioritizing increased functionality without sacrificing valuable floor space.<br>Dual glass doors with self-closing mechanisms enable effortless product identification while minimizing unnecessary cooler openings. This significantly reduces cold air loss and helps maintain consistent internal temperatures, optimizing energy efficiency.<br>An electronic temperature control system ensures consistent and precise chilling between 33\\u00b0F and 40\\u00b0F. This safeguards beverage quality and ensures drinks are served at the perfect temperature for optimal customer satisfaction.<br>The Atosa SBB48GRAUS1 features a stainless steel exterior and interior for superior durability and simplified cleaning routines. This material selection promotes long-lasting use and effortless sanitation within the cooler, minimizing downtime and maintenance costs.<br>Bright LED interior lighting offers clear visibility of stored beverages, while four pre-installed, epoxy-coated shelves provide organized and adjustable storage solutions. This design prioritizes both functionality and user experience for efficient beverage management.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":null,\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/SBB48GRAUS1_6db21407-d940-4b8b-bbc1-eabda827b9fd.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"SBB48GRAUS1\",\"price\":\"2108\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"1407\",\"margin\":\"33.25%\",\"product_id\":\"1745\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"45\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"2002.60\",\"margin\":\"29.74\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"46\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"1897.20\",\"margin\":\"25.84\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"150\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"25\",\"height\":\"40\",\"width\":\"48\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0\",\"shipping_height\":\"0\",\"shipping_width\":\"0\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"shipping_weight\":null,\"shipping_weight_option\":\"pounds\",\"titles\":{\"4\":null,\"5\":null},\"variant_color_title\":\"Color\",\"variant_color_value\":null,\"variant_color_products\":null,\"variant_1_title\":null,\"variant_1_value\":null,\"variant_1_products\":null,\"variant_2_title\":null,\"variant_2_value\":null,\"variant_2_products\":null,\"variant_3_title\":null,\"variant_3_value\":null,\"variant_3_products\":null,\"compare_type\":null,\"compare_products\":null,\"faq_schema_config\":[[{\"key\":\"question\",\"value\":null},{\"key\":\"answer\",\"value\":null}]],\"seo_meta\":{\"seo_title\":null,\"seo_description\":null,\"index\":\"noindex\"},\"seo_meta_image\":null,\"language\":\"en_US\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"store_id\":\"8\",\"is_featured\":\"1\",\"categories\":[\"45\",\"46\",\"52\"],\"brand_id\":\"14\",\"product_collections\":[\"1\",\"2\"],\"minimum_order_quantity\":\"1\",\"maximum_order_quantity\":\"0\",\"tag\":null,\"producttypes\":\"[{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Back Bar 23 - 49 Inches\\\"}]\",\"frequently_bought_together\":null,\"variant_requires_shipping\":\"0\",\"refund\":\"non-refundable\",\"google_shopping_category\":null,\"delivery_days\":null,\"google_shopping_mpn\":null,\"box_quantity\":null,\"submitter\":\"apply\"}', 'updated', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chro