(8031, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish AF-ES Energy Star 2-Door Upright Dish Machine with Single Rack Pass-Thru\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-266\",\"slug_id\":\"3112\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The AF-ES Dish Machine embodies a range of standard features tailored to elevate dishwashing efficiency while prioritizing energy savings. As an Energy Star certified appliance, it adheres to stringent energy efficiency guidelines, ensuring reduced energy consumption and operational costs without compromising performance. With a powerful 1 1\\/2 HP pump, this dishwasher delivers robust cleaning power, capable of handling 37 racks per hour, making it suitable for high-volume commercial kitchen environments. Its convertible design offers versatility, seamlessly adapting to different kitchen layouts, while the large door opening and 20 1\\/2-inch door clearance facilitate easy loading and unloading of dishes, enhancing workflow efficiency. Additionally, the dishwasher features a stainless steel air gap and dual screens to protect the pump, ensuring optimal hygiene and prolonging the lifespan of the appliance. Furthermore, the AF-ES Dish Machine prioritizes simplicity and convenience in maintenance and operation. Its large capacity scrap accumulator efficiently collects debris, simplifying cleaning routines and minimizing maintenance downtime. The dishwasher\'s specifications highlight its high performance and reliability, with a 1.5 HP motor ensuring consistent and powerful operation. With water consumption of just .936 gallons per cycle and available cycle times ranging from 90 to 150 seconds, it combines efficiency with versatility to meet various dishwashing needs. The appliance\'s electrical ratings make it compatible with standard 115-volt single-phase power sources, ensuring easy installation and operation. Overall, the AF-ES Dish Machine offers a comprehensive solution for commercial kitchens seeking efficient, reliable, and environmentally conscious dishwashing equipment.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Designed to meet or exceed energy efficiency guidelines set by the Energy Star program, ensuring reduced energy consumption and operational costs. Facilitates efficient loading and unloading of dishes, enhancing workflow in commercial kitchens. Suitable for moderate dishwashing volumes, accommodating a single rack per cycle. Allows for dishes to be loaded from one side and unloaded from the other, streamlining dishwashing processes in busy kitchens. Provides gentle yet effective cleaning, suitable for delicate items and reducing energy usage compared to high-temperature wash cycles.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/011-1090.0000_db537a16-c354-4907-ae02-17af3a89d724.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"011-1090.0000\",\"price\":\"5768.91\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"4542.45\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1984\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"523\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"5480.46\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"524\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"5192.02\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"295\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"39\",\"height\":\"76\",\"width\":\"39\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0\",\"shipping_height\":\"0\",\"shipping_width\":\