(8033, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish AF-ES Energy Star 2-Door Upright Dish Machine with Single Rack Pass-Thru 208V\\/3Ph\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-264\",\"slug_id\":\"3110\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The AF-ES Dish Machine stands out with a comprehensive set of standard features designed to deliver exceptional performance and efficiency in commercial dishwashing operations. Equipped with an Energy Star certification, it ensures significant energy savings while maintaining high cleaning standards, making it an environmentally friendly and cost-effective solution for businesses. With a powerful 1 1\\/2 HP pump, this dishwasher boasts a cleaning capacity of 37 racks per hour, ensuring rapid turnover and smooth operation even during peak hours. Its convertible design adds versatility, allowing seamless integration into different kitchen layouts, while the large door opening and 20 1\\/2-inch door clearance facilitate easy loading and unloading of dishes, optimizing workflow efficiency. Furthermore, the AF-ES Dish Machine prioritizes user convenience and maintenance simplicity. Featuring dual screens to protect the pump and a large capacity scrap accumulator, it efficiently collects debris, simplifying cleaning routines and minimizing maintenance downtime. The dishwasher\'s specifications highlight its high performance and reliability, with a 1.5 HP motor ensuring consistent and powerful operation. Its low water consumption of .936 gallons per cycle and available cycle times ranging from 90 to 150 seconds further contribute to its efficiency and versatility. With electrical ratings compatible with standard 115-volt single-phase power sources, installation and operation are straightforward, making it an ideal choice for commercial kitchens seeking efficient and reliable dishwashing equipment.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Energy Star certification guarantees energy efficiency, reducing operational costs and environmental impact Two-Door design facilitates efficient loading and unloading, optimizing workflow in commercial kitchens. Single rack capacity accommodates a single rack per cycle and is ideal for moderate dishwashing volumes. Pass-Thru configuration streamlines dishwashing processes by allowing loading from one side and unloading from the other. Low-temperature wash with muffler heater ensures gentle yet effective cleaning while maintaining consistent water temperature, optimizing wash performance and sanitation.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/011-1090.0003_0eb76112-05ac-4931-bf3a-8a66bfd74b17.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"011-1090.0003\",\"price\":\"9369.68\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"7377.7\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1982\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"519\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"8901.20\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"520\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"8432.71\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"295\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"39\",\"height\":\"76\",\"width\":\"39\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0\",\"shipping_height\":\"0\",\"shipping_width\":\"0\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"shipping_weight\":null,\"shipping_weight_option\":\"Kg\",\"titles\":