(8042, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish 5-AG-ES Energy-Star Upright Dish Machine with Double Rack\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-245\",\"slug_id\":\"3091\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The 5-AG-ES Dish Machine stands out with its comprehensive set of standard features tailored to meet the demanding needs of commercial dishwashing operations. With a remarkable capability to clean 74 racks per hour, this dishwasher ensures swift throughput, making it a perfect fit for high-volume establishments. Its water consumption of less than 1 gallon per rack strikes a balance between effective cleaning and resource conservation, contributing to operational efficiency and environmental sustainability. The generous door clearance of 20 1\\/2 inches facilitates seamless loading and unloading of dishes, enhancing workflow efficiency during peak service hours. Equipped with top mount controls featuring auto start functionality, the dishwasher offers user-friendly operation, while the stainless steel air gap and quick-release spray arms ensure durability and easy maintenance, providing reliable performance over the long term. A standout feature of the 5-AG-ES Dish Machine is its Double Duty Model, designed to double production capability and accommodate the diverse needs of commercial kitchens. With two powerful 1 HP pumps, this dishwasher delivers sparkling results with every cycle, ensuring thorough and efficient cleaning of dishware. The inclusion of a dual-screen system protects pumps and wash arms, prolonging the lifespan of critical components and reducing maintenance requirements. Moreover, the presence of a delime switch located in the control panel facilitates easy maintenance and upkeep, ensuring optimal performance over time. Detailed specifications, including motor horsepower, water consumption rates, and available cycle times, provide users with comprehensive insights into the machine\'s capabilities, ensuring informed decision-making and optimal performance in demanding kitchen environments. With its robust construction, versatile features, and efficient performance, the 5-AG-ES Dish Machine stands as a reliable and adaptable solution for commercial dishwashing needs.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>This dishwasher is Energy Star certified, ensuring energy efficiency and environmental responsibility, reducing operational costs and minimizing ecological footprint. With the capability to accommodate two racks simultaneously, this machine maximizes throughput, making it ideal for high-volume commercial operations. Utilizing a low-temperature washing process, this dishwasher effectively cleans dishware while conserving energy and ensuring gentle treatment of delicate items. Enhanced safety features include a single chemical alarm, alerting users to any chemical-related issues during operation, ensuring a secure working environment. The upright design optimizes space utilization, making it suitable for establishments with limited floor space, without compromising on performance.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/015-1090.0065_772995d2-4214-4beb-b4ce-45375b38cdf8.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"015-1090.0065\",\"price\":\"8325.42\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"6555.45\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1963\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"481\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"7909.15\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"482\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_di