(8043, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish AFB_ Bakery Rack Single Rack Upright Dish Machine\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-223\",\"slug_id\":\"3069\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The American Dish AFB dishwashing system offers customizable time cycles of 90, 120, or 150 seconds, ensuring flexibility in washing operations. It accommodates standard 20\\\" x 20\\\" racks and features a robust 1.5 HP pump, providing high-pressure cleaning for effective removal of dirt and grime. With built-in chemical dispensing, the machine simplifies the sanitation process while maintaining consistent cleaning results. Additionally, it includes a scrap accumulator, enhancing the longevity of the system by trapping debris and preventing clogs. This versatile dishwashing center is suitable for various kitchen setups, available in both corner and pass-through models. Its 27.5\\\" door opening, equipped with a safety interlock, ensures easy and secure access during operation. While the machine effectively cleans bakery trays, pots, and pans, it also offers compatibility with sheet pans, requiring a specialized stainless steel dishrack for proper washing. Moreover, occupying only 121\\\" of floor space, it serves as a complete warewashing solution, incorporating a soil dishtable with three deep sinks, making it suitable for commercial kitchens of different sizes and configurations.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>You can select from a variety to select from. For instance, you can choose from 90, 120, or 150-second cycles to suit specific washing needs. Standard Rack Compatibility that is useful to hold standard 20\\\" x 20\\\" racks for versatile dishwashing applications. Efficient Pump System that is Equipped with a high-pressure 1.5 HP pump for powerful cleaning performance. Built-In Chemical Dispensing help you streamline chemical usage and ensures consistent sanitation levels. Scrap Accumulator that is built-in and maintains cleanliness and prolongs the lifespan of the washing system.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/016-0090.0000_a6e75562-773f-466f-ac4e-aa8c9279dea7.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"016-0090.0000\",\"price\":\"6899.08\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"5432.35\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1941\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"437\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"6554.13\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"438\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"6209.17\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"330\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"35\",\"height\":\"79\",\"width\":\"34\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0\",\"shipping_height\":\"0\",\"shipping_width\":\"0\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"shipping_weight\":null,\"shipping_weight_option\":\"Kg\",\"titles\":{\"4\":null,\"5\":null},\"variant_color_title\":\"Color\",\"variant_color_value\":null,\"variant_color_products\":null,\"variant_1_title\":null,\"variant_1_value\":null,\"variant_1_products\":null,\"variant_2_title\":null,\"variant_2_value\":null,\"variant_2_products\":null,\"variant_3_title\":null,\"variant_3_value\":null,\"variant_3_products\":null,\"compare_type\":null,\"compare_products\":null,\"faq_schema_config\":[[{\"key\":\"question\",\"value\":null},{\"key\":\