(8051, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish AFB-C Corner Bakery Upright Dish Machine with Single Rack Tall + 1 S\\/S Sheetpan Rack\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-219\",\"slug_id\":\"3065\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The AFB warewashing system offers versatility with time cycle options of 90, 120, or 150 seconds, catering to varying washing needs. It accommodates standard 20\\\" x 20\\\" racks and features a robust 1.5 HP pump that ensures high-pressure washing for thorough cleaning. Integrated chemical dispensing and a built-in scrap accumulator streamline the washing process, enhancing efficiency and convenience. Whether in corner or pass-through configurations, the AFB model boasts a spacious 27.5\\\" door opening with a safety interlock, ensuring ease of access and operation. For specialized washing of sheet pans, a dedicated stainless steel dishrack is available to ensure proper cleaning. With its compact design, the AFB warewashing center optimizes floor space, offering a comprehensive solution within a minimal footprint. The soil dishtable incorporates three deep sinks, facilitating pre-wash activities and ensuring efficient workflow in busy kitchen environments. Rated capacities range from 12 to 37 racks per hour, providing flexibility to meet varying demands. Additionally, with a minimum temperature requirement of 130 degrees Fahrenheit (54.4 degrees Celsius), the AFB ensures effective sanitization. Electrical compatibility is simplified with a 115-volt single-phase connection, requiring only two 10-12 AWG copper wires and appropriate circuit protection for seamless integration into existing setups.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Designed specifically for bakery operations, the AFB-C Corner Bakery Upright Dish Machine offers specialized features tailored to handle bakery trays and pots effectively. Equipped with a single rack and a single chemical alarm, this machine ensures precise and controlled washing and sanitizing processes. Operating at low temperature, it provides gentle yet thorough cleaning, ideal for bakery items that may be sensitive to high temperatures With its corner configuration and tall design, this dishwasher optimizes space utilization, making it suitable for compact bakery layouts. Additionally, it includes one stainless steel sheet pan rack, offering added convenience for bakery operations that require simultaneous washing of sheet pans alongside other items.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/016-0091.0236_e9513f14-90d7-4d63-a1b6-aa0595ee4355.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"016-0091.0236\",\"price\":\"7161.72\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"5639.15\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1937\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"429\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"6803.63\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"430\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"6445.55\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"330\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"35\",\"height\":\"79\",\"width\":\"34\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0\",\"shipping_height\":\"0\",\"shipping_width\":\"0\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"shipping_weight\":null,\"shipping_weight_option\":\"Kg\",\"titles\":{\"4\":null,\"5\":null},\"variant_color_