(8054, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco CBF-4M 4-Slice Buffet Toaster with 1\\\" Slots - 120V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-714\",\"slug_id\":\"3560\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco CBF-4M 4-Slice Buffet Toaster is a reliable and efficient electric toaster designed to meet the demands of busy commercial kitchens and buffet settings. With four 1-inch slots, this toaster allows for quick and convenient toasting of multiple slices of bread, bagels, or English muffins simultaneously. Its manual control features provide straightforward operation, while the keep warm function ensures that toasted items remain warm and ready to serve. Built with a sturdy silver finish, the toaster is not only durable but also aesthetically pleasing for front-of-house use. Operating at 1,750 watts, it provides consistent performance and is NSF listed, guaranteeing compliance with health and safety standards. Whether for breakfast service or snack stations, the Cadco CBF-4M is an essential addition to any food service establishment.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Dimensions: 15 1\\/2\\\" W x 8\\\" D x 9\\\" H Compact design suitable for countertop placement. Slot Width: 1 Inch Accommodates a variety of bread types and sizes. Amps: 14.5 Amps Efficient energy use for standard operations. Voltage: 120 Volts Compatible with standard electrical outlets in commercial settings. Wattage: 1,750 Watts Provides fast and efficient toasting. Control Type: Manual Simple operation for user convenience. Features: Includes a keep warm function to maintain temperature of toasted items. Heating Source: Contact Ensures even toasting and reliable results. Number of Slots: 4 Slots Toasts multiple items at once, ideal for high-volume service. NSF Listed: Certified for safety and sanitation in commercial foodservice environments.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>One year warranty on all oven motors<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite