(8056, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco CDR-1T Double Burner Stainless Steel Portable Electric Side-by-Side Hot Plate with 6\\\" Tubular Elements - 1,650W, 120V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-719\",\"slug_id\":\"3565\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco CDR-1T is a robust double burner electric hot plate, ideal for both home and commercial cooking applications. Featuring two 6-inch tubular elements, this hot plate delivers a total power output of 1,650 watts, allowing for efficient cooking and heating. With dimensions of 21 1\\/4 inches wide and 12 3\\/16 inches deep, the CDR-1T offers a compact yet effective solution for preparing multiple dishes simultaneously. Constructed from durable stainless steel, this portable hot plate is built for longevity and easy cleaning. The infinite control type provides precise temperature management, while its NEMA 5-15P plug type makes it compatible with standard outlets for quick setup. Weighing only 12 pounds, it is easily transportable, making it a versatile addition to any kitchen setup, catering service, or food truck.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Dimensions: 21 1\\/4\\\" W x 12 3\\/16\\\" D x 4 1\\/8\\\" H Space-saving design for easy placement on countertops. Burner Diameter: 6 Inches Two burners for versatile cooking options and simultaneous meal preparation. Amps: 13.8 Amps Efficient power consumption, suitable for light to moderate cooking tasks. Phase: 1 Phase Designed for compatibility with standard electrical systems. Voltage: 120 Volts Ideal for residential and small commercial kitchens. Wattage: 1,650 Watts Offers strong heating capabilities for efficient cooking. Burner Style: Coil Provides even heat distribution for consistent cooking results. Control Type: Infinite Allows for precise heat adjustments to suit various cooking needs. Material: Stainless Steel Ensures durability and ease of maintenance. Plug Type: NEMA 5-15P Easily connects to standard hous