(8061, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco CDR-3K Double Burner Stainless Steel Portable Electric Front-to-Back Hot Plate with 9\\\" Cast Iron Elements - 3,000W, 220V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-725\",\"slug_id\":\"3571\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco CDR-3K is a powerful and efficient double burner electric hot plate, designed for heavy-duty cooking in both commercial and residential kitchens. Featuring two 9-inch cast iron elements, this hot plate offers an impressive 3,000 watts of cooking power, making it ideal for a variety of cooking tasks, from frying to boiling. The stainless steel construction ensures durability and easy maintenance, while the infinite control type allows for precise temperature adjustments to suit different cooking needs. With compact dimensions of 15 inches wide and 25 1\\/2 inches deep, this hot plate is designed for countertop installation, providing versatility in space-constrained kitchens. It operates on 220 volts, making it suitable for high-power applications, and features a NEMA 6-20P plug type for easy connectivity. This portable appliance is perfect for caterers, food trucks, and any kitchen looking for reliable extra cooking capacity.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Dimensions: 15\\\" W x 25 1\\/2\\\" D x 4 1\\/4\\\" H Compact design ideal for countertop use. Burner Diameter: 9 Inches Generous cooking surface suitable for larger pots and pans. Amps: 13.7 Amps Efficient energy consumption for high-performance cooking. Phase: 1 Phase Compatible with standard single-phase electrical systems. Voltage: 220 Volts Ideal for applications requiring higher voltage for increased power. Wattage: 3,000 Watts High power output for rapid heating and efficient cooking. Burner Material: Cast Iron Provides excellent heat retention and even cooking. Burner Style: French Top Designed for versatile cooking options and accommodating larger cookware. Control Type: Infinite Allows for precise temperature adjustments during cooking. Material: Stainless Steel Durable, easy to clean, and resistant to corrosion for long-lasting use.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>One year warranty on all oven motors<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/CDR-3K.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"CDR-3K\",\"price\":\"440\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"400\",\"margin\":\"9.09%\",\"product_id\":\"2443\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"1457\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"418.00\",\"margin\":\"4.31\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"1458\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"396.00\",\"margin\":\"-1.01\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"28\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"26\",\"height\":\"4\",\"width\":\"15\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0\",\"shipping_height\":\"0\",\"shipping_width\":\"0\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"shipping_weight\":null,\"shipping_weight_option\":\"Kg\",\"titles\":{\"4\":null,\"5\":null},\"variant_color_title\":\"Color\",\"variant_color_value\":null,\"variant_color_products\":null,\"variant_1_title\":null,\"variant_1_value\":null,\"variant_1_products\":null,\"variant_2_title\":null,\"variant_2_value\":null,\"variant_2_products\":null,\"variant_3_title\":null,\"variant_3_value\":null,\"variant_3_products\":null,\"compare_type\":null,\"compare_products\":null,\"faq_schema_config\":[[{\"