(8065, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish ET-AF-3-PH Single Rack Under Counter Dish Machine 37 1\\/2\\\" Tall W\\/ 14\\\"\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-236\",\"slug_id\":\"3082\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The ET Series dishwashing unit boasts a variety of standard functionalities aimed at optimizing dishwashing operations in commercial settings. With 1 1\\/2 HP wash and rinse pump prime switches, the machine ensures efficient water circulation for thorough cleaning results. An automatic chemical feed system optimizes the distribution of cleaning agents, minimizing manual intervention while maintaining consistent cleaning performance. Its rapid 90-second complete time cycle enhances workflow efficiency, enabling quick turnaround times for dishwashing tasks. The hinged-mounted panel design facilitates easy service access, simplifying maintenance procedures and minimizing downtime to ensure uninterrupted operation in busy kitchen environments. Additionally, a tall version of the machine is available to cater to various space requirements in commercial kitchens. Designed with user comfort and convenience in mind, the ET Series features an ergonomic design that allows operators to load and unload dishware with ease. The short door construction, measuring 10 inches, ensures that the aisle remains open and clear during operation, further enhancing workflow efficiency. For enhanced functionality, optional heat functionality is available, maintaining tank temperature rack after rack for consistent washing performance. Dual screening protects both wash and drain pumps from debris, ensuring long-term reliability and durability. With a pumped drain system, this dish machine offers versatility in installation, making it suitable for a wide range of kitchen configurations. Ideal for space-constrained environments, the ET Series dish machine is the optimal choice for establishments prioritizing space efficiency.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>The ET-AF-3-PH features a robust pumped drain system and sustainer heater, ensuring effective water drainage and consistent tank temperature for optimal cleaning performance. With a height of 37 1\\/2 inches and a 14-inch door opening, this dish machine is designed to fit seamlessly under counters, maximizing kitchen space utilization without compromising on functionality. Operating at low temperatures, this machine effectively cleans dishware while minimizing energy consumption, making it an environmentally friendly choice for commercial kitchens. Equipped to handle a single rack, this dishwasher offers efficient cleaning for moderate dishwashing demands, ideal for smaller foodservice establishments or as a supplementary unit in larger kitchens. The pumped drain system allows for flexible installation options, enabling the machine to be installed in a variety of kitchen configurations to suit the specific needs of the establishment.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/018-1091.0000_83937325-b675-4b49-8d4a-854aad5b1fda.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"018-1091.0000\",\"price\":\"6347.27\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"4997.85\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1954\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"463\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"6029.91\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"464\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"5712.54\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"20