(8066, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco CG-5FB 12\\\" x 21\\\" Electric Front-to-Back Countertop Griddle - 1,500W, 120V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-712\",\"slug_id\":\"3558\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco CG-5FB Electric Front-to-Back Countertop Griddle is a powerful and efficient cooking solution for any commercial kitchen or food service environment. With a generous cooking surface area of 252 square inches, this griddle features a durable cast iron cooking surface that ensures even heat distribution and excellent searing capabilities. Operating at 1,500 watts and 120 volts, it reaches a maximum temperature of 450 degrees Fahrenheit, making it suitable for a variety of cooking tasks, from pancakes to burgers. The stainless steel construction not only adds a sleek look but also provides durability and ease of cleaning. Designed with side splashes to contain spills and splatters, this griddle is also equipped with adjustable feet for stability on any countertop. The infinite control type allows for precise temperature adjustments, making it a versatile addition to your kitchen.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Dimensions: 16\\\" W x 26 3\\/4\\\" D x 9 1\\/4\\\" H Compact size ideal for countertop use. Cooking Surface: 12\\\" x 21\\\" Ample space for multiple cooking tasks. Wattage: 1,500 Watts Provides powerful heating for quick cooking. Voltage: 120 Volts Compatible with standard electrical outlets. Construction Material: Stainless Steel Durable and easy to maintain. Cooking Surface Material: Cast Iron Retains heat well for even cooking. Maximum Temperature: 450 Degrees F Versatile cooking capabilities. Control Type: Infinite Allows for precise temperature control. Features: Includes side splashes to contain spills and feet for stability. Plug Type: NEMA 5-15P Standard plug for easy connectivity.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>One year warranty on all oven motors<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"http