(8068, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco CMLW-2 23 1\\/4\\\" x 15 1\\/4\\\" x 16 1\\/4\\\" 2-Level Electric Countertop Warming Shelf - 120V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-678\",\"slug_id\":\"3524\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco CMLW-2 2-Level Electric Countertop Warming Shelf is an efficient solution for maintaining the optimal temperature of food items in busy kitchens. Designed to fit seamlessly on countertops, this warming shelf measures 23 1\\/4 inches wide, 15 1\\/4 inches deep, and stands 16 1\\/4 inches high, offering ample space with its two shelves that provide a total shelf width of 20 1\\/2 inches and depth of 14 inches for effective organization. Operating on a standard 120-volt power supply and utilizing 600 watts of heating power, this warming shelf is perfect for keeping a variety of foods at a consistent serving temperature between 155 to 205 degrees Fahrenheit. The dial control allows for easy temperature adjustments, while the NSF listed certification ensures compliance with health and safety standards, making it a reliable choice for commercial foodservice operations. Crafted from stainless steel, the unit not only offers durability but also features a sleek, silver finish that complements any kitchen decor. With two heating zones, the Cadco CMLW-2 is ideal for buffets and self-service setups, providing efficiency and convenience in food service.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Two-Level Design: Offers double the capacity for warming food, maximizing countertop space. Ample Shelf Space: Each shelf measures 20 1\\/2\\\" W x 14\\\" D, accommodating various food items. Powerful Heating: Operates at 600 watts, ensuring quick and consistent heating for optimal food service. Temperature Range: Maintains food temperatures between 155F and 205F, suitable for a variety of dishes. Easy Control: Features a simple dial control for precise temperature adjustments. NSF Listed: Meets strict health and safety standards, ideal for commercial kitchen environments. Durable Construction: Made from stainless steel for long-lasting performance and easy cleaning. Plug Type: Equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug for standard electrical outlets. Made in America: High-quality manufacturing standards, supporting local production. Versatile Usage: Perfect for buffets, catering events, and any service setting where food needs to be kept warm.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>One year warranty on all oven motors<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/CMLW-2.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"CMLW-2\",\"price\":\"468\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"400\",\"margin\":\"14.53%\",\"product_id\":\"2396\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"1363\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"444.60\",\"margin\":\"10.03\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"1364\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"421.20\",\"margin\":\"5.03\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"32\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"15\",\"height\":\"16\",\"width\":\"23\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0\",\"shipping_height\":\"0\",\"shipping_width\":\"0\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"shipping_weight\":null,\"shipping_weight_option\":\"Kg\",\"titles\":{\"4\":null,\"5\":null},\"variant_color_title\":\"Color\",\"variant_color_value\":null,\"variant_color_products\":null,\"variant_1_title\"