(8073, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco CSR-3T(220) Single Burner Stainless Steel Portable Electric Hot Plate with 8\\\" Tubular Element - 1,500W, 220V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-721\",\"slug_id\":\"3567\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco CSR-3T(220) is a versatile and compact single burner electric hot plate, designed for both professional kitchens and home use. Featuring an 8-inch tubular element, this hot plate provides a reliable cooking capacity of 1,500 watts, making it suitable for a range of cooking tasks, from simmering sauces to frying eggs. Its stainless steel construction ensures durability and easy cleaning, while the infinite control type allows for precise temperature adjustments to achieve desired cooking results. With a footprint of 14 inches wide and 12 1\\/4 inches deep, it is perfect for countertop installation, allowing chefs to maximize their workspace. Operating on 220 volts, this hot plate is ideal for commercial settings where higher voltage is required and comes equipped with a NEMA 6-20P plug type for straightforward connectivity. This portable hot plate is a practical addition for caterers, food trucks, or anyone in need of additional cooking capacity in a limited space.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Dimensions: 14\\\" W x 12 1\\/4\\\" D x 4 1\\/8\\\" H Compact size suitable for any countertop. Burner Diameter: 8 Inches Offers a versatile cooking surface for various cookware. Amps: 19.2 Amps Supports efficient power usage for effective heating. Phase: 1 Phase Designed for compatibility with standard single-phase electrical systems. Voltage: 220 Volts Ideal for high-demand cooking in commercial settings. Wattage: 1,500 Watts Provides sufficient power for diverse cooking tasks. Burner Style: Coil Ensures even heat distribution for consistent cooking results. Control Type: Infinite Allows for precise temperature control, enhancing cooking flexibility. Material: Stainless Steel