(8077, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco CTW-4M 4-Slice Standard Toaster with 1\\\" Slots and Metallic Gray Cast Aluminum End Panels - 120V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-681\",\"slug_id\":\"3527\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco CTW-4M 4-Slice Standard Toaster is an efficient and reliable appliance designed for commercial kitchens, making it ideal for high-volume operations. Featuring four slots with a generous width of 1 inch, this toaster allows for toasting a variety of bread types, including thick bagels and artisanal loaves. With dimensions of 13 1\\/2 inches in width, 8 inches in depth, and 9 inches in height, it fits comfortably on countertops while maximizing toasting capacity. The toaster operates on 1,745 watts at 120 volts and is powered by a robust heating source that ensures rapid and even toasting. Its metallic gray cast aluminum end panels add durability and a sleek appearance, while the manual control type allows users to customize toasting times to achieve their desired level of crispness. The Keep Warm feature ensures that toasted items stay warm and ready for service, making it perfect for busy breakfast and brunch settings. Additionally, the CTW-4M is NSF listed, affirming its compliance with health and safety standards for commercial use.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>4-Slice Capacity: Allows toasting of up to four slices of bread simultaneously, enhancing productivity. 1-Inch Slot Width: Accommodates various bread types, including thicker options like bagels. Robust Power: Operates at 1,745 watts for quick and efficient toasting. Compact Dimensions: Measures 13 1\\/2\\\" W x 8\\\" D x 9\\\" H, suitable for countertop placement. Manual Control: Offers precise toasting control for customizable results. Keep Warm Feature: Maintains the warmth of toasted items until they are ready to serve. NSF Listed: Meets stringent health and safety standards for commercial kitchen equipment. Durable Construction: Made with metallic gray cast aluminum end panels for longevity and style. Plug Type: NEMA 5-15P plug ensures compatibility with standard outlets. Ideal for Standard Volume Usage: Designed for moderate to high-volume toasting in cafes, diners, and restaurants.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>One year warranty on all oven motors<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/CTW-4M.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"CTW-4M\",\"price\":\"409.5\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"350\",\"margin\":\"14.53%\",\"product_id\":\"2399\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"1369\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"389.02\",\"margin\":\"10.03\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"1370\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"368.55\",\"margin\":\"5.03\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"11\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"8\",\"height\":\"9\",\"width\":\"14\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0\",\"shipping_height\":\"0\",\"shipping_width\":\"0\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"shipping_weight\":null,\"shipping_weight_option\":\"Kg\",\"titles\":{\"4\":null,\"5\":null},\"variant_color_title\":\"Color\",\"variant_color_value\":null,\"variant_color_products\":null,\"variant_1_title\":null,\"variant_1_value\":null,\"variant_1_products\":null,\"variant_2_title\":null,\"variant_2_value\":null,\"variant_2_products\":null,\"variant_3_title\"