(8078, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco CTW-6M(220) 6-Slice Standard Toaster with 1\\\" Slots - 220V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-707\",\"slug_id\":\"3553\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco CTW-6M(220) 6-Slice Standard Toaster is a high-performance toaster designed for commercial settings. This powerful unit can toast up to six slices at once, with each slot measuring 1 inch wide, making it suitable for a variety of bread types. The toaster operates on 220V and delivers 2,480 watts of heating power to ensure efficient, even toasting. Built with manual controls and a \\\"Keep Warm\\\" feature, its ideal for maintaining toast at serving temperature until needed. NSF listed and crafted for durability, this toaster is a solid choice for high-volume breakfast service.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Six Slice Capacity: Allows toasting of six slices at once. 1-Inch Slot Width: Fits standard bread slices comfortably. High Wattage: 2,480 watts for fast and even toasting. Manual Control: Simple and intuitive settings for operation. Keep Warm Feature: Maintains toast at serving temperature. Compact Design: Fits easily on countertops. Sturdy Construction: Durable, silver finish for heavy use. NSF Listed: Complies with sanitation standards. Plug Type: Equipped with NEMA 6-20P plug for 220V outlets. Ideal for Commercial Use: Suitable for high-volume applications.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>One year warranty on all oven motors<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/CTW-6M.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"CTW-6M\",\"price\":\"482.63\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"412.5\",\"margin\":\"14.53%\",\"product_id\":\"2425\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\