(8083, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish L-90-3DW-S 2-Door, Upright Dish Machine with Single Rack\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-231\",\"slug_id\":\"3077\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The \\\"L-90-3DW-S\\\" upright dish machine offers a comprehensive array of standard features tailored to streamline dishwashing operations in commercial kitchens. Its top-mounted controls ensure easy access and operation, while the generous door clearance of 20.375 inches facilitates the loading and unloading of racks with ease. The machine boasts a powerful 1.5 HP pump for quick service, coupled with quick-release spray arms for efficient cleaning. Its stainless steel air gap and impeller, along with a two-stage filter system, protect the pump and spray jets, ensuring durability and consistent performance. The unit\'s true three-door design, with only two doors opening in either configuration, enhances efficiency and workflow, while its eye-level temperature gauge and built-in de-liming switch provide added convenience and functionality. With a focus on energy efficiency and operational convenience, the \\\"L-90-3DW-S\\\" dish machine operates as a true low-energy dump and fill system, minimizing water and energy consumption without compromising cleaning effectiveness. It features an automatic chemical feed system, prime switches, and Nylatron strips to protect stainless doors, ensuring optimal cleaning performance with minimal maintenance requirements. Additionally, the unit\'s swift plumbing removal system and quick-service pump facilitate easy repair and maintenance, reducing downtime and maximizing productivity. Its capacity to accommodate 37 racks per hour, combined with its 90-second cycle time and efficient water consumption of 1.2 gallons per cycle, make it a reliable and cost-effective solution for busy kitchen environments.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Two-door design enables efficient pass-through operation, 