(8084, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco KR-1 Single Burner Black Portable Electric Hot Plate with 7 1\\/8\\\" Cast Iron Element - 1,500W, 120V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-720\",\"slug_id\":\"3566\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco KR-1 is a sleek and efficient single burner electric hot plate, designed for versatile cooking in both home and commercial settings. With a compact size of 11 1\\/2 inches wide and 14 inches deep, this hot plate features a 7 1\\/8-inch cast iron element that delivers a powerful 1,500 watts of cooking capacity, making it perfect for a variety of cooking tasks, including sautng, boiling, and simmering. The infinite control type allows for precise temperature adjustments, ensuring optimal cooking results. Constructed from durable stainless steel, the KR-1 is both stylish and easy to clean, while its enamel finish adds an attractive touch to any kitchen environment. Operating at 120 volts, it is equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug type for simple and quick setup. This portable hot plate is an excellent choice for caterers, food trucks, or anyone needing an additional cooking surface in a compact form factor.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Dimensions: 11 1\\/2\\\" W x 14\\\" D x 3\\\" H Compact design ideal for limited countertop space. Burner Diameter: 7 1\\/8 Inches Accommodates various cookware sizes for flexible cooking options. Amps: 12.5 Amps Efficient power usage, suitable for most kitchen setups. Phase: 1 Phase Compatible with standard single-phase electrical systems. Voltage: 120 Volts Perfect for home kitchens and light commercial use. Wattage: 1,500 Watts Provides strong heating performance for quick cooking. Burner Material: Cast Iron Ensures even heat distribution and durability for long-term use. Control Type: Infinite Allows for precise temperature control, enhancing versatility in cooking. Material: Stainless Steel Sturdy and easy to maintain, designed for high usage. Plug Type: NEMA 5-15P Easy connection to standard electrical outlets for convenient operation.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>One year warranty on all oven motors<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/KR-1.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"KR-1\",\"price\":\"138\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"125\",\"margin\":\"9.42%\",\"product_id\":\"2438\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"1447\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"131.10\",\"margin\":\"4.65\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"1448\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"124.20\",\"margin\":\"-0.64\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"9\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"14\",\"height\":\"3\",\"width\":\"12\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0\",\"shipping_height\":\"0\",\"shipping_width\":\"0\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"shipping_weight\":null,\"shipping_weight_option\":\"Kg\",\"titles\":{\"4\":null,\"5\":null},\"variant_color_title\":\"Color\",\"variant_color_value\":null,\"variant_color_products\":null,\"variant_1_title\":null,\"variant_1_value\":null,\"variant_1_products\":null,\"variant_2_title\":null,\"variant_2_value\":null,\"variant_2_products\":null,\"variant_3_title\":null,\"variant_3_value\":null,\"variant_3_products\":null,\"compare_type\":null,\"compare_products\":null,\"faq_schema_config\":[[{\"key\":\"question\",\"value\":null},{\"key\":\"answer\"