(8086, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco LKR-220 Single Burner Stainless Steel Portable Electric Hot Plate with 9\\\" Cast Iron Element - 2,000W, 220V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-724\",\"slug_id\":\"3570\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco LKR-220 is a versatile and powerful single burner electric hot plate, specifically designed for both commercial and home kitchen applications. Featuring a robust 9-inch cast iron element, this hot plate delivers a strong 2,000 watts of cooking power, making it ideal for various cooking tasks such as sautng, boiling, and frying. Its stainless steel construction ensures durability and easy cleaning, while the infinite control type allows for precise temperature adjustments to suit your cooking preferences. Measuring 15 inches wide and 14 inches deep, this compact hot plate is perfect for countertop installation, fitting well in kitchens with limited space. It operates on 220 volts, suitable for high-performance cooking, and features a NEMA 6-20P plug type for straightforward electrical connectivity. This portable appliance is an excellent choice for chefs needing extra cooking capacity or for food trucks and catering services.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Dimensions: 15\\\" W x 14\\\" D x 4 1\\/2\\\" H Compact size makes it ideal for countertop use in limited spaces. Burner Diameter: 9 Inches Provides ample cooking surface for larger pots and pans. Amps: 9.1 Amps Efficient energy usage for optimal cooking performance. Phase: 1 Phase Compatible with standard single-phase electrical systems. Voltage: 220 Volts Designed for higher voltage applications for increased cooking power. Wattage: 2,000 Watts High power output for rapid heating and cooking efficiency. Burner Material: Cast Iron Offers excellent heat retention and even cooking results. Burner Style: French Top Suitable for a variety of cooking techniques and larger cookware. Control Type: Infinite Allows for precise temperature control, enhancing cooking versatility. Material: Stainless Steel Durable and easy to maintain, ensuring long-lasting use in busy kitchens.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>One year warranty on all oven motors<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/LKR-220.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"LKR-220\",\"price\":\"291.5\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"265\",\"margin\":\"9.09%\",\"product_id\":\"2442\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"1455\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"276.93\",\"margin\":\"4.31\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"1456\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"262.35\",\"margin\":\"-1.01\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"18\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"14\",\"height\":\"5\",\"width\":\"15\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0\",\"shipping_height\":\"0\",\"shipping_width\":\"0\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"shipping_weight\":null,\"shipping_weight_option\":\"Kg\",\"titles\":{\"4\":null,\"5\":null},\"variant_color_title\":\"Color\",\"variant_color_value\":null,\"variant_color_products\":null,\"variant_1_title\":null,\"variant_1_value\":null,\"variant_1_products\":null,\"variant_2_title\":null,\"variant_2_value\":null,\"variant_2_products\":null,\"variant_3_title\":null,\"variant_3_value\":null,\"variant_3_products\":null,\"compare_type\":null,\"compare_products\":null,\"faq_schema_