(8087, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco Roberta OV-003 3-Shelf Quarter Size Medium-Duty Manual Countertop Convection Oven - 120V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-733\",\"slug_id\":\"3579\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco Roberta OV-003 is a compact and efficient countertop convection oven designed for commercial kitchen environments where space is at a premium. Constructed with durable stainless steel, this medium-duty oven features a glass door for easy viewing of the cooking process, ensuring that you can monitor your food without opening the door and losing heat. With a temperature range of 175 to 500 degrees Fahrenheit, it is versatile enough for a variety of cooking tasks, including baking, roasting, and reheating. The oven has a capacity of 0.83 cubic feet and can accommodate up to three racks, making it suitable for preparing multiple dishes simultaneously. Operating on 120 volts and utilizing 1.45 kilowatts, this unit is easy to install in most kitchen settings. It features manual dial controls for straightforward operation and is NSF-listed for safety and sanitation standards.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Dimensions: 18 7\\/8\\\" W x 21 1\\/2\\\" D x 15 3\\/4\\\" H Compact size perfect for countertop use in limited spaces. Interior Dimensions: 14 1\\/8\\\" W x 11 1\\/4\\\" D x 9\\\" H Adequate interior space for various cooking needs. Amps: 12 Amps Effective power consumption tailored for efficient operation. Phase: 1 Phase Suitable for standard single-phase power supply. Control Type: Manual dial User-friendly control for easy temperature adjustments. Door Type: Glass Enables visibility of cooking progress while retaining heat. Installation Type: Countertop Designed for easy placement in commercial kitchens. Number of Racks: 3 Allows for cooking multiple items at once, enhancing productivity. Plug Type: NEMA 5-15P Compatible with standard 120V outlets for easy setup. Temperature Range: 175F - 500F Versatile for various cooking techniques and recipes. Power Type: Electric Provides reliable and consistent heating. NSF Listed: Yes Complies with health and safety regulations for commercial kitchen appliances.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>One year warranty on all oven motors<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/OV-003.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"OV-003\",\"price\":\"781\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"710\",\"margin\":\"9.09%\",\"product_id\":\"2451\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"1479\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"741.95\",\"margin\":\"4.31\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"1480\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"702.90\",\"margin\":\"-1.01\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"55\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"22\",\"height\":\"16\",\"width\":\"19\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0\",\"shipping_height\":\"0\",\"shipping_width\":\"0\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"shipping_weight\":null,\"shipping_weight_option\":\"Kg\",\"titles\":{\"4\":null,\"5\":null},\"variant_color_title\":\"Color\",\"variant_color_value\":null,\"variant_color_products\":null,\"variant_1_title\":null,\"variant_1_value\":null,\"variant_1_products\":null,\"variant_2_title\":null,\"variant_2_value\":null,\"variant_2_products\":null,\"variant_3_title\":null,\"variant_3_value\":null,\"variant_3_products\":null,\"