(8091, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish L-90-3DWC-S 2-Door Single Rack Upright Dish Machine\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-229\",\"slug_id\":\"3075\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The top-mounted controls of this dishmachine ensure easy access and operation, while its spacious door clearance of 20.375 inches facilitates convenient loading and unloading. Featuring a 1 1\\/2 HP pump for swift service, coupled with quick-release spray arms and a stainless steel air gap, this unit guarantees efficient performance. Equipped with run indicator lights and built-in chemical pump heads on the exterior, it offers simple monitoring and maintenance. Constructed with a stainless steel impellor and sump, it ensures durability and hassle-free cleaning, making it a truly energy-efficient dishwashing solution. Boasting a true 3-door design with only 2 doors opening in any configuration, this dishmachine eliminates water buildup on the back wall and keeps doors perfectly aligned. It incorporates practical features like an eye-level temperature gauge, built-in de-liming switch, and large capacity internal scrapper for enhanced functionality. With automatic chemical feed and Nylatron strips protecting stainless doors, it offers added convenience and protection. Additionally, its air gap fill system eliminates the need for check valves and vacuum breakers, while swift plumbing removal and quick service pump features simplify maintenance tasks, ensuring uninterrupted operation.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>The L-90-3DWC-S features a space-saving corner design, making it ideal for establishments with limited space or unique layout requirements. With the ability to accommodate a single rack, this dish machine is suitable for smaller-scale operations or establishments with moderate dishwashing needs. Operating at low temperatures, the L-90-3DWC-S ensures efficient cleaning while conserving energy, making it an environmentally friendly choice. Its upright configuration allows for easy loading and unloading of dishes, optimizing workflow efficiency in busy kitchen environments. Equipped with two doors, this dish machine facilitates smooth operation and convenient access to the interior for maintenance and service tasks.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/024-3090.0000_ef834199-cd87-44ab-8aaa-b24b8d999d16.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"024-3090.0000\",\"price\":\"5899.53\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"4645.3\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1947\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"449\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"5604.55\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"450\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"5309.58\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"300\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"28\",\"height\":\"74\",\"width\":\"29\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0\",\"shipping_height\":\"0\",\"shipping_width\":\"0\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"shipping_weight\":null,\"shipping_weight_option\":\"Kg\",\"titles\":{\"4\":null,\"5\":null},\"variant_color_title\":\"Color\",\"variant_color_value\":null,\"variant_color_products\":null,\"variant_1_title\":null,\"variant_1_value\":null,\"variant_1_products\":null,\"variant_2_title\":null,\"variant_2_val