(8094, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco Anna OV-023P 4-Shelf Half Size Medium-Duty Manual Countertop Pizza Convection Oven - 208-240V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-731\",\"slug_id\":\"3577\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco Anna OV-023P is a specialized countertop pizza convection oven designed to meet the demands of commercial kitchens that focus on high-quality pizza preparation. With a robust stainless steel construction, this medium-duty oven features a glass door for easy monitoring of the cooking process, ensuring that pizzas are cooked to perfection without the need to open the door. The oven offers a temperature range of 175 to 500 degrees Fahrenheit, ideal for baking a variety of pizza styles. With a capacity of 1.75 cubic feet, it can accommodate up to four racks, making it perfect for cooking multiple pizzas simultaneously. Operating at 208-240 volts with a wattage of 2.7 kilowatts, this unit is designed for easy countertop installation in most kitchen environments. The manual dial controls provide straightforward operation, and its NSF listing ensures compliance with safety and sanitation standards.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Dimensions: 23 5\\/8\\\" W x 23 3\\/4\\\" D x 18 5\\/8\\\" H Compact design suited for countertop use, ideal for limited kitchen spaces. Interior Dimensions: 18 3\\/4\\\" W x 13 3\\/4\\\" D x 11 3\\/4\\\" H Generous cooking area that accommodates various pizza sizes. Amps: 11.25 Amps Efficient power consumption ensures effective operation. Phase: 1 Phase Suitable for standard single-phase power systems. Control Type: Manual dial Easy-to-use control for precise temperature settings. Door Type: Glass Allows for visibility while cooking, ensuring optimal results. Installation Type: Countertop Convenient design for easy placement in commercial kitchens. Number of Racks: 4 Provides ample cooking space for multiple pizzas or dishes at once. Plug Type: NEMA 6-15P Compatible 