(8095, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco PCG-10C 21\\\" x 12\\\" Light-Duty Electric Countertop Griddle - 1,500W, 120V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-729\",\"slug_id\":\"3575\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco PCG-10C is a versatile and efficient light-duty electric countertop griddle, perfect for small to medium-sized kitchens or foodservice operations. With a generous cooking surface area of 252 square inches, featuring a cast iron cooking surface, it offers even heat distribution and excellent cooking performance for a variety of foods, from pancakes to burgers. Operating at 1,500 watts on 120 volts, this griddle heats up quickly and can reach a maximum temperature of 400 degrees Fahrenheit, allowing for rapid cooking. Its thermostatic control type provides precise temperature adjustments for optimal cooking results. The unit is constructed from durable stainless steel, ensuring longevity and ease of cleaning, while its compact design makes it ideal for countertop installation in tight spaces. The NEMA 5-15P plug type allows for easy connection to standard outlets, making it a practical choice for any kitchen setup.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Dimensions: 29\\\" W x 12 1\\/2\\\" D x 5 1\\/2\\\" H Compact size perfect for limited countertop space. Cooking Surface Dimensions: 21\\\" W x 12\\\" D Generous surface area for versatile cooking options. Amps: 12.5 Amps Efficient energy consumption for effective operation. Phase: 1 Phase Standard compatibility with single-phase power systems. Voltage: 120 Volts Easily connects to common electrical outlets. Wattage: 1,500 Watts High power output for quick heating and cooking. Control Type: Thermostatic Allows for precise temperature control during cooking. Construction Material: Stainless Steel Ensures durability and ease of maintenance. Maximum Temperature: 400F Suitable for a wide variety of cooking tasks. Installation Type: Countertop Designed for easy setup in commercial or home kitchens.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>One year warranty on all oven motors<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/PCG-10C.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"PCG-10C\",\"price\":\"231\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"210\",\"margin\":\"9.09%\",\"product_id\":\"2447\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"1465\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"219.45\",\"margin\":\"4.31\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"1466\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"207.90\",\"margin\":\"-1.01\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"14\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"13\",\"height\":\"6\",\"width\":\"29\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0\",\"shipping_height\":\"0\",\"shipping_width\":\"0\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"shipping_weight\":null,\"shipping_weight_option\":\"Kg\",\"titles\":{\"4\":null,\"5\":null},\"variant_color_title\":\"Color\",\"variant_color_value\":null,\"variant_color_products\":null,\"variant_1_title\":null,\"variant_1_value\":null,\"variant_1_products\":null,\"variant_2_title\":null,\"variant_2_value\":null,\"variant_2_products\":null,\"variant_3_title\":null,\"variant_3_value\":null,\"variant_3_products\":null,\"compare_type\":null,\"compare_products\":null,\"faq_schema_config\":[[{\"key\":\"question\",\"value\":null},{\"key\":\"answer\",\"value\":null}]],\"seo_meta\":{\"seo_title\":null,\"