(8107, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish AF-3D-S 3D Upright 3-Door Low Temp Dish Machine with Single Rack and Single Chemical Alarm\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-268\",\"slug_id\":\"3114\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The AF-3D-S Dish Machine embodies a comprehensive array of standard features meticulously engineered to elevate dishwashing efficiency in commercial settings. Its convertible design offers unparalleled adaptability, seamlessly integrating into various kitchen configurations to optimize workflow. Boasting a remarkable 20.5-inch door clearance, this dishwasher accommodates oversized items with ease, making it particularly ideal for pizza applications and large dishware. Equipped with a quick service 1 1\\/2 HP pump and quick-release spray arms, it ensures swift and thorough dishwashing cycles, even during peak operating hours. The inclusion of a stainless steel air gap and run indicator light enhances operational hygiene and monitoring, respectively, while simplifying cleaning routines for added convenience. Furthermore, the AF-3D-S prioritizes durability and ease of maintenance, featuring innovative components such as the diagonal scrap trap for effortless screen removal and dual screens to safeguard the pump intake. Its swift plumbing removal system, utilizing zero-interference Stainless\\/Terelene Couplers, streamlines maintenance tasks, minimizing downtime and ensuring uninterrupted operation. With additional options like solid chemical dispensing and stainless steel spray bases, bayonets, and manifold couplings, this dishwasher offers versatile solutions tailored to meet specific operational needs. Backed by robust specifications including a 1.5 HP motor and low water consumption of 2.2 gallons per cycle, the AF-3D-S delivers reliable performance while adhering to energy efficiency standards, making it an indispensable asset in commercial kitchens.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Facilita