(8112, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco WT-5-HD 20 1\\/4\\\" x 14 3\\/8\\\" x 2 3\\/4\\\" Electric Heavy-Duty Countertop Warming Shelf - 120V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-687\",\"slug_id\":\"3533\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco WT-5-HD Electric Heavy-Duty Countertop Warming Shelf is a robust and efficient solution designed for food service operations that demand reliable heating and warming capabilities. Measuring 20 1\\/4 inches wide, 14 3\\/8 inches deep, and 2 3\\/4 inches high, this warming shelf is compact enough to fit on countertops while providing a generous warming area for dishes. Constructed from durable stainless steel, it ensures longevity and easy cleaning, making it ideal for busy kitchens. With a powerful wattage of 300 watts operating at 120 volts, this unit features a single heating zone that maintains temperatures between 155F and 205F, perfect for keeping a variety of foods warm and ready to serve. The easy-to-use dial control allows for precise temperature adjustments, and the built-in handle enhances portability, facilitating effortless relocation. Additionally, this warming shelf is NSF listed, confirming its compliance with strict health and safety standards, and is designed for convenient countertop installation.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Compact Dimensions: 20 1\\/4\\\" W x 14 3\\/8\\\" D x 2 3\\/4\\\" H; designed to maximize space without sacrificing heating area. Heavy-Duty Stainless Steel Construction: Ensures durability and resistance to wear and tear in busy environments. Single Heating Zone: Provides consistent warming across the entire surface for even heat distribution. Temperature Range: Adjustable from 155F to 205F to accommodate various food types and safety needs. 300 Watts of Power: Efficient heating that effectively keeps food at safe temperatures. User-Friendly Dial Control: Simplifies operation with straightforward temperature adjustments. NSF Listed: Meets safety and sanitation standards, ensuring suitability for commercial kitchen use. Built-in Handle: Facilitates easy handling and movement for versatile kitchen applications. Buffet Style: Perfect for catering and serving stations, enhancing food presentation and access. Countertop Installation: Designed for easy placement on any kitchen countertop, maximizing workflow efficiency.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>One year warranty on all oven motors<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/WT-5-HD.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"WT-5-HD\",\"price\":\"274.95\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"235\",\"margin\":\"14.53%\",\"product_id\":\"2405\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"1381\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"261.20\",\"margin\":\"10.03\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"1382\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"247.45\",\"margin\":\"5.03\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"13\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"14\",\"height\":\"3\",\"width\":\"20\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0\",\"shipping_height\":\"0\",\"shipping_width\":\"0\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"shipping_weight\":null,\"shipping_weight_option\":\"Kg\",\"titles\":{\"4\":null,\"5\":null},\"variant_color_title\":\"Color\",\"variant_color_value\":null,\"variant_color_products\":null,\"variant_1_title\":null,\"variant_1_value\":null,\"variant_