(8115, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco WT-5S 18 3\\/4\\\" x 15 1\\/4\\\" x 3\\\" Electric Countertop Warming Shelf - 120V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-688\",\"slug_id\":\"3534\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco WT-5S Electric Countertop Warming Shelf is an essential addition for any food service operation, designed to keep prepared dishes warm and ready to serve. This countertop warming shelf measures 18 3\\/4 inches in width, 15 1\\/4 inches in depth, and stands just 3 inches high, making it ideal for tight spaces while still offering ample heating area. The stainless steel construction ensures durability and ease of cleaning, while the attractive black and silver color complements any kitchen dor. With a single heating zone powered by 300 watts at 120 volts, the shelf maintains a temperature range of 155 to 205 degrees Fahrenheit, ensuring food safety and quality. This unit is proudly made in America, NSF listed for safety, and features a user-friendly dial control for precise temperature adjustments. Its built-in handle facilitates easy movement, and the NEMA 5-15P plug ensures compatibility with standard outlets.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Compact Dimensions: 18 3\\/4\\\" W x 15 1\\/4\\\" D x 3\\\" H; perfect for limited countertop space. Durable Stainless Steel Construction: Ensures longevity and is easy to clean and maintain. Single Heating Zone: Provides efficient heating for keeping food warm. Temperature Range: Adjustable from 155F to 205F for optimal food safety. Powerful 300 Watts: Effective heating for a variety of food items while being energy efficient. Dial Control: Simple and intuitive for easy temperature adjustments. NSF Listed: Meets safety and sanitation standards for commercial kitchen equipment. Built-in Handle: Allows for easy transportation and positioning on countertops. Stylish Design: Black and silver finish fits seamlessly into any kitchen setup. Made in America: Guarantees high-quality manufacturing standards and craftsmanship.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>One year warranty on all oven motors<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/WT-5S.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"WT-5S\",\"price\":\"219.38\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"187.5\",\"margin\":\"14.53%\",\"product_id\":\"2406\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"1383\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"208.41\",\"margin\":\"10.03\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"1384\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"197.44\",\"margin\":\"5.03\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"9\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"15\",\"height\":\"3\",\"width\":\"19\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0\",\"shipping_height\":\"0\",\"shipping_width\":\"0\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"shipping_weight\":null,\"shipping_weight_option\":\"Kg\",\"titles\":{\"4\":null,\"5\":null},\"variant_color_title\":\"Color\",\"variant_color_value\":null,\"variant_color_products\":null,\"variant_1_title\":null,\"variant_1_value\":null,\"variant_1_products\":null,\"variant_2_title\":null,\"variant_2_value\":null,\"variant_2_products\":null,\"variant_3_title\":null,\"variant_3_value\":null,\"variant_3_products\":null,\"compare_type\":null,\"compare_products\":null,\"faq_schema_config\":[[{\"key\":\"question\",\"value\":null},{\"key\":\"answer\",\"value\":null}]],\"seo_me