(8117, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco WT-40S 46\\\" x 15 1\\/4\\\" x 2 7\\/8\\\" Electric Countertop Warming Shelf - 120V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-683\",\"slug_id\":\"3529\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco WT-40S Electric Countertop Warming Shelf is a robust and efficient solution for keeping food warm in buffet settings. This warming shelf measures 46 inches in width, 15 1\\/4 inches in depth, and stands at a height of 2 7\\/8 inches, designed to fit conveniently on countertops while providing ample space for multiple food trays. Constructed from durable stainless steel, it ensures longevity and ease of cleaning in a busy kitchen environment. With a heating capacity of 600 watts and a voltage of 120 volts, this unit operates across two heating zones, maintaining food temperatures within a range of 155F to 205F to ensure food safety and quality. The intuitive dial control allows for easy temperature adjustments, and the shelf features a handle for enhanced portability. NSF listed for safety and sanitation compliance, the WT-40S is a reliable choice for any catering or food service operation looking to maintain food temperature efficiently.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Spacious Design: Dimensions of 46\\\" W x 15 1\\/4\\\" D x 2 7\\/8\\\" H accommodate large trays and multiple food items. Stainless Steel Construction: Durable and easy to clean, ideal for high-traffic commercial kitchens. Dual Heating Zones: Two heating zones provide even warming across the entire surface, enhancing food safety. Temperature Range: Maintains a temperature range of 155F to 205F, ensuring optimal food quality and safety. 600 Watts Power: Efficient warming capability that balances power and energy consumption effectively. Dial Control: Simple temperature adjustment for user-friendly operation. NSF Listed: Meets stringent health and safety standards, ensuring a safe food service environment. Portable Handle: Built-in handle for easy transport and positioning in various serving setups. Countertop Installation: Specifically designed for countertop use, making it a versatile addition to any buffet or catering operation. Heated Buffet Style: Perfect for keeping food warm and ready to serve at buffets, parties, or catered events.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>One year warranty on all oven motors<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/WT-40S.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"WT-40S\",\"price\":\"351\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"300\",\"margin\":\"14.53%\",\"product_id\":\"2401\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"1373\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"333.45\",\"margin\":\"10.03\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"1374\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"315.90\",\"margin\":\"5.03\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"21\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"15\",\"height\":\"3\",\"width\":\"46\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0\",\"shipping_height\":\"0\",\"shipping_width\":\"0\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"shipping_weight\":null,\"shipping_weight_option\":\"Kg\",\"titles\":{\"4\":null,\"5\":null},\"variant_color_title\":\"Color\",\"variant_color_value\":null,\"variant_color_products\":null,\"variant_1_title\":null,\"variant_1_value\":null,\"variant_1_products\":null,\"variant_2_title\":null,\"variant_2_value\":null,\"variant_