(8123, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco WTBS-23P Double Electric Buffet Server with Clear Lids - 120V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-684\",\"slug_id\":\"3530\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco WTBS-23P Double Electric Buffet Server with Clear Lids is an excellent addition to any food service operation, offering a reliable solution for maintaining food temperature and quality in buffet settings. This model measures 18 1\\/4 inches in width, 15 1\\/4 inches in depth, and stands 7 7\\/8 inches high, making it a perfect fit for countertop use. Designed to hold two 1\\/3 size pans, it features a stainless steel construction that is both durable and easy to clean, ensuring it withstands the rigors of commercial kitchen environments. With a power supply of 120 volts and a wattage of 300 watts, it operates on a single heating zone, effectively keeping food warm within a temperature range of 155F to 205F. The intuitive dial control makes it simple to set and adjust temperatures, while the clear lids allow for visibility of food items, enhancing presentation and accessibility. The buffet server is NSF listed, confirming its compliance with health and safety standards, and includes a convenient handle for easy transport, making it ideal for self-service stations.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Compact Dimensions: 18 1\\/4\\\" W x 15 1\\/4\\\" D x 7 7\\/8\\\" H; optimized for buffet setups while accommodating two 1\\/3 size pans. Durable Stainless Steel: Provides strength and durability while ensuring easy cleaning for daily use in food service operations. Dual Pan Capacity: Designed to hold two 1\\/3 size pans for versatile food offerings in a single server. Temperature Range: Maintains food temperatures between 155F and 205F, ensuring optimal food safety and quality. 300 Watts of Power: Efficiently warms food without excessive energy consumption. Dial Control: User-friendly temperature adjustment, allowing for quick