(8124, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco WTBS-4N-HD 4-Compartment Half Size Electric Heavy-Duty Buffet Server with Roll Top Lids - 120V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-711\",\"slug_id\":\"3557\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco WTBS-4N-HD Electric Heavy-Duty Buffet Server is designed for efficient and reliable food service in any commercial kitchen or catering environment. With a spacious 4-compartment setup, this buffet server can accommodate half-size pans, making it perfect for serving a variety of dishes. Each compartment features heated shelves, ensuring that food remains at an optimal serving temperature, ranging from 155 to 205 degrees Fahrenheit. The durable stainless steel construction provides longevity and ease of cleaning, while the roll top lids allow for convenient access to food while maintaining warmth. Operating at 600 watts and 120 volts, this buffet server is equipped with a dial control for easy temperature adjustments. The self-service design includes handles for easy transport, making it ideal for buffets, parties, and events.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Dimensions: 45\\\" W x 14 3\\/8\\\" D x 12\\\" H Generous size for multiple food items. Compartment Count: 4 compartments Holds half-size pans for diverse menu options. Wattage: 600 Watts Efficient heating for maintaining food temperatures. Voltage: 120 Volts Standard voltage compatible with most outlets. Construction Material: Stainless Steel Ensures durability and easy maintenance. Temperature Range: 155 - 205 Degrees F Keeps food warm and ready to serve. Control Type: Dial Simple and straightforward temperature control. Heating Zones: 2 zones Provides consistent heating across compartments. Lid Type: Roll top lids Facilitates easy access while keeping food warm. Plug Type: NEMA 5-15P Standard plug for easy connection.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>One year warranty on all oven motors<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/