(8125, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco WTRT-10-HD 24\\\" x 14 3\\/8\\\" x 9 3\\/4\\\" Electric Heavy-Duty Countertop Warming Shelf with Roll Top Lid - 120V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-682\",\"slug_id\":\"3528\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco WTRT-10-HD Electric Heavy-Duty Countertop Warming Shelf is expertly designed to keep food warm in buffet settings while enhancing convenience and accessibility. Measuring 24 inches in width, 14 3\\/8 inches in depth, and 9 3\\/4 inches in height, this warming shelf features a roll-top lid for easy access to food items while effectively maintaining temperature. The stainless steel construction provides durability and ease of cleaning, making it ideal for commercial kitchen environments. Operating at 300 watts with a voltage of 120 volts, this unit utilizes a single heating zone to deliver consistent warmth within a temperature range of 155F to 205F. The intuitive dial control allows for simple adjustments, ensuring that food is kept at the perfect serving temperature. NSF listed for safety and sanitation, the WTRT-10-HD is equipped with a handle for effortless mobility, making it an excellent addition to any catering setup or buffet service.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Roll Top Lid: Provides easy access to food while keeping items warm and protected. Stainless Steel Construction: Ensures durability and resistance to corrosion, ideal for heavy-duty use. Compact Size: Dimensions of 24\\\" W x 14 3\\/8\\\" D x 9 3\\/4\\\" H make it suitable for countertop placement in various settings. 300 Watts Power: Efficient heating capability designed to maintain optimal food temperatures. Temperature Range: Keeps food warm within a range of 155F to 205F, ensuring food safety. Dial Control: User-friendly temperature adjustment for precise heating. NSF Listed: Meets rigorous health and safety standards, suitable for commercial kitchens. Single Heating Zone: Delivers consistent warmth across the entire shelf surface. Built-in Handle: Facilitates easy transport and repositioning in serving areas. Ideal for Buffet Service: Designed specifically for buffet-style food service, enhancing both presentation and accessibility.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>One year warranty on all oven motors<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/WTRT-10-HD.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"WTRT-10-HD\",\"price\":\"391.95\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"335\",\"margin\":\"14.53%\",\"product_id\":\"2400\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"1371\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"372.35\",\"margin\":\"10.03\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"1372\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"352.75\",\"margin\":\"5.03\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"23\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"14\",\"height\":\"10\",\"width\":\"24\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0\",\"shipping_height\":\"0\",\"shipping_width\":\"0\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"shipping_weight\":null,\"shipping_weight_option\":\"Kg\",\"titles\":{\"4\":null,\"5\":null},\"variant_color_title\":\"Color\",\"variant_color_value\":null,\"variant_color_products\":null,\"variant_1_title\":null,\"variant_1_value\":null,\"variant_1_products\":null,\"variant_2_title\":null,\"variant_2_value\":null,\"variant_2_products\":null,\"variant_3_title\":null,\"variant_3