(8134, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco Rossella XAF-193 4-Shelf Full Size Heavy-Duty Manual Countertop Convection Oven - 208-240V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-700\",\"slug_id\":\"3546\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco Rossella XAF-193 is a robust full-size countertop convection oven designed for commercial kitchens that require high performance and reliability. With a generous cooking capacity of 3.85 cu. ft., this oven can accommodate full-size sheet pans and features four adjustable racks, allowing for versatile cooking options such as baking, roasting, and steaming. The oven operates with a temperature range of 175F to 500F, providing precise control over the cooking environment. Its glass door allows for easy visibility of the cooking process without interrupting heat circulation. Built from durable stainless steel, the XAF-193 is engineered to withstand the rigors of daily use, making it a perfect choice for busy restaurants and catering services.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Spacious Capacity: 3.85 cu. ft. accommodates full-size sheet pans for maximum cooking volume. Four Rack Capacity: Includes four adjustable racks for versatile cooking arrangements. Temperature Range: Operates between 175F and 500F for precise cooking control. Controlled Humidity: Designed to maintain optimal moisture levels for various cooking applications. Sturdy Construction: Made from heavy-duty stainless steel for durability and ease of cleaning. Glass Door: Allows for easy monitoring of food without opening the oven. Manual Control: Simple dial controls for straightforward operation and temperature adjustments. Countertop Installation: Compact dimensions (31 1\\/2\\\" W x 32\\\" D x 23\\\" H) fit well on countertops. High Power Output: Operates on 208-240V with a powerful wattage of 5.9 kilowatts. NEMA L6-30P Plug: Standard plug type for safe and easy connection to power sources.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>O