(8136, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco Bakerlux Station XAFT-03HS-LD 3-Shelf Half Size Heavy-Duty Digital Countertop Convection Oven with LED Control Panel - 208-240V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-704\",\"slug_id\":\"3550\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco Bakerlux Station XAFT-03HS-LD 3-Shelf Half Size Heavy-Duty Digital Countertop Convection Oven is a versatile and efficient oven built to meet the demands of busy commercial kitchens. With a capacity of 1.6 cubic feet and three adjustable shelves, it provides ample cooking space for a variety of foods. This countertop oven features an intuitive LED control panel for easy programming, along with steam injection for enhanced baking quality. Operating on 208-240 volts and 3.3 kilowatts, its both powerful and energy-efficient, suitable for high-volume cooking in limited spaces.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Three Half-Size Shelves: Allows for efficient, high-capacity baking. LED Digital Control Panel: Easy-to-use and programmable. Steam Injection Feature: Enhances baking by adding moisture. Wide Temperature Range (175F - 500F): Suitable for various cooking needs. Energy Star Qualified: Energy-efficient, reducing operating costs. NSF Listed: Meets strict sanitation standards. Stainless Steel Construction: Durable and easy to clean. Glass Door with Bottom Hinge: Offers visibility and convenient access. Compact Countertop Design: Ideal for limited kitchen space. NEMA 6-20P Plug: Compatible with 208-240V outlets.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>One year warranty on all oven motors<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/XAFT-03HS-LD.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"XAFT-03HS-LD\",\"price\":\"1941\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"1687.5\",\"margin\":\"13.06%\",\"product_id\":\"2422\",\"barcode\":null,\"wit