(8139, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco Bakerlux Station XAFT-04HS-TD 4-Shelf Half Size Heavy-Duty Digital Countertop Convection Oven with Touch Control Panel - 208-240V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-716\",\"slug_id\":\"3562\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco Bakerlux Station XAFT-04HS-TD is a heavy-duty digital countertop convection oven designed for efficiency and precision in commercial kitchens. This four-shelf oven features a stainless steel exterior, ensuring durability and easy maintenance. With a capacity of 1.6 cubic feet and a temperature range of 175F to 500F, it is perfect for a variety of cooking tasks, from baking to roasting. The digital control panel offers programmable settings for enhanced convenience, while the steam injection feature helps maintain moisture in baked goods for improved texture and flavor. This oven is also Energy Star qualified, reflecting its energy-efficient design. Its compact size, measuring 23 5\\/8 inches wide, makes it an excellent choice for establishments with limited space.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Dimensions: 23 5\\/8\\\" W x 29\\\" D x 16 5\\/8\\\" H Compact footprint suitable for countertop use. Interior Dimensions: 19 1\\/4\\\" W x 14\\\" D x 10 1\\/4\\\" H Generous cooking space for half-size pans. Amps: 12 Amps Provides efficient energy use for commercial settings. Voltage: 208 - 240 Volts Compatible with standard commercial electrical systems. Wattage: 3.3 Kilowatts Ensures powerful performance for fast cooking. Control Type: Digital Intuitive interface for easy temperature and time adjustments. Features: Energy Star qualified, NSF listed, programmable settings, and steam injection for versatile cooking. Rack Capacity: 3 Allows for multiple trays to be cooked simultaneously. Door Type: Glass Enables easy monitoring of food without opening the door. Plug Type: NEMA 6-20P Suitable for commercial power outlets, ensuring compatibility and safety.<\\/p