(8141, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish 5AG-S Double Rack Upright Dish Machine Includes 2 Sheet Pan Racks\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-247\",\"slug_id\":\"3093\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The 5-AG-S Dish Machine is engineered to deliver exceptional performance and efficiency, boasting a range of standard features that cater to the demands of high-volume commercial dishwashing. With the ability to clean an impressive 74 racks per hour, this machine ensures rapid throughput, making it an ideal choice for busy kitchen environments. Its water consumption rate of 1.6 gallons per rack strikes a balance between effective cleaning and resource conservation, contributing to both operational efficiency and sustainability efforts. The generous door clearance of 20 1\\/2 inches facilitates seamless loading and unloading of dishes, enhancing workflow efficiency and minimizing downtime during busy service periods. The top mount controls with auto start functionality offer intuitive operation, while the stainless steel air gap and quick-release spray arms ensure durability and easy maintenance, providing reliable performance over the long term. One standout feature of the 5-AG-S Dish Machine is its Double Duty Model, designed to multiply dishwashing capability and meet the diverse needs of commercial kitchens. Equipped with two quick-service 1 1\\/2 HP pumps and a dual-screen system to protect wash pump and wash arms, this dishwasher delivers consistent and thorough cleaning results with every cycle. The option to wash sheet pans horizontally with the optional pan rack expands the machine\'s versatility, accommodating a broader range of kitchenware and enhancing operational flexibility. Detailed specifications, including motor horsepower, water consumption rates, and available cycle times, offer users comprehensive insights into the machine\'s capabilities, ensuring informed decision-making and optimal performance in demanding kitchen environments. With its robust construction, versatile features, and efficient performance, the 5-AG-S Dish Machine stands as a reliable and adaptable solution for commercial dishwashing needs.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>This dishwasher accommodates two racks simultaneously, doubling the capacity for efficient throughput in high-volume commercial settings. Utilizing a low-temperature washing process, this machine ensures thorough cleaning while being gentle on dishware, suitable for delicate items and conserving energy. With a pass-thru configuration, dishes can be loaded from one side and unloaded from the other, seamlessly integrating into kitchen workflows and minimizing wait times between cycles. The inclusion of two sheet pan racks expands the machine\'s versatility, allowing for the washing of sheet pans horizontally alongside standard dish racks, enhancing operational flexibility. The upright design optimizes space utilization, making it an ideal choice for establishments with limited floor space, while still delivering efficient and reliable dishwashing performance.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/028-0090.0119_65c19f1f-7677-4ccf-b085-11da85fd3d42.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"028-0090.0119\",\"price\":\"11414.19\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"8987.55\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1965\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"485\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"10843.48\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"486\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"di