(8143, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish AWS Energy-Star Single Door Upright Dish Machine Front Load\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-256\",\"slug_id\":\"3102\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The standard features of the AWS dishwasher epitomize efficiency and reliability, making it an indispensable asset in commercial kitchens. With an Energy Star rating, it demonstrates its commitment to reducing energy consumption while maintaining high-performance standards. Its impressive water usage of under 1 gallon per rack ensures not only thorough cleaning but also conservation of water resources. Equipped with a powerful stainless steel pump featuring upper and lower rotating spray arms, this dishwasher delivers consistent and effective cleaning results, eliminating food residue and stains with ease. The built-in stainless steel scrap accumulator further enhances its functionality by preventing debris buildup, simplifying maintenance tasks and prolonging the dishwasher\'s lifespan. Its tallest door opening at 19 inches facilitates easy loading and unloading of dishes, enhancing operational efficiency in busy kitchen environments. Additionally, the AWS dishwasher offers a range of optional features to meet specific needs and preferences. These include a patent-pending top drying rack for enhanced drying capabilities, a sustainer heater available on standard units, and a built-in booster heater for increased temperature flexibility. The inclusion of an under-frame storage rack maximizes space utilization and organizational efficiency. With a motor horsepower of 1.5 HP and cycle times ranging from 90 to 150 seconds, this dishwasher ensures efficient operation and versatility to accommodate varying cleaning requirements. Its compatibility with standard 20\\\" x 20\\\" racks further enhances its convenience and usability. Overall, the AWS dishwasher combines innovative features, precise specifications, and optional enhancements to deliver reliable and high-performance dishwashing solutions for commercial establishments.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>The AWS dishwasher is Energy-Star certified, ensuring optimal energy usage and cost savings, ideal for environmentally conscious businesses. With a low-temp wash feature, this dishwasher effectively cleans dishes while minimizing energy consumption, preserving delicate dishware. Featuring a single rack, single door, and front load design, this dishwasher offers convenient loading and unloading, streamlining workflow in commercial kitchens. Equipped with a single chemical alarm system, this dishwasher enhances safety by alerting users to any issues with chemical levels, ensuring optimal cleaning performance and compliance with safety regulations. Its upright configuration saves valuable floor space in commercial kitchens, optimizing layout efficiency while maintaining high-capacity dishwashing capabilities.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/030-1090.0184_fe012a2d-25b3-45ea-a9ad-52485631bdb1.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"030-1090.0184\",\"price\":\"6649.72\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"5236\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1974\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"503\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"6317.23\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"504\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"5984.75\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weigh