(8145, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish AWS Energy-Star Single Door Upright Dish Machine with Single Rack\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-254\",\"slug_id\":\"3100\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The AWS dishwasher stands as a pinnacle of efficiency and reliability, boasting a comprehensive array of standard features tailored to meet the rigorous demands of commercial kitchens. As an Energy Star rated appliance, it underscores its commitment to sustainability by minimizing energy usage and reducing utility costs. With its impressively low water usage of under 1 gallon per rack, this dishwasher ensures thorough cleaning while conserving precious water resources, aligning with eco-conscious operational practices. Its powerful stainless steel pump, equipped with upper and lower rotating spray arms, delivers robust cleaning performance, effectively removing food residue and stains from dishes and utensils. Additionally, the built-in stainless steel scrap accumulator streamlines maintenance tasks by preventing debris buildup, while the tallest door opening at 19 inches facilitates seamless loading and unloading, enhancing operational efficiency in bustling kitchen environments. In addition to its standard features, the AWS dishwasher offers a range of optional enhancements to further elevate its functionality to meet specific needs and preferences. These optional features include a patent-pending top drying rack, sustainer heater, built-in booster heater, and under-frame storage rack, providing added versatility and convenience. With a motor horsepower of 1.5 HP and cycle times ranging from 90 to 150 seconds, this dishwasher ensures efficient operation and versatility to accommodate varying cleaning requirements. Its compatibility with standard 20\\\" x 20\\\" racks further enhances its convenience and usability, making it a reliable and high-performance solution for commercial dishwashing needs.<\\/p>\",\