(8146, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish AWS-H Single Rack Upright Dish Machine with Single Door\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-253\",\"slug_id\":\"3099\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The AWS-H Series dish machine boasts a comprehensive set of standard features, making it a top choice for commercial dishwashing needs. This Energy Star-rated appliance ensures efficiency while minimizing environmental impact. With a remarkable water usage of under 1 gallon per rack, it stands as a testament to water conservation efforts. Equipped with a powerful stainless steel pump featuring upper and lower rotating spray arms, this machine delivers thorough cleaning performance. Its built-in stainless steel scrap accumulator helps maintain cleanliness during operation. Additionally, the machine offers flexibility with a choice of time cycles90, 120, or 150 secondssuitable for various dishwashing requirements. Its tallest door opening at 19 inches facilitates easy loading and unloading of dishes. Optional features further enhance the functionality of the AWS-H Series dish machine to meet specific user needs. The patent-pending Top Drying Rack, built-in booster heater, and under-frame storage rack provide customizable options for improved drying, enhanced cleaning, and convenient storage solutions. Moreover, specifications such as motor horsepower, water consumption rates, and electrical ratings ensure users have detailed insights into the machine\'s capabilities. With its robust construction, efficient performance, and adaptable features, the AWS-H Series dish machine stands as a reliable and versatile solution for commercial dishwashing operations.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>the AWS-H dish machine utilizes a low-temperature washing process, which is ideal for delicate dishware and reduces energy consumption compared to high-temperature alternatives. With its single rack configuration, this dishwasher is optimized for smaller operations or establishments with limited space. It allows for efficient handling of dishes while conserving space in the kitchen. The single-door design of the AWS-H makes loading and unloading dishes a breeze. It simplifies workflow and enhances efficiency by providing easy access to the rack, reducing wait times between cycles. Featuring a front-load design, this dishwasher offers ergonomic advantages by allowing staff to load and unload dishes at a comfortable height. The upright configuration of the AWS-H ensures efficient use of vertical space in the kitchen. It maximizes floor space while still accommodating a significant volume of dishware, making it suitable for establishments with space constraints.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/030-2090.0000_a5afb81b-24cf-44ab-b2cc-3bc87b513e53.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"030-2090.0000\",\"price\":\"6996.87\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"5509.35\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1971\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"497\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"6647.03\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"498\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"6297.18\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"354\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"30\",\"height\":\"78\",\"width\":\"25\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0\",\"shipping_