(8148, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish  AWS-H, Single Rack Upright Dish Machine with Single Door\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-252\",\"slug_id\":\"3098\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The AWS-H series dish machine sets a high standard with its array of standard features tailored to meet the demands of commercial dishwashing. Being Energy Star rated, it ensures not only efficient operation but also environmental responsibility. With water usage reduced to under 1 gallon per rack, this dishwasher exemplifies water conservation efforts in the industry. Its powerful stainless steel pump, complemented by upper and lower rotating spray arms, guarantees thorough cleaning of dishware with every cycle. The inclusion of a built-in stainless steel scrap accumulator further enhances cleanliness during operation. Moreover, users can customize their dishwashing experience with a choice of time cycles90, 120, or 150 secondssuitable for various loads, all while accommodating standard 20\\\" x 20\\\" racks. Additionally, its tallest door opening at 19 inches facilitates convenient loading and unloading, ensuring smooth workflow in busy kitchen environments. For those seeking enhanced functionality, the AWS-H series offers optional features to tailor the dishwasher to specific needs. These include a patent-pending top drying rack for improved drying efficiency, a sustainer heater for maintaining optimal water temperature, a built-in booster heater for enhanced cleaning performance, and an under-frame storage rack for convenient storage solutions. Detailed specifications, including motor horsepower, water consumption rates, and electrical ratings, provide users with comprehensive insights into the machine\'s capabilities. With its robust construction, customizable features, and efficient performance, the AWS-H series dish machine stands as a reliable solution for commercial dishwashing needs.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>The AWS-H dishwasher utilizes a low-temperature washing process, preserving delicate dishware while conserving energy. Optimized for smaller operations, the single rack configuration efficiently handles dishware while saving kitchen space. Loading and unloading dishes is made easy with the single door design, enhancing workflow efficiency. Ergonomic benefits are provided by the front-load design, allowing staff to work comfortably during dishwashing tasks. Enhanced safety is ensured with the inclusion of a single chemical alarm, alerting users to any chemical-related issues during operation<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/030-2090.0440_e8547984-e25c-431c-9d96-d027c95ed771.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"030-2090.0440\",\"price\":\"7137.27\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"5619.9\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1970\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"495\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"6780.41\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"496\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"6423.54\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"354\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"30\",\"height\":\"78\",\"width\":\"25\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0\",\"shipping_height\":\"0\",\"shipping_width\":\"0\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"sh