(8156, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish ADC-44 R-L Dish Machine with Built On Booster,  44\\\" High Temp Conveyor, 240V \\/3 PH\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-210\",\"slug_id\":\"3056\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The ADC-44 dishwasher from American Dish sets itself apart with a comprehensive array of standard features that are often considered add-ons by other manufacturers. Operating at an impressive rate of 244 racks per hour, this dishwasher ensures efficient throughput while maintaining high standards of cleanliness. Its innovative design includes a dual rinsing system, providing thorough cleaning and sanitization for optimal hygiene. The user-friendly conveyor system enhances operational ease, while the low water consumption of just 0.49 gallons per load minimizes environmental impact and operational costs. With features like auto fill, energy-saving stage washer, and a fail-safe conveyor system, the ADC-44 offers a hassle-free and reliable dishwashing solution for commercial kitchens. Equipped with high-capacity heaters and a precise water control mechanism, the ADC-44 ensures consistent performance and reliable operation. Its robust construction, including a heavy stainless steel build and wide opening access doors with safety interlock, emphasizes durability and user safety. Additionally, the dishwasher features a self-purging system, wide-opening access doors, and a fail-safe conveyor system, further enhancing its efficiency and reliability. Whether in hot temp or chemical model wash settings, the ADC-44 maintains optimal temperatures for effective cleaning and sanitization, meeting the diverse needs of commercial dishwashing. With its comprehensive set of standard features and efficient operation, the ADC-44 stands out as a complete and ready-to-run solution for commercial dishwashing needs.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>The American Dish ADC-44 R-L dishwasher boasts a high throughput capaci