(8157, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish ADC-44 R-L LT Dish Machine 44\\\" Low Temp Conveyor With Polymer Final Rinse Jets\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-214\",\"slug_id\":\"3060\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The ADC-44 comes equipped with a comprehensive set of features as standard, distinguishing it from competitors who may offer similar functionalities as optional add-ons. At American Dish, our commitment lies in delivering fully operational machines right out of the box. With a capacity to handle 244 racks per hour, the ADC-44 ensures efficient throughput in commercial dishwashing operations. It operates only when racks are inserted, conserving energy and optimizing usage. Its cleaning prowess is unmatched, thanks to a dual rinsing system and a user-friendly conveyor that facilitates smooth operation. Moreover, the ADC-44 boasts numerous efficiency-enhancing features, including low water consumption, auto-fill functionality, and a self-purging mechanism. The absence of operator controls and circuit boards contributes to its quiet operation, while the rack-saving conveyor drive minimizes downtime and maintenance requirements. Crafted with heavy stainless steel construction, the ADC-44 is built to withstand rigorous use in commercial settings. With safety features like wide-opening access doors and a fail-safe conveyor system, it ensures both user safety and operational reliability. Additionally, its precise water control mechanism and dual-fail-safe heater control further optimize performance and durability, making it impervious to heavy soil, strong chemicals, and lime buildup.<\\/p>\",\"content\":null,\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/212-1044.0000_58dbaf20-9102-4008-ab5f-acb2c3d5155c.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"212-1044.0000\",\"price\":\"16948.4\",\"sale_price\":null,\