(8161, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish ADC-66 R-L Dish Machine 66\\\" Low-Temp Conveyor With Polymer Rinse Jets\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-205\",\"slug_id\":\"3051\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The ADC-66 dishwasher boasts a robust pre-wash system and unparalleled cleaning performance, thanks to its powerful 3 HP wash pump and 1.5 HP scrap pump, ensuring optimal cleanliness for every load. It outperforms other 66-inch conveyors in its class and is rated for dual sanitizing, meeting rigorous hygiene standards. With a remarkable 66% reduction in water usage compared to the industry average, it efficiently processes up to 244 racks per hour, consuming only 0.49 gallons of water per rack, making it both environmentally friendly and cost-effective. Additionally, it comes equipped with convenient features like autofill and shut-off, water curtain rinseability, and captive end caps, streamlining the dishwashing process and reducing downtime. The ADC-66 dishwasher incorporates advanced safety and maintenance features, including dual-fail safe heater control, a fail-safe conveyor system with a slip clutch design to prevent rack movement accidents, and a pre-wash scrap basket with V construction that keeps debris contained and protects the pump. Its drain pump filter and 2-stage pump strainer effectively eliminate wash pump obstructions and clogged jets, ensuring smooth operation. However, users must adhere to important installation guidelines, including proper bolting of clean and soiled tables, maintaining adequate distance between scrap sinks and the dishwasher, and ensuring that electrical and plumbing connections are handled by qualified professionals to comply with safety regulations and prevent potential issues.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>The ADC-66 R-L 66 dishwasher is engineered to handle high-volume dishwashing demands, with a capacity to process up to 244 racks per hour, ensuring efficient cleaning for busy commercial kitchens. Utilizing a low-temperature cleaning method, this dishwasher effectively removes food residue and sanitizes dishes while minimizing energy consumption, making it an eco-friendly and cost-effective solution. Equipped with polymer rinse jets, this dishwasher ensures thorough rinsing coverage, effectively removing detergent residues and leaving dishes sparkling clean after each wash cycle. Featuring a 5-wire conveyor system, this dishwasher offers reliable and smooth rack movement, minimizing the risk of jams or disruptions during operation, thereby maximizing productivity. With its intuitive interface and automated features, such as autofill and shut-off, the ADC-66 R-L 66 dishwasher simplifies the dishwashing process, reducing the need for manual intervention and optimizing workflow efficiency in busy kitchen environments.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/214-1066.0000_ffd14a2c-14aa-44a8-a705-86d7c5d55fab.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"214-1066.0000\",\"price\":\"27182.13\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"21403.25\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1923\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"401\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"25823.02\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"402\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"24463.92\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"960\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"