(8162, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish ADC-44-T L-R Dish Machine 44\\\" Stainless Steel Final Rinse Jets High-Temp Conveyor Tall Hood\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-196\",\"slug_id\":\"3042\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The ADC-44 comes standard with a comprehensive array of features, setting it apart from other dishwashers on the market. While competitors may offer similar functionalities as optional add-ons, our machine is fully equipped and ready for operation straight out of the box. With a capacity of 244 racks per hour and the ability to operate only when racks are inserted, it ensures efficient utilization of resources and energy. Its unmatched cleaning ability, facilitated by a dual rinsing system and precise water control mechanism, guarantees optimal cleanliness and hygiene for all dishes. Furthermore, the ADC-44 boasts user-friendly features such as an auto-fill function, energy-saving stage washer, and quiet operation, enhancing convenience and reducing operational costs. Its robust construction, including heavy stainless steel components and a fail-safe conveyor system, ensures durability and reliability in demanding kitchen environments. With advanced safety features like wide-opening access doors with safety interlocks and a slip clutch design for rack movement, it prioritizes both performance and user safety. Additionally, its compatibility with different power supplies and thorough sanitation options make it a versatile and practical choice for commercial kitchens.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>High-Temperature Conveyor: The ADC-44-T features a high-temp conveyor system, ensuring efficient cleaning and sanitization of dishes with hot water. Tall Hood Design: With its tall hood, this dishwasher accommodates larger items such as sheet pans and pots, making it versatile for various kitchen needs. Stainless Steel Final Rinse Jets: Equipped with stainless steel final rinse jets, the dishwasher ensures thorough rinsing for sparkling clean dishes. Advanced Cleaning Technology: The ADC-44-T utilizes advanced cleaning technology, including a dual rinsing system and precise water control mechanism, ensuring optimal cleaning performance. Durable Construction: Constructed with heavy-duty stainless steel, this dishwasher is built to withstand the rigors of commercial kitchen environments, ensuring long-lasting durability and reliability.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/215-0044.0000.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"215-0044.0000\",\"price\":\"26235.66\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"20658\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1914\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"383\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"24923.88\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"384\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"23612.09\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"760\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"0\",\"height\":\"0\",\"width\":\"64\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0\",\"shipping_height\":\"0\",\"shipping_width\":\"0\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"shipping_weight\":null,\"shipping_weight_option\":\"Kg\",\"titles\":{\"4\":null,\"5\":null},\"variant_color_title\":\"Color\",\"variant_color_value\":null,\"variant_color_products\":null,\"