(8167, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco CDR-1TFB Double Burner Stainless Steel Portable Electric Front-to-Back Hot Plate with 6\\\" Tubular Elements - 1,650W, 120V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-718\",\"slug_id\":\"3564\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco CDR-1TFB is a versatile double burner electric hot plate designed for efficiency and portability, making it an ideal choice for kitchens with limited space or for catering services. Featuring two 6-inch tubular burners, it offers a total power output of 1,650 watts, ensuring quick and effective cooking for a variety of dishes. With compact dimensions of 13 1\\/2 inches wide and 22 3\\/4 inches deep, this hot plate is built from durable stainless steel, providing longevity and easy maintenance. The infinite control type allows for precise temperature adjustments, making it suitable for a range of cooking tasks. Lightweight at only 14 pounds, the CDR-1TFB is easily transportable and fits seamlessly into any countertop setup, while its NEMA 5-15P plug type ensures compatibility with standard outlets<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Dimensions: 13 1\\/2\\\" W x 22 3\\/4\\\" D x 4 1\\/2\\\" H Compact size fits well on countertops. Burner Diameter: 6 Inches Two burners for flexible cooking options. Amps: 13.8 Amps Efficient power usage for reliable performance. Phase: 1 Phase Designed for standard single-phase electrical systems. Voltage: 120 Volts Compatible with most household and commercial kitchens. Wattage: 1,650 Watts Delivers robust heating power for efficient cooking. Burner Style: Coil Ensures even heat distribution for consistent results. Control Type: Infinite Allows for customizable heat settings for various cooking needs. Material: Stainless Steel Provides durability and ease of cleaning. Plug Type: NEMA 5-15P Easily plugs into standard outlets for convenient operation.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>One year warranty on all oven motors<\\/p>\"