(8170, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish HT-25 4 Wire Single Rack Upright Dish Machine, 3-Door Up, No Booster\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-198\",\"slug_id\":\"3044\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The HT-25 dishwasher boasts an efficient 60-second time cycle, making it ideal for busy commercial kitchens where speed and productivity are paramount. Its patented self-cleaning spray system ensures optimal performance with minimal maintenance required, enhancing the longevity of the machine and reducing downtime. Equipped with auto-fill and auto-shut off features as standard, this dishwasher offers convenience and ease of operation, allowing users to focus on other tasks while ensuring consistent water levels for effective cleaning. With a powerful 3 HP wash pump and ADS patented low-water protection, the HT-25 delivers exceptional cleaning performance while conserving water. Its innovative two-stage stainless steel drain filter prevents pump clogs, further enhancing reliability and reducing the need for maintenance. The dishwasher\'s versatile door design allows for installation in both corner and straight configurations without the need for conversion, providing flexibility to suit various kitchen layouts. Additionally, the option for a stainless steel built-on booster ensures compatibility with high-temperature washing requirements, making it a versatile solution for diverse dishwashing needs in commercial settings.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>The American Dish HT-25 4 Wire Single Rack Upright Dish Machine is engineered to deliver high-temperature cleaning, ensuring thorough removal of tough stains and grease from dishes, utensils, and kitchenware. Featuring a versatile three-door configuration set as a pass-thru unit, this dishwasher facilitates seamless workflow in busy kitchen environments. With a single rack capacity, the HT-25 efficiently processes one rack of dishes at a time, ensuring focused and effective cleaning. The HT-25 is designed to operate without the need for a booster heater, streamlining installation and reducing energy consumption. Built with durability in mind, the HT-25 is constructed with high-quality materials to withstand the demands of heavy-duty use in commercial kitchens. Its sturdy construction ensures longevity and reliability, providing consistent performance over time.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/311-0080.0000_a2df1ae2-5d7b-4907-af2e-6f0769a11cca.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"311-0080.0000\",\"price\":\"11012.55\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"8671.3\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1916\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"387\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"10461.92\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"388\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"9911.30\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"528\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"0\",\"height\":\"74\",\"width\":\"37\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0\",\"shipping_height\":\"0\",\"shipping_width\":\"0\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"shipping_weight\":null,\"shipping_weight_option\":\"Kg\",\"titles\":{\"4\":null,\"5\":null},\"variant_color_title\":\"Color\",\"variant_color_value\":null,\"variant_color_products\":null,\"variant