(8172, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish HUB-40 Undercounter High Temp Dish Machine With Booster\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-199\",\"slug_id\":\"3045\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The ENERGY STAR Qualified American Dish HUB-40 offers several advanced features to enhance efficiency and performance in commercial dishwashing operations. One notable feature is the \\\"Extenda-Cycle\\\" function, which extends the cycle time to ensure a final rinse temperature of 180F (82C), meeting rigorous sanitization standards. With universal power compatibility ranging from 208 to 240 volts and the ability to convert between single and three-phase power in the field, the HUB-40 provides flexibility in installation. Its smooth start feature helps protect fragile dishes from breakage, while the built-in booster ensures a high-temperature final rinse, with standard rise from 70F to 180F (39C to 82C). The machine is equipped with detergent and rinse aid pumps, along with priming switches for easy operation, and its noise-reducing double-wall design ensures a quieter working environment. In terms of specifications, the HUB-40 has a cycle time of 90 seconds, with a wash time of 70 seconds and a rinse time of 14 seconds, enabling it to wash up to 40 racks per hour. It features a 1 HP motor with pump drain, providing efficient and reliable performance. The machine\'s heating system includes tank heat electrically powered at 2.0 kW and an electric booster, with options for 6 kW or 9 kW depending on the desired rise in temperature. With a standard rack complement of 20\\\" x 20\\\", the HUB-40 accommodates various dish sizes and configurations, making it suitable for a wide range of commercial kitchen settings. Additionally, its ease of installation and operation, along with its energy-efficient design, make it a practical and cost-effective solution for foodservice establishments.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>The American Dish HUB-40 is designed for high-temperature dishwashing, ensuring thorough sanitation and effective removal of grease and grime from dishes, utensils, and glassware. With its compact undercounter design, the HUB-40 maximizes space efficiency in commercial kitchens, allowing for convenient placement beneath countertops while providing easy access for loading and unloading. Equipped with a built-in booster heater, this dish machine ensures that water reaches the required high temperatures for effective sanitization, making it suitable for meeting health and safety standards in food service establishments. Durable Construction: Constructed with durable materials, the HUB-40 is built to withstand the rigors of daily use in busy kitchen environments, providing reliable performance and longevity. The HUB-40 is designed for efficient operation, helping to streamline dishwashing processes and reduce labor costs while delivering consistently clean and sanitized dishes.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/411-1040_f399b45f-5768-40b4-ad51-02cdf8cccac6.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"411-1040\",\"price\":\"7907.02\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"6226\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1917\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"389\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"7511.67\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"390\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"7116.32\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16