(8182, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Serv-Ware RF2-HC 53.9\\u201d Stainless Steel Two Door Reach-In Freezer, 49 cu.ft\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"serv-ware-rf2-hc-539-stainless-steel-two-door-reach-in-freezer-49-cuft\",\"slug_id\":\"3602\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Serv-Ware RF2-HC is a robust 53.9 stainless steel two-door reach-in freezer with a substantial storage capacity of 49 cubic feet. This commercial-grade freezer is designed to meet the high demands of food service environments, featuring a heavy-duty stainless steel exterior and interior, ensuring durability and easy maintenance. The unit is equipped with two self-closing doors with a stay-open feature for convenience during loading and unloading. It also includes six adjustable, heavy-duty wire shelves that maximize storage space and provide flexibility to accommodate various products. This freezer operates with an environmentally friendly R290 hydrocarbon refrigerant, which is more efficient and has a lower environmental impact compared to traditional refrigerants. The digital temperature control system maintains consistent temperatures between -8F and 0F, ensuring that products remain frozen at the ideal temperature. The RF2-HC is also equipped with a powerful, bottom-mounted compressor that provides excellent cooling performance while being easy to service. Additionally, the unit features high-density polyurethane insulation for superior energy efficiency, contributing to lower operating costs.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Digital thermostat with a temperature range of -10F to 0F, ensuring precise and consistent freezing conditions.<br>Features a top-mounted, self-contained refrigeration system with environmentally friendly R290 hydrocarbon refrigerant for efficient and eco-friendly operation.<br>Durable stainless steel exterior and interior, offering long-lasting durability and easy cleaning while maintaining a professional appearance.<br>49 cubic feet of storage with six adjustable, heavy-duty wire shelves to accommodate a variety of products and organizational needs.<br>Equipped with two self-closing, lockable solid doors with heavy-duty handles, and high-density foamed-in-place polyurethane insulation for maximum energy efficiency and temperature retention.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>Three year warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/RF2-HC.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"RF2-HC\",\"price\":\"4253.05\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"2590\",\"margin\":\"39.10%\",\"product_id\":\"2474\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"1527\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"4040.40\",\"margin\":\"35.90\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"1528\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"3827.74\",\"margin\":\"32.34\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"488\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"33\",\"height\":\"82\",\"width\":\"54\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_height\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_width\":\"0.00\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"specs\":[{\"name\":\"Brand\",\"value\":\"Serv-Ware\"},{\"name\":\"Model Number\",\"value\":\"RF2-HC\"},{\"name\":\"Weight\",\"value\":\"488 lbs\"},{\"name\":\"Width\",\"value\":\"53.9\"},{\"name\":\"Depth\",\"value\":\"32.7\"},{\"name\":\"Height\",\"value\":\"82.3\"},{\"name\":\"Door Type\",\"value\":\"solid