(8190, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Serv-Ware SGF-40N 15.5\\u201d Stainless Steel 3 Tube Fryer, Natural Gas, 30,000 BTU\\/H\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-735\",\"slug_id\":\"3581\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Serv-Ware RR2-HC 15.5 Stainless Steel 2 Door Reach-In Refrigerator is a high-performance refrigeration unit designed for commercial kitchens. With a substantial storage capacity of 49 cubic feet, this refrigerator is equipped with a top-mounted, self-contained refrigeration system that uses R290 hydrocarbon refrigerant, an eco-friendly option that ensures efficient cooling with a reduced environmental impact. The unit operates on a standard 115v\\/1ph electrical connection, making it easy to integrate into most commercial setups. Its digital thermostat allows for precise temperature control, maintaining an ideal range of 33F to 41F, ensuring that food products remain fresh and safe. Constructed with a durable stainless steel interior and exterior, the RR2-HC is built to withstand the demands of a busy kitchen environment while being easy to clean and maintain. The refrigerator features two self-closing doors with magnetic gaskets that provide a tight seal, enhancing energy efficiency by keeping cold air inside. High-density foamed-in-place polyurethane insulation further aids in temperature retention, reducing energy consumption. Inside, six adjustable heavy-duty wire shelves offer flexible storage options, allowing for efficient organization of various perishable goods. This combination of robust construction, efficient cooling, and ample storage makes the Serv-Ware RR2-HC an excellent choice for commercial refrigeration needs.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Utilizes a self-contained, top-mounted refrigeration system with R290 hydrocarbon refrigerant, providing efficient and eco-friendly cooling performance.<br>Features a digital thermostat and LED display with a temperature range of 33F to 41F, allowing for precise temperature management of stored items.<br>Built with a robust stainless steel exterior and interior for superior durability, easy maintenance, and a professional appearance in any commercial kitchen setting.<br>Provides 49 cubic feet of interior storage, equipped with six adjustable, heavy-duty wire shelves, offering flexible organization options for various refrigerated goods.<br>Includes high-density, foamed-in-place polyurethane insulation and self-closing doors with magnetic gaskets, optimizing energy use and maintaining consistent internal temperatures.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>Three year warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/Fortress.556-1.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"SGF-40N\",\"price\":\"1468.04\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"894\",\"margin\":\"39.10%\",\"product_id\":\"2453\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"1485\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"1394.64\",\"margin\":\"35.90\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"1486\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"1321.24\",\"margin\":\"32.34\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"161\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"30\",\"height\":\"47\",\"width\":\"16\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0\",\"shipping_height\":\"0\",\"shipping_width\":\"0\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"specs\":[{\"name\":\"Brand\",\"value\":\"Serv-Ware\"},{\