(8191, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish AF-ES Energy Star, 2-Door Upright Dish Machine with Single Rack Pass-Thru and Single Chemical Alarm\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-265\",\"slug_id\":\"3111\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The AF-ES Dish Machine is equipped with a range of standard features designed to optimize efficiency and performance in commercial dishwashing operations. As an Energy Star certified appliance, it adheres to stringent energy efficiency guidelines, offering significant energy savings while maintaining high cleaning standards. With a powerful 1 1\\/2 HP pump, this dishwasher delivers robust cleaning power, capable of cleaning up to 37 racks per hour, ensuring rapid turnover and smooth operation in busy kitchen environments. Its convertible design adds versatility, allowing seamless integration into different kitchen layouts, while the large door opening and 20 1\\/2-inch door clearance facilitate easy loading and unloading of dishes, streamlining workflow processes. Additionally, the AF-ES Dish Machine prioritizes simplicity and convenience in maintenance and operation. Featuring dual screens to protect the pump and a large capacity scrap accumulator, it efficiently collects debris, simplifying cleaning routines and minimizing maintenance downtime. The dishwasher\'s specifications highlight its high performance and reliability, with a 1.5 HP motor ensuring consistent and powerful operation. Its low water consumption of .936 gallons per cycle and available cycle times ranging from 90 to 150 seconds further contribute to its efficiency and versatility. With electrical ratings compatible with standard 115-volt single-phase power sources, installation and operation are straightforward, making it an ideal choice for commercial kitchens seeking efficient and reliable dishwashing equipment.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Ensures energy efficiency, reducing operational costs while minimizing environmental impact. Facilitates efficient loading and unloading of dishes, enhancing workflow in commercial kitchens. Suitable for moderate dishwashing volumes, accommodating a single rack per cycle. Allows for dishes to be loaded from one side and unloaded from the other, streamlining dishwashing processes. Provides gentle yet effective cleaning, suitable for delicate items and reduces energy usage compared to high-temperature wash cycles.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/011-1090.0001_584a1e3e-035d-445a-b224-f50bb0542d51.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"011-1090.0001\",\"price\":\"5909.31\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"4653\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1983\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"521\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"5613.84\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"522\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"5318.38\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"295\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"39\",\"height\":\"76\",\"width\":\"39\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_height\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_width\":\"0.00\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"shipping_weight\":null,\"shipping_weight_option\":\"Kg\",\"titles\":{\"4\":null,\"5\":null},\"variant_color_title\":\"Color\",\"variant_color_va