(8200, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish 5AG-S Double Rack Pass-Thru Upright Dish Machine with Low-Temp\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-249\",\"slug_id\":\"3095\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The 5AG-S Double Rack Dish Machine is a powerhouse in the realm of commercial dishwashing, combining efficiency with versatility to meet the demands of high-volume establishments. Its double rack capacity allows for simultaneous washing of two racks, effectively doubling throughput and optimizing workflow efficiency. This feature is especially beneficial for busy kitchens where a large volume of dishware needs to be cleaned quickly and effectively. Furthermore, the low-temperature operation ensures gentle yet thorough cleaning, making it suitable for delicate items while also conserving energy, aligning with modern sustainability goals and reducing operational costs. With its pass-thru design, the 5AG-S Dish Machine seamlessly integrates into kitchen layouts, facilitating smooth and continuous dishwashing operations. Dishes can be loaded from one side and unloaded from the other, minimizing wait times between cycles and maximizing productivity. The upright configuration further enhances space utilization, making it an ideal choice for establishments with limited floor space. Additionally, advanced features such as built-in chemical dispensing systems and powerful pumps with rotating spray arms ensure optimal cleaning performance, delivering consistently impeccable results in even the busiest of commercial environments.`<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>This dishwasher is designed to accommodate two racks simultaneously, doubling the capacity compared to single rack models. It is ideal for high-volume establishments or those with demanding dishwashing needs. The low-temperature washing process ensures thorough cleaning while being gentle on dishware that is suitable for delicate items and helps conserve energy compared to high-temperature alternatives. With a pass-thru configuration, this dishwasher allows seamless integration into kitchen workflows. Uright Configuration: The upright design optimizes space utilization in the kitchen, making it suitable for establishments with limited floor space. The 5AG-S Double Rack Dish Machine may include advanced features such as built-in chemical dispensing systems, powerful pumps with rotating spray arms, and customizable time cycles to suit specific dishwashing requirements.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/028-0090.0000_7e765d8d-fe8d-4128-8722-258ffd423786.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"028-0090.0000\",\"price\":\"7522.15\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"5922.95\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1967\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"489\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"7146.04\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"490\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"6769.93\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"408\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"34\",\"height\":\"71\",\"width\":\"49\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_height\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_width\":\"0.00\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"shipping_weight\":null,\"shipping_weight_option\":\"Kg\",\"titles\":{\"4\":\"Instal