(8206, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish AFB_w\\/ Bakery Rack Single Rack Upright Dish Machine with Single Chemical Alarm\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-222\",\"slug_id\":\"3068\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>This dishwashing unit offers flexibility with its selectable time cycle options of 90, 120, or 150 seconds, catering to varying washing needs. It is designed to accommodate standard 20\\\" x 20\\\" racks and boasts a robust high-pressure 1.5 HP pump for efficient cleaning performance. The machine includes built-in chemical dispensing and a scrap accumulator, enhancing convenience and maintenance efficiency. Tailored for bakery operations, it effectively washes and sanitizes bakery trays, pots, and pans, ensuring hygienic standards are met. Available in both corner and pass-through models, it adapts to different kitchen layouts, with a wide 27.5\\\" door opening equipped with a safety interlock mechanism. Special stainless steel dishracks are required for washing sheet pans, offering optimal cleaning results. In addition to its operational features, this dishwashing unit is engineered with practical specifications for seamless integration into kitchen utilities. With rated capacities ranging from 37 to 12 racks per hour, it accommodates diverse washing demands. The motor boasts a 1.5 HP horsepower, ensuring powerful performance during wash cycles. It consumes 2.5 gallons of water per cycle, maintaining water efficiency while delivering thorough cleaning results. The machine operates within a temperature range of 130F minimum, meeting industry standards for effective sanitization. With a versatile electrical setup, it is compatible with 115 volts, single-phase connections, requiring appropriate wiring and circuit protection for safe operation.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Equipped with a single chemical alarm for added safety and monitoring during the dishwashing process. Designed for low-temperature operation, ensuring energy efficiency and compatibility with delicate kitchenware. Configured as a pass-through unit, facilitating smooth workflow and easy access from both sides of the machine. Specifically tailored for bakery operations, featuring a TALL design to accommodate bakery trays and a single stainless steel sheet pan rack. Offers efficient washing and sanitizing capabilities, making it suitable for cleaning various types of kitchen equipment and utensils.Efficient and reliable, the American Dish AFB is a single rack upright dish machine with a built-in bakery rack and chemical alarm. Designed for low-temperature washing, this tall pass-thru machine is perfect for bakeries and comes with a bonus stainless steel sheetpan rack.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/016-0090.0024_4deb20fa-5d50-4916-acbe-2dbe3e5389a8.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"016-0090.0024\",\"price\":\"7039.48\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"5542.9\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1940\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"435\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"6687.51\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"436\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"6335.53\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"330\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"35\",\"height\":\"79\",\"width\":\"34\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_de