(8207, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish AFB_w\\/ Bakery Rack Single Rack Upright Dish Machine 208V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-221\",\"slug_id\":\"3067\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The dishwashing equipment offers flexible cycle durations of 90, 120, or 150 seconds, accommodating various washing requirements. It is designed to hold standard 20\\\" x 20\\\" racks and operates with a high-pressure 1.5 HP pump, ensuring thorough cleaning. Featuring built-in chemical dispensing and a scrap accumulator, it effectively washes and sanitizes bakery trays, pots, and pans. Available in both corner and pass-through configurations, it boasts a 27.5-inch door opening with a safety interlock mechanism. To properly wash sheet pans, a special stainless steel dishrack is necessary. Despite its compact footprint, it serves as a complete warewashing center, incorporating three 20\\\" x 20\\\" x 14\\\" deep sinks within a floor space of only 121 inches, with longer configurations available for larger-scale operations. In terms of specifications, the unit is capable of handling 37, 25, or 12 racks per hour, depending on the selected cycle duration. It is powered by a 1.5 HP motor and consumes 2.5 gallons (9.5 liters) of water per cycle. Maintaining a minimum temperature of 130F (54.4C), it ensures effective cleaning. For electrical requirements, it operates on a 115-volt single-phase power supply, necessitating connection with two 10-12 AWG copper wires and a suitable ground on a clean circuit. Circuit protection is provided by a 20-amp circuit breaker or fuse with a 20-amp rating.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Specifically designed for bakery operations, featuring a tall build and accommodating a bakery rack along with a stainless steel sheet pan rack. Operates at low temperature settings, ensuring delicate bakery items and sheet pans are effectively cleaned without risking damage. Configured as a pass-thru model, facilitating seamless workflow in busy kitchen environments. Equipped with a muffler heater for efficient heating, enhancing the washing and drying process. Powered by a 208V electrical connection, suitable for commercial kitchen setups requiring robust dishwashing capabilities.`<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/016-0090.0028_51f2e988-57e7-40d9-94e9-f445e9d3e63d.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"016-0090.0028\",\"price\":\"10499.85\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"8267.6\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1939\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"433\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"9974.86\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"434\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"9449.86\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"330\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"35\",\"height\":\"79\",\"width\":\"34\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_height\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_width\":\"0.00\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"shipping_weight\":null,\"shipping_weight_option\":\"Kg\",\"titles\":{\"4\":\"Installation Guide\",\"5\":null},\"variant_color_title\":\"Color\",\"variant_color_value\":null,\"variant_color_products\":null,\"variant_1_title\":null,\"variant_1_value\":null,\"variant_1_products\":null,\"variant_2_title\":null,\"v