(8216, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish ADC-44 L-R 44\\\" High Temp Conveyor 208V \\/ 3PH with Built On Booster Dish Machine\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-212\",\"slug_id\":\"3058\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The ADC-44 dishwasher from American Dish offers a comprehensive array of standard features that set it apart in the commercial dishwashing industry. With a remarkable capacity of 244 racks per hour, this machine operates efficiently and effectively, ensuring rapid throughput to meet the demands of busy restaurant kitchens. Its user-friendly conveyor system operates seamlessly, allowing for continuous washing without the need for operator controls, enhancing workflow and productivity. Moreover, the dishwasher boasts low water consumption, utilizing as little as 0.49 gallons per load, contributing to cost savings and environmental sustainability. Built with durability and reliability in mind, the ADC-44 incorporates heavy stainless steel construction and a fail-safe conveyor system that prevents rack damage and ensures uninterrupted operation. The machine\'s innovative features, such as the dual rinsing system, wide-opening access doors with safety interlock, and self-purging capabilities, further enhance its performance and ease of maintenance. Additionally, the precise water control mechanism and high-capacity heaters ensure optimal washing and sanitizing temperatures, while the built-in booster facilitates efficient rinsing. Whether in a high-volume restaurant or institutional kitchen, the ADC-44 dishwasher delivers consistent results and operational efficiency, making it a preferred choice for commercial dishwashing needs.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>The ADC-44 L-R operates at high temperatures, ensuring thorough cleaning and sanitization of dishes, utensils, and glassware, meeting the stringent hygiene standards of commercial kitchens. Equipped with a built-in booster, this dishwasher ensur