(8221, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish ADC-44-T R-L Dish Machine 44\\\" High-Temp Conveyor, Tall Hood Stainless Steel Final Rinse Jets\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-207\",\"slug_id\":\"3053\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>All the functionalities listed are standard features of the ADC-44, distinguishing it from other dishwashers available. While competitors might offer similar capabilities as additional options, at American Dish, our machines arrive fully equipped and operational from the start. Capable of handling up to 244 racks per hour and designed to operate only when racks are inserted, the ADC-44 ensures efficient use of resources and energy. Its cleaning prowess is unmatched, thanks to a dual rinsing system and precise water control mechanism, guaranteeing optimal cleanliness for all dishes. Moreover, the ADC-44 prioritizes user convenience with features like auto-fill, energy-saving stage washer, and quiet operation, minimizing operational costs and enhancing ease of use. Constructed with heavy stainless steel components and equipped with advanced safety features such as wide-opening access doors with safety interlocks and a fail-safe conveyor system, it ensures durability and reliability in demanding kitchen environments. Additionally, its compatibility with different power supplies and comprehensive sanitation options make it a versatile and practical choice for commercial kitchens, meeting the highest standards of performance and hygiene<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Boost your commercial kitchen\'s efficiency with the American Dish ADC-44-T High-Temp Dish Machine. Featuring a tall hood and stainless steel final rinse jets, this 44\\\" conveyor ensures a thorough clean for all your dishes.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/216-0044.0000_66c4b6a2-045a-402b-9c8a-de7df1ece7b9.webp\"],\"product_type\":\