(8230, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Serv-Ware RF2-HC 53.9\\u201d Stainless Steel Two Door Reach-In Freezer, 49 cu.ft\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"serv-ware-rf2-hc-539-stainless-steel-two-door-reach-in-freezer-49-cuft\",\"slug_id\":\"3602\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Serv-Ware RF2-HC is a robust 53.9 stainless steel two-door reach-in freezer with a substantial storage capacity of 49 cubic feet. This commercial-grade freezer is designed to meet the high demands of food service environments, featuring a heavy-duty stainless steel exterior and interior, ensuring durability and easy maintenance. The unit is equipped with two self-closing doors with a stay-open feature for convenience during loading and unloading. It also includes six adjustable, heavy-duty wire shelves that maximize storage space and provide flexibility to accommodate various products. This freezer operates with an environmentally friendly R290 hydrocarbon refrigerant, which is more efficient and has a lower environmental impact compared to traditional refrigerants. The digital temperature control system maintains consistent temperatures between -8F and 0F, ensuring that products remain frozen at the ideal temperature. The RF2-HC is also equipped with a powerful, bottom-mounted compressor that provides excellent cooling performance while being easy to service. Additionally, the unit features high-density polyurethane insulation for superior energy efficiency, contributing to lower operating costs.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Digital thermostat with a temperature range of -10F to 0F, ensuring precise and consistent freezing conditions.<br>Features a top-mounted, self-contained refrigeration system with environmentally friendly R290 hydrocarbon refrigerant for efficient and eco-friendly operation.<br>Durable stainless steel exterior and interior, offering long-lasting durability and easy cleaning while maintaining a professional appearance.<br>49 c