(8232, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Serv-Ware SGF-40L 15.5\\u201d Stainless Steel 3 Tube Fryer LPG Gas, 30,000 BTU\\/H\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-755\",\"slug_id\":\"3601\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Serv-Ware SGF-40L 15.5 Stainless Steel 3 Tube Fryer is a high-performance commercial kitchen appliance designed to meet the demands of busy foodservice environments. This fryer is equipped with three powerful heat tubes, each delivering 30,000 BTU per hour, ensuring rapid heat recovery and consistent frying temperatures. The heat exchange tubes are strategically positioned to maximize heat transfer and efficiency, allowing for quicker cooking times and better fuel economy. The fryer features a large oil capacity, accommodating up to 40 pounds, making it suitable for high-volume frying applications. Constructed with a durable stainless steel body, the SGF-40L is built to withstand the rigors of daily use while being easy to clean and maintain. The precision-engineered temperature control system allows for accurate adjustments, ensuring that food is cooked to perfection every time. The fryer also includes safety features such as a high-limit thermostat that prevents overheating and a built-in drain valve for safe and easy oil removal. Additionally, the fryer comes with two heavy-duty fryer baskets, each with a cool-touch handle, to ensure safe handling during operation. This robust and reliable fryer is an excellent choice for restaurants, catering services, and other commercial kitchens that require efficient and consistent frying capabilities.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Equipped with three tube burners, each delivering 30,000 BTU\\/H, providing a total heat output of 90,000 BTU\\/H for rapid and consistent frying performance.<br>The fryer has a 40-pound oil capacity, allowing for high-volume frying, making it ideal for busy commercial kitchens.<br>Features a millivolt thermostat with a temperature range of 200F to 400F, enabling precise control over frying temperatures for various food items.<br>Built with a heavy-duty stainless steel tank, door, front, and sides, ensuring durability, easy cleaning, and resistance to corrosion.<br>Includes a built-in high-limit safety thermostat and a temperature probe for accurate heat monitoring, preventing overheating and ensuring safe operation.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>Three year warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/RR2-HC.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"SGF-40L\",\"price\":\"1134.69\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"691\",\"margin\":\"39.10%\",\"product_id\":\"2473\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"1525\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"1077.96\",\"margin\":\"35.90\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"1526\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"1021.22\",\"margin\":\"32.34\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"161\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"30\",\"height\":\"47\",\"width\":\"16\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0\",\"shipping_height\":\"0\",\"shipping_width\":\"0\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"specs\":[{\"name\":\"Brand\",\"value\":\"Serv-Ware\"},{\"name\":\"Model Number\",\"value\":\"SGF-40L\"},{\"name\":\"Weight\",\"value\":\"161 lbs\"},{\"name\":\"Width\",\"value\":\"15.5\"},{\"name\":\"Depth\",\"value\":\"30.2\"},{\"name\":\"Height\",\"value\"