s for better accessibility and maintenance, along with efficient temperature management.<\\/li><li>Featuring a side\\/rear breathing compressor style, it is optimized for air circulation, making it suitable for placement in various kitchen configurations.<\\/li><li>Comes with a solid swing door, facilitating convenient access to the refrigerator\'s contents while ensuring excellent temperature retention.<\\/li><li>Designed with self-closing doors, this refrigerator enhances energy efficiency and convenience, ensuring that the door closes securely after each use.<\\/li><li>Operates with a 3\\/8 HP compressor, providing strong performance for maintaining optimal refrigeration temperatures.<\\/li><li>Utilizing R-600A refrigerant, the AUC27R is environmentally friendly and efficient, ensuring effective cooling with a reduced environmental footprint.&nbsp;<\\/li><li>It maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees Fahrenheit, making it suitable for a variety of perishable goods.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>2 Years Part and Labor Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"auc27r.webp\",\"abb60.webp\",\"auc48r.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"AUC27R\",\"price\":\"2999\",\"sale_price\":\"1399\",\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"2778\",\"margin\":\"7.37%\",\"product_id\":\"1679\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"1\",\"quantity\":\"150\",\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"product_quantity\":null,\"discount\":null,\"price_after_discount\":null,\"margin\":null,\"discount_from_date\":null,\"discount_to_date\":null},{\"product_quantity\":null,\"discount\":null,\"price_after_discount\":null,\"margin\":null,\"discount_from_date\":null,\"discount_to_date\":null}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"185\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"30\",\"height\":\"35.5\",\"width\":\"27\",\"ship