(8242, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Arctic Air AUC48R 48.25 Double Door Under-Counter Refrigerator\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"arctic-air-auc48r-48-25-double-door-under-counter-refrigerator\",\"slug_id\":\"2600\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Arctic Air AUC48R 48.25 Double Door Under-Counter Refrigerator is designed for commercial use, offering a shipping weight of 265 lbs and compact dimensions of 48 1\\/4 inches in width, 30 inches in depth, and 35 5\\/8 inches in height. With a capacity of 12 cu. ft., it is powered by a 3 amp draw at 115 volts and features a 3\\/8 HP bottom-mounted compressor, ensuring efficient cooling with a side\\/rear breathing design that maximizes airflow. Equipped with two solid swing doors, the AUC48R features self-closing doors for enhanced energy efficiency. Inside, it includes two adjustable shelves, allowing for flexible storage configurations. It operates with environmentally friendly R-600A refrigerant and maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, ideal for perishable goods. The NEMA 5-15P plug type and left\\/right hinge location make it versatile for various kitchen setups, ensuring reliable performance in busy food service environments. Weight &amp; Dimensions Shipping weight: 265 lbs Width: 48 1\\/4 Inches Depth: 30 Inches Height: 35 5\\/8 Inches<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<ul><li>The Arctic Air AUC48R measures 48.25 inches in width, 30 inches in depth, and 35.625 inches in height, designed to fit snugly under counters while providing wide refrigeration space.<\\/li><li>With a shipping weight of 265 lbs, this refrigerator offers solid construction for durability and reliability in a commercial kitchen environment.<\\/li><li>It operates on 115 volts and consumes 3 amps, making it energy-efficient and suitable for various kitchen setups without overloading circuits.<\\/li><li>Has a total capacity of 12 cubic feet, providing sufficient storage for a variety of perishable items, making it ideal for busy food service operations.<\\/li><li>Featuring a bottom-mounted compressor, it allows for easy access and maintenance while enhancing the unit\'s cooling efficiency by utilizing natural convection.<\\/li><li>Side\\/rear breathing compressor-style optimizes airflow, ensuring efficient cooling and preventing overheating even in confined kitchen spaces.<\\/li><li>Includes two solid swing doors that offer easy access to the refrigerated items, designed to close automatically for improved energy efficiency.<\\/li><li>Has self-closing doors, enhancing convenience and ensuring that the refrigerator maintains optimal temperatures by minimizing cold air loss when doors are left ajar.<\\/li><li>Equipped with a 3\\/8 HP compressor, the AUC48R delivers reliable cooling performance, maintaining consistent temperatures for the safe storage of perishables.<\\/li><li>Using R-600A refrigerant, this refrigerator is environmentally friendly and operates within a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees Fahrenheit, ensuring that all stored items remain fresh and properly chilled.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>2 Years Part and Labor Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"auc48r.webp\",\"abb60g.webp\",\"abb60.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"AUC48R\",\"price\":\"2788\",\"sale_price\":\"1849\",\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"1257\",\"margin\":\"54.91%\",\"product_id\":\"1678\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"1\",\"quantity\":\"150\",\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"product_quantity\":null,\"discount\":null,\"price_after_discount\":null,\"margin\":null,\"discount_from_date\":null,\"discount_to_date\":null},{\"product_quantity\":null,\"discount\":null,\"price_after_discount\":null,\"margin\":null,\"discount_from_date\":null,\"discount_to_date\":null}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"we