(8250, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish AF-ES 3D Energy Star 3-Door Upright Dish Machine with Single Rack\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-260\",\"slug_id\":\"3106\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The AF\\/AFC-ES Dish Machine boasts an array of standard features designed to enhance efficiency and performance in commercial kitchens. With Energy Star certification, it guarantees energy savings, reducing operational costs while maintaining high cleaning standards. Equipped with a powerful 1 1\\/2 HP pump, this dishwasher can handle up to 37 racks or 34 gallons per hour, ensuring swift and thorough cleaning cycles to meet the demands of busy kitchen environments. Its large door opening of 20 1\\/2 inches facilitates easy loading and unloading of dishes, optimizing workflow efficiency. The machine\'s convertible design adds versatility, allowing seamless integration into various kitchen layouts, while its 20 1\\/5-inch door clearance accommodates bulky items, making it suitable for diverse dishwashing needs. In terms of specifications, the AF\\/AFC-ES Dish Machine underscores its robust performance and reliability. Rated capacities ranging from 37 to 12 racks per hour provide flexibility to cater to different dishwashing volumes. Powered by a 1.5 HP motor, it ensures consistent operation, while its low water consumption of 0.936 gallons per cycle minimizes resource usage. With adjustable cycle times and a minimum water temperature requirement of 120F, users can customize wash settings to suit specific requirements. Additionally, the dishwasher\'s electrical ratings make installation straightforward, ensuring compatibility with standard power sources. Overall, the AF\\/AFC-ES Dish Machine combines advanced features with reliable specifications to deliver efficient and effective dishwashing solutions for commercial kitchens.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Energy Star certified ensures energy efficiency, reducing operational costs and environmental impact. Three-Door design facilitates efficient loading and unloading, optimizing workflow in commercial kitchens. Single rack capacity accommodates a single rack per cycle, suitable for moderate dishwashing volumes. Low-temperature wash provides gentle yet effective cleaning, maintaining consistent water temperature for optimal wash performance. Upright design and space-saving configuration, maximizing kitchen layout efficiency while providing ample dishwashing capacity.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/011-1091.0000_0b1e43b2-71a2-42b5-ac62-1cc0e4706fb5.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"011-1091.0000\",\"price\":\"6018.97\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"4739.35\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1978\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"511\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"5718.02\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"512\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"5417.07\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"295\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"34\",\"height\":\"71\",\"width\":\"34\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_height\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_width\":\"0.00\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"shipping_weight\":null,\"shipping_weight_option\":\"Kg\",\"titles\":{\"4\":nul