(8254, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish AF-ES 3D Upright Energy Star Low Temp 3-Door Dish Machine with Single Rack\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-258\",\"slug_id\":\"3104\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The AF-ES dishwasher is engineered with a suite of standard features tailored to optimize performance and efficiency in commercial kitchen environments. Its Energy Savings (ES) designation underscores its commitment to minimizing energy consumption without compromising on cleaning power. With an impressive capacity to handle 37 racks or 34 gallons per hour, driven by a powerful 1 1\\/2 HP pump, this dishwasher ensures rapid and thorough cleaning cycles. The large door opening, measuring 20 1\\/2 inches, facilitates easy loading and unloading of dishes, while dual screens effectively protect the pump from debris, reducing maintenance needs and extending its operational lifespan. Its convertible design and generous 20 1\\/5-inch door clearance offer adaptability, accommodating various dish sizes and configurations with ease. Additionally, the stainless steel air gap and large capacity scrap accumulator enhance hygiene and convenience, making the dishwasher simple to clean and maintain. In terms of specifications, the AF\\/AFC-ES Series dishwasher delivers reliable and consistent performance to meet the demands of high-volume commercial kitchens. With rated capacities of 37, 25, or 12 racks per hour, it offers versatility to suit different operational needs. The powerful 1.5 HP motor ensures efficient operation, while water consumption is kept minimal at just .936 gallons per cycle, promoting water conservation efforts. Offering flexibility, it provides cycle times ranging from 90 to 150 seconds to accommodate varying cleaning requirements. Installation is straightforward with electrical ratings of 115 volts and single-phase operation, requiring connection to a suitable power source using specified wiring and protection measures. Overall, the AF-ES dishwasher combines robust features and precise specifications to deliver superior cleaning performance while promoting energy and water efficiency in commercial kitchen settings.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>The AF-ES 3D dishwasher is Energy Star certified, ensuring optimal energy usage and reduced utility costs. Featuring three doors, this dishwasher offers ample loading space, streamlining dishwashing tasks in commercial settings. With a single rack setup, loading and unloading dishes is efficient, maximizing space and productivity. Gentle yet effective, the low-temperature wash cycle preserves dishware while removing tough stains. Equipped with a muffler heater, this dishwasher operates quietly, minimizing noise disruptions in the kitchen environment.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/011-1091.0208_436ab64a-5a54-4292-8a00-959d59267c48.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"011-1091.0208\",\"price\":\"9619.74\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"7574.6\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1976\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"507\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"9138.75\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"508\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"8657.77\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"295\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"34\",\"height\":\"71\",\"width\":\"34\",\"shipping