(9271, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish AF-3D-S Upright 2-Door Low Temp Dish Machine with Single Rack\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-275\",\"slug_id\":\"3121\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>This dishwasher is designed with a convertible layout, ensuring versatility to meet various kitchen needs. Its impressive 20.5\\\" door clearance makes it particularly suitable for pizza applications, providing ample space for loading and unloading trays with ease. With a powerful 1 1\\/2 HP pump, this dishwasher delivers quick service, facilitated by quick-release spray arms that enhance efficiency. Moreover, its stainless steel air gap ensures optimal hygiene, while the run indicator light keeps users informed of the machine\'s operational status. Cleaning is simplified thanks to its straightforward design, and it\'s available with solid chemical dispensing for added convenience. Equipped with an air gap fill that eliminates the need for check valves and vacuum breakers, this dishwasher ensures smooth operation. Additionally, its diagonal scrap trap allows for easy screen removal in both corner and pass-through models, streamlining maintenance tasks. Plumbing removal is made swift through zero-interference Stainless\\/Terelene Couplers, facilitating hassle-free repairs. The dishwasher\'s dual screens protect the pump intake, prolonging its lifespan. Optional features include solid chemical dispensing and stainless steel spray bases, bayonets, and manifold couplings, enabling quick release of spray arms for effortless cleaning. Models AFC-3D-S and AF-3D-S are available, each featuring built-in scrap accumulators for added convenience.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Efficient Design of the AF-3D-S features a compact 2-door design, ideal for space-saving in commercial kitchens. Single Rack Capacity easily accommodates a single rack and efficiently handles dishwashing tasks. Low temperature operation lets the dishwasher operate at low temperatures, ensuring energy efficiency and cost savings. Upright configuration makes loading and unloading dishes convenient and ergonomic so that you can handle the operations conveniently . Built for commercial use, the AF-3D-S delivers reliable and consistent dishwashing results.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/026-0090.0000_77aa12a4-1772-4bd3-bebf-246b468a68d1.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"026-0090.0000\",\"price\":\"5530.02\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"4354.35\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1993\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"541\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"5253.52\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"542\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"4977.02\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"295\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"39\",\"height\":\"76\",\"width\":\"39\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_height\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_width\":\"0.00\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"specs\":[{\"name\":\"Quantity\",\"value\":\"Each\\/1\"},{\"name\":\"Brand\",\"value\":\"American Dish\"},{\"name\":\"Model Number\",\"value\":\"American Dish AF-ES 3D\"},{\"name\":\"Shipping Weight\",\"value\":\"295 lb. 133.8 kg.\"},{\"name\":\"Shipping Volume (crated)\",\"value\":\"56.2