(9272, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish AF-3D-S Upright 2-Door Dish Machine with Single Rack and Single Chemical Alarm\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-274\",\"slug_id\":\"3120\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The AF-3D-S dishwasher offers an array of standard features designed to streamline dishwashing operations in commercial settings. Its convertible design, coupled with a generous 20.5\\\" door clearance, ensures versatility and accessibility, making it particularly suitable for pizza applications. Equipped with a powerful 1 1\\/2 HP pump and quick-release spray arms, this dishwasher delivers quick service without compromising on cleaning quality. Additionally, its stainless steel air gap and run indicator light enhance operational efficiency, while its simple-to-clean design and swift plumbing removal facilitate hassle-free maintenance. In terms of specifications, the AF-3D-S boasts a rated capacity of 37 racks per hour, driven by a robust 1.5 HP motor. With a water consumption of 2.2 gallons per cycle and available cycle times ranging from 90 to 150 seconds, it offers flexibility to accommodate varying workload demands. Electrical ratings include 115 Volts, Single Phase, with recommended connections using 10-12 AWG copper wires. Moreover, circuit protection is ensured with a 20 AMP circuit breaker or fuse, providing safety and reliability during operation.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>The AF-3D-S features a dual-door configuration, optimizing accessibility and workflow efficiency in commercial kitchens. With the capacity to hold a single rack, this dishwasher efficiently handles dishwashing tasks while conserving space. Operating at low temperatures, it ensures energy efficiency and minimizes utility costs without compromising cleaning performance. Equipped with a single chemical alarm, it enhances safety by alerting users to chemical levels, Designed in an upright configuration, loading and unloadin