(9276, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish AF-3D-S Upright 2-Door Dish Machine with Single Rack W\\/ 208V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-273\",\"slug_id\":\"3119\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The AF-3D-S dishwasher offers a range of standard features tailored for efficiency and convenience in commercial kitchen settings. Its convertible design and generous 20.5\\\" door clearance make it versatile and suitable for various applications, particularly ideal for pizza establishments. Equipped with a powerful 1 1\\/2 HP pump and quick-release spray arms, this dishwasher ensures quick service without compromising on cleaning quality. Additionally, the stainless steel air gap and run indicator light enhance operational efficiency, while the dishwasher\'s simple-to-clean design and swift plumbing removal streamline maintenance tasks. Furthermore, the AF-3D-S dishwasher is available with solid chemical dispensing for added convenience and safety. Its innovative features include an air gap fill that eliminates the need for check valves and vacuum breakers, as well as a diagonal scrap trap for easy screen removal in both corner and pass-through models. With additional options like stainless steel spray bases, bayonets, and manifold couplings, this dishwasher offers enhanced functionality and ease of maintenance. Models AFC-3D-S and AF-3D-S are also available, each featuring built-in scrap accumulators for added convenience.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>The AF-3D-S boasts a dual-door configuration, optimizing accessibility and workflow efficiency in commercial kitchens. With the capability to accommodate a single rack, this dishwasher efficiently handles dishwashing tasks while conserving space. Operating at low temperatures ensures energy efficiency and minimizes utility costs without compromising cleaning performance. Equipped with a muffler heater operating at 208V, it enhances dishwashing effectiveness for optimal results. Designed in an upright configuration, loading and unloading dishes are ergonomic and convenient, enhancing productivity during busy kitchen hours.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/026-0090.0052_694651bd-98b5-4a04-87de-35a46f801f33.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"026-0090.0052\",\"price\":\"9130.79\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"7189.6\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1991\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"537\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"8674.25\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"538\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"8217.71\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"295\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"39\",\"height\":\"76\",\"width\":\"39\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_height\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_width\":\"0.00\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"specs\":[{\"name\":\"Quantity\",\"value\":\"Each\\/1\"},{\"name\":\"Brand\",\"value\":\"American Dish\"},{\"name\":\"Model Number\",\"value\":\"American Dish AF-ES 3D\"},{\"name\":\"Shipping Weight\",\"value\":\"295 lb. 133.8 kg.\"},{\"name\":\"Shipping Volume (crated)\",\"value\":\"56.25 cu. ft. 1.59 cu meters\"},{\"name\":\"Height All closed Doors\",\"value\":\"71 1\\/2\\\" 181.6 cm\"},{\"name\":\"Height with Door\",\"value\"