(9287, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish AF-3D-S 3D Upright 3-Door Low Temp Dish Machine with Single Rack and Muffler Heater\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-267\",\"slug_id\":\"3113\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The AF-3D-S Dish Machine boasts a comprehensive array of standard features, making it a standout solution for commercial dishwashing needs. Its convertible design offers versatility, seamlessly adapting to various kitchen configurations to optimize workflow efficiency. With an impressive 20.5-inch door clearance, this dishwasher accommodates oversized items effortlessly, making it particularly well-suited for pizza applications and large dishware. Equipped with a quick service 1 1\\/2 HP pump and quick-release spray arms, it ensures swift and thorough dishwashing cycles, even during peak operational hours. Additionally, the inclusion of a stainless steel air gap and run indicator light enhances operational hygiene and monitoring, simplifying cleaning routines for added convenience. Furthermore, the AF-3D-S prioritizes durability and ease of maintenance, featuring innovative components such as the diagonal scrap trap for effortless screen removal and dual screens to safeguard the pump intake. Its swift plumbing removal system, utilizing zero-interference Stainless\\/Terelene Couplers, streamlines maintenance tasks, minimizing downtime and ensuring uninterrupted operation. Offering additional options like solid chemical dispensing and stainless steel spray bases, bayonets, and manifold couplings, this dishwasher provides versatile solutions tailored to meet specific operational requirements. Backed by robust specifications including a 1.5 HP motor and low water consumption of 2.2 gallons per cycle, the AF-3D-S delivers reliable performance while adhering to energy efficiency standards, making it an indispensable asset in commercial kitchens.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Facilitates efficient loadi