(9289, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish  AFC-3D-S 2-Door, Upright Dish Machine with Single Rack\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-272\",\"slug_id\":\"3118\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The AFC-3D-S Dish Machine offers a range of standard features tailored to optimize performance and ease of use in commercial dishwashing settings. Its convertible design provides flexibility, allowing seamless adaptation to various kitchen configurations. With a generous door clearance of 20.5 inches, this dishwasher accommodates bulky items and facilitates efficient loading and unloading processes, making it particularly suitable for pizza applications. Equipped with a quick service 1.5 HP pump, the machine ensures swift and thorough cleaning cycles, maximizing productivity in busy kitchen environments. The inclusion of quick-release spray arms and stainless steel air gap further enhances its functionality, simplifying maintenance routines and ensuring consistent wash performance. Moreover, the AFC-3D-S Dish Machine is designed with user convenience and reliability in mind. A run indicator light provides visual feedback on the operational status, facilitating monitoring and troubleshooting. The machine\'s innovative diagonal scrap trap allows for easy removal of debris screens in both corner and pass-through models, streamlining cleaning procedures and minimizing downtime. The plumbing system is engineered for efficiency and durability, featuring swift plumbing removal and dual screens to protect the pump intake. Additionally, the dishwasher offers optional solid chemical dispensing for enhanced sanitation, while its stainless steel spray bases, bayonets, and manifold couplings allow for quick-release spray arm removal, ensuring ease of cleaning and maintenance. Overall, the AFC-3D-S Dish Machine combines advanced features with robust specifications to meet the demanding requirements of commercial kitchen operations.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>The AFC-3D-S boasts a dual-door configuration, enhancing accessibility and workflow efficiency in busy commercial kitchens. With the capability to accommodate a single rack, this dishwasher efficiently handles dishwashing tasks while conserving space. Operating at low temperatures ensures energy efficiency and minimizes utility costs without compromising cleaning performance. Designed in an upright configuration, loading and unloading dishes are ergonomic and convenient, optimizing productivity during peak hours. Built for commercial use, the AFC-3D-S delivers reliable and consistent dishwashing results, meeting the demands of busy kitchen environments.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/027-0090.0000_04f7be56-dd57-4c0d-a69a-ee324e88a50f.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"027-0090.0000\",\"price\":\"5649.47\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"4448.4\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1990\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"535\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"5367.00\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"536\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"5084.52\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"295\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"39\",\"height\":\"76\",\"width\":\"39\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_height\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_width\