(9294, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish  AFC-3D-S 2-Door, Upright Dish Machine with Single Rack 208V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-270\",\"slug_id\":\"3116\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The AFC-3D-S dishwasher is packed with standard features designed to elevate efficiency and ease of use in commercial kitchens. Its convertible design ensures adaptability to various kitchen layouts, offering flexibility in installation options. With a remarkable 20.5-inch door clearance, this dishwasher accommodates larger items with ease, making it ideal for pizza applications and other oversized dishware. The inclusion of a quick service 1 1\\/2 HP pump facilitates rapid dishwashing cycles, enhancing throughput in busy environments. Additionally, the dishwasher features quick release spray arms and stainless steel air gap, simplifying cleaning procedures and promoting optimal hygiene standards. Its run indicator light provides clear feedback on operational status, aiding in monitoring and maintenance. Swift plumbing removal, utilizing zero-interference Stainless\\/Terelene Couplers, streamlines maintenance tasks, ensuring minimal downtime. Furthermore, the dishwasher boasts a diagonal scrap trap for easy screen removal and dual screens to protect the pump intake, contributing to efficient operation and maintenance. In terms of specifications, the AFC-3D-S offers a rated capacity of 37 racks per hour, powered by a robust 1.5 HP motor. It consumes 2.2 gallons of water per cycle, maintaining efficiency without compromising on cleaning performance. The dishwasher operates at a minimum water temperature of 120F (49C), ensuring effective sanitation. With available cycle times of 90, 120, and 150 seconds, users can tailor wash cycles to suit their specific needs. Its electrical ratings include compatibility with 115-volt single-phase power sources, with circuit protection requirements of a 20-amp circuit breaker or fuse. Overall, the AFC-3D-S dishwasher combines advanced features with reliable performance, making it an indispensable asset for commercial kitchens seeking optimal cleanliness and operational efficiency.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Facilitates efficient loading and unloading of dishes, enhancing workflow efficiency in busy kitchen environments. Accommodates a single rack per cycle, making it suitable for moderate to high volumes of dishware, glasses, and utensils. Ensures gentle treatment of delicate items while effectively cleaning and sanitizing, maintaining optimal cleanliness without compromising energy efficiency. Optimizes performance by maintaining water temperature consistently, ensuring thorough cleaning results with added energy efficiency benefits. Maximizes floor space in the kitchen, ideal for establishments in limited spaces, while the durable stainless steel construction ensures longevity and ease of maintenance.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/027-0090.0127_a3a3a2ed-424c-41e6-b024-55fff42feb5e.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"027-0090.0127\",\"price\":\"9250.24\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"7283.65\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1988\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"531\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"8787.73\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"532\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"8325.22\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\