(9299, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish 5AG-S Double Rack Upright Dish Machine with Low-Temp Pass-Thru and Single Chemical Alarm\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-248\",\"slug_id\":\"3094\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The 5AG-S Double Rack Dish Machine is a versatile and efficient solution for commercial dishwashing needs, combining multiple features to streamline operations. With its double rack capacity, this dishwasher maximizes throughput, allowing for simultaneous washing of two racks and catering to the demands of high-volume establishments. Its low-temperature operation ensures thorough cleaning while being gentle on dishware, making it suitable for a wide range of items and contributing to energy conservation efforts in the kitchen. Featuring a pass-thru design, this dishwasher seamlessly integrates into kitchen workflows, allowing dishes to be loaded from one side and unloaded from the other, minimizing wait times between cycles and optimizing productivity. The inclusion of a single chemical alarm enhances safety in the workplace, alerting users to any chemical-related issues during operation, ensuring a secure working environment for staff. Additionally, its upright configuration maximizes space utilization, making it an ideal choice for establishments with limited floor space while delivering efficient and reliable dishwashing performance. Overall, the 5AG-S Double Rack Dish Machine stands as a reliable and versatile solution for commercial dishwashing needs.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>This dishwasher accommodates two racks simultaneously, effectively doubling the capacity compared to single rack models, ideal for high-volume establishments. Utilizing a low-temperature washing process, this machine ensures thorough cleaning while being gentle on dishware, suitable for delicate items and energy conservation. With a pass-thru configuration, dishes can be loaded from one side and unloaded from 