(9306, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish HT-25 4 Wire Single Rack Upright Dish Machine, 3-Door Up, 3 HP\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-197\",\"slug_id\":\"3043\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The HT-25 4 Wire Single Rack Upright Dish Machine is a high-temperature dishwashing solution designed for commercial kitchens with demanding cleaning needs. With its 3-door setup configured as a pass-thru, this machine offers seamless integration into kitchen workflows, allowing for efficient loading and unloading of racks. Equipped with a built-in booster heater, it ensures that water reaches the high temperatures necessary for effective sanitization, meeting sanitation standards and ensuring dishes come out clean and sanitized. Featuring a robust 4-wire configuration, this dishwasher is built for reliability and performance. Its high-temp design, coupled with the powerful wash pump, guarantees thorough cleaning of tough residues and grease, leaving dishes sparkling clean. The inclusion of three doors configured as a pass-thru enhances accessibility and streamlines dish flow, making it ideal for high-volume operations where speed and efficiency are paramount. Additionally, with its built-in booster, this dishwasher is versatile and adaptable to various kitchen setups, providing flexibility and convenience to meet the diverse needs of commercial kitchens.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Equipped with a 60-second time cycle, allowing for rapid dishwashing cycles to meet the demands of busy commercial kitchens. Patented self-cleaning spray system ensures optimal performance and reduces maintenance requirements, enhancing efficiency and reliability. Auto-fill and auto-shut off features come as standard equipment, offering convenience and ensuring consistent water levels for effective cleaning. Two-stage stainless steel drain filter eliminates clogged pumps, enhancing reliability and reducing downtime for maintenance. Powe