(9308, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish HT-34 Single Rack High-Temp Pan Washer, 34\\\"with  No Booster\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-216\",\"slug_id\":\"3062\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>This dishwasher model is certified by NSF for effectively cleaning pots and dishes, offering reliability and assurance in commercial kitchen environments. It features a rapid 60-second time cycle, ensuring quick turnaround times for washing operations, and includes a wash extender for additional scouring time when needed. Additionally, there\'s an option for an integrated 70-degree rise booster, providing enhanced cleaning power for tough stains and residue. The patented self-cleaning spray system ensures consistent performance, while auto-fill and auto shut-off functionalities streamline operation. With an ADS patented low-water tank clean feature and a built-in scrap accumulator, the wash tank remains clean and efficient, requiring only 1.23 gallons per rack for operation. The appliance boasts a spacious 23-inch door opening, accommodating various dish sizes, and is equipped with a powerful 3HP wash pump for thorough cleaning. In terms of specifications, this dishwasher has a rated capacity of 55 racks per hour, driven by a robust 3 HP wash motor. It consumes 1.23 gallons of water per rack and operates at different temperatures for washing and rinsing cycles. The water heater has an output of 8KW to ensure optimal water temperature throughout the cleaning process. The appliance is designed for both three-phase and single-phase electrical systems, with specific requirements outlined for each. For three-phase systems, a 208\\/240V power supply with a 40A capacity is needed, while single-phase systems require a dual-circuit setup with a 208\\/240V power supply and capacities of 60\\/30A. The electrical connections must adhere to specified wire gauges and configurations to ensure safe and efficient operation.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>The HT-34 is specifically engineered as a pass-thru dishwashing machine, facilitating seamless transfer of soiled dishes into the washer and clean dishes out, optimizing kitchen workflow. With high-temp capabilities, this machine ensures thorough sanitization, meeting rigorous cleanliness standards for commercial kitchens. Designed to accommodate pans and larger cookware, the HT-34 is equipped to handle a variety of kitchen items, ensuring comprehensive cleaning. Despite its robust capabilities, the HT-34 boasts a compact footprint of 34 inches, making it suitable for kitchens with limited space while still delivering high-performance cleaning. This model operates efficiently without the need for a built-in booster, simplifying installation and reducing overall energy consumption.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/312-0090.0000_9d20a7a0-0aca-40e5-ab37-1281a6ac5f28.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"312-0090.0000\",\"price\":\"19598.51\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"15431.9\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1934\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"423\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"18618.58\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"424\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"17638.66\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"570\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"39\",\"height\":\"80\",\"width\":\"74\",\"