(9310, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish 5-AG-ES Energy-Star Upright Dish Machine with Double Rack\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-246\",\"slug_id\":\"3092\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The 5-AG-ES Dish Machine offers a comprehensive suite of standard features designed to meet the rigorous demands of commercial dishwashing operations. With the capability to clean an impressive 74 racks per hour, this dishwasher ensures rapid throughput, catering to high-volume establishments with efficiency and reliability. Its water consumption of less than 1 gallon per rack strikes a balance between effective cleaning and resource conservation, contributing to both operational efficiency and sustainability efforts. The generous door clearance of 20 1\\/2 inches facilitates seamless loading and unloading of dishes, enhancing workflow efficiency and minimizing downtime during peak service periods. Equipped with top mount controls featuring auto start functionality, the dishwasher offers intuitive operation, while the stainless steel air gap and quick-release spray arms ensure durability and easy maintenance, providing reliable performance over the long term. One standout feature of the 5-AG-ES Dish Machine is its Double Duty Model, designed to double production capability and meet the diverse needs of commercial kitchens. Equipped with two powerful 1 HP pumps, this dishwasher delivers sparkling results with every cycle, ensuring thorough and efficient cleaning of dishware. The dual-screen system protects pumps and wash arms, prolonging the lifespan of critical components and reducing maintenance requirements, while the inclusion of a delime switch located in the control panel facilitates easy maintenance and upkeep. Furthermore, the option to wash sheet pans horizontally with the optional pan rack expands the machine\'s versatility, accommodating a broader range of kitchenware and enhancing operational flexibility. Detailed specifications, including motor horsepower, water consumption rates, and available cycle times, offer users comprehensive insights into the machine\'s capabilities, ensuring informed decision-making and optimal performance in demanding kitchen environments. With its robust construction, versatile features, and efficient performance, the 5-AG-ES Dish Machine stands as a reliable and adaptable solution for commercial dishwashing needs.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>This dishwasher is Energy Star certified, ensuring energy efficiency and environmental responsibility, reducing operational costs and minimizing ecological footprint. With the capability to accommodate two racks simultaneously, this machine maximizes throughput, making it ideal for high-volume commercial operations. Utilizing a low-temperature washing process, this dishwasher effectively cleans dishware while conserving energy and ensuring gentle treatment of delicate items. The upright design optimizes space utilization, making it suitable for establishments with limited floor space, without compromising on performance. Built with durable materials and advanced technology, this dishwasher ensures reliable operation and longevity, providing consistent and thorough cleaning results.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/015-1090.0000_a2d9c66b-4c7d-41bf-a636-fffe0bea63fc.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"015-1090.0000\",\"price\":\"8185.02\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"6444.9\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1964\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"483\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"7775.77\",\"margin\":\"17.12