(9326, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish ADC-44 L-R Dish Machine 44\\\" High Temp Conveyor With Stainless Steel Final Rinse Jets\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-213\",\"slug_id\":\"3059\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The ADC-44 comes fully equipped with a comprehensive set of features, all included as standard. While competitors may offer similar features as optional add-ons, American Dish ensures that its machines are complete and ready for immediate operation. These features guarantee optimal performance and efficiency, including an impressive throughput of 244 racks per hour. The dish machine operates only when racks are inserted, ensuring energy conservation and minimizing downtime. With its dual rinsing system and user-friendly conveyor, the ADC-44 offers unmatched cleaning ability and ease of use. Additionally, it boasts a low water consumption rate of just 0.49 gallons per load, contributing to cost savings and environmental sustainability. Furthermore, the ADC-44 incorporates numerous innovations to enhance its functionality and durability. It features an auto-fill mechanism, eliminating the need for operator controls and promoting a hassle-free operation. The machine\'s energy-saving stage washer and absence of circuit boards contribute to its quiet operation and reliable performance. Its robust construction, including a heavy stainless steel build and a skirted motor compartment, ensures longevity and resistance to heavy use. With safety features such as wide-opening access doors and captive end caps, the ADC-44 prioritizes user safety and ease of maintenance. Additionally, its fail-safe conveyor system prevents rack damage and ensures seamless operation, making it a dependable choice for commercial dishwashing needs.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>The ADC-44 L-R features a high-temperature conveyor system, ensuring effective cleaning and sanitization of dishes and utensils. Equipped with stainless steel final rinse jets, this dish machine delivers thorough rinsing for sparkling clean results. With its conveyor design, the ADC-44 L-R facilitates continuous operation, allowing for efficient processing of dishes at a rapid pace. This dish machine is NSF-certified, ensuring compliance with industry standards for cleanliness and sanitation. Built to withstand the demands of commercial kitchens, the ADC-44 L-R is constructed with durable materials for long-lasting performance and reliability.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/211-0044.0000_90f3849f-75df-44c1-b964-13d75ecdc920.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"211-0044.0000\",\"price\":\"17281.59\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"13607.55\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1931\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"417\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"16417.51\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"418\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"15553.43\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"760\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"30\",\"height\":\"74\",\"width\":\"64\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_height\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_width\":\"0.00\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"specs\":[{\"name\":\"Quantity\",\"value\":\"1\\/Each\"},{\"name\":\"Brand\",\"value