(9330, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish ADC-44 L-R LT Dish Machine 44\\\" Low Temp Conveyor With Polymer Final Rinse Jets\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-215\",\"slug_id\":\"3061\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>All the mentioned features come standard with the ADC-44 model. While some manufacturers might offer these features as optional add-ons, at American Dish, our dish machines are comprehensive and ready for immediate operation. The ADC-44 boasts an impressive capacity of 244 racks per hour, ensuring high throughput and efficiency in commercial dishwashing operations. It operates only when racks are inserted, optimizing energy usage and minimizing downtime when not in use. Additionally, the ADC-44 offers unparalleled cleaning ability with its dual rinsing system and user-friendly conveyor. With low water consumption, using as little as 0.49 gallons per load, it not only conserves water resources but also reduces operating costs. Its energy-saving features, such as the auto-fill and auto shut-off, combined with the absence of operator controls and circuit boards, contribute to its quiet operation and efficient performance. The machine\'s sturdy construction, along with features like the fail-safe conveyor system and high-capacity heaters, ensures reliable and durable operation, even in demanding commercial environments.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>The American Dish ADC-44 L-R LT is equipped with a 44-inch conveyor, allowing for efficient washing of dishes at lower temperatures, minimizing energy consumption and reducing operating costs. The dish machine features polymer final rinse jets, ensuring thorough rinsing of dishes to achieve sparkling cleanliness while being durable and resistant to corrosion. This machine operates using a conveyor system, facilitating the continuous movement of dishes through the washing process, optimizing throughput and productivity in commercial kitchens. With its low-temperature washing capabilities, the ADC-44 L-R LT effectively removes food residue and stains from dishes while conserving energy and water resources. Designed for commercial use, this dish machine is ideal for restaurants, cafeterias, and other food service establishments seeking reliable and efficient dishwashing solutions.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/211-1044.0000_f6e685dc-d1cf-4213-8ad8-957b666a1b36.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"211-1044.0000\",\"price\":\"16948.4\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"13345.2\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1933\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"421\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"16100.98\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"422\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"15253.56\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"760\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"30\",\"height\":\"74\",\"width\":\"64\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_height\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_width\":\"0.00\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"specs\":[{\"name\":\"Quantity\",\"value\":\"1\\/Each\"},{\"name\":\"Brand\",\"value\":\"American Dish\"},{\"name\":\"Model Number\",\"value\":\"ADC-44\"},{\"name\":\"Shipping Weight\",\"value\":\"760 Lbs (344.7 Kgs)\"},{\"name\":\"Shipping Volume (crated)\",\