(9332, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish ADC-44 R-L Dish Machine with Built On Booster,  44\\\" High Temp Conveyor, 240V \\/3 PH\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-210\",\"slug_id\":\"3056\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The ADC-44 dishwasher from American Dish sets itself apart with a comprehensive array of standard features that are often considered add-ons by other manufacturers. Operating at an impressive rate of 244 racks per hour, this dishwasher ensures efficient throughput while maintaining high standards of cleanliness. Its innovative design includes a dual rinsing system, providing thorough cleaning and sanitization for optimal hygiene. The user-friendly conveyor system enhances operational ease, while the low water consumption of just 0.49 gallons per load minimizes environmental impact and operational costs. With features like auto fill, energy-saving stage washer, and a fail-safe conveyor system, the ADC-44 offers a hassle-free and reliable dishwashing solution for commercial kitchens. Equipped with high-capacity heaters and a precise water control mechanism, the ADC-44 ensures consistent performance and reliable operation. Its robust construction, including a heavy stainless steel build and wide opening access doors with safety interlock, emphasizes durability and user safety. Additionally, the dishwasher features a self-purging system, wide-opening access doors, and a fail-safe conveyor system, further enhancing its efficiency and reliability. Whether in hot temp or chemical model wash settings, the ADC-44 maintains optimal temperatures for effective cleaning and sanitization, meeting the diverse needs of commercial dishwashing. With its comprehensive set of standard features and efficient operation, the ADC-44 stands out as a complete and ready-to-run solution for commercial dishwashing needs.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>The American Dish ADC-44 R-L dishwasher boasts a high throughput capacity of 244 racks per hour, ensuring efficient cleaning for busy commercial kitchens. Equipped with a dual rinsing system, this dishwasher delivers thorough cleaning and sanitization of dishware, ensuring impeccable hygiene standards. With a low water consumption of as little as 0.49 gallons per load, the ADC-44 helps minimize water usage and reduces operational costs. The dishwasher features a user-friendly conveyor system that enhances ease of use, contributing to smoother operation in busy kitchen environments. Incorporating a built-in booster, this dishwasher ensures optimal washing and sanitizing temperatures for consistent results, catering to the diverse needs of commercial dishwashing.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/212-0044.0507_e951500f-d50a-4c65-8e34-ffd3a517efcb.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"212-0044.0507\",\"price\":\"23102.89\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"18191.25\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1928\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"411\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"21947.75\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"412\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"20792.60\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"760\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"30\",\"height\":\"74\",\"width\":\"64\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_height\":\"0.00\