cks per hour. Its efficient conveyor system ensures smooth operation, moving racks through the machine at a rate of 6.8 feet per minute. Utilizing a low-temperature cleaning process, this dishwasher ensures effective sanitation while conserving energy. The incorporation of polymer rinse jets enhances rinsing efficiency, providing thorough coverage and ensuring dishes emerge clean and sanitized. Featuring a 5-wire conveyor design, this dishwasher offers reliable and consistent performance. The conveyor system is engineered for durability and smooth rack movement, minimizing the risk of jams or disruptions during operation. The ADC-66 L-R 66 dishwasher is designed with ease of use in mind. Its intuitive interface and automated features, such as autofill and shut-off, streamline the dishwashing process, reducing manual intervention and optimizing workflow efficiency. Built to withstand the rigors of commercial kitchen environments, this dishwasher boasts heavy-duty stainless steel construction. Its robust design ensures longevity and resilience, making it a reliable workhorse for busy food service establishments.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/213-1066.0000_8686472f-efda-4fa5-bc8f-c59796730640.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"213-1066.0000\",\"price\":\"27182.13\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"21403.25\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1924\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"403\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"25823.02\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"404\",\"product_quantity