(9342, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish ADC-66 R-L 66\\\" High-Temp Conveyor With 5-Wire-No Booster Heater Dish Machine\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-203\",\"slug_id\":\"3049\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The ADC-66 dishwasher boasts a comprehensive set of features that ensure optimal cleaning performance and operational efficiency. With a reliable pre-wash system and unrivaled cleaning ability, this dishwasher is equipped with a powerful 3 HP wash pump and a 1.5 HP scrap pump, delivering the best performance among all listed 66 conveyors. It is rated for dual sanitizing, offering peace of mind regarding hygiene standards. Moreover, it consumes 66% less water than the industry average, making it a cost-effective and environmentally friendly choice. With a capacity of 244 racks per hour and a water consumption rate of just 0.49 gallons per rack, it efficiently handles high volumes of dishes while minimizing resource usage. The dishwasher comes with a range of standard features designed to streamline the cleaning process and enhance durability. It includes an autofill and shut-off system, water curtain rinseability, and captive end caps for convenience and efficiency. The dual-fail-safe heater control ensures precise water temperature management, while the fail-safe conveyor system prevents rack damage and interruptions in operation. Additionally, the pre-wash scrap basket, V construction, and drain pump filter contribute to keeping the dishwasher clean and functioning optimally. With its robust specifications and reliable performance, the ADC-66 dishwasher is an ideal choice for commercial kitchens seeking high-quality dishwashing solutions.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>The ADC-66 R-L 66 dishwasher features a high-temp conveyor system, ensuring thorough cleaning and sanitization of dishes, utensils, and cookware. Equipped with stainless steel rinse jets, this dishwasher provides efficient rinsing for sparkling clean results. The dishwasher operates on a 5-wire configuration, offering reliable performance and stability during operation. Unlike some models, the ADC-66 R-L 66 does not require a booster heater, simplifying installation and reducing energy consumption. Designed as a commercial-grade dish machine, this unit is suitable for use in busy restaurant kitchens, catering facilities, and other foodservice establishments.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/214-0066.0000_d65e1cef-0a16-4f20-8db5-5e15ef66f8c2.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"214-0066.0000\",\"price\":\"27182.13\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"21403.25\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1921\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"397\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"25823.02\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"398\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"24463.92\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"960\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"35\",\"height\":\"74\",\"width\":\"86\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_height\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_width\":\"0.00\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"specs\":[{\"name\":\"Quantity\",\"value\":\"1\\/Each\"},{\"name\":\"Brand\",\"value\":\"American Dish\"},{\"name\":\"Model Number\",\"value\":\"ADC-66\"}