sher ensures thorough rinsing for sparkling clean dishes. Advanced Cleaning Technology: The ADC-44-T utilizes advanced cleaning technology, including a dual rinsing system and precise water control mechanism, ensuring optimal cleaning performance. Durable Construction: Constructed with heavy-duty stainless steel, this dishwasher is built to withstand the rigors of commercial kitchen environments, ensuring long-lasting durability and reliability.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/215-0044.0000.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"215-0044.0000\",\"price\":\"26235.66\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"20658\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1914\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"383\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"24923.88\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"384\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"23612.09\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"760\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"0\",\"height\":\"0\",\"width\":\"64\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_height\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_width\":\"0.00\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"specs\":[{\"name\":\"Quantity\",\"value\":\"1\\/Each\"},{\"name\":\"Brand\",\"value\":\"American Dish\"},{\"name\":\"Model Number\",\"value\":\"ADC-44\"},{\"name\":\"Shipping We