(9348, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish ADC-44-T L-R Dish Machine with 44\\\" Low-Temp Conveyor Polymer Final Rinse Jets\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-209\",\"slug_id\":\"3055\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The ADC-44 dishwasher from American Dish stands out for its comprehensive range of features that come as standard, setting it apart from other models in the market. With a capacity of 244 racks per hour, this machine ensures high productivity in commercial kitchens while maintaining efficiency through its operation only when racks are inserted. Its unrivaled cleaning ability is complemented by a dual rinsing system, guaranteeing thorough cleanliness and sanitation of dishes. The user-friendly conveyor system enhances ease of operation, while its low water consumption of as little as 0.49 gallons per load contributes to cost savings and environmental sustainability. What makes the ADC-44 dishwasher truly standout is its array of advanced functionalities designed to optimize performance and reliability. From auto fill and energy-saving stage washers to high-capacity heaters and fail-safe mechanisms, this machine offers a seamless and dependable dishwashing experience. Its heavy stainless steel construction ensures durability, while features such as the water curtain rinseability and dual-fail-safe heater control enhance safety and efficiency. With the ADC-44, American Dish delivers a complete and ready-to-run solution that meets the rigorous demands of commercial kitchen environments, providing peace of mind to operators and ensuring consistently excellent results.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Efficient Operation: The ADC-44-T L-R dishwasher operates at a rate of 244 racks per hour, ensuring high throughput and productivity in commercial kitchens. Low-Temperature Cleaning: Designed for low-temperature cleaning, this dishwasher utilizes polymer final rinse jets to effectively clean and sanitize dishes without the need for high heat. Tall Hood Design: Featuring a tall hood design, this dishwasher accommodates larger items such as sheet pans and oversized dishes, offering versatility in washing various types of kitchenware. Reliable Performance: With a robust construction and reliable components, the ADC-44-T L-R dishwasher delivers consistent and dependable performance, meeting the demands of busy foodservice environments. Polymer Final Rinse Jets: The inclusion of polymer final rinse jets ensures thorough cleaning and sanitation, providing peace of mind in maintaining hygiene standards.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/215-1044.0000_059cc18c-c12c-4b23-98fa-ca6507bd1625.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"215-1044.0000\",\"price\":\"25931.11\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"20418.2\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1927\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"409\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"24634.55\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"410\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"23338.00\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"760\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"30\",\"height\":\"74\",\"width\":\"64\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_height\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_width\":\"0.00\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_vide