(9356, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish ADC-66-T L-R Low-Temp Dish Machine 66\\\" Tall Hood Conveyor\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-202\",\"slug_id\":\"3048\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The ADC 66 Tall offers a dependable pre-wash phase and unmatched cleaning performance, distinguishing itself as the top-performing conveyor among all listed 66-inch models. Engineered for dual sanitizing, it conserves water efficiently, using only 0.49 gallons per rack, a remarkable 66% reduction compared to industry standards. Equipped with an autofill and shut-off feature as standard, its tall model configuration facilitates easy cleaning of sheet pans, while a door safety switch enhances operational safety. Incorporating innovative design elements, such as a water curtain rinseability feature that activates before the final rinse, the ADC 66 Tall ensures thorough cleaning while shielding against contaminants. Its captive end caps simplify maintenance by facilitating quick opening and closure, streamlining the clearing of spray arms and minimizing downtime. With a fail-safe conveyor system employing a slip clutch design, this dishwasher prevents rack movement and potential damage, ensuring uninterrupted operation. Additionally, features like the pre-wash scrap basket, V construction, and dual-fail safe heater control enhance efficiency and longevity, making it a reliable choice for commercial kitchens.<\\/p>\",\"content\":null,\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/217-1066.0000_337165fc-b2c8-4200-9ebe-ca3f778a3ed3.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"217-1066.0000\",\"price\":\"33536.38\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"26406.6\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1920\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"