(9374, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish AFC-ES Energy Star 2-Door Upright Dish Machine with Single Rack\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-263\",\"slug_id\":\"3109\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The AFC-ES Dish Machine embodies a range of standard features designed to elevate efficiency and performance in commercial dishwashing operations. With Energy Star certification, it ensures significant energy savings while maintaining high cleaning standards, aligning with environmentally conscious practices. Equipped with a powerful 1 1\\/2 HP pump, this dishwasher boasts an impressive cleaning capacity of 37 racks per hour, ensuring rapid turnover and smooth operation even during peak periods. Its convertible design adds versatility, allowing seamless integration into various kitchen layouts, while the large door opening and 20 1\\/2-inch door clearance facilitate easy loading and unloading of dishes, optimizing workflow efficiency. Moreover, the AFC-ES Dish Machine prioritizes user convenience and maintenance simplicity. Featuring dual screens to protect the pump and a large capacity scrap accumulator, it efficiently collects debris, simplifying cleaning routines and minimizing maintenance downtime. The dishwasher\'s specifications highlight its high performance and reliability, with a 1.5 HP motor ensuring consistent and powerful operation. Its low water consumption of .936 gallons per cycle and available cycle times ranging from 90 to 150 seconds further contribute to its efficiency and versatility. With electrical ratings compatible with standard 115-volt single-phase power sources, installation and operation are straightforward, making it an ideal choice for commercial kitchens seeking efficient and reliable dishwashing equipment.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Energy Star certification guarantees energy efficiency, reducing operational costs and environmental impact Two-Door design facilitates efficient loadi