(9376, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish AFC-ES Energy Star 2-Door Upright Dish Machine with Single Rack\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-262\",\"slug_id\":\"3108\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The AFC-ES Dish Machine is equipped with a comprehensive set of standard features designed to optimize efficiency and performance in commercial dishwashing operations. With Energy Star certification, it ensures significant energy savings while maintaining high cleaning standards, aligning with environmentally conscious practices. Featuring a powerful 1 1\\/2 HP pump, this dishwasher delivers robust cleaning power, capable of handling 37 racks per hour, ensuring rapid turnover and smooth operation even during peak hours. Its convertible design adds versatility, allowing seamless integration into different kitchen layouts, while the large door opening and 20 1\\/2-inch door clearance facilitate easy loading and unloading of dishes, optimizing workflow efficiency. Additionally, the AFC-ES Dish Machine prioritizes user convenience and maintenance simplicity. Featuring dual screens to protect the pump and a large capacity scrap accumulator, it efficiently collects debris, simplifying cleaning routines and minimizing maintenance downtime. The dishwasher\'s specifications highlight its high performance and reliability, with a 1.5 HP motor ensuring consistent and powerful operation. With low water consumption of .936 gallons per cycle and available cycle times ranging from 90 to 150 seconds, it combines efficiency with versatility to meet various dishwashing needs. Its electrical ratings make it compatible with standard 115-volt single-phase power sources, ensuring easy installation and operation. Overall, the AFC-ES Dish Machine offers a comprehensive solution for commercial kitchens seeking efficient and reliable dishwashing equipment.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Energy Star certification ensures energy efficiency, redu