cing operational costs and environmental impact Two-Door design facilitates efficient loading and unloading, optimizing workflow in commercial kitchens Single rack capacity accommodates a single rack per cycle, suitable for moderate dishwashing volumes. Corner design enables space-saving configuration, maximizing kitchen layout efficiency while providing ample dishwashing capacity. Low-Temperature wash and chemical alarm provides gentle yet effective cleaning, while the chemical alarm ensures proper chemical usage and sanitation standards.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/012-1090.0221_08af429d-ae05-4b54-ba32-e5ecb4b1709b.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"012-1090.0221\",\"price\":\"6038.53\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"4754.75\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1980\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"515\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"5736.60\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"516\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"5434.68\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"295\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"34\",\"height\":\"71\",\"width\":\"34\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_height\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_width\":\"0.00\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"specs\":[{\"name\":\"Quantity\",\"value\":\