(9382, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish 5-AG-ES Energy-Star Upright Dish Machine with Double Rack\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-245\",\"slug_id\":\"3091\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The 5-AG-ES Dish Machine stands out with its comprehensive set of standard features tailored to meet the demanding needs of commercial dishwashing operations. With a remarkable capability to clean 74 racks per hour, this dishwasher ensures swift throughput, making it a perfect fit for high-volume establishments. Its water consumption of less than 1 gallon per rack strikes a balance between effective cleaning and resource conservation, contributing to operational efficiency and environmental sustainability. The generous door clearance of 20 1\\/2 inches facilitates seamless loading and unloading of dishes, enhancing workflow efficiency during peak service hours. Equipped with top mount controls featuring auto start functionality, the dishwasher offers user-friendly operation, while the stainless steel air gap and quick-release spray arms ensure durability and easy maintenance, providing reliable performance over the long term. A standout feature of the 5-AG-ES Dish Machine is its Double Duty Model, designed to double production capability and accommodate the diverse needs of commercial kitchens. With two powerful 1 HP pumps, this dishwasher delivers sparkling results with every cycle, ensuring thorough and efficient cleaning of dishware. The inclusion of a dual-screen system protects pumps and wash arms, prolonging the lifespan of critical components and reducing maintenance requirements. Moreover, the presence of a delime switch located in the control panel facilitates easy maintenance and upkeep, ensuring optimal performance over time. Detailed specifications, including motor horsepower, water consumption rates, and available cycle times, provide users with comprehensive insights into the machine\'s capabilities, en