suring informed decision-making and optimal performance in demanding kitchen environments. With its robust construction, versatile features, and efficient performance, the 5-AG-ES Dish Machine stands as a reliable and adaptable solution for commercial dishwashing needs.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>This dishwasher is Energy Star certified, ensuring energy efficiency and environmental responsibility, reducing operational costs and minimizing ecological footprint. With the capability to accommodate two racks simultaneously, this machine maximizes throughput, making it ideal for high-volume commercial operations. Utilizing a low-temperature washing process, this dishwasher effectively cleans dishware while conserving energy and ensuring gentle treatment of delicate items. Enhanced safety features include a single chemical alarm, alerting users to any chemical-related issues during operation, ensuring a secure working environment. The upright design optimizes space utilization, making it suitable for establishments with limited floor space, without compromising on performance.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/015-1090.0065_772995d2-4214-4beb-b4ce-45375b38cdf8.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"015-1090.0065\",\"price\":\"8325.42\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"6555.45\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1963\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"481\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"7909.15\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"482\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_di