(9386, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish AFB_ Bakery Rack Single Rack Upright Dish Machine\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-223\",\"slug_id\":\"3069\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The American Dish AFB dishwashing system offers customizable time cycles of 90, 120, or 150 seconds, ensuring flexibility in washing operations. It accommodates standard 20\\\" x 20\\\" racks and features a robust 1.5 HP pump, providing high-pressure cleaning for effective removal of dirt and grime. With built-in chemical dispensing, the machine simplifies the sanitation process while maintaining consistent cleaning results. Additionally, it includes a scrap accumulator, enhancing the longevity of the system by trapping debris and preventing clogs. This versatile dishwashing center is suitable for various kitchen setups, available in both corner and pass-through models. Its 27.5\\\" door opening, equipped with a safety interlock, ensures easy and secure access during operation. While the machine effectively cleans bakery trays, pots, and pans, it also offers compatibility with sheet pans, requiring a specialized stainless steel dishrack for proper washing. Moreover, occupying only 121\\\" of floor space, it serves as a complete warewashing solution, incorporating a soil dishtable with three deep sinks, making it suitable for commercial kitchens of different sizes and configurations.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>You can select from a variety to select from. For instance, you can choose from 90, 120, or 150-second cycles to suit specific washing needs. Standard Rack Compatibility that is useful to hold standard 20\\\" x 20\\\" racks for versatile dishwashing applications. Efficient Pump System that is Equipped with a high-pressure 1.5 HP pump for powerful cleaning performance. Built-In Chemical Dispensing help you streamline chemical usage and ensures consistent sanitation levels. Scrap Accumulator that is built-in and maintains c