 operation, ensuring energy efficiency and compatibility with delicate kitchenware. Configured as a pass-through unit, facilitating smooth workflow and easy access from both sides of the machine. Specifically tailored for bakery operations, featuring a TALL design to accommodate bakery trays and a single stainless steel sheet pan rack. Offers efficient washing and sanitizing capabilities, making it suitable for cleaning various types of kitchen equipment and utensils.Efficient and reliable, the American Dish AFB is a single rack upright dish machine with a built-in bakery rack and chemical alarm. Designed for low-temperature washing, this tall pass-thru machine is perfect for bakeries and comes with a bonus stainless steel sheetpan rack.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/016-0090.0024_4deb20fa-5d50-4916-acbe-2dbe3e5389a8.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"016-0090.0024\",\"price\":\"7039.48\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"5542.9\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1940\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"435\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"6687.51\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"436\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"6335.53\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"330\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"35\",\"height\":\"79\",\"width\":\"34\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_de