(9391, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish AFB-C Corner Bakery Single Rack Upright Dish Machine Corner\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-220\",\"slug_id\":\"3066\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The dishwashing unit offers versatility with cycle times of either 90, 120, or 150 seconds, catering to varying washing needs. It accommodates standard 20\\\" x 20\\\" racks and operates with a high-pressure 1.5 HP pump for efficient cleaning. Equipped with built-in chemical dispensing and a scrap accumulator, it ensures effective washing and sanitizing of bakery trays and pots and pans. Available in both corner and pass-through models, it features a 27.5\\\" door opening with a safety interlock. Special stainless steel dish racks are required for proper washing of sheet pans. Despite its compact design, it serves as a complete warewashing center, incorporating three 20\\\" x 20\\\" x 14\\\" deep sinks within 121\\\" of floor space, with longer lengths also available for larger operations. Regarding specifications, the unit can handle 37, 25, or 12 racks per hour, depending on the selected cycle time. It operates with a 1.5 HP motor and consumes 2.5 gallons (9.5 liters) of water per cycle. It maintains a minimum temperature of 130F (54.4C) for effective cleaning. The electrical ratings require connection to a 115-volt single-phase power supply, using two 10-12 AWG copper wires and a suitable ground on a clean circuit, with circuit protection provided by a 20-amp circuit breaker or fuse.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>The AFB-C Corner Bakery Upright Dish Machine is specifically designed to fit into corner spaces, optimizing kitchen layout efficiency. With a single rack setup, this dishwasher streamlines the washing process for smaller batches of dishes or bakery items, ideal for compact kitchens or bakeries. Operating at low temperatures, this machine ensures efficient cleaning while conserving energy, making it suitable for delicate bakery items and reducing utility costs. The TALL feature accommodates taller bakery trays and utensils, providing versatility in washing various bakery equipment and ensuring thorough cleaning. This dishwasher comes with one stainless steel sheetpan rack, offering added convenience and flexibility for washing sheet pans alongside other kitchenware.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/016-0091.0000_21d8da73-e5f8-41ab-a806-5199c4be4303.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"016-0091.0000\",\"price\":\"7021.32\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"5528.6\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1938\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"431\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"6670.25\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"432\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"6319.19\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"330\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"35\",\"height\":\"79\",\"width\":\"34\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_height\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_width\":\"0.00\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"specs\":[{\"name\":\"Quantity\",\"value\":\"1\\/Each\"},{\"name\":\"Brand\",\"value\":\"American Dish\"},{\"name\":\"Model Number\",\"value\":\"AFB-C\"},{\"name\":\"Shipping Weight\",\"value\":\"330 lbs\"},{\"name\":\"Shippin