(9392, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish AFB-C Corner Bakery Upright Dish Machine with Single Rack Corner 208V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-218\",\"slug_id\":\"3064\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>Offered with cycle times of 90, 120, or 150 seconds, the AFB dishwasher accommodates standard 20\\\" x 20\\\" racks and is equipped with a robust 1.5 HP pump, ensuring high-pressure cleaning performance. Featuring built-in chemical dispensing and a scrap accumulator, this dishwasher effectively cleans and sanitizes bakery trays, pots, and pans. Available in corner and pass-through configurations, it boasts a 27.5\\\" door opening with a safety interlock, ensuring convenience and safety during operation. However, for proper washing of sheet pans, a specialized stainless steel dishrack is required. Despite its powerful capabilities, the AFB dishwasher is compact, offering a complete warewashing solution within just 121\\\" of floor space, with longer lengths also available. With rated capacities of 37, 25, or 12 racks per hour, the AFB dishwasher is driven by a 1.5 HP motor and consumes 2.5 gallons of water per cycle, maintaining efficient water usage. It operates at a minimum temperature of 130 degrees Fahrenheit and offers cycle times of 90, 120, and 150 seconds to accommodate varying washing needs. Electrically, it is designed for connection to a 115-volt single-phase power supply, requiring (2) 10-12 AWG copper wires and a suitable ground on a clean circuit. Circuit protection is recommended with a 20-amp circuit breaker or fuse rated at 20 amps to ensure safe and reliable operation.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Designed for bakery-specific washing needs, accommodating tall items like sheet pans Low-temperature operation ensures effective cleaning while preserving delicate bakery items Corner configuration optimizes space utilization, fitting seamlessly into kitchen layouts Equipped with a muffler heater fo