(9395, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish ET-AF-3-PH-S Single Rack Under Counter Low Temp Dish Machine 34 1\\/2\\\" Tall W\\/ 14\\\"\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-233\",\"slug_id\":\"3079\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The ET Series Dish Machine sets a standard of efficiency and reliability with its comprehensive array of standard features. Equipped with 1 1\\/2 HP wash and rinse pump prime switches, it ensures powerful cleaning performance, leaving dishes sparkling clean. Automatic chemical feed simplifies the process of dispensing cleaning agents, enhancing consistency and effectiveness. Its rapid 90-second complete time cycle facilitates quick turnaround, ideal for high-volume dishwashing operations. The hinged mounted panel offers easy service access, allowing for convenient maintenance and minimizing downtime. Additionally, the availability of a tall version and a glassware cross arm provides flexibility to accommodate various dishwashing needs. The ergonomic design, characterized by a short door construction, enables operators to load and unload with ease while keeping the aisle open and clear, enhancing workflow efficiency. Optional heat maintains tank temperature rack after rack, ensuring consistent cleaning results. Dual screening protects both wash and drain pumps from debris, enhancing durability and reliability. The pumped drain feature allows for installation in almost all applications, making it a versatile choice for diverse foodservice settings, especially when space is a concern. In terms of specifications, the ET Series offers impressive capacities, capable of handling 30, 24, or 20 racks per hour, depending on operational demands. The motor horsepower rating of 1.5 HP for the pump and 1\\/6 HP for the drain ensures robust performance. With a water usage of 1.7 gallons per cycle or 6.4 liters per cycle, it promotes efficient water consumption without compromising on cleaning efficacy. The dish machine maintains a minimum temperature of 120F or 49C, meeting essential sanitation standards. Equipped with a sustainer heater with a 500-watt capacity, it ensures consistent tank temperature, contributing to effective cleaning outcomes. The availability of cycle times ranging from 90 to 150 seconds offers flexibility to accommodate varying dishwashing needs. Electrical ratings compliant with NEC standards provide clear guidelines for safe and reliable electrical connections, ensuring operational safety<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>The ET-AF-3-PH-S Under Counter Dish Machine is equipped with a powerful 1 1\\/2 HP wash and rinse pump system, ensuring thorough cleaning of dishes with every cycle. With an automatic chemical feed system and a rapid 90-second complete time cycle, this dish machine simplifies the dishwashing process, allowing for efficient operation in busy commercial kitchens. Featuring a hinged mounted panel for easy service access and a skirted design that reaches the ground, this under-counter dish machine is designed for accessibility and convenience during maintenance tasks. The machine\'s compact size, standing at 34 1\\/2\\\" tall with a 14\\\" door opening, makes it suitable for under-counter installation in various kitchen layouts, offering flexibility in space utilization. Equipped with a pumped drain system and a sustainer heater, this dish machine ensures consistent performance, reliable operation, and effective cleaning results, meeting the demands of commercial dishwashing needs.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/018-1090.1293_100aa2d6-9407-485f-b4e7-dd2990c2af15.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"018-1090.1293\",\"price\":\"7033.9\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"5538.5\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1951\",\"barcode