(9398, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish ET-AF-M-PH Under Counter Low Temp Dish Machine\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-238\",\"slug_id\":\"3084\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The ET Series dish machine with pumped drain and heat presents a range of standard features tailored to meet the demands of commercial dishwashing operations. Equipped with a robust 1 1\\/2 HP wash and rinse pump and prime switches, this machine ensures efficient water circulation and chemical distribution, resulting in thorough cleaning of dishware with each cycle. Its automatic chemical feed system further streamlines the dishwashing process, allowing for precise chemical dosing to achieve optimal cleaning results. With a 90-second complete time cycle, this machine operates swiftly, contributing to the seamless flow of operations in busy kitchen environments. Additionally, the hinged-mounted panel provides easy access for servicing, facilitating maintenance tasks and minimizing downtime. The ergonomic design of the ET Series dish machine allows operators to load and unload with ease, thanks to its short door construction that keeps the aisle open and clear. Optional heat functionality maintains tank temperature rack after rack, ensuring consistent washing performance throughout the dishwashing process. Dual screening protects both wash and drain pumps from debris, enhancing the longevity and reliability of the machine. With its pumped drain system, this dish machine offers versatility in installation, making it suitable for a wide range of kitchen configurations. Ideal for spaces where space is a concern, the ET Series dish machine offers efficient and reliable dishwashing performance without compromising on functionality or quality.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>This dish machine is designed to be installed under the counter, optimizing space utilization in commercial kitchens while ensuring easy access for staff during operation. Utilizing a low-temperature washing process, this dish machine effectively cleans dishware while conserving energy and minimizing the risk of damaging delicate items. With a single rack capacity, this dish machine is suitable for moderate dishwashing needs in smaller establishments or as a supplementary unit in larger kitchens. Equipped with a pumped drain system and sustainer heater, this dish machine ensures efficient drainage and maintains water temperature for consistent washing performance. Standing at 34 1\\/2\\\" tall with an 11\\\" door opening, this dish machine offers a compact footprint, making it ideal for installation in tight spaces or under standard-height counters without sacrificing functionality or performance.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/022-0091.0000_12042564-5174-4078-9baf-675a667082c4.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"022-0091.0000\",\"price\":\"6229.22\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"4904.9\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1956\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"467\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"5917.76\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"468\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"5606.30\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"270\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"29\",\"height\":\"79\",\"width\":\"26\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_depth\":\