(9399, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish ET-AF-M-PH Single Rack Under Counter Dish Machine 34 1\\/2\\\" Tall W\\/ 11\\\"\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-237\",\"slug_id\":\"3083\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The ET Series dish machine with pumped drain and heat boasts a comprehensive array of standard features tailored to meet the demands of commercial dishwashing operations. With 1 1\\/2 HP wash and rinse pump prime switches, this machine ensures efficient water circulation and chemical distribution, guaranteeing thorough cleaning of dishware. Its automatic chemical feed system streamlines the dishwashing process by precisely dosing chemicals, contributing to optimal cleaning results. Operating on a swift 90-second complete time cycle, this machine enhances the efficiency of kitchen operations, facilitating the seamless flow of dishwashing tasks. Additionally, the hinged-mounted panel design enables easy access for servicing, simplifying maintenance procedures and minimizing downtime, thus ensuring continuous operation. The ET Series dish machine is designed with user comfort and convenience in mind, featuring an ergonomic design that allows operators to load and unload dishware with ease. The short door construction, measuring 10 inches, keeps the aisle open and clear, enhancing workflow efficiency in busy kitchen environments. Optional heat functionality maintains tank temperature rack after rack, ensuring consistent washing performance throughout the dishwashing process. Furthermore, dual screening protects both wash and drain pumps from debris, enhancing the longevity and reliability of the machine. With its pumped drain system, this dish machine offers versatility in installation, making it suitable for various kitchen configurations. Ideal for spaces where space is a concern, the ET Series dish machine delivers efficient and reliable dishwashing performance without compromising on functionality or quality.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Designed to fit conveniently under counters, optimizing space in commercial kitchens while ensuring easy access for staff during operation. Utilizes a low-temperature washing process, effectively cleaning dishware while conserving energy and minimizing the risk of damaging delicate items. With a single rack capacity, suitable for moderate dishwashing needs in smaller establishments or as a supplementary unit in larger kitchens. Equipped with a pumped drain system and sustainer heater, ensures efficient drainage and maintains water temperature for consistent washing performance. Includes a single chemical alarm feature, providing alerts for chemical levels to ensure proper dosing and cleaning effectiveness.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/022-0091.0394_10812b6f-ff05-421c-a1a2-bcb2d2563ad6.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"022-0091.0394\",\"price\":\"6369.62\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"5015.45\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1955\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"465\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"6051.14\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"466\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"5732.66\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"270\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"29\",\"height\":\"79\",\"width\":\"26\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0.00\",\"sh