(9400, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish L-90-3DWC-S 2-Door Single Rack Upright Dish Machine 208V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-226\",\"slug_id\":\"3072\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>Featuring top-mounted controls and an ample door clearance of 20.375 inches, this dishwasher ensures convenient operation and easy loading and unloading of dishes. Equipped with a quick-service 1 1\\/2 HP pump and quick-release spray arms, along with a stainless steel air gap and run indicator light, it guarantees efficient and effective cleaning with minimal downtime. Its stainless steel impellor and sump contribute to its reputation as a true low-energy dump and fill dishmachine, combining energy efficiency with powerful performance. Additionally, the exterior-mounted chemical pump heads and two-stage filter provide added protection to the pump and spray jets, enhancing durability and reliability. Notable features of this dishwasher include its 1.2-gallon water consumption per rack and rapid 90-second cycle time, allowing it to handle up to 37 racks per hour, making it suitable for high-volume applications. Its innovative design includes a true 3-door configuration, ensuring that only two doors open in either setup, effectively preventing water from accumulating on the back wall and maintaining door alignment. Furthermore, it incorporates user-friendly features such as an eye-level temperature gauge, built-in de-liming switch, large capacity internal scrapper, and automatic chemical feed, streamlining operation and maintenance.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>The dishwasher features a vertical, upright design with two doors, making it convenient for loading and unloading a single rack of dishes. This layout is particularly advantageous for space-saving in kitchens with limited floor space. Operating at low temperature, this dishwasher ensures efficient cleaning while conserving energy. It utilizes low-temperature settings to wash and sanitize dishes effectively without excessive heat, contributing to lower utility costs. Designed for corner placement, this dishwasher maximizes space utilization in kitchen layouts. Its corner configuration allows it to fit seamlessly into corners, optimizing the use of available space while maintaining accessibility. Equipped with a muffler heater, this dishwasher minimizes noise during operation, providing a quieter dishwashing experience. The muffler heater reduces sound emissions, creating a more comfortable environment in the kitchen. With compatibility for 208 volts electrical supply, this dishwasher is suitable for use in commercial settings where this voltage is commonly available. This ensures seamless integration into existing electrical systems, facilitating easy installation and operation.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/024-1090.0000_8e2c955d-cbb1-4b53-9618-5da9eba63b1e.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"024-1090.0000\",\"price\":\"6018.97\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"4739.35\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1944\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"443\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"5718.02\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"444\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"5417.07\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"300\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"28\",\"height\":\"74\",\"width\