(9402, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish L-90-3DWS-3D 3-Door Single Rack Upright Dish Machine 208V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-224\",\"slug_id\":\"3070\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The \\\"Top mount controls\\\" of this dishwasher provide convenient access for operators, ensuring ease of use and efficient operation. With a \\\"Great door clearance\\\" of 20.375 inches, loading and unloading dishes is hassle-free, accommodating even larger items with ease. Equipped with a \\\"Quick service 1 1\\/2 HP pump,\\\" this dishwasher offers reliability and ensures minimal downtime, facilitating quick maintenance and repair when needed. The \\\"Quick release spray arms\\\" feature allows for easy removal and cleaning, maintaining optimal performance and hygiene standards. Constructed with durable materials such as \\\"Stainless steel air gap,\\\" \\\"Stainless steel impellor and sump,\\\" and \\\"Nylatron strips,\\\" this dishwasher guarantees longevity and resistance to corrosion. Its \\\"Two-stage filter\\\" protects the pump and spray jets, prolonging their lifespan and reducing the need for frequent maintenance. Operating as a \\\"LOW-ENERGY dump and fill dishmachine,\\\" it conserves energy while delivering excellent cleaning results. Additionally, features like the \\\"Eye-level temperature gauge,\\\" \\\"Built-in de-liming switch,\\\" and \\\"Automatic chemical feed\\\" ensure precise control over the washing process, enhancing efficiency and reliability.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>The L-90-3DWS-3D upright dish machine features a unique three-door design, providing versatility and ease of access for loading and unloading dishes. With the capability to accommodate a single rack per cycle, this dishwasher is suitable for moderate to high-volume dishwashing needs in commercial kitchens. Operating at low temperatures, this dish machine ensures efficient cleaning while conserving energy, making it an environmentally friendly choice. Designed as a pass-thru model, this dishwasher facilitates seamless workflow in busy kitchen environments by allowing dishes to be loaded from one side and unloaded from the other. Equipped with a muffler heater and compatible with a 208V power supply, this dishwasher ensures optimal performance and reliability for consistent dishwashing results.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/024-1090.0425_c9da85a1-5c0d-48ee-a59e-6fc819556ea1.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"024-1090.0425\",\"price\":\"9619.74\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"7574.6\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1942\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"439\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"9138.75\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"440\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"8657.77\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"300\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"28\",\"height\":\"74\",\"width\":\"29\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_height\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_width\":\"0.00\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"specs\":[{\"name\":\"Quantity\",\"value\":\"1\\/Each\"},{\"name\":\"Brand\",\"value\":\"American Dish\"},{\"name\":\"Model Number\",\"value\":\"L-90-3DWS-3D\"},{\"name\":\"Shipping Weight\",\"value\":\"300 Lbs. 