(9403, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish L-90-3DW-S 2-Door, Upright Dish Machine with Single Rack\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-232\",\"slug_id\":\"3078\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The dishwashing experience is optimized with the L Series dish machine, featuring top-mount controls for easy access and operation. With a generous door clearance of 20.375 inches, loading and unloading are convenient, ensuring smooth workflow in busy kitchen environments. Equipped with a quick-service 1 1\\/2 HP pump and quick-release spray arms, this machine efficiently cleans dishes while minimizing downtime. The stainless steel air gap ensures sanitary operation, while the exterior-mounted chemical pump heads facilitate hassle-free chemical dispensing. With a focus on energy efficiency, this dish machine consumes just 1.2 gallons of water per rack, making it a sustainable choice for commercial kitchens. Designed for reliability and ease of maintenance, the L Series dish machine boasts features like a built-in de-liming switch, large capacity internal scraper, and no-adjustment solenoid replacement. The true 3-door design, with only 2 doors opening in either configuration, eliminates water on the back wall and ensures that doors stay in alignment for smooth operation. The machine\'s eye-level temperature gauge provides real-time monitoring, while the dual screens protect the intake of the pump, enhancing its longevity. Overall, the L Series dish machine combines efficiency, durability, and ease of maintenance to meet the rigorous demands of commercial dishwashing operations.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>The L-90-3DW-S features a convenient 2-door design, allowing for easy loading and unloading of dishes from both sides, enhancing workflow efficiency in busy kitchen environments. With a single rack capacity, this dish machine can accommodate a significant load of dishes, making it suitable for medium to high-volume dishwashing needs in commercial settings. Operating at low temperatures, this dish machine ensures energy efficiency while effectively removing dirt, grease, and stains from dishes, reducing utility costs and environmental impact. The pass-thru configuration of the L-90-3DW-S enables seamless integration into dishwashing lines, allowing dishes to be loaded from one side and unloaded from the other, streamlining the dishwashing process. Designed as an upright dish machine, the L-90-3DW-S optimizes floor space utilization, making it ideal for kitchens with limited space availability while maintaining high dishwashing capacity.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/024-2090.0000_c5d4e456-db28-4d8e-a216-aac4474d8145.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"024-2090.0000\",\"price\":\"5768.91\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"4542.45\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1950\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"455\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"5480.46\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"456\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"5192.02\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"300\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"28\",\"height\":\"74\",\"width\":\"29\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_height\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_width\":\"0.00\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_op