(9405, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish L-90-3DW-S 2-Door, 208V Upright Dish Machine with Single Rack, Low Temp\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-230\",\"slug_id\":\"3076\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The L Series upright dish machine sets a high standard with its array of top-notch features designed to streamline dishwashing operations in commercial kitchens. From its top mount controls to the impressive door clearance of 20.375 inches, every aspect is engineered for efficiency and ease of use. The machine boasts a powerful 1.5 HP pump for quick service, along with quick-release spray arms and exterior-mounted chemical pump heads, ensuring thorough cleaning with minimal downtime. Its stainless steel construction, including the air gap, impellor, sump, and sump impeller, not only enhances durability but also simplifies cleaning, making maintenance a breeze. With a true 3-door design and features like an eye-level temperature gauge, built-in de-liming switch, and large capacity internal scrapper, it offers operators a user-friendly experience while ensuring optimal cleaning results. Moreover, the L Series dish machine is designed with energy efficiency and reliability in mind. With a low-energy dump and fill system, it conserves water and energy while maintaining exceptional cleaning performance. The inclusion of a two-stage filter to protect the pump and spray jets further enhances longevity and reduces maintenance requirements. Additionally, innovative features such as Nylatron strips to protect stainless doors, air gap fill technology, and swift plumbing removal using zero-interference Stainless\\/Terelene Couplers, contribute to hassle-free operation and long-term durability. Equipped with prime switches, automatic chemical feed, and dual screens to protect the pump intake, this dish machine offers a comprehensive solution for commercial dishwashing needs, delivering consistent performance at a rated capacity of 37 racks per hour with a quick 90-second cycle time.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>The American Dish L-90-3DW-S features a pass-thru configuration, allowing for seamless integration into kitchen workflows by facilitating easy loading and unloading from both sides. Designed for energy efficiency and versatility, this dish machine operates at low temperatures, conserving energy while effectively cleaning dishes. With a single rack capacity, this machine is suitable for moderate to high-volume dishwashing needs in commercial kitchens, offering efficiency without compromising on performance. Equipped with a muffler heater operating at 208V, this dish machine ensures consistent water temperatures for optimal cleaning results while minimizing noise levels during operation. The upright design of the L-90-3DW-S maximizes floor space utilization, making it ideal for establishments where space efficiency is crucial, while also providing easy access for maintenance and service.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/024-2090.0164_dae3e52a-b903-493f-810f-76a9b65b1630.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"024-2090.0164\",\"price\":\"9369.68\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"7377.7\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1948\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"451\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"8901.20\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"452\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"8432.71\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discou