(9407, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish L-90-3DWC-S 2-Door Upright Dish Machine with Single Rack 208V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-227\",\"slug_id\":\"3073\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The dishwasher features controls mounted at the top, providing convenient access for operation. With a spacious door clearance of 20.375 inches, loading and unloading large items are made effortless. The machine is equipped with a 1 1\\/2 HP pump for quick servicing, ensuring minimal downtime. Additionally, it boasts quick-release spray arms and a stainless steel air gap for enhanced cleanliness. The presence of a run indicator light simplifies monitoring, while the stainless steel impellor and sump contribute to easy cleaning and maintenance. As a true low-energy dump and fill dishwasher, it offers efficient operation while conserving resources. Externally mounted chemical pump heads and a two-stage filter system safeguard the pump and spray jets. The dishwasher\'s stainless steel sump and impeller ensure durability and reliability. It consumes 1.2 gallons of water per rack, facilitating efficient water usage. Operating at a 90-second cycle, it can process up to 37 racks per hour. The dishwasher\'s design features a true 3-door configuration, ensuring alignment and preventing water accumulation on the back wall. It incorporates practical features such as an eye-level temperature gauge, built-in de-liming switch, and large capacity internal scrapper for added convenience. Moreover, the dishwasher\'s swift plumbing removal system and quick service pump facilitate easier maintenance, making it an ideal choice for commercial kitchens.`<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>The dishwasher is designed with two doors, allowing for easy loading and unloading of dishes, while its single rack capacity ensures efficient cleaning of a standard load of dishes Operating at low temperature, this dishwasher is suitable for handling delicate items that may be sensitive to high heat, ensuring that they are cleaned effectively without risk of damage. The dishwasher is built in a corner configuration, optimizing space utilization in the kitchen while providing a convenient location for installation. Equipped with a muffler heater, this dishwasher efficiently heats water to the required temperature for cleaning, ensuring thorough sanitation of dishes and utensils. With a power supply of 208 volts, this dishwasher delivers efficient performance while meeting the electrical requirements of commercial kitchens.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/024-3090.0147_13ac2d2b-8da8-4c5a-8d70-ad0887bba989.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"024-3090.0147\",\"price\":\"9500.3\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"7480.55\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1945\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"445\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"9025.28\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"446\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"8550.27\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"300\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"28\",\"height\":\"74\",\"width\":\"29\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_height\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_width\":\"0.00\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"specs\":[{\"nam