(9411, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish AF-3D-S 3D Upright 3-Door Low Temp Dish Machine with Single Rack\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-269\",\"slug_id\":\"3115\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The AF-3D-S Dish Machine offers a comprehensive suite of standard features tailored to meet the rigorous demands of commercial dishwashing operations. Its convertible design ensures adaptability to various kitchen layouts, while the generous 20.5-inch door clearance facilitates easy loading and unloading of dishes, making it particularly suitable for pizza applications and oversized dishware. Equipped with a quick service 1 1\\/2 HP pump and quick release spray arms, this dishwasher streamlines dishwashing processes, ensuring efficient performance even during peak hours. Additionally, the stainless steel air gap and run indicator light contribute to optimal hygiene standards and operational monitoring, respectively, while simplifying cleaning procedures for enhanced convenience. Furthermore, the AF-3D-S is engineered for durability and ease of maintenance, featuring innovative components such as the diagonal scrap trap for effortless screen removal and dual screens to protect the pump intake. The swift plumbing removal system, utilizing zero-interference Stainless\\/Terelene Couplers, facilitates hassle-free maintenance, minimizing downtime. Offering additional options like solid chemical dispensing and stainless steel spray bases, bayonets, and manifold couplings, this dishwasher provides versatile solutions tailored to meet specific operational requirements. With its robust specifications, including a 1.5 HP motor, low water consumption of 2.2 gallons per cycle, and adjustable cycle times, the AF-3D-S ensures reliable performance while adhering to energy efficiency standards.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Facilitates efficient loading and unloading of dishes, enhancing workflow efficiency and accommodating large 