(9415, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish AFC-3D-S 2-Door Upright Dish Machine With Single Rack\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-271\",\"slug_id\":\"3117\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The AFC-3D-S dishwasher stands out with its convertible design, offering adaptability to both corner and pass-through installations. This versatility ensures seamless integration into various kitchen layouts, optimizing space utilization and workflow efficiency. Its notable 20.5-inch door clearance facilitates the loading and unloading of larger items, making it particularly suitable for applications like pizza pans and trays. Additionally, its swift plumbing removal feature, utilizing zero-interference Stainless\\/Terelene Couplers, streamlines maintenance tasks, enabling easy access to plumbing components for repairs or cleaning. The inclusion of a quick service 1 1\\/2 HP pump ensures rapid and efficient dishwashing, contributing to high throughput in busy food service environments. Moreover, the AFC-3D-S boasts user-friendly features designed to enhance operational convenience and hygiene. Its quick release spray arms and stainless steel air gap simplify cleaning procedures, promoting thorough sanitation and maintenance. The incorporation of a run indicator light offers visual feedback on the dishwasher\'s operational status, aiding in monitoring and troubleshooting. The provision of solid chemical dispensing options enhances washing efficacy, ensuring consistent and reliable cleaning results. Furthermore, the dishwasher\'s innovative diagonal scrap trap facilitates easy screen removal in both corner and pass-through models, contributing to efficient maintenance practices. With its robust construction, efficient performance, and user-centric design, the AFC-3D-S dishwasher is a dependable solution for commercial kitchens seeking optimal cleanliness and operational efficiency.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>As indicated by the \\\"Single Rack\\\" designation, this dishwasher is designed to accommodate one standard-size dish rack per wash cycle. The dishwasher features a two-door configuration, allowing for easy loading and unloading of dishes. Unlike dishwashers that use high-temperature water for sanitization, the AFC-3D-S utilizes a low-temperature washing process. The inclusion of a single chemical alarm is a safety feature that alerts users if there\'s an issue with the chemical supply. The dishwasher\'s upright design saves floor space, making it suitable for kitchens with limited space<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/027-0090.0123_1c10aa0b-9b04-419a-b08c-13eaa9df555c.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"027-0090.0123\",\"price\":\"5789.87\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"4558.95\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1989\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"533\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"5500.38\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"534\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"5210.88\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"295\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"39\",\"height\":\"76\",\"width\":\"39\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_height\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_width\":\"0.00\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"specs\":[