(9419, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish L-90-3DWC-S 2-Door Single Rack Upright Dish Machine\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-228\",\"slug_id\":\"3074\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The L-90-3DWC-S dishwasher boasts top-mounted controls, ensuring easy access and intuitive operation for users. Its generous door clearance of 20.375 inches accommodates bulky items, facilitating efficient loading and unloading. Equipped with a powerful 1 1\\/2 HP pump, this dishwasher offers quick serviceability, allowing for swift repairs and maintenance to minimize downtime in busy kitchen environments. Additionally, the dishwasher features quick-release spray arms and a stainless steel air gap, enhancing its durability and ease of cleaning while ensuring reliable performance. Designed for energy efficiency, the L-90-3DWC-S is a true low-energy dish machine that conserves resources without compromising cleaning efficacy. With exterior-mounted chemical pump heads and a two-stage filter system that protects both the pump and spray jets, this dishwasher delivers consistent and thorough cleaning results. Its stainless steel sump and impeller further contribute to its longevity and performance. With a capacity of 37 racks per hour and a 90-second cycle time, this dishwasher offers efficient operation to meet the demands of busy commercial kitchens. Additionally, features like the built-in de-liming switch, large capacity internal scrapper, and automatic chemical feed streamline maintenance and ensure optimal performance.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Easy-to-access controls located at the top of the machine for convenient operation and monitoring. Generous door clearance of 20.375 inches, enabling hassle-free loading and unloading of bulky items. Equipped with a 1 1\\/2 HP pump for swift maintenance and repairs, minimizing downtime in busy kitchen settings. Stainless steel impellor and sump ensure durability and longevity, while 