(9422, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish 5-CD-LF Corner-Double Rack Upright Dish Machine With Left Front Door Opening and Single Chemical Alarm\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-243\",\"slug_id\":\"3089\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The 5-CD Dish Machine offers a comprehensive array of standard features designed to streamline and enhance commercial dishwashing operations. With a generous door clearance of 20.5 inches, loading and unloading dishes is effortless, promoting smooth workflow in busy kitchen environments. The inclusion of a stainless steel air gap ensures durability and hygiene, while quick-release spray arms facilitate easy maintenance and cleaning, reducing downtime between cycles. Additionally, the built-in scrap accumulator helps to prevent drain blockages and maintain optimal performance over time. Equipped with a powerful 1 1\\/2 HP wash\\/rinse pump, this dishwasher delivers efficient and thorough cleaning, effectively removing grease and food residue from dishware. Furthermore, the 5-CD Dish Machine offers versatile installation options, with configurations available for both right front and left front installations, allowing for flexible integration into various kitchen layouts. Automatic chemical dispensing ensures precise and consistent chemical usage, enhancing cleaning effectiveness while minimizing waste. The inclusion of an autostart with a door safety switch prioritizes user safety, preventing accidental operation and ensuring a secure working environment. Additionally, the delime switch located in the control panel simplifies maintenance procedures, allowing for easy removal of limescale buildup to maintain optimal performance. With its robust construction, efficient operation, and user-friendly features, the 5-CD Dish Machine stands as a reliable and adaptable solution for commercial dishwashing needs, capable of washing 74 racks per hour while maintaining energy efficiency and cleaning effectiveness.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>The 5-CD-LF is specially designed to fit into corners, optimizing space utilization in the kitchen and allowing for efficient workflow organization. With the capability to accommodate two racks simultaneously, this dishwasher maximizes throughput, making it ideal for high-volume commercial operations. Utilizing a low-temperature washing process, this dishwasher effectively cleans dishware while conserving energy and ensuring gentle treatment of delicate items. The left front door opening configuration facilitates easy access to the machine, enhancing user convenience and ergonomics during loading and unloading. Enhanced safety features include a single chemical alarm, alerting users to any chemical-related issues during operation, ensuring a safe working environment.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/029-0090.0040_f1994ed9-05bb-4157-951b-5f2d29e8f69d.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"029-0090.0040\",\"price\":\"8754.3\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"6893.15\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1961\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"477\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"8316.58\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"478\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"7878.87\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"408\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"34\",\"height\":\"71\",\"w