(9423, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish 5-CD-RF Corner-Double Rack Upright Dish Machine With Low-Temp Right Front Door Opening\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-242\",\"slug_id\":\"3088\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The 5-CD Dish Machine embodies a robust set of standard features meticulously designed to optimize the efficiency and effectiveness of commercial dishwashing operations. With a substantial door clearance of 20.5 inches, maneuvering dishware in and out of the machine becomes effortless, promoting seamless workflow management in bustling kitchen environments. The inclusion of a stainless steel air gap ensures not only durability but also hygiene, crucial for maintaining cleanliness standards. Quick-release spray arms facilitate easy maintenance and cleaning, minimizing downtime between cycles and maximizing productivity. Additionally, the built-in scrap accumulator helps prevent drain blockages, preserving the machine\'s performance over time and reducing maintenance requirements. Equipped with a powerful 1 1\\/2 HP wash\\/rinse pump, the 5-CD Dish Machine delivers robust cleaning performance, effectively removing grease and food residue from dishware to ensure immaculate results. Its versatile installation options, available for both right front and left front configurations, provide flexibility in integrating the machine into diverse kitchen layouts. Automatic chemical dispensing guarantees precise chemical usage, enhancing cleaning efficacy while minimizing waste. Safety features such as autostart with a door safety switch prioritize user protection, preventing accidental operation and maintaining a secure working environment. With its efficient operation, durable construction, and user-friendly features, the 5-CD Dish Machine stands as a reliable and indispensable asset for commercial kitchens, capable of washing 74 racks per hour while ensuring energy efficiency and superior cleaning performance.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Specifically crafted to fit into corners, optimizing space utilization in the kitchen and allowing for efficient workflow organization. With the ability to accommodate two racks simultaneously, this dishwasher maximizes throughput, making it ideal for high-volume commercial operations. Utilizing a low-temperature washing process, this dishwasher effectively cleans dishware while conserving energy and ensuring gentle treatment of delicate items. The right front door opening configuration facilitates easy access to the machine, enhancing user convenience and ergonomics during loading and unloading. The upright design optimizes space utilization, making it suitable for establishments with limited floor space, while still delivering efficient and reliable dishwashing performance<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/030-0090.0000_29ca9f2e-bd91-48c2-9634-3711e24f26a1.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"030-0090.0000\",\"price\":\"8613.9\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"6782.6\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1960\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"475\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"8183.20\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"476\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"7752.51\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"408\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"34\",\"height\":\"71\",\"width\":\"49