(9424, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish 5-CD-RF Corner-Double Rack With Upright Dish Machine Low-Temp Right Front Door Opening and Single Chemical Alarm\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-241\",\"slug_id\":\"3087\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The 5-CD Dish Machine boasts an array of premium features designed to optimize dishwashing efficiency and performance in commercial kitchens. With a spacious door clearance of 20.5 inches, loading and unloading dishware is a breeze, facilitating seamless workflow management during busy service hours. Its stainless steel air gap ensures both durability and hygiene, crucial for maintaining cleanliness standards in foodservice establishments. The inclusion of quick-release spray arms streamlines maintenance tasks, allowing for easy removal and cleaning to minimize downtime between cycles. Additionally, the built-in scrap accumulator helps prevent drain blockages, preserving the machine\'s performance over time and reducing maintenance needs for prolonged operational reliability. Equipped with a robust 1.5 HP wash\\/rinse pump, the 5-CD Dish Machine delivers powerful cleaning performance, effectively removing grease and food residue from dishware to achieve sparkling results with every cycle. Its versatile installation options, available for both right front and left front configurations, offer flexibility in integrating the machine into diverse kitchen layouts. Automatic chemical dispensing ensures precise chemical usage, enhancing cleaning effectiveness while minimizing waste. Safety features such as autostart with a door safety switch prioritize user protection, preventing accidental operation and maintaining a secure working environment. With its efficient operation, durable construction, and user-friendly features, the 5-CD Dish Machine stands as a reliable and indispensable asset for commercial kitchens, capable of washing 74 racks per hour while ensuring energy efficiency and superior cleaning performance.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Engineered to fit seamlessly into corners, optimizing kitchen space while ensuring efficient workflow organization. Capable of accommodating two racks simultaneously, maximizing throughput and enhancing productivity for high-volume dishwashing needs. Utilizes a low-temperature washing process, ensuring effective cleaning while conserving energy and preserving the integrity of delicate dishware. Features a right front door opening configuration, facilitating convenient access to the interior of the machine for easy loading and unloading of dishware. Enhanced safety feature includes a single chemical alarm, providing alerts in case of chemical-related issues during operation, ensuring a secure working environment.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/030-0090.0015_43e8f2d3-b5cc-4f3f-bf12-268e51fe7eab.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"030-0090.0015\",\"price\":\"8754.3\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"6893.15\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1959\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"473\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"8316.58\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"474\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"7878.87\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"408\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"34\",\"height\":\"71\",\"width\":\"49\",\"shipping_length_id\":\