(9425, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish AWS Energy-Star Upright Dish Machine with Single Rack - Single Door, Front Load\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-257\",\"slug_id\":\"3103\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The AWS dishwasher presents a comprehensive array of standard features designed to enhance efficiency and reliability in commercial kitchen environments. As an Energy Star rated appliance, it guarantees optimal energy usage, contributing to reduced utility costs and environmental sustainability. With its low water usage, averaging under 1 gallon per rack, this dishwasher not only conserves water but also ensures thorough cleaning results. The powerful stainless steel pump, equipped with upper and lower rotating spray arms, delivers robust cleaning performance, effectively removing food residue and stains. Additionally, the built-in stainless steel scrap accumulator minimizes debris buildup, simplifying maintenance tasks and prolonging the dishwasher\'s lifespan. Its tallest door opening at 19 inches enhances accessibility, facilitating easy loading and unloading of dishes and utensils. In terms of specifications, the AWS dishwasher offers flexibility and reliability to meet various operational needs in commercial kitchens. With options for cycle times of 90, 120, or 150 seconds, operators can choose the most suitable duration for their cleaning requirements. The dishwasher accommodates standard 20\\\" x 20\\\" racks, providing compatibility with existing kitchen equipment. Optional features such as the patent-pending top drying rack and built-in booster heater offer additional customization and performance enhancement. With a motor horsepower of 1.5 HP, this dishwasher ensures efficient operation, while water consumption remains low, ranging from .98 to 1.2 gallons per cycle depending on the model. Overall, the AWS dishwasher combines innovative features and precise specifications to deliver reliable, high-performance dishwashing solutions for commercial establishments.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>The AWS dishwasher is Energy-Star certified, ensuring it operates with high energy efficiency, reducing utility costs. Its low-temp feature ensures effective cleaning while minimizing energy consumption, ideal for preserving delicate dishware. With a single rack configuration, this dishwasher maximizes space utilization and simplifies the loading and unloading process. The single-door, front-load design enhances accessibility, allowing for easy loading and unloading of dishes in busy kitchen environments. Its upright design saves valuable floor space, making it a practical choice for compact commercial kitchens while maintaining high-capacity dishwashing capabilities.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/030-1090.0000_6406284e-f497-41d2-9631-f73b5061db17.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"030-1090.0000\",\"price\":\"6509.32\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"5125.45\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1975\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"505\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"6183.85\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"506\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"5858.39\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"354\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"30\",\"height\":\"78\",\"width\":\"25\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping