(9427, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish AWS Energy-Star Upright Dish Machine with Single Rack - Single Door, Front Load\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-255\",\"slug_id\":\"3101\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The AWS dishwasher is equipped with a comprehensive set of standard features tailored to meet the demanding needs of commercial kitchens while prioritizing efficiency and performance. As an Energy Star rated appliance, it exemplifies its commitment to energy efficiency, promising reduced utility costs and environmental sustainability. With its low water usage of under 1 gallon per rack, this dishwasher not only ensures thorough cleaning but also conserves water resources, contributing to eco-conscious operations. Its powerful stainless steel pump, featuring upper and lower rotating spray arms, delivers robust cleaning performance, effectively eliminating food residue and stains from dishes and utensils. Additionally, the built-in stainless steel scrap accumulator simplifies maintenance tasks by preventing debris buildup, while the tallest door opening at 19 inches facilitates easy loading and unloading, enhancing operational efficiency in bustling kitchen environments. In addition to its standard features, the AWS dishwasher offers a range of optional enhancements to further customize its functionality to specific requirements. These optional features include a patent-pending top drying rack, sustainer heater, built-in booster heater, and under-frame storage rack, providing added flexibility and convenience. With a motor horsepower of 1.5 HP and cycle times ranging from 90 to 150 seconds, this dishwasher ensures efficient operation and versatility to accommodate varying cleaning needs. Its compatibility with standard 20\\\" x 20\\\" racks further enhances its convenience and usability, making it a reliable and high-performance solution for commercial dishwashing needs.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>T