(9431, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish AWS-H Single Rack Upright Dish Machine with Single Door, Front Load 280V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-251\",\"slug_id\":\"3097\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The AWS-H Low-Temp Dish Machine epitomizes efficiency and reliability in commercial dishwashing. Engineered with a low-temperature washing mechanism, it delicately yet thoroughly cleans dishware while conserving energy, making it an eco-friendly choice for businesses. Its single rack configuration optimizes space utilization, ideal for establishments with limited room while maintaining high-performance standards. The single door access streamlines operations, allowing for easy loading and unloading of dishes, thereby enhancing workflow efficiency. Moreover, its front-load design ensures ergonomic convenience for staff, minimizing strain and promoting a comfortable work environment. One of the standout features of the AWS-H Dish Machine is its inclusion of a muffler heater and a robust 208V power supply. The muffler heater ensures that water temperatures are maintained at optimal levels for effective cleaning, guaranteeing consistently impeccable results. Combined with the powerful 208V power supply, this dishwasher delivers reliable performance even in the most demanding commercial settings, making it a trusted asset in busy kitchens. With its blend of innovative design, energy efficiency, and dependable operation, the AWS-H Dish Machine stands as a cornerstone solution for businesses seeking top-tier dishwashing capabilities.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>The AWS-H dishwasher employs a low-temperature washing method, ensuring thorough cleaning while being gentle on delicate dishware and conserving energy. Designed for efficiency, this dishwasher features a single rack configuration, making it suitable for smaller establishments or those with space constraints, without compromising on performance. With a single door design, loading and unloading dishes is convenient and straightforward, optimizing workflow and reducing downtime between cycles. The front-load design enhances user experience by providing ergonomic loading and unloading, minimizing strain on staff and promoting a more efficient work environment. Equipped with a muffler heater, this dishwasher ensures that water reaches optimal temperatures for effective cleaning.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/030-2090.0447_c848c65c-82bf-4aa6-b10a-e4f26617ff11.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"030-2090.0447\",\"price\":\"10597.64\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"8344.6\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1969\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"493\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"10067.76\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"494\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"9537.88\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"354\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"30\",\"height\":\"78\",\"width\":\"25\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_height\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_width\":\"0.00\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"specs\":[{\"name\":\"Quantity\",\"value\":\"Each\\/1\"},{\"name\":\"Brand\",\"value\":\"American Dish\"},{\"name\":\"Model Number\",\"value\":\"American Dish A