(9432, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish AWS-H Single Rack Upright Dish Machine with Single Door Front Load Overshelf\\/Undershelf\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-250\",\"slug_id\":\"3096\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The AWS-H series dishwasher sets the standard with a comprehensive array of features designed to meet the demands of commercial dishwashing. As an Energy Star-rated appliance, it ensures not only efficient operation but also environmental responsibility, aligning with modern sustainability goals. Its standout feature lies in its remarkably low water usage, boasting consumption rates of under 1 gallon per rack, showcasing a commitment to water conservation without compromising on performance. Equipped with a powerful stainless steel pump featuring upper and lower rotating spray arms, this dishwasher ensures thorough cleaning of dishware with every cycle, providing consistently immaculate results. Moreover, the inclusion of a built-in stainless steel scrap accumulator underscores the machine\'s dedication to cleanliness during operation, maintaining hygiene standards in busy kitchen environments. Optional features further enhance the versatility and functionality of the AWS-H series dishwasher, catering to specific user needs and preferences. These include innovative additions such as the patent-pending top drying rack for improved drying efficiency, a sustainer heater to maintain optimal water temperature, and a built-in booster heater for enhanced cleaning performance. Additionally, the provision of an under-frame storage rack offers practical solutions for organizing dishware, utensils, or cleaning supplies, optimizing kitchen workflow and space utilization. Detailed specifications, ranging from motor horsepower to water consumption rates, provide users with comprehensive insights into the machine\'s capabilities, ensuring informed decision-making for businesses. With its robust construction, customizable features, and efficient performance, the AWS-H series dishwasher stands as a reliable and versatile solution for commercial dishwashing needs.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>The AWS-H dishwasher utilizes a low-temperature washing process, ensuring thorough cleaning while being gentle on dishware and conserving energy. Designed for efficiency, this dishwasher features a single rack configuration, making it suitable for smaller establishments or those with limited space, without compromising on performance. With a single door design, loading and unloading dishes is convenient and straightforward, optimizing workflow and reducing downtime between cycles. The front-load design enhances user experience by providing ergonomic loading and unloading, minimizing strain on staff and promoting a more efficient work environment. The addition of an overshelf\\/undershelf provides extra storage space for dishes, utensils, or cleaning supplies, maximizing the utility of the dishwasher and optimizing kitchen organization.`<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/030-2090.0462_2b9b998d-5606-4c7d-af2c-9bc7f85d3f53.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"030-2090.0462\",\"price\":\"8009\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"6306.3\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1968\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"491\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"7608.55\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"492\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"7208.10\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discoun