(9434, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish ADC-44 L-R 44\\\" with Built On Booster High Temp Conveyor, 240V \\/3Ph\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-211\",\"slug_id\":\"3057\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The ADC-44 dishwasher from American Dish comes equipped with a comprehensive set of standard features that ensure optimal performance and convenience. With a high throughput capacity of 244 racks per hour, this dishwasher is ideal for busy commercial kitchens, and its operation initiates only when racks are inserted, enhancing efficiency. It boasts an unrivaled cleaning ability, thanks to its dual rinsing system, which ensures thorough cleaning and sanitization of dishware. The user-friendly conveyor system contributes to its ease of use, while its low water consumption of as little as 0.49 gallons per load helps to minimize water usage and reduce operational costs. Additionally, features such as auto-fill, energy-saving stage washer, and quiet operation further enhance its functionality and user experience. Notably, the ADC-44 dishwasher is designed for durability and reliability, featuring heavy stainless steel construction and a fail-safe conveyor system that prevents rack damage. Its precise water control mechanism and high-capacity heaters ensure optimal washing and sanitizing temperatures for consistent results. Moreover, safety features such as wide-opening access doors with safety interlock and captive end caps add to its user-friendly design. With specifications tailored for both hot temp and chemical wash models, along with detailed instructions for installation and power supply requirements, the ADC-44 dishwasher stands out as a complete and efficient solution for commercial dishwashing needs.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>The ADC-44 conveyor dishwasher can handle up to 244 racks per hour, ensuring efficient operation in busy commercial kitchens. Equipped with a dual rinsing system, this dishwashe