(9441, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish ADC-66 R-L 66\\\" High-Temp Conveyor With 5-Wire-No Booster Heater Dish Machine\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-203\",\"slug_id\":\"3049\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The ADC-66 dishwasher boasts a comprehensive set of features that ensure optimal cleaning performance and operational efficiency. With a reliable pre-wash system and unrivaled cleaning ability, this dishwasher is equipped with a powerful 3 HP wash pump and a 1.5 HP scrap pump, delivering the best performance among all listed 66 conveyors. It is rated for dual sanitizing, offering peace of mind regarding hygiene standards. Moreover, it consumes 66% less water than the industry average, making it a cost-effective and environmentally friendly choice. With a capacity of 244 racks per hour and a water consumption rate of just 0.49 gallons per rack, it efficiently handles high volumes of dishes while minimizing resource usage. The dishwasher comes with a range of standard features designed to streamline the cleaning process and enhance durability. It includes an autofill and shut-off system, water curtain rinseability, and captive end caps for convenience and efficiency. The dual-fail-safe heater control ensures precise water temperature management, while the fail-safe conveyor system prevents rack damage and interruptions in operation. Additionally, the pre-wash scrap basket, V construction, and drain pump filter contribute to keeping the dishwasher clean and functioning optimally. With its robust specifications and reliable performance, the ADC-66 dishwasher is an ideal choice for commercial kitchens seeking high-quality dishwashing solutions.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>The ADC-66 R-L 66 dishwasher features a high-temp conveyor system, ensuring thorough cleaning and sanitization of dishes, utensils, and cookware. Equipped with stainless steel rinse jets, this dishwasher provides efficient rinsing for 