(9449, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish ADC-66-T L-R High-Temp Dish Machine 66\\\" Tall Hood Conveyor\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-200\",\"slug_id\":\"3046\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The ADC 66 Tall conveyor dishwasher offers reliable pre-wash capabilities and unmatched cleaning performance, making it stand out as the top-performing option among all listed 66-inch conveyors. It is designed to handle dual sanitizing processes efficiently while using 66% less water than the industry average, achieving an impressive rate of 244 racks per hour with just 0.49 gallons of water per rack. Equipped with standard features such as autofill and shut-off, this dishwasher ensures convenient operation while maintaining high standards of cleanliness. Its tall model configuration enables easy washing of sheet pans, while safety features like the door safety switch enhance operational safety. With advanced engineering and fail-safe mechanisms, the ADC 66 Tall conveyor dishwasher ensures uninterrupted operation and minimal downtime. The dual-fail-safe heater control system and precise water control mechanism optimize energy efficiency and prevent damage caused by heavy soil, water action, chemicals, or lime build-up. Additionally, the dishwasher features a pre-wash scrap basket with a V-shaped construction, effectively keeping soil contained and protecting the pump. The drain pump filter with a two-stage pump strainer prevents wash pump obstructions and clogged jets, ensuring smooth operation and consistent cleaning performance. However, proper installation and maintenance are essential, as leaks can lead to potential electrical and mechanical issues under the machine. It\'s recommended that all connections be made by qualified service personnel in compliance with relevant health, electrical, plumbing, and safety codes<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>The ADC-66-T L-R features a tall hood conveyor design, offering ample space for washing taller items and accommodating larger loads efficiently. This dishwasher operates at high temperatures, ensuring thorough cleaning and effective sanitization of dishes, utensils, and kitchenware. Equipped with a hood conveyor system, it facilitates smooth and continuous operation, allowing dishes to move seamlessly through the washing process. Built to withstand the rigors of commercial kitchen environments, this dishwasher features sturdy construction for long-lasting durability and reliable performance. The ADC-66-T L-R is suitable for various food service establishments, including restaurants, hotels, cafeterias, and catering businesses, providing a versatile solution for dishwashing needs<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/217-0066.0000_5d41706a-054b-4dfb-a700-c4b342b4d5c1.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"217-0066.0000\",\"price\":\"33836.04\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"26642.55\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1918\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"391\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"32144.24\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"392\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"30452.44\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"960\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"35\",\"height\":\"74\",\"width\":\"86\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0.00\",\"ship