(9451, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish ADC-66-T R-L 66\\\" Low-Temp Dish Machine Tall Hood Conveyor\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-201\",\"slug_id\":\"3047\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The ADC 66 Tall conveyor dishwasher showcases exceptional reliability and cleaning prowess, distinguishing itself as the top performer among all listed 66-inch conveyors. With a rating for dual sanitizing and utilizing 66% less water than the industry average, it processes up to 244 racks per hour while consuming just 0.49 gallons of water per rack. Its autofill and shut-off feature comes standard, ensuring efficient operation, while the tall model\'s design facilitates the washing of sheet pans. Safety features include a door safety switch and water curtain rinseability, which activates prior to the final rinse, initiating the rinsing process and acting as a protective shield. The captive end caps offer convenience by flipping open and snapping shut, facilitating rapid clearing of spray arms and reducing downtime. Moreover, the ADC 66 Tall incorporates a fail-safe conveyor system with a slip clutch design that halts rack movement to prevent damage, ensuring smooth and reliable operation. Its pre-wash scrap basket, V construction, and drain pump filter work in tandem to maintain cleanliness, safeguarding the pump from obstructions and clogged jets. Equipped with precise water control mechanisms and resilient against heavy soil, water action, chemicals, and lime buildup, this dishwasher delivers consistent performance. Operating at various temperatures for both high and low-temperature washes, it offers versatility to meet diverse cleaning requirements in commercial settings. Additionally, it adheres to important installation guidelines, such as securing clean and soiled tables and ensuring proper electrical and plumbing connections by qualified personnel in compliance with health, electrical, plumbing, and safety codes.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>The ADC-66-T R-L features a tall hood conveyor design, allowing for efficient loading and unloading of dishes, optimizing workflow in busy commercial kitchens. Operating at low temperature, this dishwasher ensures effective cleaning while conserving energy, making it a cost-effective and environmentally friendly choice for commercial establishments. With a capacity to process up to 244 racks per hour, the ADC-66-T R-L can handle large volumes of dishes, making it suitable for high-demand environments. Equipped with automatic detergent and rinse aid dispensers, this dishwasher ensures precise chemical dosing for consistent and thorough cleaning results. Built with robust materials and reliable components, the ADC-66-T R-L is designed for durability and long-term performance in demanding commercial settings.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/218-1066.0000_1b319b98-43b1-4e2f-9a39-496ca100d211.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"218-1066.0000\",\"price\":\"33536.38\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"26406.6\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1919\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"393\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"31859.56\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"394\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"30182.74\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"960\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"35\",