(9452, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish HT-25 Single Rack Upright Dish Machine, 3-Door Up\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-217\",\"slug_id\":\"3063\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":null,\"content\":\"<p>The American Dish HT-25 Single Rack Upright Dish Machine is designed to operate at high temperatures, ensuring efficient cleaning and sanitization of dishes, utensils, and kitchenware. With its high-temp capability, it effectively removes tough stains and grease, maintaining hygiene standards in commercial kitchens. Featuring a unique three-door configuration, this dishwasher offers versatility and convenience. Set up as a pass-thru unit, it allows smooth and seamless flow of dishes from one end to the other, optimizing workflow and reducing congestion in busy kitchen environments. With the ability to accommodate a single rack at a time, the HT-25 ensures focused and thorough cleaning of each batch of dishes. This single rack capacity allows for efficient use of space while ensuring consistent and reliable washing performance. The upward-opening doors of the HT-25 enhance accessibility and ease of use. This design feature makes loading and unloading dishes hassle-free, optimizing efficiency and reducing strain on kitchen staff during operation. Built with durability in mind, the American Dish HT-25 is constructed with high-quality materials to withstand the rigors of daily commercial use. Its robust build ensures longevity and reliability, making it a dependable solution for demanding kitchen environments.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/311-0060.0000_a192b055-75ec-49f0-a7f6-9f054cd80bce.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"311-0060.0000\",\"price\":\"11012.55\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"8671.3\",\"ma