(9461, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"American Dish HT-25 4 Wire Single Rack Upright Dish Machine, 3-Door Up, 3 HP\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-197\",\"slug_id\":\"3043\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The HT-25 4 Wire Single Rack Upright Dish Machine is a high-temperature dishwashing solution designed for commercial kitchens with demanding cleaning needs. With its 3-door setup configured as a pass-thru, this machine offers seamless integration into kitchen workflows, allowing for efficient loading and unloading of racks. Equipped with a built-in booster heater, it ensures that water reaches the high temperatures necessary for effective sanitization, meeting sanitation standards and ensuring dishes come out clean and sanitized. Featuring a robust 4-wire configuration, this dishwasher is built for reliability and performance. Its high-temp design, coupled with the powerful wash pump, guarantees thorough cleaning of tough residues and grease, leaving dishes sparkling clean. The inclusion of three doors configured as a pass-thru enhances accessibility and streamlines dish flow, making it ideal for high-volume operations where speed and efficiency are paramount. Additionally, with its built-in booster, this dishwasher is versatile and adaptable to various kitchen setups, providing flexibility and convenience to meet the diverse needs of commercial kitchens.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Equipped with a 60-second time cycle, allowing for rapid dishwashing cycles to meet the demands of busy commercial kitchens. Patented self-cleaning spray system ensures optimal performance and reduces maintenance requirements, enhancing efficiency and reliability. Auto-fill and auto-shut off features come as standard equipment, offering convenience and ensuring consistent water levels for effective cleaning. Two-stage stainless steel drain filter eliminates clogged pumps, enhancing reliability and reducing downtime for maintenance. Powerful 3 HP wash pump scrubs away tough residues, providing thorough cleaning while conserving water with low usage of only 0.85 gallons per rack.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>No Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/311-0080.0970_81741184-1cf1-4fa9-8cf7-eab5ed832dc1.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"311-0080.0970\",\"price\":\"15581.44\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"12268.85\",\"margin\":\"21.26%\",\"product_id\":\"1915\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"385\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"14802.37\",\"margin\":\"17.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"386\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"14023.30\",\"margin\":\"12.51\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"460\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"0\",\"height\":\"74\",\"width\":\"37\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_height\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_width\":\"0.00\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"specs\":[{\"name\":\"Quantity\",\"value\":\"1\\/Each\"},{\"name\":\"Brand\",\"value\":\"American Dish\"},{\"name\":\"Model Number\",\"value\":\"HT-25\"},{\"name\":\"Shipping Weight\",\"value\":\"460 Lbs\"},{\"name\":\"Shipping Dimensions\",\"value\":\"19\\\" L x 36\\\" W x 82\\\" H\"},{\"name\":\"Height All closed Doors\",\"value\":\"74\\\" (187.96 cm)\"},{\"name\":\"Width (Overall)\",\"value\":\"37\\\" (93.9 cm)\"},{\"name\":\"Width Tab