(9488, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco KR-S2 Single Burner Stainless Steel Portable Electric Hot Plate with 7 1\\/8\\\" Cast Iron Element - 1,500W, 120V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-726\",\"slug_id\":\"3572\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco KR-S2 is a compact and efficient single burner electric hot plate, perfect for both commercial and home kitchen environments. Equipped with a 7 1\\/8-inch cast iron element, this hot plate provides a powerful 1,500 watts of cooking capability, ensuring quick and even heating for a variety of culinary tasks, from sautng to simmering. The stainless steel construction offers durability and easy cleaning, making it a reliable addition to any cooking setup. With a low-profile design measuring only 3 inches in height, it is easy to store and transport, while the infinite control type allows for precise temperature adjustments. Operating on 120 volts, the KR-S2 is compatible with standard outlets and features a NEMA 5-15P plug type for easy connection. This portable hot plate is an ideal solution for chefs needing extra cooking capacity or for those working in smaller kitchens.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Dimensions: 11 1\\/2\\\" W x 14\\\" D x 3\\\" H Compact size ideal for limited countertop space. Burner Diameter: 7 1\\/8 Inches Suitable for a variety of cookware sizes. Amps: 12.5 Amps Efficient power usage for effective operation. Phase: 1 Phase Compatible with standard single-phase electrical systems. Voltage: 120 Volts Easily connects to common household outlets. Wattage: 1,500 Watts High power output for rapid heating and cooking. Burner Material: Cast Iron Ensures even heat distribution and excellent cooking performance. Burner Style: French Top Designed for versatile cooking techniques. Control Type: Infinite Provides precise temperature control for various cooking needs. Material: Stainless Steel Durable and easy to clean, ensuring long-lasting use.<\\/p>\",\"