(9489, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco CDR-2C Double Burner Stainless Steel Portable Electric Side-by-Side Hot Plate with 7 1\\/2\\\" Cast Iron Elements - 1,800W, 120V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-727\",\"slug_id\":\"3573\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco CDR-2C is a versatile double burner electric hot plate, designed for efficient cooking in both commercial and home kitchens. Featuring two 7 1\\/2-inch cast iron elements, this hot plate offers a powerful 1,800 watts of cooking capacity, making it ideal for a variety of cooking tasks, from simmering sauces to frying foods. The stainless steel construction ensures durability and easy maintenance, while the infinite control type allows for precise heat adjustments to achieve the desired cooking temperature. Compactly sized at 21 1\\/4 inches wide and 12 3\\/16 inches deep, it is perfect for countertop installation, providing flexibility in tight spaces. With a NEMA 5-20P plug type, the hot plate operates on 120 volts and is compatible with standard outlets. This portable appliance is an excellent choice for caterers, food trucks, or any kitchen needing extra cooking capacity.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Dimensions: 21 1\\/4\\\" W x 12 3\\/16\\\" D x 4 1\\/8\\\" H Compact footprint suitable for countertop use. Burner Diameter: 7 1\\/2 Inches Sufficient cooking surface for various pots and pans. Amps: 13.8 Amps Efficient power consumption for high-performance cooking. Phase: 1 Phase Compatible with standard single-phase power systems. Voltage: 120 Volts Easily connects to common household electrical outlets. Wattage: 1,800 Watts High power output for rapid heating and cooking. Burner Material: Cast Iron Provides excellent heat retention and even cooking. Burner Style: French Top Designed for versatile cooking techniques and large cookware. Control Type: Infinite Allows for precise temperature control during cooking. Material: Stainless Steel Durable, e