(9490, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco CSR-3T Single Burner Stainless Steel Portable Electric Hot Plate with 8\\\" Tubular Element - 1,500W, 120V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-728\",\"slug_id\":\"3574\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco CSR-3T is a robust and portable electric hot plate designed for efficient cooking in a variety of settings, from commercial kitchens to home use. Featuring a single 8-inch tubular element, this hot plate delivers 1,500 watts of power, ensuring quick and even heating for a wide range of cooking tasks. Its stainless steel construction not only provides durability but also makes it easy to clean, while the infinite control type allows users to adjust the heat precisely for optimal cooking results. With a compact design, measuring 14 inches in width and 12 1\\/4 inches in depth, it is ideal for countertop use in kitchens with limited space. The hot plate operates on 120 volts and has a NEMA 5-15P plug type, making it compatible with standard electrical outlets. This versatile appliance is perfect for tasks such as sautng, boiling, or warming dishes, making it a practical addition to any kitchen setup.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Dimensions: 14\\\" W x 12 1\\/4\\\" D x 4 1\\/8\\\" H Compact size perfect for limited countertop space. Burner Diameter: 8 Inches Provides ample cooking surface for various pots and pans. Amps: 12.5 Amps Efficient energy usage for high-performance cooking. Phase: 1 Phase Suitable for standard single-phase electrical systems. Voltage: 120 Volts Easily connects to common household outlets. Wattage: 1,500 Watts High power output for quick heating. Burner Style: Coil Ensures even heat distribution for consistent cooking results. Control Type: Infinite Allows for precise heat adjustments during cooking. Material: Stainless Steel Durable and easy to clean, ensuring longevity. Installation Type: Countertop Designed for convenient placement in kitchens.<\\