(9512, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco WT-40-HD 45\\\" x 14 3\\/8\\\" x 2 3\\/4\\\" Electric Heavy-Duty Countertop Warming Shelf - 120V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-709\",\"slug_id\":\"3555\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco WT-40-HD Electric Heavy-Duty Countertop Warming Shelf is an essential addition to any commercial kitchen or buffet setup, designed to keep food items warm and ready for service. With generous dimensions of 45\\\" x 14 3\\/8\\\" x 2 3\\/4\\\", this warming shelf offers ample space with a usable shelf width of 19 inches and depth of 11 inches, accommodating various food trays and platters. Operating at 600 watts and 120 volts, it effectively maintains a temperature range of 155 to 205 degrees Fahrenheit, ensuring food safety and quality. Constructed from durable stainless steel, it features a dial control for easy temperature adjustments and a metal sheathed heating source for consistent heat distribution. The unit includes two heating zones, making it versatile for different food items, and it comes equipped with handles for easy mobility. With its NSF listing, the Cadco WT-40-HD meets the highest standards for safety and sanitation, making it a reliable choice for food service environments.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Dimensions: 45\\\" W x 14 3\\/8\\\" D x 2 3\\/4\\\" H Ample surface area for various food items. Wattage: 600 Watts Provides efficient heating for a variety of dishes. Voltage: 120 Volts Compatible with standard electrical outlets. Temperature Range: 155 - 205 Degrees F Ideal for maintaining food warmth. Material: Stainless Steel Sturdy construction for durability and easy cleaning. Control Type: Dial Simple and intuitive temperature adjustment. Heating Source: Metal Sheathed \\/ Calrod Ensures even heating across the surface. Number of Heating Zones: 2 Zones Flexibility to keep different foods at optimal temperatures. Installation Type: Countertop Convenient and sp