(9519, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco WTBS-3RT 3-Compartment Third Size Electric Buffet Server with Roll Top Lid - 120V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-705\",\"slug_id\":\"3551\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco WTBS-3RT 3-Compartment Third Size Electric Buffet Server is an efficient and stylish solution for keeping food warm and ready to serve. With three third-size pans and a roll-top lid, its perfect for self-serve setups at buffets, events, or catered functions. This countertop unit operates on 300 watts and features a stainless steel heating surface, maintaining food at temperatures between 155F and 205F. The roll-top lid and sturdy handles make it easy to access and handle food, while its sleek black and silver design complements any setting.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Three Third-Size Pans: Accommodates multiple food items simultaneously. Roll-Top Lid: Convenient, easy access to food. 300 Watts of Power: Efficient warming with consistent heat. Temperature Range of 155F - 205F: Suitable for keeping various dishes warm. Dial Control: Simple temperature adjustments. Heated Shelves: Ensures even heat distribution across all pans. Stainless Steel Construction: Durable and easy to clean. NSF Listed: Meets food safety standards. Portable Countertop Design: Great for events and buffets. Made in America: Ensures high-quality build and reliability.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>One year warranty on all oven motors<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/WTBS-3RT.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"WTBS-3RT\",\"price\":\"434.5\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"395\",\"margin\":\"9.09%\",\"product_id\":\"2423\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\"