(9522, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco CPG-20 Double Glass-Ceramic Panini Grill with Grooved Top and Smooth Bottom Plates - 9 7\\/8\\\" x 9 7\\/8\\\" Cooking Surface - 3,200W, 208-240V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-695\",\"slug_id\":\"3541\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco CPG-20 Double Glass-Ceramic Panini Grill is a high-performance cooking appliance designed for efficiency and versatility in commercial kitchens. Featuring a cooking surface of 9 7\\/8\\\" x 9 7\\/8\\\", this grill is perfect for toasting sandwiches, grilling vegetables, and more. Its stainless steel construction not only enhances durability but also adds a sleek, professional look. With a powerful wattage of 3,200W and a maximum temperature of 740F, it can handle various cooking tasks with ease. The grooved top and smooth bottom plates ensure that your food is cooked evenly while providing appealing grill marks. Additionally, the NSF-listed design guarantees that it meets stringent health and safety standards.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Double Cooking Surface: 9 7\\/8\\\" x 9 7\\/8\\\" grill plates for preparing multiple items simultaneously. Powerful Wattage: 3,200 watts for quick heating and cooking. High Temperature Capability: Maximum temperature of 740F for efficient grilling. Plate Configuration: Grooved top for searing and smooth bottom for even cooking. Durable Construction: Made from stainless steel for longevity and easy maintenance. NSF Listed: Meets health and safety standards for food service equipment. Convenient Drip Tray: Collects excess grease for easier cleaning. User-Friendly Dial Control: Simple temperature adjustments for precision cooking. Plug Type: Compatible with NEMA 6-20P plug for easy setup. Phase Compatibility: Operates on a single phase (1 Phase) electrical system.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>One year warranty on all oven motors<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/CPG-20.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"CPG-20\",\"price\":\"2047.5\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"1750\",\"margin\":\"14.53%\",\"product_id\":\"2413\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"1397\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"1945.13\",\"margin\":\"10.03\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"1398\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"1842.75\",\"margin\":\"5.03\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"45\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"18\",\"height\":\"7\",\"width\":\"24\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_height\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_width\":\"0.00\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"specs\":[{\"name\":\"Quantity\",\"value\":\"1\\/Each\"},{\"name\":\"Shipping Weight\",\"value\":\"45 lb.\"},{\"name\":\"Width\",\"value\":\"24 5\\/16 Inches\"},{\"name\":\"Depth\",\"value\":\"18 Inches\"},{\"name\":\"Height\",\"value\":\"7 Inches\"},{\"name\":\"Plate Width\",\"value\":\"9 7\\/8 Inches\"},{\"name\":\"Plate Depth\",\"value\":\"9 7\\/8 Inches\"},{\"name\":\"Amps\",\"value\":\"14.5 Amps\"},{\"name\":\"Phase\",\"value\":\"1 Phase\"},{\"name\":\"Voltage\",\"value\":\"208 - 240 Volts\"},{\"name\":\"Wattage\",\"value\":\"3200 Watts\"},{\"name\":\"Construction\",\"value\":\"Stainless Steel\"},{\"name\":\"Control Type\",\"value\":\"Dial\"},{\"name\":\"Features\",\"value\":\"Drip Tray - NSF Listed\"},{\"name\":\"Maximum Temperature\",\"value\