(9526, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco Stefania XAF-113 3-Shelf Half Size Heavy-Duty Manual Countertop Convection Oven - 120V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-697\",\"slug_id\":\"3543\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco Stefania XAF-113 3-Shelf Half Size Heavy-Duty Manual Countertop Convection Oven is a robust cooking solution ideal for commercial kitchens seeking efficiency and versatility. With a compact footprint of 23 5\\/8\\\" wide and a height of 16 7\\/8\\\", this oven features a spacious interior with a capacity of 1.75 cu. ft. and can accommodate up to three racks for simultaneous cooking. Designed for optimal cooking performance, it operates at 1.45 kilowatts and reaches temperatures between 175F and 500F, allowing for a wide range of cooking applications. The glass door provides visibility into the cooking chamber, while the stainless steel construction ensures durability and easy cleaning. This NSF-listed oven is perfect for any establishment looking to enhance its cooking capabilities.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Compact Design: Measures 23 5\\/8\\\" wide, making it ideal for countertop placement. Spacious Interior: Holds up to 1.75 cu. ft. with room for three racks. Powerful Heating: Operates at 1.45 kilowatts for efficient cooking. Wide Temperature Range: Adjustable from 175F to 500F for diverse cooking needs. Controlled Humidity Feature: Enhances cooking results by retaining moisture. Durable Construction: Made from stainless steel for longevity and easy maintenance. NSF Listed: Complies with safety and sanitation standards. Glass Door: Allows for easy monitoring of cooking progress. Dial Control: Simple and intuitive temperature and time adjustments. Electric Power Type: Operates on 120 volts with a NEMA 5-15P plug for standard electrical connections.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>One year warranty on all oven motors<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\