(9527, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco CPG-15FC Jumbo Glass-Ceramic Clamshell Grill with Smooth Clear Plates - 15 3\\/4\\\" x 11 13\\/16\\\" Cooking Surface - 1,800W, 120V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-698\",\"slug_id\":\"3544\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco CPG-15FC Jumbo Glass-Ceramic Clamshell Grill is a powerful and efficient cooking solution designed for commercial kitchens. With a generous cooking surface of 15 3\\/4\\\" x 11 13\\/16\\\", this grill features smooth glass-ceramic plates that provide excellent heat retention and even cooking, making it ideal for grilling a variety of foods, from sandwiches to meats. Operating at 1,800 watts, it quickly reaches a maximum temperature of 740F, ensuring fast cooking times without compromising quality. Its stainless steel construction guarantees durability and ease of cleaning, while the integrated drip tray collects excess grease for a mess-free cooking experience. This NSF-listed grill is a reliable addition to any food service environment.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Jumbo Cooking Surface: 15 3\\/4\\\" x 11 13\\/16\\\" for cooking larger portions. Glass-Ceramic Plates: Smooth top and bottom for even heat distribution and easy cleanup. Powerful Performance: 1,800 watts for quick preheating and cooking. High Maximum Temperature: Reaches up to 740F for efficient grilling. Durable Construction: Made from stainless steel to withstand heavy use. Dial Control: Easy-to-use dial for precise temperature adjustments. Drip Tray Included: Captures grease and juices for a cleaner cooking process. NSF Listed: Meets safety and sanitation standards for commercial kitchen equipment. NEMA 5-15P Plug: Standard plug type for straightforward electrical compatibility. Versatile Cooking Applications: Suitable for grilling sandwiches, meats, and more.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>One year warranty on all oven motors<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/CPG-15FC.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"CPG-15FC\",\"price\":\"1491.75\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"1275\",\"margin\":\"14.53%\",\"product_id\":\"2416\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"1403\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"1417.16\",\"margin\":\"10.03\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"1404\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"1342.58\",\"margin\":\"5.03\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"38\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"18\",\"height\":\"8\",\"width\":\"19\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_height\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_width\":\"0.00\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"specs\":[{\"name\":\"Quantity\",\"value\":\"1\\/Each\"},{\"name\":\"Shipping Weight\",\"value\":\"38 lb.\"},{\"name\":\"Width\",\"value\":\"19 Inches\"},{\"name\":\"Depth\",\"value\":\"18 Inches\"},{\"name\":\"Height\",\"value\":\"7 1\\/2 Inches\"},{\"name\":\"Plate Width\",\"value\":\"15 3\\/4 Inches\"},{\"name\":\"Plate Depth\",\"value\":\"11 13\\/16 Inches\"},{\"name\":\"Amps\",\"value\":\"15 Amps\"},{\"name\":\"Phase\",\"value\":\"1 Phase\"},{\"name\":\"Voltage\",\"value\":\"120 Volts\"},{\"name\":\"Wattage\",\"value\":\"1800 Watts\"},{\"name\":\"Construction\",\"value\":\"Stainless Steel\"},{\"name\":\"Control Type\",\"value\":\"Dial\"},{\"name\":\"Features\",\"value\":\"Drip Tray - NSF Listed\"},{\"name\":\"Maximum Tempe