(9532, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco Arianna XAF-133 4-Shelf Half Size Heavy-Duty Manual Countertop Convection Oven - 208-240V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-701\",\"slug_id\":\"3547\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco Arianna XAF-133 is a robust half-size countertop convection oven designed for commercial kitchens seeking efficiency and versatility. This oven features a generous cooking capacity of 2.27 cu. ft., allowing for multiple dishes to be cooked simultaneously on its four racks. With a temperature range of 175F to 500F, it provides excellent control over cooking processes, including baking, roasting, and steaming. The oven is equipped with a glass door for easy monitoring of food without opening the unit, ensuring that heat and moisture are retained. Made from durable stainless steel, the XAF-133 is built to withstand the demands of high-volume cooking environments, making it an ideal choice for restaurants, catering services, and food trucks.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Spacious Capacity: Holds up to 2.27 cu. ft. for cooking multiple dishes. Four Rack Capacity: Comes with four racks for maximum cooking flexibility. Temperature Range: Adjustable from 175F to 500F for various cooking techniques. Controlled Humidity: Maintains moisture levels for optimal cooking results. Durable Construction: Made of high-quality stainless steel for longevity. Glass Door: Allows for easy monitoring of food without opening the door. Manual Control: Features a simple dial control for easy operation. Countertop Design: Compact size (23 5\\/8\\\" W x 28 1\\/8\\\" D x 20\\\" H) fits well in any kitchen. Powerful Performance: Operates on 208-240V, 20 Amps, with a wattage of 2.7 kilowatts. NEMA 6-20P Plug: Standard plug type for easy connection to power sources.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>One year warranty on all oven motors<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/XAF-13