(9534, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco Bakerlux Station XAFT-04HS-LD 4-Shelf Half Size Heavy-Duty Digital Countertop Convection Oven with LED Control Panel - 208-240V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-703\",\"slug_id\":\"3549\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco VKII-220 VariKwik High Speed Countertop Convection Oven is designed for fast, efficient cooking in commercial settings. Featuring a versatile heating system that combines convection, radiant, and conductive heat, this compact oven is ideal for entry-level rapid cooking. Its 0.9 cu. ft. capacity accommodates up to a 14-inch pizza, making it perfect for quick-service establishments. With a user-friendly touchscreen and programmable settings, operators can ensure consistent cooking results. Built with a durable stainless steel exterior and LED lighting, the oven is both sleek and functional, reaching temperatures up to 500F.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Multi-Heating System: Combines convection, radiant, and conductive heat. Touchscreen Control Panel: Simple and easy to operate. LED Lighting: Enhances visibility of the cooking area. Compact Design: Ideal for countertop installation. High Temperature Range: Reaches up to 500F for versatile cooking. 0.9 cu. ft. Capacity: Fits a 14-inch pizza or similar items. NSF Listed: Compliant with sanitation standards. Programmable Settings: Allows for consistent and repeatable results. Stainless Steel Exterior: Durable and easy to clean. NEMA 6-20P Plug: Suitable for 220V, single-phase outlets.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>One year warranty on all oven motors<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/XAFT-04HS-LD.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"XAFT-04HS-LD\",\"price\":\"2243\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"1950\",\"margin\":\"13.06%\",\"product_id\":\"2421\