(9538, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco Elena XAF-183 3-Shelf Full Size Heavy-Duty Manual Countertop Convection Oven - 208-240V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-694\",\"slug_id\":\"3540\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco Elena XAF-183 3-Shelf Full Size Heavy-Duty Manual Countertop Convection Oven is an exceptional choice for commercial kitchens that demand reliability and versatility. With a generous capacity of 3 cubic feet, this oven is designed to hold full-size sheet pans, making it ideal for baking, roasting, and cooking a variety of dishes. The stainless steel construction ensures durability and easy maintenance, while the glass door allows for easy monitoring of cooking progress without losing heat. It operates at a wattage of 4.6 kilowatts, providing consistent and efficient heating across a temperature range of 175F to 500F. Equipped with controlled humidity features, this oven enhances food quality by retaining moisture, making it perfect for a range of culinary applications.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Full Size Capacity: Holds up to 3 full-size sheet pans for large-scale cooking. Powerful Performance: Operates at 4.6 kilowatts for efficient heating and cooking. Temperature Range: Adjustable from 175F to 500F to accommodate various recipes. Controlled Humidity: Helps maintain moisture for superior food quality. Robust Construction: Made from durable stainless steel for long-lasting use. Glass Door: Allows visibility into the oven without opening, maintaining heat. Ample Rack Space: Includes 3 racks for multiple cooking options. Manual Control: Easy-to-use dial controls for precise temperature settings. Plug Compatibility: Designed with NEMA L6-30P plug for secure electrical connections. Compact Design: Countertop installation for space efficiency in busy kitchens.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>One year warranty on all oven motors<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/s