(9540, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco Bakerlux Station XAFT-04FS-LD 4-Shelf Full Size Heavy-Duty Digital Countertop Convection Oven with LED Control Panel - 208-240V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-693\",\"slug_id\":\"3539\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco Bakerlux Station XAFT-04FS-LD 4-Shelf Full Size Heavy-Duty Digital Countertop Convection Oven is a top-tier solution for high-demand commercial kitchens. With a spacious capacity of 4 cubic feet, this oven features a digital LED control panel for precise temperature management and programming, ensuring consistent results every time. The stainless steel construction offers durability and ease of cleaning, while the glass door provides visibility during cooking without the need to open the door, preserving heat and efficiency. Designed to accommodate full-size sheet pans, this oven can operate at a powerful 7.6 kilowatts, with a temperature range of 175F to 500F, making it perfect for baking, roasting, and other culinary tasks. Additionally, the steam injection feature helps to achieve perfect moisture levels for various dishes, enhancing food quality.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Generous Capacity: Holds up to 4 cubic feet of cooking space, accommodating multiple full-size sheet pans. High Wattage: Operates at 7.6 kilowatts for powerful heating and efficient cooking. Digital Control: Features an LED control panel for easy programming and precise temperature adjustments. Versatile Temperature Range: Adjustable from 175F to 500F to suit a variety of cooking needs. Steam Injection: Enhances moisture retention for improved food quality and texture. Energy Star Qualified: Designed for energy efficiency, helping to reduce operational costs. NSF Listed: Meets stringent health and safety standards for commercial use. Robust Construction: Made from durable stainless steel for long-lasting performance. Ample Rack Capacity: Includes 4 racks for efficient cooking and baking. Convenient Design: Bottom hinge glass door allows for easy access while minimizing heat loss.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>One year warranty on all oven motors<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/XAFT-04FS-LD.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"XAFT-04FS-LD\",\"price\":\"3565\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"3100\",\"margin\":\"13.04%\",\"product_id\":\"2411\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"1393\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"3386.75\",\"margin\":\"8.47\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"1394\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"3208.50\",\"margin\":\"3.38\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"190\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"36\",\"height\":\"20\",\"width\":\"32\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_height\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_width\":\"0.00\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"specs\":[{\"name\":\"Quantity\",\"value\":\"1\\/Each\"},{\"name\":\"Shipping Weight\",\"value\":\"190 lb.\"},{\"name\":\"Width\",\"value\":\"31 1\\/2 Inches\"},{\"name\":\"Depth\",\"value\":\"35 1\\/2 Inches\"},{\"name\":\"Height\",\"value\":\"19 5\\/8 Inches\"},{\"name\":\"Interior Width\",\"value\":\"27 1\\/4 Inches\"},{\"name\":\"Interior Depth\",\"value\":\"19 Inches\"},{\"name\":\"Interior Height\",\"value\":\"13 1\\/4 Inches\"},{\"name\":\"Amps\",\"value\":\"32 Amps\"},{\"name\":\"Hertz\",\"