(9543, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco Bakerlux Station BLS-4FLD-1 4-Shelf Full Size Heavy-Duty Digital Countertop Convection Oven with LED Control Panel and Stand - 208-240V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-692\",\"slug_id\":\"3538\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco Bakerlux Station BLS-4FLD-1 4-Shelf Full Size Heavy-Duty Digital Countertop Convection Oven is an exceptional cooking appliance designed for high-volume kitchens, offering the perfect blend of power and efficiency. Featuring a spacious 4 cubic foot capacity, this oven can accommodate full-size sheet pans and is equipped with a robust 7.6 kilowatt heating element, ensuring rapid and uniform cooking. The digital LED control panel simplifies operation and programming, while the glass door allows for easy monitoring without heat loss. This oven includes steam injection capabilities for maintaining optimal moisture levels in foods, enhancing quality and flavor. Built with durability in mind, the oven\'s aluminum and stainless steel construction ensures long-lasting use, and it is mounted on casters for mobility, making it an ideal addition to any commercial kitchen.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Generous Capacity: Provides 4 cubic feet of cooking space, suitable for multiple full-size sheet pans. High Wattage: Operates at 7.6 kilowatts, delivering powerful heating for efficient cooking. Digital Control Panel: Easy-to-use LED interface for precise temperature control and programmable settings. Steam Injection: Maintains ideal moisture levels for better food quality and texture. Energy Star Qualified: Designed to reduce energy consumption and operating costs. NSF Listed: Complies with strict health and safety regulations for commercial equipment. Durable Construction: Made from a combination of aluminum and stainless steel for longevity. Mobility: Comes with casters for easy movement within the kitchen. Ample Rack Capacity: Includes 4 racks to optimize cooking space and efficiency. Versatile Temperature Range: Adjustable from 175F to 500F, suitable for various cooking techniques.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>One year warranty on all oven motors<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/BLS-4FLD-1.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"BLS-4FLD-1\",\"price\":\"4370\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"3800\",\"margin\":\"13.04%\",\"product_id\":\"2410\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"1391\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"4151.50\",\"margin\":\"8.47\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"1392\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"3933.00\",\"margin\":\"3.38\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"250\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"36\",\"height\":\"20\",\"width\":\"32\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_height\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_width\":\"0.00\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"specs\":[{\"name\":\"Quantity\",\"value\":\"1\\/Each\"},{\"name\":\"Shipping Weight\",\"value\":\"250 lb.\"},{\"name\":\"Width\",\"value\":\"31 1\\/2 Inches\"},{\"name\":\"Depth\",\"value\":\"35 1\\/2 Inches\"},{\"name\":\"Height\",\"value\":\"19 5\\/8 Inches\"},{\"name\":\"Interior Width\",\"value\":\"27 1\\/4 Inches\"},{\"name\":\"Interior Depth\",\"value\":\"19 Inches\"},{\"name\":\"Interior Height\",\"value\":\"19 Inches\"},{\"name\":\"Amps\",\"value\":\"32 Amps\"},{\"nam