(9546, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco SPL-2P Half Size Steam Pan with Lid for Electric Buffet Servers\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-689\",\"slug_id\":\"3535\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco SPL-2P Half Size Steam Pan with Lid is an essential accessory for any electric buffet server, offering durability and functionality for food service. Crafted from high-quality stainless steel, this half-size steam pan is designed to withstand the rigors of commercial use while maintaining its sleek appearance. It features a convenient lift-off lid made of lightweight plastic, allowing for easy access to your dishes while ensuring they stay warm and protected. With a solid rectangular design, this steam pan is perfect for serving a variety of foods and is built to optimize space in buffet settings. Proudly made in America, it reflects Cadco\'s dedication to quality craftsmanship and reliable performance.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Half Size Design: Optimized for buffet settings with a 1\\/2 size configuration. Durable Construction: Made from high-quality stainless steel for long-lasting use. Lift-Off Lid: Includes a plastic lid for easy access while keeping food warm. Convenient Handle: Equipped with a handle for easy lifting and transportation. Lightweight Lid: The plastic lid is easy to manage, enhancing usability. Versatile Application: Suitable for electric buffet servers and various catering needs. Solid Style: Provides effective coverage to maintain food temperature and quality. American Made: Manufactured in the USA, ensuring reliability and quality. Rectangular Shape: Ideal for a variety of food items while maximizing buffet space. Easy to Clean: Stainless steel surface allows for straightforward cleaning and maintenance.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>One year warranty on all oven motors<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/SPL-2P.webp\"],\"product_type\":\