(9548, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco WT-5-HD 20 1\\/4\\\" x 14 3\\/8\\\" x 2 3\\/4\\\" Electric Heavy-Duty Countertop Warming Shelf - 120V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-687\",\"slug_id\":\"3533\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco WT-5-HD Electric Heavy-Duty Countertop Warming Shelf is a robust and efficient solution designed for food service operations that demand reliable heating and warming capabilities. Measuring 20 1\\/4 inches wide, 14 3\\/8 inches deep, and 2 3\\/4 inches high, this warming shelf is compact enough to fit on countertops while providing a generous warming area for dishes. Constructed from durable stainless steel, it ensures longevity and easy cleaning, making it ideal for busy kitchens. With a powerful wattage of 300 watts operating at 120 volts, this unit features a single heating zone that maintains temperatures between 155F and 205F, perfect for keeping a variety of foods warm and ready to serve. The easy-to-use dial control allows for precise temperature adjustments, and the built-in handle enhances portability, facilitating effortless relocation. Additionally, this warming shelf is NSF listed, confirming its compliance with strict health and safety standards, and is designed for convenient countertop installation.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Compact Dimensions: 20 1\\/4\\\" W x 14 3\\/8\\\" D x 2 3\\/4\\\" H; designed to maximize space without sacrificing heating area. Heavy-Duty Stainless Steel Construction: Ensures durability and resistance to wear and tear in busy environments. Single Heating Zone: Provides consistent warming across the entire surface for even heat distribution. Temperature Range: Adjustable from 155F to 205F to accommodate various food types and safety needs. 300 Watts of Power: Efficient heating that effectively keeps food at safe temperatures. User-Friendly Dial Control: Simplifies operation with straightforward temperature adjustments. NSF Listed: Mee