(9549, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Cadco WT-10-HD 24\\\" x 14 3\\/8\\\" x 2 3\\/4\\\" Electric Heavy-Duty Countertop Warming Shelf - 120V\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-686\",\"slug_id\":\"3532\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Cadco WT-10-HD Electric Heavy-Duty Countertop Warming Shelf is expertly designed for commercial kitchens and catering operations, providing reliable and efficient warming solutions. With dimensions of 24 inches in width, 14 3\\/8 inches in depth, and a height of 2 3\\/4 inches, this warming shelf offers a spacious surface area, ideal for holding multiple dishes at optimal serving temperatures. Constructed from high-quality stainless steel, it ensures durability and easy maintenance, making it well-suited for demanding environments. Operating at 120 volts with a wattage of 300 watts, this unit features a single heating zone that effectively maintains temperatures ranging from 155F to 205F. The dial control allows for straightforward temperature adjustments, ensuring precise heating. The warming shelf is also NSF listed, indicating compliance with stringent health and safety standards, and comes with a convenient handle for easy transportation and positioning. Designed for countertop installation, this unit enhances efficiency in food service while maintaining a professional appearance.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Ample Dimensions: 24\\\" W x 14 3\\/8\\\" D x 2 3\\/4\\\" H; provides a generous warming area for various food items. Stainless Steel Construction: Ensures durability and ease of cleaning, perfect for high-traffic kitchen settings. Single Heating Zone: Delivers consistent warming across the surface for uniform heat distribution. Temperature Range: Adjustable from 155F to 205F to keep food safely warm and ready to serve. 300 Watts of Power: Efficient operation that effectively maintains food temperatures without overheating. Dial Control: User-friendly design allows for easy and precise temperature settings. NSF Listed: Complies with health and safety standards, suitable for commercial kitchen use. Built-in Handle: Provides easy handling and mobility, facilitating repositioning as needed. Buffet Style: Ideal for catering and self-service buffets, enhancing food presentation. Countertop Installation: Designed for quick placement on countertops, maximizing kitchen space and workflow efficiency.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>One year warranty on all oven motors<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/WT-10-HD.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"WT-10-HD\",\"price\":\"286.65\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"245\",\"margin\":\"14.53%\",\"product_id\":\"2404\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"1379\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"272.32\",\"margin\":\"10.03\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"1380\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"257.98\",\"margin\":\"5.03\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"14\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"14\",\"height\":\"3\",\"width\":\"24\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_height\":\"0.00\",\"shipping_width\":\"0.00\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"specs\":[{\"name\":\"Quantity\",\"value\":\"1\\/Each\"},{\"name\":\"Shipping Weight\",\"value\":\"14 lb.\"},{\"name\":\"Width\",\"value\":\"24 Inches\"},{\"name\":\"Depth\",\"value\":\"14 3\\/8 In