(9637, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Midea MIC3400F 14.2\\\"  Single Hob Countertop Induction Cooktop with Thermostatic Contols, Stainless Steel, 240v\\/1ph, 3400W\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-3\",\"slug_id\":\"2849\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Midea MIC3400F is a compact and efficient 14.2\\\" countertop induction cooktop, ideal for precise and fast cooking. Featuring a durable ceramic glass top and a single hob with five adjustable power levels, it delivers between 3000 and 5000 watts of power for versatile cooking needs. Its stainless steel exterior, slip-resistant metal feet, and advanced safety features, including an overheat sensor and pan detection, ensure durability and secure operation. Equipped with a 24-hour timer, five cooling fans, and a protective air deflector, it balances performance and safety. Operating at 3400 watts (240V\\/1ph), this cooktop is cETLus, ETL-Sanitation, and IPX3 certified, meeting high safety and sanitation standards. Lightweight and compact, its perfect for professional and home kitchens seeking reliable performance.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>High Power Output: The burner operates at 3400 watts, with adjustable wattage from 3000 to 5000 watts, providing versatility for a variety of cooking methods.<br>Induction Technology: Directly transfers heat to the cookware, reducing energy waste and ensuring faster heating compared to traditional cooktops.<br>Five Power Levels: Offers a range of heating options to suit different cooking requirements, from simmering to high-heat cooking.<br>Thermostatic Controls: Features a dial control for precise temperature and power adjustments, giving chefs optimal control over cooking conditions.<br>24-Hour Timer: Enables precise timing for recipes requiring long or short cooking durations.<br>Pan Detection Technology: Ensures that the burner only operates when a compatible induction-ready pan is present, enhancing safety and energy efficiency.<br>Overheat Sensor: Automatically shuts off the unit if the temperature exceeds safe operating limits, preventing accidents and damage.<br>Slip-Resistant Metal Feet: Provides stability on countertops, minimizing the risk of the cooktop shifting during use.<br>Ceramic Glass Top: Scratch-resistant and easy to clean, this surface is designed for durability and efficient heat transfer.<br>Stainless Steel Exterior: Corrosion-resistant and robust, ensuring the cooktops longevity even in demanding kitchen environments.<br>Compact Size: Measuring 14.2\\\" (W) x 17.7\\\" (D) x 5.1\\\" (H) and weighing only 19.51 lbs, this lightweight unit is portable and fits into tight kitchen spaces.<br>Five Cooling Fans: Efficiently dissipates heat to maintain optimal internal temperatures, prolonging the unit\'s lifespan and ensuring consistent performance.<br>Protective Air Deflector: Shields the cooktop from external contamination and prevents hot exhaust from re-entering the unit.<br>cETLus and ETL-Sanitation: Meets rigorous safety and sanitation standards for commercial kitchen appliances.<br>IPX3 Rating: Ensures protection against water splashes, making it safe to use and clean.<br>Power Requirements: Operates at 240V\\/60Hz, single-phase, drawing 14.6 amps, compatible with most commercial setups.<br>NEMA 6-20P Plug: Standardized plug type for easy installation in commercial or residential kitchens.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>2 Year Limited Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"buffet-and-food-displays-1\\/live-cooking-station.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"MIC3400F\",\"price\":\"477.9\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"405\",\"margin\":\"15.25%\",\"product_id\":\"1721\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"product_quantity\":null,\