(9639, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Migali C-G48T 48\\\" Gas Griddle w\\/ Thermostatic Controls\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-121\",\"slug_id\":\"2967\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<h2><strong>Description<\\/strong><\\/h2><p>The Migali C-G48T 48\\\" Gas Griddle is a high-performance piece of countertop cooking equipment designed for commercial kitchens. With a total BTU output of 100,000 and individual burners generating 25,000 BTU each, this griddle delivers robust heat, ensuring efficient and even cooking. The griddle features a 1-inch thick steel plate, which provides excellent heat retention and durability. The thermostatic controls allow for precise temperature management, catering to various cooking needs. Its convertible gas type capability (LP or NG) adds flexibility for different kitchen setups.<\\/p><p>Measuring 48 inches in width and 20 inches in depth, the cooking surface is expansive, offering a cooking area width of 47.9 inches. The griddle\\u2019s control spacing of 12 inches ensures easy access and operation. Weighing 415 pounds, it is built to withstand the demands of a busy kitchen environment. Backed by a 2-year parts and labor warranty, the Migali C-G48T is designed for reliability and ease of maintenance, making it a solid choice for high-volume cooking applications.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<h2><strong>Features<\\/strong><br>&nbsp;<\\/h2><p>The griddle boasts a powerful total BTU rating of 100,000, ensuring efficient and high-performance cooking. Each burner provides 25,000 BTU, delivering intense and consistent heat across the cooking surface. It is equipped with thermostatic controls for precise temperature management. The gas type is convertible, allowing for flexibility to use either LP (liquefied propane) or NG (natural gas). The griddle uses gas as its heat source for effective and reliable cooking. With an overall width of 48 inches, it provides a spacious cooking area for high-volume use. The griddle features a durable 1-inch thick steel plate, offering a robust cooking surface that distributes heat evenly. The cooking area depth is 20 inches, and the width of the cooking area is 47.9 inches, providing ample space for various cooking tasks. It comes with a 2-year parts and labor warranty, ensuring support and reliability for your kitchen operations.<br>&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>Five Years Compressor Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"products\\/c-g48t.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"C-G48T\",\"price\":\"2389\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"1830\",\"margin\":\"23.40%\",\"product_id\":\"1839\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"233\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"2269.55\",\"margin\":\"19.37\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"234\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"2150.10\",\"margin\":\"14.89\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"415\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"29\",\"height\":\"15\",\"width\":\"48\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0\",\"shipping_height\":\"0\",\"shipping_width\":\"0\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"specs\":[{\"name\":\"Weight\",\"value\":\"415 lbs\"},{\"name\":\"Width\",\"value\":\"48\"},{\"name\":\"Depth\",\"value\":\"28.6\"},{\"name\":\"Height\",\"value\":\"15.2\"},{\"name\":\"Installation Type\",\"value\":\"countertop\"},{\"name\":\"Number of Burners\",\"value\":\"4 burners\"},{\"nam