(9643, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Everest Refrigeration EBF2 54 1\\/8\\\" Bottom Mount Solid Door Reach-In Freezer, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-629\",\"slug_id\":\"3475\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Everest Refrigeration EBF2 2 Door Freezer is designed with a bottom-mounted compressor for effective cooling. It measures 54 1\\/8 inches in width, 33 1\\/8 inches in depth, and 77 inches in height, offering a spacious 50 cubic feet of storage capacity. The freezer is equipped with two solid swing doors, providing easy access and durability. This model includes Blizzard R290 technology, utilizing a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant that meets the energy consumption standards of the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency. The Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge allows for rapid cooling and can be easily replaced without the need for onsite brazing. The unit operates on 115V, 60Hz, and 1 phase, with a power requirement of 7.95 amps and a 1 horsepower compressor. Finished in stainless steel, the EBF2 is built to withstand the demands of a commercial environment. It has a crated weight of 590 lbs and features a bottom-mounted design to enhance functionality and ease of maintenance. This freezer is suitable for a variety of foodservice applications, offering reliable and efficient freezing performance.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Features a bottom-mounted design that enhances accessibility and simplifies maintenance in commercial kitchens. Provides ample interior space for full-size baking sheet pans, making it ideal for high-volume foodservice operations. Includes energy-efficient cooling with a climate-friendly refrigerant, reducing both energy costs and environmental impact. Offers a user-friendly slide-out cooling cartridge, ensuring quick and easy maintenance without onsite brazing. Comes with two solid swing doors, delivering durability and convenient access for various foodservice settings.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>Five year compressor &amp; 3 Year parts warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EBF2_0ddd1f11-1fdf-4776-b6c1-cc3202e7cccb.webp\",\"buffet-and-food-displays-1\\/live-cooking-station.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"EBF2\",\"price\":\"5243\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"4494\",\"margin\":\"14.29%\",\"product_id\":\"2347\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"1265\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"4980.85\",\"margin\":\"9.77\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"1266\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"4718.70\",\"margin\":\"4.76\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"590\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"54\",\"depth\":\"33\",\"height\":\"77\",\"width\":\"0\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0\",\"shipping_height\":\"0\",\"shipping_width\":\"0\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"shipping_weight\":null,\"shipping_weight_option\":\"Kg\",\"titles\":{\"4\":null,\"5\":null},\"variant_color_title\":\"Color\",\"variant_color_value\":null,\"variant_color_products\":null,\"variant_1_title\":null,\"variant_1_value\":null,\"variant_1_products\":null,\"variant_2_title\":null,\"variant_2_value\":null,\"variant_2_products\":null,\"variant_3_title\":null,\"variant_3_value\":null,\"variant_3_products\":null,\"compare_type\":null,\"compare_products\":null,\"faq_schema_config\":[[{\"key