(9644, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Atosa MBC80GR 80.5\\\" Stainless Steel Horizontal Bottle Cooler 21.2  Cu.Ft\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-38\",\"slug_id\":\"2884\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>&nbsp;<br>The Atosa MBC80GR 80.5\\\" Stainless Steel Horizontal Bottle Cooler is designed to provide efficient cooling and storage for beverages in commercial settings. With a spacious 21.2 cubic feet capacity, this horizontal cooler accommodates a large quantity of bottled drinks, making it ideal for bars, restaurants, and convenience stores. The exterior is crafted from durable stainless steel, which not only enhances its durability but also ensures resistance to corrosion and easy cleaning, crucial for maintaining hygiene in busy environments.<\\/p><p>Internally, the Atosa MBC80GR features a forced-air refrigeration system that ensures even cooling throughout the cabinet, keeping beverages chilled and ready for serving. The unit includes a built-in bottle opener and cap catcher on the front, adding convenience for bartenders and staff. LED interior lighting enhances visibility, making it easy to locate and retrieve beverages, especially in dimly lit environments. The MBC80GR is designed for efficiency and functionality, combining a robust build with practical features to streamline beverage service operations in commercial establishments.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Offers a generous 21.2 cubic feet capacity to store a large quantity of bottled beverages, perfect for high-demand environments such as bars and restaurants.<br>Durable stainless steel exterior provides strength, longevity, and resistance to corrosion, ensuring the cooler can withstand daily use in commercial settings.<br>Ensures consistent cooling throughout the cabinet, maintaining beverages at the optimal temperature for serving.<br>Conveniently located on the front of the cooler, allowing bartenders to quickly open bottles and dispose of caps, streamlining drink preparation.<br>Enhances visibility inside the cooler, making it easy to locate and access beverages, even in low-light conditions.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>Two Year Parts &amp; Labor Warranty h<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MBC80GR_addfa3bd-9fa9-48ce-9c29-9cc725d8bc19.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"MBC80GR\",\"price\":\"2857\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"1788\",\"margin\":\"37.42%\",\"product_id\":\"1756\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"67\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"2714.15\",\"margin\":\"34.12\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"68\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"2571.30\",\"margin\":\"30.46\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"344\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"28\",\"height\":\"37\",\"width\":\"81\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0\",\"shipping_height\":\"0\",\"shipping_width\":\"0\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"shipping_weight\":null,\"shipping_weight_option\":\"Kg\",\"titles\":{\"4\":null,\"5\":null},\"variant_color_title\":\"Color\",\"variant_color_value\":null,\"variant_color_products\":null,\"variant_1_title\":null,\"variant_1_value\":null,\"variant_1_products\":null,\"variant_2_title\":null,\"variant_2_value\":null,\"variant_2_products\":null,\"variant_3_title\":null,\"variant_3_value\":null,\"variant_3_products\":null,\"compare_type\":null,\"com