(9646, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Arctic Air ABB48 48\\\" Double Door Solid Back Bar Refrigerator\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"arctic-air-abb48-48-double-door-solid-back-bar-refrigerator\",\"slug_id\":\"2078\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Arctic Air ABB48 Double Door Back Bar Refrigerator is designed for durability and efficiency, featuring a 1.5\\u201d thick solid foamed stainless steel top and a 24\\u201d depth to conserve workspace. Inside, the stainless steel duct system ensures even cooling, powered by a self-contained capillary tube system using eco-friendly R290 Hydrocarbon gas. The electronic thermostat with LED display provides precise control, while the LED lighting and bright stainless steel interior enhance visibility and cleanliness. Its black powder-coated exterior is built for longevity, and the front-accessible condensing unit simplifies maintenance. This refrigerator is NSF Standard 7 compliant for open food storage and comes with a two-year parts and labor warranty, plus a five-year compressor warranty. Equipped with easy-to-mount plate casters, locking doors, and removable magnetic gaskets, it offers convenience and security in busy bar environments.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Weight &amp; Dimensions&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Shipping Weight: 280 lb.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Width: 49 Inches&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Depth: 24 Inches&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Height: 39.5 Inches<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<ul><li>Measures 49\\\" in width, 24\\\" in depth, and 39 1\\/2\\\" in height, providing 12.5 cubic feet of storage. It can hold up to 48 six-packs, making it ideal for high-volume beverage storage.&nbsp;<\\/li><li>Running at 4.3 amps with 60 Hz and 115V\\/1 phase, it is energy-efficient and compatible with standard electrical outlets using a NEMA 5-15P plug.&nbsp;<\\/li><li>Maintains a temperature range of 33\\u00b0F to 41\\u00b0F, ensuring beverages remain cool and fresh, with efficient front-breathing technology for optimal performance.&nbsp;<\\/li><li>Built with a black exterior finish, the unit is durable and visually appealing. The solid swing doors help maintain internal temperatures, while the LED lighting ensures easy visibility inside.&nbsp;<\\/li><li>Side-mounted, 1\\/3 HP compressor allows for convenient access and easy maintenance. Its front-breathing design requires no rear clearance, making it perfect for tight spaces.&nbsp;<\\/li><li>Equipped with casters, the refrigerator can be easily moved and repositioned, providing flexibility in busy environments.<br>It includes 4 adjustable shelves, allowing for flexible storage of items and maximizing the internal space.&nbsp;<\\/li><li>Uses R-290 refrigerant, which is environmentally responsible and energy-efficient, reducing the impact on the environment while ensuring high performance.&nbsp;<\\/li><li>Designed with a solid, black exterior and front-swinging doors, it ensures long-lasting use, and the LED lighting enhances interior visibility, making it easy to locate items quickly.&nbsp;<\\/li><li>Shipped with a weight of 280 lbs and is backed by a 1-year limited parts warranty, ensuring durability and reliability for commercial use.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>Two Years Parts &amp; Labor Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"buffet-and-food-displays-4\\/room-service-cart.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"ABB48\",\"price\":\"1699\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"1560\",\"margin\":\"8.18%\",\"product_id\":\"1569\",\"barcode\":\"1234567891112\",\"with_storehouse_management\":\"1\",\"quantity\":\"149\",\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"product_quantity\":null,\"discount\":null,\"price_after_discount\":null,\"margin\":null,\"discount_from_date\":null,\"discount_to_date\":null},{\"product_quantity\":null,\"discount\":null,\"price_after_discount\":null,\"margin\":null,\"dis