(9647, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Midea 1025F0A 20.13\\\"  Commercial Microwave Oven with Manual Controls, Stainless Steel, 120v\\/1ph, 1000W, 0.9cu. ft.\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-757\",\"slug_id\":\"3603\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Midea 1025F0A 20.13\\\" Stainless Steel Commercial Microwave Oven is a durable and compact appliance tailored for light-duty commercial use. With a 0.9 cu. ft. interior capacity, it accommodates various food items, while its 1,000-watt output ensures efficient heating. Designed with manual controls and an AutoRest feature, it provides straightforward and reliable operation. Measuring 20-1\\/8\\\" wide, 17\\\" deep, and 12-1\\/4\\\" high, this microwave fits seamlessly into tight kitchen spaces, and its stainless steel construction adds durability and easy maintenance. It features a 15-amp power draw, operates at 120 volts and 60 Hz, and connects via a NEMA 5-15P plug, making it a practical choice for commercial environments.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Dimensions: Measuring 20-1\\/8\\\" wide, 17\\\" deep, and 12-1\\/4\\\" high, this microwave is compact, making it ideal for limited countertop spaces in commercial kitchens, offices, and other professional settings.<br>Stainless Steel Construction: The exterior and interior are made of stainless steel, ensuring durability, easy cleaning, and resistance to rust or wear from frequent use.<br>Interior Size: With a 0.9 cubic foot chamber, the microwave accommodates small to medium-sized dishes, containers, or plates, suitable for quick food preparation in high-turnover environments.<br>Interior Dimensions: A spacious cavity with a width of 12-7\\/8\\\", depth of 13-5\\/8\\\", and height of 7-7\\/8\\\", provides flexibility to fit various cookware.<br>Cooking Power: Offers 1000 watts of output power, providing consistent and efficient cooking, reheating, or defrosting.<br>Bottom Energy Feed: Direct energy feed ensures faster and more even heating by placing the food closer to the source of microwaves, minimizing energy loss.<br>Simple Dial Operation: Manual controls allow for quick and intuitive operation, making it user-friendly and ideal for staff with varying skill levels.<br>No Complex Programming: Eliminates the need for complicated settings, streamlining the cooking process for busy kitchens.<br>AutoRest Technology: Automatically resets the microwave to a default ready state after each use, ensuring reliability and seamless operation in high-demand environments.<br>Voltage: Operates at 120 volts, compatible with standard outlets, requiring no special installation.<br>Plug Type: Equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug, allowing for easy setup in most commercial or residential spaces.<br>Amperage: Requires 15 amps, offering efficiency without overloading circuits.<br>Frequency: Designed to run on 60 Hertz, ensuring optimal performance in North American electrical systems.<br>Weight: Weighing only 32.4 lbs, the unit is relatively lightweight for its class, allowing for easy relocation or adjustments on countertops.<br>8. Commercial-Grade Build: Designed to withstand the rigors of heavy usage in restaurants, cafes, breakrooms, and other professional settings, maintaining performance and longevity.<br>Space-Saving: Compact design fits into tight spaces while still providing ample cooking capacity.<br>Durable and Easy to Clean: Stainless steel construction is both practical and aesthetically pleasing, simplifying maintenance.<br>User-Friendly: Manual dials and AutoRest functionality make it easy to use, even for those unfamiliar with advanced digital controls.<br>Efficient Cooking: Bottom energy feed and 1000W power reduces wait times and provides practicality, durability, and efficiency.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>Three year warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"products\\/1025f0a.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"1025F0A\",\"price\":\"318.6\",\"sale_