(9649, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Arctic Air ACP8SQ 28\\\" 8 Pan Countertop Compact Prep Unit\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"arctic-air-acp8sq-28-8-pan-countertop-compact-prep-unit\",\"slug_id\":\"2111\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Arctic Air ACP8SQ is a 28-inch, 8-pan countertop prep unit designed with a full stainless steel liner for its interior cabinet and a matching stainless steel shell for the exterior. It includes 1\\/6-size pans with covers, and its pan rail uses a \\u201ccold wall\\u201d heat transfer system instead of air cooling. The unit sits on plastic, non-scratch feet, providing durability and stability. The self-contained capillary tube system uses CFC-free refrigerant, making it environmentally friendly, and it meets NSF Standard 7 for open food storage. This prep unit requires manual defrosting as it has no built-in defrost system and is classified as an \\u201cin-service\\u201d item, meaning it must be powered off for defrosting. The compact size of the unit allows for 6-inch deep pans in the back row and 4-inch deep pans in the front, making it ideal for fast-paced prep work while conserving counter space. The strong stainless steel construction and environmentally responsible design make it a durable and efficient solution for foodservice operations. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 28\\\" Depth: 25 3\\/4\\\" Height: 9 1\\/8\\\" Weight 80 lb.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<ul><li>Weighing 80 lbs, this compact prep unit is lightweight enough for countertop placement and durable enough for daily commercial use.&nbsp;<\\/li><li>Measures 28 inches in width, 25 3\\/4 inches in depth, and 9 1\\/8 inches in height, providing a convenient size for easy integration into any kitchen workspace.&nbsp;<\\/li><li>It draws 1.4 amps of current and operates at 60 hertz with a 1-phase power supply, using standard 115 volts for optimal energy efficiency.&nbsp;<\\/li><li>Rear-mounted compressor is rated at 1\\/5 HP, ensuring efficient cooling for maintaining freshness in the stored items.&nbsp;<\\/li><li>It comes equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug, and uses electric power, featuring a 6-foot power cord for flexible installation.&nbsp;<\\/li><li>Utilizing R-600A refrigerant, it efficiently maintains temperatures between 33\\u00b0F and 41\\u00b0F, ideal for keeping ingredients cool and fresh.&nbsp;<\\/li><li>Designed to hold up to 8 pans of 1\\/6 size with a depth between 4 and 6 inches, making it versatile for various food items.&nbsp;<\\/li><li>Operating at 161 watts, it is made from durable stainless steel, offering both reliability and ease of cleaning in a commercial setting.&nbsp;<\\/li><li>It features 8 compartments, providing wide space for different food ingredients, which is perfect for sandwich or salad preparation.&nbsp;<\\/li><li>Backed by a full one-year part and labor warranty, it ensures long-term performance and peace of mind for the user.<br>&nbsp;<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"warranty_information\":null,\"images\":[null,\"buffet-and-food-displays-4\\/heating-cooling-and-air-quality.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"ACP8SQ\",\"price\":\"1999\",\"sale_price\":\"1065\",\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"722\",\"margin\":\"63.88%\",\"product_id\":\"1581\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"1\",\"quantity\":\"150\",\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"product_quantity\":null,\"discount\":null,\"price_after_discount\":null,\"margin\":null,\"discount_from_date\":null,\"discount_to_date\":null},{\"product_quantity\":null,\"discount\":null,\"price_after_discount\":null,\"margin\":null,\"discount_from_date\":null,\"discount_to_date\":null}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"80\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"25.5\",\"height\":\"9.5\",\"width\":\"49\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":