;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;max-width:100%;padding:0px;\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/cdn.shopify.com\\/s\\/files\\/1\\/0701\\/5802\\/5015\\/files\\/1R5A8343copy_480x480.jpg?v=1721815321\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"298\\\" height=\\\"298\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\"><\\/strong><\\/span>&nbsp;<\\/span><\\/a><br>&nbsp;<\\/h2><p style=\\\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Montserrat;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:inherit;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">A good-looking minibar is what creates a great impact on guests. It satisfies the guest\\u2019s hunger and thirst without having to order room service or go out to search for a food outlet. You should have items like water, soda, juice, beer\\/wine, and quality delicious snacks like chips, cookies, chocolates, etc. Lastly, a proper check should be made to see that the minibar is properly stocked. If you want a reliable minibar, then we would recommend, you should go with&nbsp;<\\/span> <a style=\\\"color:rgb(20,101,55);font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/horecastore.ae\\/collections\\/minibar\\/products\\/roomwell-uk-high-cool-absorption-minibar-solid-door-60-liters-h-57-x-w-49-x-d-49-cm-100-silent-ultra-cooling-cfc-hcfc-free-color-black\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noreferrer noopener\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">Roomwell Minibars<\\/span>&nbsp;<\\/a><span style=\\\"font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"> as they are highly reliable,<\\/span>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<\\/p><h2 style=\\\"background-c