(9701, 1, 'form', '{\"name\":\"Top 9 Must-Have Hotel Supplies for a Five-Star Guest Experience\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Blog\\\\Models\\\\Post\",\"slug\":\"top-9-must-have-hotel-supplies-for-a-five-star-guest-experience\",\"slug_id\":\"3622\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":null,\"is_featured\":\"0\",\"content\":\"<figure class=\\\"image\\\"><img style=\\\"aspect-ratio:1200\\/468;\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/admin.horecastore.sa\\/storage\\/top-9-must-have-hotel-supplies-for-a-five-star-guest-experience.webp\\\" alt=\\\"top-9-must-have-hotel-supplies-for-a-five-star-guest-experience.webp\\\" width=\\\"1200\\\" height=\\\"468\\\"><\\/figure><p style=\\\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Montserrat;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:inherit;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">Imagine reaching your hotel after a long flight only to find a room with poor supplies. You\\u2019ll feel cheated and unhappy.&nbsp; Right? That\\u2019s not how you want your guests to feel.&nbsp;You want them to enjoy their stay, come back again, and spread positive word-of-mouth. You might think providing good services would suffice.&nbsp;But the secret lies in providing exceptional hotel amenities.&nbsp;So, how can hotel amenities enrich and improve customer experience?&nbsp;This blog answers this and gives you the blueprint for guest satisfaction, loyalty, and boosting revenues.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Montserrat;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:inherit;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">Now in case if you are wondering where to get the best hotel supplies for your five-star guest experience, then let us tell you with extreme pride that we at&nbsp;<\\/span> <a style=\\\"color:rgb(20,101,55);font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/horecastore.ae\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noreferrer noopener\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">The&nbsp;HORECA Store<\\/span>&nbsp;<\\/a><span style=\\\"font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"> have a very vast variety of hotel supplies to fulfill all your business needs, be it your hotel, a restaurant, or even a caf\\u00e9. Here are the top 10 must-have hotel supplies for a \\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50 guest experience.<\\/span><\\/p><h2 style=\\\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:24px;font-style:normal;line-height:1.4;margin:0px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:24px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><strong>Minibar<\\/strong><\\/span>&nbsp;<\\/span><br><a style=\\\"font-family:inherit;font-size:24px;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/horecastore.ae\\/products\\/roomwell-retro-compressor-minibar-38-litres-h-65-5-x-w-40-x-d-44-cm-energy-efficient-fast-cooling-color-red\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noreferrer noopener\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:24px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><strong><img style=\\\"border-style:none;font-family:inherit;font-size:24px;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;height:auto;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;max-width:100%;padding:0px;\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/cdn.shopify.com\\/s\\/files\\/1\\/0701\\/5802\\/5015\\/files\\/1R5A8343copy_480x480.jpg?v=1721815321\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"298\\\" height=\\\"298\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\"><\\/strong><\\/span>&nbsp;<\\/span><\\/a><br>&nbsp;<\\/h2><p style=\\\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Montserrat;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:inherit;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">A good-looking minibar is what creates a great impact on guests. It satisfies the guest\\u2019s hunger and thirst without having to order room service or go out to search for a food outlet. You should have items like water, soda, juice, beer\\/wine, and quality delicious snacks like chips, cookies, chocolates, etc. Lastly, a proper check should be made to see that the minibar is properly stocked. If you want a reliable minibar, then we would recommend, you should go with&nbsp;<\\/span> <a style=\\\"color:rgb(20,101,55);font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/horecastore.ae\\/collections\\/minibar\\/products\\/roomwell-uk-high-cool-absorption-minibar-solid-door-60-liters-h-57-x-w-49-x-d-49-cm-100-silent-ultra-cooling-cfc-hcfc-free-color-black\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noreferrer noopener\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">Roomwell Minibars<\\/span>&nbsp;<\\/a><span style=\\\"font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"> as they are highly reliable,<\\/span>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<\\/p><h2 style=\\\"background-c