erning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:24px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-emoji:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-position:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.4;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\" data-mce-fragment=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:24px;\\\"><span style=\\\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\\\" data-mce-fragment=\\\"1\\\"><strong style=\\\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:24px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\\\" data-mce-fragment=\\\"1\\\">How much money does a Concierge make?<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/span><\\/h2><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Montserrat;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-emoji:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-position:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:inherit;margin:0px 0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\" data-mce-fragment=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\\\" data-mce-fragment=\\\"1\\\">Now, this is one of the major queries from individuals, how much money does a concierge make? Well, to answer your query, the concierge is also one of the best-paying jobs, you can easily make from&nbsp;<strong style=\\\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\\\" data-mce-fragment=\\\"1\\\">$30,000<\\/strong>&nbsp;to&nbsp;<strong style=\\\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\\\" data-mce-fragment=\\\"1\\\">$55,000<\\/strong>&nbsp;per year. Their hourly wage ranges from&nbsp;<strong style=\\\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\\\" data-mce-fragment=\\\"1\\\">$14<\\/strong>&nbsp;to&nbsp;<strong style=\\\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\\\" data-mce-fragment=\\\"1\\\">$22<\\/strong>, which obviously meets the standards.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Montserrat;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-emoji:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-position:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:inherit;margin:0px 0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\" data-mce-fragment=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\\\" data-mce-fragment=\\\"1\\\">Apart from their base salary, the Concierge does earn a good amount from guests\\u2019 tips. They are not bound under any agreement so they are allowed to have tips from the guests upon their arrival or at the time of their checkout. Guests may tip from $5 and go upward to $35 depending on the service they get.<\\/span><\\/p><h2 style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:var(--font-heading-family);font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:24px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-emoji:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-position:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.4;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\" data-mce-fragment=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:24px;\\\"><span style=\\\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\\\" data-mce-fragment=\\\"1\\\"><strong style=\\\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:24px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\\\" data-mce-fragment=\\\"1\\\">What are the Educational Requirements of Becoming a Concierge?<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/span><\\/h2><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Montserrat;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-emoji:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-position:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:inherit;margin:0px 0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\" data-mce-fragment=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\\\" data-mce-fragment=\\\"1\\\">This is also one of the most asked questions by people, \\u201cWhat are the Educational Requirements of Becoming a Concierge? Well, the answer to your question is, that you need to have at least a high school diploma, although a bachelor\\u2019s degree is necessary. If you are planning to apply for further studies, there are schools in the market that would offer you certification. By doing that, you will have additional skills in your portfolio and those skills will surely help you in the future as well.<\\/span><\\/p><h2 style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:var(--font-heading-family);font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:24px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-emoji:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-position:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.4;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\" data-mce-fragment=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:24px;\\\"><span style=\\\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\\\" data-mce-fragment=\\\"1\\\"><strong style=\\\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:24px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\\\" data-mce-fragment=\\\"1\\\">How One Can Become a Concierge?<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/span><\\/h2><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Montserrat;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-emoji:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-position:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:inherit;margin:0px 0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\" data-mce-fragment=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\\\" data-mce-fragment=\\\"1\\\">We must admit the fact that the Concierge job is one different and it would not be wrong to say that it indeed is one of the most unique jobs. If you are planning to become a Concierge, then you are at the best place because here are some of the steps you need to:<\\/span><\\/p><h3 style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:var(--font-heading-family);font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:20px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-emoji:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-var