 the&nbsp;<\\/span><a style=\\\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:var(--link-color);font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;touch-action:manipulation;transition:0.25s;vertical-align:baseline;\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/horecastore.ae\\/blogs\\/hotel\\/beginner-s-guide-to-what-are-guest-supplies-in-hotel\\\" title=\\\"Beginner\\u2019s Guide to What are Guest Supplies in Hotel\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"a11y-new-window-external-message\\\" data-mce-fragment=\\\"1\\\" data-mce-href=\\\"https:\\/\\/horecastore.ae\\/blogs\\/hotel\\/beginner-s-guide-to-what-are-guest-supplies-in-hotel\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><span style=\\\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\\\" data-mce-fragment=\\\"1\\\">hospitality<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\\\" data-mce-fragment=\\\"1\\\">&nbsp;sector, if you have no prior experience, try finding a normal-paying job and have some experience first, and then you can go for big hotels. By doing a normal paying job, you would have an idea of how hotel and operation works.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"-web