s, and seating areas and therefore defines the guest experience.<\\/span>&nbsp;<\\/span><\\/p><h2 style=\\\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:24px;font-style:normal;line-height:1.4;margin:0px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><strong>4. Ahmed Bakri LLC<\\/strong><\\/h2><p style=\\\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Montserrat;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:inherit;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">To Achieve necessary exposure,&nbsp;<\\/span> <\\/span><a style=\\\"font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/horecastore.ae\\/collections\\/bakery-equipment\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noreferrer noopener\\\"><span style=\\\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">Bakery<\\/span>&nbsp;<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"> and Kitchen Equipment LLC named Ahmad Bakri for small business development. Established in 1955, Ahmad Bakri for Bakery &amp; Kitchen Equipment LLC has changed its course from the implying category of a bakery equipment producer to a frontrunner in the industry. Famous for *Arabish* (Lebanese)*Pita Bread machinery*, they constructed a name that stands for high quality by the motto \\\"Your Bread - Our Specialty\\\". *Organization* is known for easy access to clients as well as for its year-round support. They also consider establishing wide relations with their clients through strong networking to build good communication with them.<\\/span>&nbsp;<\\/span><\\/p><h2 style=\\\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:24px;font-style:normal;line-height:1.4;margin:0px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><strong>5. Bandak Investment LLC<\\/strong><\\/h2><p style=\\\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Montserrat;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:inherit;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">Bandak Investment LLC has the strategic goal to maximize the expansion of the company\'s products and services toward being the leading firm in the importing, exporting, and trading sectors. While the beginning of this company as far back as 1988 by the no longer with us Mr. Munir Jamil Al Bandak, this firm has remained, still today, a leader in the industry of commercial food-preparation equipment to be distributed to hotels. It\'s their vision to offer well-known globally recognized kitchen equipment leading to a high standard of service for their customers.<\\/span>&nbsp;<\\/span><\\/p><h2 style=\\\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:24px;font-style:normal;line-height:1.4;margin:0px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:24px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><strong>Tips for Kitchen Supplies for Restaurant<\\/strong><\\/span>&nbsp;<\\/span><br><br><strong>Choose the Right Type<\\/strong><\\/h2><p style=\\\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Montserrat;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:inherit;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\\\"><span st