(9766, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Serv-Ware SGF-50N 16\\\" Stainless Steel 4 Tube Fryer, Natural Gas,120,000 BTU\\/H\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-750\",\"slug_id\":\"3596\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Serv-Ware SGF-50N 16 Stainless Steel 4 Tube Fryer is a high-performance commercial fryer designed for efficient and heavy-duty frying operations. With four tube burners delivering a total of 120,000 BTU\\/H, this fryer ensures rapid and even heating, making it ideal for high-volume cooking environments. The use of natural gas as the fuel source provides reliable and powerful heat, essential for achieving consistent cooking results and meeting the demands of a busy kitchen. Constructed from durable stainless steel, the SGF-50N features a robust build that withstands the rigors of frequent use and high temperatures. It includes a sizable 50-pound oil capacity, allowing for substantial quantities of fried food to be prepared with less frequent oil changes. The fryer is equipped with a precise millivolt thermostat, offering temperature control from 200F to 400F to suit various frying needs. Its design incorporates safety features such as a high-limit thermostat and a temperature probe, ensuring safe operation and preventing overheating, making it a reliable choice for commercial food service operations.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<ul><li>Equipped with four tube burners, each delivering 30,000 BTU\\/H, providing a total heat output of 120,000 BTU\\/H for fast and efficient frying.<br>&nbsp;<\\/li><li>Operates on natural gas, offering a reliable and powerful heat source suitable for high-volume frying tasks.<br>&nbsp;<\\/li><li>Designed with a 50-pound oil capacity, allowing for large batch frying and reducing the need for frequent oil changes.<br>&nbsp;<\\/li><li>Features a millivolt thermostat with a temperature range from 200F to 400F, providing precise control over frying temperatures for optimal cooking results.<br>&nbsp;<\\/li><li>Built with durable stainless steel for the tank, door, and front, ensuring longevity, easy maintenance, and resistance to high temperatures and corrosion.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>Three year warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/SGF-50N1.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"SGF-50N\",\"price\":\"1454.91\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"886\",\"margin\":\"39.10%\",\"product_id\":\"2468\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"1515\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"1382.16\",\"margin\":\"35.90\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"1516\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"1309.42\",\"margin\":\"32.34\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"172\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"30\",\"height\":\"47\",\"width\":\"16\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0\",\"shipping_height\":\"0\",\"shipping_width\":\"0\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"specs\":[{\"name\":\"abc\",\"value\":null},{\"name\":\"drf\",\"value\":null},{\"name\":\"sd\",\"value\":null},{\"name\":\"sdsd\",\"value\":null},{\"name\":\"dsdasd\",\"value\":null}],\"shipping_weight\":null,\"shipping_weight_option\":\"Kg\",\"titles\":{\"4\":null,\"5\":null},\"variant_color_title\":\"Color\",\"variant_color_value\":null,\"variant_color_products\":null,\"variant_1_title\":null,\"variant_1_value\":null,\"variant_1_products\":null,\"var