(9785, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"The Menumaster RCS511TS microwave delivers 1100W power with a 34L capacity and durable stainless-steel designperfect for small to medium kitchens.\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"the-menumaster-rcs511ts-microwave-delivers-1100w-power-with-a-34l-capacity-and-durable-stainless-steel-designperfect-for-small-to-medium-kitchens\",\"slug_id\":\"3662\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Menumaster microwave RCS511DSE offers a spacious 34L capacity with external dimensions of 352(H) x 559(W) x 483(D) mm and an internal cooking area of 216(H) x 368(W) x 381(D) mm, providing ample space for large, bulky loads, allowing you to cook more at once and save time. Made with durable stainless steel, this microwave operates with a power output of 1.55 kW, 230\\/240V, and 13A, and weighs 19 kg. The easy-to-clean, removable filters come with cleaning reminders to maintain peak efficiency, while the easy-open door provides simple and convenient access to food. The intuitive dial control makes it user-friendly for quick operation, and its stackable design helps maximize output without taking up additional workspace, with the stacking kit included. Built for long-lasting operation, this microwave is constructed with heavy-duty materials to withstand the demands of busy kitchens.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<ul><li>34L Capacity: Ideal for cooking large, bulky loads to save time.&nbsp;<\\/li><li>Compact Size: External dimensions of 352(H) x 559(W) x 483(D) mm with a cooking area of 216(H) x 368(W) x 381(D) mm.&nbsp;<\\/li><li>1.55 kW Power Output: Efficient cooking with 230\\/240V, 13A power. Durable Stainless Steel: Long-lasting and easy to clean.&nbsp;<\\/li><li>Removable Filters: Includes cleaning reminders for efficient performance.&nbsp;<\\/li><li>User-Friendly Dial Control: Easy to operate for quick cooking.&nbsp;<\\/li><li>Stackable Design: Saves space and maximizes kitchen output with the stacking kit i