(9787, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Arctic Air ABB60 60 Double Door Solid Back Bar Refrigerator\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"arctic-air-abb60-60-double-door-solid-back-bar-refrigerator\",\"slug_id\":\"2592\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Arctic Air ABB60 60 Double Door Solid Back Bar Refrigerator combines functionality with advanced features, making it an excellent addition to any commercial bar setting. The top is constructed from 1.59-inch solid foamed stainless steel, providing durability and ease of maintenance. This refrigerator employs a self-contained capillary tube system that utilizes environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant (R290), ensuring compliance with modern eco-friendly standards. Its front-accessible condensing unit simplifies cleaning and maintenance, while the front-breathing design enhances airflow and efficiency. It is equipped with easy-to-mount casters, two of which are lockable, ensuring mobility and stability. Internally, the refrigerator has interior LED lighting for improved visibility and a mirror-finish stainless steel interior, complete with a high-grade stainless steel coved corner floor for easy cleaning. The exterior features black powder-coated steel for a sleek, professional appearance. Each door includes removable magnetic gaskets that facilitate cleaning, and the electronic thermostat with a digital LED display allows for precise temperature control from the front access panel. With a compact design measuring 49 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39.5 inches in height, and meeting NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage, it is tailored to meet the demands of any busy bar environment while conserving valuable workspace. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 49 Inches Depth: 24 Inches Height: 39.5 Inches Weight: 320 lb.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<ul><li>The Arctic Air ABB60 measures 49 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39 1\\/2 inches in height, designed sp