(9788, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Midea MIC3400WK 14.8\\\"  Single Hob Countertop Induction Cooktop with Thermostatic Controls, Stainless Steel, 240v\\/1ph, 3400W\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-1\",\"slug_id\":\"2848\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Midea MIC3400WK is a versatile 14.8\\\" countertop induction cooktop designed for efficient and precise cooking. It features a recessed glass-ceramic wok bowl, paired with an included wok pan, making it ideal for high-heat stir-frying. With thermostatic controls and five adjustable power levels, this single-hob unit allows for precise temperature management and flexibility in cooking. Its durable stainless steel exterior and slip-resistant metal feet ensure stability and longevity, while five cooling fans and a protective air deflector enhance safety and performance. Equipped with a 24-hour timer and operating at 3400 watts (240V\\/1ph), this cooktop is both powerful and user-friendly. Certified by cETLus, ETL-Sanitation, and IPX3, it meets rigorous safety and sanitation standards, making it a reliable choice for professional and home kitchens.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Induction Technology: Provides rapid and energy-efficient heating by transferring heat directly to the cookware, ensuring minimal heat loss.<br>Power Output: 3400 watts of power for high-speed cooking, suitable for demanding kitchen environments.<br>Power Levels: Offers five adjustable power levels, giving chefs control over heat intensity for precise cooking.<br>Recessed Glass-Ceramic Wok Bowl: The hob features a specially designed recessed bowl, ideal for wok cooking. This design ensures that the wok pan remains stable and evenly heated.<br>Includes Wok Pan: Comes with a wok pan, making it ready for immediate use.<br>Compact Dimensions: Measuring 14.8\\\" (W) x 19.7\\\" (D) x 7.4\\\" (H), it fits comfortably on most countertops, making it ideal for kitchens with limited space.<br>Thermostatic Dial Controls: Intuitive dial for adjusting power and temperature levels, allowing easy operation.<br>24-Hour Timer: Built-in timer for precise cooking durations, suitable for tasks requiring long or short cook times.<br>Five Cooling Fans: Equipped with five silent cooling fans to maintain optimal internal temperatures and ensure consistent performance during prolonged use.<br>Protective Air Deflector: Directs hot exhaust away from the unit to prevent overheating and contamination from external sources.<br>Overheating Protection: A thermostatically controlled overheating sensor enhances safety by shutting the unit down if temperatures exceed safe levels.<br>Slip-Resistant Feet: Sturdy metal feet provide stability on countertops, preventing accidental movement during operation.<br>Waterproof Rating: Certified IPX3, offering protection against water splashes, making it safer and easier to clean.<br>Stainless Steel Exterior: The robust body is resistant to rust, corrosion, and wear, ensuring long-term durability.<br>Glass-Ceramic Surface: Scratch-resistant and easy to clean, maintaining a sleek appearance even after heavy use.<br>cETLus and ETL-Sanitation: Meets North American safety and sanitation standards.<br>NEMA 6-20P Plug: Ensures compatibility with most commercial kitchen power outlets.<br>Lightweight: Weighing only 29.1 lbs, it is easy to transport and reposition as needed in dynamic kitchen setups.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>1 Year Limited Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"products\\/mic3400wk.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"MIC3400WK\",\"price\":\"584.1\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"495\",\"margin\":\"15.25%\",\"product_id\":\"1720\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"product_quantity\":null,\"discount\"