(9789, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Midea 1217G1S 16.5\\\"  Commercial Microwave Oven with Touch Control Pad, Stainless Steel, 120v\\/1ph, 1200W, 0.6 cu. ft.\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-5\",\"slug_id\":\"2851\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Midea 1217G1S is a 16.5\\\" stainless steel commercial microwave oven designed for medium-duty use, making it perfect for food service operations that require efficient heating and cooking. With a power output of 1200 watts and a compact 0.6 cu. ft. capacity, it offers reliable performance in a small footprint. The touch control pad provides easy operation with 11 power levels, ensuring precise cooking for a variety of dishes. Its durable stainless steel construction ensures longevity, while the sleek design fits seamlessly into professional kitchen setups. Operating on 120V\\/1ph, this microwave is both powerful and user-friendly, ideal for busy commercial environments.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Fast and Consistent Heating: The 1200 Watts power output provides fast and consistent heating that is perfect for medium-duty use in commercial kitchens.<br>11 Power Levels: Offers 11 power levels and precise control over cooking and reheating, accommodating a variety of food items and preparation needs.<br>Sufficient Space: It offers 0.6 cubic feet space for heating smaller food portions or dishes, while remaining compact for tight kitchen spaces.<br>Accommodates Common Dish Sizes: Fits standard commercial plates, ensuring versatility for a variety of serving needs.<br>Stainless Steel Construction: The exterior and interior are made of durable stainless steel, ensuring longevity, easy cleaning, and a professional appearance.<br>Compact Footprint: With dimensions of 16.5\\\" (W) x 22.13\\\" (D) x 13.38\\\" (H), the unit saves valuable countertop space while delivering high performance.<br>Touch Control Pad: Features intuitive controls with clearly labeled options, making it simple to operate even in fast-paced environments.<br>Multiple Cooking Options: Programmable settings allow users to store frequently used recipes, streamlining operations and reducing prep time.<br>Commercial Grade: Engineered for reliability in medium-duty commercial settings, such as restaurants, catering businesses, and break rooms.<br>Safety and Quality Approvals: Meets industry standards for performance and sanitation.<br>120V\\/1ph Power Supply: Operates on standard outlets, drawing 1200 watts of power, ensuring compatibility with most commercial electrical setups.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>4 Year Limited Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"products\\/1217g1s.webp\",\"products\\/1217g1s-1.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"1217G1S\",\"price\":\"1255.28\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"1063.8\",\"margin\":\"15.25%\",\"product_id\":\"1723\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"product_quantity\":null,\"discount\":null,\"price_after_discount\":null,\"margin\":null,\"discount_from_date\":null,\"discount_to_date\":null},{\"product_quantity\":null,\"discount\":null,\"price_after_discount\":null,\"margin\":null,\"discount_from_date\":null,\"discount_to_date\":null}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"71\",\"length_unit_id\":\"1\",\"length\":\"0\",\"depth\":\"22\",\"height\":\"13\",\"width\":\"17\",\"shipping_length_id\":\"1\",\"shipping_length\":\"0\",\"shipping_depth\":\"0\",\"shipping_height\":\"0\",\"shipping_width\":\"0\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"deleted_videos\":null,\"shipping_weight\":null,\"shipping_weight_option\":\"Kg\",\"titles\":{\"4\":null,\"5\":null},\"variant_color_title\":\"Color\",\"variant_color_value\":null,\"variant_color_products\":null,\"variant_1_title\":null