(9791, 1, 'product', '{\"name\":\"Migali C-SM-36-LP Liquid Propane 36\\\" Salamander Manual Control\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"name-91\",\"slug_id\":\"2937\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p><strong>Description<\\/strong><br><br>The Migali C-SM-36-LP is a liquid propane salamander with independent manual control, ensuring precise cooking temperatures. It\'s built with durable stainless steel and fits compactly with dimensions of 36 inches wide, 18 inches deep, and 17.3 inches high. Ideal for broiling, melting cheese, and finishing dishes, offering versatility for consistent cooking results in commercial kitchens.<\\/p>\",\"content\":\"<p>Operates on liquid propane, 36\\\" salamander.<br>Independent manual control for precise heat adjustments.<br>Constructed from durable stainless steel.<br>Exterior dimensions: 36\\\" W x 18\\\" D x 17.3\\\" H.<br>Versatile for broiling, melting, and finishing dishes.<\\/p>\",\"warranty_information\":\"<p>Five Years Compressor Warranty<\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"products\\/c-sm-36-lp-1.webp\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":\"C-SM-36-LP\",\"price\":\"1481\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"unit_of_measurement_id\":\"1\",\"cost_per_item\":\"1135\",\"margin\":\"23.36%\",\"product_id\":\"1809\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":null,\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"discount\":[{\"discount_id\":\"173\",\"product_quantity\":\"4\",\"discount\":\"5\",\"price_after_discount\":\"1406.95\",\"margin\":\"19.33\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"},{\"discount_id\":\"174\",\"product_quantity\":\"8\",\"discount\":\"10\",\"price_after_discount\":\"1332.90\",\"margin\":\"14.85\",\"discount_from_date\":\"2024-12-16T12:16\",\"discount_to_date\":\"2024-12-20T12:16\"}],\"weight_unit_id\":\"1\",\"weight\":\"165\",\"length_