(1565, 'True STA1H-2HS 27 1/2\" Spec Series Full Height Insulated Mobile Heated Cabinet with 3 Pan Capacity,Silver, 208-230v/1ph', '<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-family:Montserrat;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\">The True STA1H-2HS is a full-height, mobile heated cabinet designed for efficient food holding and transport in commercial kitchens. Measuring 27 1/2 inches wide, this cabinet features a robust stainless steel exterior with a sleek silver finish, providing durability and ease of cleaning. It is equipped with full insulation to maintain consistent temperatures, ensuring that food stays hot and ready for service. The cabinet\'s design includes a capacity for up to three full-size pans, making it versatile for various food items. Powered by a 208-230V/1PH electrical system, the STA1H-2HS utilizes an advanced heating system to provide reliable heat distribution. The cabinet features a built-in thermostat and an adjustable temperature range to accommodate different food holding requirements. Its mobile design, supported by heavy-duty casters, allows for easy maneuverability in a busy kitchen environment. The cabinet is an ideal solution for keeping large quantities of food at the perfect serving temperature, enhancing efficiency and service quality in foodservice operations.</span>  </span></p>', '<ul><li style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(74,74,74);font-family:Montserrat;font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.4;margin-bottom:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\">The cabinet is constructed with a stainless steel exterior and an aluminum interior, ensuring durability and ease of cleaning. It features high-density, CFC-free polyurethane insulation, which enhances thermal efficiency and maintains consistent temperatures.</li><li style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(74,74,74);font-family:Montserrat;font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.4;margin-bottom:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\">Equipped with a forced-air heating system, the cabinet provides even heat distribution to keep food at the desired temperature. The heating element is designed to maintain a consistent temperature range, ensuring food safety and quality.</li><li style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(74,74,74);font-family:Montserrat;font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.4;margin-bottom:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\">The cabinet has a three-pan capacity, which allows for the storage of large quantities of food. The interior can accommodate standard-sized pans, making it versatile for various foodservice needs.</li><li style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(74,74,74);font-family:Montserrat;font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.4;margin-bottom:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\">It includes heavy-duty casters, which facilitate easy movement and positioning within a commercial kitchen. The cabinet also features hinged doors with a full-height design, allowing easy access to the interior and efficient loading and unloading.</li><li style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(74,74,74);font-family:Montserrat;font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.4;margin-bottom:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\">Operating on a 208-230V, 1-phase electrical system, this heated cabinet is suitable for high-demand environments. It is designed to deliver reliable performance and consistent heating, making it ideal for maintaining food temperatures during service.</li></ul>', 'published', '[\"sssp-1\\/sta1h-2hs-999e4bd4-c16e-4563-9827-03e607603a82.webp\",\"sssp-1\\/sta1h-2hs-999e4bd4-c16e-4563-9827-03e607603a82.webp\"]', 'STA1H-2HS', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0, 7999, 5028.31, NULL, NULL, 84.50, 3, 27.50, 3, 0.00, 3, 33.50, 3, 350.00, 9, NULL, 43, '2024-10-15 09:16:27', '2024-11-18 09:31:14', 'in_stock', 22, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'sssp-1/sta1h-2hs-999e4bd4-c16e-4563-9827-03e607603a82.webp', 'physical', NULL, 4028.31, 1, 1, 1, 0, '<p>7- Year Parts &amp; Labor, 7- Year Compressor</p>', '2024-10-19', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Refrigeration', 'STA1H-2HS', 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'pounds', 340.00, NULL, 27.50, 3, 33.50, 3, 84.50, 3, 0.00, 3, NULL, '[\"good \",\"   better \",\"   best\"]', '[\"1695\",\"   1696\",\"   1697\"]', 'non-refundable', '20', 1, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1569, 'Arctic Air ABB48 48\" Double Door Solid Back Bar Refrigerator', '<p>The Arctic Air ABB48 Double Door Back Bar Refrigerator is designed for durability and efficiency, featuring a 1.5” thick solid foamed stainless steel top and a 24” depth to conserve workspace. Inside, the stainless steel duct system ensures even cooling, powered by a self-contained capillary tube system using eco-friendly R290 Hydrocarbon gas. The electronic thermostat with LED display provides precise control, while the LED lighting and bright stainless steel interior enhance visibility and cleanliness. Its black powder-coated exterior is built for longevity, and the front-accessible condensing unit simplifies maintenance. This refrigerator is NSF Standard 7 compliant for open food storage and comes with a two-year parts and labor warranty, plus a five-year compressor warranty. Equipped with easy-to-mount plate casters, locking doors, and removable magnetic gaskets, it offers convenience and security in busy bar environments. </p><p>Weight &amp; Dimensions </p><p>Shipping Weight: 280 lb. </p><p>Width: 49 Inches </p><p>Depth: 24 Inches </p><p>Height: 39.5 Inches</p>', '<ul><li>Measures 49\" in width, 24\" in depth, and 39 1/2\" in height, providing 12.5 cubic feet of storage. It can hold up to 48 six-packs, making it ideal for high-volume beverage storage. </li><li>Running at 4.3 amps with 60 Hz and 115V/1 phase, it is energy-efficient and compatible with standard electrical outlets using a NEMA 5-15P plug. </li><li>Maintains a temperature range of 33°F to 41°F, ensuring beverages remain cool and fresh, with efficient front-breathing technology for optimal performance. </li><li>Built with a black exterior finish, the unit is durable and visually appealing. The solid swing doors help maintain internal temperatures, while the LED lighting ensures easy visibility inside. </li><li>Side-mounted, 1/3 HP compressor allows for convenient access and easy maintenance. Its front-breathing design requires no rear clearance, making it perfect for tight spaces. </li><li>Equipped with casters, the refrigerator can be easily moved and repositioned, providing flexibility in busy environments.<br>It includes 4 adjustable shelves, allowing for flexible storage of items and maximizing the internal space. </li><li>Uses R-290 refrigerant, which is environmentally responsible and energy-efficient, reducing the impact on the environment while ensuring high performance. </li><li>Designed with a solid, black exterior and front-swinging doors, it ensures long-lasting use, and the LED lighting enhances interior visibility, making it easy to locate items quickly. </li><li>Shipped with a weight of 280 lbs and is backed by a 1-year limited parts warranty, ensuring durability and reliability for commercial use.</li></ul>', 'published', '[\"buffet-and-food-displays-4\\/room-service-cart.webp\"]', 'ABB48', 0, 149, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 1699, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 49.00, NULL, 39.50, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 280.00, 1, NULL, 33, '2024-10-16 11:02:42', '2024-12-18 09:26:59', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'abb48-01bf81a0-9231-4c43-8d9f-4a916497ea87.webp', 'physical', '1234567891112', 1560, 1, 5, 7, 0, '<p>Two Years Parts &amp; Labor Warranty</p>', '2024-10-20', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1, '[{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Gxfu74TF1s0el8XQZIAwu5iiJUvprcstlQFrwGBI.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/VMK0d40fis66fRB3PyLmbS0aHIhCaw8fzQMgsS3N.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'pounds', NULL, NULL, 49.00, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 39.50, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"APP48R\"},{\"value\":\"AGDF23\"},{\"value\":\"AGR49\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', '10', 1, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1570, 'Arctic Air 69436 Can Divider with Four Mounting Clips for AUB Models Only', '<p>The Arctic Air 69436 is a specialized can divider designed specifically for AUB models, offering enhanced organization and accessibility for canned goods. It contains one shelf along with four mounting clips, ensuring secure installation and stability. With a shipping weight of 6 lbs and a product weight of 6 lbs, it is lightweight and strong, making it a practical addition to your storage setup. Crafted to fit perfectly with the vertical divider system of AUB models, it optimizes space within refrigeration units, allowing for efficient storage and easy retrieval of cans. Its design promotes better organization, minimizing clutter and maximizing the use of vertical space. By incorporating this divider, users can streamline their food storage operations while maintaining a clean and professional appearance in their kitchens. Weight &amp; Dimensions Shipping Weight 6 lbs Product Weight 6 lbs</p>', '<ul><li>Shipping weight of the can divider is 6 lbs, making it lightweight and easy to handle during transportation. </li><li>Poduct weight is also 6 lbs, ensuring that it is a compact and efficient addition to your refrigeration setup. </li><li>Set contains one shelf and four mounting clips, providing all necessary parts for installation and use. </li><li>Specifically designed to fit AUB models only, ensuring a perfect fit and optimal functionality. </li><li>Vertical divider design helps organize cans and other items efficiently, maximizing space within your refrigeration unit.<br> </li></ul>', 'published', '[\"69436-2.jpg\",\"64900k.webp\",\"70250k.webp\",\"70118k.webp\"]', '69436', 0, 148, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 150, 63, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 0.00, 1, 0.00, 1, 0.00, 1, 6.00, 9, NULL, 37, '2024-10-16 13:30:28', '2024-11-12 08:25:54', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', '69436-2.jpg', 'physical', NULL, 53, 1, 5, 7, 0, '<p>Two Year Parts &amp; Labor Warranty</p>', '2024-10-19', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', '69436', 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'pounds', 6.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, 0.00, 1, 0.00, 1, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"AST60R\"},{\"value\":\"AST72R\"},{\"value\":\"AST48R\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', '10', 1, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1571, 'Arctic Air ABB72G 73\" Triple Glass Door Back Bar Refrigerator', '<p>The Arctic Air ABB72G is a well-designed 73-inch triple glass door back bar refrigerator, constructed with a 1.59-inch solid foamed stainless steel top that adds durability and a professional appearance. It features a self-contained capillary tube system that utilizes environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant (R290), promoting a more sustainable operation. The front-accessible condensing unit allows for easy cleaning and maintenance, while the front-breathing design ensures optimal air circulation. Standard features include easy-to-mount lockable casters, an electronic thermostat with a digital LED display for precise temperature control, and removable magnetic gaskets on each door for easy cleaning. Designed to conserve valuable workspace, it has a depth of 24 inches and includes interior LED lighting to enhance visibility. The interior showcases a mirror finish stainless steel with a high-grade coved corner floor for easy cleaning, while the exterior features a black powder-coated steel front and sides, ensuring both style and sturdiness. This model has been tested to meet NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage, making it an ideal choice for bars and restaurants that prioritize both functionality and compliance with health standards. The overall dimensions are 73.125 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39.625 inches in height. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 73.125” Depth: 24\" Height: 39.625” Shipping Weight 410 lbs</p>', '<ul><li>Shipping weight is 410 lbs, indicating a solid construction suitable for commercial use. </li><li>It has a width of 73 inches, a depth of 24 inches, and a height of 39 1/2 inches, making it a spacious option for storing beverages. </li><li>Nominal depth is classified as standard, ensuring compatibility with typical bar setups. </li><li>Operates on 3 amps, at 60 hertz, with a 1-phase power supply of 115 volts, making it efficient for bar environments. </li><li>Can accommodate up to 84 six-packs, with an overall capacity of 20.7 cubic feet, providing wide storage for various beverages. </li><li>It comes with casters, allowing for easy movement and positioning within your establishment. </li><li>Compressor is side-mounted and features front breathing, ensuring efficient airflow and easy access for maintenance. </li><li>Features three swing doors made of glass, providing visibility to the contents, while the exterior finish is rich black, complementing various bar aesthetics. </li><li>Includes LED lighting for enhanced visibility of stored items, contributing to a stylish presentation. </li><li>Operates on R-290 refrigerant and maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees Fahrenheit, ensuring optimal beverage storage conditions.<br> </li></ul>', 'published', '[]', 'ABB72G', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 3999, 2725, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 49.00, NULL, 39.50, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 410.00, NULL, NULL, 35, '2024-10-16 13:30:28', '2024-12-17 07:18:21', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'sssp-1/model-abb72g-1.jpg', 'physical', NULL, 1310, 1, 5, 7, 0, NULL, '2024-10-22', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1, '[{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/KVLansPJbcQsfJqSWKPaIFOYF8euQgOGWyMLYWrx.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 49.00, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 39.50, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"ABB60G\"},{\"value\":\"ADD48R-2\"},{\"value\":\"ABB48G\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, '10', 1, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1572, 'Arctic Air AGF36 36\" Black Glass Froster with Sliding Lid', '<p>The Arctic Air AGF36 Black Glass Froster offers an efficient solution for keeping glasses and mugs chilled, ideal for busy bar environments. This 36-inch unit comes with a sliding lid for easy access, while its 6.7 cu. ft. capacity provides wide space. The froster features a bottom-mounted compressor for optimized airflow and quick cooling. Its durable black exterior finish complements modern setups, and the 1/5 horsepower compressor runs on R-290 refrigerant, an environmentally friendly option. Designed for freestanding installation, this frosted runs on 120 volts with a NEMA 5-15P plug and includes casters for mobility. The sliding door style ensures quick access to contents, while the electric power type delivers consistent performance. Built for convenience, it is perfect for rapid glass frosting, ensuring beverages are served at ideal temperatures. The unit\'s compact size at 36 ¾\" wide, 27\" deep, and 36 ½\" high makes it a practical choice for bars with limited space. Weight &amp; Dimensions Shipping Weight: 195 lb. Width: 36 3/4 Inches Depth: 27 Inches Height: 36 1/2 Inches</p>', '<ul><li>Measures 36 3/4\" in width, 27\" in depth, and 36 1/2\" in height, offering 6.7 cubic feet of frosted glass storage, making it perfect for chilling glasses and mugs. </li><li>Operating at 120 volts and powered by a NEMA 5-15P plug, this froster is designed for efficient performance while connecting to standard electrical outlets. </li><li>Featuring a bottom-mounted, 1/5 HP compressor, it ensures consistent frost performance, keeping glasses cold while maximizing space for easy maintenance.</li><li>Uses R-290 refrigerant, an environmentally responsible option that enhances energy efficiency and helps reduce environmental impact. </li><li>Freestanding and comes equipped with casters, allowing for easy movement and repositioning, making it convenient for busy environments or relocating as needed. </li><li>Built with a rich black finish, this froster is visually appealing and designed to complement modern bar setups while providing durability for commercial use. </li><li>Sliding door style ensures easy access to the interior while minimizing the amount of space needed to open the froster, which is particularly helpful in tight areas. </li><li>Freestanding installation type offers versatility, making it easy to set up in various locations without requiring built-in installation, ideal for bars and restaurants. </li><li>Electric-powered, ensuring reliable and continuous operation, perfect for establishments that need to keep glassware frosted consistently throughout the day. </li><li>Ships with a weight of 195 lbs, making it solid enough to endure the demands of a commercial environment while being manageable for shipping and installation.</li></ul>', 'published', '[\"sssp-1\\/model-agf36.jpg\",\"arcb48.webp\",\"acp4sq.webp\",\"acp55.webp\"]', 'AGF36', 0, 149, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 2799, 1725, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 49.00, 1, 36.50, 1, 27.00, 1, 195.00, 1, NULL, 44, '2024-10-16 13:30:28', '2024-12-13 12:37:33', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'sssp-1/model-agf36.jpg', 'physical', NULL, 1213, 1, 5, 7, 0, NULL, '2024-10-23', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', 'AGF36', 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 49.00, 1, 27.00, 1, 36.50, 1, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\"