(1573, 'Arctic Air AGF24 24\" Black Glass Froster with Sliding Lid', '<p>The Arctic Air AGF24 24\" Black Glass Froster is a compact, space-efficient unit perfect for bars and restaurants aiming to serve perfectly chilled glasses. With a 4.3 cu. ft. capacity and a sliding lid for easy access, it allows quick glass frosts in high-demand environments. The unit is designed for freestanding installation, runs on 120 volts, and includes casters for mobility. Its bottom-mounted compressor and 1/5 horsepower motor use R-290 refrigerant, making it an eco-friendly option. The durable black exterior offers a sleek, modern look. At 24 inches wide, 27 inches deep, and 36 ½ inches high, this froster is ideal for smaller setups without sacrificing performance. Its NEMA 5-15P plug ensures easy connection, and the electric power type guarantees consistent operation. The froster\'s strong construction, combined with its sliding door design, makes it both practical and durable for long-term use. Its lightweight build and 155 lb. shipping weight further enhance its portability and ease of installation. Weight &amp; Dimensions Shipping Weight: 155 lbs Width: 24 Inches Depth: 27 Inches Height: 36 1/2 Inches</p>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air AGF24 measures 24\" in width, 27\" in depth, and 36 1/2\" in height, with a storage capacity of 4.3 cubic feet, providing wide room for frosted glassware. </li><li>Operates on 120 volts and is equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug, allowing for easy connection to standard electrical outlets and ensuring efficient, reliable performance. </li><li>With a bottom-mounted, 1/5 HP compressor, it offers consistent and effective cooling, keeping your glasses perfectly frosted for any bar or restaurant needs. </li><li>Uses R-290 refrigerant, an eco-friendly choice that provides efficient cooling while being compliant with environmental standards, contributing to energy savings. </li><li>Equipped with casters, allowing for convenient mobility and repositioning. These casters make it easy to move the froster when necessary or clean around it. </li><li>Finished in a rich black exterior, the Arctic Air AGF24 provides a stylish, modern appearance while maintaining durability for commercial use in high-traffic environments. </li><li>The sliding door allows easy access to frosted glasses without needing extra space to open a hinged door, making it ideal for small or crowded bar areas. </li><li>Designed for freestanding installation, this froster does not require complex mounting, allowing it to be easily placed wherever needed. </li><li>Powered by electricity, the froster ensures reliable operation, maintaining the right temperature to keep glasses chilled at all times. </li><li>Ships with a weight of 155 lbs, ensuring it is solid enough to withstand the rigors of commercial environments while being manageable for installation.</li></ul>', 'published', '[\"sssp-1\\/model-agf24.jpg\",\"arcb60-2f5a2e25-9528-42db-9542-4e2902c387d1-1.webp\",\"acp4sq.webp\",\"acp55.webp\"]', 'AGF24', 0, 149, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 2599, 1595, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 49.00, 1, 36.50, 1, 27.00, 1, 155.00, 1, NULL, 36, '2024-10-16 13:30:28', '2024-11-12 08:25:21', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'sssp-1/model-agf24.jpg', 'physical', NULL, 1542, 1, 5, 7, 0, NULL, '2024-10-24', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', 'AGF24', 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 49.00, 1, 27.00, 1, 36.50, 1, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"ABB60G\"},{\"value\":\"ADD48R-2\"},{\"value\":\"ABB48G\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', '10', 1, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1574, 'Arctic Air AUB65R 65\" Slide Top Bottle Cooler', '<p>The Arctic Air AUB65R 65\" Slide Top Bottle Cooler is designed for efficient beverage storage and display, featuring a generous 19 cu. ft. capacity that holds up to 22 cases of 12 oz. bottles. It operates within a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees Fahrenheit, ensuring beverages are kept at optimal serving temperatures. With a solid stainless steel lid, this cooler includes three lids and three dividers for organized storage, making it easy to access drinks. Built with a side-mounted compressor and a 1/2 horsepower motor, it runs on 120 volts, drawing 3 amps at 60 Hertz. The unit\'s black exterior finish gives it a sleek, professional appearance, while the front-breathing design allows for versatile placement. Casters provide mobility, facilitating easy relocation, and the construction is designed for durability, ensuring it withstands the rigors of a busy environment. The NEMA 5-15P plug and R-290 refrigerant contributes to its efficient and environmentally friendly operation. With a shipping weight of 365 lb., this cooler combines strong functionality with aesthetic appeal for any bar or restaurant setting. Weight &amp; Dimensions Shipping Weight: 365 lbs Width: 49 1/2 Inches Depth: 27 Inches Height: 36 1/2 Inches</p>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air AUB65R measures 49 1/2\" in width, 27\" in depth, and 36 1/2\" in height, providing a generous 19 cubic feet of storage space for a substantial number of beverages.</li><li>Operating on 120 volts, this cooler is designed for a 1-phase system, drawing 3 amps at 60 hertz, making it compatible with standard commercial electrical setups.</li><li>Features a 1/2 HP compressor located on the side, ensuring effective and consistent cooling performance while maintaining a temperature range of 33°F to 41°F, ideal for keeping beverages at optimal serving temperatures.</li><li>Utilizing R-290 refrigerant, the cooler is environmentally friendly and energy-efficient, aligning with modern sustainability standards. </li><li>Equipped with casters, it is easy to move, allowing for flexible placement in any bar or restaurant setting, and making it convenient for cleaning or rearranging your space. </li><li>Cooler has a rich black exterior finish, ensuring it not only blends well in various settings but also withstands the wear and tear of a busy commercial environment. </li><li>Featuring slide-top doors, this design provides easy access to drinks, allowing quick service during busy hours. The cooler is constructed with stainless steel, ensuring durability and resistance to rust and corrosion. </li><li>Can hold up to 22 cases of 12 oz. bottles, making it an efficient solution for high-volume beverage service, perfect for bars, restaurants, or events. </li><li>It comes with 3 dividers that help organize different types of beverages, along with 3 solid lids to maintain temperature and minimize energy loss while enhancing accessibility. The unit uses a NEMA 5-15P plug type, ensuring compatibility with standard outlets.<br>Weighing in at 365 lbs, this strong unit is built to withstand heavy usage while providing wide storage for a variety of bottled beverages.</li></ul>', 'published', '[\"sssp-1\\/model-aub65r.jpg\",\"arcb36-b0b23b16-bcc2-4ee9-aa74-77e1c91ae067.webp\",\"acp63.webp\"]', 'AUB65R', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 2999, 1999, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 27.00, 1, 36.50, 1, 27.00, 1, 365.00, 1, NULL, 35, '2024-10-16 13:30:28', '2024-11-12 08:25:13', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'sssp-1/model-aub65r.jpg', 'physical', NULL, 1363, 1, 5, 7, 0, NULL, '2024-10-31', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', 'AUB65R', 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3