(1575, 'Arctic Air AUB36R 36\" Slide Top Bottle Cooler', '<p>The Arctic Air AUB36R 36\" Slide Top Bottle Cooler is designed for efficient beverage storage, featuring a capacity of 9.3 cu. ft. to hold up to 11 cases of 12 oz. bottles. It operates within a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees Fahrenheit, ensuring optimal beverage cooling. The cooler includes a stainless steel solid lid with one lid for easy access and organization. Measuring 37 inches in width, 27 inches in depth, and 36.5 inches in height, it is powered by a 3/8 horsepower compressor that runs on 120 volts with an amperage of 1.8 amps at 60 Hertz. The side-mounted compressor and front-breathing design enable flexible placement, while the black exterior finish ensures durability. With casters for mobility, the cooler weighs 260 lb., making it both practical and versatile for commercial use. Weight &amp; Dimensions Shipping Weight: 260 lbs Width: 37 Inches Depth: 27 Inches Height: 36 .5 Inches</p>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air AUB36R measures 37\" in width, 27\" in depth, and 36 1/2\" in height, offering a spacious storage capacity of 9.3 cubic feet for a variety of bottled beverages.</li><li>Operates at 120 volts with a 1-phase system, drawing only 1.8 amps at 60 hertz, making it suitable for typical commercial electrical setups.</li><li>Powered by a 3/8 HP side-mounted compressor, it ensures efficient cooling while maintaining a temperature range of 33°F to 41°F, perfect for keeping drinks at optimal serving temperatures.</li><li>Utilizing R-290 refrigerant, known for its eco-friendly characteristics, this cooler is designed to be energy efficient while reducing its environmental impact.</li><li>Inclusion of casters allows for easy mobility, enabling flexible placement in bars, restaurants, or event venues while simplifying cleaning and maintenance routines.</li><li>Featuring a rich black exterior finish, the cooler not only looks professional but also provides durability against wear and tear in busy commercial environments.</li><li>With a slide-top door design, this cooler facilitates easy access to stored beverages, enhancing service efficiency. It is constructed from stainless steel, ensuring both strength and resistance to corrosion.</li><li>Capable of accommodating up to 11 cases of 12 oz. bottles, the unit provides wide storage for high-demand beverage service, making it ideal for establishments with a diverse drink selection.</li><li>Comes with 1 solid lid to help maintain temperature and minimize energy loss, and it utilizes a NEMA 5-15P plug type, ensuring compatibility with standard electrical outlets.</li><li>Weighing 260 lbs, this strong cooler is built to withstand frequent use while providing efficient storage solutions for a wide array of bottled beverages.</li></ul>', 'published', '[\"sssp-1\\/model-aub36r.jpg\",\"arcb36.webp\",\"arcb60-2f5a2e25-9528-42db-9542-4e2902c387d1-1.webp\"]', 'AUB36R', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 2999, 1520, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 27.00, 1, 36.50, 1, 27.00, 1, 260.00, 1, NULL, 44, '2024-10-16 13:30:28', '2024-11-12 08:24:58', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'sssp-1/model-aub36r.jpg', 'physical', NULL, 3049, 1, 5, 7, 0, NULL, '2024-10-30', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', 'AUB36R', 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 27.00, 1, 27.00, 1, 36.50, 1, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"ABB48\"},{\"value\":\"ARGDM23\"},