(1576, 'Arctic Air ARCB72 72\" Four Drawer Refrigerated Chef Base', '<p>The Arctic Air ARCB72 is a strong 72-inch four-drawer refrigerated chef base designed to withstand the demands of a busy kitchen. It features a heavy-duty stainless steel top insulated with a ceramic fabric layer, effectively eliminating melting foam and preventing heat transfer to the cabinet\'s interior. The top includes a standard marine edge on all sides, providing a 19-inch extension on each side, allowing cooking equipment to sit flat. The exterior construction consists of full stainless steel for durability, complemented by easy-to-mount casters, including six casters with two that are lockable, facilitating easy mobility. This model is front-breathing, making it ideal for tight spaces. The stainless steel drawer facings, linings, and frames are designed for longevity, with the top and bottom drawers capable of holding up to 69 deep pans. Each drawer is equipped with stainless steel hooked adapter bars and removable magnetic gaskets for easy cleaning. The heavy-duty Fulterer telescoping cartridge drawer system ensures smooth operation, while the self-contained capillary tube system uses environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant (R290). With an electronic thermostat featuring an external digital LED display for precise temperature control, the ARCB72 is designed for efficiency. The front-accessible condensing unit simplifies maintenance, and the evaporator coil is centered along the interior back of the cabinet. It meets NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage and comes with a full two-year parts and labor warranty, plus a five-year compressor warranty. The dimensions are 74 inches in width, 32 inches in depth, and 26 inches in height. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 74\" Depth: 32\" Height: 26\" Shipping Weight 355 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>Shipping weight of it is 355 lbs, indicating a strong construction suitable for heavy-duty use in commercial kitchens.</li><li>It features a width of 74 inches, a depth of 32 inches, and a height of 26 inches, providing wide workspace and storage for food preparation.</li><li>Operates on 6 amps, at 60 hertz, and requires a 1-phase power supply of 115 volts, ensuring compatibility with standard kitchen electrical systems.</li><li>Has a capacity for 1/6 size food pans, accommodating up to 6 pans in its spacious drawers, making it ideal for efficient ingredient storage.</li><li>It comes equipped with casters, allowing for easy movement and repositioning within the kitchen environment.</li><li>Compressor is side-mounted, optimizing the unit\'s design for compact kitchen spaces while ensuring efficient operation.</li><li>Uses a NEMA 5-15P plug type, facilitating straightforward electrical connections in commercial settings.</li><li>Utilizes R-290 refrigerant, which is environmentally friendly and efficient, contributing to the unit’s low operational costs.</li><li>It maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees Fahrenheit, ensuring optimal preservation of food items stored within.</li><li>Constructed from stainless steel and aluminum, providing durability and ease of cleaning, while the marine edge top design prevents spills and simplifies maintenance.<br> </li></ul>', 'published', '[\"sssp-1\\/refrigerated-chef-bases-arcb72-new.jpg\",\"aub36r.webp\",\"arcb48.webp\"]', 'ARCB72', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 4999, 3999, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 29.00, NULL, 26.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 355.00, 1, NULL, 38, '2024-10-16 13:30:28', '2024-12-16 07:40:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'sssp-1/refrigerated-chef-bases-arcb72-new.jpg', 'physical', NULL, 2304, 1, 5, 7, 0, NULL, '2024-10-24', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', 'ARCB72', 1, '[{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/vCzcjxMQwO3oZju6eytVU1f6fgDK2rmuAvUB3T6U.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 26.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"AGF36\"},{\"value\":\"ABB48\"},{\"value\":\"AUB65R\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', '10', 1, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1577, 'Arctic Air ARCB60 60\" Two Drawers Refrigerated Chef Base', '<p>The Arctic Air ARCB60 is a 60-inch refrigerated chef base designed for high efficiency and durability in commercial kitchens. It features a heavy-duty stainless steel top insulated with a ceramic fabric layer that effectively eliminates melting foam and prevents heat transfer to the interior cabinet. The top includes a standard marine edge on all sides, with a 19-inch extension on each side to ensure that cooking equipment can sit flat. The exterior is constructed from full stainless steel, enhancing its strongness, while easy-to-mount casters (two of which are lockable) facilitate mobility. The unit is front-breathing, making it ideal for tight kitchen spaces. Inside, the ARCB60 is equipped with stainless steel drawer facings, linings, and frames, with the top and bottom drawers designed to accommodate up to 69 deep pans. Each drawer includes stainless steel hooked adapter bars and removable magnetic gaskets for straightforward cleaning. The heavy-duty Fulterer telescoping cartridge drawer system ensures smooth operation, allowing for full extension without tipping during loading or unloading. It utilizes a self-contained capillary tube system with environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant (R290) and features an electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display for accurate temperature control. The front-accessible condensing unit simplifies maintenance, while the evaporator coil is centered along the interior back of the cabinet. It meets NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage and includes a full two-year parts and labor warranty, along with a five-year compressor warranty. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 62\" Depth: 32\" Height: 26\" Shipping Weight 270 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>The shipping weight of it is 270 lbs, reflecting its solid construction tailored for heavy-duty use in commercial kitchens. </li><li>It features a width of 62 inches, a depth of 32 inches, and a height of 26 inches, providing substantial workspace and storage for efficient food preparation. </li><li>Operates on 6 amps, at 60 hertz, and requires a 1-phase power supply of 115 volts, ensuring compatibility with standard electrical systems commonly found in commercial kitchens. </li><li>Holds 1/6 size food pans, with a total capacity of 6 pans, making it ideal for storing various ingredients in an organized manner.<br>Equipped with casters, this chef base allows for easy movement and flexibility in kitchen layout, facilitating optimal workflow. </li><li>Compressor is side-mounted, which enhances the unit\'s efficiency and saves valuable kitchen space while maintaining effective refrigeration. </li><li>Utilizes a NEMA 5-15P plug type, allowing for simple electrical connections in most commercial kitchen settings. </li><li>It uses R-290 refrigerant, known for its environmental friendliness and energy efficiency, contributing to lower operational costs. </li><li>Maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees Fahrenheit, ensuring that food items are kept at safe temperatures for storage. </li><li>Constructed from stainless steel and aluminum, it provides durability and ease of cleaning, while the marine edge top design helps prevent spills, making maintenance straightforward.<br> </li></ul>', 'published', '[\"arcb60-2f5a2e25-9528-42db-9542-4e2902c387d1-1.webp\",\"arcb72.webp\",\"aub65r.webp\"]', 'ARCB60', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 3999, 2999, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 29.00, 1, 26.00, 1, 32.00, 1, 270.00, 1, NULL, 31, '2024-10-16 13:30:28', '2024-11-12 08:24:27', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'arcb60-2f5a2e25-9528-42db-9542-4e2902c387d1-1.webp', 'physical', NULL, 1831, 1, 5, 7, 0, NULL, '2024-10-23', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', 'ARCB60', 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 29.00, 1, 32.00, 1, 26.00, 1, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"AGF36\"},{\"value\":\"ABB48\"},{\"value\":\"AUB65R\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', '10', 1, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1578, 'Arctic Air ARCB48 48\" Two Drawers Refrigerated Chef Base', '<p>The Arctic Air ARCB48 is a 48-inch two-drawer refrigerated chef base, designed for efficiency and functionality in a commercial kitchen. With a shipping weight of 250 lbs, it has overall dimensions of 50 inches in width, 32 inches in depth, and 26 inches in height. It operates at 6 amps on a 115-volt power supply, functioning at 60 Hertz and in a 1-phase setup. It features a capacity for 1/6-size food pans and is equipped with side-mounted compressor technology powered by a 1/3 HP motor. The temperature range of this chef base is maintained between 33 to 41 degrees Fahrenheit, making it ideal for keeping ingredients fresh. The marine edge top design enhances usability, while the two drawers provide easy access to contents. Constructed with stainless steel and aluminum, the unit is both durable and easy to clean. The chef base also includes casters for mobility and features a NEMA 5-15P plug type along with environmentally friendly R-290 refrigerant, ensuring it meets modern energy efficiency standards while offering a full-size food pan capacity of 4 pans. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width 50 inches Depth 32 inches Height 26 inches Shipping Weight 250 lbs</p>', '<ul><li>Has a shipping weight of 250 lbs, making it strong and durable for commercial kitchen environments. </li><li>It features a width of 50 inches, a depth of 32 inches, and a height of 26 inches, providing a compact and spacious storage solution for food preparation. </li><li>Operates at 6 Amps, with a frequency of 60 Hertz, designed for use in standard 1 Phase electrical systems, and requires a voltage of 115 Volts. </li><li>Specifically designed for 1/6 Size Food Pans, it allows for efficient storage and organization of various food items, with a total capacity of 4 pans. </li><li>Compressor is side-mounted, providing efficient cooling while maximizing usable space inside the unit. </li><li>It comes equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug type, ensuring compatibility with most standard electrical outlets for easy installation. </li><li>Utilizes R-290 refrigerant, which is environmentally friendly and provides efficient cooling performance. </li><li>It operates within a temperature range of 33 - 41 Degrees F, ensuring food safety and proper preservation of ingredients. </li><li>Made of high-quality stainless steel and aluminum, it is designed for durability and ease of cleaning, suitable for heavy-duty kitchen use. </li><li>Featuring a marine edge top type and drawers for easy access, it incorporates 2 drawers for convenient storage while maintaining a smooth and functional design.<br><br> </li></ul>', 'published', '[\"refrigerated-chef-bases-arcb48-big-2.jpg\",\"arcb72.webp\",\"agf24.webp\"]', 'ARCB48', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 3999, 2399, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 29.00, 1, 26.00, 1, 32.00, 1, 250.00, 1, NULL, 21, '2024-10-16 13:30:28', '2024-11-12 08:24:18', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'refrigerated-chef-bases-arcb48-big-2.jpg', 'physical', NULL, 1736, 1, 5, 7, 0, NULL, '2024-10-23', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', 'ARCB48', 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 29.00, 1, 32.00, 1, 26.00, 1, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"AGF36\"},{\"value\":\"ABB48\"},{\"value\":\"AUB65R\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', '10', 1, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 