(1579, 'Arctic Air ARCB48 48\" Two Drawers Refrigerated Chef Base', '<p>The Arctic Air ARCB48 is a 48-inch two-drawer refrigerated chef base, designed for efficiency and functionality in a commercial kitchen. With a shipping weight of 250 lbs, it has overall dimensions of 50 inches in width, 32 inches in depth, and 26 inches in height. It operates at 6 amps on a 115-volt power supply, functioning at 60 Hertz and in a 1-phase setup. It features a capacity for 1/6-size food pans and is equipped with side-mounted compressor technology powered by a 1/3 HP motor.<br>The temperature range of this chef base is maintained between 33 to 41 degrees Fahrenheit, making it ideal for keeping ingredients fresh. The marine edge top design enhances usability, while the two drawers provide easy access to contents. Constructed with stainless steel and aluminum, the unit is both durable and easy to clean. The chef base also includes casters for mobility and features a NEMA 5-15P plug type along with environmentally friendly R-290 refrigerant, ensuring it meets modern energy efficiency standards while offering a full-size food pan capacity of 4 pans.<br>Weight &amp; Dimensions<br>Width   50 inches<br>Depth 32 inches<br>Height  26 inches<br>Shipping Weight 250 lbs</p>', '<ul><li>Has a shipping weight of 250 lbs, making it strong and durable for commercial kitchen environments.<br>It features a width of 50 inches, a depth of 32 inches, and a height of 26 inches, providing a compact and spacious storage solution for food preparation.</li><li>Operates at 6 Amps, with a frequency of 60 Hertz, designed for use in standard 1 Phase electrical systems, and requires a voltage of 115 Volts.</li><li>Specifically designed for 1/6 Size Food Pans, it allows for efficient storage and organization of various food items, with a total capacity of 4 pans.</li><li>Compressor is side-mounted, providing efficient cooling while maximizing usable space inside the unit.<br>It comes equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug type, ensuring compatibility with most standard electrical outlets for easy installation.</li><li>Utilizes R-290 refrigerant, which is environmentally friendly and provides efficient cooling performance.<br>It operates within a temperature range of 33 - 41 Degrees F, ensuring food safety and proper preservation of ingredients.</li><li>Made of high-quality stainless steel and aluminum, it is designed for durability and ease of cleaning, suitable for heavy-duty kitchen use.</li><li><p>Featuring a marine edge top type and drawers for easy access, it incorporates 2 drawers for convenient storage while maintaining a smooth and functional design.</p><p> </p></li></ul>', 'published', '[\"refrigerated-chef-bases-arcb48-big.jpg\",\"acp55.webp\",\"acp8sq.webp\"]', 'ARCB48', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 2999, 2399, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 50.00, 3, 26.00, 3, 32.00, 3, 250.00, 9, NULL, 44, '2024-10-16 14:25:04', '2024-11-12 08:24:07', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'refrigerated-chef-bases-arcb48-big.jpg', 'physical', NULL, 1831, 1, 6, 7, 0, '<p>2 Year Parts &amp; Labor Warranty</p>', '2024-10-30', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Refrigeration', 'ARCB48', 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 0.00, 1, 0.00, 1, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"65055K\"},{\"value\":\"ACP8SQ\"},{\"value\":\"69240K\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', '10', 1, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1580, 'Arctic Air ARCB36 36\" Two Drawers Refrigerated Chef Base', '<p>The Arctic Air ARCB36 is a 36-inch two-drawer refrigerated chef base designed to provide both refrigeration and a heavy-duty work surface. The stainless steel top is insulated with a ceramic fabric layer to prevent heat transfer and foam melting, and the top also includes a 19-inch extension on each side to accommodate cooking equipment. Its marine edge design ensures spills are contained. The exterior construction features full stainless steel, while the drawers are lined with stainless facings, frames, and linings, holding up to 6-inch deep pans. The drawers also include removable magnetic gaskets for easy cleaning. Equipped with a front-breathing refrigeration system, it has a self-contained capillary tube system using CFC-free R290 refrigerant, ensuring environmentally friendly operation. The drawers are fitted with a heavy-duty telescoping cartridge system, providing full extension for easy access without tipping pans. The electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display offers precise temperature control, while the front-access condensing unit makes cleaning and maintenance simple. Tested to NSF Standard 7, this chef base is designed for open food storage, ensuring compliance with safety standards. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 38\" Depth: 32\" Height: 26\" Weight 230 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>Weighs 230 lbs, providing a solid foundation suitable for commercial kitchens while still being manageable for installation. </li><li>It measures 38 inches in width, 32 inches in depth, and 26 inches in height, making it compact enough for small spaces and spacious enough for storage and functionality. </li><li>Operates at 2.1 amps and is designed for 60 hertz power systems with 1 phase, requiring a standard 115-volt electrical connection. </li><li>Designed to hold 1/6 size food pans, offering a practical storage solution for frequently used ingredients or prepared items. </li><li>Equipped with casters, it is easily movable, allowing you to reposition it in the kitchen as needed without hassle. </li><li>It features a side-mounted compressor powered by a 1/3 HP motor, with a NEMA 5-15P plug, ensuring efficient cooling and energy use. </li><li>Utilizing R-290 refrigerant, it maintains a consistent temperature range of 33°F to 41°F, keeping stored food items fresh and safe. </li><li>Marine edge design on the top prevents spills from dripping over the edge, and the drawers provide easy access to refrigerated goods. </li><li>Built with stainless steel and aluminum, it holds 2 full-size food pans within its 2 drawers, ensuring reliability and wide storage. </li><li>Comes with a full two-year parts and labor warranty, along with a five-year warranty on the compressor, providing peace of mind and long-term support for your investment.<br> </li></ul>', 'published', '[\"arcb36-b0b23b16-bcc2-4ee9-aa74-77e1c91ae067.webp\",\"acp8sq.webp\",\"arcb48.webp\"]', 'ARCB36', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 3999, 2299, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 29.00, 1, 26.00, 1, 32.00, 1, 230.00, 1, NULL, 36, '2024-10-16 14:36:38', '2024-11-12 08:23:58', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'arcb36-b0b23b16-bcc2-4ee9-aa74-77e1c91ae067.webp', 'physical', NULL, 808, 1, 5, 7, 0, NULL, '2024-10-22', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', 'ARCB36', 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 29.00, 1, 32.00, 1, 26.00, 1, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"ACP8SQ\"},{\"value\":\"ACP63\"},{\"value\":\"ACP55\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', '10', 1, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1581, 'Arctic Air ACP8SQ 28\" 8 Pan Countertop Compact Prep Unit', '<p>The Arctic Air ACP8SQ is a 28-inch, 8-pan countertop prep unit designed with a full stainless steel liner for its interior cabinet and a matching stainless steel shell for the exterior. It includes 1/6-size pans with covers, and its pan rail uses a “cold wall” heat transfer system instead of air cooling. The unit sits on plastic, non-scratch feet, providing durability and stability. The self-contained capillary tube system uses CFC-free refrigerant, making it environmentally friendly, and it meets NSF Standard 7 for open food storage. This prep unit requires manual defrosting as it has no built-in defrost system and is classified as an “in-service” item, meaning it must be powered off for defrosting. The compact size of the unit allows for 6-inch deep pans in the back row and 4-inch deep pans in the front, making it ideal for fast-paced prep work while conserving counter space. The strong stainless steel construction and environmentally responsible design make it a durable and efficient solution for foodservice operations. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 28\" Depth: 25 3/4\" Height: 9 1/8\" Weight 80 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>Weighing 80 lbs, this compact prep unit is lightweight enough for countertop placement and durable enough for daily commercial use. </li><li>Measures 28 inches in width, 25 3/4 inches in depth, and 9 1/8 inches in height, providing a convenient size for easy integration into any kitchen workspace. </li><li>It draws 1.4 amps of current and operates at 60 hertz with a 1-phase power supply, using standard 115 volts for optimal energy efficiency. </li><li>Rear-mounted compressor is rated at 1/5 HP, ensuring efficient cooling for maintaining freshness in the stored items. </li><li>It comes equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug, and uses electric power, featuring a 6-foot power cord for flexible installation. </li><li>Utilizing R-600A refrigerant, it efficiently maintains temperatures between 33°F and 41°F, ideal for keeping ingredients cool and fresh. </li><li>Designed to hold up to 8 pans of 1/6 size with a depth between 4 and 6 inches, making it versatile for various food items. </li><li>Operating at 161 watts, it is made from durable stainless steel, offering both reliability and ease of cleaning in a commercial setting. </li><li>It features 8 compartments, providing wide space for different food ingredients, which is perfect for sandwich or salad preparation. </li><li>Backed by a full one-year part and labor warranty, it ensures long-term performance and peace of mind for the user.<br> </li></ul>', 'published', '[\"buffet-and-food-displays-4\\/heating-cooling-and-air-quality.webp\"]', 'ACP8SQ', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 1999, 1065, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 49.00, NULL, 9.50, NULL, 25.50, NULL, 80.00, 1, NULL, 35, '2024-10-16 14:36:38', '2024-12-18 11:20:20', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'untitled-1-0001-61c4kfeymel-sl1500.jpg', 'physical', NULL, 722, 1, 5, 7, 0, NULL, '2024-10-29', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1, '[{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/jnic5hmtMDi3VT5M3aXTM4gJCraXuJttOw5TLhXL.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 49.00, NULL, 25.50, NULL, 9.50, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"ACP8SQ\"},{\"value\":\"ACP63\"},{\"value\":\"ACP55\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', '10', 1, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1582, 'Arctic Air ACP4SQ 15\" 4 Pan Countertop Compact Prep Unit', '<p>The Arctic Air ACP4SQ 15\" 4 Pan Countertop Compact Prep Unit features a strong design with a full stainless steel interior cabinet and exterior shell, ensuring durability and ease of cleaning. It is equipped with a “cold wall” pan rail, which provides efficient heat transfer without relying on air cooling. It includes 1/6 size pans and covers, with a configuration of four deep front pans and three deep back pans for versatile food storage and preparation. The unit is supported by plastic non-scratch feet to protect countertops. This prep unit operates with a self-contained capillary tube system using environmentally friendly, CFC-free refrigerant. It is also designed to meet NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage, ensuring compliance with safety and health regulations. Notably, the ACP4SQ model does not incorporate a defrost system, as it is designated as an “in-service” item; therefore, it must be turned off to defrost, making it essential for users to manage its operation effectively. Dimensions Width: 15 Inches Depth: 25.75 Inches Height: 9.13 Inches</p>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air ACP4SQ is designed to fit in limited spaces with its compact size of 15 inches in width, 25.75 inches in depth, and a height of 9.13 inches, making it ideal for small kitchens or food prep stations. </li><li>It can hold 4 pans, providing a convenient and accessible solution for storing ingredients or garnishes in a compact space. </li><li>Operating at 60 Hertz, 1 Phase, and 115 Volts, it is compatible with most standard electrical setups, ensuring easy integration into your existing kitchen layout. </li><li>It comes equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug, allowing it to connect to standard 115-volt outlets for simple and quick installation. </li><li>Categorized as a standard unit, offering a balance between space-saving design and efficient ingredient storage. </li><li>Designed with an open front access configuration, it allows easy and quick access to ingredients during food preparation. </li><li>Stainless steel construction ensures durability and makes it easy to clean, keeping your kitchen environment hygienic and professional. </li><li>Although compact, it effectively maintains the appropriate temperature for your prepped ingredients, ensuring freshness and quality. </li><li>With its small size and countertop design, it is versatile enough to fit into any kitchen layout, including food trucks, cafés, and small restaurants. </li><li>It comes with a full one-year parts and labor warranty, providing peace of mind and ensuring reliable operation.<br><br> </li></ul>', 'published', '[]', 'ACP4SQ', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 1999, 999, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 49.00, NULL, 9.50, NULL, 25.50, NULL, 0.00, NULL, NULL, 31, '2024-10-16 14:36:38', '2024-12-17 07:19:03', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'untitled-1-0000-71sv8dlrl6l-sl1500.jpg', 'physical', NULL, 855, 1, 5, 7, 0, NULL, '2024-10-22', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1, '[{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/9aYJWFRtFkAOao4Rl35ZxfjNS9v5HcbV7IQHEMpc.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 49.00, NULL, 25.50, NULL, 9.50, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"70250K\"},{\"value\":\"70119RK\"},{\"value\":\"70119lk\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, '10', 1, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1583, 'Arctic Air ACP63 63\" Fourteen Pan Stainless Steel Counter Top Prep Station', '<p>The Arctic Air ACP63 is a 63-inch countertop prep station designed for efficiency and durability in food preparation environments. It features a stainless cover for the refrigerated area and utilizes a “cold wall” heat transfer system, eliminating the need for air cooling. The interior cabinet is fully lined with stainless steel, while the exterior shell is also constructed from stainless steel, ensuring a strong and easy-to-clean surface. Additionally, it is equipped with plastic non-scratch feet for stability and protection on countertops. This prep station includes 1/6-size, 69-deep stainless pans with covers and stainless pan supports, facilitating organized and accessible food storage. An electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display allows precise temperature control, enhancing food safety. The self-contained capillary tube system employs CFC-free refrigerant (R290), making it an environmentally responsible choice. It has been tested to meet NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage. It is important to note that the ACP63 does not include a defrost system, as it is classified as an “in-service” item; therefore, it must be turned off for defrosting. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 63\" Depth: 15 1/2\" Height: 11\" Weight 125 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>Has a shipping weight of 125 lbs, ensuring durability while remaining manageable for installation on countertops in any commercial kitchen. </li><li>Measures 63 inches in width, 15 1/2 inches in depth, and 11 inches in height, offering a spacious and compact footprint to maximize kitchen workspace. </li><li>Operating at 1.6 amps with a 60-hertz power supply, it runs on 1-phase electricity, requiring 115 volts for efficient operation. </li><li>Featuring a side-mounted compressor with a power of 1/4 HP, it provides reliable cooling performance to keep ingredients at the proper temperature. </li><li>Equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug, the unit runs on electric power with a power cord length of 8 feet, allowing flexibility in placement and ease of connection to power sources. </li><li>R-600A refrigerant ensures energy-efficient cooling, maintaining an optimal temperature range between 33°F and 41°F, ideal for keeping food items fresh. </li><li>Designed to hold up to 14 pans of 1/6 size, it offers wide space for storing a variety of food items, making it perfect for sandwiches, salads, or other prep tasks. </li><li>Operating at 161 watts, it is made from high-quality stainless steel, providing durability, corrosion resistance, and ease of cleaning for busy commercial environments. </li><li>Features 14 compartments with a hinged lid for easy access and secure coverage of food items, ensuring food safety and freshness during preparation. </li><li>A digital temperature control system allows precise monitoring and adjustment of cooling settings, while the station is backed by a full one-year part and labor warranty for added peace of mind.<br> </li></ul>', 'published', '[]', 'ACP63', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 1999, 1125, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 49.00, NULL, 11.00, NULL, 15.50, NULL, 125.00, NULL, NULL, 36, '2024-10-16 14:36:38', '2024-12-17 07:22:30', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'sssp-1/model-acp63-1.jpg', 'physical', NULL, 758, 1, 5, 7, 0, NULL, '2024-10-29', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1, '[{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Z9YcTzN2f89lF0XDs7V5F4Wf3nqspVQvr2g