(1584, 'Arctic Air ACP55 55\" Ten Pan Stainless Steel Counter Top Prep Unit', '<p>The Arctic Air ACP55 is a 55-inch countertop prep unit designed for efficiency in food preparation settings. It features a stainless cover that safeguards the refrigerated area while ensuring easy access. It employs a “cold wall” heat transfer system, which is more efficient than traditional air-cooled systems. Its interior cabinet is fully lined with stainless steel, enhancing durability and cleanliness, while the exterior cabinet is constructed from strong stainless steel. To protect countertops, it comes equipped with plastic non-scratch feet for stability. It includes 1/6 size, 69-deep stainless pans, and covers, along with stainless pan supports for organized food storage. The self-contained capillary tube system utilizes environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant (R290), ensuring compliance with environmental standards. An electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display provides precise temperature control and easy readability. Tested to meet NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage, the ACP55 does not have a defrost system, meaning it must be turned off to defrost, as it is classified as an “in-service” item. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 55\" Depth: 15 1/2\" Height: 11\" Weight 105 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>Has a shipping weight of 105 lbs, making it manageable for installation while ensuring durability in a commercial kitchen environment. </li><li>Features a width of 55 inches, a depth of 15 1/2 inches, and a height of 11 inches, providing a compact design that optimizes countertop space for food preparation. </li><li>Operating at 1.6 amps with a 60-hertz power supply, it runs on 1-phase electricity, requiring 115 volts for efficient operation. </li><li>Includes a side-mounted compressor with a power rating of 1/4 HP, ensuring reliable cooling performance for fresh ingredient storage. </li><li>Equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug, it operates on electric power and features a power cord length of 8 feet, allowing flexible installation options. </li><li>Utilizing R-600A refrigerant, it maintains a temperature range between 33°F and 41°F, ideal for keeping ingredients fresh and safe. </li><li>Designed to accommodate 10 pans of 1/6 size, it offers wide storage space for a variety of ingredients, making it suitable for sandwiches, salads, and other food prep tasks. </li><li>Operates at 161 watts and is constructed from high-quality stainless steel, ensuring durability, ease of cleaning, and resistance to corrosion. </li><li>Featuring 10 compartments with a hinged lid, the design allows for easy access to ingredients while maintaining food safety standards. </li><li>Includes a digital temperature control system for precise temperature management, and it is backed by a full one-year part and labor warranty for added peace of mind.<br><br> </li></ul>', 'published', '[]', 'ACP55', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 1999, 999, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 49.00, NULL, 11.00, NULL, 15.50, NULL, 105.00, NULL, NULL, 32, '2024-10-16 14:36:38', '2024-12-17 07:21:47', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'model-acp55.jpg', 'physical', NULL, 718, 1, 5, 7, 0, NULL, '2024-10-29', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1, '[{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/rF006aDdJtYQW4bCDfo09XqdVxrqyr9dHXJIjUyS.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL