(1585, 'Arctic Air ACP48 48\" Eight Pan Stainless Steel Counter Top Prep Unit', '<p>The Arctic Air ACP48 is a 48-inch countertop prep unit designed for optimal food preparation efficiency. It features a stainless cover that protects the refrigerated area, ensuring easy access while maintaining a clean workspace. Utilizing a “cold wall” heat transfer system, it is designed for superior cooling compared to traditional air-cooled options. Its interior cabinet is fully lined with stainless steel, offering durability and easy cleaning, while the exterior cabinet is also crafted from high-quality stainless steel. The addition of plastic non-scratch feet ensures stability and protects countertops from damage. This prep unit comes with 1/6 size, 69-deep stainless pans, and covers, along with stainless pan supports for organized food storage. A self-contained capillary tube system utilizes environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant (R290), adhering to eco-friendly standards. It is equipped with an electronic thermostat featuring an external digital LED display for precise temperature control and easy readability. Tested to comply with NSF Standard 7 for open food storage, the ACP48 lacks a defrost system, meaning it needs to be turned off for defrosting, as it is designated as an “in-service” item. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 47 1/4\" Depth: 15 1/2\" Height: 11\" Weight 100 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>Has a shipping weight of 100 lbs, allowing for easy transportation while maintaining a strong construction suitable for commercial kitchens. </li><li>Features a width of 47 1/4 inches, a depth of 15 1/2 inches, and a height of 11 inches, optimizing countertop space for efficient food preparation and ingredient access. </li><li>Operating at 1.4 amps with a 60-hertz power supply, it runs on 1-phase electricity and requires 115 volts for its operation, ensuring compatibility with standard outlets. </li><li>Includes a side-mounted compressor with a power rating of 1/4 HP, providing reliable cooling to keep ingredients fresh throughout busy service hours. </li><li>Equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug, it operates on electric power and features a power cord length of 8 feet, allowing for versatile placement in any kitchen layout. </li><li>Utilizing R-600A refrigerant, it maintains a temperature range between 33°F and 41°F, ideal for preserving the quality of perishable items. </li><li>Designed to accommodate 8 pans of 1/6 size, it offers wide storage space for various ingredients, perfect for salad and sandwich preparations. </li><li>Operates at 161 watts and is constructed from durable stainless steel, providing a smooth and easy-to-clean surface that resists corrosion and wear. </li><li>Featuring 8 compartments with a hinged lid, the design facilitates easy access to stored ingredients while helping to maintain food safety. </li><li>Includes a digital temperature control system for precise monitoring of internal temperatures, and it comes with a full one-year parts and labor warranty for added assurance.<br> </li></ul>', 'published', '[]', 'ACP48', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 1599, 949, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 49.00, NULL, 11.00, NULL, 15.50, NULL, 100.00, NULL, NULL, 44, '2024-10-16 14:36:38', '2024-12-17 07:21:14', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'acp48.webp', 'physical', NULL, 676, 1, 5, 7, 0, NULL, '2024-10-21', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1, '[{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/SN0coxHhXw0NeV9bJDGMZRYwuYABxAUQeFWq8cKr.pdf\"}]'