(1636, 'Arctic Air ACP40 40 Six Pan Stainless Steel Counter Top Prep Unit', '<p>The Arctic Air ACP40 is a 40-inch countertop prep unit specifically designed for efficient food preparation. It features a stainless cover that protects the refrigerated area, allowing for quick access to ingredients while maintaining cleanliness. It employs a “cold wall” heat transfer system instead of traditional air cooling, providing consistent cooling performance. Its interior cabinet is fully lined with stainless steel for durability and easy cleaning, while the exterior shell is also made of stainless steel. To prevent damage to surfaces, the unit is equipped with plastic non-scratch feet. This prep unit includes 1/6 size, 69-deep stainless pans, and covers, as well as stainless pan supports to facilitate organized food storage. It operates using a self-contained capillary tube system with CFC-free refrigerant (R290), ensuring environmental safety. The electronic thermostat features an external digital LED display for precise temperature control and ease of monitoring. The ACP40 is rigorously tested to meet NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage. It’s important to note that the Item does not have a defrost system, meaning it must be turned off for defrosting, as it is designated as an “in-service” item. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 39 1/2 Depth: 15 1/2 Height: 11 Weight 90 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>Has a shipping weight of 90 lbs, ensuring a strong design that is still manageable for transport to your kitchen setup. </li><li>Features a width of 39 1/2 inches, a depth of 15 1/2 inches, and a height of 11 inches, optimizing countertop space for efficient access to ingredients and preparation tasks. </li><li>Operating at 1.4 amps with a 60-hertz power supply, it runs on 1-phase electricity and requires 115 volts for its operation, making it suitable for standard kitchen outlets. </li><li>Includes a side-mounted compressor with a power rating of 1/4 HP, ensuring consistent cooling for keeping your ingredients fresh and safe. </li><li>Equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug, it operates on electric power and features a power cord length of 8 feet, providing flexibility for placement in any kitchen layout. </li><li>Utilizing R-600A refrigerant, it maintains a temperature range between 33°F and 41°F, ideal for preserving the quality of perishable items and ensuring food safety. </li><li>Designed to accommodate 6 pans of 1/6 size, this prep unit offers wide storage space for various ingredients, making it perfect for salad and sandwich preparations. </li><li>Operates at 161 watts and is constructed from durable stainless steel, which not only gives it a sleek appearance but also ensures long-lasting performance and easy maintenance. </li><li>Featuring 6 compartments with a hinged lid, the design facilitates easy access to stored ingredients while helping to maintain the appropriate temperature for freshness. </li><li>It includes a digital temperature control system for precise monitoring of internal temperatures, and it comes with a full one-year parts and labor warranty for added peace of mind.<br> </li></ul>', 'published', '[]', 'ACP40', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 1599, 895, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 49.00, NULL, 11.00, NULL, 15.50, NULL, 90.00, NULL, NULL, 51, '2024-10-19 07:05:29', '2024-12-17 07:20:17', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'acp40-7e32afd9-8ffd-4168-96b3-4aefd097921e.webp', 'physical', NULL, 70, 1, 5, 7, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1, '[{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmol