(1637, 'Arctic Air 64915K 94 Two Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf For APP94', '<p>The Arctic Air 64915K is a 94-inch two-tier stainless steel overshelf designed for the APP94 model, boasting a strong construction that supports efficient food storage and preparation. With a shipping weight of 66 lbs, it measures 94 inches in width, 18 inches in depth, and 30 inches in height. It features a double deck design with two shelves, crafted from 22 gauge stainless steel, ensuring durability and resistance to corrosion. This construction not only enhances its strength but also makes it easy to clean, making it ideal for commercial kitchen environments. The undershelf includes a reinforced full-length hat channel mounted for added support, promoting stability and load-bearing capacity. This feature is crucial for holding heavy items without compromising safety or performance. The double-tier design optimizes vertical storage space, allowing kitchen staff to maximize efficiency while keeping ingredients and equipment organized and accessible. The combination of its solid construction and functional design makes the Arctic Air 64915K overshelf an essential addition to any professional kitchen setup, ensuring reliable performance and longevity. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 94” Depth: 18” Height: 30” Weight 66 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>Has a shipping weight of 66 lbs, ensuring it is solid and manageable for installation in your kitchen setup. </li><li>Features a width of 94 inches, a depth of 18 inches, and a height of 30 inches, providing wide space for storage and organization of kitchen supplies and equipment. </li><li>Designed with a double shelf configuration, it offers excellent vertical storage capacity for various kitchen items, maximizing the use of available space. </li><li>Constructed from stainless steel, it combines durability and a sleek finish, ensuring it withstands the rigors of a busy kitchen environment while remaining easy to clean. </li><li>This is classified as a double deck overshelf, making it ideal for storing a variety of kitchen essentials, from cooking supplies to display items. </li><li>Featuring a 22 gauge thickness, the material provides a strong and stable surface for holding heavy items without bending or warping.<br> </li></ul>', 'published', '[\"64915k-1.webp\",\"64903k.webp\",\"70250k.webp\",\"70118k.webp\"]', '64915K', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 599, 420, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 94.00, 1, 30.00, 1, 18.00, 1, 66.00, 1, NULL, 38, '2024-10-19 07:05:29', '2024-11-12 08:22:49', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', '64915k-1.webp', 'physical', NULL, 250, 1, 5, 7, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 94.00, 1, 18.00, 1, 30.00, 1, 0.00, 1, NULL, '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', '10', 1, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1638, 'Arctic Air 64914K 71 Two Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf For APP71', '<p>The Arctic Air 64914K is a 71-inch two-tier stainless steel overshelf designed specifically for the APP71 model, ensuring that your kitchen space is both functional and organized. With a shipping weight of 53 lbs, this overshelf measures 71 inches in width, 18 inches in depth, and 30 inches in height. It features a double deck design, allowing for wide storage and easy access to essential items. Crafted from 22 gauge stainless steel, it provides excellent durability and resistance to rust and corrosion, making it suitable for demanding kitchen environments. It includes a reinforced full-length hat channel mounted to the underside of the stainless steel shelf, adding extra support to enhance stability and load-bearing capacity. The double-tier construction maximizes vertical storage, helping to keep ingredients, utensils, and equipment neatly organized. This design not only optimizes workspace efficiency but also facilitates quick access to frequently used items, ensuring a smoother workflow in busy kitchens. The combination of strength, stability, and thoughtful design makes the Arctic Air 64914K an invaluable asset for any commercial kitchen setup. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 71” Depth: 18” Height: 30” Weight 53 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>Has a shipping weight of 53 lbs, making it manageable for transportation while ensuring a solid construction for heavy-duty use. </li><li>Features a width of 71 inches, a depth of 18 inches, and a height of 30 inches, providing wide storage space for kitchen supplies and equipment. </li><li>Designed with a double shelf configuration, it maximizes vertical storage capacity, allowing for organized placement of various kitchen essentials. </li><li>Made from stainless steel, it is durable, resistant to rust and corrosion, and easy to clean, maintaining a professional look in any kitchen setting. </li><li>Classified as a double deck overshelf, it is ideal for both storage and display purposes in commercial kitchens, ensuring efficient use of space. </li><li>Material has a thickness of 22 gauge, providing a solid and stable surface capable of supporting heavy items without bending or sagging. </li><li>It includes a reinforced full-length hat channel mounted to the underside of the stainless steel shelf, which adds significant support and stability for the stored items.<br><br> </li></ul>', 'published', '[\"64914k.webp\",\"64903k.webp\",\"64900k.webp\",\"70251k.webp\"]', '64914K', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 599, 375, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 71.00, 1, 30.00, 1, 18.00, 1, 53.00, 1, NULL, 36, '2024-10-19 07:05:29', '2024-11-12 08:22:29', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', '64914k.webp', 'physical', NULL, 225, 1, 5, 7, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 71.00, 1, 18.00, 1, 30.00, 1, 0.00, 1, NULL, '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', '10', 1, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1639, 'Arctic Air 64913K 48 Two Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf For APP48', '<p>The Arctic Air 64913K is a 48-inch, two-tier stainless steel overshelf designed for the APP48 model. It features a durable construction made from 22-gauge stainless steel, ensuring longevity and strongness in demanding kitchen environments. With dimensions of 48 in length, 18 in width, and 30 in height, it provides wide space for organizing kitchen essentials. The double-deck design maximizes storage efficiency by offering two shelves for easy access to items. It weighs 38 lbs, making it solid and manageable to install and integrate into various kitchen setups. This two-tier overshelf is ideal for professionals looking to increase storage while maintaining a streamlined workspace. Its stainless steel build not only enhances durability but also offers a smooth and modern appearance that complements various kitchen environments. The double-deck structure allows for additional organization, making it easier to keep tools, utensils, or ingredients within arm’s reach. Perfect for use with the APP48, this shelf ensures utility and style in any commercial kitchen. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 18 Length: 48” Height: 30 Weight 38 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>Has a shipping weight of 38 lbs, making it lightweight and durable enough for commercial use. </li><li>Spans a length of 48 inches, offering wide space for additional storage and organization above your APP48 unit. </li><li>With an 18-inch width, it provides a balanced structure for holding items efficiently while maintaining a sleek profile. </li><li>Height of 30 inches ensures great space between tiers, accommodating various kitchen essentials comfortably. </li><li>Made from stainless steel, it is highly durable, corrosion-resistant, and easy to clean, making it ideal for the demands of a busy commercial kitchen. </li><li>It features two tiers, providing extra storage levels for kitchen tools, ingredients, or other necessities, and optimizing vertical space. </li><li>Constructed with 22-gauge stainless steel, it strikes a balance between durability and lightweight functionality, ensuring it withstands regular use. </li><li>Classified as a double-deck overshelf, it maximizes vertical storage space, giving you more room for storage without taking up additional floor space.</li><li>Designed to fit perfectly with the APP48 series, it enhances functionality without compromising kitchen space. </li><li>Strong stainless steel finish complements the design of any professional kitchen, adding both aesthetic appeal and practical storage to your equipment.<br> </li></ul>', 'published', '[\"64913k.webp\",\"64903k.webp\",\"69214k.webp\",\"70119rk.webp\"]', '64913K', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 599, 337.5, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 18.00, 1, 30.00, 1, 0.00, 1, 38.00, 1, NULL, 36, '2024-10-19 07:05:29', '2024-11-12 08:21:14', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', '64913k.webp', 'physical', NULL, 225, 1, 5, 7, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 18.00, 1, 0.00, 1, 30.00, 1, 0.00, 1, NULL, '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', '10', 1, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1640, 'Arctic Air 64911K 94 Single Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf For APP94', '<p>The Arctic Air 64911K 94 Single Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf is designed to enhance workspace organization and efficiency in commercial kitchen settings. With a shipping weight of 38 lbs, this strong overshelf measures 94 inches in width and 18 inches in depth, providing wide storage space above the food prep area. Its height of 20 inches is optimal for maximizing vertical space while ensuring easy accessibility for kitchen staff. Constructed entirely from stainless steel, this over-shelf is durable, easy to clean, and resistant to corrosion, making it ideal for food service environments. This single-tier overshelf features a single-deck design that offers a straightforward and effective solution for storing ingredients, tools, and equipment within arm\'s reach. The streamlined construction ensures that it integrates perfectly with the Arctic Air APP94 pizza prep table, promoting an organized and efficient work environment. Its solid design supports various kitchen items, helping to keep the workspace tidy and enhancing overall productivity in fast-paced kitchen operations. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 94 Inches Depth: 18 Inches Height: 20 Inches Weight: 38 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air 64911K weighs 38 lbs, making it manageable for installation while providing a solid overhead storage solution. </li><li>Measures 94 inches in width, 18 inches in depth, and 20 inches in height, allowing wide space for storing kitchen essentials above your APP94 prep table. </li><li>Its design features a single shelf, providing a spacious area for storing frequently used items, enhancing organization and accessibility in your workspace. </li><li>Crafted from stainless steel, it offers durability and resistance to rust and corrosion, ensuring longevity in demanding kitchen environments. </li><li>Classified as a single-deck unit, this overshelf maximizes overhead storage without taking up valuable