(1641, 'Arctic Air 64910K 71 Single Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf For APP71', '<p>The Arctic Air 64910K 71 Single Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf is an essential addition to the APP71 series, designed to maximize workspace efficiency in commercial kitchens. Weighing 31 lbs, it provides a solid structure with a width of 71 inches and a depth of 18 inches, creating wide space for storage and organization of kitchen supplies. Its height of 20 inches allows for easy access while keeping items within reach, enhancing workflow efficiency. Constructed from durable stainless steel, this overshelf is built to withstand the rigors of a busy kitchen environment, ensuring longevity and resistance to corrosion. As a single deck shelf with one tier, it offers a straightforward design that provides sufficient surface area for storing ingredients, utensils, and equipment without taking up excessive vertical space. This practical addition not only helps in decluttering the workspace but also adheres to professional standards, contributing to an organized and efficient kitchen setup. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 71 Inches Depth: 18 Inches Height: 20 Inches Weight: 31 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air 64910K has a shipping weight of 31 lbs, indicating a lightweight and solid design that facilitates easy installation and handling.</li><li>Measures 71 inches in width, providing wide space for additional storage and organization above the APP71, enhancing workspace efficiency.</li><li>With a depth of 18 inches, the overshelf offers a generous surface area for holding ingredients, utensils, and other kitchen essentials while remaining compact.</li><li>Its height is 20 inches, allowing for sufficient clearance to accommodate various items while maintaining a streamlined appearance.</li><li>Designed as a single shelf, this overshelf maximizes vertical space, making it an ideal solution for kitchens where space optimization is key.</li><li>Made from stainless steel, it is built for durabil