ove your prep units. </li><li>Made from high-quality stainless steel, it is resistant to rust and corrosion, ensuring durability and easy maintenance in a fast-paced kitchen environment. </li><li>As a single deck overshelf, it offers a straightforward solution for additional storage without overwhelming your cooking area, making it ideal for compact kitchen setups. </li><li>Constructed from 22-gauge stainless steel, it provides excellent strength and durability while remaining lightweight enough for convenient handling and installation.<br> </li></ul>', 'published', '[\"64903k.webp\",\"64908k.webp\",\"64900k.webp\",\"70118k.webp\"]', '64903K', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 599, 202.5, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 18.00, 1, 20.00, 1, 0.00, 1, 26.00, 1, NULL, 41, '2024-10-19 07:05:29', '2024-11-12 08:20:09', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', '64903k.webp', 'physical', NULL, 120, 1, 5, 7, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 18.00, 1, 0.00, 1, 20.00, 1, 0.00, 1, NULL, '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', '10', 1, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1647, 'Arctic Air 64902K 48â€ Single Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf For AST/AMT48', '<p>The Arctic Air 64902K 48” Single Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf is designed for the AST/AMT48 series, providing an effective solution for maximizing vertical storage in busy commercial kitchens. With a length of 48 inches, a width of 18 inches, and a height of 20 inches, this single-deck overshelf offers wide space for keeping essential kitchen supplies organized and easily accessible. Constructed from stainless steel, it ensures durability and resistance to corrosion, making it suitable for various kitchen environments. The 22-gauge thickness adds to its strength, allowing it to support a wide range of items. Weighing only 22 lbs, it is lightweight, facilitating easy installation and relocation as needed. Its design helps to free up valuable countertop space, allowing chefs and kitchen staff to work more efficiently. By providing a designated area for storing ingredients, utensils, and equipment, this overshelf contributes to maintaining a tidy workspace. The combination of solid construction and practical design makes the Arctic Air 64902K an essential addition for any professional kitchen looking to enhance organization and workflow efficiency. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 18 Inches Length: 48 Inches Height: 20 Inches Weight: 22 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air 64902K overshelf has a shipping weight of 22 lbs, making it a lightweight and solid addition to enhance storage above your prep units. </li><li>Measures 48 inches in length, providing wide space for additional storage without taking up extra floor space in your kitchen. </li><li>With a width of 18 inches, it offers a wide surface for storing essential items, allowing easy access to frequently used tools and supplies. </li><li>Stands at 20 inches in height, offering a comfortable reach for users while optimizing vertical space. </li><li>It is a single-tier overshelf, featuring one shelf that provides a simple and efficient storage solution for your kitchen. </li><li>Built from durable stainless steel, it is designed to resist corrosion and withstand the rigors of daily kitchen use, ensuring longevity. </li><li>As a single deck overshelf, it offers an uncluttered storage solution that fits well in any commercial kitchen setting, maximizing overhead space. </li><li>Made from 22-gauge stainless steel, it strikes a balance between strength and weight, providing durability while remaining easy to install and maintain.<br><br> </li></ul>', 'published', '[\"64902k.webp\",\"64907k.webp\",\"70250k.webp\",\"70119lk.webp\"]', '64902K', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 999, 180, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 18.00, 1, 20.00, 1, 0.00, 1, 22.00, 1, NULL, 38, '2024-10-19 07:05:29', '2024-11-12 08:19:56', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', '64902k.webp', 'physical', NULL, 230, 1, 5, 7, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 18.00, 1, 0.00, 1, 20.00, 1, 0.00, 1, NULL, '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', '10', 1, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1648, 'Arctic Air 64901K  21 Stainless Steel Sheet Pan Rack For AR23,AGR23,AF23,AR49,AGR49,AF49,APP48R,APP71R,APP94R', '<p>The Arctic Air 64901K 21 Stainless Steel Sheet Pan Rack is expertly designed for use with a variety of models, including AR23, AGR23, AF23, AR49, AGR49, AF49, APP48R, APP71R, and APP94R. With a shipping weight of 25 lbs, it features dimensions of 21 inches in width, 22.5 inches in depth, and 22.5 inches in height, making it a compact and efficient solution for storing sheet and bun pans. Its open-top design allows for easy access to the pans, enhancing workflow in busy kitchens. This rack holds six levels, providing wide space for organization while using a bottom-load slide type for convenient pan retrieval. Constructed from durable stainless steel, the Arctic Air 64901K ensures long-lasting performance and resistance to corrosion, making it ideal for food service environments. Its versatility and efficient design not only help in maximizing storage but also contribute to maintaining cleanliness and organization in any commercial kitchen. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 21 Inches Length: 22.5 Inches Height: 22.5 Inches Shipping Weight: 25 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air 64901K sheet pan rack has a shipping weight of 25 lbs, ensuring a strong structure while being manageable for installation. </li><li>With a width of 21 inches, this rack is designed to fit perfectly alongside your existing kitchen equipment, optimizing available space. </li><li>Measuring 22.5 inches in depth, it provides wide room for storing multiple sheet pans without compromising accessibility. </li><li>Height of 22.5 inches allows for easy access to pans and quick loading or unloading, enhancing workflow in busy kitchen environments. </li><li>Featuring an open top, the design facilitates easy loading of sheet pans and improves airflow, ensuring efficient cooling and storage. </li><li>Includes 6 levels, providing sufficient vertical space for organizing various sheet or bun pans, maximizing storage efficiency. </li><li>Designed for bottom load, it allows for straightforward placement and removal of pans, improving operational efficiency during meal prep. </li><li>It is specifically designed for sheet/bun pans, making it ideal for bakeries and food service operations that require versatile storage options. </li><li>Made from high-quality stainless steel, it offers durability and resistance to corrosion, ensuring long-term performance in a commercial kitchen setting. </li><li>Compatible with various models, including AR23, AGR23, AF23, AR49, AGR49, AF49, APP48R, APP71R, and APP94R, making it a versatile addition to your kitchen equipment lineup.<br><br> </li></ul>', 'published', '[\"64901k.webp\",\"70119rk.webp\",\"69226k.webp\",\"70118k.webp\"]', '64901K', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 999, 345, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 21.00, 1, 22.50, 1, 22.50, 1, 25.00, 1, NULL, 45, '2024-10-19 07:05:29', '2024-11-12 08:19:46', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', '64901k.webp', 'physical', NULL, 410, 1, 5, 7, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 21.00, 1, 22.50, 1, 22.50, 1, 0.00, 1, NULL, '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', '10', 1, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1649, 'Arctic Air 64900K 21 Stainless Steel Sheet Pan Rack For AR23,AGR23,AF23,AR49,AGR49,AF49', '<p>The Arctic Air 64900K 21 Stainless Steel Sheet Pan Rack is specifically designed for compatibility with models such as AR23, AGR23, AF23, AR49, AGR49, and AF49. This strong rack has a shipping weight of 32 lbs, and its dimensions are 21 inches in width, 22.5 inches in depth, and 48 inches in height, making it a space-efficient solution for food storage in commercial kitchens. The open-top design enhances accessibility, allowing for easy placement and retrieval of bun pans. Constructed from high-quality stainless steel, it is built for durability and longevity, ensuring it can withstand the rigors of a busy kitchen environment. It features an end load configuration and open sides, facilitating smooth pan access while optimizing space usage. This rack style is particularly suitable for organizing and storing bun pans, making it an essential tool for any food service operation looking to improve workflow and organization while maintaining hygiene and efficiency in food preparation areas. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 21 Inches Length: 22.5 Inches Height: 48 Inches Shipping Weight: 32 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air 64900K sheet pan rack has a shipping weight of 32 lbs, which indicates a solid construction suitable for commercial use. </li><li>With a width of 21 inches, it is designed to fit conveniently within various kitchen spaces, ensuring efficient organization. </li><li>Measuring 22.5 inches in depth, it provides wide space for multiple sheet pans, making it easy to store and access items. </li><li>Standing at 48 inches, it offers a substantial vertical storage solution, maximizing the use of space in your kitchen. </li><li>Featuring an open top, the design promotes easy loading and unloading of pans while ensuring proper ventilation. </li><li>Made from durable stainless steel, the rack is built to withstand the rigors of a commercial kitchen, providing longevity and ease of maintenance. </li><li>Designed for end load, it allows for efficient placement and removal of pans from the front, streamlining food preparation processes. </li><li>Open sides enhance accessibility, making it easy to grab pans from either side while ensuring a clear view of stored items. </li><li>Specifically designed for bun pans, this rack is perfect for bakeries and food service operations, optimizing storage for various baking needs. </li><li>Compatible with models such as AR23, AGR23, AF23, AR49, AGR49, and AF49, making it a versatile addition to your kitchen equipment.<br><br> </li></ul>', 'published', '[\"64900k.webp\",\"70251k.webp\",\"70119rk.webp\"]', '64900K', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 999, 615, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 21.00, 1, 48.00, 1, 22.50, 1, 32.00, 1, NULL, 45, '2024-10-19 07:05:29', '2024-11-12 08:19:37', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', '64900k.webp', 'physical', NULL, 49, 1, 5, 7, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 21.00, 1, 22.50, 1, 48.00, 1, 0.00, 1, NULL, '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', '10', 1, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1650, 'Arctic Air 70251K Merchandiser Shelf Kit with Four Mounting Clips For ARGDM49,AFGDM49', '<p>The Arctic Air 70251K Merchandiser Shelf Kit is designed specifically for the ARGDM49 and AFGDM49 models, providing an effective solution for maximizing display and storage space within these units. Measuring 23.5 inches in length and 24 inches in width, it enhances the visibility and accessibility of merchandise, allowing for better organization and presentation of products. It includes four mounting clips, ensuring secure and stable installation, which is essential for maintaining a professional appearance in retail settings. Constructed to meet the demands of a commercial environment, this shelf kit allows for easy adjustments and repositioning to accommodate various products. The design facilitates optimal airflow around displayed items, contributing to better preservation of perishable goods. Its solid construction guarantees durability, making it an ideal addition to any merchandising setup focused on efficiency and effective product showcasing. It not only enhances functionality but also improves the overall aesthetic of the refrigerated display unit. Dimensions Width: 24 Inches Length: 23.5 Inches</p>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air 70251K merchandiser shelf kit measures 23.5 inches in length, providing a suitable surface area for displaying merchandise efficiently. </li><li>With a width of 24 inches, it offers wide space for products, allowing for organized presentation and easy access. </li><li>Designed specifically for use with models ARGDM49 and AFGDM49, ensuring a perfect fit and optimal performance in your merchandising setup. </li><li>Includes four mounting clips, facilitating secure and stable attachment to the designated display units, ensuring the shelf remains firmly in place. </li><li>Constructed from durable materials, it is designed to withstand the demands of a busy retail environment, ensuring long-lasting use.<br><br> </li></ul>', 'published', '[\"7