(1651, 'Arctic Air 70250K Merchandiser Shelf Kit with Four Mounting Clips For ARGDM23,AFGDM23', '<p>The Arctic Air 70250K Merchandiser Shelf Kit is an essential addition designed specifically for the ARGDM23 and AFGDM23 models, offering an efficient way to enhance product visibility and organization within refrigerated displays. It includes one standard shelf measuring 21.25 x 24.50 inches, providing wide space for displaying a variety of items. It not only supports the weight of numerous products but also features a label holder, making it easier to identify merchandise at a glance and ensuring a neat presentation. Included in the kit are four mounting clips, which facilitate straightforward installation and ensure the shelf is securely attached to the display unit. This setup allows for easy adjustments and repositioning of the shelf, catering to different product sizes and display preferences. The shelf\'s strong construction is designed to withstand the rigors of a commercial environment, making it an ideal choice for businesses looking to improve their merchandising strategies while maintaining a professional appearance. Dimensions 21.25 x 24.50 inches</p>', '<ul><li>Includes 1 shelf, specifically designed for effective merchandising, allowing for the organized display of products. </li><li>Comes with four mounting clips, ensuring secure installation and stability of the shelf on compatible display units. </li><li>Features standard dimensions of 21.25 inches in width and 24.50 inches in depth, providing wide space for product placement and visibility. </li><li>Designed for use with models ARGDM23 and AFGDM23, ensuring a precise fit for optimal performance in your merchandising setups. </li><li>Includes a label holder, allowing for easy identification and pricing of merchandise, enhancing the shopping experience for customers.</li></ul>', 'published', '[\"70250k.webp\",\"69226k.webp\",\"64901k.webp\",\"64903k.webp\"]', '70250K', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 125, 7