(1652, 'Arctic Air 70119RK Right Shelf Kit with Four Mounting Clips For AGR49, AGDF490', '<p>The Arctic Air 70119RK Right Shelf Kit is designed to enhance storage and display capabilities for the AGR49 and AGDF490 models. It includes one standard shelf that measures 24.50 x 24.50 inches, providing a solid platform for displaying a variety of items, whether they are beverages, condiments, or other merchandise. The design ensures that the shelf can handle the demands of a commercial kitchen or merchandising environment, making it a practical addition to any food service operation. In addition to the shelf, it comes with four mounting clips that facilitate easy installation and secure attachment to the refrigeration unit. These clips ensure stability and allow for quick adjustments if needed. The strong construction of the shelf and its mounting system are tailored to withstand daily use, making it an ideal solution for businesses aiming to optimize their space and improve product visibility. This shelf kit is essential for any establishment looking to maximize efficiency and organization in their refrigerated display units. Dimensions 24.50 x 24.50 inches</p>', '<ul><li>Includes one standard shelf measuring 24.50 inches in width and 24.50 inches in depth, providing a spacious area for displaying a variety of merchandise. </li><li>Comes equipped with four mounting clips, ensuring secure installation and stability of the shelf on compatible display units. </li><li>Designed for use with models AGR49 and AGDF490, it guarantees a precise fit for optimal performance in your merchandising setups. </li><li>Made from durable materials, it is built to withstand the demands of a retail environment, ensuring longevity and reliability.<br>Its practical design enhances product visibility, helping to attract customer attention and facilitate easy access to displayed items.<br><br> </li></ul>', 'published', '[\"70118k.webp\",\"70251k.webp\",\"70119rk.webp\"]', '70119RK', 0, 150, 0, 1