(1654, 'Arctic Air 70118K Refrigerator Shelf Kit with Four Mounting Clips For AGR23,AGDF23', '<p>The Arctic Air 70118K Refrigerator Shelf Kit is designed for use with the AGR23 and AGDF23 refrigeration models, offering an efficient solution for enhancing storage capacity within commercial settings. It includes one standard shelf that measures 21.25 x 23.50 inches, providing wide space for organizing various items such as beverages, condiments, or other food products. It is constructed from durable materials to withstand the demands of a busy kitchen, ensuring longevity and reliability in everyday use. Accompanying the shelf are four mounting clips, which simplify the installation process and secure the shelf firmly in place. These clips facilitate quick adjustments, allowing for customization of shelf height based on the user’s needs. The combination of a high-quality shelf and strong mounting hardware not only maximizes the efficiency of the refrigeration unit but also enhances the overall organization and presentation of stored items, making it a valuable addition to any food service operation. Dimensions 21.25 x 23.50 inches</p>', '<ul><li>Includes one standard shelf measuring 21.25 inches in width and 23.50 inches in depth, providing wide space for displaying a variety of items in your refrigerator. </li><li>Equipped with four mounting clips, ensuring a secure installation and stability of the shelf on compatible refrigerator units. </li><li>Specifically designed for use with models AGR23 and AGDF23, this shelf kit guarantees a precise fit for optimal performance and utility. </li><li>Made from durable materials, it is built to withstand the rigors of a refrigeration environment, ensuring reliability and longevity during everyday use. </li><li>Its practical design enhances product visibility and accessibility, helping to effectively organize and display a variety of refrigerated items.<br><br> </li></ul>', 'published', '[\"70118k.webp\",\"69226k.webp\",\"65500k.