(1657, 'Arctic Air 65500K 62 - 67 (Side - Side) Tempered Glass Top Cover for ACP63', '<p>The Arctic Air 65500K Tempered Glass Top Cover is an essential accessory for the ACP63, designed to enhance hygiene and food safety in commercial settings. This optional sneeze guard effectively maintains sanitary standards by providing a protective barrier around food products, reducing the risk of contamination. Made from durable tempered glass, it ensures both safety and clarity, allowing customers to view the food displayed while safeguarding it from external elements. Assembly and installation of the cover are straightforward, making it easy for operators to set up and use without requiring specialized tools or expertise. The adjustable design holds a range of widths from 62 to 67 inches, ensuring compatibility with various setups. By incorporating this glass top cover, businesses can not only comply with health regulations but also create an inviting presentation of their offerings, enhancing the overall dining experience for customers. Dimensions Width: 62 to 67 inches</p>', '<ul><li>Designed to fit ACP63 models, it is adjustable in width, accommodating sizes from 62 inches to 67 inches, providing versatility for various setups.</li><li>Constructed from tempered glass, it ensures durability and resilience, offering a clear view of the displayed food items while enhancing the aesthetic appeal of your food service area.</li><li>This top cover serves as an optional sneeze guard accessory, effectively maintaining sanitary standards by providing a protective barrier that prevents contamination from airborne particles.</li><li>Covering food products helps protect against external contaminants, ensuring that your offerings remain safe and hygienic for customers.</li><li>Designed for easy assembly and installation, allowing for quick setup without the need for specialized tools or skills, making it user-friendly.<br><br> </li></ul>', 'published', '[\"65500k.webp\",\"70119lk.webp\