(1658, 'Arctic Air 65400K 44 - 49 (Side - Side) Tempered Glass Top Cover for ACP48', '<p>The Arctic Air 65400K Tempered Glass Top Cover is an invaluable accessory for the ACP48, designed as a single-sided sneeze guard that helps maintain sanitary standards while protecting food products. It is made from durable tempered glass, ensuring both safety and clarity. Measuring 48 inches in width, 15.3 inches in depth, and 7.5 inches in height, it fits perfectly with the unit to provide an unobstructed view of the displayed food while keeping it shielded from contaminants. Weighing 80 lbs, it is easy to assemble and install, allowing users to set it up quickly without needing specialized tools. This feature makes it accessible for various commercial environments, enhancing both hygiene and presentation. By using this sneeze guard, food establishments can comply with health regulations while creating an inviting display that attracts customers, ultimately improving their dining experience. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width 48 inches Depth 15.3 inches Height 7.5 inches Shipping Weight 80 lbs</p>', '<ul><li>Designed to fit ACP48 models, adjustable to widths ranging from 44 inches to 49 inches, ensuring a proper fit for various configurations.</li><li>Constructed from high-quality tempered glass, it provides excellent durability and visibility, showcasing the food items while enhancing the presentation of your display.</li><li>Serving as an optional sneeze guard accessory, this top cover is crucial for maintaining sanitary standards by offering a protective barrier against airborne contaminants.</li><li>By shielding food products, it helps to keep offerings safe from external contaminants, ensuring hygiene and safety for consumers.</li><li>Designed for easy assembly and installation, it can be set up quickly without the need for specialized tools, making it accessible to all users.</li><li>Its clear tempered glass construction allows for excellent visibility of displayed items, making it easier for customers to see what is available while still providing a protective barrier.</li><li>Tailored for ACP48 models, it ensures a suitable fit, optimizing both protection and presentation for your refrigeration unit.</li><li>Smooth surface of the tempered glass is straightforward to clean and maintain, promoting hygiene in busy food service environments.</li><li>With a single-sided design, this top cover is ideal for open food displays, allowing for easy access while maintaining a clean presentation.</li><li>Weighing 80 lbs, this tempered glass cover is strong and manageable, ensuring stability and reliability in high-traffic areas.<br> </li></ul>', 'published', '[\"65400k.webp\",\"64900k.webp\",\"70250k.webp\"]', '65400K', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 899, 349.5, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 48.00, 1, 7.50, 1, 15.30, 1, 80.00, 1, NULL, 48, '2024-10-19 07:05:29', '2024-11-12 08:17:00', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', '65400k.webp', 'physical', NULL, 233, 1, 5, 7, 0, '<p>2 Years Part and Labor Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 2, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[\"videos/upZTGwpviJAlGqjHEQdUs88NIy8oIrdVs8Nomk3v.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 48.00, 1, 15.30, 1, 7.50, 1, 0.00, 1, NULL, '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', '10', 1, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1659, 'Arctic Air 65300K 56 - 61 ((Side - Side) Tempered Glass Top Cover for ACP55', '<p>The Arctic Air 65300K 56 - 61 Tempered Glass Top Cover is designed specifically for the ACP55 series, enhancing the functionality and presentation of food items in commercial kitchen environments. With a shipping weight of 80 lbs, this durable cover features a width of 59 inches, ensuring a suitable fit for a variety of countertop setups. Its depth of 17 inches provides wide coverage for the food prep area, while the height of just 2 inches maintains an unobtrusive profile, facilitating easy access to contents. This tempered glass top cover not only protects food from contaminants but also offers a clear view of displayed items, enhancing visibility and appealing presentation for customers. The strong construction ensures longevity and resistance to breakage, making it suitable for high-traffic kitchen environments. By keeping food items covered while allowing visibility, this cover helps maintain food safety standards while optimizing the workflow for kitchen staff, contributing to a more organized and efficient workspace. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 59 Inches Depth: 17 Inches Height: 2 Inches Shipping Weight: 80 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>Has a shipping weight of 80 lbs, ensuring a solid build that contributes to durability and stability in use.</li><li>Measures 59 inches in width, designed to fit the ACP55 and provide a sleek, professional appearance.</li><li>Depth of the cover is 17 inches, allowing wide coverage for the prep area while maintaining accessibility to the items below.</li><li>At just 2 inches in height, this cover is designed to provide a low-profile solution that minimizes space usage while still offering the benefits of protection and visibility.</li><li>Made from tempered glass, it is not only aesthetically pleasing but also provides enhanced strength and safety compared to regular glass.</li><li>Specifically designed for the ACP55, this top cover integrates per