(1660, 'Arctic Air 69240K 25.75 Refrigerator Shelf Kit with Four Mounting Clips For AWR25,AWF25', '<p>The Arctic Air 69240K Refrigerator Shelf Kit is designed for use with the AWR25 and AWF25 models, providing a practical storage solution with dimensions of 25 3/4 inches in width and 21 inches in depth. It has a shipping weight of 6 lbs, making it lightweight and easy to handle. Its white-coated wire construction ensures durability while allowing for excellent airflow, which is essential in a refrigeration environment, promoting even cooling and minimizing moisture retention. It includes four mounting clips for secure installation, ensuring that the shelf remains firmly in place during use. The coated wire material not only adds to the aesthetic appeal with its clean, white finish but also contributes to the overall functionality by preventing rust and corrosion. With this shelf, users can maximize their storage capabilities while maintaining an organized and efficient refrigeration system, making it an ideal choice for commercial kitchens and food service operations. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width 25 3/4 inches Depth 21 inches Shipping Weight 6 lbs</p>', '<ul><li>Features a width of 25 3/4 inches and a depth of 21 inches, providing wide space for storing various food items and beverages.</li><li>Total shipping weight of the kit is 6 lbs, making it lightweight and easy to handle during installation.</li><li>Finished in a clean white color, which not only enhances visibility but also blends well with most refrigerator interiors.</li><li>Constructed from coated wire, it is designed for durability and resistance to corrosion, ensuring it maintains its integrity in a refrigeration environment.</li><li>Includes a single shelf that maximizes vertical storage in your AWR25 or AWF25 units, optimizing space and organization.</li><li>Comes complete with four mounting clips, facilitating easy and secure installation, ensuring the shelf remains stable under load.</li><li>Specifically designed for use with AWR25 and AWF25 models, ensuring a perfect fit and optimal performance in your refrigeration unit.<br><br> </li></ul>', 'published', '[\"69240k.webp\",\"69240k.webp\",\"69240k.webp\",\"69240k.webp\"]', '69240K', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 125, 73.5, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 21.50, 1, 0.00, 1, 21.00, 1, 6.00, 1, NULL, 41, '2024-10-19 07:05:29', '2024-11-12 08:16:04', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', '69240k.webp', 'physical', NULL, 49, 1, 5, 7, 0, '<p>2 Years Part and Labor Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 21.50, 1, 21.00, 1, 0.00, 1, 0.00, 1, NULL, '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', '10', 1, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1661, 'Arctic Air 65058K 21 Refrigerator Shelf Kit with Four Mounting Clips For AUC48R,AUC48F', '<p>The Arctic Air 65058K is a 21-inch refrigerator shelf kit designed for specific models, including the AUC48R and AUC48F. With a shipping weight of 4.5 lbs, it measures 21 inches in width and 16.75 inches in depth, making it a practical addition to your refrigeration setup. Sold as a single unit, this shelf is available in a sleek silver color and is categorized as a shelf type. Constructed from epoxy-coated metal, it offers enhanced durability and resistance to corrosion, ensuring longevity even in high-humidity environments typical of commercial kitchens. The kit includes four mounting clips, providing all the necessary hardware for straightforward installation. This design not only maximizes storage efficiency within your refrigerator but also helps in maintaining organization, allowing for easy access to stored items. Whether you need extra space for ingredients or tools, the Arctic Air 65058K shelf kit is a reliable solution for enhancing your kitchen\'s functionality. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 21” Depth: 16.75” Weight 4.5 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>Has a shipping weight of 4.5 lbs, making it lightweight and easy to handle during installation.</li><li>Measures 21 inches in width and 16 3/4 inches in depth, providing wide space for organizing food items within the refrigerator.</li><li>Includes 1 shelf, which is sufficient for adding extra storage to your refrigerator setup.</li><li>Features a silver finish, enhancing its aesthetic appeal and ensuring it complements various refrigerator interiors.</li><li>Designed specifically to fit Arctic Air refrigerator models AUC48R and AUC48F.</li><li>Constructed from epoxy-coated metal, it offers excellent durability and resistance to corrosion, making it suitable for food storage.</li><li>Includes four mounting clips, ensuring easy installation and secure attachment of the shelf to the refrigerator.<br> </li></ul>', 'publishe