(1663, 'Arctic Air 65056K 23.75 Refrigerator Shelf Kit with Four Mounting Clips For AR49,AF49', '<p>The Arctic Air 65056K is a 23.75-inch refrigerator shelf kit designed for compatibility with the AR49 and AF49 models. With a shipping weight of 8 lbs, it offers a practical and solid option for enhancing storage capacity within your refrigeration system. Measuring 23.75 inches in width and 24.375 inches in depth, it effectively utilizes available space while accommodating various food items and supplies. Its white color provides a clean, professional look that complements any kitchen design. Constructed from coated wire, it is engineered for durability and easy cleaning, ensuring it can withstand the demanding conditions of commercial kitchens. The kit includes four mounting clips, facilitating straightforward installation and secure attachment within the refrigerator. This design not only maximizes vertical space but also promotes organization, allowing users to quickly access ingredients and supplies. The Arctic Air 65056K shelf kit combines functionality and efficiency, making it an essential addition for any food service operation looking to optimize storage solutions. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 23 3/4 Depth: 24 3/8 Weight 8 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>Has a shipping weight of 8 lbs, ensuring it\'s easy to handle and install.</li><li>Measures 23 3/4 inches in width and 24 3/8 inches in depth, providing wide space for organizing and storing various food items in your refrigerator.</li><li>Features a clean white finish, which enhances visibility and complements the interior of your refrigerator.</li><li>Specifically designed to fit Arctic Air refrigerator models AR49 and AF49.</li><li>Made from coated wire, it is lightweight and solid, ensuring reliable support for stored items while allowing for airflow.</li><li>Includes four mounting clips, facilitating easy installation and secure attachment to the refrigerator.<br> </li></ul>', 'published', '[\"65056k.webp\",\"65056