(1664, 'Arctic Air 65055K 21.63 Refrigerator Shelf Kit with Four Mounting Clips For AR23,AF23', '<p>The Arctic Air 65055K is a 21.63-inch refrigerator shelf kit tailored for the AR23 and AF23 models, providing an efficient solution for maximizing storage space in refrigeration units. With a shipping weight of 8 lbs, it measures 21.625 inches in width and 24.375 inches in depth, making it versatile for organizing various food items. Its coated wire construction ensures durability, allowing it to withstand the rigors of commercial kitchen environments while offering excellent airflow to maintain freshness. Included in the kit are four mounting clips that facilitate easy installation and secure attachment to the refrigerator, ensuring it remains stable during use. The coated wire design not only contributes to a clean and professional appearance but also allows for quick cleaning, making maintenance hassle-free. This combination of practicality and functionality makes the Arctic Air 65055K an ideal choice for food service operations seeking to optimize their storage solutions and enhance organization within their refrigeration systems. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 21 5/8 Depth: 24 3/8 Weight 8 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>Hs a shipping weight of 8 lbs, making it lightweight and easy to handle during installation.</li><li>Measures 21 5/8 inches in width and 24 3/8 inches in depth, providing wide storage space for organizing food items in your refrigerator.</li><li>Features a coated wire design, ensuring durability while maintaining a clean, professional appearance.</li><li>Specifically designed for use with Arctic Air refrigerator models AR23 and AF23.</li><li>Constructed from coated wire, it is both lightweight and strong, offering reliable support for a variety of items while promoting airflow.</li><li>Includes four mounting clips, which facilitate straightforward installation and secure attachment to the refrigerator.<br><br> </li></ul>', 'published', '[\"65055k.webp\",\"65055k.webp\",\"65055k.webp\",\"65055k.webp\"]', '65055K', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 5999, 3304, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 21.00, 1, 0.00, 1, 24.50, 1, 8.00, 1, NULL, 34, '2024-10-19 07:05:29', '2024-11-08 14:50:34', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', '65055k.webp', 'physical', NULL, 2304, 1, 5, 7, 0, '<p>2 Years Part and Labor Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 21.00, 1, 24.50, 1, 0.00, 1, 0.00, 1, NULL, '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', '10', 1, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1665, 'Arctic Air ADD72R-2 72 Kegerator,  Direct Draw Double Door Beer Refrigerator', '<p>The Arctic Air ADD72R-2 72 Kegerator is designed for efficient beer storage and dispensing, featuring a top made of 1.59-inch solid foamed stainless steel that ensures durability and easy maintenance. It utilizes an electronic thermostat with a digital LED display for accurate temperature control, conveniently located behind the front access panel. The self-contained capillary tube system employs environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant (R290), promoting eco-friendliness. Its front-breathing design and front-accessible condensing unit facilitate easy cleaning and maintenance, while the high-grade reinforced stainless steel coved corner floor enhances durability. This kegerator maximizes workspace efficiency with a 249 depth and features an external drain mount for easy drainage. Its mounted 4-way air distributor and interior LED lighting ensure optimal cooling and visibility. The bright mirror finish stainless steel interior not only looks appealing but also simplifies cleaning. Each door is equipped with locks and removable magnetic gaskets to aid in maintenance. The exterior construction consists of black powder-coated steel for added durability, and it meets NSF Standard 7 for food safety, ensuring that it’s suitable for commercial use. With dimensions of 73 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39.5 inches in height, It is a practical addition to any bar or restaurant. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 73 Inches Depth: 24 Inches Height: 39.5 Inches Weight: 375 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air ADD72R-2 kegerator measures 73 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39 1/2 inches in height, designed to fit perfectly in bar setups while providing wide space for keg storage.</li><li>With a shipping weight of 375 lbs, this strong kegerator is built to withstand the rigors of commercial use, ensuring stability and durability.</li><li>Operating at 6 Amps, 115 Volts, and 60 Hertz with a 1-phase electrical configuration, the kegerator is compatible with standard electrical systems commonly found in bars and restaurants.</li><li>Equipped with casters, it enhances mobility for easy relocation during cleaning or event setups, allowing staff to efficiently manage their service areas.</li><li>It features a side-mounted compressor designed for efficient operation, ensuring optimal cooling performance while maintaining a compact design.</li><li>Designed to accommodate 3 kegs and features 4 taps, providing versatility and convenience for serving various beers, making it ideal for busy establishments.</li><li>Comes with 3 solid doors, allowing easy access to the kegs while maintaining an energy-efficient environment for beer storage.</li><li>Designed to maintain a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, it ensures that beer is served at the perfect temperature for optimal flavor and quality.</li><li>Constructed with a rich black exterior finish, it not only looks professional but also includes LED lighting for improved visibility inside, enhancing both functionality and aesthetics.</li><li>Powered by a 1/3 HP compressor, the kegerator utilizes R-290 refrigerant for environmentally friendly cooling. It is equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug for easy electrical connections and comes with a full two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year compressor warranty, ensuring long-term reliability and peace of mind.</li></ul>', 'published', '[]', 'ADD72R-2', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 4999, 3025, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 49.00, NULL, 39.50, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 375.00, NULL, NULL, 37, '2024-10-19 07:05:29', '2024-12-17 07:26:04', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'add72r-2.webp', 'physical', NULL, 1995, 1, 5, 7, 0, '<p>2 Years Part and Labor Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1, '[{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/5TdLnceaLHwP40bSK7bF9IjyqyiehhRDQgqp21TK.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 49.00, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 39.50, NULL, 0.00, NULL, NULL, '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, '10', 1, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1666, 'Arctic Air ADD60R-2 60 Kegerator, Direct Draw Double Door Beer Refrigerator', '<p>The Arctic Air ADD60R-2 60 Kegerator is engineered for optimal beer storage and dispensing, featuring a top constructed from 1.59-inch solid foamed stainless steel, ensuring durability and ease of maintenance. It includes an electronic thermostat with a digital LED display for precise temperature control, conveniently located behind the front access panel. The kegerator utilizes a self-contained capillary tube system that employs environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant (R290), promoting eco-conscious operation. Its front-breathing design and front-accessible condensing unit allow for easy cleaning and maintenance, while the high-grade reinforced stainless steel coved corner floor enhances structural integrity. This model is designed for efficiency with a 249 depth that conserves the workspace, complemented by an external drain mount for easy drainage. The kegerator features an easy-to-mount caster system with two lockable wheels, ensuring mobility and stability. It also includes a mounted 4-way air distributor and interior LED lighting for optimal cooling and visibility. The bright mirror finish stainless steel interior simplifies cleaning, while each door is equipped with locks and removable magnetic gaskets. Constructed from black powder-coated steel, the kegerator meets NSF Standard 7 for safety and is available with dimensions of 61 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39.5 inches in height, making it a valuable addition to any bar or restaurant setup. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 61 Inches Depth: 24 Inches Height: 39.5 Inches Weight: 325 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air ADD60R-2 kegerator measures 61 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39 1/2 inches in height, offering a compact footprint suitable for various commercial settings.</li><li>With a shipping weight of 325 lbs, this strong kegerator is designed for durability and stability, making it ideal for high-traffic environments.</li><li>Operating at 6 Amps, 115 Volts, and 60 Hertz in a 1-phase configuration, the kegerator is compatible with standard electrical systems found in bars and restaurants.</li><li>Equipped with casters, it enhances mobility for easy movement during cleaning or setup, allowing staff to efficiently manage their service areas.</li><li>Featuring a side-mounted compressor, the kegerator ensures optimal cooling performance while maintaining a space-efficient design.</li><li>Designed to hold 2 kegs and equipped with 4 taps, this kegerator provides versatility and convenience, making it perfect for serving a variety of beers.</li><li>Comes with 2 solid doors, facilitating easy access to the kegs while promoting an energy-efficient environment for beer storage.</li><li>It maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, ensuring that beers are served at their ideal temperature for optimal taste and enjoyment.</li><li>The kegerator features a rich black exterior finish and includes LED lighting for improved visibility inside, enhancing both functionality and aesthetics.</li><li>Powered by a 1/3 HP compressor, the unit utilizes R-290 refrigerant for eco-friendly cooling. It is equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug for easy electrical connections and comes with a full two-year parts and labor warranty along with a five-year compressor warranty, ensuring reliability and peace of mind for users.</li></ul>', 'published', '[]', 'ADD60R-2', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 3999, 2625, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 49.00, NULL, 39.50, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 325.00, NULL, NULL, 37, '2024-10-19 07:05:29', '2024-12-17 07:23:55', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'add60r-2.webp', 'physical', NULL, 1804, 1, 5, 7, 0, '<p>2 Years Part and Labor Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1, '[{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/WaADYmPPMlcihm9Gky9vdepPKhxq8Rt3VlHkAsph.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 49.00, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 39.50, NULL, 0.00, NULL, NULL, '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, '10', 1, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
