(1667, 'Arctic Air ADD48R-2 48 Kegerator Direct Draw Double Door Beer Refrigerator', '<p>The Arctic Air ADD48R-2 48 Kegerator is designed for efficient beer storage and dispensing, featuring a top made from 1.59-inch solid foamed stainless steel for durability and thermal efficiency. Equipped with an electronic thermostat and a digital LED display, it allows for precise temperature control, easily accessed through the front panel. This kegerator operates using a self-contained capillary tube system with environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant (R290), ensuring eco-friendly operation. The front-breathing design allows for installation flexibility, while the front-accessible condensing unit simplifies maintenance and cleaning tasks. Internally, the kegerator has a high-grade reinforced stainless steel coved corner floor that is easy to clean, complemented by an external drain mount for quick drainage. It features easy-to-mount casters (two of which are lockable) for mobility and a mounted 4-way air distributor that enhances cooling efficiency. The interior is illuminated with LED lighting, and the bright mirror finish stainless steel interior adds aesthetic appeal while making maintenance straightforward. Each door is equipped with locks and removable magnetic gaskets for added security and convenience. Constructed from black powder-coated steel, it has dimensions of 49 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39.5 inches in height, and it meets NSF Standard 7 for food safety standards. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 49 Inches Depth: 24 Inches Height: 39.5 Inches Weight: 290 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air ADD48R-2 kegerator features dimensions of 49 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39 1/2 inches in height, making it a compact and efficient solution for commercial beer dispensing.</li><li>Weighing 290 lbs, this solid kegerator is designed to withstand the rigors of daily use in high-demand environments.\\</li><li>Operates on 6 Amps at 115 Volts and 60 Hertz in a 1-phase system, ensuring compatibility with standard electrical setups commonly found in bars and restaurants.</li><li>Equipped with casters, it offers enhanced mobility, allowing staff to easily reposition it for cleaning or service adjustments.\\</li><li>Features a side-mounted compressor, which optimizes cooling efficiency while maintaining a space-saving design.</li><li>Designed to accommodate 2 kegs and equipped with 4 taps, this kegerator is perfect for serving a diverse selection of beers.</li><li>Includes 2 solid doors, providing easy access to kegs while contributing to energy efficiency and temperature maintenance.</li><li>It maintains an optimal temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, ensuring that beer is served at its ideal temperature for the best taste experience.</li><li>With a rich black exterior finish, the kegerator is both stylish and functional, featuring LED lighting to illuminate the interior, enhancing visibility for users.</li><li>Powered by a 1/3 HP compressor, it utilizes R-290 refrigerant, an environmentally friendly option. It is fitted with a NEMA 5-15P plug for easy electrical connections and comes with a full two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year compressor warranty, ensuring reliability and peace of mind for users.</li></ul>', 'published', '[]', 'ADD48R-2', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 4999, 2375, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 49.00, NULL, 39.50, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 290.00, NULL, NULL, 37, '2024-10-19 07:05:29', '2024-12-17 07:23:20', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'add48r-2.webp', 'physical', NULL, 1789, 1, 5, 7, 0, '<p>2 Years Part and Labor Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1, '[{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Em9PPl9unkeH3cA5q2bMm657aRsylvoivD3YuDgt.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 49.00, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 39.50, NULL, 0.00, NULL, NULL, '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, '10', 1, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1668, 'Arctic Air ABB60G 60 Double Glass Door Back Bar Refrigerator', '<p>The Arctic Air ABB60G 60 Double Glass Door Back Bar Refrigerator is designed for efficient beer storage and dispensing, featuring a top constructed from 1.59-inch solid foamed stainless steel for durability and thermal efficiency. It utilizes a self-contained capillary tube system with environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant (R290), ensuring eco-friendly operation. Its front-breathing design allows for installation in tight spaces, and the front-accessible condensing unit simplifies maintenance. Equipped with easy-to-mount casters (two lockable), this refrigerator is both mobile and practical for various environments. The interior is well-lit with LED lighting, enhancing visibility while showcasing your products. It features a mirror-finish stainless steel interior complemented by a high-grade stainless steel coved corner floor, making cleaning easy. Each door includes removable magnetic gaskets, facilitating easy maintenance. It has a depth of 24 inches that conserves important workspace while providing a width of 61 inches and a height of 39.5 inches. Built with an exterior of black powder-coated steel, it meets NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage, ensuring safety and reliability in commercial settings. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 61 Inches Depth: 24 Inches Height: 39.5 Inches Weight: 365 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air ABB60G measures 61 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39 1/2 inches in height, providing wide space for storing beverages while maintaining a compact design suitable for bar environments.</li><li>Weighing 365 lbs, it is well constructed to handle the demands of busy commercial settings.</li><li>Operating at 8 Amps with a voltage of 115 Volts and a frequency of 60 Hertz, it runs on a standard 1-phase electrical system, making it easy to integrate into existing setups.</li><li>Equipped with casters, facilitating easy movement for cleaning, maintenance, or repositioning within your establishment.</li><li>It features a side-mounted compressor and a front-breathing design, ensuring efficient cooling while allowing for flexible placement against walls or other surfaces.</li><li>Has a can capacity of 72 six-packs and a total capacity of 16.7 cu. ft., making it perfect for keeping a variety of beverages readily available for customers.</li><li>It comes with 2 swing glass doors, allowing for easy visibility and access to stored items, enhancing the customer experience in a bar setting.</li><li>With a rich black exterior finish, the unit is not only functional but also aesthetically pleasing. It includes LED lighting for improved visibility inside the refrigerator, showcasing its contents effectively.</li><li>Maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, ensuring that beverages are kept at optimal serving temperatures for freshness and flavor.</li><li>Powered by a 1/3 HP compressor, it uses R-290 refrigerant, which is eco-friendly. The unit includes 4 shelves for organized storage and has a NEMA 5-15P plug type for easy connectivity. </li><li>It also comes with a full two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year compressor warranty, assuring quality and reliability.</li></ul>', 'published', '[]', 'ABB60G', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 3999, 2365, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 49.00, NULL, 39.50, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 365.00, NULL, NULL, 49, '2024-10-19 07:05:29', '2024-12-17 07:16:57', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'abb60g.webp', 'physical', NULL, 1730, 1, 5, 7, 0, '<p>2 Years Part and Labor Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1, '[{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0O