(1669, 'Arctic Air ABB72  72 Double Door Solid Back Bar Refrigerator', '<p>The Arctic Air ABB72 72 Double Door Solid Back Bar Refrigerator is designed for optimal performance and convenience, featuring a top constructed from 1.59-inch solid foamed stainless steel for enhanced insulation and durability. It operates on a self-contained capillary tube system that utilizes environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant (R290), aligning with eco-friendly practices. Its front-breathing design allows for versatile placement in tight spaces, while the front-accessible condensing unit facilitates straightforward cleaning and maintenance. Additionally, it includes easy-to-mount casters, two of which are lockable, ensuring mobility and stability. The interior of the ABB72 is illuminated with LED lighting, which not only highlights the contents but also promotes energy efficiency. The mirror-finish stainless steel interior is complemented by a high-grade stainless steel coved corner floor, which is easy to clean and maintain. Each door is fitted with removable magnetic gaskets, simplifying the cleaning process. The refrigerator maintains a depth of 24 inches, conserving workspace while providing a generous width of 73 inches and a height of 39.5 inches. Constructed with a durable black powder-coated steel exterior, the ABB72 has been tested to meet NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage, making it an ideal choice for commercial use. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 73 Inches Depth: 24 Inches Height: 39.5 Inches Weight: 360 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air ABB72 measures 73 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39 1/2 inches in height, providing a substantial storage solution while maintaining a compact footprint suitable for bars and restaurants.</li><li>With a shipping weight of 360 lbs, this back bar refrigerator is designed for durability and stability, ensuring it can handle the demands of a busy commercial environment.</li><li>Operates at 6 Amps with a voltage of 115 Volts and a frequency of 60 Hertz, making it compatible with standard electrical systems typically found in food service establishments. It is designed for a 1-phase power supply.</li><li>Equipped with casters, the refrigerator allows for easy movement, facilitating cleaning and repositioning within the bar area as needed.</li><li>Featuring a side-mounted compressor with a front-breathing design, the unit ensures optimal airflow and cooling efficiency, allowing it to be placed against walls or in confined spaces.</li><li>With a total can capacity of 84 six-packs and a total storage capacity of 20.7 cu. ft., this refrigerator provides wide space for </li><li>keeping a wide selection of beverages easily accessible for service.</li><li>Includes 3 swing solid doors, providing secure storage while maintaining a professional appearance in the bar setting.</li><li>Has a rich black exterior finish, complemented by features such as LED lighting, which enhances the visibility and accessibility of the stored items.</li><li>Operates within a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, ensuring that beverages remain at optimal serving temperatures for freshness and quality.</li><li>Powered by a 1/3 HP compressor, it utilizes environmentally friendly R-290 refrigerant. It includes 6 shelves for organized storage and is equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug type for straightforward electrical connection. </li><li>Additionally, it comes with a full two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year compressor warranty, assuring its quality and reliability.</li></ul>', 'published', '[]', 'ABB72', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 3299, 2285, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 49.00, NULL, 39.50, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 360.00, NULL, NULL, 31, '2024-10-19 07:05:29', '2024-12-17 07:17:41', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'abb72.webp', 'physical', NULL, 1487, 1, 5, 7, 0, '<p>2 Years Part and Labor Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1,