(1670, 'Arctic Air ABB60 60 Double Door Solid Back Bar Refrigerator', '<p>The Arctic Air ABB60 60 Double Door Solid Back Bar Refrigerator combines functionality with advanced features, making it an excellent addition to any commercial bar setting. The top is constructed from 1.59-inch solid foamed stainless steel, providing durability and ease of maintenance. This refrigerator employs a self-contained capillary tube system that utilizes environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant (R290), ensuring compliance with modern eco-friendly standards. Its front-accessible condensing unit simplifies cleaning and maintenance, while the front-breathing design enhances airflow and efficiency. It is equipped with easy-to-mount casters, two of which are lockable, ensuring mobility and stability. Internally, the refrigerator has interior LED lighting for improved visibility and a mirror-finish stainless steel interior, complete with a high-grade stainless steel coved corner floor for easy cleaning. The exterior features black powder-coated steel for a sleek, professional appearance. Each door includes removable magnetic gaskets that facilitate cleaning, and the electronic thermostat with a digital LED display allows for precise temperature control from the front access panel. With a compact design measuring 49 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39.5 inches in height, and meeting NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage, it is tailored to meet the demands of any busy bar environment while conserving valuable workspace. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 49 Inches Depth: 24 Inches Height: 39.5 Inches Weight: 320 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air ABB60 measures 49 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39 1/2 inches in height, designed specifically to fit under counters while maximizing storage efficiency in bar environments.</li><li>With a shipping weight of 320 lbs, this solid refrigerator ensures stability and durability, making it suitable for the high demands of busy bars and restaurants.</li><li>Operating at 3 Amps, 115 Volts, and 60 Hertz with a 1-phase electrical configuration, the refrigerator is compatible with standard electrical setups found in commercial settings.</li><li>Has a total capacity of 12.5 cu. ft., allowing for efficient organization of beverages, with a canning capacity of up to 48 six-packs, making it ideal for bar operations.</li><li>The unit comes with casters, enhancing mobility for easy repositioning during cleaning or setup changes, while also facilitating accessibility to the compressor for maintenance.</li><li>It features a side-mounted compressor with front breathing, ensuring efficient airflow and operation while maintaining a compact design.</li><li>Has two swing-style glass doors, providing visibility to contents while ensuring easy access for staff during busy service hours.</li><li>Designed to maintain a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, it effectively preserves the freshness and quality of drinks and perishable items.</li><li>Constructed with a rich black exterior finish, it complements bar aesthetics while featuring LED lighting for improved visibility inside, enhancing both functionality and appeal.</li><li>Powered by a 1/3 HP compressor, it utilizes R-290 refrigerant for environmentally friendly cooling. The refrigerator includes 4 adjustable shelves for flexible storage solutions and is equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug for straightforward electrical connections. </li><li>Additionally, it is backed by full two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year compressor warranty, ensuring long-term reliability.</li></ul>', 'published', '[\"products\\/abb60-1.webp\"]', 'ABB60', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 3599, 1950, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 49.00, NULL, 39.50, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 320.00, 1, NULL, 38, '2024-10-19 07:05:30', '2024-12-30 06:59:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'abb60.webp', 'physical', NULL, 1287, 1, 5, 7, 0, '<p>2 Years Part and Labor Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1, '[{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/S96N738DchVz2Ya7cNbt0VFb7WA5b2DfTCeUIu2v.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 49.00, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 39.50, NULL, 0.00, 1, NULL, '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', '10', 1, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1671, 'Arctic Air AMT72R 72 Triple Door Mega-Top Sandwich/ Salad Prep Table', '<p>The Arctic Air AMT72R 72 Triple Door Mega-Top Sandwich/Salad Prep Table is engineered for efficiency in food preparation, featuring added space for extra rows of pans, enhancing its utility in busy kitchen environments. Included with it are 1/6-size plastic pans, which are designed to fit perfectly into the preparation area. A full-length, heavy-duty cutting board provides wide space for slicing and assembling ingredients, while the self-closing doors, which remain open at 90 degrees, ensure easy access without compromising on safety. Constructed with solid door construction and a foamed-in-place recessed handle, this table is durable and user-friendly. The exterior of the AMT72R consists of a full stainless steel front and sides, ensuring a smooth and professional appearance, while the interior features a bright white epoxy-coated aluminum sidewall liner complemented by a full high-grade stainless steel floor with coved corners, making it easy to clean and maintain. Magnetic door gaskets are designed for convenience, as they can be removed and replaced without tools. An electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display allows for precise temperature control and easy reading. Standard with all units, the easy-to-mount casters (two of which are locking) provide mobility, and the unit has been tested to NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage, confirming its reliability and safety in commercial use. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 71 1/2 Inches Depth: 34 1/2 Inches Height: 43 5/16 Inches Weight: 450 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air AMT72R measures 71 1/2 inches in width, 34 1/2 inches in depth, and 43 5/16 inches in height, providing a spacious work surface that is ideal for sandwich and salad preparation in commercial kitchens.</li><li>This prep table has a shipping weight of 450 lb., indicating strong construction suitable for high-volume food service environments.</li><li>Operates at 4.3 Amps with a voltage of 120 Volts, designed to connect to standard electrical systems in restaurants and catering facilities.</li><li>Offering a total storage capacity of 18 cu. ft., this table is designed to efficiently store a wide variety of ingredients, keeping them organized and accessible during food preparation.</li><li>Featuring a side/rear breathing compressor, it ensures optimal airflow and cooling efficiency. The unit is powered by a 1/2 HP compressor, which provides strong and reliable refrigeration performance.</li><li>Includes 3 doors, allowing for easy access to stored ingredients while maintaining a streamlined workflow during busy service hours.</li><li>It is equipped with 3 shelves, providing wide space for organization and storage of various food items and supplies.</li><li>Utilizing environmentally friendly R-290 refrigerant, it supports efficient cooling while minimizing environmental impact.</li><li>Mega Top design holds 18 pans of 1/6 size, providing a versatile and easily accessible ingredient station. The nominal width of the prep area is 72 inches, with a cutting board depth of 11 1/2 inches, ideal for efficient food preparation.</li><li>Work surface is set at a height of 36 5/16 inches, ensuring ergonomic access for food preparation tasks. It is constructed from stainless steel, offering durability and ease of cleaning. </li><li>Additionally, it comes with a full two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year compressor warranty, ensuring long-term reliability and service.</li></ul>', 'published', '[\"amt72r.webp\",\"amt72r.webp\",\"amt72r.webp\",\"amt72r.webp\"]', 'AMT72R', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 5999, 3225, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 29.00, 1, 43.50, 1, 34.50, 1, 450.00, 1, NULL, 42, '2024-10-19 07:05:30', '2024-11-12 08:10:46', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'amt72r.webp', 'physical', NULL, 2121, 1, 5, 7, 0, '<p>2 Years Part and Labor Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, NULL, '', 0,