(1672, 'Arctic Air AMT60R 60 Double Door Mega-Top Sandwich/ Salad Prep Table', '<p>The Arctic Air AMT60R 60 Double Door Mega-Top Sandwich/Salad Prep Table is a highly functional unit designed to optimize food preparation, offering added space for extra rows of pans. It includes 1/6-size plastic pans for organizing ingredients and a full-length, heavy-duty cutting board for wide prep space. Its self-closing doors, which remain open at 90 degrees, provide ease of access. Built with solid door construction and a foamed-in-place recessed handle, the design ensures durability and user comfort. The stainless steel exterior gives it a modern look while the bright white epoxy-coated aluminum interior makes it easy to clean. This prep table also features magnetic door gaskets, which are removable and replaceable without tools, ensuring hassle-free maintenance. The electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display allows precise temperature control for storing fresh ingredients. Mounted on easy-to-install casters (two of which are lockable), the unit offers mobility. Additionally, the single and double stainless steel overshelf systems offer added storage options. Tested to meet NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage, the AMT60R ensures safety and reliability in commercial kitchens. Its dimensions are 61 1/4 in width, 34 1/2 in depth, and 43 5/16 in height. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 61 1/4 Inches Depth: 34 1/2 Inches Height: 43 5/16 Inches Weight: 385 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air AMT60R has a width of 61 1/4 inches, a depth of 34 1/2 inches, and a height of 43 5/16 inches, designed to fit perfectly into commercial kitchen spaces while providing a generous work area for food preparation.</li><li>Has a shipping weight of 385 lb., reflecting its solid construction, which is suitable for the demands of high-volume food service environments.</li><li>Operating at 4.3 Amps with a frequency of 60 Hertz, it is compatible with standard electrical systems in most commercial kitchens, ensuring easy installation and operation.</li><li>Features a substantial capacity of 15.5 cu. ft., allowing wide space for various ingredients, condiments, and other items, keeping them organized and readily accessible.</li><li>Comes equipped with casters, enhancing mobility for easy repositioning within the kitchen or during cleaning.</li><li>Utilizing a side/rear breathing compressor, this model efficiently maintains temperature while providing optimal airflow. The 1/2 HP compressor ensures effective cooling performance for food safety.</li><li>Featuring 2 swing doors, the prep table allows for easy access to ingredients, facilitating a smooth workflow during meal preparation.</li><li>Includes 2 shelves, providing additional organization for food items and supplies, enhancing kitchen efficiency.</li><li>Utilizing eco-friendly R-290 refrigerant, it supports effective cooling while reducing environmental impact. The operating temperature range is maintained between 33 - 41 degrees F, ensuring food safety.</li><li>Constructed from stainless steel and aluminum, ensuring durability and easy cleaning. It holds 24 pans of 1/6 size, providing efficient access to ingredients and maximizing preparation space. </li><li>Backed by a two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year warranty on the compressor, this prep table offers long-term reliability for commercial kitchen use.</li></ul>', 'published', '[\"amt60r.webp\",\"amt60r.webp\",\"amt60r.webp\",\"amt60r.webp\"]', 'AMT60R', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 3999, 2799, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 61.50, 1, 43.50, 1, 34.50, 1, 385.00, 1, NULL, 47, '2024-10-19 07:05:30', '2024-11-12 08:10:37', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'amt60r.webp', 'physical', NULL, 1879, 1, 5, 7, 0, '<p>2 Years Part and Labor Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai