(1673, 'Arctic Air AMT28R 28 Single Door Mega-Top Sandwich/ Salad Prep Table', '<p>The Arctic Air AMT28R 28 Single Door Mega-Top Sandwich/Salad Prep Table provides added space to accommodate extra rows of pans, ensuring efficient preparation in busy kitchens. It comes with 1/6-size plastic pans and features a full-length, heavy-duty cutting board for enhanced functionality. The self-closing doors remain open at 90 degrees for ease of access. Its solid door construction with a foamed-in-place recessed handle and stainless steel exterior ensures durability and long-lasting performance. The interior is built for easy maintenance with a bright white epoxy-coated aluminum sidewall liner and a high-grade stainless steel floor with coved corners. The magnetic door gaskets are removable and replaceable without tools, simplifying upkeep. The electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display provides accurate temperature control, while easy-to-mount casters (two of which lock) ensure mobility. Additional single and double stainless steel overshelf systems are available for added versatility. Certified to NSF Standard 7, it meets the requirements for open food storage. It measures 29 in width, 34 1/2 in depth, and 43 5/16 in height. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 29 Inches Depth: 34 1/2 Inches Height: 43 5/16 Inches Weight: 230 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air AMT28R features a compact design with a width of 29 inches, a depth of 34 1/2 inches, and a height of 43 5/16 inches, providing an efficient prep station for smaller kitchens or tight spaces.</li><li>Has a shipping weight of 230 lb., making it a relatively lightweight option for a commercial prep table, while still maintaining durability and strength.</li><li>Runs on 3 Amps, with a frequency of 60 Hertz and a 1 Phase electrical configuration. It operates with 115 Volts, making it compatible with standard kitchen power setups.</li><li>With a capacity of 6.5 cu. ft., the unit offers wide storage for food and ingredients, supporting efficient kitchen workflows during busy service times.</li><li>Comes with casters, allowing easy movement for cleaning or repositioning in the kitchen, ensuring flexibility in layout changes.</li><li>The bottom-mounted compressor is designed with a side/rear breathing system for optimal cooling performance. It uses a 3/8 HP compressor, ensuring the unit maintains consistent temperatures, crucial for food safety.</li><li>Features 1 swing door with a solid construction, providing excellent insulation and energy efficiency. The left/right hinge configuration allows for flexibility in door placement based on kitchen layout.</li><li>Has 1 adjustable shelf inside, giving flexibility to organize ingredients or containers as needed. The shelf is designed to accommodate a variety of storage needs.</li><li>Using R-290 refrigerant, the unit maintains a temperature range between 33 - 41 degrees F, ensuring food safety. The air-cooled refrigeration system ensures the internal environment remains consistent and energy efficient.</li><li>Mega Top design holds 12 pans of 1/6 size, with a nominal width of 27 inches and a cutting board depth of 9 inches for wide ingredient preparation space. </li><li>It is made from stainless steel and aluminum and includes a two-year parts and labor warranty, plus a five-year compressor warranty.<br><br> </li></ul>', 'published', '[\"amt28r.webp\",\"amt28r.webp\",\"amt28r.webp\"]', 'AMT28R', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 2999, 1699, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 49.00, 1, 43.50, 1, 34.50, 1, 230.00, 1, NULL, 42, '2024-10-19 07:05:30', '2024-11-12 08:10:29', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'amt28r.webp', 'physical', NULL, 2131, 1, 5, 7, 0, '<p>2 Years Part and Labor Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/do