(1674, 'Arctic Air AST72R 72 Triple Door Sandwich/ Salad Prep Table', '<p>The Arctic Air AST72R 72 Triple Door Sandwich/Salad Prep Table is expertly designed for efficiency and functionality in food preparation environments, featuring 1/6 size 49 deep plastic pans included for quick access to ingredients. A full-length, heavy-duty cutting board is also provided to facilitate perfect food preparation. It has self-closing doors that remain open at 90 degrees for easy access, while the solid door construction features a foamed-in-place recessed handle for durability. The exterior cabinet is made of full stainless steel on the front and sides, enhancing its longevity and aesthetic appeal. Internally, the cabinet is equipped with a bright white epoxy-coated aluminum sidewall liner and a high-grade stainless steel floor with coved corners to facilitate easy cleaning. The magnetic door gaskets can be removed and replaced without tools, making maintenance straightforward. An electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display offers precise temperature control, and easy-to-mount casters (two locking) ensure mobility. The table also holds single and double stainless steel over-shelf systems, expanding storage options. This prep table is tested to meet NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage, making it ideal for commercial use. The dimensions are 71 1/2 in width, 30 in depth, and 43 5/16 in height. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 71 1/2 Inches Depth: 30 Inches Height: 43 5/16 Inches Weight: 425 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air AST72R features a spacious design with a width of 71 1/2 inches, a depth of 30 inches, and a height of 43 5/16 inches, providing an expansive work area for sandwich and salad preparation.</li><li>Has a shipping weight of 425 lb., ensuring solid construction suitable for high-volume commercial use while remaining manageable for installation.</li><li>It operates on 4.3 Amps, at a frequency of 60 Hertz, and is configured for 1 Phase electrical systems, running on 120 Volts, making </li><li>it compatible with standard commercial kitchen power.</li><li>With a capacity of 18 cu. ft., the unit offers wide storage for fresh ingredients, allowing for efficient workflow in busy kitchens and food service environments.</li><li>Equipped with casters, facilitating easy mobility for cleaning, repositioning, or storage, enhancing versatility in kitchen arrangements.</li><li>Features a rear-mounted compressor that operates with a side/rear breathing design for efficient cooling. With a 1/2 HP compressor, it ensures reliable temperature control for food safety.</li><li>Three swing doors are designed with solid construction to provide excellent insulation, maintaining internal temperatures while allowing easy access to stored ingredients.</li><li>Interior includes 3 adjustable shelves, providing flexibility in organizing various ingredients or containers based on the needs of the kitchen.</li><li>Using R-290 refrigerant, the unit maintains a temperature range of 33 - 41 degrees F, essential for preserving the freshness of perishable items. The air-cooled refrigeration system supports consistent performance.</li><li>The standard top holds 18 pans of 1/6 size with a cutting board measuring 72 inches wide by 11 1/2 inches deep, and a work surface height of 35 5/16 inches. </li><li>Built with stainless steel and aluminum, it comes with a two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year compressor warranty.<br> </li></ul>', 'published', '[\"ast72r.webp\",\"abb60g.webp\",\"amt60r.webp\",\"abb60.webp\"]', 'AST72R', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 4999, 2799, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 27.00, 1, 43.50, 1, 30.00, 1, 425.00, 1, NULL, 41, '2024-10-19 07:05:30', '2024-11-12 08:10:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'ast72r.webp', 'physical', NULL, 1866, 1, 5, 7, 0, '<p>2 Years Part and Labor Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",