(1675, 'Arctic Air AST60R 60 Double Door Sandwich/ Salad Prep Table', '<p>The Arctic Air AST60R 60 Double Door Sandwich/Salad Prep Table is expertly designed for commercial food preparation, featuring 1/6 size 49 deep plastic pans to optimize ingredient accessibility. It comes with a full-length, heavy-duty cutting board, enhancing food prep efficiency. It is equipped with self-closing doors that stay open at a 90-degree angle for easy access, and the solid door construction incorporates a foamed-in-place recessed handle for durability and a professional look. Constructed with a full stainless steel exterior, the cabinet provides longevity and easy maintenance. Inside, the bright white epoxy-coated aluminum sidewall liner complements the high-grade stainless steel floor with coved corners, ensuring easy cleaning. Magnetic door gaskets can be removed and replaced without tools for convenience. An electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display allows for precise temperature control, while easy-to-mount casters (with two lockable) facilitate mobility. This prep table also holds single and double stainless steel over-shelf systems for additional storage options. It meets NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage, making it an ideal choice for any commercial kitchen. The dimensions are 61 1/4 in width, 30 in depth, and 43 5/16 in height. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 61 1/4 Inches Depth: 30 Inches Height: 43 5/16 Inches Weight: 385 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air AST60R measures 61 1/4 inches wide, 30 inches deep, and 43 5/16 inches high, providing wide workspace for food preparation.</li><li>Has a shipping weight of 385 lb., ensuring durable construction for commercial kitchen use.</li><li>Operating on 4.3 Amps, 60 Hertz, 1 Phase, and 120 Volts, it’s compatible with standard commercial electrical systems.</li><li>Offers a generous 15.5 cu. ft. of storage capacity, allowing for efficient organization of ingredients.</li><li>Equipped with casters, this prep table provides easy mobility for cleaning and repositioning.</li><li>Features a rear-mounted compressor with a side/rear breathing design and operates with a 1/2 HP compressor for effective cooling.</li><li>Includes two solid swing doors that provide easy access to the refrigerated contents.</li><li>Comes with 2 adjustable shelves, allowing flexibility in storage organization.</li><li>Utilizing R-290 refrigerant, it maintains a temperature range of 33 - 41 degrees F, equipped with an air-cooled system.</li><li>Standard top holds 16 pans of 1/6 size, featuring a cutting board with a nominal width of 60 inches, depth of 30 inches, and a work surface height of 36 5/16 inches. </li><li>Constructed with stainless steel and aluminum, it is backed by a two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year compressor warranty.<br> </li></ul>', 'published', '[\"ast60r.webp\",\"abb72g.webp\",\"ast72r.webp\",\"app48r.webp\"]', 'AST60R', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 4999, 2465, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 27.00, 1, 43.50, 1, 30.00, 1, 385.00, 1, NULL, 30, '2024-10-19 07:05:30', '2024-11-12 08:10:15', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'ast60r.webp', 'physical', NULL, 1723, 1, 5, 7, 0, '<p>2 Years Part and Labor Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 27.00, 1, 30.00, 1, 43.50, 1, 0.00, 1, NULL, '[\"good 