(1676, 'Arctic Air AST48R 48 Double Door Sandwich/ Salad Prep Table', '<p>The Arctic Air AST48R 48 Double Door Sandwich/Salad Prep Table is meticulously designed to enhance food preparation efficiency in commercial kitchens. Included with it are 1/6 size 49 deep plastic pans, providing wide storage for ingredients. The full-length, heavy-duty cutting board is perfect for prepping meals. The self-closing doors are engineered to remain open at a 90-degree angle, allowing for quick access. Constructed with a solid door and foamed-in-place recessed handle, the durability and functionality of this prep table are paramount. The exterior features a strong full stainless steel construction that ensures longevity and ease of maintenance, while the interior has a bright white epoxy-coated aluminum sidewall liner paired with a high-grade stainless steel floor that includes coved corners for simple cleaning. The magnetic door gaskets can be easily removed and replaced without the need for tools, enhancing usability. An electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display provides precise temperature control for optimal food storage. Standard easy-to-mount casters (two locking) ensure the unit is mobile, making it convenient to reposition as needed. This prep table also supports single and double stainless steel over-shelf systems for additional storage options. It meets the NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage, ensuring it is suitable for commercial use. The dimensions are 48 1/4 inches in width, 30 inches in depth, and 43 3/8 inches in height. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 48 1/4 Inches Depth: 30 Inches Height: 43 3/8 Inches Weight: 300 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air AST48R measures 48 1/4 inches wide, 30 inches deep, and 43 3/8 inches high, providing a compact and functional workspace for food preparation.</li><li>It has a shipping weight of 300 lb., indicating its strong construction for commercial kitchen environments.</li><li>Operating on 4.3 Amps, 60 Hertz, 1 Phase, and 120 Volts, it is designed to meet standard commercial electrical requirements.</li><li>Offers a capacity of 12 cu. ft., allowing for efficient organization and easy access to ingredients.</li><li>Equipped with casters, this prep table enhances mobility for cleaning and repositioning within the kitchen.</li><li>Features a bottom-mounted compressor with a side/rear breathing design, ensuring optimal cooling performance with a 1/2 HP compressor.</li><li>Includes two solid swing doors for convenient access to refrigerated contents.</li><li>Comes with 2 adjustable shelves, providing flexibility in organizing storage space for various ingredients.</li><li>Utilizing R-290 refrigerant, it maintains a temperature range of 33 - 41 degrees F and is equipped with an air-cooled system.</li><li>Standard top holds12 pans of 1/6 size, with a nominal width of 48 inches, a cutting board depth of 11 1/2 inches, and a total height of 48 1/2 inches. </li><li>Constructed with stainless steel and aluminum, it is backed by a two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year compressor warranty.<br> </li></ul>', 'published', '[\"ast48r.webp\",\"amt28r.webp\",\"ast72r.webp\"]', 'AST48R', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 5299, 2275, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 27.00, 1, 43.50, 1, 30.00, 1, 300.00, 1, NULL, 40, '2024-10-19 07:05:30', '2024-11-12 08:10:07', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'ast48r.webp', 'physical', NULL, 1212, 1, 5, 7, 0, '<p>2 Years Part and Labor Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 27.00, 1, 30.00, 1, 43.50, 1, 0.00, 1, NULL, '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', '10', 1, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
