(1677, 'Arctic Air APP48R 48 Single Door Stainless Steel Pizza Prep Table', '<p>The Arctic Air APP48R 48 Single Door Stainless Steel Pizza Prep Table is designed for efficiency and durability in commercial kitchens. With dimensions of 48 inches in width, 32.25 inches in depth, and 41 inches in height, this prep table offers a spacious work surface with a capacity of 12 cu. ft. It operates at 5 Amps and utilizes a 1/2 HP compressor, ensuring effective cooling within the 33 to 41 degrees Fahrenheit temperature range. Constructed from stainless steel and aluminum, it features a swing door style for easy access. The side-mounted compressor is designed for side and rear breathing, enhancing airflow for optimal cooling. The table includes one shelf and is equipped with a mega top that holds six 1/3-size pans, providing wide space for ingredients. The NEMA 5-15P plug type allows for easy connection to standard outlets, making it a versatile addition to any kitchen. Weighing 310 lbs, this prep table is strong and built for the demands of high-traffic food preparation environments. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 48 Inches Depth: 32.5 Inches Height: 41 Inches Weight: 310 lbs</p>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air APP48R measures 48 inches in width, 32 1/4 inches in depth, and 41 inches in height, providing wide workspace for pizza preparation while ensuring a compact footprint suitable for various kitchen layouts.</li><li>Has a shipping weight of 310 lbs, indicating a solid construction designed to withstand the rigors of a busy kitchen environment.</li><li>Operating on 5 Amps at 60 Hertz, the unit is designed for 1 Phase power and requires a voltage of 120 Volts, making it compatible with standard electrical systems in most commercial settings.</li><li>With a total capacity of 12 cu. ft., this pizza prep table offers wide storage space for ingredients and toppings, helping streamline food preparation processes.</li><li>The side-mounted compressor ensures efficient cooling while saving valuable space, allowing for easy access and maintenance.</li><li>Featuring a cold wall refrigeration system, the APP48R provides consistent cooling throughout the unit, maintaining optimal temperature for perishable items.</li><li>The prep table is constructed from durable stainless steel and aluminum, ensuring longevity and ease of cleaning, which is essential in a fast-paced kitchen environment.</li><li>The table includes 1 swing door, providing easy access to the storage compartment, and facilitating quick retrieval of ingredients during busy service times.</li><li>Designed to accommodate 6 (1/3 size) pans in the mega top section, the APP48R allows for organized and accessible ingredient storage, improving workflow efficiency during pizza preparation.</li><li>Operates within a temperature range of 33 - 41 degrees F, ensuring that ingredients remain fresh and safe for use, while also complying with food safety standards.</li></ul>', 'published', '[\"app48r.webp\",\"amt28r.webp\",\"ast48r.webp\"]', 'APP48R', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 3599, 2599, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 29.00, 1, 41.00, 1, 35.50, 1, 310.00, 1, NULL, 53, '2024-10-19 07:05:30', '2024-11-12 08:09:55', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'app48r.webp', 'physical', NULL, 1872, 1, 5, 7, 0, '<p>2 Years Part and Labor Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]'