(1678, 'Arctic Air AUC48R 48.25 Double Door Under-Counter Refrigerator', '<p>The Arctic Air AUC48R 48.25 Double Door Under-Counter Refrigerator is designed for commercial use, offering a shipping weight of 265 lbs and compact dimensions of 48 1/4 inches in width, 30 inches in depth, and 35 5/8 inches in height. With a capacity of 12 cu. ft., it is powered by a 3 amp draw at 115 volts and features a 3/8 HP bottom-mounted compressor, ensuring efficient cooling with a side/rear breathing design that maximizes airflow. Equipped with two solid swing doors, the AUC48R features self-closing doors for enhanced energy efficiency. Inside, it includes two adjustable shelves, allowing for flexible storage configurations. It operates with environmentally friendly R-600A refrigerant and maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, ideal for perishable goods. The NEMA 5-15P plug type and left/right hinge location make it versatile for various kitchen setups, ensuring reliable performance in busy food service environments. Weight &amp; Dimensions Shipping weight: 265 lbs Width: 48 1/4 Inches Depth: 30 Inches Height: 35 5/8 Inches</p>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air AUC48R measures 48.25 inches in width, 30 inches in depth, and 35.625 inches in height, designed to fit snugly under counters while providing wide refrigeration space.</li><li>With a shipping weight of 265 lbs, this refrigerator offers solid construction for durability and reliability in a commercial kitchen environment.</li><li>It operates on 115 volts and consumes 3 amps, making it energy-efficient and suitable for various kitchen setups without overloading circuits.</li><li>Has a total capacity of 12 cubic feet, providing sufficient storage for a variety of perishable items, making it ideal for busy food service operations.</li><li>Featuring a bottom-mounted compressor, it allows for easy access and maintenance while enhancing the unit\'s cooling efficiency by utilizing natural convection.</li><li>Side/rear breathing compressor-style optimizes airflow, ensuring efficient cooling and preventing overheating even in confined kitchen spaces.</li><li>Includes two solid swing doors that offer easy access to the refrigerated items, designed to close automatically for improved energy efficiency.</li><li>Has self-closing doors, enhancing convenience and ensuring that the refrigerator maintains optimal temperatures by minimizing cold air loss when doors are left ajar.</li><li>Equipped with a 3/8 HP compressor, the AUC48R delivers reliable cooling performance, maintaining consistent temperatures for the safe storage of perishables.</li><li>Using R-600A refrigerant, this refrigerator is environmentally friendly and operates within a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees Fahrenheit, ensuring that all stored items remain fresh and properly chilled.</li></ul>', 'published', '[\"auc48r.webp\",\"abb60g.webp\",\"abb60.webp\"]', 'AUC48R', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 2788, 1849, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 27.00, NULL, 35.50, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 265.00, 1, NULL, 44, '2024-10-19 07:05:30', '2024-12-16 07:42:48', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'auc48r.webp', 'physical', NULL, 1257, 1, 5, 7, 0, '<p>2 Years Part and Labor Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1, '[{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/yZrvWP3JIrdT43qH7iWEHEQoruDGPhWDewAQHVwM.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'Kg',