(1679, 'Arctic AUC27R 27.88 Air Single Door Under-Counter Refrigerator', '<p>The Arctic Air AUC27R 27.88 Single Door Under-Counter Refrigerator is engineered for efficiency in commercial settings, with a shipping weight of 185 lbs and dimensions of 27 7/8 inches in width, 30 inches in depth, and 35 5/8 inches in height. This under-counter refrigerator offers a capacity of 6.5 cu. ft., operating on 1.5 amps at 115 volts with a 3/8 HP bottom-mounted compressor, ensuring optimal cooling performance. Designed for convenience, the unit features a solid swing door that is self-closing, enhancing energy efficiency. Inside, it includes one shelf for organized storage. The refrigerator utilizes R-600A refrigerant, maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, and comes equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug type for easy installation in various kitchen environments. Weight &amp; Dimensions Shipping weight: 185lbs Width: 27 7/8 Inches Depth: 30 Inches Height: 35 5/8 Inches</p>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air AUC27R features a width of 27.88 inches, a depth of 30 inches, and a height of 35.625 inches, making it ideal for under-counter placement in commercial settings.</li><li>Has a shipping weight of 185 lbs, indicating its solid construction, suitable for heavy-duty use in busy kitchens.</li><li>Operating on 115 volts and drawing 1.5 amps, this refrigerator ensures efficient performance while minimizing energy consumption, and is equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug, allowing for easy and safe connectivity to standard electrical outlets.</li><li>With a total capacity of 6.5 cubic feet, the AUC27R provides wide storage space for perishable items, keeping them organized and easily accessible.</li><li>Bottom-mounted compressor design allows for better accessibility and maintenance, along with efficient temperature management.</li><li>Featuring a side/rear breathing compressor style, it is optimized for air circulation, making it suitable for placement in various kitchen configurations.</li><li>Comes with a solid swing door, facilitating convenient access to the refrigerator\'s contents while ensuring excellent temperature retention.</li><li>Designed with self-closing doors, this refrigerator enhances energy efficiency and convenience, ensuring that the door closes securely after each use.</li><li>Operates with a 3/8 HP compressor, providing strong performance for maintaining optimal refrigeration temperatures.</li><li>Utilizing R-600A refrigerant, the AUC27R is environmentally friendly and efficient, ensuring effective cooling with a reduced environmental footprint. </li><li>It maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees Fahrenheit, making it suitable for a variety of perishable goods.</li></ul>', 'published', '[\"auc27r.webp\",\"abb60.webp\",\"auc48r.webp\"]', 'AUC27R', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 2999, 1399, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 27.00, NULL, 35.50, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 185.00, 1, NULL, 38, '2024-10-19 07:05:30', '2024-12-16 07:41:57', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'auc27r.webp', 'physical', NULL, 2778, 1, 5, 7, 0, '<p>2 Years Part and Labor Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1, '[{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/wpIIik5ukSYj9q2VM3MMKMOjOXiGflHbuXBUeNu3.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 27.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 35.50, NULL, 0.00, 1, NULL, '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', '10', 1, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1680, 'Arctic Air ARGDM23 27 Single Glass Door Reach-In Merchandiser Refrigerator', '<p>The Arctic Air ARGDM23 27 Single Glass Door Reach-In Merchandiser Refrigerator is a smooth and efficient solution for displaying beverages and other perishable items. With a width of 27 inches, a depth of 40 inches, and a height of 81.5 inches, it is designed to fit perfectly into retail spaces while providing wide storage in a single section. Its swing door style allows for easy access, while the black exterior finish offers a modern aesthetic that complements any environment. Powered by a 1/5 HP compressor, this refrigerator features a self-contained, rear-mounted refrigeration system that enhances efficiency and makes maintenance straightforward. The unit is designed to maintain optimal temperatures for stored products, ensuring freshness and quality for customers. This combination of functionality and design makes the Arctic Air ARGDM23 an excellent choice for businesses looking to enhance their merchandising capabilities.  </p><p><span class=\"ui-provider\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Weight &amp; Dimensions:</strong></span></p><ul><li><span class=\"ui-provider\" dir=\"ltr\">Width: 27 Inches</span></li><li><span class=\"ui-provider\" dir=\"ltr\">Depth: 40 Inches</span></li><li><span class=\"ui-provider\" dir=\"ltr\">Height: 81.5 Inches</span></li></ul>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air ARGDM23 measures 27 inches in width, 40 inches in depth, and 81.5 inches in height, making it an ideal size for maximizing product display without taking up excessive floor space.</li><li>This refrigerator features a swing door design, allowing easy access to the interior while providing a clear view of the products displayed, enhancing customer engagement.</li><li>Finished in a rich black exterior, the ARGDM23 not only provides a modern aesthetic but also ensures durability and easy maintenance, fitting well in various retail environments.</li><li>Operates with a 1/5 HP compressor, offering efficient cooling performance while maintaining energy efficiency, ideal for busy commercial settings.</li><li>Designed as a 1-section unit, this refrigerator allows for organized storage of products, making it easy to keep items visible and accessible for customers and staff alike.</li><li>It features a self-contained, rear-mounted refrigeration system, which simplifies installation and maintenance while ensuring effective cooling throughout the unit.</li><li>The rear-mounted design optimizes airflow, ensuring even temperature distribution and enhancing the longevity of stored products.</li></ul>', 'published', '[\"argdm23.webp\",\"ar23.webp\",\"awr25.webp\"]', 'ARGDM23', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 3500, 1995, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 29.00, 1, 81.50, 1, 40.00, 1, 0.00, 1, NULL, 44, '2024-10-19 07:05:30', '2024-11-12 08:08:02', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'argdm23.webp', 'physical', NULL, 3284, 1, 5, 7, 0, '<p>2 Years Part and Labor Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 29.00, 1, 40.00, 1, 81.50, 1, 0.00, 1, NULL, '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', '10', 1, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1681, 'Arctic Air AGR49 54 Double Glass Door Reach-In Refrigerator', '<p>The Arctic Air AGR49 54 Double Glass Door Reach-In Refrigerator is meticulously designed for high performance and convenience in commercial settings, featuring dimensions of 54 inches in width, 31 1/4 inches in depth, and 83 1/4 inches in height. This refrigerator is equipped with an electronic thermostat alongside an external digital LED display, allowing for accurate temperature control and easy visibility. Inside, the cabinet showcases a bright stainless liner and a full high-grade stainless steel floor with coved corners for enhanced hygiene and maintenance. Each door includes three adjustable, heavy-duty epoxy-coated wire shelves, providing flexible storage solutions. The unit employs a self-contained capillary tube system that utilizes environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerants, promoting sustainability while ensuring efficient cooling. Its exterior construction consists of full stainless steel for durability, and the built-in condensate heating element in the condensate pan facilitates efficient evaporation of excess water. The bottom-mounted compressor is strategically placed to operate in the coolest area of the kitchen, and the front-accessible, bottom-mounted condensing unit is mounted on a slide-out rack for simplified maintenance. Additional features include self-closing lockable doors, removable magnetic door gaskets for easy cleaning, and larger fan motors and blades that enhance airflow for faster recovery times. The refrigerator is equipped with easy-to-mount casters, including two lockable options, making it mobile. It meets NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage and is backed by a full two-year parts and labor warranty, along with a five-year compressor warranty, ensuring reliable operation. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 54 Inches Depth: 31 1/4 Inches Height: 83 1/4 Inches Weight: 500 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air AGR49 measures 54 inches in width, 31 1/4 inches in depth, and 83 1/4 inches in height, providing a spacious interior that can accommodate a substantial amount of food and beverage products.</li><li>Has a shipping weight of 500 lbs, indicating a solid construction that is designed for durability in commercial environments.</li><li>Operating at 8 Amps and 115 Volts, the AGR49 is compatible with standard electrical systems, ensuring easy installation and operation in a variety of settings.</li><li>Maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, ideal for safely storing perishable items while ensuring they remain fresh and ready for service.</li><li>Featuring a bottom-mounted compressor design, the unit enhances efficiency and reduces noise levels, making it suitable for front-of-house applications while simplifying maintenance access.</li><li>Equipped with 2 swing glass doors, allowing for easy visibility and access to stored items, improving efficiency during busy service periods.</li><li>With a generous capacity of 49 cu. ft., the AGR49 provides wide storage space, accommodating various products and making it an excellent choice for restaurants, cafes, and catering services.</li><li>Equipped with 6 shelves, allowing for versatile storage options and efficient organization of food and beverage items.</li><li>Crafted from all stainless steel, the AGR49 offers a professional appearance while ensuring durability and ease of cleaning, making it a reliable addition to any kitchen.</li><li>Designed as a freestanding unit, the AGR49 can be placed conveniently within the kitchen layout, providing flexibility in design while accommodating various operational needs.</li></ul>', 'published', '[\"agr49.webp\",\"ar23.webp\",\"agr23.webp\",\"awr25.webp\"]', 'AGR49', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 5858, 3399, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 49.00, 1, 83.25, 1, 31.50, 1, 500.00, 1, NULL, 37, '2024-10-19 07:05:30', '2024-11-12 08:04:51', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'agr49.webp', 'physical', NULL, 1735, 1, 5, 7, 0, '<p>2 Years Part and Labor Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 49.00, 1, 31.50, 1, 83.25, 1, 0.00, 1, NULL, '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', '10', 1, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1682, 'Arctic Air AGR23 27 Single Commercial Glass Door Reach-In Refrigerator', '<p>The Arctic Air AGR23 27 Single Commercial Glass Door Reach-In Refrigerator is a compact and powerful refrigeration solution, ideal for commercial kitchens. With its electronic thermostat and external digital LED display, it ensures precise temperature control, while the bright stainless-steel interior and coved corner design enhance cleanliness and durability. Inside, it comes equipped with three adjustable, heavy-duty epoxy-coated wire shelves, allowing for flexible organization of contents. The self-contained capillary tube system uses CFC-free refrigerant, making it an eco-friendly choice. This refrigerator features a bottom-mounted compressor, designed for efficiency by utilizing the cooler kitchen area. It also has a condensate heating element built into the pan for improved evaporation of excess water, and the bottom-mounted condensing unit is accessible via a slide-out rack, simplifying maintenance. Additional user-friendly features include self-closing lockable doors, easy-to-remove magnetic door gaskets, and large fan motors for superior airflow. It is mounted on casters, two of which are lockable for stability, and is NSF Standard 7 certified for safe food storage. <br> <br><br><span class=\"ui-provider\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Weight &amp; Dimensions:</strong></span></p><ul><li><span class=\"ui-provider\" dir=\"ltr\">Width: 27 Inches</span></li><li><span class=\"ui-provider\" dir=\"ltr\">Depth: 31 1/4 Inches</span></li><li><span class=\"ui-provider\" dir=\"ltr\">Height: 83 1/4 Inches</span></li><li><span class=\"ui-provider\" dir=\"ltr\">Weight: 330 lb.</span></li></ul>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air AGR23 is 27 inches wide, 31 1/4 inches deep, and 83 1/4 inches high, providing a compact and spacious refrigeration solution for commercial kitchens.</li><li>Has a shipping weight of 330 lbs, which reflects its solid and durable construction, built to withstand the rigors of a busy kitchen environment.</li><li>Operating at 2.6 Amps, 115 Volts, and 60 Hertz in a 1-phase configuration, the AGR23 is designed for energy-efficient performance while being compatible with standard commercial electrical setups.</li><li>Maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, ensuring optimal preservation of food and beverages, and keeping items fresh and ready for service.</li><li>Bottom-mounted compressor enhances both energy efficiency and ease of access for maintenance while helping to keep the refrigerator cool in high-heat environments.</li><li>Features a single swing glass door, allowing for easy visibility of contents and quick access to stored items, enhancing operational efficiency.</li><li>With a capacity of 23 cu. ft., the AGR23 offers wide storage space, making it ideal for small to medium-sized operations, while maintaining a compact footprint.</li><li>Comes with 3 adjustable shelves, providing versatile storage options for organizing various types of food and beverage products within the refrigerator.</li><li>Featuring all stainless steel construction, the AGR23 is not only durable but also easy to clean, making it an attractive and functional addition to any commercial kitchen.</li><li>Freestanding with right-hinged doors and does not have Dutch half doors. It includes casters for easy mobility and operates with an R-290 refrigerant, which is environmentally friendly. </li><li>Backed by a full two-year parts and labor warranty, and a five-year compressor warranty, it provides peace of mind for long-term use.</li></ul>', 'published', '[\"agr23.webp\",\"awr25.webp\",\"agr49.webp\",\"awr25.webp\"]', 'AGR23', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 3265, 2295, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 49.00, 1, 83.25, 1, 31.50, 1, 330.00, 1, NULL, 40, '2024-10-19 07:05:30', '2024-11-12 08:04:43', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'agr23.webp', 'physical', NULL, 1516, 1, 5, 7, 0, '<p>2 Years Part and Labor Warranty</p>', '2024-10-26', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, 1,