(1683, 'Arctic Air AWR25 30.75 Single Door Reach-In Refrigerator in White', '<p>The Arctic Air AWR25 30.75 Single Door Reach-In Refrigerator in White is an efficient, commercial-grade unit, designed for temperature accuracy and durability. It features an electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display, allowing precise temperature control and easy monitoring. The interior has bright white ABS sidewalls paired with a high-grade stainless steel floor with coved corners for easy cleaning. Storage flexibility is provided through three adjustable, heavy-duty epoxy-coated wire shelves, while the self-contained capillary tube system uses environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant, aligning with modern sustainability standards. The refrigerator\'s exterior is constructed from white epoxy-coated steel for a clean, professional look, with a bottom-mounted compressor for optimal efficiency in cooler areas of the kitchen. The condensate heating element built into the pan ensures effective water evaporation. It includes a field-reversible, lockable door with a foamed-in-place recessed handle for convenience and security. For smooth mobility, it is equipped with easy-to-mount casters (two lockable). Additionally, larger fan motors and blades increase airflow, speeding up temperature recovery. The refrigerator is NSF Standard 7 certified, ensuring it meets food storage safety requirements. <br><br><span class=\"ui-provider\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Weight &amp; Dimensions:</strong></span>  <br><br><strong>Width: 30 3/4 Inches </strong><br><strong>Depth: 29 Inches </strong><br><strong>Height: 78 Inches </strong><br><strong>Weight: 310 lb.</strong></p>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air AWR25 measures 30 3/4 inches wide, 29 inches deep, and 78 inches high, providing a compact and spacious design for commercial refrigeration needs.</li><li>With a shipping weight of 310 lbs, it is built to be durable and strong, suitable for various commercial kitchen environments.</li><li>Runs on 3 Amps, 115 Volts, and 60 Hertz in a 1-phase configuration, making it efficient and compatible with standard commercial electrical setups.</li><li>Offering a generous 25 cu. ft. of internal storage, the AWR25 provides plenty of space for storing refrigerated items, ideal for mid-size commercial kitchens or restaurants.</li><li>Bottom-mounted compressor ensures easy access for maintenance and offers improved cooling efficiency by keeping the compressor away from rising kitchen heat.</li><li>Features a single swing solid door, which is right-hinged, ensuring easy access while maintaining the internal temperature efficiently.</li><li>Capable of maintaining temperatures between 33 - 41 degrees F, ensuring consistent cooling for perishable goods, and meeting food safety standards.</li><li>Equipped with 3 adjustable shelves, the AWR25 offers flexibility in storage organization, allowing you to optimize space according to your needs.</li><li>Freestanding unit is easy to install and maneuver thanks to its casters, allowing for mobility while being solid enough for long-term use. The painted steel exterior ensures durability and ease of maintenance.</li><li>Uses R-290 refrigerant and is powered by a 1/4 HP compressor for reliable cooling performance. It includes a NEMA 5-15P plug type for standard commercial outlets. </li><li>The AWR25 comes with full one-year parts and labor warranty along with a five-year compressor warranty, providing peace of mind for long-term operation.</li></ul>', 'published', '[\"awr25.webp\",\"argdm23.webp\",\"ar23.webp\",\"agr23.webp\"]', 'AWR25', 0, 150, 0, 0, 1, 13, 0, 1, 2699, 1699, '2024-11-29 18:07:22', NULL, 0.00, 1, 26.50, NULL, 78.00, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 310.00, 1, NULL, 37, '2024-10-19 07:05:30', '2024-11-29 13:07:25', 'out_of_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'awr25.webp', 'physical', NULL, 2678, 1, 5, 7, 0, '<p>2 Years Part and Labor Warranty</p>', '2024-10-19', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', 'AWR2