(1684, 'Arctic Air AR23 26.75 Commercial Single Door Reach-In Stainless Steel Refrigerator', '<p>The Arctic Air AR23 26.75 Commercial Single Door Reach-In Stainless Steel Refrigerator is built for efficiency and durability, offering a range of advanced features. The electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display ensures precise temperature control. The interior features a bright white epoxy-coated aluminum liner with a high-grade stainless steel floor and coved corners for easy cleaning and durability. The unit includes three adjustable heavy-duty epoxy-coated wire shelves to accommodate various storage needs, while the self-contained capillary tube system uses CFC-free refrigerant, making it environmentally friendly. The refrigerator’s stainless steel front and sides provide a sleek, durable exterior. Its bottom-mounted compressor operates in the coolest area of the kitchen for greater efficiency, and the front-accessible condensing unit is mounted on a slide-out rack for easy maintenance. The self-closing door, which remains open at 90 degrees, features a magnetic gasket that is removable and replaceable without tools. Additional features include field-reversible lockable doors, larger fan motors and blades for improved airflow, and easy-to-mount casters (two lockable). Tested to NSF Standard 7 requirements for safe food storage, it measures 26 3/4 inches in width, 32 3/4 inches in depth, and 82 3/4 inches in height. Weight &amp; Dimensions Width: 26 3/4 Inches Depth: 32 3/4 Inches Height: 82 3/4 Inches Weight: 320 lb.</p>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air AR23 measures 26 3/4 inches wide, 32 3/4 inches deep, and 82 3/4 inches high, providing a compact and spacious refrigeration solution for commercial kitchens. </li><li>Weighing in at 320 lbs, this refrigerator is solidly built, ensuring durability and the ability to withstand the heavy use typical in busy commercial environments. </li><li>Runs on 6 Amps, 115 Volts, and 60 Hertz, with a 1-phase electrical configuration, making it compatible with standard commercial power setups. </li><li>Has a total storage capacity of 23 cu. ft., offering wide space for storing refrigerated goods in an organized and accessible manner. </li><li>Bottom-mounted compressor aids in easy access for maintenance and improved efficiency. The unit is equipped with casters, providing easy mobility for cleaning or rearranging kitchen layouts. </li><li>Features a swing-style solid door with a right-hinged design. This door type ensures a tight seal, helping to maintain consistent internal temperatures. </li><li>Maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, which is ideal for safely storing perishable food items and beverages.</li><li>Inside the item, there are 3 adjustable shelves, allowing users to customize the storage layout to accommodate items of various sizes, optimizing space.</li><li>Designed as a freestanding unit, the refrigerator is constructed from stainless steel and aluminum, ensuring long-lasting durability and easy cleaning in a busy kitchen environment.</li><li>Powered by a 3/8 HP compressor and uses R-290 refrigerant. It comes with a NEMA 5-15P plug for a straightforward electrical connection. Additionally, the unit is backed by full two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year compressor warranty, ensuring long-term reliability.</li></ul>', 'published', '[\"ar23.webp\",\"agr23.webp\",\"awr25.webp\",\"argdm23.webp\"]', 'AR23', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 2999, 1999, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 29.00, 1, 82.50, 1, 32.50, 1, 320.00, 1, NULL, 42, '2024-10-19 07:05:30', '2024-11-12 08:04:15', 'on_backorder', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'ar23.webp', 'physical', '12345456', NULL, 1, 5, 7, 0, '<p>2 Years Part &amp; Labor Warranty</p>', '2024-10-26', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', 'AR23', 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/gutfLrwr0R8j4wXaTnq2Qa7dwb30rZHWkS9NpKfu.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Document 2\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/JtTZ6MRV5yxiXQrrEjuC1HqDvH7kXejoRb9OCwnz.pdf\"},\"2\":{\"title\":\"Document 3\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/VgiQPr0tFN3reZT9d4PXxDXd1oOMpJFOWXHylvT6.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/A0ohTnwnK99Idmgzb5tjGJNhcPrBqUs72gnNsrcU.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/hFR7gJ356lBKP4UxNnVe4tueKY0S2gihx8vRcYls.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'pounds', 320.00, NULL, 29.00, 1, 32.50, 1, 82.50, 1, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"123\"},{\"value\":\"AWR25\"},{\"value\":\"AGR23\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', '10', 1, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1685, 'Serv-Ware SSSP-1 18” Dual Ring Cast Iron Stock Pot with 1 Burner and 1 Open Front Cabinet, Natural Gas, 110,000 BTU', '<p>The Serv-Ware SSSP-1 18” Dual Ring Cast Iron Stock Pot with 1 Burner and 1 Open Front Cabinet is a high-performance cooking unit designed for commercial kitchens that require powerful and efficient heating. It features a dual ring cast iron burner capable of delivering up to 110,000 BTU of heat, making it ideal for quickly bringing large quantities of liquid to a boil or for cooking soups, stews, and other large-scale dishes. The dual ring design allows for even heat distribution across the entire pot, ensuring consistent cooking results. The burner operates on natural gas, which is both cost-effective and reliable for continuous use in demanding kitchen environments. In addition to its powerful burner, this unit comes with an open front cabinet that provides convenient storage space for pots, pans, and other kitchen essentials. The cabinet is constructed from heavy-duty stainless steel, which offers excellent durability and easy cleaning, essential for maintaining a hygienic kitchen. The 18-inch diameter of the stock pot accommodates large cooking vessels, making it a versatile addition to any commercial kitchen that handles high-volume cooking tasks. The combination of high BTU output, durable construction, and practical design makes the Serv-Ware SSSP-1 an indispensable tool for busy restaurants, catering services, and food production facilities.</p>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air AR23 measures 26 3/4 inches wide, 32 3/4 inches deep, and 82 3/4 inches high, providing a compact and spacious refrigeration solution for commercial kitchens. </li><li>Weighing in at 320 lbs, this refrigerator is solidly built, ensuring durability and the ability to withstand the heavy use typical in busy commercial environments. </li><li>Runs on 6 Amps, 115 Volts, and 60 Hertz, with a 1-phase electrical configuration, making it compatible with standard commercial power setups. </li><li>Has a total storage capacity of 23 cu. ft., offering wide space for storing refrigerated goods in an organized and accessible manner. </li><li>Bottom-mounted compressor aids in easy access for maintenance and improved efficiency. The unit is equipped with casters, providing easy mobility for cleaning or rearranging kitchen layouts. </li><li>Features a swing-style solid door with a right-hinged design. This door type ensures a tight seal, helping to maintain consistent internal temperatures. </li><li>Maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, which is ideal for safely storing perishable food items and beverages.</li><li>Inside the item, there are 3 adjustable shelves, allowing users to customize the storage layout to accommodate items of various sizes, optimizing space.</li><li>Designed as a freestanding unit, the refrigerator is constructed from stainless steel and aluminum, ensuring long-lasting durability and easy cleaning in a busy kitchen environment.</li><li>Powered by a 3/8 HP compressor and uses R-290 refrigerant. It comes with a NEMA 5-15P plug for a straightforward electrical connection. Additionally, the unit is backed by full two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year compressor warranty, ensuring long-term reliability.</li></ul>', 'draft', '[\"sssp-1\\/sssp-2.webp\",\"sssp-1\\/sssp-3.webp\",\"sssp-1\\/sssp-4.webp\",\"sssp-1\\/sssp-5.webp\",\"buffet-and-food-displays-2\\/mobile-buffet-trolley.webp\"]', 'SSSP-1', 0, NULL, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 578.02, 1156.04, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 29.00, 1, 82.50, 1, 32.50, 1, 320.00, 1, NULL, 47, '2024-10-19 07:05:30', '2024-12-13 12:55:02', 'on_backorder', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'sssp-1/sssp-1.webp', 'physical', '123456789', NULL, 1, 0, 23, 0, 'Three year warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Commercial Gas & Electric Cooker', 'SSSP-1', 1, '[{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/WdXxHp26SRbUpiYbFwy5CQrwoozSXUOni7vXLzDI.