(1689, 'Atosa ATRC-36 36\" Gas Countertop Radiant Broiler  105,000 BTU', '<p>The Atosa ATRC-36 36\" Gas Countertop Radiant Broiler is designed for high-performance cooking in commercial kitchens, offering a robust heating capability with its 105,000 BTU burner system. This broiler is ideal for grilling and searing a variety of foods quickly and efficiently. It features a durable stainless steel construction both on the exterior and interior, ensuring longevity and ease of cleaning, which is crucial in busy kitchen environments.</p><p>Equipped with individual heavy-duty cast iron grates, the Atosa ATRC-36 provides even heat distribution and excellent heat retention, allowing chefs to achieve consistent cooking results across the entire cooking surface. The broiler includes adjustable multi-level top grates, giving flexibility in cooking different types of food at various heat intensities. Designed for reliability and efficiency, this countertop unit is suitable for restaurants, catering services, and other food establishments that require a powerful and versatile cooking appliance to handle high-volume cooking demands.</p>', '<p>ul&gt; Equipped with a powerful 105,000 BTU burner system, ideal for quick heating and high-temperature cooking applications such as searing and grilling.<br>Made with durable stainless steel for both exterior and interior surfaces, ensuring longevity and ease of cleaning in commercial kitchen environments.<br>Features individual, heavy-duty cast iron grates that provide even heat distribution and excellent heat retention, promoting consistent cooking results.<br>Includes adjustable multi-level top grates, allowing for flexible cooking configurations to accommodate different types of food and cooking preferences.<br>Designed for versatility, suitable for restaurants, catering services, and other food establishments needing a reliable and efficient countertop broiler to handle high-volume cooking demands.</p>', 'draft', '[\"sssp-1\\/atrc-36-634cdbab-2b15-41e9-ad54-c47853554c01.webp\"]', 'ATRC-36', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1338, 2676, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 29.00, 1, 82.50, 1, 32.50, 1, 320.00, 1, NULL, 45, '2024-10-22 10:53:22', '2024-12-13 12:43:38', 'on_backorder', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'sssp-1/atrc-36-634cdbab-2b15-41e9-ad54-c47853554c01.webp', 'physical', '13214412851', NULL, 1, 5, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty??', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Countertop Broilers', 'ATRC-36', 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '', 0, NULL, 'Kg', 205.00, NULL, 36.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 15.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '[]', '[]', 'non-refundable', '8 Days', 1, 'Color', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1690, 'Atosa ATCB-24 24\" Heavy Duty Countertop Charbroiler 70,000 BTU', '<p>The Atosa ATCB-24 24\" Heavy Duty Countertop Charbroiler is designed to deliver high-performance grilling capabilities in commercial kitchen settings. With a robust 70,000 BTU output spread across its cooking surface, this charbroiler provides intense heat for searing and grilling various types of food quickly and efficiently. The unit features heavy-duty cast iron grates that ensure even heat distribution and retention, crucial for achieving consistent cooking results and creating distinct grill marks on meats, vegetables, and seafood.</p><p>Constructed with a durable stainless steel body, the ATCB-24 is built to withstand the rigors of daily use while maintaining a professional appearance. Stainless steel not only enhances durability but also facilitates easy cleaning, essential for maintaining hygiene standards in busy kitchens. The charbroiler includes independent manual controls for each burner, allowing chefs to adjust heat levels precisely to meet different cooking needs. Its compact 24-inch width makes it suitable for countertops with limited space, providing a versatile grilling solution for restaurants, cafes, and other foodservice establishments aiming to enhance their menu offerings with grilled specialties.</p>', '<ul><li>Robust 70,000 BTU output for efficient grilling and searing.</li><li>Heavy-duty cast iron grates ensure even heat distribution and retention.</li><li>Durable stainless steel construction for longevity and easy cleaning.</li><li>Compact 24-inch width ideal for kitchens with limited space.</li><li>Independent manual controls for precise heat adjustment per burner.</li></ul>', 'draft', '[\"sssp-1\\/atcb-24-b375b704-a39a-42cf-a5e3-5ca6a4901488.webp\"]', 'ATCB-24', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 14, 0, 0, 998, 1996, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 29.00, 1, 82.50, 1, 32.50, 1, 320.00, 1, NULL, 39, '2024-10-22 10:53:22', '2024-12-13 12:43:37', 'on_backorder', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User'