(1691, 'Atosa ACHP-2 12\" Heavy Duty Countertop Range, Hot Plate with 2 Burners 64,000 BTU', '<p>The Atosa ACHP-2 12\" Heavy Duty Countertop Range or Hot Plate is designed to provide versatile cooking capabilities in compact spaces. With two burners delivering a total of 64,000 BTUs, this countertop range offers sufficient power for various cooking tasks, from boiling and simmering to sautÃ©ing and searing. Its durable stainless steel construction ensures durability and ease of cleaning, making it suitable for high-volume use in commercial kitchens, food trucks, or small restaurants.</p><p>Each burner on the ACHP-2 features individual manual controls, allowing chefs to adjust heat levels independently for precise cooking control. The heavy-duty cast iron grates provide a stable cooking surface that retains heat effectively, ensuring consistent cooking results. Its compact 12-inch width makes it easy to place on countertops without occupying excessive space, making it ideal for establishments where space is limited but performance is crucial. Whether used as a primary cooking appliance or as an additional burner for busy kitchens, the Atosa ACHP-2 combines reliability, efficiency, and compact design to meet the demands of professional chefs and foodservice operators.</p>', '<ul><li>2 Burners Each burner has its own manual control for precise heat adjustment tailored to specific cooking needs.<br> </li><li>Constructed with stainless steel inside and out, ensuring durability, easy cleaning, and a professional appearance.<br> </li><li>The full-width crumb tray collects debris, promoting cleanliness and simplifying maintenance in busy kitchen environments.<br> </li><li>Powerful 32,000 BTU burners deliver high heat output, ideal for a variety of cooking tasks and efficient performance.<br> </li><li>Designed with standing pilot lights, these heavy-duty burners ensure quick ignition and consistent heat for cooking.<br> </li><li>Durable cast iron top grates provide excellent heat retention and even cooking, perfect for high-demand usage.<br> </li><li>Independent controls for each burner enhance flexibility, allowing simultaneous cooking at different temperatures.<br> </li><li>Standard stainless steel legs provide stability and durability, ensuring secure placement in commercial kitchen settings.<br> </li><li>Features a standard 3/4â€³ NPT rear gas connection and regulator for easy installation and reliable gas flow.</li></ul>', 'draft', '[\"sssp-1\\/achp-2-7518c0f6-719c-4ebf-90be-56024856b17e.webp\"]', 'ACHP-2', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 14, 0, 0, 520, 1040, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 29.00, 1, 82.50, 1, 32.50, 1, 320.00, 1, NULL, 43, '2024-10-22 10:53:22', '2024-12-13 12:43:35', 'on_backorder', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'sssp-1/achp-2-7518c0f6-719c-4ebf-90be-56024856b17e.webp', 'physical', '13214412853', NULL, 1, 5, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty??', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Gas Range', 'ACHP-2', 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '', 0, NULL, 'Kg', 74.00, NULL, 12.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 13.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '[]', '[]', 'non-refundable', '8 Days', 1, 'Color', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1692, 'Atosa ATFS-40-LP 40 lb, CookRite Fryer Liquid Propane Gas Floor Model', '<p>The Atosa ATFS-40 Gas Floor Fryer is designed for commercial kitchens seeking efficiency and reliability in frying operations. With a capacity of 40 lbs, it\'s well-suited for medium to high-volume frying applications, making it ideal for restaurants, diners, and other food service establishments. This fryer features a durable stainless steel construction that not only enhances its longevity but also simplifies cleaning and maintenance, crucial in busy kitchen environments where hygiene and efficiency are paramount.</p><p>Equipped with powerful 102,000 BTU burners, the ATFS-40 ensures quick heat-up times and efficient frying, enabling chefs to maintain consistent cooking temperatures for crispy and delicious results. The fryer includes two nickel-plated fry baskets with ergonomic handles, facilitating safe and convenient frying operations. Additionally, it features independent manual controls for each fryer tank, offering flexibility in managing different types of fried foods simultaneously. Overall, the Atosa ATFS-40 Gas Floor Fryer combines robust performance, user-friendly design, and durable construction to meet the demands of commercial frying applications.</p>', '<ul><li>Holds up to 40 lbs of oil, suitable for medium to high-volume frying needs.<br> </li><li>102,000 BTU total output ensures rapid heat-up and efficient frying.<br> </li><li>Durable and easy to clean, enhances longevity and maintains hygiene standards.<br> </li><li>Allows for simultaneous frying of different foods with independent manual controls.<br> </li><li>Includes two nickel-plated fry baskets with ergonomic handles for safe handling and operation.</li></ul>', 'draft', '[\"sssp-1\\/atfs-40-lp.webp\"]', 'ATFS-40-LP', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1068, 2136, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 29.00, 1, 82.50, 1, 32.50, 1, 320.00, 1, NULL, 36, '2024-10-22 10:53:22', '2024-12-13 12:43:24', 'on_backorder', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'sssp-1/atfs-40-lp.webp', 'physical', '13214412854', NULL, 1, 5, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty??', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Commercial Gas Fryers', 'ATFS-40-LP', 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '', 0, NULL, 'Kg', 160.00, NULL, 16.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 44.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '[]', '[]', 'non-refundable', '8 Days', 1, 'Color', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1693, 'Atosa ATFS-50-NG 50 lb CookRite Fryer Natural Gas Floor Model', '<p>Standing out for its ability to tackle high-volume food production with ease, the Atosa ATFS-50 Gas Floor Fryer is a workhorse ideally suited for restaurants, cafes, and other demanding commercial kitchens. Its generous 50-lb capacity oil tank allows you to confidently fry large batches of food, whether it\'s golden french fries, crispy chicken wings, or any other deep-fried menu item your customers crave. The Atosa ATFS-50 is crafted from durable, corrosion-resistant stainless steel, guaranteeing longevity and simplifying post-service cleaning routines for your busy kitchen staff.</p><p>Ensuring optimal frying performance, the ATFS-50 incorporates three powerful gas burners with standing pilots for rapid ignition and consistent heat distribution throughout the cooking process. A high-precision thermostat affords you precise control over oil temperatures between 200Â°F and 400Â°F, essential for achieving perfectly cooked and consistently crisp results. An innovative oil cooling zone integrated within the tank astutely captures food particles, extending the lifespan of your cooking oil and reducing waste for overall operational cost-effectiveness. For the safety of your staff, the Atosa ATFS-50 comes equipped with a safety valve and automatic voltage stabilization. An additional safety feature includes a self-resetting high-temperature limiting device, providing peace of mind in even the most fast-paced kitchen environments.</p>', '<ul><li>The 50-lb capacity oil tank allows for frying large batches of food, perfect for busy restaurants and cafes.<br> </li><li>Made entirely from stainless steel, this fryer ensures longevity and simplifies cleaning.<br> </li><li>Three gas burners with standing pilots provide quick ignition and even heat distribution for consistent results.<br> </li><li>A high-precision thermostat allows you to control oil temperatures between 200Â°F and 400Â°F for perfectly cooked food.<br> </li><li>Includes a safety valve, automatic voltage stabilization, and a self-resetting high-temperature limiting device for safe operation.</li></ul>', 'draft', '[\"sssp-1\\/atfs-50-ng.webp\"]', 'ATFS-50-NG', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1368, 2736, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 29.00, 1, 82.50, 1, 32.50, 1, 320.00, 1, NULL, 38, '2024-10-22 10:53:22', '2024-12-13 12:43:20', 'on_backorder', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'sssp-1/atfs-50-ng.webp', 'physical', '13214412855', NULL, 1, 5, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty??', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Commercial Gas Fryers', 'ATFS-50-NG', 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 16.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 44.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '[]', '[]', 'non-refundable', '8 Days', 1, 'Color', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1694, 'Atosa AGR-24G-LP 24\" CookRite Range Liquid Propane Gas', '<p>The Atosa AGR-24G 24\" Gas Range with Griddle Tops is a compact yet powerful cooking appliance designed for commercial kitchens seeking efficient and versatile cooking solutions. Built with robust stainless steel, this gas range ensures durability and ease of cleaning, essential for maintaining hygiene standards in busy environments. The unit features two burners and a centrally located griddle top, providing chefs with flexibility to simultaneously cook a variety of dishes such as meats, vegetables, and breakfast items like pancakes and eggs.</p><p>Each burner and the griddle top on the Atosa AGR-24G are equipped with individual manual controls, allowing precise adjustment of heat levels tailored to different cooking requirements. This setup enhances operational efficiency, enabling chefs to manage multiple cooking tasks efficiently. The griddle top is made from durable steel and features a smooth cooking surface that distributes heat evenly, ensuring consistent results across the entire cooking area. Overall, the Atosa AGR-24G gas range with griddle tops combines compact design, durable construction, and versatile cooking capabilities to meet the demands of commercial kitchen environments effectively.</p>', '<ul><li>Durable stainless steel body ensures longevity and easy cleaning, suitable for commercial kitchen use.<br> </li><li>24-inch width makes efficient use of kitchen space while offering versatile cooking capabilities.<br> </li><li>Equipped with two powerful gas burners, ideal for boiling, simmering, and sautÃ©ing various dishes simultaneously.<br> </li><li>Features a centrally located griddle top for cooking items like pancakes, eggs, and meats with even heat distribution.<br> </li><li>Burners and griddle top have independent manual controls for precise heat adjustments tailored to specific cooking needs.</li></ul>', 'draft', '[\"sssp-1\\/agr-24g-lp-7fa92928-e5db-4e29-b980-5559cfba9436.webp\"]', 'AGR-24G-LP', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1878, 3756, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 29.00, 1, 82.50, 1, 32.50, 1, 320.00, 1, NULL, 40, '2024-10-22 10:53:22', '2024-12-13 12:43:14', 'on_backorder', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'sssp-1/agr-24g-lp-7fa92928-e5db-4e29-b980-5559cfba9436.webp', 'physical', '13214412856', NULL, 1, 5, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty??', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Natural Gas Griddles', 'AGR-24G-LP', 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '', 0, NULL, 'Kg', 469.00, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 57.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '[]', '[]', 'non-refundable', '8 Days', 1, 'Color', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1695, 'Atosa AGR-10B-LP 60\" CookRite Range Liquid Propane Gas, 10 Burners', '<p>The Atosa AGR-10B is a robust 60-inch gas range designed for high-performance cooking in commercial kitchens. Featuring 10 burners and a standard oven, this range offers ample cooking capacity to handle large volumes of food preparation efficiently. Each burner is equipped with heavy-duty cast iron grates that provide stability for pots and pans while ensuring even heat distribution. This setup is ideal for busy kitchens where simultaneous cooking of multiple dishes is necessary.</p><p>Constructed from durable stainless steel, both the exterior and interior of the Atosa AGR-10B are designed to withstand the rigors of daily use in a commercial environment. Stainless steel is not only resistant to corrosion and easy to clean but also presents a sleek and professional appearance that complements any kitchen decor. The oven below the burners is spacious and equipped with a thermostat control for precise temperature regulation, allowing chefs to bake, roast, or broil with consistency. Overall, the Atosa AGR-10B combines durability, functionality, and efficiency, making it a reliable choice for restaurants, hotels, and other foodservice establishments seeking a versatile gas range for their kitchen operations.</p>', '<ul><li>Provides ample cooking space and flexibility for preparing multiple dishes simultaneously, ideal for high-volume kitchens.<br> </li><li>Each burner is equipped with sturdy cast iron grates that ensure stability for pots and pans while allowing for even heat distribution.<br> </li><li>Both the exterior and interior are constructed from stainless steel, offering durability, resistance to corrosion, and easy cleaning.<br> </li><li>Spacious oven below the burners equipped with a thermostat control for precise temperature regulation during baking, roasting, or broiling.<br> </li><li>Simple and intuitive manual controls for each burner and the oven, allowing for easy operation and adjustment of cooking settings.</li></ul>', 'draft', '[\"sssp-1\\/agr-10b-lp-f4791867-e06b-443e-bd65-d3297e3a76c0.webp\"]', 'AGR-10B-LP', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 14, 0, 0, 3805, 7610, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 29.00, 1, 82.50, 1, 32.50, 1, 320.00, 1, NULL, 35, '2024-10-22 10:53:22', '2024-12-13 12:42:58', 'on_backorder', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'sssp-1/agr-10b-lp-f4791867-e06b-443e-bd65-d3297e3a76c0.webp', 'physical', '13214412857', NULL, 1, 5, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty??', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Gas Range', 'AGR-10B-LP', 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '', 0, NULL, 'Kg', 897.00, NULL, 60.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 57.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '[]', '[]', 'non-refundable', '8 Days', 1, 'Color', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1696, 'Atosa AGR-4B-NG 24\" CookRite Range Natural Gas, 4 Burners', '<p>The Atosa AGR-4B 24\" Gas Range with 4 Burners and Standard Oven is a compact yet powerful appliance designed for efficiency and versatility in commercial kitchens. This gas range features four high-performance burners, each capable of delivering substantial BTU output to meet various cooking needs. The burners are arranged on a 24-inch wide cooktop, offering enough space for multiple pots and pans while maximizing kitchen workspace. Each burner is equipped with a durable cast iron grate, ensuring long-lasting performance and excellent heat distribution for consistent cooking results.</p><p>Below the cooktop, the Atosa AGR-4B boasts a spacious standard oven, enhancing its versatility. The oven is perfect for baking, roasting, and broiling, with adjustable racks that can accommodate different dish sizes and cooking requirements. Constructed with high-quality stainless steel, both the oven interior and the range exterior are designed for easy cleaning and maintenance. The stainless steel exterior not only ensures durability but also adds a sleek, professional look to any kitchen setting. Additionally, the oven features a precise thermostat for accurate temperature control, ensuring optimal cooking outcomes. This combination of powerful burners and a versatile oven makes the Atosa AGR-4B an essential addition to any commercial kitchen, capable of handling a wide range of culinary tasks efficiently.</p>', '<ul><li>Equipped with four powerful burners, providing ample BTU output for a variety of cooking tasks, including boiling, sautÃ©ing, simmering, and frying.<br> </li><li>The burners feature heavy-duty cast iron grates that ensure excellent heat retention and durability for consistent cooking performance.<br> </li><li>Includes a standard oven beneath the cooktop, perfect for baking, roasting, and broiling. The oven comes with adjustable racks to accommodate different dish sizes and cooking needs.<br> </li><li>The range is made from high-quality stainless steel, ensuring durability and longevity in demanding commercial kitchen environments. The stainless steel exterior and oven interior are designed for easy cleaning and maintenance.<br> </li><li>The oven features a reliable thermostat, providing accurate and consistent temperature control for optimal cooking results.</li></ul>', 'published', '[\"sssp-1\\/agr-4b-ng-6c293f55-1268-4d1a-8c3b-6b19d74e39e6.webp\"]', 'AGR-4B-NG', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 14, 0, 0, 3706, 1853, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 29.00, 1, 82.50, 1, 32.50, 1, 320.00, 1, NULL, 30, '2024-10-22 10:53:23', '2024-11-12 08:01:54', 'on_backorder', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'sssp-1/agr-4b-ng-6c293f55-1268-4d1a-8c3b-6b19d74e39e6.webp', 'physical', '13214412858', NULL, 1, 5, 8, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 29.00, 1, 32.50, 1, 82.50, 1, 0.00, 1, NULL, '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', '10', 1, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1697, 'Atosa AOM-40B 39.6\" Open Air Merchandiser, Black Exterior, 20.6 Cu. Ft', '<p>The Atosa AOM-40B is a 39.6\" Open Air Merchandiser designed to provide an appealing and accessible display solution for refrigerated products. With its sleek black exterior, this merchandiser adds a modern touch to any retail space, enhancing the visual appeal of the products inside. It offers 20.6 cubic feet of storage capacity, making it ideal for showcasing a variety of items such as beverages, dairy products, and prepared foods. The open-air design not only facilitates easy access for customers but also encourages impulse purchases by providing a clear and unobstructed view of the merchandise.</p><p>Equipped with advanced refrigeration technology, the AOM-40B ensures consistent and reliable temperature control to maintain the freshness and safety of the displayed products. Its energy-efficient components help reduce operating costs while maintaining optimal performance. The unit\'s durable construction is designed to withstand the demands of a busy retail environment, ensuring long-lasting use. Overall, the Atosa AOM-40B combines functionality, efficiency, and aesthetic appeal, making it a valuable addition to grocery stores, convenience stores, and other retail establishments.</p>', '<ul><li>Offers 20.6 cubic feet of storage, providing ample space for displaying a variety of refrigerated products.<br> </li><li>Facilitates easy access and enhances product visibility, encouraging impulse purchases and making it convenient for customers to browse and select items.<br> </li><li>Ensures consistent and reliable temperature control, keeping products fresh and safe for consumption.<br> </li><li>Adds a modern and sophisticated appearance to the display, enhancing the aesthetic appeal of the retail environment.<br> </li><li>Designed with energy-efficient components to reduce operating costs while maintaining optimal performance, making it a cost-effective choice for retailers.</li></ul>', 'draft', '[\"sssp-1\\/aom-40b-4753d221-5a60-448b-ad4c-40592bdad477.webp\"]', 'AOM-40B', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 14, 0, 0, 7870, 15740, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 29.00, 1, 82.50, 1, 32.50, 1, 320.00, 1, NULL, 31, '2024-10-22 10:53:23', '2024-12-13 12:42:20', 'on_backorder', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'sssp-1/aom-40b-4753d221-5a60-448b-ad4c-40592bdad477.webp', 'physical', '13214412859', NULL, 1, 5, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty??', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Vertical Open Air Merchandisers', 'AOM-40B', 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '', 0, NULL, 'Kg', 441.00, NULL, 79.00, NULL, 40.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '[]', '[]', 'non-refundable', '8 Days', 1, 'Color', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1704, 'Omega MMV700S Mega Mouth Vertical 240-Watt Low Speed Juicer, Silver', '<p>The Omega Mega Mouth Vertical Juicer combines efficiency and quiet operation, making it an ideal choice for those seeking a high-performance, low-speed juicer. Featuring a powerful 240-watt motor, this vertical juicer operates at a slow 60 RPM, which helps preserve nutrients and minimize oxidation for healthier juice. Its advanced design includes a Smart Cap Spout Tap, allowing for easy and mess-free pouring, and the integrated cap helps prevent leaks and spills.</p><p>With a sleek silver finish and compact dimensions of 6.5 inches in length, 9.6 inches in width, and 17.8 inches in height, this juicer fits conveniently on most countertops, making it suitable for both home and professional use. The Omega Mega Mouth is engineered for durability and ease of use, ensuring a quiet operation that minimizes disruption in any setting. Weighing 21 pounds, it is sturdy yet manageable, balancing robust performance with practical design.</p><p>This juicer\'s vertical configuration allows for efficient extraction with minimal space usage, while the low-speed masticating process ensures maximum juice yield from fruits and vegetables. Whether used for daily juice preparation or occasional servings, the Omega Mega Mouth Juicer provides reliable and effective performance, making it a valuable addition to any kitchen that values both functionality and quality.</p>', '<ul><li>Low-speed operation at 60 RPM preserves nutrients and minimizes oxidation for healthier juice.</li><li>Powerful 240-watt motor ensures efficient extraction with quiet performance.</li><li>Compact dimensions: 6.5 inches long, 9.6 inches wide, and 17.8 inches high fit well on countertops.</li><li>Smart Cap Spout Tap prevents leaks and spills, offering easy, mess-free pouring.</li><li>Weighs 21 pounds for stability and durability, ideal for both home and commercial use.</li></ul>', 'published', '[\"mmv700s-2.jpg\",\"mmv700s-4.jpg\",\"mmv700s-3.jpg\",\"mmv700s-1.jpg\",\"mmv700s-5.jpg\"]', 'MMV700S', 0, 100, 0, 1, 1, 14, 0, 0, 499.95, 470, '2024-11-25 11:26:18', '2024-11-27 11:26:20', 0.00, 1, 6.50, 3, 17.80, 3, 9.60, 3, 18.40, 9, NULL, 22, '2024-10-31 14:31:19', '2024-11-25 06:27:46', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'mmv700s-2.jpg', 'physical', NULL, 328.97, 1, 12, 8, 0, '<ul style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(11,11,11);font-family:\'DIN Next\', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;list-style:none;margin:0px 0px 0px 18px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px;\">Warranty: 10 Year</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'juicer', 'MMV700S', 1, '[{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Di3XY9tPDbBnDGrBYyhzZ4IqSu2inJwyIBy8Ccl7.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/4L39eaHUMvhhwZTYnnhFK0TNiRcJ80lDvugqedEk.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Disassembling\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/v7y1MFUKyv2FsuWAbAc96MCA9NHk9XAuQVHPdqfE.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Assembling\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/pEUsyW2MDSpMdBtQxeKP0KbKMS0qXzStH7oP2k3g.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[\"videos/or2fosUWk4thajznRz6HXnIINGqvZscvB1rFQH4R.mp4\"]', 0, NULL, 'pounds', 18.40, NULL, 6.50, 3, 9.60, 3, 17.80, 3, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"1697\"},{\"value\":\"1694\"},{\"value\":\"1696\"},{\"value\":\"1693\"}]', '[\"1697\",\"    1696\",\"    1695\",\"    1694\"]', '[\"1694\",\"    1695\",\"    1696\",\"    1697\"]', 'non-refundable', '10', 1, 'Color', 'Silver', '1704', 'Material', 'Stainless Steel', '1704', 'Other Available Sizes', 'Juicer', '1697', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1705, 'Arctic Air AWR25 30.75 Single Door Reach-In Refrigerator in White', '<p>The Arctic Air AWR25 30.75 Single Door Reach-In Refrigerator in White is an efficient, commercial-grade unit, designed for temperature accuracy and durability. It features an electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display, allowing precise temperature control and easy monitoring. The interior has bright white ABS sidewalls paired with a high-grade stainless steel floor with coved corners for easy cleaning. Storage flexibility is provided through three adjustable, heavy-duty epoxy-coated wire shelves, while the self-contained capillary tube system uses environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant, aligning with modern sustainability standards. The refrigerator\'s exterior is constructed from white epoxy-coated steel for a clean, professional look, with a bottom-mounted compressor for optimal efficiency in cooler areas of the kitchen. The condensate heating element built into the pan ensures effective water evaporation. It includes a field-reversible, lockable door with a foamed-in-place recessed handle for convenience and security. For smooth mobility, it is equipped with easy-to-mount casters (two lockable). Additionally, larger fan motors and blades increase airflow, speeding up temperature recovery. The refrigerator is NSF Standard 7 certified, ensuring it meets food storage safety requirements. <br><br><span class=\"ui-provider\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Weight &amp; Dimensions:</strong></span>  <br><br><strong>Width: 30 3/4 Inches </strong><br><strong>Depth: 29 Inches </strong><br><strong>Height: 78 Inches </strong><br><strong>Weight: 310 lb.</strong></p>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air AWR25 measures 30 3/4 inches wide, 29 inches deep, and 78 inches high, providing a compact and spacious design for commercial refrigeration needs.</li><li>With a shipping weight of 310 lbs, it is built to be durable and strong, suitable for various commercial kitchen environments.</li><li>Runs on 3 Amps, 115 Volts, and 60 Hertz in a 1-phase configuration, making it efficient and compatible with standard commercial electrical setups.</li><li>Offering a generous 25 cu. ft. of internal storage, the AWR25 provides plenty of space for storing refrigerated items, ideal for mid-size commercial kitchens or restaurants.</li><li>Bottom-mounted compressor ensures easy access for maintenance and offers improved cooling efficiency by keeping the compressor away from rising kitchen heat.</li><li>Features a single swing solid door, which is right-hinged, ensuring easy access while maintaining the internal temperature efficiently.</li><li>Capable of maintaining temperatures between 33 - 41 degrees F, ensuring consistent cooling for perishable goods, and meeting food safety standards.</li><li>Equipped with 3 adjustable shelves, the AWR25 offers flexibility in storage organization, allowing you to optimize space according to your needs.</li><li>Freestanding unit is easy to install and maneuver thanks to its casters, allowing for mobility while being solid enough for long-term use. The painted steel exterior ensures durability and ease of maintenance.</li><li>Uses R-290 refrigerant and is powered by a 1/4 HP compressor for reliable cooling performance. It includes a NEMA 5-15P plug type for standard commercial outlets. </li><li>The AWR25 comes with full one-year parts and labor warranty along with a five-year compressor warranty, providing peace of mind for long-term operation.</li></ul>', 'published', '[\"awr25.webp\",\"argdm23.webp\",\"ar23.webp\",\"agr23.webp\"]', 'AWR25', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 2699, 1699, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 26.50, 1, 78.00, 1, 29.00, 1, 310.00, 1, NULL, 21, '2024-11-04 08:03:16', '2024-11-12 08:01:26', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'awr25.webp', 'physical', NULL, 2678, 1, 5, 7, 0, '<p>2 Years Part and Labor Warranty</p>', '2024-10-19', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', 'AWR25', 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'pounds', 310.00, NULL, 26.50, 1, 29.00, 1, 78.00, 1, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"AR23\"},{\"value\":\"AGR23\"},{\"value\":\"AGR49\"}]', '[\"good \",\"           better \",\"           best\"]', '[\"1695\",\"           1696\",\"           1697\"]', 'non-refundable', '10', 1, 'Color', 'blue', 'green', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'burners', '2 burners', '12,34,56', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1706, 'Arctic Air AWR25 30.75 Single Door Reach-In Refrigerator in White', '<p>The Arctic Air AWR25 30.75 Single Door Reach-In Refrigerator in White is an efficient, commercial-grade unit, designed for temperature accuracy and durability. It features an electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display, allowing precise temperature control and easy monitoring. The interior has bright white ABS sidewalls paired with a high-grade stainless steel floor with coved corners for easy cleaning. Storage flexibility is provided through three adjustable, heavy-duty epoxy-coated wire shelves, while the self-contained capillary tube system uses environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant, aligning with modern sustainability standards. The refrigerator\'s exterior is constructed from white epoxy-coated steel for a clean, professional look, with a bottom-mounted compressor for optimal efficiency in cooler areas of the kitchen. The condensate heating element built into the pan ensures effective water evaporation. It includes a field-reversible, lockable door with a foamed-in-place recessed handle for convenience and security. For smooth mobility, it is equipped with easy-to-mount casters (two lockable). Additionally, larger fan motors and blades increase airflow, speeding up temperature recovery. The refrigerator is NSF Standard 7 certified, ensuring it meets food storage safety requirements. <br><br><span class=\"ui-provider\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Weight &amp; Dimensions:</strong></span>  <br><br><strong>Width: 30 3/4 Inches </strong><br><strong>Depth: 29 Inches </strong><br><strong>Height: 78 Inches </strong><br><strong>Weight: 310 lb.</strong></p>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air AWR25 measures 30 3/4 inches wide, 29 inches deep, and 78 inches high, providing a compact and spacious design for commercial refrigeration needs.</li><li>With a shipping weight of 310 lbs, it is built to be durable and strong, suitable for various commercial kitchen environments.</li><li>Runs on 3 Amps, 115 Volts, and 60 Hertz in a 1-phase configuration, making it efficient and compatible with standard commercial electrical setups.</li><li>Offering a generous 25 cu. ft. of internal storage, the AWR25 provides plenty of space for storing refrigerated items, ideal for mid-size commercial kitchens or restaurants.</li><li>Bottom-mounted compressor ensures easy access for maintenance and offers improved cooling efficiency by keeping the compressor away from rising kitchen heat.</li><li>Features a single swing solid door, which is right-hinged, ensuring easy access while maintaining the internal temperature efficiently.</li><li>Capable of maintaining temperatures between 33 - 41 degrees F, ensuring consistent cooling for perishable goods, and meeting food safety standards.</li><li>Equipped with 3 adjustable shelves, the AWR25 offers flexibility in storage organization, allowing you to optimize space according to your needs.</li><li>Freestanding unit is easy to install and maneuver thanks to its casters, allowing for mobility while being solid enough for long-term use. The painted steel exterior ensures durability and ease of maintenance.</li><li>Uses R-290 refrigerant and is powered by a 1/4 HP compressor for reliable cooling performance. It includes a NEMA 5-15P plug type for standard commercial outlets. </li><li>The AWR25 comes with full one-year parts and labor warranty along with a five-year compressor warranty, providing peace of mind for long-term operation.</li></ul>', 'published', '[\"awr25.webp\",\"argdm23.webp\",\"ar23.webp\",\"agr23.webp\"]', 'AWR25', 0, 150, 0, 1, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2699, 1699, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 26.50, 1, 78.00, 1, 29.00, 1, 310.00, 1, NULL, 22, '2024-11-04 08:25:53', '2024-11-12 08:03:09', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'awr25.webp', 'physical', NULL, 2678, 1, 5, 7, 0, '<p>2 Years Part and Labor Warranty</p>', '2024-10-19', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', 'AWR25', 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Document 1\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/btWxwQbuKa42nFHPHn2GUnaN2Ai9PLVgP8Y42yvs.pdf\"},\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Q7C4lCFuOuSoJjKGarD5fuD1MwHynxRJtvwjBTEP.pdf\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Product Diagram\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3RcpBUcEiJK8FDOIjXs00kJ5e6Ln1Lo0OJg5oJnC.pdf\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"Product Maintenance\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6uC2kWQk1DDgmQ3vezkmZkuHjkopHmQrTVmolIUd.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'pounds', 310.00, NULL, 26.50, 1, 29.00, 1, 78.00, 1, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"AR23\"},{\"value\":\"AGR23\"},{\"value\":\"AGR49\"}]', '[\"good \",\"            better \",\"            best\"]', '[\"1695\",\"            1696\",\"            1697\"]', 'non-refundable', '10', 1, 'Color', 'blue', 'green', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'burners', '2 burners', '12,34,56', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1707, '2 Section Solid Door Commercial Refrigerator and Freezer Combo, 48\", 36 Cu.ft', '<p>The 48\" W Commercial Refrigerator and Freezer Combo is a versatile and efficient solution for commercial kitchens, providing both refrigeration and freezing capabilities in one unit. This robust appliance features dual temperature zones, with the left side operating between 33°F and 41°F for refrigeration and the right-side maintaining temperatures between -8°F and 0°F for freezing. This dual functionality allows for versatile storage of a wide range of perishable items. With a generous storage capacity of 36 cubic feet (863 liters), this combo unit offers ample space to meet the demands of busy commercial environments. The Cubigel compressor and R-290 refrigerant work together to provide efficient cooling while minimizing energy consumption.<br><br>The unit is equipped with an advanced air cooling system that ensures even temperature distribution throughout both the refrigerator and freezer sections. The auto defrost design prevents frost or ice buildup, maintaining consistent performance and reducing maintenance needs. Additionally, the innovative heating on the freezer door frame prevents the buildup of water mist, keeping the doors clear and ensuring a hygienic environment. The combo unit features two solid doors that provide secure and reliable access to the storage compartments. The smart door mechanism is designed to enhance convenience and energy efficiency. If a door is left open under 90°, it will automatically close, preventing cold air loss. However, if a door is left open over 90°, it will remain ajar, allowing for easy loading and unloading of items.<br><br>Mobility and positioning are made easy with the inclusion of heavy-duty casters. These durable wheels allow you to move the unit effortlessly within your kitchen. Certified by ETL and ETL SANITATION, this refrigerator and freezer combo meets the highest standards for safety and sanitation. Operating at 115V/60Hz/713W, it combines powerful performance with energy efficiency. Measuring 49 x 32 x 78 inches without the pallet and 52 x 34 x 80 inches with the pallet, and weighing 321 pounds (370 pounds with packaging), this appliance is a substantial and valuable addition to any commercial kitchen.</p>', '<ul><li>Dual temperature zones enables left side to operate at 33°F41°F for refrigeration, right side at -8°F0°F for freezing.<br> </li><li>Generous storage capacity offers a substantial 36 cubic feet (863 liters) of storage space for diverse kitchen needs.<br> </li><li>Efficient air cooling system utilizes R-290 refrigerant and Cubigel compressor for optimal performance and energy efficiency.<br> </li><li>Convenient auto defrost prevents frost buildup, with innovative heating on the freezer door frame to avoid water mist.<br> </li><li>Smart door mechanism allows doors to auto-close if left open under 90° and stay ajar if over 90°, enhancing convenience and energy efficiency.</li></ul>', 'published', '[\"mk-48rf-2section-39c50e46-a036-4071-98a6-6f5870e8cad3.webp\",\"mk-48rf-2section-f95ee878-78e3-4cd2-8f6b-822c11445989.webp\",\"mk-48rf-2section-53f8dbee-821c-4282-bfdd-a0e15ced84ba.webp\",\"mk-48rf-2section-99a444db-27c4-41ee-9d1c-b6654699a4bb.webp\",\"mk-48rf-2section-82f32fab-3ef5-405f-886c-1d57c6098d61.webp\",\"mk-48rf-2section-43143898-eb6c-4047-87f3-6ae683ff1392.webp\",\"mk-48rf-2section-4d8fdd4e-2b8d-4779-9074-e05ed785b740.webp\",\"mk-48rf-2section-af7d95b5-fd82-4bc1-a18b-d48676ae4e4d.webp\"]', 'MK-48RF-2Section', 0, 1000, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 1, 2830.82, 1500, '2024-11-04 14:59:54', '2024-11-15 14:59:56', 15.00, 3, 10.00, 9, 12.00, 9, 10.00, 9, 120.00, 9, NULL, 24, '2024-11-04 09:11:30', '2024-11-08 14:44:45', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'mk-48rf-2section-39c50e46-a036-4071-98a6-6f5870e8cad3.webp', 'physical', NULL, 2399, 1, 12, 7, 0, '<p>10 Year Warranty</p>', '10 Working Days', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Refrigeration', 'MK-48RF-2Section', 1, '[{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/ETkAG86s3tTGM01WsAZzq9hfs2fgOw4ChtgrW871.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/p9zXVduYZ5zYRvf3eyGky5nhpVou2GZXSKvXodea.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Assembling\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/pMCVfwJS4gAdncOUpt1I8ll8bVcU6Jw7jLft00lH.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Disassembling\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/n7gFePdjLXPLYzg6qppZyPdHpZOCLMBjvN2SEtwy.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[\"videos/MUCtGZ8Al17TRETDiSkLPOCjR5ICGxlLVqJq2x08.mp4\",\"videos/OCpLTJd7VNEM4xdAVmC7uW7i3GZyR1vJlvEPbzEa.mkv\"]', 0, NULL, 'pounds', 350.00, NULL, 16.00, 9, 12.00, 9, 12.00, 9, 10.00, 9, '[{\"value\":\"1707\"},{\"value\":\"1706\"},{\"value\":\"1705\"},{\"value\":\"1701\"},{\"value\":\"1702\"}]', '[\"1707\",\"    1706\",\"    1705\",\"    1704\",\"    1703\"]', '[\"1703\",\"    1704\",\"    1705\",\"    1706\",\"    1707\"]', 'non-refundable', '10', 1, 'Color', 'Black', '1707', 'Material', 'Stainless Steel', '1707', 'Other Available Option', 'Single Door', '1706', 'Other Available Size', '30.75', '1705'),
(1708, 'Arctic Air AWR25 30.75 Single Door Reach-In Refrigerator in White', '<p>The Arctic Air AWR25 30.75 Single Door Reach-In Refrigerator in White is an efficient, commercial-grade unit, designed for temperature accuracy and durability. It features an electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display, allowing precise temperature control and easy monitoring. The interior has bright white ABS sidewalls paired with a high-grade stainless steel floor with coved corners for easy cleaning. Storage flexibility is provided through three adjustable, heavy-duty epoxy-coated wire shelves, while the self-contained capillary tube system uses environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant, aligning with modern sustainability standards. The refrigerator\'s exterior is constructed from white epoxy-coated steel for a clean, professional look, with a bottom-mounted compressor for optimal efficiency in cooler areas of the kitchen. The condensate heating element built into the pan ensures effective water evaporation. It includes a field-reversible, lockable door with a foamed-in-place recessed handle for convenience and security. For smooth mobility, it is equipped with easy-to-mount casters (two lockable). Additionally, larger fan motors and blades increase airflow, speeding up temperature recovery. The refrigerator is NSF Standard 7 certified, ensuring it meets food storage safety requirements. <br><br><span class=\"ui-provider\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Weight &amp; Dimensions:</strong></span>  <br><br><strong>Width: 30 3/4 Inches </strong><br><strong>Depth: 29 Inches </strong><br><strong>Height: 78 Inches </strong><br><strong>Weight: 310 lb.</strong></p>', '<ul><li>The Arctic Air AWR25 measures 30 3/4 inches wide, 29 inches deep, and 78 inches high, providing a compact and spacious design for commercial refrigeration needs.</li><li>With a shipping weight of 310 lbs, it is built to be durable and strong, suitable for various commercial kitchen environments.</li><li>Runs on 3 Amps, 115 Volts, and 60 Hertz in a 1-phase configuration, making it efficient and compatible with standard commercial electrical setups.</li><li>Offering a generous 25 cu. ft. of internal storage, the AWR25 provides plenty of space for storing refrigerated items, ideal for mid-size commercial kitchens or restaurants.</li><li>Bottom-mounted compressor ensures easy access for maintenance and offers improved cooling efficiency by keeping the compressor away from rising kitchen heat.</li><li>Features a single swing solid door, which is right-hinged, ensuring easy access while maintaining the internal temperature efficiently.</li><li>Capable of maintaining temperatures between 33 - 41 degrees F, ensuring consistent cooling for perishable goods, and meeting food safety standards.</li><li>Equipped with 3 adjustable shelves, the AWR25 offers flexibility in storage organization, allowing you to optimize space according to your needs.</li><li>Freestanding unit is easy to install and maneuver thanks to its casters, allowing for mobility while being solid enough for long-term use. The painted steel exterior ensures durability and ease of maintenance.</li><li>Uses R-290 refrigerant and is powered by a 1/4 HP compressor for reliable cooling performance. It includes a NEMA 5-15P plug type for standard commercial outlets. </li><li>The AWR25 comes with full one-year parts and labor warranty along with a five-year compressor warranty, providing peace of mind for long-term operation.</li></ul>', 'published', '[\"awr25.webp\",\"argdm23.webp\",\"ar23.webp\",\"agr23.webp\"]', 'AWR25', 0, 148, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 2699, 1699, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 26.50, 1, 78.00, 1, 29.00, 1, 310.00, 1, NULL, 20, '2024-11-04 11:00:14', '2024-12-06 18:49:17', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'awr25.webp', 'physical', NULL, 2678, 1, 5, 7, 0, '<p>2 Years Part and Labor Warranty</p>', '2024-10-19', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', 'AWR25', 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Do