Amps, 115 Volts, and 60 Hertz in a 1-phase configuration, making it efficient and compatible with standard commercial electrical setups.</li><li>Offering a generous 25 cu. ft. of internal storage, the AWR25 provides plenty of space for storing refrigerated items, ideal for mid-size commercial kitchens or restaurants.</li><li>Bottom-mounted compressor ensures easy access for maintenance and offers improved cooling efficiency by keeping the compressor away from rising kitchen heat.</li><li>Features a single swing solid door, which is right-hinged, ensuring easy access while maintaining the internal temperature efficiently.</li><li>Capable of maintaining temperatures between 33 - 41 degrees F, ensuring consistent cooling for perishable goods, and meeting food safety standards.</li><li>Equipped with 3 adjustable shelves, the AWR25 offers flexibility in storage organization, allowing you to optimize space according to your needs.</li><li>Freestanding unit is easy to install and maneuver thanks to its casters, allowing for mobility while being solid enough for long-term use. The painted steel exterior ensures durability and ease of maintenance.</li><li>Uses R-290 refrigerant and is powered by a 1/4 HP compressor for reliable cooling performance. It includes a NEMA 5-15P plug type for standard commercial outlets. </li><li>The AWR25 comes with full one-year parts and labor warranty along with a five-year compressor warranty, providing peace of mind for long-term operation.</li></ul>', 'published', '[\"awr25.webp\",\"argdm23.webp\",\"ar23.webp\",\"agr23.webp\"]', 'AWR25', 0, 149, 0, 1, 1, 13, 0, 0, 2699, 1699, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 26.50, 1, 78.00, 1, 29.00, 1, 310.00, 1, NULL, 24, '2024-11-04 11:01:18', '2024-11-25 11:58:21', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'awr25.webp', 'physical', NULL, 2678, 1, 5, 7, 0, '<p>2 Years Part and Labor Warranty</p>', '2024-10-19', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', 'AWR25', 1, '{\"0\":{\"title\":\"Do