(1710, 'Amana', '<p>The Arctic Air 69436 is a specialized can divider designed specifically for AUB models, offering enhanced organization and accessibility for canned goods. It contains one shelf along with four mounting clips, ensuring secure installation and stability. With a shipping weight of 6 lbs and a product weight of 6 lbs, it is lightweight and strong, making it a practical addition to your storage setup. Crafted to fit perfectly with the vertical divider system of AUB models, it optimizes space within refrigeration units, allowing for efficient storage and easy retrieval of cans. Its design promotes better organization, minimizing clutter and maximizing the use of vertical space. By incorporating this divider, users can streamline their food storage operations while maintaining a clean and professional appearance in their kitchens. Weight &amp; Dimensions Shipping Weight 6 lbs Product Weight 6 lbs</p>', '<ul><li>Shipping weight of the can divider is 6 lbs, making it lightweight and easy to handle during transportation.</li><li>Poduct weight is also 6 lbs, ensuring that it is a compact and efficient addition to your refrigeration setup.</li><li>Set contains one shelf and four mounting clips, providing all necessary parts for installation and use.</li><li>Specifically designed to fit AUB models only, ensuring a perfect fit and optimal functionality.</li><li>Vertical divider design helps organize cans and other items efficiently, maximizing space within your refrigeration unit.<br> </li></ul>', 'published', '[\"69436-2.jpg\",\"64900k.webp\",\"70250k.webp\",\"70118k.webp\"]', '1233214', 0, 148, 0, 1, 1, 18, 0, 0, 150, 63, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 0.00, 1, 0.00, 1, 0.00, 1, 6.00, 1, NULL, 20, '2024-11-06 13:36:51', '2024-11-18 09:25:54', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', '69436-2.jpg', 'physical', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 7, 0, '<p>Two Year Parts &amp; Labor Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 1, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', 'Refrigeration', NULL, NULL,