(1713, 'True STA1H-2HS 27 1/2 Spec Series Full Height Insulated Mobile Heated Cabinet with 3 Pan Capacity,Silver, 208-230v/1ph', '<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-family:Montserrat;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\">The True STA1H-2HS is a full-height, mobile heated cabinet designed for efficient food holding and transport in commercial kitchens. Measuring 27 1/2 inches wide, this cabinet features a robust stainless steel exterior with a sleek silver finish, providing durability and ease of cleaning. It is equipped with full insulation to maintain consistent temperatures, ensuring that food stays hot and ready for service. The cabinet\'s design includes a capacity for up to three full-size pans, making it versatile for various food items. Powered by a 208-230V/1PH electrical system, the STA1H-2HS utilizes an advanced heating system to provide reliable heat distribution. The cabinet features a built-in thermostat and an adjustable temperature range to accommodate different food holding requirements. Its mobile design, supported by heavy-duty casters, allows for easy maneuverability in a busy kitchen environment. The cabinet is an ideal solution for keeping large quantities of food at the perfect serving temperature, enhancing efficiency and service quality in foodservice operations.</span>  </span></p>', '<ul><li style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(74,74,74);font-family:Montserrat;font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.4;margin-bottom:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\">The cabinet is constructed with a stainless steel exterior and an aluminum interior, ensuring durability and ease of cleaning. It features high-density, CFC-free polyurethane insulation, which enhances thermal efficiency and maintains consistent temperatures.</li><li style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(74,74,74);font-family:Montserrat;font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.4;margin-bottom:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\">Equipped with a forced-air heating system, the cabinet provides even heat distribution to keep food at the desired temperature. The heating element is designed to maintain a consistent temperature range, ensuring food safety and quality.</li><li style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(74,74,74);font-family:Montserrat;font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.4;margin-bottom:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\">The cabinet has a three-pan capacity, which allows for the storage of large quantities of food. The interior can accommodate standard-sized pans, making it versatile for various foodservice needs.</li><li style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(74,74,74);font-family:Montserrat;font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.4;margin-bottom:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\">It includes heavy-duty casters, which facilitate easy movement and positioning within a commercial kitchen. The cabinet also features hinged doors with a full-height design, allowing easy access to the interior and efficient loading and unloading.</li><li style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(74,74,74);font-family:Montserrat;font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.4;margin-bottom:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\">Operating on a 208-230V, 1-phase electrical system, this heated cabinet is suitable for high-demand environments. It is designed to deliver reliable performance and consistent heating, making it ideal for maintaining food temperatures during service.</li></ul>', '', '[\"sssp-1\\/sta1h-2hs-999e4bd4-c16e-4563-9827-03e607603a82.webp\",\"sssp-1\\/sta1h-2hs-999e4bd4-c16e-4563-9827-03e607603a82.webp\"]', 'STA1H-2HSs', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, NULL, 