(1715, 'Everest Refrigeration ECF1 23 1/2\" Back Mount Nitro Cold Brew Coffee Dispenser Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', '<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-family:Montserrat;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\">The Everest Refrigeration ECF1 23 1/2\" Back Mount Nitro Cold Brew Coffee Dispenser Refrigerator is crafted for efficiency and practicality in commercial coffee settings. The unit, featuring a sleek black finish, is designed with a solid swing door for easy access. It has a total capacity of 8 cu. ft., with dimensions of 23.5 inches in width, 32 inches in depth, and 39.375 inches in height. The ECF1 is equipped with Blizzard R290, an advanced cooling technology that uses a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant. This system meets the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, ensuring lower energy costs and reduced carbon emissions. The all-in-one, slide-out cooling cartridge provides rapid cooling and ease of maintenance without the need for onsite brazing. Operating on 115 volts, 60 Hz, and 2.5 amps with a 1/5 horsepower compressor, the unit has a crated weight of 177 lbs. Its back mount design allows for efficient use of kitchen space, making it a reliable choice for cafes, restaurants, and bars looking to streamline their cold brew coffee service.</span>  </span></p>', '<h2>Features:</h2><ul><li>Features an 8 cu. ft. capacity, providing ample space for cold brew coffee storage, ideal for cafes and restaurants with high coffee demand.</li><li>Offers a swing solid door for easy access and secure storage, ensuring convenience in busy bar settings.</li><li>More efficient cooling with Blizzard R290 technology, helping reduce energy costs and carbon emissions, aligning with eco-friendly business practices.</li><li>Includes a back mount design for efficient use of floor space, making it suitable for compact kitchen layouts.</li><li>Provides a compact 23.5-inch width, fitting well in various setups while offering reliable cold brew dispensing.</li></ul>', 'draft', '[\"sssp-1\\/ecf1-8540066a-de80-4d7b-bef5-9c1ac094e20a.webp\"]', 'ECF1', 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 13, 0, 0, 3936, 7872, NULL, NULL, 23.00, 3, 0.00, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 177.00, 9, NULL, 0, '2024-11-29 06:58:08', '2024-12-13 12:46:32', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'sssp-1/ecf1-8540066a-de80-4d7b-bef5-9c1ac094e20a.webp', 'physical', NULL, 3373, 1, 1, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', '5 Days', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', 'Coffee Urns', 'ECF1', 1, '[{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/PlL9vt1B5y1GrDY2WBqq8gfaXHG5cxhnXe6ZsYh4.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/KupjJT6Qct69MFPpQK8HEV8MqM4CKrFTcSS3rIQM.pdf\"}]', NULL, '', 0, NULL, 'pounds', 177.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 24.00, NULL, '[]', '[]', '[]', '15 days', '8 Days', 1, 'Color', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1716, 'Cadco VariKwik VK-120-SS Stainless Steel Countertop High-Speed Oven with Touchscreen - 1,650W, 120V', '<p>The Cadco VariKwik VK-120-SS is a cutting-edge countertop high-speed oven designed to meet the needs of busy commercial kitchens. With a sleek stainless steel exterior and a user-friendly touchscreen control panel, this oven combines modern design with advanced cooking technology. It offers a capacity of 0.7 cubic feet, making it suitable for preparing a variety of dishes, including pizzas up to 10 inches in diameter. This versatile oven utilizes a combination of convection, radiant, and conductive heating methods to achieve cooking results quickly and evenly, with a maximum temperature of 500 degrees Fahrenheit. The LED lighting enhances visibility inside the cooking chamber, while the NSF listing confirms compliance with health and safety standards. Designed for countertop installation, the oven is powered by 1,650 watts and operates on 120 volts, making it an efficient choice for commercial environments.</p>', '<h2><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul><li>Dimensions: 24\"\" W x 23 3/4\"\" D x 12 1/2\"\" H – Compact design perfect for countertop placement in kitchens with limited space. </li><li>Interior Dimensions: 14 3/4\"\" W x 11\"\" D x 7 1/2\"\" H – Sufficient interior space for various cooking needs. </li><li>Amps: 13.75 Amps – Efficient energy usage for high-performance cooking. </li><li>Phase: 1 Phase – Compatible with standard single-phase electrical systems. </li><li>Control Type: Touchscreen – Intuitive interface for easy operation and program selection. </li><li>Door Type: Glass – Allows for visibility of cooking progress without losing heat. </li><li>Exterior Material: Stainless Steel – Durable and easy to clean, ensuring longevity and maintaining hygiene. </li><li>Features: Includes LED lighting, programmable cooking options, and made in America for quality assurance. </li><li>Heating Source: Convection, Radiant, &amp; Conductive – Multi-faceted cooking methods for rapid and efficient food preparation. </li><li>Hinge Location: Bottom – Easy access to the cooking chamber. </li><li>Installation Type: Countertop – Designed for convenient placement in commercial kitchens. </li><li>Maximum Temperature: 500°F – Versatile cooking capabilities for a variety of dishes. </li><li>Number of Doors: 1 Door – Simplifies access to the oven interior. </li><li>Pizza Size: Accommodates pizzas up to 10 inches – Perfect for quick pizza preparation. </li><li>Plug Type: NEMA 5-20P – Compatible with standard commercial outlets. </li><li>Power Type: Electric – Provides consistent and reliable heating. </li><li>Type: Rapid Cook Ovens – Ideal for fast-paced cooking environments where speed and efficiency are essential.</li></ul>', 'pending', '[\"sssp-1\\/vkii-220-ss.webp\"]', 'VK-120-SS', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 13, 0, 0, 3134, 6268, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 14.00, NULL, 7.50, NULL, 11.00, NULL, 77.00, 1, NULL, 1, '2024-11-29 08:47:47', '2024-12-13 14:13:53', 'out_of_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'sssp-1/vkii-220-ss.webp', 'physical', NULL, 2725, 4, 1, 18, 0, 'One year warranty on all oven motors', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', '', '', 1, '[{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/jyDfkW4DoelxHLxZAtEO5bXn2mcZFIWAkhhzG7Wa.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/sWA61wzdp6YJ1RAIIRiCG2tsNWYoEUmt3mx6LR0r.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Warranty\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/UJfWF9yVMDJk5OowABwfwSRTDkz4O0raSV0Bepyt.pdf\"}]', NULL, '', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB24\"}]', '[]', '[]', 'non-refundable', '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1717, 'Cadco VariKwik VKII-220-SS Stainless Steel Countertop High-Speed Oven with 2 1/2\" Touchscreen - 4,200W, 220V', '<p>The Cadco VariKwik VKII-220-SS is a powerful and efficient countertop high-speed oven designed for commercial kitchens that demand quick and versatile cooking solutions. Featuring a robust stainless steel exterior, this oven is both durable and easy to clean. The 2 1/2-inch touchscreen control panel provides intuitive operation, allowing users to program and customize cooking settings with ease. With a capacity of 0.9 cubic feet, this oven can accommodate pizzas up to 14 inches in diameter and a variety of other dishes. Utilizing a combination of convection, radiant, and conductive heating, the oven reaches a maximum temperature of 500 degrees Fahrenheit, ensuring rapid and even cooking. Additional features include LED lighting for enhanced visibility, and its NSF listing guarantees compliance with health and safety standards. Designed for countertop installation, this high-speed oven operates on 220 volts and consumes 4,200 watts, making it an ideal choice for fast-paced commercial environments.</p>', '<h2><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul><li>Dimensions: 24\"\" W x 26 3/4\"\" D x 12 1/2\"\" H – Compact design suitable for countertop placement in commercial kitchens. </li><li>Interior Dimensions: 14 3/4\"\" W x 14 1/4\"\" D x 7 1/2\"\" H – Provides ample space for a variety of cooking needs. </li><li>Amps: 19 Amps – High power consumption for optimal cooking performance. </li><li>Phase: 1 Phase – Compatible with standard single-phase electrical systems. </li><li>Control Type: Touchscreen – User-friendly interface for easy operation and programming. </li><li>Display Size: 2 1/2 Inches – Clear and accessible display for navigating settings. </li><li>Door Type: Glass – Allows visibility into the cooking chamber without opening the door. </li><li>Exterior Material: Stainless Steel – Ensures durability and easy cleaning. </li><li>Features: Includes LED lighting, programmable settings, and made in America for quality assurance. </li><li>Heating Source: Convection, Radiant, &amp; Conductive – Versatile heating methods for rapid cooking. </li><li>Hinge Location: Bottom – Facilitates easy access to the cooking area. </li><li>Installation Type: Countertop – Designed for straightforward placement in kitchens. </li><li>Maximum Temperature: 500°F – Suitable for a wide range of cooking applications. </li><li>Number of Doors: 1 Door – Simplifies access to the oven interior. </li><li>Pizza Size: Accommodates pizzas up to 14 inches – Ideal for quick pizza preparation. </li><li>Plug Type: NEMA 6-20P – Compatible with standard 220V outlets. </li><li>Power Type: Electric – Reliable heating source for consistent performance. </li><li>Type: Rapid Cook Ovens – Perfect for high-demand environments requiring speed and efficiency.</li></ul>', 'pending', '[\"sssp-1\\/vkii-220-ss.webp\"]', 'VKII-220-SS', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 13, 0, 0, 3767, 7534, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 14.00, NULL, 7.50, NULL, 14.50, NULL, 82.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-11-29 08:47:47', '2024-12-13 14:13:53', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'sssp-1/vkii-220-ss.webp', 'physical', NULL, 3275, 4, 1, 18, 0, 'One year warranty on all oven motors', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', '', '', 1, '[{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/emvOmET3YGYfIuQ48xtdZCleXqomL29ry3dNZLuq.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/BTgGYRTYIKWWA2EGtTa4r3WJfyPDqF3z227Z0ohL.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Warranty\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/vR6C98Sagqgolco2L0rLPod42Y2JT756bVKDdkiF.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/0dNIQzqZNwwDRduiyhoukvPEQJihNOu1h63Rdq3P.pdf\"}]', NULL, '', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB25\"}]', '[]', '[]', 'non-refundable', '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '',