(1718, 'Cadco VariKwik VKII-220-SS+ Stainless Steel Countertop High-Speed Oven with 7\" Touchscreen - 4,200W, 220V', '<p>The Cadco VariKwik VKII-220-SS+ is a state-of-the-art countertop high-speed oven designed for efficiency and versatility in commercial kitchens. This robust oven features a spacious 7-inch touchscreen control panel, making it easy to navigate and customize cooking programs. Constructed with durable stainless steel, it not only ensures longevity but also offers a sleek and professional appearance. With a capacity of 0.9 cubic feet, this oven can accommodate pizzas up to 14 inches in diameter and utilizes a combination of convection, radiant, and conductive heating methods to deliver rapid cooking results. Capable of reaching temperatures up to 500 degrees Fahrenheit, the VKII-220-SS+ is perfect for a variety of cooking applications, making it an ideal choice for fast-paced environments where efficiency is key. Additional features such as LED lighting enhance visibility inside the cooking chamber, while the NSF listing confirms its adherence to safety and sanitation standards, ensuring reliability in food preparation.</p>', '<h2><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul><li>Dimensions: 24\"\" W x 26 3/4\"\" D x 12 1/2\"\" H – Compact footprint ideal for countertop placement.</li><li>Interior Dimensions: 14 3/4\"\" W x 14 1/4\"\" D x 7 1/2\"\" H – Generous cooking space to accommodate various dishes. </li><li>Amps: 19 Amps – Provides efficient power usage for high-performance cooking. </li><li>Phase: 1 Phase – Compatible with standard single-phase power supply. </li><li>Control Type: Touchscreen – Intuitive interface for easy operation and program selection. </li><li>Display Size: 7 Inches – Large display for clear visibility of settings and cooking progress. </li><li>Door Type: Glass – Allows for easy monitoring of food without losing heat. </li><li>Exterior Material: Stainless Steel – Durable, easy to clean, and visually appealing. </li><li>Maximum Temperature: 500°F – Versatile cooking capabilities for a wide range of dishes. </li><li>Plug Type: NEMA 6-20P – Suitable for standard 220V electrical outlets, ensuring easy setup in commercial kitchens.</li></ul>', 'pending', '[\"sssp-1\\/vkii-220-ss.webp\"]', 'VKll-220-SS+', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 13, 0, 0, 4485, 8970, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 14.00, NULL, 7.50, NULL, 14.50, NULL, 82.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-11-29 08:47:47', '2024-12-13 14:13:53', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'sssp-1/vkii-220-ss.webp', 'physical', NULL, 3900, 4, 1, 18, 0, 'One year warranty on all oven motors', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', '', '', 1, '[{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/o4yzuFYohrdOH2YsTXoVKXePS0lZrQExFKnvxTso.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/amoAPAVHYtgV9zwuzIPLnpkIiNCRwtefggoBA6dO.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Warranty\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/MIAw95vyv4UWrlCXKUHTF3GYlanZxZjj1oi232ei.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/ZYxH6Xf6vLPA9ItFETEMxjbc0ty2RlU5Nqilsj1e.pdf\"}]', NULL, '', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB26\"}]', '[]', '[]', 'non-refundable', '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1719, 'Cadco VKII-220 VariKwik High Speed Countertop Convection Oven, 220v/1ph123', '<p>The Cadco VKII-220 VariKwik High Speed Countertop Convection Oven is engineered for rapid cooking and versatile food preparation in commercial kitchens. With its innovative combination of conduction, convection, and infrared heating technologies, this oven can significantly reduce cooking times while delivering consistent results. Its spacious cooking chamber, measuring 14 3/4 inches wide, 14 1/4 inches deep, and 7 1/2 inches high, allows for various culinary applications, from baking to broiling. The independent door design ensures easy access and efficient operation, making it an excellent choice for busy food service environments. Built with a robust stainless steel construction, the VKII-220 not only looks sleek but is also durable and easy to maintain.</p>', '<h2><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul><li>High Speed Cooking: Utilizes conduction, convection, and infrared heating.</li><li>Spacious Cooking Chamber: Measures 14 3/4\"\" W x 14 1/4\"\" D x 7 1/2\"\" H.</li><li>Independent Door Design: Facilitates easy access and operation.</li><li>Powerful Output: 4,200 watts for efficient cooking performance.</li><li>Stainless Steel Construction: Ensures durability and ease of cleaning.</li><li>Energy Efficient: Operates on 220V, 60 Hz, 1-phase electrical supply.</li><li>Compact Footprint: Overall dimensions of 23 1/4\"\" W x 26 3/4\"\" D x 12 1/2\"\" H.</li><li>CrisPlate Size: Fits a 14\"\" W x 14\"\" D cooking surface.</li><li>One-Year Warranty: Covers parts and labor for peace of mind.</li><li>NEMA 5-15P Plug: Standard plug type for easy connection.</li></ul>', 'pending', '[\"sssp-1\\/vkii-220-ss.webp\"]', 'VKII-220', 0, 100, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 1500, 1200, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 17.00, NULL, 7.50, NULL, 14.50, NULL, 82.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-11-29 13:34:10', '2024-12-13 14:13:53', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'sssp-1/vkii-220-ss.webp', 'physical', NULL, 3275, 4, 1, 18, 0, 'One year warranty on all oven motors', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', 1, '[{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/4TpDNZYWSBgzOehgV4H7RwmGTzn4Wf8sjCCvHBj2.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/R9B2gPbfDcIML7XbYKhYlc3qrmRIM4ZUVmXnRRhV.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Warranty\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/EeFx2azFyasb0ZOlHds1HV5jYmYORg5u0DzdTT5L.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/L9nvIGIQSQfosJKjIeoGfztyFsFHlgu62XUaBelk.pdf\"}]', NULL, '', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB27\"}]', '[]', '[]', 'non-refundable', '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1720, 'Midea MIC3400WK 14.8\"  Single Hob Countertop Induction Cooktop with Thermostatic Controls, Stainless Steel, 240v/1ph, 3400W', '<p>The Midea MIC3400WK is a versatile 14.8\" countertop induction cooktop designed for efficient and precise cooking. It features a recessed glass-ceramic wok bowl, paired with an included wok pan, making it ideal for high-heat stir-frying. With thermostatic controls and five adjustable power levels, this single-hob unit allows for precise temperature management and flexibility in cooking. Its durable stainless steel exterior and slip-resistant metal feet ensure stability and longevity, while five cooling fans and a protective air deflector enhance safety and performance. Equipped with a 24-hour timer and operating at 3400 watts (240V/1ph), this cooktop is both powerful and user-friendly. Certified by cETLus, ETL-Sanitation, and IPX3, it meets rigorous safety and sanitation standards, making it a reliable choice for professional and home kitchens.</p>', '<p>Induction Technology: Provides rapid and energy-efficient heating by transferring heat directly to the cookware, ensuring minimal heat loss.<br>Power Output: 3400 watts of power for high-speed cooking, suitable for demanding kitchen environments.<br>Power Levels: Offers five adjustable power levels, giving chefs control over heat intensity for precise cooking.<br>Recessed Glass-Ceramic Wok Bowl: The hob features a specially designed recessed bowl, ideal for wok cooking. This design ensures that the wok pan remains stable and evenly heated.<br>Includes Wok Pan: Comes with a wok pan, making it ready for immediate use.<br>Compact Dimensions: Measuring 14.8\" (W) x 19.7\" (D) x 7.4\" (H), it fits comfortably on most countertops, making it ideal for kitchens with limited space.<br>Thermostatic Dial Controls: Intuitive dial for adjusting power and temperature levels, allowing easy operation.<br>24-Hour Timer: Built-in timer for precise cooking durations, suitable for tasks requiring long or short cook times.<br>Five Cooling Fans: Equipped with five silent cooling fans to maintain optimal internal temperatures and ensure consistent performance during prolonged use.<br>Protective Air Deflector: Directs hot exhaust away from the unit to prevent overheating and contamination from external sources.<br>Overheating Protection: A thermostatically controlled overheating sensor enhances safety by shutting the unit down if temperatures exceed safe levels.<br>Slip-Resistant Feet: Sturdy metal feet provide stability on countertops, preventing accidental movement during operation.<br>Waterproof Rating: Certified IPX3, offering protection against water splashes, making it safer and easier to clean.<br>Stainless Steel Exterior: The robust body is resistant to rust, corrosion, and wear, ensuring long-term durability.<br>Glass-Ceramic Surface: Scratch-resistant and easy to clean, maintaining a sleek appearance even after heavy use.<br>cETLus and ETL-Sanitation: Meets North American safety and sanitation standards.<br>NEMA 6-20P Plug: Ensures compatibility with most commercial kitchen power outlets.<br>Lightweight: Weighing only 29.1 lbs, it is easy to transport and reposition as needed in dynamic kitchen setups.</p>', 'pending', '[\"products\\/mic3400wk.webp\"]', 'MIC3400WK', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 29, 0, 0, 584.1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 15.00, NULL, 7.00, NULL, 20.00, NULL, 29.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 11:48:15', '2024-12-30 07:01:20', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', NULL, 'physical', NULL, 495, 4, 0, 21, 0, '<p>1 Year Limited Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, 1, '[]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB28\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1721, 'Midea MIC3400F 14.2\"  Single Hob Countertop Induction Cooktop with Thermostatic Contols, Stainless Steel, 240v/1ph, 3400W', '<p>The Midea MIC3400F is a compact and efficient 14.2\" countertop induction cooktop, ideal for precise and fast cooking. Featuring a durable ceramic glass top and a single hob with five adjustable power levels, it delivers between 3000 and 5000 watts of power for versatile cooking needs. Its stainless steel exterior, slip-resistant metal feet, and advanced safety features, including an overheat sensor and pan detection, ensure durability and secure operation. Equipped with a 24-hour timer, five cooling fans, and a protective air deflector, it balances performance and safety. Operating at 3400 watts (240V/1ph), this cooktop is cETLus, ETL-Sanitation, and IPX3 certified, meeting high safety and sanitation standards. Lightweight and compact, its perfect for professional and home kitchens seeking reliable performance.</p>', '<p>High Power Output: The burner operates at 3400 watts, with adjustable wattage from 3000 to 5000 watts, providing versatility for a variety of cooking methods.<br>Induction Technology: Directly transfers heat to the cookware, reducing energy waste and ensuring faster heating compared to traditional cooktops.<br>Five Power Levels: Offers a range of heating options to suit different cooking requirements, from simmering to high-heat cooking.<br>Thermostatic Controls: Features a dial control for precise temperature and power adjustments, giving chefs optimal control over cooking conditions.<br>24-Hour Timer: Enables precise timing for recipes requiring long or short cooking durations.<br>Pan Detection Technology: Ensures that the burner only operates when a compatible induction-ready pan is present, enhancing safety and energy efficiency.<br>Overheat Sensor: Automatically shuts off the unit if the temperature exceeds safe operating limits, preventing accidents and damage.<br>Slip-Resistant Metal Feet: Provides stability on countertops, minimizing the risk of the cooktop shifting during use.<br>Ceramic Glass Top: Scratch-resistant and easy to clean, this surface is designed for durability and efficient heat transfer.<br>Stainless Steel Exterior: Corrosion-resistant and robust, ensuring the cooktops longevity even in demanding kitchen environments.<br>Compact Size: Measuring 14.2\" (W) x 17.7\" (D) x 5.1\" (H) and weighing only 19.51 lbs, this lightweight unit is portable and fits into tight kitchen spaces.<br>Five Cooling Fans: Efficiently dissipates heat to maintain optimal internal temperatures, prolonging the unit\'s lifespan and ensuring consistent performance.<br>Protective Air Deflector: Shields the cooktop from external contamination and prevents hot exhaust from re-entering the unit.<br>cETLus and ETL-Sanitation: Meets rigorous safety and sanitation standards for commercial kitchen appliances.<br>IPX3 Rating: Ensures protection against water splashes, making it safe to use and clean.<br>Power Requirements: Operates at 240V/60Hz, single-phase, drawing 14.6 amps, compatible with most commercial setups.<br>NEMA 6-20P Plug: Standardized plug type for easy installation in commercial or residential kitchens.</p>', 'pending', '[\"buffet-and-food-displays-1\\/live-cooking-station.webp\"]', 'MIC3400F', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 29, 0, 0, 477.9, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 14.00, NULL, 5.00, NULL, 18.00, NULL, 20.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 11:48:15', '2024-12-18 08:33:49', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', NULL, 'physical', NULL, 405, 4, 0, 21, 0, '<p>2 Year Limited Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, 1, '[]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB29\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1722, 'Midea MIC1800F 14.2\"  Countertop Induction Cooktop with Thermostatic Controls, Stainless Steel, 120v/1ph, 1800W', '<p>The Midea MIC1800F is a compact 14.2\" countertop induction cooktop designed for efficient and precise cooking. Featuring a durable ceramic glass top and a single hob, it offers five adjustable power levels with a wattage range of 300 to 1800 watts, making it suitable for various cooking tasks. Its stainless steel exterior, slip-resistant metal feet, and advanced safety features such as an overheat sensor and pan detection ensure reliable and safe operation. Additional features include a 24-hour timer, five cooling fans, and a protective air deflector to enhance performance and safety. Operating at 1800 watts (120V/1ph), this cooktop is lightweight, portable, and certified by cETLus, ETL-Sanitation, and IPX3, making it an excellent choice for professional or home kitchens.</p>', '<p>Power Output: Delivers 1800 watts, adjustable between 300 and 1800 watts, suitable for a wide range of cooking techniques, from simmering to boiling.<br>Induction Technology: Provides direct heat transfer to compatible cookware, ensuring faster heating and energy efficiency while minimizing heat loss.<br>Five Power Levels: Offers flexibility to match different cooking tasks, enabling precise control over heat intensity.<br>Thermostatic Dial Control: Intuitive control for adjusting power and temperature, ensuring consistency in cooking.<br>24-Hour Timer: Allows for extended cooking times with precise control, ideal for recipes requiring long durations.<br>Pan Detection Technology: Ensures the cooktop only operates when induction-ready cookware is in place, enhancing safety and conserving energy.<br>Overheat Sensor: Protects the unit by shutting it off automatically if it exceeds safe operating temperatures.<br>Slip-Resistant Feet: Provides stability on countertops, preventing the cooktop from moving during use.<br>Ceramic Glass Top: Durable, scratch-resistant, and easy to clean, designed for efficiency and long-lasting use.<br>Stainless Steel Exterior: Corrosion-resistant and robust, suitable for demanding kitchen environments.<br>Lightweight and Portable: Weighing only 19.29 lbs and measuring 14.2\" (W) x 17.7\" (D) x 5.1\" (H), it is easy to transport and fits comfortably on most countertops.<br>Five Cooling Fans: Integrated cooling system ensures the unit remains at optimal temperatures for consistent performance and extended durability.<br>Protective Air Deflector: Prevents external contamination and protects internal components from hot exhaust.<br>cETLus and ETL-Sanitation: Meets stringent safety and sanitation standards for commercial and residential use.<br>IPX3 Rating: Provides protection against water splashes, enhancing safety during use and cleaning.<br>Power Requirements: Operates on 120V/60Hz single-phase power, drawing 15 amps, suitable for standard residential outlets.<br>NEMA 5-15P Plug: Equipped with a standard plug for easy compatibility with household outlets.</p>', 'pending', '[\"buffet-and-food-displays-4\\/guest-room-supplies.webp\"]', 'MIC1800F', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 29, 0, 0, 477.9, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 14.00, NULL, 5.00, NULL, 18.00, NULL, 20.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 11:48:15', '2024-12-23 12:36:12', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', NULL, 'physical', NULL, 405, 4, 0, 21, 0, '<p>3 Year Limited Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, 1, '[]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB30\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1723, 'Midea 1217G1S 16.5\"  Commercial Microwave Oven with Touch Control Pad, Stainless Steel, 120v/1ph, 1200W, 0.6 cu. ft.', '<p>The Midea 1217G1S is a 16.5\" stainless steel commercial microwave oven designed for medium-duty use, making it perfect for food service operations that require efficient heating and cooking. With a power output of 1200 watts and a compact 0.6 cu. ft. capacity, it offers reliable performance in a small footprint. The touch control pad provides easy operation with 11 power levels, ensuring precise cooking for a variety of dishes. Its durable stainless steel construction ensures longevity, while the sleek design fits seamlessly into professional kitchen setups. Operating on 120V/1ph, this microwave is both powerful and user-friendly, ideal for busy commercial environments.</p>', '<p>Fast and Consistent Heating: The 1200 Watts power output provides fast and consistent heating that is perfect for medium-duty use in commercial kitchens.<br>11 Power Levels: Offers 11 power levels and precise control over cooking and reheating, accommodating a variety of food items and preparation needs.<br>Sufficient Space: It offers 0.6 cubic feet space for heating smaller food portions or dishes, while remaining compact for tight kitchen spaces.<br>Accommodates Common Dish Sizes: Fits standard commercial plates, ensuring versatility for a variety of serving needs.<br>Stainless Steel Construction: The exterior and interior are made of durable stainless steel, ensuring longevity, easy cleaning, and a professional appearance.<br>Compact Footprint: With dimensions of 16.5\" (W) x 22.13\" (D) x 13.38\" (H), the unit saves valuable countertop space while delivering high performance.<br>Touch Control Pad: Features intuitive controls with clearly labeled options, making it simple to operate even in fast-paced environments.<br>Multiple Cooking Options: Programmable settings allow users to store frequently used recipes, streamlining operations and reducing prep time.<br>Commercial Grade: Engineered for reliability in medium-duty commercial settings, such as restaurants, catering businesses, and break rooms.<br>Safety and Quality Approvals: Meets industry standards for performance and sanitation.<br>120V/1ph Power Supply: Operates on standard outlets, drawing 1200 watts of power, ensuring compatibility with most commercial electrical setups.</p>', 'pending', '[\"products\\/1217g1s.webp\",\"products\\/1217g1s-1.webp\"]', '1217G1S', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 29, 0, 0, 1255.28, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 17.00, NULL, 13.00, NULL, 22.00, NULL, 71.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 11:48:15', '2024-12-30 07:05:14', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', NULL, 'physical', NULL, 1063.8, 4, 0, 21, 0, '<p>4 Year Limited Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, 1, '[]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB31\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
