(1724, 'Midea 2117G1A 16.5\"  Commercial Microwave Oven with Touch Control Pad, Stainless Steel, 208v/1ph, 2100W, 0.6 cu. ft.', '<p>The Midea 2117G1A is a robust 16.5\" stainless steel commercial microwave oven built for heavy-duty use in demanding kitchens. With a 0.6 cu. ft. capacity and a powerful 2100-watt output, it provides fast and efficient cooking. Designed with usability in mind, it features a touch control pad with 11 power levels, 3 cooking stages, and 100 auto programs. The ADA-compliant braille navigation and advanced features like a USB port, X2/X3 quantity pads, and a 60-minute max cooking timer enhance versatility. Its durable stainless steel construction includes a removable splatter shield, stainless steel air intake filter, and an EZ Grab\'n Go handle for easy cleaning and operation. Stackable and equipped with dual energy feed for even heating, this microwave is perfect for high-volume commercial kitchens, operating on selectable 208-240V power. Certified by cULus and ETL-Sanitation, it combines performance with safety and convenience.</p>', '<p>Fast and even heating: Use 2100 Watts Power Output that provides fast and even heating for high-demand operations.<br>Top &amp; Bottom Energy Feed: You can distribute microwave energy uniformly for optimal cooking performance.<br>Compact and Spacious Capacity: The 0.6 cubic feet capacity makes it compact and spacious enough to accommodate commercial plates and dishes.<br>11 Power Levels: Youc can get precision cooking control to handle a variety of foods and preparation needs.<br>Three Cooking Stages: Supports customizable multi-stage cooking for complex recipes.<br>100 Auto Programs: Pre-programmed settings simplify operation, saving time and ensuring consistent results.<br>X2 &amp; X3 Quantity Pads: Adjust cooking times automatically for double or triple portions, enhancing kitchen efficiency.<br>Touch Control Pad with Braille Navigation: The ADA-compliant controls ensure accessibility for all operators.<br>USB Port: It comes with a USB Port that allows quick programming updates and custom settings uploads.<br>Time Entry Option: Users can manually set precise cooking durations.<br>Interior Cavity Light: Illuminates food during cooking for easy monitoring.<br>60-Minute Max Cooking Time: You cna easily accommodate longer cooking tasks as needed.<br>Stainless Steel Construction: It is durable, easy-to-clean interior and exterior ensure longevity in demanding commercial environments.<br>EZ Grabn Go Handle: Provides ergonomic access with a durable side-hinged door design.<br>Removable Splatter Shield: Simplifies cleaning and helps maintain food safety standards.<br>Stainless Steel Air Intake Filter: The filter ensures efficient cooling and operation while reducing maintenance needs.<br>Stackable Design: Multiple units can be securely stacked, optimizing space in busy kitchens.<br>Selectable Voltage: Operates on 208V/60Hz or 230/240V/60Hz single-phase power, providing flexibility for different setups.<br>Efficient Power Draw: The 18.0 Amps power makes it efficient power draw for high-performance cooking.<br>NEMA 6-20P Plug: Compatible with standard heavy-duty commercial outlets.<br>3200 Watts Power Input: This ensures reliable performance under demanding conditions.</p>', 'pending', '[\"products\\/2117g1a.webp\",\"products\\/2117g1a-1.webp\",\"products\\/2117g1a-3.webp\",\"products\\/2117g1a-2.webp\"]', '2117G1A', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 29, 0, 0, 1274.93, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 17.00, NULL, 13.00, NULL, 22.00, NULL, 71.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 11:48:15', '2024-12-30 06:29:25', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', NULL, 'physical', NULL, 1080.45, 4, 0, 21, 0, '<p>5 Year Limited Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, 1, '[]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB32\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refunda