(1725, 'Midea 1817G1A 16.5\"  Commercial Microwave Oven with Touch Control Pad, Stainless Steel, 208v/1ph, 1800W, 0.6 cu. ft.', 'The Midea 1817G1A is a heavy-duty 16.5\" stainless steel commercial microwave oven designed for high-performance use in demanding environments. It features a 0.6 cu. ft. capacity and powerful 1800-watt output, making it ideal for fast and efficient cooking. Equipped with advanced features, including 11 power levels, 3 cooking stages, 100 auto programs, and a 60-minute cooking timer, it offers exceptional versatility. The touch control pad includes ADA-compliant braille navigation, X2/X3 multiple quantity pads, and a USB port for easy programming. Designed for durability and ease of maintenance, it includes a removable splatter shield, a stainless steel air intake filter, and an EZ Grab\'n Go handle. Its stackable design and dual-energy feed ensure even heating in compact spaces. Operating on selectable 208-240V power, this microwave is cULus and ETL-Sanitation certified, combining reliability, safety, and efficiency for professional kitchens.', '1800 Watts of Cooking Power: It provides quick and consistent heating, ideal for busy commercial kitchens.<br>Dual Energy Feed (Top &amp; Bottom): This ensures even and efficient cooking for all types of food.<br>0.6 Cubic Feet Capacity: It easily accommodates commercial-sized plates and dishes.<br>11 Power Levels: Offers precise control to suit various cooking requirements.<br>Three Cooking Stages: Programmable to adjust cooking time and power for different recipes.<br>100 Auto Programs: Simplifies operation with pre-configured settings for popular dishes.<br>X2 &amp; X3 Quantity Pads: Automatically adjusts cooking times for two or three portions, streamlining batch preparation.<br>Touch Control Pad with ADA-Compliant Braille Navigation: Accessible design for all operators.<br>Time Entry Option: Allows manual input of exact cooking times for precision.<br>USB Port: You can easily simplify programming and software updates.<br>Interior Cavity Light: Improves visibility during cooking, enabling easy monitoring of food.<br>60-Minute Maximum Cooking Time: Supports a wide range of cooking tasks, from reheating to more complex preparations.<br>Stainless Steel Interior and Exterior: Easy to clean and resistant to corrosion, designed for heavy commercial use.<br>EZ Grabn Go Handle: Side-hinged door with an ergonomic design for ease of use.<br>Removable Splatter Shield: Protects the interior from messes, ensuring hygiene and simplifying cleaning.<br>Stainless Steel Air Intake Filter: Prolongs the units life by ensuring efficient airflow and easy maintenance.<br>Stackable Design: Optimizes kitchen space by allowing secure stacking of multiple units.<br>Selectable Voltage: Compatible with 208V/60Hz or 230/240V/60Hz single-phase power.<br>18 Amps: Designed for energy-efficient, heavy-duty performance.<br>NEMA 6-20P Plug: Standard for commercial-grade appliances.<br>2800 Watts Power Input: Ensures reliable and robust operation during peak usage.<br>cULus and ETL-Sanitation Certified: Meets industry safety and hygiene standards for commercial foodservice equipment.', 'pending', '[]', '1817G1A', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 29, 0, 0, 1204.31, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 17.00, NULL, 13.00, NULL, 22.00, NULL, 71.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 11:48:15', '2024-12-13 14:13:53', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', NULL, 'physical', '', 1020.6, 4, 0, 21, 0, '6 Year Limited Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', 1, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB33\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1727, 'Midea 2134G1A 22.63\"  Commercial Microwave Oven with Touch Control Pad, Stainless Steel, 208v/1ph, 2100W, 1.2 cu. ft.', 'The Midea 2134G1A is a 22.63\" stainless steel commercial microwave oven designed for heavy-duty use in foodservice environments. With a powerful 2100W output and a 1.2 cu. ft. capacity, it accommodates large platters up to 14 inches. The microwave offers 100 auto programs and 5 power levels, providing versatility in cooking with selectable 208V or 230/240V operation. It features an easy-to-use touch control panel with ADA-compliant braille navigation, a cleanable stainless steel air filter, and a ceiling splatter shield for easier maintenance. The oven also includes convenient features like a large oven cavity light, a durable EZ Grabn Go door handle, and a 60-minute maximum cooking time, making it ideal for quick and efficient food preparation in commercial kitchens.', '2100 Watts of Cooking Power: This microwave delivers strong cooking performance, ensuring fast and efficient heating for a variety of food items.<br>Dimensions: Its 1.2 cu. ft. (34 L) interior accommodates large platters up to 14 inches in diameter, making it ideal for heating larger portions or multiple items at once.<br>EZ Grabn Go Door Handle: A durable, no-moving-parts handle allows for easy, reliable use without the risk of wear and tear.<br>Touch Control Pads with Braille Navigation: The intuitive touchpad interface, complete with Braille navigation, ensures that the microwave is accessible for all users, including those in self-service environments. <br>Oven Cavity Light: The built-in light provides clear visibility inside the microwave, so users can monitor the cooking process without having to open the door, reducing the risk of heat loss and ensuring quicker results.<br>5 Power Levels and 3 Cooking Stages: The microwave provides flexibility in cooking, allowing for different levels of heat and multi-stage cooking, which is essential for preparing a variety of dishes with specific temperature and cooking requirements.<br>100 Auto Programs: With 100 pre-programmed settings, this microwave offers quick and efficient cooking for a wide variety of foods. Time Entry &amp; X2 Multiple Quantity Pad: For more customized cooking, users can manually set the cooking time with the time entry option. The X2 pad allows for cooking multiple portions at once, increasing kitchen efficiency in busy commercial environments.<br>Cleanable Ceiling Splatter Shield &amp; Stainless Steel Air Filter: These features make cleaning easier by preventing food splatters from sticking to the interior ceiling and ensuring the air filter remains free of grease buildup, maintaining optimal performance over time.<br>Stainless Steel Construction: The microwaves commercial-grade stainless steel cabinet and oven cavity are built to withstand the high-volume use of a commercial kitchen, offering both durability and ease of maintenance.<br>Top and Bottom Energy Feed: This feature helps ensure even cooking by distributing heat more effectively, which improves energy efficiency and cooking performance.<br>Selectable 208V or 230/240V Operation: The microwave can be configured for either 208V or 230/240V operation, making it versatile enough to be used in different electrical environments. It requires a 1-phase, 20 Amp power supply.<br>Stackable Design: The microwave\'s stackable design allows for space-saving in kitchens where multiple units may be needed, without sacrificing performance or accessibility.<br>Chef/Test Kitchen Support: The microwave is designed to withstand the rigors of professional kitchens, providing consistent performance for demanding culinary tasks.<br>60:00 Maximum Cooking Time: With a cooking time limit of up to 60 minutes, this microwave can handle a wide range of cooking needs, from quick reheats to more extended cooking times for certain dishes.', 'pending', '[]', '2134G1A', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 29, 0, 0, 1345.55, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL,