t and cook food more efficiently.<br>5 Power Levels and 3 Cooking Stages: The microwave offers flexibility with five power levels and three cooking stages, making it ideal for a wide range of cooking requirements, from defrosting to full cooking.<br>100 Auto Programs: With 100 pre-programmed settings, this microwave offers fast and reliable cooking for a variety of foods, reducing the need for manual adjustments and increasing efficiency.<br>Time Entry Option &amp; X2 Multiple Quantity Pad: For more precise control, the time entry option allows for custom cooking times, while the X2 pad facilitates the cooking of multiple portions at once, improving workflow in busy environments.<br>Cleanable Ceiling Splatter Shield &amp; Stainless Steel Air Filter: These features make the microwave easy to clean and maintain. The ceiling splatter shield prevents food buildup on the interior, while the cleanable air filter helps keep the appliance running smoothly by reducing grease accumulation.<br>Durable Stainless Steel Construction: Both the cabinet and oven cavity are constructed from high-quality stainless steel, ensuring long-lasting durability and making it easy to maintain in high-traffic commercial kitchens.<br>Top and Bottom Energy Feed: This design helps distribute heat evenly throughout the oven cavity, improving cooking performance and energy efficiency.<br>Selectable 208V or 230/240V Operation: This microwave offers the flexibility of being able to operate on 208V or 230/240V power, making it suitable for various kitchen setups. It requires a 1-phase, 20 Amp power supply.<br>Stackable Design: The microwave is stackable, making it a great space-saving option for kitchens with limited counter space or those that require multiple units.<br>Chef/Test Kitchen Support: Designed to withstand the demands of professional kitchens, this microwave is built for high-volume cooking, ensuring reliable and consistent results.<br>60:00 Maximum Cooking Time: With a maximum cooking time of 60 minutes, the microwave is versatile enough to handle both quick reheats and longer cooking times for a variety of dishes.', 'pending', '[]', '1834G1A', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 29, 0, 0, 1204.31, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 23.00, NULL, 13.00, NULL, 21.00, NULL, 76.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 11:48:15', '2024-12-13 14:13:54', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', NULL, 'physical', '', 1020.6, 4, 0, 21, 0, '9 Year Limited Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', 1, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB36\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1729, 'Midea 1034N1A 21.75\"  Commercial Microwave Oven with Push Button Control, Stainless Steel, 120v/1ph, 1000W, 1.2 cu. ft.', 'The Midea 1034N1A is a medium-duty 21\" commercial microwave oven with a 1.2 cu. ft. capacity and 1000W of power, designed for commercial foodservice environments. It offers 5 power levels and 3 cooking stages, making it versatile for various food preparation needs. With a 60-minute maximum cooking time and 100 auto programs, it accommodates diverse cooking demands. The microwave includes a user-friendly touch control panel with ADA-compliant braille navigation, a time entry option, and a multiple quantity pad (X2) for efficient cooking of multiple portions. Features like a side-hinged door with an EZ Grab\'n Go handle, a stainless steel interior, and an interior cavity light add convenience and durability. This model operates on a 120V/1Ph power supply and is certified for commercial use with ETL Sanitation and CULUS approval.', '1.2 Cu. Ft. Capacity: This microwave offers a spacious interior, providing ample room for a variety of food items, making it ideal for medium-volume commercial kitchens.<br>1000 Watts of Power: With 1000 watts of cooking power, the microwave delivers fast and consistent heating, ideal for reheating or cooking a wide range of food items.<br>Five Power Levels &amp; Three Cooking Stages: The microwave allows for greater control with five power levels and three cooking stages, providing flexibility to handle various types of cooking tasks and ensuring food is heated or cooked perfectly every time.<br>60-Minute Maximum Cooking Time: This microwave supports extended cooking times, up to 60 minutes, offering flexibility for preparing different types of dishes that require longer cooking times.<br>100 Auto Programs: With 100 pre-programmed settings, this microwave simplifies cooking by offering quick and efficient heating options for a wide range of menu items.<br>Touch Control Pads &amp; Electronic Timer with Braille Navigation: The microwave features user-friendly touch control pads, complete with Braille navigation.<br> Time Entry Option &amp; X2 Multiple Quantity Pad: For greater customization, the microwave includes a time entry option that allows users to manually set the cooking time, while the X2 pad facilitates cooking multiple portions at once, improving kitchen efficiency.<br>Interior Cavity Light: The built-in cavity light provides visibility inside the microwave without opening the door, allowing operators to monitor the cooking progress and reduce heat loss.<br>Bottom Energy Feed: This feature ensures even heat distribution throughout the cavity for consistent cooking results.<br>Side-Hinged Door with EZ Grab\'n Go Handle: The side-hinged door with an EZ Grab\'n Go handle makes it easy and safe to open and close, ensuring reliable operation with no moving parts to wear out over time.<br>Stainless Steel Interior Cavity &amp; Exterior Wrap: The microwave is built with a stainless steel interior and exterior wrap, ensuring durability, ease of cleaning, and long-lasting performance in demanding commercial environments.<br>Power Requirements: Operating at 120V/60Hz/1-Phase, with 15.0 amps of power and a NEMA 5-15P plug, this microwave is compatible with standard commercial electrical setups.<br>Certifications: The unit is CULus and ETL-Sanitation certified, ensuring it meets the safety and sanitation standards required for commercial food service equipment.', 'pending', '[]', '1034N1A', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 29, 0, 0, 576.14, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 22.00, NULL, 14.00, NULL, 19.00, NULL, 46.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 11:48:15', '2024-12-13 14:13:54', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', NULL, 'physical', '', 488.25, 4, 0, 21, 0, '10 Year Limited Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', 1, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SST