e Entry Option: Allows for manual time input, giving full control over cooking duration.<br>X2 Multiple Quantity Pad: Efficient for heating multiple portions at once, a helpful feature for busy kitchens.<br>Interior Cavity Light: Provides visibility to monitor food as it cooks, reducing the need to open the door.<br>Bottom Energy Feed: Ensures even cooking and reduces hot spots, improving cooking quality.<br>Side-Hinged Door with EZ Grab\'n Go Handle: The door opens easily, providing ergonomic operation and making it suitable for high-paced kitchen environments.<br>Stainless Steel Interior Cavity, Door &amp; Exterior Wrap: Easy-to-clean and highly durable, suitable for the commercial kitchen environment that requires constant use.<br>Power Rating:1500 Watts, 15.0 Amps: Rated for efficient operation with high performance.<br>Voltage: 120V/60Hz/1ph is compatible with standard electrical outlets, making it easy to install.<br>NEMA 5-15P, CULUS: The microwave is UL and ETL certified, ensuring safety and reliability.<br>ETL-Sanitation: Ensures that the microwave meets the required sanitation standards for foodservice use.<br>Perfect For: Light Duty Commercial Use: Ideal for cafes, snack bars, or small restaurants where quick, efficient heating is needed without heavy-duty requirements.', 'pending', '[]', '1025F1A', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 29, 0, 0, 363.74, 727.48, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 20.00, NULL, 12.00, NULL, 17.00, NULL, 36.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 11:59:38', '2024-12-13 14:13:54', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', NULL, 'physical', '', 308.25, 4, 0, 21, 0, '12 Year Limited Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', 1, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB39\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
