(1734, 'Atosa MCF8709GR 54.38\" Bottom Mount Refrigerator, 2 Two Sliding Door 44.9  Cu.Ft', '<p>The Atosa MCF8709GR 54.38\" Bottom Mount Refrigerator with two sliding doors is designed to offer expansive storage capacity and convenient access in commercial kitchen environments. Boasting a spacious 44.9 cubic feet of interior space, this refrigerator provides ample room for storing a wide range of perishable goods, making it well-suited for restaurants, hotels, and other food service establishments with high-volume storage needs. The two sliding glass doors not only enhance visibility of stored items but also help conserve space compared to swing doors, making it easier to navigate around busy kitchen areas without obstructing pathways.</p><p>Constructed with a durable stainless steel exterior and interior, the Atosa MCF8709GR ensures longevity, easy cleaning, and resistance to corrosion, essential for maintaining hygiene standards in commercial settings. The bottom mount design places the compressor near the floor, which optimizes energy efficiency by utilizing cooler air and facilitates easier access to stored items at eye level. Adjustable shelves inside the refrigerator offer flexibility in organizing various sizes and types of products, allowing for efficient use of space and customizable storage configurations based on specific operational needs. Overall, the Atosa MCF8709GR combines robust construction, spacious capacity, and practical design features to meet the rigorous demands of professional kitchens.</p>', '<p>Provides 44.9 cubic feet of interior storage space, suitable for storing a large quantity of perishable items in commercial kitchens.<br>Two sliding doors with glass panels enhance visibility of stored contents and save space compared to swing doors, making it easier to navigate busy kitchen areas.<br>Stainless steel exterior and interior ensure durability, ease of cleaning, and resistance to corrosion, maintaining sanitary conditions in demanding kitchen environments.<br>Positions the compressor near the floor for efficient operation, utilizing cooler air and providing easier access to stored items at eye level.<br>Includes adjustable shelves that allow for flexible storage configurations, accommodating items of varying sizes and shapes to optimize storage space and organization.</p>', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MCF8709GR_2763cf79-8387-4d00-bfdd-a6abf39df2ad.webp\"]', 'MCF8709GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 3609, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 54.00, NULL, 81.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 511.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:04', '2024-12-18 11:25:49', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MCF8709GR_2763cf79-8387-4d00-bfdd-a6abf39df2ad.webp', 'physical', NULL, 2348, 4, 0, 8, 0, '<p>Two Year Parts &amp; Labor Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB42\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1735, 'Atosa 54.38\" MCF8707GR Bottom Mount Refrigerator, 2 Two Glass Door 44.8 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa 54.38\" Bottom Mount Refrigerator with two glass doors offers a spacious and efficient cooling solution tailored for commercial kitchens and food service establishments. With a generous capacity of 44.8 cubic feet, this refrigerator provides ample storage space for a wide range of perishable items, making it ideal for storing ingredients, beverages, and prepared foods. The two glass doors not only enhance the unit\'s aesthetic appeal but also facilitate easy visibility of stored contents, allowing kitchen staff to quickly assess inventory levels without opening the doors frequently. This feature helps maintain consistent internal temperatures, ensuring food stays fresh longer.</p>\n<p>Constructed with a robust stainless steel exterior and interior, the Atosa bottom mount refrigerator is designed for durability, ease of cleaning, and resistance to corrosion, essential for maintaining sanitary conditions in busy kitchen environments. The bottom mount configuration places the compressor near the floor, which not only improves energy efficiency by utilizing cooler air but also makes it easier to access stored items at eye level. Adjustable shelves inside the unit provide flexibility in organizing items of varying sizes and shapes, optimizing storage space and improving workflow efficiency. Overall, the Atosa 54.38\" Bottom Mount Refrigerator with two glass doors combines spacious capacity, visibility, and durable construction to meet the demanding needs of commercial food service operations.</p>', '\n\nProvides a generous 44.8 cubic feet of storage space, ideal for storing a large quantity of perishable items in commercial kitchens.<br>\n\nTwo glass doors enhance visibility and allow easy monitoring of contents, reducing the frequency of door openings and helping to maintain consistent internal temperatures.<br>\n\nBuilt with stainless steel exterior and interior for durability, easy maintenance, and resistance to corrosion, ensuring longevity in demanding kitchen environments.<br>\n\nPositions the compressor near the floor for efficient operation and easier access to stored items at eye level, improving workflow efficiency.<br>\n\nIncludes adjustable shelves that allow for flexible storage configurations to accommodate items of varying sizes and shapes, optimizing storage space and organization.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MCF8707GR_52905171-4132-44e3-9ccc-8f75583ef45e.webp\"]', 'MCF8707GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 3609, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 54.00, NULL, 83.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 540.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:05', '2024-12-13 14:13:54', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MCF8707GR_52905171-4132-44e3-9ccc-8f75583ef45e.webp', 'physical', '', 2392.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB43\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1736, 'Atosa MCF8705GR 27\" Bottom Mount Refrigerator, 1 One Glass Door, 19.1 Cu.Ft', '\n<p>The Atosa MCF8705GR 27\" Bottom Mount Refrigerator with a single glass door offers a practical solution for commercial refrigeration needs, combining efficiency with visibility. With a capacity of 19.1 cubic feet, it provides ample storage space while its compact 27-inch width makes it suitable for establishments with limited floor space. The glass door not only enhances the unit\'s aesthetic appeal but also allows for easy visibility of stored items, aiding in quick inventory checks without needing to open the door frequently, which helps maintain consistent internal temperatures.</p>\n<p>Constructed with a stainless steel exterior and interior, the Atosa MCF8705GR ensures durability and ease of cleaning, essential for maintaining hygiene in busy kitchen environments. Its bottom-mount design places the compressor near the floor, which not only makes it easier to access stored items at eye level but also enhances energy efficiency by utilizing the cooler air naturally found at lower levels. This refrigerator is equipped with adjustable shelves, allowing for customizable storage configurations to accommodate various types and sizes of food products. Overall, the Atosa MCF8705GR is designed to optimize space, efficiency, and functionality, making it a reliable choice for commercial kitchens seeking a quality refrigeration solution.</p>', '\n\nAllows easy visibility of contents without needing to open the door, helping to maintain consistent temperatures inside the refrigerator.<br>\n\nOffers 19.1 cubic feet of interior space, providing ample room for storing a variety of food and beverage items.<br>\n\nStainless steel exterior and interior ensure durability, easy cleaning, and resistance to corrosion in commercial kitchen environments.<br>\n\nPositions the compressor at the bottom for easier access to stored items at eye level, while also improving energy efficiency by utilizing cooler air near the floor.<br>\n\nIncludes adjustable shelves to accommodate different sizes and types of products, allowing for customizable storage configurations based on the needs of the kitchen.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MCF8705GR_cff95080-175a-4ba0-a694-c2cf63c008fe.webp\"]', 'MCF8705GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2513, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 27.00, NULL, 83.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 326.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:06', '2024-12-13 14:13:55', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MCF8705GR_cff95080-175a-4ba0-a694-c2cf63c008fe.webp', 'physical', '', 1642.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB44\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1737, 'Atosa ATSB-36 36\" Infrared Salamander Broiler', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa ATSB-36 36\" Infrared Salamander Broiler is a versatile and powerful kitchen appliance designed for precise broiling and finishing tasks in commercial settings. This broiler utilizes advanced infrared heating technology, which ensures rapid and efficient cooking, allowing chefs to achieve consistent results quickly. With a width of 36 inches, it offers a spacious cooking area suitable for handling various dishes, from melting cheese and browning gratins to caramelizing toppings and finishing steaks. The stainless steel construction not only enhances durability but also makes the unit easy to clean and maintain, essential for busy kitchen environments.</p>\n<p>Equipped with adjustable rack positions, the Atosa ATSB-36 allows chefs to control the distance between the food and the heat source, providing flexibility to achieve desired cooking outcomes. It features easy-to-use controls that allow precise adjustment of cooking temperatures, ensuring optimal results for different recipes. The infrared burners distribute heat evenly across the cooking surface, minimizing hot spots and ensuring thorough cooking. Whether used in restaurants, hotels, or catering operations, the ATSB-36 Salamander Broiler is designed to enhance kitchen efficiency and culinary precision, making it a valuable tool for chefs looking to elevate their cooking capabilities.</p>', '\n\nUtilizes advanced infrared burners for rapid and efficient cooking, ensuring even heat distribution and precise control over the cooking process.<br>\n\n36-inch width provides a generous cooking surface suitable for various dishes, from melting cheese to finishing meats and vegetables.<br>\n\nConstructed with stainless steel for durability, ease of cleaning, and resistance to corrosion in busy commercial kitchen environments.<br>\n\nAllows for flexible cooking options with adjustable rack positions, enabling chefs to control the distance between the food and the heat source for optimal results.<br>\n\nEasy-to-use controls for adjusting temperatures and settings, ensuring precise cooking control and consistency across different recipes.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ATSB-36_631fee1e-b1b5-4667-9e16-d33805b5a6b1.webp\"]', 'ATSB-36', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1610, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36.00, NULL, 17.00, NULL, 18.00, NULL, 169.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:07', '2024-12-13 14:13:55', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ATSB-36_631fee1e-b1b5-4667-9e16-d33805b5a6b1.webp', 'physical', '', 1032.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB45\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '');
