(1738, 'Atosa SBB69GGRAUS1 68\" Shallow Depth Back Bar Cooler with Glass Doors 18.6 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa SBB69GGRAUS1 68\" Shallow Depth Back Bar Cooler with Glass Doors is designed to meet the storage and display needs of commercial establishments, particularly in bars and restaurants. With a spacious 18.6 cubic feet capacity and a width of 68 inches, it provides ample space for storing a wide variety of beverages while fitting neatly into limited spaces. The glass doors not only enhance the visual appeal by allowing customers to see the selection of beverages but also improve operational efficiency by enabling staff to quickly locate and retrieve items without opening the doors unnecessarily, thereby maintaining consistent internal temperatures.</p>\n<p>Constructed with a durable stainless steel exterior and interior, the Atosa SBB69GGRAUS1 ensures longevity and ease of cleaning, essential for maintaining sanitary conditions in busy environments. Its efficient refrigeration system keeps beverages at optimal serving temperatures, ensuring drinks are consistently chilled. Adjustable shelves inside the cooler offer flexibility in organizing different sizes of bottles and cans, maximizing storage capacity and operational efficiency. Equipped with bright LED lighting, the interior is well-lit to enhance visibility and showcase beverages attractively, enticing customers and facilitating easier inventory management. Overall, the Atosa SBB69GGRAUS1 combines functionality, durability, and aesthetics to provide a reliable solution for commercial beverage storage and display needs.</p>', '\n\nOffers 18.6 cubic feet of storage space, providing ample room for a wide variety of beverages.<br>\n\nEnhances visibility and allows for easy product identification without opening the doors, helping to maintain consistent internal temperatures.<br>\n\nStainless steel exterior and interior ensure durability, longevity, and ease of cleaning in high-traffic environments.<br>\n\nEquipped with a robust refrigeration system to maintain optimal temperatures for keeping beverages chilled.<br>\n\nIncludes adjustable shelves for flexible storage configurations, accommodating different sizes of bottles and cans effectively.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/SBB69GGRAUS1_cf1caf70-0275-438c-86a8-37b1786f7640.webp\"]', 'SBB69GGRAUS1', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2903, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 68.00, NULL, 40.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 150.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:08', '2024-12-13 14:13:55', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/SBB69GGRAUS1_cf1caf70-0275-438c-86a8-37b1786f7640.webp', 'physical', '', 1817, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB46\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1739, 'Atosa CYR400 30\" Ice Storage Bin, 395 lbs', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa CYR400 30\" Ice Storage Bin is a compact yet efficient solution for commercial ice storage needs, capable of holding up to 395 pounds of ice. This makes it suitable for smaller to mid-sized establishments such as cafes, small restaurants, and bars that require a steady supply of ice. Its 30-inch width allows it to fit comfortably into various kitchen layouts while providing sufficient storage capacity for daily operations. The exterior is constructed from durable stainless steel, ensuring longevity and ease of maintenance in busy environments. Additionally, the bin features a polyethylene interior liner that enhances sanitation and protects against scratches and dents, maintaining the quality of the stored ice.</p>\n<p>Designed for practicality and ease of use, the Atosa CYR400 includes a large door opening and a sloped front for convenient access to the ice, facilitating quick retrieval during peak service times. It also comes equipped with adjustable legs, providing stability on uneven floors and allowing for customizable positioning to suit the workflow of the kitchen. The insulated design helps maintain the ice\'s temperature, reducing melting and ensuring that the ice remains cold and ready for use whenever needed. Overall, the Atosa CYR400 Ice Storage Bin combines durability, functionality, and efficiency, making it an essential asset for establishments looking to streamline their ice storage and service operations.</p>', '\n\n30-inch width suitable for smaller to mid-sized commercial kitchens, conserving space while offering substantial ice storage capacity.<br>\n\nHolds up to 395 pounds of ice, ensuring a steady supply for cafes, small restaurants, and bars with moderate ice demands.<br>\n\nConstructed with a stainless steel exterior for durability, corrosion resistance, and easy maintenance in busy environments.<br>\n\nFeatures a polyethylene interior liner that enhances sanitation, protects against scratches, and maintains the quality of stored ice.<br>\n\nIncludes a large door opening and a sloped front design for easy access to ice, facilitating quick retrieval during busy service periods.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/CYR400P_4a4c006b-e720-4749-8b05-ad49984e6086.webp\"]', 'CYR400', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 994, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 41.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 141.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:09', '2024-12-13 14:13:55', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/CYR400P_4a4c006b-e720-4749-8b05-ad49984e6086.webp', 'physical', '', 689, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB47\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1740, 'Atosa  CYR700P 48.25\" Ice Storage Bin, 700 lbs', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa CYR700P 48.25\" Ice Storage Bin is a robust and efficient solution for commercial ice storage needs. Designed to accommodate up to 700 pounds of ice, this storage bin ensures that high-volume establishments, such as restaurants, bars, and hotels, have a reliable supply of ice on hand. Its spacious 48.25-inch width provides ample storage capacity while allowing for easy integration into various kitchen layouts. The durable stainless steel exterior offers both longevity and ease of cleaning, making it ideal for the demanding environments of commercial kitchens. Additionally, the bin features a polyethylene interior liner that is both sanitary and resistant to scratches and dents, ensuring that ice remains clean and uncontaminated.</p>\n<p>The Atosa CYR700P is designed with practicality and efficiency in mind. The bin\'s sloped front and large door opening facilitate easy access to the ice, allowing staff to retrieve large quantities quickly and efficiently. The unit is equipped with heavy-duty, adjustable legs, providing stability on uneven surfaces and ensuring the bin can be positioned at a comfortable working height. The insulated construction helps maintain the ice\'s temperature, reducing melting and ensuring that the stored ice remains in optimal condition for longer periods. Overall, the Atosa CYR700P 48.25\" Ice Storage Bin combines durability, large capacity, and user-friendly features, making it a valuable asset for any business that requires a consistent and readily available ice supply.</p>', '\n\nSpacious interior capable of storing up to 700 pounds of ice, ensuring ample supply for high-demand environments like restaurants and bars.<br>\n\nBuilt with a stainless steel exterior that enhances durability, resists corrosion, and simplifies cleaning, making it suitable for commercial use.<br>\n\nIncludes a polyethylene interior liner that is sanitary, scratch-resistant, and dent-resistant, maintaining the cleanliness and integrity of stored ice.<br>\n\nFeatures a large door opening and a sloped front design for easy access to ice, facilitating quick retrieval and reducing downtime during service.<br>\n\nDesigned with insulation to maintain ice integrity and minimize melting, ensuring that stored ice remains cold and ready for use over extended periods.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/CYR700P_8b3d5f52-6170-4037-b885-dcfe4d6260bf.webp\"]', 'CYR700P', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1453, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48.00, NULL, 41.00, NULL, 33.00, NULL, 154.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:10', '2024-12-13 14:13:55', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/CYR700P_8b3d5f52-6170-4037-b885-dcfe4d6260bf.webp', 'physical', '', 1026, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB48\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1741, 'Atosa ATCM-36 18\" Infrared Cheese Melter', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa ATCM-36 18\" Infrared Cheese Melter is a high-performance kitchen appliance designed to meet the demanding needs of commercial kitchens. This cheese melter utilizes advanced infrared technology to provide quick and efficient heating, making it ideal for melting cheese, browning dishes, and finishing a variety of culinary creations. Its compact 18-inch width allows it to fit seamlessly into kitchens with limited space, while still offering ample cooking area. The stainless steel construction ensures durability and longevity, making it a reliable addition to any professional kitchen. Its sleek design and robust build quality also contribute to a professional and polished kitchen environment.</p>\n<p>This cheese melter features adjustable rack positions, allowing chefs to control the distance between the food and the heat source for precise cooking results. The infrared burners provide consistent, even heat distribution, ensuring that dishes are evenly cooked and perfectly finished every time. The ATCM-36 is also equipped with user-friendly controls, making it easy to operate and adjust settings as needed. Additionally, the unit is designed with energy efficiency in mind, helping to reduce operational costs without compromising on performance. Overall, the Atosa ATCM-36 18\" Infrared Cheese Melter combines efficiency, durability, and versatility, making it an excellent choice for commercial kitchens looking to enhance their cooking capabilities.</p>', '\n\n18-inch width, allowing it to fit into kitchens with limited space while still providing ample cooking area.<br>\n\nAdvanced infrared technology for quick and efficient heating, ideal for melting cheese, browning dishes, and finishing culinary creations.<br>\n\nStainless steel exterior and interior for durability, longevity, and a professional appearance in commercial kitchens.<br>\n\nMultiple rack positions to control the distance between the food and the heat source for precise cooking results.<br>\n\nEasy-to-use controls for adjusting settings and ensuring consistent, even heat distribution for perfectly finished dishes.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ATCM-36_f6fd74d0-171f-47ee-934c-98a97506c953.webp\"]', 'ATCM-36', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1383, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36.00, NULL, 17.00, NULL, 18.00, NULL, 119.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:11', '2024-12-13 14:13:55', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ATCM-36_f6fd74d0-171f-47ee-934c-98a97506c953.webp', 'physical', '', 887.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB49\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1742, 'Atosa SBB69GRAUS1 68\" Shallow Depth Back Bar Cooler 18.6 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa SBB69GRAUS1 68\" Shallow Depth Back Bar Cooler is an optimal solution for commercial beverage storage, designed to cater to the demands of busy bars, restaurants, and other hospitality venues. With its 68-inch width and shallow depth, this cooler is perfect for establishments with limited space, providing a significant 18.6 cubic feet of storage capacity. Its sleek glass doors not only enhance the aesthetic appeal of the cooler but also allow for easy visibility of the contents, enabling staff to quickly locate and access beverages. The cooler’s robust stainless steel exterior and interior ensure durability, easy maintenance, and a professional appearance that fits seamlessly into any commercial setting.</p>\n<p>Equipped with an efficient refrigeration system, the Atosa SBB69GRAUS1 maintains consistent temperatures to keep beverages at their optimal serving conditions. The unit features adjustable shelves, allowing for customizable storage configurations to accommodate various bottle and can sizes, maximizing the available space. Additionally, the bright LED interior lighting enhances product visibility and creates an attractive display, drawing customers\' attention. Designed with energy efficiency in mind, this back bar cooler helps reduce operational costs while maintaining reliable performance, making it a practical and cost-effective choice for any business seeking to improve its beverage storage and presentation capabilities.</p>', '\n\n68-inch width and shallow depth, offering 18.6 cubic feet of storage capacity, ideal for space-constrained commercial settings.<br>\n\nEnhances visual appeal and allows easy monitoring of contents without opening the doors, maintaining consistent internal temperatures.<br>\n\nStainless steel exterior and interior ensure longevity, durability, and easy cleaning, suitable for high-traffic environments.<br>\n\nHigh-performance refrigeration system keeps beverages at optimal temperatures, ensuring they are perfectly chilled for serving.<br>\n\nCustomizable storage configurations with adjustable shelves and bright interior LED lighting for improved visibility and attractive display of beverages.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/SBB69GRAUS1_5b771f51-8834-496c-b336-a98ac52fd39f.webp\"]', 'SBB69GRAUS1', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2812, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 68.00, NULL, 40.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 150.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:12', '2024-12-13 14:13:55', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/SBB69GRAUS1_5b771f51-8834-496c-b336-a98ac52fd39f.webp', 'physical', '', 1760, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB50\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1743, 'Atosa SBB59GRAUS1 57.75\" Shallow Depth Back Bar Cooler 15  Cu.Ft', '\n<p>The Atosa SBB59GRAUS1 57.75\" Shallow Depth Back Bar Cooler is a practical and stylish solution for commercial beverage storage, designed to meet the needs of busy bars, restaurants, and hospitality venues. Its compact dimensions, with a width of 57.75 inches and a shallow depth, make it perfect for areas with limited space while still providing substantial storage capacity with its 15 cubic feet interior. The cooler\'s exterior and interior are constructed from durable stainless steel, ensuring longevity and ease of maintenance, crucial for high-traffic environments. The unit\'s glass doors enhance the cooler’s aesthetic appeal and allow for easy monitoring of inventory without needing to open the doors, thus helping to maintain a consistent internal temperature.</p>\n<p>This back bar cooler features an efficient refrigeration system that keeps beverages at optimal serving temperatures, ensuring that customers always receive perfectly chilled drinks. The adjustable shelves provide flexibility in organizing various bottle and can sizes, maximizing the use of available space. Additionally, the cooler is equipped with bright interior LED lighting, which not only improves visibility but also highlights the beverages, creating an attractive display. The Atosa SBB59GRAUS1 is designed with energy efficiency in mind, helping businesses reduce operational costs while maintaining reliable performance. Overall, this cooler combines functionality, durability, and style, making it an excellent addition to any commercial setting looking to optimize its beverage storage and presentation.</p>', '\n\nThe cooler\'s 57.75\" width and shallow depth make it ideal for spaces with limited room, ensuring it fits seamlessly into tight bar or restaurant areas.<br>Offers a 15 cubic feet storage capacity, providing ample space for a variety of beverages, including bottles and cans.<br>\n\nEquipped with glass doo