(1744, 'Atosa SBB59GGRAUS1 57.75\" Shallow Depth Back Bar Cooler with Glass Doors 15  Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa SBB59GGRAUS1 57.75\" Shallow Depth Back Bar Cooler is a versatile and efficient solution for commercial beverage storage. With a compact 57.75-inch width, this cooler is designed to fit seamlessly into tight spaces, making it ideal for bars, restaurants, and other hospitality venues with limited room. The unit boasts a 15 cubic feet capacity, providing ample space for a wide range of beverages, from bottles to cans. Its glass doors not only enhance the visual appeal by allowing a clear view of the contents but also make it easy for staff to quickly locate and access items. The cooler’s stainless steel construction ensures durability, longevity, and ease of cleaning, which are crucial features in high-traffic commercial environments.</p>\n<p>This back bar cooler is equipped with an efficient refrigeration system that maintains consistent temperatures to keep beverages perfectly chilled. The adjustable shelves offer flexibility in organizing different sizes of bottles and cans, while the bright interior LED lighting enhances product visibility and presentation. Additionally, the Atosa SBB59GGRAUS1 is designed with energy efficiency in mind, helping businesses reduce operational costs without compromising performance. Overall, this cooler combines functionality, aesthetics, and energy efficiency, making it a reliable and attractive choice for any commercial setting looking to optimize its beverage storage and display solutions.</p>', '\n\nWith a 57.75\" width, the cooler is ideal for spaces with limited depth, fitting seamlessly into tight bar or restaurant areas.<br>\n\nOffers a 15 cubic feet storage capacity, providing ample space for a variety of beverages.<br>\n\nFeatures glass doors for clear visibility of contents, enhancing the display and making it easier to locate items quickly.<br>\n\nBoth the exterior and interior are made of stainless steel, ensuring durability, longevity, and ease of cleaning.<br>\n\nEquipped with a high-performance refrigeration system that maintains consistent and optimal temperatures to keep beverages chilled.<br>Includes adjustable shelves, allowing for customizable storage configurations to accommodate different bottle and can sizes.<br>\n\nBright interior LED lighting improves product visibility and enhances the display of beverages.<br>Designed to be energy-efficient, reducing operational costs while maintaining high performance.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/SBB59GGRAUS1_66881186-a7d2-4e01-84f7-5e269c592064.webp\"]', 'SBB59GGRAUS1', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2672, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 58.00, NULL, 40.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 150.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:14', '2024-12-13 14:13:55', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/SBB59GGRAUS1_66881186-a7d2-4e01-84f7-5e269c592064.webp', 'physical', '', 1673.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB52\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1745, 'Atosa SBB48GRAUS1 48\" Shallow Depth Back Bar Cooler 11.5 Cu.Ft', '<p> <br>The Atosa SBB48GRAUS1 48\" Shallow Depth Back Bar Cooler is tailored for commercial environments requiring efficient beverage storage and display. Its design prioritizes functionality and space-saving features, making it ideal for bars, restaurants, or anywhere that requires quick access to chilled drinks without occupying excessive floor space. With a capacity of 11.5 cubic feet, it strikes a balance between compact size and ample storage capacity.</p><p>Constructed with a sturdy stainless steel exterior, the SBB48GRAUS1 is built to withstand the rigors of daily use in busy establishments while ensuring durability and easy maintenance. It features double-pane glass doors that not only provide a clear view of the stored beverages but also offer insulation to maintain consistent cooling temperatures inside. The interior is equipped with adjustable shelves, allowing for flexible organization of different-sized bottles and cans. This ensures efficient use of space and easy customization according to specific storage needs.</p><p>Internally, the cooler utilizes a forced air cooling system, which ensures even distribution of cold air throughout the cabinet. This system helps maintain optimal temperatures for beverages, keeping them refreshingly cold and ready for serving. The digital temperature control panel provides precise temperature management, allowing operators to monitor and adjust settings as needed to ensure beverages are kept at their ideal cooling point. Overall, the Atosa SBB48GRAUS1 combines practical design with reliable performance, making it a valuable asset in any commercial setting where efficient beverage storage is essential.</p>', '<p>Designed with a 48-inch width and a shallow depth of 24.5 inches, this back bar cooler maximizes storage capacity in kitchens with limited floor space. This is particularly beneficial for establishments prioritizing increased functionality without sacrificing valuable floor space.<br>Dual glass doors with self-closing mechanisms enable effortless product identification while minimizing unnecessary cooler openings. This significantly reduces cold air loss and helps maintain consistent internal temperatures, optimizing energy efficiency.<br>An electronic temperature control system ensures consistent and precise chilling between 33°F and 40°F. This safeguards beverage quality and ensures drinks are served at the perfect temperature for optimal customer satisfaction.<br>The Atosa SBB48GRAUS1 features a stainless steel exterior and interior for superior durability and simplified cleaning routines. This material selection promotes long-lasting use and effortless sanitation within the cooler, minimizing downtime and maintenance costs.<br>Bright LED interior lighting offers clear visibility of stored beverages, while four pre-installed, epoxy-coated shelves provide organized and adjustable storage solutions. This design prioritizes both functionality and user experience for efficient beverage management.</p>', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/SBB48GRAUS1_6db21407-d940-4b8b-bbc1-eabda827b9fd.webp\"]', 'SBB48GRAUS1', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2108, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 48.00, NULL, 40.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 150.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:15', '2024-12-13 14:13:55', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/SBB48GRAUS1_6db21407-d940-4b8b-bbc1-eabda827b9fd.webp', 'physical', NULL, 1407, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, '[]', NULL, '', 0, NULL, 'pounds', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB53\"}]', '[]', '[]', 'non-refundable', '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1746, 'Atosa MGF8408GR 27.5\" Worktop Refrigerator with Backsplash 27.5 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MGF8408GR 27.5\" Worktop Refrigerator with Backsplash is designed to maximize efficiency in commercial kitchens by providing both refrigerated storage and a practical workspace in a compact footprint. With a width of 27.5 inches, it offers a versatile solution for smaller kitchen spaces or areas where a dedicated prep surface is needed alongside refrigeration. The unit features a durable stainless steel exterior and interior, ensuring durability and ease of cleaning while maintaining a professional appearance. The included backsplash enhances cleanliness by preventing spills and food debris from accumulating behind the unit.</p>\n<p>Internally, the MGF8408GR is equipped with adjustable shelves, allowing for customizable storage of ingredients, beverages, and other perishable items. Its built-in refrigeration system is designed for efficiency, providing consistent cooling to maintain optimal temperatures for food safety and freshness. This makes it ideal for storing ingredients that require immediate access during food preparation. Overall, the Atosa MGF8408GR Worktop Refrigerator with Backsplash is a practical choice for commercial kitchens seeking a blend of functionality, space efficiency, and durability in their refrigeration equipment.</p>', '\n\nAt 27.5 inches wide, this worktop refrigerator is ideal for maximizing storage capacity in kitchens with limited counter space. This space-conscious design allows for efficient use of valuable floor space, making it a suitable solution for smaller cafes, kiosks, or back-of-house operations.<br>\n\nA digital temperature control system ensures consistent and accurate temperatures between 33°F and 40°F. This precise temperature control is essential for maintaining optimal food safety and preserving food quality.<br>\n\nThe refrigerator features a stainless steel interior and exterior for superior strength and longevity. Stainless steel is resistant to dents, scratches, and corrosion, commonly encountered in busy kitchens. It also simplifies cleaning and sanitation routines, promoting a hygienic food storage environment.<br>\n\nOne pre-installed, adjustable shelf is included for efficient inventory management. This shelf allows for the organization of various food items, contributing to a clean and well-maintained workspace.<br>\n\nThe integrated worktop surface maximizes the unit\'s functionality by providing additional prep space within kitchens with limited counter space. This optimizes workflow and efficiency, particularly in areas with high-volume food preparation demands.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MGF8408GR_d4295fb5-6217-4cf3-bb5e-023e7905d743.webp\"]', 'MGF8408GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1559, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 40.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 176.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:15', '2024-12-13 14:13:56', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MGF8408GR_d4295fb5-6217-4cf3-bb5e-023e7905d743.webp', 'physical', '', 1019.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB54\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1747, 'Atosa MGF8409GR 48.3\" Worktop Refrigerator with Backsplash 13.4 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MGF8409GR 48.3\" Worktop Refrigerator with Backsplash is designed to enhance efficiency in commercial kitchen environments by combining refrigerated storage with a practical workspace. With a width of 48.3 inches, it offers ample room for storing perishable ingredients while providing a sturdy stainless steel work surface for food preparation tasks. The stainless steel construction not only ensures durability and easy maintenance but also contributes to a hygienic environment by resisting corrosion and facilitating quick cleanup.</p>\n<p>Internally, the MGF8409GR features adjustable shelves that allow for flexible organization of various items, from ingredients to prepared foods. The unit\'s built-in refrigeration system ensures consistent cooling throughout, maintaining optimal temperatures to preserve the freshness and quality of stored items. The included backsplash serves as a sanitary barrier, preventing food debris and liquids from accumulating behind the unit and making cleaning easier. Overall, the Atosa MGF8409GR Worktop Refrigerator with Backsplash is an excellent choice for kitchens seeking a blend of storage space and functional workspace in a compact and efficient design.At 13.4 cu. ft., this worktop refrigerator provides a practical solution for storing and organizing food and beverages in smaller commercial kitchens or restaurants with limited floor space.<br>A Dixell digital temperature control system ensures consistent and accurate temperatures between 33°F and 40°F, ideal for maintaining optimal food safety and quality.<br>The refrigerator features a stainless steel interior and exterior for superior strength and longevity. This material selection resists dents, scratches, and corrosion commonly encountered in busy kitchens, and simplifies cleaning and sanitation routines.<br>One pre-installed, epoxy-coated shelf is included to promote efficient organization and easy access to stored products, contributing to a clean and well-maintained workspace.<br>The worktop surface maximizes the unit\'s functionality by providing additional prep space within kitchens with limited counter space, optimizing workflow and efficiency.</p>', '\n\nAt 13.4 cu. ft., this worktop refrigerator provides a practical solution for storing and organizing food and beverages in smaller commercial kitchens or restaurants with limited floor space.<br>\n\nA Dixell digital temperature control system ensures consistent and accurate temperatures between 33°F and 40°F, ideal for maintaining optimal food safety and quality.<br>\n\nThe refrigerator features a stainless steel interior and exterior for superior strength and longevity. This material selection resists dents, scratches, and corrosion commonly encountered in busy kitchens, and simplifies cleaning and sanitation routines.<br>\n\nOne pre-installed, epoxy-coated shelf is included to promote efficient organization and easy access to stored products, contributing to a clean and well-maintained workspace.<br>\n\nThe worktop surface maximizes the unit\'s functionality by providing additional prep space within kitchens with limited counter space, optimizing workflow and efficiency.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MGF8409GR_8cc9417e-c51b-47bc-a3ed-cfdc3977bbf0.webp\"]', 'MGF8409GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2246, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48.00, NULL, 40.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 242.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:17', '2024-12-13 14:13:56', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MGF8409GR_8cc9417e-c51b-47bc-a3ed-cfdc3977bbf0.webp', 'physical', '', 1470, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SST