(1749, 'Atosa MGF8448GR  35.63\" Two Drawer Refrigerated Chef Base 4.7 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MGF8448GR 35.63\" Refrigerated Chef Base is designed to provide essential refrigerated storage directly underneath kitchen cooking equipment, optimizing workflow efficiency in commercial kitchens. With a compact footprint and 4.7 cubic feet of storage capacity, it offers a convenient solution for chefs to keep frequently used ingredients close at hand. The exterior and interior are constructed from durable stainless steel, ensuring resilience against corrosion and facilitating easy cleaning, which is crucial in maintaining hygiene standards in busy kitchen environments.</p>\n<p>Internally, the MGF8448GR features heavy-duty insulation that helps maintain consistent temperatures, preserving the freshness and quality of stored ingredients. The unit is equipped with drawers that can accommodate various pan sizes, providing organized storage and easy access to ingredients during food preparation. A built-in temperature control system allows precise adjustment of cooling settings to suit different storage needs, ensuring that foods are kept at optimal temperatures for maximum freshness and safety. Overall, the Atosa MGF8448GR combines durability, functionality, and efficient design to support seamless kitchen operations and enhance food preparation processes in commercial settings.</p>', '\n\nProvides 4.7 cubic feet of refrigerated storage space, ideal for keeping ingredients and prepared foods cool and easily accessible in commercial kitchens.<br>\n\nDurable stainless steel exterior and interior ensure longevity, ease of cleaning, and resistance to corrosion, maintaining hygiene standards in busy kitchen environments.<br>\n\nEfficient insulation helps to maintain consistent temperatures, preserving the freshness and quality of stored ingredients.<br>\n\nEquipped with drawers that can accommodate pans of varying sizes, providing organized storage for easy access to ingredients during food preparation.<br>\n\nAllows precise temperature adjustment to meet specific storage requirements, ensuring foods are stored at optimal temperatures for freshness and safety.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MGF8448GR_e630421f-7b0c-44f6-8d42-b78c91381c3a.webp\"]', 'MGF8448GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2292, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36.00, NULL, 27.00, NULL, 33.00, NULL, 218.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:19', '2024-12-13 14:13:56', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MGF8448GR_e630421f-7b0c-44f6-8d42-b78c91381c3a.webp', 'physical', '', 1456, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB57\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1750, 'Atosa SBB48GGRAUS1 48\" Shallow Depth Double Glass Door Back Bar Cooler 11.5 Cu.Ft', 'criptions\n<p> <br>The Atosa SBB48GGRAUS1 48\" Shallow Depth Double Glass Door Back Bar Cooler is designed to offer efficient refrigeration and display capabilities in commercial settings. With a capacity of 11.5 cubic feet, this unit is compact yet spacious enough to store and display a variety of beverages, making it ideal for bars, pubs, and restaurants with limited space. The shallow depth design allows it to fit seamlessly behind bars or in tight spaces without compromising on storage capacity.</p>\n<p>Constructed with a sleek stainless steel exterior and double glass doors, the SBB48GGRAUS1 not only provides durability but also offers a visually appealing display of beverages to customers. The glass doors are designed to enhance product visibility, making it easy for staff to quickly locate and retrieve items during busy service periods. Inside, the cooler features adjustable shelves to accommodate different bottle and can sizes, providing flexibility in organizing and storing various beverages. A forced-air refrigeration system ensures even cooling throughout the cabinet, maintaining consistent temperatures to preserve the quality and freshness of drinks. Overall, the Atosa SBB48GGRAUS1 combines functionality with aesthetics, making it a practical choice for establishments looking to optimize beverage storage and display in a compact footprint.</p>', '\n\nDesigned with a shallow depth of 24.5 inches, the Atosa SBB48GGRAUS1 back bar cooler maximizes storage capacity in kitchens and bars with limited floor space. This is ideal for establishments that prioritize maximizing functionality without sacrificing valuable floor space.<br>\n\nDual glass doors with self-closing mechanisms allow for effortless product identification while minimizing unnecessary cooler openings. This significantly reduces cold air loss and helps maintain consistent internal temperatures, optimizing energy efficiency.<br>\n\nAn electronic temperature control system ensures consistent and precise chilling between 33°F and 40°F. This safeguards beverage quality and ensures drinks are served at the perfect temperature.<br>\n\nThe Atosa SBB48GGRAUS1 features a stainless steel exterior and interior for superior durability and simplified cleaning routines. This material selection promotes long-lasting use and effortless sanitation within the cooler.<br>\n\nBright LED interior lighting offers clear visibility of stored beverages, while four pre-installed, epoxy-coated shelves provide organized and adjustable storage solutions. This design prioritizes both functionality and user experience for efficient beverage management.<br>\n\nA conveniently designed slide-out compressor assembly facilitates easier maintenance procedures whenever required.\n\n<h2>Des</h2>', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/SBB48GGRAUS1_8f17598f-3d9e-44f4-b119-7248a727cbbf.webp\"]', 'SBB48GGRAUS1', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2325, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48.00, NULL, 40.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 150.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:19', '2024-12-13 14:13:56', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/SBB48GGRAUS1_8f17598f-3d9e-44f4-b119-7248a727cbbf.webp', 'physical', '', 1552.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB58\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1751, 'Atosa MKC90GR  89.3\" 2 Double Tap Kegerator Beer Dispenser - Stainless Steel, 4 1/2 Keg Capacity 30.1 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MKC90GR 89.3\" (2) Double Tap Kegerator Beer Dispenser is a powerhouse designed for establishments needing extensive beer storage and service capabilities. With an expansive capacity of 30.1 cubic feet, capable of accommodating four half kegs simultaneously, it caters perfectly to high-demand environments such as large bars, pubs, and event venues. Constructed from durable stainless steel, the exterior not only ensures longevity but also provides resistance against corrosion, making it suitable for continuous use in busy settings.</p>\n<p>Internally, the MKC90GR is equipped with a robust forced-air refrigeration system that maintains consistent temperatures throughout the cabinet, ensuring that beers are kept chilled and ready for immediate service. The dispenser features two tap towers, each with double faucets, allowing for efficient dispensing of up to four different types of beer simultaneously. A digital temperature control and display system provides precise management of cooling settings, guaranteeing that beers are served at optimal temperatures for enjoyment. LED interior lighting enhances visibility inside the dispenser, facilitating easy access and retrieval of beverages, even during busy operations. Overall, the Atosa MKC90GR combines expansive storage, durability, and advanced features to streamline beer service and meet the needs of large-scale operations.</p>', '\n\nOffers a spacious 30.1 cubic feet capacity, capable of storing up to four half kegs simultaneously, making it suitable for large-scale venues and events.<br>\n\nDurable stainless steel exterior provides strength, corrosion resistance, and easy cleaning, ensuring longevity and hygiene in busy environments.<br>\n\nEnsures uniform cooling throughout the cabinet to maintain beer at the optimal serving temperature.<br>\n\nFeatures two tap towers with double faucets each, enabling the dispensing of up to four different beers simultaneously, which enhances operational efficiency during peak times.<br>\n\nAllows precise temperature management, ensuring beers are served at the perfect temperature for enjoyment and consistency.<br>\n\nEnhances visibility inside the dispenser, making it easy for staff to locate and serve beverages, even in low-light conditions.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MKC90GR_06657ded-a3aa-4a79-9782-3a44a2f665fb.webp\"]', 'MKC90GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 3639, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 89.00, NULL, 56.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 357.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:21', '2024-12-13 14:13:56', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MKC90GR_06657ded-a3aa-4a79-9782-3a44a2f665fb.webp', 'physical', '', 2278, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB59\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '');
