(1752, 'Atosa MKC68GR 57.8\" 2 Double Tap Kegerator Beer Dispenser - Stainless Steel, 3 1/2 Keg Capacity 21.5  Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MKC68GR 57.8\" (2) Double Tap Kegerator Beer Dispenser is a robust solution designed to meet the demands of high-volume draft beer service in commercial settings. With a generous capacity of 21.5 cubic feet, capable of accommodating three half kegs simultaneously, this dispenser is ideal for bars, restaurants, and events where a wide variety of beers are offered on tap. The exterior is crafted from durable stainless steel, ensuring durability and resistance to corrosion, making it suitable for rigorous use in bustling environments.</p>\n<p>Internally, the MKC68GR features a powerful forced-air refrigeration system that maintains consistent temperatures, preserving beer at optimal serving conditions. It boasts two tap towers, each equipped with double faucets, allowing for the simultaneous dispensing of two different types of beer. A digital temperature control and display enable precise temperature management, ensuring that beer is served at the perfect temperature for maximum enjoyment. LED interior lighting enhances visibility inside the dispenser, making it easy for bartenders and staff to access and serve beverages, even in low-light environments. Overall, the Atosa MKC68GR combines durability, efficiency, and practical design to streamline draft beer service and enhance customer satisfaction.</p>', '\n\nOffers a large 21.5 cubic feet capacity, allowing for the storage of three half kegs simultaneously, making it suitable for venues with high demand for draft beer.<br>\n\nDurable stainless steel exterior provides strength, corrosion resistance, and easy cleaning, ideal for maintaining hygiene in busy commercial environments.<br>\n\nEnsures uniform cooling throughout the cabinet to maintain beer at the optimal serving temperature.<br>\n\nFeatures two tap towers with double faucets each, enabling the dispensing of up to four different beers simultaneously, enhancing operational efficiency during peak times.<br>\n\nAllows precise temperature management, ensuring beer is served at the perfect temperature for enjoyment and maintaining consistency.<br>\n\nEnhances visibility inside the dispenser, making it easy for staff to locate and serve beverages, even in low-light conditions.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MKC68GR_61038877-f24e-4ceb-9df7-2d449a73dd9f.webp\"]', 'MKC68GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 3134, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 68.00, NULL, 56.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 291.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:22', '2024-12-13 14:13:56', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MKC68GR_61038877-f24e-4ceb-9df7-2d449a73dd9f.webp', 'physical', '', 1980, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB60\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1753, 'Atosa MKC58GR 57.8\" 2 Double Tap Kegerator Beer Dispenser - Stainless Steel, 2 1/2 Keg Capacity 17.3  Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MKC58GR 57.8\" (2) Double Tap Kegerator Beer Dispenser is a robust solution designed for efficiently dispensing draft beer in commercial settings. With a spacious 17.3 cubic feet capacity, it can accommodate two half kegs simultaneously, making it suitable for bars, restaurants, and events where a variety of beers are served on tap. The exterior is constructed from durable stainless steel, offering both strength and resistance to corrosion, ensuring longevity even in high-traffic environments.</p>\n<p>Internally, the MKC58GR features a forced-air refrigeration system that maintains consistent temperatures to keep beer at optimal serving conditions. It includes two tap towers with double faucets each, allowing for the simultaneous dispensing of two different types of beer. The unit is equipped with a digital temperature control and display, providing precise management of cooling settings. LED interior lighting enhances visibility inside the dispenser, making it easy for bartenders and staff to access and serve beverages even in dimly lit environments. Overall, the Atosa MKC58GR combines durability, functionality, and convenience to streamline draft beer service in commercial establishments.</p>', '\n\nOffers a large 17.3 cubic feet capacity, allowing for the storage of two half kegs simultaneously, ideal for establishments serving multiple types of draft beer.<br>\n\nDurable stainless steel exterior provides strength, durability, and resistance to corrosion, ensuring longevity in commercial environments.<br>\n\nEnsures uniform cooling throughout the cabinet to maintain beer at the optimal serving temperature.<br>\n\nFeatures two tap towers with double faucets each, allowing for the dispensing of two different beers simultaneously, which enhances operational efficiency during peak hours.<br>\n\nAllows precise temperature management, ensuring beer is served at the perfect temperature for enjoyment.<br>Enhances visibility inside the dispenser, making it easy for staff to locate and serve beverages, especially in low-light conditions.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MKC58GR_5ece0b22-68df-46bd-b0fe-94ecfd43cc49.webp\"]', 'MKC58GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2812, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 58.00, NULL, 56.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 243.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:23', '2024-12-13 14:13:56', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MKC58GR_5ece0b22-68df-46bd-b0fe-94ecfd43cc49.webp', 'physical', '', 1760, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB61\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1754, 'Atosa MBC50GR 49.3\" Stainless Steel Horizontal Bottle Cooler 11.7  Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MBC50GR 49.3\" Stainless Steel Horizontal Bottle Cooler is designed to provide efficient cooling and storage for beverages in commercial settings. With a capacity of 11.7 cubic feet, this cooler offers a compact yet substantial space to keep a variety of bottled drinks chilled and ready for service. The exterior is crafted from durable stainless steel, ensuring durability and resistance to corrosion, which is essential for maintaining hygiene standards in busy environments such as bars and restaurants.</p>\n<p>Internally, the MBC50GR features a forced-air refrigeration system that ensures even distribution of cold air throughout the cabinet. This system maintains consistent temperatures, keeping beverages at their optimal serving temperature. The cooler is equipped with a built-in bottle opener and cap catcher on the front panel, providing convenience for bartenders and staff during service. LED interior lighting enhances visibility inside the cooler, making it easy to locate and retrieve beverages, even in low-light conditions. Overall, the Atosa MBC50GR combines durability, functionality, and efficiency to meet the needs of establishments requiring a reliable beverage cooling solution.</p>', '\n\nOffers a capacity of 11.7 cubic feet, providing ample space to store and chill a variety of bottled beverages.<br>\n\nDurable stainless steel exterior ensures longevity, resistance to corrosion, and easy cleaning, suitable for maintaining hygiene in busy commercial environments.<br>\n\nEnsures uniform cooling throughout the cabinet, keeping beverages consistently chilled at the desired temperature.<br>\n\nConveniently located on the front panel for easy access, facilitating quick bottle opening and cap disposal during service.<br>\n\nEnhances visibility inside the cooler, making it easy for staff to locate and access beverages, even in dimly lit environments.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MBC50GR_66418412-ab4a-46e9-8f9e-32f24f90c52a.webp\"]', 'MBC50GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1888, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 49.00, NULL, 37.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 236.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:24', '2024-12-13 14:13:56', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MBC50GR_66418412-ab4a-46e9-8f9e-32f24f90c52a.webp', 'physical', '', 1183, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB62\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1755, 'Atosa MBC65GR 64.7\" Stainless Steel Horizontal Bottle Cooler 16.4 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MBC65GR 64.7\" Stainless Steel Horizontal Bottle Cooler is designed to efficiently chill and store beverages in commercial settings such as bars, restaurants, and convenience stores. With a capacity of 16.4 cubic feet, this cooler provides ample space to hold a substantial quantity of bottled drinks, ensuring that customers always have access to refreshments. The exterior is constructed from durable stainless steel, which not only enhances its durability but also makes it resistant to rust and easy to clean, essential qualities for maintaining hygiene in busy environments.</p>\n<p>Internally, the MBC65GR features a forced-air refrigeration system that ensures uniform cooling across the entire cabinet, keeping beverages consistently chilled and ready for immediate service. The cooler includes a built-in bottle opener and cap catcher conveniently located on the front panel, facilitating efficient bottle opening and disposal of caps. LED lighting inside the cooler improves visibility, making it effortless for staff to locate and retrieve beverages, even in dimly lit environments. Overall, the Atosa MBC65GR combines robust construction with practical features to meet the demands of commercial beverage cooling applications effectively.</p>', '\n\nOffers a spacious 16.4 cubic feet interior capacity, providing ample space to store and chill a large quantity of bottled beverages.<br>\n\nDurable stainless steel exterior ensures longevity, resistance to corrosion, and easy cleaning, maintaining hygiene standards in commercial environments.<br>\n\nEnsures even distribution of cold air throughout the cabinet, keeping beverages consistently chilled at the ideal serving temperature.<br>\n\nLocated conveniently on the front panel, facilitating quick and efficient bottle opening and cap disposal, streamlining beverage service.<br>\n\nEnhances visibility inside the cooler, making it easy for staff to locate and retrieve beverages, even in low-light conditions\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MBC65GR_71f7e4dd-4a22-48c9-ad98-42724acd6b4c.webp\"]', 'MBC65GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2122, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 65.00, NULL, 37.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 278.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:25', '2024-12-13 14:13:56', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MBC65GR_71f7e4dd-4a22-48c9-ad98-42724acd6b4c.webp', 'physical', '', 1340, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB63\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1756, 'Atosa MBC80GR 80.5\" Stainless Steel Horizontal Bottle Cooler 21.2  Cu.Ft', '<p> <br>The Atosa MBC80GR 80.5\" Stainless Steel Horizontal Bottle Cooler is designed to provide efficient cooling and storage for beverages in commercial settings. With a spacious 21.2 cubic feet capacity, this horizontal cooler accommodates a large quantity of bottled drinks, making it ideal for bars, restaurants, and convenience stores. The exterior is crafted from durable stainless steel, which not only enhances its durability but also ensures resistance to corrosion and easy cleaning, crucial for maintaining hygiene in busy environments.</p><p>Internally, the Atosa MBC80GR features a forced-air refrigeration system that ensures even cooling throughout the cabinet, keeping beverages chilled and ready for serving. The unit includes a built-in bottle opener and cap catcher on the front, adding convenience for bartenders and staff. LED interior lighting enhances visibility, making it easy to locate and retrieve beverages, especially in dimly lit environments. The MBC80GR is designed for efficiency and functionality, combining a robust build with practical features to streamline beverage service operations in commercial establishments.</p>', '<p>Offers a generous 21.2 cubic feet capacity to store a large quantity of bottled beverages, perfect for high-demand environments such as bars and restaurants.<br>Durable stainless steel exterior provides strength, longevity, and resistance to corrosion, ensuring the cooler can withstand daily use in commercial settings.<br>Ensures consistent cooling throughout the cabinet, maintaining beverages at the optimal temperature for serving.<br>Conveniently located on the front of the cooler, allowing bartenders to quickly open bottles and dispose of caps, streamlining drink preparation.<br>Enhances visibility inside the cooler, making it easy to locate and access beverages, even in low-light conditions.</p>', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MBC80GR_addfa3bd-9fa9-48ce-9c29-9cc725d8bc19.webp\"]', 'MBC80GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2857, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 81.00, NULL, 37.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 344.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:26', '2024-12-18 09:24:44', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MBC80GR_addfa3bd-9fa9-48ce-9c29-9cc725d8bc19.webp', 'physical', NULL, 1788, 4, 0, 8, 0, '<p>Two Year Parts &amp; Labor Warranty&nbsp;</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB64\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1757, 'Atosa MKC23GR 1 Double Tap Kegerator Beer Dispenser - Stainless Steel, 1 1/2 Keg Capacity 7.1 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MKC23GR Double Tap Kegerator Beer Dispenser is a sleek and efficient solution designed for dispensing draft beer in commercial or home settings. With the capacity to hold one half-barrel (1/2) keg, equivalent to approximately 7.1 cubic feet, it offers ample storage for keeping beer chilled and ready for serving. The stainless steel exterior not only provides durability but also adds a professional aesthetic that fits well in bars, restaurants, or private entertainment spaces.</p>\n<p>Equipped with two taps, the MKC23GR allows for dispensing two different types of beer simultaneously, enhancing drink options for customers or guests. This feature is particularly useful for establishments with a diverse selection of draft beers. The unit includes features like a digital temperature control panel, ensuring precise temperature management to maintain beer at optimal serving temperatures. Overall, the Atosa MKC23GR combines functionality, durability, and style to meet the needs of draft beer enthusiasts and businesses looking to offer quality beer service.</p>', '\n\nDurable and easy to clean, providing a professional appearance suitable for commercial and home settings.<br>\n\nAllows for dispensing two different types of beer simultaneously, offering versatility in drink options.\nAccommodates one half-barrel (1/2) keg, providing approximately 7.1 cubic feet of storage space for draft beer.<br>\n\nEnsures precise temperature management to keep beer at the ideal serving temperature.<br>\n\nEquipped with casters for easy movement and placement within the space, enhancing flexibility and convenience.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MKC23GR_e1a1e66b-8e8e-4b36-b233-73bd933d3ecf.webp\"]', 'MKC23GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1523, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 23.00, NULL, 55.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 188.00, NULL