(1758, 'Atosa MBB90G-GR 89.3\" Stainless Steel Glass Door Back Bar Refrigerator 30.1 Cu.Ft', '\n<p>The Atosa MBB90GGR is an expansive 89.3-inch stainless steel glass door back bar refrigerator, offering a substantial 30.1 cubic feet of storage capacity. This refrigerator is designed for high-volume commercial bar environments, providing ample space for storing a diverse selection of beverages and other bar essentials while showcasing them through its transparent glass door. The stainless steel construction ensures durability and ease of cleaning, making it suitable for environments where cleanliness and longevity are paramount.</p>\n<p>Equipped with a powerful refrigeration system, the MBB90GGR maintains consistent internal temperatures to preserve the quality and freshness of stored items. The glass door design not only enhances visibility but also adds a contemporary aesthetic to the bar setting, making it easier for bartenders and patrons to locate and access beverages. Adjustable shelves inside the refrigerator allow for customizable storage configurations, accommodating various bottle sizes and shapes to maximize storage efficiency. Overall, the Atosa MBB90GGR combines spacious storage capacity with an attractive design, ideal for enhancing both operational efficiency and visual appeal in large-scale commercial bars.</p>', '\n\nFeatures a transparent glass door that provides clear visibility of stored beverages, enhancing merchandising and customer convenience in bar settings.<br>\n\nDurable and easy to clean, designed to withstand the demands of commercial environments while maintaining hygiene standards.<br>\n\nOffers a generous 30.1 cubic feet of storage space, accommodating a wide variety of beverages, mixers, and other bar essentials.<br>\n\nAllows for flexible storage configurations to accommodate different bottle sizes and shapes, maximizing storage efficiency.<br>\n\nEnsures precise temperature control to maintain optimal storage conditions while minimizing energy consumption, supporting cost-effective operation.<br>\n\nIlluminates the interior for enhanced visibility and presentation of stored items, improving visibility and aesthetic appeal in bar settings.<br>\n\nEnhances convenience and accessibility, ensuring the door closes securely to maintain internal temperatures during busy service periods.<br>Helps prevent ice buildup and ensures consistent cooling performance without manual intervention, maintaining operational efficiency.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MBB90G-GR_e5994925-03b9-4d35-86da-8f1bc9b434a2.webp\"]', 'MBB90G-GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 3409, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:27', '2024-12-13 14:13:56', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MBB90G-GR_e5994925-03b9-4d35-86da-8f1bc9b434a2.webp', 'physical', '', 2134.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB66\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
