(1766, 'Atosa MGF8454GR 76\" Four Drawer Refrigerated Chef Base, Extended Top 12.1 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MGF8454GR is a robust 76-inch four-drawer refrigerated chef base designed to optimize storage and workspace efficiency in commercial kitchens. With a generous capacity of 12.1 cubic feet, this unit offers ample refrigerated space for storing ingredients and prepared items within easy reach of kitchen workstations. Its extended top provides additional workspace, allowing chefs to organize and prepare ingredients efficiently without needing to venture far from the cooking area.</p>\n<p>Crafted from durable stainless steel, the MGF8454GR is built to withstand the demands of a busy kitchen environment while ensuring easy cleaning and maintenance. It features a digital temperature control system that maintains precise temperature levels, ensuring food stays fresh and safe. The self-closing drawers with recessed handles enhance convenience and security, ensuring the drawers close properly to maintain optimal storage conditions. Heavy-duty casters facilitate easy mobility, making it simple to reposition the chef base for cleaning or rearranging kitchen layouts. Overall, the Atosa MGF8454GR combines durability, ample storage capacity, and practical design elements to support efficient kitchen operations.</p>', '\n\nProvides additional workspace, enhancing efficiency in food preparation and organization.<br>\n\nOffers four spacious drawers for organized storage of ingredients and prepared items.<br>\n\nProvides 12.1 cubic feet of refrigerated space, suitable for a variety of kitchen essentials.<br>\n\nEnsures durability, longevity, and easy cleaning, ideal for busy commercial kitchens.<br>\n\nEnables precise temperature management to maintain food freshness and safety.<br>Includes self-closing drawers with recessed handles and heavy-duty casters for ease of mobility and convenience in kitchen operations.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/pro