(1767, 'Atosa MGF8453GR 72.4\" Four Drawer Refrigerated Chef Base 12.1 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MGF8453GR is a 72.4-inch four-drawer refrigerated chef base, offering a substantial 12.1 cubic feet of storage capacity. This model is designed to support kitchen efficiency by providing ample refrigerated storage directly at the workstation. The four-drawer configuration ensures that ingredients and prepared items can be neatly organized and quickly accessed, reducing the need for chefs to move around the kitchen frequently. This layout is particularly advantageous in busy commercial kitchens where maintaining a streamlined workflow is essential.</p>\n<p>Constructed from durable stainless steel, the MGF8453GR is built to withstand the rigors of a high-demand kitchen environment while being easy to clean and maintain. The chef base features a digital temperature control system, which provides precise temperature regulation to ensure that stored items remain fresh and safe. The self-closing drawers with recessed handles are designed for convenience, ensuring that the drawers close securely to maintain the internal temperature. Additionally, heavy-duty casters offer mobility, making it easy to reposition the unit for cleaning or reconfiguring the kitchen layout. Overall, the Atosa MGF8453GR combines robust construction, ample storage capacity, and practical features, making it an excellent choice for any professional kitchen.</p>', '\n\nOffers organized storage with four spacious drawers, allowing for easy access to ingredients and prepared items.<br>\n\nProvides 12.1 cubic feet of refrigerated space, ideal for storing a variety of kitchen essentials.<br>\n\nEnsures durability, longevity, and ease of cleaning, suitable for high-demand commercial kitchen environments.<br>\n\nAllows for precise temperature management to maintain optimal freshness and food safety.<br>\n\nIncludes self-closing drawers with recessed handles and heavy-duty casters for enhanced mobility and convenience.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MGF8453GR_dc015543-63d0-41ad-a0cb-c52c7213114c.webp\"]', 'MGF8453GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 3601, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 72.00, NULL, 27.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 364.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:36', '2024-12-13 14:13:57', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MGF8453GR_dc015543-63d0-41ad-a0cb-c52c7213114c.webp', 'physical', '', 2292.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB75\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '');
