(1768, 'Atosa MGF8452GR 60.5\" Two Drawer Refrigerated Chef Base, Extended Top  8.4 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MGF8452GR is a 60.5-inch two-drawer refrigerated chef base with an extended top, designed to enhance kitchen functionality and efficiency. With an 8.4 cubic feet storage capacity, this unit provides ample space for storing ingredients and prepared items, making it an ideal solution for busy commercial kitchens. The extended top offers additional workspace, allowing chefs to prep and organize their stations more effectively. This feature is particularly useful in tight kitchen spaces where maximizing surface area is crucial.</p>\n<p>Constructed with high-quality stainless steel, the MGF8452GR is built to endure the demands of a high-traffic kitchen while being easy to clean and maintain. The unit features a digital temperature control system, ensuring precise and consistent temperature regulation to keep stored items fresh and safe. The two-drawer design allows for organized storage, and the self-closing drawers with recessed handles provide convenience and security. Additionally, the heavy-duty casters facilitate easy movement and repositioning, making it simple to clean underneath the unit or rearrange the kitchen layout as needed. Overall, the Atosa MGF8452GR combines robust construction, ample storage, and practical design elements, making it a valuable addition to any professional kitchen.</p>', '\n\nProvides additional workspace, allowing for more efficient prep and organization in the kitchen.<br>\n\nFeatures two spacious drawers for organized storage of ingredients and prepared items.<br>\n\nOffers 8.4 cubic feet of refrigerated space, ideal for a variety of kitchen essentials.<br>\n\nEnsures durability, longevity, and easy cleaning, suitable for demanding commercial kitchen environments.<br>\n\nEnables precise temperature management to maintain optimal freshness and food safety.<br>Includes self-closing drawers with recessed handles and heavy-duty casters for enhanced mobility and convenience.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MGF8452GR_89a89920-4590-48d8-a6ab-6d0d1fc2273e.webp\"]', 'MGF8452GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2714, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 61.00, NULL, 27.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 282.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:37', '2024-12-13 14:13:57', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MGF8452GR_89a89920-4590-48d8-a6ab-6d0d1fc2273e.webp', 'physical', '', 1727.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB76\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1769, 'Atosa MGF8451GR 52.06\" Two Drawer Refrigerated Chef Base  8.4  Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MGF8451GR is a 52.06-inch two-drawer refrigerated chef base designed to enhance kitchen efficiency and organization. With an 8.4 cubic feet storage capacity, this unit provides ample space for storing ingredients and prepared items, allowing chefs to keep essential items within easy reach. The two-drawer design ensures that ingredients are organized and easily accessible, improving workflow and reducing the need to move across the kitchen frequently.</p>\n<p>Constructed from durable stainless steel, the MGF8451GR is built to withstand the rigors of a busy commercial kitchen while being easy to clean. The unit features a digital temperature control system that ensures precise temperature regulation, maintaining optimal freshness and food safety. The chef base is equipped with self-closing drawers that have recessed handles, ensuring secure closure and ease of use. Additionally, heavy-duty casters offer mobility, making it easy to reposition the unit for cleaning or rearranging the kitchen layout. Overall, the Atosa MGF8451GR combines robust construction with practical features, making it an excellent addition to any professional kitchen.</p>', '\n\nProvides organized storage with two spacious drawers, allowing for easy access to ingredients and prepared items.<br>\n\nOffers 8.4 cubic feet of refrigerated space, ideal for storing a variety of kitchen essentials.<br>\n\nEnsures durability, longevity, and ease of cleaning, suitable for demanding commercial kitchen environments.<br>\n\nEnables precise temperature management to maintain optimal freshness and food safety for stored items.<br>\n\nIncludes self-closing drawers with recessed handles and heavy-duty casters for enhanced mobility and convenience.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MGF8451GR_fe6abfb0-31d2-4f56-8124-8f80c1dad9c1.webp\"]', 'MGF8451GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 26