(1770, 'Atosa MGF8450GR  48.4\" Two Drawer Refrigerated Chef Base 7.7 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MGF8450GR is a 48.4-inch two-drawer refrigerated chef base designed to optimize kitchen efficiency by providing a reliable cooling solution directly at the workstation. With a storage capacity of 7.7 cubic feet, this chef base allows chefs to store ingredients and prepared items within easy reach, enhancing workflow and reducing the need for constant movement across the kitchen. The two-drawer design ensures organized storage, making it easy to access ingredients quickly and maintain a well-ordered kitchen space.</p>\n<p>Constructed from high-quality stainless steel, the MGF8450GR is built to withstand the demands of a busy commercial kitchen. Its robust construction ensures durability and ease of cleaning, while the heavy-duty casters offer mobility for easy repositioning and cleaning underneath the unit. The chef base features a digital temperature control system, providing precise temperature management to keep stored items fresh and safe. Additionally, the self-closing drawers with recessed handles are designed for convenience, ensuring the drawers close securely to maintain the internal temperature. Overall, the Atosa MGF8450GR combines practicality, durability, and efficient design, making it a valuable addition to any professional kitchen.</p>', '\n\nProvides organized storage with two drawers, making it easy to access ingredients and maintain an orderly kitchen.<br>\n\nOffers 7.7 cubic feet of refrigerated space, ideal for storing a variety of ingredients and prepared items.<br>\n\nEnsures durability, longevity, and ease of cleaning, suitable for high-demand commercial kitchen environments.<br>\n\nAllows for precise temperature management to keep stored items fresh and at safe temperatures.<br>\n\nIncludes self-closing drawers with recessed handles and heavy-duty casters for mobility and convenience.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MGF8450GR_55980dea-3b7c-4bff-9d5c-4652d7cfcb8f.webp\"]', 'MGF8450GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2490, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48.00, NULL, 27.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 258.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:39', '2024-12-13 14:13:57', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MGF8450GR_55980dea-3b7c-4bff-9d5c-4652d7cfcb8f.webp', 'physical', '', 1586, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB78\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1771, 'Atosa MPF8203GR 93\" Pizza Prep Table, 12 Pans 68 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MPF8203GR is a 93-inch pizza prep table designed to provide ample space and efficient functionality for pizza preparation. This model features a generous 68 cubic feet of storage capacity and is equipped with 12 pans, allowing for the organization and quick access to various ingredients. The table\'s stainless steel construction ensures durability and easy cleaning, making it suitable for high-traffic kitchen environments. Additionally, the unit includes a refrigerated base to keep ingredients fresh and at the optimal temperature, which is crucial for maintaining food quality and safety.</p>\n<p>This pizza prep table also boasts user-friendly features such as a digital temperature control system for precise regulation, ensuring the internal environment remains consistently cool. The MPF8203GR is designed with convenience in mind, featuring self-closing doors and recessed door handles to facilitate smooth operation. Heavy-duty casters provide mobility, allowing the unit to be easily relocated as needed. Overall, the Atosa MPF8203GR combines robust construction with practical features, making it an ideal choice for pizzerias and commercial kitchens that require a reliable and spacious prep table.</p>', '\n\nOffers 68 cubic feet of refrigerated storage, providing ample space for ingredients.<br>\n\nComes with 12 pans for organized and efficient ingredient management, ideal for pizza preparation.<br>\n\nDurable and easy to clean, suitable for high-traffic commercial kitchen environments.<br>\n\nGital Temperature Control: Allows for precise temperature regulation to maintain optimal freshness and food safety.<br>\n\nUser-Friendly Design: Features self-closing doors, recessed door handles, and heavy-duty casters for ease of use and mobility.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MPF8203GR_b5bdb5e6-b2a9-471e-b745-d7736aa473e7.webp\"]', 'MPF8203GR', 0, NULL,