(1772, 'Atosa MPF8202GR 67\" Pizza Prep Table, 9 Pans 18.5 Cu.Ft', '\n<p>The Atosa MPF8202GR is a spacious 67\" Pizza Prep Table designed to cater to the needs of high-volume pizza preparation in commercial settings. With a substantial storage capacity of 18.5 cubic feet, this unit accommodates up to 9 food pans, providing ample space for organizing various pizza toppings and ingredients. The prep table is equipped with a generous cutting board that spans the length of the unit, offering chefs a convenient workspace to assemble pizzas directly from the refrigerated compartments. This setup not only enhances operational efficiency during peak hours but also ensures that ingredients are kept fresh and easily accessible.</p>\n<p>Constructed with durable stainless steel, the MPF8202GR is built to withstand the rigors of daily use in busy kitchens while maintaining a clean and professional appearance. The stainless steel construction facilitates easy cleaning and sanitation, crucial for maintaining food safety standards in commercial food preparation environments. Internally, the prep table features a robust refrigeration system that maintains consistent temperatures across its compartments, preserving the quality and freshness of pizza ingredients. This efficient cooling system supports optimal food storage conditions, reducing waste and ensuring customer satisfaction with every pizza served. Overall, the Atosa MPF8202GR combines generous storage capacity, durable construction, and efficient performance, making it an essential tool for enhancing productivity in pizza-focused food establishments.</p>', '\n\nOffers 18.5 cubic feet of storage space, accommodating up to 9 food pans for extensive pizza topping and ingredient storage.<br>\n\n67\" width provides ample room for food preparation, ideal for high-volume pizza production in commercial kitchens.<br>\n\nFeatures a full-length cutting board for convenient pizza assembly directly from refrigerated compartments, enhancing workflow efficiency.<br>\n\nEnsures durability, easy cleaning, and a professional appearance, suitable for busy kitchen environments.<br>\n\nMaintains consistent temperatures to preserve the freshness and quality of pizza ingredients, supporting food safety and minimizing waste.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MPF8202GR_33017023-3a1b-42b2-acef-5c62319581e3.webp\"]', 'MPF8202GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 3984, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 67.00, NULL, 44.00, NULL, 33.00, NULL, 406.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:41', '2024-12-13 14:13:57', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MPF8202GR_33017023-3a1b-42b2-acef-5c62319581e3.webp', 'physical', '', 2631, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB80\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1773, 'Atosa MPF8201GR 44\" Pizza Prep Table, 6 Pans 9.7 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MPF8201GR is a specialized 44\" Pizza Prep Table designed to streamline the preparation of pizzas in commercial kitchens. With a storage capacity of 9.7 cubic feet, it accommodates up to 6 food pans, providing sufficient space for storing a variety of pizza toppings and ingredients. The unit is equipped with a convenient cutting board that spans the length of the prep area, allowing chefs to assemble pizzas directly from the refrigerated compartments. This setup not only enhances efficiency during peak service hours but also ensures that ingredients remain fresh and readily accessible.</p>\n<p>Constructed with durable stainless steel, the MPF8201GR is built to withstand the demands of a busy kitchen environment while maintaining a clean and professional appearance. The stainless steel construction also facilitates easy cleaning and sanitation, crucial for maintaining food safety standards. Internally, the prep table features a reliable refrigeration system that maintains consistent temperatures, ensuring that pizza toppings and ingredients are kept at optimal conditions for quality and freshness. Overall, the Atosa MPF8201GR combines practical design with efficient performance, making it an essential piece of equipment for any establishment focused on delivering quality pizzas efficiently.</p>', '\n\n44\" width with a space-saving footprint, suitable for smaller commercial kitchens or limited workspace.<br>\n\nIncludes space for 6 food pans, specifically designed for organizing pizza toppings and ingredients.<br>\n\nFeatures a full-length cutting board for convenient pizza assembly directly from refrigerated compartments, optimizing workflow efficiency.<br>\n\nEnsures durability, easy cleaning, and a professional appearance, ideal for busy kitchen environments.<br>\n\nMaintains consistent temperatures to preserve the freshness and quality of pizza ingredients, supporting food safety standards.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MPF8201GR_a685cc77-3320-49d8-8107-386e41a29791.webp\"]', 'MPF8201GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2903, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 44.00, NULL, 44.00, NULL, 33.00, NULL, 295.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:42', '2024-12-13 14:13:57', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MPF8201GR_a685cc77-3320-49d8-8107-386e41a29791.webp', 'physical', '', 1868.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB81\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1774, 'Atosa MSF8308GR 72.69\" Mega Top Sandwich Prep Table, 30 Pans 21.1 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MSF8308GR is an expansive and high-capacity 72.69\" Mega Top Sandwich Prep Table designed for the most demanding commercial kitchen environments. With a generous storage capacity of 21.1 cubic feet, this unit accommodates up to 30 food pans, providing extensive storage space for a wide variety of sandwich and salad ingredients. The mega top configuration includes an integrated cutting board that spans the entire length of the unit, offering chefs ample workspace to efficiently prepare and assemble dishes directly from the refrigerated compartments. This design not only enhances workflow efficiency but also ensures quick access to ingredients during busy service periods, making it ideal for large-scale food service operations.</p>\n<p>Constructed with durable stainless steel, the MSF8308GR is built to withstand the rigors of daily use in busy kitchens while maintaining a hygienic and professional appearance. The robust construction facilitates easy cleaning and maintenance, crucial for upholding food safety standards. Internally, the prep table features a reliable refrigeration system that ensures consistent temperatures throughout its compartments, preserving the freshness and quality of stored ingredients. This efficient cooling system supports operational efficiency and helps minimize food waste by keeping perishable items at optimal conditions until they are ready to be used. Overall, the Atosa MSF8308GR combines extensive storage capacity, durable construction, and efficient performance, making it an essential tool for maximizing productivity in large food service establishments.</p>', '\n\nProvides 21.1 cubic feet of storage space, accommodating up to 30 food pans for extensive ingredient storage.<br>\n\n72.69\" width offers a large area for food preparation, suitable for high-volume commercial kitchens and large-scale food service operations.<br>\n\nFeatures a spacious top area with room for 30 food pans and an integrated cutting board for efficient assembly of sandwiches and salads.<br>\n\nEnsures durability, easy cleaning, and a professional appearance, ideal for busy kitchen environments.<br>\n\nMaintains consistent temperatures to preserve ingredient freshness and quality, supporting food safety and minimizing waste.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MSF8308GR_64066d3c-7178-4205-8712-ede3dd97462b.webp\"]', 'MSF8308GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 3583, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 73.00, NULL, 47.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 401.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:43', '2024-12-13 14:13:57', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MSF8308GR_64066d3c-7178-4205-8712-ede3dd97462b.webp', 'physical', '', 2348, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB82\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1775, 'Atosa MSF8307GR 60.2\" Mega Top Sandwich Prep Table, 24 Pans 17.2 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MSF8307GR is a spacious and versatile 60.2\" Mega Top Sandwich Prep Table designed to meet the rigorous demands of high-volume commercial kitchens. With an impressive capacity of 17.2 cubic feet, this unit accommodates up to 24 food pans, providing ample storage for a wide variety of sandwich and salad ingredients. The expansive top configuration includes an integrated cutting board that spans the length of the unit, offering chefs a convenient workspace for assembling dishes directly from the refrigerated compartments. This setup not only enhances workflow efficiency but also ensures quick and easy access to ingredients during busy service hours.</p>\n<p>Crafted with durable stainless steel, the MSF8307GR is built to withstand the daily challenges of a bustling kitchen environment while maintaining a professional appearance. The robust construction facilitates easy cleaning and maintenance, essential for upholding food safety standards. Internally, the prep table features a reliable refrigeration system that maintains consistent temperatures across its compartments, preserving the freshness and quality of stored ingredients. This efficient cooling system supports operational efficiency and helps minimize waste by ensuring perishable items remain at optimal conditions until they are ready to be used. Overall, the Atosa MSF8307GR combines generous storage capacity, durable construction, and efficient performance, making it an indispensable asset in high-capacity food service operations.</p>', '\n\nOffers 17.2 cubic feet of storage space, accommodating up to 24 food pans for extensive ingredient storage.<br>\n\n60.2\" width provides ample room for food preparation, suitable for high-volume commercial kitchens and busy food service operations.<br>\n\nFeatures a large top area with space for 24 food pans and an integrated cutting board for convenient assembly of sandwiches and salads.<br>\n\nEnsures durability, easy cleaning, and a professional appearance, ideal for demanding kitchen environments.<br>\n\nMaintains consistent temperatures to keep ingredients fresh and ready for use, supporting food safety and quality standards.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MSF8307GR_8aa06e01-da1b-4692-ac98-8ff51d0e5392.webp\"]', 'MSF8307GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 3153, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 60.00, NULL, 47.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 340.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:44', '2024-12-13 14:13:57', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MSF8307GR_8aa06e01-da1b-4692-ac98-8ff51d0e5392.webp', 'physical', '', 2065, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB83\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1776, 'Atosa MSF8306GR 48.2\" Mega Top Sandwich Prep Table, 18 Pans 7.2 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MSF8306GR is a robust 48.2\" Mega Top Sandwich Prep Table designed to cater to the demanding needs of commercial kitchens. Despite its compact footprint, it boasts a spacious top configuration that accommodates up to 18 food pans, making it ideal for establishments requiring efficient organization and quick access to sandwich and salad ingredients. This setup includes an integrated cutting board that spans the length of the unit, providing ample workspace for chefs to assemble dishes directly from the refrigerated compartments.</p>\n<p>Constructed with durable stainless steel, the MSF8306GR ensures longevity, easy cleaning, and a professional appearance suitable for bustling kitchen environments. Internally, it features a reliable refrigeration system that maintains consistent temperatures throughout the unit, preserving the freshness and quality of stored ingredients. This efficient cooling system not only supports food safety standards but also helps reduce waste by keeping perishable items at optimal conditions. Overall, the Atosa MSF8306GR combines practical design with efficient performance, making it an excellent choice for enhancing productivity and organization in busy food service operations.</p>', '\n\n48.2\" width with a mega top design accommodating up to 18 food pans, optimizing ingredient storage and accessibility.<br>\n\nIncludes a full-length cutting board for convenient food preparation directly from refrigerated compartments, enhancing workflow efficiency.<br>\n\nEnsures durability, easy maintenance, and a professional appearance suitable for commercial kitchen environments.<br>\n\nMaintains consistent temperatures to preserve ingredient freshness and quality, supporting food safety standards.<br>\n\nDespite its generous storage capacity, features a space-saving design ideal for kitchens with limited space, maximizing efficiency.\n', 'pending', '[\