(1777, 'Atosa MSF8305GR 27.5\" Mega Top Sandwich Prep Table, 12 Pans 7.2 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MSF8305GR is a compact yet efficient 27.5\" Mega Top Sandwich Prep Table, designed to optimize food preparation in smaller commercial kitchens. Despite its smaller footprint, it offers a generous storage capacity of 7.2 cubic feet and accommodates up to 12 food pans. This makes it ideal for establishments with limited space that still require efficient organization and access to sandwich and salad ingredients.</p>\n<p>Constructed with a durable stainless steel exterior, the MSF8305GR ensures durability, easy maintenance, and a professional appearance. The mega top design includes a spacious cutting board that spans the length of the unit, providing ample workspace for assembling sandwiches and salads directly from the refrigerated compartments. This setup not only enhances workflow efficiency but also helps maintain ingredient freshness with its efficient refrigeration system, ensuring consistent temperatures for optimal food safety and quality. Overall, the Atosa MSF8305GR is a practical choice for smaller kitchens seeking reliable and space-saving sandwich prep solutions.</p>', '\n\n27.5\" width with a space-saving footprint, ideal for smaller commercial kitchens.<br>\n\nIncludes a spacious top area for food pans and an integrated cutting board for efficient food preparation.<br>\n\nAccommodates up to 12 food pans, providing ample storage for sandwich and salad ingredients.<br>\n\nEnsures durability, easy cleaning, and a professional look suitable for busy kitchen environments.<br>\n\nMaintains consistent temperatures to keep ingredients fresh and ready for use, supporting food safety standards.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MSF8305GR_f7e3d787-eb4f-4499-8346-680395a5d269.webp\"]', 'MSF8305GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2036, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 47.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 212.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12