(1778, 'Atosa MSF8304GR 72.7\" Sandwich Prep Table, 18 Pans 21.1 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MSF8304GR is a robust 72.7\" Sandwich Prep Table designed for intensive food preparation in commercial kitchens. With an expansive storage capacity of 21.1 cubic feet, this unit accommodates up to 18 food pans, making it ideal for large-scale food service operations such as bustling restaurants, catering services, and institutional kitchens. The generous 72.7\" width provides ample workspace for organizing ingredients and assembling sandwiches and salads efficiently, helping kitchen staff maintain high productivity levels during peak hours.</p>\n<p>Crafted with a durable stainless steel exterior, the Atosa MSF8304GR ensures resilience against the rigors of daily use while facilitating easy cleaning and maintenance. This sturdy construction not only enhances the table\'s longevity but also contributes to a hygienic kitchen environment. Internally, the sandwich prep table features a dependable refrigeration system that maintains consistent temperatures throughout its compartments, ensuring ingredients remain fresh and at optimal conditions for food preparation. Additionally, the unit includes an integrated cutting board spanning the entire length of the prep area, providing chefs with a convenient workspace to streamline food assembly directly from refrigerated storage. Overall, the Atosa MSF8304GR combines ample storage capacity, durable construction, and efficient cooling capabilities, making it an essential asset for kitchens requiring high-performance food preparation equipment.</p>', '\n\nOffers 21.1 cubic feet of storage space, accommodating up to 18 food pans for extensive ingredient storage.<br>\n\n72.7\" width provides ample room for food preparation, suitable for large-scale commercial kitchens and high-volume operations.<br>\n\nEnsures durability, easy cleaning, and a professional appearance, ideal for busy kitchen environments.<br>\n\nMaintains consistent temperatures to preserve ingredient freshness and quality, supporting food safety standards.<br>\n\nIncludes a full-length cutting board for convenient assembly of sandwiches and salads directly from refrigerated compartments, optimizing workflow efficiency.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MSF8304GR_1179fd8d-449c-4ba9-9c22-3d4b59d5a64b.webp\"]', 'MSF8304GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 3316, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 73.00, NULL, 44.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 379.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:46', '2024-12-13 14:13:58', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MSF8304GR_1179fd8d-449c-4ba9-9c22-3d4b59d5a64b.webp', 'physical', '', 2179, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB86\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1779, 'Atosa MSF8303GR 60.2\" Sandwich Prep Table, 16 Pans 17.2 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MSF8303GR is a spacious and efficient 60.2\" Sandwich Prep Table designed to meet the rigorous demands of commercial kitchens. With a substantial capacity of 17.2 cubic feet, this unit accommodates up to 16 food pans, making it ideal for high-volume food preparation settings such as restaurants, delis, and sandwich shops. The ample storage space and 60.2\" width provide plenty of room for organizing ingredients and assembling sandwiches and salads, helping to streamline kitchen operations and enhance workflow efficiency.</p>\n<p>Constructed with a durable stainless steel exterior, the Atosa MSF8303GR is built to withstand daily use while ensuring easy cleaning and maintenance. This robust construction not only contributes to the table\'s longevity but also maintains a professional appearance in the kitchen. Internally, the sandwich prep table features a reliable refrigeration system that maintains consistent temperatures across its compartments, keeping ingredients fresh and ready for immediate use. The unit includes an integrated cutting board that spans the entire length of the prep area, offering a convenient workspace for chefs to prepare dishes directly from refrigerated storage. Overall, the Atosa MSF8303GR combines generous storage capacity, durable construction, and efficient cooling capabilities, making it an excellent choice for busy food service establishments looking to optimize their food preparation processes.</p>', '\n\nProvides 17.2 cubic feet of storage space, accommodating up to 16 food pans for versatile ingredient storage.<br>\n\n60.2\" width offers ample room for food preparation, suitable for high-volume commercial kitchens.<br>\n\nEnsures durability, easy cleaning, and a professional appearance in busy kitchen environments.<br>\n\nMaintains consistent temperatures to keep ingredients fresh and ready for use, enhancing food safety and quality.<br>\n\nIncludes a full-length cutting board for convenient assembly of sandwiches and salads directly from refrigerated compartments, optimizing workflow efficiency.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MSF8303GR_53dc4df0-d9fa-4817-a4a0-84aebad3d220.webp\"]', 'MSF8303GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2837, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 60.00, NULL, 44.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 320.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:47', '2024-12-13 14:13:58', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MSF8303GR_53dc4df0-d9fa-4817-a4a0-84aebad3d220.webp', 'physical', '', 1840, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB87\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1780, 'Atosa MSF8302GR 48.2\" Sandwich Prep Table, 12 Pans 13.4 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MSF8302GR is a robust 48.2\" Sandwich Prep Table designed to meet the demands of commercial kitchens, offering ample storage and preparation space. With a capacity of 13.4 cubic feet, this unit accommodates up to 12 food pans, providing extensive storage for various ingredients used in sandwich and salad preparation. Its spacious design makes it suitable for medium to large-sized kitchens where efficiency and organization are crucial. The sandwich prep table features a durable stainless steel exterior, ensuring longevity, easy cleaning, and a hygienic workspace essential for food safety compliance.</p>\n<p>Internally, the Atosa MSF8302GR is equipped with a powerful refrigeration system that maintains consistent temperatures across its compartments. This system ensures that ingredients remain fresh and at optimal temperatures, enhancing food quality and reducing waste. The unit includes an integrated cutting board spanning the length of the prep area, facilitating seamless assembly of sandwiches and salads directly from refrigerated storage. Overall, the Atosa MSF8302GR combines robust construction, generous storage capacity, and efficient cooling capabilities, making it an excellent choice for high-volume food preparation environments.</p>', '\n\nOffers 13.4 cubic feet of storage space, accommodating up to 12 food pans for versatile ingredient storage.<br>\n\n48.2\" width provides ample workspace for food preparation, suitable for medium to large commercial kitchens.<br>\n\nEnsures durability, easy cleaning, and a professional appearance in busy kitchen environments.<br>\n\nMaintains consistent temperatures to keep ingredients fresh and ready for use, enhancing food safety and quality.<br>\n\nIncludes a full-length cutting board for convenient assembly of sandwiches and salads directly from refrigerated compartments, optimizing workflow efficiency.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MSF8302GR_598dd5ea-93ce-4976-bcaa-e7cc6608af66.webp\"]', 'MSF8302GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2464, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48.00, NULL, 44.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 276.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:48', '2024-12-13 14:13:58', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MSF8302GR_598dd5ea-93ce-4976-bcaa-e7cc6608af66.webp', 'physical', '', 1613.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB88\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1781, 'Atosa MSF8301GR 27.5\" Sandwich Prep Table, 8 Pans 7.2 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MSF8301GR is a versatile 27.5\" Sandwich Prep Table designed specifically for commercial kitchens, offering a compact yet efficient solution for preparing and storing sandwiches and salads. It comes equipped with space for 8 pans, providing ample capacity within its 7.2 cubic feet of storage space. This setup allows chefs and kitchen staff to organize ingredients conveniently, enhancing workflow efficiency during food preparation. The sandwich prep table is crafted with a durable stainless steel exterior, ensuring durability and easy cleaning, which is essential for maintaining a hygienic kitchen environment.</p>\n<p>Internally, the Atosa MSF8301GR features a robust refrigeration system that maintains a consistent temperature range, keeping ingredients fresh and ready for use. The unit includes a cutting board that spans the length of the prep area, providing a convenient workspace for assembling sandwiches and salads directly from the refrigerated compartments. This setup not only streamlines food preparation processes but also ensures that ingredients remain at optimal temperatures to meet food safety standards. Overall, the Atosa MSF8301GR combines practical design with reliable performance, making it a valuable asset in any busy commercial kitchen where efficiency and food quality are paramount.</p>', '\n\n27.5\" width with 7.2 cubic feet of storage space, ideal for smaller kitchens or limited workspace.<br>\n\nAccommodates up to 8 food pans for organized ingredient storage and easy access during food prepartion.<br>\n\nStainless steel exterior ensures durability, easy cleaning, and a professional appearance.<br>\n\nMaintains consistent temperature to keep ingredients fresh and ready for use.<br>\n\nProvides a convenient workspace for assembling sandwiches and salads directly from refrigerated compartments, enhancing workflow efficiency.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MSF8301GR_57120d70-e8a7-4232-a6e1-846619248f9f.webp\"]', 'MSF8301GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1729, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 44.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 196.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:49', '2024-12-13 14:13:58', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MSF8301GR_57120d70-e8a7-4232-a6e1-846619248f9f.webp', 'physical', '', 1144, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB89\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1782, 'Atosa MGF8406GR 48\" Undercounter Freezer 13.4 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MGF8406GR is a compact yet spacious undercounter freezer designed to optimize storage in commercial kitchens with limited space. With a capacity of 13.4 cubic feet, it offers ample room for storing frozen foods while fitting conveniently under countertops. This model is crafted with stainless steel both inside and out, ensuring durability and ease of cleaning in busy kitchen environments. The unit features a self-closing door with a recessed handle, which helps maintain consistent temperatures by minimizing cold air loss. This design also enhances energy efficiency, which is crucial for reducing operational costs in commercial settings.</p>\n<p>Equipped with a powerful and efficient refrigeration system, the Atosa MGF8406GR maintains temperatures between -10°F to 0°F (-23.3°C to -17.8°C), ideal for preserving a wide range of frozen goods from meats to ice cream. Its digital temperature control and monitoring system provide precise regulation, ensuring food safety and quality. The freezer includes heavy-duty shelves that are adjustable, allowing for customizable storage options to accommodate varying sizes of items. Whether used in restaurants, bars, or other foodservice establishments, the Atosa MGF8406GR combines reliability, functionality, and compact design to meet the demanding needs of commercial refrigeration.</p>', '\n\nThis model provides 13.4 cubic feet of storage space, making it suitable for undercounter installation in kitchens where space is at a premium. It\'s compact yet spacious enough to store a variety of frozen goods efficiently.<br>\n\nConstructed with durable stainless steel both inside and out, the\nAtosa MGF8406GR ensures longevity and easy maintenance. The stainless steel exterior is resistant to corrosion and easy to clean, while the interior maintains a hygienic environment for food storage.<br>\n\nIt features a robust refrigeration system that maintains temperatures between -10°F to 0°F (-23.3°C to -17.8°C), suitable for preserving a wide range of frozen foods at optimal temperatures. The digital temperature control and monitoring system ensure precise temperature management for food safety and quality assurance.<br>\n\nThe unit is designed with a self-closing door equipped with a recessed handle, which helps prevent cold air loss and improves energy efficiency. Adjustable heavy-duty shelves inside offer flexibility in organizing and storing items of various sizes, enhancing convenience and usability in busy kitchen environments.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MGF8406GR_5a8eeac6-c975-430c-bb7a-55f6640c3e21.webp\"]', 'MGF8406GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2520, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 245.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:51', '2024-12-13 14:13:58', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MGF8406GR_5a8eeac6-c975-430c-bb7a-55f6640c3e21.webp', 'physical', '', 1642.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB90\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1783, 'Atosa MGF8402GR  48.25\" Undercounter Refrigerator 13.4 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MGF8402GR 48.25\" Undercounter Refrigerator is designed to offer efficient refrigeration in a compact footprint, making it ideal for smaller commercial kitchens or spaces where maximizing floor space is essential. With a storage capacity of 13.4 cubic feet, this refrigerator provides sufficient room for storing perishable items while fitting neatly under countertops for easy access. Its exterior and interior are constructed from durable stainless steel, ensuring longevity, ease of cleaning, and a professional look that complements any kitchen environment.</p>\n<p>Equipped with a high-efficiency Embraco compressor, the MGF8402GR delivers reliable cooling performance while minimizing energy consumption, helping to reduce operational costs. The refrigerator features an electronic thermostat with a digital LED display, enabling precise temperature control and straightforward monitoring of internal conditions. Self-closing doors with a stay-open feature enhance convenience during busy periods, and pre-installed casters facilitate mobility for effortless cleaning and maintenance tasks. Overall, the Atosa MGF8402GR combines compact design with robust performance, making it a practical choice for small-scale commercial refrigeration needs.</p>', '\n\nThe refrigerator has a compact footprint of 48.25\" wide, making it suitable for small commercial kitchens or areas where space is limited.<br>\n\nBoth the exterior and interior are constructed with stainless steel, ensuring durability, easy cleaning, and a professional appearance.<br>\n\nEquipped with a high-efficiency Embrace compressor, the unit provides reliable cooling performance while minimizing energy consumption.<br>\n\nFeatures an electronic thermostat with a digital LED display for precise temperature management and easy monitoring of internal conditions.<br>\n\nIncludes self-closing doors with a stay-open feature for convenient loading and unloading, as well as pre-installed casters for mobility and easy maneuverability during cleaning and maintenance tasks.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MGF8402GR_3730fd6a-d430-487a-8081-d8eb0cc925bc.webp\"]', 'MGF8402GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2200, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 231.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:52', '2024-12-13 14:13:58', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MGF8402GR_3730fd6a-d430-487a-8081-d8eb0cc925bc.webp', 'physical', '', 1415.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB91\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '');
