(1784, 'Atosa MGF8403GR 60.25\" Undercounter Refrigerator 17.2 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MGF8403GR 60.25\" Undercounter Refrigerator is a versatile and efficient refrigeration solution designed for commercial kitchens. With a storage capacity of 17.2 cubic feet, this undercounter refrigerator provides ample space for storing a variety of perishable items, all while fitting comfortably under countertops to maximize kitchen workspace. Its sleek stainless steel exterior and interior not only enhance its durability but also make it easy to clean and maintain, ensuring a professional and hygienic environment. The unit features a high-efficiency Embraco compressor that delivers consistent cooling performance, helping to keep food items at the optimal temperature.</p>\n<p>This refrigerator is designed with convenience and ease of use in mind. It includes an electronic thermostat with a digital LED display, allowing for precise temperature control and easy monitoring. The self-closing doors are equipped with a stay-open feature, making it convenient to load and unload items. Additionally, the Atosa MGF8403GR comes with pre-installed casters, which facilitate easy movement for cleaning and maintenance. Overall, this undercounter refrigerator combines robust construction, energy-efficient operation, and user-friendly features, making it an excellent choice for any commercial kitchen.</p>', '\n\nThe Atosa MGF8403GR offers 17.2 cubic feet of storage space, suitable for storing a variety of perishable goods while maintaining a compact undercounter design.<br>\n\nBuilt with a stainless steel exterior and interior, this refrigerator ensures durability, easy cleaning, and a professional appearance suitable for commercial environments.<br>\n\nEquipped with a high-efficiency Embrac compressor, the unit delivers reliable cooling performance while minimizing energy consumption, contributing to cost savings.<br>\n\nFeatures an electronic thermostat with a digital LED display for precise temperature adjustments and easy monitoring to maintain optimal storage conditions.<br>\n\nIncludes self-closing doors with a stay-open feature for effortless loading and unloading, as well as pre-installed casters for mobility and easy access during cleaning and maintenance tasks.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MGF8403GR_c2f3c8c6-0bf4-4a99-b356-5574e9e73b3d.webp\"]', 'MGF8403GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2589, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 60.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 264.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:52', '2024-12-13 14:13:58', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MGF8403GR_c2f3c8c6-0bf4-4a99-b356-5574e9e73b3d.webp', 'physical', '', 1698, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB92\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1785, 'Atosa MGF8404GR 72.69\" Undercounter Refrigerator 21.1 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MGF8404GR 72.69\" Undercounter Refrigerator is designed to offer efficient and reliable refrigeration solutions for commercial kitchens. With a storage capacity of 21.1 cubic feet, this undercounter refrigerator provides ample space for storing perishable goods while maintaining a low profile that fits seamlessly under counters, optimizing kitchen workspace. Its stainless steel exterior and interior ensure durability, ease of cleaning, and a sleek, professional appearance that complements any kitchen décor. The unit is equipped with a high-efficiency Embraco compressor, which ensures consistent cooling performance and energy efficiency.</p>\n<p>This refrigerator features user-friendly controls, including an electronic thermostat with a digital LED display, allowing for precise temperature adjustments and easy monitoring. The self-closing doors are designed with a stay-open feature to facilitate convenient loading and unloading of items. Additionally, the Atosa MGF8404GR includes pre-installed casters, making it easy to move for cleaning and maintenance purposes. With its robust construction, energy-efficient operation, and convenient features, the Atosa MGF8404GR is an excellent choice for commercial establishments seeking a reliable and efficient refrigeration solution.</p>', '\n\nThe Atosa MGF8404GR provides 21.1 cubic feet of storage space, ideal for holding a wide range of perishable items while fitting conveniently under counters.<br>\n\nFeaturing a stainless steel exterior and interior, this refrigerator ensures durability, ease of cleaning, and a professional look for commercial kitchens.<br>\n\nThe unit is equipped with a high-efficiency Embrac compressor, delivering reliable and consistent cooling performance with reduced energy consumption.<br>\n\nThe electronic thermostat with a digital LED display allows for precise temperature control and easy monitoring, ensuring optimal storage conditions.<br>\n\nIncludes self-closing doors with a stay-open feature for ease of use, as well as pre-installed casters for easy mobility and maintenance.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MGF8404GR_ff34bc09-ca59-4d7d-90f0-c2276eaf3163.webp\"]', 'MGF8404GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2835, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 73.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 315.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:53', '2024-12-13 14:13:58', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MGF8404GR_ff34bc09-ca59-4d7d-90f0-c2276eaf3163.webp', 'physical', '', 1840, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB93\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1786, 'Atosa MGF8405GR 72.69\" Undercounter Freezer 21.1 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MGF8405GR 72.69\" Undercounter Freezer is a high-capacity commercial unit designed to provide reliable and efficient freezing solutions for various foodservice operations. With a total storage capacity of 21.1 cubic feet, this undercounter freezer offers ample space to store a variety of frozen goods while maintaining a compact footprint that fits seamlessly into tight kitchen spaces. The unit features a stainless steel exterior and interior, ensuring durability, ease of cleaning, and a professional appearance. It also comes equipped with an environmentally friendly R290 hydrocarbon refrigerant, which helps reduce energy consumption and minimizes environmental impact.</p>\n<p>The MGF8405GR includes user-friendly features such as an electronic thermostat with a digital LED display, allowing for precise temperature control and easy monitoring. The self-closing doors are designed with a stay-open feature to facilitate convenient loading and unloading, while the heavy-duty Embraco compressor ensures reliable and efficient performance. The freezer also comes with pre-installed casters, making it easy to move for cleaning and maintenance. Overall, the Atosa MGF8405GR is an excellent choice for commercial kitchens that require a robust and efficient undercounter freezing solution.</p>', '\n\nThe Atosa MGF8405GR offers 21.1 cubic feet of storage space, providing ample room to store a variety of frozen goods while maintaining a compact design that fits under counters.<br>\n\nBoth the interior and exterior are made of stainless steel, ensuring durability, ease of cleaning, and a sleek, professional look suitable for commercial kitchens.<br>\n\nThe freezer uses R290 hydrocarbon refrigerant, which is environmentally friendly and helps reduce energy consumption, contributing to lower operating costs.<br>\n\nEquipped with an electronic thermostat and a digital LED display, this unit allows for precise temperature control and easy monitoring to ensure optimal freezing conditions.<br>\n\nThe freezer includes self-closing doors with a stay-open feature for easy access, heavy-duty Embraco compressor for reliable performance, and pre-installed casters for easy mobility and maintenance.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MGF8405GR_963fb2bf-4262-4065-90b0-c428c765d385.webp\"]', 'MGF8405GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1743, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 179.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:54', '2024-12-13 14:13:59', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MGF8405GR_963fb2bf-4262-4065-90b0-c428c765d385.webp', 'physical', '', 1132.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB94\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1787, 'Atosa MGF8401GR 27\" Undercounter Refrigerator 7.2  Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MGF8401GR 27\" Undercounter Refrigerator is a compact and efficient refrigeration solution ideal for various commercial settings. With a capacity of 7.2 cubic feet, it offers ample storage space while fitting neatly under countertops, making it perfect for kitchens with limited space. The single-door design allows for easy access and organization of refrigerated items, and its stainless steel construction ensures durability and ease of cleaning, which is essential in high-demand environments.</p>\n<p>Key features of the Atosa MGF8401GR include a digital temperature control system, which provides precise temperature management, ensuring optimal storage conditions for perishable items. The refrigerator also features a self-closing door with a stay-open mechanism, enhancing convenience during busy service periods. Additionally, it uses environmentally friendly R290 refrigerant, promoting sustainability and reducing its environmental impact. The heavy-duty, adjustable shelves inside the unit allow for flexible storage configurations, accommodating a variety of items and maximizing the available space.</p>', '\n\nWith a 27\" width, it fits conveniently under countertops, saving valuable space in busy kitchens.<br>\n\nProvides ample storage space for a variety of perishable items, ideal for smaller commercial settings.<br>\n\nBoth the interior and exterior are made of durable stainless steel, ensuring long-lasting use and easy cleaning.<br>\n\nAllows for precise temperature management, ensuring optimal storage conditions for perishable goods.<br>\n\nEnhances convenience by automatically closing but can remain open when needed during busy periods.<br>\n\nUses R290 refrigerant, which is more sustainable and has a lower environmental impact.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MGF8401GR_ed470f0c-39e7-40fd-beac-1e32a9003dc9.webp\"]', 'MGF8401GR', 0, NULL, 