(1788, 'Atosa MBF8504GR 82\" Reach-In Bottom Mount Freezer, 3 Three Door, 68 Cu.Ft', '\n<p>The Atosa MBF8504GR is a commercial-grade bottom mount freezer designed for efficiency and durability. With its substantial 68 cubic feet capacity, it provides ample storage space for various frozen goods, making it ideal for busy commercial kitchens, restaurants, and foodservice operations. The three-door configuration allows for organized storage and easy access, minimizing the time the doors are open and helping to maintain consistent internal temperatures. The bottom mount design places the compressor at the base of the unit, which not only helps in maintaining a stable temperature but also makes it easier to access for maintenance.</p>\n<p>This freezer features stainless steel construction both inside and out, ensuring it is not only robust but also easy to clean and maintain. The doors are self-closing with a stay-open feature, which is highly convenient during busy service times. The unit is equipped with efficient LED lighting, providing clear visibility of the contents. The digital temperature control system ensures precise temperature management, which is crucial for food safety. Additionally, the Atosa MBF8504GR utilizes environmentally friendly R290 refrigerant, making it a more sustainable choice.</p>', '\n\nWith a 68 cubic feet storage capacity, it provides ample space for a variety of frozen goods.<br>\n\nAllows for organized storage and easy access, reducing the time the doors are open and helping maintain consistent internal temperatures.<br>\n\nThe compressor is located at the base of the unit, offering stable temperature maintenance and easier access for maintenance.<br>\n\nBoth the interior and exterior are made of durable stainless steel, ensuring longevity and easy cleaning.<br>\n\nDoors close automatically but can stay open at an angle, which is convenient during busy service times.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MBF8504GR_5d99507a-00ad-464b-a9cf-1b4bf8532269.webp\"]', 'MBF8504GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 6002, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 82.00, NULL, 83.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 638.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:56', '2024-12-13 14:13:59', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MBF8504GR_5d99507a-00ad-464b-a9cf-1b4bf8532269.webp', 'physical', '', 3875.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB96\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1789, 'Atosa MBF8503GR 55\" Reach-In Bottom Mount Freezer, 2 Two Door, 44.8 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MBF8503GR is a versatile and spacious bottom-mount freezer designed for commercial use, offering ample freezing capacity and reliable performance. With a width of 54.4 inches, this freezer provides a generous 43.8 cubic feet of storage space, making it suitable for medium to large-scale foodservice operations such as restaurants, cafes, and institutional kitchens. The two-door configuration allows for organized storage and easy access to a variety of frozen items, with each door crafted from durable stainless steel to withstand the rigors of daily use while maintaining a professional appearance.</p>\n<p>This freezer is designed with convenience and efficiency in mind. The bottom-mount configuration places the compressor unit near the floor, optimizing interior space and making it easier to access stored items at eye level without the need for excessive bending. Digital temperature controls enable precise monitoring and adjustment of internal temperatures, ensuring consistent and safe freezing conditions for stored goods. Energy-efficient LED lighting illuminates the interior, enhancing visibility while reducing overall energy consumption. Adjustable shelves inside the freezer provide flexibility in organizing different types of frozen foods, accommodating varying storage needs effectively. Overall, the Atosa MBF8503GR combines durability, functionality, and energy efficiency, making it a dependable choice for commercial kitchens seeking high-capacity freezing solutions.</p>', '\n\nProvides 43.8 cubic feet of freezing storage space, suitable for medium to large-scale commercial kitchens.<br>\n\nBuilt with heavy-duty stainless steel for durability and a professional appearance.<br>\n\nFeatures two doors for organized storage and easy access to a variety of frozen items.<br>\n\nOptimizes interior space and accessibility, making it easier to reach stored items at eye level and facilitating maintenance.<br>\n\nEquipped with digital temperature controls for precise monitoring and regulation of internal temperatures, ensuring consistent and safe freezing conditions.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MBF8503GR_ced76e4e-d9bb-4df2-8473-2322f183d627.webp\"]', 'MBF8503GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 4164, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 54.00, NULL, 83.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 465.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:57', '2024-12-13 14:13:59', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MBF8503GR_ced76e4e-d9bb-4df2-8473-2322f183d627.webp', 'physical', '', 2717, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB97\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1790, 'Atosa MBF8501GR 27\" Reach-In Bottom Mount Freezer, 1 One Door, 19 Cu.Ft', '\n<p>The Atosa MBF8501GR is a compact and efficient bottom-mount freezer designed to meet the needs of smaller commercial kitchens. With a width of 27 inches, this freezer offers a practical 19.1 cubic feet of freezing storage space, making it ideal for cafes, delis, and smaller restaurants where space efficiency is crucial. The single-door design provides easy access to frozen items, with the door constructed from durable stainless steel to ensure longevity and maintain a professional appearance in any kitchen setting.</p>\n<p>This freezer\'s bottom-mount configuration places the compressor unit near the floor, which optimizes the use of space within the unit and makes it easier to access items stored at eye level without the need for excessive bending. The Atosa MBF8501GR is equipped with digital temperature controls, allowing precise monitoring and adjustment of internal temperatures to maintain consistent freezing performance and ensure food safety. Inside, energy-efficient LED lighting enhances visibility while minimizing energy consumption. Adjustable shelves offer flexibility in organizing various types of frozen foods, accommodating different packaging sizes and storage needs effectively. Overall, the Atosa MBF8501GR combines compact design, durability, and efficient operation, making it a practical choice for smaller commercial kitchens looking to maximize space without compromising on freezing capabilities.</p>', '\n\nCompact and efficient bottom-mount freezer ideal for smaller commercial kitchens\n27-inch width with 19.1 cubic feet of freezing storage space\nDurable stainless steel single-door design for longevity and professional appearance\nBottom-mount configuration optimizes space, places compressor near floor for easy access\nFeatures digital temperature controls, LED lighting, and adjustable shelves for efficient organization\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MBF8501GR_7118fbfc-af22-4eb2-b704-1aa17c6e1cf0.webp\"]', 'MBF8501GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2826, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 27.00, NULL, 83.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 298.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:58', '2024-12-13 14:13:59', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MBF8501GR_7118fbfc-af22-4eb2-b704-1aa17c6e1cf0.webp', 'physical', '', 1812, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB98\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1791, 'Atosa MBF8003GR 78\" Reach-In Top Mount Freezer, 3 Three Door, 69.2 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MBF8003GR is a robust top-mount freezer designed to provide extensive freezing capabilities for commercial kitchens. With a width of 77.8 inches, this freezer offers a spacious 64.9 cubic feet of storage capacity, making it suitable for large-scale foodservice operations such as restaurants, hotels, and institutional settings. The three-door configuration allows for organized storage and easy access to a wide variety of frozen items, with each door crafted from durable stainless steel to withstand the demands of busy kitchen environments while maintaining a professional appearance.</p>\n<p>This freezer is equipped with a top-mount refrigeration system, which optimizes interior space by placing the compressor unit above the storage area. This design not only maximizes usable storage space but also facilitates easier maintenance and cleaning. The Atosa MBF8003GR features digital temperature controls, enabling precise monitoring and adjustment of internal temperatures to ensure consistent freezing conditions for stored goods. Interior LED lighting enhances visibility while operating efficiently, contributing to reduced energy consumption. Adjustable shelves inside the freezer provide flexibility in organizing different types of frozen foods, accommodating varying storage needs effectively. Overall, the Atosa MBF8003GR combines durability, functionality, and energy efficiency, making it a reliable choice for commercial kitchens seeking high-capacity freezing solutions.</p>', '\n\nProvides a generous 64.9 cubic feet of freezing storage space, suitable for large-scale commercial kitchens.<br>\n\nBuilt with heavy-duty stainless steel for durability and a professional appearance.<br>\n\nFeatures three doors for organized storage and easy access to a variety of frozen items.<br>\n\nOptimizes interior space and facilitates easier maintenance and cleaning.<br>\n\nEquipped with digital temperature controls for precise monitoring and regulation of internal temperatures, ensuring consistent and safe freezing conditions.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MBF8003GR_a8ef37b1-9983-48da-ba51-80e1f219775c.webp\"]', 'MBF8003GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 5661, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 78.00, NULL, 83.00, NULL, 33.00, NULL, 569.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:34:59', '2024-12-13 14:13:59', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MBF8003GR_a8ef37b1-9983-48da-ba51-80e1f219775c.webp', 'physical', '', 3678, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB99\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1792, 'Atosa MBF8505GR 27\" Reach-In Bottom Mount Refrigerator, 1 One Door, 19 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MBF8505GR is a compact yet efficient bottom-mount refrigerator designed to cater to the needs of smaller commercial kitchens and establishments. With a width of 27 inches, this refrigerator offers a practical 19.1 cubic feet of storage capacity, making it suitable for cafes, delis, and smaller restaurants where space efficiency is crucial. The single-door design provides easy access to stored items, with the door made from durable stainless steel to ensure longevity and a professional appearance in any kitchen setting.</p>\n<p>This refrigerator\'s bottom-mount configuration places the compressor unit near the floor, optimizing the use of space within the unit and making it easier to access items stored at eye level. The Atosa MBF8505GR is equipped with digital temperature controls, allowing precise monitoring and adjustment of internal temperatures to maintain consistent cooling performance and ensure food safety. Inside, energy-efficient LED lighting enhances visibility while minimizing energy consumption. Adjustable shelves provide flexibility in organizing various types of food products, accommodating different storage needs effectively. Overall, the Atosa MBF8505GR combines compact design, durability, and efficient operation, making it a practical choice for smaller commercial kitchens looking to maximize space without compromising on refrigeration capabilities.</p>', '\n\nProvides 19.1 cubic feet of refrigerated storage space, ideal for smaller commercial kitchens and establishments.<br>\n\nBuilt with heavy-duty stainless steel for durability and a professional appearance.<br>\n\nFeatures a single door for easy access to stored items, constructed from stainless steel to withstand daily use.<br>\n\nOptimizes interior space and accessibility, making it easier to reach stored items at eye level and facilitating maintenance.<br>\n\nEquipped with digital temperature controls for precise monitoring and regulation of internal temperatures, ensuring consistent refrigeration conditions.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MBF8505GR_ab5ac085-4fef-4a6d-9dd2-366f188c8db7.webp\"]', 'MBF8505GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2332, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 27.00, NULL, 83.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 282.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:01', '2024-12-13 14:13:59', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MBF8505GR_ab5ac085-4fef-4a6d-9dd2-366f188c8db7.webp', 'physical', '', 1529, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB100\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1793, 'Atosa MBF8507GR 55\" Reach-In Bottom Mount Refrigerator, 2 Two Door, 46.8 Cu.Ft', '\n<p>The Atosa MBF8507GR is a versatile and efficient bottom-mount refrigerator designed for commercial use, offering ample storage capacity and reliable performance. With a width of 54.4 inches, this refrigerator provides 43.8 cubic feet of storage space, making it suitable for medium to large-scale foodservice operations such as restaurants, cafes, and catering businesses. The two-door configuration allows for organized storage and easy access to a variety of perishable items, with each door crafted from durable stainless steel to withstand daily use and maintain a sleek, professional appearance.</p>\n<p>This refrigerator features a bottom-mount design, placing the compressor unit near the floor for several benefits. It maximizes the usable storage space within the refrigerator, making it easier to reach items stored at eye level without bending down. Additionally, this design makes maintenance and servicing more convenient. The Atosa MBF8507GR is equipped with digital temperature controls, enabling precise monitoring and adjustment of internal temperatures to ensure consistent cooling performance and food safety. Interior LED lighting enhances visibility while operating efficiently, contributing to reduced energy consumption. Adjustable shelves inside the refrigerator offer flexibility in organizing various types of food products, accommodating diverse storage needs effectively. Overall, the Atosa MBF8507GR combines durability, functionality, and energy efficiency, making it a reliable choice for commercial kitchens seeking high-quality refrigeration solutions.</p>', '\n\nProvides 43.8 cubic feet of refrigerated storage space, suitable for medium to large-scale foodservice operations.<br>\n\nBuilt with heavy-duty stainless steel for durability and a professional appearance.<br>\n\nFeatures two doors for organized storage and easy access to a variety of perishable items.<br>\n\nOptimizes interior space and accessibility, making it easier to reach stored items at eye level and facilitating maintenance.<br>\n\nEquipped with digital temperature controls for precise monitoring and regulation of internal temperatures, ensuring consistent refrigeration conditions.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MBF8507GR_1e518e7f-6e87-49b9-a39f-365ecd1003d1.webp\"]', 'MBF8507GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 3249, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 54.00, NULL, 83.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 452.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:01', '2024-12-13 14:13:59', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MBF8507GR_1e518e7f-6e87-49b9-a39f-365ecd1003d1.webp', 'physical', '', 2162.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB101\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1794, 'Atosa MBF8508GR 82\" Reach-In Bottom Mount Refrigerator, 3 Three Door, 67 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MBF8508GR is a spacious and efficient commercial-grade bottom-mount refrigerator designed to meet the needs of large foodservice establishments. With an impressive width of 81.9 inches, this refrigerator offers a substantial 68 cubic feet of storage capacity, making it ideal for busy restaurants, hotels, and institutional kitchens that require extensive refrigerated storage space. The three-door configuration allows for organized storage and easy access to a wide variety of perishable items, with each door constructed from durable stainless steel to withstand frequent use and maintain a professional appearance.</p>\n<p>Equipped with advanced features, the Atosa MBF8508GR ensures optimal performance and efficiency. The bottom-mount design places the compressor unit near the floor, which not only maximizes the refrigerator\'s interior space but also makes it easier to access and service. Digital temperature controls provide precise monitoring and adjustment of internal temperatures, maintaining consistent refrigeration conditions for food safety and quality. LED interior lighting enhances visibility while operating efficiently to reduce energy consumption. Adjustable shelves inside the refrigerator offer flexibility in organizing different types of food products, accommodating various storage needs effectively. Overall, the Atosa MBF8508GR combines durability, functionality, and energy efficiency, making it a reliable choice for demanding commercial kitchen environments.</p>', '\n\nOffers a generous 68 cubic feet of refrigerated storage space, suitable for large foodservice establishments.<br>\n\nBuilt with heavy-duty stainless steel for durability and a professional appearance.<br>\n\nFeatures three doors for organized storage and easy access to a wide variety of perishable items.<br>\n\nOptimizes interior space and accessibility while facilitating easier maintenance and servicing.<br>\n\nEquipped with digital temperature controls for precise monitoring and regulation of internal temperatures, ensuring consistent refrigeration conditions.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MBF8508GR_26037ee1-3598-49ac-8a52-40ff9cb077c5.webp\"]', 'MBF8508GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 5087, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 82.00, NULL, 83.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 615.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:02', '2024-12-13 14:13:59', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MBF8508GR_26037ee1-3598-49ac-8a52-40ff9cb077c5.webp', 'physical', '', 3367, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB102\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1795, 'Atosa MBF8002GR 52\" Reach-In Top Mount Freezer 2 Two Door, 43.2 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MBF8002GR is a robust upright freezer designed for commercial use, offering ample storage capacity and reliable performance. With a width of 51.7 inches, this freezer provides a spacious 43.2 cubic feet of storage space, making it suitable for large-scale foodservice operations such as restaurants, cafeterias, and hotels. The two-door configuration allows for efficient organization and access to frozen goods, with each door constructed from durable stainless steel to withstand the rigors of daily use in busy kitchens. The top-mount design positions the refrigeration system above the storage area, optimizing interior space and facilitating easier maintenance and cleaning.</p>\n<p>Advanced temperature management is a key feature of the Atosa MBF8002GR, ensuring precise control over freezing conditions. Digital temperature controls enable operators to monitor and adjust internal temperatures according to specific storage requirements, maintaining consistent and safe freezing temperatures for stored items. The interior is illuminated with energy-efficient LED lighting, enhancing visibility and making it easy to locate items quickly without compromising energy efficiency. Adjustable shelves inside the freezer provide flexibility in organizing various types of frozen foods, accommodating different packaging sizes and storage needs effectively. Overall, the Atosa MBF8002GR combines durability, functionality, and efficiency, making it a dependable choice for commercial kitchens seeking high-capacity freezing solutions.</p>', '\n\nProvides a spacious 43.2 cubic feet of freezing storage space, ideal for large-scale foodservice operations.<br>\n\nBuilt with heavy-duty stainless steel for both exterior and interior, ensuring durability and a professional appearance.<br>\n\nFeatures two doors for efficient organization and access to frozen items, enhancing operational efficiency in busy kitchens.<br>\n\nOptimizes interior space and facilitates easier maintenance and cleaning.<br>\n\nEquipped with digital temperature controls for precise monitoring and regulation of freezing conditions, ensuring consistent and safe storage of frozen goods.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MBF8002GR_f7d71e99-b973-4e05-a6bc-77beb766c7f5.webp\"]', 'MBF8002GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 4044, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 52.00, NULL, 81.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 403.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:03', '2024-12-13 14:13:59', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MBF8002GR_f7d71e99-b973-4e05-a6bc-77beb766c7f5.webp', 'physical', '', 2603, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB103\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1796, 'Atosa MBF8007GR 29\" Reach-In Top Mount Freezer, Half Door, 21.4 Cu.Ft', '\n<p>The Atosa MBF8007GR is a versatile and efficient commercial-grade top-mount freezer designed to meet the rigorous demands of professional kitchens. With a width of 28.75 inches, it offers a substantial 21.4 cubic feet of freezing capacity, making it suitable for restaurants, hotels, and other foodservice establishments that require reliable frozen storage. The half-door design is a standout feature, allowing for convenient access to frequently used items while minimizing temperature loss and optimizing energy efficiency. Built with durable stainless steel, both the exterior and interior ensure longevity and maintain a clean, polished appearance suitable for any professional kitchen environment.</p>\n<p>This freezer is equipped with advanced features to enhance functionality and ease of use. Digital temperature controls enable precise monitoring and adjustment of internal temperatures, ensuring consistent and optimal freezing conditions for stored goods. The interior is illuminated with energy-efficient LED lighting, which not only enhances visibility but also reduces energy consumption compared to traditional lighting options. Adjustable shelves offer flexibility in organizing various types of frozen foods, accommodating different storage needs effectively. The Atosa MBF8007GR combines durability, efficiency, and innovative design to provide a reliable freezing solution for commercial kitchens seeking high-performance equipment.</p>', '\n\nOffers 21.4 cubic feet of freezing storage space, suitable for commercial kitchens requiring ample frozen food storage.<br>\n\nFeatures a unique half-door design for convenient access to frequently used items while minimizing cold air loss, enhancing energy efficiency.<br>\n\nConstructed with heavy-duty stainless steel for both exterior and interior, ensuring durability and a professional appearance.<br>\n\nEquipped with digital temperature controls for precise monitoring and regulation, maintaining consistent and optimal freezing conditions.<br>\n\nIncludes LED interior lighting that enhances visibility and operates efficiently, reducing overall energy consumption.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MBF8007GR_c7755ade-a66b-416f-8f35-77a633bb5277.webp\"]', 'MBF8007GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2844, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 81.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 269.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:04', '2024-12-13 14:14:00', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MBF8007GR_c7755ade-a66b-416f-8f35-77a633bb5277.webp', 'physical', '', 1840, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB104\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1797, 'Atosa MBF8001GR 29\" Reach-In Top Mount Freezer, 1 Door, 21.4 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MBF8001GR is a commercial-grade upright freezer designed for efficient and reliable food storage. Standing at 28.7 inches wide, this freezer offers a substantial storage capacity of 21.4 cubic feet, making it suitable for restaurants, cafeterias, and other foodservice establishments. Its top-mount design ensures that the compressor and other critical components are positioned away from the food storage area, enhancing efficiency and ease of maintenance. The single door is constructed with heavy-duty stainless steel, providing durability and a sleek, professional appearance that fits seamlessly into any commercial kitchen environment.</p>\n<p>This freezer features advanced refrigeration technology to maintain consistent and optimal temperatures, ensuring food safety and quality. The interior is illuminated with LED lighting, which not only enhances visibility but also operates more efficiently than traditional lighting. Adjustable shelves allow for flexible storage configurations to accommodate various types of food items. Additionally, the freezer is equipped with digital temperature controls, allowing precise monitoring and adjustments to meet specific storage needs. The Atosa MBF8001GR combines functionality, durability, and energy efficiency, making it an excellent choice for demanding commercial kitchen settings.</p>', '\n\nOffers a substantial 21.4 cubic feet of storage capacity, ideal for commercial kitchens requiring ample space for frozen goods.<br>\n\nFeatures a heavy-duty stainless steel exterior and interior, ensuring long-lasting durability and a sleek, professional appearance.<br>\n\nEquipped with digital temperature controls for precise monitoring and adjustments, ensuring consistent and optimal freezing conditions.<br>\n\nIncludes LED interior lighting that enhances visibility and operates more efficiently than traditional lighting options.<br>\n\nProvides adjustable shelves for flexible storage configurations, accommodating a variety of food items and packaging sizes.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MBF8001GR_7d7b18fe-0f90-4061-9994-e9822e9c6824.webp\"]', 'MBF8001GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2644, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 81.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 269.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:05', '2024-12-13 14:14:00', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MBF8001GR_7d7b18fe-0f90-4061-9994-e9822e9c6824.webp', 'physical', '', 1698, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB105\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1798, 'Atosa MBF8006GR 78\" Reach-In Top Mount Refrigerator, 3 Three Door, 69.2 Cu.Ft', 'riptions\n<p>The Atosa MBF8006GR is a high-capacity commercial refrigerator designed to meet the demanding needs of large-scale foodservice operations. Measuring 77.8 inches in width, this refrigerator provides an impressive 64.9 cubic feet of storage space, making it ideal for restaurants, cafeterias, and other commercial kitchens that require substantial refrigerated storage. The three-door design allows for easy access and organization of a wide variety of perishable items, with each door constructed from heavy-duty stainless steel for enhanced durability and a polished, professional look. The top-mount configuration places the refrigeration system above the storage compartment, optimizing the interior space and facilitating easier maintenance.</p>\n<p>This refrigerator is equipped with advanced features to ensure optimal performance and energy efficiency. Digital temperature controls allow precise regulation of internal temperatures, ensuring food safety and freshness. The interior is brightly illuminated with energy-efficient LED lighting, improving visibility and making it easier to locate items quickly. Adjustable shelving provides flexibility in organizing different types of food products, catering to various storage needs. With its robust construction, ample storage capacity, and sophisticated temperature management system, the Atosa MBF8006GR stands out as a reliable and efficient choice for busy commercial kitchens.</p>', '\n\nOffers a vast 64.9 cubic feet of refrigerated storage space, suitable for large-scale commercial kitchens.<br>\n\nFeatures three heavy-duty stainless steel doors for easy access, organization, and enhanced durability.<br>\n\nEquipped with digital temperature controls for precise monitoring and regulation, ensuring consistent refrigeration conditions.<br>\n\nIncludes LED interior lighting that enhances visibility and operates efficiently, reducing energy consumption.<br>\n\nProvides adjustable shelves for flexible storage configurations, accommodating a variety of food items and packaging sizes.\n\n<h2>Desc</h2>', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MBF8006GR_0e343392-7eb3-4047-88cf-cac59490cae9.webp\"]', 'MBF8006GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 4836, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 78.00, NULL, 81.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 551.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:06', '2024-12-13 14:14:00', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MBF8006GR_0e343392-7eb3-4047-88cf-cac59490cae9.webp', 'physical', '', 3196.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB106\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
