(1800, 'Atosa MBF8010GR 29\" Reach-In Top Mount Refrigerator, Half Door, 21.4 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MBF8010GR is a versatile and compact commercial refrigerator designed to provide reliable cooling solutions for smaller foodservice operations. Measuring 28-3/4 inches in width, this refrigerator offers a practical storage capacity of 21.4 cubic feet, making it an excellent choice for cafes, small restaurants, and catering services that need efficient refrigeration without occupying too much space. The half-door design adds a unique feature, allowing for easier access to frequently used items while minimizing the loss of cold air, which enhances energy efficiency. Constructed from heavy-duty stainless steel, both the exterior and interior boast durability and a polished, professional appearance that fits seamlessly into any kitchen environment.</p>\n<p>Equipped with advanced features, the Atosa MBF8010GR ensures optimal performance and energy efficiency. Digital temperature controls provide precise regulation of the internal environment, maintaining consistent and safe refrigeration conditions. The interior is brightly lit with energy-efficient LED lighting, which not only enhances visibility but also contributes to lower energy consumption. The adjustable shelving allows for flexible storage configurations, accommodating a variety of food items and packaging sizes. With its compact design, robust construction, and sophisticated temperature management, the Atosa MBF8010GR is a reliable and efficient choice for small to medium commercial kitchens seeking quality refrigeration solutions.</p>', '\n\nProvides 21.4 cubic feet of refrigerated storage space, ideal for smaller commercial kitchens, cafes, and catering services.<br>\n\nFeatures a half-door design for easier access to frequently used items while minimizing cold air loss and enhancing energy efficiency.<br>\n\nMade with heavy-duty stainless steel for both the exterior and interior, ensuring longevity and a polished, professional appearance.<br>\n\nEquipped with digital temperature controls for precise monitoring and regulation, maintaining consistent and safe refrigeration conditions.<br>\n\nIncludes LED interior lighting that improves visibility and operates efficiently, reducing energy consumption.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MBF8010GR_aba9b52d-654b-42d2-b141-9f658955d2d2.webp\"]', 'MBF8010GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2410, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 81.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 286.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:08', '2024-12-13 14:14:00', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MBF8010GR_aba9b52d-654b-42d2-b141-9f658955d2d2.webp', 'physical', '', 1586, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB108\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1801, 'Atosa MBF8004GR 29\" Reach-In Top Mount Refrigerator, 1 One Door, 22 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MBF8004GR is a commercial-grade upright refrigerator designed to deliver reliable and efficient refrigeration for foodservice establishments. Measuring 28.7 inches in width, this refrigerator provides a generous 22 cubic feet of storage capacity, making it ideal for small to medium-sized kitchens in restaurants, cafes, and catering businesses. The single-door design offers easy access to the interior, with the door constructed from heavy-duty stainless steel for enhanced durability and a sleek, professional look. The top-mount design places the refrigeration system above the storage compartment, optimizing interior space and facilitating easier maintenance.</p>\n<p>This refrigerator features advanced temperature control systems to ensure optimal performance and food safety. Digital temperature controls allow precise regulation of the internal environment, maintaining consistent and safe refrigeration conditions. The interior is brightly illuminated with energy-efficient LED lighting, enhancing visibility and making it easier to locate stored items quickly. Adjustable shelving provides flexibility in organizing various types of food products, catering to different storage needs. The Atosa MBF8004GR combines durability, functionality, and energy efficiency, making it a dependable choice for any busy commercial kitchen seeking a high-quality refrigeration solution.</p>', '\n\nOffers 22 cubic feet of refrigerated storage space, suitable for small to medium-sized commercial kitchens.<br>\n\nFeatures a heavy-duty stainless steel single door for enhanced durability and a sleek, professional appearance.<br>\n\nEquipped with digital temperature controls for precise monitoring and regulation, ensuring consistent and safe refrigeration conditions.<br>\n\nIncludes LED interior lighting that improves visibility and operates efficiently, reducing energy consumption.<br>\n\nProvides adjustable shelves for flexible storage configurations, accommodating a variety of food items and packaging sizes.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MBF8004GR_e5c96522-c854-454e-a063-447ac43f7859.webp\"]', 'MBF8004GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2219, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 81.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 254.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:09', '2024-12-13 14:14:00', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MBF8004GR_e5c96522-c854-454e-a063-447ac43f7859.webp', 'physical', '', 1471.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB109\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1802, 'Atosa MMF9113 50.13\" Angle Curved Top Chest Freezer 12 cu.ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MMF9113 is a sophisticated and practical 50.13\" Angle Curved Top Chest Freezer, offering a generous 12 cubic feet of storage capacity. This unit is designed with an aesthetically pleasing angled curved top, which not only enhances its visual appeal but also provides easy and convenient access to stored items. Ideal for commercial environments such as convenience stores, cafes, and small restaurants, the Atosa MMF9113 combines ample storage space with a compact and space-efficient design. The curved top design also adds a touch of modern elegance, making it a stylish addition to any establishment\'s interior.</p>\n<p>Inside, the Atosa MMF9113 features a highly efficient cooling system that ensures consistent temperature maintenance, crucial for preserving the quality and safety of stored products. The thick insulation within the unit aids in superior temperature retention, which helps minimize energy consumption and operational costs. The freezer is equipped with a user-friendly thermostat, allowing for precise temperature adjustments to meet various storage needs. Additionally, the durable construction ensures long-lasting performance and easy maintenance. With its blend of large capacity, attractive design, and efficient performance, the Atosa MMF9113 is an excellent choice for businesses seeking reliable and aesthetically pleasing frozen storage solutions.</p>', '\n\nProvides 12 cubic feet of storage space, accommodating a wide range of frozen goods.<br>\n\nFeatures a stylish curved top for easy access and enhanced visual appeal in commercial settings.<br>\n\nMaintains consistent temperatures to preserve the quality and safety of stored products.<br>\n\nEnhances temperature retention, reducing energy consumption and operational costs.<br>\n\nAllows precise temperature adjustments to meet specific storage requirements.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storag