(1803, 'Atosa MMF9110 40.75\" Angle Curved Top Chest Freezer, 9  cu.ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MMF9110 is a stylish and functional 40.75\" Angle Curved Top Chest Freezer, providing 9 cubic feet of storage capacity. This unit is designed with an elegant curved top, which not only enhances its visual appeal but also allows for easy access to stored items. Ideal for commercial settings such as convenience stores, cafes, and small restaurants, the Atosa MMF9110 offers ample space for a variety of frozen goods while maintaining a compact footprint. The angled curved top also adds an aesthetic edge, making it a visually appealing addition to any establishment.</p>\n<p>Internally, the Atosa MMF9110 is equipped with a highly efficient cooling system that ensures consistent temperature maintenance, crucial for preserving the quality and safety of stored products. The freezer’s thick insulation aids in excellent temperature retention, helping to minimize energy consumption and reduce operational costs. Additionally, the freezer features a user-friendly thermostat, allowing for precise temperature adjustments to meet different storage needs. With its combination of elegant design, durable construction, and efficient performance, the Atosa MMF9110 is an ideal solution for businesses looking to enhance both their frozen storage capabilities and their interior aesthetics.</p>', '\n\nFeatures an angled curved top that enhances visual appeal and provides easy access to stored items.<br>\n\nOffers 9 cubic feet of storage space, ideal for a variety of frozen goods in commercial settings.<br>\n\nEnsures consistent temperature maintenance to preserve the quality and safety of stored products.<br>\n\nProvides excellent temperature retention, reducing energy consumption and operational costs.<br>\n\nAllows for precise temperature adjustments to meet different storage needs.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MMF9110_1d793b2b-d423-41c0-bb6a-991e3b32c7cc.we