(1810, 'Migali C-RO-36G-LP 36” Liquid Propane Oven with 36” Wide Griddle', '\n<p>The Migali C-RO-36G-LP gas range combines compact efficiency with powerful performance for commercial kitchens. It features a standard oven and a full-width griddle, both designed to handle rigorous cooking demands. Each burner pumps out 25,000 BTUs, ensuring rapid heating for large pots and pans, while the griddle\'s polished steel surface heats evenly and cleans easily. The unit\'s stainless steel construction, including adjustable feet for stability on uneven surfaces, enhances durability and cleanliness. With a nonstick porcelain enamel interior in the oven and chrome accents for temperature control, the range offers both functionality and ease of maintenance.</p>', '\n\n25,000 BTU burners for high heat output<br>\n\nFull-width polished steel griddle for even cooking and easy cleaning<br>\n\nStainless steel construction for durability and hygiene<br>\n\nAdjustable oven shelf for flexible storage options<br>\n\nNonstick porcelain enamel interior for effortless cleaning\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-RO-36G-LP_c80232dd-58eb-4e37-b270-08eeebc866cb.webp\"]', 'C-RO-36G-LP', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 3183, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36.00, NULL, 56.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 598.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:18', '2024-12-13 14:14:01', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-RO-36G-LP_c80232dd-58eb-4e37-b270-08eeebc866cb.webp', 'physical', '', 2438, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB118\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1811, 'Migali C-RO-36G-NG 36\" Natural Gas Oven with 36” Griddle', '\n<p>The Migali C-RO-36G-NG gas range combines efficiency and durability for professional kitchen environments. Powered by natural gas, it features three high-output burners, each generating 25,000 BTUs to ensure even heating across its full-width griddle and oven. The polished steel griddle plate heats up swiftly and evenly, controlled via front-facing dials for precise temperature adjustments. Its porcelain-enameled oven interior simplifies cleaning, complemented by chrome knobs for temperature control. Designed for versatility, an adjustable overshelf accommodates additional tools or small appliances, while sturdy stainless steel feet stabilize the unit on any surface.</p>', '\n\nThree 25,000 BTU burners for a total of 75,000 BTUs on the griddle<br>\n\nQuick-heating polished steel griddle plate<br>\n\nPorcelain-enameled steel interior for easy cleaning<br>\n\nAdjustable overshelf for extra storage<br>\n\nFront-facing control dials for burner and oven temperature\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-RO-36G-NG_4bfac89a-8330-4750-855c-fd0a8c915886.webp\"]', 'C-RO-36G-NG', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 3183, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36.00, NULL, 56.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 598.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:19', '2024-12-13 14:14:01', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-RO-36G-NG_4bfac89a-8330-4750-855c-fd0a8c915886.webp', 'physical', '', 2438, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB119\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1812, 'Migali C-RO6-24GL-LP 60” Six Burner Liquid Propane Range with 24” Griddle, Left side', '\n<p>The Migali C-RO6-24GL-LP Competitor Series® gas range offers versatile cooking capabilities with its six burners, 24-inch griddle, and dual ovens. Its 3?4-inch polished steel griddle ensures even heat distribution, while removable cast iron grates beneath each manually ignited burner facilitate easy cleaning. Each oven features an adjustable shelf and a porcelain enameled interior for hassle-free maintenance. Designed for commercial kitchens, its stainless steel exterior resists corrosion, complemented by a rear backsplash that prevents splatters. Front-located temperature knobs provide convenient control over the 240,000 BTU total output. Ideal for chefs needing efficiency and durability, it\'s equipped with safety features like a high-limit switch for oven temperature regulation.</p>', '\n\nSix 23,000 BTU open-top burners and 24-inch griddle<br>\n\nRemovable cast iron grates for burner cleaning<br>\n\nPorcelain enameled oven interiors for easy upkeep<br>\n\nCorrosion-resistant stainless steel construction<br>\n\nRear backsplash to prevent kitchen wall splatters\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-RO6-24GL-LP_2eb9087d-fe09-4839-8547-cd9a19b02516.webp\"]', 'C-RO6-24GL-LP', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 4759, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 60.00, NULL, 56.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 895.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:21', '2024-12-13 14:14:01', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-RO6-24GL-LP_2eb9087d-fe09-4839-8547-cd9a19b02516.webp', 'physical', '', 3646, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB120\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '',