(1813, 'Migali C-RO6-24GL-NG 60” Six Burner Natural Gas Range with 24” Griddle', '\n<p>The Migali C-RO6-24GL-NG Competitor Series® six burner gas range is designed for efficient and durable commercial cooking. It features a robust 24-inch polished steel griddle with a 3?4-inch-thick plate, ensuring fast and even cooking. The six burners, each operating at 25,000 BTU, are complemented by removable cast iron grates for easy cleaning. Two spacious ovens, each equipped with an adjustable rack, accommodate versatile cooking needs. Safety is prioritized with a high-limit control that prevents overheating, while temperature regulation is straightforward with chrome handles. Its stainless steel exterior and rear-located backsplash enhance longevity and cleanliness, ideal for high-demand kitchen environments.</p>', '\n\n24-inch polished steel griddle with 3?4-inch-thick plate<br>\n\nSix 25,000 BTU burners with removable cast iron grates<br>\n\nTwo spacious ovens with adjustable racks<br>\n\nHigh-limit control for safety against overheating<br>\n\nDurable stainless steel construction with rear-located backsplash\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-RO6-24GL-NG_7d66ce07-bc8e-4c10-b06a-e3f421788fb9.webp\"]', 'C-RO6-24GL-NG', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 4759, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 60.00, NULL, 56.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 895.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:22', '2024-12-13 14:14:01', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-RO6-24GL-NG_7d66ce07-bc8e-4c10-b06a-e3f421788fb9.webp', 'physical', '', 3646, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB121\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1814, 'Migali C-RO4-24GL-LP 48” Four Burner Liquid Propane Range with 24” Griddle', '\n<p>The Migali C-RO4-24GL-LP Competitor Series® gas range is a robust choice for commercial kitchens, featuring durable stainless steel construction that ensures longevity. It includes two porcelain enameled ovens for easy cleaning, each equipped with a movable rack to accommodate diverse cooking needs. The unit is mobile thanks to sturdy casters and incorporates a rear backsplash to maintain kitchen cleanliness. Four 23,000 BTU burners, manually ignited and featuring removable cast iron grates, offer versatile cooking options. A 24-inch griddle with a 3?4-inch-thick plate ensures even cooking, complemented by chrome knobs for precise temperature control and a safety mechanism that shuts off the unit if temperatures exceed safe limits.</p>', '\n\nStainless steel construction for durability in commercial environments<br>\n\nTwo porcelain enameled ovens with adjustable racks for versatile cooking applications<br>\n\nFour 23,000 BTU burners with removable cast iron grates for easy cleaning<br>\n\n24-inch griddle with 3?4-inch-thick plate for even cooking<br>\n\nSafety feature shuts off unit when temperatures are too high\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-RO4-24GL-LP_50e72088-16f2-475b-a0aa-f660077ebc17.webp\"]', 'C-RO4-24GL-LP', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 3784, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48.00, NULL, 56.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 772.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:23', '2024-12-13 14:14:01', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-RO4-24GL-LP_50e72088-16f2-475b-a0aa-f660077ebc17.webp', 'physical', '', 2899, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB122\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1815, 'Migali C-RO4-24GL-NG 48” Four Burner Natural Gas Range with 24” Griddle', '\n<p>The Migali C-RO4-24GL-NG Competitor Series® gas range is a versatile kitchen powerhouse ideal for commercial settings. Featuring four 25,000 BTU burners, it allows simultaneous cooking of soups, frying, and boiling alongside a 24-inch griddle with a 3?4-inch thick plate for quick, even cooking. Two ovens with adjustable racks cater to baking needs efficiently. Its stainless steel construction ensures durability against kitchen rigors, including a rear backsplash that prevents grease splatter. Removable cast iron grates simplify cleaning, maintaining hygiene effortlessly. With a high-limit switch for safety and totaling 196,000 BTU, this range combines robust performance with ease of maintenance.</p>', '\n\nFour 25,000 BTU burners for versatile cooking options.<br>\n\n24-inch griddle with 3?4-inch thick plate ensures even cooking.<br>\n\nStainless steel construction for durability and easy cleaning.<br>\n\nRear backsplash prevents mess on kitchen walls.<br>\n\nTwo ovens with adjustable racks allow simultaneous baking.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-RO4-24GL-NG_351a2b4a-4815-4618-a081-69b06e2ad41b.webp\"]', 'C-RO4-24GL-NG', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 3784, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48.00, NULL, 56.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 772.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:24', '2024-12-13 14:14:01', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-RO4-24GL-NG_351a2b4a-4815-4618-a081-69b06e2ad41b.webp', 'physical', '', 2899, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB123\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1816, 'Migali C-RO4-12GL-LP 36” Four Burner Liquid Propane Range with 12” Griddle', '\n<p>The Migali C-RO2-24GL-LP gas range offers versatile cooking capabilities with its griddle, four burners, and oven, making it ideal for diverse kitchen needs. Featuring a sturdy 3?4-in.-thick steel griddle on the left for preparing pancakes and burgers, and four powerful 25,000 BTU burners on the right for soups and sauces, it ensures efficient cooking. The 27,000 BTU oven, despite its porcelain-enameled interior, simplifies cleaning but requires careful handling. Constructed from durable stainless steel and heavy-duty cast iron grates, it withstands rigorous kitchen use. Additional features include a shelf for storage, chrome knobs for durability, and a safety pilot for added security.</p>', '\n\nVersatile cooking with griddle, burners, and oven<br>\n\nDurable stainless steel construction for longevity<br>\n\nPowerful burners with high BTU output (140,000 total)<br>\n\nPorcelain-enameled oven interior for easy cleaning<br>\n\nSafety features like high-limit shut-off switch\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-RO4-12GL-LP_31f5255b-e184-408f-ba1b-a10ca3c8ed44.webp\"]', 'C-RO4-12GL-LP', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 2512, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36.00, NULL, 56.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 562.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:25', '2024-12-13 14:14:02', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-RO4-12GL-LP_31f5255b-e184-408f-ba1b-a10ca3c8ed44.webp', 'physical', '', 1924, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB124\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1817, 'Migali C-RO4-12GL-NG 36” Four Burner Natural Gas Range with 12” Griddle', '\n<p>The Migali C-RO4-12GL-NG Competitor Series® gas range is a robust kitchen appliance designed for efficiency and durability in high-volume cooking environments. Featuring four 25,000-BTU burners with chrome temperature knobs, it offers precise control over cooking temperatures. A 12-inch griddle with a 3?4-inch-thick polished steel plate ensures even cooking of various items like bacon and burgers. The oven, equipped with a porcelain-enameled interior and adjustable rack, simplifies cleaning and accommodates diverse culinary needs. Constructed from stainless steel, its exterior guarantees longevity. Safety features include a high-limit shut-off to prevent overheating, complemented by a rear backsplash to maintain kitchen cleanliness.</p>', '\n\nFour 25,000-BTU burners with chrome temperature knobs<br>\n\n12-inch griddle with 3?4-inch-thick polished steel plate<br>\n\nPorcelain-enameled oven interior for easy cleaning<br>\n\nDurable stainless steel exterior<br>\n\nHigh-limit safety shut-off and rear backsplash\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-RO4-12GL-NG_7f5c193a-f7ab-434a-b7f6-27dab425e701.webp\"]', 'C-RO4-12GL-NG', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 2512, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36.00, NULL, 56.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 562.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:26', '2024-12-13 14:14:02', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-RO4-12GL-NG_7f5c193a-f7ab-434a-b7f6-27dab425e701.webp', 'physical', '', 1924, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB125\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1818, 'Migali C-RO2-24GL-LP 36” Two Burner Liquid Propane Range with 24” Griddle', '\n<p>The Migali C-RO2-24GL-LP gas range with griddle is a versatile addition to any professional kitchen, featuring a 3/4-inch thick polished steel griddle for preparing pancakes and burgers on the left side, alongside two 25,000 BTU burners on the right for heating saucepans and stock pots. Beneath, a 27,000 BTU oven facilitates baking, while an adjustable shelf above provides convenient storage. Built to withstand rigorous use, it boasts a stainless steel body, durable cast iron grates, and chrome controls. The oven\'s porcelain enamel interior ensures easy cleaning, enhancing efficiency in high-demand environments.</p>', '\n\n3/4-inch thick polished steel griddle plate heats evenly and quickly<br>\n\nTwo 25,000 BTU burners for powerful cooking performance<br>\n\n27,000 BTU oven with porcelain enameled interior for easy maintenance<br>\n\nStainless steel construction with rugged cast iron grates<br>\n\nAdjustable shelf for storage above the unit\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-RO2-24GL-LP_b48423c1-a637-404a-a4b5-e61e189bacd0.webp\"]', 'C-RO2-24GL-LP', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 2512, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36.00, NULL, 56.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 588.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:27', '2024-12-13 14:14:02', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-RO2-24GL-LP_b48423c1-a637-404a-a4b5-e61e189bacd0.webp', 'physical', '', 1924, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB126\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1819, 'Migali C-RO2-24GL-NG 36” Two Burner Natural Gas Range with 24” Griddle', '\n<p>The Migali C-RO2-24GL-LP gas range is a versatile addition for restaurants seeking to diversify their menu offerings. Featuring a robust design, it includes a 3?4-in.-thick polished steel griddle on the left for cooking pancakes and burgers, while the right side boasts two high-powered burners ideal for heating stock pots and saucepans with up to 25,000 BTUs each. Below, a 27,000-BTU oven accommodates baking desserts or casseroles. Constructed from durable stainless steel with cast iron grates, this unit ensures longevity under heavy use. Chrome oven handles and wear-resistant knobs further enhance its durability and usability.</p>', '\n\n3/4-in.-thick polished steel griddle for fast and even heating<br>\n\nTwo 25,000 BTU burners for powerful cooking capabilities<br>\n\n27,000 BTU oven with adjustable shelf for versatile baking options<br>\n\nStainless steel body and griddle, cast iron grates for durability<br>\n\nChrome oven handle and temperature control knobs for longevity\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-RO2-24GL-NG_a399a75b-94f2-4d40-9538-a90ebaf674eb.webp\"]', 'C-RO2-24GL-NG', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 2512, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36.00, NULL, 56.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 588.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:28', '2024-12-13 14:14:02', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-RO2-24GL-NG_a399a75b-94f2-4d40-9538-a90ebaf674eb.webp', 'physical', '', 1924, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB127\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1820, 'Migali C-RO10-LP 60” Ten Burner Liquid Propane Range With Oven', '\n<p>The Migali® C-RO10-LP ten burner, liquid gas range combines robust performance with sleek design, ideal for culinary enthusiasts. Its heavy-duty, cast iron trivets and removable slide-out waste tray ensure durability and easy maintenance. Featuring 23,000 BTU-rated burners, each adjustable for precise cooking control, this range offers versatility. Crafted from high-polished stainless steel, it includes (10) chrome temperature knobs and (2) thermostat knobs, all set on stainless steel adjustable legs. The porcelain-wrapped steel interior of the oven simplifies cleaning and enhances longevity, accommodating two full-sized sheet racks. With a potent 27,000 BTU heat capacity, this range excels in both efficiency and aesthetic appeal.</p>', '\n\n10 burners with 23,000 BTU each, manually adjustable<br>\n\nHigh-polished stainless steel exterior and interior<br>\n\nPorcelain-wrapped steel oven interior for easy cleaning<br>\n\nIncludes (10) chrome temperature knobs and (2) thermostat knobs<br>\n\nAccommodates two full-sized sheet racks\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-RO10-LP_d6b94aef-766a-4c28-8e14-07398f9422c9.webp\"]', 'C-RO10-LP', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 4374, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 60.00, NULL, 55.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 775.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:29', '2024-12-13 14:14:02', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-RO10-LP_d6b94aef-766a-4c28-8e14-07398f9422c9.webp', 'physical', '', 3350, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB128\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '');
