(1821, 'Migali C-RO10-NG 60” Ten Burner Natural Gas Range With Oven', '\n<p>The Migali® C-RO10-NG ten burner natural gas range is a powerhouse designed for culinary excellence, ideal for both cooking and baking gourmet recipes and entrees. Featuring heavy-duty cast iron trivets and a convenient removable full-width slide-out waste tray, it combines robust functionality with easy maintenance. Each of its 10 hot plate burners delivers 25,000 BTUs of power, adjustable manually for precise cooking control. Its striking design includes a high-polished stainless steel exterior and interior, complemented by chrome temperature knobs and stainless steel adjustable legs. The oven, with a porcelain-wrapped steel interior, ensures effortless cleaning and long-term durability, accommodating two full-sized sheet racks with a 27,000 BTU heat capacity.</p>', '\n\n10 burners delivering 25,000 BTUs each, manually adjustable<br>\n\nHeavy-duty cast iron trivets and removable waste tray<br>\n\nHigh-polished stainless steel exterior and interior<br>\n\nPorcelain-wrapped steel oven interior for easy cleaning<br>\n\nOven fits two full-sized sheet racks, with 27,000 BTU heat capacity\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-RO10-NG_eecd24d7-b032-4586-828d-938662e21195.webp\"]', 'C-RO10-NG', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 4374, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 60.00, NULL, 55.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 775.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:29', '2024-12-13 14:14:02', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-RO10-NG_eecd24d7-b032-4586-828d-938662e21195.webp', 'physical', '', 3350, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB129\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1822, 'Migali C-RO8-LP 48” Eight Burner Liquid Propane Gas Range With Oven', '\n<p>The Migali C-RO8-LP Competitor Series® gas range features eight 23,000 BTU burners with manually ignited operation and removable cast iron grates for easy cleaning. Built from stainless steel, it ensures durability suitable for commercial kitchens, including the gas tubing and burners. Front chrome knobs allow precise temperature control, while a high-limit safety switch prevents overheating and potential damage.</p>', '\n\nEight 23,000-BTU burners with manual ignition<br>\n\nDurable stainless steel construction, including burners and gas tubing<br>\n\nRemovable cast iron grates for easy cleaning underneath<br>\n\nTwo ovens with adjustable shelves, ideal for simultaneous cooking<br>\n\nHigh-limit safety switch prevents overheating\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-RO8-LP_28e60b98-a8c2-4b53-9c72-bb83d4291f19.webp\"]', 'C-RO8-LP', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 3784, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48.00, NULL, 56.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 772.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:31', '2024-12-13 14:14:02', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-RO8-LP_28e60b98-a8c2-4b53-9c72-bb83d4291f19.webp', 'physical', '', 2899, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB130\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1823, 'Migali C-RO8-NG 48” Eight Burner Natural Gas Range With Oven', '\n<p>The Migali C-RO8-NG Competitor Series® gas range combines robust performance with safety and ease of use. Featuring eight 25,000-BTU open-top burners and two spacious ovens, this commercial range is ideal for busy kitchens. Its front-located chrome knobs allow precise temperature control, while a high-limit switch automatically shuts off the unit if temperatures exceed safe limits, preventing damage. Cast iron grates over the burners facilitate easy cleaning, and stainless steel construction ensures durability and longevity. With porcelain-enameled interiors and adjustable shelves in each oven, it offers flexibility for various cooking needs. Mounted on casters, it\'s mobile yet stable, making it a versatile choice for professional kitchens.</p>', '\n\nEight 25,000-BTU open-top burners<br>\n\nTwo porcelain-enameled ovens with adjustable shelves<br>\n\nHigh-limit switch for overheating protection<br>\n\nStainless steel exterior, burners, and gas tubing<br>\n\nRemovable cast iron grates for easy cleaning\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-RO8-NG_5e85d41d-4b93-4748-929f-b22ac17aa626.webp\"]', 'C-RO8-NG', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 3784, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48.00, NULL, 56.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 772.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:33', '2024-12-13 14:14:02', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-RO8-NG_5e85d41d-4b93-4748-929f-b22ac17aa626.webp', 'physical', '', 2899, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB131\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1824, 'Migali C-RO6-LP 36” Six Burner Liquid Propane Range With Oven', '\n<p>The Migali C-RO6-LP Competitor Series® gas range is designed for versatile cooking needs in commercial kitchens. Featuring a standard oven with a porcelain-enameled interior, it resists corrosion and simplifies cleaning with its nonstick surfaces. Six 23,000 BTU burners, each with durable cast iron grates, ensure even heat distribution and easy maintenance. Chrome knobs allow precise temperature control, with an automatic safety shut-off feature for overheating protection. Its stainless steel exterior enhances durability and facilitates effortless cleaning, complemented by a rear-located backsplash that keeps kitchen walls tidy. Mounted on four casters, this unit delivers a total of 165,000 BTU for efficient cooking performance.</p>', '\n\nCompetitor Series design for commercial use<br>\n\nSix 23,000 BTU burners with removable cast iron grates<br>\n\nPorcelain-enameled oven interior for easy cleaning<br>\n\nAutomatic shut-off safety feature<br>\n\nStainless steel exterior with rear backsplash\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-RO6-LP_74affc92-cad1-41e6-92b5-a245017e89d6.webp\"]', 'C-RO6-LP', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 2233, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36.00, NULL, 56.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 456.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:34', '2024-12-13 14:14:02', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-RO6-LP_74affc92-cad1-41e6-92b5-a245017e89d6.webp', 'physical', '', 1710, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB132\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1825, 'Migali C-RO6-NG 36” Six Burner Natural Gas Range With Oven', '\n<p>The Migali C-RO6-NG Competitor Series® six burner gas range combines robust functionality with easy maintenance for commercial kitchens. Crafted from durable stainless steel, its exterior ensures longevity and effortless cleaning. The removable cast iron grates facilitate thorough cleaning, preventing food buildup. A rear-located backsplash shields kitchen walls from splatters during cooking.</p>', '\n\nSix 25,000-BTU burners for high-efficiency cooking<br>\n\nChrome knobs for precise temperature control<br>\n\nSafety pilot feature shuts off if temperatures exceed safe limits<br>\n\nPorcelain enameled oven interior simplifies post-cooking cleanup<br>\n\nHeavy-duty construction with 177,000 total BTU output\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-RO6-NG_41b05611-0ef1-44d1-b3ac-84d6bef62c0e.webp\"]', 'C-RO6-NG', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 2233, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36.00, NULL, 56.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 456.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:35', '2024-12-13 14:14:02', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-RO6-NG_41b05611-0ef1-44d1-b3ac-84d6bef62c0e.webp', 'physical', '', 1710, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB133\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1826, 'Migali C-RO4-LP 24” Four Burner Liquid Propane Gas Range With Oven', '\n<p>The Migali C-RO4-LP Competitor Series® gas range combines versatile cooking capabilities with durability, ideal for bustling restaurant kitchens. Its four high-powered burners, each at 23,000 BTU, and a spacious oven allow simultaneous cooking of diverse dishes, enhancing operational efficiency. The cast iron grates are removable for thorough cleaning, complemented by a stainless steel construction that ensures longevity and simplifies maintenance. Chrome knobs facilitate precise temperature adjustments, while a high-limit control ensures safety by automatically shutting off the unit during overheating. With a porcelain-enameled oven interior for corrosion resistance and a sleek finish, this range offers both functionality and ease of cleanup.</p>', '\n\nFour 23,000 BTU burners for simultaneous cooking<br>\n\nRemovable cast iron grates for easy cleaning<br>\n\nStainless steel construction for durability and hygiene<br>\n\nHigh-limit switch for safety against overheating<br>\n\nPorcelain-enameled oven interior for corrosion resistance\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-RO4-LP_306dab41-daf6-4ae4-93e1-daf6ee8f003b.webp\"]', 'C-RO4-LP', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 1922, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 56.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 357.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:36', '2024-12-13 14:14:03', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-RO4-LP_306dab41-daf6-4ae4-93e1-daf6ee8f003b.webp', 'physical', '', 1472, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB134\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1827, 'Migali C-RO4-NG 24” Four Burner Natural Gas Range With Standard Oven', '\n<p>Discover the perfect blend of efficiency and functionality with our 4 Burner Range. Ideal for culinary enthusiasts and professional kitchens alike, this range features a single spacious oven and operates on natural gas, ensuring consistent heat for precision cooking. The four burners offer ample space for simultaneous cooking, catering effortlessly to multiple dishes at once. Whether preparing delicate sauces or hearty roasts, each burner provides reliable performance and control. With its sleek design and robust construction, our 4 Burner Range promises durability and style, making it an indispensable centerpiece for any kitchen environment.</p>', '\n\n4 burners for versatile cooking options<br>\n\nSpacious oven for baking and roasting<br>\n\nOperates on natural gas for economical use<br>\n\nSleek design enhancing kitchen aesthetics<br>\n\nDurable construction ensuring long-term reliability\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-RO4-NG_38c67330-9379-478d-9d08-5884c59807c4.webp\"]', 'C-RO4-NG', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 1922, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 56.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 357.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:37', '2024-12-13 14:14:03', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-RO4-NG_38c67330-9379-478d-9d08-5884c59807c4.webp', 'physical', '', 1472, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB135\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1828, 'Migali C-SPS-2-18 Two Burner, 18” Wide, Stock Pot Stove', '\n<p>The Migali® C-SPS-2-18 (2) burner stock pot stove excels in preparing appetizers and entrees with its powerful features. It features heavy-duty cast iron trivets and additional shelf space beneath the burners for added convenience. Each burner delivers a robust 80,000 BTUs and allows for manual adjustment, ensuring precise cooking control. Its high-polished stainless steel exterior and interior not only enhance durability but also make it visually appealing. The stove is equipped with four chrome temperature knobs for easy operation and stainless steel adjustable legs for stability on any surface.</p>', '\n\nHeavy-duty cast iron trivet and extra shelf space<br>\n\nEach burner rated at 80,000 BTUs with manual adjustment<br>\n\nHigh-polished stainless steel exterior and interior<br>\n\nFour chrome temperature knobs for precise control<br>\n\nStainless steel adjustable legs for stability\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-SPS-2-18_b255ec02-c059-4ba8-b37c-f47083a8dba2.webp\"]', 'C-SPS-2-18', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 1194, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 18.00, NULL, 23.00, NULL, 42.00, NULL, 222.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:38', '2024-12-13 14:14:03', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-SPS-2-18_b255ec02-c059-4ba8-b37c-f47083a8dba2.webp', 'physical', '', 915, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB136\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1829, 'Migali C-SPS-1-18 Single Burner, 18” Wide, Stock Pot Stove', '\n<p>The Migali® C-SPS-1-18 burner stock pot stove is designed for superior appetizer and entree preparation. It features a heavy-duty cast iron trivet and additional shelf space beneath the burner for convenient storage. Each of its high-powered burners is rated at 80,000 BTUs, offering precise manual adjustments for optimal cooking control. Its sleek design includes a high-polished stainless steel exterior and interior, complemented by chrome temperature knobs that add a touch of elegance. Stainless steel adjustable legs ensure stability on any surface, making the C-SPS-1-18 both functional and visually appealing in any professional kitchen environment.</p>', '\n\nHeavy-duty cast iron trivet and extra shelf space<br>\n\n80,000 BTU burners with manual adjustment<br>\n\nHigh-polished stainless steel exterior and interior<br>\n\nChrome temperature knobs for precise control<br>\n\nStainless steel adjustable legs\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-SPS-1-18_49b0daf0-c81e-4597-93a3-7b9bdd2558ac.webp\"]', 'C-SPS-1-18', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 648, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 18.00, NULL, 23.00, NULL, 21.00, NULL, 119.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:39', '2024-12-13 14:14:03', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-SPS-1-18_49b0daf0-c81e-4597-93a3-7b9bdd2558ac.webp', 'physical', '', 496, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB137\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1830, 'Migali C-HP-6-36 Counter-top Six Burners, 36” Wide Hot Plate', '\n<p>The Migali® C-HP-6-36 (6) burner, counter-top hot plate is designed for exceptional performance in cooking appetizers and entrees. Featuring heavy-duty cast iron trivets and a removable full-width slide-out waste tray, it ensures durability and easy maintenance. Each burner delivers a powerful 25,000 BTUs and allows for manual adjustment, providing precise control over cooking temperatures. Its high polished stainless steel exterior and interior, along with (6) chrome temperature knobs, not only enhance its aesthetic appeal but also ensure resilience against corrosion. Stainless steel adjustable legs offer stability and adaptability to varying kitchen environments.</p>', '\n\n6 burners with 25,000 BTUs each for powerful cooking.<br>\n\nHeavy-duty cast iron trivets for durability.<br>\n\nRemovable full-width slide-out waste tray for easy cleaning.<br>\n\nHigh polished stainless steel exterior and interior for a sleek look and durability.<br>\n\nStainless steel adjustable legs for stability and adaptability.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-HP-6-36_4887478f-dbbb-4d12-a26d-79a1f72e0051.webp\"]', 'C-HP-6-36', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 1115, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36.00, NULL, 13.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 179.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:40', '2024-12-13 14:14:03', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-HP-6-36_4887478f-dbbb-4d12-a26d-79a1f72e0051.webp', 'physical', '', 854, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB138\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1831, 'Migali C-HP-4-24 Counter-top Four Burners, 24” Wide Hot Plate', '\n<p>The Migali® C-HP-4-24 is a powerful counter-top hot plate designed for culinary excellence. Featuring four burners with individual 25,000 BTU ratings, it ensures precise cooking control for appetizers and entrees. The heavy-duty cast iron trivets provide robust support, complemented by a convenient removable waste tray that simplifies cleanup. Its polished stainless steel exterior and interior not only enhance durability but also add a professional aesthetic to any kitchen environment. The unit is further distinguished by chrome temperature knobs that facilitate easy adjustment, along with stainless steel adjustable legs for stability on any surface.</p>', '\n\nFour 25,000 BTU burners for powerful cooking performance.<br>\n\nHeavy-duty cast iron trivets for sturdy support.<br>\n\nPolished stainless steel exterior and interior for durability and professional appearance.<br>\n\nChrome temperature knobs for precise heat control.<br>\n\nStainless steel adjustable legs for stability and easy leveling.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-HP-4-24_15fdf9a2-9b3e-4fbf-8e0f-8e782f585037.webp\"]', 'C-HP-4-24', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 878, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 24.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 125.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:41', '2024-12-13 14:14:03', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-HP-4-24_15fdf9a2-9b3e-4fbf-8e0f-8e782f585037.webp', 'physical', '', 673, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB139\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1832, 'Migali C-HP-2-12 Counter-top Two Burners, 12” Wide Hot Plate', '\n<p>The Migali® C-HP-2-12 is a versatile counter-top hot plate designed for culinary excellence. Ideal for preparing appetizers and entrees, this model features two powerful burners, each boasting 25,000 BTUs for precise cooking control. Its heavy-duty cast iron trivets ensure durability, while a removable full-width slide-out waste tray simplifies cleaning. The hot plate offers manual adjustment capabilities for each burner, allowing chefs to fine-tune temperatures as needed. Crafted with a high polished stainless steel exterior and interior, it not only enhances kitchen aesthetics but also offers practicality with chrome temperature knobs and adjustable stainless steel legs.</p>', '\n\nTwo 25,000 BTU burners for powerful cooking performance<br>\n\nHeavy-duty cast iron trivets for durability and stability<br>\n\nRemovable full-width slide-out waste tray for easy cleaning<br>\n\nHigh polished stainless steel exterior and interior for aesthetic appeal and durability<br>\n\nChrome temperature knobs and stainless steel adjustable legs for customization\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-HP-2-12_59767b36-9c44-431c-9d46-02c17cd0943a.webp\"]', 'C-HP-2-12', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 486, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 12.00, NULL, 13.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 74.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:42', '2024-12-13 14:14:03', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-HP-2-12_59767b36-9c44-431c-9d46-02c17cd0943a.webp', 'physical', '', 372, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB140\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1833, 'Migali C-RB48 Counter-top 48\" Wide Radiant Broiler', '\n<p>The Migali® C-CB48 48? wide radiant broiler is a versatile kitchen appliance designed for grilling an array of proteins and vegetables to perfection. Its heavy-duty, reversible cast iron cooking grates feature angled sides, allowing for both flat and sloped positions to accommodate different cooking styles. The broiler\'s “U” shape burners ensure even heat distribution across the radiant surface, enhancing cooking consistency. Crafted with a high polished stainless steel exterior and interior, it exudes a sleek, professional look. Chrome temperature knobs add a touch of elegance, while stainless steel adjustable legs provide stability and flexibility in placement.</p>', '\n\n48\" wide radiant broiler for grilling proteins and vegetables<br>\n\nHeavy-duty, reversible cast iron cooking grates with angled sides<br>\n\n“U” shape burners for even temperature distribution<br>\n\nHigh polished stainless steel exterior and interior<br>\n\nChrome temperature knobs and stainless steel adjustable legs\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-RB48_034220de-1f20-4f44-af46-ae2c6aa42d39.webp\"]', 'C-RB48', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 1664, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48.00, NULL, 15.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 256.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:43', '2024-12-13 14:14:03', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-RB48_034220de-1f20-4f44-af46-ae2c6aa42d39.webp', 'physical', '', 1275, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB141\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1834, 'Migali C-RB36 Counter-top 36” Wide Radiant Broiler', '\n<p>The Migali® C-CB36 36? wide radiant broiler is a versatile powerhouse designed for grilling a wide array of proteins and vegetables with precision. Its heavy-duty, reversible cast iron grates feature angled sides, allowing for flat or sloped cooking positions to suit different culinary needs. Equipped with Migali® “U” shape burners, it ensures uniform heat distribution across the radiant surface, enhancing cooking consistency. This broiler stands out not only for its performance but also for its sleek appearance, featuring a high polished stainless steel exterior and interior. Additionally, it offers user-friendly chrome temperature knobs and stainless steel adjustable legs for stability.</p>', '\n\n36\" wide radiant broiler suitable for grilling proteins and veggies<br>\n\nHeavy-duty, reversible cast iron grates with angled sides<br>\n\nMigali® “U” shape burners for even temperature distribution<br>\n\nHigh polished stainless steel exterior and interior<br>\n\nChrome temperature knobs and stainless steel adjustable legs\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-RB36_d67f0859-899d-440f-8ec3-f050d56c377b.webp\"]', 'C-RB36', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 1344, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36.00, NULL, 15.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 205.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:44', '2024-12-13 14:14:03', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-RB36_d67f0859-899d-440f-8ec3-f050d56c377b.webp', 'physical', '', 1030, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB142\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1835, 'Migali C-RB24 Counter-top 24” Wide Radiant Broiler', '\n<p>The Migali® C-CB24 24? wide radiant broiler offers exceptional versatility for grilling a wide range of proteins and vegetables. Its heavy-duty, cast iron reversible cooking grates feature angled sides that allow for both flat and sloped positions, perfect for achieving varied cooking results. Equipped with robust \"U\" shape burners, this broiler ensures even heat distribution across its radiant surface, enhancing cooking consistency. Its high polished stainless steel exterior and interior not only add durability but also give it a sleek, eye-catching appearance. Chrome temperature knobs and adjustable stainless steel legs provide precise control and stability, making it a reliable choice for any kitchen.</p>', '\n\n24\" wide radiant broiler for grilling proteins and veggies.<br>\n\nHeavy-duty, cast iron reversible cooking grates with angled sides.<br>\n\n\"U\" shape burners for even temperature distribution.<br>\n\nHigh polished stainless steel exterior and interior.<br>\n\nChrome temperature knobs and stainless steel adjustable legs.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-RB24_fec1dec7-d1c0-4693-91b3-4d92b4254b12.webp\"]', 'C-RB24', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 950, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 15.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 147.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:46', '2024-12-13 14:14:03', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-RB24_fec1dec7-d1c0-4693-91b3-4d92b4254b12.webp', 'physical', '', 728, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB143\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1836, 'Migali C-CR48 Counter-top 48\" Wide Char-Rock Broiler', '\n<p>The Migali® C-CR48 is a 48? wide char-rock broiler designed for grilling a variety of proteins and vegetables, imparting a rich BBQ flavor using char-rocks or briquettes. It features heavy-duty cast iron reversible cooking grates with angled sides for flat or sloped positions, ensuring versatility in cooking styles. The broiler is equipped with robust Migali® “U” shape burners that distribute heat evenly across the char-rock grates, maintaining consistent cooking temperatures. Its exterior and interior boast a high polished stainless steel finish, complemented by chrome temperature knobs for precise control. Stainless steel adjustable legs add stability and adaptability to different kitchen environments.</p>', '\n\n48\" wide char-rock broiler for versatile grilling.<br>\n\nHeavy-duty cast iron reversible cooking grates with angled sides.<br>\n\nMigali® “U” shape burners ensure even heat distribution.<br>\n\nHigh polished stainless steel exterior and interior.<br>\n\nChrome temperature knobs for precise control; stainless steel adjustable legs for stability.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-CR48_c04e0f58-1a0b-4432-bcb1-c10119e24ea0.webp\"]', 'C-CR48', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 1721, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48.00, NULL, 15.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 314.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:47', '2024-12-13 14:14:04', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-CR48_c04e0f58-1a0b-4432-bcb1-c10119e24ea0.webp', 'physical', '', 1319, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB144\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1837, 'Migali C-CR36 Counter-top 36” Wide Char-Rock Broiler', '<p>Description</p>\n<p>The Migali® C-CR36 36? wide char-rock broiler is a versatile appliance designed for achieving delicious grilled dishes with a rich, BBQ-style smoky flavor. It features heavy-duty, reversible cast iron cooking grates with angled sides, allowing for both flat and sloped positions to accommodate various cooking needs. The broiler is equipped with Migali® “U” shape burners that ensure even heat distribution across the char-rock grates, enhancing cooking consistency. Its exterior and interior are crafted from high-polished stainless steel, complemented by chrome temperature knobs for precise control, and stainless steel adjustable legs for stability. This broiler not only performs exceptionally but also adds a stylish touch to any kitchen environment.</p>', '\n\n36\" wide char-rock broiler for versatile grilling<br>\n\nHeavy-duty, reversible cast iron cooking grates with angled sides<br>\n\nMigali® “U” shape burners for even temperature distribution<br>\n\nHigh-polished stainless steel exterior and interior<br>\n\nChrome temperature knobs and stainless steel adjustable legs\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-CR36_b0f95474-79ec-4a52-bc7f-74c3bcfb0905.webp\"]', 'C-CR36', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 1368, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36.00, NULL, 15.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 238.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:48', '2024-12-13 14:14:04', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-CR36_b0f95474-79ec-4a52-bc7f-74c3bcfb0905.webp', 'physical', '', 1048, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB145\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 