(1838, 'Migali C-CR24 Counter-top 24” Wide Char-Rock Broiler', '\n<p>The Migali® C-CR24 24? wide char-rock broiler is a versatile kitchen appliance designed for grilling various proteins and vegetables to perfection. It utilizes char-rocks or briquettes to impart a delightful BBQ smokiness to your dishes. Featuring heavy-duty, reversible cast iron cooking grates with angled sides, it allows for flat or sloped positions based on your cooking needs. The broiler is equipped with robust \"U\" shape burners that ensure even heat distribution across the grates, promoting consistent cooking results. Its aesthetic appeal is enhanced by a high-polished stainless steel exterior and interior, complemented by chrome temperature knobs and stainless steel adjustable legs.</p>', '\n\n24\" wide char-rock broiler for versatile grilling<br>\n\nHeavy-duty, reversible cast iron cooking grates with angled sides<br>\n\n\"U\" shape burners for even temperature distribution<br>\n\nHigh-polished stainless steel exterior and interior<br>\n\nChrome temperature knobs and stainless steel adjustable legs\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-CR24_d75c1272-4701-4b04-bab2-c43f92aa909f.webp\"]', 'C-CR24', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 964, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 15.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 168.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:49', '2024-12-13 14:14:04', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-CR24_d75c1272-4701-4b04-bab2-c43f92aa909f.webp', 'physical', '', 738, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB146\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1839, 'Migali C-G48T 48\" Gas Griddle w/ Thermostatic Controls', '<h2><strong>Description</strong></h2><p>The Migali C-G48T 48\" Gas Griddle is a high-performance piece of countertop cooking equipment designed for commercial kitchens. With a total BTU output of 100,000 and individual burners generating 25,000 BTU each, this griddle delivers robust heat, ensuring efficient and even cooking. The griddle features a 1-inch thick steel plate, which provides excellent heat retention and durability. The thermostatic controls allow for precise temperature management, catering to various cooking needs. Its convertible gas type capability (LP or NG) adds flexibility for different kitchen setups.</p><p>Measuring 48 inches in width and 20 inches in depth, the cooking surface is expansive, offering a cooking area width of 47.9 inches. The griddle’s control spacing of 12 inches ensures easy access and operation. Weighing 415 pounds, it is built to withstand the demands of a busy kitchen environment. Backed by a 2-year parts and labor warranty, the Migali C-G48T is designed for reliability and ease of maintenance, making it a solid choice for high-volume cooking applications.</p>', '<h2><strong>Features</strong><br> </h2><p>The griddle boasts a powerful total BTU rating of 100,000, ensuring efficient and high-performance cooking. Each burner provides 25,000 BTU, delivering intense and consistent heat across the cooking surface. It is equipped with thermostatic controls for precise temperature management. The gas type is convertible, allowing for flexibility to use either LP (liquefied propane) or NG (natural gas). The griddle uses gas as its heat source for effective and reliable cooking. With an overall width of 48 inches, it provides a spacious cooking area for high-volume use. The griddle features a durable 1-inch thick steel plate, offering a robust cooking surface that distributes heat evenly. The cooking area depth is 20 inches, and the width of the cooking area is 47.9 inches, providing ample space for various cooking tasks. It comes with a 2-year parts and labor warranty, ensuring support and reliability for your kitchen operations.<br> </p>', 'pending', '[\"products\\/c-g48t.webp\"]', 'C-G48T', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 2389, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 48.00, NULL, 15.00, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 415.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:50', '2024-12-18 09:05:29', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-G48T_c3b03e53-a15f-4e7d-840f-d7b89ae4d82e.jpg', 'physical', NULL, 1830, 4, 0, 22, 0, '<p>Five Years Compressor Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB147\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1840, 'Migali C-G24T 24\" Gas Griddle w/ Thermostatic Controls', '<p><strong>Description</strong><br><br>The Migali C-G24T Gas Griddle offers a 24-inch cooking surface with precise thermostatic controls, ensuring consistent cooking temperatures. Featuring manual ignition, it\'s designed for reliability and durability in commercial settings. Compact dimensions of 24 inches wide, 28.6 inches deep, and 15.2 inches high make it space-efficient. Ideal for preparing a variety of foods with even heat distribution and ease of use.</p>', '<p>24\" gas griddle with thermostatic controls for precise cooking.<br>Manual ignition system for straightforward startup.<br>Cooking surface measures 24\" W x 28.6\" D.<br>Exterior dimensions: 24\" W x 28.6\" D x 15.2\" H.<br>Durable construction suitable for commercial kitchen environments.</p>', 'pending', '[\"products\\/c-g24t-2.webp\"]', 'C-G24T', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 1447, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 24.00, NULL, 15.00, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 195.00, 1, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:35:51', '2024-12-18 09:04:29', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-G24T_7bfb69bd-8143-4334-a8b6-1c4169340ddd.jpg', 'physical', NULL, 1108, 4, 0, 22, 0, '<p>Five Years Compressor Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB148\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1841, 'Migali C-G48 Counter-top  48\" Wide Manual Griddle W/Manual Controls', '\n<p>The Migali® C-G48 48? wide, manual griddle is essential to most commercial kitchens and restaurants. This model is designed with a 20? deep, 3/4? thick steel cooking surface and includes (4) chrome temperature knobs. Migali® “U” shape burners are robust, creating an even temperature across the cooking surface. Finally, the C-G48 is also eye catching, boasting a high polished stainless steel exterior and interior, chrome accents and stainless steel adjustable legs.</p>', '\n\n36\" wide manual griddle suitable for commercial kitchens<br>\n\n20\" deep, 3/4? thick steel cooking surface<br>\n\nThree chrome temperature knobs for precise heat control<br>\n\nMigali® “U” shape burners ensure even temperature distribution<br>\n\nHigh polished stainless steel exterior and interior with chrome accents\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-G48_18ebe19b-27a6-4fa1-a4fe-80830c9851e9.webp\"]', 'C-G48', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 1653, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48.00, NULL, 15.00, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 415.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:52', '2024-12-13 14:14:04', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-G48_18ebe19b-27a6-4fa1-a4fe-80830c9851e9.webp', 'physical', '', 1266, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB149\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1842, 'Migali C-G36 Counter-top 36” Wide Manual Griddle W/Manual Controls', '\n<p>The Migali® C-G36 36? wide manual griddle is a cornerstone in commercial kitchens and restaurants, prized for its efficiency and sleek design. Featuring a substantial 20? deep cooking surface made of 3/4? thick steel, it ensures even heat distribution for consistent cooking results. The griddle comes equipped with three chrome temperature knobs, allowing precise control over cooking temperatures. Migali® “U” shape burners further enhance performance by maintaining uniform heat across the entire surface. Its attractive appearance is characterized by a high polished stainless steel exterior and interior, complemented by chrome accents and adjustable stainless steel legs.</p>', '\n\n36\" wide manual griddle suitable for commercial kitchens<br>\n\n20\" deep, 3/4? thick steel cooking surface<br>\n\nThree chrome temperature knobs for precise heat control<br>\n\nMigali® “U” shape burners ensure even temperature distribution<br>\n\nHigh polished stainless steel exterior and interior with chrome accents\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-G36_2966f11a-75e8-4749-9862-a0e1d9919330.webp\"]', 'C-G36', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 1283, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36.00, NULL, 15.00, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 281.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:54', '2024-12-13 14:14:04', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-G36_2966f11a-75e8-4749-9862-a0e1d9919330.webp', 'physical', '', 983, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB150\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1843, 'Migali C-G24 Counter-top 24” Wide Manual Griddle W/Manual Controls', '\n<p>The Migali® C-G24 24? wide manual griddle is a must-have for commercial kitchens and restaurants, offering exceptional functionality and aesthetic appeal. Its 20? deep, 3/4? thick steel cooking surface ensures durability and even heat distribution, supported by two chrome temperature knobs for precise control. The griddle features Migali® “U” shape burners, known for their robust performance in maintaining consistent temperatures across the entire surface. Not only is it efficient, but the C-G24 also stands out with its high polished stainless steel exterior and interior, complemented by chrome accents and stainless steel adjustable legs, making it both durable and visually striking.</p>', '\n\n24\" wide manual griddle ideal for commercial kitchens<br>\n\n20\" deep, 3/4? thick steel cooking surface for durability and even heating<br>\n\nMigali® “U” shape burners ensure consistent temperature distribution<br>\n\nHigh polished stainless steel exterior and interior with chrome accents<br>\n\nStainless steel adjustable legs for stability\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-G24_c6b220bb-39fc-48a5-b01a-529573d36788.webp\"]', 'C-G24', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 883, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 15.00, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 195.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:55', '2024-12-13 14:14:04', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-G24_c6b220bb-39fc-48a5-b01a-529573d36788.webp', 'physical', '', 677, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB151\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1844, 'Migali C-F75-LP 75 lb Liquid Propane Fryer', '\n<p>The Migali® C-F75-LP commercial liquid propane fryer offers exceptional performance for frying appetizers and entrees favored by your customers. Featuring a spacious 75 lb capacity oil tank, it comes equipped with (2) wire mesh chrome baskets for efficient frying operations. This model ensures precise cooking temperatures up to 400°F /150,000 BTUs, utilizing a reliable Robert Shaw® thermostat. Its exterior and interior are crafted from high-polished stainless steel, complemented by chrome accents and stainless steel adjustable legs, making it both durable and visually appealing in any kitchen setup.</p>', '\n\nAmple 75 lb capacity oil tank for large-scale frying.<br>\n\nRobert Shaw® thermostat maintains temperatures up to 400°F.<br>\n\nHigh-polished stainless steel exterior and interior for durability and aesthetics.<br>\n\nIncludes (2) wire mesh chrome baskets for efficient frying.<br>\n\nStainless steel adjustable legs ensure stability and flexibility in placement.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-F75-LP_fa35774c-cda4-4151-9f8f-f096ae65ae63.webp\"]', 'C-F75-LP', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 1721, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 21.00, NULL, 44.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 200.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:55', '2024-12-13 14:14:04', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-F75-LP_fa35774c-cda4-4151-9f8f-f096ae65ae63.webp', 'physical', '', 1319, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB152\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1845, 'Migali C-F75-NG 75 lb Natural Gas Fryer', '\n<p>The Migali® C-F75-NG commercial natural gas fryer is the ideal choice for efficiently frying a variety of appetizers and main dishes in busy restaurant settings. Featuring a generous 75 lb capacity oil tank, it comes equipped with (2) wire mesh chrome baskets, ensuring ample space for cooking multiple items simultaneously. This fryer is built to last with top-tier components, including a Robert Shaw® thermostat that allows precise temperature control up to 400°F /170,000 BTUs. Its polished stainless steel exterior and interior, complemented by chrome accents and adjustable legs, not only enhance durability but also add a sleek, attractive look to any kitchen.</p>', '\n\nSpacious 75 lb capacity oil tank<br>\n\nIncludes (2) wire mesh chrome baskets<br>\n\nRobert Shaw® thermostat for precise temperature control up to 400°F /170,000 BTUs<br>\n\nHigh polished stainless steel exterior and interior with chrome accents<br>\n\nStainless steel adjustable legs\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-F75-NG_24a54b92-5417-4d86-9903-5c1f1124ae00.webp\"]', 'C-F75-NG', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 1721, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 21.00, NULL, 44.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 200.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:56', '2024-12-13 14:14:04', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-F75-NG_24a54b92-5417-4d86-9903-5c1f1124ae00.webp', 'physical', '', 1319, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB153\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '');
