(1846, 'Migali C-F50-LP 50 lb Liquid Propane Fryer', '\n<p>The Migali® C-F50-LP commercial liquid propane fryer is a robust choice for culinary professionals aiming to deliver crispy appetizers and entrees efficiently. With a spacious 50 lb oil tank capacity, it accommodates large batches effortlessly using (2) wire mesh chrome baskets. Its reliable Robert Shaw® thermostat ensures precise temperature control up to 400°F, supported by a powerful 120,000 BTU output for quick heating. This fryer not only excels in performance but also in aesthetics, featuring a striking high polished stainless steel exterior and interior, complemented by chrome accents and adjustable stainless steel legs. It\'s designed to enhance both kitchen functionality and visual appeal.</p>', '\n\nGenerous 50 lb capacity oil tank<br>\n\n(2) wire mesh chrome baskets included<br>\n\nRobert Shaw® thermostat for precise temperature control up to 400°F<br>\n\nHigh polished stainless steel exterior and interior with chrome accents<br>\n\nStainless steel adjustable legs\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-F50-LP_26f2e945-543d-47c0-9a0c-1b679503ba34.webp\"]', 'C-F50-LP', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 1471, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 16.00, NULL, 44.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 171.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:57', '2024-12-13 14:14:05', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-F50-LP_26f2e945-543d-47c0-9a0c-1b679503ba34.webp', 'physical', '', 1127, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB154\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1847, 'Migali C-F50-NG 50 lb Natural Gas Fryer', '\n<p>The Migali® C-F50-NG commercial natural gas fryer is the ideal choice for restaurants looking to enhance their frying capabilities. With a generous 50 lb capacity oil tank, it efficiently handles appetizers and entrees, supported by (2) wire mesh chrome baskets for versatile cooking. Engineered with a Robert Shaw® thermostat, it ensures precise temperature control up to 400°F, utilizing 136,000 BTUs for powerful performance. Its attractive design features a high polished stainless steel exterior and interior, complemented by chrome accents and adjustable stainless steel legs, making it both durable and aesthetically pleasing for any kitchen environment.</p>', '\n\n50 lb capacity oil tank for large-scale frying<br>\n\nRobert Shaw® thermostat for precise temperature control<br>\n\nPowerful 136,000 BTUs for quick heating<br>\n\nHigh polished stainless steel exterior and interior for durability and easy cleaning<br>\n\nAttractive design with chrome accents and adjustable stainless steel legs\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-F50-NG_ebad5fbc-fb6f-483d-8ea7-1465ad33215d.webp\"]', 'C-F50-NG', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 1471, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 16.00, NULL, 44.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 171.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:59', '2024-12-13 14:14:05', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-F50-NG_ebad5fbc-fb6f-483d-8ea7-1465ad33215d.webp', 'physical', '', 1127, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB155\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1848, 'Migali C-F40-LP 40 lb Liquid Propane Fryer', '\n<p>The Migali® C-F40-LP commercial liquid propane fryer is the ideal choice for restaurants aiming to serve delicious appetizers and entrees efficiently. Featuring a spacious 40 lb capacity oil tank, it comes equipped with (2) wire mesh chrome baskets for simultaneous frying. Engineered with premium components, including a Robert Shaw® thermostat, it ensures precise cooking temperatures up to 400°F with a powerful 90,000 BTUs. Its sleek design is both functional and attractive, showcasing a high polished stainless steel exterior and interior, complemented by chrome accents and adjustable stainless steel legs. The C-F40-LP fryer combines durability, performance, and aesthetic appeal seamlessly.</p>', '\n\n40 lb oil tank capacity for high-volume frying<br>\n\n(2) wire mesh chrome baskets for versatile cooking<br>\n\nRobert Shaw® thermostat for accurate temperature control up to 400°F<br>\n\nHigh polished stainless steel exterior and interior for durability and easy cleaning<br>\n\n90,000 BTUs ensure fast and efficient frying\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-F40-LP_7a316795-db8d-43de-b153-ba0bce887603.webp\"]', 'C-F40-LP', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 1213, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 16.00, NULL, 44.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 160.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:35:59', '2024-12-13 14:14:05', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-F40-LP_7a316795-db8d-43de-b153-ba0bce887603.webp', 'physical', '', 929, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB156\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1849, 'Migali C-F40-NG 40 lb Natural Gas Fryer', '\n<p>The Migali® C-F40-NG commercial natural gas fryer is an essential appliance for any kitchen focused on delivering crispy, delicious dishes swiftly. With a generous 40 lb capacity oil tank, it effortlessly handles a variety of appetizers and entrees. Equipped with (2) wire mesh chrome baskets, it ensures efficient frying operations. Precision is guaranteed with a Robert Shaw® thermostat, maintaining cooking temperatures up to 400°F with its robust 102,000 BTU output. Beyond functionality, its polished stainless steel exterior and interior, complemented by chrome accents and adjustable stainless steel legs, not only enhance durability but also elevate the aesthetic appeal of any culinary space.</p>', '\n\n40 lb capacity oil tank for large-scale frying<br>\n\nRobert Shaw® thermostat for precise temperature control up to 400°F<br>\n\nHigh polished stainless steel exterior and interior for durability and easy maintenance<br>\n\nIncludes (2) wire mesh chrome baskets for versatile frying options<br>\n\n102,000 BTU output ensures rapid heating and efficient frying\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-F40-NG_89f2a423-04b0-47f5-a291-b82d0f67c95a.webp\"]', 'C-F40-NG', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 1213, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 16.00, NULL, 44.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 160.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:36:00', '2024-12-13 14:14:05', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-F40-NG_89f2a423-04b0-47f5-a291-b82d0f67c95a.webp', 'physical', '', 929, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB157\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1850, 'Migali C-BB72G-HC Glass Door Back Bar 72” Wide Refrigerator', '\n<p>The Migali® C-BB72G-HC glass door back bar refrigerator is a great addition to any bar, restaurant or man cave. The all black exterior, stainless steel top and stainless steel interior provides a minimalist appearance that is both attractive and durable. The interior includes LED lightings for a bright attractive display. This series is engineered with a robust forced air refrigeration system for cold, uniform temperatures throughout the interior, keeping your beverages at an average temperature of 36°F. The C-BB72G-HC incorporates a digital controller and temperature read-out for improved temperature consistency, increased energy efficiencies and top-of-the-line performance. Lastly, this unit is built with a state-of-the-art, hydrocarbon refrigeration system which reduces energy consumption up to 40% (when compared to traditional freons 134a and 404a). This in turn saves you money on your monthly electric bill, greatly reduces your overall cost of ownership and finally helps fight climate change by drastically reducing the refrigerator’s carbon footprint.</p>', '\n\nAll-black exterior with stainless steel top and interior<br>\n\nLED lighting for attractive display<br>\n\nForced air refrigeration system for uniform cooling<br>\n\nDigital controller for precise temperature management<br>\n\nHydrocarbon refrigeration system for energy savings\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-BB72G-HC_fc87eb7e-2c08-42c8-80d9-fc5f6fba0df5.webp\"]', 'C-BB72G-HC', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 2688, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 73.00, NULL, 36.00, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 456.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:36:01', '2024-12-13 14:14:05', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-BB72G-HC_fc87eb7e-2c08-42c8-80d9-fc5f6fba0df5.webp', 'physical', '', 2059, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 