(1851, 'Migali C-BB60G-HC Glass Door Back Bar 60” Wide Refrigerator', '\n<p>The Migali® C-BB60G-HC glass door back bar refrigerator is an ideal choice for bars, restaurants, or personal spaces like man caves. Its sleek design features an all-black exterior complemented by a stainless steel top and interior, ensuring both style and durability. Inside, LED lighting illuminates beverages attractively. Engineered with a robust forced air refrigeration system, it maintains a consistent 36°F temperature, preserving beverages perfectly. A digital controller enhances temperature precision and energy efficiency, while the hydrocarbon refrigeration system reduces energy consumption by up to 40%, cutting costs and minimizing environmental impact. This refrigerator is a superior blend of performance, efficiency, and aesthetic appeal.</p>', '\n\nAll-black exterior with stainless steel top and interior<br>\n\nLED lighting for attractive display<br>\n\nForced air refrigeration system for uniform cooling<br>\n\nDigital controller for precise temperature management<br>\n\nHydrocarbon refrigeration system for energy savings\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-BB60G-HC_b63e933e-341e-4d17-b173-d7779876fc1e.webp\"]', 'C-BB60G-HC', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 2422, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 61.00, NULL, 36.00, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 421.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:36:03', '2024-12-13 14:14:05', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-BB60G-HC_b63e933e-341e-4d17-b173-d7779876fc1e.webp', 'physical', '', 1855, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB159\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
