(1863, 'Migali C-CB72-76-HC 76\" Wide Chef Base Refrigerator', '\n<p>The Migali® C-CB72 refrigerated chef base is created to enhance cooking efficiencies with its innovative features. It includes a refrigerated drawer section that can hold up to (24) 1/6th size pans, while the sturdy top supports up to 1,084 lbs of countertop cooking equipment. Engineered with a robust forced air refrigeration system, it ensures cold, uniform temperatures throughout the interior. The digital controller and temperature read-out enhance temperature consistency and energy efficiency. Additionally, the unit is visually appealing and ergonomic, featuring a high-polished stainless steel exterior and interior, along with recessed drawer handles to maximize workspace.</p>', '\n\nRefrigerated drawer section with storage for up to (24) 1/6th size pans<br>\n\nTop designed to hold up to 1,084 lbs of countertop cooking equipment<br>\n\nRobust forced air refrigeration system for uniform interior temperatures<br>\n\nDigital controller and temperature read-out for consistency and efficiency<br>\n\nHigh-polished stainless steel exterior and interior with recessed drawer handles\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-CB72-76-HC_1e0c3ede-4445-48a7-a314-693d34ee6487.webp\"]', 'C-CB72-76-HC', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 3570, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 76.00, NULL, 27.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 730.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:36:17', '2024-12-13 14:14:06', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-CB72-76-HC_1e0c3ede-4445-48a7-a314-693d34ee6487.webp', 'physical', '', 2735, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB171\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 