(1864, 'Migali C-CB72-HC 72\" Wide Chef Base Refrigerator', '\n<p>The Migali® C-CB72 refrigerated chef base is made to boost cooking efficiencies. It features a refrigerated drawer section that accommodates up to (24) 1/6th size pans and a top capable of supporting up to 1,084 lbs of cooking equipment. This model is built with a powerful forced air refrigeration system to ensure consistently cold temperatures throughout its interior. The C-CB72 is equipped with a digital controller and temperature read-out for enhanced temperature accuracy, energy efficiency, and superior performance. Additionally, its high polished stainless steel exterior and interior, along with recessed drawer handles, provide both an attractive and ergonomic design.</p>', '\n\nRefrigerated drawer section holds up to (24) 1/6th size pans.<br>\n\nTop surface supports up to 1,084 lbs of cooking equipment.<br>\n\nRobust forced air refrigeration system ensures uniform cold temperatures.<br>\n\nDigital controller and temperature read-out for improved accuracy and energy efficiency.<br>\n\nHigh polished stainless steel exterior and interior with recessed drawer handles for maximum work space.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-CB72-HC_b8eeadd4-dde5-4682-b4c2-eefba9662cb7.webp\"]', 'C-CB72-HC', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 3533, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 72.00, NULL, 27.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 708.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:36:17', '2024-12-13 14:14:06', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-CB72-HC_b8eeadd4-dde5-4682-b4c2-eefba9662cb7.webp', 'physical', '', 2707, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB172\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 