(1867, 'Migali C-CB48-HC 48\" Wide Chef Base Refrigerator', '\n<p>The Migali® C-CB48 refrigerated chef base is crafted to boost cooking efficiency. It features a refrigerated drawer section capable of holding up to fifteen 1/6th size pans, while its top can support up to 717 lbs of countertop cooking equipment. Engineered with a robust forced air refrigeration system, it ensures cold, uniform temperatures throughout the interior. The C-CB48 also includes a digital controller and temperature read-out, enhancing temperature consistency and energy efficiency. Additionally, this unit is visually appealing and ergonomic, with a high polished stainless steel exterior and interior, and recessed drawer handles to maximize workspace.</p>', '\n\nHolds up to fifteen 1/6th size pans in refrigerated drawer section.<br>\n\nSupports up to 717 lbs of countertop cooking equipment.<br>\n\nRobust forced air refrigeration system for uniform temperatures.<br>\n\nDigital controller and temperature read-out for improved consistency and energy efficiency.<br>\n\nHigh polished stainless steel exterior and interior with recessed drawer handles for maximum workspace.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-CB48-HC_e974f148-0f6a-455d-b2a1-b4c51fa869e1.webp\"]', 'C-CB48-HC', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 2386, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48.00, NULL, 27.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 472.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:36:20', '2024-12-13 14:14:07', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-CB48-HC_e974f148-0f6a-455d-b2a1-b4c51fa869e1.webp', 'physical', '', 1828, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB175\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1868, 'Migali C-CB36-HC 36\" Wide Chef Base Refrigerator', '\n<p>The Migali® C-CB36 refrigerated chef base is crafted to boost cooking efficiency with its versatile and robust features. It includes a refrigerated drawer section that holds up to six 1/6th size pans, while the top supports up to 717 lbs of countertop cooking equipment. Equipped with a powerful forced air refrigeration system, it maintains cold, uniform temperatures throughout the interior. The digital controller and temperature read-out offer enhanced temperature consistency and energy efficiency. Combining functionality with aesthetics, this chef base features a high-polished stainless steel exterior and interior, along with recessed drawer handles for optimal workspace efficiency.</p>', '\n\nAccommodates up to six 1/6th size pans in the refrigerated drawer section.<br>\n\nSupports up to 717 lbs of countertop cooking equipment.<br>\n\nPowerful forced air refrigeration system ensures cold, uniform temperatures.<br>\n\nDigital controller and temperature read-out enhance temperature consistency and energy efficiency.<br>\n\nHigh-polished stainless steel exterior and interior with recessed drawer handles for maximum workspace efficiency.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-CB36-HC_5309c261-8d3f-43cd-ad4e-2bbd627a9ef4.webp\"]', 'C-CB36-HC', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 2123, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36.00, NULL, 27.00, NULL, 33.00, NULL, 400.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:36:21', '2024-12-13 14:14:07', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-CB36-HC_5309c261-8d3f-43cd-ad4e-2bbd627a9ef4.webp', 'physical', '', 1626, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB176\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL