(1869, 'Migali C-PP93-HC 93” Triple Door Pizza Prep Refrigerator', '\n<p>The Migali® C-PP93 pizza prep table excels in both storage and preparation of pizza and sandwich ingredients. Featuring a robust forced air refrigeration system, it ensures consistent, cold temperatures across the cabinet and beneath the pan rail. A digital controller enhances temperature management, optimizing energy efficiency and overall performance. Its sleek design combines high-polished stainless steel inside and out, complemented by rounded door edges and a recessed handle for ergonomic ease. The spacious 26 cu/ft interior includes three adjustable shelves as standard, with the flexibility to accommodate an optional bun rack for 18? x 26? sheet pans or 12? x 20? hotel pans.</p>', '\n\nTrusted forced air refrigeration system for uniform temperature distribution.<br>\n\nDigital controller and temperature read-out for precise temperature control.<br>\n\nHigh polished stainless steel exterior and interior for durability and aesthetic appeal.<br>\n\nSpacious 26 cu/ft interior with three adjustable shelves.<br>\n\nOptional bun rack compatibility for increased versatility in food storage.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-PP93-HC_61b35313-88a3-4f1b-836f-f0c91d1c1809.webp\"]', 'C-PP93-HC', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 4254, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 93.00, NULL, 42.00, NULL, 33.00, NULL, 503.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:36:22', '2024-12-13 14:14:07', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-PP93-HC_61b35313-88a3-4f1b-836f-f0c91d1c1809.webp', 'physical', '', 3259, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB177\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1870, 'Migali C-PP67-HC 67” Double Door Pizza Prep Refrigerator', '\n<p>The Migali® C-PP67 pizza prep table excels in efficiently storing and preparing pizza and sandwich ingredients. Its robust forced air refrigeration system guarantees uniform cold temperatures throughout, including under the pan rail. Enhanced by a digital controller, it optimizes temperature management for increased energy efficiency and superior performance. The unit\'s design is characterized by a sleek high polished stainless steel exterior and interior, complemented by rounded door edges and a recessed handle for modern aesthetics and ergonomic convenience. Boasting a spacious 20 cu/ft interior, it features 2 adjustable shelves and accommodates optional bun racks, catering to diverse storage needs for sheet pans or hotel pans.</p>', '\n\nReliable forced air refrigeration system for uniform cooling<br>\n\nDigital controller for precise temperature regulation<br>\n\nHigh polished stainless steel exterior and interior<br>\n\nSpacious 20 cu/ft interior with adjustable shelves<br>\n\nErgonomic design with rounded door edges and recessed handle\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-PP67-HC_30658bf4-9bc9-4600-85a4-f3334714f35d.webp\"]', 'C-PP67-HC', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 3506, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 67.00, NULL, 42.00, NULL, 33.00, NULL, 385.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:36:23', '2024-12-13 14:14:07', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-PP67-HC_30658bf4-9bc9-4600-85a4-f3334714f35d.webp', 'physical', '', 2686, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB178\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1871, 'Migali C-PP44-HC 44” Single Door Pizza Prep Refrigerator', '\n<p>The Migali® C-PP44 pizza prep table is a versatile solution tailored for storing and preparing pizza and sandwich ingredients efficiently. Featuring a robust forced air refrigeration system, it ensures consistent cold temperatures both inside the cabinet and beneath the pan rail. This model is equipped with a digital controller and temperature read-out for precise temperature management, enhancing energy efficiency and overall performance. Its exterior and interior boast a sleek, high-polished stainless steel finish, complemented by rounded door edges and a recessed handle for ergonomic appeal. The 14 cu/ft interior offers ample space, complete with one adjustable shelf and optional compatibility for bun racks.</p>', '\n\nRobust forced air refrigeration system for uniform cold temperatures<br>\n\nDigital controller with temperature read-out for precise control<br>\n\nHigh-polished stainless steel exterior and interior for durability and aesthetics<br>\n\nErgonomic design with rounded door edges and recessed handle<br>\n\nSpacious 14 cu/ft interior with adjustable shelf and optional bun rack compatibility\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-PP44-HC_2559beca-52e7-46ec-80a0-5d904334b245.webp\"]', 'C-PP44-HC', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 2507, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 44.00, NULL, 42.00, NULL, 33.00, NULL, 352.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:36:24', '2024-12-13 14:14:07', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-PP44-HC_2559beca-52e7-46ec-80a0-5d904334b245.webp', 'physical', '', 1921, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB179\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1872, 'Migali C-SP72-30BT-HC Thirty pans 72” Wide Big Top Sandwich Prep Table Refrigerator', '\n<p>The Migali® C-SP72-30BT “Big Top” sandwich prep table is the ultimate solution for efficiently storing and preparing sandwich and salad ingredients. Designed with ample space on the pan rail, it accommodates a variety of pan configurations, enhancing productivity in busy kitchens. Its robust forced air refrigeration system ensures consistent cold temperatures both inside the cabinet and along the pan rail, preserving food freshness. Equipped with a digital controller and temperature read-out, it offers precise temperature management, optimizing energy efficiency and performance. Beyond functionality, it boasts a sleek, polished stainless steel exterior, ergonomic features like rounded door edges and recessed handles, ensuring durability and user comfort.</p>', '\n\nAmple pan rail space for increased pan capacity and configuration flexibility.<br>\n\nRobust forced air refrigeration system for uniform cooling throughout.<br>\n\nDigital controller with temperature read-out for precise temperature management.<br>\n\nHigh polished stainless steel exterior and interior for durability and cleanliness.<br>\n\nErgonomic design with rounded door edges, insulated roll cover, and recessed handles for user comfort.\n', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-SP72-30BT-HC_667e765e-0a23-4a19-8f0e-70d86c64236c.webp\"]', 'C-SP72-30BT-HC', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 3382, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 73.00, NULL, 47.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 374.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:36:26', '2024-12-13 14:14:07', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-SP72-30BT-HC_667e765e-0a23-4a19-8f0e-70d86c64236c.webp', 'physical', '', 2591, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NUL