(1886, 'Migali C-U60R-HC Under-Counter/ Work Top 60” Wide Refrigerator', '\n<p>The Migali® C-U60R under-counter/work top refrigerator is the ideal solution for compact commercial kitchens, offering versatile food storage capabilities. Featuring a robust forced air refrigeration system, it ensures consistent cold temperatures across its interior, crucial for preserving food freshness. The refrigerator is equipped with a digital controller and temperature read-out, enabling precise temperature management and enhancing energy efficiency. Crafted with a high-polished stainless steel exterior and interior, rounded door edges, and recessed handles, the C-U60R combines durability with sleek aesthetics. Migali® also provides an optional stainless steel backsplash for customizable worktop configurations, allowing for easy installation and added workspace functionality.</p>', '\n\nRobust forced air refrigeration system for uniform temperature distribution<br>\n\nDigital controller with temperature read-out for precise temperature management<br>\n\nHigh polished stainless steel exterior and interior for durability and hygiene<br>\n\nRounded door edges and recessed door handles for ergonomic design<br>\n\nOptional stainless steel backsplash for customizable worktop configurations\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-U60R-HC_177d2405-28e1-4f4b-8f2d-5c21862e0f10.webp\"]', 'C-U60R-HC', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 2571, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 60.00, NULL, 37.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 266.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:36:40', '2024-12-30 07:49:52', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-U60R-HC_177d2405-28e1-4f4b-8f2d-5c21862e0f10.webp', 'physical', '', 1969, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},