(1887, 'Migali C-U48R-HC Under-Counter/ Work Top 48” Wide Refrigerator', '\n<p>The Migali® C-U48R under-counter/work top refrigerator offers optimal storage solutions for commercial kitchens with limited space. It features a robust forced air refrigeration system ensuring consistent cold temperatures throughout its interior. Equipped with a digital controller and temperature read-out, it provides precise temperature management, energy efficiency, and high performance. The unit combines functionality with aesthetics, boasting a sleek high-polished stainless steel exterior and interior, rounded door edges, and recessed handles for ergonomic use. Additionally, Migali® offers an optional stainless steel backsplash for worktop configurations, enhancing both functionality and design flexibility.</p>', '\n\nReliable forced air refrigeration system ensures even temperatures<br>\n\nPrecision control via digital controller with temperature read-out<br>\n\nDurable and visually appealing high-polished stainless steel construction<br>\n\nErgonomic features include rounded door edges and recessed handles<br>\n\nCustomizable configurations with optional stainless steel backsplash\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-U48R-HC_c8015f99-8c1f-45aa-b639-8c216d48d0db.webp\"]', 'C-U48R-HC', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 1935, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48.00, NULL, 37.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 236.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:36:41', '2024-12-30 07:49:52', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-U48R-HC_c8015f99-8c1f-45aa-b639-8c216d48d0db.webp', 'physical', '', 1482, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB195\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', ''