(1888, 'Migali C-U27R-HC Under-Counter/ Work Top 27” Wide Refrigerator', '\n<p>The Migali® C-U27R under-counter/work top refrigerator is an ideal solution for compact commercial kitchens, offering efficient food storage. Featuring a robust forced air refrigeration system, it ensures consistent cold temperatures throughout its interior. Equipped with a digital controller and temperature read-out, it allows precise temperature management, enhancing energy efficiency and overall performance. Its sleek design combines functionality with style, featuring a high polished stainless steel exterior and interior, along with rounded door edges and a recessed door handle for ergonomic convenience. Additionally, Migali® offers an optional stainless steel backsplash for customizable worktop configurations, providing flexibility and easy installation in any kitchen setup.</p>', '\n\nStrong forced air refrigeration system for uniform temperatures<br>\n\nDigital controller with temperature read-out for precise control<br>\n\nHigh polished stainless steel exterior and interior for durability and aesthetics<br>\n\nErgonomic design with rounded door edges and recessed handle<br>\n\nOptional stainless steel backsplash for customizable configurations\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-U27R-HC_9cbb98da-582e-4141-98e2-f00e9adcc157.webp\"]', 'C-U27R-HC', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 1479, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 37.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 164.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:36:42', '2024-12-30 07:49:52', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-U27R-HC_9cbb98da-582e-4141-98e2-f00e9adcc157.webp', 'physical', '', 1133, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\"