(1889, 'Migali C-72FM-HC Triple Glass Door Merchandiser 72 cu/ft Freezers', '\n<p>The Migali® C-72FM-HC hinged glass door freezer combines optimal functionality with sleek design, catering perfectly to retail and display requirements. Featuring a robust forced air refrigeration system, it ensures consistent cold temperatures throughout the interior, ideal for preserving product quality. The digital controller and temperature read-out enhance precision in temperature management, promoting energy efficiency and superior operational performance. Its attractive appearance includes a bright white exterior with stylish black trimming, complemented by a gray and white lighted sign that catches the eye. Interior visibility is enhanced by energy-efficient LED lighting, illuminating 72 cu/ft of space that includes 12 adjustable shelves for versatile display options.</p>', '\n\nRobust forced air refrigeration system for uniform cooling<br>\n\nDigital controller with temperature read-out for precise control<br>\n\nEye-catching design with white exterior and black trim<br>\n\nEnergy-saving LED lighting for enhanced visibility<br>\n\nSpacious 72 cu/ft interior with 12 adjustable shelves\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-72FM-HC_98259e78-adea-4865-bfad-d112e378dcfb.webp\"]', 'C-72FM-HC', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 5991, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 82.00, NULL, 83.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 755.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:36:43', '2024-12-30 07:49:52', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-72FM-HC_98259e78-adea-4865-bfad-d112e378dcfb.webp', 'physical', '', 4590, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB197\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', ''