(1903, 'Migali 4C-2FB-HC Bottom Mount Reach-In Double Door 9 cu/ft Freezer', '\n<p>This 72 cu/ft reach-in freezer from Migali Industries® offers impressive features tailored for commercial kitchens. Featuring a spacious interior with (9) adjustable, epoxy-coated wire shelves, it ensures flexibility and organization. The unit boasts a sleek stainless steel exterior and interior, complemented by rounded corners for easy cleaning and a professional look. A digital temperature controller and read-out provide precise temperature management, supported by a forced air refrigeration system for consistent cooling. With a bottom mount compressor ideal for hot environments, it includes a variable fan system for energy efficiency and humidity control. Additional highlights include self-closing doors with a 90° hold-open feature, door locks, and pre-installed casters for mobility.</p>', '\n\nA generous 72 cubic feet of storage space<br>\n\n(9) adjustable epoxy coated wire shelves<br>\n\nDigital temperature controller with read-out<br>\n\nStainless steel exterior and interior<br>\n\nBottom mount compressor\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-2FB-HC_034c4186-080e-4ed4-9095-325c7bd1d528.webp\"]', 'C-2FB-HC', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 3594, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 54.00, NULL, 83.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 425.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:00', '2024-12-30 07:49:52', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-2FB-HC_034c4186-080e-4ed4-9095-325c7bd1d528.webp', 'physical', '', 2908, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB211\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
