(1907, 'Migali C-2R-HC Top Mount Reach-In Double Door 49 cu/ft Refrigerator', '<p>The Migali® C-2R reach-in refrigerator excels at storing diverse food items in commercial kitchens. It features a robust forced air refrigeration system ensuring consistent cold temperatures across the cabinet. Enhanced by a digital controller and temperature read-out, it offers precise temperature management, energy efficiency, and high performance. The C-1R variant is equally impressive with its polished stainless steel exterior and interior, complemented by rounded door edges and recessed handles for ergonomic appeal. Inside, the spacious 49 cu/ft interior includes six adjustable shelves as standard, accommodating various storage needs. Additionally, it can be equipped with an optional bun rack suitable for 18?x 26? sheet pans or 12? by 20? hotel pans.</p>', '<p>Robust forced air refrigeration system for uniform cooling.<br>Digital controller and temperature read-out for precise control and efficiency.<br>Polished stainless steel exterior and interior for durability and aesthetics.<br>Spacious 49 cu/ft interior with six adjustable shelves.<br>Optional bun rack fits 18?x 26? sheet pans or 12\" by 20\" hotel pans.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-2R-HC_bfb00573-3da5-422e-a393-548814840e3e.webp\"]', 'C-2R-HC', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 3381, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 52.00, NULL, 83.00, NULL, 33.00, NULL, 420.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:05', '2024-12-30 07:49:52', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-2R-HC_bfb00573-3da5-422e-a393-548814840e3e.webp', 'physical', NULL, 2590, 4, 0, 22, 0, '<p>Five Years Compressor Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/TVmOzzorFgnJ6UllhRXb8qogregyQD1qzjrSIwme.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.0