(1908, 'Migali C-1R-LHH-HC Top Mount Reach-In Single Door 23 cu/ft Refrigerator with left hand hinge', '\n<p>The Migali® C-1R reach-in refrigerator is perfect for storing various foods in a commercial kitchen. The series features a robust forced air refrigeration system, ensuring cold and uniform temperatures throughout the cabinet. A digital controller and temperature read-out provide precise temperature control, increased energy efficiency, and exceptional performance. The C-1R is both visually appealing and ergonomic, featuring a high polished stainless steel exterior and interior, rounded door edges, and a recessed door handle. The 23 cu/ft interior is spacious with three adjustable shelves and accommodates optional bun racks for different pan sizes.</p>', '\n\nDurable forced air refrigeration system for uniform temperatures<br>\n\nDigital controller and temperature read-out for precise control<br>\n\nHigh polished stainless steel exterior and interior<br>\n\nSpacious 23 cu/ft interior with three adjustable shelves<br>\n\nErgonomic design with rounded door edges and recessed door handle\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-1R-LHH-HC_33e7734d-1f98-4af1-9d9d-7afd76919a8b.webp\"]', 'C-1R-LHH-HC', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 2184, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 83.00, NULL, 33.00, NULL, 284.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:06', '2024-12-30 07:49:52', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-1R-LHH-HC_33e7734d-1f98-4af1-9d9d-7afd76919a8b.webp', 'physical', '', 1673, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB216\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1909, 'Migali C-1R-HC Top Mount Reach-In Single Door 23 cu/ft Refrigerator', '\n<p>The Migali® C-1R reach-in refrigerator is ideal for commercial kitchens, offering reliable food storage with a robust forced air refrigeration system ensuring uniform temperatures throughout its interior. Featuring a digital controller and temperature read-out, it provides precise temperature control and improved energy efficiency. The C-1R combines functionality with aesthetics, showcasing a polished stainless steel exterior and interior, rounded door edges, and a recessed door handle. Its 23 cu/ft interior is spacious, equipped with three adjustable shelves, and accommodates an optional bun rack for various pan sizes, making it versatile for different kitchen needs.</p>', '\n\nEfficient forced air refrigeration system for uniform temperatures.<br>\n\nDigital controller and temperature read-out for precise control and energy efficiency.<br>\n\nPolished stainless steel exterior and interior with rounded door edges and recessed handle.<br>\n\n23 cu/ft interior with three adjustable shelves.<br>\n\nOptional bun rack for 18\"x 26\" sheet pans or 12\" x 20\" hotel pans.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-1R-HC_975d3161-bd22-4396-bc78-97547db42ea6.webp\"]', 'C-1R-HC', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 2184, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 83.00, NULL, 33.00, NULL, 284.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:06', '2024-12-30 07:49:52', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-1R-HC_975d3161-bd22-4396-bc78-97547db42ea6.webp', 'physical', '', 1673, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB217\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '