(1910, 'Migali C-3F-HC Top Mount Reach-In Triple Door 72 cu/ft Freezer', '\n<p>The Migali® C-3F-HC reach-in freezer is designed for storing various types of food in a commercial kitchen. Its reach-in series features a robust forced air refrigeration system that ensures cold, uniform temperatures throughout the cabinet\'s interior. This model includes a digital controller and temperature read-out, providing superior temperature control, energy efficiency, and top-tier performance. The C-3F-HC is not only functional but also stylish and ergonomic, with a high-polish stainless steel exterior and interior, rounded door edges, and recessed door handles. Its spacious 72 cu/ft interior comes with 9 adjustable shelves and can accommodate an optional bun rack for 18?x 26? sheet pans or 12? by 20? hotel pans.</p>', '\n\nDurable forced air refrigeration system for uniform temperatures.<br>\n\nDigital controller and temperature read-out for efficient control.<br>\n\nHigh polished stainless steel exterior and interior.<br>\n\n72 cu/ft interior with 9 adjustable shelves.<br>\n\nOptional bun rack for 18?x 26? sheet pans or 12? by 20? hotel pans.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-3F-HC_92495b24-28c1-4232-89ef-e37095adec63.webp\"]', 'C-3F-HC', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 5427, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 78.00, NULL, 83.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 621.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:08', '2024-12-30 07:49:52', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-3F-HC_92495b24-28c1-4232-89ef-e37095adec63.webp', 'physical', '', 4157, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB218\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1911, 'Migali C-2F-HC Top Mount Reach-In Double Door 49 cu/ft Freezer', '\n<p>The Migali® C-2F reach-in freezer is ideal for storing various food items in a commercial kitchen. Its durable forced air refrigeration system ensures cold, uniform temperatures throughout the cabinet. The model features a digital controller and temperature read-out for precise temperature control, enhanced energy efficiency, and superior performance. Its high-polished stainless steel exterior and interior, rounded door edges, and recessed door handles make it both visually appealing and ergonomic. The 49 cu/ft interior is spacious with six adjustable shelves and can accommodate an optional bun rack for 18?x 26? sheet pans or 12\" by 20\" hotel pans.</p>', '\n\nRobust forced air refrigeration system for uniform temperatures.<br>\n\nDigital controller and temperature read-out for precise control and efficiency.<br>\n\nHigh-polished stainless steel exterior and interior for aesthetics and durability.<br>\n\nErgonomic design with rounded door edges and recessed door handles.<br>\n\nSpacious 49 cu/ft interior with six adjustable shelves and optional bun rack compatibility.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C-2F-HC_0c340790-a2b9-43f3-b7dd-a66138b29b60.webp\"]', 'C-2F-HC', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 30, 0, 0, 3797, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 52.00, NULL, 83.00, NULL, 33.00, NULL, 425.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:09', '2024-12-30 07:49:52', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C-2F-HC_0c340790-a2b9-43f3-b7dd-a66138b29b60.webp', 'physical', '', 2908, 4, 0, 22, 0, 'Five Years Compressor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB219\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '')