(1914, 'American Dish ADC-44-T L-R Dish Machine 44\" Stainless Steel Final Rinse Jets High-Temp Conveyor Tall Hood', '<p>The ADC-44 comes standard with a comprehensive array of features, setting it apart from other dishwashers on the market. While competitors may offer similar functionalities as optional add-ons, our machine is fully equipped and ready for operation straight out of the box. With a capacity of 244 racks per hour and the ability to operate only when racks are inserted, it ensures efficient utilization of resources and energy. Its unmatched cleaning ability, facilitated by a dual rinsing system and precise water control mechanism, guarantees optimal cleanliness and hygiene for all dishes. Furthermore, the ADC-44 boasts user-friendly features such as an auto-fill function, energy-saving stage washer, and quiet operation, enhancing convenience and reducing operational costs. Its robust construction, including heavy stainless steel components and a fail-safe conveyor system, ensures durability and reliability in demanding kitchen environments. With advanced safety features like wide-opening access doors with safety interlocks and a slip clutch design for rack movement, it prioritizes both performance and user safety. Additionally, its compatibility with different power supplies and thorough sanitation options make it a versatile and practical choice for commercial kitchens.</p>', '<p>High-Temperature Conveyor: The ADC-44-T features a high-temp conveyor system, ensuring efficient cleaning and sanitization of dishes with hot water. Tall Hood Design: With its tall hood, this dishwasher accommodates larger items such as sheet pans and pots, making it versatile for various kitchen needs. Stainless Steel Final Rinse Jets: Equipped with stainless steel final rinse jets, the dishwasher ensures thorough rinsing for sparkling clean dishes. Advanced Cleaning Technology: The ADC-44-T utilizes advanced cleaning technology, including a dual rinsing system and precise water control mechanism, ensuring optimal cleaning performance. Durable Construction: Constructed with heavy-duty stainless steel, this dishwasher is built to withstand the rigors of commercial kitchen environments, ensuring long-lasting durability and reliability.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/215-0044.0000.webp\"]', '215-0044.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 26235.66, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 64.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 760.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:12', '2024-12-30 07:49:52', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/215-0044.0000.webp', 'physical', NULL, 20658, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/4AV0va465WW55GK0sV7XNEO6Rcp3ZnFQs2cT1j3X.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/FS0LvLaNAT3gRIV6X3fbHe11YCxLIwqt4jDfSIpa.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/K3tkYTxA5jmh2qzpcThK8mu4G6WhBeeO9pupV54c.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/rZjp9s911YlJKqx0zTo3wrP4pqXG4S8bx7iVoCuT.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB222\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1915, 'American Dish HT-25 4 Wire Single Rack Upright Dish Machine, 3-Door Up, 3 HP', '<p>The HT-25 4 Wire Single Rack Upright Dish Machine is a high-temperature dishwashing solution designed for commercial kitchens with demanding cleaning needs. With its 3-door setup configured as a pass-thru, this machine offers seamless integration into kitchen workflows, allowing for efficient loading and unloading of racks. Equipped with a built-in booster heater, it ensures that water reaches the high temperatures necessary for effective sanitization, meeting sanitation standards and ensuring dishes come out clean and sanitized. Featuring a robust 4-wire configuration, this dishwasher is built for reliability and performance. Its high-temp design, coupled with the powerful wash pump, guarantees thorough cleaning of tough residues and grease, leaving dishes sparkling clean. The inclusion of three doors configured as a pass-thru enhances accessibility and streamlines dish flow, making it ideal for high-volume operations where speed and efficiency are paramount. Additionally, with its built-in booster, this dishwasher is versatile and adaptable to various kitchen setups, providing flexibility and convenience to meet the diverse needs of commercial kitchens.</p>', '<p>Equipped with a 60-second time cycle, allowing for rapid dishwashing cycles to meet the demands of busy commercial kitchens. Patented self-cleaning spray system ensures optimal performance and reduces maintenance requirements, enhancing efficiency and reliability. Auto-fill and auto-shut off features come as standard equipment, offering convenience and ensuring consistent water levels for effective cleaning. Two-stage stainless steel drain filter eliminates clogged pumps, enhancing reliability and reducing downtime for maintenance. Powerful 3 HP wash pump scrubs away tough residues, providing thorough cleaning while conserving water with low usage of only 0.85 gallons per rack.</p>', 'published', '[]', '311-0080.0970', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 15581.44, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 37.00, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 460.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:13', '2024-12-30 07:49:52', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/311-0080.0970_81741184-1cf1-4fa9-8cf7-eab5ed832dc1.webp', 'physical', NULL, 12268.85, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/GVC2PhfdX6Axz4UvqgWpXIxGU0xVqqsHRocn79Pf.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3ElYRbQzTfXW6O9eNrY6U8CkrxKp52Sr7zNcbST9.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/qb89MOb5Jy7w10k4CDADUccXBkLrATwha2XyKcTw.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/V7FSiF6ZN1j0AReuWuEm4pNuZW4DhMsRpqTGMBlo.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/8Ls2ls3ZZQf5MThh4Qoxttp7exd8BOuquQoAIcWv.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB223\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1916, 'American Dish HT-25 4 Wire Single Rack Upright Dish Machine, 3-Door Up, No Booster', '<p>The HT-25 dishwasher boasts an efficient 60-second time cycle, making it ideal for busy commercial kitchens where speed and productivity are paramount. Its patented self-cleaning spray system ensures optimal performance with minimal maintenance required, enhancing the longevity of the machine and reducing downtime. Equipped with auto-fill and auto-shut off features as standard, this dishwasher offers convenience and ease of operation, allowing users to focus on other tasks while ensuring consistent water levels for effective cleaning. With a powerful 3 HP wash pump and ADS patented low-water protection, the HT-25 delivers exceptional cleaning performance while conserving water. Its innovative two-stage stainless steel drain filter prevents pump clogs, further enhancing reliability and reducing the need for maintenance. The dishwasher\'s versatile door design allows for installation in both corner and straight configurations without the need for conversion, providing flexibility to suit various kitchen layouts. Additionally, the option for a stainless steel built-on booster ensures compatibility with high-temperature washing requirements, making it a versatile solution for diverse dishwashing needs in commercial settings.</p>', '<p>The American Dish HT-25 4 Wire Single Rack Upright Dish Machine is engineered to deliver high-temperature cleaning, ensuring thorough removal of tough stains and grease from dishes, utensils, and kitchenware. Featuring a versatile three-door configuration set as a pass-thru unit, this dishwasher facilitates seamless workflow in busy kitchen environments. With a single rack capacity, the HT-25 efficiently processes one rack of dishes at a time, ensuring focused and effective cleaning. The HT-25 is designed to operate without the need for a booster heater, streamlining installation and reducing energy consumption. Built with durability in mind, the HT-25 is constructed with high-quality materials to withstand the demands of heavy-duty use in commercial kitchens. Its sturdy construction ensures longevity and reliability, providing consistent performance over time.</p>', 'published', '[]', '311-0080.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 11012.55, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 37.00, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 528.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:14', '2024-12-30 07:49:52', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/311-0080.0000_a2df1ae2-5d7b-4907-af2e-6f0769a11cca.webp', 'physical', NULL, 8671.3, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/D8iY6yhjM4yRb5XeDQ8L3L5Trnc8rPYkA7KmrYnK.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/yciqKYU3z7XB9EaS2UIJL6Ir9rvFp925hyFi6gZH.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/OCzPOzNWUDfOfFEr7l1l3vLGG7N0ojmNRUsjHKOE.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/WZmwyfZqpMlyavgrUbdHWVIJfpMu1M84EZjo2oeT.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB224\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1917, 'American Dish HUB-40 Undercounter High Temp Dish Machine With Booster', '<p>The ENERGY STAR Qualified American Dish HUB-40 offers several advanced features to enhance efficiency and performance in commercial dishwashing operations. One notable feature is the \"Extenda-Cycle\" function, which extends the cycle time to ensure a final rinse temperature of 180F (82C), meeting rigorous sanitization standards. With universal power compatibility ranging from 208 to 240 volts and the ability to convert between single and three-phase power in the field, the HUB-40 provides flexibility in installation. Its smooth start feature helps protect fragile dishes from breakage, while the built-in booster ensures a high-temperature final rinse, with standard rise from 70F to 180F (39C to 82C). The machine is equipped with detergent and rinse aid pumps, along with priming switches for easy operation, and its noise-reducing double-wall design ensures a quieter working environment. In terms of specifications, the HUB-40 has a cycle time of 90 seconds, with a wash time of 70 seconds and a rinse time of 14 seconds, enabling it to wash up to 40 racks per hour. It features a 1 HP motor with pump drain, providing efficient and reliable performance. The machine\'s heating system includes tank heat electrically powered at 2.0 kW and an electric booster, with options for 6 kW or 9 kW depending on the desired rise in temperature. With a standard rack complement of 20\" x 20\", the HUB-40 accommodates various dish sizes and configurations, making it suitable for a wide range of commercial kitchen settings. Additionally, its ease of installation and operation, along with its energy-efficient design, make it a practical and cost-effective solution for foodservice establishments.</p>', '<p>The American Dish HUB-40 is designed for high-temperature dishwashing, ensuring thorough sanitation and effective removal of grease and grime from dishes, utensils, and glassware. With its compact undercounter design, the HUB-40 maximizes space efficiency in commercial kitchens, allowing for convenient placement beneath countertops while providing easy access for loading and unloading. Equipped with a built-in booster heater, this dish machine ensures that water reaches the required high temperatures for effective sanitization, making it suitable for meeting health and safety standards in food service establishments. Durable Construction: Constructed with durable materials, the HUB-40 is built to withstand the rigors of daily use in busy kitchen environments, providing reliable performance and longevity. The HUB-40 is designed for efficient operation, helping to streamline dishwashing processes and reduce labor costs while delivering consistently clean and sanitized dishes.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/411-1040_f399b45f-5768-40b4-ad51-02cdf8cccac6.webp\"]', '411-1040', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 7907.02, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 215.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:15', '2024-12-30 07:49:52', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/411-1040_f399b45f-5768-40b4-ad51-02cdf8cccac6.webp', 'physical', NULL, 6226, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/OetzSF6Si7wYCWoEIYtk0O3W3xl20luvilsSeuSK.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/89NgSB9gSkfjA0dUMkfrvaxSciXC4lDIO0J8IdUv.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/M4DSkgNFh7eYZuZX7RjnlmjiLeAWoQuHvX2iYzJD.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB225\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1918, 'American Dish ADC-66-T L-R High-Temp Dish Machine 66\" Tall Hood Conveyor', '<p>The ADC 66 Tall conveyor dishwasher offers reliable pre-wash capabilities and unmatched cleaning performance, making it stand out as the top-performing option among all listed 66-inch conveyors. It is designed to handle dual sanitizing processes efficiently while using 66% less water than the industry average, achieving an impressive rate of 244 racks per hour with just 0.49 gallons of water per rack. Equipped with standard features such as autofill and shut-off, this dishwasher ensures convenient operation while maintaining high standards of cleanliness. Its tall model configuration enables easy washing of sheet pans, while safety features like the door safety switch enhance operational safety. With advanced engineering and fail-safe mechanisms, the ADC 66 Tall conveyor dishwasher ensures uninterrupted operation and minimal downtime. The dual-fail-safe heater control system and precise water control mechanism optimize energy efficiency and prevent damage caused by heavy soil, water action, chemicals, or lime build-up. Additionally, the dishwasher features a pre-wash scrap basket with a V-shaped construction, effectively keeping soil contained and protecting the pump. The drain pump filter with a two-stage pump strainer prevents wash pump obstructions and clogged jets, ensuring smooth operation and consistent cleaning performance. However, proper installation and maintenance are essential, as leaks can lead to potential electrical and mechanical issues under the machine. It\'s recommended that all connections be made by qualified service personnel in compliance with relevant health, electrical, plumbing, and safety codes</p>', '<p>The ADC-66-T L-R features a tall hood conveyor design, offering ample space for washing taller items and accommodating larger loads efficiently. This dishwasher operates at high temperatures, ensuring thorough cleaning and effective sanitization of dishes, utensils, and kitchenware. Equipped with a hood conveyor system, it facilitates smooth and continuous operation, allowing dishes to move seamlessly through the washing process. Built to withstand the rigors of commercial kitchen environments, this dishwasher features sturdy construction for long-lasting durability and reliable performance. The ADC-66-T L-R is suitable for various food service establishments, including restaurants, hotels, cafeterias, and catering businesses, providing a versatile solution for dishwashing needs</p>', 'published', '[]', '217-0066.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 33836.04, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 86.00, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 35.00, NULL, 960.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:16', '2024-12-30 07:49:52', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/217-0066.0000_5d41706a-054b-4dfb-a700-c4b342b4d5c1.webp', 'physical', NULL, 26642.55, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/7fnnq9p1S7f5BwFb7bkGcv4oGl2Y0xR7hGARLTN9.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/vZHBKOi9JVfQfh33djiicTL2HJsyuK0lOV0QJVtC.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/7L5wBKq4NN8V09IltZ3JwHbmPg5D5Pqh0xtZ0HSU.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/w0GwUUwdoNA80N48p56I2YgfT04xSuiT15wrH6ZP.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB226\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1919, 'American Dish ADC-66-T R-L 66\" Low-Temp Dish Machine Tall Hood Conveyor', '<p>The ADC 66 Tall conveyor dishwasher showcases exceptional reliability and cleaning prowess, distinguishing itself as the top performer among all listed 66-inch conveyors. With a rating for dual sanitizing and utilizing 66% less water than the industry average, it processes up to 244 racks per hour while consuming just 0.49 gallons of water per rack. Its autofill and shut-off feature comes standard, ensuring efficient operation, while the tall model\'s design facilitates the washing of sheet pans. Safety features include a door safety switch and water curtain rinseability, which activates prior to the final rinse, initiating the rinsing process and acting as a protective shield. The captive end caps offer convenience by flipping open and snapping shut, facilitating rapid clearing of spray arms and reducing downtime. Moreover, the ADC 66 Tall incorporates a fail-safe conveyor system with a slip clutch design that halts rack movement to prevent damage, ensuring smooth and reliable operation. Its pre-wash scrap basket, V construction, and drain pump filter work in tandem to maintain cleanliness, safeguarding the pump from obstructions and clogged jets. Equipped with precise water control mechanisms and resilient against heavy soil, water action, chemicals, and lime buildup, this dishwasher delivers consistent performance. Operating at various temperatures for both high and low-temperature washes, it offers versatility to meet diverse cleaning requirements in commercial settings. Additionally, it adheres to important installation guidelines, such as securing clean and soiled tables and ensuring proper electrical and plumbing connections by qualified personnel in compliance with health, electrical, plumbing, and safety codes.</p>', '<p>The ADC-66-T R-L features a tall hood conveyor design, allowing for efficient loading and unloading of dishes, optimizing workflow in busy commercial kitchens. Operating at low temperature, this dishwasher ensures effective cleaning while conserving energy, making it a cost-effective and environmentally friendly choice for commercial establishments. With a capacity to process up to 244 racks per hour, the ADC-66-T R-L can handle large volumes of dishes, making it suitable for high-demand environments. Equipped with automatic detergent and rinse aid dispensers, this dishwasher ensures precise chemical dosing for consistent and thorough cleaning results. Built with robust materials and reliable components, the ADC-66-T R-L is designed for durability and long-term performance in demanding commercial settings.</p>', 'published', '[]', '218-1066.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 33536.38, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 86.00, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 35.00, NULL, 960.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:17', '2024-12-30 07:49:52', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/218-1066.0000_1b319b98-43b1-4e2f-9a39-496ca100d211.webp', 'physical', NULL, 26406.6, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/zT5NvtrqsrsnLdJo9vxdgrGvL0dRbs9uSeAlWjmh.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/OOYSSSOWgkS46DXfveL08AQ8nRcTP5XdwolthoXg.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/ZRCY3lyRB6jDylfcTiz7dHmSt6DgdhU54WCqZf1W.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/vgzAlPsxo3TYNZmuLVdJ6hEzy0RNtpP6AmSqrWmi.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB227\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1920, 'American Dish ADC-66-T L-R Low-Temp Dish Machine 66\" Tall Hood Conveyor', '<p>The ADC 66 Tall offers a dependable pre-wash phase and unmatched cleaning performance, distinguishing itself as the top-performing conveyor among all listed 66-inch models. Engineered for dual sanitizing, it conserves water efficiently, using only 0.49 gallons per rack, a remarkable 66% reduction compared to industry standards. Equipped with an autofill and shut-off feature as standard, its tall model configuration facilitates easy cleaning of sheet pans, while a door safety switch enhances operational safety. Incorporating innovative design elements, such as a water curtain rinseability feature that activates before the final rinse, the ADC 66 Tall ensures thorough cleaning while shielding against contaminants. Its captive end caps simplify maintenance by facilitating quick opening and closure, streamlining the clearing of spray arms and minimizing downtime. With a fail-safe conveyor system employing a slip clutch design, this dishwasher prevents rack movement and potential damage, ensuring uninterrupted operation. Additionally, features like the pre-wash scrap basket, V construction, and dual-fail safe heater control enhance efficiency and longevity, making it a reliable choice for commercial kitchens.</p>', '', 'published', '[]', '217-1066.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 33536.38, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 86.00, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 35.00, NULL, 960.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:18', '2024-12-30 07:49:52', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/217-1066.0000_337165fc-b2c8-4200-9ebe-ca3f778a3ed3.webp', 'physical', NULL, 26406.6, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/yrOMFNi3c6cC17bukw9ixcJsfpFou0ukyM5TUv1u.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/YUJcLbNkwkF