(1921, 'American Dish ADC-66 R-L 66\" High-Temp Conveyor With 5-Wire-No Booster Heater Dish Machine', '<p>The ADC-66 dishwasher boasts a comprehensive set of features that ensure optimal cleaning performance and operational efficiency. With a reliable pre-wash system and unrivaled cleaning ability, this dishwasher is equipped with a powerful 3 HP wash pump and a 1.5 HP scrap pump, delivering the best performance among all listed 66 conveyors. It is rated for dual sanitizing, offering peace of mind regarding hygiene standards. Moreover, it consumes 66% less water than the industry average, making it a cost-effective and environmentally friendly choice. With a capacity of 244 racks per hour and a water consumption rate of just 0.49 gallons per rack, it efficiently handles high volumes of dishes while minimizing resource usage. The dishwasher comes with a range of standard features designed to streamline the cleaning process and enhance durability. It includes an autofill and shut-off system, water curtain rinseability, and captive end caps for convenience and efficiency. The dual-fail-safe heater control ensures precise water temperature management, while the fail-safe conveyor system prevents rack damage and interruptions in operation. Additionally, the pre-wash scrap basket, V construction, and drain pump filter contribute to keeping the dishwasher clean and functioning optimally. With its robust specifications and reliable performance, the ADC-66 dishwasher is an ideal choice for commercial kitchens seeking high-quality dishwashing solutions.</p>', '<p>The ADC-66 R-L 66 dishwasher features a high-temp conveyor system, ensuring thorough cleaning and sanitization of dishes, utensils, and cookware. Equipped with stainless steel rinse jets, this dishwasher provides efficient rinsing for sparkling clean results. The dishwasher operates on a 5-wire configuration, offering reliable performance and stability during operation. Unlike some models, the ADC-66 R-L 66 does not require a booster heater, simplifying installation and reducing energy consumption. Designed as a commercial-grade dish machine, this unit is suitable for use in busy restaurant kitchens, catering facilities, and other foodservice establishments.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/214-0066.0000_d65e1cef-0a16-4f20-8db5-5e15ef66f8c2.webp\"]', '214-0066.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 27182.13, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 86.00, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 35.00, NULL, 960.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:19', '2024-12-30 07:49:52', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/214-0066.0000_d65e1cef-0a16-4f20-8db5-5e15ef66f8c2.webp', 'physical', NULL, 21403.25, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/zwKYcu4OUYHNjz3YdsSnyEJIPH5I6Ys1ZfguRZCu.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3BvWTJ7tmTIYOo02s4oBikbQgNsPIZ0q4i5qDfXw.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/NrLKmCwz3Rs2lQITIIGbzZAS3y2lF3lfEFXMhWne.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB229\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1922, 'American Dish ADC-66 L-R Dish Machine 66\" High-Temp Conveyor', '<p>The ADC-66 dishwasher boasts a reliable pre-wash function and unparalleled cleaning prowess, making it an industry leader among 66-inch conveyors. With a robust 3 HP wash pump and a dedicated 1.5 HP scrap pump, it delivers exceptional performance, ensuring thorough cleaning of dishes with each cycle. Notably, it stands out for its dual sanitizing capability and remarkable water efficiency, utilizing 66% less water than the industry average. With a capacity of up to 244 racks per hour and consuming only 0.49 gallons of water per rack, it maximizes productivity while minimizing environmental impact. Equipped with standard features like autofill and shut-off, water curtain rinseability, and captive end caps, it streamlines operations, reduces downtime, and enhances user convenience. Incorporating advanced safety and maintenance features, the ADC-66 dishwasher is engineered for durability and reliability. Its fail-safe conveyor system, coupled with a slip clutch design, prevents rack movement accidents and eliminates the risk of damaged racks, ensuring smooth and efficient operation. Additionally, features like dual-fail safe heater control and precise water control mechanisms further enhance safety and efficiency. With its pre-wash scrap basket, V construction, and drain pump filter with a 2-stage pump strainer, it effectively manages soil and prevents pump obstructions, prolonging the lifespan of the equipment and reducing maintenance requirements. However, users must adhere to installation guidelines and ensure that electrical and plumbing connections are handled by qualified personnel to meet safety standards and prevent potential issues.</p>', '<p>The ADC-66 L-R 66 dishwasher operates at high temperatures, ensuring thorough sanitation and effective removal of grease and grime from dishes, utensils, and kitchenware. With its high-temp design, it provides optimal cleaning results, meeting rigorous hygiene standards in commercial settings. Equipped with stainless steel rinse jets, this dishwasher ensures durable and reliable performance over time. The use of stainless steel materials enhances resistance to corrosion and wear, contributing to the longevity and efficiency of the machine. The ADC-66 L-R 66 dishwasher features a 5-wire configuration, offering versatility and flexibility in installation options. This wiring setup allows for efficient operation and easy integration into various commercial kitchen setups without the need for a booster heater. With its high-temperature operation and stainless steel rinse jets, this dishwasher provides enhanced sanitization capabilities, ensuring that dishes are thoroughly cleaned and sanitized to meet stringent health and safety standards. Designed for efficiency, the ADC-66 L-R 66 dishwasher optimizes water usage and energy consumption, minimizing operational costs while delivering exceptional cleaning performance. Its streamlined design and high-quality components contribute to reliable and efficient operation in busy commercial kitchens.</p>', 'published', '[]', '213-0066.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 27182.13, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 86.00, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 35.00, NULL, 960.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:21', '2024-12-30 07:49:52', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/213-0066.0000_5aadc368-88ba-430e-b943-67f4426013cc.webp', 'physical', NULL, 21403.25, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/aT1SyBo01cV1D8bqnZuCrsvhR0faZ6s7EIv8lY93.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/XuodKeSbjP3qjv996CU5ttsq8merlMArNcLT8AuU.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/rjO3mwmfEkYAEAcJqtKHlxNRyFEKmT5okBlZTA7W.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation\",\"path\":\"products\\/document