(1923, 'American Dish ADC-66 R-L Dish Machine 66\" Low-Temp Conveyor With Polymer Rinse Jets', '<p>The ADC-66 dishwasher boasts a robust pre-wash system and unparalleled cleaning performance, thanks to its powerful 3 HP wash pump and 1.5 HP scrap pump, ensuring optimal cleanliness for every load. It outperforms other 66-inch conveyors in its class and is rated for dual sanitizing, meeting rigorous hygiene standards. With a remarkable 66% reduction in water usage compared to the industry average, it efficiently processes up to 244 racks per hour, consuming only 0.49 gallons of water per rack, making it both environmentally friendly and cost-effective. Additionally, it comes equipped with convenient features like autofill and shut-off, water curtain rinseability, and captive end caps, streamlining the dishwashing process and reducing downtime. The ADC-66 dishwasher incorporates advanced safety and maintenance features, including dual-fail safe heater control, a fail-safe conveyor system with a slip clutch design to prevent rack movement accidents, and a pre-wash scrap basket with V construction that keeps debris contained and protects the pump. Its drain pump filter and 2-stage pump strainer effectively eliminate wash pump obstructions and clogged jets, ensuring smooth operation. However, users must adhere to important installation guidelines, including proper bolting of clean and soiled tables, maintaining adequate distance between scrap sinks and the dishwasher, and ensuring that electrical and plumbing connections are handled by qualified professionals to comply with safety regulations and prevent potential issues.</p>', '<p>The ADC-66 R-L 66 dishwasher is engineered to handle high-volume dishwashing demands, with a capacity to process up to 244 racks per hour, ensuring efficient cleaning for busy commercial kitchens. Utilizing a low-temperature cleaning method, this dishwasher effectively removes food residue and sanitizes dishes while minimizing energy consumption, making it an eco-friendly and cost-effective solution. Equipped with polymer rinse jets, this dishwasher ensures thorough rinsing coverage, effectively removing detergent residues and leaving dishes sparkling clean after each wash cycle. Featuring a 5-wire conveyor system, this dishwasher offers reliable and smooth rack movement, minimizing the risk of jams or disruptions during operation, thereby maximizing productivity. With its intuitive interface and automated features, such as autofill and shut-off, the ADC-66 R-L 66 dishwasher simplifies the dishwashing process, reducing the need for manual intervention and optimizing workflow efficiency in busy kitchen environments.</p>', 'published', '[]', '214-1066.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 27182.13, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 86.00, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 35.00, NULL, 960.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:22', '2024-12-30 07:49:52', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/214-1066.0000_ffd14a2c-14aa-44a8-a705-86d7c5d55fab.webp', 'physical', NULL, 21403.25, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/ZBe1WBVelaHd7NkM3zLls07aXksQefSXBYmNqz5K.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3Gu3kC9tjhfl96GPhbeVRAUvGMM1AutBdYGBINCe.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/RiiE6oNvMkRn5790hJ1NeqTcQBsUyiXaZFTTmouG.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/OLmnuD0mmbOyB3vjwsIvr1RdkPh3SU41au5INz69.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB231\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1924, 'American Dish ADC-66 L-R Dish Machine 66\" Low-Temp Conveyor With 5-Wire and Polymer Rinse Jets', '<p>The ADC-66 dishwasher embodies a blend of innovative features and robust performance to meet the demanding needs of commercial kitchen environments. With a reliable pre-wash function and unrivaled cleaning ability, this dishwasher ensures thorough sanitation of dishes and utensils. Boasting a powerful 3 HP wash pump and a 1.5 HP scrap pump, it offers exceptional performance, processing up to 244 racks per hour while consuming only 0.49 gallons of water per rack, significantly less than the industry average. The inclusion of an autofill and shut-off system, along with a water curtain rinseability feature, enhances operational efficiency by automating key processes and providing superior rinse coverage, thereby minimizing manual intervention and ensuring optimal cleaning outcomes. Moreover, the ADC-66 dishwasher incorporates advanced engineering elements such as a fail-safe conveyor system with a slip clutch design, which prevents rack movement and eliminates the risk of damage. With dual-fail safe heater control and precise water control mechanisms, it operates reliably and efficiently, unaffected by heavy soil, water action, strong chemicals, or lime buildup. The dishwasher also features a pre-wash scrap basket and a drain pump filter with a two-stage pump strainer, safeguarding the pump and preventing wash pump obstructions. These attributes, combined with its V construction design and robust build quality, make the ADC-66 dishwasher a dependable solution for commercial dishwashing needs, delivering superior performance, durability, and ease of maintenance.</p>', '<p>The ADC-66 L-R 66 dishwasher is designed for high-volume dishwashing needs, capable of processing up to 244 racks per hour. Its efficient conveyor system ensures smooth operation, moving racks through the machine at a rate of 6.8 feet per minute. Utilizing a low-temperature cleaning process, this dishwasher ensures effective sanitation while conserving energy. The incorporation of polymer rinse jets enhances rinsing efficiency, providing thorough coverage and ensuring dishes emerge clean and sanitized. Featuring a 5-wire conveyor design, this dishwasher offers reliable and consistent performance. The conveyor system is engineered for durability and smooth rack movement, minimizing the risk of jams or disruptions during operation. The ADC-66 L-R 66 dishwasher is designed with ease of use in mind. Its intuitive interface and automated features, such as autofill and shut-off, streamline the dishwashing process, reducing manual intervention and optimizing workflow efficiency. Built to withstand the rigors of commercial kitchen environments, this dishwasher boasts heavy-duty stainless steel construction. Its robust design ensures longevity and resilience, making it a reliable workhorse for busy food service establishments.</p>', 'published', '[]', '213-1066.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 27182.13, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 86.00, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 35.00, NULL, 960.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:23', '2024-12-30 07:49:52', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/213-1066.0000_8686472f-efda-4fa5-bc8f-c59796730640.webp', 'physical', NULL, 21403.25, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/aYavOx17WyP6C0pUBWsZ99dtoNcMquY4shKjwRFB.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/fSwUlqJnmtjCiplVn9HfHRxTlRpO3YNtzBXz3oDD.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/ViPn8olP129aUv5y4pOuOzYY6LyXwjeOkAQ99ho2.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/7iGuhhfqR74oQ6Nc8B4m5mt0tir2SxUrzZ3vl2i6.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\