(1925, 'American Dish ADC-44-T R-L Dish Machine 44\" High-Temp Conveyor, Tall Hood Stainless Steel Final Rinse Jets', '<p>All the functionalities listed are standard features of the ADC-44, distinguishing it from other dishwashers available. While competitors might offer similar capabilities as additional options, at American Dish, our machines arrive fully equipped and operational from the start. Capable of handling up to 244 racks per hour and designed to operate only when racks are inserted, the ADC-44 ensures efficient use of resources and energy. Its cleaning prowess is unmatched, thanks to a dual rinsing system and precise water control mechanism, guaranteeing optimal cleanliness for all dishes. Moreover, the ADC-44 prioritizes user convenience with features like auto-fill, energy-saving stage washer, and quiet operation, minimizing operational costs and enhancing ease of use. Constructed with heavy stainless steel components and equipped with advanced safety features such as wide-opening access doors with safety interlocks and a fail-safe conveyor system, it ensures durability and reliability in demanding kitchen environments. Additionally, its compatibility with different power supplies and comprehensive sanitation options make it a versatile and practical choice for commercial kitchens, meeting the highest standards of performance and hygiene</p>', '<p>Boost your commercial kitchen\'s efficiency with the American Dish ADC-44-T High-Temp Dish Machine. Featuring a tall hood and stainless steel final rinse jets, this 44\" conveyor ensures a thorough clean for all your dishes.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/216-0044.0000_66c4b6a2-045a-402b-9c8a-de7df1ece7b9.webp\"]', '216-0044.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 26235.66, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 64.00, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 760.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:24', '2024-12-30 07:49:52', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/216-0044.0000_66c4b6a2-045a-402b-9c8a-de7df1ece7b9.webp', 'physical', NULL, 20658, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/ezdkjls92CAlRcuNsccV3t2ZboihDTHDD0EZEwBf.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/uFhpImeFMEygHs6IsorITK2syRWLJTPPLKCTNJxn.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/WqYY3FVEMdCzPvLlKnwWwAZpTHFTagu90Z6tFzdr.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/mOaxsgeFQgvSvZOdbj7Bc5EkMZ8EG2qbI5DRYLXf.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB233\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1926, 'American Dish ADC-44-T R-L Dish Machine 44\" Low-Temp Conveyor, Tall Hood Polymer Final Rinse Jets', '<p>The ADC-44 comes equipped with a comprehensive array of features as standard, setting it apart from other dish machines on the market. While competitors may offer these features as optional add-ons, American Dish ensures that its machines are complete and ready to operate right out of the box. With a capacity to handle up to 244 racks per hour, this dishwasher operates efficiently and effectively, ensuring that cleaning needs are met in high-demand environments. Its user-friendly design includes a conveyor system that activates only when racks are inserted, minimizing energy consumption and enhancing operational convenience. Additionally, the ADC-44 boasts advanced cleaning technology, including a dual rinsing system and a low water consumption feature, using as little as 0.49 gallons per load. The dishwasher is also equipped with safety features such as a fail-safe conveyor system and a precise water control mechanism, ensuring reliable performance and peace of mind for operators. With its heavy stainless steel construction and high-capacity heaters, the ADC-44 is built to withstand heavy use and deliver consistent results, making it a dependable choice for commercial kitchens and food service establishments.</p>', '<p>Tall hood design ensures ample space for cleaning larger dishes and utensils, catering to the needs of busy kitchens with high-volume dishwashing requirements. Low-temperature conveyor system offers efficient cleaning without the need for high temperatures, reducing energy consumption and operating costs while maintaining optimal cleaning performance. Polymer final rinse jets provide thorough rinsing and sanitation, ensuring that dishes come out clean and hygienic after each cycle. Dual-fail safe heater control enhances safety and reliability by ensuring that heaters only operate when the tank is full, minimizing the risk of overheating and equipment damage. High-capacity wash pump enables thorough cleaning and faster operation, allowing for increased productivity and throughput in commercial dishwashing applications.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/216-1044.0000_e1bce7c7-0b09-4e8b-ba1f-739c338e1a11.webp\"]', '216-1044.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 25931.11, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 64.00, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 760.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:25', '2024-12-30 07:49:52', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/216-1044.0000_e1bce7c7-0b09-4e8b-ba1f-739c338e1a11.webp', 'physical', NULL, 20418.2, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/zP9FQcyzVsGgmNHiulDbj5mjJBgNjOKAwyeTftfo.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/cTrqpUFFqswQ7n7GGmJFcSJg0KuMsWeHh2TrgUY7.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/KwTdlbDkE4dc8HtZegn2QqfM2ihHoqgqqY9YydmF.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/MJyC4hJkoHtqqQEZRK08WVn8HhQunQw1czI2HTou.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB234\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
