(1927, 'American Dish ADC-44-T L-R Dish Machine with 44\" Low-Temp Conveyor Polymer Final Rinse Jets', '<p>The ADC-44 dishwasher from American Dish stands out for its comprehensive range of features that come as standard, setting it apart from other models in the market. With a capacity of 244 racks per hour, this machine ensures high productivity in commercial kitchens while maintaining efficiency through its operation only when racks are inserted. Its unrivaled cleaning ability is complemented by a dual rinsing system, guaranteeing thorough cleanliness and sanitation of dishes. The user-friendly conveyor system enhances ease of operation, while its low water consumption of as little as 0.49 gallons per load contributes to cost savings and environmental sustainability. What makes the ADC-44 dishwasher truly standout is its array of advanced functionalities designed to optimize performance and reliability. From auto fill and energy-saving stage washers to high-capacity heaters and fail-safe mechanisms, this machine offers a seamless and dependable dishwashing experience. Its heavy stainless steel construction ensures durability, while features such as the water curtain rinseability and dual-fail-safe heater control enhance safety and efficiency. With the ADC-44, American Dish delivers a complete and ready-to-run solution that meets the rigorous demands of commercial kitchen environments, providing peace of mind to operators and ensuring consistently excellent results.</p>', '<p>Efficient Operation: The ADC-44-T L-R dishwasher operates at a rate of 244 racks per hour, ensuring high throughput and productivity in commercial kitchens. Low-Temperature Cleaning: Designed for low-temperature cleaning, this dishwasher utilizes polymer final rinse jets to effectively clean and sanitize dishes without the need for high heat. Tall Hood Design: Featuring a tall hood design, this dishwasher accommodates larger items such as sheet pans and oversized dishes, offering versatility in washing various types of kitchenware. Reliable Performance: With a robust construction and reliable components, the ADC-44-T L-R dishwasher delivers consistent and dependable performance, meeting the demands of busy foodservice environments. Polymer Final Rinse Jets: The inclusion of polymer final rinse jets ensures thorough cleaning and sanitation, providing peace of mind in maintaining hygiene standards.</p>', 'pending', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/215-1044.0000_059cc18c-c12c-4b23-98fa-ca6507bd1625.webp\"]', '215-1044.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 25931.11, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 64.00, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 760.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:26', '2024-12-16 11:47:09', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/215-1044.0000_059cc18c-c12c-4b23-98fa-ca6507bd1625.webp', 'physical', NULL, 20418.2, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/uYhAXHWoZLZL3HLzcqGBw43IZJtteVMNKZdNAn81.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/mJ0veQhDj1pLMtpzC1KCqPOPMV62K76NEvk0ZKS4.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Qri3JjOPQyVL2l3Ma6aCr9TJWEubOkCjeJy3P9EY.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/DPzmGcIaksGf7u1bR3bCZvCz31di6vCbg8LW5uEb.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB235\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1928, 'American Dish ADC-44 R-L Dish Machine with Built On Booster,  44\" High Temp Conveyor, 240V /3 PH', '<p>The ADC-44 dishwasher from American Dish sets itself apart with a comprehensive array of standard features that are often considered add-ons by other manufacturers. Operating at an impressive rate of 244 racks per hour, this dishwasher ensures efficient throughput while maintaining high standards of cleanliness. Its innovative design includes a dual rinsing system, providing thorough cleaning and sanitization for optimal hygiene. The user-friendly conveyor system enhances operational ease, while the low water consumption of just 0.49 gallons per load minimizes environmental impact and operational costs. With features like auto fill, energy-saving stage washer, and a fail-safe conveyor system, the ADC-44 offers a hassle-free and reliable dishwashing solution for commercial kitchens. Equipped with high-capacity heaters and a precise water control mechanism, the ADC-44 ensures consistent performance and reliable operation. Its robust construction, including a heavy stainless steel build and wide opening access doors with safety interlock, emphasizes durability and user safety. Additionally, the dishwasher features a self-purging system, wide-opening access doors, and a fail-safe conveyor system, further enhancing its efficiency and reliability. Whether in hot temp or chemical model wash settings, the ADC-44 maintains optimal temperatures for effective cleaning and sanitization, meeting the diverse needs of commercial dishwashing. With its comprehensive set of standard features and efficient operation, the ADC-44 stands out as a complete and ready-to-run solution for commercial dishwashing needs.</p>', '<p>The American Dish ADC-44 R-L dishwasher boasts a high throughput capacity of 244 racks per hour, ensuring efficient cleaning for busy commercial kitchens. Equipped with a dual rinsing system, this dishwasher delivers thorough cleaning and sanitization of dishware, ensuring impeccable hygiene standards. With a low water consumption of as little as 0.49 gallons per load, the ADC-44 helps minimize water usage and reduces operational costs. The dishwasher features a user-friendly conveyor system that enhances ease of use, contributing to smoother operation in busy kitchen environments. Incorporating a built-in booster, this dishwasher ensures optimal washing and sanitizing temperatures for consistent results, catering to the diverse needs of commercial dishwashing.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/212-0044.0507_e951500f-d50a-4c65-8e34-ffd3a517efcb.webp\"]', '212-0044.0507', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 23102.89, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 64.00, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 760.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:27', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/212-0044.0507_e951500f-d50a-4c65-8e34-ffd3a517efcb.webp', 'physical', NULL, 18191.25, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/iH3Mwg5aczUqnaNmJmITXKNhRkEGvRRJt9OlZFE3.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/YO43TcWCGoVoTmDxSwA4TPINzHZ7in5p5wzrfzOq.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/fLGfAKGhNL9hSWsKFCHbArhrMQ4fBzAz7li7ZtNU.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/nzcOyiQXMyeWiala3SobBbOLSBVplhvVJbiiVXs9.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB236\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1929, 'American Dish ADC-44 L-R 44\" with Built On Booster High Temp Conveyor, 240V /3Ph', '<p>The ADC-44 dishwasher from American Dish comes equipped with a comprehensive set of standard features that ensure optimal performance and convenience. With a high throughput capacity of 244 racks per hour, this dishwasher is ideal for busy commercial kitchens, and its operation initiates only when racks are inserted, enhancing efficiency. It boasts an unrivaled cleaning ability, thanks to its dual rinsing system, which ensures thorough cleaning and sanitization of dishware. The user-friendly conveyor system contributes to its ease of use, while its low water consumption of as little as 0.49 gallons per load helps to minimize water usage and reduce operational costs. Additionally, features such as auto-fill, energy-saving stage washer, and quiet operation further enhance its functionality and user experience. Notably, the ADC-44 dishwasher is designed for durability and reliability, featuring heavy stainless steel construction and a fail-safe conveyor system that prevents rack damage. Its precise water control mechanism and high-capacity heaters ensure optimal washing and sanitizing temperatures for consistent results. Moreover, safety features such as wide-opening access doors with safety interlock and captive end caps add to its user-friendly design. With specifications tailored for both hot temp and chemical wash models, along with detailed instructions for installation and power supply requirements, the ADC-44 dishwasher stands out as a complete and efficient solution for commercial dishwashing needs.</p>', '<p>The ADC-44 conveyor dishwasher can handle up to 244 racks per hour, ensuring efficient operation in busy commercial kitchens. Equipped with a dual rinsing system, this dishwasher provides thorough cleaning and sanitizing to ensure hygienic dishware. With a water consumption rate as low as 0.49 gallons per rack, the ADC-44 helps to minimize water usage and reduce operational costs. Built with heavy stainless steel construction, this dishwasher is designed to withstand the rigors of daily use in commercial settings, ensuring long-term reliability. The ADC-44 features high-capacity heaters and precise water control mechanisms, ensuring optimal washing and sanitizing temperatures for consistent results``</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/211-0044.0470_37fe009f-aec8-47a1-8124-fcd99c898319.webp\"]', '211-0044.0470', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 23102.89, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 64.00, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 760.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:28', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/211-0044.0470_37fe009f-aec8-47a1-8124-fcd99c898319.webp', 'physical', NULL, 18191.25, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/MkGOGPBTlTuBxzcnyOkmftBvP9fiiWUzmgYTNUtV.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/fGf4t27hkQ1uHZjRWOlc0KwfRtP9bGM9z1Ny9QuL.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Untitled\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/IngC8OsNgSDlcdyLLZIiiUMvRvpxhQyUZmeJdToj.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/aeYTppB4WaMcPbx6bzTopYz8kWiRx55MOqs5712L.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB237\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1930, 'American Dish ADC-44 L-R 44\" High Temp Conveyor 208V / 3PH with Built On Booster Dish Machine', '<p>The ADC-44 dishwasher from American Dish offers a comprehensive array of standard features that set it apart in the commercial dishwashing industry. With a remarkable capacity of 244 racks per hour, this machine operates efficiently and effectively, ensuring rapid throughput to meet the demands of busy restaurant kitchens. Its user-friendly conveyor system operates seamlessly, allowing for continuous washing without the need for operator controls, enhancing workflow and productivity. Moreover, the dishwasher boasts low water consumption, utilizing as little as 0.49 gallons per load, contributing to cost savings and environmental sustainability. Built with durability and reliability in mind, the ADC-44 incorporates heavy stainless steel construction and a fail-safe conveyor system that prevents rack damage and ensures uninterrupted operation. The machine\'s innovative features, such as the dual rinsing system, wide-opening access doors with safety interlock, and self-purging capabilities, further enhance its performance and ease of maintenance. Additionally, the precise water control mechanism and high-capacity heaters ensure optimal washing and sanitizing temperatures, while the built-in booster facilitates efficient rinsing. Whether in a high-volume restaurant or institutional kitchen, the ADC-44 dishwasher delivers consistent results and operational efficiency, making it a preferred choice for commercial dishwashing needs.</p>', '<p>The ADC-44 L-R operates at high temperatures, ensuring thorough cleaning and sanitization of dishes, utensils, and glassware, meeting the stringent hygiene standards of commercial kitchens. Equipped with a built-in booster, this dishwasher ensures that the final rinse water reaches the necessary temperature for effective sanitization, providing peace of mind regarding hygiene and cleanliness. Featuring a conveyor system, the ADC-44 L-R facilitates continuous washing of dishes, offering high efficiency and throughput to meet the demands of busy foodservice establishments. Designed for 208 volts and three-phase electrical supply, this dishwasher is optimized for reliable performance and energy efficiency, catering to the needs of commercial kitchens while minimizing operational costs. Constructed with durable materials and components, the ADC-44 L-R is built to withstand the rigors of daily use in demanding restaurant environments, ensuring longevity and reliability.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/211-0044.0477_5a851155-f218-4d1b-aac0-0095b3ba8f94.webp\"]', '211-0044.0477', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 23102.89, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 64.00, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 760.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:30', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/211-0044.0477_5a851155-f218-4d1b-aac0-0095b3ba8f94.webp', 'physical', NULL, 18191.25, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/ZHKBaK9vIrIyOQUCyR9bE3Mbm9fspP7gva4IAcXj.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Xo4vaQR6u8ZpqfusebqkD8IWhJyokEKLav4BlSUM.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/1FnyqWGR9MXg9LJLE7dqCeZDHkwghKlfmjQDWjmg.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/5H7SyoLOCRyziCYeb0TLLfI4TPxbgcifFF7UmUsX.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB238\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1931, 'American Dish ADC-44 L-R Dish Machine 44\" High Temp Conveyor With Stainless Steel Final Rinse Jets', '<p>The ADC-44 comes fully equipped with a comprehensive set of features, all included as standard. While competitors may offer similar features as optional add-ons, American Dish ensures that its machines are complete and ready for immediate operation. These features guarantee optimal performance and efficiency, including an impressive throughput of 244 racks per hour. The dish machine operates only when racks are inserted, ensuring energy conservation and minimizing downtime. With its dual rinsing system and user-friendly conveyor, the ADC-44 offers unmatched cleaning ability and ease of use. Additionally, it boasts a low water consumption rate of just 0.49 gallons per load, contributing to cost savings and environmental sustainability. Furthermore, the ADC-44 incorporates numerous innovations to enhance its functionality and durability. It features an auto-fill mechanism, eliminating the need for operator controls and promoting a hassle-free operation. The machine\'s energy-saving stage washer and absence of circuit boards contribute to its quiet operation and reliable performance. Its robust construction, including a heavy stainless steel build and a skirted motor compartment, ensures longevity and resistance to heavy use. With safety features such as wide-opening access doors and captive end caps, the ADC-44 prioritizes user safety and ease of maintenance. Additionally, its fail-safe conveyor system prevents rack damage and ensures seamless operation, making it a dependable choice for commercial dishwashing needs.</p>', '<p>The ADC-44 L-R features a high-temperature conveyor system, ensuring effective cleaning and sanitization of dishes and utensils. Equipped with stainless steel final rinse jets, this dish machine delivers thorough rinsing for sparkling clean results. With its conveyor design, the ADC-44 L-R facilitates continuous operation, allowing for efficient processing of dishes at a rapid pace. This dish machine is NSF-certified, ensuring compliance with industry standards for cleanliness and sanitation. Built to withstand the demands of commercial kitchens, the ADC-44 L-R is constructed with durable materials for long-lasting performance and reliability.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/211-0044.0000_90f3849f-75df-44c1-b964-13d75ecdc920.webp\"]', '211-0044.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 17281.59, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 64.00, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 760.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:31', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/211-0044.0000_90f3849f-75df-44c1-b964-13d75ecdc920.webp', 'physical', NULL, 13607.55, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/yVi9EP47MmvmK4WwzIm3MEkVrRavfwVQG7sf05mH.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/2kcxcHxhrMbZMFucv8rv1DVXzXll35GoXbzpuUIb.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Untitled\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/JAg7PuGLiqqkFqDsPiSTKSW95JaHNOC8mC89nzGh.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Dh0BczlRWJJ7QNC3CBanhgcxUCMpKIFu8WTgHpH5.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/1xTJKiVJDA2rjfZgAqZLcbnB63MiQYMvKXrkIMXf.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB239\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1932, 'American Dish ADC-44 R-L LT Dish Machine 44\" Low Temp Conveyor With Polymer Final Rinse Jets', '<p>The ADC-44 comes equipped with a comprehensive set of features as standard, distinguishing it from competitors who may offer similar functionalities as optional add-ons. At American Dish, our commitment lies in delivering fully operational machines right out of the box. With a capacity to handle 244 racks per hour, the ADC-44 ensures efficient throughput in commercial dishwashing operations. It operates only when racks are inserted, conserving energy and optimizing usage. Its cleaning prowess is unmatched, thanks to a dual rinsing system and a user-friendly conveyor that facilitates smooth operation. Moreover, the ADC-44 boasts numerous efficiency-enhancing features, including low water consumption, auto-fill functionality, and a self-purging mechanism. The absence of operator controls and circuit boards contributes to its quiet operation, while the rack-saving conveyor drive minimizes downtime and maintenance requirements. Crafted with heavy stainless steel construction, the ADC-44 is built to withstand rigorous use in commercial settings. With safety features like wide-opening access doors and a fail-safe conveyor system, it ensures both user safety and operational reliability. Additionally, its precise water control mechanism and dual-fail-safe heater control further optimize performance and durability, making it impervious to heavy soil, strong chemicals, and lime buildup.</p>', '', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/212-1044.0000_58dbaf20-9102-4008-ab5f-acb2c3d5155c.webp\"]', '212-1044.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 16948.4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 64.00, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 760.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:33', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/212-1044.0000_58dbaf20-9102-4008-ab5f-acb2c3d5155c.webp', 'physical', NULL, 13345.2, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/1IHScyajHrdan9RpKjTEOMC6ddvIXlRDUe24F5Vf.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/VwPzk12o6ImYhxiZbojQ9Dgsr9MdsIYWRIesRpYO.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/39OdBR3tXYyi8sUq0OPy6tMdVue2jKGrbZASqywA.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/75hK4iaq7DpQAmglCzLvC6dqQuV5krWGjjDhcdSB.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB240\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1933, 'American Dish ADC-44 L-R LT Dish Machine 44\" Low Temp Conveyor With Polymer Final Rinse Jets', '<p>All the mentioned features come standard with the ADC-44 model. While some manufacturers might offer these features as optional add-ons, at American Dish, our dish machines are comprehensive and ready for immediate operation. The ADC-44 boasts an impressive capacity of 244 racks per hour, ensuring high throughput and efficiency in commercial dishwashing operations. It operates only when racks are inserted, optimizing energy usage and minimizing downtime when not in use. Additionally, the ADC-44 offers unparalleled cleaning ability with its dual rinsing system and user-friendly conveyor. With low water consumption, using as little as 0.49 gallons per load, it not only conserves water resources but also reduces operating costs. Its energy-saving features, such as the auto-fill and auto shut-off, combined with the absence of operator controls and circuit boards, contribute to its quiet operation and efficient performance. The machine\'s sturdy construction, along with features like the fail-safe conveyor system and high-capacity heaters, ensures reliable and durable operation, even in demanding commercial environments.</p>', '<p>The American Dish ADC-44 L-R LT is equipped with a 44-inch conveyor, allowing for efficient washing of dishes at lower temperatures, minimizing energy consumption and reducing operating costs. The dish machine features polymer final rinse jets, ensuring thorough rinsing of dishes to achieve sparkling cleanliness while being durable and resistant to corrosion. This machine operates using a conveyor system, facilitating the continuous movement of dishes through the washing process, optimizing throughput and productivity in commercial kitchens. With its low-temperature washing capabilities, the ADC-44 L-R LT effectively removes food residue and stains from dishes while conserving energy and water resources. Designed for commercial use, this dish machine is ideal for restaurants, cafeterias, and other food service establishments seeking reliable and efficient dishwashing solutions.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/211-1044.0000_f6e685dc-d1cf-4213-8ad8-957b666a1b36.webp\"]', '211-1044.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 16948.4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 64.00, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 760.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:33', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/211-1044.0000_f6e685dc-d1cf-4213-8ad8-957b666a1b36.webp', 'physical', NULL, 13345.2, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/oMnbjfRp1CRLxZP016lYZlzjeEZXiHgDRv5VONAF.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/HGR8NiWX8OCG5XJmW7mGLstVOE40QXcSzQtJolM5.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Untitled\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/AExaQj6pkcXbUDknSCpcqIbKhAWMabVNbAUI4yPM.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/w8Ehg3fm3fgFuiYmw9pIXub7edAlGIw1uWveLsSq.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB241\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1934, 'American Dish HT-34 Single Rack High-Temp Pan Washer, 34\"with  No Booster', '<p>This dishwasher model is certified by NSF for effectively cleaning pots and dishes, offering reliability and assurance in commercial kitchen environments. It features a rapid 60-second time cycle, ensuring quick turnaround times for washing operations, and includes a wash extender for additional scouring time when needed. Additionally, there\'s an option for an integrated 70-degree rise booster, providing enhanced cleaning power for tough stains and residue. The patented self-cleaning spray system ensures consistent performance, while auto-fill and auto shut-off functionalities streamline operation. With an ADS patented low-water tank clean feature and a built-in scrap accumulator, the wash tank remains clean and efficient, requiring only 1.23 gallons per rack for operation. The appliance boasts a spacious 23-inch door opening, accommodating various dish sizes, and is equipped with a powerful 3HP wash pump for thorough cleaning. In terms of specifications, this dishwasher has a rated capacity of 55 racks per hour, driven by a robust 3 HP wash motor. It consumes 1.23 gallons of water per rack and operates at different temperatures for washing and rinsing cycles. The water heater has an output of 8KW to ensure optimal water temperature throughout the cleaning process. The appliance is designed for both three-phase and single-phase electrical systems, with specific requirements outlined for each. For three-phase systems, a 208/240V power supply with a 40A capacity is needed, while single-phase systems require a dual-circuit setup with a 208/240V power supply and capacities of 60/30A. The electrical connections must adhere to specified wire gauges and configurations to ensure safe and efficient operation.</p>', '<p>The HT-34 is specifically engineered as a pass-thru dishwashing machine, facilitating seamless transfer of soiled dishes into the washer and clean dishes out, optimizing kitchen workflow. With high-temp capabilities, this machine ensures thorough sanitization, meeting rigorous cleanliness standards for commercial kitchens. Designed to accommodate pans and larger cookware, the HT-34 is equipped to handle a variety of kitchen items, ensuring comprehensive cleaning. Despite its robust capabilities, the HT-34 boasts a compact footprint of 34 inches, making it suitable for kitchens with limited space while still delivering high-performance cleaning. This model operates efficiently without the need for a built-in booster, simplifying installation and reducing overall energy consumption.</p>', 'published', '[]', '312-0090.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 19598.51, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 80.00, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 570.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:34', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/312-0090.0000_9d20a7a0-0aca-40e5-ab37-1281a6ac5f28.webp', 'physical', NULL, 15431.9, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3OxyIjWzcBHRppAMlhrdge7E2Mksjl1wzLnqYCuO.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3gaM22Os0ab6hhpG6eCQJvOjetSBELuAvDXsLf3f.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/q8hmMLKOzbMLK6o3QW9Sjgj6djANnxAv8pmIoQW4.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/wx61sjLBxtoQzNFjtQJrwOPOsCdYGpo5YfMIBx1y.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB242\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1935, 'American Dish HT-25 Single Rack Upright Dish Machine, 3-Door Up', '', '<p>The American Dish HT-25 Single Rack Upright Dish Machine is designed to operate at high temperatures, ensuring efficient cleaning and sanitization of dishes, utensils, and kitchenware. With its high-temp capability, it effectively removes tough stains and grease, maintaining hygiene standards in commercial kitchens. Featuring a unique three-door configuration, this dishwasher offers versatility and convenience. Set up as a pass-thru unit, it allows smooth and seamless flow of dishes from one end to the other, optimizing workflow and reducing congestion in busy kitchen environments. With the ability to accommodate a single rack at a time, the HT-25 ensures focused and thorough cleaning of each batch of dishes. This single rack capacity allows for efficient use of space while ensuring consistent and reliable washing performance. The upward-opening doors of the HT-25 enhance accessibility and ease of use. This design feature makes loading and unloading dishes hassle-free, optimizing efficiency and reducing strain on kitchen staff during operation. Built with durability in mind, the American Dish HT-25 is constructed with high-quality materials to withstand the rigors of daily commercial use. Its robust build ensures longevity and reliability, making it a dependable solution for demanding kitchen environments.</p>', 'published', '[]', '311-0060.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 11012.55, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 80.00, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 570.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:35', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/311-0060.0000_a192b055-75ec-49f0-a7f6-9f054cd80bce.webp', 'physical', NULL, 8671.3, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/JtN0RJvpHyYIl9thH