(1936, 'American Dish AFB-C Corner Bakery Upright Dish Machine with Single Rack Corner 208V', '<p>Offered with cycle times of 90, 120, or 150 seconds, the AFB dishwasher accommodates standard 20\" x 20\" racks and is equipped with a robust 1.5 HP pump, ensuring high-pressure cleaning performance. Featuring built-in chemical dispensing and a scrap accumulator, this dishwasher effectively cleans and sanitizes bakery trays, pots, and pans. Available in corner and pass-through configurations, it boasts a 27.5\" door opening with a safety interlock, ensuring convenience and safety during operation. However, for proper washing of sheet pans, a specialized stainless steel dishrack is required. Despite its powerful capabilities, the AFB dishwasher is compact, offering a complete warewashing solution within just 121\" of floor space, with longer lengths also available. With rated capacities of 37, 25, or 12 racks per hour, the AFB dishwasher is driven by a 1.5 HP motor and consumes 2.5 gallons of water per cycle, maintaining efficient water usage. It operates at a minimum temperature of 130 degrees Fahrenheit and offers cycle times of 90, 120, and 150 seconds to accommodate varying washing needs. Electrically, it is designed for connection to a 115-volt single-phase power supply, requiring (2) 10-12 AWG copper wires and a suitable ground on a clean circuit. Circuit protection is recommended with a 20-amp circuit breaker or fuse rated at 20 amps to ensure safe and reliable operation.</p>', '<p>Designed for bakery-specific washing needs, accommodating tall items like sheet pans Low-temperature operation ensures effective cleaning while preserving delicate bakery items Corner configuration optimizes space utilization, fitting seamlessly into kitchen layouts Equipped with a muffler heater for enhanced performance and energy efficiency Includes one stainless steel sheet pan rack, providing convenient storage and washing for bakery supplies</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/016-0091.0239_a64ca66b-8779-4448-8054-050a858bbc2a.webp\"]', '016-0091.0239', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 10622.09, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 34.00, NULL, 79.00, NULL, 35.00, NULL, 330.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:36', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/016-0091.0239_a64ca66b-8779-4448-8054-050a858bbc2a.webp', 'physical', NULL, 8363.85, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/L6xDxFg3gTbn44Cyz9Sn8DR9lBOdh2aJ6gpklN1i.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/255SQda5CitfF6MpvA0Pnz5VnFr4ZPhZpGWl3vva.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/C1eMztg0mwtRodYFTXqnqaD2GHsqdz6wq7Dmjkut.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB244\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1937, 'American Dish AFB-C Corner Bakery Upright Dish Machine with Single Rack Tall + 1 S/S Sheetpan Rack', '<p>The AFB warewashing system offers versatility with time cycle options of 90, 120, or 150 seconds, catering to varying washing needs. It accommodates standard 20\" x 20\" racks and features a robust 1.5 HP pump that ensures high-pressure washing for thorough cleaning. Integrated chemical dispensing and a built-in scrap accumulator streamline the washing process, enhancing efficiency and convenience. Whether in corner or pass-through configurations, the AFB model boasts a spacious 27.5\" door opening with a safety interlock, ensuring ease of access and operation. For specialized washing of sheet pans, a dedicated stainless steel dishrack is available to ensure proper cleaning. With its compact design, the AFB warewashing center optimizes floor space, offering a comprehensive solution within a minimal footprint. The soil dishtable incorporates three deep sinks, facilitating pre-wash activities and ensuring efficient workflow in busy kitchen environments. Rated capacities range from 12 to 37 racks per hour, providing flexibility to meet varying demands. Additionally, with a minimum temperature requirement of 130 degrees Fahrenheit (54.4 degrees Celsius), the AFB ensures effective sanitization. Electrical compatibility is simplified with a 115-volt single-phase connection, requiring only two 10-12 AWG copper wires and appropriate circuit protection for seamless integration into existing setups.</p>', '<p>Designed specifically for bakery operations, the AFB-C Corner Bakery Upright Dish Machine offers specialized features tailored to handle bakery trays and pots effectively. Equipped with a single rack and a single chemical alarm, this machine ensures precise and controlled washing and sanitizing processes. Operating at low temperature, it provides gentle yet thorough cleaning, ideal for bakery items that may be sensitive to high temperatures With its corner configuration and tall design, this dishwasher optimizes space utilization, making it suitable for compact bakery layouts. Additionally, it includes one stainless steel sheet pan rack, offering added convenience for bakery operations that require simultaneous washing of sheet pans alongside other items.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/016-0091.0236_e9513f14-90d7-4d63-a1b6-aa0595ee4355.webp\"]', '016-0091.0236', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 7161.72, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 34.00, NULL, 79.00, NULL, 35.00, NULL, 330.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:38', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/016-0091.0236_e9513f14-90d7-4d63-a1b6-aa0595ee4355.webp', 'physical', NULL, 5639.15, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/u9vQZ4TnWAsdzAfSmPiwvnHQEYOT2rAPetCeBJAb.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/sVLPwG5AmrYJ3w7V8yc6TRhVQJnZNL9NRAcHcnis.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Flb9P6ZxkpqzMNNmC57pesycidawUnZ9spDlTs2B.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB245\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1938, 'American Dish AFB-C Corner Bakery Single Rack Upright Dish Machine Corner', '<p>The dishwashing unit offers versatility with cycle times of either 90, 120, or 150 seconds, catering to varying washing needs. It accommodates standard 20\" x 20\" racks and operates with a high-pressure 1.5 HP pump for efficient cleaning. Equipped with built-in chemical dispensing and a scrap accumulator, it ensures effective washing and sanitizing of bakery trays and pots and pans. Available in both corner and pass-through models, it features a 27.5\" door opening with a safety interlock. Special stainless steel dish racks are required for proper washing of sheet pans. Despite its compact design, it serves as a complete warewashing center, incorporating three 20\" x 20\" x 14\" deep sinks within 121\" of floor space, with longer lengths also available for larger operations. Regarding specifications, the unit can handle 37, 25, or 12 racks per hour, depending on the selected cycle time. It operates with a 1.5 HP motor and consumes 2.5 gallons (9.5 liters) of water per cycle. It maintains a minimum temperature of 130F (54.4C) for effective cleaning. The electrical ratings require connection to a 115-volt single-phase power supply, using two 10-12 AWG copper wires and a suitable ground on a clean circuit, with circuit protection provided by a 20-amp circuit breaker or fuse.</p>', '<p>The AFB-C Corner Bakery Upright Dish Machine is specifically designed to fit into corner spaces, optimizing kitchen layout efficiency. With a single rack setup, this dishwasher streamlines the washing process for smaller batches of dishes or bakery items, ideal for compact kitchens or bakeries. Operating at low temperatures, this machine ensures efficient cleaning while conserving energy, making it suitable for delicate bakery items and reducing utility costs. The TALL feature accommodates taller bakery trays and utensils, providing versatility in washing various bakery equipment and ensuring thorough cleaning. This dishwasher comes with one stainless steel sheetpan rack, offering added convenience and flexibility for washing sheet pans alongside other kitchenware.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/016-0091.0000_21d8da73-e5f8-41ab-a806-5199c4be4303.webp\"]', '016-0091.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 7021.32, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 34.00, NULL, 79.00, NULL, 35.00, NULL, 330.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:38', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/016-0091.0000_21d8da73-e5f8-41ab-a806-5199c4be4303.webp', 'physical', NULL, 5528.6, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/1Vsb7fPXtwGPx1h9ixMIX8D8DZjfkxDgLILszufQ.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/iuk5UR4I4XxZCrpW6HwZ226kVOGIEUe4xV9kDptW.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/d4aVexMZJwcunVN2lwzNL0cy68UoQC0IqIeIUSYf.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB246\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
