(1940, 'American Dish AFB_w/ Bakery Rack Single Rack Upright Dish Machine with Single Chemical Alarm', '<p>This dishwashing unit offers flexibility with its selectable time cycle options of 90, 120, or 150 seconds, catering to varying washing needs. It is designed to accommodate standard 20\" x 20\" racks and boasts a robust high-pressure 1.5 HP pump for efficient cleaning performance. The machine includes built-in chemical dispensing and a scrap accumulator, enhancing convenience and maintenance efficiency. Tailored for bakery operations, it effectively washes and sanitizes bakery trays, pots, and pans, ensuring hygienic standards are met. Available in both corner and pass-through models, it adapts to different kitchen layouts, with a wide 27.5\" door opening equipped with a safety interlock mechanism. Special stainless steel dishracks are required for washing sheet pans, offering optimal cleaning results. In addition to its operational features, this dishwashing unit is engineered with practical specifications for seamless integration into kitchen utilities. With rated capacities ranging from 37 to 12 racks per hour, it accommodates diverse washing demands. The motor boasts a 1.5 HP horsepower, ensuring powerful performance during wash cycles. It consumes 2.5 gallons of water per cycle, maintaining water efficiency while delivering thorough cleaning results. The machine operates within a temperature range of 130F minimum, meeting industry standards for effective sanitization. With a versatile electrical setup, it is compatible with 115 volts, single-phase connections, requiring appropriate wiring and circuit protection for safe operation.</p>', '<p>Equipped with a single chemical alarm for added safety and monitoring during the dishwashing process. Designed for low-temperature operation, ensuring energy efficiency and compatibility with delicate kitchenware. Configured as a pass-through unit, facilitating smooth workflow and easy access from both sides of the machine. Specifically tailored for bakery operations, featuring a TALL design to accommodate bakery trays and a single stainless steel sheet pan rack. Offers efficient washing and sanitizing capabilities, making it suitable for cleaning various types of kitchen equipment and utensils.Efficient and reliable, the American Dish AFB is a single rack upright dish machine with a built-in bakery rack and chemical alarm. Designed for low-temperature washing, this tall pass-thru machine is perfect for bakeries and comes with a bonus stainless steel sheetpan rack.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/016-0090.0024_4deb20fa-5d50-4916-acbe-2dbe3e5389a8.webp\"]', '016-0090.0024', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 7039.48, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 34.00, NULL, 79.00, NULL, 35.00, NULL, 330.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:40', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/016-0090.0024_4deb20fa-5d50-4916-acbe-2dbe3e5389a8.webp', 'physical', NULL, 5542.9, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/LtYQyn4trWAhXdxwDbfb0QHjGXKYUocvLfUerH2W.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/BSKQwQ6oBksce7mOhl4Tr6ZCsh9JNlHL2g0ce5yW.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/sZBswjuO4Vs1GDFIFK6NBeEjgLmLoGXI4Sf87mn8.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB248\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1941, 'American Dish AFB_ Bakery Rack Single Rack Upright Dish Machine', '<p>The American Dish AFB dishwashing system offers customizable time cycles of 90, 120, or 150 seconds, ensuring flexibility in washing operations. It accommodates standard 20\" x 20\" racks and features a robust 1.5 HP pump, providing high-pressure cleaning for effective removal of dirt and grime. With built-in chemical dispensing, the machine simplifies the sanitation process while maintaining consistent cleaning results. Additionally, it includes a scrap accumulator, enhancing the longevity of the system by trapping debris and preventing clogs. This versatile dishwashing center is suitable for various kitchen setups, available in both corner and pass-through models. Its 27.5\" door opening, equipped with a safety interlock, ensures easy and secure access during operation. While the machine effectively cleans bakery trays, pots, and pans, it also offers compatibility with sheet pans, requiring a specialized stainless steel dishrack for proper washing. Moreover, occupying only 121\" of floor space, it serves as a complete warewashing solution, incorporating a soil dishtable with three deep sinks, making it suitable for commercial kitchens of different sizes and configurations.</p>', '<p>You can select from a variety to select from. For instance, you can choose from 90, 120, or 150-second cycles to suit specific washing needs. Standard Rack Compatibility that is useful to hold standard 20\" x 20\" racks for versatile dishwashing applications. Efficient Pump System that is Equipped with a high-pressure 1.5 HP pump for powerful cleaning performance. Built-In Chemical Dispensing help you streamline chemical usage and ensures consistent sanitation levels. Scrap Accumulator that is built-in and maintains cleanliness and prolongs the lifespan of the washing system.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/016-0090.0000_a6e75562-773f-466f-ac4e-aa8c9279dea7.webp\"]', '016-0090.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 6899.08, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 34.00, NULL, 79.00, NULL, 35.00, NULL, 330.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:41', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/016-0090.0000_a6e75562-773f-466f-ac4e-aa8c9279dea7.webp', 'physical', NULL, 5432.35, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/PEiGlcJWG1QZniA26Moc5J3PvLoPdjeY9FftiOVD.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/JxQPZnHC8FchhbGFVURxbeGyADFR1UrTd6nQdbv3.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/7FWA7I0lrNV1QcUIKTvqsoLg1WKOI1LG1LE5lzFq.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB249\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1942, 'American Dish L-90-3DWS-3D 3-Door Single Rack Upright Dish Machine 208V', '<p>The \"Top mount controls\" of this dishwasher provide convenient access for operators, ensuring ease of use and efficient operation. With a \"Great door clearance\" of 20.375 inches, loading and unloading dishes is hassle-free, accommodating even larger items with ease. Equipped with a \"Quick service 1 1/2 HP pump,\" this dishwasher offers reliability and ensures minimal downtime, facilitating quick maintenance and repair when needed. The \"Quick release spray arms\" feature allows for easy removal and cleaning, maintaining optimal performance and hygiene standards. Constructed with durable materials such as \"Stainless steel air gap,\" \"Stainless steel impellor and sump,\" and \"Nylatron strips,\" this dishwasher guarantees longevity and resistance to corrosion. Its \"Two-stage filter\" protects the pump and spray jets, prolonging their lifespan and reducing the need for frequent maintenance. Operating as a \"LOW-ENERGY dump and fill dishmachine,\" it conserves energy while delivering excellent cleaning results. Additionally, features like the \"Eye-level temperature gauge,\" \"Built-in de-liming switch,\" and \"Automatic chemical feed\" ensure precise control over the washing process, enhancing efficiency and reliability.</p>', '<p>The L-90-3DWS-3D upright dish machine features a unique three-door design, providing versatility and ease of access for loading and unloading dishes. With the capability to accommodate a single rack per cycle, this dishwasher is suitable for moderate to high-volume dishwashing needs in commercial kitchens. Operating at low temperatures, this dish machine ensures efficient cleaning while conserving energy, making it an environmentally friendly choice. Designed as a pass-thru model, this dishwasher facilitates seamless workflow in busy kitchen environments by allowing dishes to be loaded from one side and unloaded from the other. Equipped with a muffler heater and compatible with a 208V power supply, this dishwasher ensures optimal performance and reliability for consistent dishwashing results.</p>', 'published', '[]', '024-1090.0425', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 9619.74, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 300.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:43', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/024-1090.0425_c9da85a1-5c0d-48ee-a59e-6fc819556ea1.webp', 'physical', NULL, 7574.6, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/RW1sgrMT5d7TrZekzzAmRod8Nd6IsMJKIpW6WfYV.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/JMQ05v84JXwCLarZteoeFzQl1vv9jfRNZoKybY7a.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Qbd7QjAkSIIIA1LG4zbaSa3bFNsU7OlBFdPyTLqd.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/HyPEdIn1jzkSSbuFwmU9IaqYMeLryZbIjhroXDPG.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/r2fSqqTI8mbkxCENMPrqtgdfKmPUn29CrmqaD9fc.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB250\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1943, 'American Dish L-90-3DWS-3D 3-Door Upright Single Rack Dish Machine', '<p>The upright dish machine boasts convenient top mount controls, providing easy access for operators to manage the washing process efficiently. With a generous door clearance of 20.375 inches, loading and unloading dishes is made effortless, accommodating various dish sizes and shapes. Equipped with a quick-service 1 1/2 HP pump, this dishwasher ensures swift maintenance and repairs, minimizing downtime in busy kitchen environments. Additionally, its quick-release spray arms facilitate easy cleaning and maintenance, promoting optimal performance with minimal hassle. Constructed with durable stainless steel components, including an air gap, impellor, and sump, the dishwasher promises longevity and reliability. Its low-energy dump and fill system contribute to energy efficiency without compromising on cleaning effectiveness. The exterior-mounted chemical pump heads and two-stage filter safeguard the pump and spray jets, ensuring consistent performance over time. With a water consumption rate of 1.2 gallons per rack and a 90-second cycle time, this dishwasher achieves high throughput, capable of handling up to 37 racks per hour. The innovative design features a true 3-door configuration, with only two doors opening in either arrangement, minimizing water splash and maintaining door alignment. Additional features such as an eye-level temperature gauge, built-in de-liming switch, and automatic chemical feed further enhance usability and maintenance ease, making it an ideal choice for commercial kitchen operations.</p>', '<p>The dishwasher is equipped with a three-door configuration, facilitating efficient loading and unloading of dishes. Featuring an upright layout, this dishwasher optimizes space utilization in the kitchen while accommodating a single rack of dishes. Operating at low temperatures, this dishwasher ensures energy efficiency while effectively cleaning and sanitizing dishes. Designed with a pass-through configuration, this dishwasher allows for seamless transfer of racks from one side to the other. Equipped with a single chemical alarm, this dishwasher provides notification in case of any chemical-related issues during the washing cycle.</p>', 'published', '[]', '024-1090.0422', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 6159.37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 300.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:44', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/024-1090.0422_f03e4ad0-3482-4b64-bd04-0ba6fe95239d.webp', 'physical', NULL, 4849.9, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/B5VoHz8wODB4SMkPeu2YgAo1q69xlUjbEVDgC8tC.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/vSbRErBSzijYxSw76qVjSdWJ8YfDGa7jLtYY3GJp.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/u0M0Jh8esLTmwRvwjJmVIhRcoG1mYHIWsG7TrATf.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/gg2HnM2UmDDObOlVNa3wrAsnxsclicdnUq4P7BAf.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB251\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1944, 'American Dish L-90-3DWC-S 2-Door Single Rack Upright Dish Machine 208V', '<p>Featuring top-mounted controls and an ample door clearance of 20.375 inches, this dishwasher ensures convenient operation and easy loading and unloading of dishes. Equipped with a quick-service 1 1/2 HP pump and quick-release spray arms, along with a stainless steel air gap and run indicator light, it guarantees efficient and effective cleaning with minimal downtime. Its stainless steel impellor and sump contribute to its reputation as a true low-energy dump and fill dishmachine, combining energy efficiency with powerful performance. Additionally, the exterior-mounted chemical pump heads and two-stage filter provide added protection to the pump and spray jets, enhancing durability and reliability. Notable features of this dishwasher include its 1.2-gallon water consumption per rack and rapid 90-second cycle time, allowing it to handle up to 37 racks per hour, making it suitable for high-volume applications. Its innovative design includes a true 3-door configuration, ensuring that only two doors open in either setup, effectively preventing water from accumulating on the back wall and maintaining door alignment. Furthermore, it incorporates user-friendly features such as an eye-level temperature gauge, built-in de-liming switch, large capacity internal scrapper, and automatic chemical feed, streamlining operation and maintenance.</p>', '<p>The dishwasher features a vertical, upright design with two doors, making it convenient for loading and unloading a single rack of dishes. This layout is particularly advantageous for space-saving in kitchens with limited floor space. Operating at low temperature, this dishwasher ensures efficient cleaning while conserving energy. It utilizes low-temperature settings to wash and sanitize dishes effectively without excessive heat, contributing to lower utility costs. Designed for corner placement, this dishwasher maximizes space utilization in kitchen layouts. Its corner configuration allows it to fit seamlessly into corners, optimizing the use of available space while maintaining accessibility. Equipped with a muffler heater, this dishwasher minimizes noise during operation, providing a quieter dishwashing experience. The muffler heater reduces sound emissions, creating a more comfortable environment in the kitchen. With compatibility for 208 volts electrical supply, this dishwasher is suitable for use in commercial settings where this voltage is commonly available. This ensures seamless integration into existing electrical systems, facilitating easy installation and operation.</p>', 'published', '[]', '024-1090.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 6018.97, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 300.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:45', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/024-1090.0000_8e2c955d-cbb1-4b53-9618-5da9eba63b1e.webp', 'physical', NULL, 4739.35, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/N9wrgdBBp8JUlm5p8eOufu0wU4oK4n4hTB3qK10O.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/JQB0K0Z0uVfu2cOuLEwgGjkBSLUOLWsTxSnYddt3.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/39cYK2uhQZFUOf07r3x8LOC6LcLPMwhzb8yI21IN.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3WYMhpnkIOPQRRMXaFNSHhM9973U8LpThvkhJKOe.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/K0qa7oD6EizQlaWSOBzzptloBTwIGX9PrlBdR5EK.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB252\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1945, 'American Dish L-90-3DWC-S 2-Door Upright Dish Machine with Single Rack 208V', '<p>The dishwasher features controls mounted at the top, providing convenient access for operation. With a spacious door clearance of 20.375 inches, loading and unloading large items are made effortless. The machine is equipped with a 1 1/2 HP pump for quick servicing, ensuring minimal downtime. Additionally, it boasts quick-release spray arms and a stainless steel air gap for enhanced cleanliness. The presence of a run indicator light simplifies monitoring, while the stainless steel impellor and sump contribute to easy cleaning and maintenance. As a true low-energy dump and fill dishwasher, it offers efficient operation while conserving resources. Externally mounted chemical pump heads and a two-stage filter system safeguard the pump and spray jets. The dishwasher\'s stainless steel sump and impeller ensure durability and reliability. It consumes 1.2 gallons of water per rack, facilitating efficient water usage. Operating at a 90-second cycle, it can process up to 37 racks per hour. The dishwasher\'s design features a true 3-door configuration, ensuring alignment and preventing water accumulation on the back wall. It incorporates practical features such as an eye-level temperature gauge, built-in de-liming switch, and large capacity internal scrapper for added convenience. Moreover, the dishwasher\'s swift plumbing removal system and quick service pump facilitate easier maintenance, making it an ideal choice for commercial kitchens.`</p>', '<p>The dishwasher is designed with two doors, allowing for easy loading and unloading of dishes, while its single rack capacity ensures efficient cleaning of a standard load of dishes Operating at low temperature, this dishwasher is suitable for handling delicate items that may be sensitive to high heat, ensuring that they are cleaned effectively without risk of damage. The dishwasher is built in a corner configuration, optimizing space utilization in the kitchen while providing a convenient location for installation. Equipped with a muffler heater, this dishwasher efficiently heats water to the required temperature for cleaning, ensuring thorough sanitation of dishes and utensils. With a power supply of 208 volts, this dishwasher delivers efficient performance while meeting the electrical requirements of commercial kitchens.</p>', 'published', '[]', '024-3090.0147', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 9500.3, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 300.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:46', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/024-3090.0147_13ac2d2b-8da8-4c5a-8d70-ad0887bba989.webp', 'physical', NULL, 7480.55, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/7y7TzkCagaKnYjwCOGAeKaIl6R83FjFK6LIa7PV4.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/uh7hEHdv14aSpdDTJiWjdY3y8T4KPgcpVL4Wo6aB.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/95uwIiBMaE4YX9ZmRG2tq21Kq7USbMUEJGhXFYhz.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/ci76xNvZ5uIo6Oig1iOoj0JGfDh8Xz6lHciGM2lJ.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/YiuPx0q91TSml5IxcgYsJT2bu114asfjN4o4Fyt6.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB253\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1946, 'American Dish L-90-3DWC-S 2-Door Single Rack Upright Dish Machine', '<p>The L-90-3DWC-S dishwasher boasts top-mounted controls, ensuring easy access and intuitive operation for users. Its generous door clearance of 20.375 inches accommodates bulky items, facilitating efficient loading and unloading. Equipped with a powerful 1 1/2 HP pump, this dishwasher offers quick serviceability, allowing for swift repairs and maintenance to minimize downtime in busy kitchen environments. Additionally, the dishwasher features quick-release spray arms and a stainless steel air gap, enhancing its durability and ease of cleaning while ensuring reliable performance. Designed for energy efficiency, the L-90-3DWC-S is a true low-energy dish machine that conserves resources without compromising cleaning efficacy. With exterior-mounted chemical pump heads and a two-stage filter system that protects both the pump and spray jets, this dishwasher delivers consistent and thorough cleaning results. Its stainless steel sump and impeller further contribute to its longevity and performance. With a capacity of 37 racks per hour and a 90-second cycle time, this dishwasher offers efficient operation to meet the demands of busy commercial kitchens. Additionally, features like the built-in de-liming switch, large capacity internal scrapper, and automatic chemical feed streamline maintenance and ensure optimal performance.</p>', '<p>Easy-to-access controls located at the top of the machine for convenient operation and monitoring. Generous door clearance of 20.375 inches, enabling hassle-free loading and unloading of bulky items. Equipped with a 1 1/2 HP pump for swift maintenance and repairs, minimizing downtime in busy kitchen settings. Stainless steel impellor and sump ensure durability and longevity, while the stainless steel air gap enhances cleanliness and hygiene. Designed as a true low-energy dump and fill dish machine, it conserves resources while delivering reliable cleaning performance.</p>', 'published', '[]', '024-3090.0145', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 6039.93, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 300.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:47', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/024-3090.0145_94d9e5e7-36fb-4e66-8460-5d98273a45df.webp', 'physical', NULL, 4755.85, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/gqbBt7hPHJbs4PatUEMqtq1IaPHkNLIjdtVO9Zmp.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/UYmLmo57lAgVSJt6xaCM35DnftyFPglz990ib6A8.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/EPdELrA3yaBzKX8KlAvPVWROYLwpfBGcwPtsSu7W.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/wYQNPzaa3wz7wmyl7J4SX6ViNM0yEuuJQDEUNLrR.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/z8AhF807LPIArClLCayZ92yaILKM0YvfUTuvVJS1.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB254\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1947, 'American Dish L-90-3DWC-S 2-Door Single Rack Upright Dish Machine', '<p>The top-mounted controls of this dishmachine ensure easy access and operation, while its spacious door clearance of 20.375 inches facilitates convenient loading and unloading. Featuring a 1 1/2 HP pump for swift service, coupled with quick-release spray arms and a stainless steel air gap, this unit guarantees efficient performance. Equipped with run indicator lights and built-in chemical pump heads on the exterior, it offers simple monitoring and maintenance. Constructed with a stainless steel impellor and sump, it ensures durability and hassle-free cleaning, making it a truly energy-efficient dishwashing solution. Boasting a true 3-door design with only 2 doors opening in any configuration, this dishmachine eliminates water buildup on the back wall and keeps doors perfectly aligned. It incorporates practical features like an eye-level temperature gauge, built-in de-liming switch, and large capacity internal scrapper for enhanced functionality. With automatic chemical feed and Nylatron strips protecting stainless doors, it offers added convenience and protection. Additionally, its air gap fill system eliminates the need for check valves and vacuum breakers, while swift plumbing removal and quick service pump features simplify maintenance tasks, ensuring uninterrupted operation.</p>', '<p>The L-90-3DWC-S features a space-saving corner design, making it ideal for establishments with limited space or unique layout requirements. With the ability to accommodate a single rack, this dish machine is suitable for smaller-scale operations or establishments with moderate dishwashing needs. Operating at low temperatures, the L-90-3DWC-S ensures efficient cleaning while conserving energy, making it an environmentally friendly choice. Its upright configuration allows for easy loading and unloading of dishes, optimizing workflow efficiency in busy kitchen environments. Equipped with two doors, this dish machine facilitates smooth operation and convenient access to the interior for maintenance and service tasks.</p>', 'published', '[]', '024-3090.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 5899.53, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 300.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:48', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/024-3090.0000_ef834199-cd87-44ab-8aaa-b24b8d999d16.webp', 'physical', NULL, 4645.3, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/39xHgq39tLlyN9mR1xRiqvEl0S7fcslVDXli9HPH.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/jR5BHdOrRGF9YxeUqLBZJyaqpeOuNsAkk8cso37n.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/V397yQ3k39fjChUlyzTayQLs3lmLhG4sbjaFczg8.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/z8E0k8bFjZA0b5jOlMGdqXcXFtPtXcTFHXEn3ZnF.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/bJruQlWWUj9baPujnS9B9Xvt3IzFwpiEL1YjDG5n.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB255\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1948, 'American Dish L-90-3DW-S 2-Door, 208V Upright Dish Machine with Single Rack, Low Temp', '<p>The L Series upright dish machine sets a high standard with its array of top-notch features designed to streamline dishwashing operations in commercial kitchens. From its top mount controls to the impressive door clearance of 20.375 inches, every aspect is engineered for efficiency and ease of use. The machine boasts a powerful 1.5 HP pump for quick service, along with quick-release spray arms and exterior-mounted chemical pump heads, ensuring thorough cleaning with minimal downtime. Its stainless steel construction, including the air gap, impellor, sump, and sump impeller, not only enhances durability but also simplifies cleaning, making maintenance a breeze. With a true 3-door design and features like an eye-level temperature gauge, built-in de-liming switch, and large capacity internal scrapper, it offers operators a user-friendly experience while ensuring optimal cleaning results. Moreover, the L Series dish machine is designed with energy efficiency and reliability in mind. With a low-energy dump and fill system, it conserves water and energy while maintaining exceptional cleaning performance. The inclusion of a two-stage filter to protect the pump and spray jets further enhances longevity and reduces maintenance requirements. Additionally, innovative features such as Nylatron strips to protect stainless doors, air gap fill technology, and swift plumbing removal using zero-interference Stainless/Terelene Couplers, contribute to hassle-free operation and long-term durability. Equipped with prime switches, automatic chemical feed, and dual screens to protect the pump intake, this dish machine offers a comprehensive solution for commercial dishwashing needs, delivering consistent performance at a rated capacity of 37 racks per hour with a quick 90-second cycle time.</p>', '<p>The American Dish L-90-3DW-S features a pass-thru configuration, allowing for seamless integration into kitchen workflows by facilitating easy loading and unloading from both sides. Designed for energy efficiency and versatility, this dish machine operates at low temperatures, conserving energy while effectively cleaning dishes. With a single rack capacity, this machine is suitable for moderate to high-volume dishwashing needs in commercial kitchens, offering efficiency without compromising on performance. Equipped with a muffler heater operating at 208V, this dish machine ensures consistent water temperatures for optimal cleaning results while minimizing noise levels during operation. The upright design of the L-90-3DW-S maximizes floor space utilization, making it ideal for establishments where space efficiency is crucial, while also providing easy access for maintenance and service.</p>', 'published', '[]', '024-2090.0164', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 9369.68, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 300.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:49', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/024-2090.0164_dae3e52a-b903-493f-810f-76a9b65b1630.webp', 'physical', NULL, 7377.7, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/SCGzCQITOMRg6MH4S8hBzFhNqfgMdCSzBIfyvhxz.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/55qdq45HPTeAiwaYcn7YfhwaPHxi3044L7HHNQD6.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/wBccmQH6QcRZBKr89LBdusBz64Kdgw8q064g7SJZ.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/jyAx1sbLFcqwVVelVLr0pHPoljnB1jURa6g4Wb5x.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/jiXs1O15Id0yVnMMrRdnZt0DtaPmkAiIxwJZuG9d.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB256\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1949, 'American Dish L-90-3DW-S 2-Door, Upright Dish Machine with Single Rack', '<p>The \"L-90-3DW-S\" upright dish machine offers a comprehensive array of standard features tailored to streamline dishwashing operations in commercial kitchens. Its top-mounted controls ensure easy access and operation, while the generous door clearance of 20.375 inches facilitates the loading and unloading of racks with ease. The machine boasts a powerful 1.5 HP pump for quick service, coupled with quick-release spray arms for efficient cleaning. Its stainless steel air gap and impeller, along with a two-stage filter system, protect the pump and spray jets, ensuring durability and consistent performance. The unit\'s true three-door design, with only two doors opening in either configuration, enhances efficiency and workflow, while its eye-level temperature gauge and built-in de-liming switch provide added convenience and functionality. With a focus on energy efficiency and operational convenience, the \"L-90-3DW-S\" dish machine operates as a true low-energy dump and fill system, minimizing water and energy consumption without compromising cleaning effectiveness. It features an automatic chemical feed system, prime switches, and Nylatron strips to protect stainless doors, ensuring optimal cleaning performance with minimal maintenance requirements. Additionally, the unit\'s swift plumbing removal system and quick-service pump facilitate easy repair and maintenance, reducing downtime and maximizing productivity. Its capacity to accommodate 37 racks per hour, combined with its 90-second cycle time and efficient water consumption of 1.2 gallons per cycle, make it a reliable and cost-effective solution for busy kitchen environments.</p>', '<p>Two-door design enables efficient pass-through operation, facilitating smooth workflow in busy kitchen settings. Equipped with a low-temperature washing system for effective cleaning while conserving energy and reducing operational costs. Incorporates a single chemical alarm for monitoring chemical levels, ensuring consistent and optimal cleaning performance. Upright configuration facilitates ergonomic loading and unloading of dishes, enhancing operational efficiency and reducing strain on kitchen staff. Built-in safety features, including the single chemical alarm, ensure compliance with safety regulations and maintain a secure working environment.</p>', 'published', '[]', '024-2090.0162', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 5909.31, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 300.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:50', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/024-2090.0162_b1b649f4-6958-47e4-a6af-e8643267533f.webp', 'physical', NULL, 4653, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/t3BJVMBsbm90392YmPDCYCwlfZpan1a7BVcSaJ6I.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6QdGeSwlMiJbETu4WKEbzjpSRLorEvNjp3TK3ZDN.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/l4ONYjbCZRH3zEaQ3lksNHmHtjS8hI8IeHCCZWJH.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/ri1g8OoPvV3FVs6awUUX84h3xvRhefivp5G3y28P.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/MHjS2uIHXlFlFqLU1vZazs1IKKxnDflE3aXcLRcI.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB257\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1950, 'American Dish L-90-3DW-S 2-Door, Upright Dish Machine with Single Rack', '<p>The dishwashing experience is optimized with the L Series dish machine, featuring top-mount controls for easy access and operation. With a generous door clearance of 20.375 inches, loading and unloading are convenient, ensuring smooth workflow in busy kitchen environments. Equipped with a quick-service 1 1/2 HP pump and quick-release spray arms, this machine efficiently cleans dishes while minimizing downtime. The stainless steel air gap ensures sanitary operation, while the exterior-mounted chemical pump heads facilitate hassle-free chemical dispensing. With a focus on energy efficiency, this dish machine consumes just 1.2 gallons of water per rack, making it a sustainable choice for commercial kitchens. Designed for reliability and ease of maintenance, the L Series dish machine boasts features like a built-in de-liming switch, large capacity internal scraper, and no-adjustment solenoid replacement. The true 3-door design, with only 2 doors opening in either configuration, eliminates water on the back wall and ensures that doors stay in alignment for smooth operation. The machine\'s eye-level temperature gauge provides real-time monitoring, while the dual screens protect the intake of the pump, enhancing its longevity. Overall, the L Series dish machine combines efficiency, durability, and ease of maintenance to meet the rigorous demands of commercial dishwashing operations.</p>', '<p>The L-90-3DW-S features a convenient 2-door design, allowing for easy loading and unloading of dishes from both sides, enhancing workflow efficiency in busy kitchen environments. With a single rack capacity, this dish machine can accommodate a significant load of dishes, making it suitable for medium to high-volume dishwashing needs in commercial settings. Operating at low temperatures, this dish machine ensures energy efficiency while effectively removing dirt, grease, and stains from dishes, reducing utility costs and environmental impact. The pass-thru configuration of the L-90-3DW-S enables seamless integration into dishwashing lines, allowing dishes to be loaded from one side and unloaded from the other, streamlining the dishwashing process. Designed as an upright dish machine, the L-90-3DW-S optimizes floor space utilization, making it ideal for kitchens with limited space availability while maintaining high dishwashing capacity.</p>', 'published', '[]', '024-2090.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 5768.91, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 300.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:51', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/024-2090.0000_c5d4e456-db28-4d8e-a216-aac4474d8145.webp', 'physical', NULL, 4542.45, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/ml59o4Fqzjnc9onkJVoaVcttbnUxZSSHUZbutI0R.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/9o5cxWHoFqcAh9S4NDl3U1UVp55Kgw7AxVSvVouL.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/5pH6XWhvMRmK72gMO9C1QZVKNM8AorgjNlxk5CAm.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/nCG6YNZqcYdvBYlCNrpURYoMoAD2N7vIug9zed4d.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/yihBFp7KJLo9FO1zok4LatoBf42gyJcCUSUbyLRf.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB258\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1951, 'American Dish ET-AF-3-PH-S Single Rack Under Counter Low Temp Dish Machine 34 1/2\" Tall W/ 14\"', '<p>The ET Series Dish Machine sets a standard of efficiency and reliability with its comprehensive array of standard features. Equipped with 1 1/2 HP wash and rinse pump prime switches, it ensures powerful cleaning performance, leaving dishes sparkling clean. Automatic chemical feed simplifies the process of dispensing cleaning agents, enhancing consistency and effectiveness. Its rapid 90-second complete time cycle facilitates quick turnaround, ideal for high-volume dishwashing operations. The hinged mounted panel offers easy service access, allowing for convenient maintenance and minimizing downtime. Additionally, the availability of a tall version and a glassware cross arm provides flexibility to accommodate various dishwashing needs. The ergonomic design, characterized by a short door construction, enables operators to load and unload with ease while keeping the aisle open and clear, enhancing workflow efficiency. Optional heat maintains tank temperature rack after rack, ensuring consistent cleaning results. Dual screening protects both wash and drain pumps from debris, enhancing durability and reliability. The pumped drain feature allows for installation in almost all applications, making it a versatile choice for diverse foodservice settings, especially when space is a concern. In terms of specifications, the ET Series offers impressive capacities, capable of handling 30, 24, or 20 racks per hour, depending on operational demands. The motor horsepower rating of 1.5 HP for the pump and 1/6 HP for the drain ensures robust performance. With a water usage of 1.7 gallons per cycle or 6.4 liters per cycle, it promotes efficient water consumption without compromising on cleaning efficacy. The dish machine maintains a minimum temperature of 120F or 49C, meeting essential sanitation standards. Equipped with a sustainer heater with a 500-watt capacity, it ensures consistent tank temperature, contributing to effective cleaning outcomes. The availability of cycle times ranging from 90 to 150 seconds offers flexibility to accommodate varying dishwashing needs. Electrical ratings compliant with NEC standards provide clear guidelines for safe and reliable electrical connections, ensuring operational safety</p>', '<p>The ET-AF-3-PH-S Under Counter Dish Machine is equipped with a powerful 1 1/2 HP wash and rinse pump system, ensuring thorough cleaning of dishes with every cycle. With an automatic chemical feed system and a rapid 90-second complete time cycle, this dish machine simplifies the dishwashing process, allowing for efficient operation in busy commercial kitchens. Featuring a hinged mounted panel for easy service access and a skirted design that reaches the ground, this under-counter dish machine is designed for accessibility and convenience during maintenance tasks. The machine\'s compact size, standing at 34 1/2\" tall with a 14\" door opening, makes it suitable for under-counter installation in various kitchen layouts, offering flexibility in space utilization. Equipped with a pumped drain system and a sustainer heater, this dish machine ensures consistent performance, reliable operation, and effective cleaning results, meeting the demands of commercial dishwashing needs.</p>', 'published', '[]', '018-1090.1293', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 7033.9, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 26.00, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 274.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:53', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/018-1090.1293_100aa2d6-9407-485f-b4e7-dd2990c2af15.webp', 'physical', NULL, 5538.5, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6E3uvxzgVwxufvQroocTGXgftVc3Re2GJ3mfpBuM.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/8Gi7T2quxZHhpzy74HUXdSTkWLX4k1iXMwhdEkOk.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/F1mJR8ihoK99OhT01bhMOWvsrAWiSCilFHYPjQTY.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/QUkuN2jDzYmUShSENDWRFAZOs4CWkAHSnGHxiyme.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB259\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1952, 'American Dish ET-AF-3-PH-S Single Rack Under Counter Low Temp Dish Machine 37 1/2\" Tall W/ 14\"', '<p>The ET-AF-3-PH-S Under Counter Dish Machine offers a comprehensive array of standard features designed to optimize dishwashing efficiency and convenience. With robust 1 1/2 HP wash and rinse pump prime switches, it ensures powerful cleaning performance. Automatic chemical feed simplifies the process of dispensing cleaning agents, promoting consistency and reliability. The machine\'s rapid 90-second complete time cycle facilitates quick turnover, ideal for busy foodservice environments. Its hinged mounted panel provides easy service access, streamlining maintenance tasks and minimizing downtime. Additionally, the option for a tall version and the availability of a glassware cross arm cater to varying operational needs, ensuring versatility and adaptability. In terms of specifications, the ET Series with Pumped Drain and Heat boasts impressive capacities, offering the flexibility to handle 30, 24, or 20 racks per hour, depending on operational requirements. With a robust motor rating of 1.5 HP for the pump and 1/6 HP for the drain, it delivers reliable performance. The dish machine operates with a water usage of 1.7 gallons per cycle, ensuring efficient water consumption. It maintains a minimum temperature of 120F or 49C, meeting essential sanitation standards. Equipped with a sustainer heater with a 500-watt capacity, it ensures consistent tank temperature for effective cleaning. Moreover, its electrical ratings comply with NEC standards, providing clear guidelines for safe and reliable electrical connections.</p>', '<p>The ET-AF-3-PH-S dish machine boasts a powerful 1 1/2 HP wash and rinse pump, ensuring thorough cleaning with every cycle, even at low temperatures. With an automatic chemical feed system, this machine simplifies the process of dispensing cleaning agents, enhancing consistency and reliability in dishwashing operations. Featuring a 90-second complete time cycle, this dish machine offers rapid turnover, ideal for high-demand environments where efficiency is crucial. The hinged mounted panel facilitates easy access for servicing and maintenance, minimizing downtime and ensuring smooth operation during busy periods. Designed with operators in mind, the machine features an ergonomic design that allows for easy loading and unloading, with a short door construction and available glassware cross arm to keep the aisle clear and accessible.</p>', 'published', '[]', '018-1090.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 6893.5, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 26.00, NULL, 80.00, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 274.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:54', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/018-1090.0000_699fb0e6-d799-4ec9-96ff-3806c1325d9f.webp', 'physical', NULL, 5427.95, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/lYb9XD40DZNheP3T3htTES4mQKbgOUFARfigREcV.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/tcaG3SvKkOCVPJpExrLbJgS1PHAg4RBW50IOTbfh.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/xBDcpe0pNPGA7OCKxDoeambNxIkbkTZYOEksiPla.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/eMTBmhzY3rIqlTPMHkOoOFyXUQXqR64MyZlLSwU7.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB260\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
