(1954, 'American Dish ET-AF-3-PH Single Rack Under Counter Dish Machine 37 1/2\" Tall W/ 14\"', '<p>The ET Series dishwashing unit boasts a variety of standard functionalities aimed at optimizing dishwashing operations in commercial settings. With 1 1/2 HP wash and rinse pump prime switches, the machine ensures efficient water circulation for thorough cleaning results. An automatic chemical feed system optimizes the distribution of cleaning agents, minimizing manual intervention while maintaining consistent cleaning performance. Its rapid 90-second complete time cycle enhances workflow efficiency, enabling quick turnaround times for dishwashing tasks. The hinged-mounted panel design facilitates easy service access, simplifying maintenance procedures and minimizing downtime to ensure uninterrupted operation in busy kitchen environments. Additionally, a tall version of the machine is available to cater to various space requirements in commercial kitchens. Designed with user comfort and convenience in mind, the ET Series features an ergonomic design that allows operators to load and unload dishware with ease. The short door construction, measuring 10 inches, ensures that the aisle remains open and clear during operation, further enhancing workflow efficiency. For enhanced functionality, optional heat functionality is available, maintaining tank temperature rack after rack for consistent washing performance. Dual screening protects both wash and drain pumps from debris, ensuring long-term reliability and durability. With a pumped drain system, this dish machine offers versatility in installation, making it suitable for a wide range of kitchen configurations. Ideal for space-constrained environments, the ET Series dish machine is the optimal choice for establishments prioritizing space efficiency.</p>', '<p>The ET-AF-3-PH features a robust pumped drain system and sustainer heater, ensuring effective water drainage and consistent tank temperature for optimal cleaning performance. With a height of 37 1/2 inches and a 14-inch door opening, this dish machine is designed to fit seamlessly under counters, maximizing kitchen space utilization without compromising on functionality. Operating at low temperatures, this machine effectively cleans dishware while minimizing energy consumption, making it an environmentally friendly choice for commercial kitchens. Equipped to handle a single rack, this dishwasher offers efficient cleaning for moderate dishwashing demands, ideal for smaller foodservice establishments or as a supplementary unit in larger kitchens. The pumped drain system allows for flexible installation options, enabling the machine to be installed in a variety of kitchen configurations to suit the specific needs of the establishment.</p>', 'published', '[]', '018-1091.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 6347.27, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 26.00, NULL, 80.00, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 274.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:56', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/018-1091.0000_83937325-b675-4b49-8d4a-854aad5b1fda.webp', 'physical', NULL, 4997.85, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/mrI3t4LUYQfoSg0eR2Eirgv5Qq2Uvul7TrcIVUZR.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/RgPJHxHWW3li7X4aU854VkudDW2yw1EncFSgZBIB.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/j9sdKeLEnnKuNzHkDAvfBNkenCpjkQLFEDhw5yRv.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/KKhp4af2xSESLAThHJG1KKYcttziaJ2nsAPxZ01I.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB262\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1955, 'American Dish ET-AF-M-PH Single Rack Under Counter Dish Machine 34 1/2\" Tall W/ 11\"', '<p>The ET Series dish machine with pumped drain and heat boasts a comprehensive array of standard features tailored to meet the demands of commercial dishwashing operations. With 1 1/2 HP wash and rinse pump prime switches, this machine ensures efficient water circulation and chemical distribution, guaranteeing thorough cleaning of dishware. Its automatic chemical feed system streamlines the dishwashing process by precisely dosing chemicals, contributing to optimal cleaning results. Operating on a swift 90-second complete time cycle, this machine enhances the efficiency of kitchen operations, facilitating the seamless flow of dishwashing tasks. Additionally, the hinged-mounted panel design enables easy access for servicing, simplifying maintenance procedures and minimizing downtime, thus ensuring continuous operation. The ET Series dish machine is designed with user comfort and convenience in mind, featuring an ergonomic design that allows operators to load and unload dishware with ease. The short door construction, measuring 10 inches, keeps the aisle open and clear, enhancing workflow efficiency in busy kitchen environments. Optional heat functionality maintains tank temperature rack after rack, ensuring consistent washing performance throughout the dishwashing process. Furthermore, dual screening protects both wash and drain pumps from debris, enhancing the longevity and reliability of the machine. With its pumped drain system, this dish machine offers versatility in installation, making it suitable for various kitchen configurations. Ideal for spaces where space is a concern, the ET Series dish machine delivers efficient and reliable dishwashing performance without compromising on functionality or quality.</p>', '<p>Designed to fit conveniently under counters, optimizing space in commercial kitchens while ensuring easy access for staff during operation. Utilizes a low-temperature washing process, effectively cleaning dishware while conserving energy and minimizing the risk of damaging delicate items. With a single rack capacity, suitable for moderate dishwashing needs in smaller establishments or as a supplementary unit in larger kitchens. Equipped with a pumped drain system and sustainer heater, ensures efficient drainage and maintains water temperature for consistent washing performance. Includes a single chemical alarm feature, providing alerts for chemical levels to ensure proper dosing and cleaning effectiveness.</p>', 'published', '[]', '022-0091.0394', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 6369.62, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 26.00, NULL, 79.00, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 270.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:57', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/022-0091.0394_10812b6f-ff05-421c-a1a2-bcb2d2563ad6.webp', 'physical', NULL, 5015.45, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/S8dveDmFJbTFfXqKGJdR05pJJGWEgqCiMqrWR83x.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/JT9RwHmNN7H09StruZbhlS9e7bLComKAE3MES2D0.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/MDajBD58VopJG1iGfiLutEr8Cp4QZazOqZBqjSWu.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/boHEWOUKEinw5bpkWo4KMg7rcrZYC2omtbn5wUdN.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB263\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1956, 'American Dish ET-AF-M-PH Under Counter Low Temp Dish Machine', '<p>The ET Series dish machine with pumped drain and heat presents a range of standard features tailored to meet the demands of commercial dishwashing operations. Equipped with a robust 1 1/2 HP wash and rinse pump and prime switches, this machine ensures efficient water circulation and chemical distribution, resulting in thorough cleaning of dishware with each cycle. Its automatic chemical feed system further streamlines the dishwashing process, allowing for precise chemical dosing to achieve optimal cleaning results. With a 90-second complete time cycle, this machine operates swiftly, contributing to the seamless flow of operations in busy kitchen environments. Additionally, the hinged-mounted panel provides easy access for servicing, facilitating maintenance tasks and minimizing downtime. The ergonomic design of the ET Series dish machine allows operators to load and unload with ease, thanks to its short door construction that keeps the aisle open and clear. Optional heat functionality maintains tank temperature rack after rack, ensuring consistent washing performance throughout the dishwashing process. Dual screening protects both wash and drain pumps from debris, enhancing the longevity and reliability of the machine. With its pumped drain system, this dish machine offers versatility in installation, making it suitable for a wide range of kitchen configurations. Ideal for spaces where space is a concern, the ET Series dish machine offers efficient and reliable dishwashing performance without compromising on functionality or quality.</p>', '<p>This dish machine is designed to be installed under the counter, optimizing space utilization in commercial kitchens while ensuring easy access for staff during operation. Utilizing a low-temperature washing process, this dish machine effectively cleans dishware while conserving energy and minimizing the risk of damaging delicate items. With a single rack capacity, this dish machine is suitable for moderate dishwashing needs in smaller establishments or as a supplementary unit in larger kitchens. Equipped with a pumped drain system and sustainer heater, this dish machine ensures efficient drainage and maintains water temperature for consistent washing performance. Standing at 34 1/2\" tall with an 11\" door opening, this dish machine offers a compact footprint, making it ideal for installation in tight spaces or under standard-height counters without sacrificing functionality or performance.</p>', 'published', '[]', '022-0091.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 6229.22, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 26.00, NULL, 79.00, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 270.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:58', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/022-0091.0000_12042564-5174-4078-9baf-675a667082c4.webp', 'physical', NULL, 4904.9, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/VlChXjmJlem8hqCSQI6qotb9BowRQHQXMHsRjlpF.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/AYuNEvhQkKC5mEyzE02ur8Fcm2xISxPfIrQ7QbJ8.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/4YbWuHyhm96NOBXN9A7SM7LgB6jQcR8XPU7fO1vD.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/tkqpEUqPtxoYdZBOEKzuscgk2EFqWEiw7PsPMvFU.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB264\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1957, 'American Dish Glass Washer With Single Chemical Alarm', 'The ASQ II Glasswasher presents a comprehensive set of standard features tailored to meet the demands of high-volume glassware cleaning in hospitality settings. Its capability for full load washing not only saves power, water, and chemicals but also optimizes efficiency, ensuring that establishments can maintain a steady supply of clean glassware during peak hours. With a rapid 75-second cycle time, this glasswasher operates swiftly, facilitating quick turnover and minimizing wait times for clean glassware. The rotating spray arm mechanism delivers outstanding cleaning results, effectively removing soil and debris from glassware with each cycle, guaranteeing spotless results.\n\nCentral to its design is the divided carousel, which creates a washing chamber that cleans with a recirculating, high-volume water spray, ensuring thorough cleaning action while accommodating simultaneous loading, unloading, and washing of glassware. The manual turn carousel eliminates the need for washing glasses one at a time, streamlining the dishwashing process for bartenders and staff. Equipped with a sustainer heater, this glasswasher maintains the tank temperature, ensuring consistent washing performance. Additionally, the inclusion of built-in chemical storage containers and pre-plumbed dump sink with a stainless steel drain enhances convenience and efficiency in operation, further solidifying the ASQ II Glasswasher as an indispensable asset for hospitality establishments striving for cleanliness and efficiency.', 'This glasswasher features a manual carousel operation, allowing for efficient loading and unloading of glassware, streamlining the dishwashing process in busy bar or restaurant settings.\n\nUtilizing a low-temperature washing process, this glasswasher effectively cleans glassware while conserving energy and minimizing the risk of damaging delicate glassware.\n\nEnhanced safety feature includes a single chemical alarm, providing alerts in case of chemical-related issues during operation, ensuring a secure working environment.\n\nIncorporating ASQ II (Automatic Soil Removal) technology, this glasswasher efficiently removes soil and debris from glassware, ensuring thorough cleaning results with each cycle.\n\nThe carousel is divided into three positions by stainless steel panels, isolating each compartment and controlling the water and washing action of the rotating spray, ensuring efficient and effective cleaning of glassware.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/021-1172.0356_41146eec-9b9c-482d-a586-e1ba77fbfa20.webp\"]', '021-1172.0356', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 7214.11, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:37:59', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/021-1172.0356_41146eec-9b9c-482d-a586-e1ba77fbfa20.webp', 'physical', '', 5680.4, 4, 0, 16, 0, 'No Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB265\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1958, 'American Dish ASQ II Glasswasher Dish Machine with Manual Carousel', 'The ASQ II Glasswasher with its array of standard features offers an efficient and effective solution for cleaning glassware in busy bar and restaurant environments. With full load washing capability, it optimizes power, water, and chemical usage, contributing to cost savings and environmental sustainability. Its rapid 75-second cycle time ensures swift cleaning, allowing establishments to maintain a steady supply of clean glassware during peak service hours. Equipped with a rotating spray arm, this glasswasher delivers outstanding cleaning results, ensuring spotless glassware with each cycle. The divided carousel design creates a washing chamber that utilizes a recirculating, high-volume water spray, enhancing cleaning efficiency while accommodating simultaneous loading, unloading, and washing of glassware.\n\nFeaturing a manual turn carousel, this glasswasher eliminates the need for washing glassware one at a time, streamlining the dishwashing process for bartenders and staff. The sustainer heater maintains the tank temperature, ensuring consistent washing performance. Built-in chemical storage containers offer convenience and efficiency, while the pre-plumbed dump sink and stainless steel drain facilitate easy wastewater disposal. The separate stainless steel wash and drain pumps ensure quieter operation, minimizing disruption in the bar or restaurant environment. With its carousel system divided into three positions by stainless steel panels, this glasswasher provides controlled washing action, delivering the cleaning power of a dishmachine in a carousel format. The ASQ II Glasswasher offers an efficient and user-friendly solution for maintaining clean glassware, allowing bartenders to efficiently unload spot-free glasses and load glassware to be washed while the machine completes the cleaning process.', 'This glasswasher features a manual carousel operation, allowing users to load and unload glassware efficiently, ensuring smooth workflow management in busy bar or restaurant settings.\n\nUtilizing a low-temperature washing process, this glasswasher effectively cleans glassware while conserving energy and minimizing the risk of damaging delicate glassware.\n\nIncorporating ASQ II (Automatic Soil Removal) technology, this glasswasher efficiently removes soil and debris from glassware, ensuring thorough cleaning results with each cycle.\n\nWith its compact design, this glasswasher is suitable for establishments with limited space, providing a space-efficient solution for maintaining cleanliness and hygiene standards.\n\nDesigned for ease of use, this glasswasher features intuitive controls, making it simple for staff to operate and maintain, enhancing overall efficiency in the dishwashing process.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/021-1172.0000_c34b68c3-c099-4a6d-a324-193d0a7b168b.webp\"]', '021-1172.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 7073.71, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:38:01', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/021-1172.0000_c34b68c3-c099-4a6d-a324-193d0a7b168b.webp', 'physical', '', 5569.85, 4, 0, 16, 0, 'No Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB266\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1959, 'American Dish 5-CD-RF Corner-Double Rack With Upright Dish Machine Low-Temp Right Front Door Opening and Single Chemical Alarm', '<p>The 5-CD Dish Machine boasts an array of premium features designed to optimize dishwashing efficiency and performance in commercial kitchens. With a spacious door clearance of 20.5 inches, loading and unloading dishware is a breeze, facilitating seamless workflow management during busy service hours. Its stainless steel air gap ensures both durability and hygiene, crucial for maintaining cleanliness standards in foodservice establishments. The inclusion of quick-release spray arms streamlines maintenance tasks, allowing for easy removal and cleaning to minimize downtime between cycles. Additionally, the built-in scrap accumulator helps prevent drain blockages, preserving the machine\'s performance over time and reducing maintenance needs for prolonged operational reliability. Equipped with a robust 1.5 HP wash/rinse pump, the 5-CD Dish Machine delivers powerful cleaning performance, effectively removing grease and food residue from dishware to achieve sparkling results with every cycle. Its versatile installation options, available for both right front and left front configurations, offer flexibility in integrating the machine into diverse kitchen layouts. Automatic chemical dispensing ensures precise chemical usage, enhancing cleaning effectiveness while minimizing waste. Safety features such as autostart with a door safety switch prioritize user protection, preventing accidental operation and maintaining a secure working environment. With its efficient operation, durable construction, and user-friendly features, the 5-CD Dish Machine stands as a reliable and indispensable asset for commercial kitchens, capable of washing 74 racks per hour while ensuring energy efficiency and superior cleaning performance.</p>', '<p>Engineered to fit seamlessly into corners, optimizing kitchen space while ensuring efficient workflow organization. Capable of accommodating two racks simultaneously, maximizing throughput and enhancing productivity for high-volume dishwashing needs. Utilizes a low-temperature washing process, ensuring effective cleaning while conserving energy and preserving the integrity of delicate dishware. Features a right front door opening configuration, facilitating convenient access to the interior of the machine for easy loading and unloading of dishware. Enhanced safety feature includes a single chemical alarm, providing alerts in case of chemical-related issues during operation, ensuring a secure working environment.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/030-0090.0015_43e8f2d3-b5cc-4f3f-bf12-268e51fe7eab.webp\"]', '030-0090.0015', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 8754.3, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 49.00, NULL, 71.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 408.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:38:02', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/030-0090.0015_43e8f2d3-b5cc-4f3f-bf12-268e51fe7eab.webp', 'physical', NULL, 6893.15, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/RxHRpvBFYw0OfLq7lRrzmCKKqth8E7nC18kr1mgk.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB267\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1960, 'American Dish 5-CD-RF Corner-Double Rack Upright Dish Machine With Low-Temp Right Front Door Opening', '<p>The 5-CD Dish Machine embodies a robust set of standard features meticulously designed to optimize the efficiency and effectiveness of commercial dishwashing operations. With a substantial door clearance of 20.5 inches, maneuvering dishware in and out of the machine becomes effortless, promoting seamless workflow management in bustling kitchen environments. The inclusion of a stainless steel air gap ensures not only durability but also hygiene, crucial for maintaining cleanliness standards. Quick-release spray arms facilitate easy maintenance and cleaning, minimizing downtime between cycles and maximizing productivity. Additionally, the built-in scrap accumulator helps prevent drain blockages, preserving the machine\'s performance over time and reducing maintenance requirements. Equipped with a powerful 1 1/2 HP wash/rinse pump, the 5-CD Dish Machine delivers robust cleaning performance, effectively removing grease and food residue from dishware to ensure immaculate results. Its versatile installation options, available for both right front and left front configurations, provide flexibility in integrating the machine into diverse kitchen layouts. Automatic chemical dispensing guarantees precise chemical usage, enhancing cleaning efficacy while minimizing waste. Safety features such as autostart with a door safety switch prioritize user protection, preventing accidental operation and maintaining a secure working environment. With its efficient operation, durable construction, and user-friendly features, the 5-CD Dish Machine stands as a reliable and indispensable asset for commercial kitchens, capable of washing 74 racks per hour while ensuring energy efficiency and superior cleaning performance.</p>', '<p>Specifically crafted to fit into corners, optimizing space utilization in the kitchen and allowing for efficient workflow organization. With the ability to accommodate two racks simultaneously, this dishwasher maximizes throughput, making it ideal for high-volume commercial operations. Utilizing a low-temperature washing process, this dishwasher effectively cleans dishware while conserving energy and ensuring gentle treatment of delicate items. The right front door opening configuration facilitates easy access to the machine, enhancing user convenience and ergonomics during loading and unloading. The upright design optimizes space utilization, making it suitable for establishments with limited floor space, while still delivering efficient and reliable dishwashing performance</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/030-0090.0000_29ca9f2e-bd91-48c2-9634-3711e24f26a1.webp\"]', '030-0090.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 8613.9, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 49.00, NULL, 71.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 408.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:38:04', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/030-0090.0000_29ca9f2e-bd91-48c2-9634-3711e24f26a1.webp', 'physical', NULL, 6782.6, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/SpnTZEVyhTZdNoU6ylS361IWc2JkRWeB3jriSqdF.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB268\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1961, 'American Dish 5-CD-LF Corner-Double Rack Upright Dish Machine With Left Front Door Opening and Single Chemical Alarm', '<p>The 5-CD Dish Machine offers a comprehensive array of standard features designed to streamline and enhance commercial dishwashing operations. With a generous door clearance of 20.5 inches, loading and unloading dishes is effortless, promoting smooth workflow in busy kitchen environments. The inclusion of a stainless steel air gap ensures durability and hygiene, while quick-release spray arms facilitate easy maintenance and cleaning, reducing downtime between cycles. Additionally, the built-in scrap accumulator helps to prevent drain blockages and maintain optimal performance over time. Equipped with a powerful 1 1/2 HP wash/rinse pump, this dishwasher delivers efficient and thorough cleaning, effectively removing grease and food residue from dishware. Furthermore, the 5-CD Dish Machine offers versatile installation options, with configurations available for both right front and left front installations, allowing for flexible integration into various kitchen layouts. Automatic chemical dispensing ensures precise and consistent chemical usage, enhancing cleaning effectiveness while minimizing waste. The inclusion of an autostart with a door safety switch prioritizes user safety, preventing accidental operation and ensuring a secure working environment. Additionally, the delime switch located in the control panel simplifies maintenance procedures, allowing for easy removal of limescale buildup to maintain optimal performance. With its robust construction, efficient operation, and user-friendly features, the 5-CD Dish Machine stands as a reliable and adaptable solution for commercial dishwashing needs, capable of washing 74 racks per hour while maintaining energy efficiency and cleaning effectiveness.</p>', '<p>The 5-CD-LF is specially designed to fit into corners, optimizing space utilization in the kitchen and allowing for efficient workflow organization. With the capability to accommodate two racks simultaneously, this dishwasher maximizes throughput, making it ideal for high-volume commercial operations. Utilizing a low-temperature washing process, this dishwasher effectively cleans dishware while conserving energy and ensuring gentle treatment of delicate items. The left front door opening configuration facilitates easy access to the machine, enhancing user convenience and ergonomics during loading and unloading. Enhanced safety features include a single chemical alarm, alerting users to any chemical-related issues during operation, ensuring a safe working environment.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/029-0090.0040_f1994ed9-05bb-4157-951b-5f2d29e8f69d.webp\"]', '029-0090.0040', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 8754.3, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 49.00, NULL, 71.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 408.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:38:05', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/029-0090.0040_f1994ed9-05bb-4157-951b-5f2d29e8f69d.webp', 'physical', NULL, 6893.15, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/kIbrRf6ffO2wz0hvUBVKuVGpEj7Ib38TPAOPexbP.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB269\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1962, 'American Dish 5-CD-LF Corner-Double Rack Upright Dish Machine With Left Front Door Opening', '<p>The 5-AG-ES Energy-Star Dish Machine represents a pinnacle of efficiency and reliability in the realm of commercial dishwashing. With a double rack capacity, it efficiently handles high-volume dishwashing needs, allowing for simultaneous cleaning of two racks and significantly enhancing throughput. Its low-temperature operation not only ensures thorough cleaning but also contributes to energy conservation, making it an environmentally conscious choice for businesses. The inclusion of a single chemical alarm adds an extra layer of safety, alerting users to any chemical-related issues during operation, thereby maintaining a secure working environment. Furthermore, the upright design of the 5-AG-ES maximizes space utilization, making it ideal for establishments with limited floor space. Despite its compact footprint, this dishwasher doesn\'t compromise on performance, delivering efficient and reliable dishwashing results. Its Energy-Star certification underscores its commitment to energy efficiency and environmental responsibility, reducing operational costs and minimizing ecological impact. Overall, the 5-AG-ES Energy-Star Dish Machine is a versatile and dependable solution for commercial dishwashing needs, combining efficiency, safety, and sustainability in one robust package.</p>', '<p>This dishwasher is Energy-Star certified, ensuring energy efficiency and environmental sustainability, reducing operational costs and minimizing ecological impact. With the ability to accommodate two racks simultaneously, this machine maximizes throughput, making it perfect for high-volume commercial operations. Utilizing a low-temperature washing process, this dishwasher effectively cleans dishware while conserving energy and ensuring gentle treatment of delicate items. Enhanced safety features include a single chemical alarm, alerting users to any chemical-related issues during operation, ensuring a safe working environment. The upright configuration optimizes space utilization, making it suitable for establishments with limited floor space, while maintaining efficient and reliable dishwashing performance.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/029-0090.0000_189dc130-d92b-433b-8bfc-94a6870826e0.webp\"]', '029-0090.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 8613.9, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 49.00, NULL, 71.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 408.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:38:07', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/029-0090.0000_189dc130-d92b-433b-8bfc-94a6870826e0.webp', 'physical', NULL, 6782.6, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/BqnafbPc6tV3dmyTn3XdYbE4Evq1LOPVzv2Lxe5N.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB270\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1963, 'American Dish 5-AG-ES Energy-Star Upright Dish Machine with Double Rack', '<p>The 5-AG-ES Dish Machine stands out with its comprehensive set of standard features tailored to meet the demanding needs of commercial dishwashing operations. With a remarkable capability to clean 74 racks per hour, this dishwasher ensures swift throughput, making it a perfect fit for high-volume establishments. Its water consumption of less than 1 gallon per rack strikes a balance between effective cleaning and resource conservation, contributing to operational efficiency and environmental sustainability. The generous door clearance of 20 1/2 inches facilitates seamless loading and unloading of dishes, enhancing workflow efficiency during peak service hours. Equipped with top mount controls featuring auto start functionality, the dishwasher offers user-friendly operation, while the stainless steel air gap and quick-release spray arms ensure durability and easy maintenance, providing reliable performance over the long term. A standout feature of the 5-AG-ES Dish Machine is its Double Duty Model, designed to double production capability and accommodate the diverse needs of commercial kitchens. With two powerful 1 HP pumps, this dishwasher delivers sparkling results with every cycle, ensuring thorough and efficient cleaning of dishware. The inclusion of a dual-screen system protects pumps and wash arms, prolonging the lifespan of critical components and reducing maintenance requirements. Moreover, the presence of a delime switch located in the control panel facilitates easy maintenance and upkeep, ensuring optimal performance over time. Detailed specifications, including motor horsepower, water consumption rates, and available cycle times, provide users with comprehensive insights into the machine\'s capabilities, ensuring informed decision-making and optimal performance in demanding kitchen environments. With its robust construction, versatile features, and efficient performance, the 5-AG-ES Dish Machine stands as a reliable and adaptable solution for commercial dishwashing needs.</p>', '<p>This dishwasher is Energy Star certified, ensuring energy efficiency and environmental responsibility, reducing operational costs and minimizing ecological footprint. With the capability to accommodate two racks simultaneously, this machine maximizes throughput, making it ideal for high-volume commercial operations. Utilizing a low-temperature washing process, this dishwasher effectively cleans dishware while conserving energy and ensuring gentle treatment of delicate items. Enhanced safety features include a single chemical alarm, alerting users to any chemical-related issues during operation, ensuring a secure working environment. The upright design optimizes space utilization, making it suitable for establishments with limited floor space, without compromising on performance.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/015-1090.0065_772995d2-4214-4beb-b4ce-45375b38cdf8.webp\"]', '015-1090.0065', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 8325.42, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 49.00, NULL, 71.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 408.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:38:08', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/015-1090.0065_772995d2-4214-4beb-b4ce-45375b38cdf8.webp', 'physical', NULL, 6555.45, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/UHqLXI9ypk13dHy06bLuxh9GeZlI40C3qXrEvnm0.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6LbjaRl2SrwinlDLhcqKroOiRg5rSTX1fK20iMMK.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/ZthrVX08fZBO2eXCp0umqfMeQ1LVoJCuVl3koUYS.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/tOl950fGcPS8CQnPG8ReMBNqYvaMd9WtmubMTowZ.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/27