(1965, 'American Dish 5AG-S Double Rack Upright Dish Machine Includes 2 Sheet Pan Racks', '<p>The 5-AG-S Dish Machine is engineered to deliver exceptional performance and efficiency, boasting a range of standard features that cater to the demands of high-volume commercial dishwashing. With the ability to clean an impressive 74 racks per hour, this machine ensures rapid throughput, making it an ideal choice for busy kitchen environments. Its water consumption rate of 1.6 gallons per rack strikes a balance between effective cleaning and resource conservation, contributing to both operational efficiency and sustainability efforts. The generous door clearance of 20 1/2 inches facilitates seamless loading and unloading of dishes, enhancing workflow efficiency and minimizing downtime during busy service periods. The top mount controls with auto start functionality offer intuitive operation, while the stainless steel air gap and quick-release spray arms ensure durability and easy maintenance, providing reliable performance over the long term. One standout feature of the 5-AG-S Dish Machine is its Double Duty Model, designed to multiply dishwashing capability and meet the diverse needs of commercial kitchens. Equipped with two quick-service 1 1/2 HP pumps and a dual-screen system to protect wash pump and wash arms, this dishwasher delivers consistent and thorough cleaning results with every cycle. The option to wash sheet pans horizontally with the optional pan rack expands the machine\'s versatility, accommodating a broader range of kitchenware and enhancing operational flexibility. Detailed specifications, including motor horsepower, water consumption rates, and available cycle times, offer users comprehensive insights into the machine\'s capabilities, ensuring informed decision-making and optimal performance in demanding kitchen environments. With its robust construction, versatile features, and efficient performance, the 5-AG-S Dish Machine stands as a reliable and adaptable solution for commercial dishwashing needs.</p>', '<p>This dishwasher accommodates two racks simultaneously, doubling the capacity for efficient throughput in high-volume commercial settings. Utilizing a low-temperature washing process, this machine ensures thorough cleaning while being gentle on dishware, suitable for delicate items and conserving energy. With a pass-thru configuration, dishes can be loaded from one side and unloaded from the other, seamlessly integrating into kitchen workflows and minimizing wait times between cycles. The inclusion of two sheet pan racks expands the machine\'s versatility, allowing for the washing of sheet pans horizontally alongside standard dish racks, enhancing operational flexibility. The upright design optimizes space utilization, making it an ideal choice for establishments with limited floor space, while still delivering efficient and reliable dishwashing performance.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/028-0090.0119_65c19f1f-7677-4ccf-b085-11da85fd3d42.webp\"]', '028-0090.0119', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 11414.19, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 49.00, NULL, 71.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 408.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:38:10', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/028-0090.0119_65c19f1f-7677-4ccf-b085-11da85fd3d42.webp', 'physical', NULL, 8987.55, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/8Mj0ugCYykShVTZw0TSoIeCZWX9J54mxazpWrlRG.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/LdIFBiE9fSxSefHvxXLYaiXBTYPD4EwmsQkYvqjj.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/rIoZQX7ahcLav76LZqXar2wKNOUf68K57wRbHSdN.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Untitled\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/DudnisexkilGojTxVVjMKmiQSoLlTW90wF3MilHn.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/IyqjkZE74VdqmXXKNrmB2gyNq4Y7HljPS3pjTpnH.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB273\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1966, 'American Dish 5AG-S Double Rack Upright Dish Machine with Low-Temp Pass-Thru and Single Chemical Alarm', '<p>The 5AG-S Double Rack Dish Machine is a versatile and efficient solution for commercial dishwashing needs, combining multiple features to streamline operations. With its double rack capacity, this dishwasher maximizes throughput, allowing for simultaneous washing of two racks and catering to the demands of high-volume establishments. Its low-temperature operation ensures thorough cleaning while being gentle on dishware, making it suitable for a wide range of items and contributing to energy conservation efforts in the kitchen. Featuring a pass-thru design, this dishwasher seamlessly integrates into kitchen workflows, allowing dishes to be loaded from one side and unloaded from the other, minimizing wait times between cycles and optimizing productivity. The inclusion of a single chemical alarm enhances safety in the workplace, alerting users to any chemical-related issues during operation, ensuring a secure working environment for staff. Additionally, its upright configuration maximizes space utilization, making it an ideal choice for establishments with limited floor space while delivering efficient and reliable dishwashing performance. Overall, the 5AG-S Double Rack Dish Machine stands as a reliable and versatile solution for commercial dishwashing needs.</p>', '<p>This dishwasher accommodates two racks simultaneously, effectively doubling the capacity compared to single rack models, ideal for high-volume establishments. Utilizing a low-temperature washing process, this machine ensures thorough cleaning while being gentle on dishware, suitable for delicate items and energy conservation. With a pass-thru configuration, dishes can be loaded from one side and unloaded from the other, seamlessly integrating into kitchen workflows and minimizing wait times between cycles. Enhanced safety features include a single chemical alarm, alerting users to any chemical-related issues during operation, ensuring a safe working environment. The upright design optimizes space utilization, making it suitable for establishments with limited floor space, while still delivering efficient and reliable dishwashing performance.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/028-0090.0105_d08cb6b2-3f98-43cf-9f10-e68934d91ecf.webp\"]', '028-0090.0105', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 7662.55, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 49.00, NULL, 71.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 408.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:38:11', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/028-0090.0105_d08cb6b2-3f98-43cf-9f10-e68934d91ecf.webp', 'physical', NULL, 6033.5, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/cNbUUfyXmJlOHaRJNos5bBXuuaGXBVIlgXJ9GYUE.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Uh5jjvrB4KEbbkAGJ8lr8tInw2Y2SMASsLQ50e2h.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/CHPQ0maX71niIOgobutPY9XfzL3kYwkgxr7wsQNh.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/mtl99vRycmGcqu0g7PiElrlcZeuF1OEjfe8quWqI.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/DBzXageiL88obl8mERXhVgnlWjWoH67xA7BEwkzz.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB274\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1967, 'American Dish 5AG-S Double Rack Pass-Thru Upright Dish Machine with Low-Temp', '<p>The 5AG-S Double Rack Dish Machine is a powerhouse in the realm of commercial dishwashing, combining efficiency with versatility to meet the demands of high-volume establishments. Its double rack capacity allows for simultaneous washing of two racks, effectively doubling throughput and optimizing workflow efficiency. This feature is especially beneficial for busy kitchens where a large volume of dishware needs to be cleaned quickly and effectively. Furthermore, the low-temperature operation ensures gentle yet thorough cleaning, making it suitable for delicate items while also conserving energy, aligning with modern sustainability goals and reducing operational costs. With its pass-thru design, the 5AG-S Dish Machine seamlessly integrates into kitchen layouts, facilitating smooth and continuous dishwashing operations. Dishes can be loaded from one side and unloaded from the other, minimizing wait times between cycles and maximizing productivity. The upright configuration further enhances space utilization, making it an ideal choice for establishments with limited floor space. Additionally, advanced features such as built-in chemical dispensing systems and powerful pumps with rotating spray arms ensure optimal cleaning performance, delivering consistently impeccable results in even the busiest of commercial environments.`</p>', '<p>This dishwasher is designed to accommodate two racks simultaneously, doubling the capacity compared to single rack models. It is ideal for high-volume establishments or those with demanding dishwashing needs. The low-temperature washing process ensures thorough cleaning while being gentle on dishware that is suitable for delicate items and helps conserve energy compared to high-temperature alternatives. With a pass-thru configuration, this dishwasher allows seamless integration into kitchen workflows. Uright Configuration: The upright design optimizes space utilization in the kitchen, making it suitable for establishments with limited floor space. The 5AG-S Double Rack Dish Machine may include advanced features such as built-in chemical dispensing systems, powerful pumps with rotating spray arms, and customizable time cycles to suit specific dishwashing requirements.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/028-0090.0000_7e765d8d-fe8d-4128-8722-258ffd423786.webp\"]', '028-0090.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 7522.15, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 49.00, NULL, 71.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 408.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:38:12', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/028-0090.0000_7e765d8d-fe8d-4128-8722-258ffd423786.webp', 'physical', NULL, 5922.95, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/U7WRqrULhWAnNHPRiEDBHKDx2B84wC2yFuIBXYHI.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/p3CBOFP7MSNiDt7alnG9Ovl2iNpSxmPyZC13n7dw.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/OYX4wZmSPdj6ZwEgJrdjRLaSIWCtlW3H5pBFpZTq.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/4MCm2gCCDXgREnqEjwczQACkKTlOF24fNEExYkC0.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/XaQN7W3lD7XHkmUtknLmglFT6dFX0aaPUXrQvaRy.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB275\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1968, 'American Dish AWS-H Single Rack Upright Dish Machine with Single Door Front Load Overshelf/Undershelf', '<p>The AWS-H series dishwasher sets the standard with a comprehensive array of features designed to meet the demands of commercial dishwashing. As an Energy Star-rated appliance, it ensures not only efficient operation but also environmental responsibility, aligning with modern sustainability goals. Its standout feature lies in its remarkably low water usage, boasting consumption rates of under 1 gallon per rack, showcasing a commitment to water conservation without compromising on performance. Equipped with a powerful stainless steel pump featuring upper and lower rotating spray arms, this dishwasher ensures thorough cleaning of dishware with every cycle, providing consistently immaculate results. Moreover, the inclusion of a built-in stainless steel scrap accumulator underscores the machine\'s dedication to cleanliness during operation, maintaining hygiene standards in busy kitchen environments. Optional features further enhance the versatility and functionality of the AWS-H series dishwasher, catering to specific user needs and preferences. These include innovative additions such as the patent-pending top drying rack for improved drying efficiency, a sustainer heater to maintain optimal water temperature, and a built-in booster heater for enhanced cleaning performance. Additionally, the provision of an under-frame storage rack offers practical solutions for organizing dishware, utensils, or cleaning supplies, optimizing kitchen workflow and space utilization. Detailed specifications, ranging from motor horsepower to water consumption rates, provide users with comprehensive insights into the machine\'s capabilities, ensuring informed decision-making for businesses. With its robust construction, customizable features, and efficient performance, the AWS-H series dishwasher stands as a reliable and versatile solution for commercial dishwashing needs.</p>', '<p>The AWS-H dishwasher utilizes a low-temperature washing process, ensuring thorough cleaning while being gentle on dishware and conserving energy. Designed for efficiency, this dishwasher features a single rack configuration, making it suitable for smaller establishments or those with limited space, without compromising on performance. With a single door design, loading and unloading dishes is convenient and straightforward, optimizing workflow and reducing downtime between cycles. The front-load design enhances user experience by providing ergonomic loading and unloading, minimizing strain on staff and promoting a more efficient work environment. The addition of an overshelf/undershelf provides extra storage space for dishes, utensils, or cleaning supplies, maximizing the utility of the dishwasher and optimizing kitchen organization.`</p>', 'published', '[]', '030-2090.0462', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 8009, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 78.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 354.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:38:13', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/030-2090.0462_2b9b998d-5606-4c7d-af2c-9bc7f85d3f53.webp', 'physical', NULL, 6306.3, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/PrrIo1gO0MD04nYATOMxxGac1RviUPOrN0WWMyFi.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/uwpAm3Kerfl08DCCHRROHb5JsNYTJZTcE3ui91TO.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/w3tZ4UNc52h3PqGICpGFpUUR5ETH6ptzSDHRkq0F.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB276\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1969, 'American Dish AWS-H Single Rack Upright Dish Machine with Single Door, Front Load 280V', '<p>The AWS-H Low-Temp Dish Machine epitomizes efficiency and reliability in commercial dishwashing. Engineered with a low-temperature washing mechanism, it delicately yet thoroughly cleans dishware while conserving energy, making it an eco-friendly choice for businesses. Its single rack configuration optimizes space utilization, ideal for establishments with limited room while maintaining high-performance standards. The single door access streamlines operations, allowing for easy loading and unloading of dishes, thereby enhancing workflow efficiency. Moreover, its front-load design ensures ergonomic convenience for staff, minimizing strain and promoting a comfortable work environment. One of the standout features of the AWS-H Dish Machine is its inclusion of a muffler heater and a robust 208V power supply. The muffler heater ensures that water temperatures are maintained at optimal levels for effective cleaning, guaranteeing consistently impeccable results. Combined with the powerful 208V power supply, this dishwasher delivers reliable performance even in the most demanding commercial settings, making it a trusted asset in busy kitchens. With its blend of innovative design, energy efficiency, and dependable operation, the AWS-H Dish Machine stands as a cornerstone solution for businesses seeking top-tier dishwashing capabilities.</p>', '<p>The AWS-H dishwasher employs a low-temperature washing method, ensuring thorough cleaning while being gentle on delicate dishware and conserving energy. Designed for efficiency, this dishwasher features a single rack configuration, making it suitable for smaller establishments or those with space constraints, without compromising on performance. With a single door design, loading and unloading dishes is convenient and straightforward, optimizing workflow and reducing downtime between cycles. The front-load design enhances user experience by providing ergonomic loading and unloading, minimizing strain on staff and promoting a more efficient work environment. Equipped with a muffler heater, this dishwasher ensures that water reaches optimal temperatures for effective cleaning.</p>', 'published', '[]', '030-2090.0447', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 10597.64, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 78.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 354.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:38:14', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/030-2090.0447_c848c65c-82bf-4aa6-b10a-e4f26617ff11.webp', 'physical', NULL, 8344.6, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/N0XipzMlxiLQUhffPS7h79zJbR2bo2Fc9jSqEwjM.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3rvpPjj6tziYtMuPqJfeFWAdEESy1rw3yEpCamCj.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/MiDdKEnTwKgfEW2ZDyzyCLqlcoHf7VRX5oHwjs2e.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/KMfmL49f5dSwdfM68F76Q5FsjM1VPUAtqdizU9es.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB277\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1970, 'American Dish  AWS-H, Single Rack Upright Dish Machine with Single Door', '<p>The AWS-H series dish machine sets a high standard with its array of standard features tailored to meet the demands of commercial dishwashing. Being Energy Star rated, it ensures not only efficient operation but also environmental responsibility. With water usage reduced to under 1 gallon per rack, this dishwasher exemplifies water conservation efforts in the industry. Its powerful stainless steel pump, complemented by upper and lower rotating spray arms, guarantees thorough cleaning of dishware with every cycle. The inclusion of a built-in stainless steel scrap accumulator further enhances cleanliness during operation. Moreover, users can customize their dishwashing experience with a choice of time cycles90, 120, or 150 secondssuitable for various loads, all while accommodating standard 20\" x 20\" racks. Additionally, its tallest door opening at 19 inches facilitates convenient loading and unloading, ensuring smooth workflow in busy kitchen environments. For those seeking enhanced functionality, the AWS-H series offers optional features to tailor the dishwasher to specific needs. These include a patent-pending top drying rack for improved drying efficiency, a sustainer heater for maintaining optimal water temperature, a built-in booster heater for enhanced cleaning performance, and an under-frame storage rack for convenient storage solutions. Detailed specifications, including motor horsepower, water consumption rates, and electrical ratings, provide users with comprehensive insights into the machine\'s capabilities. With its robust construction, customizable features, and efficient performance, the AWS-H series dish machine stands as a reliable solution for commercial dishwashing needs.</p>', '<p>The AWS-H dishwasher utilizes a low-temperature washing process, preserving delicate dishware while conserving energy. Optimized for smaller operations, the single rack configuration efficiently handles dishware while saving kitchen space. Loading and unloading dishes is made easy with the single door design, enhancing workflow efficiency. Ergonomic benefits are provided by the front-load design, allowing staff to work comfortably during dishwashing tasks. Enhanced safety is ensured with the inclusion of a single chemical alarm, alerting users to any chemical-related issues during operation</p>', 'published', '[]', '030-2090.0440', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 7137.27, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 78.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 354.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:38:15', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/030-2090.0440_e8547984-e25c-431c-9d96-d027c95ed771.webp', 'physical', NULL, 5619.9, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/dyFOa34Ifft4pJ2w2UplQUWYosoXmqpj9L84KzEI.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/S1O9Rm6Txj1MrPytIDitHc1QjkD3WFDxHSQrvSNB.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/gUCfQe09Wc9Rq3ulG3spXFV8Yz74ch8gEyTUlsS0.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/0AY6lsRJ3GcKYnYWAkfw6iLXzDHXgopbztqdzMjf.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB278\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1971, 'American Dish AWS-H Single Rack Upright Dish Machine with Single Door', '<p>The AWS-H Series dish machine boasts a comprehensive set of standard features, making it a top choice for commercial dishwashing needs. This Energy Star-rated appliance ensures efficiency while minimizing environmental impact. With a remarkable water usage of under 1 gallon per rack, it stands as a testament to water conservation efforts. Equipped with a powerful stainless steel pump featuring upper and lower rotating spray arms, this machine delivers thorough cleaning performance. Its built-in stainless steel scrap accumulator helps maintain cleanliness during operation. Additionally, the machine offers flexibility with a choice of time cycles90, 120, or 150 secondssuitable for various dishwashing requirements. Its tallest door opening at 19 inches facilitates easy loading and unloading of dishes. Optional features further enhance the functionality of the AWS-H Series dish machine to meet specific user needs. The patent-pending Top Drying Rack, built-in booster heater, and under-frame storage rack provide customizable options for improved drying, enhanced cleaning, and convenient storage solutions. Moreover, specifications such as motor horsepower, water consumption rates, and electrical ratings ensure users have detailed insights into the machine\'s capabilities. With its robust construction, efficient performance, and adaptable features, the AWS-H Series dish machine stands as a reliable and versatile solution for commercial dishwashing operations.</p>', '<p>the AWS-H dish machine utilizes a low-temperature washing process, which is ideal for delicate dishware and reduces energy consumption compared to high-temperature alternatives. With its single rack configuration, this dishwasher is optimized for smaller operations or establishments with limited space. It allows for efficient handling of dishes while conserving space in the kitchen. The single-door design of the AWS-H makes loading and unloading dishes a breeze. It simplifies workflow and enhances efficiency by providing easy access to the rack, reducing wait times between cycles. Featuring a front-load design, this dishwasher offers ergonomic advantages by allowing staff to load and unload dishes at a comfortable height. The upright configuration of the AWS-H ensures efficient use of vertical space in the kitchen. It maximizes floor space while still accommodating a significant volume of dishware, making it suitable for establishments with space constraints.</p>', 'published', '[]', '030-2090.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 6996.87, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 78.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 354.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:38:16', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/030-2090.0000_a5afb81b-24cf-44ab-b2cc-3bc87b513e53.webp', 'physical', NULL, 5509.35, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/uQgi6kae4LJwlYztZSt2BapP0wjgshStHC4UjrBB.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6XzW2OGzfjMP0QQrZGKduOHI8z71JTkSv23uVTCU.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/qchSHUQ5ivDTuWThMt5nILPkj8JaNIGQgG5IoNms.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/aBJu2bCJHC3oIGLbCwymWHEMOOM5X8Oj8Ype9Whh.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB279\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1972, 'American Dish AWS Energy-Star Single Door Upright Dish Machine with Single Rack', '<p>The AWS dishwasher stands as a pinnacle of efficiency and reliability, boasting a comprehensive array of standard features tailored to meet the rigorous demands of commercial kitchens. As an Energy Star rated appliance, it underscores its commitment to sustainability by minimizing energy usage and reducing utility costs. With its impressively low water usage of under 1 gallon per rack, this dishwasher ensures thorough cleaning while conserving precious water resources, aligning with eco-conscious operational practices. Its powerful stainless steel pump, equipped with upper and lower rotating spray arms, delivers robust cleaning performance, effectively removing food residue and stains from dishes and utensils. Additionally, the built-in stainless steel scrap accumulator streamlines maintenance tasks by preventing debris buildup, while the tallest door opening at 19 inches facilitates seamless loading and unloading, enhancing operational efficiency in bustling kitchen environments. In addition to its standard features, the AWS dishwasher offers a range of optional enhancements to further elevate its functionality to meet specific needs and preferences. These optional features include a patent-pending top drying rack, sustainer heater, built-in booster heater, and under-frame storage rack, providing added versatility and convenience. With a motor horsepower of 1.5 HP and cycle times ranging from 90 to 150 seconds, this dishwasher ensures efficient operation and versatility to accommodate varying cleaning requirements. Its compatibility with standard 20\" x 20\" racks further enhances its convenience and usability, making it a reliable and high-performance solution for commercial dishwashing needs.</p>', '<p>The AWS dishwasher is Energy-Star certified, ensuring optimal energy usage and cost savings, making it ideal for environmentally conscious businesses. Featuring a low-temp wash option, this dishwasher effectively cleans dishes while minimizing energy consumption, preserving delicate dishware. With a single rack, single door, and front load design, this dishwasher offers convenient loading and unloading, streamlining workflow in commercial kitchens. Equipped with a muffler heater, this dishwasher operates quietly, minimizing noise disruptions in the kitchen environment for a more pleasant working environment. Its upright configuration saves valuable floor space in commercial kitchens, optimizing layout efficiency while maintaining high-capacity dishwashing capabilities.</p>', 'published', '[]', '030-1090.0205', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 10110.09, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 78.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 354.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:38:18', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/030-1090.0205_86479078-c7aa-42ce-be0e-e28367abb00c.webp', 'physical', NULL, 7960.7, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/zwx1C098zZ63uvlF2FpfT4wtcKHz6Q1oOOqXFf60.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/EKHOewA2eXKf7ONRqagCJcDHoANJwMF6ZzjG014r.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/B3rcGEqrn7rM8kZ1SsRWBGdrpuhzlok4d73h60EA.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/9ovWm2cwBmr7Dx5siwUyDqqoExLdAnrjXbrBl7lZ.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB280\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1973, 'American Dish AWS Energy-Star Upright Dish Machine with Single Rack - Single Door, Front Load', '<p>The AWS dishwasher is equipped with a comprehensive set of standard features tailored to meet the demanding needs of commercial kitchens while prioritizing efficiency and performance. As an Energy Star rated appliance, it exemplifies its commitment to energy efficiency, promising reduced utility costs and environmental sustainability. With its low water usage of under 1 gallon per rack, this dishwasher not only ensures thorough cleaning but also conserves water resources, contributing to eco-conscious operations. Its powerful stainless steel pump, featuring upper and lower rotating spray arms, delivers robust cleaning performance, effectively eliminating food residue and stains from dishes and utensils. Additionally, the built-in stainless steel scrap accumulator simplifies maintenance tasks by preventing debris buildup, while the tallest door opening at 19 inches facilitates easy loading and unloading, enhancing operational efficiency in bustling kitchen environments. In addition to its standard features, the AWS dishwasher offers a range of optional enhancements to further customize its functionality to specific requirements. These optional features include a patent-pending top drying rack, sustainer heater, built-in booster heater, and under-frame storage rack, providing added flexibility and convenience. With a motor horsepower of 1.5 HP and cycle times ranging from 90 to 150 seconds, this dishwasher ensures efficient operation and versatility to accommodate varying cleaning needs. Its compatibility with standard 20\" x 20\" racks further enhances its convenience and usability, making it a reliable and high-performance solution for commercial dishwashing needs.</p>', '<p>The AWS dishwasher is Energy-Star certified, ensuring optimal energy usage and cost savings for environmentally conscious businesses. Its low-temp wash feature effectively cleans dishes while conserving energy and preserving delicate dishware. With a single rack, single door, and front load design, this dishwasher offers convenient loading and unloading, streamlining workflow in commercial kitchens. Equipped with an overshelf and undershelf, this dishwasher provides additional storage space for utensils, dishes, or cleaning supplies, optimizing kitchen organization. Its upright configuration saves valuable floor space, making it suitable for compact commercial kitchens while maintaining high-capacity dishwashing capabilities.</p>', 'published', '[]', '030-1090.0192', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 7521.45, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 78.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 354.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:38:18', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/030-1090.0192_36d40e2b-c201-4791-8050-9d74a3d410d4.webp', 'physical', NULL, 5922.4, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/w1TLa2L2hrrf595a6iROai9eiDu4LDhFnh4VSOt2.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/clHzi6BbTSWEzbWbq28FCsGbw9CUTygTGMAtVRiD.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/TZVAAdVDboaYNXUXLSqLKSX9AbkQGMEqYkCbQQLD.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/tskQsd4r5L5tG8BTHWxDWnGuPFWwQzuX25ISIaxZ.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB281\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1974, 'American Dish AWS Energy-Star Single Door Upright Dish Machine Front Load', '<p>The standard features of the AWS dishwasher epitomize efficiency and reliability, making it an indispensable asset in commercial kitchens. With an Energy Star rating, it demonstrates its commitment to reducing energy consumption while maintaining high-performance standards. Its impressive water usage of under 1 gallon per rack ensures not only thorough cleaning but also conservation of water resources. Equipped with a powerful stainless steel pump featuring upper and lower rotating spray arms, this dishwasher delivers consistent and effective cleaning results, eliminating food residue and stains with ease. The built-in stainless steel scrap accumulator further enhances its functionality by preventing debris buildup, simplifying maintenance tasks and prolonging the dishwasher\'s lifespan. Its tallest door opening at 19 inches facilitates easy loading and unloading of dishes, enhancing operational efficiency in busy kitchen environments. Additionally, the AWS dishwasher offers a range of optional features to meet specific needs and preferences. These include a patent-pending top drying rack for enhanced drying capabilities, a sustainer heater available on standard units, and a built-in booster heater for increased temperature flexibility. The inclusion of an under-frame storage rack maximizes space utilization and organizational efficiency. With a motor horsepower of 1.5 HP and cycle times ranging from 90 to 150 seconds, this dishwasher ensures efficient operation and versatility to accommodate varying cleaning requirements. Its compatibility with standard 20\" x 20\" racks further enhances its convenience and usability. Overall, the AWS dishwasher combines innovative features, precise specifications, and optional enhancements to deliver reliable and high-performance dishwashing solutions for commercial establishments.</p>', '<p>The AWS dishwasher is Energy-Star certified, ensuring optimal energy usage and cost savings, ideal for environmentally conscious businesses. With a low-temp wash feature, this dishwasher effectively cleans dishes while minimizing energy consumption, preserving delicate dishware. Featuring a single rack, single door, and front load design, this dishwasher offers convenient loading and unloading, streamlining workflow in commercial kitchens. Equipped with a single chemical alarm system, this dishwasher enhances safety by alerting users to any issues with chemical levels, ensuring optimal cleaning performance and compliance with safety regulations. Its upright configuration saves valuable floor space in commercial kitchens, optimizing layout efficiency while maintaining high-capacity dishwashing capabilities.</p>', 'published', '[]', '030-1090.0184', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 6649.72, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 78.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 354.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:38:19', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/030-1090.0184_fe012a2d-25b3-45ea-a9ad-52485631bdb1.webp', 'physical', NULL, 5236, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/2ToVTQBtZ5j9P09ZTrfrzv3HFjMv2LbPTljDGJwN.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/TULLjUgvSWtx983VbuXgBrD8OaKJzgd5At00fmkV.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/poqgVZuK8JgxmGzR9dlpq2wfqZatci1lYjmx0gdF.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/PcPK32VhrjzyHRooXBx9L0ikUEhiy2MZLdlz6ri6.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB282\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1975, 'American Dish AWS Energy-Star Upright Dish Machine with Single Rack - Single Door, Front Load', '<p>The AWS dishwasher presents a comprehensive array of standard features designed to enhance efficiency and reliability in commercial kitchen environments. As an Energy Star rated appliance, it guarantees optimal energy usage, contributing to reduced utility costs and environmental sustainability. With its low water usage, averaging under 1 gallon per rack, this dishwasher not only conserves water but also ensures thorough cleaning results. The powerful stainless steel pump, equipped with upper and lower rotating spray arms, delivers robust cleaning performance, effectively removing food residue and stains. Additionally, the built-in stainless steel scrap accumulator minimizes debris buildup, simplifying maintenance tasks and prolonging the dishwasher\'s lifespan. Its tallest door opening at 19 inches enhances accessibility, facilitating easy loading and unloading of dishes and utensils. In terms of specifications, the AWS dishwasher offers flexibility and reliability to meet various operational needs in commercial kitchens. With options for cycle times of 90, 120, or 150 seconds, operators can choose the most suitable duration for their cleaning requirements. The dishwasher accommodates standard 20\" x 20\" racks, providing compatibility with existing kitchen equipment. Optional features such as the patent-pending top drying rack and built-in booster heater offer additional customization and performance enhancement. With a motor horsepower of 1.5 HP, this dishwasher ensures efficient operation, while water consumption remains low, ranging from .98 to 1.2 gallons per cycle depending on the model. Overall, the AWS dishwasher combines innovative features and precise specifications to deliver reliable, high-performance dishwashing solutions for commercial establishments.</p>', '<p>The AWS dishwasher is Energy-Star certified, ensuring it operates with high energy efficiency, reducing utility costs. Its low-temp feature ensures effective cleaning while minimizing energy consumption, ideal for preserving delicate dishware. With a single rack configuration, this dishwasher maximizes space utilization and simplifies the loading and unloading process. The single-door, front-load design enhances accessibility, allowing for easy loading and unloading of dishes in busy kitchen environments. Its upright design saves valuable floor space, making it a practical choice for compact commercial kitchens while maintaining high-capacity dishwashing capabilities.</p>', 'published', '[]', '030-1090.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 6509.32, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 78.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 354.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:38:20', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/030-1090.0000_6406284e-f497-41d2-9631-f73b5061db17.webp', 'physical', NULL, 5125.45, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/OUqqBLIg169i8F8BKsjH70KnbmpEAPLFGGMlZajl.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/YinAe8xL82iyHjSgEWZLbSc0ftQpYW7p7EUtu9LT.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/PO2flEZxyWHHdnNKgadsxXtRtQscM5c8bAvpM4qQ.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/RO2fYm6pglXDP0y0KFqAhzjbdVOOflseOFsc2dFz.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB283\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1976, 'American Dish AF-ES 3D Upright Energy Star Low Temp 3-Door Dish Machine with Single Rack', '<p>The AF-ES dishwasher is engineered with a suite of standard features tailored to optimize performance and efficiency in commercial kitchen environments. Its Energy Savings (ES) designation underscores its commitment to minimizing energy consumption without compromising on cleaning power. With an impressive capacity to handle 37 racks or 34 gallons per hour, driven by a powerful 1 1/2 HP pump, this dishwasher ensures rapid and thorough cleaning cycles. The large door opening, measuring 20 1/2 inches, facilitates easy loading and unloading of dishes, while dual screens effectively protect the pump from debris, reducing maintenance needs and extending its operational lifespan. Its convertible design and generous 20 1/5-inch door clearance offer adaptability, accommodating various dish sizes and configurations with ease. Additionally, the stainless steel air gap and large capacity scrap accumulator enhance hygiene and convenience, making the dishwasher simple to clean and maintain. In terms of specifications, the AF/AFC-ES Series dishwasher delivers reliable and consistent performance to meet the demands of high-volume commercial kitchens. With rated capacities of 37, 25, or 12 racks per hour, it offers versatility to suit different operational needs. The powerful 1.5 HP motor ensures efficient operation, while water consumption is kept minimal at just .936 gallons per cycle, promoting water conservation efforts. Offering flexibility, it provides cycle times ranging from 90 to 150 seconds to accommodate varying cleaning requirements. Installation is straightforward with electrical ratings of 115 volts and single-phase operation, requiring connection to a suitable power source using specified wiring and protection measures. Overall, the AF-ES dishwasher combines robust features and precise specifications to deliver superior cleaning performance while promoting energy and water efficiency in commercial kitchen settings.</p>', '<p>The AF-ES 3D dishwasher is Energy Star certified, ensuring optimal energy usage and reduced utility costs. Featuring three doors, this dishwasher offers ample loading space, streamlining dishwashing tasks in commercial settings. With a single rack setup, loading and unloading dishes is efficient, maximizing space and productivity. Gentle yet effective, the low-temperature wash cycle preserves dishware while removing tough stains. Equipped with a muffler heater, this dishwasher operates quietly, minimizing noise disruptions in the kitchen environment.</p>', 'published', '[]', '011-1091.0208', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 9619.74, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 71.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 295.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:38:21', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/011-1091.0208_436ab64a-5a54-4292-8a00-959d59267c48.webp', 'physical', NULL, 7574.6, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/CpYFFEDPKJ3k4iukDrUE7ZCeB3ONjSRBdesBh1Yn.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/bL1sDEgFJ7OW8lAse2Pg7y1Sbst9kGKtBDmQ7whM.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/fspCKB5snWsUa5gbduz0Frx5r7BGonjVcMIeUC1E.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/MDQ7E8taWsD74AVkwQdvmpRImA0RFiWCv1LqwIR1.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/7CaX3b6GZv1LczYFdZOQ5i5IcnJZyTtTcvOa3udi.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB284\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
