(1977, 'American Dish AF-ES 3D Upright Energy Star Low Temp 3-Door Dish Machine with Single Rack', '<p>The AF-ES dishwasher boasts a range of standard features designed to enhance efficiency and performance in commercial kitchen environments. With its Energy Savings (ES) designation, it ensures optimal energy usage, contributing to cost savings over time. Operating at an impressive rate of 37 racks or 34 gallons per hour, this dishwasher is equipped with a powerful 1 1/2 HP pump, ensuring thorough cleaning with each cycle. Its large door opening of 20 1/2 inches facilitates easy loading and unloading of dishes, while dual screens protect the pump from debris, extending its lifespan and reducing maintenance requirements. The convertible design and generous 20 1/5-inch door clearance offer flexibility and convenience, accommodating a variety of dish sizes and configurations. In terms of specifications, the AF/AFC-ES Series dishwasher delivers consistent performance and reliability. With rated capacities of 37, 25, or 12 racks per hour, it meets the demands of high-volume commercial kitchens. The powerful 1.5 HP motor ensures efficient operation, while water consumption is kept minimal at just .936 gallons per cycle, contributing to water conservation efforts. Offering versatility, it provides cycle times of 90, 120, and 150 seconds to suit varying cleaning needs. Additionally, with electrical ratings of 115 volts and single-phase operation, installation is straightforward, requiring connection to a suitable power source using appropriate wiring and protection. Overall, the AF-ES dishwasher combines robust features and specifications to deliver superior cleaning performance while promoting energy and water efficiency.</p>', '<p>The AF-ES 3D dishwasher is Energy Star certified, guaranteeing optimal energy efficiency and reduced utility costs over time. Featuring three doors, this dishwasher offers ample space for loading and unloading dishes, optimizing workflow and productivity in commercial settings. With a single rack setup, this dishwasher streamlines the loading and unloading process, allowing for efficient handling of dishes and utensils while maximizing the available space. The low-temperature wash cycle ensures gentle yet thorough cleaning, preserving the integrity of delicate dishware while effectively removing tough stains and residues. Equipped with a single chemical alarm system, this dishwasher enhances safety by alerting users to any issues with chemical levels, ensuring optimal cleaning performance and compliance with safety regulations.</p>', 'published', '[]', '011-1091.0206', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 6159.37, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 71.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 295.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:38:22', '2024-12-30 07:47:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/011-1091.0206_05b6476c-b432-4043-b06a-45aa7967fe07.webp', 'physical', NULL, 4849.9, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/qAUcb3lF425ftYAAqz9q096n0H5h9RzFMur4jbYC.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/lFGrHE80RY1NvbbHtqfdnvsJwn8IUKFRZMqGP2RI.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/kCSSpCbxbtWfKAg52mQJkt2on8t1gcmqrKqLVtP7.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/SOrLqXcoltT45w26B4Cy0UkO9BlPAQ4kiobt6ybf.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/VzqvNVP1mRSVkFuEPhG9cinjUTN04kc3eOcsxzyy.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB285\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1978, 'American Dish AF-ES 3D Energy Star 3-Door Upright Dish Machine with Single Rack', '<p>The AF/AFC-ES Dish Machine boasts an array of standard features designed to enhance efficiency and performance in commercial kitchens. With Energy Star certification, it guarantees energy savings, reducing operational costs while maintaining high cleaning standards. Equipped with a powerful 1 1/2 HP pump, this dishwasher can handle up to 37 racks or 34 gallons per hour, ensuring swift and thorough cleaning cycles to meet the demands of busy kitchen environments. Its large door opening of 20 1/2 inches facilitates easy loading and unloading of dishes, optimizing workflow efficiency. The machine\'s convertible design adds versatility, allowing seamless integration into various kitchen layouts, while its 20 1/5-inch door clearance accommodates bulky items, making it suitable for diverse dishwashing needs. In terms of specifications, the AF/AFC-ES Dish Machine underscores its robust performance and reliability. Rated capacities ranging from 37 to 12 racks per hour provide flexibility to cater to different dishwashing volumes. Powered by a 1.5 HP motor, it ensures consistent operation, while its low water consumption of 0.936 gallons per cycle minimizes resource usage. With adjustable cycle times and a minimum water temperature requirement of 120F, users can customize wash settings to suit specific requirements. Additionally, the dishwasher\'s electrical ratings make installation straightforward, ensuring compatibility with standard power sources. Overall, the AF/AFC-ES Dish Machine combines advanced features with reliable specifications to deliver efficient and effective dishwashing solutions for commercial kitchens.</p>', '<p>Energy Star certified ensures energy efficiency, reducing operational costs and environmental impact. Three-Door design facilitates efficient loading and unloading, optimizing workflow in commercial kitchens. Single rack capacity accommodates a single rac