(1979, 'American Dish AFC-ES Energy Star 2-Door Upright Dish Machine with Single Rack 208V/3Ph', '<p>The standard features of the AF/AFC-ES Dish Machine embody efficiency and functionality, making it an indispensable asset in commercial kitchens. With Energy Star certification denoting its energy-saving capabilities, this dishwasher ensures reduced operational costs while maintaining high cleaning standards. Its powerful 1 1/2 HP pump drives efficient cleaning, capable of handling up to 37 racks or 34 gallons per hour, catering to the demands of busy kitchen environments. The large door opening of 20 1/2 inches facilitates easy loading and unloading of dishes, optimizing workflow efficiency. Moreover, the machine is equipped with dual screens to protect the pump, ensuring reliable and consistent performance over time. The convertible design of the AF/AFC-ES Dish Machine adds versatility to its functionality, allowing seamless integration into various kitchen layouts. With a door clearance of 20 1/5 inches, it accommodates bulky items, making it suitable for diverse dishwashing needs. Its stainless steel air gap enhances sanitation and prevents contamination, while the large capacity scrap accumulator efficiently collects debris, simplifying cleaning routines. The dishwasher\'s specifications highlight its robust performance and reliability, with a 1.5 HP motor ensuring consistent operation. With adjustable cycle times and low water consumption, this dishwasher offers customizable options to meet specific dishwashing requirements. Additionally, its electrical ratings make installation straightforward, ensuring compatibility with standard power sources and providing peace of mind to kitchen operators.</p>', '<p>Energy Star certified ensures energy efficiency, reducing operational costs and environmental impact Two-Door design facilitates efficient loading and unloading, optimizing workflow in commercial kitchens. Single rack capacity accommodates a single rack per cyc