(1984, 'American Dish AF-ES Energy Star 2-Door Upright Dish Machine with Single Rack Pass-Thru', '<p>The AF-ES Dish Machine embodies a range of standard features tailored to elevate dishwashing efficiency while prioritizing energy savings. As an Energy Star certified appliance, it adheres to stringent energy efficiency guidelines, ensuring reduced energy consumption and operational costs without compromising performance. With a powerful 1 1/2 HP pump, this dishwasher delivers robust cleaning power, capable of handling 37 racks per hour, making it suitable for high-volume commercial kitchen environments. Its convertible design offers versatility, seamlessly adapting to different kitchen layouts, while the large door opening and 20 1/2-inch door clearance facilitate easy loading and unloading of dishes, enhancing workflow efficiency. Additionally, the dishwasher features a stainless steel air gap and dual screens to protect the pump, ensuring optimal hygiene and prolonging the lifespan of the appliance. Furthermore, the AF-ES Dish Machine prioritizes simplicity and convenience in maintenance and operation. Its large capacity scrap accumulator efficiently collects debris, simplifying cleaning routines and minimizing maintenance downtime. The dishwasher\'s specifications highlight its high performance and reliability, with a 1.5 HP motor ensuring consistent and powerful operation. With water consumption of just .936 gallons per cycle and available cycle times ranging from 90 to 150 seconds, it combines efficiency with versatility to meet various dishwashing needs. The appliance\'s electrical ratings make it compatible with standard 115-volt single-phase power sources, ensuring easy installation and operation. Overall, the AF-ES Dish Machine offers a comprehensive solution for commercial kitchens seeking efficient, reliable, and environmentally conscious dishwashing equipment.</p>', '<p>Designed to meet or exceed energy efficiency guidelines set by the Energy Star program, ensuring reduced energy consumption and operational costs. Facilitates efficient loading and unloading of dishes, enhancing workflow in commercial kitchens. Suitable for moderate dishwashing volumes, accommodating a single rack per cycle. Allows for dishes to be loaded from one side and unloaded from the other, streamlining dishwashing processes in busy kitchens. Provides gentle yet effective cleaning, suitable for delicate items and reducing energy usage compared to high-temperature wash cycles.</p>', 'published', '[]', '011-1090.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 5768.91, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 76.00, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 295.00, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:38:30', '2024-12-17 06:07:00', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/011-1090.0000_db537a16-c354-4907-ae02-17af3a89d724.webp', 'physical', NULL, 4542.45, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/CorkNj2pf2hPfJFrtQARhOCbgA1Kg2XuF4p8B6eD.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/E7I8kur9DuXKNjcaij9mMV6u1GqvkNJwxKO6Zhzf.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/kseQpddDR35Q5xNHgOu1YTVqBtzNEdnt02ApFe9k.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/0IifeK672HfZHnmkPaSV64O5hBgsSQ1zmuKZXyAA.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/8tInezI5GjH66zWxEHF8kzL97eixEj2i3gREdGHC.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB292\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1985, 'American Dish AF-3D-S 3D Upright 3-Door Low Temp Dish Machine with Single Rack and Muffler Heater', '<p>The AF-3D-S Dish Machine boasts a comprehensive array of standard features, making it a standout solution for commercial dishwashing needs. Its convertible design offers versatility, seamlessly adapting to various kitchen configurations to optimize workflow efficiency. With an impressive 20.5-inch door clearance, this dishwasher accommodates oversized items effortlessly, making it particularly well-suited for pizza applications and large dishware. Equipped with a quick service 1 1/2 HP pump and quick-release spray arms, it ensures swift and thorough dishwashing cycles, even during peak operational hours. Additionally, the inclusion of a stainless steel air gap and run indicator light enhances operational hygiene and monitoring, simplifying cleaning routines for added convenience. Furthermore, the AF-3D-S prioritizes durability and ease of maintenance, featuring innovative components such as the diagonal scrap trap for effortless screen removal and dual screens to safeguard the pump intake. Its swift plumbing removal system, utilizing zero-interference Stainless/Terelene Couplers, streamlines maintenance tasks, minimizing downtime and ensuring uninterrupted operation. Offering additional options like solid chemical dispensing and stainless steel spray bases, bayonets, and manifold couplings, this dishwasher provides versatile solutions tailored to meet specific operational requirements. Backed by robust specifications including a 1.5 HP motor and low water consumption of 2.2 gallons per cycle, the AF-3D-S delivers reliable performance while adhering to energy efficiency standards, making it an indispensable asset in commercial kitchens.</p>', '<p>Facilitates efficient loading and unloading of dishes, optimizing workflow in commercial kitchens. Suitable for moderate to high dishwashing volumes, handling a single rack per cycle efficiently. Provides gentle yet effective cleaning, ideal for delicate items and energy efficiency. Ensures consistent water temperature, optimizing wash performance and sanitation standards. Maximizes floor space while offering easy access to the dishwasher, suitable for kitchens with limited space.</p>', 'published', '[]', '026-1090.0081', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 9374.57, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 76.00, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 295.00, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:38:31', '2024-12-17 06:48:39', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/026-1090.0081_c236fefd-c079-48de-b652-d81a979613ad.webp', 'physical', NULL, 7381.55, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/D1xQH0usB87AYADIhAioR88IsttPVCRWIu1yQUkH.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/J2gJjrl2YgL0UZVb0ore2BK8ZmE2LWQESPqXkliM.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/oL4w6xfZlzrlG7nlwJmKnS9sz5OvNGrQH9UQ3Zky.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Mvj3j8YkxpWnONNjkBHczPuUTySR9hNTWwGBlObH.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/dRyD6tnYhGoCbx1w8RIXNddwJ8LDdr3tlPJyVUsJ.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB293\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1986, 'American Dish AF-3D-S 3D Upright 3-Door Low Temp Dish Machine with Single Rack and Single Chemical Alarm', '<p>The AF-3D-S Dish Machine embodies a comprehensive array of standard features meticulously engineered to elevate dishwashing efficiency in commercial settings. Its convertible design offers unparalleled adaptability, seamlessly integrating into various kitchen configurations to optimize workflow. Boasting a remarkable 20.5-inch door clearance, this dishwasher accommodates oversized items with ease, making it particularly ideal for pizza applications and large dishware. Equipped with a quick service 1 1/2 HP pump and quick-release spray arms, it ensures swift and thorough dishwashing cycles, even during peak operating hours. The inclusion of a stainless steel air gap and run indicator light enhances operational hygiene and monitoring, respectively, while simplifying cleaning routines for added convenience. Furthermore, the AF-3D-S prioritizes durability and ease of maintenance, featuring innovative components such as the diagonal scrap trap for effortless screen removal and dual screens to safeguard the pump intake. Its swift plumbing removal system, utilizing zero-interference Stainless/Terelene Couplers, streamlines maintenance tasks, minimizing downtime and ensuring uninterrupted operation. With additional options like solid chemical dispensing and stainless steel spray bases, bayonets, and manifold couplings, this dishwasher offers versatile solutions tailored to meet specific operational needs. Backed by robust specifications including a 1.5 HP motor and low water consumption of 2.2 gallons per cycle, the AF-3D-S delivers reliable performance while adhering to energy efficiency standards, making it an indispensable asset in commercial kitchens.</p>', '<p>Facilitates efficient loading and unloading of dishes, optimizing workflow in commercial kitchens. Designed to handle a single rack per cycle, suitable for moderate to high dishwashing volumes. Provides gentle yet effective cleaning, ideal for delicate items and energy efficiency. Ensures proper chemical concentration for effective sanitation, enhancing dishwashing performance. Maximizes floor space while offering easy access to the dishwasher, suitable for kitchens with limited space.</p>', 'published', '[]', '026-1090.0077', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 5914.2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 76.00, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 295.00, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:38:33', '2024-12-17 06:45:34', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/026-1090.0077_83de0852-f435-4a85-b80c-d7a92926908f.webp', 'physical', NULL, 4656.85, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/aOGCD9WB8jSvAY8uruY5NUh4fIwCHYFtr2I6HmFv.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/JSq8aT7eQJWfpbqqkYgtP5sRJhj9XgmEttWsDzsu.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/5vEle99NP3sNErZSyiuyIBA9OAbvsG17CgAHePkf.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6RlM4qMqL4GK96IahDYY6qGUy2ttMJHkoFF51Qvs.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/vKcbvrJk76TdanqCSyDh34UNKCkqYhnfY751HCFi.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB294\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1987, 'American Dish AF-3D-S 3D Upright 3-Door Low Temp Dish Machine with Single Rack', '<p>The AF-3D-S Dish Machine offers a comprehensive suite of standard features tailored to meet the rigorous demands of commercial dishwashing operations. Its convertible design ensures adaptability to various kitchen layouts, while the generous 20.5-inch door clearance facilitates easy loading and unloading of dishes, making it particularly suitable for pizza applications and oversized dishware. Equipped with a quick service 1 1/2 HP pump and quick release spray arms, this dishwasher streamlines dishwashing processes, ensuring efficient performance even during peak hours. Additionally, the stainless steel air gap and run indicator light contribute to optimal hygiene standards and operational monitoring, respectively, while simplifying cleaning procedures for enhanced convenience. Furthermore, the AF-3D-S is engineered for durability and ease of maintenance, featuring innovative components such as the diagonal scrap trap for effortless screen removal and dual screens to protect the pump intake. The swift plumbing removal system, utilizing zero-interference Stainless/Terelene Couplers, facilitates hassle-free maintenance, minimizing downtime. Offering additional options like solid chemical dispensing and stainless steel spray bases, bayonets, and manifold couplings, this dishwasher provides versatile solutions tailored to meet specific operational requirements. With its robust specifications, including a 1.5 HP motor, low water consumption of 2.2 gallons per cycle, and adjustable cycle times, the AF-3D-S ensures reliable performance while adhering to energy efficiency standards.</p>', '<p>Facilitates efficient loading and unloading of dishes, enhancing workflow efficiency and accommodating large volumes of dishware. Designed to handle a single rack per cycle, suitable for moderate to high dishwashing demands in commercial settings. Ensures gentle cleaning and sanitization, ideal for delicate items and energy efficiency. Maximizes floor space in the kitchen, making it suitable for establishments where space is limited while maintaining efficient operation. Built to withstand the rigors of commercial use, featuring durable materials such as stainless steel for longevity and ease of maintenance.</p>', 'published', '[]', '026-1090.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 5773.8, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 76.00, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 295.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:38:34', '2024-12-17 06:44:32', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/026-1090.0000_11094ea5-dee9-441c-becf-59b365631795.webp', 'physical', NULL, 4546.3, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/2uuIHE6I87bkWnGF30PCmwXhha0BQcjbUvLosuLc.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/03n6TV49s1aAkwbRuVvrwRPjQmnlddrjQY1JYEIO.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/NTTR3L0hPe90waPTlIM4s4rPGymd84XSLmautUq7.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/KwV72U4EV74hViHcE9ecfL3Xqk7EF2me0NxLnbVb.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/JXH2We7IF0FgWPgMkYT4eq4dKBvu0W6zEBCSSA34.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB295\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1988, 'American Dish  AFC-3D-S 2-Door, Upright Dish Machine with Single Rack 208V', '<p>The AFC-3D-S dishwasher is packed with standard features designed to elevate efficiency and ease of use in commercial kitchens. Its convertible design ensures adaptability to various kitchen layouts, offering flexibility in installation options. With a remarkable 20.5-inch door clearance, this dishwasher accommodates larger items with ease, making it ideal for pizza applications and other oversized dishware. The inclusion of a quick service 1 1/2 HP pump facilitates rapid dishwashing cycles, enhancing throughput in busy environments. Additionally, the dishwasher features quick release spray arms and stainless steel air gap, simplifying cleaning procedures and promoting optimal hygiene standards. Its run indicator light provides clear feedback on operational status, aiding in monitoring and maintenance. Swift plumbing removal, utilizing zero-interference Stainless/Terelene Couplers, streamlines maintenance tasks, ensuring minimal downtime. Furthermore, the dishwasher boasts a diagonal scrap trap for easy screen removal and dual screens to protect the pump intake, contributing to efficient operation and maintenance. In terms of specifications, the AFC-3D-S offers a rated capacity of 37 racks per hour, powered by a robust 1.5 HP motor. It consumes 2.2 gallons of water per cycle, maintaining efficiency without compromising on cleaning performance. The dishwasher operates at a minimum water temperature of 120F (49C), ensuring effective sanitation. With available cycle times of 90, 120, and 150 seconds, users can tailor wash cycles to suit their specific needs. Its electrical ratings include compatibility with 115-volt single-phase power sources, with circuit protection requirements of a 20-amp circuit breaker or fuse. Overall, the AFC-3D-S dishwasher combines advanced features with reliable performance, making it an indispensable asset for commercial kitchens seeking optimal cleanliness and operational efficiency.</p>', '<p>Facilitates efficient loading and unloading of dishes, enhancing workflow efficiency in busy kitchen environments. Accommodates a single rack per cycle, making it suitable for moderate to high volumes of dishware, glasses, and utensils. Ensures gentle treatment of delicate items while effectively cleaning and sanitizing, maintaining optimal cleanliness without compromising energy efficiency. Optimizes performance by maintaining water temperature consistently, ensuring thorough cleaning results with added energy efficiency benefits. Maximizes floor space in the kitchen, ideal for establishments in limited spaces, while the durable stainless steel construction ensures longevity and ease of maintenance.</p>', 'published', '[]', '027-0090.0127', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 9250.24, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 76.00, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 295.00, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:38:35', '2024-12-17 06:50:51', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/027-0090.0127_a3a3a2ed-424c-41e6-b024-55fff42feb5e.webp', 'physical', NULL, 7283.65, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/u1e0qKJxKbPZEo8c9GyCUKpd5EZSa6s1QBDQDFb1.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/ENcki9PJ5rqaoRpbtLhx9BxQj3JI1kG7h5uMCiTh.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/NK71sNuVL7O6fFL27Z7plspQ8mTS6Zp5VR9Q4pLO.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/jedET6eWYFhIkKhNjcfGtgRChjHlfg0Ye1lY09sU.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/t9XNwvHAvAzej5ZNYnZHF8i5iYz2Pl7ejC8PNrTp.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB296\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1989, 'American Dish AFC-3D-S 2-Door Upright Dish Machine With Single Rack', '<p>The AFC-3D-S dishwasher stands out with its convertible design, offering adaptability to both corner and pass-through installations. This versatility ensures seamless integration into various kitchen layouts, optimizing space utilization and workflow efficiency. Its notable 20.5-inch door clearance facilitates the loading and unloading of larger items, making it particularly suitable for applications like pizza pans and trays. Additionally, its swift plumbing removal feature, utilizing zero-interference Stainless/Terelene Couplers, streamlines maintenance tasks, enabling easy access to plumbing components for repairs or cleaning. The inclusion of a quick service 1 1/2 HP pump ensures rapid and efficient dishwashing, contributing to high throughput in busy food service environments. Moreover, the AFC-3D-S boasts user-friendly features designed to enhance operational convenience and hygiene. Its quick release spray arms and stainless steel air gap simplify cleaning procedures, promoting thorough sanitation and maintenance. The incorporation of a run indicator light offers visual feedback on the dishwasher\'s operational status, aiding in monitoring and troubleshooting. The provision of solid chemical dispensing options enhances washing efficacy, ensuring consistent and reliable cleaning results. Furthermore, the dishwasher\'s innovative diagonal scrap trap facilitates easy screen removal in both corner and pass-through models, contributing to efficient maintenance practices. With its robust construction, efficient performance, and user-centric design, the AFC-3D-S dishwasher is a dependable solution for commercial kitchens seeking optimal cleanliness and operational efficiency.</p>', '<p>As indicated by the \"Single Rack\" designation, this dishwasher is designed to accommodate one standard-size dish rack per wash cycle. The dishwasher features a two-door configuration, allowing for easy loading and unloading of dishes. Unlike dishwashers that use high-temperature water for sanitization, the AFC-3D-S utilizes a low-temperature washing process. The inclusion of a single chemical alarm is a safety feature that alerts users if there\'s an issue with the chemical supply. The dishwasher\'s upright design saves floor space, making it suitable for kitchens with limited space</p>', 'published', '[]', '027-0090.0123', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 5789.87, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 76.00, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 295.00, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:38:36', '2024-12-17 06:50:10', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/027-0090.0123_1c10aa0b-9b04-419a-b08c-13eaa9df555c.webp', 'physical', NULL, 4558.95, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Lbwt3aAdk7hjU6gpFYB44E3C39AMTGZ9LFyLy0wx.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/DDEWihUgIgkcKyIAnT8j4rJ2tEoiUPZeQseyDKCj.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/pMwC3UPaGRbgWaTJCv4PtUTSZVBwDWLOJtluqZzG.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/jU4cAdxcbLEqPDLZ9u4Hq6wC88rYuWqZN2p5faNZ.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/DpitMNYU6fLZ6upKbjeHF28kEbIwxVvB34mzuiAb.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB297\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
