(1990, 'American Dish  AFC-3D-S 2-Door, Upright Dish Machine with Single Rack', '<p>The AFC-3D-S Dish Machine offers a range of standard features tailored to optimize performance and ease of use in commercial dishwashing settings. Its convertible design provides flexibility, allowing seamless adaptation to various kitchen configurations. With a generous door clearance of 20.5 inches, this dishwasher accommodates bulky items and facilitates efficient loading and unloading processes, making it particularly suitable for pizza applications. Equipped with a quick service 1.5 HP pump, the machine ensures swift and thorough cleaning cycles, maximizing productivity in busy kitchen environments. The inclusion of quick-release spray arms and stainless steel air gap further enhances its functionality, simplifying maintenance routines and ensuring consistent wash performance. Moreover, the AFC-3D-S Dish Machine is designed with user convenience and reliability in mind. A run indicator light provides visual feedback on the operational status, facilitating monitoring and troubleshooting. The machine\'s innovative diagonal scrap trap allows for easy removal of debris screens in both corner and pass-through models, streamlining cleaning procedures and minimizing downtime. The plumbing system is engineered for efficiency and durability, featuring swift plumbing removal and dual screens to protect the pump intake. Additionally, the dishwasher offers optional solid chemical dispensing for enhanced sanitation, while its stainless steel spray bases, bayonets, and manifold couplings allow for quick-release spray arm removal, ensuring ease of cleaning and maintenance. Overall, the AFC-3D-S Dish Machine combines advanced features with robust specifications to meet the demanding requirements of commercial kitchen operations.</p>', '<p>The AFC-3D-S boasts a dual-door configuration, enhancing accessibility and workflow efficiency in busy commercial kitchens. With the capability to accommodate a single rack, this dishwasher efficiently handles dishwashing tasks while conserving space. Operating at low temperatures ensures energy efficiency and minimizes utility costs without compromising cleaning performance. Designed in an upright configuration, loading and unloading dishes are ergonomic and convenient, optimizing productivity during peak hours. Built for commercial use, the AFC-3D-S delivers reliable and consistent dishwashing results, meeting the demands of busy kitchen environments.</p>', 'published', '[]', '027-0090.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 5649.47, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 76.00, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 295.00, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:38:37', '2024-12-17 06:49:19', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/027-0090.0000_04f7be56-dd57-4c0d-a69a-ee324e88a50f.webp', 'physical', NULL, 4448.4, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/cDlzjXQhuId3JGvz8DPnQjy2Uk8ERcnP4h3uuGiW.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/rYalbnmsqXTkTFMtPVEbjCg5NIw4a7wk49hdhUKO.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/BY2JPIiIgbt9xotkX37ittSBWKVMsYkQ77xW7K6U.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/mpVLevt0kzHY9iBBHOoRYWOgS22zYCm8lzKv1l9c.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/ve8ClQ20H3CY5cjwZklWnYWDsfunbiVlcF9dhR6T.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB298\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1991, 'American Dish AF-3D-S Upright 2-Door Dish Machine with Single Rack W/ 208V', '<p>The AF-3D-S dishwasher offers a range of standard features tailored for efficiency and convenience in commercial kitchen settings. Its convertible design and generous 20.5\" door clearance make it versatile and suitable for various applications, particularly ideal for pizza establishments. Equipped with a powerful 1 1/2 HP pump and quick-release spray arms, this dishwasher ensures quick service without compromising on cleaning quality. Additionally, the stainless steel air gap and run indicator light enhance operational efficiency, while the dishwasher\'s simple-to-clean design and swift plumbing removal streamline maintenance tasks. Furthermore, the AF-3D-S dishwasher is available with solid chemical dispensing for added convenience and safety. Its innovative features include an air gap fill that eliminates the need for check valves and vacuum breakers, as well as a diagonal scrap trap for easy screen removal in both corner and pass-through models. With additional options like stainless steel spray bases, bayonets, and manifold couplings, this dishwasher offers enhanced functionality and ease of maintenance. Models AFC-3D-S and AF-3D-S are also available, each featuring built-in scrap accumulators for added convenience.</p>', '<p>The AF-3D-S boasts a dual-door configuration, optimizing accessibility and workflow efficiency in commercial kitchens. With the capability to accommodate a single rack, this dishwasher efficiently handles dishwashing tasks while conserving space. Operating at low temperatures ensures energy efficiency and minimizes utility costs without compromising cleaning performance. Equipped with a muffler heater operating at 208V, it enhances dishwashing effectiveness for optimal results. Designed in an upright configuration, loading and unloading dishes are ergonomic and convenient, enhancing productivity during busy kitchen hours.</p>', 'published', '[]', '026-0090.0052', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 9130.79, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 76.00, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 295.00, NULL, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:38:38', '2024-12-17 06:43:41', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/026-0090.0052_694651bd-98b5-4a04-87de-35a46f801f33.webp', 'physical', NULL, 7189.6, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/7WRgjZAbtQDtt1f5fG9uKzkugPCDL2xK4VgbizLS.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/1mF26dVl2l8VtSg8UslwGCjGFeEMpKCwK3oBNf0g.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/fRwwEHjBZ1L71FRNVjK996hqWMN2oLtb5cvGor4V.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/2b4UShUOaPIBypksVaI7ioGz61fLYp1CyhABbSpV.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/lULvudu6EF1qkhH7jTEBO6FivQePNogypgX8N2KV.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB299\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1992, 'American Dish AF-3D-S Upright 2-Door Dish Machine with Single Rack and Single Chemical Alarm', '<p>The AF-3D-S dishwasher offers an array of standard features designed to streamline dishwashing operations in commercial settings. Its convertible design, coupled with a generous 20.5\" door clearance, ensures versatility and accessibility, making it particularly suitable for pizza applications. Equipped with a powerful 1 1/2 HP pump and quick-release spray arms, this dishwasher delivers quick service without compromising on cleaning quality. Additionally, its stainless steel air gap and run indicator light enhance operational efficiency, while its simple-to-clean design and swift plumbing removal facilitate hassle-free maintenance. In terms of specifications, the AF-3D-S boasts a rated capacity of 37 racks per hour, driven by a robust 1.5 HP motor. With a water consumption of 2.2 gallons per cycle and available cycle times ranging from 90 to 150 seconds, it offers flexibility to accommodate varying workload demands. Electrical ratings include 115 Volts, Single Phase, with recommended connections using 10-12 AWG copper wires. Moreover, circuit protection is ensured with a 20 AMP circuit breaker or fuse, providing safety and reliability during operation.</p>', '<p>The AF-3D-S features a dual-door configuration, optimizing accessibility and workflow efficiency in commercial kitchens. With the capacity to hold a single rack, this dishwasher efficiently handles dishwashing tasks while conserving space. Operating at low temperatures, it ensures energy efficiency and minimizes utility costs without compromising cleaning performance. Equipped with a single chemical alarm, it enhances safety by alerting users to chemical levels, Designed in an upright configuration, loading and unloading dishes are ergonomic and convenient,</p>', 'published', '[]', '026-0090.0049', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 5670.42, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 76.00, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 