(1993, 'American Dish AF-3D-S Upright 2-Door Low Temp Dish Machine with Single Rack', '<p>This dishwasher is designed with a convertible layout, ensuring versatility to meet various kitchen needs. Its impressive 20.5\" door clearance makes it particularly suitable for pizza applications, providing ample space for loading and unloading trays with ease. With a powerful 1 1/2 HP pump, this dishwasher delivers quick service, facilitated by quick-release spray arms that enhance efficiency. Moreover, its stainless steel air gap ensures optimal hygiene, while the run indicator light keeps users informed of the machine\'s operational status. Cleaning is simplified thanks to its straightforward design, and it\'s available with solid chemical dispensing for added convenience. Equipped with an air gap fill that eliminates the need for check valves and vacuum breakers, this dishwasher ensures smooth operation. Additionally, its diagonal scrap trap allows for easy screen removal in both corner and pass-through models, streamlining maintenance tasks. Plumbing removal is made swift through zero-interference Stainless/Terelene Couplers, facilitating hassle-free repairs. The dishwasher\'s dual screens protect the pump intake, prolonging its lifespan. Optional features include solid chemical dispensing and stainless steel spray bases, bayonets, and manifold couplings, enabling quick release of spray arms for effortless cleaning. Models AFC-3D-S and AF-3D-S are available, each featuring built-in scrap accumulators for added convenience.</p>', '<p>Efficient Design of the AF-3D-S features a compact 2-door design, ideal for space-saving in commercial kitchens. Single Rack Capacity easily accommodates a single rack and efficiently handles dishwashing tasks. Low temperature operation lets the dishwasher operate at low temperatures, ensuring energy efficiency and cost savings. Upright configuration makes loading and unloading dishes convenient and ergonomic so that you can handle the operations conveniently . Built for commercial use, the AF-3D-S delivers reliable and consistent dishwashing results.</p>', 'published', '[]', '026-0090.0000', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 19, 0, 0, 5530.02, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 76.00, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 295.00, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:38:41', '2024-12-17 06:42:01', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/026-0090.0000_77aa12a4-1772-4bd3-bebf-246b468a68d1.webp', 'physical', NULL, 4354.35, 4, 0, 16, 0, '<p>No Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/OMT8bj3WfpSp6kqzZcwtevi3BTJBiD3nxARVAEVm.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Untitled\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/x87eOLSgh8x0rX9ymv2bTbpS0bWDMOA2N72sxaIA.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/bd5L7xpAfSdzGDdZBxqwVjT3uFgECc7vksMioNOg.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/eFqbLorh9gosRrVwjWVEpY7Tv4q9QSUSd4FH8zng.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Installation\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/rkZkmrebRU72FxBm5v0GIOcsDpcTpJO66ldEQfOF.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parts Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/lWfhVRcKSzR1XGcuoBlS2P32kRBKn8ITJeBt9N9S.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB301\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1994, 'CMA Dishmachine EST-66 High Temperature Conveyor Dishwasher, Right to Left, 3 Phase, 220V, 60Hz', '\n<p>The CMA Dishmachine EST-66 is designed for high-performance dishwashing, handling up to 243 racks per hour with a right-to-left conveyor feed. This high-temperature conveyor dishwasher utilizes a sophisticated four-stage washing process: two wash stages, a power heated rinse, and a final rinse, ensuring comprehensive cleaning of dishware and glassware while using only 0.49 gallons of water per rack.</p>\n<p>Featuring a robust stainless steel construction, the EST-66 is equipped with a 12.75 kW heater for the wash tank and a 3 kW heater for the rinse tank, optimizing the cleaning process. The machine operates with a conveyor speed of 6.75 feet per minute and an interior chamber clearance of 19 inches, accommodating larger items and utensils. An automatic soil purging system filters out debris into a removable external tray, facilitating easy maintenance.</p>\n<p>The dishwasher requires a 208V, 3-phase electrical connection and operates at 50 amps. Its overall dimensions are 66 inches in width, 25 1/8 inches in depth, and 56 1/2 inches in height. With a total wattage of 15.75 kilowatts, the EST-66 delivers reliable performance for high-output dishwashing needs in busy commercial settings.</p>', 'Moves racks from right to left along a conveyor, enhancing workflow efficiency in high-traffic areas like hotels and restaurants.<br>\n\nEmploys a four-stage washing process with two wash stages, a power heated rinse, and a final rinse for thorough and effective cleaning.<br>\n\nConstructed with all stainless steel for durability and resistance to wear, ensuring long-term reliability in commercial kitchens.<br>\n\nIncludes an automatic soil purging system that captures and filters debris into an easy-to-clean external tray, maintaining clean wash water.<br>\n\nFeatures auto start/stop functionality and a table limit switch with a rack saver clutch system to protect the machine, racks, and surrounding equipment from damage.\n\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EST-66_053ab8c4-567c-4531-a9e6-0cfb426659b7.webp\"]', 'EST-66', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 23, 0, 0, 24999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:41:42', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/EST-66_053ab8c4-567c-4531-a9e6-0cfb426659b7.webp', 'physical', '', 19790.88, 4, 0, 19, 0, 'one year parts & labor limited warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB302\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1995, 'CMA Dishmachine S-C Tall Single Rack Low Temperature Scullery Pot and Pan Corner Dishwasher, 1 Phase, 115V, 60Hz,1 HP', '\n<p>The CMA Dishmachine S-C Tall Single Rack Low Temperature Chemical Sanitizing Corner Dishwasher operates on a 115V/60Hz/1 Phase electrical connection and adheres to NSF, UL, and CSA sanitation standards. Designed to accommodate pots and pans up to 27 inches high, this dishwasher offers a 90-second wash cycle and can clean up to 40 standard dish racks per hour. It uses 1.7 gallons of water per rack, which enhances its efficiency for high-volume dishwashing tasks.</p>\n<p>The dishwasher is equipped with a pump purging system that removes soil and chemical residues during the rinse cycle. It features a built-in Poly Pro scrap accumulator that captures debris, keeping the wash water clean and maintaining performance. The unique spray arm system includes upper and lower stainless steel wash arms with reinforced end caps, which provide thorough cleaning and can be easily removed for maintenance.</p>\n<p>Constructed entirely from stainless steel, the CMA S-C dishwasher is built for durability and long-lasting operation in commercial kitchens. It includes a top-mounted control box with chemical pumps and a deliming system for optimal chemical management. The unit comes with one dishrack and requires a 115V electrical connection.</p>', '\n\nFeatures a corner design with extended height to fit pots and pans up to 27 inches, perfect for versatile kitchen layouts and large items.<br>\n\nOffers a high-efficiency wash cycle that cleans up to 40 racks per hour while using only 1.7 gallons of water per cycle, making it economical and effective.<br>\n\nIncludes a pump purging system that keeps wash water clean by trapping debris and preventing soil and chemical carryover during the rinse cycle.<br>\n\nProvides top-mounted controls with built-in chemical pumps and a deliming system, ensuring accurate chemical use and ease of maintenance.<br>\n\nFeatures durable stainless steel construction, ensuring long-term reliability and easy cleaning in demanding commercial environments.\n\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/S-C_416d6158-b503-4e1b-a475-6dc739ab777d.webp\"]', 'S-C', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 23, 0, 0, 6307, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 26.00, NULL, 66.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 298.00, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:41:43', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/S-C_416d6158-b503-4e1b-a475-6dc739ab777d.webp', 'physical', '', 4993.2, 4, 0, 19, 0, 'one year parts & labor limited warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB303\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1996, 'CMA Dishmachine S-B Tall Double Rack Low Temperature Upright Scullery Pot and Pan Dishwasher, 1 Phase, 115V, 60Hz, 1HP', '\n<p>The CMA Dishmachine S-B Tall Double Rack Low Temperature Chemical Sanitizing Straight Dishwasher operates on a 115V/60Hz/1 Phase electrical connection and adheres to NSF, UL, and CSA sanitation standards. This model is well-suited for washing tall items, such as pots and pans up to 27 inches high, and offers a 90-second wash cycle. It can clean up to 80 standard dish racks per hour and uses 3 gallons of water per rack, making it highly efficient for high-volume use.</p>\n<p>The dishwasher features a pump purging system that prevents soil and chemical carryover during the rinse cycle. A built-in Poly Pro scrap accumulator captures debris, keeping the wash water clean throughout the process. The upper and lower stainless steel wash arms, with reinforced end caps, ensure thorough cleaning and can be easily removed for maintenance.</p>\n<p>Constructed entirely from stainless steel, the CMA S-B is designed for durability and long-term operation. The top-mounted control box includes chemical pumps and a deliming system to facilitate proper chemical management. The unit includes two dishracks and operates with a standard 115V electrical connection.</p>', '\n\nFeatures a tall double rack design that accommodates pots and pans up to 27 inches high, ideal for commercial kitchens needing versatile cleaning options.<br>\n\nOffers the capability to clean up to 80 racks per hour, maximizing efficiency and productivity while using only 3 gallons of water per rack.<br>\n\nIncludes an auto start/stop feature for easy operation, simplifying the dishwashing process and ensuring consistent performance.<br>\n\nProvides a built-in Poly Pro scrap accumulator and pump purging system to keep wash water clean by trapping debris and eliminating soil and chemical carryover.<br>\n\nEquipped with a top-mounted control box with chemical pumps and a deliming system to ensure proper chemical usage and easy maintenance.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/S-B_52c84142-8bf6-4b4f-9a94-026c2a7e0a4b.webp\"]', 'S-B', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 23, 0, 0, 8555, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 44.00, NULL, 66.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 396.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:41:44', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/S-B_52c84142-8bf6-4b4f-9a94-026c2a7e0a4b.webp', 'physical', '', 6773.03, 4, 0, 19, 0, 'one year parts & labor limited warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB304\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1997, 'CMA Dishmachine S-AH Tall Single Rack Low Temperature Upright Scullery Pot and Pan Dishwasher, 1 Phase, 115V, 60Hz, 1HP', '\n<p>The CMA Dishmachine S-AH Tall Single Rack Low Temperature Chemical Sanitizing Straight Dishwasher operates on a 115V/60Hz/1 Phase electrical connection and is designed to meet NSF, UL, and CSA sanitation standards. This model can handle dishware up to 27 inches high and is equipped with a tall design to accommodate larger items such as pots and pans. It features a 90-second wash cycle and can clean up to 40 racks per hour, using 1.7 gallons of water per cycle.</p>\n<p>The dishwasher incorporates a pump purging system that eliminates soil and chemical carryover during the rinse cycle, trapping debris in an integrated Poly Pro scrap accumulator. This ensures that the wash water remains clean and effective throughout the cleaning process. The upper and lower stainless steel wash arms, designed with reinforced end caps, deliver superior cleaning performance and are easily removable for maintenance.</p>\n<p>Constructed entirely from stainless steel, the CMA S-AH is built for durability and long-term use. It includes a top-mounted control box with chemical pumps and a deliming system to assure proper chemical usage and maintenance. The unit also includes one dishrack and operates with a standard 115V electrical connection.</p>', '\n\nFeatures a tall design that accommodates pots and pans up to 27 inches high, making it ideal for large or bulky items in commercial kitchens.<br>\n\nOffers efficient cleaning with a capacity of up to 40 racks per hour while using only 1.7 gallons of water per cycle, ensuring sustainability and cost savings.<br>\n\nIncludes an auto start/stop function for ease of use and efficient operation, streamlining the dishwashing process.<br>\n\nProvides an integrated Poly Pro scrap accumulator and pump purging system that prevents soil and chemical carryover, keeping wash water clean and effective.<br>\n\nEquipped with a top-mounted control box with built-in chemical pumps and a deliming system for effective chemical use and maintenance.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/S-AH_5de3d32b-12bc-4fe4-b3aa-ea5cd02a181a.webp\"]', 'S-AH', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 23, 0, 0, 6307, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 26.00, NULL, 66.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 292.00, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:41:45', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/S-AH_5de3d32b-12bc-4fe4-b3aa-ea5cd02a181a.webp', 'physical', '', 4993.2, 4, 0, 19, 0, 'one year parts & labor limited warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB305\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1998, 'CMA Dishmachine UC50e High Temperature Undercounter Dishwasher, 1 Phase, 220V, 60Hz, 3/4 HP', '\n\n<p>The CMA UC50E high-temperature undercounter dishwasher efficiently washes up to 30 racks per hour with a fully automatic cycle. This user-friendly machine features built-in detergent and rinse chemical pumps, simplifying the warewashing process. Its triple filtering protection system effectively captures excess soil and debris, preventing recirculation over the dishes. The pump drain allows for multiple installation applications, including elevated drains, adding flexibility to your kitchen setup.</p>\n<p>Constructed with double skin stainless steel, the UC50E ensures consistent heating and quiet operation. The removable stainless steel wash and rinse arms make cleaning easy, while stainless steel safety filters protect the wash pump from corrosion and damage. Polished stainless steel surfaces, molded rack supports, and tanks with rounded corners enhance the cleaning process, ensuring thorough sanitation. The top-mounted controls are easy to read and use, adding to the dishwasher\'s user-friendly design.</p>\n<p>Measuring 23 7/16 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 33 5/8 inches in height, this dishwasher uses only 0.8 gallons of water per rack. It operates at 208V/60Hz/1 phase with a 3/4 HP motor, ensuring powerful performance. The built-in 6 kW wash tank heater and booster safety thermostat maintain optimal sanitizing temperatures. With a shipping weight of 176 pounds, the UC50E provides a reliable and efficient solution for commercial kitchens, enhancing both performance and safety with features like door and water level safety switches.</p>', '\n\nFeatures an automatic wash cycle for user-friendly operation, ideal for busy cafes and restaurants.<br>\n\nOffers built-in detergent and rinse pumps, ensuring consistent cleaning performance without manual intervention.<br>\n\nEnsures quiet operation and consistent heating due to its double-skin stainless steel construction, perfect for undercounter use in hotels and dining establishments.<br>\n\nProvides versatile installation options with a pump drain, making it adaptable for various kitchen layouts without needing a floor drain.<br>\n\nIncludes safety features such as door and water level switches, enhancing both performance and safety in commercial kitchens.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/UC50e_34b3b208-7ae6-4e6c-b99c-f2f7739842e6.webp\"]', 'UC50e', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 23, 0, 0, 4952, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 23.00, NULL, 33.00, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 234.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:41:46', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/UC50e_34b3b208-7ae6-4e6c-b99c-f2f7739842e6.webp', 'physical', '', 3920.18, 4, 0, 19, 0, 'one year parts & labor limited warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB306\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(1999, 'CMA Dishmachine 181 VL High Temperature Energy Recovery Undercounter Glasswasher, 1 Phase, 220V, 60Hz, 1HP', '\n<p>The CMA 81-VL high-temperature energy recovery undercounter glass washer, manufactured by CMA Dishmachines, features a robust energy recovery system that significantly reduces water vapor escape during and after each cycle. This model, designed for high-volume settings, promotes faster drying of glasses while reducing energy costs by utilizing only a cold water supply. The unit is constructed from durable type 304 stainless steel, which ensures longevity and efficient heat retention.</p>\n<p>With dimensions of 24\" width, 27\" depth, and 33 3/8\" height, the glass washer is compact yet spacious enough to accommodate a large 11 1/4\" interior chamber clearance. This allows it to fit taller stemware, mugs, and various glass sizes. The efficient 1 hp wash motor uses only 0.73 gallons of water per cycle, conserving both water and energy. The Safe-T-Temperature booster heater integrated within the unit achieves a 180-degree Fahrenheit final rinse, ensuring thorough sanitation. A pair of rotating arms provide fresh water rinsing during the 178-second cycle.</p>\n<p>Designed for user convenience, the washer chamber is set at an ergonomic height, reducing the need for excessive bending and enhancing employee comfort. The top-mounted controls are easy to read and operate, contributing to effortless use in high-paced environments. Maintenance is simplified with a removable stainless steel pump protection screen, which helps preserve internal components. This glass washer requires a 208-230V electrical connection and is an excellent choice for commercial kitchens seeking efficiency and durability.</p>', '\n\nFeatures an energy recovery system to reduce water vapor, promoting faster drying and lowering energy costs, perfect for busy hotel bars and restaurants.<br>\n\nOffers a large interior chamber to fit various glassware sizes, ensuring versatility in cafes and other food service environments.<br>\n\nIncludes a soft start feature that minimizes noise and reduces glass breakage, extending the life of your glassware.<br>\n\nUtilizes efficient water and energy use per cycle, conserving resources while maintaining a high level of cleanliness.<br>\n\nProvides user-friendly controls and a comfortable chamber height, making it easy to operate and reducing strain on staff.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/181VL.webp\"]', '181 VL', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 23, 0, 0, 8401, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 33.00, NULL, 27.00, NULL, 272.00, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:41:47', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/181VL.webp', 'physical', '', 6650.95, 4, 0, 19, 0, 'one year parts & labor limited warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB307\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2000, 'CMA Dishmachine 181GW High Temperature Undercounter Glasswasher, 1 Phase, 220V, 60Hz, 1HP', '\n<p>The CMA 181GW high-temperature undercounter glass washer, manufactured by CMA Dishmachines, features a robust 1 hp wash motor that efficiently uses 0.75 gallons of water per cycle. With dimensions of 24\" width, 25\" depth, and 39\" height, it fits comfortably in most kitchen setups. The integrated Safe-T-Temperature booster heater ensures a final rinse temperature of 180 degrees Fahrenheit, crucial for effective sanitation. Constructed from durable 16-gauge 304 stainless steel, it is built to withstand high-volume usage, making it a reliable choice for commercial kitchens.</p>\n<p>Equipped with an 11 1/4\" interior chamber clearance, this glass washer accommodates larger glassware, including stemware and mugs. The top-mounted controls are easy to read, allowing for straightforward operation. The unit\'s gravity drain system ensures that wash water and chemicals are efficiently removed, maintaining a clean chamber for every cycle. With its dual chemical pumps and rotating rinse arms, the CMA 181GW guarantees thorough and consistent cleaning performance.</p>\n<p>This high-temperature glass washer operates on a 208-240V electrical connection and requires 33-36 amps. The unit is designed for user convenience with its ergonomic chamber height, minimizing the need for excessive bending. The stainless steel pump protection screen is removable for easy maintenance, ensuring the machine\'s longevity. The CMA 181GW is a reliable and efficient addition to any commercial kitchen, providing top-tier performance and durability.</p>', '\n\nFeatures a large 11 1/4\" interior chamber clearance, accommodating taller stemware, mugs, and glasses, making it ideal for high volume bars.<br>\n\nOffers efficient operation with a 1 hp wash motor, using only 0.75 gallons of water per cycle to conserve water and energy.<br>\n\nIncludes an integrated Safe-T-Temperature booster heater capable of a 70-degree Fahrenheit rise, ensuring a 180-degree Fahrenheit final rinse for proper sanitation.<br>\n\nProvides quick and reliable cleaning with built-in detergent and rinse chemical pumps, and a pair of rotating arms that rinse contents with fresh water.<br>\n\nEnsures effortless draining with an integrated gravity drain system, preventing the accumulation of chemicals and water within the chamber.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/181GW_a9b40ba9-61cc-4c69-adec-3a932ed7940b.webp\"]', '181 GW', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 23, 0, 0, 6986, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:41:49', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/181GW_a9b40ba9-61cc-4c69-adec-3a932ed7940b.webp', 'physical', '', 5530.43, 4, 0, 19, 0, 'one year parts & labor limited warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB308\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2001, 'CMA Dishmachine 180 UC High Temperature Undercounter Dishwasher with Dispenser, 1 Phase, 220V, 60Hz, 1HP', '\n<p>The CMA Dishmachines 180UC is a high-temperature undercounter dishwasher designed for efficient and reliable cleaning in commercial kitchens. Constructed with durable materials, it features a robust 1 hp wash pump and a patented automatic soil purging system that filters dishwater during the wash cycle. This unit uses only 0.75 gallons of water per cycle, making it both economical and environmentally friendly. The dual chemical dispenser system ensures precise dispensing of detergent and rinse-aid, enhancing the cleaning process.</p>\n<p>Measuring 28 inches in width, 28 inches in depth, and 42 inches in height, this undercounter dishwasher accommodates items up to 14 1/2 inches high. The upper and lower rotating wash and rinse arms ensure comprehensive cleaning, while the built-in 5.3 kW booster heater maintains a consistent supply of 180-degree Fahrenheit water for effective sanitation. The dishwasher\'s water pressure regulator valve, easy-to-operate controls, and digital LED temperature gauges further enhance its user-friendly design.</p>\n<p>Requiring a 208/240V electrical connection, the CMA 180UC is equipped to handle the rigorous demands of busy commercial kitchens. Its high-temperature performance, efficient water usage, and reliable cleaning capabilities make it an ideal choice for hotels, restaurants, and cafes that require dependable dishwashing solutions.</p>', '\n\nFeatures a 2-minute wash cycle, allowing up to 30 racks to be cleaned per hour, ideal for high-demand settings in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.<br>\n\nOffers a built-in dual chemical dispenser system that ensures consistent use of detergent and rinse-aid for effective cleaning.<br>\n\nIncludes an energy-efficient design using only 0.75 gallons of water per cycle, reducing operational costs and environmental impact.<br>\n\nProvides upper and lower rotating wash and rinse arms for thorough cleaning, ensuring all dishware and glassware are sparkling clean.<br>\n\nEnsures proper sanitation with a built-in 5.3 kW booster heater that maintains a continuous supply of 180-degree Fahrenheit water during the rinse cycle.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/180UC.webp\"]', '180 UC', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 23, 0, 0, 7273, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 33.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 228.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:41:50', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/180UC.webp', 'physical', '', 5757.95, 4, 0, 19, 0, 'one year parts & labor limited warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB309\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2002, 'CMA Dishmachine H-1X High Temperature Undercounter Fill and Dump Dishwasher with Dispenser, 1 Phase, 220V, 60Hz, 1HP', '\n<p>The CMA Dishmachine H-1X is a high-temperature undercounter dishwasher designed for efficient cleaning in commercial kitchens. Constructed from durable all-stainless steel, this model features a unique fill and dump cycle that drains the wash water after each cycle and refills with high-temperature water for a thorough sanitizing rinse. It accommodates items up to 14 1/4 inches high and can clean up to 24 standard 20\" x 20\" racks or 96 covers per hour.</p>\n<p>With a fully automatic rinse and fill cycle, the H-1X simplifies dishwashing operations, while its built-in chemical pumps ensure consistent chemical usage. The unit operates on a 208V electrical connection and includes a 5 kW booster heater for maintaining high temperatures. The pumped drain allows for flexible installation, and the removable spray arms facilitate easy cleaning.</p>\n<p>Measuring 23 7/8 inches in width, 25 inches in depth, and 33 1/2 to 34 1/2 inches in height, the H-1X fits well in commercial kitchen spaces. The dishwasher’s high-temperature performance and user-friendly features make it ideal for hotels, restaurants, and cafes that require reliable and efficient dishwashing capabilities.</p>', '\n\nFeatures a fill and dump cycle that ensures high-temperature sanitizing after each wash, providing thorough cleaning for glassware and dishware.<br>\n\nOffers an easy-to-use fully automatic rinse cycle and fill, simplifying operations in busy kitchens.<br>\n\nIncludes built-in chemical pumps for consistent chemical usage, eliminating the guesswork and ensuring optimal sanitation.<br>\n\nProvides durable all-stainless steel construction and removable spray arms for easy maintenance and long-term reliability.<br>\n\nAllows flexible installation with a pumped drain system, eliminating the need for a floor drain and making it suitable for various kitchen layouts.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/H-1X_b6b55beb-8a89-492a-9580-dade26ff0d98.webp\"]', 'H-1X', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 23, 0, 0, 5083, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 165.00, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:41:51', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/H-1X_b6b55beb-8a89-492a-9580-dade26ff0d98.webp', 'physical', '', 4023.73, 4, 0, 19, 0, 'one year parts & labor limited warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB310\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2003, 'CMA Dishmachine L-1X16 Low Temperature Undercounter Dishwasher with Heater, 1 Phase, 115V, 60Hz, 1 HP', '\n<p>The CMA Dishmachine L-1X16 is a robust undercounter dishwasher designed for low-temperature operation. Constructed from high-quality 304-gauge stainless steel, this unit efficiently cleans up to 30 racks per hour with a 120-second wash cycle. It uses only 1.7 gallons of water per cycle, and the sustaining heater maintains the water temperature between loads, making it an energy-efficient choice for busy foodservice operations.</p>\n<p>With a dish height clearance of 16 inches, the L-1X16 accommodates a variety of dishware sizes. The dishwasher is equipped with upper and lower stainless steel wash arms that feature reinforced end caps for thorough cleaning. It also includes built-in chemical pumps and a deliming system to ensure proper chemical dosing and prevent scale accumulation.</p>\n<p>Measuring 24 1/4 inches in width, 23 1/2 inches in depth, and 34 1/4 inches in height, the L-1X16 fits comfortably in standard kitchen spaces. It operates on a 115V electrical connection and is suitable for commercial kitchens in hotels, restaurants, and cafes, providing reliable and efficient dishwashing performance.</p>', '\n\nFeatures a 120-second wash cycle, handling up to 30 racks per hour, which efficiently meets the high demands of restaurants and cafes.<br>\n\nOffers low-temperature sanitization using chemicals, reducing energy costs by eliminating the need for a booster heater.<br>\n\nIncludes built-in chemical pumps and a deliming system to ensure optimal chemical usage and prevent mineral build-up.<br>\n\nProvides a sustaining heater that maintains water temperature between cycles, ensuring consistent performance.<br>\n\nMade with durable 304-gauge stainless steel construction for long-lasting use and easy maintenance.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/L-1X16_a35cb0de-735a-4689-a484-ef0c296e2b9b.webp\"]', 'L-1X16', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 23, 0, 0, 5282, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 181.00, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:41:52', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/L-1X16_a35cb0de-735a-4689-a484-ef0c296e2b9b.webp', 'physical', '', 4181.9, 4, 0, 19, 0, 'one year parts & labor limited warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB311\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2004, 'CMA Dishmachine L-1X Low Temperature Undercounter Dishwasher with Heater, 1 Phase, 115V, 60Hz, 1HP', '\n<p>The CMA Dishmachine L-1X Undercounter Dishwasher operates efficiently at low temperatures and is designed for high performance in busy foodservice environments. This model uses a 115V electrical connection and features a total cycle time of 120 seconds, including wash, rinse, and purge stages. It can clean up to 30 racks per hour while using only 1.7 gallons of water per cycle, making it an economical choice for restaurants, cafes, and hotels.</p>\n<p>Constructed from durable stainless steel, the L-1X includes both upper and lower wash arms with reinforced end caps, ensuring thorough cleaning. The unit utilizes a sustainer heater to maintain tank temperature between cycles and comes equipped with built-in chemical pumps and a deliming system to manage chemical levels and prevent build-up. A pump purging system also helps eliminate carryover of soil and chemicals during rinsing.</p>\n<p>Measuring 24 inches in width, 23.5 inches in depth, and with a height of 31 inches, this undercounter dishwasher fits conveniently in tight spaces. It features an adjustable stainless steel leg design for easy installation, a water inlet strainer to prevent clogging, and a door safety switch for added safety. With a warranty covering parts and labor for one year, the L-1X provides reliable and effective dishwashing solutions for a variety of commercial kitchen settings.</p>', '\n\nFeatures a rapid 120-second cycle, washing up to 30 racks per hour, ideal for busy environments like restaurants and hotels.<br>\n\nOffers low-temperature sanitization using chemicals, which reduces energy costs by eliminating the need for a booster heater.<br>\n\nIncludes built-in chemical pumps and a deliming system to ensure proper chemical usage and prevent limescale build-up.<br>\n\nProvides a pump purging system that removes soil and chemical residue between cycles, enhancing cleanliness and efficiency.<br>\n\nIncorporates a durable stainless steel construction with adjustable legs and easy-access drawer for convenient maintenance.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/L-1XLow.webp\"]', 'L-1X', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 23, 0, 0, 5173, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 178.00, NULL, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:41:54', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/L-1XLow.webp', 'physical', '', 4094.98, 4, 0, 19, 0, 'one year parts & labor limited warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB312\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '');
