(2005, 'CMA Dishmachine L-1Xe Low Temperature Energy Efficient Undercounter Dishwasher with Heater, 1 Phase, 115V, 60Hz, 1 HP', '\n<p>The CMA Dishmachine L-1Xe Undercounter Low Temperature Dishwasher is a highly efficient model designed to accommodate dishware and glassware up to 12 1/4 inches in height. Operating on a 115V electrical connection, it can clean up to 40 standard 20\" x 20\" racks per hour, making it ideal for busy dining establishments. This dishwasher uses just 1.19 gallons of water per cycle, enhancing its cost-effectiveness and environmental performance.</p>\n<p>Constructed from durable stainless steel, the L-1Xe features an advanced spray arm system with both upper and lower wash arms to ensure thorough cleaning. The unit includes a built-in strainer to prevent water valve clogging, as well as a prime switch, instant start, and safety switch in the door. The integrated pump purging system minimizes chemical and soil carryover, maintaining clean wash water and reducing maintenance needs.</p>\n<p>Measuring 24 inches in width, 23 1/2 inches in depth, and with an adjustable height from 33 1/8 to 34 1/8 inches, this model is designed for efficient undercounter use. It provides easy maintenance through its sliding drawer design and requires a minimum water inlet temperature of 120 degrees Fahrenheit. With its combination of functionality and energy efficiency, the L-1Xe is a practical choice for hotels, restaurants, and cafes.</p>', '\n\nFeatures the capability to clean up to 40 standard 20\" x 20\" dish racks per hour, making it suitable for high-volume restaurants and hotels.<br>\n\nOffers an energy-efficient design that uses only 1.19 gallons of water per cycle, providing significant cost savings and eco-friendliness.<br>\n\nIncludes a built-in chemical pump and deliming system to ensure proper chemical usage and reduce maintenance efforts.<br>\n\nProvides a flexible installation with a pumped drain system, eliminating the need for a floor drain and allowing for more versatile placement.<br>\n\nIncorporates a sliding drawer design for easy access to internal components, simplifying maintenance and repairs.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/L-1Xe_b4a9f7d7-af59-4d24-841d-6066b50255f9.webp\"]', 'L-1Xe', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 23, 0, 0, 6065, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 33.00, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 190.00, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:41:55', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/L-1Xe_b4a9f7d7-af59-4d24-841d-6066b50255f9.webp', 'physical', '', 4801.3, 4, 0, 19, 0, 'one year parts & labor limited warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB313\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2006, 'CMA Dishmachine GL-C Low Temperature Chemical Sanitizing Undercounter Glasswasher with ScrapTrap, 1 Phase, 220V, 60Hz', '\n<p>The CMA Dishmachine GL-C Low Temperature Glass Washer operates on a 208-230V electrical connection and is designed for high efficiency in sanitizing glassware. It is capable of handling up to 1,000 glasses per hour, thanks to its independent upper and lower wash and rinse arms that deliver a consistent, superior clean.</p>\n<p>This model features a 3kW electric tank heater that maintains the wash water temperature at 140 degrees Fahrenheit and offers adjustable rinse temperature settings for versatile sanitizing options. Constructed from 100% stainless steel, the GL-C has a double-walled design to ensure quiet operation and durability.</p>\n<p>The unit measures 25 1/4 inches in width, 25 1/8 inches in depth, and has an adjustable height ranging from 39 to 40 1/2 inches. It also includes an integrated ScrapTrap to handle debris and keep the wash water clean. This model is ideal for both front-of-house and back-of-house use, providing reliable performance and ease of maintenance.</p>', '\n\nFeatures the ability to sanitize up to 1,000 glasses per hour, making it perfect for busy bars and restaurants.<br>\n\nOffers compatibility with both iodine and chlorine sanitizers, providing flexibility for different sanitizing preferences.<br>\n\nIncludes a built-in 3kW electric tank heater that keeps water at a consistent 140°F, ensuring thorough cleaning and sanitizing.<br>\n\nProvides a quiet operation with its double-walled stainless steel construction, suitable for use in various settings.<br>\n\nComes with an integrated ScrapTrap that helps manage debris, keeping the wash water clean and reducing maintenance needs.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/GL-C_Low_1dddf6e5-4456-4005-9861-d2ba1b24fec4.webp\"]', 'GL-C', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 23, 0, 0, 7609, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 25.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 25.00, NU