(2007, 'CMA Dishmachine GW-100 Low Temperature Chemical Sanitizing Undercounter Glasswasher with ScrapTrap, 1 Phase, 115V, 60 Hz', '\n<p>The CMA Dishmachine GW-100 Low Temperature Chemical Sanitizing Undercounter Glass Washer operates on a 115V power supply and is engineered for high efficiency with a capacity to clean up to 1,000 glasses per hour. It features independent upper and lower wash and rinse arms that ensure thorough cleaning and sanitizing of glassware.</p>\n<p>This model includes a built-in 1.5 kW electric tank heater that keeps the recirculated wash water at a consistent 140 degrees Fahrenheit, and it offers adjustable rinse temperature settings for various sanitizing needs. Constructed from 100% stainless steel, the GW-100 Offers a double-walled design that minimizes operational noise, making it suitable for both visible and kitchen areas.</p>\n<p>With overall dimensions of 25 1/4 inches in width, 25 1/8 inches in depth, and a height adjustable between 39 and 40 1/2 inches, the GW-100 fits well in standard undercounter spaces. It operates on a 120V electrical connection and features a 1/2 inch water inlet size. The unit\'s design includes an integrated ScrapTrap to handle debris effectively, promoting cleaner wash water and reducing maintenance.</p>', '\n\nFeatures the ability to clean up to 1,000 glasses per hour, making it ideal for high-volume establishments like bars and restaurants.<br>\n\nOffers compatibility with both iodine and chlorine sanitizers, allowing for flexibility in sanitizing options.<br>\n\nIncludes a built-in electric tank heater that maintains water at the recommended 140°F, ensuring effective cleaning and sanitizing.<br>\n\nProvides a quiet operation with its double-walled stainless steel construction, suitable for use in both front-of-house and back-of-house environments.<br>\n\nComes with an integrated ScrapTrap that helps manage debris and maintain clean wash water, reducing maintenance needs.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/GW-100_Low_36efd3c1-86dc-40fb-81d0-b7d96d883b9f.webp\"]', 'GW-100', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 23, 0, 0, 7609, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 25.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 188.00, NULL, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:41:57', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/GW-100_Low_36efd3c1-86dc-40fb-81d0-b7d96d883b9f.webp', 'physical', '', 6023.48, 4, 0, 19, 0, 'one year parts & labor limited warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB315\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2008, 'CMA Dishmachine GL-X Low Temperature Undercounter Glasswasher, 1 Phase, 115V, 60Hz, 1 HP', '\n<p>The CMA Dishmachine GL-X Low Temperature Undercounter Glass Washer operates on a 115V/60Hz/1 Phase power supply and is constructed from 304-gauge stainless steel for durability. This unit efficiently cleans up to 30 racks per hour, with a wash cycle time of two minutes. It features upper and lower stainless steel wash arms with reinforced end caps, providing thorough cleaning of various types of glassware.</p>\n<p>The CMA-GL-X uses 1.7 gallons of water per cycle and operates with a recommended water temperature range of 120 to 130°F. It includes built-in chemical pumps with primer switches for consistent chemical application and a delimer switch to manage mineral build-up and maintain the unit’s performance. The glass washer offers an 11 1/4-inch dish height clearance and is designed for low temperature operation, making it suitable for efficient and economical glass cleaning in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.</p>\n<p>With overall dimensions of 24 inches in width, 24 3/4 inches in depth, and 39 inches in height, the CMA-GL-X fits comfortably in various kitchen spaces. The unit requires a 115V electrical connection and features a water inlet size of 1/2 inch. Its low temperature and efficient design make it a practical choice for maintaining clean and sanitary glassware while reducing water and energy consumption.</p>', '\n\nFeatures an efficient wash cycle of two minutes, allowing up to 30 racks per hour, making it ideal for busy bars and restaurants.<br>\n\nOffers an 11 1/4-inch dish height clearance, accommodating a variety of glassware sizes and ensuring thorough cleaning.<br>\n\nIncludes built-in chemical pumps with primer switches, ensuring consistent chemical dosing and easy maintenance.<br>\n\nProvides a delimer switch that helps manage mineral build-up, keeping the machine in top working condition.<br>\n\nIncorporates a low temperature operation that uses only 1.7 gallons of water per cycle, promoting water and energy savings in commercial kitchens.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/GL-X_Low_455a0cbc-66ae-44fe-8c45-a424bd0ee92b.webp\"]', 'GL-X', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 23, 0, 0, 6308, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 202.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:41:58', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/GL-X_Low_455a0cbc-66ae-44fe-8c45-a424bd0ee92b.webp', 'physical', '', 4994.15, 4, 0, 19, 0, 'one year parts & labor limited warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB316\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2009, 'CMA Dishmachine L-1C Low Temperature Undercounter Glasswasher with 11\" Door Opening, No Heater, 1 Phase, 115V, 60Hz, 1HP', '\n<p>The CMA Dishmachine L-1C Low Temperature Undercounter Glasswasher operates on a 115V/60Hz/1 Phase power supply and is designed to efficiently clean glassware in commercial environments. This model features an 11-inch door opening and can handle up to 30 racks per hour while using just 1.7 gallons of water per rack. The unit is equipped with a sophisticated noise suppression system, including double-wall stainless steel construction and sound-deadening materials, which reduces noise by 50% for a quieter work environment.</p>\n<p>This glasswasher includes upper and lower stainless steel wash arms with reinforced end caps for effective cleaning. It is also fitted with programmable chemical pumps that ensure the correct amount of chemicals are used throughout the washing process. The built-in deliming system helps remove mineral deposits and maintains the machine\'s performance over time. The pumped drain system enhances installation flexibility by eliminating the need for a floor drain and helps improve wash results by preventing soil and chemical carryover during the rinse cycle.</p>\n<p>The CMA L-1C is constructed entirely of stainless steel and features 4-inch legs, one peg rack, and one all-purpose open rack. With dimensions of 24 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 34 to 35 inches in height, it fits comfortably in various kitchen spaces. This unit requires a 115V electrical connection and operates within a water temperature range of 120 to 140°F, making it a practical choice for maintaining clean and sanitary glassware in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.</p>', '\n\nFeatures noise suppression technology that minimizes operating noise by 50%, creating a quieter environment ideal for bars and restaurant settings.<br>\n\nOffers an 11-inch door opening, making it versatile enough to handle various types of glassware and simplifying the loading and unloading process.<br>\n\nIncludes stainless steel wash arms with reinforced end caps, ensuring thorough cleaning of glasses and efficient performance.<br>\n\nProvides built-in chemical pumps and a deliming system, which manage chemical use and prevent mineral build-up for consistent operation and easy maintenance.<br>\n\nIncorporates a pumped drain system that eliminates the need for a floor drain, offering flexibility in installation for different kitchen layouts.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/L-1C_Low_9d1ec7ed-93e6-4a2f-af53-2a1a3cf2c09d.webp\"]', 'L-1C', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 23, 0, 0, 5878, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 35.00, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 210.00, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:41:59', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/L-1C_Low_9d1ec7ed-93e6-4a2f-af53-2a1a3cf2c09d.webp', 'physical', '', 4653.58, 4, 0, 19, 0, 'one year parts & labor limited warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB317\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2010, 'CMA Dishmachine 180-VL Tall Single Rack High Temperature Ventless 3-Door Dishwasher with Booster, 3 Phase, 220V, 60Hz, 1HP', '\n<p>The CMA Dishmachine 180-VL Single Rack High Temperature Ventless Dishwasher, powered by 220V/60Hz/3 Phase, is engineered for high-efficiency performance in commercial kitchens. This dishwasher is designed with a ventless heat recovery system that utilizes heat from the wash and rinse tanks to preheat the incoming final rinse water, thereby reducing energy consumption and eliminating the need for an additional hood system.</p>\n<p>With an 8-gallon wash tank and a 1 HP wash pump motor, this unit is capable of handling up to 40 racks per hour while consuming just 0.89 gallons of water per cycle. The built-in 12kW booster heater ensures that the final rinse reaches optimal temperatures for effective sanitization. The machine features dimensions of 25 1/2 inches in width, 29 inches in depth, and 86 5/16 inches in height, with an interior chamber clearance of 17 1/2 inches, providing ample space for various types of dishware.</p>\n<p>Constructed entirely from stainless steel, the CMA-180-VL is built for durability and easy maintenance. It includes an automatic soil purging system with a removable external tray to keep wash water clean, and the fully automatic cycle, coupled with an integrated heat exchange condenser, simplifies operation and enhances efficiency. Designed for a 208/240V, 3-phase electrical connection, this model is well-suited for high-volume dishwashing needs in restaurants, hotels, and other food service environments.</p>', '\n\nFeatures a ventless design with a heat recovery system, providing energy savings and eliminating the need for a separate hood system, which is ideal for saving on operating costs.<br>\n\nOffers high-temperature cleaning with a built-in 12kW booster heater, ensuring effective sanitization of up to 40 racks per hour with minimal water usage.<br>\n\nIncludes an automatic soil purging system with a removable external tray, which keeps the wash water clean and reduces the need for frequent maintenance.<br>\n\nProvides a versatile design that allows for rack loading from the front or sides, making it suitable for both straight and corner installations in various kitchen layouts.<br>\n\nIncorporates all-stainless steel construction and a fully automatic cycle with an integrated heat exchange condenser, ensuring durability and ease of use in busy environments.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/180-VL_Tall_Single_Rack_ee3416c1-4dfc-4356-a7a7-7a3dcf0f843c.webp\"]', '180-VL Tall', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 23, 0, 0, 17778, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:42:00', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/180-VL_Tall_Single_Rack_ee3416c1-4dfc-4356-a7a7-7a3dcf0f843c.webp', 'physical', '', 14074.25, 4, 0, 19, 0, 'one year parts & labor limited warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB318\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2011, 'CMA Dishmachine 180-VL Single Rack High Temperature Ventless 3-Door Dishwasher with Booster, 3 Phase, 220V, 60Hz, 1HP', '\n<p>The CMA Dishmachine 180-VL Single Rack High Temperature Ventless Dishwasher is a sophisticated solution for commercial kitchens, offering high efficiency and energy savings. Manufactured by CMA, this unit operates on a 208/240V, 3-phase electrical connection, and is designed with a ventless system that utilizes natural heat from the wash and rinse tanks to preheat incoming final rinse water, reducing energy consumption and eliminating the need for a separate hood system.</p>\n<p>This dishwasher features an 8-gallon wash tank and a 1 HP wash pump motor, supported by a 6 kW wash tank heater and a 12kW booster heater, which provides precise high-temperature cleaning. The unit\'s dimensions are 25 1/2 inches in width, 29 inches in depth, and 86 5/16 inches in height, with an interior chamber clearance of 17 1/2 inches. It handles up to 40 racks per hour with only 0.89 gallons of water used per cycle, enhancing efficiency and reducing water consumption.</p>\n<p>Constructed entirely from stainless steel, the CMA-180-VL is built for durability and longevity. The dishwasher includes an automatic soil purging system that captures plate debris in a removable external tray, ensuring clean wash water. Its fully automatic cycle and integrated heat exchange condenser facilitate ease of use and maintenance. With a wash cycle time of 90 seconds and a water temperature range of 155-195°F, this machine is well-suited for high-volume dishwashing needs in various food service environments.</p>', '\n\nFeatures a ventless design with a heat recovery system, reducing energy costs and eliminating the need for a separate hood system, making it ideal for efficient kitchen environments.<br>\n\nOffers a high-temperature cleaning with a built-in 12kW booster heater, ensuring thorough sanitization and effective cleaning of up to 40 racks per hour.<br>\n\nIncludes an automatic soil purging system with a removable external tray, keeping the wash water clean and reducing maintenance efforts.<br>\n\nProvides a flexible design that allows for rack loading from the front or sides, suitable for both straight and corner applications in various kitchen setups.<br>\n\nIncorporates an all-stainless steel construction and fully automatic cycle with an integrated heat exchange condenser, ensuring durability and ease of use.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/180-VL_Single_Rack_230bae6d-a9b5-4f8c-8f2f-2ee175796325.webp\"]', '180-VL Single', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 23, 0, 0, 13909, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 26.00, NULL, 86.00, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 428.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:42:01', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/180-VL_Single_Rack_230bae6d-a9b5-4f8c-8f2f-2ee175796325.webp', 'physical', '', 11010.98, 4, 0, 19, 0, 'one year parts & labor limited warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB319\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2012, 'CMA Dishmachine C Single Rack Upright Low Temperature Chemical Sanitizing Corner Dishwasher, 1 Phase, 115V, 60Hz, 1HP', '\n<p>The CMA Dishmachine C Single Rack Low Temperature, Chemical Sanitizing Corner Dishwasher operates on a 115V, 60Hz, 1-phase electrical system. It features a corner design, allowing it to fit into tight spaces while efficiently handling up to 40 racks per hour. The dishwasher has a 90-second wash cycle, making it suitable for high-volume use in commercial kitchens. The unit utilizes only 1.7 gallons of water per cycle, enhancing water efficiency and reducing operating costs.</p>\n<p>This dishwasher is built with a robust automatic soil purging system that helps to maintain clean wash water by eliminating soil and chemical carryover. The spray arm system includes upper and lower stainless steel arms with reinforced end caps, and the wash arms can be easily removed for cleaning thanks to their pull-pin design. The top-mounted control box features chemical pumps and a deliming system to ensure proper chemical usage and ease of operation.</p>\n<p>With dimensions of 25 3/4 inches in width, 25 3/4 inches in depth, and a height range of 56 to 57 inches, the CMA Dishmachine C fits standard kitchen spaces. It requires a minimum water inlet temperature of 120 degrees Fahrenheit, with 140 degrees Fahrenheit recommended. The unit also features a 1 HP motor, 16 amps, and operates with a hardwired plug. Made in America and NSF listed, this dishwasher is designed for durability and reliable performance in commercial settings.</p>', '\n\nCleans up to 40 racks per hour, ensuring high efficiency for busy kitchens in hotels and restaurants.<br>\n\nUses only 1.7 gallons of water per cycle, helping to conserve water and reduce utility expenses in cafes and dining areas.<br>\n\nEquipped with an automatic soil purging system to maintain clean water and consistent results, ideal for high-volume use.<br>\n\nConstructed with durable stainless steel, offering long-lasting performance and reliability in commercial environments.<br>\n\nIncludes a top-mounted control box with chemical pumps for easy management and proper chemical use, simplifying operation for staff.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/C_28e2c4ef-890e-4dd4-ba66-f77f9150cd96.webp\"]', 'C', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 23, 0, 0, 5447, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 26.00, NULL, 57.00, NULL, 26.00, NULL, 269.00, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:42:02', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/C_28e2c4ef-890e-4dd4-ba66-f77f9150cd96.webp', 'physical', '', 4312.05, 4, 0, 19, 0, 'one year parts & labor limited warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB320\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2013, 'CMA Dishmachine B Double Rack Upright Low Temperature Chemical Sanitizing Dishwasher, 1 Phase, 115V, 60Hz', '\n<p>The CMA Dishmachine B Double Rack Low Temperature, Chemical Sanitizing Straight Dishwasher operates with a 115V, 60Hz, 1-phase electrical connection. It is designed with a double rack, straight-through configuration, and features a robust spray arm system with upper and lower stainless steel wash arms equipped with reinforced end caps. The dishwasher achieves a high throughput, cleaning up to 80 racks per hour and 320 covers per hour, utilizing just .97 gallons of water per rack. The machine\'s maximum dish clearance is 20-1/2 inches, accommodating various sizes of dishware.</p>\n<p>The unit includes several user-friendly features such as chemical pumps, a deliming switch, and top-mounted controls for ease of access and operation. An automatic start/stop function ensures safe and straightforward use. The pump purging system enhances cleaning efficiency by preventing soil and chemical carryover, while the built-in Poly Pro scrap accumulator and stainless steel scrap tray help prevent debris from clogging the drain.</p>\n<p>Dimensions of the dishwasher are 44-1/4 inches in width, 25-1/4 inches in depth, and it stands between 59-1/2 to 60-1/2 inches in height. It requires a water inlet size of 3/4 inches and has a drain size of 2 inches. For optimal performance, the machine operates with water temperatures between 120 degrees Fahrenheit (49 degrees Celsius) and 140 degrees Fahrenheit (60 degrees Celsius). This dishwasher is well-suited for high-traffic environments, ensuring reliable and efficient dishwashing in commercial settings.</p>', '\n\nProvides a 20-1/2\" clearance for dishes, accommodating larger items easily in hotels and restaurants.<br>\n\nUses only .97 gallons of water per rack, helping cafes save on water and utility costs.<br>\n\nBuilt with all stainless steel for durability, ensuring long-lasting performance in busy commercial kitchens.<br>\n\nIncludes top-mounted controls with chemical pumps and an auto start/stop feature, making operation simple and reliable.<br>\n\nEquipped with a Poly Pro scrap accumulator and pump purging system to keep the wash water clean, enhancing cleanliness for every cycle.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/B_cd55b715-7aec-4d90-a64e-9b6d02768062.webp\"]', 'B', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 23, 0, 0, 6839, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 44.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 358.00, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:42:03', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/B_cd55b715-7aec-4d90-a64e-9b6d02768062.webp', 'physical', '', 5414.05, 4, 0, 19, 0, 'one year parts & labor limited warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB321\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2014, 'CMA Dishmachine AH Single Rack Upright Low Temperature Chemical Sanitizing Dishwasher, 1 Phase, 115V, 60Hz, 1HP', '\n\n<p>The CMA Dishmachine AH Single Rack Low Temperature, Chemical Sanitizing Straight Dishwasher is manufactured by CMA. It features a stainless steel construction, ensuring durability and longevity. The unit measures 25 3/4 inches in both depth and width, and stands at a height ranging from 56 to 57 inches. The dishwasher is equipped with a top-mounted control box that includes chemical pumps and a deliming system, ensuring accurate chemical usage and easy maintenance. The evaporator type is robust, designed to handle commercial kitchen demands.</p>\n<p>This dishwasher has a single rack capacity and can clean up to 40 standard dish racks per hour with a 90-second wash cycle. It operates on 115 volts, 60 hertz, and 1 phase, with a power cord length sufficient for standard kitchen setups. The unit\'s pump purging system efficiently eliminates soil and chemical carryover during the rinse cycle, and the built-in Poly Pro scrap accumulator traps plate debris, keeping the wash water clean. The machine\'s interior material is stainless steel, designed for ease of cleaning and to prevent corrosion.</p>\n<p>The CMA Dishmachine AH comes with one cycle and uses 1.7 gallons of water per rack. It features upper and lower stainless steel wash arms with reinforced end caps for effective cleaning. The compressor is conveniently located for easy access and maintenance. The dishwasher\'s door type is a standard single door, and it includes a hardwire plug type for secure installation. The warranty ensures reliable performance, and the unit meets NSF, UL, and CSA sanitation and construction standards. The refrigerant used is environmentally friendly, complying with industry standards.</p>', '\n\nOffers automatic washing, rinsing, and sanitizing, saving time for hotel, restaurant, and cafe staff.<br>\n\nFeatures a single rack, straight-through design that is simple and efficient for daily use.<br>\n\nIncludes a pump purging system to ensure clean wash water, improving cleaning results.<br>\n\nConstructed entirely of stainless steel, ensuring long-term durability in busy kitchens.<br>\n\nProduces 40 racks per hour, making it ideal for high-demand environments like hotels and restaurants.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/AH_e3bb038f-88df-43ae-b35f-be5dd5983c46.webp\"]', 'AH', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 23, 0, 0, 5447, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 26.00, NULL, 57.00, NULL, 26.00, NULL, 261.00, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:42:05', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/AH_e3bb038f-88df-43ae-b35f-be5dd5983c46.webp', 'physical', '', 4312.05, 4, 0, 19, 0, 'one year parts & labor limited warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB322\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2015, 'Atosa MGF24RGR 72.69\" Undercounter Refrigerator 21.1 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MGF24RGR is a compact 23.82\" Undercounter Refrigerator designed to provide convenient refrigeration storage in commercial kitchens with limited space. With a capacity of 4.8 cubic feet, this unit fits neatly under countertops, making it ideal for establishments where space is at a premium, such as small cafes, bars, or food trucks. It features a stainless steel exterior, which not only enhances durability but also facilitates easy cleaning and maintenance, crucial for maintaining sanitary conditions in busy kitchen environments. The refrigerator is equipped with a single solid door that provides access to the interior storage space, which is designed to keep food items at optimal temperatures.</p>\n<p>Internally, the Atosa MGF24RGR includes adjustable shelves, allowing for customizable storage configurations to accommodate various sizes of food containers and ingredients. This flexibility in shelving arrangement helps optimize storage efficiency, ensuring easy organization and access to stored items. The unit is designed to operate efficiently while maintaining consistent temperatures, helping to preserve the freshness and quality of perishable goods. Overall, the Atosa MGF24RGR combines compact size, durable construction, and functional design to meet the refrigeration needs of smaller commercial kitchen setups.</p>', '\n\nDesigned to fit under countertops with dimensions of 23.82\" width, optimizing space in small commercial kitchens.<br>\n\nStainless steel exterior ensures durability, easy cleaning, and resistance to corrosion.<br>\n\nProvides access to 4.8 cubic feet of interior storage space for efficient organization of food items.<br>\n\nIncludes adjustable shelves to accommodate various sizes of food containers and optimize storage capacity.<br>\n\nMaintains consistent temperatures to preserve the freshness and quality of perishable goods effectively.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MGF24RGR_94ccf4a0-8fd8-4486-b16e-702c7fff283c.webp\"]', 'MGF24RGR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1501, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 33.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 128.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:42:07', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MGF24RGR_94ccf4a0-8fd8-4486-b16e-702c7fff283c.webp', 'physical', '', 991, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB323\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2016, 'Atosa MSF3610GR 36.32\" Refrigerated Standard Top Sandwich Prep Table 8.7 Cu. Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MSF3610GR is a 36.32\" Refrigerated Standard Top Sandwich Prep Table designed to streamline food preparation processes in commercial kitchens. This prep table features a spacious top that accommodates various ingredients in gastronome pans, making it ideal for assembling sandwiches, salads, wraps, and other menu items. The refrigerated top section keeps ingredients fresh and at safe temperatures, ensuring food quality and minimizing waste during busy service hours. With a capacity of 8.7 cubic feet, it provides ample storage space without occupying excessive floor space, suitable for smaller to medium-sized food establishments.</p>\n<p>Constructed from stainless steel, the Atosa MSF3610GR ensures durability and easy cleaning, essential for maintaining hygiene standards in professional kitchens. The unit is equipped with a refrigeration system that maintains consistent temperatures, allowing chefs and kitchen staff to work efficiently without compromising on food safety. Its ergonomic design includes features like easy-grip handles and adjustable shelves, enhancing convenience and flexibility in food preparation workflows. Overall, the Atosa MSF3610GR combines functionality, durability, and efficient cooling capabilities to support the demanding needs of commercial food service operations.</p>', '\n\nKeeps ingredients at optimal temperatures for food preparation.<br>\n\nAccommodates gastronome pans for organizing and assembling sandwiches, salads, and other dishes.<br>\n\nOffers ample storage space for ingredients and prepared foods.<br>\n\nProvides durability, easy cleaning, and resistance to corrosion in a commercial kitchen environment.<br>\n\nEnsures consistent cooling performance to maintain food freshness and safety throughout operations.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MSF3610GR_040d9ec0-694d-4722-82e8-e6f5fce46d89.webp\"]', 'MSF3610GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2370, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36.00, NULL, 44.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 227.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:42:08', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MSF3610GR_040d9ec0-694d-4722-82e8-e6f5fce46d89.webp', 'physical', '', 1504.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB324\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2017, 'Atosa  HD350-AP-161 23\" Hotel Ice Dispenser Head 350 LB / 24 HR with Storage Bin 160 Lbs', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa HD350-AP-161 is a 23\" Hotel Ice Dispenser designed to meet the ice demands of hospitality environments and other commercial settings. With a capacity to produce up to 350 pounds of ice per day, this dispenser ensures a steady supply of ice for hotels, restaurants, and bars. Its compact size and efficient design make it suitable for locations where space is limited but a reliable ice supply is essential. The dispenser features a durable stainless steel exterior that not only enhances its durability but also facilitates easy cleaning and maintenance, crucial for maintaining sanitary standards in busy environments.</p>\n<p>Equipped with user-friendly controls and a robust ice dispensing mechanism, the Atosa HD350-AP-161 offers ease of operation for staff and guests alike. It provides quick access to ice, enhancing efficiency during peak hours of service. The dispenser is designed to integrate seamlessly into various hospitality settings, offering convenience and reliability in delivering ice for drinks and other uses. Overall, the Atosa HD350-AP-161 combines practicality with performance to support the demanding needs of commercial ice dispensing applications.</p>', '\n\nProduces up to 350 lbs of ice per 24 hours, ensuring a steady supply of ice to keep up with demand in hotels, restaurants, and other busy locations.<br>\n\nWith a 160 lb capacity, the bin can store enough ice to meet peak demands without needing frequent refills.<br>\n\nThe exterior is made of stainless steel with black trim, making it resistant to corrosion and easy to clean, ideal for withstanding the wear and tear of constant use in a commercial setting.<br>\n\nFeatures a simple single push chute for effortless ice dispensing, minimizing wait times and frustration for users.<br>\n\nNo additional plumbing is required for installation, streamlining the set up process and offering more flexibility in placement.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/HD350-AP-161_daa8098e-095c-456e-9db0-e0af5407a5de.webp\"]', 'HD350-AP-161', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 4207, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 23.00, NULL, 71.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 341.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:42:09', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/HD350-AP-161_daa8098e-095c-456e-9db0-e0af5407a5de.webp', 'physical', '', 2915, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB325\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2018, 'Atosa CTCO-100 26\" x 17\" 7/10  Countertop Convection Oven Full Size 208V 5450W', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa CTCO-100 Countertop Convection Oven is designed to meet the baking and cooking needs of commercial kitchens with its full-size capacity and efficient operation. With dimensions of 26\" x 17\", it offers ample cooking space while remaining compact enough for countertop placement, making it suitable for restaurants, bakeries, and cafes. Powered by 208V and 5450W, this oven delivers robust heating capabilities essential for consistent cooking results across a variety of dishes.</p>\n<p>Constructed with durability in mind, the Atosa CTCO-100 features a stainless steel exterior that not only enhances its longevity but also facilitates easy cleaning and maintenance. The oven\'s convection heating technology ensures even heat distribution throughout the cooking chamber, promoting uniform baking and roasting. It is equipped with intuitive controls that allow precise temperature adjustments and timer settings, providing chefs and kitchen staff with flexibility and control over the cooking process. Overall, the Atosa CTCO-100 combines efficiency, reliability, and versatility to support demanding culinary operations in commercial settings.</p>', '\n\nA full-size 26\" x 17-7/10\" interior provides ample space to cook a variety of items, accommodating large dishes or multiple baking sheets at once. This makes it versatile for use in restaurants, cafes, or bakeries, and convenient for preparing big family meals at home.\nThe high wattage of 5450W delivers fast preheating and efficient cooking times. This is ideal for professional kitchens with high-volume demands, or for home cooks who want to get food on the table quickly.\nUnlike traditional built-in ovens, the CTCO-100 sits on your countertop, freeing up valuable floor space in your kitchen. This is particularly beneficial for smaller kitchens or those with limited storage space.\nThe convection technology circulates hot air throughout the oven cavity, ensuring consistent temperatures and even cooking for your food. This is essential for achieving perfectly browned pastries, roasted vegetables, or consistently cooked pizzas.\nThe heavy-duty stainless steel construction of both the interior and exterior guarantees a long-lasting oven that can withstand the rigors of a busy kitchen. Stainless steel is also easy to clean, which helps to maintain a hygienic cooking environment.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/CTCO-100_ca0e8f63-096e-4ee7-9f39-a9a5a3b59d6f.webp\"]', 'CTCO-100', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2058, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 23.00, NULL, 27.00, NULL, 108.00, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:42:10', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/CTCO-100_ca0e8f63-096e-4ee7-9f39-a9a5a3b59d6f.webp', 'physical', '', 1308, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB326\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2019, 'Atosa CHDS-71 35.38\" Countertop Heated Square Display Case 7.1  Cu. Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa CHDS-71 constitutes a versatile heated display case ideal for showcasing and maintaining the temperature of prepared food items in professional settings like buffets, restaurants, convenience stores, and other food service establishments. Boasting a generous 7.1 cubic feet capacity, it offers ample space to prominently display a wide array of culinary creations, be it pastries, pizzas, hot sandwiches, or enticing appetizers. The integrated heating system ensures your food remains at optimal serving temperatures throughout the day, keeping it fresh and inviting for customers.</p>\n<p>The 35.38-inch wide display case features a stainless steel exterior and interior for a professional and polished look that seamlessly integrates into any kitchen environment. Two rear sliding glass doors grant effortless access to the interior for loading, unloading, and rearranging food displays. Magnetic gaskets on the doors guarantee a positive seal to maintain consistent temperatures and minimize heat loss for optimal efficiency. For maximized versatility, the CHDS-71 incorporates three adjustable stainless steel shelves, enabling you to customize the layout to perfectly accommodate your specific requirements. Finally, an LED interior lighting system offers exceptional visibility of the showcased food, while a removable water pan ingeniously assists in maintaining humidity and freshness.</p>', '\n\nThe generous 7.1 cubic foot interior provides ample space to showcase a wide variety of prepared foods, ideal for buffets, restaurants, convenience stores, and other food service locations. This allows you to present a tempting and diverse selection to entice customers.<br>\n\nThe integrated heating system ensures your food stays at safe and appetizing temperatures for extended periods throughout the day. This helps maintain food quality and freshness, reducing waste.<br>\n\nThe Atosa CHDS-71 features a professional-grade stainless steel exterior and interior.\nThis not only creates a sleek and polished look that complements any kitchen environment, but also ensures durability and resistance to corrosion. Stainless steel is easy to clean and sanitize, promoting a hygienic food storage environment.<br>\n\nTwo rear sliding glass doors allow for effortless access to the display case for loading, unloading, and rearranging food. Magnetic gaskets on the doors guarantee a positive seal to maintain consistent temperatures and minimize heat loss for optimal efficiency. Additionally, an LED interior lighting system offers excellent visibility of the showcased food, making it even more appealing to customers.<br>\n\nThree adjustable stainless steel shelves provide the flexibility to customize the layout of the display case. This enables you to perfectly accommodate a variety of food items and serving dishes, optimizing the use of space and presentation. As a bonus feature, a removable water pan is included to help maintain humidity and freshness of your displayed food.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/CHDS-71_2b7aac40-1593-4345-be78-d77bb653da73.webp\"]', 'CHDS-71', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1318, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35.00, NULL, 27.00, NULL, 23.00, NULL, 154.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:42:11', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/CHDS-71_2b7aac40-1593-4345-be78-d77bb653da73.webp', 'physical', '', 880.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB327\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '');
