(2020, 'Atosa CHDS-53 27.63\" Countertop Heated Square Display Case 5.3 Cu. Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa CHDS-53 Countertop Heated Square Display Case is designed to enhance the presentation and preservation of food items in commercial settings. With a compact size of 27.63 inches, it offers a convenient countertop solution for displaying and keeping food warm, making it suitable for cafes, delis, and convenience stores. This heated display case helps maintain the temperature of food items, ensuring they remain at optimal serving conditions for extended periods.</p>\n<p>Constructed with durability in mind, the Atosa CHDS-53 features a sturdy build and is equipped with transparent glass panels that allow customers to view the displayed food items easily. The heated interior ensures uniform warmth throughout, keeping food items fresh and appealing. This display case is designed for practicality, with easy-access doors for convenient loading and cleaning, making it a versatile choice for businesses looking to showcase and serve hot food items efficiently.</p>', '\n\nWith 5.3 cubic feet of capacity, this countertop display case offers ample space to showcase a variety of hot foods, ideal for restaurants, cafes, convenience stores, and bakeries.<br>\n\nThe integrated heating system maintains food at safe serving temperatures, ensuring quality and freshness throughout the day.<br>\n\nA stainless steel exterior and interior provide a polished look, easy cleaning, and withstand the demands of a busy environment.<br>\n\nTwo rear sliding glass doors with magnetic gaskets allow for both clear presentation of your food and effortless access for restocking. LED interior lighting further enhances visibility.<br>\n\nThree adjustable stainless steel shelves enable you to customize the layout to accommodate various food items and serving dishes. A removable water pan helps maintain humidity and freshness.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/CHDS-53_e46b8ae3-c91f-44dc-b5e6-1c66a5a8790d.webp\"]', 'CHDS-53', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1154, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 27.00, NULL, 23.00, NULL, 128.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:42:12', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/CHDS-53_e46b8ae3-c91f-44dc-b5e6-1c66a5a8790d.webp', 'physical', '', 771, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB328\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2021, 'Atosa CHDC-56 35.38\" Countertop Heated Curved Display Case 5.7 Cu. Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa CHDC-56 Countertop Heated Curved Display Case is crafted to provide an elegant and functional solution for presenting and maintaining the warmth of food items in commercial settings. Featuring a sleek curved glass design and a compact footprint of 35.38 inches, it fits well on countertops in various establishments such as restaurants, cafeterias, and hotels. This display case is ideal for showcasing freshly baked goods, desserts, or hot entrees while ensuring they remain at an optimal serving temperature.</p>\n<p>Constructed with high-quality stainless steel, the Atosa CHDC-56 not only enhances durability but also simplifies cleaning and maintenance. The curved glass front offers a clear view of the displayed items, inviting customers to view and select their choices easily. Inside, the heated interior is designed for uniform heat distribution, preserving the texture and flavor of food items throughout the display period. With convenient access doors, operators can effortlessly load and serve food items, making it a practical choice for enhancing food presentation and customer satisfaction in food service environments.</p>', '\n\nThe 5.7 cubic foot capacity offers ample space to showcase a variety of prepared foods, while the curved glass front maximizes visibility and creates an attractive presentation for customers in buffets, restaurants, convenience stores, and other food service locations.<br>\n\nThe integrated heating system maintains food at safe and appetizing temperatures throughout the day, ensuring freshness and quality.<br>\n\nThe stainless steel exterior and interior guarantee longevity, resist corrosion, and promote easy cleaning for a sanitary environment.<br>\n\nDual rear sliding glass doors with magnetic closures allow for effortless access for restocking and maintaining the display, while an LED interior lighting system effectively showcases your food.<br>\n\nThree adjustable stainless steel shelves provide the flexibility to configure the display case to perfectly accommodate a variety of food items and serving dishes. A removable water pan is included to help maintain humidity and freshness.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/CHDC-56_5d9bd653-9630-4a9c-8a64-d6b91e6ee2cb.webp\"]', 'CHDC-56', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1155, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35.00, NULL, 27.00, NULL, 23.00, NULL, 168.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:42:14', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/CHDC-56_5d9bd653-9630-4a9c-8a64-d6b91e6ee2cb.webp', 'physical', '', 771.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB329\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2022, 'Atosa CHDC-44 27.5\" Countertop Heated Curved Display Case 4.4 Cu. Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa CHDC-44 Countertop Heated Curved Display Case is a practical and visually appealing solution for showcasing hot food items in a variety of commercial settings. With its compact size of 27.5 inches and a capacity of 4.4 cubic feet, this display case is designed to fit conveniently on countertops, making it ideal for cafes, bakeries, delis, and restaurants. The curved glass design enhances the visibility of the displayed items, attracting customers and making food selection easier.</p>\n<p>Constructed with durable materials, the Atosa CHDC-44 ensures longevity and ease of maintenance. The heated interior is designed to maintain a consistent temperature, preserving the freshness and warmth of the food items. This feature is crucial for keeping baked goods, pastries, and other hot foods at their optimal serving conditions. The display case also includes easy-access doors, allowing for quick and sanitary loading and serving of food items. Its combination of functionality, durability, and attractive design makes the Atosa CHDC-44 a valuable addition to any food service operation.</p>', '\n\nEnhances visibility and provides an attractive display for showcasing hot food items, drawing customer attention.<br>\n\nThe heated interior ensures even warmth distribution, keeping food items at optimal serving temperatures.<br>\n\nWith a 27.5-inch width and 4.4 cubic feet capacity, it fits conveniently on countertops, ideal for space-limited environments.<br>\n\nBuilt with high-quality materials, ensuring longevity and ease of cleaning and maintenance.<br>\n\nFacilitates quick and sanitary loading and serving of food items, improving operational efficiency in busy settings.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/CHDC-44_70201ef7-c824-4a7f-814d-461dc9916e61.webp\"]', 'CHDC-44', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 988, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 27.00, NULL, 23.00, NULL, 134.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:42:15', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/CHDC-44_70201ef7-c824-4a7f-814d-461dc9916e61.webp', 'physical', '', 660, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB330\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2023, 'Atosa ATHC-9P 25.1\" Heated Insulated Cabinet Holds 9 Pans', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa ATHC-9P 25.1\" Heated Insulated Cabinet is a reliable solution for maintaining food at ideal serving temperatures. Designed to hold up to 9 pans, this cabinet is perfect for commercial kitchens, catering services, and other food service establishments that require efficient and consistent warming of dishes. Its insulated design ensures that heat is retained within the cabinet, providing uniform temperature distribution and preventing heat loss. This feature is essential for keeping food warm and ready to serve during busy service periods.</p>\n<p>Constructed with durability in mind, the Atosa ATHC-9P features a sturdy stainless steel exterior and interior, which not only enhances its longevity but also makes it easy to clean and maintain. The cabinet\'s compact size of 25.1 inches allows it to fit seamlessly into various kitchen layouts without taking up excessive space. Additionally, the heated cabinet is equipped with user-friendly controls, enabling precise temperature adjustments to meet the specific needs of different dishes. Overall, the Atosa ATHC-9P offers a practical and efficient solution for food warming and storage, ensuring that meals are served at their best quality.</p>', '\n\nThe cabinet is well-insulated to retain heat, ensuring consistent and uniform temperature distribution throughout the interior.<br>\n\nDesigned to hold up to 9 pans, making it ideal for various food service operations that require efficient warming and storage of multiple dishes.<br>\n\nFeatures a robust stainless steel exterior and interior, enhancing durability and making it easy to clean and maintain.<br>\n\nWith a width of 25.1 inches, the cabinet is compact enough to fit into various kitchen layouts without occupying excessive space.<br>\n\nEquipped with intuitive controls that allow precise temperature adjustments, catering to the specific needs of different food items.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ATHC-9P_e0de9d7d-9c3f-4bc7-8cac-dc3b0fed9b02.webp\"]', 'ATHC-9P', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1890, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 43.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 168.00, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:42:16', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ATHC-9P_e0de9d7d-9c3f-4bc7-8cac-dc3b0fed9b02.webp', 'physical', '', 1378, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB331\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2024, 'Atosa ATHC-18P 25.1\" Heated Insulated Cabinet Holds 18 Pans', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa ATHC-18P 25.1\" Heated Insulated Cabinet is a highly efficient solution for maintaining the warmth and quality of food in commercial kitchens. Designed to accommodate up to 18 pans, this heated cabinet is ideal for high-volume food service establishments such as restaurants, catering services, and banquet halls. The insulated design ensures consistent temperature retention, providing even heat distribution to keep dishes warm and ready for serving. This feature is crucial for maintaining the taste and texture of food, ensuring that customers receive meals at their optimal quality.</p>\n<p>Constructed from durable stainless steel, the Atosa ATHC-18P is built to withstand the rigors of daily use in busy kitchen environments. The robust design not only enhances the cabinet\'s longevity but also simplifies cleaning and maintenance, contributing to improved kitchen hygiene. Despite its high capacity, the cabinet maintains a compact footprint of 25.1 inches, making it a space-efficient addition to any kitchen setup. User-friendly controls allow for precise temperature adjustments, giving chefs the flexibility to store a variety of dishes at their ideal serving temperatures. Overall, the Atosa ATHC-18P combines practicality, durability, and efficiency, making it an essential piece of equipment for any professional kitchen.</p>', '\n\nDesigned to hold up to 18 pans, making it suitable for high-volume food service operations.<br>\n\nEnsures consistent and uniform temperature retention, preventing heat loss and maintaining food quality.<br>\n\nFeatures a robust stainless steel exterior and interior, enhancing durability and simplifying cleaning and maintenance.<br>\n\nDespite its high capacity, the cabinet has a compact width of 25.1 inches, making it space-efficient for various kitchen layouts.<br>\n\nEquipped with intuitive controls for precise temperature adjustments, allowing chefs to store different dishes at their optimal serving temperatures.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ATHC-18P_4e9a8e1a-cb5b-4103-9488-502060ff7c21.webp\"]', 'ATHC-18P', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2252, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 212.00, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:42:18', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ATHC-18P_4e9a8e1a-cb5b-4103-9488-502060ff7c21.webp', 'physical', '', 1643, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB332\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2025, 'Atosa AOM-50B 51.4\" Open Air Merchandiser, Black Exterior, 27.5 Cu. Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa AOM-50B is a 51.4\" Open Air Merchandiser designed with a sleek black exterior and offers a generous 27.5 cubic feet of storage capacity. This merchandiser is perfect for displaying a variety of refrigerated products in a visually appealing and easily accessible manner. Its open-air design encourages impulse buys by providing an unobstructed view of the contents, making it ideal for grocery stores, convenience stores, and other retail environments where product visibility is crucial.</p>\n<p>The AOM-50B features advanced refrigeration technology to ensure consistent and reliable temperature control, keeping products fresh and safe for consumption. The black exterior not only adds a modern and sophisticated touch to the display but also enhances the visibility of the products inside. This merchandiser is designed with durability in mind, utilizing high-quality materials that withstand the demands of a busy retail environment. Additionally, the unit is equipped with energy-efficient components to reduce operating costs while maintaining optimal performance, making it a practical and attractive addition to any retail space.</p>', '\n\nOffers 27.5 cubic feet of storage space, providing ample room for displaying a wide range of refrigerated products.<br>\n\nEnhances product visibility and accessibility, encouraging impulse purchases and making it easy for customers to browse and select items.<br>\n\nEnsures consistent and reliable temperature control to keep products fresh and safe for consumption.<br>\n\nAdds a modern and sophisticated touch to the display, enhancing the overall aesthetic appeal of the retail environment.<br>\n\nDesigned with energy-efficient components to reduce operating costs while maintaining optimal performance, making it a cost-effective choice for retailers.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/AOM-50B_26ce83b6-