(2026, 'Atosa CTCO-50 23\" Countertop Convection Oven, Half Size, 120V, 1550W', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa CTCO-50 is a versatile countertop convection oven designed for efficient cooking in commercial kitchens. With its compact 23-inch size, it\'s ideal for establishments where space is at a premium but high-performance cooking is essential. Operating at 120V and 1550W, this oven offers sufficient power for baking, roasting, and warming a variety of foods. It features a half-size capacity, making it suitable for smaller batches and limited kitchen spaces while still providing ample cooking area.</p>\n<p>Equipped with convection heating technology, the Atosa CTCO-50 ensures even heat distribution throughout the oven cavity, resulting in consistent cooking results. This feature is especially beneficial for achieving uniform browning and cooking food faster than traditional ovens. The oven is designed with user convenience in mind, featuring simple controls for temperature and timer settings. Its compact yet robust construction, along with stainless steel components, enhances durability and facilitates easy cleaning, making it a practical choice for busy commercial environments where efficiency and reliability are paramount.</p>', '\n\nWith a 23-inch width, it\'s designed to fit on countertops, making it suitable for kitchens with limited space.<br>\n\nUtilizes convection technology for even heat distribution, ensuring consistent cooking results across all trays.<br>\n\nOffers enough space for half-size sheet pans, ideal for smaller batches of baked goods or dishes.<br>\n\nFeatures straightforward controls for temperature and timer settings, allowing for precise cooking adjustments.<br>\n\nBuilt with stainless steel for durability and easy cleaning, making it suitable for busy commercial kitchen environments.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/CTCO-50_33b91906-f553-4b69-ad5d-b247b0ed4d16.webp\"]', 'CTCO-50', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 883, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 23.00, NULL, 17.00, NULL, 23.00, NULL, 62.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:42:21', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/CTCO-50_33b91906-f553-4b69-ad5d-b247b0ed4d16.webp', 'physical', '', 561, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB334\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2027, 'Atosa CTCO-25 18.75\" Countertop Convection Oven, Quarter Size, 120V, 1440W', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa CTCO-25 is a compact countertop convection oven designed for efficient cooking in commercial settings where space is limited. With its quarter-size capacity and dimensions of 18.75 inches, it\'s particularly well-suited for kitchens that require a smaller footprint without compromising on cooking capabilities. Operating at 120V and 1440W, this oven provides sufficient power for baking, roasting, and reheating various food items. Its smaller size makes it ideal for establishments such as cafes, food trucks, or small restaurants where space optimization is crucial.</p>\n<p>Equipped with convection heating technology, the Atosa CTCO-25 ensures uniform heat distribution throughout the oven cavity. This feature promotes even cooking and consistent results, essential for baking delicate pastries or roasting meats. The oven features intuitive controls for temperature and timer settings, allowing chefs to adjust cooking parameters with ease. Constructed with durable stainless steel, it not only enhances longevity but also facilitates effortless cleaning, making it a practical choice for busy kitchen environments where efficiency and hygiene are priorities.</p>', '\n\nIts quarter-size capacity and compact dimensions (18.75 inches wide) make it ideal for kitchens with limited countertop space.<br>\n\nUtilizes convection technology for efficient and even distribution of heat, ensuring consistent cooking results across all trays.<br>\n\nDesigned to accommodate quarter-size sheet pans, suitable for baking smaller batches or reheating dishes.<br>\n\nFeatures easy-to-operate controls for adjusting temperature and time settings, providing flexibility in cooking various recipes.<br>\n\nBuilt with stainless steel materials that enhance durability, resist corrosion, and facilitate easy cleaning, making it suitable for commercial kitchen environments.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/CTCO-25_e3973086-bb7c-4241-a79d-d5cba5da2d69.webp\"]', 'CTCO-25', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 569, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 19.00, NULL, 15.00, NULL, 20.00, NULL, 47.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:42:22', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/CTCO-25_e3973086-bb7c-4241-a79d-d5cba5da2d69.webp', 'physical', '', 361.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB335\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2028, 'Atosa ATSE-3024 24\" Stainless Steel Equipment Stand', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa ATSE-3024 is a sturdy and practical stainless steel equipment stand designed to support various kitchen appliances and equipment. With a width of 24 inches, it provides a stable platform for countertop cooking equipment, such as griddles, fryers, or countertop ovens. This stand is crafted from durable stainless steel, known for its strength and resistance to corrosion, ensuring longevity in busy kitchen environments. Its stainless steel construction also makes it easy to clean and maintain, ideal for maintaining hygiene standards in commercial kitchens.</p>\n<p>This equipment stand is built with adjustable undershelves, offering additional storage space for utensils, pots, or ingredients, thus optimizing kitchen organization and workflow. Its versatile design and robust build make it suitable for restaurants, cafeterias, or any food service establishment looking to maximize space efficiency while ensuring durability and functionality in their kitchen setup.</p>', '\n\nBuilt with durable stainless steel material, providing strength, durability, and resistance to corrosion.<br>\n\nIncludes a convenient adjustable undershelf that allows for customizable storage space, accommodating various kitchen essentials and equipment.<br>\n\nSuitable for supporting a range of countertop kitchen equipment such as griddles, fryers, mixers, or small ovens, enhancing workspace efficiency.<br>\n\nSmooth stainless steel surface and construction facilitate easy cleaning and maintenance, ensuring hygiene standards are met in commercial kitchens.<br>\n\nDesigned with sturdy legs and reinforced edges for stability, ensuring safe and secure support for heavy kitchen appliances and equipment.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ATSE-3024_d15c232a-e044-4bb9-b1c0-d0c1b87207ff.webp\"]', 'ATSE-3024', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 291, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 24.0