(2029, 'Atosa ATSE-3036 36\" Stainless Steel Equipment Stand', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa ATSE-3036 is a robust stainless steel equipment stand designed to provide sturdy support for various kitchen appliances and equipment. With a width of 36 inches, it offers ample space to accommodate larger countertop cooking equipment like griddles, countertop fryers, or mixers. Constructed from durable stainless steel, this stand is built to withstand the rigors of commercial kitchen environments, ensuring longevity and resistance to corrosion. Its sleek and smooth surface not only enhances its durability but also facilitates easy cleaning and maintenance, crucial for maintaining high hygiene standards in busy kitchens.</p>\n<p>This equipment stand features an adjustable undershelf, providing flexibility in storage and allowing kitchen operators to organize utensils, pans, or ingredients efficiently. The stand\'s stable design, reinforced with sturdy legs and edges, ensures secure placement of heavy equipment, promoting safety and operational efficiency. Whether used in restaurants, hotels, or other food service establishments, the Atosa ATSE-3036 is designed to optimize kitchen workflow by providing a reliable foundation for essential kitchen tools and appliances.</p>', '\n\nMade from high-quality stainless steel, offering durability, resistance to corrosion, and easy cleaning, ideal for commercial kitchen environments.<br>\n\nProvides a generous 36-inch width to accommodate various countertop kitchen equipment such as griddles, fryers, mixers, or slicers, optimizing kitchen space and workflow.<br>\n\nIncludes a convenient adjustable undershelf that allows for customized storage, enabling operators to organize kitchen tools, pans, or ingredients efficiently.<br>\n\nFeatures sturdy legs with adjustable bullet feet, ensuring stability on uneven surfaces and providing secure support for heavy kitchen appliances.<br>\n\nSuitable for use in restaurants, cafes, catering businesses, or any commercial kitchen setting where durable and functional equipment stands are essential for operational efficiency.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ATSE-3036_5ab7d884-a0f3-474e-9512-0eeb110a5ed0.webp\"]', 'ATSE-3036', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 379, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36.00, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 62.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:42:24', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ATSE-3036_5ab7d884-a0f3-474e-9512-0eeb110a5ed0.webp', 'physical', '', 163, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB337\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2030, 'Atosa AGR-8B-NG 48\" CookRite Range Natural Gas, 8 Burners', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa AGR-8B 48\" Gas Range is a versatile and robust appliance designed for high-performance cooking in commercial kitchens. With its eight powerful burners, this gas range allows chefs to prepare multiple dishes simultaneously, increasing kitchen efficiency and productivity. Each burner offers precise control, enabling chefs to adjust the flame to the desired level for different cooking techniques, from simmering to boiling. The spacious cooktop provides ample room for large pots and pans, making it ideal for busy restaurants, catering services, and other food service establishments that require high-volume cooking capabilities.</p>\n<p>In addition to the impressive cooktop, the Atosa AGR-8B features two standard ovens that offer excellent baking and roasting performance. The ovens are designed to distribute heat evenly, ensuring consistent cooking results every time. They are equipped with adjustable racks, allowing chefs to customize the cooking space according to their needs. The ovens\' spacious interiors can accommodate large batches of food, making them suitable for baking bread, roasting meats, or preparing casseroles. The durable construction of the Atosa AGR-8B, including its stainless steel exterior, ensures longevity and ease of maintenance, making it a reliable and essential addition to any commercial kitchen.</p>', '\n\nThe gas range comes with eight high-performance burners, providing ample cooking space and the ability to handle multiple pots and pans simultaneously.<br>\n\nEquipped with two spacious standard ovens, offering excellent baking and roasting capabilities with even heat distribution for consistent cooking results.<br>\n\nThe range features a durable stainless steel exterior, ensuring longevity, resistance to corrosion, and easy cleaning, ideal for demanding commercial kitchen environments.<br>\n\nThe ovens include adjustable racks, allowing for customizable cooking space to accommodate different sizes of bakeware and cooking needs.<br>\n\nEach burner offers precise flame control, enabling chefs to adjust the heat level accurately for various cooking techniques, from simmering to high-heat searing.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/AGR-8B-NG.webp\"]', 'AGR-8B-NG', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 3467, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48.00, NULL, 57.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 765.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:42:25', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/AGR-8B-NG.webp', 'physical', '', 2244, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB338\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
