tomizable cooking space to accommodate different sizes of bakeware and cooking needs.<br>\n\nEach burner offers precise flame control, enabling chefs to adjust the heat level accurately for various cooking techniques, from simmering to high-heat searing.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/AGR-8B-LP.webp\"]', 'AGR-8B-LP', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 3467, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48.00, NULL, 57.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 765.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:42:27', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/AGR-8B-LP.webp', 'physical', '', 2244, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB339\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2032, 'Atosa MBF8520GR 24.25\" Bottom Mount Reach-In Freezer, 1 One Door, 8.3 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MBF8520GR is a compact yet powerful bottom mount reach-in freezer designed to meet the needs of commercial kitchens. With a single door and a capacity of 8.3 cubic feet, it offers ample storage space for frozen goods while maintaining an efficient footprint. The bottom mount design places the compressor at the base, improving energy efficiency and making it easier to access stored items without excessive bending. This freezer is ideal for small to medium-sized kitchens, providing reliable freezing capabilities to keep ingredients fresh and ready for use.</p>\n<p>Constructed with high-quality stainless steel, both inside and out, the Atosa MBF8520GR is built to endure the rigors of a busy kitchen environment. Its robust construction ensures durability and ease of cleaning, which is essential for maintaining hygiene standards. The freezer features a digital temperature control system for precise temperature management, ensuring that your food remains at optimal freezing conditions. Additionally, it includes adjustable shelves, self-closing doors, and a lock and key mechanism for added security, making it a versatile and secure storage solution for any commercial kitchen.</p>', '\n\nPlaces the compressor at the bottom of the unit, enhancing energy efficiency and providing easier access to stored items.<br>\n\nMade from durable stainless steel inside and out, ensuring long-lasting performance and easy cleaning.<br>\n\nFeatures a digital control system for precise temperature management, maintaining optimal freezing conditions.<br>\n\nIncludes adjustable shelves to accommodate different sizes of storage containers and optimize space utilization.<br>\n\nEquipped with self-closing doors and a lock and key mechanism for added security, ensuring that contents are safely stored.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MBF8520GR_10bb7429-81