(2033, 'Atosa MCF8733GR 39.4\" Glass Merchandiser, 2 Sections Black Exterior 28.5 Cu. Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MCF8733GR 39.4\" Glass Merchandiser is a sleek and efficient solution for businesses looking to enhance their product display and storage capabilities. With its stylish black exterior, this merchandiser adds a modern and professional touch to any retail environment. The dual glass doors provide clear visibility of the 28.5 cubic feet of storage space, allowing customers to easily see the contents without opening the doors, thus maintaining the internal temperature and energy efficiency. The bright LED lighting inside further enhances product visibility, ensuring that all items are attractively displayed and easily accessible.</p>\n<p>This merchandiser is designed with functionality and durability in mind. The digital temperature control system ensures precise regulation of the internal environment, keeping products at their optimal freshness and safety levels. Adjustable shelving allows for flexible organization, accommodating various product sizes and maximizing display space. The durable construction of the Atosa MCF8733GR, combined with its energy-efficient features, makes it a reliable and cost-effective choice for businesses looking to improve their refrigerated display capabilities. Whether used in a grocery store, convenience store, or other retail setting, this merchandiser is built to withstand the demands of a busy commercial environment while maintaining a polished appearance.</p>', '\n\nThe Atosa MCF8733GR features two glass doors that provide clear visibility of the products inside, making it easy for customers to view and select items without opening the doors.<br>\n\nEquipped with bright, energy-saving LED lights, this merchandiser ensures that all products are well-lit and attractively displayed, enhancing the visual appeal and reducing energy costs.<br>\n\nThe advanced digital temperature control system allows precise adjustment and monitoring of the internal temperature, ensuring that all products are kept at optimal conditions for freshness and safety.<br>\n\nThe unit comes with adjustable shelves, offering flexible storage options to accommodate a variety of product sizes and maximize the available display space.<br>\n\nThe sleek black exterior not only adds a modern, stylish look to any retail space but also provides durability and easy maintenance, ensuring the merchandiser remains in excellent condition over time.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MCF8733GR_7cadf001-9c50-4060-99e3-a39bc1fdc58a.webp\"]', 'MCF8733GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2926, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 81.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 403.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:42:30', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MCF8733GR_7cadf001-9c50-4060-99e3-a39bc1fdc58a.webp', 'physical', '', 1859, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB341\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2034, 'Atosa MSF3615GR 36.31\" Mega Top Sandwich Prep Table 8.7 Cu. Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MSF3615GR 36.31\" Mega Top Sandwich Prep Table is a versatile and efficient solution for food service establishments that require a reliable prep station with ample storage. This prep table features a spacious 8.7 cubic feet capacity, providing ample room for storing ingredients and keeping them at optimal temperatures. The table is designed with a stainless steel exterior and interior, ensuring durability and easy cleaning, which is essential in a busy kitchen environment. The insulated cover helps to maintain the internal temperature, ensuring that the ingredients remain fresh and safe for consumption.</p>\n<p>This model includes a mega top design, which accommodates multiple pans, making it ideal for sandwich and salad preparation. The digital temperature control allows for precise regulation of the internal environment, ensuring food safety and quality. The prep table also features a cutting board, providing a convenient space for food preparation directly on the unit. The adjustable shelving allows for customization of the storage space to suit various needs, enhancing its functionality. Overall, the Atosa MSF3615GR is a reliable and efficient prep table that enhances productivity and maintains high standards of food safety and quality.</p>', '\n\nOffers 8.7 cubic feet of storage space, providing sufficient room for ingredients and supplies.<br>\n\nFeatures a stainless steel exterior and interior for long-lasting durability and easy cleaning.<br>\n\nAccommodates multiple pans, ideal for sandwich and salad preparation, with a convenient cutting board for direct food prep.<br>\n\nDigital temperature control ensures the internal environment is kept at optimal levels for food safety and quality.<br>\n\nAllows for customization of the storage space to accommodate various items, enhancing the unit\'s versatility and functionality.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MSF3615GR_e4e8bde8-88b9-43ba-8019-0c378054cc6c.webp\"]', 'MSF3615GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2574, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36.00, NULL, 47.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 240.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:42:31', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MSF3615GR_e4e8bde8-88b9-43ba-8019-0c378054cc6c.webp', 'physical', '', 1635.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB342\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2035, 'Atosa SSTW-3084 84\" 18-Gauge Stainless Steel Work Table with Undershelf', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa SSTW-3084 is an 84\" work table designed to provide a robust and spacious work surface for various kitchen tasks. Constructed from 18-gauge stainless steel, this table is built to withstand the rigors of a busy commercial kitchen while maintaining a professional and clean appearance. The stainless steel construction ensures resistance to corrosion and rust, making it a durable and long-lasting addition to any food service establishment. The smooth surface of the table allows for easy cleaning and maintenance, which is crucial in maintaining hygiene standards in a kitchen environment.</p>\n<p>This work table also features an undershelf, offering additional storage space for kitchen tools, ingredients, and other essentials, helping to keep the workspace organized and efficient. The undershelf is adjustable, allowing for customization based on specific storage needs. The table\'s sturdy legs and reinforced design ensure stability, even when handling heavy loads or rigorous use. Overall, the Atosa SSTW-3084 is an excellent choice for kitchens seeking a durable, spacious, and versatile work table that enhances productivity and organization.</p>', '\n\nMade from 18-gauge stainless steel, ensuring resistance to rust and corrosion for long-lasting use.<br>\n\nProvides an expansive 84\" work surface suitable for various kitchen tasks and preparation activities.<br>\n\nFeatures an adjustable undershelf for additional storage, allowing for customization based on storage needs.<br>\n\nThe smooth stainless steel surface facilitates easy cleaning and maintenance, crucial for maintaining hygiene standards.<br>\n\nReinforced legs and construction provide stability and support, even under heavy loads and rigorous use.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/SSTW-3084_4ab28c09-0c63-457d-a737-750eb399a851.webp\"]', 'SSTW-3084', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 653, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 84.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 103.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:42:31', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/SSTW-3084_4ab28c09-0c63-457d-a737-750eb399a851.webp', 'physical', '', 286.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB343\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '');
