(2036, 'Atosa SSTW-3072 72\" Gauge Stainless Steel Work Table with Undershelf', '\n<p> <br>Crafted entirely from 18-gauge, 430 stainless steel, the Atosa SSTW-3072 work table is a paragon of durability and functionality, designed to excel in fast-paced professional kitchens. Its expansive 72\" x 30\" work surface offers ample space for food preparation, plating, or assembly line operations, optimizing workflow and efficiency. The smooth, satin finish stainless steel top is not only effortless to clean and sanitize, but it also exudes a polished and professional aesthetic that seamlessly integrates into any back-of-house environment.</p>\n<p>Further enhancing its functionality, the Atosa SSTW-3072 incorporates an adjustable undershelf. This versatile feature provides additional storage space for cookware, ingredients, or other culinary essentials, contributing to a well-organized and clutter-free workspace. The undershelf\'s adjustable design allows for customized positioning to accommodate individual preferences and promote ergonomic use. Safety is paramount, and the Atosa SSTW-3072 incorporates turned-down edges on the work surface to minimize the risk of accidental cuts or abrasions for your staff. For increased convenience, the unit arrives unassembled but is engineered for straightforward assembly, ensuring a swift setup and minimal downtime in your busy kitchen.0</p>', '\n\nAt 72 inches wide and 30 inches deep, the Atosa SSTW-3072 provides a generous amount of space for food preparation, packing, or assembly tasks.<br>\n\nThe undershelf offers additional storage space and can be adjusted to your desired height for optimized use of vertical space.<br>\n\nThis feature helps to dampen noise created during food prep activities, such as pounding meat or chopping vegetables, contributing to a quieter working environment.<br>\n\nThe edges of the work surface are turned down for user safety, minimizing the risk of cuts or abrasions.<br>\n\nThe table ships unassembled but is designed for easy assembly for convenience.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/SSTW-3072_961162b6-d366-4837-945a-af38c98b037b.webp\"]', 'SSTW-3072', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 540, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 72.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 86.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:42:33', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/SSTW-3072_961162b6-d366-4837-945a-af38c98b037b.webp', 'physical', '', 236, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB344\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2037, 'Atosa SSTW-3060 60\" Stainless Steel Work Table with Undershelf', '\nptions\n<p> <br>Crafted entirely from 18-gauge, 430 stainless steel for exceptional durability and corrosion resistance, the Atosa SSTW-3060 work table is a bastion of functionality designed to optimize workflow within your commercial kitchen. Its expansive 60\" x 30\" work surface provides ample space for food prep, plating, or assembly line tasks, effectively streamlining processes and maximizing efficiency. The polished, satin finish not only imparts a sleek aesthetic that seamlessly integrates with any back-of-house environment, but it also allows for effortless post-service cleaning and sanitation, ensuring the highest hygienic standards are maintained. An innovative feature of the SSTW-3060 is the sound-deadened top, which significantly reduces noise levels generated during food preparation activities, fostering a quieter and more comfortable work atmosphere for your staff.</p>\n<p>Furthermore, the Atosa SSTW-3060 incorporates a versatile adjustable undershelf, crafted from the same premium stainless steel. This valuable addition provides much-needed storage space for cookware, ingredients, or other culinary essentials, contributing to an organized and clutter-free workspace. The adjustable nature of the undershelf allows for customized positioning to perfectly accommodate individual preferences and optimize ergonomic use for your team. Safety remains paramount, and the Atosa SSTW-3060 features turned-down edges on the work surface to minimize the risk of accidental cuts or abrasions for your staff. Conveniently, the unit arrives unassembled but is engineered for straightforward assembly, ensuring swift setup with minimal disruption to your busy kitchen\'s operations.</p>', '\nAt 60 inches wide and 30 inches deep, the Atosa SSTW-3060 provides a generous amount of space for food preparation, packing, or assembly tasks.<br>\n\nThe undershelf offers additional storage space and can be adjusted to your desired height for optimized use of vertical space.<br>\n\nThe entire table, including the top, undershelf, and legs, is constructed from 18-gauge, 430 stainless steel. This makes it resistant to corrosion, easy to clean, and able to withstand the wear and tear of a busy kitchen environment.<br>\n\nA special feature of the Atosa SSTW-3060 is the sound deadened top. This helps to dampen noise created during food prep activities, such as pounding meat or chopping vegetables, contributing to a quieter working environment.<br>\n\nThe edges of the work surface are turned down for user safety, minimizing the risk of cuts or abrasions.<br>\n\nThe table ships unassembled but is designed for easy assembly for convenience.\n\n<h2>Descri</h2>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/SSTW-3060_c324b807-cb2b-4e64-9596-eb662d359649.webp\"]', 'SSTW-3060', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 482, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 60.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 73.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:42:34', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/SSTW-3060_c324b807-cb2b-4e64-9596-eb662d359649.webp', 'physical', '', 211.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB345\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2038, 'Atosa SSTW-3036 36\" 18 Gauge Stainless Steel Work Table with Undershelf', '\n<p> <br>Engineered to excel within demanding commercial kitchen environments, the Atosa SSTW-3036 work table delivers the perfect harmony of functionality and space optimization. Constructed entirely from 18-gauge, 430 stainless steel, this workhorse boasts exceptional durability and resistance to corrosion, guaranteeing longevity and resilience in the face of everyday wear and tear. The 36\" x 30\" work surface provides a generous yet space-saving platform for food preparation, packaging, or assembly line operations, streamlining workflows and maximizing efficiency within your kitchen. The polished, satin-finish top is not only effortless to clean and maintain, ensuring the highest hygienic standards, but it also exudes a professional aesthetic that complements any back-of-house environment.</p>\n<p>Further enhancing its functionality, the Atosa SSTW-3036 incorporates a thoughtfully designed adjustable undershelf, crafted from the same premium stainless steel. This versatile feature provides much-needed storage space for essential cookware, ingredients, or other culinary supplies, contributing to an organized and clutter-free workspace. The adjustable design allows for customized positioning to perfectly accommodate individual preferences and optimize ergonomic use for your team. Moreover, an innovative sound-deadened top significantly reduces noise levels generated during food preparation activities, fostering a quieter and more comfortable work atmosphere for your staff. Safety remains paramount, with the Atosa SSTW-3036 featuring turned-down edges on the work surface to minimize the risk of accidental cuts or abrasions. Conveniently, the unit arrives unassembled for efficient shipping but is engineered for straightforward assembly, ensuring a swift setup with minimal disruption to your busy kitchen\'s operations.</p>', '\n\nMeasuring 36 inches wide by 30 inches deep, the SSTW-3036 offers a sizable work surface for food preparation, packaging, or assembly tasks without occupying excessive floor space in your kitchen.<br>\n\nThis worktable features a convenient undershelf crafted from the same durable stainless steel. The adjustable design allows you to customize the shelf\'s height to accommodate various storage needs and promote ergonomic use for your team. It provides additional space to keep pots, pans, ingredients, or other kitchen essentials within easy reach, contributing to a well-organized and efficient workspace.<br>\n\nA thoughtful feature of the Atosa SSTW-3036 is the sound-deadened top. This innovative design effectively dampens noise generated during typical food prep activities like chopping vegetables or pounding meat. This helps to create a more peaceful and comfortable work environment for your staff.<br>\n\nThe edges of the work surface are thoughtfully turned downwards, prioritizing the safety of your staff. This design minimizes the risk of accidental cuts or abrasions that could occur during fast-paced kitchen operations.<br>\n\nThe Atosa SSTW-3036 arrives unassembled for convenient shipping. However, it\'s designed for straightforward assembly, ensuring a quick and effortless setup process with minimal disruption to your busy kitchen\'s workflow.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/SSTW-3036_eed65ff6-31c7-44db-bb99-8048d17907b4.webp\"]', 'SSTW-3036', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 356, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 51.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:42:34', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/SSTW-3036_eed65ff6-31c7-44db-bb99-8048d17907b4.webp', 'physical', '', 156, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB346\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2039, 'Atosa SSTW-3030 30\" Stainless Steel Work Table with Undershelf 18-Gauge', '\n<p> <br>This stainless steel work table is crafted from high-quality 18-gauge stainless steel, making it exceptionally durable and resistant to corrosion. Its smooth surface is easy to clean, ensuring optimal hygiene standards in food preparation areas. The 30-inch width offers a spacious and robust workspace suitable for a variety of kitchen tasks, from food prep to organizing utensils and assembling ingredients. The table includes a convenient undershelf that can be adjusted to accommodate different storage needs, whether for kitchen tools, small appliances, or ingredients. This flexibility allows for efficient organization, contributing to a streamlined workflow in busy kitchens.</p>\n<p>Designed with safety in mind, the table features rounded edges and corners to minimize the risk of accidental bumps and injuries in fast-paced kitchen environments. Its sturdy legs are equipped with adjustable feet, providing stability and the ability to level the table on uneven floors. This ensures a secure and balanced workspace, essential for maintaining efficiency during food preparation. Overall, this stainless steel work table combines durability, functionality, and safety features, making it an indispensable asset in commercial kitchens striving for cleanliness, organization, and operational efficiency.</p>', '\n\nMade from high-quality 18-gauge stainless steel, this work table is durable, resistant to corrosion, and easy to clean. It ensures longevity and maintains hygiene standards essential for food preparation areas.<br>\n\nThe 30-inch width provides a spacious and sturdy surface for various kitchen tasks, including food prep, assembling ingredients, and organizing utensils.<br>\n\nIncludes a convenient undershelf that offers additional storage space for kitchen tools, small appliances, and ingredients. The undershelf is adjustable, allowing for flexible storage configurations to suit different operational needs.<br>\n\nDesigned with rounded edges and corners for safety, minimizing the risk of accidental bumps and injuries in a fast-paced kitchen environment.<br>\n\nFeatures sturdy legs with adjustable feet, providing stability and allowing the table to be leveled on uneven floors. This ensures a secure and balanced workspace for efficient food preparation.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/SSTW-3030_3b45b1e5-d255-4275-8562-2b23e4b743da.webp\"]', 'SSTW-3030', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 307, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 45.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:42:36', '2024-12-16 08:19:23', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/SSTW-3030_3b45b1e5-d255-4275-8562-2b23e4b743da.webp', 'physical', '', 134.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB347\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2040, 'Atosa SSTW-2472 72\" Stainless Steel Work Table with Undershelf 18 Gauge', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa SSTW-2472 is a robust and practical addition to any commercial kitchen, offering a spacious and durable workspace. With its 72-inch width and made from sturdy 18-gauge stainless steel, this work table is designed to withstand the demands of busy foodservice environments. The stainless steel construction ensures not only durability but also easy cleaning and maintenance, crucial for maintaining hygiene standards in food preparation areas.</p>\n<p>Equipped with an undershelf, the Atosa SSTW-2472 provides additional storage space for kitchen tools, small appliances, and ingredients, helping to keep the work area organized and efficient. The undershelf is adjustable, allowing for customization to fit varying storage needs. Rounded edges and corners contribute to safety, reducing the risk of accidental bumps and injuries during hectic kitchen activities. Supported by sturdy legs with adjustable feet, the table remains stable on uneven floors, ensuring a secure and balanced workspace for chefs and kitchen staff. Overall, the Atosa SSTW-2472 is a reliable choice for enhancing productivity and functionality in commercial kitchens, catering to the practical needs of food preparation and organization.</p>', '\n\nConstructed from durable 18-gauge stainless steel, the table is robust, easy to clean, and resistant to corrosion. This ensures longevity and meets stringent hygiene standards required in foodservice environments.<br>\n\nWith a width of 72 inches, the table provides a spacious and sturdy surface for various kitchen tasks, including chopping, mixing, and assembling ingredients. It offers ample room for multiple chefs or large batches of food preparation.<br>\n\nIncludes a convenient undershelf beneath the tabletop, providing additional storage space for kitchen utensils, small appliances, and ingredients. The undershelf is adjustable, allowing for customizable storag