(2041, 'Atosa SSTW-2460 60\" Stainless Steel Work Table with Undershelf 18 Gauge', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa SSTW-2460 is a versatile and durable 60-inch stainless steel work table designed for commercial kitchen environments. Built from robust 18-gauge stainless steel, it offers exceptional strength and resilience against corrosion, ensuring longevity and ease of maintenance. Its 60-inch width provides a spacious and reliable surface for various food preparation tasks, from chopping and mixing to assembling dishes, making it suitable for busy kitchen operations.</p>\n<p>This work table features a convenient undershelf that enhances organizational efficiency by providing additional storage space for kitchen essentials such as utensils, small appliances, and ingredients. The undershelf is adjustable, allowing for flexible configurations to accommodate specific storage needs and optimize workflow. Rounded edges and corners enhance safety by minimizing the risk of accidental bumps and injuries, ensuring a safer working environment. Supported by sturdy legs with adjustable feet, the Atosa SSTW-2460 maintains stability on uneven surfaces, offering chefs and kitchen staff a secure and balanced workspace to perform tasks efficiently. Overall, the Atosa SSTW-2460 combines durability, functionality, and practicality, making it an essential piece of equipment for enhancing productivity in commercial kitchens.</p>', '\n\nMade from sturdy 18-gauge stainless steel, providing strength and resistance to corrosion, ensuring longevity in commercial kitchen environments.<br>\n\nOffers a generous 60-inch width, providing ample space for food preparation, assembly, and other kitchen tasks.<br>\n\nIncludes a convenient undershelf that offers additional storage space for kitchen tools, small appliances, and ingredients. The undershelf is adjustable to accommodate different storage needs.<br>\n\nDesigned with rounded edges and corners for safety, reducing the risk of accidents and injuries in 