(2043, 'Atosa SSTW-2436 36\" Stainless Steel Work Table with Undershelf, 18 Gauge', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa SSTW-2436 36\" Stainless Steel Work Table with Undershelf is designed to be a reliable and functional addition to any commercial kitchen. Constructed from sturdy 18-gauge stainless steel, this work table ensures durability, resistance to corrosion, and easy cleaning, making it suitable for food preparation areas where hygiene is paramount. The table features a smooth, flat surface that provides ample space for various kitchen tasks such as food preparation, mixing, and assembling ingredients.</p>\n<p>Underneath the tabletop, the Atosa SSTW-2436 includes a convenient undershelf that offers additional storage space for kitchen essentials like small appliances, pots, pans, or ingredients. This undershelf helps to keep the workspace organized and clear of clutter, promoting efficiency during busy kitchen operations. The table\'s 36-inch width strikes a balance between providing ample workspace and fitting into kitchen layouts without occupying excessive floor space. Overall, the Atosa SSTW-2436 combines practical design, durable construction, and functional features to support smooth and efficient food preparation in commercial settings.</p>', '\n\nMade from durable 18-gauge stainless steel for long-lasting performance and resistance to corrosion.<br>\n\n36-inch width provides ample space for food preparation, mixing, and other kitchen tasks.<br>\n\nIncludes a convenient undershelf for storing kitchen essentials, keeping them within easy reach and optimizing workspace organization.<br>\n\nSmooth stainless steel surface is easy to wipe down and sanitize, maintaining hygiene standards in commercial kitchens.<br>\n\nEquipped with adjustable bullet feet to ensure stability on uneven surfaces and allow for customized height adjustments as needed.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/SSTW-2436_fc0ed9a2-ed2c-4304-93eb-133360d9d9df.webp\"]',