(2044, 'Atosa SSTW-2430 Stainless Steel Work Table with Undershelf, 18 Gauge', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa SSTW-2430 Stainless Steel Work Table with Undershelf, 18 Gauge, is designed to provide durability and functionality in commercial kitchen environments. Constructed from robust 18-gauge stainless steel, this work table offers resistance to corrosion and wear, ensuring longevity even under demanding conditions. The 24-inch width of the table provides a generous workspace suitable for various food preparation tasks, from chopping and mixing to plating and serving.</p>\n<p>Underneath the smooth stainless steel tabletop, the Atosa SSTW-2430 features a convenient undershelf that enhances storage capacity and organization in the kitchen. This undershelf allows for easy access to essential kitchen tools, small appliances, or ingredients, promoting efficiency during busy periods of operation. The table is designed with adjustable bullet feet, enabling stable placement on uneven surfaces and providing flexibility to adjust the height as needed for ergonomic comfort or to match other kitchen equipment heights. Overall, the Atosa SSTW-2430 combines practical design, durable construction, and functional features to support efficient workflow and hygiene standards in commercial kitchens.</p>', '\n\nMade from sturdy 18-gauge stainless steel for long-lasting durability and resistance to corrosion.<br>\n\n24-inch width provides ample space for food preparation, making it suitable for various kitchen tasks.<br>\n\nIncludes a convenient undershelf for storing kitchen tools, small appliances, or ingredients, keeping them organized and within easy reach.<br>\n\nEquipped with adjustable bullet feet to ensure stability on uneven floors and allow for customizable height adjustments.<br>\n\nSmooth stainless steel surface is easy to wipe down and sanitize, maintaining cleanliness and hygiene in the kitchen.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/SSTW-2430_90232a