(2045, 'Atosa SSTW-2424 24\" Stainless Steel Work Table with Undershelf, 18 Gauge', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa SSTW-2424 24\" Stainless Steel Work Table with Undershelf, 18 Gauge, is designed to be a compact yet versatile addition to commercial kitchens. Crafted from durable 18-gauge stainless steel, this work table offers excellent resistance to corrosion and wear, ensuring longevity even in demanding kitchen environments. The 24-inch width provides a sufficient workspace for various food preparation tasks, from chopping vegetables to assembling ingredients for cooking.</p>\n<p>Beneath the smooth stainless steel tabletop, the Atosa SSTW-2424 features a practical undershelf that enhances storage capacity and organization. This undershelf allows for convenient storage of kitchen essentials such as utensils, small appliances, or ingredients, keeping them easily accessible during busy kitchen operations. The table is equipped with adjustable bullet feet, enabling stable placement on uneven surfaces and facilitating customization of height for ergonomic comfort or to match other kitchen equipment. Overall, the Atosa SSTW-2424 combines durability, functionality, and compact design to support efficient workflow and maintain cleanliness in commercial kitchens.</p>', '\n\nMade from sturdy 18-gauge stainless steel, providing durability and resistance to corrosion in commercial kitchen environments.<br>\n\n24-inch width offers a space-efficient design that fits well in smaller kitchens or as additional workspace in larger setups.<br>\n\nIncludes a convenient undershelf for storing kitchen essentials such as utensils, small appliances, or ingredients, keeping them organized and within easy reach.<br>\n\nEquipped with adjustable bullet feet to ensure stability on uneven floors and allow for customizable height adjustments.<br>\n\nSmooth stainless steel surface is easy to wipe down and sanitize, maintaining cleanliness and hygiene standards in busy kitchen settings.\n', 'published', '