(2047, 'Atosa AGR-36G-LP 36\" CookRite Range Liquid Propane Gas', '\n<p>The Atosa AGR-36G-NG 36\" Natural Gas Range with Griddle Top is a high-performance appliance tailored for commercial kitchens that require versatile cooking equipment. This range features a 36-inch wide griddle top made of polished steel, providing a large, even-heating surface ideal for cooking a variety of foods such as pancakes, eggs, burgers, and more. The griddle is designed to distribute heat evenly, ensuring consistent cooking results across its entire surface, which is essential for maintaining food quality in a busy kitchen environment.</p>\n<p>Constructed with heavy-duty stainless steel, the Atosa AGR-36G-NG is built to withstand the rigors of daily use in commercial settings. The stainless steel body is not only durable but also easy to clean, helping maintain hygiene standards. Beneath the griddle, the range includes a spacious oven with adjustable racks, allowing for additional cooking versatility such as baking and roasting. The oven\'s thermostat ensures precise temperature control, which is crucial for achieving perfect cooking results. Additionally, the range comes with adjustable legs for stability on uneven floors, making it a reliable and adaptable addition to any kitchen setup.</p>', '\n\nLarge, polished steel griddle top provides ample cooking space and ensures even heat distribution for consistent cooking results.<br>\n\nMade from durable stainless steel, offering robustness and longevity suitable for demanding commercial kitchen environments.<br>\n\nIncludes a spacious oven with adjustable racks, allowing for versatile cooking options such as baking and roasting, with precise temperature control via a high-quality thermostat.<br>\n\nEquipped with adjustable legs to ensure stability and easy leveling on uneven kitchen floors.<br>\n\nStainless steel construction extends to the body and oven interior, making the range easy to clean and maintain, thereby supporting high hygie