(2048, 'Atosa AGR-6B-NG 36\" CookRite Range Natural Gas, 6 Burners', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa AGR-6B 36\" Gas Range with 6 Burners and Standard Oven is a powerhouse appliance designed for high-demand commercial kitchens. This gas range features six robust burners, each providing ample BTU output to handle various cooking tasks simultaneously, from boiling and sautéing to simmering and frying. The burners are arranged on a 36-inch wide cooktop, offering generous space for multiple pots and pans. Each burner is equipped with a heavy-duty cast iron grate, ensuring durability and excellent heat retention for consistent cooking performance.</p>\n<p>Beneath the cooktop, the Atosa AGR-6B includes a spacious standard oven, adding to the range\'s versatility. The oven is perfect for baking, roasting, and broiling, with adjustable racks to accommodate different dish sizes. Constructed with high-quality stainless steel, the oven interior is designed for easy cleaning and maintenance, while the exterior offers a sleek, professional appearance that enhances any kitchen setting. The oven features a precise thermostat, ensuring accurate temperature control for optimal cooking results. Combined, the six burners and the standard oven make the Atosa AGR-6B a versatile and essential piece of equipment for any commercial kitchen, capable of handling a wide range of culinary tasks with efficiency and reliability.</p>', '\n\nEquipped with six high-output burners, providing ample BTU capacity for various cooking tasks such as boiling, sautéing, simmering, and frying.<br>\n\nMade from heavy-duty stainless steel, ensuring durability and longevity in demanding commercial kitchen environments. The burners feature heavy-duty cast iron grates for excellent heat retention and durability.<br>\n\nIncludes a standard oven beneath the cooktop, offering versatility for baking, roasting, and broiling. The oven comes with adjustable racks to accommodate different dish sizes and cooking needs.<br>\n\nThe oven features a high-quality thermostat, ensuring accurate and consistent temperature control for optimal cooking results.<br>\n\nThe stainless steel construction extends to both the exterior and the oven interior, making the range easy to clean and maintain, which helps maintain high hygiene standards in a busy kitchen.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/AGR-6B-NG_f7498037-beb9-426f-8db9-29594cb8d3ff.webp\"]', 'AGR-6B-NG', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1998, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36.00, NULL, 57.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 568.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:42:45', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/AGR-6B-NG_f7498037-beb9-426f-8db9-29594cb8d3ff.webp', 'physical', '', 1293.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB356\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
