eeds.<br>\n\nThe range is made from high-quality stainless steel, ensuring durability and longevity in demanding commercial kitchen environments. The stainless steel exterior and oven interior are designed for easy cleaning and maintenance.<br>\n\nThe oven features a reliable thermostat, providing accurate and consistent temperature control for optimal cooking results.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/AGR-4B-NG_6c293f55-1268-4d1a-8c3b-6b19d74e39e6.webp\"]', 'AGR-4B-NG', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1853, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 57.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 428.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:42:47', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/AGR-4B-NG_6c293f55-1268-4d1a-8c3b-6b19d74e39e6.webp', 'physical', '', 1199.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB358\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '');
