(2051, 'Atosa AGR-4B-LP 24 \" CookRite Range Liquid Propane Gas, 4 Burners', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa AGR-4B 24\" Gas Range with 4 Burners and Standard Oven is a compact yet powerful appliance designed for efficiency and versatility in commercial kitchens. This gas range features four high-performance burners, each capable of delivering substantial BTU output to meet various cooking needs. The burners are arranged on a 24-inch wide cooktop, offering enough space for multiple pots and pans while maximizing kitchen workspace. Each burner is equipped with a durable cast iron grate, ensuring long-lasting performance and excellent heat distribution for consistent cooking results.</p>\n<p>Below the cooktop, the Atosa AGR-4B boasts a spacious standard oven, enhancing its versatility. The oven is perfect for baking, roasting, and broiling, with adjustable racks that can accommodate different dish sizes and cooking requirements. Constructed with high-quality stainless steel, both the oven interior and the range exterior are designed for easy cleaning and maintenance. The stainless steel exterior not only ensures durability but also adds a sleek, professional look to any kitchen setting. Additionally, the oven features a precise thermostat for accurate temperature control, ensuring optimal cooking outcomes. This combination of powerful burners and a versatile oven makes the Atosa AGR-4B an essential addition to any commercial kitchen, capable of handling a wide range of culinary tasks efficiently.</p>', '\n\nEquipped with four powerful burners, providing ample BTU output for a variety of cooking tasks, including boiling, sautéing, simmering, and frying.<br>\n\nThe burners feature heavy-duty cast iron grates that ensure excellent heat retention and durability for consistent cooking performance.<br>\n\nIncludes a standard oven beneath the cooktop, perfect for baking, roasting, and broiling. The oven comes with adjustable racks to accommodate different dish sizes and cooking needs.<br>\n\nThe range is made from high-quality stainless steel, ensuring durability and longevity in demanding commercial kitchen environments. The stainless steel exterior and oven interior are designed for easy cleaning and maintenance.<br>\n\nThe oven features a reliable thermostat, providing accurate and consistent temperature control for optimal cooking results.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/AGR-4B-LP_77c6d1a8-3784-484d-a724-92523ec3bfaa.webp\"]', 'AGR-4B-LP', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1853, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 57.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 428.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:42:48', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/AGR-4B-LP_77c6d1a8-3784-484d-a724-92523ec3bfaa.webp', 'physical', '', 1199.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB359\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2052, 'Atosa SSTW-3048 48\" Stainless Steel Work Table with Undershelf 18-Gauge', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa SSTW-3048 is a 48-inch stainless steel work table designed to provide durability and functionality in commercial kitchen environments. Crafted from 18-gauge stainless steel, this work table is built to withstand the demands of daily use while maintaining a sleek and professional appearance. The stainless steel construction ensures resistance to corrosion, stains, and rust, making it ideal for food preparation and other kitchen tasks. The table\'s smooth surface is easy to clean, promoting a hygienic workspace that meets the high standards required in professional kitchens.</p>\n<p>In addition to its robust top, the Atosa SSTW-3048 features an undershelf that offers additional storage space, optimizing kitchen organization. This undershelf is adjustable, allowing for customization based on specific storage needs, and is also made from stainless steel, ensuring the same level of durability as the tabletop. The table is equipped with sturdy legs that provide stability and support, and adjustable bullet feet to accommodate uneven floors. This combination of strength, practicality, and ease of maintenance makes the Atosa SSTW-3048 a reliable and essential piece of equipment for any commercial kitchen.</p>', '\n\nMade from 18-gauge stainless steel, the table offers durability and resistance to corrosion, ensuring long-lasting use in commercial kitchen environments.<br>\n\nThe 48-inch wide tabletop provides a generous workspace, accommodating various kitchen tasks such as food preparation, equipment placement, and more.<br>\n\nEquipped with an adjustable stainless steel undershelf, offering additional storage space for kitchen tools, equipment, and supplies, helping to keep the workspace organized and efficient.<br>\n\nThe table features strong, stainless steel legs with adjustable bullet feet, providing stability and allowing for height adjustments to ensure a level surface on uneven floors.<br>\n\nThe smooth stainless steel surface is easy to clean and maintain, promoting high hygiene standards in a busy kitchen environment.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/SSTW-3048_5412a32f-adc5-4bb0-aa30-295a142bde09.webp\"]', 'SSTW-3048', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 404, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 62.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:42:49', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/SSTW-3048_5412a32f-adc5-4bb0-aa30-295a142bde09.webp', 'physical', '', 177.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB360\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2053, 'Atosa MGF36RGR 36.31\" Undercounter Refrigerator 8.7 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MGF36RGR is a 36.31-inch undercounter refrigerator with a storage capacity of 8.7 cubic feet, designed to meet the needs of commercial kitchens. Its compact size allows it to fit conveniently under counters, making it ideal for establishments with limited space. The exterior and interior are constructed from high-quality stainless steel, ensuring durability and easy cleaning, which is essential in maintaining a hygienic environment. The unit is equipped with a heavy-duty Embraco compressor, which provides efficient cooling performance while minimizing energy consumption and noise levels.</p>\n<p>The MGF36RGR features a digital temperature control system that allows for precise temperature management, ensuring that food items are stored at optimal conditions. The interior is designed with adjustable shelves to accommodate various sizes of products, enhancing flexibility in storage. The self-closing doors help in maintaining the internal temperature and also feature a stay-open mechanism for ease of use during loading and unloading. Additionally, the refrigerator is equipped with casters, allowing for easy mobility and positioning within the kitchen. This combination of efficiency, durability, and practical design makes the Atosa MGF36RGR a valuable addition to any commercial kitchen setup.</p>', '\n\nHigh-quality stainless steel exterior and interior for durability and easy cleaning.<br>\n\nHeavy-duty compressor for efficient cooling performance and reduced energy consumption.<br>\n\nPrecise temperature management system to ensure optimal storage conditions.<br>\n\nFlexible storage with adjustable shelves to accommodate various product sizes.<br>\n\nSelf-closing doors with a stay-open feature and casters for easy mobility and positioning.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MGF36RGR_6b8cf48e-e8f1-4d11-a775-808887a13351.webp\"]', 'MGF36RGR', 0, 