(2054, 'Atosa MGF36FGR 36.38\" Undercounter Freezer 8.7 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MGF36FGR is a 36.38-inch undercounter freezer with an 8.7 cubic feet capacity, specifically designed to meet the rigorous demands of commercial kitchens. This freezer is constructed from high-quality stainless steel, both inside and out, ensuring durability, resistance to corrosion, and ease of cleaning. The robust design makes it a reliable addition to any foodservice establishment, offering a sleek and professional look that complements any kitchen decor. The compact size allows it to fit conveniently under counters, maximizing kitchen space and providing easy access to frozen goods.</p>\n<p>Equipped with a powerful Embraco compressor and utilizing environmentally friendly R290 refrigerant, the Atosa MGF36FGR delivers efficient and consistent cooling performance while minimizing energy consumption. The digital temperature control system ensures precise temperature management, keeping stored items at optimal freezing conditions. The interior features adjustable shelves, allowing for flexible storage options to accommodate a variety of product sizes. The self-closing doors help maintain the internal temperature and include a stay-open feature for convenience during loading and unloading. Additionally, the freezer is mounted on casters, enabling easy mobility and repositioning within the kitchen. This combination of efficiency, durability, and practical design makes the Atosa MGF36FGR an excellent choice for commercial kitchens seeking reliable undercounter freezing solutions.</p>', '\n\nHigh-quality stainless steel exterior and interior for long-lasting durability and easy maintenance.<br>\n\nEquipped with a heavy-duty Embraco compressor and environmentally friendly R290 refrigerant for efficient and consistent freezing performance.<br>\n\nAllows precise temperature adjustments to maintain optimal freezing conditions.<br>\n\nInterior shelves are adjustable, providing flexibility to store various sizes of products.<br>\n\nFeatures self-closing doors with a stay-open mechanism and casters for easy mobility and positioning in the kitchen.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MGF36FGR_3f18d072-60a8-465e-aa7f-f28c6d56c505.webp\"]', 'MGF36FGR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2270, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 222.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:42:52', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MGF36FGR_3f18d072-60a8-465e-aa7f-f28c6d56c505.webp', 'physical', '', 1442, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB362\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2055, 'Atosa SBB69GGRAUS2 68\"  Shallow Depth Double Glass Door Back Bar Cooler 18.6 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa SBB69GGRAUS2 is a 68-inch shallow depth double glass door back bar cooler with an 18.6 cubic feet capacity, designed to meet the needs of commercial bars and restaurants. Its sleek and modern design features double glass doors that enhance the aesthetic appeal and allow for easy visibility of stored beverages. This makes it convenient for bartenders to quickly identify and access drinks while showcasing the variety of beverages to customers. The shallow depth design is particularly advantageous for establishments with limited space, maximizing storage capacity without occupying excessive room.</p>\n<p>Built with a high-quality stainless steel interior and exterior, the Atosa SBB69GGRAUS2 ensures durability and ease of maintenance. The stainless steel construction also provides a professional and clean look that complements any bar setting. The cooler is equipped with a powerful Embraco compressor and utilizes environmentally friendly R290 refrigerant, delivering consistent and efficient cooling performance. The digital temperature control system allows for precise temperature adjustments, ensuring beverages are kept at optimal serving temperatures. This combination of efficiency, durability, and stylish design makes the Atosa SBB69GGRAUS2 a reliable and attractive choice for any commercial bar or restaurant.</p>', '\n\nAllows for easy visibility of contents while maintaining optimal cooling and showcasing beverages attractively.<br>\n\nThe shallow depth design maximizes space efficiency, making it ideal for bars with limited space.<br>\n\nConstructed with high-quality stainless steel interior and exterior for durability, easy cleaning, and a professional appearance.<br>\n\nEquipped with a powerful Embraco compressor and environmentally friendly R290 refrigerant for consistent and energy-efficient cooling.<br>\n\nFeatures a digital temperature control system for precise temperature management, ensuring beverages are kept at optimal serving temperatures.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/SBB69GGRAUS2_9feb40b3-c2e6-4db2-b26e-2c28f7d8353f.webp\"]', 'SBB69GGRAUS2', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2889, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 68.00, NULL, 40.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 150.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:42:53', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/SBB69GGRAUS2_9feb40b3-c2e6-4db2-b26e-2c28f7d8353f.webp', 'physical', '', 1810.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB363\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2056, 'Atosa SBB59GGRAUS2 57.75\" Shallow Depth Double Glass Door Back Bar Cooler 15 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa SBB59GGRAUS2 is a 57.75-inch shallow depth double glass door back bar cooler with a 15 cubic feet capacity, designed for efficient and stylish beverage storage in commercial settings. Its sleek design features double glass doors that provide clear visibility of the interior, making it easy for bartenders to quickly locate and access drinks. This visibility also serves to attractively display the variety of beverages available to customers, enhancing the overall aesthetic of the bar area. The shallow depth design is particularly useful for bars and restaurants with limited space, ensuring that the cooler does not take up excessive room while still providing ample storage capacity.</p>\n<p>Constructed with a high-quality stainless steel interior and exterior, the Atosa SBB59GGRAUS2 ensures durability and ease of maintenance, while also presenting a professional and polished appearance. The stainless steel construction is resistant to corrosion and easy to clean, making it ideal for the demanding environment of a busy bar. Equipped with a powerful Embraco compressor and utilizing environmentally friendly R290 refrigerant, this cooler delivers consistent and efficient cooling performance. The digital temperature control system allows for precise temperature adjustments, ensuring that beverages are kept at their optimal serving temperatures. This combination of robust construction, efficient cooling, and attractive design makes the Atosa SBB59GGRAUS2 an excellent choice for any commercial bar or restaurant looking to optimize their beverage storage and display.</p>', '\n\nAllows for easy visibility and attractive display of beverages stored inside the cooler.<br>\n\nMaximizes storage capacity while minimizing the footprint, making it ideal for bars or establishments with limited space.<br>\n\nBoth interior and exterior are constructed from high-quality stainless steel, ensuring durability, resistance to corrosion, and easy cleaning.<br>\n\nEquipped with a powerful Embraco compressor and utilizes environmentally friendly R290 refrigerant for efficient and consistent cooling performance.<br>\n\nFeatures a digital display and control for precise temperature management, ensuring beverages are kept at optimal serving temperatures.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/SBB59GGRAUS2_ced6a3a5-db03-454f-8858-9bd895a893a2.webp\"]', 'SBB59GGRAUS2', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2658, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 58.00, NULL, 40.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 150.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:42:54', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/SBB59GGRAUS2_ced6a3a5-db03-454f-8858-9bd895a893a2.webp', 'physical', '', 1667, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB364\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2057, 'Atosa SBB48GGRAUS2 48\" Shallow Depth Double Glass Door Back Bar Cooler 11.5  Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa SBB48GGRAUS2 is a 48-inch shallow depth double glass door back bar cooler with a capacity of 11.5 cubic feet, designed specifically for efficient and stylish beverage storage in commercial environments. Its compact design with double glass doors allows for excellent visibility of beverages, making it easy for bartenders to locate and access drinks quickly. This visibility also serves to enhance the presentation of beverages to customers, contributing to the overall appeal of the bar area. The shallow depth of the cooler is particularly beneficial for establishments with limited space, as it maximizes storage capacity without occupying excessive room.</p>\n<p>Constructed with a durable stainless steel interior and exterior, the Atosa SBB48GGRAUS2 ensures longevity and ease of maintenance in busy bar settings. Stainless steel is known for its resistance to corrosion and ease of cleaning, making it an ideal choice for environments where cleanliness and durability are paramount. The cooler is equipped with a powerful Embraco compressor and utilizes environmentally friendly R290 refrigerant, ensuring efficient and reliable cooling performance. A digital temperature control system allows precise adjustment of the internal temperature, ensuring that beverages are stored at optimal serving conditions. Overall, the Atosa SBB48GGRAUS2 combines durability, efficiency, and sleek design to meet the needs of commercial bars looking to enhance their beverage storage capabilities.</p>', '\n\nMaximizes storage capacity while occupying minimal space, ideal for establishments with limited room.<br>\n\nBoth the interior and exterior are constructed from stainless steel, ensuring durability, resistance to corrosion, and easy maintenance.<br>\n\nEquipped with a powerful Embraco compressor and uses environmentally friendly R290 refrigerant for efficient and consistent cooling performance.<br>\n\nAllows for precise temperature adjustments to maintain beverages at optimal serving temperatures.<br>\n\nEnhances visibility inside the cooler and showcases beverages effectively without adding heat.<br>Interior shelves are adjustable to accommodate various sizes of bottles and cans, providing flexibility in storage options.<br>\n\nHelps maintain internal temperatures and energy efficiency, with a stay-open feature for convenient loading and unloading.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/SBB48GGRAUS2_1a4236cb-727c-4ebf-8cd8-adbd86355c86.webp\"]', 'SBB48GGRAUS2', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2312, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48.00, NULL, 40.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 150.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:42:56', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/SBB48GGRAUS2_1a4236cb-727c-4ebf-8cd8-adbd86355c86.webp', 'physical', '', 1547, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB365\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2058, 'Atosa AGR-10B-NG 60\" CookRite Range Natural Gas, 10 Burners', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa AGR-10B is a robust 60-inch gas range designed for high-performance cooking in commercial kitchens. Featuring 10 burners and a standard oven, this range offers ample cooking capacity to handle large volumes of food preparation efficiently. Each burner is equipped with heavy-duty cast iron grates that provide stability for pots and pans while ensuring even heat distribution. This setup is ideal for busy kitchens where simultaneous cooking of multiple dishes is necessary.</p>\n<p>Constructed from durable stainless steel, both the exterior and interior of the Atosa AGR-10B are designed to withstand the rigors of daily use in a commercial environment. Stainless steel is not only resistant to corrosion and easy to clean but also presents a sleek and professional appearance that complements any kitchen decor. The oven below the burners is spacious and equipped with a thermostat control for precise temperature regulation, allowing chefs to bake, roast, or broil with consistency. Overall, the Atosa AGR-10B combines durability, functionality, and efficiency, making it a reliable choice for restaurants, hotels, and other foodservice establishments seeking a versatile gas range for their kitchen operations.</p>', '\n\nProvides ample cooking space and flexibility for preparing multiple dishes simultaneously, ideal for high-volume kitchens.<br>\n\nEach burner is equipped with sturdy cast iron grates that ensure stability for pots and pans while allowing for even heat distribution.<br>\n\nBoth the exterior and interior are constructed from stainless steel, offering durability, resistance to corrosion, and easy cleaning.<br>\n\nSpacious oven below the burners equipped with a thermostat control for precise temperature regulation during baking, roasting, or broiling.<br>\n\nSimple and intuitive manual controls for each burner and the oven, allowing for easy operation and adjustment of cooking settings.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/AGR-10B-NG_02da201b-055b-4092-a97b-f967ccf8d9ba.webp\"]', 'AGR-10B-NG', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 3805, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 60.00, NULL, 57.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 897.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:42:56', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/AGR-10B-NG_02da201b-055b-4092-a97b-f967ccf8d9ba.webp', 'physical', '', 2462.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB366\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2059, 'Atosa SBB69GRAUS2 68\" Shallow Depth Double Solid Door Back Bar Cooler 18.6  Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa SBB69GRAUS2 is a 68-inch shallow depth double solid door back bar cooler designed for efficient and convenient beverage storage in commercial settings. With a capacity of 18.6 cubic feet, it offers ample space to store a wide range of beverages while minimizing the footprint in busy bar areas. The solid doors provide excellent insulation to maintain consistent temperatures inside, ensuring that beverages are kept at their optimal serving conditions. This design not only helps in energy efficiency but also enhances the cooler\'s ability to maintain cold temperatures in high-demand environments.</p>\n<p>Constructed with a durable stainless steel interior and exterior, the Atosa SBB69GRAUS2 is built to withstand the rigors of daily use in bars and restaurants. Stainless steel is known for its resistance to corrosion, ease of cleaning, and sleek appearance, making it an ideal choice for environments where hygiene and aesthetics are crucial. The cooler is equipped with a powerful Embraco compressor and utilizes environmentally friendly R290 refrigerant, ensuring efficient cooling performance while minimizing environmental impact. Overall, the Atosa SBB69GRAUS2 combines durability, efficiency, and practical design to meet the needs of commercial establishments looking to optimize beverage storage and display.</p>', '\n\nProvides excellent insulation to maintain consistent temperatures inside the cooler.<br>\n\nMaximizes storage capacity while occupying minimal space, ideal for bars and restaurants with limited room.<br>\n\nDurable stainless steel interior and exterior for longevity, easy maintenance, and a professional appearance.<br>\n\nEquipped with a powerful Embraco compressor and uses environmentally friendly R290 refrigerant for efficient and reliable cooling performance.<br>\n\nAllows precise temperature adjustments to ensure beverages are stored at optimal serving temperatures.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/SBB69GRAUS2_fa3b48d2-e9dd-4a22-bde7-bc72121a9b86.webp\"]', 'SBB69GRAUS2', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2796, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 68.00, NULL, 40.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 150.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:42:58', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/SBB69GRAUS2_fa3b48d2-e9dd-4a22-bde7-bc72121a9b86.webp', 'physical', '', 1753.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB367\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2060, 'Atosa SBB59GRAUS2 57.75\" Shallow Depth Double Solid Door Back Bar Cooler 15 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa SBB59GRAUS2 is a 57.75-inch shallow depth double solid door back bar cooler designed to meet the refrigeration needs of commercial bars and restaurants efficiently. With a spacious 15 cubic feet capacity, it provides ample storage for a variety of beverages while maintaining a compact footprint, making it ideal for establishments with limited space. The solid door design ensures excellent insulation, helping to preserve cold temperatures inside the cooler and reduce energy consumption. This feature is particularly advantageous in high-traffic areas where frequent access to beverages is necessary without compromising cooling efficiency.</p>\n<p>Constructed with a durable stainless steel interior and exterior, the Atosa SBB59GRAUS2 is built to withstand the demands of a busy commercial environment. Stainless steel not only ensures durability and resistance to corrosion but also facilitates easy cleaning and maintains a sleek and professional appearance in the bar setting. The cooler is equipped with a reliable Embraco compressor and utilizes environmentally friendly R290 refrigerant, providing efficient cooling performance while minimizing environmental impact. Overall, the Atosa SBB59GRAUS2 combines durability, efficiency, and practical design to enhance beverage storage and presentation in commercial establishments.</p>', '\n\nProvides excellent insulation to maintain consistent temperatures inside the cooler, enhancing energy efficiency.<br>\n\nMaximizes storage capacity while minimizing the space required, ideal for bars and restaurants with limited room.<br>\n\nDurable stainless steel interior and exterior ensure longevity, ease of cleaning, and a professional look.<br>\n\nEquipped with a powerful Embraco compressor and uses environmentally friendly R290 refrigerant for efficient and reliable cooling.<br>\n\nInterior shelves are adjustable to accommodate different sizes of bottles and cans, providing flexibility in storage options.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/SBB59GRAUS2_9a9406d4-db92-435d-a285-d58b1494df08.webp\"]', 'SBB59GRAUS2', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2382, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 58.00, NULL, 40.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 150.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:42:59', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/SBB59GRAUS2_9a9406d4-db92-435d-a285-d58b1494df08.webp', 'physical', '', 1509, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB368\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2061, 'Atosa SBB48GRAUS2 48\" Shallow Depth Double Solid Door Back Bar Cooler 11.5 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa SBB48GRAUS2 is a versatile 48-inch shallow depth double solid door back bar cooler designed to meet the refrigeration needs of commercial establishments efficiently. With a capacity of 11.5 cubic feet, this cooler offers ample storage space for a variety of beverages while minimizing its footprint in busy bar environments. The solid door design not only enhances insulation but also helps maintain consistent internal temperatures, ensuring that beverages are kept chilled and ready for serving at all times. This feature is essential for bars where quick access to cold drinks is crucial during peak hours.</p>\n<p>Constructed with a robust stainless steel interior and exterior, the Atosa SBB48GRAUS2 is built to withstand the demands of daily use in commercial settings. Stainless steel ensures durability, resists corrosion, and is easy to clean, making it an ideal choice for maintaining hygiene standards in bustling bar environments. Equipped with an efficient compressor and utilizing environmentally friendly R290 refrigerant, this cooler delivers reliable cooling performance while minimizing environmental impact. Overall, the Atosa SBB48GRAUS2 combines durability, efficiency, and practical design to optimize beverage storage and presentation in bars and restaurants.</p>', '\n\nProvides excellent insulation to maintain consistent temperatures inside the cooler.<br>Maximizes storage capacity while occupying minimal space, making it ideal for bars and restaurants with limited room.<br>\n\nDurable stainless steel interior and exterior ensure durability, resistance to corrosion, and easy maintenance.<br>\n\nEquipped with a powerful compressor and utilizes environmentally friendly R290 refrigerant for efficient and reliable cooling performance.<br>Interior shelves are adjustable to accommodate various sizes of bottles and cans, providing flexibility in storage options.<br>\n\nAllows precise temperature adjustments to ensure beverages are stored at optimal serving temperatures.<br>\n\nEnhances visibility inside the cooler and showcases beverages effectively without adding extra heat.<br>Helps maintain internal temperatures and energy efficiency, with a stay-open feature for convenient loading and unloading.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/SBB48GRAUS2_890da5d1-e97e-4619-b637-0c833c38f9e9.webp\"]', 'SBB48GRAUS2', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2095, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48.00, NULL, 40.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 150.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:43:00', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/SBB48GRAUS2_890da5d1-e97e-4619-b637-0c833c38f9e9.webp', 'physical', '', 1401, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB369\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2062, 'Atosa CSTEB-5C 72.5\" 3750W/240V  Electric Steam Table, 5 Open Wells', '\n<p>The Atosa CSTEB-5C is a robust 72.5-inch electric steam table designed for commercial kitchens that require efficient and consistent food warming capabilities. It features five open wells, each equipped to hold standard-size food pans, making it versatile for holding various dishes simultaneously. This setup is ideal for buffet lines, catering events, or busy restaurants where keeping food at optimal serving temperatures is essential. The steam table operates at 3750 watts with a 240-volt electrical connection, ensuring powerful heating to maintain food warmth throughout service periods.</p>\n<p>Constructed with a durable stainless steel exterior and interior, the Atosa CSTEB-5C is built to endure the rigors of daily use in commercial settings. Stainless steel not only enhances durability but also facilitates easy cleaning and maintenance, crucial for maintaining hygiene standards in busy kitchens. Each well is individually controlled by thermostatic knobs, allowing precise temperature adjustments for different food items. This level of control ensures that each dish is kept at its ideal serving temperature, enhancing food quality and customer satisfaction. Overall, the Atosa CSTEB-5C combines durability, efficiency, and precise temperature control, making it a reliable choice for any foodservice establishment needing dependable food warming solutions.</p>', '\n\nAccommodates standard-size food pans, providing versatility for holding a variety of dishes simultaneously.<br>\n\nOperates at 3750 watts with a 240-volt electrical connection, ensuring powerful and consistent heating to maintain food at optimal serving temperatures.<br>\n\nDurable stainless steel exterior and interior construction for longevity, ease of cleaning, and maintaining hygiene standards.<br>\n\nEach well is equipped with its own thermostatic knob for precise temperature management of different food items.<br>\n\nProvides visual indication when the steam table is operational, helping kitchen staff monitor its status.<br>\n\nAllows for easy leveling and stability on uneven surfaces, ensuring the steam table remains steady during use.<br>\n\nDesigned to maximize space efficiency while offering ample capacity for food storage and warming, ideal for busy commercial kitchens.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/CSTEB-5C_96c92b0f-3f2d-4239-b511-b8426d27d2c4.webp\"]', 'CSTEB-5C', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1897, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 73.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 168.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:43:02', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/CSTEB-5C_96c92b0f-3f2d-4239-b511-b8426d27d2c4.webp', 'physical', '', 1204, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB370\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2063, 'Atosa CSTEA-4 2000W/120V Electric Steam Table, 4 Open Wells', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa CSTEA-4 Electric Steam Table is a compact yet efficient solution for commercial kitchens needing reliable food warming capabilities. Featuring four open wells, this steam table is designed to accommodate standard-size food pans, making it versatile for holding a variety of dishes simultaneously. With a heating capacity of 2000 watts and operating at 120 volts, it provides sufficient power to maintain consistent food temperatures during service periods, ideal for buffet setups, catering events, or restaurants with diverse menu offerings.</p>\n<p>Constructed with a durable stainless steel exterior and interior, the Atosa CSTEA-4 ensures durability and easy maintenance in busy kitchen environments. Stainless steel not only enhances longevity but also facilitates quick cleanup after use, crucial for maintaining food hygiene standards. Each well is equipped with individual thermostatic controls, allowing precise temperature adjustments for different food items. This feature enables chefs to ensure that each dish is kept at its optimal serving temperature, preserving food quality and ensuring customer satisfaction. Overall, the Atosa CSTEA-4 combines compact design, efficiency, and precise temperature control to meet the needs of commercial kitchens seeking reliable food warming solutions.</p>', '\n\nAccommodates standard-size food pans, providing versatility for holding various dishes simultaneously.<br>\n\nOperates at 2000 watts with a 120-volt electrical connection, ensuring efficient heating to maintain consistent food temperatures.<br>\n\nDurable stainless steel exterior and interior for longevity, ease of cleaning, and maintaining food hygiene.<br>\n\nEach well is equipped with its own temperature control knob for precise adjustment according to different food requirements.<br>\n\nIndicates when the steam table is operational, allowing for easy monitoring and management during