(2064, 'Atosa CSTEA-3 1500W/120V Electric Steam Table, 3 Open Wells', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa CSTEA-3 Electric Steam Table is a compact and efficient solution designed to keep food warm and ready for service in commercial kitchens. With three open wells, each capable of accommodating standard-size food pans, this steam table offers versatility for holding a variety of dishes simultaneously. Operating at 1500 watts and utilizing a standard 120-volt electrical connection, it provides ample heating power to maintain consistent food temperatures throughout service, making it suitable for buffet lines, catering events, or restaurants with diverse menu offerings.</p>\n<p>Built with a durable stainless steel exterior and interior, the Atosa CSTEA-3 ensures longevity and ease of maintenance in busy kitchen environments. Stainless steel construction not only enhances durability but also simplifies cleaning, crucial for maintaining food hygiene standards. Each well is equipped with individual thermostatic controls, allowing precise temperature adjustments tailored to different food types and ensuring optimal serving conditions. The compact design of the CSTEA-3 makes it an ideal choice for establishments with limited space, while its efficient heating capabilities and reliable performance contribute to seamless food service operations.</p>', '\n\nAccommodates standard-size food pans, providing flexibility for holding various dishes simultaneously.<br>\n\nOperates at 1500 watts with a standard 120-volt electrical connection, ensuring efficient and reliable heating.<br>\n\nDurable stainless steel exterior and interior for longevity, ease of cleaning, and maintaining food hygiene standards.<br>\n\nEach well is equipped with its own temperature control knob, allowing precise adjustments for different types of food.<br>\n\nIndicates when the steam table is operational, providing visual confirmation during use.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/CSTEA-3_fc661542-1237-45c2-9465-25677b3d1ac1.webp\"]', 'CSTEA-3', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1274, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 44.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 104.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:43:04', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/CSTEA-3_fc661542-1237-45c2-9465-25677b3d1ac1.webp', 'physical', '', 808.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB372\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2065, 'Atosa AGR-4B36G-NG 60\" CookRite Range Natural Gas with 36\" Griddle', '\n<p>The Atosa AGR-4B36G is a robust 60-inch gas range designed for high-performance cooking in commercial kitchens. It features four powerful burners complemented by a spacious 36-inch griddle, offering extensive cooking space to handle diverse culinary tasks simultaneously. The burners are equipped with heavy-duty cast iron grates that provide stability for cookware and ensure even heat distribution, essential for achieving consistent cooking results. This setup is ideal for restaurants, diners, and other food service establishments where efficient cooking capacity is crucial during peak hours.</p>\n<p>Constructed with a durable stainless steel exterior and interior, the Atosa AGR-4B36G is built to withstand the demands of daily use in busy kitchen environments. Stainless steel enhances durability, resists corrosion, and facilitates easy cleaning, maintaining hygiene standards effortlessly. The 36-inch griddle expands cooking options, allowing chefs to prepare a wide range of items such as pancakes, eggs, and burgers with precision and efficiency. Manual controls for each burner and the griddle provide operators with precise heat management, ensuring optimal cooking conditions for various menu items. Overall, the Atosa AGR-4B36G combines durability, versatility, and high-capacity cooking capabilities to meet the needs of commercial kitchens seeking reliable and efficient cooking equipment.</p>', '\n\nProvides ample cooking space and flexibility for preparing multiple dishes simultaneously, suitable for high-volume cooking environments.<br>\n\nSpacious cooking surface for preparing a variety of foods such as pancakes, eggs, and burgers, enhancing menu versatility.<br>\n\nDurable stainless steel exterior and interior for longevity, resistance to corrosion, and ease of cleaning.<br>\n\nEnsures stability for pots and pans while distributing heat evenly, essential for consistent cooking results.<br>\n\nIntuitive controls for each burner and griddle, allowing for precise heat adjustments tailored to different cooking needs.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/AGR-4B36G_c8a24e2d-c929-4d9c-8a21-a207d586868c.webp\"]', 'AGR-4B36G-NG', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 4369, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 60.00, NULL, 57.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 949.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:43:05', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/AGR-4B36G_c8a24e2d-c929-4d9c-8a21-a207d586868c.webp', 'physical', '', 2828, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB373\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
