ing results.<br>\n\nIntuitive controls for each burner and griddle, allowing for precise heat adjustments tailored to different cooking needs.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/AGR-4B36G_1f58c75f-abb5-4d94-897c-bc27483f1d9b.webp\"]', 'AGR-4B36G-LP', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 4369, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 60.00, NULL, 57.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 949.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:43:07', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/AGR-4B36G_1f58c75f-abb5-4d94-897c-bc27483f1d9b.webp', 'physical', '', 2828, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB374\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '');
