(2067, 'Atosa AGR-6B24G-NG 60\" CookRite Range Natural Gas with 24\" Griddle', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa AGR-6B24G is a versatile 60-inch gas range designed to meet the demands of commercial kitchens requiring robust cooking capabilities. This model features six burners alongside a substantial 24-inch griddle, offering ample cooking space and flexibility for preparing a wide range of dishes simultaneously. The burners are equipped with heavy-duty cast iron grates that provide stability for pots and pans while ensuring even heat distribution, essential for achieving consistent cooking results in a high-volume kitchen setting.</p>\n<p>Constructed with a durable stainless steel exterior and interior, the Atosa AGR-6B24G is built to withstand the rigors of daily use in busy kitchens. Stainless steel not only enhances durability but also simplifies cleaning and maintenance, maintaining hygiene standards effortlessly. The 24-inch griddle adds versatility, allowing chefs to prepare items like pancakes, eggs, and burgers with precision and efficiency. Manual controls for each burner and the griddle provide operators with straightforward adjustments, ensuring precise heat management tailored to the specific cooking needs of different dishes. Overall, the Atosa AGR-6B24G combines durability, versatility, and efficiency, making it a reliable choice for commercial kitchens aiming to optimize their cooking processes.</p>', '\n\nProvides ample cooking space and flexibility for preparing multiple dishes simultaneously, ideal for high-volume cooking environments.<br>\n\nFeatures a spacious griddle for cooking a variety of foods such as pancakes, burgers, and eggs, enhancing versatility in menu preparation.<br>\n\nDurable stainless steel exterior and interior ensure longevity, resistance to corrosion, and ease of cleaning.<br>\n\nEquipped with powerful burners and a robust griddle burner, providing efficient and even heat distribution for consistent cooking results.<br>\n\nSimple and intuitive manual controls for each burner and the griddle, allowing for precise heat adjustments and easy operation in busy kitchens.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/AGR-6B24G_2986d913-d53a-466b-9a76-9a476b0378d9.webp\"]', 'AGR-6B24G-NG', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 4309, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 60.00, NULL, 57.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 941.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:43:08', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/AGR-6B24G_2986d913-d53a-466b-9a76-9a476b0378d9.webp', 'physical', '', 2789.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB375\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
