(2069, 'Atosa AGR-2B24GR-NG 36\" CookRite Range Natural Gas With 24\" Griddle', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa AGR-2B24GR 36\" Gas Range with 24\" Griddle is designed to cater to the rigorous demands of commercial kitchens, offering a versatile cooking platform with a combination of burners and a spacious griddle. Constructed from durable stainless steel, this gas range ensures longevity and ease of maintenance, crucial for maintaining hygiene standards in busy environments. The unit features two powerful gas burners alongside a centrally located 24-inch griddle, providing chefs with the flexibility to simultaneously prepare a variety of dishes from stir-fries and steaks to breakfast items like pancakes and eggs.</p>\n<p>Each burner and the griddle on the Atosa AGR-2B24GR is equipped with individual manual controls, allowing precise adjustment of heat levels tailored to different cooking requirements. This setup enhances operational efficiency, enabling chefs to manage multiple cooking tasks efficiently and maintain consistency in food preparation. The griddle itself is designed with a smooth cooking surface that distributes heat evenly, ensuring uniform cooking results across the entire surface area. Overall, the Atosa AGR-2B24GR gas range with griddle combines robust construction, versatile cooking options, and efficient performance to meet the diverse needs of commercial kitchen environments effectively.</p>', '\n\nDurable stainless steel body ensures longevity and easy cleaning, suitable for commercial kitchen use.<br>\n\nProvides ample cooking space while optimizing kitchen layout and workflow.<br>\n\nEquipped with two powerful gas burners for cooking flexibility, ideal for various cooking techniques.<br>\n\nCentrally located griddle top with a smooth cooking surface, allowing for even heat distribution and versatile cooking options like grilling and frying.<br>\n\nBurners and griddle feature independent manual controls for precise heat adjustments tailored to specific cooking needs.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/AGR-2B24GR_3600c115-ac59-4582-bed6-7b26a18b1b90.webp\"]', 'AGR-2B24GR-NG', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2533, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36.00, NULL, 57.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 607.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:43:10', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/AGR-2B24GR_3600c115-ac59-4582-bed6-7b26a18b1b90.webp', 'physical', '', 1609.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB377\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
