(2071, 'Atosa AGR-24G-NG 24\" CookRite Range Natural Gas With Griddle Top', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa AGR-24G 24\" Gas Range with Griddle Tops is a compact yet powerful cooking appliance designed for commercial kitchens seeking efficient and versatile cooking solutions. Built with robust stainless steel, this gas range ensures durability and ease of cleaning, essential for maintaining hygiene standards in busy environments. The unit features two burners and a centrally located griddle top, providing chefs with flexibility to simultaneously cook a variety of dishes such as meats, vegetables, and breakfast items like pancakes and eggs.</p>\n<p>Each burner and the griddle top on the Atosa AGR-24G are equipped with individual manual controls, allowing precise adjustment of heat levels tailored to different cooking requirements. This setup enhances operational efficiency, enabling chefs to manage multiple cooking tasks efficiently. The griddle top is made from durable steel and features a smooth cooking surface that distributes heat evenly, ensuring consistent results across the entire cooking area. Overall, the Atosa AGR-24G gas range with griddle tops combines compact design, durable construction, and versatile cooking capabilities to meet the demands of commercial kitchen environments effectively.</p>', '\n\nDurable stainless steel body ensures longevity and easy cleaning, suitable for commercial kitchen use.<br>\n\n24-inch width makes efficient use of kitchen space while offering versatile cooking capabilities.<br>\n\nEquipped with two powerful gas burners, ideal for boiling, simmering, and sautéing various dishes simultaneously.<br>\n\nFeatures a centrally located griddle top for cooking items like pancakes, eggs, and meats with even heat distribution.<br>\n\nBurners and griddle top have independent manual controls for precise heat adjustments tailored to specific cooking needs.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/AGR-24G-NG_7f827c26-45