(2072, 'Atosa ATSP-18-2L 18\"  Lower Version Stock Pot Stove with 4 Burners', '\n<p><br>The Atosa ATSP-18-2L 18\" Lower Version Stock Pot Stove with 4 Burners is engineered to deliver robust performance in commercial kitchen settings while offering enhanced accessibility and ergonomic benefits. Constructed from durable stainless steel, this stove ensures longevity and ease of maintenance, crucial for maintaining hygiene standards in busy environments. The lower height profile of this model makes it more accessible for chefs and kitchen staff, optimizing comfort and efficiency during use.</p>\n<p>Featuring four powerful gas burners, the Atosa ATSP-18-2L is designed to accommodate large stock pots simultaneously, ideal for preparing large quantities of soups, stews, and sauces. Each burner is equipped with independent manual controls, allowing precise adjustment of heat levels tailored to specific cooking requirements. This versatility is essential in high-demand kitchens where speed and consistency are priorities. Additionally, heavy-duty cast iron grates provide stability and support for the pots, ensuring safe and reliable cooking operations. Overall, the Atosa ATSP-18-2L combines durability, efficiency, and practical design to meet the rigorous demands of commercial cooking environments.</p>', '\n\nDurable stainless steel body ensures longevity and easy cleaning, suitable for commercial kitchen use.<br>\n\nDesigned with a lower height for improved accessibility and ergonomic comfort during operation.<br>\n\nEquipped with four gas burners capable of accommodating large stock pots simultaneously, ideal for high-volume cooking.<br>\n\nEach burner features independent manual controls for precise adjustment of heat levels, allowing versatile cooking options.<br>\n\nIncludes heavy-duty cast iron grates that provide stability and support for large pots, ensuring safety and reliability during cooking.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ATSP-18-2L_c0f5d520-b40a-4e9e-b070-d3e0beff0ade.webp\"]', 'ATSP-18-2L', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 998, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 18.00, NULL, 18.00, NULL, 42.00, NULL, 221.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:43:15', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ATSP-18-2L_c0f5d520-b40a-4e9e-b070-d3e0beff0ade.webp', 'physical', '', 640, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB380\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2073, 'Atosa ATSP-18-1L 18\" Stock Pot Stove with 2 Burners', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa ATSP-18-1L 18\" Lower Version Stock Pot Stove with 2 Burners is a specialized appliance designed for efficient and versatile cooking in commercial kitchens. Built with stainless steel, it ensures durability and ease of cleaning, essential for maintaining hygiene standards in busy environments. This model is specifically designed with a lower height profile compared to standard stock pot stoves, making it more accessible and ergonomic for chefs and kitchen staff.</p>\n<p>Equipped with two powerful gas burners, the Atosa ATSP-18-1L allows for simultaneous cooking of different dishes or larger batches in large stock pots. Each burner features independent manual controls, offering precise heat adjustments tailored to specific cooking requirements. This flexibility is crucial in busy kitchens where efficiency and consistency are paramount. The stove includes heavy-duty cast iron grates that provide stability and support for large pots during cooking, ensuring safety and reliability in high-demand cooking operations. Overall, the Atosa ATSP-18-1L combines robust construction, practical design, and efficient performance to enhance productivity in commercial kitchen settings.</p>', '\n\nDurable stainless steel body ensures longevity and easy cleaning, suitable for commercial kitchen use.<br>\n\nDesigned with a lower height for improved accessibility and ergonomic use in kitchens.<br>\n\nEquipped with two gas burners capable of accommodating large stock pots, ideal for high-volume cooking.<br>\n\nEach burner has independent manual controls, allowing precise adjustment of heat levels for different cooking needs.<br>\n\nFeatures heavy-duty cast iron grates that provide stability and support for large pots during cooking, ensuring safety and reliability.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ATSP-18-1L_5bc25a24-2095-4d64-a2b2-c9f4302789a1.webp\"]', 'ATSP-18-1L', 