(2074, 'Atosa ATSP-18-2 18\" Stock Pot Stove with 4 Burners', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa ATSP-18-2 18\" Stock Pot Stove with 4 Burners is designed for high-capacity cooking in commercial kitchens, offering versatility and efficiency. Built with durable stainless steel, this stock pot stove is robust and easy to maintain, ensuring longevity in demanding kitchen environments. With its compact 18-inch width, it optimizes space while accommodating four powerful gas burners, each equipped to handle large stock pots for boiling, simmering, and preparing large batches of soups, stews, and sauces.</p>\n<p>Each burner on the Atosa ATSP-18-2 features independent manual controls, providing chefs with precise command over heat settings for different cooking requirements. This flexibility enhances operational efficiency and allows for simultaneous cooking of multiple dishes, ideal for busy kitchens where speed and consistency are paramount. Heavy-duty cast iron grates support the weight of large pots securely, ensuring stability during cooking and making it suitable for heavy-duty use. Overall, the Atosa ATSP-18-2 combines robust construction, efficient performance, and practical design to meet the rigorous demands of commercial cooking environments.</p>', '\n\nDurable stainless steel body ensures longevity and ease of cleaning, suitable for commercial kitchen use.<br>\n\nEquipped with four gas burners designed to accommodate large stock pots, ideal for boiling, simmering, and stewing.<br>\n\nEach burner has independent manual controls, allowing precise adjustment of heat levels for versatile cooking options.<br>\n\nFeatures heavy-duty cast iron grates that provide stability and support for large pots during cooking.<br>\n\nCompact 18-inch width makes efficient use of kitchen space while offering high-capacity cooking capabilities, suitable for busy kitchens.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ATSP-18-2_f3c354de-e9f6-4f96-885c-3860e9262b12.webp\"]',