(2075, 'Atosa ATSP-18-1 18\" Stock Pot Stove with 2 Burners', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa ATSP-18-1 18\" Stock Pot Stove with 2 Burners is designed to meet the demanding needs of commercial kitchens, particularly for large-scale cooking operations such as boiling, simmering, and stewing. With its sturdy and compact design, this stock pot stove is crafted from stainless steel, ensuring durability and ease of maintenance. The two burners are powered by gas, offering efficient heat distribution and precise temperature control, crucial for achieving consistent cooking results across various dishes.</p>\n<p>Each burner on the Atosa ATSP-18-1 is equipped to accommodate large stock pots, providing ample space for preparing soups, sauces, and other culinary creations in bulk. The stove features independent manual controls for each burner, allowing chefs to adjust heat levels according to different cooking requirements. This flexibility enhances workflow efficiency in busy kitchen environments, where speed and reliability are essential. Additionally, the stock pot stove includes heavy-duty cast iron grates that support the weight of large pots and ensure stability during cooking, making it a practical choice for commercial kitchens seeking robust equipment to handle intensive cooking tasks.</p>', '\n\nDurable stainless steel construction ensures longevity and ease of cleaning, ideal for busy commercial kitchens.<br>\n\nEquipped with two powerful gas burners designed for heating large stock pots efficiently.<br>\n\nEach burner has independent manual controls, allowing precise adjustment of heat levels for different cooking tasks.<br>\n\nFeatures heavy-duty cast iron grates that provide stability and support for large pots during cooking.<br>\n\nCompact 18-inch width makes it suitable for kitchens with limited space while still accommodating large cooking vessels.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ATSP-18-1_6f6ddfb4-0380-4c2a-8749-d77e5bf6f53f.webp\"]', 'ATSP-18-1', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 543, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 18.00, NULL, 23.00, NULL, 21.00, NULL, 119.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:43:18', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ATSP-18-1_6f6ddfb4-0380-4c2a-8749-d77e5bf6f53f.webp', 'physical', '', 349.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB383\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2076, 'Atosa ATFS-75-NG 75 lb CookRite Fryer Natural Gas Floor Model', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa ATFS-75 Gas Floor Fryer is a robust and efficient addition to commercial kitchens, designed to handle high-volume frying with ease. With a capacity of 75 pounds, this fryer is ideal for restaurants, hotels, and other foodservice establishments that require consistent and reliable frying capabilities. It operates on gas, providing quick heating and precise temperature control, crucial for achieving perfect frying results across various menu items.</p>\n<p>Constructed from stainless steel, the Atosa ATFS-75 ensures durability and is easy to clean, maintaining hygiene standards effortlessly in busy kitchen environments. It features a tube-fired heating system that evenly distributes heat throughout the fryer, ensuring even cooking and crispy textures for fried foods. The fryer also includes two nickel-plated fry baskets with plastic-coated handles for safe and convenient handling of food items. A front-mounted oil drain valve simplifies the process of cleaning and maintaining the fryer, while adjustable stainless steel legs provide stability and allow for leveling on uneven floors. Overall, the Atosa ATFS-75 Gas Floor Fryer combines durability, efficiency, and user-friendly features to meet the demanding needs of commercial frying operations.</p>', '\n\nCapable of holding up to 75 pounds of oil, ideal for high-volume frying in commercial settings.<br>\n\nOperates on natural gas or propane, providing quick heating and precise temperature control for consistent frying results.<br>\n\nBuilt with durable stainless steel, ensuring longevity and ease of cleaning while maintaining hygiene standards.<br>\n\nDistributes heat evenly throughout the fryer for uniform cooking and crispy textures.<br>\n\nIncludes two nickel-plated fry baskets with plastic-coated handles for safe handling of food, along with a front-mounted oil drain valve for easy cleaning and maintenance.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ATFS-75-NG.webp\"]', 'ATFS-75-NG', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1602, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 21.00, NULL, 44.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 200.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:43:19', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ATFS-75-NG.webp', 'physical', '', 1091, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB384\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2077, 'Atosa ATFS-75-LP 75 lb, CookRite Fryer Liquid Propane Gas Floor Model', '<h2>Descriptions<br>\n</h2>\n<p>The Atosa ATFS-75 Gas Floor Fryer is a robust and efficient addition to commercial kitchens, designed to handle high-volume frying with ease. With a capacity of 75 pounds, this fryer is ideal for restaurants, hotels, and other foodservice establishments that require consistent and reliable frying capabilities. It operates on gas, providing quick heating and precise temperature control, crucial for achieving perfect frying results across various menu items.</p>\n<p>Constructed from stainless steel, the Atosa ATFS-75 ensures durability and is easy to clean, maintaining hygiene standards effortlessly in busy kitchen environments. It features a tube-fired heating system that evenly distributes heat throughout the fryer, ensuring even cooking and crispy textures for fried foods. The fryer also includes two nickel-plated fry baskets with plastic-coated handles for safe and convenient handling of food items. A front-mounted oil drain valve simplifies the process of cleaning and maintaining the fryer, while adjustable stainless steel legs provide stability and allow for leveling on uneven floors. Overall, the Atosa ATFS-75 Gas Floor Fryer combines durability, efficiency, and user-friendly features to meet the demanding needs of commercial frying operations.</p>', '\n\nCapable of holding up to 75 pounds of oil, ideal for high-volume frying in commercial settings.<br>\n\nOperates on natural gas or propane, providing quick heating and precise temperature control for consistent frying results.<br>\n\nBuilt with durable stainless steel, ensuring longevity and ease of cleaning while maintaining hygiene standards.<br>\n\nDistributes heat evenly throughout the fryer for uniform cooking and crispy textures.<br>\n\nIncludes two nickel-plated fry baskets with plastic-coated handles for safe handling of food, along with a front-mounted oil drain valve for easy cleaning and maintenance.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ATFS-75-LP.webp\"]', 'ATFS-75-LP', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1602, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:43:20', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ATFS-75-LP.webp', 'physical', '', 1091, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB385\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2078, 'Atosa ATFS-50-LP 50 lb, CookRite Fryer Liquid Propane Gas Floor Model', '\n<p> <br>Standing out for its ability to tackle high-volume food production with ease, the Atosa ATFS-50 Gas Floor Fryer is a workhorse ideally suited for restaurants, cafes, and other demanding commercial kitchens. Its generous 50-lb capacity oil tank allows you to confidently fry large batches of food, whether it\'s golden french fries, crispy chicken wings, or any other deep-fried menu item your customers crave. The Atosa ATFS-50 is crafted from durable, corrosion-resistant stainless steel, guaranteeing longevity and simplifying post-service cleaning routines for your busy kitchen staff.</p>\n<p>Ensuring optimal frying performance, the ATFS-50 incorporates three powerful gas burners with standing pilots for rapid ignition and consistent heat distribution throughout the cooking process. A high-precision thermostat affords you precise control over oil temperatures between 200°F and 400°F, essential for achieving perfectly cooked and consistently crisp results. An innovative oil cooling zone integrated within the tank astutely captures food particles, extending the lifespan of your cooking oil and reducing waste for overall operational cost-effectiveness. For the safety of your staff, the Atosa ATFS-50 comes equipped with a safety valve and automatic voltage stabilization. An additional safety feature includes a self-resetting high-temperature limiting device, providing peace of mind in even the most fast-paced kitchen environments.</p>', '\n\nThe 50-lb capacity oil tank allows for frying large batches of food, perfect for busy restaurants and cafes.<br>\n\nMade entirely from stainless steel, this fryer ensures longevity and simplifies cleaning.<br>\n\nThree gas burners with standing pilots provide quick ignition and even heat distribution for consistent results.<br>\n\nA high-precision thermostat allows you to control oil temperatures between 200°F and 400°F for perfectly cooked food.<br>\n\nIncludes a safety valve, automatic voltage stabilization, and a self-resetting high-temperature limiting device for safe operation.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ATFS-50-LP.webp\"]', 'ATFS-50-LP', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1368, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 16.00, NULL, 44.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:43:21', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ATFS-50-LP.webp', 'physical', '', 930.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB386\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2079, 'Atosa ATFS-40-NG Natural Gas Floor Fryer 40 lb.', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa ATFS-40 Gas Floor Fryer is designed for commercial kitchens seeking efficiency and reliability in frying operations. With a capacity of 40 lbs, it\'s well-suited for medium to high-volume frying applications, making it ideal for restaurants, diners, and other food service establishments. This fryer features a durable stainless steel construction that not only enhances its longevity but also simplifies cleaning and maintenance, crucial in busy kitchen environments where hygiene and efficiency are paramount.</p>\n<p>Equipped with powerful 102,000 BTU burners, the ATFS-40 ensures quick heat-up times and efficient frying, enabling chefs to maintain consistent cooking temperatures for crispy and delicious results. The fryer includes two nickel-plated fry baskets with ergonomic handles, facilitating safe and convenient frying operations. Additionally, it features independent manual controls for each fryer tank, offering flexibility in managing different types of fried foods simultaneously. Overall, the Atosa ATFS-40 Gas Floor Fryer combines robust performance, user-friendly design, and durable construction to meet the demands of commercial frying applications.</p>', '\n\nHolds up to 40 lbs of oil, suitable for medium to high-volume frying needs.<br>\n\n102,000 BTU total output ensures rapid heat-up and efficient frying.<br>\n\nDurable and easy to clean, enhances longevity and maintains hygiene standards.<br>\n\nAllows for simultaneous frying of different foods with independent manual controls.<br>\n\nIncludes two nickel-plated fry baskets with ergonomic handles for safe handling and operation.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ATFS-40-NG.webp\"]', 'ATFS-40-NG', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1068, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 16.00, NULL, 44.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 160.00, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:43:22', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ATFS-40-NG.webp', 'physical', '', 740.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB387\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2080, 'Atosa ATTG-48 48\" Gas Countertop Griddle with Thermostatic Controls 100,000 BTU', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa ATTG-48 is a robust 48\" gas countertop griddle designed for heavy-duty cooking in commercial kitchens. It boasts a powerful 100,000 BTU output, ensuring rapid and uniform heating across its expansive cooking surface. This griddle is equipped with thermostatic controls, allowing chefs precise temperature management for consistent cooking results. Whether searing steaks, grilling vegetables, or preparing breakfast items like pancakes and bacon, the ATTG-48 offers the versatility and power needed to handle diverse menu items efficiently.</p>\n<p>Built with durability in mind, the ATTG-48 features a stainless steel construction that not only enhances its longevity but also facilitates easy cleaning and maintenance. The griddle\'s robust design makes it suitable for continuous use in busy kitchen environments, maintaining performance and appearance over time. Its spacious 48\" cooking area provides ample room for large batches of food, making it ideal for high-volume operations such as restaurants, diners, and catering services. Overall, the Atosa ATTG-48 combines powerful performance, precise control, and durable construction to meet the demands of professional chefs and enhance kitchen productivity.</p>', '\n\nProvides 100,000 BTU for quick and efficient heating, suitable for various cooking tasks.<br>\n\nAllows for precise temperature adjustment, ensuring consistent cooking results.<br>\n\nDurable and easy to clean, ideal for busy commercial kitchens.<br>\n\nSpacious 48\" griddle accommodates multiple items simultaneously, maximizing productivity.<br>\n\nBuilt to withstand frequent use, maintaining performance and appearance over extended periods.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ATTG-48_cd371b86-63fc-47c7-a757-275ab1adebd4.webp\"]', 'ATTG-48', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2637, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48.00, NULL,