(2081, 'Atosa ATTG-36 36\" Gas Countertop Griddle with Thermostatic Controls 75,000 BTU', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa ATTG-36 is a 36\" gas countertop griddle designed for professional kitchens requiring precise temperature control and high-performance cooking. With a total output of 75,000 BTU, this griddle ensures efficient heating, allowing for quick and even cooking of a variety of foods. The thermostatic controls provide chefs with the ability to set and maintain specific temperatures, ensuring consistent results for dishes like pancakes, burgers, eggs, and more. This precise control makes it ideal for busy kitchens that need to deliver consistent quality with every order.</p>\n<p>Constructed from high-quality stainless steel, the ATTG-36 is both durable and easy to clean, making it a reliable choice for commercial environments. The griddle surface is designed to withstand continuous use, maintaining its performance and appearance over time. Additionally, the unit\'s compact countertop design allows for flexibility in kitchen layout, making it a versatile addition to any cooking station. Overall, the Atosa ATTG-36 combines powerful heating, precise control, and durable construction to meet the demands of professional chefs and enhance kitchen efficiency.</p>', '\n\nDelivers a total of 75,000 BTU, ensuring quick and even heating across the griddle surface for efficient cooking.<br>\n\nAllows precise temperature settings, providing consistent results and versatility for a variety of cooking tasks.<br>\n\nMade from high-quality stainless steel, offering durability and ease of cleaning, essential for busy kitchens.<br>\n\nThe 36\" griddle provides ample space for cooking multiple items simultaneously, ideal for high-volume food preparation.<br>\n\nFits easily on countertops, making it a versatile and space-saving addition to any commercial kitchen layout.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ATTG-36_d9ede6a0-2698-4f97-8cd1-e2ce930011be.webp\"]', 'ATTG-36', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2245, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36.00, NULL, 15.00, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 150.00, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:43:26', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ATTG-36_d9ede6a0-2698-4f97-8cd1-e2ce930011be.webp', 'physical', '', 1469, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB389\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2082, 'Atosa ATTG-24 24\" Gas Countertop Griddle with Thermostatic Controls 50,000 BTU', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa ATTG-24 is a versatile 24\" Gas Countertop Griddle designed to offer precise cooking control in commercial kitchen settings. Featuring thermostatic controls, this griddle allows chefs to set and maintain specific cooking temperatures with accuracy, ensuring consistent results across the cooking surface. With a heat output of 50,000 BTU, the griddle provides efficient and even heat distribution, making it suitable for cooking a variety of foods such as pancakes, eggs, burgers, and more. The thermostatic control system enhances operational efficiency by allowing chefs to adjust temperatures according to different cooking requirements, from gentle simmering to high-temperature searing.</p>\n<p>Constructed from durable stainless steel, the ATTG-24 is built to endure the demands of busy kitchens while facilitating easy cleaning and maintenance. Stainless steel construction not only ensures durability but also enhances the griddle\'s resistance to corrosion, preserving its professional appearance over time. The compact countertop design of the ATTG-24 optimizes kitchen space, fitting seamlessly into existing setups without occupying excessive room. Whether used in restaurants, diners, or food trucks, this griddle combines precision cooking control, durable build quality, and efficient performance to meet the needs of professional chefs and enhance kitchen productivity.</p>', '\n\nAllows precise temperature adjustment for consistent cooking results across the 24-inch griddle surface.<br>\n\n50,000 BTU ensures efficient heating for various cooking tasks, from delicate foods to high-temperature searing.<br>\n\nBuilt with stainless steel for durability, easy cleaning, and resistance to corrosion in busy kitchen environments.<br>\n\nSaves space and fits conveniently on countertops, maximizing kitchen workspace efficiency.<br>\n\nSuitable for a wide range of foods including pancakes, eggs, burgers, and more, accommodating diverse menu items in commercial settings.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ATTG-24_38b01178-6d0c-4331-934d-7850ce2d61b5.webp\"]', 'ATTG-24', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1563, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 15.00, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 150.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:43:27', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ATTG-24_38b01178-6d0c-4331-934d-7850ce2d61b5.webp', 'physical', '', 1022.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB390\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2083, 'Atosa ATMG-48 48\" Heavy Duty  Gas Griddle with Manual Control 120,000 BTU', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa ATMG-48 is a robust 48\" Heavy Duty Gas Griddle designed for high-performance cooking in commercial kitchens. With an impressive output of 120,000 BTU, this griddle ensures rapid and even heating across its expansive cooking surface. It features manual controls that allow chefs to adjust temperatures precisely, providing flexibility to handle a wide range of cooking tasks efficiently. Whether preparing pancakes, burgers, eggs, or other menu items, the griddle\'s manual control system enables chefs to maintain optimal cooking conditions for consistent results.</p>\n<p>Constructed from durable stainless steel, the ATMG-48 is built to withstand the demands of continuous use in busy kitchen environments while facilitating easy cleaning and maintenance. The stainless steel construction also enhances the griddle\'s resistance to corrosion, ensuring longevity and preserving its professional appearance over time. The 48-inch cooking surface provides ample room for cooking large batches of food simultaneously, making it suitable for high-volume cooking operations in restaurants, hotels, and other food service establishments. Overall, the Atosa ATMG-48 combines powerful heating capabilities, durable construction, and efficient cooking performance to meet the needs of professional chefs and enhance kitchen productivity.</p>', '\n\nPowerful 120,000 BTU output ensures rapid and even heating across the expansive 48-inch griddle surface.<br>\n\nAllows precise adjustment of cooking temperatures, providing flexibility to handle various cooking tasks with consistent results.<br>\n\nBuilt to withstand continuous use in busy commercial kitchens, offering durability, ease of cleaning, and resistance to corrosion.<br>\n\nSpacious 48-inch cooking area accommodates large batches of food simultaneously, ideal for high-volume cooking operations.<br>\n\nSaves space and fits conveniently on countertops, maximizing kitchen workspace efficiency while delivering powerful cooking performance.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ATMG-48_41616927-d721-4052-baa5-c966c0f1f7b4.webp\"]', 'ATMG-48', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1586, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48.00, NULL, 15.00, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 414.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:43:28', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ATMG-48_41616927-d721-4052-baa5-c966c0f1f7b4.webp', 'physical', '', 1019, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB391\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '');
