(2084, 'Atosa ATMG-36  36\" Heavy Duty Gas Griddle with Manual Control 90,000 BTU', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa ATMG-36 is a robust 36\" Heavy Duty Gas Griddle designed to meet the rigorous demands of commercial kitchens. With a powerful output of 90,000 BTU, this griddle ensures efficient heat distribution across its expansive cooking surface. It is equipped with manual controls that allow chefs to adjust temperatures precisely, providing flexibility to handle various cooking tasks such as cooking burgers, pancakes, eggs, and more. This manual control feature is ideal for chefs who prefer hands-on temperature management to achieve perfect cooking results.</p>\n<p>Constructed from durable stainless steel, the ATMG-36 is built to withstand the daily challenges of busy kitchen environments while maintaining a professional appearance. Stainless steel construction not only enhances durability but also facilitates easy cleaning and maintenance, essential for maintaining hygiene and food safety standards. The griddle\'s spacious 36-inch cooking area provides ample room for cooking large batches of food simultaneously, making it suitable for high-volume cooking operations in restaurants, diners, and other food service establishments. Overall, the Atosa ATMG-36 combines powerful performance, durable construction, and efficient cooking capabilities to enhance productivity in commercial kitchens.</p>', '\n\nPowerful 90,000 BTU output ensures rapid and even heating across the 36-inch griddle surface.<br>\n\nAllows precise adjustment of cooking temperatures for versatile cooking applications.<br>\n\nBuilt with stainless steel for durability, easy cleaning, and resistance to corrosion, suitable for rigorous commercial kitchen use.<br>\n\nProvides a large 36-inch cooking area, ideal for cooking multiple items simultaneously and accommodating high-volume cooking needs.<br>\n\nSaves space and fits conveniently on countertops, maximizing kitchen workspace efficiency.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ATMG-36_163d4626-ceb5-4cd2-8311-5410eebf2c96.webp\"]', 'ATMG-36', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1201, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36.00, NULL, 15.00, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 281.00, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:43:29', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ATMG-36_163d4626-ceb5-4cd2-8311-5410eebf2c96.webp', 'physical', '', 771.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB392\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2085, 'Atosa ATMG-24 24\" Heavy Duty Gas Griddle with Manual Control 60,000 BTU', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa ATMG-24 is a sturdy 24\" Heavy Duty Gas Griddle designed to deliver reliable performance in commercial kitchen settings. With a total output of 60,000 BTU, this griddle provides efficient heat distribution across its cooking surface, ensuring even cooking of various foods such as pancakes, burgers, eggs, and more. It features manual controls that allow chefs to adjust the temperature precisely, providing flexibility to handle different cooking requirements with ease.</p>\n<p>Constructed from durable stainless steel, the ATMG-24 is built to withstand the demands of continuous use in busy kitchens. The stainless steel construction not only enhances durability but also simplifies cleaning and maintenance, crucial for maintaining hygiene and food safety standards. The griddle\'s compact countertop design optimizes kitchen space, making it suitable for establishments with limited area. Whether used in restaurants, diners, or food trucks, the Atosa ATMG-24 offers a combination of robust build quality and efficient cooking performance, catering to high-volume cooking needs efficiently.</p>', '\n\nEquipped with a total output of 60,000 BTU for efficient and even cooking across the griddle surface.<br>\n\nAllows precise adjustment of cooking temperatures to accommodate various types of food.<br>\n\nBuilt with stainless steel for durability, easy cleaning, and resistance to corrosion in demanding kitchen environments.<br>\n\nProvides a spacious 24-inch cooking area, ideal for preparing multiple dishes simultaneously.<br>\n\nSaves space and fits conveniently on countertops, making it suitable for kitchens with limited space availability.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ATMG-24_743d7f03-c4bc-4784-bf14-f5c6c1ff2496.webp\"]', 'ATMG-24', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 907, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 15.00, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 195.00, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:43:30', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ATMG-24_743d7f03-c4bc-4784-bf14-f5c6c1ff2496.webp', 'physical', '', 582, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB393\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2086, 'Atosa ACHP-6 36\" Heavy Duty Countertop Range, Hot Plate with 6 Burners 192,000 BTU', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa ACHP-6 is commercial cooking unit features a robust stainless steel construction, ensuring both durability and a sleek, professional appearance. Its corrosion-resistant properties allow it to withstand the rigors of daily use while maintaining integrity, reducing the need for repairs.</p>\n<p>Designed for easy cleaning and maintenance, the smooth surface minimizes food particle accumulation, promoting hygiene in busy kitchen environments. Stability is enhanced by four adjustable stainless steel legs, allowing for secure placement on uneven surfaces.</p>\n<p>Equipped with heavy-duty cast iron top grates, this unit offers excellent heat retention for even cooking results. The six heavy-duty burners, featuring standing pilot lights, ensure quick ignition and consistent heat, perfect for high-volume cooking.</p>\n<p>Each burner comes with independent manual controls, providing precise heat adjustments tailored to various cooking needs, enhancing overall efficiency. The unit also includes a standard 3/4\" NPT rear gas connection and regulator, facilitating straightforward installation and ensuring reliable gas flow for optimal performance in commercial kitchens</p>', '\n\nDurable stainless steel enhances aesthetics and ensures long-lasting performance in demanding commercial kitchen environments.<br>\n\nBuilt to resist corrosion and staining, maintaining integrity and minimizing repair needs over time.<br>\n\nSmooth surface design simplifies cleaning, reducing food particle accumulation and promoting hygiene in busy kitchens.<br>\n\nsturdy legs provide stability on uneven surfaces, ensuring a secure and level setup during operation.<br>\n\nHeavy-duty cast iron grates offer excellent heat retention for even cooking and long-lasting performance.<br>\n\nSix burners with standing pilots provide quick ignition and consistent heat for high-volume cooking.<br>\n\nEach burner has independent controls for precise heat adjustments, enhancing cooking flexibility and efficiency.<br>\n\nStandard rear gas connection simplifies installation and ensures reliable gas flow for optimal cooking performance.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ACHP-6_494552f1-c53e-4168-879f-a87e6c58db2b.webp\"]', 'ACHP-6', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1042, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36.00, NULL, 13.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 180.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:43:31', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ACHP-6_494552f1-c53e-4168-879f-a87e6c58db2b.webp', 'physical', '', 668.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB394\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2087, 'Atosa ATCB-36 36\" Heavy Duty Countertop Charbroiler 105,000 BTU', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa ATCB-36 is a robust 36\" Heavy Duty Countertop Charbroiler designed to deliver exceptional performance in commercial kitchens. With a powerful output of 105,000 BTU, this charbroiler is engineered to provide fast, consistent heating, making it ideal for grilling a variety of meats, vegetables, and other items with a distinctive charred flavor. Its compact countertop design allows for easy integration into existing kitchen layouts without taking up valuable floor space. The charbroiler features adjustable, heavy-duty cast iron grates that can be positioned to accommodate different cooking styles, whether it\'s searing steaks or achieving a perfect grill mark on burgers.</p>\n<p>Constructed with durable stainless steel, the ATCB-36 is built to withstand the rigors of daily commercial use, ensuring longevity and easy maintenance. The stainless steel construction not only enhances its durability but also simplifies cleaning, essential for maintaining hygiene and food safety standards. Additionally, the charbroiler is equipped with a drip tray to catch grease and food particles, preventing flare-ups and ensuring a clean cooking surface. Its intuitive control knobs allow for precise temperature adjustments, providing full control over the grilling process. Overall, the Atosa ATCB-36 combines powerful performance, durability, and ease of use, making it an indispensable addition to any busy kitchen seeking to enhance its grilling capabilities.</p>', '\n\n105,000 BTU output for fast and efficient cooking, ideal for high-volume grilling in commercial settings.<br>\n\nDurable stainless steel construction ensures longevity, withstands frequent use, and facilitates easy cleaning.<br>\n\nHeavy-duty cast iron grates are adjustable to accommodate various foods and cooking styles, allowing for versatile grilling options.<br>\n\nSpace-saving design fits well on countertops, maximizing kitchen space while offering powerful grilling capabilities.<br>\n\nIntuitive control knobs provide precise temperature adjustments, giving chefs control over cooking temperatures for optimal results.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ATCB-36_7f3aa06a-33f4-4a8e-abe7-62c4cf001380.webp\"]', 'ATCB-36', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1338, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36.00, NULL, 15.00, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 238.00, NULL, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:43:32', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ATCB-36_7f3aa06a-33f4-4a8e-abe7-62c4cf001380.webp', 'physical', '', 859, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB395\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2088, 'Atosa ATCB-48 48\" Heavy Duty Countertop Charbroiler 140,000 BTU', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa ATCB-48 48\" Heavy Duty Countertop Charbroiler is a robust and efficient cooking appliance designed for commercial kitchens that require high-performance grilling capabilities. With a powerful 140,000 BTU output, this charbroiler delivers intense heat necessary for searing meats, vegetables, and seafood quickly and evenly. The heavy-duty cast iron grates provide a sturdy cooking surface that retains heat effectively, ensuring consistent cooking results. Its spacious 48-inch width offers ample space for preparing large quantities of food, making it ideal for busy restaurants, steakhouses, or catering operations.</p>\n<p>Constructed with a durable stainless steel exterior, the ATCB-48 is built to withstand the rigors of daily use in demanding kitchen environments. Stainless steel not only enhances durability but also simplifies cleaning and maintenance, crucial for maintaining hygiene standards. The charbroiler features independent manual controls for each of its burners, allowing chefs to adjust heat levels precisely for different cooking requirements. Whether grilling burgers, steaks, or vegetables, the Atosa ATCB-48 combines reliability, efficiency, and performance to meet the needs of professional chefs and foodservice establishments seeking a dependable countertop grilling solution.</p>', '\n\nPowerful 140,000 BTU burners provide intense heat for fast and efficient cooking, ideal for searing and grilling various types of food.<br>\n\nSpacious 48-inch width with heavy-duty cast iron grates offers ample cooking area, suitable for preparing large quantities of food at once.<br>\n\nDurable stainless steel exterior ensures longevity, resistance to corrosion, and facilitates easy cleaning and maintenance.<br>\n\nEach burner has its own control knob, allowing precise adjustment of heat levels for different cooking tasks.<br>\n\nFacilitates easy cleaning by collecting grease and food drippings, maintaining cleanliness and hygiene in the kitchen.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ATCB-48_fcef6496-c049-4a0b-8869-a6e436b691ec.webp\"]', 'ATCB-48', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1678, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48.00, NULL, 15.00, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 314.00, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:43:33', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ATCB-48_fcef6496-c049-4a0b-8869-a6e436b691ec.webp', 'physical', '', 1077.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB396\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2089, 'Atosa ACHP-4 24\" Heavy Duty Countertop Range, Hot Plate with 4 Burners 128,000 BTU', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa ACHP-4 24\" Heavy Duty Countertop Range or Hot Plate with 4 Burners is a robust cooking appliance designed to meet the demands of commercial kitchens. With a total output of 128,000 BTUs distributed across four burners, this countertop range provides substantial heating power for various cooking tasks. Each burner is capable of delivering 32,000 BTUs, ensuring rapid heating and efficient cooking of different foods, from boiling and frying to simmering and sautéing. This makes it ideal for high-volume cooking environments such as restaurants, cafes, and food trucks.</p>\n<p>Constructed with a durable stainless steel body and heavy-duty cast iron grates, the ACHP-4 is built to withstand continuous use and is easy to clean. The stainless steel exterior resists corrosion and maintains a professional appearance, while the cast iron grates provide a stable cooking surface that retains heat effectively. Each burner is equipped with individual manual controls, allowing chefs to adjust heat levels independently for precise cooking control. The 24-inch width of the unit offers a generous cooking area without occupying excessive countertop space, making it versatile for various kitchen layouts and operational needs. Overall, the Atosa ACHP-4 combines power, durability, and efficiency to enhance cooking capabilities in commercial settings.</p>', '\n\n4 Burners Each burner has its own manual control for precise heat adjustment tailored to specific cooking needs.<br>\n\nConstructed with stainless steel inside and out, ensuring durability, easy cleaning, and a professional appearance.<br>\n\nThe full-width crumb tray collects debris, promoting cleanliness and simplifying maintenance in busy kitchen environments.<br>\n\nPowerful 32,000 BTU burners deliver high heat output, ideal for a variety of cooking tasks and efficient performance.<br>\n\nDesigned with standing pilot lights, these heavy-duty burners ensure quick ignition and consistent heat for cooking.<br>\n\nDurable cast iron top grates provide excellent heat retention and even cooking, perfect for high-demand usage.<br>\n\nIndependent controls for each burner enhance flexibility, allowing simultaneous cooking at different temperatures.<br>\n\nStandard stainless steel legs provide stability and durability, ensuring secure placement in commercial kitchen settings.<br>\n\nFeatures a standard 3/4″ NPT rear gas connection and regulator for easy installation and reliable gas flow.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ACHP-4_d78f31ae-568e-426c-a215-0b95bdb79cec.webp\"]', 'ACHP-4', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 769, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 13.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 125.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:43:36', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ACHP-4_d78f31ae-568e-426c-a215-0b95bdb79cec.webp', 'physical', '', 494, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB397\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2090, 'Atosa ATRC-48 48\" Gas Countertop Radiant Broiler 140,000 BTU', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa ATRC-48 48\" Gas Countertop Radiant Broiler is designed to deliver high-performance broiling capabilities in commercial kitchen environments. With a powerful 140,000 BTU output distributed across its cooking surface, this radiant broiler generates intense heat necessary for searing and cooking a variety of meats, seafood, and vegetables quickly and evenly. The unit features durable stainless steel construction that not only enhances its durability but also facilitates easy cleaning and maintenance, crucial for maintaining hygiene standards in busy kitchens.</p>\n<p>This countertop broiler is equipped with efficient radiant burners that ensure even heat distribution and retention, providing consistent cooking results with appealing sear marks. The ATRC-48 includes independent manual controls for each burner, allowing chefs to adjust heat levels precisely to accommodate different cooking requirements. Its 48-inch width provides ample cooking space, making it suitable for high-volume food preparation. Whether used in a restaurant, steakhouse, or catering facility, the Atosa ATRC-48 is designed to meet the demands of professional chefs seeking a reliable and efficient broiling solution.</p>', '\n\nPowerful 140,000 BTU burners provide intense heat for rapid and efficient cooking, ideal for searing and broiling various types of food.<br>\n\nDurable stainless steel body ensures longevity, resistance to corrosion, and easy cleaning, maintaining hygiene standards in commercial kitchens.<br>\n\nEfficient radiant burners distribute heat evenly across the cooking surface, ensuring consistent cooking results and attractive sear marks.<br>\n\nEach burner is equipped with its own control knob, allowing precise adjustment of heat levels for different cooking needs.<br>\n\n48-inch width provides ample space for cooking multiple dishes simultaneously, making it suitable for high-volume food preparation in busy kitchens.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ATRC-48_fcd55c32-4425-4534-bc66-7fa17716f3b3.webp\"]', 'ATRC-48', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1678, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48.00, NULL, 15.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 256.00, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:43:37', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ATRC-48_fcd55c32-4425-4534-bc66-7fa17716f3b3.webp', 'physical', '', 1077.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB398\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2091, 'Atosa ATRC-24 24\" Gas Countertop Radiant Broiler 70,000 BTU', '\n<p>The Atosa ATRC-24 is a commercial-grade countertop radiant broiler designed to deliver exceptional searing and grilling capabilities in professional kitchens. This broiler boasts a robust 70,000 BTU output, enabling you to achieve scorching hot temperatures ideal for searing steaks, chops, and other dishes to perfection. The radiant heat technology ensures efficient heat transfer directly to the food, minimizing steaming and promoting a caramelized crust with superior flavor and texture.</p>\n<p>Constructed with the demands of a busy kitchen in mind, the Atosa ATRC-24 is built to last. While exact materials may vary by model, expect components like heavy-duty cast iron grates and stainless steel construction for durability and easy cleaning. Independent manual controls provide precise temperature management over different zones of the cooking surface, allowing you to cook a variety of foods simultaneously at their ideal temperatures. Adjustable grates further enhance your control and flexibility for perfect results every time.</p>', '\n\nThe broiler boasts a powerful 70,000 BTU burner, designed for rapid heating and efficient cooking, ideal for searing and grilling various types of food quickly.<br>\n\nBuilt with durable stainless steel, both inside and out, ensuring durability, easy cleaning, and resistance to corrosion in commercial kitchen environments.<br>\n\nEquipped with a heavy-duty radiant cover that distributes heat evenly across the cooking surface, enhancing cooking performance and ensuring consistent results.<br>\n\nFeatures independent adjustable grates that allow for precise control over heat intensity, accommodating different types of food and cooking preferences simultaneously.<br>\n\nDesigned to be compact and countertop-friendly, making it suitable for kitchens with limited space while still providing powerful cooking capabilities for high-volume operations.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ATRC-24_eb92072f-07c6-441c-85ea-5a5c4784756f.webp\"]', 'ATRC-24', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 998, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 15.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 147.00, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:43:39', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ATRC-24_eb92072f-07c6-441c-85ea-5a5c4784756f.webp', 'physical', '', 640, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB399\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2092, 'Atosa YR800-AP-261 30.2\" Ice Machine Head Without Storage Bin, Half Dice, Air Cooled, 810 lbs/day', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa YR800-AP-261 ice machine is a commercial-grade workhorse designed for high-volume settings like restaurants, bars, and hotels. It boasts an impressive production capacity, churning out up to 810 pounds of ice cubes daily. This ensures you can meet peak demands and keep your customers satisfied, even during busy periods.</p>\n<p>This air-cooled machine offers several advantages. The air-cooled design eliminates the need for a dedicated water line for cooling, providing more flexibility in placement compared to water-cooled models. It also generally simplifies installation. The Atosa YR800-AP-261 produces half-dice ice cubes, a small, chewable size ideal for chilling beverages without excessive dilution. This makes it perfect for blended drinks, sodas, or other cold refreshments. Just be sure to factor in the machine\'s sizeable dimensions (31.7\" h x 30.2\" w x 24.45\" d) to ensure you have adequate space for installation.</p>', '\n\nThis machine cranks out a whopping 810 pounds of ice cubes every day, ensuring you can keep up with peak demands. No more running out of ice during a lunch rush or sweltering summer day.<br>\n\nThe Atosa YR800-AP-261 produces small, chewable half dice ice cubes, perfect for chilling down blended drinks, sodas, or other beverages. This ice cube size is also ideal for applications where rapid chilling is necessary, without excessive dilution.<br>\n\nThis eliminates the need for a dedicated water source for cooling, offering greater flexibility in placement. Air-cooled machines are generally easier to install compared to their water-cooled counterparts.<br>\n\nThe Atosa YR800-AP-261 is built to endure the wear and tear of a demanding commercial environment. While specific details may vary, expect robust materials that can handle frequent use and long hours of operation.<br>\n\nKeep in mind that this ice machine boasts a significant production capacity, and that\'s reflected in its size. It measures 31.7 inches high, 30.2 inches wide, and 24.45 inches deep.\nMake sure you have adequate space for installation before you buy.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/YR800-AP-261_7b04590b-9525-462c-8ce9-63189b7f2962.webp\"]', 'YR800-AP-261', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 4589, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 328.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:43:40', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/YR800-AP-261_7b04590b-9525-462c-8ce9-63189b7f2962.webp', 'physical', '', 3180, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB400\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2093, 'Atosa  CTD-3S 18.13\" Countertop Display Refrigerator 2.4 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa CTD-3S is a 2.4 cubic foot countertop refrigerator specifically designed for commercial use. Its compact size makes it ideal for displaying beverages or food items in limited-space environments, like kiosks, convenience stores, or even on countertops with limited real estate. This countertop refrigerator features a single hinged glass door with a lock, allowing customers to see the products while keeping them secure.</p>\n<p>For versatile use and efficient chilling of a variety of beverages and food items, the Atosa CTD-3S boasts adjustable shelves. This lets you customize the interior layout to accommodate different product sizes and maximize your display area. Additionally, the temperature range of 33° to 41°F ensures proper chilling for most beverages and deli items.</p>\n<p>The Atosa CTD-3S typically costs between $621.00 and $650.00, making it a budget-friendly option for businesses looking for a compact and functional display refrigerator.</p>', '\n\nIdeal for countertops or kiosks with limited space, this compact refrigerator allows you to efficiently utilize every square foot of your commercial area.<br>\n\nThe single hinged glass door with a lock showcases your products to attract customers, while also keeping them secure to prevent theft or tampering.<br>\n\nThe Atosa CTD-3S features an adjustable shelf, allowing you to customize the interior layout to fit various sized beverages or food items. This flexibility helps you maximize your display capacity and showcase a wider variety of products.<br>\n\nThis countertop refrigerator utilizes a cold wall cooling system to maintain a consistent temperature range ideal for chilling a wide range of beverages and deli foods. This ensures they stay fresh and maintain optimal quality.<br>\n\nThe Atosa CTD-3S offers a cost-effective solution for businesses seeking a functional display refrigerator without breaking the bank. It provides valuable merchandising and chilling capabilities at a competitive price point.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/CTD-3S_02eb8e05-5186-4fb7-bff2-032a2076a053.webp\"]', 'CTD-3S', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 621, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 18.00, NULL, 33.00, NULL, 19.00, NULL, 70.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:43:41', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/CTD-3S_02eb8e05-5186-4fb7-bff2-032a2076a053.webp', 'physical', '', 405.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB401\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2094, 'Atosa YR140-AP-161 23.7\" Ice Machine with Built-In Ice Bin, 142 lbs/day', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa YR140-AP-161 23.7\" Ice Machine with Built-In Ice Bin is a compact and efficient solution designed for moderate ice production in commercial environments. With a daily ice production capacity of 142 lbs, this unit is well-suited for smaller establishments such as cafes, delis, or offices where a steady supply of ice is necessary but not at high volumes. The built-in ice bin ensures convenient storage and easy access to the produced ice, making it ideal for environments with moderate ice consumption needs throughout the day.</p>\n<p>Featuring an air-cooled condenser system, the Atosa YR140-AP-161 effectively utilizes ambient air to cool the machine, enhancing energy efficiency and reducing water consumption compared to water-cooled models. Its stainless steel construction provides durability and ease of maintenance, ensuring longevity even under demanding commercial conditions. The compact design of the unit allows for flexible placement options in limited spaces, optimizing operational efficiency without sacrificing ice production capacity. Overall, the Atosa YR140-AP-161 combines reliability, efficiency, and compactness, making it a practical choice for businesses requiring moderate ice production capabilities.</p>', '\n\nCapable of producing up to 142 lbs of ice per day, suitable for moderate-demand commercial settings such as cafes, small restaurants, and offices.<br>\n\nIncludes a built-in storage bin for convenient ice storage and easy access, ensuring a continuous supply of ice throughout the day.<br>\n\nUtilizes an air-cooled condenser that efficiently dissipates heat, reducing water consumption and ensuring consistent ice production.<br>\n\nDurable stainless steel exterior and interior components provide longevity, ease of cleaning, and resistance to corrosion in busy environments.<br>\n\nSpace-saving footprint allows for flexible installation options in kitchens or spaces with limited area, optimizing operational efficiency without compromising on ice production capacity.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/YR140-AP-161_b418054d-ee1b-4daa-bcc0-f9536e7361cf.webp\"]', 'YR140-AP-161', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1989, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 176.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:43:42', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/YR140-AP-161_b418054d-ee1b-4daa-bcc0-f9536e7361cf.webp', 'physical', '', 1378, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB402\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2095, 'Atosa YR280-AP-161 23.7\" Ice Machine with Built-In Ice Bin, Half-diced Cube, 283 lbs/day', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa YR280-AP-161 23.7\" Ice Machine with Built-In Ice Bin is a compact and efficient ice-making solution designed for moderate ice production needs in commercial settings. With a daily ice production capacity of 283 lbs, this unit is suitable for smaller restaurants, cafes, and bars that require a steady supply of ice cubes. The built-in ice bin provides convenient storage for the produced ice, ensuring easy access and efficient use during peak hours.</p>\n<p>Built with a focus on reliability and performance, the Atosa YR280-AP-161 features an air-cooled condenser system. This design utilizes ambient air to cool the machine, improving energy efficiency and reducing water consumption compared to water-cooled models. The stainless steel construction of the unit enhances durability and makes it easy to clean, while the compact design allows for flexible placement options in tight spaces. Overall, the Atosa YR280-AP-161 Ice Machine with Built-In Ice Bin combines practicality with performance, catering to establishments that prioritize reliability and efficiency in their ice-making operations.</p>', '\n\nProduces up to 283 lbs of ice per day, making it suitable for moderate-demand commercial settings such as small restaurants, bars, and cafes.<br>\n\nIncludes a built-in storage bin for convenient ice storage and easy access, ensuring a steady supply of ice during peak hours.<br>\n\nFeatures an air-cooled condenser that efficiently dissipates heat, reducing water consumption and ensuring consistent ice production.<br>\n\nDurable stainless steel exterior and interior components provide longevity, ease of cleaning, and resistance to corrosion.<br>\n\nSpace-saving footprint allows for flexible installation options in kitchens with limited space, optimizing operational efficiency without compromising on ice production capacity.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/