(2096, 'Atosa YR450-AP-161 30.2\" Ice Machine Head Without Storage Bin, Stainless Steel, Half Dice, Air Cooled, 460 lbs/day', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa YR450-AP-161 30.2\" Ice Machine Head is a robust and efficient ice-making solution designed for commercial settings that require a reliable source of ice. With a production capacity of up to 460 lbs of ice per day, this machine is capable of meeting the high demands of busy restaurants, bars, and other hospitality establishments. It produces half-dice ice cubes, which are known for their versatility and quick cooling properties, making them ideal for a variety of applications from drinks to food displays.</p>\n<p>Built with an air-cooled condenser, the Atosa YR450-AP-161 is designed for efficiency and reliability, utilizing ambient air to dissipate heat and maintain optimal operating temperatures. This design not only ensures consistent ice production but also reduces water consumption compared to water-cooled systems. Its compact size and stainless steel construction make it durable and easy to clean, suitable for installation in kitchens or bar areas where space is at a premium. Overall, the Atosa YR450-AP-161 Ice Machine Head combines high capacity with practical features, making it a dependable choice for businesses needing a steady supply of quality ice.</p>', '\n\nCapable of producing up to 460 lbs of half-dice ice cubes per day, making it suitable for high-demand commercial environments such as restaurants and bars.<br>\n\nProduces ice cubes that are smaller and more compact, ideal for cooling beverages quickly and fitting into containers more efficiently.<br>\n\nUtilizes an air-cooled condenser which efficiently dissipates heat, reducing water consumption compared to water-cooled systems and ensuring consistent ice production.<br>\n\nDurable stainless steel exterior and interior components provide longevity and ease of cleaning, suitable for heavy-duty use in busy kitchens.<br>\n\nSpace-saving footprint allows for installation in various kitchen configurations, optimizing available space while maintaining high ice production capacity.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/YR450-AP-161_631cd2ed-0017-4e0f-b086-95fd6f824c18.webp\"]', 'YR450-AP-161', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 22.00, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 300.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:43:45', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/YR450-AP-161_631cd2ed-0017-4e0f-b086-95fd6f824c18.webp', 'physical', '', 2226, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB404\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2097, 'Atosa CTD-3 18.13\" Countertop Display Refrigerator 2.4  Cu.Ft', '\n<p>The Atosa CTD-3 18.13\" Countertop Display Refrigerator is a compact and versatile refrigeration solution designed for displaying chilled items in small commercial spaces. With a capacity of 2.4 cubic feet, this countertop unit is ideal for showcasing beverages, snacks, desserts, or other perishable goods where space efficiency is crucial. Its compact size makes it suitable for placement on countertops or bar tops, maximizing available space in cafes, convenience stores, or food service areas.</p>\n<p>Constructed with a stainless steel exterior, the Atosa CTD-3 ensures durability and ease of maintenance, making it well-suited for busy environments. The glass front provides a clear view of the displayed items, allowing customers to easily see and access products while enhancing their visual appeal. Internally, the refrigeration system maintains consistent cooling temperatures to keep contents at optimal freshness. This display refrigerator is equipped with LED lighting to illuminate the interior, improving visibility and presentation of items without consuming excessive energy, thus balancing operational efficiency with effective product showcasing.</p>', '\n\nDesigned for countertop placement, making it suitable for small spaces such as cafes, convenience stores, or food trucks where space is limited.<br>\n\nOffers a clear view of the interior contents, enhancing visibility and making it easy for customers to view and access displayed items.<br>\n\nDurable stainless steel exterior ensures longevity and ease of cleaning, ideal for commercial use.<br>\n\nEfficient refrigeration system maintains consistent cooling temperatures to keep products fresh and chilled at optimal conditions.<br>\n\nInterior LED lighting illuminates the contents, enhancing product visibility and presentation while being energy-efficient and cost-effective to operate.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/CTD-3_3e12c97f-7a43-4bce-b73d-5ab83098e68d.webp\"]', 'CTD-3', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 570, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 17.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 20.00, NULL, 57.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:43:46', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/CTD-3_3e12c97f-7a43-4bce-b73d-5ab83098e68d.webp', 'physical', '', 372.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB405\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2098, 'Atosa CRDS-56  35.4\" Flat Glass Countertop Refrigerated Display Case 5.6 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa CRDS-56 35.4\" Flat Glass Countertop Refrigerated Display Case is designed to efficiently showcase and store chilled goods in various commercial settings. With a generous capacity of 5.6 cubic feet, it offers ample space for displaying a wide range of products such as beverages, sandwiches, salads, and desserts. The flat glass front provides a clear view of the displayed items from different angles, enhancing visibility and making it easier for customers to browse and select products. This feature is crucial for stimulating impulse purchases and improving overall customer satisfaction.</p>\n<p>Constructed with a durable stainless steel exterior, the Atosa CRDS-56 ensures robustness and longevity, suitable for demanding environments like cafes, delis, or convenience stores. The refrigeration system is designed for efficient cooling, maintaining consistent temperatures throughout the display case to keep products fresh and ready for consumption. LED lighting inside the unit illuminates the contents effectively, enhancing product visibility without compromising energy efficiency. Its countertop design optimizes space utilization, making it a practical choice for establishments where floor space is limited but showcasing chilled items is essential for driving sales and customer engagement.</p>', '\n\nOffers 5.6 cubic feet of interior space to display a variety of chilled products such as beverages, sandwiches, salads, and desserts.<br>\n\nProvides a clear view of displayed items from multiple angles, enhancing visibility and making it easy for customers to view and access products.<br>\n\nBuilt with a stainless steel exterior for durability and easy cleaning, suitable for commercial environments like cafes, delis, and convenience stores.<br>\n\nEnsures consistent cooling throughout the display case to maintain product freshness and quality.<br>\n\nInterior LED lighting illuminates products, enhancing their presentation while being energy-efficient and minimizing operational costs.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/CRDS-56_58e2b39a-cad8-4d5b-87d1-a3fbfd8f9329.webp\"]', 'CRDS-56', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2099, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35.00, NULL, 26.00, NULL, 22.00, NULL, 214.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:43:47', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/CRDS-56_58e2b39a-cad8-4d5b-87d1-a3fbfd8f9329.webp', 'physical', '', 1402.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB406\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
