(2100, 'Atosa CRDC-46 35.4\" Curved Glass Countertop Refrigerated Display Case  4.6 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa CRDC-46 35.4\" Curved Glass Countertop Refrigerated Display Case is a versatile and compact solution designed to showcase chilled items in retail and food service settings. With a capacity of 4.6 cubic feet, this display case offers ample space for displaying a variety of beverages, desserts, or other perishable goods. The curved glass design not only enhances the visual appeal but also provides a panoramic view of the products, making them easily visible and attractive to customers from different angles. This feature is especially beneficial for encouraging impulse purchases and enhancing the overall customer experience.</p>\n<p>Constructed with a durable stainless steel exterior and a sleek curved glass front, the Atosa CRDC-46 is built to withstand the rigors of daily commercial use while maintaining an elegant appearance. The refrigeration system ensures consistent cooling throughout the interior, keeping products at optimal temperatures for freshness. LED lighting inside the display case effectively illuminates the contents, enhancing visibility and presentation without compromising energy efficiency. Designed for countertop placement, this display case is suitable for various settings such as cafes, delis, or convenience stores where space efficiency and visual appeal are paramount.</p>', '\n\nDesigned for countertop placement, making it suitable for small spaces in cafes, delis, or retail establishments where space efficiency is crucial.<br>\n\nEnhances visibility and attractiveness of displayed items, providing a panoramic view that attracts customer attention and promotes impulse purchases.<br>\n\nDurable stainless steel exterior ensures longevity and easy maintenance, ideal for busy commercial environments.<br>\n\nReliable refrigeration system maintains consistent cooling temperatures to keep products fresh and chilled at optimal serving conditions.<br>\n\nInterior LED lighting illuminates the products, enhancing visibility and presentation while being energy-efficient and cost-effective to operate.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/CRDC-46_b27fc259-ea52-4411-b27b-4a6affd841a0.webp\"]', 'CRDC-46', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1775, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35.00, NULL, 26.00, NULL, 22.00, NULL, 200.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:43:49', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/CRDC-46_b27fc259-ea52-4411-b27b-4a6affd841a0.webp', 'physical', '', 1186.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB408\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2101, 'Atosa CRDC-35 27.6\" Curved Glass Countertop Refrigerated Display Case 3.5 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa CRDC-35 27.6\" Curved Glass Countertop Refrigerated Display Case is a compact yet effective solution for showcasing chilled products in retail and food service environments. With a capacity of 3.5 cubic feet, this display case is ideal for presenting beverages, desserts, or other perishable items where visibility and accessibility are key. The curved glass design not only enhances the aesthetic appeal but also provides a clear view of the displayed items from various angles, attracting customer attention and encouraging impulse purchases.</p>\n<p>Constructed with a durable stainless steel exterior and a sleek curved glass front, the Atosa CRDC-35 is designed for durability and visual appeal. The interior is designed to maintain consistent cooling temperatures, ensuring that products stay fresh and appealing to customers. LED lighting inside illuminates the displayed items effectively, enhancing their visibility and presentation while minimizing energy consumption. This countertop display case is versatile, fitting well on counters or bar tops, making it suitable for cafes, convenience stores, or any establishment looking to showcase chilled goods in an attractive and accessible manner.</p>', '\n\nDesigned for countertop placement, making it ideal for small spaces in cafes, convenience stores, or food service establishments where space is limited.<br>\n\nEnhances visibility and attractiveness of displayed items, providing a clear view from different angles to attract customer attention and promote sales.<br>\n\nDurable stainless steel exterior ensures longevity and easy maintenance, suitable for demanding commercial environments.<br>\n\nReliable refrigeration system maintains consistent cooling temperatures to keep products fresh and chilled at optimal serving temperatures.<br>\n\nInterior LED lighting illuminates the contents of the display case, enhancing visibility and presentation of products while being energy-efficient.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/CRDC-35_48e5c301-9523-414a-966c-c0f7ce619810.webp\"]', 'CRDC-35', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1453, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 26.00, NULL, 22.00, NULL, 172.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:43:50', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/CRDC-35_48e5c301-9523-414a-966c-c0f7ce619810.webp', 'physical', '', 971, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB409\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2102, 'Atosa MCF8703ES 54.4\" Bottom Mount Freezer, 2 Two Glass Door 44.8 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MCF8703ES 54.4\" Bottom Mount Freezer with two glass doors is designed to meet the demanding storage needs of commercial kitchens and food service establishments. With a substantial capacity of 44.8 cubic feet, this freezer offers ample space for storing a wide range of frozen foods, making it suitable for restaurants, cafeterias, and grocery stores. The two glass doors provide excellent visibility, allowing staff to quickly locate items without opening the doors frequently, which helps maintain consistent temperatures inside and ensures energy efficiency.</p>\n<p>Constructed with a robust stainless steel exterior and interior, the Atosa MCF8703ES is built to withstand the rigors of daily use in busy kitchen environments. The stainless steel not only enhances durability but also facilitates easy cleaning and maintenance, crucial for maintaining hygiene standards. The bottom mount design places the compressor near the floor, utilizing cooler air for efficient cooling while allowing for easy access to stored items at eye level. Adjustable shelves inside offer flexibility in organizing products of various sizes and shapes, optimizing storage space and ensuring efficient use of the freezer\'s capacity. Overall, the Atosa MCF8703ES combines reliability, durability, and practical design features to support efficient frozen food storage in commercial settings.</p>', '\n\nOffers a generous 44.8 cubic feet of interior storage space, suitable for storing a large quantity of frozen goods in commercial settings such as restaurants, supermarkets, or institutional kitchens.<br>\n\nEnhance visibility of stored items, allowing for easy viewing and quick identification of products without needing to open the doors frequently, which helps maintain consistent temperatures inside the freezer.<br>\n\nDesigned with energy-saving features to optimize operational costs while ensuring reliable performance in maintaining freezing temperatures.<br>\n\nDurable stainless steel exterior and interior construction ensures longevity, easy cleaning, and resistance to corrosion, making it suitable for demanding kitchen environments.<br>\n\nCompressor located at the bottom for efficient operation, utilizing cooler air near the floor and providing convenient access to stored items at eye level.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MCF8703ES_ed363617-3924-4e0b-afd6-3e71ab3c242e.webp\"]', 'MCF8703ES', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 4663, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 54.00, NULL, 83.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 553.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:43:51', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MCF8703ES_ed363617-3924-4e0b-afd6-3e71ab3c242e.webp', 'physical', '', 3055.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB410\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2103, 'Atosa MCF8701GR 27\" Bottom Mount Freezer, 1 One Glass Door 19.1 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MCF8701GR 27\" Bottom Mount Freezer with one glass door combines efficient storage and visibility, making it a practical choice for commercial kitchens and food service establishments. With a capacity of 19.1 cubic feet, this freezer provides ample space to store frozen goods while maintaining a compact footprint that saves valuable floor space. The single glass door not only enhances the aesthetic appeal of the unit but also allows easy visibility of the contents, enabling staff to quickly locate items without needing to open the door frequently, which helps maintain consistent temperatures inside.</p>\n<p>Constructed with a durable stainless steel exterior and interior, the Atosa MCF8701GR ensures longevity and ease of maintenance in demanding kitchen environments. The bottom mount design places the compressor near the floor, utilizing cooler air for efficient operation and making it convenient for users to access stored items at eye level. Inside, adjustable shelves provide flexibility in organizing a variety of frozen products, optimizing storage capacity based on specific needs. Overall, the Atosa MCF8701GR offers a blend of functionality, durability, and visibility that meets the rigorous demands of professional food service operations.</p>', '\n\nFeatures a single glass door that enhances visibility of stored items, allowing for easy viewing and quick identification without needing to open the door frequently.<br>\n\nProvides 19.1 cubic feet of interior storage space, offering ample room to store a variety of frozen goods in commercial kitchens or food service establishments.<br>\n\nDurable stainless steel exterior and interior construction ensures longevity, easy maintenance, and resistance to corrosion in busy kitchen environments.<br>\n\nCompressor is mounted near the bottom for efficient operation, utilizing cooler air for better performance and easier access to stored items at eye level.<br>\n\nInterior shelves are adjustable, allowing for flexible storage configurations to accommodate items of different sizes and shapes, optimizing storage space efficiently.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MCF8701GR_800c6d8b-3e12-46f8-9bbf-ac41bef3feea.webp\"]', 'MCF8701GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 3042, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 27.00, NULL, 83.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 342.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:43:52', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MCF8701GR_800c6d8b-3e12-46f8-9bbf-ac41bef3feea.webp', 'physical', '', 1981, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB411\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2104, 'Atosa MCF8725GR 24.2\" Glass Merchandiser, 1 Section, Black Exterior 11.1 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MCF8725GR 24.2\" Glass Merchandiser with a single door and black exterior is designed for compact yet efficient display of beverages and perishable items in retail settings. With a capacity of 11.1 cubic feet, this merchandiser provides a smaller footprint suitable for smaller shops, cafes, or spaces where space efficiency is critical. The glass door offers excellent visibility, allowing customers to easily see the displayed products, which can help drive impulse purchases and enhance the overall shopping experience. It also enables staff to monitor inventory without frequent door openings, which helps maintain consistent internal temperatures and improves energy efficiency.</p>\n<p>Constructed with a durable black exterior, the Atosa MCF8725GR not only adds a sleek and modern look to the display area but also ensures durability and resistance to daily wear and tear. Inside, the merchandiser features adjustable shelves, offering flexibility in organizing products of various sizes and shapes to maximize storage space. LED lighting illuminates the interior, ensuring that items are well-lit and visually appealing to customers. Overall, the Atosa MCF8725GR combines practical functionality with a compact design, making it an ideal choice for smaller retail environments seeking an efficient merchandising solution.</p>', '\n\nDesigned with a small footprint, ideal for spaces where floor space is limited, such as small shops, cafes, or convenience stores.<br>\n\nOffers 11.1 cubic feet of interior space, providing sufficient room to display a variety of beverages, snacks, or other perishable items.<br>\n\nSingle glass door enhances product visibility, allowing customers to easily view items on display and potentially increasing impulse purchases.<br>\n\nSleek black exterior finish enhances the aesthetic appeal of the merchandiser, blending well with modern retail environments.<br>\n\nInterior shelves are adjustable, enabling flexible storage configurations to accommodate products of different sizes and shapes efficiently.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MCF8725GR_86c0b0df-163b-476e-90d6-c6e68cfe4607.webp\"]', 'MCF8725GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 1747, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 76.00, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 251.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:43:53', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MCF8725GR_86c0b0df-163b-476e-90d6-c6e68cfe4607.webp', 'physical', '', 1109.5, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB412\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2105, 'Atosa MCF8722GR 31.5\" Glass Merchandiser, 1 Section, Black Exterior 19.4 Cu.Ft', '\n<p> <br>The Atosa MCF8722GR 31.5\" Glass Merchandiser with a single door and a sleek black exterior is designed to effectively showcase a variety of products in retail environments with limited space. Boasting a capacity of 19.4 cubic feet, this merchandiser offers sufficient storage for beverages, snacks, and other perishable items, making it suitable for convenience stores, cafes, and small retail shops. The glass door provides excellent visibility, allowing customers to easily view the displayed items, which can encourage impulse purchases and enhance the overall shopping experience. Additionally, the clear glass design allows staff to monitor inventory levels without the need to open the door frequently, helping to maintain consistent internal temperatures and energy efficiency.</p>\n<p>Constructed with a durable black exterior, the Atosa MCF8722GR not only enhances the aesthetic appeal of the display but also ensures longevity and resistance to daily wear and tear. Inside, adjustable shelves provide flexibility in organizing products of varying sizes and shapes, optimizing storage space based on specific merchandising needs. The merchandiser is equipped with LED lighting that illuminates the interior, ensuring that the displayed items are well-lit and visually appealing to customers. Overall, the Atosa MCF8722GR combines functionality, space efficiency, and attractive design features to meet the merchandising requirements of small to medium-sized retail establishments.</p>', '\n\nOffers a capacity of 19.4 cubic feet, providing ample space to display a variety of beverages, snacks, and perishable items in retail environments.<br>\n\nSingle glass door enhances visibility of products, allowing customers to easily view items on display and promoting impulse purchases.<br>\n\nSleek black exterior finish enhances the aesthetics of the merchandiser, making it suitable for various retail settings.<br>\n\nInterior shelves are adjustable, allowing for flexible storage configurations to accommodate products of different sizes and shapes.<br>\n\nEquipped with LED lighting to illuminate the interior, ensuring that products are well-lit and visually appealing while minimizing energy consumption.\n', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/MCF8722GR_b3ea7b87-f071-4813-88bd-d2a0ce5013ff.webp\"]', 'MCF8722GR', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 2106, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 27.00, NULL, 81.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 326.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:43:54', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/MCF8722GR_b3ea7b87-f071-4813-88bd-d2a0ce5013ff.webp', 'physical', '', 1362, 4, 0, 8, 0, 'Two Year Parts & Labor Warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB413\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2106, 'Everest Refrigeration ETBF1-LAB 27 3/4\" Back Mount Undercounter Laboratory Freezer, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ETBF1-LAB Undercounter Laboratory Freezer is carefully crafted for secure storage of scientific samples within a compact footprint. Measuring 27 3/4 inches in width, 31 1/2 inches in depth, and 30 1/4 inches in height, this unit offers a 7.5 cubic feet capacity. The freezer features a stainless steel finish and a single solid swing door, combining durability with practical accessibility. It operates on 115V, 60Hz, and 1 Phase, drawing 1 2/5 amps to deliver reliable cooling performance.\n\nEquipped with the cutting-edge Blizzard R290 cooling system, the ETBF1-LAB employs the first all-in-one, slide-out cooling cartridge for effective and rapid cooling. This system simplifies maintenance and removes the need for onsite brazing. The Blizzard R290 refrigerant, a natural and eco-friendly hydrocarbon, provides an efficient alternative to conventional hydrofluorocarbon refrigerants, meeting the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and EPA.\n\nEngineered to offer both functionality and efficiency, the ETBF1-LAB is an ideal choice for laboratories needing a compact and dependable freezer. Its advanced cooling technology and space-saving design make it suitable for various lab applications, ensuring the preservation and safety of valuable scientific materials.', 'Features reliable inverter compressor technology for consistent and stable cooling, ensuring safe storage of critical samples.\nOffers energy-efficient performance, helping to lower energy expenses and reduce environmental impact.\nMore advanced Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge allows for rapid cooling and hassle-free maintenance.\nProvides a compact design with a 7.5 cubic feet capacity, ideal for use in limited space environments such as laboratories.\nEnsures stainless steel finish and swing solid door design enhance durability and ease of access in busy lab settings.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ETBF1-LAB_a5fcd6d0-9f1f-4b28-8e88-d0343cd37e27.webp\"]', 'ETBF1-LAB', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 4152, NULL, NULL, NULL, 27.75, NULL, NULL, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 184.00, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:46:05', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ETBF1-LAB_a5fcd6d0-9f1f-4b28-8e88-d0343cd37e27.webp', 'physical', '', 3558, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB414\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2107, 'Everest Refrigeration EBF2-LAB 54 1/8\" Back Mount Solid Door Laboratory Freezer, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBF2-LAB Laboratory Freezer is crafted to provide dependable and secure storage for scientific samples. With a width of 54 1/8 inches, a depth of 33 1/8 inches, and a height of 77 inches, this freezer offers a substantial 33 cubic feet of storage space. It features a strong stainless steel finish and is equipped with two solid swing doors, ensuring both functionality and durability. The unit operates on 115V, 60Hz, and 1 Phase, with a power draw of 3.3 amps, delivering the necessary performance for demanding laboratory environments.\n\nThe EBF2-LAB utilizes the Blizzard R290 cooling system, featuring the industry\'s first all-in-one, slide-out cooling cartridge. This advanced system facilitates rapid cooling and simplifies maintenance through easy cartridge replacement without the need for onsite brazing. The Blizzard R290 refrigerant is a natural, climate-friendly hydrocarbon, providing an efficient alternative to traditional hydrofluorocarbon-based refrigerants and meeting the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency.\n\nEngineered with a crated weight optimized for safe shipping and handling, the EBF2-LAB is an excellent choice for laboratories that need robust and efficient cold storage. Its combination of advanced cooling technology, spacious design, and eco-friendly refrigerant makes it a reliable solution for maintaining the integrity of critical scientific materials.', 'Features consistent cooling to securely store scientific samples, crucial for laboratory environments.\nOffers energy efficiency that reduces operating costs, benefiting research facilities.\nMore advanced inverter compressor technology provides stable temperature control, ensuring sample integrity.\nProvides easy maintenance with a user-friendly slide-out cooling cartridge, simplifying repairs.\nEnsures an adaptable design with solid swing doors, suitable for various lab settings and applications.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EBF2-LAB_cf05dcb7-236d-47b1-9d3f-dad6a8d46b61.webp\"]', 'EBF2-LAB', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 9218, NULL, NULL, NULL, 54.12, NULL, NULL, NULL, 77.00, NULL, 33.00, NULL, 491.00, NULL, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:46:06', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/EBF2-LAB_cf05dcb7-236d-47b1-9d3f-dad6a8d46b61.webp', 'physical', '', 7900, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB415\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2108, 'Everest Refrigeration EBWF1-LAB 29 1/4\" Bottom Mount Solid Door Laboratory Freezer, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBWF1-LAB Laboratory Freezer is carefully engineered for the precise and secure storage of scientific samples. Measuring 29 1/4 inches in width, 33 1/8 inches in depth, and 77 inches in height, this unit offers a substantial 23 cubic feet of storage capacity. The freezer features a durable stainless steel finish and a solid swing door, ensuring strength and ease of use. It operates on 115V, 60Hz, and 1 Phase, drawing 1.6 amps, and is powered by an advanced inverter compressor that maintains a temperature range from -10F to 54F.\n\nOutfitted with the innovative Blizzard R290 cooling system, the EBWF1-LAB includes the industrys first all-in-one, slide-out cooling cartridge. This system guarantees rapid cooling and simplifies maintenance by allowing for easy replacement without the need for onsite brazing. The Blizzard R290 utilizes a natural, climate-friendly hydrocarbon refrigerant that meets the daily energy consumption standards of the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, delivering effective cooling while significantly lowering energy costs and carbon emissions.\n\nWith a crated weight optimized for secure transport, the EBWF1-LAB is an ideal choice for laboratories requiring precise, reliable, and efficient cold storage solutions. Its combination of advanced technology, user-friendly features, and eco-friendly design ensures peak performance, making it a dependable option for maintaining the integrity of critical scientific samples.', 'Features compact design that fits easily in tight spaces, ideal for laboratories needing efficient storage solutions.\nOffers precise temperature control, ensuring safe and reliable preservation of scientific samples in a range from -10F to 54F.\nProvides energy-efficient operation, lowering energy costs and reducing environmental impact.\nUtilizes advanced inverter compressor technology for consistent and stable cooling performance.\nMore convenient with a user-friendly slide-out cooling cartridge system, making maintenance straightforward and hassle-free.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EBWF1-LAB_e393b9e3-1d9f-45ba-8a58-9a5e4c1542bb.webp\"]', 'EBWF1-LAB', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 5742, NULL, NULL, NULL, 29.25, NULL, NULL, NULL, 77.00, NULL, 33.00, NULL, 341.00, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:46:08', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/EBWF1-LAB_e393b9e3-1d9f-45ba-8a58-9a5e4c1542bb.webp', 'physical', '', 4921, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB416\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2109, 'Everest Refrigeration ETBR1-LAB 27 3/4\" Back Mount Undercounter Laboratory Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBGR2-LAB 2 Glass Door Laboratory Refrigerator is meticulously designed to meet the demanding needs of scientific storage. With dimensions of 54 1/8 inches in width, 33 1/8 inches in depth, and 77 inches in height, this refrigerator offers a substantial storage capacity of 33 cubic feet. Its robust stainless steel finish and swing glass door style provide both durability and easy access, while the dual glass doors allow for effortless monitoring of stored items. Operating on 115V, 60Hz, and 1 Phase, this unit requires 2.1 amps of current and is equipped with an advanced inverter compressor, maintaining a precise temperature range from 32F to 54F.\n\nThe EBGR2-LAB features the cutting-edge Blizzard R290 cooling system, the industry\'s first all-in-one, slide-out cooling cartridge. This innovative design facilitates rapid cooling and ensures easy replacement without the need for onsite brazing. Utilizing a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant, Blizzard R290 meets the daily energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency. This eco-friendly refrigerant not only provides effective cooling but also contributes to significant energy savings and reduced environmental impact.\n\nWeighing approximately 400 lbs when crated, the EBGR2-LAB is engineered for efficiency and reliability, making it an excellent choice for laboratories requiring dependable and precise temperature control. Its combination of transparent double doors, advanced cooling technology, and spacious interior enhances operational efficiency, providing secure and sustainable storage solutions for a wide range of scientific samples.', 'Features double glass doors for clear visibility, allowing easy monitoring of stored samples without opening the doors.\nOffers precise temperature control, ensuring the safety and integrity of sensitive scientific materials.\nProvides eco-friendly cooling technology, helping laboratories save on energy costs and reduce carbon emissions.\nUtilizes inverter compressor technology for consistent and efficient cooling, essential for maintaining sample quality.\nMore user-friendly maintenance with a slide-out cooling cartridge, enhancing convenience in busy lab environments.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ETBR1-LAB_794a7c71-6c6a-41eb-aa34-b642ba96651f.webp\"]', 'ETBR1-LAB', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 3773, NULL, NULL, NULL, 27.75, NULL, NULL, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 184.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:46:09', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ETBR1-LAB_794a7c71-6c6a-41eb-aa34-b642ba96651f.webp', 'physical', '', 3234, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB417\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
