(2111, 'Everest Refrigeration EBGWR1-LAB 29 1/4\" Bottom Mount Laboratory Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBGWR1-LAB 1 Wide Glass Door Laboratory Refrigerator is designed for precise and secure storage of scientific samples. Measuring 29 1/4 inches in width, 33 1/8 inches in depth, and 77 inches in height, this unit offers a generous 23 cubic feet of storage capacity. It features a durable stainless steel finish and a swing glass door style, allowing for easy visibility and access to stored items. The refrigerator operates at 115V, 60Hz, and 1 Phase, drawing 1.4 amps of current, and is equipped with an advanced inverter compressor that maintains a stable temperature range of 32F to 54F.\n\nThis model utilizes the innovative Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge, designed for rapid cooling and easy replacement without the need for onsite brazing. The Blizzard R290 system uses a natural, climate-friendly hydrocarbon refrigerant, complying with the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency. This cutting-edge cooling technology not only ensures the preservation of essential lab items but also contributes to significant reductions in energy costs and carbon emissions.\n\nWeighing approximately 331 lbs when crated, the EBGWR1-LAB is built for durability and efficiency, making it an ideal choice for laboratories that require reliable and precise temperature control. The combination of a glass door for easy monitoring, advanced cooling technology, and a spacious interior enhances operational efficiency, providing secure and sustainable storage solutions for a wide range of scientific samples.', 'Features a glass door for easy visibility, allowing quick access to stored samples without opening the door.\nOffers stable temperature control, ensuring reliable preservation of sensitive scientific materials.\nProvides eco-friendly cooling, helping laboratories reduce energy costs and carbon footprint.\nUtilizes inverter compressor technology for consistent and efficient cooling, crucial for maintaining sample integrity.\nMore convenient maintenance with a slide-out cooling cartridge, streamlining operations in busy lab environments.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EBGWR1-LAB_09975d90-9220-4c38-95f7-429d1820d749.webp\"]', 'EBGWR1-LAB', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 5609, NULL, NULL, NULL, 27.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 77.00, NULL, 33.00, NULL, 336.00, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:46:12', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/EBGWR1-LAB_09975d90-9220-4c38-95f7-429d1820d749.webp', 'physical', '', 4808, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB419\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2112, 'Everest Refrigeration EBR2-LAB 54 1/8\" Bottom Mount Solid Door Laboratory Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBR2-LAB 2 Door Laboratory Refrigerator is engineered for the precise and secure storage of scientific samples. With dimensions of 54 1/8 inches in width, 33 1/8 inches in depth, and 77 inches in height, this unit offers a substantial 33 cubic feet of storage capacity. It features a durable stainless steel finish and a swing solid door style, ensuring reliable performance in demanding laboratory settings. Operating at 115V, 60Hz, and 1 Phase with a current draw of 1.8 amps, this refrigerator is equipped with an advanced inverter compressor that maintains a consistent temperature range of 32F to 54F.\n\nThe EBR2-LAB is integrated with the innovative Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge, designed for rapid cooling and ease of replacement without the need for onsite brazing. This system utilizes a natural, climate-friendly hydrocarbon refrigerant, meeting the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency. This advanced cooling technology not only ensures the preservation of essential lab items but also contributes to significant reductions in energy costs and carbon emissions.\n\nWeighing approximately 477 lbs when crated, this refrigerator is built for durability and efficiency, making it an ideal choice for laboratories that require reliable and precise temperature control. The spacious interior and state-of-the-art cooling technology enhance operational efficiency, providing secure and sustainable storage solutions for a wide range of scientific samples.', 'Features precise temperature control, ensuring the safe storage of critical scientific samples in laboratories.\nOffers a spacious design, providing ample storage capacity for various laboratory needs.\nProvides eco-friendly cooling solutions, reducing energy consumption and supporting sustainable practices.\nUtil