(2113, 'Everest Refrigeration EBWR1-LAB 29 1/4\" Bottom Mount Solid Door Laboratory Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBWR1-LAB 1 Wide Door Laboratory Refrigerator is specifically designed for the precise and secure storage of scientific samples. This unit, with a width of 29 1/4 inches, a depth of 33 1/8 inches, and a height of 77 inches, provides a substantial 23 cubic feet of storage capacity. It features a swing solid door style and operates on 115V, 60Hz, and 1 Phase with a current draw of 1.2 amps. The refrigerator is powered by a 1/3 HP inverter compressor, ensuring reliable and stable cooling with a temperature range of 32F to 54F.\n\nEquipped with the innovative Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge, this laboratory refrigerator offers rapid cooling and ease of maintenance. The Blizzard R290 uses a natural, climate-friendly hydrocarbon refrigerant that meets the energy consumption standards of the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency. This advanced cooling system not only ensures the safe storage of essential lab items but also contributes to significant reductions in energy costs and carbon emissions.\n\nWeighing approximately 417 lbs when crated, the EBWR1-LAB is built for durability and efficiency. Its spacious interior and advanced cooling technology make it an ideal choice for laboratories that require reliable and precise temperature control. This refrigerator is designed to enhance the operational efficiency and sustainability of laboratory environments, providing secure storage for a wide range of scientific samples.', 'Features reliable temperature control, ensuring the safe storage of scientific samples, essential for laboratories.\nOffers a spacious interior, providing ample room for storing a variety of lab materials securely.\nProvides eco-friendly cooling, reducing energy costs and supporting sustainable practices in laboratory environments.\nUtilizes advanced inverter compressor technology for consistent and stable cooling, ideal for preserving sensitive samples.\nMore efficient cooling system, enhancing operational efficiency and reducing maintenance time in lab settings.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EBWR1-LAB_1fcaf201-4886-4db7-af13-1f5a2998b4a6.webp\"]', 'EBWR1-LAB', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 5292, NULL, NULL, NULL, 29.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 77.00, NULL, 33.00, NULL, 341.00, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:46:14', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/EBWR1-LAB_1fcaf201-4886-4db7-af13-1f5a2998b4a6.webp', 'physical', '', 4536, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB421\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2114, 'Everest Refrigeration EMGR69C 72 7/8\" Bottom Mount Chromatography Sliding Door Refrigerators, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EMGR69C is designed for laboratory environments, featuring a modern white finish and sliding glass doors. It offers a generous 69 cubic feet of storage, with dimensions of 72 7/8 inches in width, 30 3/4 inches in depth, and 80 1/8 inches in height. Operating on 115V, 60Hz, and 7 amps, it is powered by a 3/4 HP compressor.\n\nThis refrigerator incorporates the Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge, providing efficient and reliable cooling with its natural hydrocarbon refrigerant. The unit is equipped with double-pane UV-reflective glass doors and bright LED lighting, which enhances visibility while conserving energy. It also includes access ports for external connections and an in-cabinet power outlet, making it suitable for laboratory tools and equipment.\n\nThe EMGR69C features a built-in thermometer, multiple shelves, and sturdy construction to meet the demands of high-traffic environments. It adheres to the energy consumption standards established by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, ensuring it meets modern energy efficiency requirements.', 'Provides sliding glass doors for easy access and clear visibility, making it ideal for lab setups, hotels, and restaurants.\nIncludes access ports for external connections and an in-cabinet power outlet to support laboratory tools and equipment.\nEnsures easy maintenance with a slide-out cooling cartridge that simplifies repairs and reduces downtime.\nEquipped with vivid LED lighting, offering clear illumination of contents while being energy efficient.\nUses a climate-friendly refrigerant that helps lower energy costs and cut carbon emissions, beneficial for both labs and commercial kitchens.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EMGR69C_81d05ad2-8e37-49b5-8ca8-0df3d2fa988c.webp\"]', 'EMGR69C', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1,