(2115, 'Everest Refrigeration EMGR48C 53 1/8\" Bottom Mount Chromatography Sliding Door Refrigerators, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EMGR48C is a 2-door chromatography refrigerator crafted to meet the rigorous demands of laboratory environments. With a generous 48 cubic feet of capacity, it measures 53 1/8 inches in width, 30 3/4 inches in depth, and 80 1/8 inches in height. The unit features a sleek white finish and sliding glass doors, combining durability with efficient space utilization. Operating on 115V, 60Hz, and 1 Phase, it draws 5.5 amps and is powered by a 1/2 horsepower compressor.\n\nEquipped with the Blizzard R290 cooling system, the EMGR48C incorporates an advanced all-in-one, slide-out cartridge that provides rapid and reliable cooling. The R290 refrigerant, a natural hydrocarbon, meets U.S. Department of Energy and EPA standards, offering a climate-friendly alternative to traditional refrigerants and achieving significant reductions in energy costs and carbon emissions.\n\nAdditional features include access ports for external connections and a built-in power outlet, enhancing convenience for laboratory operations. The bright, low-heat LED lighting improves visibility inside the unit while maintaining energy efficiency. Designed to deliver secure and effective cooling, the EMGR48C ensures optimal storage conditions for essential laboratory samples.', 'Provides precise cooling with a temperature range of 32F to 54F, ensuring the safe storage of valuable lab samples.\nIncludes access ports for external lines and an in-cabinet power outlet for easy use of lab equipment like mixers and shakers.\nComes with UV-reflective glass doors and energy-efficient LED lighting, enhancing visibility while minimizing heat output.\nEquipped with Blizzard R290 cooling technology for rapid and reliable cooling, reducing the need for frequent maintenance.\nDesigned for energy efficiency with a climate-friendly refrigerant, helping to lower operational costs and reduce carbon emissions.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EMGR48C_f71d651a-541b-4bfd-a5ae-88d42fb12327.webp\"]', 'EMGR48C', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 4522, NULL, NULL, NULL, 53.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 80.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 535.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:46:16', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/EMGR48C_f71d651a-541b-4bfd-a5ae-88d42fb12327.webp', 'physical', '', 3875, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB423\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2116, 'Everest Refrigeration EMGR33C 39 3/8\" Bottom Mount Chromatography Sliding Door Refrigerators, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EMGR33C is a 2-door chromatography refrigerator engineered to fulfill the needs of laboratory environments. It provides 33 cubic feet of storage space and measures 39 3/8 inches in width, 30 3/4 inches in depth, and 80 1/8 inches in height. Featuring a sleek white finish and sliding glass doors, it offers easy access to the contents while maximizing space in busy labs. Operating on 115V, 60Hz, and 1 Phase, with a current draw of 2.5 amps, it is powered by a 1/3 horsepower compressor.\n\nThis model utilizes the Blizzard R290 cooling system, which includes an innovative slide-out cartridge for efficient and safe cooling. The R290 refrigerant, a natural hydrocarbon, meets U.S. Department of Energy and EPA standards, offering an eco-friendly alternative to hydrofluorocarbon-based refrigerants. This system significantly reduces energy costs and carbon emissions.\n\nAdditional features of the EMGR33C include access ports for external lines and a built-in power outlet for convenience. The vivid, low-heat LED lighting enhances visibility inside the unit while ensuring energy efficiency. Designed for reliable and effective cooling, this refrigerator is ideal for securely storing critical samples in laboratory settings.', 'Offers 33 cubic feet of storage space, providing ample room for laboratory samples and equipment.\nIncludes sliding glass doors that enhance access and visibility while making optimal use of space.\nFeatures an in-cabinet power outlet, allowing for the use of laboratory tools like mixers and shakers directly within the refrigerator.\nEquipped with double-pane, UV-reflective glass doors that safeguard samples from light and maintain temperature stability.\nProvides vivid, low-heat LED lighting to improve interior visibility while reducing energy consumption and heat generation.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\