(2117, 'Everest Refrigeration EMSGR69C 72 1/8\" Bottom Mount Chromatography Swing Door Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EMSGR69C is a 3-door chromatography refrigerator designed to meet the rigorous needs of laboratory environments. It offers a substantial 71 cubic feet of capacity, with dimensions of 72 1/8 inches in width, 32 inches in depth, and 80 1/8 inches in height. This unit features a white finish and is equipped with three swing glass doors, allowing easy access and visibility of stored items. It operates on 115V, 60Hz, and 1 Phase, with a current draw of 7 amps and is powered by a 3/4 horsepower compressor.\n\nThe refrigerator includes the Blizzard R290 cooling system, which integrates a slide-out cartridge for efficient cooling and straightforward maintenance. The R290 refrigerant is an eco-friendly hydrocarbon that meets U.S. Department of Energy and EPA standards for energy consumption, helping to lower both energy costs and carbon emissions.\n\nAdditional features include access ports for external lines and a built-in power outlet, which supports the operation of laboratory tools. The vivid, low-heat LED lighting ensures clear interior visibility while maintaining energy efficiency. This model is designed to provide reliable and efficient cooling for laboratory settings, ensuring the safe storage of critical samples.', 'Includes advanced access ports for connecting external equipment, perfect for integrating mixers, shakers, and other lab tools.\nProvides efficient cooling with bright LED lighting to enhance the visibility of samples.\nFeatures double-pane, UV-reflective glass doors that help maintain stable internal conditions and offer clear visibility.\nUtilizes an energy-efficient Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge for quick and dependable temperature control.\nContributes to a significant reduction in energy consumption and carbon emissions, leading to lower operational costs.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite