(2118, 'Everest Refrigeration EMSGR48C 39 3/8\" Bottom Mount Chromatography Swing Door Refrigerators, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EMSGR33C Chromatography Refrigerator is designed to meet the rigorous demands of laboratory environments, offering 36 cubic feet of internal storage. With dimensions of 39 3/8 inches in width, 32 inches in depth, and 80 1/8 inches in height, this unit features a white finish and is equipped with two swing glass doors. Operating on 115V, 60Hz, and 1 Phase, it draws 2.5 amps and is powered by a 1/3 horsepower compressor, ensuring dependable cooling performance.\n\nThis model integrates the Blizzard R290 cooling system, featuring an all-in-one, slide-out cartridge that allows for swift cooling and easy maintenance without onsite brazing. The system employs a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant, offering a climate-friendly alternative to conventional hydrofluorocarbon refrigerants, and complies with the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the EPA.\n\nEngineered for laboratory use, the refrigerator includes practical features such as access ports for external lines and a built-in power outlet for laboratory equipment. The low-heat LED lighting enhances visibility inside the unit, while the UV-reflective glass doors help maintain a stable internal environment. These features make the EMSGR33C an efficient and reliable choice for chromatography and various laboratory applications.', 'Features a generous 36 cubic feet capacity, perfect for storing a variety of laboratory samples and equipment.\nOffers double-pane glass doors for clear visibility and a stable internal environment.\nIncludes an in-cabinet power outlet for convenient use of lab tools such as mixers and shakers.\nProvides low-heat LED lighting that enhances interior visibility without affecting temperature stability.\nUtilizes the Blizzard R290 cooling system, known for its efficient and easy-to-maintain design, helping to cut energy costs.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EMSGR48C_9f65387a-1778-4be2-bc81-13735eb08577.webp\"]', 'EMSGR48C', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 4752, NULL, NULL, NULL, 53.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 80.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 524.00, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:46:20', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/EMSGR48C_9f65387a-1778-4be2-bc81-13735eb08577.webp', 'physical', '', 4073, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB426\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2119, 'Everest Refrigeration EMGR24C 28 3/8\" Bottom Mount Chromatography Swing Door Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EMGR24C Chromatography Refrigerator is designed to meet the rigorous demands of laboratory environments. With an internal capacity of 25 cubic feet, it measures 28 3/8 inches in width, 32 inches in depth, and 80 1/8 inches in height. This unit features a white finish and a swing glass door, providing both durability and ease of access. Operating on 115V, 60Hz, and 1 Phase with a draw of 2.5 amps, the refrigerator uses a 1/3 horsepower compressor to deliver reliable cooling performance.\n\nThe refrigerator is equipped with the innovative Blizzard R290 cooling system, which includes a slide-out cartridge designed for rapid cooling and simplified maintenance. This system uses natural, climate-friendly hydrocarbon refrigerant, offering an effective and environmentally responsible alternative to traditional hydrofluorocarbon-based refrigerants. The Blizzard R290 system aligns with the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the EPA.\n\nIn addition to its cooling capabilities, the EMGR24C includes features tailored for laboratory use, such as access ports for external lines and a dedicated power outlet for lab equipment. The double-pane glass doors are UV-reflective to protect stored items from light, while low-heat LED lighting enhances visibility without affecting internal conditions. This combination of features ensures that the EMGR24C provides efficient, reliable performance for various chromatography applications.', 'Features dependable inverter compressor technology, which ensures consistent cooling for sensitive laboratory samples.\nOffers a spacious 25 cubic feet interior, ideal for accommodating a wide range of laboratory materials.\nUtilizes an advanced Blizzard R290 cooling system for rapid temperature adjustments and simplified maintenance.\nIncludes a swing glass door, facilitatin