blished', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ESC47L_5af8e9a2-a5a6-4ffb-9400-4541d102e4ea.webp\"]', 'ESC47L', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 2519, NULL, NULL, NULL, 47.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 11.00, NULL, 14.00, NULL, 105.00, NULL, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:46:31', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ESC47L_5af8e9a2-a5a6-4ffb-9400-4541d102e4ea.webp', 'physical', '', 2159, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB435\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2128, 'Everest Refrigeration EGC65 64 5/8\" Side Mount Solid Slide Lid Glass &amp; Plate Chiller, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EGC65 64 5/8\" Side Mount Solid Slide Lid Glass &amp; Plate Chiller Freezer is engineered for performance in demanding foodservice environments. Manufactured by Everest Refrigeration, this unit features a sleek black finish and a practical solid slide lid design. It offers a substantial capacity of 21 cu. ft., with dimensions of 64.625 inches in width, 26.75 inches in depth, and 33.75 inches in height.\n\nEquipped with Blizzard R290 technology, this chiller freezer uses a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant, meeting the stringent energy consumption standards of the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency. The innovative slide-out cooling cartridge ensures quick maintenance and enhanced safety.\n\nOperating on 115 volts, 60 Hz, and 5 amps with a 1/2 horsepower compressor, the EGC65 has a crated weight of 314 lbs. It is designed to provide reliable and efficient storage for glassware and plates, making it an ideal choice for hotels, restaurants, and cafes where both performance and energy efficiency are critical.', 'Features a 21 cu. ft. capacity, providing ample space for glassware and plates, making it ideal for busy bars and kitchens.\nEnsures secure storage and easy access with a solid slide lid, promoting efficiency in high-traffic environments like restaurants and hotels.\nEnhanced cooling with Blizzard R290 technology, which helps in reducing energy costs and carbon emissions, supporting eco-friendly practices.\nComes with a slide-out cooling cartridge for easy maintenance and safe operation, streamlining upkeep in commercial settings.\nIncludes a 64.625-inch width, fitting well in various kitchen layouts and maximizing available space.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EGC65_e9a8ce25-438f-447a-8bb8-391a965b6966.webp\"]', 'EGC65', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0,