(2129, 'Everest Refrigeration EGC50 49 1/2\" Side Mount Solid Slide Lid Glass &amp; Plate Chiller, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EGC50 49 1/2\" Side Mount Solid Slide Lid Glass &amp; Plate Chiller Freezer is designed for efficiency and reliability in high-demand environments. Constructed by Everest Refrigeration, this unit features a stylish black finish and a practical solid slide lid for easy access. With a capacity of 15 cu. ft., it measures 49.5 inches in width, 26.75 inches in depth, and 33.75 inches in height.\n\nThis chiller freezer uses Blizzard R290 technology, employing natural hydrocarbon refrigerant for superior cooling performance while meeting the energy standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency. The slide-out cooling cartridge enhances safety and simplifies maintenance.\n\nOperating on 115 volts, 60 Hz, and 5 amps with a 1/2 horsepower compressor, the EGC50 has a crated weight of 263 lbs. It is specifically designed for efficient storage of glassware and plates, making it an ideal choice for hotels, restaurants, and cafes where reliability and energy efficiency are crucial.', 'Features a 15 cu. ft. capacity, providing generous storage for glassware and plates, making it suitable for busy commercial settings.\nEnsures secure storage and easy access with a solid slide lid design, ideal for use in restaurants, hotels, and cafes.\nEnhanced cooling with Blizzard R290 technology, reducing energy costs and carbon emissions for eco-friendly operations.\nComes with a slide-out cooling cartridge, facilitating quick maintenance and ensuring safe operation.\nIncludes a 49.5-inch width, fitting seamlessly into various kitchen configurations and maximizing workspace.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EGC50_46d4cfc5-fa95-492a-bf01-ad8f1bacfacc.webp\"]', 'EGC50', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 2679, NULL, NULL, NULL, 50.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 27.00, NULL, 263