(2130, 'Everest Refrigeration EGC37 36 3/4\" Side Mount Solid Slide Lid Glass &amp; Plate Chiller, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EGC37 36 3/4\" Side Mount Solid Slide Lid Glass &amp; Plate Chiller Freezer is an essential addition to any commercial kitchen or bar setup. Manufactured by Everest Refrigeration, this model features a sleek black finish and a solid slide lid design for secure and easy access. With an 11 cu. ft. capacity, it measures 36.75 inches in width, 26.75 inches in depth, and 33.75 inches in height.\n\nThis chiller freezer is equipped with the Blizzard R290 cooling system, using a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant. This innovative system is designed for efficient cooling while meeting the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency. The slide-out cooling cartridge enhances both safety and maintenance ease.\n\nOperating at 115 volts, 60 Hz, with a single phase and 5 amps, the unit includes a 1/2 horsepower compressor and has a crated weight of 209 lbs. The EGC37 is perfect for storing and chilling plates and glasses, making it suitable for high-demand settings in hotels, restaurants, and cafes where reliable performance and energy efficiency are key.', 'Features an 11 cu. ft. capacity, providing ample space for storing plates and glasses efficiently in busy dining environments.\nOffers a solid slide lid design, allowing easy access and secure storage, perfect for hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nMore energy-efficient cooling with the Blizzard R290 system, designed to reduce energy costs and carbon emissions.\nIncludes a user-friendly slide-out cooling cartridge for simplified maintenance and enhanced safety.\nProvides a width of 36.75 inches, fitting conveniently in various commercial kitchen layouts.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EGC37_6c7ddb1f-b652-4949-9144-5ba68e0b8361.webp\"]', 'EGC37', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 2335, NULL, N