(2131, 'Everest Refrigeration EBC95 95 1/8\" Side Mount Horizontal Bottle Cooler Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBC95 95 1/8\" Side Mount Horizontal Bottle Cooler Refrigerator is designed for high-demand settings in the food and drink industry. Produced by Everest Refrigeration, this model features a black finish and three swing solid doors, offering a substantial 31 cu. ft. capacity. It measures 95.125 inches in width, 26.75 inches in depth, and 33.75 inches in height.\n\nEquipped with the Blizzard R290 cooling system, the refrigerator uses a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant, providing effective cooling while minimizing environmental impact. The slide-out cooling cartridge design simplifies maintenance, eliminating the need for onsite brazing and ensuring reliability. This unit meets the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency.\n\nOperating at 115 volts, 60 Hz, with a single phase and 2.5 amps, the EBC95 features a 1/3 horsepower compressor and has a crated weight of 421 lbs. Its large capacity and efficient cooling make it ideal for bars, hotels, and restaurants where high storage volume and energy efficiency are essential.', 'Features a generous 31 cu. ft. capacity, providing ample space for high-volume storage of bottles and cans in busy food and drink establishments.\nOffers a sleek black finish with three swing solid doors, enhancing both the aesthetics and functionality of your bar or restaurant setup.\nMore efficient cooling with the Blizzard R290 system, designed to cut down on energy consumption and environmental impact.\nIncludes a user-friendly slide-out cooling cartridge for easy maintenance and repair, ensuring consistent performance.\nProvides a width of 95.125 inches, accommodating larger setups and fitting seamlessly into various commercial environments.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EBC95_36fda3c7-31b6-4bf2-b5fc-