(2132, 'Everest Refrigeration EBC80 80 1/2\" Side Mount Horizontal Bottle Cooler Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBC80 80 1/2\" Side Mount Horizontal Bottle Cooler Refrigerator is built to support high-demand environments in the food and beverage sector. Manufactured by Everest Refrigeration, this unit features a black finish with three swing solid doors and a substantial 26 cu. ft. storage capacity. It measures 80.5 inches in width, 26.75 inches in depth, and 33.75 inches in height.\n\nThis model is equipped with the Blizzard R290 cooling system, which utilizes a natural, climate-friendly hydrocarbon refrigerant. The system ensures rapid cooling and simplifies maintenance with its slide-out cartridge design, avoiding the need for onsite brazing. The refrigerator meets energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, promoting cost savings and reduced carbon emissions.\n\nOperating on 115 volts, 60 Hz, with a single phase and 2.5 amps, the EBC80 features a 1/3 horsepower compressor and a crated weight of 348 lbs. Its combination of effective cooling, ample storage, and sleek design makes it ideal for use in bars, restaurants, and hotels.', 'Features a spacious 26 cu. ft. capacity, offering ample storage for bottles and cans in busy bars, hotels, and restaurants.\nProvides a sleek black finish and three swing solid doors, enhancing the modern look and accessibility in commercial settings.\nMore effective cooling with the Blizzard R290 system, designed to lower energy costs and reduce environmental impact.\nIncludes an easy-to-service slide-out cooling cartridge, simplifying maintenance and ensuring dependable operation.\nOffers a compact design with a width of 80.5 inches, fitting seamlessly into various bar and beverage service areas.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EBC80_01c42a77-5c0b-459e-8b37-ad4504b78f67.webp\"]', 'EBC80', 0, NULL, 0, 0