(2133, 'Everest Refrigeration EBC65 64 5/8\" Side Mount Horizontal Bottle Cooler Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBC65 64 5/8\" Side Mount Horizontal Bottle Cooler Refrigerator is engineered to meet the demands of the food and beverage industry. Manufactured by Everest Refrigeration, this model features a durable black finish and comes with two swing solid doors. It has a generous 21 cu. ft. capacity, with overall dimensions of 64.625 inches in width, 26.75 inches in depth, and 33.75 inches in height.\n\nThis refrigerator is equipped with the Blizzard R290 cooling system, which uses an eco-friendly hydrocarbon refrigerant. The system is designed for rapid cooling and easy maintenance, eliminating the need for onsite brazing. It adheres to energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, contributing to reduced energy costs and lower carbon emissions.\n\nThe EBC65 operates on 115 volts, 60 Hz, with a single phase and 3.5 amps. It features a 1/4+ horsepower compressor and has a crated weight of 285 lbs. The units combination of performance and design makes it suitable for use in bars, cafes, and hotels, providing reliable beverage storage and efficient cooling.', 'Features a 21 cu. ft. storage capacity, providing ample space for organizing bottles and cans efficiently in busy bars, hotels, and restaurants.\nOffers a sleek black finish and swing solid doors that add a modern, professional look to any commercial setting.\nMore efficient cooling with the Blizzard R290 system, designed to minimize energy costs and environmental impact through effective refrigerant use.\nIncludes easy-to-maintain slide-out cooling cartridge for quick service and reliable performance, ideal for high-traffic environments.\nProvides a compact yet spacious design with a width of 64.625 inches, fitting well into various bar and beverage service areas.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storag