(2134, 'Everest Refrigeration EBC50 49 1/2\" Side Mount Horizontal Bottle Cooler Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBC50 49 1/2\" Side Mount Horizontal Bottle Cooler Refrigerator is designed for high-performance beverage storage in commercial settings. Manufactured by Everest Refrigeration, this model features a sleek black finish and comes with two swing solid doors. It offers a 15 cu. ft. capacity and has dimensions of 49.5 inches in width, 26.75 inches in depth, and 33.75 inches in height.\n\nThis unit utilizes the Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge, which incorporates a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant for enhanced cooling efficiency. The R290 system ensures rapid cooling while being environmentally friendly and meeting the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency. This system also eliminates the need for onsite brazing, making maintenance easier.\n\nThe EBC50 operates on 115 volts, 60 Hz, with a single phase and 3.5 amps. It features a 1/4+ horsepower compressor and weighs 235 lbs when crated. Combining functionality with a sleek design, the EBC50 is well-suited for use in bars, cafes, and hotels, offering reliable performance and efficiency.', 'Features a spacious 15 cu. ft. interior, ideal for efficient bottle storage and organization in bars, restaurants, and hotels.\nOffers a modern black finish that complements any commercial setting, providing a professional look.\nMore efficient cooling with the Blizzard R290 system, designed to lower energy costs and reduce carbon emissions, making it eco-friendly.\nIncludes dual swing solid doors for easy access and restocking, enhancing convenience in busy environments.\nProvides a compact size with a width of 49.5 inches, fitting well in various setups while offering substantial storage space.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EBC50_93870047-d23a-4240-a328-1ef9a0d407a9.webp\"]', 'EBC50', 0, N