(2135, 'Everest Refrigeration EBC37 36 3/4\" Side Mount Horizontal Bottle Cooler Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBC37 36 3/4\" Side Mount Horizontal Bottle Cooler Refrigerator is an excellent solution for the beverage storage needs of commercial establishments. Made by Everest Refrigeration, this model features a sleek black finish and is equipped with a single swing solid door. It offers an 11 cu. ft. capacity and measures 36.75 inches in width, 26.75 inches in depth, and 33.75 inches in height.\n\nThis bottle cooler uses the Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge, which incorporates a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant that is both climate-friendly and efficient. The R290 system is designed to provide rapid cooling and ease of maintenance, eliminating the need for onsite brazing. It complies with the energy standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, resulting in lower energy consumption and reduced carbon emissions.\n\nOperating on 115 volts, 60 Hz, and a single phase with 3.5 amps, the unit features a 1/4+ horsepower compressor and weighs 197 lbs when crated. The EBC37 combines a modern design with effective performance, making it a valuable addition to bars, cafes, and hotels.', 'Features a spacious 11 cu. ft. interior, ideal for storing and organizing bottles in bars, restaurants, and hotels.\nOffers a sleek black finish that enhances the look of any commercial setting, providing a professional appearance.\nMore efficient cooling with the Blizzard R290 system, designed to reduce energy costs and lower carbon emissions, contributing to a greener operation.\nIncludes a convenient swing solid door for easy access and quick restocking, perfect for busy environments.\nProvides a compact design with a width of 36.75 inches, fitting well in various spaces while offering substantial storage capacity.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EBC37_c0b76150-fe72-4e00-8320-0a2