(2136, 'Everest Refrigeration EBD4-CT 89 1/4\" Side Mount Club Top Direct Draw Keg Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBD4-CT 89 1/4\" Side Mount Club Top Direct Draw Keg Refrigerator is a premium choice for the food and drink industry. Manufactured by Everest Refrigeration, this model comes with a sleek black finish and features three swing solid doors. With an expansive 32 cu. ft. capacity, it measures 89.25 inches in width, 27 inches in depth, and 37.25 inches in height, making it well-suited for high-demand commercial environments.\n\nThis unit incorporates the Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge, which uses a natural, climate-friendly hydrocarbon refrigerant. This system is designed for rapid cooling and ease of maintenance without requiring onsite brazing. The R290 refrigerant complies with the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, offering a reduction in energy use and carbon emissions.\n\nOperating on 115 volts, 60 Hz, and a single phase with 2.5 amps, the refrigerator is equipped with a 1/3 horsepower compressor and weighs 415 lbs when crated. The EBD4-CT combines a modern design with efficient performance, making it a reliable choice for bars, hotels, and restaurants.', 'Features a spacious 32 cu. ft. interior, ideal for storing large quantities of kegs and beverages in busy bars and restaurants.\nOffers a sleek black finish that complements various commercial decors, enhancing the appearance of your bar or caf\nMore efficient cooling with the Blizzard R290 system, designed to lower energy costs and reduce carbon emissions, making it eco-friendly.\nIncludes a practical swing solid door for easy access, streamlining operations in high-traffic environments like hotels and bars.\nProvides a durable construction with a 3-door setup, ensuring reliability and ease of use for demanding commercial settings.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/produc