(2137, 'Everest Refrigeration EBD3-CT 68\" Side Mount Club Top Direct Draw Keg Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBD3-CT 68\" Side Mount Club Top Direct Draw Keg Refrigerator is an advanced solution for the food and beverage industry. Manufactured by Everest Refrigeration, this unit features a sleek black finish and is equipped with a swing solid door. With dimensions of 68 inches in width, 27 inches in depth, and 37.25 inches in height, it offers a generous 24 cu. ft. capacity, perfect for high-volume usage in bars, hotels, and restaurants.\n\nThis refrigerator employs the Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge, a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant designed for efficient and eco-friendly performance. The slide-out cooling cartridge ensures rapid cooling and ease of replacement without requiring onsite brazing. It meets the U.S. Department of Energy and Environmental Protection Agency\'s standards, contributing to reduced energy consumption and lower carbon emissions.\n\nOperating on 115 volts, 60 Hz, and a single phase with 3.5 amps, the unit includes a 1/4+ horsepower compressor. It has a crated weight of 335 lbs. This model combines durability with efficiency, making it an excellent choice for high-demand commercial environments.', 'Features a sleek black finish that adds a modern touch to bars and restaurants, seamlessly blending with any decor.\nOffers a spacious 24 cu. ft. capacity with a club top design, providing ample storage for kegs and beverages in high-traffic environments.\nMore efficient cooling is provided by the Blizzard R290 system, which cuts down on energy costs and minimizes carbon emissions.\nIncludes a practical swing solid door for easy access, enhancing convenience in busy settings such as hotels and cafes.\nProvides a durable construction, making it well-suited for the rigorous demands of commercial use.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EBD3-CT_37516900-f6ca-4f68-af32-d26a34ea0fd1.web