(2150, 'Everest Refrigeration EBD3-24 68\" Side Mount Direct Draw Keg Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBD3-24 68\" Side Mount Direct Draw Keg Refrigerator is a versatile and reliable choice for bar equipment needs. It features a black finish and swing solid door style, offering durability and ease of use in commercial settings. The refrigerator is equipped with a Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge, known for its rapid cooling capabilities and environmental benefits. This natural hydrocarbon refrigerant meets the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, leading to lower energy costs and reduced carbon emissions.\n\nWith dimensions of 68 inches in width, 24.5 inches in depth, and 37.25 inches in height, this unit provides ample space with a 20 cu. ft. capacity, making it suitable for storing numerous kegs or bottles. The unit operates at 115V, 60Hz, with a single phase connection and 3.5 amps. The compressor, rated at 1/4+ horsepower, ensures effective and reliable cooling performance. Its sturdy construction and compact size make it an excellent choice for both small and large bar areas, seamlessly fitting into a variety of setups.\n\nThe refrigerator features a NEMA plug type and a power cord length that facilitates flexible placement. With a crated weight of 299 lbs, it reflects a robust build designed to endure the demands of daily use in commercial environments. The unit comes with a comprehensive warranty and is easy to install, providing dependable performance and convenience for various food and drink establishments. The side mount design allows for efficient space utilization, making it a practical addition to any bar setup.', 'Features a sleek black finish, enhancing the appearance of any bar or service area in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nProvides a swing solid door design for easy access and secure closure, ideal for high-traffic environments.\nEmploys a Bli