(2151, 'Everest Refrigeration EBD2-24 57 3/4\" Side Mount Direct Draw Keg Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBD2-24 Side Mount Direct Draw Keg Refrigerator is designed to meet the rigorous demands of commercial beverage service. With a generous 17 cu. ft. capacity, it efficiently stores and dispenses multiple kegs, making it ideal for busy bars and restaurants.\n\nThis model features Blizzard R290 cooling technology, which includes an innovative slide-out cartridge for easy maintenance and fast cooling. The use of R290 refrigerant, a natural and eco-friendly hydrocarbon, aligns with energy efficiency standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, contributing to lower energy costs and reduced carbon emissions.\n\nWith dimensions of 57 3/4 inches in width, 24 1/2 inches in depth, and 37 1/4 inches in height, the EBD2-24 is designed to fit seamlessly into various setups. Its two solid swing doors provide durable access, while the 1/4+ horsepower compressor operates efficiently on 115 V, 60 Hz, 1 Phase, and 3.5 amps, ensuring dependable performance for high-demand environments.', 'Provides 17 cu. ft. of storage space, accommodating multiple kegs for efficient beverage service in high-volume settings.\nUtilizes Blizzard R290 technology, featuring a slide-out cooling cartridge that simplifies maintenance and ensures rapid cooling.\nEquipped with two solid swing doors, offering easy access while maintaining robust construction for durability.\nMeasures 57 3/4 inches in width, 24 1/2 inches in depth, and 37 1/4 inches in height, making it a versatile fit for various bar and kitchen environments.\nRuns on a 1/4+ horsepower compressor, with a power requirement of 115 V, 60 Hz, 1 Phase, and 3.5 amps, ensuring reliable and efficient operation.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EBD2-24_ed665d89-4b81-40ee-ba5c-142b6ee57930.webp\"]', 'EBD2-24', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 30