(2152, 'Everest Refrigeration EBDS2-24 49\" Side Mount Direct Draw Keg Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBDS2-24 Side Mount Direct Draw Keg Refrigerator is specifically designed for efficient keg storage and direct dispensing, ideal for high-traffic commercial environments. With a capacity of 13 cu. ft., it offers sufficient space to accommodate multiple kegs, streamlining beverage service in bars and restaurants.\n\nThis model is integrated with Blizzard R290 cooling technology, which features a unique slide-out cooling cartridge. This innovation allows for rapid cooling and simplifies maintenance by eliminating the need for onsite brazing. The use of R290 refrigerant, a natural and climate-friendly hydrocarbon, supports lower energy consumption and reduced carbon emissions, in line with standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency.\n\nThe EBDS2-24\'s dimensions49 inches wide, 24 1/2 inches deep, and 37 1/4 inches highmake it a versatile choice for various setups, while its two solid swing doors ensure easy access and durability. Operating on a 1/4+ horsepower compressor with a power requirement of 115 V, 60 Hz, 1 Phase at 3.5 amps, this unit combines efficiency with reliable performance, meeting the demands of a busy beverage service environment.', 'Offers a 13 cu. ft. capacity, providing ample space for efficient keg storage and direct dispensing in commercial settings.\nEquipped with Blizzard R290 cooling technology, featuring a slide-out cartridge for quick and easy maintenance and repair.\nConstructed with two solid swing doors, ensuring secure access to the interior while enhancing durability.\nCompact design with dimensions of 49 inches in width, 24 1/2 inches in depth, and 37 1/4 inches in height, making it suitable for various bar and kitchen layouts.\nOperates on a 1/4+ horsepower compressor, with a power requirement of 115 V, 60 Hz, 1 Phase, and 3.5 amps for reliable performance.',