(2153, 'Everest Refrigeration EBD4 89 1/4\" Side Mount Direct Draw Keg Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBD4 Side Mount Direct Draw Keg Refrigerator is an ideal choice for high-demand commercial environments requiring substantial keg storage. With its 32 cu. ft. capacity, this model offers ample space for multiple kegs, facilitating efficient beverage service in busy settings such as bars and restaurants.\n\nThis unit is equipped with Blizzard R290 technology, featuring an innovative slide-out cooling cartridge for rapid and reliable cooling. The use of natural, climate-friendly R290 refrigerant helps reduce both energy costs and carbon emissions, aligning with the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency.\n\nThe EBD4\'s dimensions89 1/4 inches in width, 27 inches in depth, and 37 1/4 inches in heightprovide a spacious interior while maintaining a manageable footprint. The three solid swing doors are designed for easy access and secure storage, complemented by a stylish black finish. With a 1/3 horsepower compressor and a power requirement of 115 V, 60 Hz, 1 Phase at 2.5 amps, the EBD4 combines efficiency with high performance to meet the demands of a dynamic beverage service environment.', 'Provides a large 32 cu. ft. capacity, accommodating several kegs to support high-volume beverage service.\nFeatures Blizzard R290 cooling technology, which includes an all-in-one slide-out cartridge for efficient cooling and easy maintenance.\nDesigned with three solid swing doors, offering secure and convenient access to the interior while maintaining a sleek black finish.\nCompact yet spacious dimensions of 89 1/4 inches in width, 27 inches in depth, and 37 1/4 inches in height, making it suitable for various bar setups.\nOperates on a 1/3 horsepower compressor and complies with the energy consumption standards of the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agenc