(2154, 'Everest Refrigeration EBD3 68\" Side Mount Direct Draw Keg Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBD3 Side Mount Direct Draw Keg Refrigerator is a versatile and efficient solution for keg storage in commercial settings. With a generous 24 cu. ft. capacity, this model is well-suited for bars and restaurants that need ample space for multiple kegs. Its black finish and dual solid swing doors offer a combination of durability and modern style, ensuring both functionality and aesthetic appeal.\n\nThe EBD3 features advanced Blizzard R290 cooling technology, which includes a slide-out cooling cartridge for easy maintenance and rapid cooling. This system uses natural, climate-friendly hydrocarbon refrigerant, an effective alternative to traditional refrigerants, helping to reduce energy costs and carbon emissions. The unit meets the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency.\n\nWith overall dimensions of 68 inches in width, 27 inches in depth, and 37 1/4 inches in height, and a crated weight of 320 lbs, the EBD3 is built to handle the demands of busy beverage service environments. It operates efficiently on 115 V, 60 Hz, 1 Phase power with a 1/4+ horsepower compressor, consuming 3.5 amps. This combination of features makes the EBD3 a reliable choice for maintaining optimal keg storage and service.', 'Provides a spacious 24 cu. ft. interior, capable of holding multiple kegs for efficient beverage service in high-demand environments.\nEquipped with the Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge, ensuring rapid and effective cooling while using an environmentally-friendly refrigerant.\nDesigned with a sleek black finish and two solid swing doors for easy access and secure storage.\nCompact dimensions of 68 inches in width, 27 inches in depth, and 37 1/4 inches in height make it suitable for a variety of bar setups.\nOperates on a 1/4+ horsepower compressor and complies with energy consumption standards of the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EBD3_8ba461dd-9a8a-48a2-8db3-2ac15b98249c.webp\"]', 'EBD3', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 3310, NULL, NULL, NULL, 68.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 37.00, NULL, 27.00, NULL, 320.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:47:02', '2024-12-16 08:19:22', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/EBD3_8ba461dd-9a8a-48a2-8db3-2ac15b98249c.webp', 'physical', '', 2837, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB462\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2155, 'Everest Refrigeration EBD2 57 3/4\" Side Mount Direct Draw Keg Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBD2 Side Mount Direct Draw Keg Refrigerator offers an efficient solution for keg storage in busy commercial settings. Measuring 57 3/4 inches in width, 27 inches in depth, and 37 1/4 inches in height, this model provides a substantial 20 cu. ft. capacity, ideal for bars and restaurants that require ample space for keg storage. The sleek black finish and dual solid swing doors contribute to both the units aesthetic appeal and functional design.\n\nPowered by a 1/4+ horsepower compressor, the EBD2 runs on 115 V, 60 Hz, and 1 Phase, consuming 3.5 amps of power. The inclusion of the Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge, a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant, supports rapid and efficient cooling while adhering to energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency. This setup ensures lower energy costs and reduced carbon emissions.\n\nWith a crated weight of 282 lbs, the EBD2 is built to withstand the demands of high-traffic environments. The side mount design and advanced cooling technology make this unit a reliable and environmentally-friendly choice for any commercial beverage service operation.', 'Offers a generous 20 cu. ft. capacity, designed to accommodate multiple kegs and support high-volume beverage service.\nEquipped with the Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge, ensuring rapid cooling and efficient operation while minimizing environmental impact.\nFeatures a sleek black finish and two solid swing doors for easy access and secure keg storage.\nIncludes a compact footprint of 57 3/4 inches in width, 27 inches in depth, and 37 1/4 inches in height, making it suitable for various bar and beverage service setups.\nOperates efficiently with a 1/4+ horsepower compressor and is designed to meet energy standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency.', 'pu