(2156, 'Everest Refrigeration EBD1 23 1/2\" Back Mount Direct Draw Keg Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBD1 Back Mount Direct Draw Keg Refrigerator is designed to deliver reliable keg storage solutions for commercial beverage service. With a compact profile of 23 1/2 inches in width, 32 inches in depth, and 39 3/8 inches in height, this unit efficiently utilizes space while providing an 8 cu. ft. storage capacity. Its sleek black finish and swing solid door make it a practical addition to bars, restaurants, and cafes.\n\nPowered by a 1/5 horsepower compressor, the EBD1 operates on 115 V, 60 Hz, and 1 Phase, consuming 2.5 amps. The back-mounted compressor ensures optimal cooling performance while maintaining a clean and accessible front. The Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge, featuring a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant, aligns with the energy efficiency standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, helping to reduce both energy costs and carbon emissions.\n\nWeighing 167 lbs when crated, this keg refrigerator is built for durability and ease of use. It is designed to meet the demands of high-traffic beverage service environments, providing reliable performance and effective cooling for keg storage.', 'Offers a compact design with an 8 cu. ft. capacity, ideal for efficient keg storage in bars, restaurants, and cafes.\nFeatures a sleek black finish that seamlessly integrates with various bar and beverage service environments.\nEquipped with the Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge for fast and reliable cooling, promoting energy efficiency and reduced environmental impact.\nIncludes a swing solid door for easy access and secure storage of kegs, ensuring convenience and safety.\nProvides 23 1/2 inches in width and 32 inches in depth, fitting well into smaller spaces while still accommodating standard keg sizes.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EBD1_e62f1b2e-c891-49c8-b