(2160, 'Everest Refrigeration EBB48G-SD 49\" Side Mount Glass Door Back Bar Cooler Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBB48G-SD Side Mount Glass Door Back Bar Cooler is designed for effective beverage storage in commercial environments. This model features a black finish and sliding glass doors, blending contemporary design with practical functionality. With a 13 cu. ft. capacity, it is perfect for managing a selection of beverages in bars, hotels, and cafes.\n\nMeasuring 49 inches in width, 24 1/2 inches in depth, and 37 1/4 inches in height, the cooler is equipped with a side-mounted compressor to ensure efficient cooling. It operates at 115 V, 60 Hz, and 1 Phase, with a 1/4+ horsepower compressor and 3.5 amps. The Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge utilizes natural refrigerant, aligning with energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, which helps to lower energy costs and minimize carbon emissions.\n\nWith a crated weight of 278 lbs, this cooler is built to handle the demands of high-traffic settings. It includes a reliable thermometer for precise temperature control, ensuring optimal performance and dependable beverage storage. Combining durability and efficiency, this back bar cooler is a practical choice for any busy beverage service area.', 'Showcases beverages with its sliding glass doors, making it easy to see and access items in bars, hotels, and cafes.\nFeatures a sleek black finish that complements any beverage service area with a modern look.\nUses the Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge for efficient cooling, contributing to lower energy costs and reduced environmental impact.\nEquipped with durable sliding doors designed for high-traffic areas, ensuring reliability and ease of use.\nProvides a compact 13 cu. ft. of storage space, ideal for organizing a variety of drinks in busy commercial settings.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/