(2161, 'Everest Refrigeration EBB90G-24 89 1/4\" Side Mount Glass Door Back Bar Cooler Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBB90G-24 Side Mount Glass Door Back Bar Cooler provides an effective solution for beverage storage in commercial environments. Featuring a black finish and swing glass doors, this model combines modern aesthetics with practical functionality. With a spacious 28 cu. ft. capacity, it is ideal for storing a diverse range of beverages in bars, hotels, and cafes.\n\nThis cooler measures 89 1/4 inches in width, 24 1/2 inches in depth, and 37 1/4 inches in height. It is equipped with a side-mounted compressor that ensures efficient cooling performance. Operating at 115 V, 60 Hz, and 1 Phase, with a 1/3 horsepower compressor and 2.5 amps, it utilizes the Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge. This cartridge uses natural refrigerant, meeting the energy consumption standards of the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, which contributes to reduced energy costs and lower carbon emissions.\n\nWith a crated weight of 446 lbs, the cooler is built to withstand the demands of high-traffic commercial environments. It includes a reliable thermometer for precise temperature control, ensuring consistent performance. This back bar cooler blends durability with efficiency, making it a practical choice for any busy beverage service area.', 'Displays beverages clearly with its glass doors, simplifying access and organization in bars, hotels, and cafes.\nFeatures a contemporary black finish that adds a modern touch to beverage service areas.\nEmploys the Blizzard R290 cartridge for effective cooling, helping to reduce both energy costs and environmental impact.\nComes with a sturdy swing door design, perfect for high-traffic areas requiring durability and ease of use.\nOffers a generous 28 cu. ft. of storage space, accommodating a large assortment of beverages for busy commercial settings.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/