(2162, 'Everest Refrigeration EBB69G-24 68\" Side Mount Glass Door Back Bar Cooler Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBB69G-24 Side Mount Glass Door Back Bar Cooler is crafted to offer efficient and stylish beverage storage for commercial use. This model features a sleek black finish and swing glass doors, enhancing both the look and functionality of beverage areas. With a spacious 20 cu. ft. capacity, it is well-suited for handling a substantial inventory of drinks in bars, hotels, and cafes.\n\nThe cooler measures 68 inches in width, 24 1/2 inches in depth, and 37 1/4 inches in height. It includes a side-mounted compressor that supports effective cooling performance. Operating at 115 V, 60 Hz, and 1 Phase, with a 1/4+ horsepower compressor and 3.5 amps, this cooler uses the Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge. This advanced system employs natural refrigerant, adhering to the energy consumption standards of the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, which contributes to reduced energy usage and carbon emissions.\n\nWeighing 328 lbs when crated, the cooler is designed to endure the rigors of high-traffic commercial environments. It also features a reliable thermometer for precise temperature control, ensuring optimal performance. This back bar cooler combines durability and efficiency, making it a dependable choice for any busy beverage service area.', 'Offers clear visibility of beverages with its glass doors, making it easy to organize and access items in bars, hotels, and cafes.\nShowcases a sleek black finish that adds a modern touch to any beverage service area.\nUtilizes the Blizzard R290 cartridge for efficient cooling, which helps in reducing energy costs and lowering environmental impact.\nEquipped with a sturdy swing door design, built to handle the demands of high-traffic environments.\nProvides ample 20 cu. ft. of storage capacity, suitable for managing a variety of beverages in busy commercial setti