(2169, 'Everest Refrigeration EBB23G 23 1/2\" Back Mount Glass Door Back Bar Cooler Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBB23G Back Mount Glass Door Back Bar Cooler is a practical and stylish solution for commercial beverage storage. With a sleek black finish and a swing glass door, this unit combines aesthetic appeal with functionality. Its 8 cu. ft. capacity is well-suited for holding a diverse range of beverages, making it an excellent choice for bars, hotels, and cafes.\n\nThe cooler measures 23 1/2 inches in width, 32 inches in depth, and 39 3/8 inches in height. It features a back-mounted compressor that ensures efficient cooling performance. Operating at 115 V, 60 Hz, and 1 Phase with a 1/5 horsepower compressor and 2.5 amps, it is designed for reliable refrigeration. The Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge, which is included, uses natural refrigerant to meet energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency.\n\nWith a crated weight of 179 lbs, this back bar cooler is built to withstand the demands of busy commercial environments. The unit also includes a reliable thermometer for accurate temperature monitoring. Its straightforward design and construction make it an efficient addition to any food and beverage service area, ensuring optimal performance and ease of use.', 'Offers easy visibility of stored items through the glass door, making it simple to find and retrieve beverages quickly in bars, hotels, and cafes.\nIncludes a stylish black finish that enhances the look of any service area, adding a modern touch to your beverage station.\nProvides energy-efficient cooling with its advanced Blizzard R290 cartridge, helping to lower energy costs and improve environmental impact.\nFeatures a reliable swing door design for durability and convenience in high-traffic settings, ideal for busy food and drink establishments.\nDelivers 8 cu. ft. of storage space, accommodating a variety of