(2170, 'Everest Refrigeration EBB90-24 89 1/4\" Side Mount Solid Door Back Bar Cooler Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBB90-24 Side Mount Solid Door Back Bar Cooler is an essential addition to any commercial setting, designed to meet the demands of the food and beverage industry. This unit features a black finish and a swing solid door style, combining functionality with a modern appearance. It includes three doors and offers a spacious 28 cu. ft. capacity, making it ideal for storing a large volume of beverages.\n\nWith dimensions of 89 1/4 inches in width, 24 1/2 inches in depth, and 37 1/4 inches in height, this back bar cooler is equipped with a side-mounted compressor, which contributes to its efficient cooling performance. The cooler operates at 115 V, 60 Hz, and 1 Phase, with a 1/3 horsepower compressor and 2.5 amps, ensuring effective refrigeration. The Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge utilizes natural, climate-friendly refrigerant for reduced energy costs and lower carbon emissions.\n\nAdditional features include a durable construction, a thermometer for accurate temperature monitoring, and a NEMA plug type. The unit comes with a 397 lbs crated weight and supports a variety of bar equipment functions. Designed for easy installation and operation, this back bar cooler is a reliable choice for maintaining optimal beverage storage in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.', 'Provides easy access to beverages, ideal for quick service in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nIncludes a sleek black finish that enhances the visual appeal of any bar or service area.\nEnsures energy-efficient cooling, reducing operational costs and maintaining stable temperatures.\nEquipped with a durable swing solid door design, suitable for high-traffic environments.\nDelivers a spacious 28 cu. ft. of storage, allowing efficient organization of canned and bottled drinks.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EBB90-24_21d12b63-f098