(2179, 'Everest Refrigeration EBD4-SS 89 1/4\" Side Mount Direct Draw Keg Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBD4-SS is a side mount direct draw keg refrigerator designed to meet the needs of high-volume beverage service. This unit features a robust stainless steel finish and a swing solid door style. With dimensions of 89 1/4 inches in width, 27 inches in depth, and 37 1/4 inches in height, it provides a substantial 32 cu. ft. capacity suitable for large-scale keg storage.\n\nOperating on a 115 V, 60 Hz, 1 Phase electrical supply, the EBD4-SS requires 2.5 amps and is equipped with a 1/3 horsepower compressor. It utilizes the Blizzard R290 cooling system, which features an all-in-one, slide-out cartridge designed for efficient cooling and ease of maintenance. The R290 refrigerant is a natural, climate-friendly option that adheres to the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency.\n\nWith a crated weight of 405 lbs, this keg refrigerator is built to withstand the demands of busy commercial environments. It is well-suited for use in bars, restaurants, and other establishments where efficient and reliable keg storage is essential.', 'Provides a generous 32 cu. ft. capacity, allowing ample storage for multiple kegs, ideal for busy bars and restaurants.\nIncludes a stainless steel finish for durability and easy cleaning, making it a practical choice for high-use environments.\nOffers efficient cooling with the Blizzard R290 system, ensuring beverages are kept at optimal temperatures for best quality.\nFeatures a swing solid door design, which facilitates easy access and secure keg storage, perfect for commercial settings.\nDelivers energy efficiency with the natural R290 refrigerant, helping to reduce both energy costs and environmental impact.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EBD4-SS_01c62e89-e314-4735-8903-0aa7933e302e.webp\"]', 'EBD4-SS', 0,