(2180, 'Everest Refrigeration EBD2-SS 57 3/4\" Side Mount Direct Draw Keg Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBD2-SS is a direct draw keg refrigerator designed to meet the rigorous demands of the food and beverage industry. It features a sleek stainless steel finish and a swing solid door style, ensuring durability and ease of use. With a width of 57 3/4 inches, a depth of 27 inches, and a height of 37 1/4 inches, this unit offers a 20 cu. ft. capacity suitable for large-scale keg storage.\n\nOperating on a 115 V, 60 Hz, 1 Phase power supply, the EBD2-SS draws 3.5 amps and includes a 1/4+ horsepower compressor. It utilizes the Blizzard R290 cooling system, which incorporates a slide-out cartridge for efficient cooling and hassle-free maintenance. The R290 refrigerant is an eco-friendly, hydrocarbon-based option that adheres to the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency.\n\nWeighing 282 lbs when crated, this keg refrigerator is designed for heavy-duty use and reliable performance. It is well-suited for bars, restaurants, and other establishments where efficient keg storage and optimal beverage serving conditions are essential.', 'Provides a spacious 20 cu. ft. interior, ideal for storing multiple kegs and ensuring an efficient service in bars and restaurants.\nIncludes a sturdy stainless steel finish, which adds a modern look while being easy to clean and maintain in high-traffic environments.\nOffers rapid cooling with the Blizzard R290 system, designed to keep kegs at optimal temperatures and enhance overall beverage quality.\nFeatures a swing solid door design that provides easy access and secure storage, perfect for busy hospitality settings.\nDelivers energy efficiency with natural, climate-friendly refrigerant, helping to reduce operational costs and environmental impact.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EBD2-SS_7c8a3df7-2296-4e9d