(2181, 'Everest Refrigeration EBB59G-SS 57 3/4\" Side Mount Glass Door Back Bar Cooler Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBB59G-SS is a side mount glass door back bar cooler featuring a sleek stainless steel finish. This model is designed with swing glass doors, providing clear visibility and easy access to stored beverages. It measures 57 3/4 inches in width, 27 inches in depth, and 37 1/4 inches in height, offering a spacious interior for effective organization.\n\nThis cooler operates on a 115 V, 60 Hz, 1 Phase power supply, drawing 3.5 amps and is equipped with a 1/4+ horsepower compressor. It includes the Blizzard R290 cooling system, which has a slide-out cartridge for quick cooling and simplified maintenance. The R290 refrigerant is a natural, hydrocarbon-based alternative to hydrofluorocarbon refrigerants, meeting U.S. Department of Energy and Environmental Protection Agency standards for energy efficiency and environmental responsibility.\n\nWith a capacity of 20 cu. ft. and a crated weight of 313 lbs, the EBB59G-SS offers ample storage while ensuring dependable performance. Its practical design features ample shelving and supports, making it well-suited for bars, cafes, and restaurants to effectively store and serve a variety of beverages.', 'Provides a stylish stainless steel finish with swing glass doors, enhancing visibility and modern aesthetics in bars, cafes, and restaurants.\nFeatures the Blizzard R290 cooling system for quick and efficient cooling, ideal for maintaining ideal beverage temperatures in busy settings.\nOffers a generous 20 cu. ft. capacity, which helps accommodate a large inventory of drinks, supporting smooth service in hospitality environments.\nDelivers energy efficiency with eco-friendly refrigerant, reducing energy costs and environmental impact, making it a sustainable choice for food and drink establishments.\nIncludes a user-friendly design with easy access and ample storage space, well-suited for streamlining operations and improving organization in various food service areas.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EBB59G-SS_e3962773-e74f-491b-a754-05f70e072767.webp\"]', 'EBB59G-SS', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 3367, NULL, NULL, NULL, 58.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 37.00, NULL, 27.00, NULL, 313.00, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:47:34', '2024-12-16 08:19:21', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/EBB59G-SS_e3962773-e74f-491b-a754-05f70e072767.webp', 'physical', '', 2886, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB489\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2182, 'Everest Refrigeration EBB59G-SD-SS 57 3/4\" Side Mount Glass Door Back Bar Cooler Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBB59G-SD-SS is a side mount glass door back bar cooler with a sleek stainless steel finish. It features sliding glass doors that allow easy access and clear visibility of the contents. This model measures 57 3/4 inches in width, 24 1/2 inches in depth, and 37 1/4 inches in height, offering a compact yet spacious design.\n\nIt operates on a 115 V, 60 Hz, 1 Phase electrical system, drawing 3.5 amps, and includes a 1/4+ horsepower compressor. The unit is equipped with the Blizzard R290 cooling system, which features a slide-out cartridge for efficient cooling and straightforward maintenance. The R290 refrigerant is a natural, hydrocarbon-based option that aligns with the energy consumption standards of the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, promoting lower energy costs and a smaller carbon footprint.\n\nWith a total capacity of 17 cu. ft. and a crated weight of 295 lbs, the cooler provides ample storage space while ensuring reliable performance. It is designed with practical shelving and support features, making it well-suited for organizing beverages and streamlining service in various food and drink establishments.', 'Showcases a modern stainless steel finish with sliding glass doors, providing a stylish look and clear visibility of stored items, ideal for bars and cafes.\nIncludes a Blizzard R290 cooling system, designed for rapid and effective cooling while simplifying maintenance, making it suitable for busy restaurant environments.\nOffers a spacious 17 cu. ft. interior for efficient storage of beverages, enhancing service efficiency in hotels, bars, and restaurants.\nProvides energy-efficient performance with eco-friendly refrigerant, leading to reduced energy costs and a lower environmental footprint.\nFeatures a sleek design that integrates seamlessly with various bar setups, enhancing both functionality and aesthetics in any food service area.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EBB59G-SD-SS_92c5de8e-2c5d-45f0-b549-c58c2d06b414.webp\"]', 'EBB59G-SD-SS', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 3773, NULL, NULL, NULL, 58.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 37.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 295.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:47:35', '2024-12-16 08:19:21', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/EBB59G-SD-SS_92c5de8e-2c5d-45f0-b549-c58c2d06b414.webp', 'physical', '', 3234, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB490\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2183, 'Everest Refrigeration EBB59-SS 57 3/4\" Side Mount Solid Door Back Bar Cooler Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBB59-SS is a side mount solid door back bar cooler designed to meet the demanding needs of the food and drink industry. It features a stainless steel finish with solid swing doors, offering both durability and practicality. This model has a width of 57 3/4 inches, a depth of 27 inches, and a height of 37 1/4 inches.\n\nThe cooler operates on a 115 V, 60 Hz, 1 Phase electrical system, drawing 3.5 amps and includes a 1/4+ horsepower compressor. It features the Blizzard R290 cooling system, which includes a slide-out cartridge for effective cooling and straightforward maintenance. The R290 refrigerant is a natural, hydrocarbon-based option that aligns with the energy standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, leading to lower energy costs and reduced carbon emissions.\n\nWith a 20 cu. ft. capacity and a crated weight of 291 lbs, the cooler provides ample storage space while maintaining reliable performance. It is designed with practical shelving and support features, ensuring efficient organization of beverages and quick service in various food service environments.', 'Offers a sleek stainless steel exterior with solid swing doors, providing durability and easy access, ideal for high-traffic bars and cafes.\nIncludes an advanced Blizzard R290 cooling system that ensures quick cooling and easy maintenance, making it efficient for busy restaurant environments.\nProvides a spacious 20 cu. ft. interior for organized storage of beverages, which helps streamline service in hotels, bars, and restaurants.\nDelivers energy-efficient operation with eco-friendly refrigerant, lowering energy costs and reducing environmental impact.\nFeatures a design that blends seamlessly into various settings, enhancing both functionality and visual appeal in any food service establishment.', 'publishe