(2184, 'Everest Refrigeration EBB48G-SS 49\" Side Mount Glass Door Back Bar Cooler Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBB48G-SS is a side mount glass door back bar cooler, crafted to accommodate the various requirements of the food and beverage industry. This model showcases a sleek stainless steel finish and swing glass doors, providing both durability and clear visibility for efficient beverage display and access. The cooler measures 49 inches in width, 27 inches in depth, and 37 1/4 inches in height.\n\nPowered by a 115 V, 60 Hz, 1 Phase electrical system, the unit operates with 3.5 amps and is equipped with a 1/4+ horsepower compressor. It includes the Blizzard R290 cooling system, which features a slide-out cartridge for effective cooling and straightforward maintenance. The system uses R290 refrigerant, a climate-friendly hydrocarbon that complies with the energy consumption standards of the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, leading to reduced energy costs and lower carbon emissions.\n\nWith a 14 cu. ft. capacity and a crated weight of 288 lbs, this cooler offers ample storage space for beverages while maintaining efficient performance. The design incorporates practical shelving and support features, ensuring that drinks are organized and easily accessible in high-traffic areas.', 'Offers a stylish stainless steel finish with swing glass doors, providing clear visibility and easy access to beverages, perfect for bars, restaurants, and cafes.\nIncludes an advanced Blizzard R290 cooling system, which ensures fast and efficient cooling while simplifying maintenance with its slide-out cartridge.\nFeatures a spacious 14 cu. ft. interior, allowing for organized storage and quick retrieval of drinks, ideal for high-traffic environments.\nProvides energy-efficient operation using R290 refrigerant, which lowers energy costs and reduces environmental impact.\nDelivers a practical design that integrates smoothly into various settings, enhancing both functionality and aesthetic appeal.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EBB48G-SS_5ca1a7e2-2bbb-4338-8dac-224fc719bf49.webp\"]', 'EBB48G-SS', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 3118, NULL, NULL, NULL, 49.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 37.00, NULL, 27.00, NULL, 288.00, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:47:37', '2024-12-16 08:19:21', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/EBB48G-SS_5ca1a7e2-2bbb-4338-8dac-224fc719bf49.webp', 'physical', '', 2673, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB492\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2185, 'Everest Refrigeration EBB48G-SD-SS 49\" Side Mount Glass Door Back Bar Cooler Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBB48G-SD-SS is a side mount glass door back bar cooler designed to enhance beverage storage and presentation. With a sleek stainless steel finish and sliding glass doors, this cooler combines durability with visibility, making it an excellent choice for bars, restaurants, and cafes. The unit measures 49 inches in width, 24 1/2 inches in depth, and 37 1/4 inches in height, fitting seamlessly into various settings.\n\nOperating on 115 V, 60 Hz, and 1 Phase, the cooler requires 3.5 amps and features a 1/4+ horsepower compressor. It is equipped with the Blizzard R290 cooling system, which includes an innovative slide-out cartridge for efficient cooling and straightforward maintenance. This system uses R290 refrigerant, a natural hydrocarbon that meets energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, offering both energy efficiency and reduced carbon emissions.\n\nWith a capacity of 13 cu. ft. and a crated weight of 278 lbs, this model is built to provide reliable performance and ample space for various beverage types. The cooler\'s design includes practical shelving and supports, ensuring organized storage and easy access to drinks.', 'Offers a sleek design with sliding glass doors, providing easy visibility and access to beverages, ideal for bars, restaurants, and cafes.\nIncludes the Blizzard R290 cooling system, which ensures fast cooling and easy maintenance without complex procedures.\nFeatures a durable stainless steel finish that resists scratches and simplifies cleaning, enhancing longevity and hygiene.\nProvides ample storage with a 13 cu. ft. capacity, allowing efficient organization of drinks and maximizing space in high-traffic areas.\nDelivers energy-efficient operation with a climate-friendly refrigerant, reducing both operational costs and environmental impact.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EBB48G-SD-SS_15868484-2888-4401-8edb-1d5292eb8305.webp\"]', 'EBB48G-SD-SS', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 3534, NULL, NULL, NULL, 49.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 37.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 278.00, NULL, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:47:39', '2024-12-16 08:19:21', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/EBB48G-SD-SS_15868484-2888-4401-8edb-1d5292eb8305.webp', 'physical', '', 3029, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB493\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2186, 'Everest Refrigeration EBB48-SS 49\" Side Mount Solid Door Back Bar Cooler Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBB48-SS is a side mount back bar cooler refrigerator designed for efficient beverage storage and display. This unit features a stainless steel finish and solid swing doors, providing durability and ease of access. With a width of 49 inches, a depth of 27 inches, and a height of 37 1/4 inches, this cooler is well-suited for use in bars, restaurants, and hotels.\n\nThe refrigerator operates on 115 V, 60 Hz, and 1 Phase, drawing 3.5 amps with a 1/4+ horsepower compressor. It is equipped with the Blizzard R290 cooling system, which includes a slide-out cartridge for rapid cooling and simple maintenance. The natural R290 refrigerant complies with energy standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, contributing to reduced energy costs and a lower carbon footprint.\n\nWith a 14 cu. ft. capacity and a crated weight of 269 lbs, this model ensures reliable performance and ample storage for a variety of beverages. The unit\'s design includes a practical interior layout and sturdy construction, making it a valuable addition to any establishment requiring efficient beverage refrigeration and display.', 'Provides ample space for storing and chilling beverages, making it an excellent addition to bars, restaurants, and hotels for efficient drink service.\nEquipped with the Blizzard R290 cooling system, offering easy maintenance and rapid cooling without complicated procedures.\nFeatures a durable stainless steel finish that resists wear and simplifies cleaning, ensuring long-term use and hygiene in busy environments.\nIncludes solid swing doors that offer easy access and secure closure, enhancing organization and accessibility in various food and drink settings.\nOffers energy-efficient operation with a climate-friendly refrigerant, helping to lower operational costs and reduce environmental im