(2187, 'Everest Refrigeration EPPR3-D4 93 1/8\" Side Mount Drawered Pizza Prep. Table Refrigerators, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EPPR3-D4 Side Mount Drawered Pizza Prep Table Refrigerator provides a spacious 30 cu. ft. capacity, with dimensions of 93 1/8 inches in width, 36 1/2 inches in depth, and 36 1/4 inches in height. Crafted with a stainless steel finish, this refrigerator is designed for durability and ease of maintenance, making it ideal for commercial kitchens in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\n\nThis model operates on 115 V, 60 Hz, and 1 Phase with a 2.5-amp current draw and a 1/3 horsepower compressor. It includes the Blizzard R290 cooling system, which has an all-in-one, slide-out cartridge for efficient and straightforward maintenance. The use of R290 refrigerant, a natural hydrocarbon, complies with the energy standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, supporting both energy efficiency and environmental responsibility.\n\nThe EPPR3-D4 includes swing solid doors and drawers, providing versatile storage and preparation options. This arrangement improves accessibility and organization, making it a solid choice for any food service operation that requires reliable and effective refrigeration and preparation solutions.', 'Delivers ample storage and workspace for effective ingredient preparation, ideal for use in making sandwiches, pizzas, salads, and desserts in busy kitchens.\nEquipped with the Blizzard R290 cooling system, which ensures quick and easy maintenance, suitable for high-volume food preparation environments.\nOffers a durable stainless steel finish that resists stains and simplifies cleaning, helping to maintain hygiene in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nIncludes a combination of swing solid doors and drawers, allowing for efficient organization and convenient access to stored ingredients.\nProvides energy-efficient cooling with a climate-friendly refrigerant, which helps red