(2192, 'Everest Refrigeration EPPR3 93 1/8\" Side Mount Pizza Prep. Table Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EPPR3 93 1/8\" Side Mount Pizza Prep Table Refrigerator is engineered for extensive use in commercial kitchens. With a stainless steel finish, it measures 93 1/8 inches wide, 36 1/2 inches deep, and 36 1/4 inches high, offering a generous 30 cubic feet of storage space. This model includes three swing solid doors for easy access to the refrigerated compartments.\n\nThe unit comes with the Blizzard R290 cooling system, known for its natural hydrocarbon refrigerant that ensures rapid cooling and complies with energy efficiency standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency. This system also has a slide-out cooling cartridge, simplifying maintenance and reducing the need for onsite brazing.\n\nOperating at 115 volts, 60 Hz, with 2.5 amps and a 1/3+ HP compressor, the EPPR3 is designed to handle the high demands of commercial kitchens. It supports ideal ingredient preservation and helps streamline food preparation processes, making it an essential piece of equipment for large-scale foodservice operations.', 'Features a generous 93 1/8-inch width, providing extensive space for ingredient storage and preparation, making it a perfect fit for large-scale kitchens in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nOffers a substantial 30 cubic feet capacity, allowing for efficient organization and access to a wide range of ingredients, improving workflow and productivity in busy foodservice environments.\nIncludes the advanced Blizzard R290 cooling system, which delivers effective and rapid cooling while minimizing energy consumption and reducing environmental impact.\nFeatures a durable stainless steel finish that is easy to maintain and clean, ensuring long-lasting performance and a professional appearance.\nEquipped with three swing solid doors for convenient access to the interior, enhancing usability and oper