(2193, 'Everest Refrigeration EPPR2 71\" Side Mount Pizza Prep. Table Refrigerators, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EPPR2 71\" Side Mount Pizza Prep Table Refrigerator is built to handle the demands of busy food prep areas. With a stainless steel finish, it measures 71 inches in width, 36 1/2 inches in depth, and 36 1/4 inches in height, offering a substantial 23 cubic feet of storage. This model includes two swing solid doors that provide easy access to the refrigerated interior.\n\nThis unit comes with the Blizzard R290 cooling system, which employs a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant for effective cooling while being environmentally friendly. The innovative slide-out cartridge simplifies maintenance and reduces the need for onsite brazing. It meets the energy efficiency guidelines set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency.\n\nOperating at 115 volts, 60 Hz, with 2.5 amps and a 1/3 HP compressor, the EPPR2 is designed to perform reliably in demanding kitchen environments. It efficiently maintains the appropriate temperature for ingredients, supporting smooth food preparation and service operations.', 'Features a spacious 71-inch width, offering ample room for preparing and assembling a variety of menu items, making it ideal for high-volume kitchens in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nOffers a 23 cubic feet capacity, ensuring plenty of storage space for ingredients and condiments, which helps streamline kitchen operations and improve efficiency.\nIncludes an advanced Blizzard R290 cooling system that provides rapid and reliable cooling while reducing energy consumption and carbon emissions.\nProvides a stainless steel finish that is both durable and easy to clean, maintaining a professional look and ensuring longevity in busy foodservice environments.\nEnsures user-friendly maintenance with a slide-out cooling cartridge, allowing for quick service and reducing downtime.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.co