(2194, 'Everest Refrigeration EPPSR2 59 1/8\" Side Mount Pizza Prep. Table Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EPPSR2 59 1/8\" Side Mount Pizza Prep Table Refrigerator showcases a stainless steel finish, combining durability with a sleek design. It measures 59 1/8 inches in width, 36 1/2 inches in depth, and 36 1/4 inches in height, offering a generous 16 cubic feet of storage space. The unit is designed with two swing solid doors that provide easy access to the refrigerators interior.\n\nFitted with the Blizzard R290 cooling system, this model employs a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant for efficient cooling and environmental sustainability. The slide-out cartridge allows for rapid cooling and simplifies maintenance by eliminating the need for onsite brazing. This system complies with the energy efficiency standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency.\n\nOperating on 115 volts, 60 Hz, and 2.5 amps with a 1/3 HP compressor, the EPPSR2 is designed to handle the demands of busy commercial kitchens. It offers reliable performance, ensuring that ingredients are stored at ideal temperatures and are readily available for food preparation and service.', '\nFeatures ample workspace for pizza and other menu preparations, making it versatile for a variety of food assembly needs in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nOffers efficient cold storage for ingredients, helping to keep them fresh and easily accessible during busy service periods.\nIncludes an advanced Blizzard R290 cooling system that supports eco-friendly operations, reducing energy consumption and carbon emissions.\nProvides a durable and easy-to-clean stainless steel finish, ensuring both longevity and a professional appearance in high-traffic environments.\nEnsures simple maintenance with a slide-out cooling cartridge, facilitating quick repairs and minimizing operational disruptions.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/produc