(2195, 'Everest Refrigeration EPPR1 35 5/8\" Side Mount Pizza Prep. Table Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EPPR1 35 5/8\" Side Mount Pizza Prep Table Refrigerator showcases a stainless steel finish that provides both durability and a sleek look. Measuring 35 5/8 inches in width, 36 1/2 inches in depth, and 36 1/4 inches in height, this unit offers a practical 9 cubic feet of storage space. It is equipped with a single swing solid door for easy access to its contents.\n\nThe unit is powered by the Blizzard R290 cooling system, which uses a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant for effective and efficient cooling. The slide-out cartridge simplifies maintenance by allowing for easy replacement without needing onsite brazing. This system meets the energy standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the EPA, helping to lower energy expenses and support environmentally friendly operations.\n\nOperating at 115 volts, 60 Hz, and 2.5 amps with a 1/3 HP compressor, the EPPR1 is designed for reliable performance in commercial settings. It combines efficient cooling with sturdy construction, ensuring it fulfills the demands of high-traffic kitchens while offering ease of use and maintenance.', '\nFeatures extensive preparation space suitable for pizzas and other menu items, making it ideal for food assembly and topping dispensing in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nOffers versatility by accommodating various types of food prep and ingredient storage, enhancing efficiency in busy kitchens.\nIncludes an advanced cooling system that supports eco-friendly practices and reduces energy costs.\nProvides a durable work surface that withstands high heat from nearby cooking equipment, ensuring long-term performance.\nEnsures easy maintenance with a slide-out cooling cartridge, simplifying repairs and reducing downtime.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EPPR1_90f6ba85-46dd-44d9-8927-70b57663e3db.webp\"]', 'EPPR1', 0, NULL,