(2197, 'Everest Refrigeration EPWR2 59 1/8\" Side Mount Sandwich Prep. Table Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EPWR2 59 1/8\" Side Mount Sandwich Prep Table Refrigerator is built for high performance in commercial kitchens. Showcasing a stainless steel finish that is both durable and easy to maintain. The refrigerator measures 59 1/8 inches in width, 31 1/2 inches in depth, and 37 1/2 inches in height, providing a generous 17 cubic feet of storage space through two swing solid doors, suitable for various food preparation tasks.\n\nFitted with the Blizzard R290 cooling system, the unit employs a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant that meets the energy consumption standards of the U.S. Department of Energy and EPA. The system features a slide-out cooling cartridge, which facilitates rapid cooling and easy maintenance without the need for onsite brazing. The effective evaporator ensures consistent temperatures to keep ingredients fresh.\n\nOperating on 115 volts with a frequency of 60 hertz and a single-phase power supply, the EPWR2 draws 3.48 amps and has a 1/4+ HP compressor. The refrigerator is mounted on sturdy casters for mobility and ease of positioning. Manufactured in the USA, it complies with high-quality standards and comes with a comprehensive warranty, ensuring reliable performance and making it a valuable asset for any food service operation.', '\nFeatures a spacious prep and storage area, making it perfect for a variety of food items such as sandwiches, burgers, pizzas, salads, and desserts in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nOffers versatile use for both food preparation and assembly, as well as for dispensing condiments, sauces, and toppings.\nIncludes an energy-efficient cooling system that helps reduce operational costs and supports eco-friendly practices.\nProvides a durable worktop that withstands high temperatures from kitchen equipment, ensuring long-term reliability.\nEnsures straightforward maintenance with a slide-out cooling cartridge, making repairs and upkeep easier.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EPWR2_455e0a12-bf6e-4955-bb70-48a3912f53ba.webp\"]', 'EPWR2', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 3775, NULL, NULL, NULL, 59.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 38.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 382.00, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:47:54', '2024-12-16 08:19:21', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/EPWR2_455e0a12-bf6e-4955-bb70-48a3912f53ba.webp', 'physical', '', 3236, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB505\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
