(2205, 'Everest Refrigeration EPBR3 71 1/8\" Back Mount Mega-Top Sandwich Prep. Table Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EPBR3 71 1/8\" Back Mount Mega-Top Sandwich Prep Table Refrigerator combines superior construction and innovative features to meet the demands of commercial kitchens. The stainless steel finish provides a sleek, durable exterior, and the back-mounted compressor enhances space efficiency. With dimensions of 71 1/8 inches in width, 35 1/4 inches in depth, and 38 1/2 inches in height, this unit offers a generous 19 cubic feet capacity, divided among three swing solid doors, making it ideal for busy food preparation environments.\n\nThis prep table is equipped with the Blizzard R290 cooling system, featuring a natural, hydrocarbon refrigerant that aligns with the U.S. Department of Energy and EPA standards. The slide-out cooling cartridge ensures rapid and easy maintenance, eliminating the need for onsite brazing. The efficient evaporator ensures quick cooling, maintaining ingredients at ideal temperatures. The unit operates within a food-safe temperature range, monitored by a reliable thermometer and thermostat to ensure consistent performance.\n\nDesigned for efficiency and convenience, the EPBR3 operates on 115 volts, with a frequency of 60 hertz, and a single-phase power supply, drawing 2.5 amps. The 1/3 HP compressor ensures robust performance, while the sturdy casters provide mobility and stability. Manufactured in the USA, this prep table meets high standards of quality and reliability, supported by a comprehensive warranty for peace of mind, making it a valuable addition to any food service establishment.', 'Features a spacious layout that allows for efficient ingredient preparation, perfect for busy hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nOffers a durable worktop resistant to intense heat, ensuring longevity and reliability in commercial kitchens.\nMore storage options provide ample space for condiments and toppings, making it versatile for various foodservice applications.\nIncludes an eco-friendly refrigerant system, reducing energy costs and environmental impact, ideal for sustainability-conscious businesses.\nDesigned with easy access and usability in mind, enhancing workflow and productivity in fast-paced environments.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EPBR3_6ba665d9-2992-4183-87ef-b527c4000100.webp\"]', 'EPBR3', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 4180, NULL, NULL, NULL, 71.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 35.00, NULL, 455.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:48:05', '2024-12-16 08:19:21', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/EPBR3_6ba665d9-2992-4183-87ef-b527c4000100.webp', 'physical', '', 3583, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB513\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2206, 'Everest Refrigeration EPBWR2 59 1/8\" Back Mount Mega-Top Sandwich Prep. Table Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EPBWR2 2 Door Sandwich Prep Table is designed to deliver both food preparation and storage capabilities in commercial kitchens. This model includes a back-mounted refrigeration system with the Blizzard R290 slide-out cooling cartridge, which ensures rapid and effective cooling. It operates with R290 refrigerant, a natural and climate-friendly choice that meets energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the EPA. The unit functions at 115 V, 60 Hz, and 1 Phase with a 1/3 HP compressor for reliable cooling performance.\n\nThe prep table is constructed with a stainless steel finish and measures 59 1/8 inches in width, 35 1/4 inches in depth, and 38 1/2 inches in height. It has a capacity of 16 cu. ft. and includes two swing doors for convenient access and ample storage. This robust design is built to withstand the demands of high-traffic environments such as hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\n\nFitted with a unique anti-warp worktop, the EPBWR2 can handle intense heat from cooking equipment while keeping the refrigerated section well-insulated. With a rating of 2.5 amps, it includes a power cord of suitable length for flexible installation. This unit is designed to provide efficient cooling and energy savings, making it a practical choice for establishments aiming to improve their operational efficiency and reduce their environmental impact.', 'Features a patented anti-warp worktop that resists high temperatures from cooking equipment while maintaining insulation for the refrigerated interior, ideal for high-volume kitchens in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nIncludes the Blizzard R290 slide-out cooling cartridge for efficient and rapid cooling, simplifying maintenance and reducing energy consumption in busy food prep areas.\nUses R290 refrigerant, a natural and environmentally friendly option that aligns with energy consumption standards and helps cut carbon emissions, suitable for establishments focused on sustainability.\nProvides a generous 16 cu. ft. capacity with two doors, offering ample space for ingredient storage and easy access, enhancing organization and efficiency in commercial kitchens.\nComes with a stainless steel finish that is easy to clean and maintain, ensuring a hygienic and efficient workspace for high-traffic food preparation environments.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EPBWR2_8b4d7881-a527-45dc-b958-4e924b61bc0e.webp\"]', 'EPBWR2', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 3701, NULL, NULL, NULL, 59.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 35.00, NULL, 393.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:48:06', '2024-12-16 08:19:21', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/EPBWR2_8b4d7881-a527-45dc-b958-4e924b61bc0e.webp', 'physical', '', 3172, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB514\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2207, 'Everest Refrigeration EPBR2 47 1/2\" Back Mount Mega-Top Sandwich Prep. Table Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EPBR2 2 Door Sandwich Prep Table is designed to offer versatile and efficient food preparation and storage solutions in commercial kitchens. This model features a back-mounted refrigeration system with the Blizzard R290 slide-out cooling cartridge, which ensures rapid and effective cooling. The unit uses R290 refrigerant, a natural and climate-friendly alternative that meets the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the EPA. It operates at 115 V, 60 Hz, and 1 Phase with a 1/4+ HP compressor, providing reliable performance.\n\nConstructed with a stainless steel finish, the prep table measures 47 1/2 inches in width, 35 1/4 inches in depth, and 38 1/2 inches in height. It offers a 13 cu. ft. capacity with two swing doors, providing ample space for ingredient storage and easy access. The solid doors and robust design are built to handle the demands of high-traffic environments, such as hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\n\nThe innovative anti-warp worktop is engineered to resist intense heat from cooking equipment while keeping the refrigerated section insulated. Rated for 3.5 amps, the unit includes a power cord of suitable length for flexible placement. The EPBR2 is designed to deliver efficient cooling and energy savings, making it a practical choice for establishments aiming to improve their operational efficiency and reduce their environmental impact.', 'Features a unique anti-warp worktop that can handle high temperatures from griddles and fryers while keeping the refrigerated interior insulated, making it ideal for high-volume kitchens in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nIncludes a Blizzard R290 slide-out cooling cartridge for efficient and rapid cooling, which simplifies maintenance and lowers energy consumption in busy food preparation areas.\nUses R290 refrigerant, a natural and eco-friendly choice that meets energy consumption standards and helps reduce carbon emissions, suitable for establishments focused on environmental sustainability.\nProvides a spacious 13 cu. ft. capacity with two doors, offering ample storage for ingredients and condiments to streamline food prep and enhance organization in commercial kitchens.\nComes with a stainless steel finish that is easy to clean and maintain, ensuring a hygienic and efficient workspace for high-traffic food prep environments.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EPBR2_3dd6d544-4eaa-4a2f-996d-e4617d254f6e.webp\"]', 'EPBR2', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 3291, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 35.00, NULL, 339.00, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:48:07', '2024-12-16 08:19:21', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/EPBR2_3dd6d544-4eaa-4a2f-996d-e4617d254f6e.webp', 'physical', '', 2821, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB515\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2208, 'Everest Refrigeration EPBSR2 35 5/8\" Back Mount Mega-Top Sandwich Prep. Table Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EPBSR2 2 Door Sandwich Prep Table is designed to improve food preparation and storage in commercial kitchens. This model features a back-mounted refrigeration system equipped with a Blizzard R290 slide-out cooling cartridge, which provides efficient cooling and ease of maintenance. The unit uses R290 refrigerant, a natural and climate-friendly alternative that meets the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the EPA. It operates at 115 V, 60 Hz, and 1 Phase with a 1/5 HP compressor, ensuring dependable performance.\n\nConstructed with a stainless steel finish, the prep table measures 35 5/8 inches in width, 35 1/4 inches in depth, and 38 1/2 inches in height. It offers a 10 cu. ft. capacity with two swing doors for convenient access and ample storage space. The solid doors and sturdy construction are designed to withstand the demands of high-traffic environments, such as hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\n\nThe innovative anti-warp worktop is engineered to resist intense heat from griddles, grills, and fryers while maintaining a well-insulated refrigerated interior. Rated for 2.5 amps, the unit includes a power cord of suitable length for flexible installation. The EPBSR2 is built to deliver efficient cooling and significant energy savings, making it an excellent choice for establishments aiming to enhance their operations and reduce their environmental impact.', 'Features an innovative anti-warp worktop that withstands high temperatures from cooking equipment, ensuring durability and insulation for the refrigerated section, making it suitable for busy kitchens in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nIncludes a Blizzard R290 slide-out cooling cartridge for rapid and effective cooling, which simplifies maintenance and minimizes energy consumption in food preparation areas.\nUses R290 refrigera