(2210, 'Everest Refrigeration EPBNR3-D2 71 1/8\" Back Mount Drawered Sandwich Prep. Table Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EPBNR3-D2 3 Section 1 Door &amp; 2 Drawer Sandwich Prep Table is designed to provide versatile food preparation and storage solutions in commercial kitchens. This model features a back-mounted refrigeration system with a Blizzard R290 slide-out cooling cartridge for effective cooling. The use of R290 refrigerant ensures a climate-friendly approach to energy efficiency, meeting the daily consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the EPA. Operating on 115 V, 60 Hz, and 1 Phase, the unit is equipped with a 1/3 HP compressor for reliable performance.\n\nConstructed with a stainless steel finish, the prep table measures 71 1/8 inches in width, 31 1/2 inches in depth, and 38 1/2 inches in height. It offers a generous 19 cu. ft. capacity and features a combination of 1 door and 2 drawers for versatile storage options. The solid swing door and drawers are built to withstand the demands of high-traffic kitchen environments, making it suitable for use in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\n\nThe innovative anti-warp worktop is designed to resist intense heat from cooking equipment while maintaining a well-insulated refrigerated interior. Rated for 2.5 amps, it includes a power cord of appropriate length for flexible installation. The EPBNR3-D2 is engineered to deliver efficient cooling and significant energy savings, making it an excellent choice for establishments aiming to enhance their operational efficiency and reduce environmental impact.', 'Features an innovative anti-warp worktop that endures high temperatures from griddles and fryers while keeping the refrigerated interior well-insulated, suitable for high-volume kitchens in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nIncludes a Blizzard R290 slide-out cooling cartridge for rapid and efficient cooling, simplifying maintenance and reducing energy use in busy food preparation areas.\nEmploys eco-friendly R290 refrigerant, which enhances energy efficiency and reduces carbon emissions, making it suitable for establishments focused on environmental sustainability.\nProvides a substantial 19 cu. ft. capacity with 1 door and 2 drawers, offering ample storage space for ingredients and condiments, improving the food prep process.\nComes with a stainless steel finish that is easy to clean and maintain, ensuring a hygienic and efficient workspace for high-traffic food preparation environments.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EPBNR3-D2_54099e9d-49da-4ae2-b67c-65997769cf6c.webp\"]', 'EPBNR3-D2', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 4494, NULL, NULL, NULL, 71.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 473.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:48:11', '2024-12-16 08:19:21', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/EPBNR3-D2_54099e9d-49da-4ae2-b67c-65997769cf6c.webp', 'physical', '', 3852, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB518\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2211, 'Everest Refrigeration EPBNWR2-D4 59 1/8\" Back Mount Drawered Sandwich Prep. Table Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EPBNWR2-D4 2 Section 4 Drawer Sandwich Prep Table is designed to enhance food preparation and storage in commercial kitchens. This model includes a back-mounted refrigeration system with the Blizzard R290 slide-out cooling cartridge, which provides rapid and effective cooling. The unit employs R290 refrigerant, a natural and climate-friendly alternative that aligns with the U.S. Department of Energy and EPA energy consumption standards. It operates on 115 V, 60 Hz, and 1 Phase with a 1/3 HP compressor, ensuring dependable performance.\n\nConstructed with a stainless steel finish, the prep table measures 59 1/8 inches in width, 31 1/2 inches in depth, and 38 1/2 inches in height. It offers a generous 16 cu. ft. capacity and includes four drawers for easy access and organization of ingredients. The solid swing doors and durable construction are suited to withstand the demands of high-traffic environments, such as hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\n\nThis prep table comes with an anti-warp worktop that resists intense heat from griddles, grills, and fryers while keeping the refrigerated section insulated. Rated for 2.5 amps, it comes with a power cord of appropriate length for flexible installation. The EPBNWR2-D4 is designed to deliver efficient cooling and energy savings, making it an excellent choice for establishments aiming to improve their operational efficiency and environmental impact.', 'Features an anti-warp worktop that withstands high temperatures from cooking equipment while keeping the refrigerated interior well-insulated, making it ideal for bustling kitchens in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nIncludes a Blizzard R290 slide-out cooling cartridge for quick and efficient cooling, which simplifies maintenance and lowers energy consumption in food preparation settings.\nEmploys natural R290 refrigerant, an eco-friendly option that supports energy savings and reduces carbon emissions, suitable for establishments committed to sustainability.\nOffers a spacious 16 cu. ft. capacity with 4 drawers, providing ample storage for ingredients and condiments to enhance workflow and efficiency in commercial kitchens.\nComes with a stainless steel finish that is easy to clean and maintain, ensuring a hygienic and efficient workspace for high-traffic food prep areas.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EPBNWR2-D4_cb98d6e7-7d7d-4aca-ab7a-df66576c8b13.webp\"]', 'EPBNWR2-D4', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 4205, NULL, NULL, NULL, 59.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 436.00, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:48:12', '2024-12-16 08:19:21', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/EPBNWR2-D4_cb98d6e7-7d7d-4aca-ab7a-df66576c8b13.webp', 'physical', '', 3604, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB519\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '');
