(2212, 'Everest Refrigeration EPBNR2-D4 47 1/2\" Back Mount Drawered Sandwich Prep. Table Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EPBNR2-D4 2 Section 4 Drawer Sandwich Prep Table is a versatile and essential addition to any commercial kitchen. This model includes a back-mounted refrigeration system equipped with a Blizzard R290 slide-out cooling cartridge for rapid cooling. The system employs natural R290 refrigerant, providing an eco-friendly solution that meets the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the EPA. The cooling unit operates at 115 V, 60 Hz, and 1 Phase, with a 1/4+ HP compressor, ensuring reliable performance.\n\nConstructed with a stainless steel finish, the prep table measures 47 1/2 inches in width, 31 1/2 inches in depth, and 38 1/2 inches in height. It offers a generous 13 cu. ft. capacity with four drawers for easy access and organization of ingredients. The solid swing doors and durable construction are designed to withstand the demands of busy commercial kitchens, including hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\n\nThis prep table is built with an anti-warp worktop that resists high temperatures from cooking equipment while keeping the refrigerated interior well-insulated. Rated for 3.5 amps, it includes a suitably long power cord for flexible placement. The EPBNR2-D4 is designed to support efficient cooling and energy savings, making it an excellent choice for establishments aiming to reduce operational costs and environmental impact.', 'Features a robust, anti-warp worktop designed to endure high temperatures from griddles and fryers, maintaining insulation for the refrigerated area, ideal for busy kitchens in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nIncludes a Blizzard R290 slide-out cooling cartridge for fast and efficient cooling, which simplifies maintenance and reduces energy consumption in commercial food prep areas.\nUtilizes R290 refrigerant, a natural and eco-friendly option that cuts energy costs and minimizes carbon emissions, making it suitable for establishments focused on environmental sustainability.\nProvides a spacious 13 cu. ft. capacity with 4 drawers, offering ample storage for ingredients and condiments to enhance workflow efficiency in food preparation.\nComes with a stainless steel finish that is easy to clean and maintain, ensuring a hygienic and efficient work environment for high-traffic food prep settings.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EPBNR2-D4_50899e13-8ae7-4f09-be82-3d8dc2527a6a.webp\"]', 'EPBNR2-D4', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 3675, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 368.00, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:48:13', '2024-12-16 08:19:21', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/EPBNR2-D4_50899e13-8ae7-4f09-be82-3d8dc2527a6a.webp', 'physical', '', 3150, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB520\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2213, 'Everest Refrigeration EPBNSR2-D2 35 5/8\" Back Mount Drawered Sandwich Prep. Table Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EPBNSR2-D2 1 Section 2 Drawer Sandwich Prep Table is a versatile unit designed for both food preparation and storage. Featuring a back-mounted refrigeration system, it includes a Blizzard R290 slide-out cooling cartridge that ensures rapid and efficient cooling. This system uses natural R290 refrigerant, which is both climate-friendly and energy-efficient, aligning with U.S. Department of Energy and EPA energy consumption standards. The cooling unit operates at 115 V, 60 Hz, and 1 Phase with a 1/5 HP compressor, providing robust performance.\n\nThe prep table is built with a stainless steel finish and measures 35 5/8 inches in width, 31 1/2 inches in depth, and 38 1/2 inches in height. It offers a spacious 10 cu. ft. capacity with two drawers for convenient ingredient storage and easy access. The solid swing doors and sturdy construction ensure durability and ease of cleaning, making it suitable for the demanding environments of hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\n\nBuilt with an anti-warp worktop, this model withstands intense heat from griddles, grills, and fryers while maintaining an insulated refrigerated interior. Rated for 2.5 amps, it comes with a power cord of appropriate length for flexible placement. This prep table is designed to meet daily energy consumption standards, reflecting its efficiency and commitment to reducing energy costs and carbon footprint.', 'Features a durable, anti-warp worktop that can handle high temperatures from cooking equipment, ensuring it remains functional and insulated in busy kitchens, ideal for hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nIncludes a Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge for quick, efficient cooling, which simplifies maintenance and reduces energy usage in food preparation areas.\nUses R290 refrigerant, a natural and eco-friendly option that helps cut energy costs and lower carbon emissions, suitable for establishments focused on sustainability.\nProvides a generous 10 cu. ft. capacity with 2 drawers, offering ample storage space for ingredients and condiments to streamline the food prep process.\nComes with a stainless steel finish that is easy to clean and maintain, keeping the workspace hygienic and efficient in high-traffic kitchens.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EPBNSR2-D2_a2b2dd90-6888-4ee5-b87d-b71a43127688.webp\"]', 'EPBNSR2-D2', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 3075, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 299.00, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:48:15', '2024-12-16 08:19:21', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/EPBNSR2-D2_a2b2dd90-6888-4ee5-b87d-b71a43127688.webp', 'physical', '', 2636, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB521\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
