(2215, 'Everest Refrigeration EPBNR3 71 1/8\" Back Mount Sandwich Prep. Table Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EPBNR3 3 Door Sandwich Prep Table measures 71 1/2 inches in width, 31 1/2 inches in depth, and 38 1/2 inches in height, designed to enhance both food preparation and storage capabilities. Featuring a stainless steel finish, this model comes with three swing solid doors, providing robust construction and straightforward access to the refrigerated section.\n\nEquipped with the Blizzard R290 cooling system, this prep table utilizes a cutting-edge slide-out cartridge that facilitates efficient cooling and easy maintenance. The R290 refrigerant is a natural hydrocarbon that aligns with energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, promoting lower energy costs and reduced carbon emissions.\n\nWith a total capacity of 19 cubic feet, and operating on 115 V, 60 Hz, 1 Phase with a 2.5 amp draw and a 1/3 horsepower compressor, this unit is ideal for a variety of food preparation tasks. It is perfectly suited for commercial kitchens that require both extensive cold storage and workspace, enhancing productivity and operational efficiency.', 'Equipped with three swing doors that ensure easy access to ingredients and efficient organization, suitable for high-volume kitchens and food prep stations.\nProvides 19 cubic feet of storage space combined with a work area, making it versatile for ingredient preparation and assembly in cafes, restaurants, and catering businesses.\nFeatures the Blizzard R290 cooling system and a slide-out cartridge for quick cooling and simple maintenance, helping to cut down on energy costs and environmental impact.\nIncludes a stainless steel finish for durability and easy cleaning, ensuring longevity even in demanding foodservice environments.\nOffers a specialized anti-warp worktop that withstands high temperatures from cooking equipment while maintaining effective insulation for the refrigerated compartments.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EPBNR3_20540113-43b1-46b2-97a8-8c0aec020114.webp\"]', 'EPBNR3', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 4112, NULL, NULL, NULL, 71.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 39.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 426.00, NULL, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:48:17', '2024-12-16 08:19:21', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/EPBNR3_20540113-43b1-46b2-97a8-8c0aec020114.webp', 'physical', '', 3525, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB523\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2216, 'Everest Refrigeration EPBNWR2 59 1/8\" Back Mount Sandwich Prep. Table Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EPBNWR2 2 Door Sandwich Prep Table measures 59 1/2 inches in width, 31 1/2 inches in depth, and 38 1/2 inches in height, designed to enhance both food preparation and cold storage efficiency. This model is constructed with a stainless steel finish and equipped with swing solid doors, offering durability and ease of access for daily operations.\n\nThis prep table includes the Blizzard R290 cooling system, which comes with an innovative slide-out cartridge for quick cooling and straightforward maintenance. The use of R290 refrigerant helps in meeting U.S. Department of Energy and Environmental Protection Agency standards, contributing to energy savings and lower carbon emissions.\n\nWith a total capacity of 16 cubic feet, and operating on 115 V, 60 Hz, 1 Phase with a 2.5 amp draw and a 1/3 horsepower compressor, this unit is well-suited for a variety of foodservice tasks. It provides ample space for ingredient preparation and condiment dispensing, making it an effective choice for any high-traffic kitchen or foodservice setting.', 'Offers a solid swing door design that provides easy access to stored items, ideal for busy kitchens and foodservice environments.\nProvides a generous 16 cubic feet of cold storage space and work area, suitable for prepping ingredients and assembling dishes in restaurants, cafes, and catering operations.\nEquipped with the Blizzard R290 cooling system for rapid and efficient cooling, helping to lower energy costs and reduce environmental impact.\nHas a stainless steel finish that ensures durability and easy cleaning, able to withstand the demands of a commercial kitchen.\nFeatures a specialized anti-warp worktop that resists heat from cooking equipment while maintaining insulation for the refrigerated section.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EPBNWR2_553c0ca8-0f75