(2217, 'Everest Refrigeration EPBNR2 47 1/2\" Back Mount Sandwich Prep. Table Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EPBNR2 2 Door Sandwich Prep Table features a width of 47 1/2 inches, a depth of 31 1/2 inches, and a height of 38 1/2 inches. This unit is designed to offer both a functional prep workspace and cold storage for ingredients, making it a versatile addition to any commercial kitchen. The stainless steel finish and solid swing doors contribute to its durability and ease of access.\n\nThis model is equipped with the Blizzard R290 cooling system, featuring an innovative slide-out cartridge for effective and rapid cooling. The use of R290, a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant, complies with the energy consumption standards of the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, leading to lower energy costs and reduced carbon emissions.\n\nWith a 13 cubic feet capacity and operating on 115 V, 60 Hz, 1 Phase with a 3.5 amp draw and a 1/4+ horsepower compressor, the EPBNR2 ensures dependable performance. It provides ample storage and prep space, making it a practical choice for food prep, assembly, and condiment dispensing in various foodservice environments.', 'Features a swing solid door design that provides easy access to contents, ideal for efficient use in kitchens, cafes, and restaurants.\nOffers a spacious 13 cubic feet work area for cold storage and food preparation, helping streamline food assembly and condiment dispensing in any foodservice setting.\nIncludes Blizzard R290 cooling technology, which delivers fast, reliable cooling while minimizing environmental impact and reducing energy expenses.\nProvides a stainless steel finish that resists wear and tear, making it a durable and easy-to-maintain option for high-traffic kitchens.\nEnsures an anti-warp worktop that handles heat from cooking equipment while keeping the refrigerated section effectively insulated and operational.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/t