(2218, 'Everest Refrigeration EPBNSR2 35 5/8\" Back Mount Sandwich Prep. Table Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EPBNSR2 2 Door Sandwich Prep Table measures 35 5/8 inches in width, 31 1/2 inches in depth, and 38 1/2 inches in height. This model is designed to offer both cold storage and a functional workspace, making it a versatile tool for food preparation and assembly. Featuring a stainless steel finish and solid swing doors, the unit combines durability with ease of access.\n\nEquipped with Blizzard R290 technology, this prep table uses an innovative, slide-out cooling cartridge for effective and quick cooling. The R290 refrigerant is a natural hydrocarbon alternative that aligns with the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, promoting reduced energy use and lower carbon emissions.\n\nOperating on 115 V, 60 Hz, 1 Phase with a 2.5 amp draw and a 1/5 horsepower compressor, the EPBNSR2 provides reliable cooling performance. Its 10 cubic feet capacity and well-insulated design make it a practical choice for efficiently managing ingredient storage and prep tasks in a variety of foodservice environments.', 'Features a swing solid door design, making it easy to access the contents and maintain an organized prep area in any busy kitchen.\nOffers a spacious working surface combined with cold storage, ideal for food preparation, assembly, and condiment dispensing in restaurants, cafes, and hotels.\nIncludes Blizzard R290 cooling technology, which ensures efficient and rapid cooling while being environmentally friendly, thus lowering energy costs and carbon emissions.\nProvides a durable stainless steel finish that stands up to the rigors of a commercial kitchen, ensuring easy maintenance and long-lasting performance.\nEnsures an anti-warp worktop that withstands heat from cooking equipment, keeping the refrigerated section efficient and stable.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\