(2220, 'Everest Refrigeration EPR2-24 2 47 1/2\" Side Mount Sandwich Prep. Table Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EPR2-24 2 Door Sandwich Prep Table is a versatile solution for commercial kitchens, offering both a functional workspace and efficient cold storage. With dimensions of 47 1/2 inches in width, 24 1/2 inches in depth, and 37 1/2 inches in height, this prep table provides ample room for food preparation and ingredient storage. The unit features solid doors and a durable stainless steel finish, designed to withstand the demands of a busy kitchen.\n\nThis prep table is equipped with Blizzard R290 cooling technology, featuring a slide-out cooling cartridge that simplifies maintenance and delivers effective cooling. The use of R290 refrigerant, a natural hydrocarbon, complies with the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, offering an eco-friendly alternative to traditional refrigerants.\n\nOperating at 115 V, 60 Hz, 1 Phase with a current draw of 3.48 amps, the EPR2-24 is built to handle the high demands of commercial kitchens. Its combination of efficient cooling, robust construction, and ample workspace makes it an ideal choice for enhancing food prep areas in restaurants, hotels, and cafes.', 'Features a solid door design for durability and a professional look, ideal for maintaining a clean and efficient kitchen environment.\nOffers a spacious work area for preparing and assembling a variety of foods, from sandwiches and pizzas to salads and desserts, enhancing kitchen efficiency.\nIncludes Blizzard R290 cooling technology, which ensures rapid cooling with an environmentally friendly refrigerant, reducing both energy costs and carbon emissions.\nProvides convenient cold storage and easy access to ingredients, streamlining food prep tasks in busy hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nEnsures a stainless steel finish that is easy to clean and resistant to damage, maintaining its appearance in high-traffic kitchen areas.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EPR2-24_3748cf22-1473-4464-ab44-84b908aa8af1.webp\"]', 'EPR2-24', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 3467, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 38.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 229.00, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:48:25', '2024-12-16 08:19:21', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/EPR2-24_3748cf22-1473-4464-ab44-84b908aa8af1.webp', 'physical', '', 2972, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB528\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2221, 'Everest Refrigeration EPR1-24 35 5/8\" Side Mount Sandwich Prep. Table Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EPR1-24 1 Door Sandwich Prep Table is designed to enhance food preparation and assembly in commercial kitchens. With dimensions of 35 5/8 inches in width, 24 1/2 inches in depth, and 37 1/2 inches in height, this prep table offers a practical solution for handling a variety of kitchen tasks. The unit features a solid door and a stainless steel finish, ensuring durability and a professional appearance.\n\nEquipped with Blizzard R290 cooling technology, the prep table incorporates a slide-out cooling cartridge that simplifies maintenance and provides efficient, rapid cooling. The use of natural hydrocarbon refrigerant aligns with energy consumption standards from the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, offering a more eco-friendly alternative to traditional refrigerants.\n\nOperating on a 115 V, 60 Hz, 1 Phase power supply with a current draw of 3.27 amps, this unit is built to handle the demands of busy kitchens while reducing energy consumption. With its combination of ample workspace, efficient cooling, and robust construction, the EPR1-24 is an excellent choice for enhancing food prep areas in restaurants, hotels, and cafes.', 'Features a solid door design, ensuring durability and ease of use while maintaining a clean and professional appearance in any kitchen setting.\nOffers a versatile workspace for preparing and assembling sandwiches, burgers, pizzas, salads, and desserts, streamlining kitchen operations in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nIncludes Blizzard R290 cooling technology, which delivers rapid cooling with an eco-friendly refrigerant, helping to lower energy costs and carbon emissions.\nProvides ample cold storage space, keeping ingredients fresh and easily accessible for efficient food preparation.\nEnsures a stainless steel finish that is both easy to clean and resistant to wear, maintaining its appearance and functionality in high-traffic areas.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EPR1-24_dec549c1-9929-403e-a1be-fc2eec5dad5b.webp\"]', 'EPR1-24', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 2417, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 38.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 185.00, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:48:27', '2024-12-16 08:19:21', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/EPR1-24_dec549c1-9929-403e-a1be-fc2eec5dad5b.webp', 'physical', '', 2071, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB529\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2222, 'Everest Refrigeration ECB96D4 95 1/2\" Side Mount Drawered Chef Base Refrigerators, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ECB96D4 4 Drawer Chef Base is crafted to meet the needs of high-demand commercial kitchens. With a stainless steel exterior, this chef base measures 95 1/2 inches in width, 32 1/8 inches in depth, and 20 inches in height, providing ample storage with a 6 cubic feet capacity. Its design combines durability with functionality, making it an ideal choice for busy hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\n\nThis model features a specialized anti-warp worktop that can handle the intense heat from equipment like griddles and fryers while keeping the refrigerated compartments well-insulated. The chef base is equipped with Blizzard R290 technology, which includes a slide-out cooling cartridge for efficient performance and ease of maintenance. This system employs a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant that aligns with energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency.\n\nThe ECB96D4 operates on 115 V, 60 Hz, and 1 Phase power supply, with a 2.5 amp current draw and a 1/3 horsepower compressor. The advanced cooling technology ensures effective refrigeration and contributes to reduced energy costs and lower carbon emissions. Designed for high performance and environmental efficiency, this chef base is a reliable addition to any commercial kitchen setup.', 'Features four spacious drawers for easy access to ingredients, enhancing efficiency in busy kitchens across hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nOffers a worktop that withstands high heat from cooking appliances, ensuring durability and insulation for the refrigerated sections.\nIncludes Blizzard R290 cooling technology, which provides eco-friendly refrigeration with reduced energy use and lower carbon emissions.\nProvides a sleek stainless steel finish that resists damage and is easy to clean, maintaining a professional appearance in any commercial setting.\nEnsures 6 cubic feet of interior capacity, accommodating a variety of ingredients and kitchen supplies for seamless food preparation.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ECB96D4_03313209-7639-402d-a0f3-4de935c3d770.webp\"]', 'ECB96D4', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 6709, NULL, NULL, NULL, 96.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 20.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 567.00, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:48:28', '2024-12-16 08:19:21', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ECB96D4_03313209-7639-402d-a0f3-4de935c3d770.webp', 'physical', '', 5750, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB530\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2223, 'Everest Refrigeration ECB82-86D4 86 1/4\" Side Mount Drawered Chef Base Refrigerators, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ECB82-86D4 4 Drawer Chef Base is engineered to deliver reliability and convenience in demanding culinary environments. This model features a stainless steel finish and measures 86 1/4 inches in width, 32 1/8 inches in depth, and 20 inches in height. It offers a generous storage capacity of 6 cubic feet, ideal for managing a wide range of ingredients and supplies.\n\nThis chef base is built with a specialized anti-warp worktop that endures high temperatures from cooking equipment such as griddles, grills, and fryers while insulating the refrigerated compartments. It is equipped with the Blizzard R290 cooling system, which includes a slide-out cartridge for efficient cooling and ease of maintenance without onsite brazing.\n\nThe ECB82-86D4 operates on 115 V, 60 Hz, and 1 Phase, with a 2.5 amp draw and a 1/3 horsepower compressor. It uses a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant that aligns with the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency\'s energy consumption standards. This chef base is designed to offer both high performance and environmental responsibility in commercial kitchens.', 'Features four drawers for quick and easy access to ingredients, streamlining kitchen operations in restaurants, hotels, and cafes.\nOffers a robust worktop designed to withstand high temperatures from cooking equipment, making it suitable for intense cooking environments.\nIncludes Blizzard R290 cooling technology, which supports eco-friendly refrigeration, reducing both energy consumption and carbon emissions.\nProvides a durable stainless steel exterior that resists wear and simplifies cleaning, maintaining a professional look in any commercial kitchen.\nEnsures a spacious 6 cubic feet of interior capacity, allowing for ample storage of ingredients and kitchen essentials.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ECB82-86D4_89fdaab6-ef9f-470f-a350-0637fdbb80ef.webp\"]', 'ECB82-86D4', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 6061, NULL, NULL, NULL, 86.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 20.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 494.00, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:48:29', '2024-12-16 08:19:21', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ECB82-86D4_89fdaab6-ef9f-470f-a350-0637fdbb80ef.webp', 'physical', '', 5195, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB531\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2224, 'Everest Refrigeration ECB82-84D4 84\" Side Mount Drawered Chef Base Refrigerators, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ECB82-84D4 4 Drawer Chef Base is designed to offer both functionality and durability in professional kitchens. This unit features a stainless steel finish and measures 84 inches in width, 32 1/8 inches in depth, and 20 inches in height. With a total capacity of 6 cubic feet, it provides ample space for storing ingredients and supplies.\n\nEquipped with a specialized anti-warp worktop, this chef base is capable of withstanding the high temperatures produced by cooking equipment while insulating the refrigerated sections. The unit incorporates the Blizzard R290 cooling system, which includes an all-in-one, slide-out cartridge that simplifies maintenance and replacement without requiring onsite brazing.\n\nThe ECB82-84D4 operates on 115 V, 60 Hz, and 1 Phase, with a power draw of 2.5 amps and a 1/3 horsepower compressor. It uses natural hydrocarbon refrigerant, complying with energy efficiency standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency. This chef base is designed to enhance performance and sustainability in commercial foodservice environments.', 'Features four convenient drawers, allowing quick access to ingredients and enhancing workflow efficiency in busy kitchens, restaurants, and hotels.\nOffers a sturdy worktop that withstands high temperatures from cooking equipment, making it ideal for griddles, grills, and fryers in commercial settings.\nIncludes Blizzard R290 cooling technology, which ensures eco-friendly refrigeration and reduces energy costs and carbon footprint.\nProvides a stainless steel finish that is both durable and easy to clean, maintaining a professional appearance in any foodservice environment.\nEnsures a spacious 6 cubic feet of storage capacity, accommodating a variety of ingredients and tools needed for efficient kitchen operations.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\