(2225, 'Everest Refrigeration ECB82D4 82 3/8\" Side Mount Drawered Chef Base Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ECB82D4 4 Drawer Chef Base combines functionality with durability, offering a robust solution for kitchen operations. Featuring a stainless steel finish, this unit measures 82 3/8 inches in width, 32 1/8 inches in depth, and 20 inches in height. The four drawers provide a total capacity of 6 cubic feet, making it suitable for storing a range of ingredients and supplies.\n\nDesigned with a specialized anti-warp worktop, this chef base endures high temperatures from cooking equipment like griddles and fryers while keeping the refrigerated compartments insulated. It incorporates the Blizzard R290 cooling system, which includes a slide-out cartridge for easy maintenance and replacement, thus eliminating the need for onsite brazing.\n\nThe ECB82D4 operates on 115 V, 60 Hz, and 1 Phase, with a power draw of 2.5 amps and a 1/3 horsepower compressor. It uses a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant, complying with the energy standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, resulting in significant energy and environmental benefits. This chef base is built to enhance efficiency and sustainability in professional kitchens.', 'Features four spacious drawers that allow quick access to ingredients, enhancing efficiency in commercial kitchens, hotels, and cafes.\nOffers a durable worktop capable of withstanding high temperatures from cooking equipment, well-suited for busy foodservice environments.\nIncludes the Blizzard R290 cooling system, which delivers eco-friendly refrigeration and helps lower energy bills and carbon footprint.\nProvides a stainless steel finish that is easy to clean and maintain, preserving a professional look in any kitchen setting.\nEnsures a substantial 6 cubic feet of refrigerated storage space, accommodating various ingredients and kitchen tools.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/test