(2226, 'Everest Refrigeration ECB72D4 72 3/8\" Side Mount Drawered Chef Base Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ECB72D4 4 Drawer Chef Base is designed to support hot cooking equipment on its top while offering efficient refrigerated storage underneath. This unit features a stainless steel finish and measures 72 3/8 inches in width, 32 1/8 inches in depth, and 20 inches in height. With a total drawer capacity of 4.4 cubic feet, it provides convenient storage for ingredients and easy access during busy service hours.\n\nConstructed with a specialized anti-warp worktop, this chef base can withstand high temperatures from equipment such as griddles, grills, and fryers while insulating the refrigerated compartments. It is equipped with the Blizzard R290 cooling system, which incorporates a slide-out cartridge for effective cooling and ease of replacement, eliminating the need for onsite brazing.\n\nThe ECB72D4 operates on 115 V, 60 Hz, and 1 Phase, drawing 3.5 amps with a 1/4+ horsepower compressor. It uses natural hydrocarbon refrigerant, meeting the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency. This setup contributes to significant reductions in energy costs and carbon emissions, making it a sustainable choice for professional kitchens.', 'Features four quick-access drawers that streamline ingredient retrieval, enhancing operational efficiency in restaurants, hotels, and cafes.\nOffers a sturdy, heat-resistant worktop that can handle high temperatures from cooking equipment, making it suitable for demanding kitchen environments.\nIncludes the Blizzard R290 cooling system, which provides eco-friendly refrigeration and helps lower energy expenses and carbon emissions.\nProvides a durable stainless steel finish that ensures easy maintenance and a professional appearance in foodservice areas.\nEnsures ample storage capacity with a design that accommodates both hot equipment on top and refrigerated items below, fitting various kitchen layouts.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ECB72D4_01a79f4f-8134-4ce3-8fca-1bdffed48207.webp\"]', 'ECB72D4', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 5100, NULL, NULL, NULL, 72.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 20.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 421.00, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:48:34', '2024-12-16 08:19:21', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ECB72D4_01a79f4f-8134-4ce3-8fca-1bdffed48207.webp', 'physical', '', 4371, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB534\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2227, 'Everest Refrigeration ECB52-60D2 60\" Side Mount Drawered Chef Base Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ECB52-60D2 2 Drawer Chef Base is designed to support hot cooking equipment on its top while offering refrigerated storage underneath. With a stainless steel finish, this unit is both durable and easy to maintain. The dimensions are 60 inches in width, 32 1/8 inches in depth, and 20 inches in height. It features two drawers with a total storage capacity of 4.4 cubic feet, allowing for convenient access to stored ingredients.\n\nThe chef base includes a specialized anti-warp worktop that can handle intense heat from various cooking appliances such as griddles, grills, and fryers. This feature helps to insulate the refrigerated interior and maintain consistent cooling. The Blizzard R290 cooling system, an all-in-one, slide-out cartridge, ensures effective refrigeration and safety, with easy replacement and no need for onsite brazing.\n\nOperating on 115 V, 60 Hz, and 1 Phase, the ECB52-60D2 draws 3.5 amps and utilizes a 1/4+ horsepower compressor. The refrigeration unit is equipped with natural hydrocarbon refrigerant, compliant with energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency. This configuration helps in reducing energy costs and environmental impact, making it a practical choice for professional kitchens.', 'Features quick-access drawers for easy retrieval of ingredients, enhancing efficiency in busy kitchens, restaurants, and cafes.\nOffers a heat-resistant, specialized worktop that can handle intense heat from cooking equipment, ideal for grilling, frying, and more.\nIncludes the innovative Blizzard R290 cooling system for effective, eco-friendly refrigeration, helping reduce energy costs and environmental impact.\nProvides a sleek, stainless steel finish that is easy to clean and maintain, ensuring a professional look in any commercial kitchen.\nEnsures a versatile design with ample storage space for both hot equipment and refrigerated ingredients, maximizing kitchen functionality.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ECB52-60D2_f8f071be-4a34-47ab-896f-413fd393958d.webp\"]', 'ECB52-60D2', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 4524, NULL, NULL, NULL, 60.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 20.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 342.00, NULL, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:48:35', '2024-12-16 08:19:21', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ECB52-60D2_f8f071be-4a34-47ab-896f-413fd393958d.webp', 'physical', '', 3878, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB535\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '');
