(2228, 'Everest Refrigeration ECB52D2 51 7/8\" Side Mount Drawered Chef Base Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ECB52D2 2 Drawer Chef Base features a stainless steel finish and is designed with a sturdy worktop that can support hot cooking equipment. Measuring 51 7/8 inches in width, 32 1/8 inches in depth, and 20 inches in height, it offers a total storage capacity of 4.4 cubic feet. The unit operates on 115 V power, 60 Hz frequency, and 1 Phase, with a 3.5 amp draw and a 1/4+ horsepower compressor for reliable cooling.\n\nThis chef base includes a specialized anti-warp worktop that resists heat from griddles, grills, and fryers while insulating the refrigerated compartment. The interior is designed to hold cold ingredients efficiently, making it a practical addition to professional kitchens. The unit features quick-access drawers for easy ingredient retrieval and effective organization.\n\nThe ECB52D2 is equipped with Blizzard R290, a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant that complies with energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency. This system supports rapid cooling and minimizes environmental impact, contributing to reduced energy costs and lower carbon emissions.', 'Features quick-access drawers that allow chefs to efficiently store and retrieve ingredients, enhancing workflow in restaurants and cafes.\nOffers a durable, heat-resistant worktop that can withstand high temperatures from cooking equipment, ideal for busy kitchens.\nIncludes the Blizzard R290 cooling system, providing effective and eco-friendly refrigeration while reducing energy consumption and carbon emissions.\nProvides a sleek stainless steel finish that is easy to clean and maintain, ensuring a professional appearance in foodservice settings.\nEnsures a versatile design with ample storage space, accommodating both hot equipment on top and refrigerated items below, perfect for maximizing kitchen functionality.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ECB52D2_4182ce8e-b224-4c46-b7e1-57fe95284e43.webp\"]', 'ECB52D2', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 4296, NULL, NULL, NULL, 52.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 20.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 320.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:48:36', '2024-12-16 08:19:21', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ECB52D2_4182ce8e-b224-4c46-b7e1-57fe95284e43.webp', 'physical', '', 3682, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB536\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
