(2237, 'Everest Refrigeration ETF3 71 1/8\" Side Mount Solid Door Undercounter Freezer, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ETF3 3 Door Undercounter Freezer, with a sleek stainless steel finish, is designed for both durability and efficiency. Measuring 71 1/8 inches in width, 31 1/2 inches in depth, and 29 1/4 inches in height, this unit integrates seamlessly into various commercial environments. The front-breathing condensing unit enables placement against walls, making it ideal for kitchens with limited space.\n\nThis undercounter freezer features a swing solid door style, equipped with the innovative Blizzard R290 system. The Blizzard R290 technology includes a slide-out cooling cartridge that simplifies maintenance and replacement without onsite brazing. The use of R290 refrigerant aligns with energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency.\n\nOperating at 115 volts, 60 hertz, and 1 phase, the freezer is supported by a 5-amp power draw and a 1/2 horsepower compressor. It offers a total capacity of 22 cubic feet and includes internal shelving for organized storage. The unit is designed for easy integration into various commercial settings, providing reliable performance and significant energy savings.', 'Features a spacious 22 cu. ft. interior, ideal for high-volume use in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nOffers solid swing doors that ensure secure and easy access to the contents, perfect for fast-paced kitchen environments.\nMore efficient cooling with the Blizzard R290, which helps in reducing energy costs and lowering carbon emissions.\nIncludes a front-breathing condensing unit, allowing for flexible installation against walls or under counters.\nProvides a durable stainless steel finish that stands up to daily wear and tear in busy commercial settings.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ETF3_87fc5683-3dfb-47d9-87b5-da28a9fb20ff.webp\"]', 'ETF3', 0, NUL