(2238, 'Everest Refrigeration ETWF2 59 1/4\" Side Mount Solid Door Undercounter Freezer, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ETWF2 2 Door Undercounter Freezer measures 59 1/4 inches in width, 31 1/2 inches in depth, and 29 1/4 inches in height. It operates on 115 V, 60 Hz, with a single-phase power system, drawing 5 amps and featuring a 1/2 horsepower compressor.\n\nThis model utilizes the Blizzard R290 cooling technology, which includes a slide-out cooling cartridge for efficient cooling and ease of maintenance. The R290 refrigerant is a natural hydrocarbon, known for its eco-friendly properties and compliance with energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and EPA.\n\nDesigned with a stainless steel exterior and side-mounted compressor, the ETWF2 combines durability with a compact footprint. It is ideal for use in various commercial settings, offering reliable freezing capabilities while fitting neatly under counters or serving as a functional workspace.', 'Features an 18 cubic feet capacity, providing ample space for storing frozen goods efficiently in busy commercial kitchens, such as those in hotels and restaurants.\nOffers flexible placement with a front-breathing condensing unit, allowing the unit to be installed against walls or in confined areas.\nDelivers effective cooling with the Blizzard R290 system, designed for quick temperature recovery and lower energy consumption.\nIncludes a stainless steel finish that is easy to maintain and durable, suitable for high-traffic environments in cafes and food service operations.\nProvides convenient access with its swing solid door design, ideal for organizing and retrieving items quickly.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ETWF2_b70957bc-8989-47df-a755-2d174583861d.webp\"]', 'ETWF2', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 3547, NULL, NULL, NULL, 59.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 306.00, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:48:50', '2024-12-16 08