(2239, 'Everest Refrigeration ETF2 47 1/2\" Side Mount Solid Door Undercounter Freezer, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ETF2 2 Door Undercounter Freezer is designed with a width of 47 1/2 inches, a depth of 31 1/2 inches, and a height of 29 1/4 inches, providing ample space in a compact footprint. It operates on 115 V, 60 Hz, with a single-phase power supply, using 5 amps and equipped with a 1/2 horsepower compressor.\n\nThe freezer features the Blizzard R290 cooling system, which includes an innovative slide-out cartridge for easy maintenance and rapid cooling. This system uses R290 refrigerant, a natural and eco-friendly hydrocarbon that complies with U.S. Department of Energy and EPA energy consumption standards, contributing to lower energy costs and reduced environmental impact.\n\nWith its stainless steel finish and side-mounted design, the ETF2 offers both durability and a sleek appearance. The unit is suitable for use in various commercial settings, providing reliable freezing capabilities while fitting neatly under counters or as a tabletop workspace.', 'Offers a spacious 13 cubic feet capacity, ideal for storing a variety of frozen items in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nAllows versatile placement with a front-breathing condensing unit, making it suitable for installation against walls or in confined spaces.\nProvides efficient cooling with the Blizzard R290 system, designed for quick temperature adjustments and reduced energy use.\nFeatures a durable stainless steel finish that resists wear and is easy to clean, ensuring longevity in busy commercial kitchens.\nIncludes a practical swing solid door design, making it easy to access and organize frozen goods efficiently.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ETF2_6cd6d8de-476a-4d66-a5ad-9adee41135e8.webp\"]', 'ETF2', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 3170, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 270.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:4