(2240, 'Everest Refrigeration ETF1 35 5/8\" Side Mount Solid Door Undercounter Freezer, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ETF1 1 Door Undercounter Freezer features a compact design, measuring 35 5/8 inches in width, 31 1/2 inches in depth, and 29 1/4 inches in height. Operating on 115 V with a 60 Hz frequency and a 1-phase power supply, it uses 3 amps and is equipped with a 1/3 horsepower compressor for reliable performance.\n\nThis freezer utilizes the Blizzard R290 system, which includes a slide-out cooling cartridge for easy maintenance and quick replacement. The R290 refrigerant is a natural hydrocarbon, aligning with the energy consumption standards of the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, offering both energy efficiency and reduced carbon emissions.\n\nWith its stainless steel finish, the ETF1 combines durability with a sleek appearance, making it suitable for both front-of-house and back-of-house applications in foodservice settings. The units side-mounted design and compact size make it versatile for various kitchen layouts, providing a practical solution for freezing needs in busy commercial kitchens.', 'Provides ample freezing space with a 9 cubic feet capacity, making it a great choice for smaller kitchens in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nAllows flexible placement with its front-breathing condensing unit, enabling installation against walls or in tight spaces.\nEnsures efficient freezing with the Blizzard R290 system, designed for rapid cooling and lower energy consumption.\nFeatures a durable stainless steel finish that is easy to clean and maintain, ideal for high-use environments.\nOffers a compact design with a swing solid door, perfect for under-counter or tabletop use in commercial kitchens.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ETF1_b8f7f52a-101b-446d-9d1c-f03e1ed11de3.webp\"]', 'ETF1', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 2272, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 29.