(2241, 'Everest Refrigeration ETR3 71 1/8\" Side Mount Solid Door Undercounter Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ETR3 3 Door Undercounter Refrigerator is designed for efficiency in compact workspaces. With a width of 71 1/8 inches, a depth of 31 1/2 inches, and a height of 29 1/4 inches, it is well-suited for installation under counters or as a workspace. The unit operates on 115 V, 60 Hz, with a 1-phase power supply, consuming 3.5 amps and featuring a 1/4+ horsepower compressor to ensure reliable refrigeration.\n\nEquipped with Blizzard R290, this model uses a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant that meets the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency. The all-in-one slide-out cooling cartridge facilitates rapid cooling and simplifies maintenance without the need for onsite brazing, contributing to reduced energy costs and lower carbon emissions.\n\nThe refrigerators stainless steel finish provides durability and ease of maintenance, making it ideal for busy commercial kitchens. With a generous 22 cubic feet of storage capacity and three swing solid doors, the ETR3 offers ample space for organizing refrigerated items. The front-breathing condensing unit allows for flexible placement, making it a versatile choice for various kitchen configurations in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.', 'Offers a spacious design with three swing solid doors, making it ideal for large-scale storage needs in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nAllows flexible installation with its front-breathing condensing unit, suitable for placement against walls without obstructing airflow.\nEnsures efficient and consistent cooling with the Blizzard R290 system, which helps to lower energy expenses and improve cooling performance.\nFeatures a stainless steel finish that is durable and easy to clean, seamlessly integrating into any commercial kitchen setup.\nProvides 22 cubic feet of storage capacity, offering ample space for organizing and accessing refrigerated items in high-traffic food service environments.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ETR3_fbf9a4f1-5085-438d-bf74-5318751b14d8.webp\"]', 'ETR3', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 3418, NULL, NULL, NULL, 71.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 343.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:48:53', '2024-12-16 08:19:21', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ETR3_fbf9a4f1-5085-438d-bf74-5318751b14d8.webp', 'physical', '', 2929, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB549\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2242, 'Everest Refrigeration ETWR2 59 1/4\" Side Mount Solid Door Undercounter Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ETWR2 2 Door Undercounter Refrigerator is designed for functionality in compact spaces. With a width of 59 1/4 inches, a depth of 31 1/2 inches, and a height of 29 1/4 inches, it is suitable for installation under counters or as a workspace. The unit operates on 115 V, 60 Hz, with a 1-phase power supply, drawing 3.5 amps and equipped with a 1/4+ horsepower compressor to ensure reliable refrigeration.\n\nThis refrigerator features the Blizzard R290 system, utilizing a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant that aligns with the energy standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency. The innovative all-in-one slide-out cooling cartridge facilitates rapid cooling and simplifies maintenance without requiring onsite brazing, helping to cut energy costs and reduce carbon emissions.\n\nWith a stainless steel finish for durability and ease of cleaning, the ETWR2 is built to withstand the demands of high-traffic commercial kitchens. The unit offers 18 cubic feet of storage capacity and is equipped with two swing solid doors, providing ample space for refrigerated items. The front-breathing condensing unit allows for flexible placement against walls, making it adaptable to various kitchen setups in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.', 'Provides a versatile design suitable for under-counter use or as a workspace, ideal for maximizing space in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nAllows flexible placement with its front-breathing condensing unit, enabling installation against walls without blocking airflow.\nEnsures efficient cooling with the Blizzard R290 system, which supports consistent temperature control and reduces overall energy consumption.\nFeatures a stainless steel finish that offers durability and easy maintenance, fitting seamlessly into various commercial kitchen environments.\nIncludes two swing solid doors and 18 cubic feet of storage capacity, providing ample space for storing and organizing refrigerated goods in busy food service areas.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ETWR2_ccb22dce-12ee-4536-9536-1065324899a6.webp\"]', 'ETWR2', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 3142, NULL, NULL, NULL, 59.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 296.00, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:48:54', '2024-12-16 08:19:21', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ETWR2_ccb22dce-12ee-4536-9536-1065324899a6.webp', 'physical', '', 2693, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB550\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2243, 'Everest Refrigeration ETR2 47 1/2\" Side Mount Solid Door Undercounter Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ETR2 2 Door Undercounter Refrigerator is designed for efficient use in compact areas. With dimensions of 47 1/2 inches in width, 31 1/2 inches in depth, and 29 1/4 inches in height, this unit is ideal for installation under counters or as a workspace. It operates on 115 V, 60 Hz, with a 1-phase power supply, drawing 3.5 amps and featuring a 1/4+ horsepower compressor for reliable cooling.\n\nThis model is equipped with Blizzard R290, a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant that meets the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency. The innovative all-in-one slide-out cooling cartridge ensures rapid cooling and facilitates easy maintenance without the need for onsite brazing, promoting energy efficiency and reducing carbon emissions.\n\nThe ETR2 features a stainless steel finish for durability and ease of maintenance, making it suitable for high-traffic commercial kitchens. With a storage capacity of 13 cubic feet and two swing solid doors, it provides ample space for refrigerated goods. The front-breathing condensing unit allows for flexible installation against walls, adapting to various kitchen layouts in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.', 'Offers a compact design perfect for under-counter placement or as a workspace, ideal for maximizing space in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nAllows for versatile installation with its front-breathing condensing unit, making it possible to position the unit against walls without hindering performance.\nEnsures efficient cooling with the Blizzard R290 system, which helps maintain consistent temperatures and contributes to lower energy costs.\nFeatures a durable stainless steel finish that is easy to clean and complements a variety of commercial kitchen settings.\nIncludes two swing solid doors and 13 cubic feet of storage capacity, p