(2244, 'Everest Refrigeration ETR1 35 5/8\" Side Mount Solid Door Undercounter Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ETR1 1 Door Undercounter Refrigerator is designed for efficient use in compact spaces. It measures 35 5/8 inches in width, 31 1/2 inches in depth, and 29 1/4 inches in height, making it suitable for installation under counters or as a workspace. The unit operates on 115 V, 60 Hz, with a 1-phase power supply, drawing 3.5 amps and featuring a 1/4+ horsepower compressor to ensure reliable cooling performance.\n\nThis refrigerator is equipped with Blizzard R290, a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant that meets the energy consumption standards of the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency. The all-in-one slide-out cooling cartridge allows for quick maintenance and replacement without the need for onsite brazing, helping to reduce energy costs and carbon emissions.\n\nThe ETR1 features a stainless steel finish for durability and ease of cleaning, making it ideal for high-traffic commercial kitchens. With a storage capacity of 9 cubic feet and a single swing solid door, it offers ample space for refrigerated goods. The front-breathing condensing unit enables flexible installation against walls, adapting to various kitchen configurations in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.', 'Offers a compact design ideal for use under counters or as a workspace, fitting seamlessly into kitchens with limited space in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nProvides flexible installation options with its front-breathing condensing unit, allowing placement against walls without obstruction.\nEnsures effective cooling with the Blizzard R290 system, which helps maintain stable temperatures and reduces energy consumption.\nFeatures a durable stainless steel finish that is easy to clean and integrates well with various kitchen environments.\nIncludes a single swing solid door and 9 cubic feet of storage capacity, making it suitable for storing refrigerated items in busy food service areas.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ETR1_28ac9e64-4b2f-4df2-8fac-73c357f7ca74.webp\"]', 'ETR1', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 1995, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 201.00, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:48:57', '2024-12-16 08:19:21', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ETR1_28ac9e64-4b2f-4df2-8fac-73c357f7ca74.webp', 'physical', '', 1710, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB552\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '');
