(2245, 'Everest Refrigeration ETBF3 71 1/8\" Back Mount Solid Door Undercounter Freezer, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ETBF3 3 Door Undercounter Freezer is designed to deliver reliable refrigeration in compact spaces. With dimensions of 71 1/8 inches in width, 31 1/2 inches in depth, and 30 1/4 inches in height, it is suitable for installation under counters or as a workspace. The unit operates on 115 V, 60 Hz, with a 1-phase power supply, drawing 5 amps and featuring a 1/2 horsepower compressor for consistent performance.\n\nThis freezer is equipped with Blizzard R290, a natural, climate-friendly hydrocarbon refrigerant. This system meets the energy consumption standards of the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, contributing to lower energy costs and reduced carbon emissions. The all-in-one slide-out cooling cartridge ensures easy maintenance and eliminates the need for onsite brazing.\n\nFeaturing a stainless steel finish and sturdy construction, the ETBF3 is both durable and easy to clean. It provides a total storage capacity of 22 cubic feet with three swing solid doors, offering ample space for frozen items. The front-breathing condensing unit allows for flexible installation, adapting to various kitchen configurations in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.', 'Provides a compact design suitable for under-counter placement or use as a workspace, making it ideal for hotels, restaurants, and cafes with limited space.\nAllows versatile installation with its front-breathing condensing unit, enabling it to be positioned against walls or under counters for flexible kitchen setups.\nEnsures efficient cooling with the Blizzard R290 cartridge, which maintains consistent temperatures and helps reduce energy costs.\nFeatures a stainless steel finish for durability and easy cleaning, blending seamlessly into various commercial kitchen environments.\nIncludes three swing solid doors and 22 cubic feet of storage capacity, offer