(2246, 'Everest Refrigeration ETBWF2 59 1/4\" Back Mount Solid Door Undercounter Freezer, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ETBWF2 2 Door Undercounter Freezer is designed to provide efficient refrigeration in compact areas. With dimensions of 59 1/4 inches in width, 31 1/2 inches in depth, and 30 1/4 inches in height, this unit fits well under counters or can be used as a workspace. It operates on 115 V, 60 Hz, with a 1-phase power supply, drawing 5 amps and featuring a 1/2 horsepower compressor for reliable performance.\n\nThis model is equipped with the Blizzard R290 refrigerant system, which uses a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant. The system meets the energy consumption standards established by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, supporting reduced energy costs and decreased carbon emissions. The all-in-one slide-out cooling cartridge facilitates easy maintenance and eliminates the need for onsite brazing.\n\nThe ETBWF2s stainless steel exterior and robust construction ensure durability and ease of cleaning, making it a practical choice for busy commercial kitchens. With a total storage capacity of 18 cubic feet and two swing solid doors, it offers generous space for frozen goods. The front-breathing condensing unit allows for adaptable installation, catering to a variety of kitchen layouts in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.', 'Provides a space-efficient design that fits under counters or functions as a workspace, ideal for hotels, restaurants, and cafes with limited room.\nEnables flexible installation with its front-breathing condensing unit, allowing placement against walls or under counters for versatile kitchen arrangements.\nEnsures effective cooling with the Blizzard R290 cartridge, which helps maintain consistent temperatures while lowering energy expenses.\nFeatures a stainless steel finish that offers durability and ease of maintenance, blending seamlessly into various commercial kitchen settings.\nInc