itchens.\nIncludes a user-friendly interface that ensures straightforward operation, making it convenient for staff to manage inventory and maintain product freshness.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ETBR3_295cb33d-cd74-4bd9-ba09-9a5cdbe133cc.webp\"]', 'ETBR3', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 3213, NULL, NULL, NULL, 71.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 359.00, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:49:11', '2024-12-16 08:19:21', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ETBR3_295cb33d-cd74-4bd9-ba09-9a5cdbe133cc.webp', 'physical', '', 2754, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB563\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2256, 'Everest Refrigeration ETBWR2 59 1/4\" Back Mount Solid Door Undercounter Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ETBWR2 2 Door Undercounter Refrigerator, designed by Everest Refrigeration, features a durable stainless steel finish and is equipped with a swing door style. It measures 59 1/4 inches in width, 31 1/2 inches in depth, and 30 1/4 inches in height, offering a spacious 18 cubic feet capacity. This model operates on 115V, 60 Hz, and 1 Phase, with a power consumption of 3.7 amps.\n\nThe refrigerator is designed with a back-mounted condensing unit and a front-breathing feature that allows for flexible placement against walls or under counters. It includes a Blizzard R290 cooling system, which utilizes a hydrocarbon refrigerant that is both climate-friendly and highly efficient. This system ensures rapid cooling and reduced energy costs while meeting U.S. Department of Energy and Environmental Protection Agency standards.\n\nThe ETBWR2 includes two solid swing doors and a sturdy construction suitable for commercial environments. The interior is designed to maximize storage space, with shelves and supports accommodating various items. The unit comes with a 1/4+ horsepower compressor and a warranty for reliable performance. It is ideal for use in foodservice operations, providing effective refrigeration while contributing to lower carbon emissions and energy savings.', 'Features a solid stainless steel finish that complements various kitchen environments, making it ideal for use in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nOffers a swing door style for easy access, enhancing convenience in high-traffic areas like commercial kitchens and service stations.\nMore efficient cooling is achieved with the advanced Blizzard R290 system, reducing energy consumption and operational costs.\nProvides a compact design suitable for under-counter placement or as a workspace, fitting well in smaller or space-constrained settings.\nIncludes a user-friendly interface with simple controls, ensuring straightforward operation for staff in busy foodservice environments.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ETBWR2_5a582cd2-60f5-45b9-81a9-1ca37fa8b5fc.webp\"]', 'ETBWR2', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 2935, NULL, NULL, NULL, 59.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 306.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:49:13', '2024-12-16 08:19:21', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ETBWR2_5a582cd2-60f5-45b9-81a9-1ca37fa8b5fc.webp', 'physical', '', 2516, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB564\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2257, 'Everest Refrigeration ETBR2 47 1/2\" Back Mount Solid Door Undercounter Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ETBR2 is a two-door undercounter refrigerator designed by Everest Refrigeration, featuring a stainless steel finish. It measures 47 1/2 inches in width, 31 1/2 inches in depth, and 30 1/4 inches in height. This model operates on a 115V electrical supply, with a frequency of 60Hz, and uses a single phase with 2.7 amps of power.\n\nThe refrigerator is equipped with a back-mounted condensing unit and features front-breathing technology, allowing for installation in tight spaces, such as under counters or against walls. It includes Blizzard R290, a slide-out cooling cartridge designed for efficient and rapid cooling, which also simplifies maintenance without the need for onsite brazing. The R290 refrigerant is a natural hydrocarbon that meets the energy consumption standards of the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency.\n\nWith a total capacity of 14 cubic feet, the ETBR2 combines robust construction with energy-efficient operation, making it a reliable choice for commercial settings. Its design ensures effective cooling while supporting environmentally friendly practices, making it suitable for various food storage needs in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.', 'Offers 14 cubic feet of storage space in a compact design, ideal for busy kitchens and service areas in hotels and cafes.\nFacilitates versatile installation with front-breathing technology, fitting comfortably under counters or against walls.\nIncludes Blizzard R290 for reliable cooling performance and easy maintenance, perfect for high-demand environments.\nFeatures a swing solid door for enhanced durability and easy access, supporting efficient food storage and management.\nUtilizes an eco-friendly refrigerant, reducing both energy consumption and environmental impact while providing effective cooling.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssit