(2258, 'Everest Refrigeration ETBSR2 35 1/2\" Back Mount Solid Door Undercounter Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ETBSR2 is a two-door undercounter refrigerator crafted by Everest Refrigeration, featuring a stainless steel finish. It measures 35 5/8 inches in width, 31 1/2 inches in depth, and 30 1/4 inches in height. Designed to operate on a 115V power supply with a frequency of 60Hz, it uses a single phase and requires 2.7 amps of electricity.\n\nThis model includes a back-mounted condensing unit and employs front-breathing technology, allowing it to be installed against walls or underneath counters. It features Blizzard R290, a slide-out cooling cartridge that ensures rapid cooling and simplifies maintenance. The R290 refrigerant is a natural, hydrocarbon-based option that meets the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency.\n\nWith a total capacity of 10 cubic feet, the ETBSR2 combines sturdy construction with energy-efficient performance, making it an ideal choice for commercial settings. It provides a reliable refrigeration solution while supporting sustainable practices, thanks to its effective cooling system and eco-friendly refrigerant.', 'Provides ample storage space in a compact design, perfect for accommodating essentials in restaurants, hotels, and cafes.\nAllows flexible installation with front-breathing technology, fitting neatly under counters or against walls.\nIncludes Blizzard R290 for efficient cooling and easy maintenance, suitable for high-traffic commercial kitchens.\nFeatures a swing solid door that ensures durability and reliable temperature control, contributing to food safety.\nEmploys an eco-friendly refrigerant, reducing energy costs and minimizing environmental impact with improved cooling efficiency.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ETBSR2_4bb09ad9-08b8-4ef5-a2fe-239b3ee8f79c.webp\"]', 'ETBSR2', 0, NULL, 0