(2259, 'Everest Refrigeration ETBR1 27 3/4\" Back Mount Solid Door Undercounter Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ETBR1 is a one-door undercounter refrigerator designed by Everest Refrigeration, featuring a sleek stainless steel finish. With dimensions of 27 3/4 inches in width, 31 1/2 inches in depth, and 30 1/4 inches in height, this unit fits seamlessly under counters or can be used as a tabletop workspace. It operates on a 115V power supply, with a frequency of 60Hz, single phase, and requires 2.7 amps of electrical current.\n\nThis model features a back-mounted condensing unit and front-breathing technology, allowing for placement against walls or within compact spaces. The refrigerator uses Blizzard R290, a slide-out cooling cartridge system that simplifies maintenance and enhances cooling efficiency. The R290 refrigerant is a natural, hydrocarbon-based option that complies with the U.S. Department of Energy and Environmental Protection Agency standards for energy consumption.\n\nWeighing in with a crated weight of 7.5 cubic feet capacity, the ETBR1 blends robust construction with energy-efficient performance. Its design is ideal for the demands of commercial kitchens, offering a reliable refrigeration solution while supporting environmentally-friendly operations.', 'Provides efficient storage in a compact design, making it perfect for tight spaces in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nOffers front-breathing technology, enabling placement against walls or under counters for flexible kitchen layouts.\nIncludes Blizzard R290 for rapid cooling and easy maintenance, ideal for busy commercial environments.\nFeatures a solid swing door that enhances durability and helps maintain consistent temperatures, ensuring food safety.\nUtilizes an eco-friendly refrigerant, which lowers energy consumption and reduces carbon emissions, aligning with green practices.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ETBR1_a5a91b6c-