(2260, 'Everest Refrigeration ETR2-24 47 1/2\" Side Mount Undercounter Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ETR2-24 undercounter refrigerator is crafted by Everest Refrigeration and features a sleek stainless steel finish with solid doors. This model measures 47 1/2 inches in length, 24 1/2 inches in depth, and 29 1/4 inches in height. It operates on a 115V electrical system, with a frequency of 60Hz, single phase, and requires 3.5 amps of power.\n\nDesigned for versatile use, the ETR2-24 includes a front-breathing condensing unit that facilitates installation against walls, making it a practical choice for maximizing space in commercial kitchens. It employs Blizzard R290 technology, which features an all-in-one slide-out cooling cartridge for efficient cooling and straightforward maintenance without on-site brazing. The R290 refrigerant is natural and eco-friendly, providing a more sustainable alternative to hydrofluorocarbon-based options.\n\nWith a crated weight of 223 lbs, this undercounter refrigerator is built to withstand the demands of commercial environments. Its durable design and energy-efficient operation make it suitable for hotels, restaurants, and cafes, where it provides reliable refrigeration and supports eco-friendly practices.', 'Offers ample storage with a two-door design, ideal for busy kitchens in hotels, restaurants, and cafes where frequent access is required.\nIncludes a front-breathing condensing unit that allows placement against walls, maximizing kitchen space and maintaining efficiency.\nUtilizes Blizzard R290 technology for easy maintenance and effective cooling, perfect for environments with high refrigeration demands.\nSolid doors ensure durability and consistent temperature control, enhancing food safety and reliability in commercial settings.\nEmploys eco-friendly refrigerant for reduced energy consumption and lower carbon emissions, supporting sustainable kitchen practices.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\