(2261, 'Everest Refrigeration ETR1-24 35 3/8\" Side Mount Undercounter Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ETR1-24 undercounter refrigerator, crafted by Everest Refrigeration, is designed with a stainless steel finish and a solid door. It measures 35 1/2 inches in length, 24 1/2 inches in depth, and 29 1/4 inches in height. The unit operates on a 115V power supply with a frequency of 60Hz, single phase, and requires 3.5 amps of electrical current.\n\nThis refrigerator features a front-breathing condensing unit, enabling installation against walls, which is ideal for maximizing kitchen space. The unit integrates Blizzard R290 technology, with an all-in-one slide-out cooling cartridge that ensures efficient cooling and simplifies maintenance without the need for on-site brazing. The R290 refrigerant used is natural and climate-friendly, providing an effective alternative to traditional hydrofluorocarbon-based refrigerants.\n\nWith a crated weight of 146 lbs, the ETR1-24 is a practical choice for kitchens that require a compact design and dependable refrigeration. Its durable construction and energy-efficient operation make it suitable for various commercial environments, including hotels, restaurants, and cafes, where efficient food storage and ease of use are crucial.', 'Provides a compact design that fits seamlessly under counters or serves as a workspace, making it suitable for space-constrained areas in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nFeatures a front-breathing condensing unit, enabling installation directly against walls without hindering airflow or performance.\nEquipped with Blizzard R290 technology for easy maintenance and rapid cooling, perfect for high-demand kitchen environments.\nIncludes a solid door for durability and consistent temperature control, ensuring food safety and reliability in busy commercial kitchens.\nUtilizes an eco-friendly refrigerant to reduce energy consumption and lower carbon emissions, contributing to sustainable practices in the food service industry.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ETR1-24_4b0258d6-62c3-4cf3-8483-0017828d134a.webp\"]', 'ETR1-24', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 1995, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 146.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:49:19', '2024-12-16 08:19:21', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ETR1-24_4b0258d6-62c3-4cf3-8483-0017828d134a.webp', 'physical', '', 1710, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB569\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2262, 'Everest Refrigeration ETF2-24 47 1/2\" Side Mount Undercounter Freezer, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ETF2-24 undercounter freezer, designed by Everest Refrigeration, features a stainless steel finish and a solid door design. This unit measures 47 1/2 inches in width, 24 1/2 inches in depth, and 29 1/4 inches in height. It operates on a 115V power supply with a frequency of 60Hz, a single phase, and requires 5 amps of current.\n\nThis freezer includes a front-breathing condensing unit, allowing it to be installed directly against walls, which is ideal for making the most of space in kitchens. It is equipped with Blizzard R290, an all-in-one slide-out cooling cartridge that provides efficient cooling and simplifies maintenance without requiring on-site brazing. The eco-friendly refrigerant used ensures compliance with energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency.\n\nWith a crated weight of 184 lbs, the ETF2-24 meets a variety of kitchen needs while being compact enough for smaller areas. Its design is particularly suitable for hotels, restaurants, and cafes where space is limited and reliable refrigeration is essential. The unit\'s robust construction and energy-efficient technology make it a practical choice for various commercial food storage applications.', 'Includes a compact design perfect for placement under counters or as a workspace, ideal for efficient use in limited spaces in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nEquipped with a front-breathing condensing unit, enabling flexible installation against walls without compromising performance.\nComes with Blizzard R290 technology, allowing easy maintenance and quick cooling, making it convenient for busy commercial kitchens.\nProvides a solid door for enhanced durability and reliable temperature control, ensuring food safety and quality in various food service settings.\nUses an eco-friendly refrigerant to reduce energy consumpt