(2263, 'Everest Refrigeration ETF1-24 35 3/8\" Side Mount Undercounter Freezer, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ETF1-24 is a versatile undercounter freezer with a stainless steel finish, designed to fit seamlessly into compact spaces. It features a solid door and measures 35 3/8 inches in width, 24 1/2 inches in depth, and 29 1/4 inches in height. This unit operates on 115V, 60Hz power with a current of 3 amps.\n\nThis undercounter freezer is equipped with a Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge, which utilizes natural, hydrocarbon-based refrigerant for effective cooling. The innovative design includes a front-breathing condensing unit, allowing for flexible installation options even in tight spaces. Its sturdy construction and solid door ensure reliability in high-use environments.\n\nWith a crated weight of 149 lbs, the ETF1-24 meets modern energy efficiency standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environment Protection Agency. It is well-suited for use in commercial kitchens, hotels, and restaurants, providing dependable storage while helping to reduce operational costs.', 'Offers a compact design suitable for under-counter installation or as a tabletop unit, ideal for small kitchens and workspaces.\nProvides a front-breathing condensing unit, enabling placement against walls without affecting performance.\nIncludes a Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge, which allows for quick and simple maintenance while ensuring efficient cooling.\nEquipped with a solid door to enhance durability and maintain temperature consistency in busy environments like cafes and restaurants.\nUses eco-friendly refrigerant to lower energy consumption and reduce carbon emissions, beneficial for both commercial and residential use.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ETF1-24_9c8df7f9-b320-4bcd-a11d-d25322ac02be.webp\"]', 'ETF1-24', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 2272, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 14