friendly practices.\nUtilizes a high-performance cooling system to maintain ideal temperatures, ensuring products stay fresh and appealing in busy commercial settings.\nMore effective than many other models, it supports a warmer ambient temperature, allowing it to perform well in diverse environments.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EOMH-72-B-35-T_4ef84560-949b-46ae-a032-0136deb9fb56.webp\"]', 'EOMH-72-B-35-T', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 9389, NULL, NULL, NULL, 73.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 46.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 713.00, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:49:34', '2024-12-16 08:19:20', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/EOMH-72-B-35-T_4ef84560-949b-46ae-a032-0136deb9fb56.webp', 'physical', '', 8047, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB580\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2273, 'Everest Refrigeration EOMH-72-W-35-T 73 1/4\" Bottom Mount Open Air Horizontal Refrigerated Merchandiser, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EOMH-72-W-35-T Horizontal Open Air Merchandiser, finished in white, measures 73 1/4 inches in length, 34 1/4 inches in depth, and 46 inches in height. It offers a generous 15.2 cubic feet of capacity and operates on a 115-volt, 60 Hz, single-phase power supply, drawing 13.2 amps.\n\nThis model features the innovative Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge, which simplifies maintenance with its slide-out design, removing the need for onsite brazing. The Blizzard R290 system uses a natural, climate-friendly hydrocarbon refrigerant, providing a sustainable alternative to traditional refrigerants and meeting energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency.\n\nDesigned to conform to NSF 7 Type II standards, this merchandiser operates efficiently even in ambient temperatures up to 80F. It combines practical features with energy-efficient technology, offering both operational efficiency and cost savings.', 'Provides 15.2 cubic feet of open space, perfect for displaying a variety of products in high-traffic areas like hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\n\nBoasts a white exterior with a clean finish, making it a versatile addition to different decor styles and environments.\n\nFeatures an open front design for easy customer access and efficient restocking, enhancing overall convenience.\n\nUtilizes the Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge for effective and energy-efficient cooling, helping to reduce operational costs and support eco-friendly practices.\n\nEnsures reliable performance in warmer conditions with a maximum ambient temperature tolerance of 80F, maintaining efficient cooling performance.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EOMH-72-W-35-T_367934b4-89c1-4212-bb3e-96e15418283f.webp\"]', 'EOMH-72-W-35-T', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0