(2274, 'Everest Refrigeration EOMH-60-B-35-T 60\" Bottom Mount Open Air Horizontal Refrigerated Merchandiser, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EOMH-60-B-35-T Horizontal Open Air Merchandiser, with its sleek black finish, measures 60 inches in length, 34 1/4 inches in depth, and 46 inches in height. It offers a spacious 12.3 cubic feet of capacity and operates on a 115-volt, 60 Hz, single-phase electrical system, drawing 11 amps.\n\nThis model is equipped with the Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge, an industry-first all-in-one system that facilitates rapid cooling and easy maintenance. The slide-out design eliminates the need for onsite brazing, enhancing safety and convenience during service. Blizzard R290 utilizes a natural, hydrocarbon refrigerant, providing an environmentally friendly alternative to traditional refrigerants and meeting the energy consumption standards of the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency.\n\nDesigned to meet NSF 7 Type II standards, this merchandiser can function efficiently in ambient temperatures up to 80F, making it suitable for various commercial environments. Its blend of practical features and energy efficiency offers both performance and cost-saving benefits.', 'Offers 12.3 cubic feet of open space, making it perfect for displaying a wide range of products in commercial settings such as hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nFeatures an open front design for easy customer access and streamlined restocking, enhancing convenience and efficiency.\nIncludes a black exterior with a sleek finish, blending well with various interior styles and providing a modern aesthetic.\nDelivers energy-efficient cooling thanks to the Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge, which helps reduce operational costs and supports environmental sustainability.\nEnsures reliable performance even in warmer conditions, accommodating ambient temperatures up to 80F without compromising cooling efficiency.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\