(2275, 'Everest Refrigeration EOMH-60-W-35-T 60\" Bottom Mount Open Air Horizontal Refrigerated Merchandiser, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EOMH-60-W-35-T Horizontal Open Air Merchandiser features a sleek white finish and measures 60 inches in length, 34 1/4 inches in depth, and 46 inches in height. With a capacity of 12.3 cubic feet, it operates on a 115-volt, 60 Hz, single-phase power supply, drawing 11 amps.\n\nThis model is equipped with the Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge, an innovative system designed for efficient and quick cooling. The cartridge\'s slide-out design facilitates easy maintenance and replacement without the need for onsite brazing. The use of R290, a natural and climate-friendly refrigerant, aligns with energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency.\n\nConforming to NSF 7 Type II standards, this open air merchandiser can withstand ambient temperatures up to 80F, making it suitable for use in a range of commercial food service environments. Its practical design and energy-efficient operation offer both performance and sustainability benefits.', 'Offers a generous 12.3 cubic feet of space, ideal for merchandising a wide array of products in any busy hotel, restaurant, or cafsetting.\nIncludes an open front design that facilitates easy customer access and efficient restocking processes.\nFeatures a white exterior with a clean finish that enhances visibility and integrates seamlessly with various dor styles.\nProvides energy-efficient cooling that helps lower operational costs while contributing to environmental sustainability.\nDelivers consistent performance even in warmer environments, ensuring reliable cooling in diverse settings.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EOMH-60-W-35-T_a8401ca5-f1e2-4a19-b54a-e734dcb38a1b.webp\"]', 'EOMH-60-W-35-T', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 8694, NULL, NULL, NULL, 60.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 46.00, NULL,