(2290, 'Everest Refrigeration EOMV-60-B-28-T 60\" Bottom Mount Open Air Vertical Refrigerated Merchandiser, 230 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EOMV-60-B-28-T Vertical Open Air Merchandiser is designed for commercial use with a black exterior finish. It measures 60 inches in width, 28 3/8 inches in depth, and 78 inches in height, providing ample space for product display with a total capacity of 21.2 cubic feet. This unit operates on a 230-volt, 60 Hz electrical system with a current of 11 amps, suitable for standard commercial power setups.\n\nThe merchandiser features an open door design, which allows for easy access and visibility. It is equipped with a Blizzard R290 cooling system, known for its efficiency and eco-friendliness. This system includes a slide-out evaporator that simplifies maintenance and enhances cooling performance. The R290 refrigerant used in this model is a natural, hydrocarbon-based alternative that meets the U.S. Department of Energy and EPA\'s energy consumption standards.\n\nConstructed to endure higher ambient temperatures of up to 80F, this open air merchandiser conforms to NSF 7 Type II standards, ensuring it performs reliably in various environments. It is also fitted with standard features that enhance usability and energy efficiency, making it a practical choice for businesses looking to improve their product display and operational efficiency.', 'Offers a generous 21.2 cubic feet of display space, perfect for showcasing a wide variety of products in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nProvides an open door design for easy access and visibility, making it convenient for staff to restock and for customers to view items.\nIncludes an efficient cooling system that reduces energy costs and minimizes environmental impact, ideal for businesses aiming to lower operating expenses.\nFeatures a sleek black finish that complements various interior designs, giving a modern and professional look to any commercial space.\nDelivers reliable performance even in warmer environments up to 80F, ensuring consistent cooling and product preservation.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EOMV-60-B-28-T_2413b817-ea4f-43b5-b779-a12154d834d9.webp\"]', 'EOMV-60-B-28-T', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 9609, NULL, NULL, NULL, 60.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 78.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 918.00, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:49:58', '2024-12-16 08:19:20', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/EOMV-60-B-28-T_2413b817-ea4f-43b5-b779-a12154d834d9.webp', 'physical', '', 8236, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB598\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2291, 'Everest Refrigeration EOMV-60-W-28-T 60\" Bottom Mount Open Air Vertical Refrigerated Merchandiser, 230 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EOMV-60-W-28-T Vertical Open Air Merchandiser features a white exterior and offers a substantial 21.2 cubic feet of storage space. It measures 60 inches in width, 28 3/8 inches in depth, and 78 inches in height, providing ample room for product display. This unit operates on a 230-volt, 60 Hz power supply with an 11-amp current, designed to fit typical commercial electrical setups.\n\nThe merchandiser is equipped with the Blizzard R290 cooling system, which features a slide-out evaporator for effective and easy maintenance. R290 is a natural, eco-friendly refrigerant that meets the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency. This unit is engineered to handle ambient temperatures up to 80F, complying with NSF 7 Type II standards.\n\nWith its open door style, the EOMV-60-W-28-T is ideal for high-traffic commercial settings like cafes and hotels where product visibility and accessibility are key. Its white finish blends with various decor styles, and with a crated weight of about 918 pounds, the unit reflects solid construction for reliable performance.', 'Provides 21.2 cubic feet of display space, ideal for hotels, restaurants, and cafes to showcase a wide range of products.\nOffers an open door design that enhances product accessibility and visibility, making it easier for staff to restock and customers to view items.\nIncludes the Blizzard R290 cooling system, which improves energy efficiency and reduces environmental impact.\nFeatures a white finish that integrates seamlessly with various interior styles, giving a clean and modern look.\nDelivers reliable performance even in ambient temperatures up to 80F, ensuring consistent operation in diverse commercial environments.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EOMV-60-