(2292, 'Everest Refrigeration EOMV-48-B-28-T 48\" Bottom Mount Open Air Vertical Refrigerated Merchandiser, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EOMV-48-B-28-T Vertical Open Air Merchandiser comes in a sleek black finish, measuring 48 inches in width, 28 3/8 inches in depth, and 78 inches in height. It provides 16.8 cubic feet of capacity, ideal for displaying a variety of products in commercial settings. The unit operates on a 115-volt, 60 Hz power supply with a 14-amp current, designed for efficient performance in typical electrical environments.\n\nThis merchandiser is equipped with the Blizzard R290 cooling system, featuring an all-in-one, slide-out evaporator for effective cooling and easy maintenance. The R290 refrigerant is a natural, climate-friendly alternative to traditional hydrofluorocarbon refrigerants, meeting the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency. The unit is built to withstand ambient temperatures up to 80F, adhering to NSF 7 Type II standards.\n\nIdeal for high-traffic areas like hotels, restaurants, and cafes, the EOMV-48-B-28-T combines functionality with style. Its open door design enhances product visibility, while the black exterior ensures it complements various interior designs. With a crated weight of approximately 754 pounds, the unit reflects a durable construction suited for commercial use.', 'Provides 16.8 cubic feet of display space, perfect for showcasing products in cafes, restaurants, and hotels where visibility is crucial.\nOffers an open door design for easy access and enhanced product visibility, making restocking and customer interactions simpler.\nIncludes the Blizzard R290 cooling system, known for its energy efficiency and eco-friendly refrigerant, helping to reduce operational costs.\nFeatures a black finish that integrates seamlessly with various decor styles, offering a sleek and modern look for commercial environments.\nDelivers dependable performance in ambient temperatures up to 80F, ensuring reliable operation in diverse conditions.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EOMV-48-B-28-T_b56ad7b3-f0ba-47f1-9b0b-9907ff7f795d.webp\"]', 'EOMV-48-B-28-T', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 8630, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 78.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 754.00, NULL, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:50:00', '2024-12-16 08:19:20', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/EOMV-48-B-28-T_b56ad7b3-f0ba-47f1-9b0b-9907ff7f795d.webp', 'physical', '', 7397, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB600\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
