(2298, 'Everest Refrigeration EOMV-60-B-35-T 60\" Bottom Mount Open Air Vertical Refrigerated Merchandiser, 230 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EOMV-60-B-35-T Bottom Mount Open Air Vertical Refrigerated Merchandiser is designed to meet the rigorous demands of commercial environments. Conforming to NSF 7 Type II standards, this unit can withstand a maximum ambient temperature of 80F, surpassing many comparable brands. Its bottom-mounted refrigeration system includes the innovative Blizzard R290 slide-out cooling cartridge, which allows for rapid cooling and easy maintenance without requiring onsite brazing. The R290 refrigerant used is environmentally friendly, adhering to the energy consumption standards of the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency.\n\nMeasuring 60 inches in exterior length, 34 1/4 inches in depth, and 78 inches in height, this open-air merchandiser offers a generous 30.2 cu. ft. of capacity. The black finish provides a modern and professional appearance, making it suitable for various commercial settings. Operating on a power requirement of 230 V, 60 Hz, and 1 phase, the unit draws 11 amps, ensuring robust performance to keep products at the desired temperature.\n\nThe open door style enhances the accessibility and visibility of displayed items, making it an excellent choice for high-traffic areas. With a crated weight of 976 lbs, this merchandiser is built for durability and longevity. The EOMV-60-B-35-T is designed to reduce energy costs and carbon emissions, making it a practical and eco-friendly solution for displaying refrigerated goods in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.', 'Provides ample 30.2 cubic feet of open display space, perfect for showcasing a wide range of products in cafes, restaurants, and hotels.\nOffers an open design for easy customer access, enhancing service efficiency and product visibility in high-traffic areas.\nIncludes advanced Blizzard R290 cooling technology, ensuring eco-friend