(2307, 'Everest Refrigeration EMGF36B 41\" Bottom Mount Glass Door Merchandising Freezer, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EMGF36B 2 Glass Door Freezer is engineered to handle high-capacity freezing needs with its 36 cubic feet of storage space. Measuring 41 inches in width, 31 5/8 inches in depth, and 80 1/8 inches in height, this freezer provides ample room for commercial use while maintaining a compact profile.\n\nEquipped with Blizzard R290 refrigeration, this model uses a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant that offers both environmental and economic benefits. The integrated slide-out cooling cartridge simplifies maintenance and ensures quick cooling, all while meeting the stringent energy consumption standards of the U.S. Department of Energy and the EPA.\n\nThe black finish and swing glass doors of the EMGF36B not only enhance its visual appeal but also ensure durability and ease of use. With a 1/1.9 horsepower compressor and 9.1 amps of power consumption, this freezer operates efficiently to support your business\'s freezing needs, with a crated weight of 592 lbs for stability and durability.', 'Offers 36 cubic feet of freezer space, ideal for storing a large volume of frozen products.\nHighlights products with low-heat LED lighting and double-pane, UV-reflective, low-emissivity glass doors.\nIncludes Blizzard R290 technology, featuring an all-in-one slide-out cooling cartridge for rapid cooling and ease of maintenance.\nUses a natural, climate-friendly refrigerant, aligning with U.S. Department of Energy and EPA energy standards.\nShowcases a black exterior with swing glass doors, combining durability with a sleek design.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EMGF36B_18d9f00c-8234-43d3-8e25-cb6f258c18c0.webp\"]', 'EMGF36B', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 6032, NULL, NULL, NULL, 41.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 80.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 592.00, NULL, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:50:22', '2024-12-16 08:19:20', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botb