(2308, 'Everest Refrigeration EMGF36 41\" Bottom Mount Glass Door Merchandising Freezer, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EMGF36 2 Glass Door Freezer delivers 36 cubic feet of reliable freezing capacity, making it suitable for high-demand commercial environments such as restaurants, hotels, and cafes. With its dimensions of 41 inches in width, 31 5/8 inches in depth, and 80 1/8 inches in height, it offers substantial storage while maintaining a manageable footprint.\n\nFeaturing the advanced Blizzard R290 cooling system, this freezer uses a natural, climate-friendly refrigerant that complies with the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the EPA. The innovative all-in-one slide-out cooling cartridge facilitates easy maintenance and rapid cooling without requiring onsite brazing. It operates on a 115V, 60Hz power supply with a 1/1.9 horsepower compressor and draws 9.1 amps.\n\nFinished in white with swing glass doors, the EMGF36 combines practicality with a modern design, enhancing product visibility and accessibility. Its crated weight of 592 lbs ensures durability and stability in demanding commercial settings.', 'Provides 36 cubic feet of freezing space, accommodating larger quantities of frozen goods efficiently.\nShowcases products with low-heat LED lighting and double-pane, UV-reflective, low-emissivity glass doors.\nUtilizes Blizzard R290, a natural refrigerant that supports eco-friendly and energy-efficient cooling.\nEquipped with an all-in-one, slide-out cooling cartridge for easy maintenance and rapid cooling.\nDesigned with a white exterior and swing glass doors for both durability and a clean appearance.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EMGF36_4407f3d3-d4ac-4f45-982e-699f2909f0c5.webp\"]', 'EMGF36', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 6032, NULL, NULL, NULL, 41.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 80.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 592.00, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:50:23', '2024-12-16 08:19:20', 'i