(2309, 'Everest Refrigeration EMGF23B 29 1/8\" Bottom Mount Glass Door Merchandising Freezer, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EMGF23B 1 Glass Door Freezer delivers 23 cubic feet of efficient freezing capacity, making it an ideal choice for restaurants, hotels, and cafes. With dimensions of 29 1/8 inches in width, 31 5/8 inches in depth, and 80 1/8 inches in height, it provides substantial storage while maintaining a compact design.\n\nEquipped with the innovative Blizzard R290 cooling system, this freezer uses a natural, climate-friendly refrigerant that meets U.S. Department of Energy and EPA energy standards. The all-in-one slide-out cooling cartridge ensures safe, rapid cooling and simplifies maintenance without requiring onsite brazing. It operates on a 115V, 60Hz power supply with a 1 horsepower compressor and draws 11.06 amps.\n\nFinished in a black exterior with a swing glass door, the EMGF23B combines durability with a modern aesthetic, enhancing the visibility and accessibility of frozen goods. With a crated weight of 450 lbs, it offers reliable performance for demanding commercial applications.', 'Provides 23 cubic feet of ample freezer space, perfect for high-volume storage in commercial settings.\nEnhances product visibility with low-heat LED lighting and double-pane, UV-reflective glass doors.\nIncludes Blizzard R290, a natural refrigerant known for its efficiency and eco-friendliness.\nOffers an all-in-one slide-out cooling cartridge for easy maintenance and rapid cooling.\nFeatures a sleek black exterior that fits seamlessly into various commercial environments.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EMGF23B_00fe856e-84aa-4e2a-810e-bc8ada0a9e2d.webp\"]', 'EMGF23B', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 4875, NULL, NULL, NULL, 29.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 80.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 450.00, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:50:24', '2024-12-16 08:19:20', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/st