(2310, 'Everest Refrigeration EMGF23 29 1/8\" Bottom Mount Glass Door Merchandising Freezer, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EMGF23 1 Glass Door Freezer offers a substantial 23 cubic feet of storage space, suitable for busy restaurants, hotels, and caf. Measuring 29 1/8 inches in width, 31 5/8 inches in depth, and 80 1/8 inches in height, it accommodates a variety of frozen goods while maintaining a compact footprint.\n\nThis freezer is equipped with Blizzard R290, a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant that is both climate-friendly and energy-efficient. The system includes an all-in-one slide-out cooling cartridge, facilitating quick and safe maintenance without the need for onsite brazing. The unit operates on a 115V, 60Hz power supply with a 1 horsepower compressor and a 11.06-amp draw.\n\nFeaturing a white finish and swing glass door style, the EMGF23 is designed to enhance product visibility and accessibility while fitting seamlessly into any commercial kitchen or storage area. With a crated weight of 450 lbs, it combines durability with practicality for reliable, long-term use.', 'Offers 23 cubic feet of spacious freezer storage, ideal for high-demand commercial environments.\nEnhances product visibility with low-heat LED lighting and double-pane, UV-reflective glass doors.\nReduces energy costs and carbon emissions using the Blizzard R290 cooling system, an eco-friendly refrigerant.\nProvides efficient and easy maintenance with its all-in-one slide-out cooling cartridge.\nIncludes a sleek white finish that complements any commercial setting.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EMGF23_50b4aecd-d2cd-4a14-8688-d5b3e0d78037.webp\"]', 'EMGF23', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 4875, NULL, NULL, NULL, 29.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 80.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 450.00, NULL, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:50:26', '2024-12-16 08:19:20', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/EMGF23_50b4aecd-d2cd-