(2311, 'Everest Refrigeration EMGR69B 72 7/8\" Bottom Mount Glass Door Refrigerated Merchandiser, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EMGR69B 3 Door Refrigerated Merchandiser provides an expansive 69 cubic feet of storage space, perfect for busy commercial environments. It measures 72 7/8 inches wide, 30 3/4 inches deep, and 80 1/8 inches high, making it suitable for showcasing a wide array of products.\n\nEquipped with the Blizzard R290 cooling system, this unit utilizes a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant that meets both the U.S. Department of Energy and Environmental Protection Agency\'s standards for energy consumption. This ensures both cost savings and a reduced environmental impact. Operating on a 115V, 60Hz, single-phase power supply, the unit has a 7-amp draw and a 3/4 horsepower compressor.\n\nThe merchandiser features a black finish and sliding glass doors, designed to offer both functionality and style. With a crated weight of 684 lbs, it combines durability with ease of use, making it an excellent choice for high-traffic commercial applications.', 'Offers a generous 69 cu ft capacity, ideal for high-demand settings like hotels, restaurants, and caf.\nEnhances product visibility with low-heat LED lighting and UV-reflective, low-emissivity glass sliding doors.\nReduces energy costs and carbon emissions thanks to the Blizzard R290 refrigerant, an eco-friendly and efficient cooling solution.\nIncludes an all-in-one slide-out cooling cartridge for quick, hassle-free maintenance and repairs.\nFeatures a sleek black exterior that complements any commercial space while providing durable, high-performance refrigeration.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EMGR69B_28ed0f14-cfb3-4e1a-8f8b-c262cae611b7.webp\"]', 'EMGR69B', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 4873, NULL, NULL, NULL, 73.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 80.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 684.00, NULL, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:50:27', '2024-12-16 08:19:20', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\