(2312, 'Everest Refrigeration EMGR69 72 7/8\" Bottom Mount Glass Door Refrigerated Merchandiser, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EMGR69 3 Door Refrigerated Merchandiser is designed to provide substantial storage with a 69 cubic feet capacity. Measuring 72 7/8 inches in width, 30 3/4 inches in depth, and 80 1/8 inches in height, this unit is well-suited for commercial environments such as hotels, restaurants, and caf.\n\nIt features the Blizzard R290 cooling system, utilizing a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant that aligns with energy efficiency standards from the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency. This system operates on a 115V, 60Hz, single-phase power supply, with a 7-amp draw and a 3/4 horsepower compressor.\n\nThe merchandiser\'s white finish and sliding glass doors are designed to facilitate easy access while enhancing product visibility. With a crated weight of 684 lbs, it ensures durability and stability, making it a practical and effective solution for high-volume commercial use.', 'Features a spacious 69 cu ft capacity, offering ample storage for high-traffic areas such as hotels, restaurants, and caf.\nOffers low-heat LED lighting that enhances visibility of products, attracting customers and improving sales.\nMore efficient cooling is ensured by the Blizzard R290 refrigerant, which lowers energy expenses and supports eco-friendly practices.\nIncludes a slide-out cooling cartridge for easy maintenance, reducing downtime and facilitating quick repairs.\nProvides a sleek white finish and sliding glass doors, combining style with practicality for enhanced product accessibility.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EMGR69_ac754eab-8c8d-4117-a962-baa0eb3190d4.webp\"]', 'EMGR69', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 4873, NULL, NULL, NULL, 73.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 80.00, NULL, 31.00, NULL, 684.00, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:50:28', '2024-12-16 08:19:20', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Model