(2313, 'Everest Refrigeration EMGR48B 53 1/8\" Bottom Mount Glass Door Refrigerated Merchandiser, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EMGR48B 2 Door Refrigerated Merchandiser features a sleek black exterior and sliding glass doors, ideal for high-capacity commercial use. With dimensions of 53 1/8 inches in width, 30 3/4 inches in depth, and 80 1/8 inches in height, this model offers a substantial 48 cubic feet of storage space, making it suitable for various establishments including hotels, restaurants, and caf.\n\nEquipped with the Blizzard R290 cooling system, this merchandiser utilizes a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant that meets energy efficiency standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency. It operates on a 115V, 60Hz, single-phase power supply, drawing 5.5 amps and featuring a 1/2 horsepower compressor.\n\nThe units crated weight is 533 lbs, ensuring durability and stability. Its sliding glass doors are designed with double-pane, UV-reflective glass to enhance product visibility and protect the items inside. This combination of style and functionality makes the EMGR48B a valuable addition to any commercial food service environment.', 'Features a sleek black exterior, enhancing the modern appearance of any commercial setting such as hotels, restaurants, and caf.\nOffers low-heat LED lighting that improves product visibility and helps attract customers while maintaining a consistent cooling environment.\nMore efficient cooling is provided by the Blizzard R290 refrigerant, which reduces energy costs and supports eco-friendly operations.\nIncludes an innovative slide-out cooling cartridge for easy maintenance and repairs, ensuring minimal downtime and reliable performance.\nProvides clear visibility with sliding glass doors that are UV-reflective and low-emissivity, facilitating effortless access to displayed items.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EMGR48B_bc7dffa3-1c35-4b