(2314, 'Everest Refrigeration EMGR48 53 1/8\" Bottom Mount Glass Door Refrigerated Merchandiser, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EMGR48 2 Door Refrigerated Merchandiser is designed for high-capacity storage with a sleek white finish and sliding glass doors. Ideal for commercial environments such as hotels, restaurants, and caf, it measures 53 1/8 inches in width, 30 3/4 inches in depth, and 80 1/8 inches in height, offering a generous 48 cubic feet of storage capacity.\n\nThis model features the Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge, utilizing a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant that meets the energy standards of the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency. Operating on 115V, 60Hz, and 1 Phase with a 5.5 amp draw, it ensures effective and energy-efficient cooling.\n\nEquipped with a 1/2 horsepower compressor and a crated weight of 533 lbs, the EMGR48 ensures robust performance and durability. The sliding glass doors feature double-pane construction and UV-reflective properties, providing clear visibility and protection for stored items. Combining practical functionality with a modern design, the EMGR48 is a valuable addition to any commercial food service setting.', 'Features a clean white finish that complements various settings in hotels, restaurants, and caf, providing a sleek and professional look.\nOffers low-heat LED lighting to enhance product visibility, making it easier to attract customers while maintaining ideal cooling conditions.\nMore efficient cooling is achieved with the Blizzard R290 refrigerant, which supports eco-friendly operations and helps reduce energy expenses.\nIncludes a slide-out cooling cartridge for convenient maintenance and repairs, minimizing operational interruptions and ensuring reliable performance.\nProvides superior visibility with sliding glass doors that are UV-reflective and low-emissivity, allowing easy access to displayed products.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\