(2315, 'Everest Refrigeration EMGR33B 39 3/8\" Bottom Mount Glass Door Refrigerated Merchandiser, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EMGR33B 2 Door Refrigerated Merchandiser features a sophisticated black finish and sliding glass doors, designed to meet high-capacity needs in commercial settings. It is suitable for use in hotels, restaurants, and caf, offering a width of 39 3/8 inches, a depth of 30 3/4 inches, and a height of 80 1/8 inches, with a total storage capacity of 33 cubic feet.\n\nEquipped with the Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge, this model uses a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant that complies with the energy consumption standards of the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environment Protection Agency. It operates on 115V, 60Hz, and 1 Phase, with a 2.5 amp draw, providing reliable and efficient cooling.\n\nWith a 1/3 horsepower compressor and a crated weight of 416 lbs, the refrigerator is built for durability and performance. The sliding glass doors feature double-pane and UV-reflective technology, ensuring clear visibility and protection for stored items. The EMGR33B combines functionality with a stylish design, making it a valuable addition to any commercial food service operation.', 'Features a sleek black exterior that adds a modern touch to any hotel, restaurant, or caf enhancing overall aesthetics.\nOffers low-heat LED lighting that illuminates products clearly, helping to attract customers while keeping items at the ideal temperature.\nMore efficient cooling is provided by the Blizzard R290 refrigerant, which supports eco-friendly practices and lowers energy costs.\nIncludes a slide-out cooling cartridge for easy maintenance and repairs, ensuring minimal downtime and efficient operation.\nProvides excellent visibility and durability with sliding glass doors that are UV-reflective and low-emissivity, making it easy for customers to see and access products.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EMGR33B_9