(2325, 'Everest Refrigeration EMGR24 28 3/8\" Bottom Mount Glass Door Refrigerated Merchandiser, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EMGR24 1 Door Refrigerated Merchandiser is engineered for high-capacity performance in commercial settings. With a white finish and a single swing glass door, this model fits well into diverse environments such as hotels, restaurants, and caf. It measures 28 3/8 inches in width, 32 inches in depth, and 80 1/8 inches in height, offering a substantial display area with a capacity of 23 cubic feet.\n\nThis unit is equipped with the Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge, which uses a hydrocarbon refrigerant. This refrigerant is known for its climate-friendly properties and complies with the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environment Protection Agency. Operating at 115V, 60Hz, and 1 Phase with a 2.5 amp draw, it provides reliable cooling performance.\n\nThe refrigerator includes a 1/3 horsepower compressor and has a crated weight of 334 lbs. The design features a slide-out cooling cartridge for easy maintenance and a thermally efficient construction that helps reduce both energy costs and carbon emissions. This combination of features makes the EMGR24 an excellent choice for any high-traffic commercial food service area.', 'Features a clean white finish that enhances the appearance of any hotel, restaurant, or caf providing a versatile and professional display.\nOffers low-heat LED lighting to effectively showcase products while minimizing heat, keeping items fresh and appealing.\nMore efficient cooling is achieved with the Blizzard R290, a natural refrigerant that lowers energy costs and aligns with environmental standards.\nProvides straightforward maintenance with a slide-out cooling cartridge, facilitating easy repairs and replacements without complex procedures.\nIncludes double-pane, UV-reflective glass doors that ensure clear visibility and protect contents from UV damage.', 'publis