(2328, 'Everest Refrigeration EMGR10B 24\" Bottom Mount Glass Door Refrigerated Merchandiser, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EMGR10B 1 Door Refrigerated Merchandiser is designed for high-efficiency performance in commercial settings. This model, featuring a sleek black exterior, includes a single swing glass door and is ideal for various environments like hotels, restaurants, and caf. It has a compact depth of 24 3/8 inches and a height of 68 1/8 inches, fitting seamlessly into different layouts.\n\nEquipped with Blizzard R290, the unit uses a climate-friendly hydrocarbon refrigerant, ensuring compliance with the energy consumption standards of the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency. It operates on 115V, 60Hz, and 1 Phase with a 2.3 amp draw, providing reliable cooling performance.\n\nThe refrigerator has a 10 cubic feet capacity and includes a 1/4+ horsepower compressor, with a crated weight of 245 lbs. Its design features a slide-out cooling cartridge for easy maintenance and a thermally efficient construction that contributes to significant energy savings and reduced carbon emissions. This unit is a practical and stylish addition to any commercial food service operation.', 'Features a sleek black exterior that complements a range of dor styles, enhancing the visual appeal of your hotel, restaurant, or cafdisplay area.\nOffers low-heat LED lighting, ensuring products are brightly illuminated without generating excess heat, ideal for maintaining freshness and visibility.\nMore efficient cooling is provided by the Blizzard R290, which utilizes a natural refrigerant to reduce energy costs and align with eco-friendly standards.\nProvides easy maintenance with a slide-out cooling cartridge, eliminating the need for on-site repairs and facilitating quick replacements.\nIncludes double-pane, UV-reflective glass doors that protect contents from UV rays while offering clear visibility for customer engagement.', 'published'