(2329, 'Everest Refrigeration EMGR10 24\" Bottom Mount Glass Door Refrigerated Merchandiser, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EMGR10 1 Door Refrigerated Merchandiser is engineered for high performance in commercial environments. Manufactured by Everest Refrigeration, this model features a white finish and a swing glass door design, providing both style and practicality. It has a compact depth of 24 inches and a height of 68 1/8 inches, making it suitable for various layouts in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\n\nThis refrigerator is equipped with a Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge, which includes a natural, hydrocarbon refrigerant known for its eco-friendly properties and compliance with energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency. It operates at 115V, 60Hz, and 1 Phase with a 2.3 amp draw, ensuring reliable performance.\n\nThe unit\'s interior is designed with a practical setup to accommodate various items. It has a capacity of 10 cubic feet and features a single swing glass door. The cooling system utilizes a 1/4+ horsepower compressor, and the appliance\'s overall weight is 245 lbs. This model also includes a thermally efficient construction that helps to keep energy use and operational costs low, making it a valuable addition to any commercial food service operation.', 'Features a sleek white finish that blends seamlessly into any hotel, restaurant, or cafsetting, providing a stylish look while enhancing display visibility.\nOffers low-heat LED lighting that effectively showcases products without generating excess heat, ideal for maintaining the freshness of items in a busy commercial environment.\nMore efficient cooling is achieved with the Blizzard R290, which uses a climate-friendly refrigerant, reducing energy costs and making it suitable for eco-conscious establishments.\nProvides easy maintenance and safety with the slide-out cooling cartridge, eliminating the need for complex on-site repairs and ensuring minimal downtime.\nIncludes double-pane, UV-reflective glass doors that enhance visibility while protecting contents from harmful UV rays, making it perfect for high-traffic areas.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EMGR10_e261b280-e89e-4318-b016-b0b4f83195e6.webp\"]', 'EMGR10', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 1800, NULL, NULL, NULL, 24.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 68.00, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 245.00, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:50:50', '2024-12-16 08:19:20', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/EMGR10_e261b280-e89e-4318-b016-b0b4f83195e6.webp', 'physical', '', 1542, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB637\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2330, 'Everest Refrigeration EMGR8B 24\" Bottom Mount Glass Door Refrigerated Merchandiser, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EMGR8B 1 Door Refrigerated Merchandiser features a sleek black exterior and a swing glass door design, providing both functionality and style. It has a capacity of 8 cubic feet, with dimensions of 24 inches in width, 24 3/8 inches in depth, and 61 3/8 inches in height, making it suitable for various commercial settings such as hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\n\nThis model utilizes Blizzard R290, a climate-friendly hydrocarbon refrigerant that offers efficient cooling while meeting U.S. Department of Energy and Environmental Protection Agency energy standards. The refrigerator operates on 115V, 60Hz, and 1 phase with a power consumption of 2.3 amps and a 1/4+ horsepower compressor.\n\nThe unit\'s slide-out cooling cartridge is designed for easy maintenance and replacement, eliminating the need for onsite brazing. With a crated weight of 205 lbs, this durable and efficient Refrigerated Merchandiser combines a stylish black finish with practical features for enhanced performance in commercial food service environments.', 'Features low-heat LED lighting that highlights contents, improving visibility and helping hotels, restaurants, and cafes drive impulse sales.\nOffers double-pane, UV-reflective glass doors that maintain Ideal temperatures, enhancing food preservation and reducing energy costs.\nMore efficient cooling with the Blizzard R290 system, using an eco-friendly refrigerant that supports reduced carbon emissions and energy consumption.\nIncludes an easy-to-maintain slide-out cooling cartridge, making it simple to replace components with minimal disruption to operations.\nProvides a spacious 8 cu. ft. capacity with a black exterior, fitting seamlessly into various commercial environments and accommodating a range of products.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EMGR8B_daefa805-414a-4403-9