(2331, 'Everest Refrigeration EMGR8 24\" Bottom Mount Glass Door Refrigerated Merchandiser, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EMGR8 1 Door Refrigerated Merchandiser features a sleek white finish and an elegant swing glass door, designed to enhance product visibility and accessibility. Measuring 24 inches in width, 24 3/8 inches in depth, and 61 3/8 inches in height, this unit offers an 8 cubic feet capacity, making it suitable for high-traffic areas in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\n\nThis refrigerator uses a Blizzard R290 cooling system, which includes a natural, hydrocarbon refrigerant. The system is designed for rapid cooling while complying with energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency. It operates on 115V, 60Hz, and 1 phase, drawing 2.3 amps with a 1/4+ horsepower compressor.\n\nThe EMGR8 includes a slide-out cooling cartridge that simplifies maintenance and replacement without the need for onsite brazing. It is equipped with a glass door merchandiser, offering visibility and efficient cooling. The unit is constructed for durability and ease of use, with a crated weight of 205 lbs and featuring a design that fits seamlessly into a variety of commercial settings.', 'Features low-heat LED lighting that enhances product visibility, making it easier for hotels, restaurants, and cafes to attract customer attention and boost sales.\nOffers UV-reflective, low-emissivity glass doors that help maintain a consistent internal temperature, ensuring efficient cooling for better preservation of stored items.\nMore efficient cooling provided by Blizzard R290, which uses a climate-friendly refrigerant for rapid cooling and reduced environmental impact.\nIncludes a slide-out cooling cartridge for simple maintenance and quick replacement, ideal for busy food service environments needing minimal downtime.\nProvides a spacious 8 cu. ft. interior, accommodating a variety of products, making it versatile for different food and beverage needs in commercial settings.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EMGR8_17a0ade5-909a-4ddf-b53e-55942725765a.webp\"]', 'EMGR8', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 1694, NULL, NULL, NULL, 24.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 61.00, NULL, 24.00, NULL, 205.00, NULL, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:50:52', '2024-12-16 08:19:20', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/EMGR8_17a0ade5-909a-4ddf-b53e-55942725765a.webp', 'physical', '', 1452, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB639\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2332, 'Everest Refrigeration EMGR5B 25\" Bottom Mount Glass Door Refrigerated Merchandiser, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EMGR5B 1 Door Refrigerated Merchandiser features a sleek black exterior and a swing glass door design, offering both functionality and aesthetic appeal. With dimensions of 25 inches in width, 24 3/4 inches in depth, and 36 inches in height, this unit is compact yet provides ample space with a 5 cubic feet capacity. It operates on 115V, 60Hz, 1 phase, and consumes 2 amps of electricity.\n\nThe refrigerator is equipped with a Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge, utilizing natural hydrocarbon refrigerant for efficient and eco-friendly cooling. The Blizzard R290 design ensures rapid cooling, safety, and easy maintenance, eliminating the need for onsite brazing. The interior features include a single door with glass for visibility and a temperature range that aligns with the standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environment Protection Agency.\n\nAdditional specifications include a 1/5 HP compressor, a crated weight of 192 lbs, and a power cord length suitable for various installation setups. This model is designed to meet commercial needs with a sturdy construction, reliable performance, and a user-friendly design, making it a practical choice for any restaurant, cafe, or hotel.', 'Features a sleek black exterior that complements various hotel, restaurant, and cafdecors while providing a professional appearance.\nProvides low-heat LED lighting to enhance product visibility and attract customers, boosting sales in high-traffic areas.\nUtilizes energy-efficient natural refrigerant that helps reduce carbon emissions and lowers energy costs, making it an eco-friendly choice for businesses.\nIncludes a swing glass door for easy access and visibility of products, ideal for busy commercial settings.\nDelivers a compact 5 cu. ft. capacity, providing ample storage in a space-saving design suitable for diverse business environ