(2333, 'Everest Refrigeration EMGR5 25\" Bottom Mount Glass Door Refrigerated Merchandiser, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EMGR5 1 Door Refrigerated Merchandiser is designed with a compact 5 cu. ft. capacity, measuring 25 inches in width, 24 3/4 inches in depth, and 36 inches in height. It operates on a 115 V power supply, with a 60 Hz frequency and a single-phase connection, drawing 2 amps. The compressor is rated at 1/5 HP, providing effective cooling for smaller commercial applications.\n\nThis merchandiser features a white finish that blends seamlessly with any dor while offering durability and easy maintenance. It includes a swing glass door for easy access and visibility. The interior is illuminated by low-heat LED lighting, and the double-pane, UV-reflective glass helps to maintain a consistent temperature while reducing energy consumption.\n\nThe unit utilizes Blizzard R290 refrigerant, a natural hydrocarbon that meets the energy consumption standards of the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency. This refrigerant choice ensures efficient cooling, contributing to lower energy costs and reduced carbon emissions. Weighing 192 lbs when crated, the EMGR5 is a practical and environmentally conscious choice for small-scale merchandising.', 'Features a compact 5 cu. ft. interior, perfect for smaller spaces in cafes, restaurants, or convenience stores.\nOffers a clean white finish that provides a professional and versatile appearance suitable for various commercial settings.\nProvides easy access with a swing glass door, allowing for convenient product placement and retrieval.\nIncludes low-heat LED lighting and double-pane, UV-reflective glass to enhance visibility while saving energy.\nMore eco-friendly with Blizzard R290 refrigerant, helping to reduce energy costs and lower carbon emissions with efficient cooling.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EMGR5_53f53a6e-717a-448c-91aa-42e1d