(2342, 'Everest Refrigeration EBRF3 74 3/4\" Bottom Mount Reach-In Dual Temperature Refrigerator/Freezer with Solid Doors, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBRF3 3 Door Dual Temp unit combines efficiency and versatility with its bottom-mounted compressor design. This unit measures 74 3/4 inches in width, 33 1/8 inches in depth, and 77 inches in height, offering a total capacity of 46 cubic feet for refrigeration and 22 cubic feet for freezing. The three solid swing doors provide convenient access and durability for high-traffic areas.\n\nEquipped with Blizzard R290 technology, the EBRF3 uses a hydrocarbon refrigerant that aligns with the energy consumption standards of the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency. The advanced slide-out cooling cartridge facilitates quick cooling and simplifies maintenance, eliminating the need for onsite brazing. The unit operates on 115V, 60Hz, 1 phase, consuming 14.06 amps, and features a 1/3 horsepower compressor for refrigeration and a 1/2 horsepower compressor for freezing.\n\nFinished in stainless steel, the EBRF3 is built to withstand the rigors of commercial use while providing reliable dual-temperature performance. With a crated weight of 698 lbs, it is well-suited for demanding foodservice environments, ensuring both efficient refrigeration and freezing capabilities.', 'Delivers dual-temperature functionality with distinct sections for refrigeration and freezing, offering flexibility for varied storage needs.\nFeatures a bottom-mounted compressor for ease of maintenance and enhanced reliability, making it ideal for busy commercial kitchens.\nProvides a large interior space that accommodates full-size baking sheet pans, suitable for high-volume operations in hotels and restaurants.\nUtilizes Blizzard R290 technology, which ensures efficient cooling with a natural refrigerant that reduces energy costs and environmental impact.\nIncludes three solid swing doors for durable and easy 