(2343, 'Everest Refrigeration EBRF2 54 1/8\" Bottom Mount Reach-In Dual Temperature Refrigerator/Freezer with Solid Doors, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBRF2 2 Door Dual Temp unit is designed with a bottom-mounted compressor for efficient cooling. Measuring 54 1/8 inches in width, 33 1/8 inches in depth, and 77 inches in height, this model provides a combined capacity of 24 cubic feet for refrigeration and freezing. It features two solid swing doors for durability and convenient access.\n\nThis unit features Blizzard R290 technology, utilizing a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant that meets the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency. The innovative slide-out cooling cartridge facilitates rapid cooling and simplifies maintenance without requiring onsite brazing. The unit operates on 115V, 60Hz, and 1 phase, with a power consumption of 10.87 amps and features a 1/4+ horsepower compressor for refrigeration and a 1/2 horsepower compressor for freezing.\n\nFinished in stainless steel, the EBRF2 is built to withstand the demands of commercial use. With a crated weight of 613 lbs and a dual-temperature design, this model is well-suited for various foodservice applications, providing reliable performance for both refrigeration and freezing.', 'Provides dual-temperature functionality with separate compartments for refrigeration and freezing, ideal for versatile storage needs.\nFeatures a bottom-mounted compressor for easy access and maintenance, streamlining operation in busy foodservice environments.\nOffers a spacious interior that can accommodate full-size baking sheet pans, perfect for high-capacity storage in restaurants and cafes.\nEquipped with Blizzard R290 technology for efficient cooling, using a natural, climate-friendly refrigerant that helps reduce energy costs and carbon emissions.\nComes with two solid swing doors, offering durability and easy access for frequent use in various foodservice settings.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EBRF2_3c6b7043-f292-4db7-8adc-e7a4bbf2ce75.webp\"]', 'EBRF2', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 5382, NULL, NULL, NULL, 54.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 77.00, NULL, 33.00, NULL, 613.00, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:51:09', '2024-12-16 08:19:20', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/EBRF2_3c6b7043-f292-4db7-8adc-e7a4bbf2ce75.webp', 'physical', '', 4612, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB651\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
