(2345, 'Everest Refrigeration EBWRFH2 29 1/4\" Bottom Mount Reach-In Dual Temperature Refrigerator/Freezer with Solid Doors, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBWRFH2 1 Section Wide Half Door Dual Temp unit is engineered with a bottom-mounted compressor for effective cooling. It measures 29 1/4 inches in width, 33 1/8 inches in depth, and 77 inches in height, offering a total capacity of 11 cubic feet for both refrigeration and freezing. This model features two half doors, which facilitate easy access and efficient use of space.\n\nEquipped with Blizzard R290 technology, the EBWRFH2 uses a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant that meets the energy standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency. The slide-out cooling cartridge provides rapid cooling and simplifies maintenance, eliminating the need for onsite brazing. The unit operates on 115V, 60Hz, and 1 phase, with a power consumption of 7.59 amps and a 1/2 horsepower compressor.\n\nFinished in stainless steel, the EBWRFH2 is built to endure the demands of a commercial environment. With a crated weight of 341 lbs and a dual-temperature design, this model is ideal for various foodservice settings, offering reliable performance for both refrigeration and freezing needs.', 'Provides a dual-temperature design with separate refrigeration and freezing compartments, offering versatile storage options for various food items.\nFeatures a bottom-mounted compressor for easy access and maintenance, making it practical for busy commercial kitchens.\nIncludes a spacious interior suitable for full-size baking sheet pans, ideal for restaurants and cafes with high storage needs.\nUtilizes a climate-friendly refrigerant with efficient cooling technology, reducing energy costs and minimizing environmental impact.\nComes with two half doors, combining durability with convenience for frequent access in diverse foodservice environments.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/s