(2346, 'Everest Refrigeration EBF3 74 3/4\" Bottom Mount Solid Door Reach-In Freezer, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBF3 3 Door Freezer is equipped with a bottom-mounted compressor for efficient cooling performance. It measures 74 3/4 inches in width, 33 1/8 inches in depth, and 77 inches in height, providing an ample 71 cubic feet of storage capacity. The freezer features three solid swing doors for easy access and long-term durability.\n\nThis model utilizes Blizzard R290 technology, featuring a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant that meets the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency. The Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge is designed for rapid cooling and allows for easy replacement without onsite brazing. The unit operates on 115V, 60Hz, and 1 phase, with a power requirement of 10.98 amps and two 1/2 horsepower compressors.\n\nFinished in stainless steel, the EBF3 is built to handle the demands of a commercial environment. It has a crated weight of 680 lbs and includes a bottom-mounted design for enhanced functionality and ease of maintenance. This freezer is well-suited for various foodservice applications, delivering reliable and efficient freezing performance.', 'Offers a bottom-mounted design for enhanced accessibility and easier maintenance in busy commercial kitchens.\nProvides a spacious interior that accommodates full-size baking sheet pans, ideal for high-capacity storage in restaurants and cafes.\nIncludes energy-efficient cooling with a climate-friendly refrigerant, helping to reduce both energy costs and environmental impact.\nFeatures a slide-out cooling cartridge for easy maintenance and quick replacement without the need for onsite brazing.\nComes with three solid swing doors, offering durability and convenience for frequent access in various foodservice environments.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EBF3_e471a059-8382-48c0-a4a1-d13