(2357, 'Everest Refrigeration EBWRH2 29 1/4\" Bottom Mount Solid Door Reach-In Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBWRH2 1 Section Wide Half Door Refrigerator is a versatile and energy-efficient appliance designed for commercial use. Manufactured with a stainless steel finish, this unit features a bottom-mounted compressor that enhances cooling efficiency and simplifies maintenance. With dimensions of 29 1/4 inches in width, 33 1/8 inches in depth, and 77 inches in height, it provides ample space for storage while fitting seamlessly into various kitchen configurations.\n\nThe refrigerator uses Blizzard R290, an advanced hydrocarbon refrigerant known for its rapid cooling capabilities and eco-friendly properties. This refrigerant is an effective alternative to traditional hydrofluorocarbon-based options, meeting the U.S. Department of Energy and EPA standards for energy consumption. The unit operates at 115V, 60Hz, and 1 phase, drawing 2.5 amps of power and equipped with a 1/4+ horsepower compressor.\n\nDesigned with a solid swing half door style, the EBWRH2 offers 23 cubic feet of interior space and includes a 348 lb crated weight. It is well-suited for commercial kitchens and foodservice operations, providing reliable performance with a temperature range that meets industry standards. The product includes a 1-year warranty and is shipped with the necessary power cord and installation components.', 'Features a bottom-mounted design that enhances accessibility and simplifies maintenance in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nProvides a spacious interior that accommodates full-size baking sheet pans, ideal for busy kitchens and food preparation areas.\nIncludes energy-efficient cooling with a climate-friendly refrigerant, reducing operational costs and environmental impact.\nOffers easy-to-replace cooling cartridge technology, ensuring quick service without complex repairs.\nComes with multiple door options including solid and half doors, fi