(2358, 'Everest Refrigeration EBWR1 29 1/4\" Bottom Mount Solid Door Reach-In Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EBWR1 is a bottom-mounted upright reach-in refrigerator that blends functionality with efficiency. It measures 29 1/4 inches in width, 33 1/8 inches in depth, and 77 inches in height, offering a spacious 23 cu. ft. of interior capacity. The refrigerator features a stainless steel finish and a wide solid swing door, designed for heavy-duty use in commercial settings.\n\nThis model is equipped with the Blizzard R290 cooling system, which employs a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant. This system is designed for rapid cooling and easy maintenance with its slide-out cartridge, eliminating the need for onsite brazing. The Blizzard R290 refrigerant is recognized for its energy efficiency and reduced environmental impact, meeting the energy consumption standards of the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency.\n\nOperating on 115V, 60 Hz, single-phase power, the EBWR1 uses 2.5 amps and features a 1/4+ horsepower compressor. The unit has a crated weight of 341 lbs, ensuring a sturdy build suited for rigorous use. The bottom-mounted design enhances access to the interior, which is well-suited for storing large items and maintaining efficiency in busy food service environments.', 'Features a bottom-mounted cooling system for easy access and efficient use of space, ideal for busy kitchens in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nOffers a wide swing solid door, enhancing durability and providing ample access to the interior, suitable for high-traffic areas.\nProvides a generous 23 cu. ft. of storage space, accommodating large baking sheets and diverse food items, perfect for various food service operations.\nIncludes the Blizzard R290 refrigerant, which supports energy savings and reduces environmental impact, aligning with sustainability goals.\nMore efficient cooling system meets energy consumption standards, helping to