(2360, 'Everest Refrigeration ESPT-2G-2S 49 5/8\" Top Mounted Pass-Through Reach-In Refrigerator with 2 Front Glass Door and 2 Rear Solid Door, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ESPT-2G-2S is a top-mounted upright reach-in refrigerator designed for efficiency and convenience. Measuring 49 5/8 inches in width, 33 5/7 inches in depth, and 74 1/4 inches in height, it features a stainless steel finish and combines two front glass doors with two rear solid doors. This configuration provides both visibility and durability, making it ideal for high-traffic environments in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\n\nThe refrigerator uses Blizzard R290, a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant known for its climate-friendly properties and efficiency. This refrigerant not only meets the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency but also contributes to lower energy costs and reduced carbon emissions. The unit operates on 115V, 60 Hz, single phase power, and consumes 4.71 amps.\n\nWith an interior that supports a total capacity and ample shelving, the ESPT-2G-2S provides reliable refrigeration with a combination of swing solid and glass doors. The construction ensures easy access and maintenance, while the efficient cooling system supports the daily operations of a busy food service environment. The unit\'s 505 lbs crated weight reflects its sturdy build and quality craftsmanship.', 'Features a top-mounted cooling system for efficient temperature management in busy hotel kitchens, restaurants, and cafes.\nOffers easy access with a combination of glass and solid doors, ideal for visibility and durability in high-traffic areas.\nIncludes natural refrigerant for eco-friendly operation and reduced energy costs, benefiting establishments with a focus on sustainability.\nProvides ample storage capacity, accommodating various food items and supplies, making it suitable for diverse culinary needs.\nMore energy-efficient d