(2361, 'Everest Refrigeration ESPT-1G-1S 29 1/4\" Top Mounted Pass-Through Reach-In Refrigerator with 1 Front Glass Door and 1 Rear Solid Door, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ESPT-1G-1S is a pass-thru refrigerator featuring a top-mounted cooling system and a combination of a glass front door and a solid rear door. It measures 29 1/4 inches in width, 33 5/7 inches in depth, and 74 1/4 inches in height. The unit operates at 115 volts, 60 Hz, and 1 phase, with a current draw of 3.35 amps.\n\nThis model utilizes the Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge, which employs a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant for effective cooling performance. It aligns with the energy consumption standards of the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, offering reduced energy costs and lower carbon emissions. The slide-out design of the cooling cartridge simplifies maintenance and eliminates the need for onsite brazing.\n\nWith a crated weight of 364 pounds, the ESPT-1G-1S offers a practical solution for commercial kitchens requiring a pass-thru refrigerator. The combination of a glass door and a solid door enhances both visibility and durability, making it a versatile choice for various foodservice applications.', 'Features a pass-thru design with a front glass door and a rear solid door, allowing easy access from both sides, ideal for efficient workflow in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nProvides effective storage space for a range of refrigerated items, enhancing organization and accessibility.\nIncludes the Blizzard R290 cooling system for rapid and efficient cooling while reducing energy consumption and minimizing environmental impact.\nConstructed with a stainless steel finish, combining durability with ease of maintenance, perfect for high-traffic commercial settings.\nEquipped with a top-mounted cooling system, making maintenance simple and providing easy access to cooling components.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ESPT-1G-1S_8850d820-1f0b-4eaf-8870-dc0fc12555e5.webp\"]', 'ESPT-1G-1S', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 4124, NULL, NULL, NULL, 29.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 364.00, NULL, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:51:34', '2024-12-16 08:19:20', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ESPT-1G-1S_8850d820-1f0b-4eaf-8870-dc0fc12555e5.webp', 'physical', '', 3535, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB669\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '');
