(2362, 'Everest Refrigeration ESPT-1S-1S 29 1/4\" Top Mount Pass-Through Reach-In Refrigerator with a Solid Front and Rear Door, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ESPT-1S-1S is a pass-thru refrigerator with a top-mounted cooling system and a sleek stainless steel exterior. It measures 29 1/4 inches in width, 33 5/7 inches in depth, and 74 1/4 inches in height. The unit operates at 115 volts, 60 Hz, and 1 phase, with a current draw of 3.49 amps.\n\nThis model features the Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge, which uses a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant for efficient cooling. It meets the energy consumption standards of the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, resulting in reduced energy costs and lower carbon emissions. The slide-out cooling cartridge design simplifies maintenance and eliminates the need for onsite brazing.\n\nWith a crated weight of 324 pounds, the ESPT-1S-1S provides a practical and space-efficient solution for various commercial kitchens. The pass-thru design, with solid doors on both sides, enhances convenience and functionality, making it a versatile option for foodservice operations.', 'Features a pass-thru design with one front solid door and one rear solid door, facilitating easy access from both sides, which is ideal for busy kitchens in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nProvides practical storage space for various refrigerated items, enhancing organizational efficiency and accessibility.\nIncludes the Blizzard R290 cooling system, delivering effective and rapid cooling while minimizing energy usage and environmental impact.\nConstructed with a stainless steel finish, offering durability and ease of cleaning, making it suitable for high-use environments.\nEquipped with a top-mounted cooling system that simplifies maintenance and ensures easy access to cooling components.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ESPT-1S-1S_deac92fb-2feb-4f7f-b209-ba1e18ddb0d5.webp\"]', 'ESPT-1S-1S', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 3446, NULL, NULL, NULL, 29.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 34.00, NULL, 324.00, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:51:35', '2024-12-16 08:19:20', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ESPT-1S-1S_deac92fb-2feb-4f7f-b209-ba1e18ddb0d5.webp', 'physical', '', 2953, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB670\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2363, 'Everest Refrigeration ESPT-2S-2S 49 5/8\" Top Mount Reach-In Pass-Through Refrigerator with 2 Solid Doors, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ESPT-2S-2S is a pass-thru refrigerator featuring a top-mounted cooling system and a stainless steel exterior. The unit has dimensions of 49 5/8 inches in width, 33 5/7 inches in depth, and 74 1/4 inches in height. It operates at 115 volts, 60 Hz, and 1 phase, with a current draw of 3.49 amps.\n\nThis model utilizes the Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge, which employs a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant to deliver efficient cooling performance. It complies with the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, offering reduced energy costs and lower carbon emissions. The slide-out design of the cooling cartridge facilitates easy maintenance and eliminates the need for onsite brazing.\n\nWith a crated weight of 452 pounds, the ESPT-2S-2S offers a spacious and practical solution for high-traffic commercial kitchens. The pass-thru design, with solid doors on both the front and rear, enhances both functionality and convenience, making it a versatile choice for various foodservice applications.', 'Features a pass-thru design with two front solid doors and two rear solid doors, allowing easy access from both sides, ideal for high-traffic areas in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nProvides ample storage space, accommodating a variety of refrigerated items for efficient organization and accessibility.\nIncludes the Blizzard R290 cooling system, which ensures rapid cooling and reduced energy consumption while being environmentally friendly.\nDesigned with a durable stainless steel finish, making it both robust and easy to clean, suitable for demanding commercial environments.\nOperates with a top-mounted cooling system, simplifying maintenance and ensuring straightforward access to the cooling components.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/stora