(2364, 'Everest Refrigeration EGSH6 74 3/4\" Top Mount Reach-In Refrigerator with 6 Glass and Solid Half-Doors, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EGSH6 is an upright reach-in refrigerator with a top-mounted cooling system and a combination of stainless steel and glass doors. It measures 74 3/4 inches in width, 31 5/8 inches in depth, and 74 1/4 inches in height. The unit operates at 115 volts, 60 Hz, and 1 phase, drawing 7.8 amps and is equipped with a 3/4 horsepower compressor.\n\nThis model features the Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge, which uses a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant for effective cooling. It meets the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, resulting in reduced energy costs and lower carbon emissions. The slide-out design of the cooling cartridge facilitates easy maintenance and eliminates the need for onsite brazing.\n\nWith a crated weight of 636 pounds and a total capacity of 71 cubic feet, the EGSH6 is built to handle extensive refrigeration needs. The six half doors, combining glass and solid sections, offer enhanced functionality and durability. The top-mounted cooling system ensures reliable performance and easy servicing, making it a versatile choice for demanding foodservice environments.', 'Features six half doors with a top glass section and a bottom solid section, offering both visibility and durability for easy organization in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nProvides a spacious 71 cubic feet of storage capacity, accommodating a large volume of refrigerated items to meet high-demand needs.\nIncludes the Blizzard R290 cooling system, delivering efficient and rapid cooling while reducing energy consumption and minimizing environmental impact.\nDesigned with a stainless steel finish for durability and ease of cleaning, making it ideal for high-traffic commercial kitchens.\nOperates with a top-mounted cooling system, simplifying maintenance and ensuring strai