(2365, 'Everest Refrigeration EGSWH4 59\" Top Mount Reach-In Refrigerator with 4 Glass and Solid Half Doors, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration EGSH4 is an upright reach-in refrigerator equipped with a top-mounted cooling system and a combination of a stainless steel exterior with a glass and solid door design. The unit measures 59 inches in width, 31 5/8 inches in depth, and 74 1/4 inches in height. It operates at 115 volts, 60 Hz, and 1 phase, with a current draw of 3 amps and a 1/3 horsepower compressor.\n\nThis model features the Blizzard R290 cooling cartridge, which uses a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant for efficient cooling. The system meets the energy consumption standards of the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, resulting in reduced energy costs and lower carbon emissions. The slide-out design of the cooling cartridge simplifies maintenance and eliminates the need for onsite brazing.\n\nWith a crated weight of 449 pounds and a total storage capacity of 48 cubic feet, the EGSH4 is designed to handle substantial refrigeration needs in a commercial setting. The combination of four half doors with both glass and solid sections enhances both functionality and durability, making it a versatile choice for various foodservice applications. The top-mounted cooling system ensures reliable performance and ease of servicing.', 'Stainless Steel Finish, Door Style is Swing Solid &amp; Glass Combo,4 Half Door,55 Cu. Ft. Capacity,59 Width,31 5/8 Depth,74 1/4 Height,115 V,60 Hz,1 Phase,5.5 Amps,1/2 Compressor HP,486 Crated Weight Lbs,Upright Reach-Ins,Refrigerator,Top Mounted', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/EGSWH4_77373537-36a1-48b0-855e-d852808ea4c2.webp\"]', 'EGSWH4', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 5349, NULL, NULL, NULL, 59.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 486.00, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:51:39', '2024-12-16 08:19:20', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https