(2378, 'Everest Refrigeration ESRF3 74 3/4\" Top Mount Solid Door Dual Temperature Reach-In Freezer/Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ESRF3 is a top-mounted, upright reach-in unit designed to offer dual temperature control with a combination of refrigeration and freezing capabilities. It features a stainless steel finish and is equipped with three swing doors. The unit provides a total capacity of 68 cubic feet, with 46 cubic feet allocated for refrigeration and 22 cubic feet for freezing. Its dimensions are 74 3/4 inches in width, 31 5/8 inches in depth, and 74 1/4 inches in height.\n\nThis model utilizes a combination of 1/4 horsepower for the refrigeration section and 1/2 horsepower for the freezing section. It operates on a 115-volt, 60 hertz, single-phase electrical system, drawing 10 amps. The ESRF3 employs Blizzard R290, a hydrocarbon refrigerant that meets the energy efficiency standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the EPA, resulting in reduced energy consumption and lower carbon emissions.\n\nBuilt for durability, the ESRF3 features a top-mounted cooling system that facilitates easy maintenance and reliable performance. It includes adjustable shelves for flexible storage and a precise thermometer for accurate temperature control. The unit\'s construction and design make it suitable for high-demand environments, ensuring both efficient cooling and ease of use in commercial kitchens.', 'Features a dual temperature system with ample refrigeration space, ideal for managing both fresh and frozen items in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nProvides easy access through three swing doors, which enhances efficiency in busy kitchen environments.\nIncludes adjustable shelving to accommodate various food items and organize storage effectively.\nOperates quietly, minimizing noise and contributing to a more comfortable work environment.\nConstructed with a stainless steel finish for easy cleaning and durability, making it a practical choice for high-traffic kitchens.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ESRF3_deebb12d-e75b-4ea7-af0e-5068404c4493.webp\"]', 'ESRF3', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 6161, NULL, NULL, NULL, 75.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 654.00, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:51:56', '2024-12-16 08:19:20', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ESRF3_deebb12d-e75b-4ea7-af0e-5068404c4493.webp', 'physical', '', 5280, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB686\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2379, 'Everest Refrigeration ESWQ3 59\" Top Mount Solid Door Dual Temperature Reach-In Freezer/Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ESWQ3 is a top-mounted, upright reach-in unit with a dual temperature setup, providing an efficient solution for both refrigeration and freezing needs. The unit features a stainless steel finish and is equipped with two wide swing doors. It offers a total capacity of 52 cubic feet, with 39 cubic feet dedicated to refrigeration and 13 cubic feet for freezing. The dimensions of the unit are 59 inches in width, 31 5/8 inches in depth, and 74 1/4 inches in height.\n\nThis model is powered by a combination of 1/4 horsepower for refrigeration and 1/2 horsepower for freezing. It operates on a 115-volt, 60 hertz, single-phase electrical system, drawing 5.5 amps. The ESWQ3 uses Blizzard R290, a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant that complies with the energy efficiency standards of the U.S. Department of Energy and the EPA, ensuring lower energy consumption and reduced carbon emissions.\n\nBuilt to endure the demands of commercial kitchens, the ESWQ3 features adjustable shelves for versatile storage options and a precise thermometer for accurate temperature monitoring. Its top-mounted cooling system and durable construction make it a reliable choice for maintaining ideal conditions for both refrigeration and freezing, simplifying maintenance and enhancing operational efficiency.', 'Features a dual temperature design with a larger refrigeration section, perfect for restaurants and cafes that need substantial refrigeration space alongside a smaller freezing section.\nOffers easy access through two wide swing doors, streamlining operations in busy kitchen environments.\nIncludes adjustable shelving for customized storage solutions, allowing for flexible organization of various food items.\nOperates quietly to ensure a more comfortable work environment, reducing noise distractions in the kitchen.\nDesigned with a stainless 