(2380, 'Everest Refrigeration ESWRF2 59\" Top Mount Solid Door Dual Temperature Reach-In Freezer/Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ESWRF2 is a top-mounted, upright reach-in unit with dual temperature capabilities, designed for versatile use in commercial settings. With a sleek stainless steel finish, this model features two half doors and one full door, offering a total capacity of 52 cubic feet26 cubic feet each for refrigeration and freezing. Its dimensions are 59 inches in width, 31 5/8 inches in depth, and 74 1/4 inches in height, providing ample storage space in a compact design.\n\nEquipped with a combination of 1/4 horsepower for the refrigeration section and 1/2 horsepower for the freezing section, the ESWRF2 ensures reliable cooling performance. It operates on 115 volts, 60 hertz, and a single-phase electrical system, drawing 9 amps. The unit utilizes Blizzard R290, a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant that meets the energy efficiency standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the EPA, contributing to lower energy consumption and reduced carbon emissions.\n\nConstructed with durable materials, the ESWRF2 is built to withstand the demands of a professional kitchen. It features adjustable shelves for flexible organization and a precise thermometer for accurate temperature control. With its top-mounted cooling system and sturdy design, this dual-temperature unit is both reliable and easy to maintain, making it a practical choice for commercial kitchens.', 'Features dual temperature zones, offering flexible storage options for both refrigerated and frozen goods, ideal for hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nProvides easy access through two wide half doors and one full door, enhancing convenience in high-traffic kitchen areas.\nIncludes adjustable shelves for customizable storage solutions, accommodating various sizes and types of food items.\nEnsures quiet operation, contributing to a more comfortable and focused work environment.\nDesigned with easy-to-clean surfaces, making maintenance quick and efficient for busy kitchen staff.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ESWRF2_d818a1e1-a0ff-487b-a631-b4d174dd785e.webp\"]', 'ESWRF2', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 5552, NULL, NULL, NULL, 59.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 529.00, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:51:58', '2024-12-16 08:19:20', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ESWRF2_d818a1e1-a0ff-487b-a631-b4d174dd785e.webp', 'physical', '', 4758, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB688\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2381, 'Everest Refrigeration ESRF2A 49 5/8\" Top Mount Solid Door Dual Temperature Reach-In Freezer/Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ESRF2A is a top-mounted, upright reach-in unit with dual temperature capabilities, designed to meet diverse storage needs. Finished in stainless steel, this model features two swing solid doors and offers a total capacity of 44 cubic feet22 cubic feet for refrigeration and 22 cubic feet for freezing. It measures 49 5/8 inches in width, 31 5/8 inches in depth, and 74 1/4 inches in height, making it a practical addition to any commercial kitchen.\n\nThis unit is equipped with a combination of 1/4 horsepower for refrigeration and 1/2 horsepower for freezing, ensuring efficient and reliable cooling performance. Operating on 115 volts, 60 hertz, and a single-phase electrical system, it draws 9 amps. The ESRF2A utilizes Blizzard R290, a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant that meets energy efficiency standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the EPA. This refrigerant helps reduce both energy consumption and carbon emissions.\n\nConstructed with durable materials, the ESRF2A is built to withstand the demands of a commercial kitchen. It features adjustable shelves for customizable storage solutions and a precise thermometer for accurate temperature monitoring. With its top-mounted cooling system and robust construction, this dual-temperature unit is designed for reliability and ease of maintenance, making it a valuable asset for professional kitchens.', 'Features a dual temperature setup, ideal for storing both refrigerated and frozen items, perfect for diverse needs in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nOffers convenient access through two swing solid doors, enhancing efficiency in busy kitchen environments.\nIncludes adjustable shelves for flexible organization, allowing you to customize storage space for various items.\nEnsures quiet operation, contributing to a more focused and pleasant workspace in commercial kitchens.\nProvides easy-to-clean surfaces for hassle-free maintenance, helping staff save time and effort.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ESRF2A_d9c9ee28-f1d3-446a-8ce2-45e02899799c.webp\"]', 'ESRF2A', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 5138, NULL, NULL, NULL, 50.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 500.00, NULL, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:52:00', '2024-12-16 08:19:20', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ESRF2A_d9c9ee28-f1d3-446a-8ce2-45e02899799c.webp', 'physical', '', 4403, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB689\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2382, 'Everest Refrigeration ESRFH2 29 1/4\" Top Mount Solid Door Dual Temperature Reach-In Freezer/Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ESRFH2 is a top-mounted, upright reach-in unit with dual temperature capabilities, designed for versatile commercial use. Finished in stainless steel, this model features a combination of half doors with solid swing style, offering a total capacity of 22 cubic feet11 cubic feet for refrigeration and 11 cubic feet for freezing. It measures 29 1/4 inches in width, 31 5/8 inches in depth, and 74 1/4 inches in height, fitting well in various kitchen spaces.\n\nEquipped with a 1/2 horsepower top-mounted compressor, the ESRFH2 ensures efficient and reliable temperature control. Operating on 115 volts, 60 hertz, and a single-phase electrical system, it draws 7.57 amps. The unit uses Blizzard R290, a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant that complies with energy efficiency standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the EPA. This refrigerant helps reduce energy consumption and carbon emissions.\n\nInside, the ESRFH2 is built with durable materials suitable for heavy use in commercial environments. It features adjustable shelves for customizable storage and a precise thermometer for accurate temperature monitoring. With its top-mounted cooling system and sturdy construction, the ESRFH2 offers both reliability and ease of maintenance, making it a valuable addition to any professional kitchen.', 'Features a dual temperature design, allowing versatile storage for both refrigeration and freezing needs in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nOffers efficient cooling with easy access via two half doors, ideal for busy kitchen environments.\nIncludes adjustable shelves for flexible organization, accommodating a variety of items and containers.\nEnsures quiet operation, contributing to a calm and focused work atmosphere in commercial kitchens.\nProvides easy-to-clean surfaces for quick maintenance, saving valuable time fo