(2383, 'Everest Refrigeration ESF3 74 3/4\" Top Mount Solid Door Reach-In Freezer, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ESF3 is a top-mounted, upright reach-in freezer tailored for the demanding needs of commercial kitchens. Showcasing a sleek stainless steel finish and three swing solid doors, this freezer provides an ample storage capacity of 71 cubic feet. Its dimensions are 74 3/4 inches in width, 31 5/8 inches in depth, and 74 1/4 inches in height, offering extensive storage space while maintaining a compact footprint.\n\nThis model is equipped with dual 1/2 horsepower top-mounted compressors, ensuring efficient and reliable cooling. It operates on 115 volts, 60 hertz, and a single-phase electrical system, drawing 12.36 amps. The ESF3 uses Blizzard R290, a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant that complies with energy efficiency standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the EPA. This refrigerant helps reduce energy consumption and minimize carbon emissions, making it an environmentally friendly choice.\n\nInside, the ESF3 is constructed with durable materials designed to withstand the heavy use typical in commercial settings. It includes adjustable shelves for versatile storage options and a precise thermometer for accurate temperature monitoring. With a warranty included, this freezer is built for reliability and ease of maintenance, making it an essential asset for any professional kitchen.', 'Features a spacious design, perfect for storing large volumes of frozen goods in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nOffers consistent temperature control to ensure food remains fresh and safe.\nIncludes adjustable shelves for flexible storage, accommodating various items and containers.\nEnsures quiet operation, maintaining a calm environment in busy kitchen settings.\nProvides easy-to-clean surfaces for quick maintenance, saving time and effort for staff.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ESF3_2c654dc6-bb46-44f7-84c3-2