(2384, 'Everest Refrigeration ESWF2 59\" Top Mount Solid Door Reach-In Freezer, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ESWF2 is a top-mounted, upright reach-in freezer designed for the rigorous demands of commercial kitchens. With a sleek stainless steel finish and two swing solid doors, this freezer provides a substantial storage capacity of 55 cubic feet. Its dimensions are 59 inches in width, 31 5/8 inches in depth, and 74 1/4 inches in height, making it a spacious and reliable addition to any professional kitchen.\n\nThis model features dual 1/2 horsepower top-mounted compressors, ensuring effective and reliable cooling. It operates on 115 volts, 60 hertz, and a single-phase electrical system, drawing 14.81 amps. The ESWF2 utilizes Blizzard R290, a natural, hydrocarbon refrigerant that meets energy efficiency standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the EPA. This refrigerant helps reduce energy consumption and lower carbon emissions, making it an environmentally friendly option.\n\nInside, the ESWF2 is constructed with durable materials to withstand heavy use in commercial settings. It includes adjustable shelves, allowing for versatile storage options, and a precise thermometer for accurate temperature monitoring. With a warranty included, this freezer is designed for reliability and ease of maintenance, making it an essential component for any busy kitchen.', 'Features a wide design, ideal for storing large quantities of frozen goods in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nOffers consistent temperature control to maintain the freshness and safety of food.\nIncludes adjustable shelves for flexible storage, accommodating various items and containers.\nEnsures quiet operation, providing a calm environment in busy kitchen areas.\nProvides easy-to-clean surfaces for simple and efficient maintenance, saving time for staff.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ESWF2_8971499c-321f-4d04-a90b-d2602dd34e66.webp\"]', 'ESWF