(2386, 'Everest Refrigeration ESFH2 29 1/4\" Top Mount Solid Door Reach-In Freezer, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ESFH2 is a top-mounted, upright reach-in freezer designed to enhance the efficiency of commercial kitchens. Finished in sleek stainless steel, this model features two half swing solid doors and provides a storage capacity of 23 cubic feet. The dimensions of the freezer are 29 1/4 inches in width, 31 5/8 inches in depth, and 74 1/4 inches in height, making it a compact yet highly functional unit.\n\nThis freezer is equipped with a 1/2 horsepower top-mounted compressor, ensuring effective and reliable cooling. It operates on 115 volts, 60 hertz, and a single-phase electrical system, drawing 5 amps. The ESFH2 uses Blizzard R290, a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant that meets the energy efficiency standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the EPA. This environmentally friendly refrigerant contributes to lower energy consumption and reduced carbon emissions.\n\nInside, the ESFH2 is constructed with durable materials designed to withstand the demands of a commercial kitchen. It includes adjustable shelves, providing flexible storage options for various frozen items. The freezer also has a precise thermometer for accurate temperature monitoring, ensuring consistent freezing performance. While ETL approved, the unit does not have NSF certification. However, it comes with a warranty, emphasizing reliability and ease of maintenance, making it an essential addition to any professional kitchen.', 'Features a half-door design for better organization and access, perfect for busy kitchens in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nOffers efficient temperature control to keep frozen items at ideal conditions, ensuring food quality and safety.\nIncludes adjustable shelving for flexible storage, accommodating various frozen goods and containers.\nEnsures quiet operation, maintaining a peaceful environment in kitchen areas, enhancing workflow.\nProvide