(2387, 'Everest Refrigeration ESF1 29 1/4\" Top Mount Solid Door Reach-In Freezer, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ESF1 is a top-mounted, upright reach-in freezer designed to meet the needs of commercial kitchens. With a sleek stainless steel finish, this freezer features a swing solid door and offers a storage capacity of 23 cubic feet. Measuring 29 1/4 inches in width, 31 5/8 inches in depth, and 74 1/4 inches in height, the ESF1 is compact yet spacious enough to handle substantial frozen inventory.\n\nEquipped with a 1/2 horsepower top-mounted compressor, the ESF1 ensures efficient and reliable cooling. It operates on 115 volts, 60 hertz, and a single-phase electrical system, drawing 5 amps. The freezer uses Blizzard R290, a natural, hydrocarbon refrigerant that is environmentally friendly and meets the energy standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the EPA. This refrigerant aids in reducing energy consumption and lowering carbon emissions.\n\nInside, the ESF1 is constructed with durable materials to withstand heavy use. It includes adjustable shelves, allowing for versatile storage options. The unit also features a precise thermometer for accurate temperature monitoring, ensuring consistent freezing performance. With a warranty provided, the ESF1 is designed for long-lasting reliability and ease of maintenance, making it an essential component for any commercial kitchen.', 'Features a compact design for space-saving storage, ideal for kitchens in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nOffers efficient temperature control to maintain frozen goods at ideal conditions, ensuring food quality and longevity.\nIncludes adjustable shelves for flexible organization, accommodating various frozen items and containers.\nEnsures quiet operation, promoting a calm environment in busy kitchen areas, enhancing workflow.\nProvides easy-to-clean surfaces for hassle-free maintenance, saving time and effort for staff.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite