(2388, 'Everest Refrigeration ESR3 74 3/4\" Top Mount Solid Door Reach-In Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ESR3 is a top-mounted, upright reach-in refrigerator crafted for demanding commercial environments. It features a sleek stainless steel finish and swing solid doors. With a storage capacity of 71 cubic feet, the refrigerator measures 74 3/4 inches in width, 31 5/8 inches in depth, and 74 1/4 inches in height, providing ample space for various food items.\n\nThis model is equipped with a 3/4 horsepower top-mounted compressor, ensuring effective cooling and energy efficiency. It operates on 115 volts, 60 hertz, and a single-phase electrical system, drawing 7.5 amps. The ESR3 uses Blizzard R290, a natural, hydrocarbon refrigerant known for its eco-friendly properties and compliance with the U.S. Department of Energy and EPA standards. This refrigerant contributes to lower energy consumption and reduced carbon emissions.\n\nInside, the ESR3 features a durable construction designed to endure heavy use, with adjustable shelves that offer flexible storage options. The unit includes a precise thermometer for accurate temperature monitoring, ensuring consistent cooling performance. With a warranty included, the ESR3 is built for reliability and easy maintenance, making it an essential addition to any professional kitchen.', 'Features a spacious design to handle large volumes, perfect for high-demand kitchens in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nOffers precise temperature control to keep ingredients at their best, ensuring food safety and quality.\nIncludes adjustable shelving for customizable storage, accommodating a variety of food items and containers.\nEnsures quiet operation, maintaining a serene atmosphere in dining areas, enhancing guest comfort.\nProvides easy-to-clean surfaces for quick maintenance, reducing downtime and increasing efficiency.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ESR3_f90b63f7-60c5-4