(2389, 'Everest Refrigeration ESWR2 59\" Top Mount Solid Door Reach-In Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ESWR2 is a top-mounted, upright reach-in refrigerator designed for professional kitchens. Manufactured with a sleek stainless steel finish, it features swing solid doors and provides a storage capacity of 55 cubic feet. The refrigerator dimensions are 59 inches in width, 31 5/8 inches in depth, and 74 1/4 inches in height, making it a substantial addition to any commercial kitchen.\n\nEquipped with a 1/3 horsepower top-mounted compressor, the ESWR2 ensures efficient cooling and energy usage. It operates on 115 volts, 60 hertz, and a single-phase electrical system, drawing just 3 amps. The refrigerator uses Blizzard R290, a natural, climate-friendly refrigerant that meets the U.S. Department of Energy and EPA standards, offering both environmental benefits and compliance with energy regulations.\n\nInside, the ESWR2 features a durable interior material designed to withstand heavy use, with adjustable shelves providing versatile storage solutions. The unit also includes a reliable thermometer for accurate temperature monitoring, ensuring consistent cooling performance. The product comes with a warranty, and its overall construction emphasizes durability and ease of maintenance, making it a valuable asset for any commercial food service establishment.', 'Features a large storage capacity to accommodate extensive inventory, ideal for busy kitchens in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nOffers user-friendly temperature control for maintaining ideal freshness, ensuring food quality and safety.\nIncludes adjustable shelves for flexible storage options, perfect for varying sizes of ingredients and containers.\nEnsures quiet operation to maintain a pleasant environment in dining areas, enhancing customer experience.\nProvides easy-to-clean surfaces to simplify maintenance, saving time and effort for staff.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhss