(2390, 'Everest Refrigeration ESRH4 49 5/8\" Top Mount Solid Door Reach-In Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ESRH4 is a top-mounted, two-section reach-in refrigerator with a half door design, measuring 49 5/8 inches in width. This model includes four swing half doors and offers a total interior capacity of 48 cubic feet. With dimensions of 31 5/8 inches in depth and 74 1/4 inches in height, it provides ample storage space for various commercial needs.\n\nEquipped with Blizzard R290, a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant, this refrigerator delivers efficient cooling while minimizing environmental impact. It operates on 115V, 60Hz with a single-phase power system, requiring 4.5 amps, and features a 1/4+ horsepower compressor for effective performance.\n\nConstructed with a stainless steel exterior, the ESRH4 combines durability with a modern design that integrates well into different kitchen setups. The unit is rated for energy efficiency and has a crated shipping weight of 404 lbs. It meets the energy consumption standards of the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, ensuring both high performance and environmental responsibility.', 'Features energy-efficient cooling to help lower energy costs and keep a consistent temperature, ideal for hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nOffers a user-friendly slide-out cooling cartridge that simplifies maintenance, ensuring minimal downtime and reliable performance.\nProvides a durable stainless steel finish with four half doors, designed to seamlessly integrate into various commercial kitchen environments.\nIncludes a spacious 48 cubic feet interior, accommodating large volumes of ingredients and supplies, perfect for high-demand settings.\nEnsures a design that fits well in diverse kitchen layouts, enhancing both accessibility and functionality.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ESRH4_80c8c632-56cf-477a-b08e-55c4bd0cd1cf.webp\"]', 'ESRH4', 0,