(2391, 'Everest Refrigeration ESR2 49 5/8\" Top Mount Solid Door Reach-In Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'Everest Refrigeration ESR2 49 5/8\" Top Mount Solid Door Reach-In Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz; This top-mounted, two-door reach-in refrigerator measures 49 5/8 inches in width and is designed for commercial use. It features solid swing doors and offers a total interior capacity of 48 cubic feet. With a depth of 31 5/8 inches and a height of 74 1/4 inches, it provides ample storage space for food and beverages.\n\nThe unit uses Blizzard R290, a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant that enhances energy efficiency and reduces environmental impact. Operating on 115V, 60Hz with a single-phase electrical system, it requires 4.5 amps. It includes a 1/4+ horsepower compressor, ensuring effective cooling performance.\n\nConstructed with a stainless steel finish, the ESR2 combines durability with a sleek, modern appearance suitable for various commercial kitchen settings. The refrigerator is rated for energy efficiency and has a crated shipping weight of 401 lbs. It is designed to comply with standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, ensuring both high performance and environmental responsibility.', 'Delivers energy-efficient cooling to reduce energy costs and maintain a stable temperature, ideal for use in hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nFeatures an easy-to-service slide-out cooling cartridge, minimizing maintenance time and ensuring reliable operation.\nProvides a durable stainless steel exterior with two solid swing doors, integrating seamlessly into various commercial kitchen settings.\nOffers a spacious 48 cubic feet interior, accommodating large quantities of ingredients and provisions for high-demand environments.\nIncludes compact dimensions and a user-friendly design, enhancing accessibility and functionality in diverse kitchen layouts.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ES