(2392, 'Everest Refrigeration ESRH2 29 1/4\" Top Mount Solid Door Reach-In Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', '\nThe Everest Refrigeration ESRH2 is a top-mounted, single-section reach-in refrigerator with a half door design, measuring 29 1/4 inches in width. It features two swing half doors and offers a total capacity of 23 cubic feet, with a depth of 31 5/8 inches and a height of 74 1/4 inches, providing ample storage space for commercial use.\n\nEmploying Blizzard R290, a natural hydrocarbon refrigerant, this model enhances cooling efficiency and reduces environmental impact. It operates on 115V, 60Hz power with a single-phase electrical system and requires 4 amps. The unit includes a 1/4+ horsepower compressor for dependable cooling performance.\n\nConstructed with a stainless steel finish, the refrigerator combines durability with a sleek, modern look, suitable for various commercial kitchen settings. It is rated for energy efficiency and has a crated shipping weight of 298 lbs. Designed to comply with U.S. Department of Energy and Environmental Protection Agency standards, this unit ensures both high performance and environmental responsibility.', 'Delivers energy-efficient cooling that reduces energy costs and maintains a stable temperature, ideal for hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nIncludes an easy-to-maintain slide-out cooling cartridge, reducing downtime and ensuring reliable performance.\nOffers a robust stainless steel exterior with two half doors, blending durability with accessibility for busy commercial kitchens.\nProvides a spacious 23 cubic feet interior, suitable for storing large quantities of ingredients and provisions in high-demand environments.\nFeatures compact dimensions that fit well in various kitchen layouts, enhancing functionality and ease of use.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ESRH2_f5dd01e2-c202-4e73-a2ac-abd8a4e8798a.webp\"]', 'ESRH2', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 2843, NULL, NULL, NULL, 29.00,