(2393, 'Everest Refrigeration ESR1 29 1/4\" Top Mount Solid Door Reach-In Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ESR1 is a top-mounted, single-door reach-in refrigerator with a width of 29 1/4 inches, designed for commercial use. This model includes a solid swing door and offers a total capacity of 23 cubic feet. The unit measures 31 5/8 inches in depth and 74 1/4 inches in height, providing ample interior space for food storage.\n\nThe ESR1 is equipped with Blizzard R290, a climate-friendly hydrocarbon refrigerant that improves energy efficiency and reduces carbon emissions. This top-mounted refrigerator operates on a voltage of 115V, 60Hz, and is designed for single-phase power with a 4-amp electrical requirement. It features a 1/4+ horsepower compressor for reliable cooling performance.\n\nConstructed with a stainless steel finish, the ESR1 combines durability with a modern appearance suitable for various commercial settings. The refrigerator is rated for efficient energy use and is shipped with a crated weight of 296 lbs. This unit is designed to meet the standards of the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environmental Protection Agency, ensuring both performance and environmental responsibility.', 'Features efficient cooling technology that lowers energy costs and maintains a consistent temperature, making it ideal for busy hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nProvides a convenient, slide-out cooling cartridge for easy maintenance, minimizing downtime and ensuring reliable performance.\nOffers a durable stainless steel exterior with a sleek swing solid door design, fitting seamlessly into commercial kitchen and dining environments.\nIncludes a spacious 23 cubic feet interior, accommodating ample ingredients and provisions for high-demand food service operations.\nEnsures a user-friendly design with dimensions that fit well in various kitchen layouts, enhancing accessibility and ease of use.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/s