(2394, 'Everest Refrigeration ESGRH4 49 5/8\" Top Mount Glass Door Reach-In Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ESGRH4 is a top-mounted, two-section reach-in refrigerator with a half glass door design, measuring 49 5/8 inches in width. This model features a durable stainless steel construction with a sleek appearance, designed to withstand the demands of busy commercial kitchens. The refrigerator is equipped with Blizzard R290, a natural, climate-friendly refrigerant that ensures efficient cooling and helps reduce energy consumption and carbon emissions.\n\nWith an interior depth of 30 inches, width of 48 inches, and height of 78 inches, this unit is fitted with a sliding evaporator type and includes four adjustable shelves to organize your items efficiently. The unit operates on a voltage of 115V, 60Hz, and is designed for a single phase with a 15 amp power cord. The interior is made from stainless steel, providing both durability and ease of cleaning.\n\nThe ESGRH4 features a hinged glass door configuration, allowing for easy access and visibility of contents. It includes a built-in thermometer for precise temperature monitoring, and its construction is intended for heavy-duty use. This model is rated for commercial use with a warranty covering essential parts and components, ensuring long-term reliability. The refrigerator is shipped with a weight of 400 lbs, making it a substantial addition to any high-volume food service operation.', 'Features efficient cooling that lowers energy expenses and maintains a steady temperature, ideal for use in busy hotels, restaurants, and cafes.\nOffers a user-friendly cooling cartridge that simplifies maintenance, reducing downtime and ensuring reliable operation.\nProvides a stainless steel exterior for long-lasting durability and a modern look, seamlessly fitting into commercial kitchen and dining spaces.\nIncludes glass swing doors for easy access and visibility, making it convenient to retrieve items quickly in fast-paced settings.\nHighlights a spacious 48 cubic feet interior, accommodating large amounts of ingredients and provisions, ideal for high-demand environments.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ESGRH4_36bd17b3-1fb5-4d19-8919-c8b0a5d02e70.webp\"]', 'ESGRH4', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 4977, NULL, NULL, NULL, 50.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 467.00, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:52:15', '2024-12-16 08:19:19', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ESGRH4_36bd17b3-1fb5-4d19-8919-c8b0a5d02e70.webp', 'physical', '', 4265, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB702\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '');
