(2395, 'Everest Refrigeration ESGRH2 29 1/4\" Top Mount Glass Door Reach-In Refrigerator, 115 V, 1 Phase, 60 Hz', 'The Everest Refrigeration ESGRH2 is manufactured with a sleek stainless steel finish and features a top-mounted compressor. Measuring 29 1/4 inches in width, 31 5/8 inches in depth, and 74 1/4 inches in height, this upright reach-in refrigerator is designed for commercial use. It comes with two half-glass swing doors, allowing easy visibility and access to the stored contents. The unit operates on 115 volts, 60 hertz, and 1 phase, drawing 3.7 amps of power with a 1/4+ horsepower compressor.\n\nEquipped with the innovative Blizzard R290 cooling system, this refrigerator ensures rapid cooling and efficiency. The R290 refrigerant, a natural hydrocarbon, aligns with the energy consumption standards set by the U.S. Department of Energy and the Environment Protection Agency. The evaporator is designed for durability and performance, and the refrigerator includes an interior thermometer for precise temperature monitoring. The refrigerator\'s capacity is 23 cubic feet, offering ample storage for perishable items.\n\nThe unit features robust construction with high-quality materials, supporting heavy use in busy kitchens. The refrigerator\'s interior material is stainless steel, providing both durability and ease of cleaning. It includes adjustable shelves to accommodate various storage needs, and it supports a crated weight of 329 pounds. The product comes with a reliable warranty, ensuring peace of mind for commercial kitchen operators.', '\nFeatures a clear glass door, providing easy visibility of stored items, ideal for busy cafes, hotels, and restaurants.\nEnsures energy-efficient cooling, helping businesses reduce electricity costs while maintaining ideal food preservation.\nProvides versatile storage solutions with adjustable shelves, ideal for adapting to varying stock levels in dining establishments.\nFacilitates easy maintenance with a slide-out cooling cartridge, minimizing downtime in high-traffic kitchens.\nDelivers consistent performance with advanced refrigeration technology, essential for reliable service in food service operations.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/ESGRH2_fef489da-a143-4393-a4e4-0b1f2cca6394.webp\"]', 'ESGRH2', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 28, 0, 0, 3479, NULL, NULL, NULL, 29.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 74.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 329.00, NULL, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:52:17', '2024-12-16 08:19:19', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/ESGRH2_fef489da-a143-4393-a4e4-0b1f2cca6394.webp', 'physical', '', 2982, 4, 0, 20, 0, 'Five year compressor & 3 Year parts warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB703\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2396, 'Cadco CMLW-2 23 1/4\" x 15 1/4\" x 16 1/4\" 2-Level Electric Countertop Warming Shelf - 120V', '<p>The Cadco CMLW-2 2-Level Electric Countertop Warming Shelf is an efficient solution for maintaining the optimal temperature of food items in busy kitchens. Designed to fit seamlessly on countertops, this warming shelf measures 23 1/4 inches wide, 15 1/4 inches deep, and stands 16 1/4 inches high, offering ample space with its two shelves that provide a total shelf width of 20 1/2 inches and depth of 14 inches for effective organization. Operating on a standard 120-volt power supply and utilizing 600 watts of heating power, this warming shelf is perfect for keeping a variety of foods at a consistent serving temperature between 155 to 205 degrees Fahrenheit. The dial control allows for easy temperature adjustments, while the NSF listed certification ensures compliance with health and safety standards, making it a reliable choice for commercial foodservice operations. Crafted from stainless steel, the unit not only offers durability but also features a sleek, silver finish that complements any kitchen decor. With two heating zones, the Cadco CMLW-2 is ideal for buffets and self-service setups, providing efficiency and convenience in food service.</p>', '<p>Two-Level Design: Offers double the capacity for warming food, maximizing countertop space. Ample Shelf Space: Each shelf measures 20 1/2\" W x 14\" D, accommodating various food items. Powerful Heating: Operates at 600 watts, ensuring quick and consistent heating for optimal food service. Temperature Range: Maintains food temperatures between 155F and 205F, suitable for a variety of dishes. Easy Control: Features a simple dial control for precise temperature adjustments. NSF Listed: Meets strict health and safety standards, ideal for commercial kitchen environments. Durable Construction: Made from stainless steel for long-lasting performance and easy cleaning. Plug Type: Equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug for standard electrical outlets. Made in America: High-quality manufacturing standards, supporting local production. Versatile Usage: Perfect for buffets, catering events, and any service setting where food needs to be kept warm.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/CMLW-2.webp\"]', 'CMLW-2', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 468, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 23.00, NULL, 16.00, NULL, 15.00, NULL, 32.00, 1, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:53:43', '2024-12-16 08:19:19', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/CMLW-2.webp', 'physical', NULL, 400, 4, 0, 18, 0, '<p>One year warranty on all oven motors</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/U5iFljsqdJ17V2EJY1mfpkq8TO1SWNG9Qw2qFgmE.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB704\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2397, 'Cadco CTS-4(220) 4-Slice Standard Toaster with 1\" Slots and Aluminum End Panels - 220V', 'The Cadco CTS-4(220) 4-Slice Standard Toaster is a robust and efficient solution for commercial toasting needs, designed to deliver consistent performance in high-volume environments. Operating at 220 volts and 2,350 watts, this toaster can handle up to four slices of bread simultaneously, thanks to its 1-inch wide slots that accommodate various types of bread, including thick slices and bagels. With its compact footprint of 13 1/2 inches in width, 8 inches in depth, and 9 inches in height, the toaster is well-suited for countertop placement in any kitchen setting, maximizing space without compromising functionality. The manual control allows for easy adjustments to achieve the desired level of toasting, while the Keep Warm feature ensures that toasted items remain at the perfect serving temperature. Constructed with aluminum end panels and a sleek silver finish, this toaster not only offers durability but also enhances the aesthetic of any commercial kitchen. NSF listed for safety and sanitation, it meets the stringent standards required for foodservice equipment.', '4-Slice Capacity: Capable of toasting four slices at once, making it ideal for busy commercial kitchens.\n1-Inch Slot Width: Accommodates a variety of bread sizes, including thick artisan breads and bagels.\nHigh Power Output: Delivers 2,350 watts of toasting power for quick and efficient performance.\nCompact Design: Measures 13 1/2\" W x 8\" D x 9\" H, perfect for limited countertop space.\nManual Controls: Provides easy customization of toasting times for preferred browning levels.\nKeep Warm Feature: Maintains the temperature of toasted items until they are served, enhancing service efficiency.\nNSF Listed: Ensures compliance with health and safety regulations, suitable for foodservice environments.\nDurable Construction: Made with aluminum end panels, providing a sturdy and visually appealing finish.\nPlug Type: NEMA 6-20P plug for compatibility with 220V outlets.\nDesigned for Standard Volume Use: Tailored for use in cafes, restaurants, and other commercial settings where volume toasting is required.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/CTS-4_220.webp\"]', 'CTS-4(220)', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 409.5, 819, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 14.00, NULL, 9.00, NULL, 8.00, NULL, 11.00, NULL, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:53:44', '2024-12-16 08:19:19', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/CTS-4_220.webp', 'physical', '', 350, 4, 0, 18, 0, 'One year warranty on all oven motors', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', 1, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB705\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2398, 'Cadco CTW-4M(220) 4-Slice Standard Toaster with 1\" Slots - 220V', 'The Cadco CTW-4M(220) 4-Slice Standard Toaster is engineered for high-efficiency toasting in commercial environments, designed to meet the demands of busy kitchens. This powerful toaster operates at 220 volts and 2,350 watts, allowing it to quickly and evenly toast up to four slices of bread at once, thanks to its 1-inch wide slots that accommodate a variety of bread types, including thick artisanal loaves and bagels. With a compact size of 13 1/2 inches in width, 8 inches in depth, and 9 inches in height, it is perfect for countertop use without taking up excessive space. The manual control system offers precise toasting time adjustments, enabling users to achieve their preferred level of browning. The Keep Warm feature maintains the temperature of toasted items, ensuring they are ready to serve when needed. Constructed with a silver finish, the toaster is not only durable but also visually appealing for any commercial kitchen. It is NSF listed, ensuring compliance with stringent health and safety standards, making it a reliable choice for restaurants and cafes.', '4-Slice Capacity: Toasts four slices simultaneously, enhancing operational efficiency during peak hours.\n1-Inch Slot Width: Versatile enough to toast a variety of breads, including thick bagels and other specialty items.\nHigh Power: Operates at 2,350 watts, ensuring rapid heating and toasting.\nCompact Dimensions: Measures 13 1/2\" W x 8\" D x 9\" H, ideal for countertop placement in any kitchen setting.\nManual Control: Allows for user-friendly adjustments to toasting times for optimal results.\nKeep Warm Feature: Keeps toasted items warm until they\'re ready to be served, perfect for busy environments.\nNSF Listed: Complies with health and safety standards, making it suitable for commercial use.\nDurable Construction: Finished in silver, this toaster combines durability with an attractive appearance.\nPlug Type: NEMA 6-20P plug for compatibility with 220V outlets.\nDesigned for Standard Volume Usage: Ideal for moderate to high-volume operations in cafes, diners, and restaurants.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/CTW-4M_220.webp\"]', 'CTW-4M(220)', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 409.5, 819, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 14.00, NULL, 9.00, NULL, 8.00, NULL, 11.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:53:46', '2024-12-16 08:19:19', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/CTW-4M_220.webp', 'physical', '', 350, 4, 0, 18, 0, 'One year warranty on all oven motors', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', 1, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB706\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2399, 'Cadco CTW-4M 4-Slice Standard Toaster with 1\" Slots and Metallic Gray Cast Aluminum End Panels - 120V', '<p>The Cadco CTW-4M 4-Slice Standard Toaster is an efficient and reliable appliance designed for commercial kitchens, making it ideal for high-volume operations. Featuring four slots with a generous width of 1 inch, this toaster allows for toasting a variety of bread types, including thick bagels and artisanal loaves. With dimensions of 13 1/2 inches in width, 8 inches in depth, and 9 inches in height, it fits comfortably on countertops while maximizing toasting capacity. The toaster operates on 1,745 watts at 120 volts and is powered by a robust heating source that ensures rapid and even toasting. Its metallic gray cast aluminum end panels add durability and a sleek appearance, while the manual control type allows users to customize toasting times to achieve their desired level of crispness. The Keep Warm feature ensures that toasted items stay warm and ready for service, making it perfect for busy breakfast and brunch settings. Additionally, the CTW-4M is NSF listed, affirming its compliance with health and safety standards for commercial use.</p>', '<p>4-Slice Capacity: Allows toasting of up to four slices of bread simultaneously, enhancing productivity. 1-Inch Slot Width: Accommodates various bread types, including thicker options like bagels. Robust Power: Operates at 1,745 watts for quick and efficient toasting. Compact Dimensions: Measures 13 1/2\" W x 8\" D x 9\" H, suitable for countertop placement. Manual Control: Offers precise toasting control for customizable results. Keep Warm Feature: Maintains the warmth of toasted items until they are ready to serve. NSF Listed: Meets stringent health and safety standards for commercial kitchen equipment. Durable Construction: Made with metallic gray cast aluminum end panels for longevity and style. Plug Type: NEMA 5-15P plug ensures compatibility with standard outlets. Ideal for Standard Volume Usage: Designed for moderate to high-volume toasting in cafes, diners, and restaurants.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/CTW-4M.webp\"]', 'CTW-4M', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 409.5, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 14.00, NULL, 9.00, NULL, 8.00, NULL, 11.00, 1, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:53:47', '2024-12-16 08:19:19', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/CTW-4M.webp', 'physical', NULL, 350, 4, 0, 18, 0, '<p>One year warranty on all oven motors</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/xVeTrXDgIrq0bb21weOyhKqIKpDRmhX79Dp6G0zU.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB707\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2400, 'Cadco WTRT-10-HD 24\" x 14 3/8\" x 9 3/4\" Electric Heavy-Duty Countertop Warming Shelf with Roll Top Lid - 120V', '<p>The Cadco WTRT-10-HD Electric Heavy-Duty Countertop Warming Shelf is expertly designed to keep food warm in buffet settings while enhancing convenience and accessibility. Measuring 24 inches in width, 14 3/8 inches in depth, and 9 3/4 inches in height, this warming shelf features a roll-top lid for easy access to food items while effectively maintaining temperature. The stainless steel construction provides durability and ease of cleaning, making it ideal for commercial kitchen environments. Operating at 300 watts with a voltage of 120 volts, this unit utilizes a single heating zone to deliver consistent warmth within a temperature range of 155F to 205F. The intuitive dial control allows for simple adjustments, ensuring that food is kept at the perfect serving temperature. NSF listed for safety and sanitation, the WTRT-10-HD is equipped with a handle for effortless mobility, making it an excellent addition to any catering setup or buffet service.</p>', '<p>Roll Top Lid: Provides easy access to food while keeping items warm and protected. Stainless Steel Construction: Ensures durability and resistance to corrosion, ideal for heavy-duty use. Compact Size: Dimensions of 24\" W x 14 3/8\" D x 9 3/4\" H make it suitable for countertop placement in various settings. 300 Watts Power: Efficient heating capability designed to maintain optimal food temperatures. Temperature Range: Keeps food warm within a range of 155F to 205F, ensuring food safety. Dial Control: User-friendly temperature adjustment for precise heating. NSF Listed: Meets rigorous health and safety standards, suitable for commercial kitchens. Single Heating Zone: Delivers consistent warmth across the entire shelf surface. Built-in Handle: Facilitates easy transport and repositioning in serving areas. Ideal for Buffet Service: Designed specifically for buffet-style food service, enhancing both presentation and accessibility.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/WTRT-10-HD.webp\"]', 'WTRT-10-HD', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 391.95, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 24.00, NULL, 10.00, NULL, 14.00, NULL, 23.00, 1, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:53:48', '2024-12-16 08:19:19', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/WTRT-10-HD.webp', 'physical', NULL, 335, 4, 0, 18, 0, '<p>One year warranty on all oven motors</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Vn1nRiBoqUgOGtiXdrvQhvNMSVS3aVtA7egbk8ng.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB708\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2401, 'Cadco WT-40S 46\" x 15 1/4\" x 2 7/8\" Electric Countertop Warming Shelf - 120V', '<p>The Cadco WT-40S Electric Countertop Warming Shelf is a robust and efficient solution for keeping food warm in buffet settings. This warming shelf measures 46 inches in width, 15 1/4 inches in depth, and stands at a height of 2 7/8 inches, designed to fit conveniently on countertops while providing ample space for multiple food trays. Constructed from durable stainless steel, it ensures longevity and ease of cleaning in a busy kitchen environment. With a heating capacity of 600 watts and a voltage of 120 volts, this unit operates across two heating zones, maintaining food temperatures within a range of 155F to 205F to ensure food safety and quality. The intuitive dial control allows for easy temperature adjustments, and the shelf features a handle for enhanced portability. NSF listed for safety and sanitation compliance, the WT-40S is a reliable choice for any catering or food service operation looking to maintain food temperature efficiently.</p>', '<p>Spacious Design: Dimensions of 46\" W x 15 1/4\" D x 2 7/8\" H accommodate large trays and multiple food items. Stainless Steel Construction: Durable and easy to clean, ideal for high-traffic commercial kitchens. Dual Heating Zones: Two heating zones provide even warming across the entire surface, enhancing food safety. Temperature Range: Maintains a temperature range of 155F to 205F, ensuring optimal food quality and safety. 600 Watts Power: Efficient warming capability that balances power and energy consumption effectively. Dial Control: Simple temperature adjustment for user-friendly operation. NSF Listed: Meets stringent health and safety standards, ensuring a safe food service environment. Portable Handle: Built-in handle for easy transport and positioning in various serving setups. Countertop Installation: Specifically designed for countertop use, making it a versatile addition to any buffet or catering operation. Heated Buffet Style: Perfect for keeping food warm and ready to serve at buffets, parties, or catered events.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/WT-40S.webp\"]', 'WT-40S', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 351, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 46.00, NULL, 3.00, NULL, 15.00, NULL, 21.00, 1, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:53:49', '2024-12-16 08:19:19', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/WT-40S.webp', 'physical', NULL, 300, 4, 0, 18, 0, '<p>One year warranty on all oven motors</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Lt3juROWOm8XdGHswpwIFXa2sdJsIsry4hOJ9AT9.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB709\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2402, 'Cadco WTBS-23P Double Electric Buffet Server with Clear Lids - 120V', '<p>The Cadco WTBS-23P Double Electric Buffet Server with Clear Lids is an excellent addition to any food service operation, offering a reliable solution for maintaining food temperature and quality in buffet settings. This model measures 18 1/4 inches in width, 15 1/4 inches in depth, and stands 7 7/8 inches high, making it a perfect fit for countertop use. Designed to hold two 1/3 size pans, it features a stainless steel construction that is both durable and easy to clean, ensuring it withstands the rigors of commercial kitchen environments. With a power supply of 120 volts and a wattage of 300 watts, it operates on a single heating zone, effectively keeping food warm within a temperature range of 155F to 205F. The intuitive dial control makes it simple to set and adjust temperatures, while the clear lids allow for visibility of food items, enhancing presentation and accessibility. The buffet server is NSF listed, confirming its compliance with health and safety standards, and includes a convenient handle for easy transport, making it ideal for self-service stations.</p>', '<p>Compact Dimensions: 18 1/4\" W x 15 1/4\" D x 7 7/8\" H; optimized for buffet setups while accommodating two 1/3 size pans. Durable Stainless Steel: Provides strength and durability while ensuring easy cleaning for daily use in food service operations. Dual Pan Capacity: Designed to hold two 1/3 size pans for versatile food offerings in a single server. Temperature Range: Maintains food temperatures between 155F and 205F, ensuring optimal food safety and quality. 300 Watts of Power: Efficiently warms food without excessive energy consumption. Dial Control: User-friendly temperature adjustment, allowing for quick and precise control. Clear Lids: Enhance food visibility while preserving heat, improving food presentation and serving convenience. NSF Listed: Meets rigorous safety and sanitation standards suitable for commercial use. Self-Service Style: Designed for customer access, making it perfect for buffets and catered events. Portable Handle: Facilitates easy movement and placement, adding to its versatility in various service scenarios.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/WTBS-23P.webp\"]', 'WTBS-23P', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 330.53, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 18.00, NULL, 8.00, NULL, 15.00, NULL, 14.00, 1, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:53:51', '2024-12-16 08:19:19', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/WTBS-23P.webp', 'physical', NULL, 282.5, 4, 0, 18, 0, '<p>One year warranty on all oven motors</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/SiSRF1JSnP7vmJ4DHdOIU0VbiCkZXyRG94jlTZSI.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB710\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2403, 'Cadco WTBS-12P Electric Buffet Server with Clear Lid - 120V', '<p>The Cadco WTBS-12P Electric Buffet Server with Clear Lid is a high-performance solution designed to keep food warm and ready for service in commercial settings such as buffets, catering events, and food service establishments. This buffet server measures 18 1/4 inches in width, 15 1/4 inches in depth, and stands 7 7/8 inches tall, making it compact yet spacious enough to hold a half-size pan. Constructed from durable stainless steel, it features a sleek black and silver design that enhances any presentation. Operating at 120 volts with a wattage of 300 watts, this server utilizes a single heating zone to maintain food temperatures within a range of 155F to 205F. The user-friendly dial control allows for easy temperature adjustments, while the heated shelves ensure food remains at the ideal serving temperature. The clear lid allows for visibility while keeping contents covered, enhancing food safety and presentation. As an NSF listed product, it meets stringent health standards, and the included handle provides ease of transport, making it perfect for self-service stations.</p>', '<p>Compact Dimensions: 18 1/4\" W x 15 1/4\" D x 7 7/8\" H; optimized for buffet tables while accommodating a half-size pan. Durable Stainless Steel: Ensures longevity and easy cleaning, suitable for high-volume use in commercial kitchens. Single Heating Zone: Provides consistent warming across the entire surface for evenly heated food. Temperature Range: Maintains temperatures between 155F and 205F to ensure food safety and quality. 300 Watts of Power: Efficiently heats food while consuming minimal energy. Dial Control: Simple and intuitive temperature setting, allowing for precise control. Clear Lid: Offers visibility for food contents while maintaining heat, enhancing food presentation. NSF Listed: Complies with safety and sanitation standards, making it ideal for commercial food service. Self-Service Style: Designed for easy access by customers, perfect for buffets and catered events. Portable Handle: Facilitates easy maneuvering and placement, adding to its versatility in various service environments.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/WTBS-12P.webp\"]', 'WTBS-12P', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 307.13, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 18.00, NULL, 8.00, NULL, 15.00, NULL, 14.00, 1, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:53:52', '2024-12-16 14:54:19', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/WTBS-12P.webp', 'physical', NULL, 262.5, 4, 0, 18, 0, '<p>One year warranty on all oven motors</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/QJ3UJpJeBzeCYqx9yVOdXy4pF92HhY0RVxYoTORg.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/wPM9uNRy599eDgX5kGv8rmYX45XuC4rhAPyNXiQJ.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Warranty\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/NmIvJyBBBUSad7AvW2NKqwkQsij1FwQo0rPf8MGb.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB711\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2404, 'Cadco WT-10-HD 24\" x 14 3/8\" x 2 3/4\" Electric Heavy-Duty Countertop Warming Shelf - 120V', '<p>The Cadco WT-10-HD Electric Heavy-Duty Countertop Warming Shelf is expertly designed for commercial kitchens and catering operations, providing reliable and efficient warming solutions. With dimensions of 24 inches in width, 14 3/8 inches in depth, and a height of 2 3/4 inches, this warming shelf offers a spacious surface area, ideal for holding multiple dishes at optimal serving temperatures. Constructed from high-quality stainless steel, it ensures durability and easy maintenance, making it well-suited for demanding environments. Operating at 120 volts with a wattage of 300 watts, this unit features a single heating zone that effectively maintains temperatures ranging from 155F to 205F. The dial control allows for straightforward temperature adjustments, ensuring precise heating. The warming shelf is also NSF listed, indicating compliance with stringent health and safety standards, and comes with a convenient handle for easy transportation and positioning. Designed for countertop installation, this unit enhances efficiency in food service while maintaining a professional appearance.</p>', '<p>Ample Dimensions: 24\" W x 14 3/8\" D x 2 3/4\" H; provides a generous warming area for various food items. Stainless Steel Construction: Ensures durability and ease of cleaning, perfect for high-traffic kitchen settings. Single Heating Zone: Delivers consistent warming across the surface for uniform heat distribution. Temperature Range: Adjustable from 155F to 205F to keep food safely warm and ready to serve. 300 Watts of Power: Efficient operation that effectively maintains food temperatures without overheating. Dial Control: User-friendly design allows for easy and precise temperature settings. NSF Listed: Complies with health and safety standards, suitable for commercial kitchen use. Built-in Handle: Provides easy handling and mobility, facilitating repositioning as needed. Buffet Style: Ideal for catering and self-service buffets, enhancing food presentation. Countertop Installation: Designed for quick placement on countertops, maximizing kitchen space and workflow efficiency.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/WT-10-HD.webp\"]', 'WT-10-HD', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 286.65, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 24.00, NULL, 3.00, NULL, 14.00, NULL, 14.00, 1, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:53:53', '2024-12-16 14:53:30', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/WT-10-HD.webp', 'physical', NULL, 245, 4, 0, 18, 0, '<p>One year warranty on all oven motors</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/O6iX4uO5pB5yzpxhSpXNL709uvsrCBRtwZpTZyhv.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/ktLWnAJ2IZlufqYbeIgzpccJJkt7r5lwTfsoIq3P.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Warranty\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/WFPfhHguvpo8Te2zCDdaSO8F3q2UcPRFiYfDx61U.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB712\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
