(2407, 'Cadco SPL-2P Half Size Steam Pan with Lid for Electric Buffet Servers', '<p>The Cadco SPL-2P Half Size Steam Pan with Lid is an essential accessory for any electric buffet server, offering durability and functionality for food service. Crafted from high-quality stainless steel, this half-size steam pan is designed to withstand the rigors of commercial use while maintaining its sleek appearance. It features a convenient lift-off lid made of lightweight plastic, allowing for easy access to your dishes while ensuring they stay warm and protected. With a solid rectangular design, this steam pan is perfect for serving a variety of foods and is built to optimize space in buffet settings. Proudly made in America, it reflects Cadco\'s dedication to quality craftsmanship and reliable performance.</p>', '<p>Half Size Design: Optimized for buffet settings with a 1/2 size configuration. Durable Construction: Made from high-quality stainless steel for long-lasting use. Lift-Off Lid: Includes a plastic lid for easy access while keeping food warm. Convenient Handle: Equipped with a handle for easy lifting and transportation. Lightweight Lid: The plastic lid is easy to manage, enhancing usability. Versatile Application: Suitable for electric buffet servers and various catering needs. Solid Style: Provides effective coverage to maintain food temperature and quality. American Made: Manufactured in the USA, ensuring reliability and quality. Rectangular Shape: Ideal for a variety of food items while maximizing buffet space. Easy to Clean: Stainless steel surface allows for straightforward cleaning and maintenance.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/SPL-2P.webp\"]', 'SPL-2P', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 43.88, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 13.00, NULL, 5.00, NULL, 11.00, NULL, 2.00, 1, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:53:57', '2024-12-16 14:47:20', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/SPL-2P.webp', 'physic