(2408, 'Cadco SPL-3P Third Size Steam Pan with Lid for Electric Buffet Servers', '<p>The Cadco SPL-3P Third Size Steam Pan with Lid is a high-quality food storage solution designed for use with electric buffet servers. This stainless steel steam pan features a convenient lift-off lid, ensuring easy access to your dishes while keeping them warm and protected. Its sturdy construction guarantees durability, while the included lid is made of lightweight plastic, making it easy to handle. The pan\'s rectangular shape allows for efficient storage and organization in buffet settings, and its 1/3 size is perfect for serving a variety of dishes without taking up too much space. This steam pan is made in America, reflecting Cadco\'s commitment to quality and craftsmanship.</p>', '<p>Compact Size: Third size (1/3) design for efficient use in buffet settings. Durable Material: Constructed from high-quality stainless steel for long-lasting performance. Lift-Off Lid: Comes with a plastic lid for easy access and maintaining food temperature. User-Friendly: Features a handle for convenient lifting and transportation. Lightweight Lid: The lid\'s plastic construction makes it easy to handle. Versatile Use: Ideal for use with electric buffet servers and other catering equipment. Solid Style: Provides a secure cover to keep food warm and protected. American Made: Manufactured in the USA, ensuring quality and reliability. Rectangular Shape: Optimizes space in buffet setups for multiple food items. Easy to Clean: Stainless steel surface allows for quick cleaning and maintenance.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/SPL-3P.webp\"]', 'SPL-3P', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 40.95, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 13.00, NULL, 5.00, NULL, 7.00, NULL, 2.00, 1, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:53:59', '2024-12-16 14:46:54', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/SPL-3P.webp', 'physical', NULL, 35, 4, 0, 18, 0, '<p>One year warran