(2409, 'Cadco MobileServ 70 1/4\" x 31 1/2\" Mobile Food Cart with 4 Heated Wells CBC-HHHH - 1,200W, 120V', 'The Cadco MobileServ 70 1/4\" x 31 1/2\" Mobile Food Cart with 4 heated wells is a versatile and robust solution for catering, buffet services, or food transport in any commercial setting. Designed with mobility in mind, this cart is constructed from high-quality stainless steel, ensuring durability and resistance to wear. It features four heated wells to keep food at the perfect serving temperature, with a total wattage of 1,200 watts, making it energy-efficient for extended use. The cart includes eight pans for food storage, along with six drawers and two shelves for ample storage and organization. With its heavy-duty casters, including brakes for stability, this mobile food cart is easy to maneuver while ensuring safety during operation.', 'Spacious Design: Measures 70 1/4\" in length and 31 1/2\" in width, providing ample surface area for food service.\nFour Heated Wells: Equipped with 4 heated wells to maintain optimal food temperatures for service.\nDurable Construction: Made of stainless steel, ensuring longevity and easy cleaning.\nAmple Storage: Features 8 food pans, 6 drawers, and 2 shelves for efficient organization of food and supplies.\nMobility: Heavy-duty casters with brakes allow for easy movement and secure positioning.\nPower Efficient: Operates at 1,200 watts with a 120-volt power supply, making it suitable for various settings.\nUser-Friendly: Designed with a handle for easy pushing and maneuvering.\nMade in America: Proudly manufactured in the USA, ensuring quality craftsmanship.\nOpen Style: Provides an accessible layout for quick service and replenishment.\nPan Depth: Includes pans with a depth of 2 1/2 inches, accommodating various food items.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/CBC-HHHH.webp\"]', 'CBC-HHHH', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 6084, 12168, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 70.00, NULL, 49.00, NULL, 32.0