(2410, 'Cadco Bakerlux Station BLS-4FLD-1 4-Shelf Full Size Heavy-Duty Digital Countertop Convection Oven with LED Control Panel and Stand - 208-240V', '<p>The Cadco Bakerlux Station BLS-4FLD-1 4-Shelf Full Size Heavy-Duty Digital Countertop Convection Oven is an exceptional cooking appliance designed for high-volume kitchens, offering the perfect blend of power and efficiency. Featuring a spacious 4 cubic foot capacity, this oven can accommodate full-size sheet pans and is equipped with a robust 7.6 kilowatt heating element, ensuring rapid and uniform cooking. The digital LED control panel simplifies operation and programming, while the glass door allows for easy monitoring without heat loss. This oven includes steam injection capabilities for maintaining optimal moisture levels in foods, enhancing quality and flavor. Built with durability in mind, the oven\'s aluminum and stainless steel construction ensures long-lasting use, and it is mounted on casters for mobility, making it an ideal addition to any commercial kitchen.</p>', '<p>Generous Capacity: Provides 4 cubic feet of cooking space, suitable for multiple full-size sheet pans. High Wattage: Operates at 7.6 kilowatts, delivering powerful heating for efficient cooking. Digital Control Panel: Easy-to-use LED interface for precise temperature control and programmable settings. Steam Injection: Maintains ideal moisture levels for better food quality and texture. Energy Star Qualified: Designed to reduce energy consumption and operating costs. NSF Listed: Complies with strict health and safety regulations for commercial equipment. Durable Construction: Made from a combination of aluminum and stainless steel for longevity. Mobility: Comes with casters for easy movement within the kitchen. Ample Rack Capacity: Includes 4 racks to optimize cooking space and efficiency. Versatile Temperature Range: Adjustable from 175F to 500F, suitable for various cooking techniques.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/BLS-4FLD-1.webp\"]', 'BLS-4FLD-1', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 4370, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 32.00, NULL, 20.00, NULL, 36.00, NULL, 250.00, 1, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:54:01', '2024-12-16 14:45:04', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/BLS-4FLD-1.webp', 'physical', NULL, 3800, 4, 0, 18, 0, '<p>One year warranty on all oven motors</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/FVqELdvyOKn4KqLakwmWUvbaxpM0bOiqlGFVJxgs.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/2Ngag1AetspL0uaEpdkJ6ARzYObrhc7O6mwWEcG1.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/k5rC3hQmqwHy8NxcL52k4lidyxzFrNnKgsqGuLbJ.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Warranty\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3cfFcUrkSu4Dm0DGIY5fScJQpNGSUyaAzW5yW4Y9.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB718\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2411, 'Cadco Bakerlux Station XAFT-04FS-LD 4-Shelf Full Size Heavy-Duty Digital Countertop Convection Oven with LED Control Panel - 208-240V', '<p>The Cadco Bakerlux Station XAFT-04FS-LD 4-Shelf Full Size Heavy-Duty Digital Countertop Convection Oven is a top-tier solution for high-demand commercial kitchens. With a spacious capacity of 4 cubic feet, this oven features a digital LED control panel for precise temperature management and programming, ensuring consistent results every time. The stainless steel construction offers durability and ease of cleaning, while the glass door provides visibility during cooking without the need to open the door, preserving heat and efficiency. Designed to accommodate full-size sheet pans, this oven can operate at a powerful 7.6 kilowatts, with a temperature range of 175F to 500F, making it perfect for baking, roasting, and other culinary tasks. Additionally, the steam injection feature helps to achieve perfect moisture levels for various dishes, enhancing food quality.</p>', '<p>Generous Capacity: Holds up to 4 cubic feet of cooking space, accommodating multiple full-size sheet pans. High Wattage: Operates at 7.6 kilowatts for powerful heating and efficient cooking. Digital Control: Features an LED control panel for easy programming and precise temperature adjustments. Versatile Temperature Range: Adjustable from 175F to 500F to suit a variety of cooking needs. Steam Injection: Enhances moisture retention for improved food quality and texture. Energy Star Qualified: Designed for energy efficiency, helping to reduce operational costs. NSF Listed: Meets stringent health and safety standards for commercial use. Robust Construction: Made from durable stainless steel for long-lasting performance. Ample Rack Capacity: Includes 4 racks for efficient cooking and baking. Convenient Design: Bottom hinge glass door allows for easy access while minimizing heat loss.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/XAFT-04FS-LD.webp\"]', 'XAFT-04FS-LD', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 3565, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 32.00, NULL, 20.00, NULL, 36.00, NULL, 190.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:54:03', '2024-12-16 13:08:38', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/XAFT-04FS-LD.webp', 'physical', NULL, 3100, 4, 0, 18, 0, '<p>One year warranty on all oven motors</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/TThO1RRmL2qHdp1B0lgW3SMVWguEoZJ7SumHjJa3.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/5D3tOu5vP2iPovA9FTAuvr8NYRTtUUb7WTOauqlf.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Warranty\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/eBeUHm1RDqmJhKgLKqWSopoejHncQ6XX4CG1ybkI.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB719\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2412, 'Cadco Elena XAF-183 3-Shelf Full Size Heavy-Duty Manual Countertop Convection Oven - 208-240V', '<p>The Cadco Elena XAF-183 3-Shelf Full Size Heavy-Duty Manual Countertop Convection Oven is an exceptional choice for commercial kitchens that demand reliability and versatility. With a generous capacity of 3 cubic feet, this oven is designed to hold full-size sheet pans, making it ideal for baking, roasting, and cooking a variety of dishes. The stainless steel construction ensures durability and easy maintenance, while the glass door allows for easy monitoring of cooking progress without losing heat. It operates at a wattage of 4.6 kilowatts, providing consistent and efficient heating across a temperature range of 175F to 500F. Equipped with controlled humidity features, this oven enhances food quality by retaining moisture, making it perfect for a range of culinary applications.</p>', '<p>Full Size Capacity: Holds up to 3 full-size sheet pans for large-scale cooking. Powerful Performance: Operates at 4.6 kilowatts for efficient heating and cooking. Temperature Range: Adjustable from 175F to 500F to accommodate various recipes. Controlled Humidity: Helps maintain moisture for superior food quality. Robust Construction: Made from durable stainless steel for long-lasting use. Glass Door: Allows visibility into the oven without opening, maintaining heat. Ample Rack Space: Includes 3 racks for multiple cooking options. Manual Control: Easy-to-use dial controls for precise temperature settings. Plug Compatibility: Designed with NEMA L6-30P plug for secure electrical connections. Compact Design: Countertop installation for space efficiency in busy kitchens.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/XAF-183.webp\"]', 'XAF-183', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 2310, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 32.00, NULL, 20.00, NULL, 32.00, NULL, 180.00, 1, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:54:04', '2024-12-16 13:00:36', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'ht