(2414, 'Cadco WTRT-40-HD 45\" x 14 3/8\" x 9 3/4\" Electric Heavy-Duty Countertop Warming Shelf with Roll Top Lids - 120V', '<p>The Cadco WTRT-40-HD Electric Heavy-Duty Countertop Warming Shelf is designed for efficiency and practicality in any food service environment. With dimensions of 45\" in width, this warming shelf provides ample space to keep a variety of dishes warm and ready for serving. The stainless steel construction ensures durability while maintaining a professional appearance. Featuring two heating zones and a temperature range of 155F to 205F, this unit is ideal for a buffet-style setup, allowing easy access to food through its convenient roll top lids. It is NSF listed for safety, making it a reliable choice for commercial kitchens.</p>', '<p>Ample Size: 45\" width provides generous space for multiple dishes. Dual Heating Zones: Two heating zones ensure even heat distribution for all food items. Temperature Range: Adjustable from 155F to 205F, suitable for a variety of foods. Stainless Steel Build: Durable and easy to clean, suitable for high-use environments. NSF Certification: Meets health and safety standards for commercial food service. Roll Top Lids: Provides easy access while helping to maintain heat and moisture. Countertop Installation: Designed for convenient placement on kitchen counters. User-Friendly Control: Simple dial control for quick and accurate temperature adjustments. Heating Source: Metal sheathed Calrod heating elements for reliable performance. Efficient Wattage: Operates at 600 watts, making it energy-efficient while delivering high performance.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/WTRT-40-HD.webp\"]', 'WTRT-40-HD', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 602.55, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 45.00, NULL, 10.00, NULL, 14.00, NULL, 31.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:54:07', '2024-12-16 12:53:16', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/WTRT-40-HD.webp', 'physical', NULL, 515, 4, 0, 18, 0, '<p>One year warranty on all oven motors</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/prpWvIhS7gcIoBLdFh7SzzQV2NiHaZL5Qc6T05XB.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/utbqMeCYRh0yoyjVhpl0OKQV8V1dmcGW6osruSCa.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Warranty\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/PxyyXLhotQAKZvewokOS6fvdoSwUg1ME48uYWQaP.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB722\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2415, 'Cadco Stefania XAF-113 3-Shelf Half Size Heavy-Duty Manual Countertop Convection Oven - 120V', '<p>The Cadco Stefania XAF-113 3-Shelf Half Size Heavy-Duty Manual Countertop Convection Oven is a robust cooking solution ideal for commercial kitchens seeking efficiency and versatility. With a compact footprint of 23 5/8\" wide and a height of 16 7/8\", this oven features a spacious interior with a capacity of 1.75 cu. ft. and can accommodate up to three racks for simultaneous cooking. Designed for optimal cooking performance, it operates at 1.45 kilowatts and reaches temperatures between 175F and 500F, allowing for a wide range of cooking applications. The glass door provides visibility into the cooking chamber, while the stainless steel construction ensures durability and easy cleaning. This NSF-listed oven is perfect for any establishment looking to enhance its cooking capabilities.</p>', '<p>Compact Design: Measures 23 5/8\" wide, making it ideal for countertop placement. Spacious Interior: Holds up to 1.75 cu. ft. with room for three racks. Powerful Heating: Operates at 1.45 kilowatts for efficient cooking. Wide Temperature Range: Adjustable from 175F to 500F for diverse cooking needs. Controlled Humidity Feature: Enhances cooking results by retaining moisture. Durable Construction: Made from stainless steel for longevity and easy maintenance. NSF Listed: Complies with safety and sanitation standards. Glass Door: Allows for easy monitoring of cooking progress. Dial Control: Simple and intuitive temperature and time adjustments. Electric Power Type: Operates on 120 volts with a NEMA 5-15P plug for standard electrical connections.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/XAF-113.webp\"]', 'XAF-113', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 1375, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 24.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 120.00, 1, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:54:08', '2024-12-16 12:55:34', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.co