(2416, 'Cadco CPG-15FC Jumbo Glass-Ceramic Clamshell Grill with Smooth Clear Plates - 15 3/4\" x 11 13/16\" Cooking Surface - 1,800W, 120V', '<p>The Cadco CPG-15FC Jumbo Glass-Ceramic Clamshell Grill is a powerful and efficient cooking solution designed for commercial kitchens. With a generous cooking surface of 15 3/4\" x 11 13/16\", this grill features smooth glass-ceramic plates that provide excellent heat retention and even cooking, making it ideal for grilling a variety of foods, from sandwiches to meats. Operating at 1,800 watts, it quickly reaches a maximum temperature of 740F, ensuring fast cooking times without compromising quality. Its stainless steel construction guarantees durability and ease of cleaning, while the integrated drip tray collects excess grease for a mess-free cooking experience. This NSF-listed grill is a reliable addition to any food service environment.</p>', '<p>Jumbo Cooking Surface: 15 3/4\" x 11 13/16\" for cooking larger portions. Glass-Ceramic Plates: Smooth top and bottom for even heat distribution and easy cleanup. Powerful Performance: 1,800 watts for quick preheating and cooking. High Maximum Temperature: Reaches up to 740F for efficient grilling. Durable Construction: Made from stainless steel to withstand heavy use. Dial Control: Easy-to-use dial for precise temperature adjustments. Drip Tray Included: Captures grease and juices for a cleaner cooking process. NSF Listed: Meets safety and sanitation standards for commercial kitchen equipment. NEMA 5-15P Plug: Standard plug type for straightforward electrical compatibility. Versatile Cooking Applications: Suitable for grilling sandwiches, meats, and more.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/CPG-15FC.webp\"]', 'CPG-15FC', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 1491.75, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 19.00, NULL, 8.00, NULL, 18.00, NULL, 38.00, 1, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:54:10', '2024-12-16 12:55:54', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://test