(2417, 'Cadco WTBS-3N-HD 3-Compartment Third Size Electric Heavy-Duty Buffet Server with Roll Top Lid - 120V', '<p>The Cadco WTBS-3N-HD is a versatile and heavy-duty buffet server designed for efficient self-service in commercial settings. This electric buffet server features three compartments, each accommodating third-size pans, making it perfect for displaying a variety of hot foods at catering events, buffets, or restaurant settings. With a robust construction of stainless steel and a gray finish, it ensures durability while maintaining a professional appearance. The unit operates at 300 watts and maintains a temperature range of 155F to 205F, thanks to its metal sheathed heating source. Its roll top lid allows for easy access to the food while retaining heat, making it an excellent choice for any service environment.</p>', '<p>Three Compartment Design: Holds three third-size pans for diverse food offerings. Heated Shelves: Ensures food stays warm and at optimal serving temperatures. Durable Construction: Made from stainless steel for long-lasting performance. Self-Service Operation: Designed for easy access and user-friendly service. Temperature Control: Maintains a consistent range of 155F to 205F for food safety. NEMA 5-15P Plug: Standard plug type for compatibility with most power outlets. NSF Listed: Meets stringent public health standards for foodservice equipment. Compact Size: Measures 24\" W x 14 3/8\" D x 12\" H, ideal for countertop placement. Made in America: Reflects quality craftsmanship and local manufacturing. Dial Control: Simple dial mechanism for easy temperature adjustments.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/WTBS-3N-HD.webp\"]', 'WTBS-3N-HD', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 468, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 24.00, NULL, 12.00, NULL, 14.00, NULL, 32.00, 1, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:54:12', '2024-12-16 12:56:51', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/WTBS-3N-HD.webp',