(2419, 'Cadco Arianna XAF-133 4-Shelf Half Size Heavy-Duty Manual Countertop Convection Oven - 208-240V', '<p>The Cadco Arianna XAF-133 is a robust half-size countertop convection oven designed for commercial kitchens seeking efficiency and versatility. This oven features a generous cooking capacity of 2.27 cu. ft., allowing for multiple dishes to be cooked simultaneously on its four racks. With a temperature range of 175F to 500F, it provides excellent control over cooking processes, including baking, roasting, and steaming. The oven is equipped with a glass door for easy monitoring of food without opening the unit, ensuring that heat and moisture are retained. Made from durable stainless steel, the XAF-133 is built to withstand the demands of high-volume cooking environments, making it an ideal choice for restaurants, catering services, and food trucks.</p>', '<p>Spacious Capacity: Holds up to 2.27 cu. ft. for cooking multiple dishes. Four Rack Capacity: Comes with four racks for maximum cooking flexibility. Temperature Range: Adjustable from 175F to 500F for various cooking techniques. Controlled Humidity: Maintains moisture levels for optimal cooking results. Durable Construction: Made of high-quality stainless steel for longevity. Glass Door: Allows for easy monitoring of food without opening the door. Manual Control: Features a simple dial control for easy operation. Countertop Design: Compact size (23 5/8\" W x 28 1/8\" D x 20\" H) fits well in any kitchen. Powerful Performance: Operates on 208-240V, 20 Amps, with a wattage of 2.7 kilowatts. NEMA 6-20P Plug: Standard plug type for easy connection to power sources.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/XAF-133.webp\"]', 'XAF-133', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 1540, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 24.00, NULL, 20.00, NULL, 28.00, NULL, 125.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:54:14', '2024-12-16 12:57:44', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/product