(2421, 'Cadco Bakerlux Station XAFT-04HS-LD 4-Shelf Half Size Heavy-Duty Digital Countertop Convection Oven with LED Control Panel - 208-240V', '<p>The Cadco VKII-220 VariKwik High Speed Countertop Convection Oven is designed for fast, efficient cooking in commercial settings. Featuring a versatile heating system that combines convection, radiant, and conductive heat, this compact oven is ideal for entry-level rapid cooking. Its 0.9 cu. ft. capacity accommodates up to a 14-inch pizza, making it perfect for quick-service establishments. With a user-friendly touchscreen and programmable settings, operators can ensure consistent cooking results. Built with a durable stainless steel exterior and LED lighting, the oven is both sleek and functional, reaching temperatures up to 500F.</p>', '<p>Multi-Heating System: Combines convection, radiant, and conductive heat. Touchscreen Control Panel: Simple and easy to operate. LED Lighting: Enhances visibility of the cooking area. Compact Design: Ideal for countertop installation. High Temperature Range: Reaches up to 500F for versatile cooking. 0.9 cu. ft. Capacity: Fits a 14-inch pizza or similar items. NSF Listed: Compliant with sanitation standards. Programmable Settings: Allows for consistent and repeatable results. Stainless Steel Exterior: Durable and easy to clean. NEMA 6-20P Plug: Suitable for 220V, single-phase outlets.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/XAFT-04HS-LD.webp\"]', 'XAFT-04HS-LD', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 2243, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 24.00, NULL, 20.00, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 139.00, 1, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:54:16', '2024-12-16 12:58:42', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/XAFT-04HS-LD.webp', 'physical', NULL, 1950, 4, 0, 18, 0, '<p>One year warranty on all oven motors</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/70X9D3Z06EYk