(2422, 'Cadco Bakerlux Station XAFT-03HS-LD 3-Shelf Half Size Heavy-Duty Digital Countertop Convection Oven with LED Control Panel - 208-240V', '<p>The Cadco Bakerlux Station XAFT-03HS-LD 3-Shelf Half Size Heavy-Duty Digital Countertop Convection Oven is a versatile and efficient oven built to meet the demands of busy commercial kitchens. With a capacity of 1.6 cubic feet and three adjustable shelves, it provides ample cooking space for a variety of foods. This countertop oven features an intuitive LED control panel for easy programming, along with steam injection for enhanced baking quality. Operating on 208-240 volts and 3.3 kilowatts, its both powerful and energy-efficient, suitable for high-volume cooking in limited spaces.</p>', '<p>Three Half-Size Shelves: Allows for efficient, high-capacity baking. LED Digital Control Panel: Easy-to-use and programmable. Steam Injection Feature: Enhances baking by adding moisture. Wide Temperature Range (175F - 500F): Suitable for various cooking needs. Energy Star Qualified: Energy-efficient, reducing operating costs. NSF Listed: Meets strict sanitation standards. Stainless Steel Construction: Durable and easy to clean. Glass Door with Bottom Hinge: Offers visibility and convenient access. Compact Countertop Design: Ideal for limited kitchen space. NEMA 6-20P Plug: Compatible with 208-240V outlets.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/XAFT-03HS-LD.webp\"]', 'XAFT-03HS-LD', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 1941, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 24.00, NULL, 17.00, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 130.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:54:17', '2024-12-16 12:59:33', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/XAFT-03HS-LD.webp', 'physical', NULL, 1687.5, 4, 0, 18, 0, '<p>One year warranty on all oven motors</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/jmRB9QKElq9qMeiQdEke7SQ6qcWJ0e0E6eqt