(2423, 'Cadco WTBS-3RT 3-Compartment Third Size Electric Buffet Server with Roll Top Lid - 120V', '<p>The Cadco WTBS-3RT 3-Compartment Third Size Electric Buffet Server is an efficient and stylish solution for keeping food warm and ready to serve. With three third-size pans and a roll-top lid, its perfect for self-serve setups at buffets, events, or catered functions. This countertop unit operates on 300 watts and features a stainless steel heating surface, maintaining food at temperatures between 155F and 205F. The roll-top lid and sturdy handles make it easy to access and handle food, while its sleek black and silver design complements any setting.</p>', '<p>Three Third-Size Pans: Accommodates multiple food items simultaneously. Roll-Top Lid: Convenient, easy access to food. 300 Watts of Power: Efficient warming with consistent heat. Temperature Range of 155F - 205F: Suitable for keeping various dishes warm. Dial Control: Simple temperature adjustments. Heated Shelves: Ensures even heat distribution across all pans. Stainless Steel Construction: Durable and easy to clean. NSF Listed: Meets food safety standards. Portable Countertop Design: Great for events and buffets. Made in America: Ensures high-quality build and reliability.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/WTBS-3RT.webp\"]', 'WTBS-3RT', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 434.5, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 26.00, NULL, 13.00, NULL, 15.00, NULL, 25.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:54:18', '2024-12-16 12:51:29', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/WTBS-3RT.webp', 'physical', NULL, 395, 4, 0, 18, 0, '<p>One year warranty on all oven motors</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/6qsfRRJ6Osthlssf7TFqYemn2dCGuvwRPpWR70Kv.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/fb2r7nenuxrl3YkaBxpbmOJAsv9R7SleYvbzQLaT.pdf\"},{\"titl