(2424, 'Cadco CG-10 21\" x 12\" Electric Countertop Griddle', '<p>The Cadco 21\" x 12\" Electric Countertop Griddle is a compact yet powerful griddle, ideal for commercial kitchens with limited space. Featuring a 252 square inch cast iron cooking surface, it provides ample room to cook a variety of items at once. The griddle operates at 1,500 watts and reaches up to 450F, ensuring quick and even heating across the surface. Built with stainless steel construction, side splashes, and sturdy feet, this griddle is durable, easy to clean, and designed to fit seamlessly into any countertop setup.</p>', '<p>21\" x 12\" Cooking Surface: Ample space for cooking multiple items. 1,500 Watts of Power: Efficient heating for fast cooking. Cast Iron Surface: Durable and provides even heat distribution. Infinite Control Dial: Allows precise temperature adjustments. Maximum Temperature of 450F: Suitable for a wide range of cooking tasks. Side Splashes: Helps contain splatters for a cleaner workspace. Stainless Steel Construction: Durable and easy to clean. Compact Countertop Design: Fits in kitchens with limited space. Stable Feet: Ensures the griddle stays secure during use. Made in America: Quality construction for long-lasting performance.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/CG-10.webp\"]', 'CG-10', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 429, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 25.00, NULL, 9.00, NULL, 18.00, NULL, 25.00, 1, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:54:19', '2024-12-16 12:51:00', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/CG-10.webp', 'physical', NULL, 390, 4, 0, 18, 0, '<p>One year warranty on all oven motors</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/AJ7zAZR5fXxCqrscMF02UVj7eN5j05SY0lt4aMoI.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/8mPRzZarNDgJlpABwS3Ll6Rms1jYQRW5v2lnc9Pn.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Warranty\",