(2425, 'Cadco CTW-6M(220) 6-Slice Standard Toaster with 1\" Slots - 220V', '<p>The Cadco CTW-6M(220) 6-Slice Standard Toaster is a high-performance toaster designed for commercial settings. This powerful unit can toast up to six slices at once, with each slot measuring 1 inch wide, making it suitable for a variety of bread types. The toaster operates on 220V and delivers 2,480 watts of heating power to ensure efficient, even toasting. Built with manual controls and a \"Keep Warm\" feature, its ideal for maintaining toast at serving temperature until needed. NSF listed and crafted for durability, this toaster is a solid choice for high-volume breakfast service.</p>', '<p>Six Slice Capacity: Allows toasting of six slices at once. 1-Inch Slot Width: Fits standard bread slices comfortably. High Wattage: 2,480 watts for fast and even toasting. Manual Control: Simple and intuitive settings for operation. Keep Warm Feature: Maintains toast at serving temperature. Compact Design: Fits easily on countertops. Sturdy Construction: Durable, silver finish for heavy use. NSF Listed: Complies with sanitation standards. Plug Type: Equipped with NEMA 6-20P plug for 220V outlets. Ideal for Commercial Use: Suitable for high-volume applications.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/CTW-6M.webp\"]', 'CTW-6M', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 482.63, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 17.00, NULL, 9.00, NULL, 8.00, NULL, 12.00, 1, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:54:21', '2024-12-16 12:50:41', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/CTW-6M.webp', 'physical', NULL, 412.5, 4, 0, 18, 0, '<p>One year warranty on all oven motors</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/Hr9ayeKemzv0Vl9qsjmbdqfy8PKbLOdy0eYAPhcG.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/y7HT1KYFKU7hurBmB5o6GRNHL14slNhnuSBbo7wX.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Warr