(2426, 'Cadco WTBS-2N-HD 2-Compartment Half Size Electric Heavy-Duty Buffet Server with Roll Top Lid - 120V', '<p>The Cadco WTBS-2N-HD 2-Compartment Half Size Electric Heavy-Duty Buffet Server is ideal for keeping food at the perfect serving temperature in busy commercial settings. This countertop unit features two spacious compartments with a roll-top lid, making it easy for guests to self-serve while maintaining food warmth. Crafted from durable stainless steel, it operates with a 300-watt Calrod heating element that distributes heat evenly, and the dial control lets you adjust the temperature between 155F and 205F. NSF listed and made in the USA, this buffet server combines quality and functionality, making it a reliable addition to any buffet or catering setup.</p>', '<p>Two Compartment Design: Holds two pans for versatile food options. Adjustable Temperature: Maintains between 155 - 205F. Compact Size: Half-size design for countertop efficiency. Roll-Top Lid: Easy-access lid to keep food covered and warm. Material: Made of durable stainless steel for heavy-duty use. Heating Element: Metal-sheathed Calrod for even heating. NSF Listed: Meets sanitation standards for safe food handling. User-Friendly Dial Control: Simple temperature adjustments. Made in America: Quality you can trust. Power Source: 120V with NEMA 5-15P plug for convenience.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/WTBS-2N-HD.webp\"]', 'WTBS-2N-HD', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 462.15, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 24.00, NULL, 12.00, NULL, 14.00, NULL, 32.00, 1, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:54:23', '2024-12-16 12:50:29', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/WTBS-2N-HD.webp', 'physical', NULL, 395, 4, 0, 18, 0, '<p>One year warranty on all oven motors</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/1944dLxLE4ImPvgu70mqhQKfitcM8yfMy3jOtskJ.