(2427, 'Cadco WT-40-HD 45\" x 14 3/8\" x 2 3/4\" Electric Heavy-Duty Countertop Warming Shelf - 120V', '<p>The Cadco WT-40-HD Electric Heavy-Duty Countertop Warming Shelf is an essential addition to any commercial kitchen or buffet setup, designed to keep food items warm and ready for service. With generous dimensions of 45\" x 14 3/8\" x 2 3/4\", this warming shelf offers ample space with a usable shelf width of 19 inches and depth of 11 inches, accommodating various food trays and platters. Operating at 600 watts and 120 volts, it effectively maintains a temperature range of 155 to 205 degrees Fahrenheit, ensuring food safety and quality. Constructed from durable stainless steel, it features a dial control for easy temperature adjustments and a metal sheathed heating source for consistent heat distribution. The unit includes two heating zones, making it versatile for different food items, and it comes equipped with handles for easy mobility. With its NSF listing, the Cadco WT-40-HD meets the highest standards for safety and sanitation, making it a reliable choice for food service environments.</p>', '<p>Dimensions: 45\" W x 14 3/8\" D x 2 3/4\" H Ample surface area for various food items. Wattage: 600 Watts Provides efficient heating for a variety of dishes. Voltage: 120 Volts Compatible with standard electrical outlets. Temperature Range: 155 - 205 Degrees F Ideal for maintaining food warmth. Material: Stainless Steel Sturdy construction for durability and easy cleaning. Control Type: Dial Simple and intuitive temperature adjustment. Heating Source: Metal Sheathed / Calrod Ensures even heating across the surface. Number of Heating Zones: 2 Zones Flexibility to keep different foods at optimal temperatures. Installation Type: Countertop Convenient and space-saving design. NSF Listed: Complies with health and safety regulations for food service equipment.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/WT-40-HD.webp\"]', 'WT-40-HD', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 421.2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 45.00, NULL, 3.00, NULL, 14.00, NULL, 22.00, 1, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:54:24', '2024-12-16 12:47:09', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/WT-40-HD.webp', 'physical', NULL, 360, 4, 0, 18, 0, '<p>One year warranty on all oven motors</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/RNQpREZe1XOArIuWu4cvhNHa4YXwwl3LSfgbrwGJ.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/tGaZkPZOvqp99Lm4PksS4k9qyDAPt6KVaJgYyhRQ.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Warranty\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/fzzAxZSTUIoRyyubafnp32uDidPLiI2QORlhBrQA.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB735\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2428, 'Cadco WT-10S 26\" x 15 1/4\" x 2 7/8\" Electric Countertop Warming Shelf - 120V', '<p>The Cadco WT-10S Electric Countertop Warming Shelf is a versatile and efficient solution for keeping food warm in any commercial kitchen or buffet setup. With dimensions of 26\" x 15 1/4\" x 2 7/8\", this warming shelf is designed to fit seamlessly on countertops, providing ample surface area with a usable shelf width of 20 1/2 inches and a depth of 14 inches. Operating at 300 watts and 120 volts, it maintains an optimal temperature range of 155 to 205 degrees Fahrenheit, ensuring that your food stays at the perfect serving temperature. Constructed from stainless steel, the unit is not only durable but also easy to clean. The dial control allows for straightforward temperature adjustments, while the metal sheathed heating element ensures even heat distribution. With a sleek black and silver design, the Cadco WT-10S is both functional and stylish for any food service environment.</p>', '<p>Dimensions: 26\" W x 15 1/4\" D x 2 7/8\" H Compact and efficient design. Wattage: 300 Watts Provides sufficient heating for warm food. Voltage: 120 Volts Standard voltage suitable for most outlets. Temperature Range: 155 - 205 Degrees F Ideal for maintaining food warmth. Material: Stainless Steel Durable and easy to clean. Control Type: Dial User-friendly for temperature adjustments. Heating Source: Metal Sheathed / Calrod Ensures reliable and even heating. Number of Heating Zones: 1 Zone Simple operation for warming food. Installation Type: Countertop Space-saving design for easy placement. NSF Listed: Meets health and safety standards for food service equipment.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/WT-10S.webp\"]', 'WT-10S', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 220, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 26.00, NULL, 3.00, NULL, 15.00, NULL, 10.00, 1, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:54:25', '2024-12-16 12:46:31', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/WT-10S.webp', 'physical', NULL, 200, 4, 0, 18, 0, '<p>One year warranty on all oven motors</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/1y9owS64R9C07RbYvUkGRgd8T7ozm1LHjZzYkNlW.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/gFvtNi3N6pSV20oVj6oxwlColq13WhtHiIMSAmgD.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Warranty\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/7hdBCpTdJYX08hoDZB4pJm2o3GbqKBYaVmT5ER9a.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB736\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2429, 'Cadco WTBS-4N-HD 4-Compartment Half Size Electric Heavy-Duty Buffet Server with Roll Top Lids - 120V', '<p>The Cadco WTBS-4N-HD Electric Heavy-Duty Buffet Server is designed for efficient and reliable food service in any commercial kitchen or catering environment. With a spacious 4-compartment setup, this buffet server can accommodate half-size pans, making it perfect for serving a variety of dishes. Each compartment features heated shelves, ensuring that food remains at an optimal serving temperature, ranging from 155 to 205 degrees Fahrenheit. The durable stainless steel construction provides longevity and ease of cleaning, while the roll top lids allow for convenient access to food while maintaining warmth. Operating at 600 watts and 120 volts, this buffet server is equipped with a dial control for easy temperature adjustments. The self-service design includes handles for easy transport, making it ideal for buffets, parties, and events.</p>', '<p>Dimensions: 45\" W x 14 3/8\" D x 12\" H Generous size for multiple food items. Compartment Count: 4 compartments Holds half-size pans for diverse menu options. Wattage: 600 Watts Efficient heating for maintaining food temperatures. Voltage: 120 Volts Standard voltage compatible with most outlets. Construction Material: Stainless Steel Ensures durability and easy maintenance. Temperature Range: 155 - 205 Degrees F Keeps food warm and ready to serve. Control Type: Dial Simple and straightforward temperature control. Heating Zones: 2 zones Provides consistent heating across compartments. Lid Type: Roll top lids Facilitates easy access while keeping food warm. Plug Type: NEMA 5-15P Standard plug for easy connection.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/WTBS-4N-HD.webp\"]', 'WTBS-4N-HD', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 760.5, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 45.00, NULL, 12.00, NULL, 14.00, NULL, 47.00, 1, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:54:26', '2024-12-16 12:46:07', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/WTBS-4N-HD.webp', 'physical', NULL, 650, 4, 0, 18, 0, '<p>One year warranty on all oven motors</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/b8oXr2GbJ7ZzaWutbNucnZqdILEKC0Skc8O5QQem.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/siEwIwPPhscSSOa2oZw1WuCHzqskzBHxJaDAlpfb.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Warranty\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/3u31ioaCh7WSxZUh8NlwrapIlEFJxbc8P0Dt4FKX.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB737\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2430, 'Cadco CG-5FB 12\" x 21\" Electric Front-to-Back Countertop Griddle - 1,500W, 120V', '<p>The Cadco CG-5FB Electric Front-to-Back Countertop Griddle is a powerful and efficient cooking solution for any commercial kitchen or food service environment. With a generous cooking surface area of 252 square inches, this griddle features a durable cast iron cooking surface that ensures even heat distribution and excellent searing capabilities. Operating at 1,500 watts and 120 volts, it reaches a maximum temperature of 450 degrees Fahrenheit, making it suitable for a variety of cooking tasks, from pancakes to burgers. The stainless steel construction not only adds a sleek look but also provides durability and ease of cleaning. Designed with side splashes to contain spills and splatters, this griddle is also equipped with adjustable feet for stability on any countertop. The infinite control type allows for precise temperature adjustments, making it a versatile addition to your kitchen.</p>', '<p>Dimensions: 16\" W x 26 3/4\" D x 9 1/4\" H Compact size ideal for countertop use. Cooking Surface: 12\" x 21\" Ample space for multiple cooking tasks. Wattage: 1,500 Watts Provides powerful heating for quick cooking. Voltage: 120 Volts Compatible with standard electrical outlets. Construction Material: Stainless Steel Durable and easy to maintain. Cooking Surface Material: Cast Iron Retains heat well for even cooking. Maximum Temperature: 450 Degrees F Versatile cooking capabilities. Control Type: Infinite Allows for precise temperature control. Features: Includes side splashes to contain spills and feet for stability. Plug Type: NEMA 5-15P Standard plug for easy connectivity.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/CG-5FB.webp\"]', 'CG-5FB', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 429, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 16.00, NULL, 9.00, NULL, 27.00, NULL, 25.00, 1, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:54:28', '2024-12-16 12:45:33', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 