(2431, 'Cadco WTBS-2RT 2-Compartment Half Size Electric Buffet Server with Roll Top Lid - 120V', '<p>The Cadco WTBS-2RT 2-Compartment Half Size Electric Buffet Server is an essential piece for any catering service or buffet line, designed to keep food warm and easily accessible for self-service. With a sleek stainless steel construction and a stylish roll top lid, this buffet server provides a professional appearance while ensuring food remains at an optimal serving temperature. The server features two compartments, each capable of holding a half-size pan, making it versatile for various dishes. It operates at 300 watts and maintains temperatures ranging from 155 to 205 degrees Fahrenheit, thanks to its efficient metal sheathed heating element. Easy to operate with a dial control, this unit is also NSF listed for safety and sanitation, making it a reliable choice for food service environments.</p>', '<p>Dimensions: 26\" W x 15 1/4\" D x 13 1/4\" H Compact size ideal for buffet setups. Compartment Capacity: 2 compartments Holds half-size pans for versatile food options. Wattage: 300 Watts Provides efficient heating for maintaining food temperature. Voltage: 120 Volts Standard power supply for convenience. Material: Stainless Steel Durable and easy to clean, ensuring long-lasting use. Heating Source: Metal Sheathed / Calrod Reliable and consistent heating performance. Temperature Range: 155 - 205 Degrees F Adjustable for various food types and serving needs. Control Type: Dial Simple and intuitive operation. Features: Equipped with a roll top lid for easy access and temperature retention. NSF Listed: Certified for safety and sanitation standards in commercial food service.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/WTBS-2RT.webp\"]', 'WTBS-2RT', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 418, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 26.00, NULL, 13.00, NULL, 15.00, NULL, 25.00, 1, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:54:29', '2024-12-16 12:45:05', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Mod