(2433, 'Cadco Bakerlux Station XAFT-03HS-GD 3-Shelf Half Size Heavy-Duty Digital Countertop Convection Oven with GO Control Panel - 120V', '<p>The Cadco Bakerlux Station XAFT-03HS-GD is a powerful and efficient 3-shelf half-size digital countertop convection oven, designed for heavy-duty use in commercial kitchens. With a capacity of 1.6 cubic feet and an adjustable temperature range from 175F to 500F, this oven is versatile enough for a variety of cooking applications, including baking, roasting, and reheating. The GO control panel allows for straightforward programming and operation, while the glass door provides visibility into the cooking process without the need to open the oven. Built with a stainless steel exterior, this oven is not only durable but also easy to clean. Additionally, it features steam injection for enhanced moisture control, making it ideal for baking bread and pastries. Its Energy Star qualification reflects its commitment to energy efficiency, helping reduce operating costs for foodservice operations.</p>', '<p>Dimensions: 23 5/8\" W x 29\" D x 16 5/8\" H Compact size ideal for countertop installation. Interior Dimensions: 19 1/4\" W x 14\" D x 10 1/4\" H Ample space for half-size pans. Amps: 12 Amps Efficient energy consumption suitable for commercial environments. Voltage: 208 - 240 Volts Compatible with standard commercial electrical systems. Wattage: 3.3 Kilowatts Delivers powerful cooking performance. Control Type: Digital GO Control Panel User-friendly interface for programming cooking settings. Features: Energy Star qualified, NSF listed, programmable functions, and steam injection capability. Rack Capacity: 3 Supports cooking multiple trays at once for high-volume operations. Door Type: Glass Allows for easy monitoring of cooking progress without heat loss. Plug Type: NEMA 6-20P Designed for commercial power outlets, ensuring compatibility and safety.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/XAFT-03HS-