(2441, 'Cadco CDR-2CFB Double Burner Stainless Steel Portable Electric Front-to-Back Hot Plate with 7 1/2\" Cast Iron Elements - 1,800W, 120V', '<p>The Cadco CDR-2CFB is a reliable and efficient double burner electric hot plate, designed for both commercial and residential kitchens. Featuring two 7 1/2-inch cast iron elements, this hot plate provides a total cooking power of 1,800 watts, making it versatile enough for a wide range of cooking tasks, from sautng to boiling. Its stainless steel construction ensures durability and easy cleaning, while the infinite control type allows for precise temperature adjustments, providing flexibility in cooking methods. With compact dimensions of 13 1/2 inches wide and 22 3/4 inches deep, this hot plate is ideal for countertop use, fitting seamlessly into any kitchen setup. Operating on 120 volts, it is perfect for standard outlets and features a NEMA 5-20P plug type for easy connectivity. This portable appliance is an excellent choice for chefs needing additional cooking capacity or for temporary setups like catering or food service events.</p>', '<p>Dimensions: 13 1/2\" W x 22 3/4\" D x 4 1/8\" H Compact design ideal for countertop use in space-constrained kitchens. Burner Diameter: 7 1/2 Inches Suitable for a variety of cookware sizes, providing flexibility in cooking. Amps: 15 Amps Efficient power usage for effective cooking performance. Phase: 1 Phase Compatible with standard single-phase electrical systems. Voltage: 120 Volts Easily connects to common household and commercial outlets. Wattage: 1,800 Watts Provides strong heating capability for efficient cooking. Burner Material: Cast Iron Ensures excellent heat retention and even cooking across the surface. Burner Style: French Top Designed for versatile cooking options, accommodating various pots and pans. Control Type: Infinite Allows for precise temperature adjustments, enhancing cooking control. Material: Stainless Steel Durable and easy to clean, ensuring long-lasting performance in busy kitchens.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/CDR-2CFB.webp\"]', 'CDR-2CFB', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 27, 0, 0, 358, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 14.00, NULL, 4.00, NULL, 23.00, NULL, 20.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:54:42', '2024-12-16 12:19:53', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/CDR-2CFB.webp', 'physical', NULL, 325, 4, 0, 18, 0, '<p>One year warranty on all oven motors</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/5WevqV31fgBhPsvClqx4ZTbXnZosnVUQ1ScY2VKY.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/9MN0wgdoKMM1gNmDnc0L20cIgno7rpBydWLXX1ta.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Warranty\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/ZbmdLAziBBREa9fCWskVZBYCDr01KA4v8yRJTGqQ.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB749\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
