(2453, 'Serv-Ware SGF-40N 15.5” Stainless Steel 3 Tube Fryer, Natural Gas, 30,000 BTU/H', '<p>The Serv-Ware RR2-HC 15.5 Stainless Steel 2 Door Reach-In Refrigerator is a high-performance refrigeration unit designed for commercial kitchens. With a substantial storage capacity of 49 cubic feet, this refrigerator is equipped with a top-mounted, self-contained refrigeration system that uses R290 hydrocarbon refrigerant, an eco-friendly option that ensures efficient cooling with a reduced environmental impact. The unit operates on a standard 115v/1ph electrical connection, making it easy to integrate into most commercial setups. Its digital thermostat allows for precise temperature control, maintaining an ideal range of 33F to 41F, ensuring that food products remain fresh and safe. Constructed with a durable stainless steel interior and exterior, the RR2-HC is built to withstand the demands of a busy kitchen environment while being easy to clean and maintain. The refrigerator features two self-closing doors with magnetic gaskets that provide a tight seal, enhancing energy efficiency by keeping cold air inside. High-density foamed-in-place polyurethane insulation further aids in temperature retention, reducing energy consumption. Inside, six adjustable heavy-duty wire shelves offer flexible storage options, allowing for efficient organization of various perishable goods. This combination of robust construction, efficient cooling, and ample storage makes the Serv-Ware RR2-HC an excellent choice for commercial refrigeration needs.</p>', '<p>Utilizes a self-contained, top-mounted refrigeration system with R290 hydrocarbon refrigerant, providing efficient and eco-friendly cooling performance.<br>Features a digital thermostat and LED display with a temperature range of 33F to 41F, allowing for precise temperature management of stored items.<br>Built with a robust stainless steel exterior and interior for superior durability, easy maintenance, and a professional appearance in any commercial kitchen setting.<br>Provides 49 cubic feet of interior storage, equipped with six adjustable, heavy-duty wire shelves, offering flexible organization options for various refrigerated goods.<br>Includes high-density, foamed-in-place polyurethane insulation and self-closing doors with magnetic gaskets, optimizing energy use and maintaining consistent internal temperatures.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/Fortress.556-1.webp\"]', 'SGF-40N', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 31, 0, 0, 1468.04, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 16.00, NULL, 47.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 161.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:55:04', '2024-12-16 08:19:19', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/Fortress.556-1.webp', 'physical', NULL, 894, 4, 0, 23, 0, '<p>Three year warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/2f9jIks7jkInDdx88Xv6NnSIplrAd3fPhRuNFDLG.pdf\"}}', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB761\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2454, 'Serv-Ware SP29-8-HC 29” Stainless Steel Sandwich Prep Unit with 1 Solid Door and 8 Pan Capacity. 7 cu. ft.', 'The Serv-Ware SP29-8-HC 29 Stainless Steel Sandwich Prep Unit is a compact and efficient unit designed for commercial kitchens that need reliable sandwich preparation capabilities. This prep unit features a 29-inch width with a 7 cubic feet interior capacity, providing ample space for storing and organizing ingredients. It includes an 8-pan capacity, allowing for easy access to various toppings and condiments required for sandwich making. The unit\'s solid door is hinged for easy access and is designed to keep stored items at optimal temperatures.\n\nConstructed with durable stainless steel, the SP29-8-HC ensures long-lasting performance and ease of cleaning, making it well-suited for the high demands of a busy kitchen. The unit\'s refrigeration system uses R290 hydrocarbon refrigerant, which is eco-friendly and efficient, maintaining temperatures that keep ingredients fresh. Its compact design, combined with high-performance features, makes this sandwich prep unit an ideal choice for establishments with limited space but high-volume food preparation needs.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n', 'Designed to hold up to 8 standard 1/6-size pans, providing ample space for organizing and accessing sandwich toppings and ingredients.<br>Features a self-contained refrigeration system using R290 hydrocarbon refrigerant, ensuring efficient and eco-friendly cooling performance.<br>Maintains a temperature range of 33F to 41F, keeping ingredients fresh and properly chilled for optimal food safety and quality.<br>Built with durable stainless steel for both the exterior and interior, offering resistance to corrosion, easy cleaning, and a professional look.<br>Includes a single solid door with a recessed handle and an interior storage area with adjustable shelves, allowing for additional storage of kitchen supplies and flexibility in organizing space.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/sp29-8.webp\"]', 'SP29-8-HC', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 31, 0, 0, 1791.54, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 43.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 217.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:55:05', '2024-12-16 08:19:19', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/sp29-8.webp', 'physical', '', 1091, 4, 0, 23, 0, 'Three year warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB762\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2455, 'Serv-Ware UCR-48-HC 48.2” Stainless Steel Undercounter Refrigerator with 2 Solid Doors, 12 cu. ft.', 'The Serv-Ware UCR-48-HC 48.2 Stainless Steel Undercounter Refrigerator is a robust and versatile unit designed for efficient use of space in commercial kitchens. With a total storage capacity of 12 cubic feet, it offers ample room for refrigerated ingredients while maintaining a compact footprint. This refrigerator features a self-contained refrigeration system that uses R290 hydrocarbon refrigerant, providing efficient and eco-friendly cooling. The temperature range of 33F to 41F ensures that stored items remain fresh and properly chilled, adhering to food safety standards.\n\nConstructed from durable stainless steel, both the exterior and interior of the UCR-48-HC are designed for easy cleaning and long-term resistance to corrosion and wear. The unit includes two solid doors with ergonomic handles, offering easy access to the interior and secure storage. Inside, the refrigerator is equipped with adjustable shelves to accommodate various sizes of food items and optimize organization. The high-density, foamed-in-place polyurethane insulation and self-closing doors with magnetic gaskets contribute to energy efficiency by maintaining consistent internal temperatures and reducing energy consumption.', 'Equipped with a self-contained refrigeration system using R290 hydrocarbon refrigerant, providing efficient and environmentally friendly cooling performance.<br>Maintains a temperature range of 33F to 41F, ensuring optimal conditions for safely storing perishable items.<br>Built with a robust stainless steel exterior and interior for durability, corrosion resistance, and easy cleaning, ideal for commercial kitchen environments.<br>Offers 12 cubic feet of interior storage space with adjustable shelving, allowing flexible organization and efficient use of available space.<br>Features high-density, foamed-in-place polyurethane insulation and self-closing doors with 