(2456, 'Serv-Ware SMGS-48 47.99\" Stainless Steel Manual Griddle with 4 Burners, Gas, 30,000 BTU/H', 'The Serv-Ware SMGS-48 47.99 Stainless Steel Manual Griddle is a robust and efficient cooking appliance designed for high-performance use in commercial kitchens. This griddle features a gas-powered heating system with a total output of 30,000 BTU/H, distributed evenly across its 48-inch cooking surface. The unit is equipped with four independently controlled burners, allowing for precise temperature management and versatile cooking capabilities. The manual controls provide flexibility in adjusting heat levels to achieve the desired cooking results, making it suitable for a variety of tasks from searing meats to preparing breakfast items like pancakes and bacon.\n\nConstructed with durable stainless steel, the SMGS-48 is built to withstand the rigors of a busy kitchen environment while offering easy maintenance and a professional appearance. The griddle\'s large cooking surface provides ample space for preparing multiple items simultaneously, increasing efficiency and productivity. Additionally, the griddle features a built-in grease tray for collecting excess oil and residues, which simplifies cleaning and helps maintain a hygienic workspace. This combination of powerful heating, durable construction, and user-friendly design makes the Serv-Ware SMGS-48 a reliable choice for commercial kitchens requiring high-capacity and versatile cooking equipment.', 'Equipped with four powerful burners, each delivering 30,000 BTU/H, providing a total heat output of 120,000 BTU/H for efficient and high-performance cooking.<br>Operates on natural gas, offering reliable and consistent heat suitable for high-volume cooking and versatile applications.<br>Features a 47.99-inch-wide cooking surface made from heavy-duty stainless steel, ensuring durability, even heat distribution, and ease of cleaning.<br>Includes manual controls for each burner, allowing precise adjustment of cooking temperatures to accommodate various cooking requirements.<br>Built with durable stainless steel for the griddle and frame, providing resistance to high temperatures and corrosion, and ensuring longevity and ease of maintenance in a commercial kitchen setting.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/SMGS-48.webp\"]', 'SMGS-48', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 31, 0, 0, 1678.23, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48.00, NULL, 15.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 412.00, NULL, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:55:07', '2024-12-16 08:19:19', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/SMGS-48.webp', 'physical', '', 1022, 4, 0, 23, 0, 'Three year warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB764\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2457, 'Serv-Ware SP29-12M-HC 28.9” Stainless Steel Mega Top Sandwich Prep Table with 1 Solid Door and 12 Pan Capacity,115v/1ph, 7 cu. ft.', 'The Serv-Ware SP29-12M-HC 28.9 Stainless Steel Mega Top Sandwich Prep Table is a versatile and durable unit designed for efficient sandwich preparation in busy commercial kitchens. It features a mega top configuration with the capacity to hold up to 12 standard 1/6-size pans, providing ample space for organizing and accessing a variety of sandwich toppings and ingredients. The unit maintains a temperature range of 33F to 41F, thanks to its self-contained refrigeration system using R290 hydrocarbon refrigerant, which ensures reliable cooling while being environmentally friendly.\n\nConstructed with a stainless steel exterior and interior, this prep table offers both durability and easy maintenance, withstanding the rigors of a high-demand kitchen environment. The unit also includes a single solid door with a recessed handle, which provides access to a spacious storage compartment with adjustable shelving for additional kitchen supplies. Designed for efficiency, the prep table operates on 115V/1PH power, making it suitable for a wide range of commercial settings, and its 7 cubic feet of storage capacity ensures ample room for various ingredients and tools.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n', 'Designed to accommodate up to 12 standard 1/6-size pans in the mega top, providing ample space for organizing and accessing sandwich ingredients and toppings.<br>Equipped with a self-contained refrigeration system using R290 hydrocarbon refrigerant, ensuring efficient and eco-friendly cooling performance.<br>Maintains a temperature range of 33F to 41F, keeping ingredients fresh and properly chilled for optimal food safety.<br>Built with a durable stainless steel exterior and interior, offering resistance to corrosion and ease of cleaning, making it suitable for busy commercial environments.<br>Features a single solid door with a recessed handle and an interior storage compartment with adjustable shelving, providing additional storage space and flexibility in organizing kitchen supplies.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/SP29-12M-HC.webp\"]', 'SP29-12M-HC', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 31, 0, 0, 2041.14, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 29.00, NULL, 43.00, NULL, 35.00, NULL, 227.00, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:55:08', '2024-12-16 08:19:19', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/SP29-12M-HC.webp', 'physical', '', 1243, 4, 0, 23, 0, 'Three year warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB765\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '');
