(2460, 'Serv-Ware SP48-12-HC 48.2” Stainless Steel Sandwich Prep Unit with 2 Solid Doors and 12 pan Capacity, 115v/1ph', 'The Serv-Ware SP48-12-HC 48.2 Stainless Steel Sandwich Prep Unit is designed to streamline sandwich preparation in busy commercial kitchens. It features a generous 12-pan capacity, accommodating standard 1/6-size pans for organizing a variety of sandwich toppings and ingredients. The mega top provides easy access to frequently used items, while the 48.2-inch width ensures ample workspace for efficient assembly. The unit is constructed with durable stainless steel, ensuring longevity and resistance to the wear and tear of daily kitchen use. The two solid doors at the bottom offer additional storage space for ingredients and supplies, further enhancing its functionality.\n\nEquipped with a self-contained refrigeration system using R290 hydrocarbon refrigerant, this sandwich prep unit maintains a temperature range of 33F to 41F, keeping ingredients fresh and properly chilled. The unit operates on 115V/1Ph power, making it compatible with standard electrical outlets. High-density polyurethane insulation helps improve energy efficiency by maintaining consistent internal temperatures and reducing energy consumption. The combination of practical features and efficient cooling makes the SP48-12-HC an excellent choice for high-volume sandwich preparation and food service operations.\n\n\n\n\n\n', 'Designed to hold up to 12 standard 1/6-size pans, providing ample space for organizing and accessing a variety of sandwich toppings and ingredients.<br>Equipped with a self-contained refrigeration system using R290 hydrocarbon refrigerant, ensuring efficient and eco-friendly cooling performance.<br>Maintains a temperature range of 33F to 41F, keeping ingredients fresh and properly chilled to ensure food safety.<br>Built with durable stainless steel for both the exterior and interior, offering resistance to corrosion, easy cleaning, and a sleek, professional look.<br>Features two solid doors with recessed handles and an interior storage area with adjustable shelves, providing additional storage space and flexible organization options.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/SP48-12-HC.webp\"]', 'SP48-12-HC', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 31, 0, 0, 2527.2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48.00, NULL, 43.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 322.00, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:55:12', '2024-12-16 08:19:19', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/SP48-12-HC.webp', 'physical', '', 1539, 4, 0, 23, 0, 'Three year warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB768\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2461, 'Serv-Ware SGF-50L 16\", Stainless Steel 4 Tube Fryer, LPG Gas, 120,000 BTU/H', 'The Serv-Ware SGF-50L 16 Stainless Steel 4 Tube Fryer is a high-performance commercial fryer designed for efficient and high-capacity frying. Powered by LPG (liquefied petroleum gas), this fryer delivers a substantial heating power of 120,000 BTU/H through its four tube burners, ensuring rapid heat recovery and consistent cooking temperatures. With a robust 50-pound oil capacity, it is ideal for handling large volumes of fried foods, making it suitable for busy restaurant kitchens and food service operations.\n\nConstructed with heavy-duty stainless steel, the SGF-50L combines durability with ease of maintenance, providing a sleek and resilient surface that withstands high temperatures and heavy use. The fryer features a manual thermostat with a temperature range from 200F to 400F, allowing precise control over cooking temperatures for optimal frying results. Its design includes a large fry pot and efficient heat distribution system, ensuring uniform cooking and reducing oil consumption while maintaining high performance.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n', 'Equipped with four tube burners, each delivering 30,000 BTU/H, providing a total heat output of 120,000 BTU/H for rapid and efficient frying.<br>Operates on LPG (liquefied petroleum gas), offering reliable and high-intensity heat for commercial frying applications.<br>Designed with a 50-pound oil capacity, allowing for large batch frying and reducing the frequency of oil changes in a busy kitchen environment.<br>Features a millivolt thermostat with a temperature range of 200F to 400F, enabling precise control over frying temperatures to achieve optimal cooking results.<br>Made with durable stainless steel for the tank, door, and front, ensuring resistance to high temperatures and corrosion, and facilitating easy maintenance and long-term reliability.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/SGF-50N1_14bb908c-78e2-4c33