(2462, 'Serv-Ware SP48-18M-HC 48.2” Stainless Steel Mega Top Sandwich Prep Table with 2 Solid Doors, 115v/1ph, 12 cu.ft', 'The Serv-Ware SP48-18M-HC 48.2 Stainless Steel Mega Top Sandwich Prep Table is a versatile and durable piece of commercial kitchen equipment designed to streamline sandwich and salad preparation. It features a mega top with capacity for up to 18 standard 1/6-size pans, allowing for efficient organization and quick access to various ingredients. The unit operates on a 115v/1ph electrical system and uses a self-contained refrigeration system with R290 hydrocarbon refrigerant. This ensures reliable and energy-efficient cooling, maintaining a temperature range of 33F to 41F to keep ingredients fresh.\n\nConstructed with a robust stainless steel exterior and interior, the SP48-18M-HC combines durability with ease of maintenance, making it suitable for high-traffic environments. The prep table includes two solid doors that open to reveal a spacious interior with adjustable shelves, providing additional storage for kitchen supplies. Its 12 cubic feet of storage capacity and practical design enhance kitchen efficiency by keeping essential ingredients organized and within easy reach, while its sturdy build ensures long-term reliability and performance.', 'Accommodates up to 18 standard 1/6-size pans in the mega top, providing extensive space for organizing and accessing sandwich ingredients and toppings.<br>Utilizes a self-contained refrigeration system with R290 hydrocarbon refrigerant, ensuring efficient and eco-friendly cooling.<br>Maintains a temperature range of 33F to 41F, keeping ingredients fresh and properly chilled to ensure food safety.<br>Constructed with durable stainless steel for both the exterior and interior, offering resistance to corrosion, ease of cleaning, and a professional appearance.<br>Includes two solid doors with recessed handles and an interior storage area with adjustable shelving, providing additional storage space and flexible organization options.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/sp48-18m.webp\"]', 'SP48-18M-HC', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 31, 0, 0, 3014.91, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48.00, NULL, 43.00, NULL, 35.00, NULL, 319.00, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:55:15', '2024-12-16 08:19:19', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/sp48-18m.webp', 'physical', '', 1836, 4, 0, 23, 0, 'Three year warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB770\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2463, 'Serv-Ware RF3-HC 81” Stainless Steel Reach-In Refrigerator with 3 Solid Doors, 230v/1ph, 72 cu. ft.', 'The Serv-Ware RF3-HC 81 Stainless Steel Reach-In Refrigerator is a high-capacity commercial refrigeration unit designed for efficiency and durability. Featuring a spacious 72 cubic feet of interior storage, it offers ample room for organizing and storing a large volume of perishable goods. The unit is equipped with three solid doors, each designed to provide easy access while ensuring a tight seal to maintain consistent internal temperatures. Operating on 230v/1ph power, it uses R290 hydrocarbon refrigerant, which is both environmentally friendly and energy-efficient, ensuring reliable cooling performance while minimizing environmental impact.\n\nConstructed from robust stainless steel for both the exterior and interior, the RF3-HC is built to withstand the demands of a busy commercial kitchen. It maintains a temperature range of 33F to 41F, making it ideal for keeping ingredients fresh and properly chilled. The refrigerator also includes high-density polyurethane insulation to enhance energy efficiency and temperature consistency. With its reliable cooling system and durable construction, the RF3-HC is designed to provide long-lasting performance and ease of maintenance in a professional setting.', 'Equipped with a self-contained refrigeration system using R290 hydrocarbon refrigerant, which provides efficient and environmentally friendly cooling.<br>Maintains a temperature range of 33F to 41F, ensuring optimal conditions for the safe storage of perishable items.<br>Offers a spacious 72 cubic feet of interior storage with adjustable shelving, allowing for flexible organization and efficient use of space.<br>Built with durable stainless steel for both the exterior and interior, offering resistance to corrosion, ease of cleaning, and a sleek, professional appearance.<br>Operates on 230 volts with a single-phase power supply, designed for commercial use in environments where higher voltage and power efficiency are required', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/RF3-HC.png\"]', 'RF3-HC', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 31, 0, 0, 6062.65, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 81.00, NULL, 82.00, NULL, 33.00, NULL, 706.00, NULL, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:55:17', '2024-12-16 08:19:19', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/RF3-HC.png', 'physical', '', 3692, 4, 0, 23, 0, 'Three year warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB771\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2464, 'Serv-Ware SHPS-12 12” Stainless Steel  Hotplate with 2 Burners, Gas, 25,000 BTU/H', 'The Serv-Ware SHPS-12 12 Stainless Steel Hotplate is a compact yet powerful gas-operated cooking appliance designed to deliver efficient heat for commercial kitchens. Equipped with two high-output burners, each providing 12,500 BTU/H, the hotplate totals 25,000 BTU/H, allowing for rapid and consistent heating. This makes it ideal for tasks such as sautng, simmering, and heating various dishes. The burners are constructed with durable cast iron, ensuring longevity and resilience under frequent use. The gas-powered design provides precise temperature control, essential for achieving optimal cooking results.\n\nThe hotplate\'s construction features a sturdy stainless steel exterior that resists corrosion and is easy to clean, which is crucial for maintaining hygiene and durability in a busy kitchen environment. Its compact 12-inch size makes it suitable for establishments with limited counter space while still offering the robust performance needed for high-demand cooking. The units design includes a removable drip tray to catch spills and simplify maintenance, further enhancing its practicality and ease of use in a commercial setting.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n', 'Equipped with two burners, each delivering 12,500 BTU/H, providing a total heat output of 25,000 BTU/H for efficient and versatile cooking.<br>Operates on natural gas, offering reliable and consistent heat suitable for a variety of cooking tasks.<br>Features two heavy-duty cast iron burners that provide even heat distribution and durability for high-volume use.<br>Constructed with durable stainless steel for both the body and burners, ensuring resistance to high temperatures, ease of cleaning, and long-lasting performance.<br>Includes individual control knobs for each burner, allowing precise adjustment of heat levels to accommodate different cooking requirements and techniques.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/SHPS-12.webp\"]', 'SHPS-12', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 31, 0, 0, 550.11, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 12.00, NULL, 11.00, NULL, 27.00, NULL, 101.00, NULL, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:55:18', '2024-12-16 08:19:19', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/SHPS-12.webp', 'physical', '', 335, 4, 0, 23, 0, 'Three year warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB772\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
