intenance and long-term reliability.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/SMGS-36.webp\"]', 'SMGS-36', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 31, 0, 0, 1270.99, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36.00, NULL, 15.00, NULL, 25.00, NULL, 315.00, NULL, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:55:19', '2024-12-16 08:19:19', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/SMGS-36.webp', 'physical', '', 774, 4, 0, 23, 0, 'Three year warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB773\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2466, 'Serv-Ware SGF-70N 21\" Stainless Steel 5 tube Fryer, Natural Gas, 30,000 BTU/H', 'The Serv-Ware SGF-70N 21 Stainless Steel 5 Tube Fryer is designed for high-performance frying in commercial kitchens, operating on natural gas with a powerful output of 30,000 BTU/H per burner. This fryer features five tube burners, which collectively provide efficient and intense heat, ensuring rapid cooking and consistent results. The high BTU rating is ideal for handling large volumes of food and maintaining optimal frying temperatures, making it suitable for busy food service environments where quick and reliable frying is essential.\n\nConstructed with durable stainless steel, the SGF-70N offers both robustness and ease of maintenance. The fryer includes a spacious tank capable of holding a substantial amount of oil, enhancing its capacity to handle significant frying tasks. Its manual thermostat allows for precise temperature control, ranging from 200F to 400F, ensuring that various frying needs are met with accuracy. The fryers design also includes a deep cold zone, which helps extend oil life by trapping food particles away from the heating elements, contributing to overall operational efficiency and cost-effectiveness.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n', 'Features five tube burners, each delivering 30,000 BTU/H, providing a total heat output of 150,000 BTU/H for efficient and high-performance frying.<br>Operates on natural gas, offering a reliable and consistent heat source suitable for commercial frying applications.<br>Designed with a large oil capacity, allowing for extended frying periods and reducing the frequency of oil changes, ideal for high-volume use.<br>Equipped with a millivolt thermostat that maintains a temperature range of 200F to 400F, allowing precise control over frying temperatures for optimal cooking results.<br>Made with durable stainless steel for the fryer tank, door, and front, ensuring high resistance to corrosion and high temperatures, and facilitating easy maintenance and long-term durability.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/SGF-70N.webp\"]', 'SGF-70N', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 31, 0, 0, 2216, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 21.00, NULL, 47.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 187.00, NULL, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:55:20', '2024-12-16 08:19:19', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/SGF-70N.webp', 'physical', '', 1350, 4, 0, 23, 0, 'Three year warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB774\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2467, 'Serv-Ware SGR-6B 36\" Stainless Steel 6 Burner Range with 2 Ovens, Natural Gas, 31,000 BTU', 'The Serv-Ware SGR-6B 36\" Stainless Steel 6 Burner Range with 2 Ovens is a versatile and high-performance commercial cooking appliance designed for demanding kitchen environments. It operates on natural gas and features six heavy-duty burners, each delivering 31,000 BTU, providing robust and reliable heat for efficient cooking. The range\'s powerful burners ensure quick and even heating, ideal for preparing a wide variety of dishes.\n\nThe range is constructed from durable stainless steel, offering both longevity and ease of maintenance. It includes two spacious ovens with a total of 31,000 BTU each, providing ample cooking capacity for baking, roasting, and other oven-based cooking methods. The ovens feature a temperature range suitable for various culinary needs, from low-temperature simmering to high-temperature roasting. The combination of high BTU burners and efficient ovens makes the Serv-Ware SGR-6B a versatile choice for commercial kitchens, catering to high-volume cooking demands with reliability and efficiency.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n', 'Features six powerful burners, each delivering 31,000 BTU, providing high heat output for efficient and versatile cooking.<br>Includes two ovens with separate temperature controls, offering additional cooking space and flexibility for baking, roasting, or broiling.<br>Operates on natural gas, ensuring reliable and consistent heat for both the burners and ovens.<br>Constructed with durable stainless steel for the exterior and interior, ensuring resistance to high temperatures, ease of cleaning, and long-lasting performance in commercial kitchens.<br>Each burner has its own individual control knob, and the ovens are equipped with thermostats, allowing precise control over cooking temperatures to accommodate various cooking requirements.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/SGR-6B.webp\"]', 'SGR-6B', 0