(2468, 'Serv-Ware SGF-50N 16\" Stainless Steel 4 Tube Fryer, Natural Gas,120,000 BTU/H', '<p>The Serv-Ware SGF-50N 16 Stainless Steel 4 Tube Fryer is a high-performance commercial fryer designed for efficient and heavy-duty frying operations. With four tube burners delivering a total of 120,000 BTU/H, this fryer ensures rapid and even heating, making it ideal for high-volume cooking environments. The use of natural gas as the fuel source provides reliable and powerful heat, essential for achieving consistent cooking results and meeting the demands of a busy kitchen. Constructed from durable stainless steel, the SGF-50N features a robust build that withstands the rigors of frequent use and high temperatures. It includes a sizable 50-pound oil capacity, allowing for substantial quantities of fried food to be prepared with less frequent oil changes. The fryer is equipped with a precise millivolt thermostat, offering temperature control from 200F to 400F to suit various frying needs. Its design incorporates safety features such as a high-limit thermostat and a temperature probe, ensuring safe operation and preventing overheating, making it a reliable choice for commercial food service operations.</p>', '<ul><li>Equipped with four tube burners, each delivering 30,000 BTU/H, providing a total heat output of 120,000 BTU/H for fast and efficient frying.<br> </li><li>Operates on natural gas, offering a reliable and powerful heat source suitable for high-volume frying tasks.<br> </li><li>Designed with a 50-pound oil capacity, allowing for large batch frying and reducing the need for frequent oil changes.<br> </li><li>Features a millivolt thermostat with a temperature range from 200F to 400F, providing precise control over frying temperatures for optimal cooking results.<br> </li><li>Built with durable stainless steel for the tank, door, and front, ensuring longevity, easy maintenance, and resistance to high temperatures and corrosion.</li></ul>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/