(2470, 'Serv-Ware RR1-HC 26.8\' Stainless Steel 1 Solid Door Reach-In Refrigerator, 115v/1ph, 23 cu.ft', 'The Serv-Ware RR1-HC 26.8 Stainless Steel 1 Solid Door Reach-In Refrigerator is designed for efficiency and durability in commercial kitchens. Operating on a 115V/1ph power supply, this refrigerator features a self-contained refrigeration system utilizing R290 hydrocarbon refrigerant. This eco-friendly refrigerant ensures effective cooling while minimizing environmental impact. The unit maintains a temperature range of 33F to 41F, which is ideal for preserving a wide variety of refrigerated goods while maintaining optimal food safety.\n\nConstructed with a stainless steel exterior and interior, the RR1-HC offers robust durability and ease of maintenance, ensuring it withstands the demands of a busy kitchen environment. With 23 cubic feet of storage capacity, it includes adjustable shelving to provide flexible organization and maximize storage efficiency. The unit is also designed with high-density, foamed-in-place polyurethane insulation and a self-closing door with a magnetic gasket, which contribute to energy efficiency and consistent internal temperatures, reducing operating costs and maintaining the quality of stored products.', 'Utilizes a self-contained refrigeration system with R290 hydrocarbon refrigerant, providing efficient and environmentally friendly cooling performance.<br>Maintains a temperature range of 33F to 41F, ensuring optimal conditions for storing perishable goods and keeping them fresh.<br>Built with a sturdy stainless steel exterior and interior, which offers durability, resistance to corrosion, and ease of maintenance.<br>Offers 23 cubic feet of storage space with adjustable shelving, allowing for flexible organization and efficient use of the interior space.<br>Features high-density, foamed-in-place polyurethane insulation and a self-closing door with a magnetic gasket, enhancing energy efficiency and maintaining consistent internal temperatures.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/RR1-HC-3.webp\"]', 'RR1-HC', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 31, 0, 0, 2381.05, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 27.00, NULL, 82.00, NULL, 33.00, NULL, 314.00, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-12-13 12:55:26', '2024-12-16 08:19:19', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/RR1-HC-3.webp', 'physical', '', 1450, 4, 0, 23, 0, 'Three year warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB778\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2471, 'Serv-Ware RF1-HC  26.8”  Stainless Steel 1 Solid Door Reach-In Freezer, 115v/1ph,  23 cu. ft.', 'The Serv-Ware RF1-HC 26.8 Stainless Steel 1 Solid Door Reach-In Freezer is designed for commercial kitchens that require efficient and reliable freezing capabilities. With a total storage capacity of 23 cubic feet, this reach-in freezer provides ample space to accommodate a variety of frozen goods. It is equipped with a top-mounted refrigeration system that uses R290 hydrocarbon refrigerant, offering both energy efficiency and eco-friendly operation. The freezer operates on a 115V/1Ph electrical system, making it suitable for standard commercial kitchen setups.\n\nConstructed with durable stainless steel for both the exterior and interior, the RF1-HC is built to withstand the rigors of daily use while maintaining a sleek, professional appearance. The unit includes a digital thermostat and LED display, allowing precise temperature control and easy monitoring with a range of -10F to 0F. Additionally, the high-density, foamed-in-place polyurethane insulation ensures optimal temperature retention and energy efficiency. The solid door features a self-closing design with a magnetic gasket to maintain a tight seal, further enhancing its energy-saving capabilities and maintaining consistent internal temperatures.\n\n\n\n\n\n', 'Equipped with a self-contained refrigeration system using R290 hydrocarbon refrigerant for efficient and environmentally friendly cooling.<br>Maintains a temperature range of -10F to 0F, ensuring reliable freezing conditions for optimal food preservation and safety.<br>Features a durable stainless steel exterior and interior, which enhances the units longevity and ease of cleaning while maintaining a professional appearance.<br>Provides 23 cubic feet of storage space with adjustable shelving, allowing for flexible organization of frozen items and efficient use of available space.<br>Includes high-density, foamed-in-place polyurethane insulation and a self-closing door with a magnetic gasket, optimizing energy efficiency and maintaining consistent internal temperatures.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/RF1-HC.webp\"]', 'RF1-HC', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 31, 0, 0, 2985.35, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 27.00, NULL, 82.00, NULL, 33.00, NULL, 320.00, NULL, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:55:27', '2024-12-16 08:19:19', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/RF1-HC.webp', 'physical', '', 1818, 4, 0, 23, 0, 'Three year warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB779\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2472, 'Serv-Ware RR2-HC 53.9” Stainles Steel 2 Door Refrigerator. 115v/1ph, 49 cu. ft', 'The Serv-Ware RR2-HC 53.9 Stainless Steel 2 Door Refrigerator is a high-performance commercial refrigeration unit designed for durability and efficiency. It features a spacious 49 cubic feet of storage capacity, making it ideal for restaurants, cafeterias, and other food service environments that require ample refrigerated storage. The refrigerator is equipped with a powerful, top-mounted, self-contained refrigeration system that uses R290 hydrocarbon refrigerant, an environmentally friendly option that offers superior cooling performance while reducing environmental impact. The digital thermostat allows for precise temperature control, ensuring that stored items remain at the optimal temperature range of 33F to 38F.\n\nConstructed from heavy-duty stainless steel on both the exterior and interior, this refrigerator is built to withstand the demands of a commercial kitchen while being easy to clean and maintain. The unit includes six adjustable, heavy-duty wire shelves, providing flexible storage options to accommodate a variety of items. The two solid doors are self-closing, which helps to maintain internal temperatures and improve energy efficiency. Additionally, the doors are fitted with heavy-duty handles and locks, ensuring security and ease of use. The high-density foamed-in-place polyurethane insulation further enhances energy efficiency by providing superior temperature retention. With its robust construction and advanced features, the Serv-Ware RR2-HC is a reliable choice for any commercial refrigeration need.', 'Features a self-contained, top-mounted refrigeration system using environmentally friendly R290 hydrocarbon refrigerant, ensuring efficient cooling with minimal environmental impact.<br>Equipped with a digital thermostat and display, providing a temperature range of 33F to 41F, suitable for safely storing a wide variety of perishable items.<br>Constructed with a stainless steel interior and exterior for enhanced durability, corrosion resistance, and easy cleaning, making it ideal for commercial kitchens.<br>Offers 49 cubic feet of storage space with six adjustable, heavy-duty wire shelves, allowing for flexible organization of refrigerated goods.<br>Designed with high-density, foamed-in-place polyurethane insulation and self-closing doors with magnetic gaskets, ensuring excellent temperature retention and energy efficiency.', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/RR2-HC_ee336df4-265d-4618-b3bc-50fc969f3f01.webp\"]', 'RR2-HC', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 31, 0, 0, 3323.62, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 54.00, NULL, 82.00, NULL, 33.00, NULL, 460.00, NULL, NULL, 3, '2024-12-13 12:55:28', '2024-12-16 08:19:19', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/RR2-HC_ee336df4-265d-4618-b3bc-50fc969f3f01.webp', 'physical', '', 2024, 4, 0, 23, 0, 'Three year warranty', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB780\"}]', '[]', '[]', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(2473, 'Serv-Ware SGF-40L 15.5” Stainless Steel 3 Tube Fryer LPG Gas, 30,000 BTU/H', '<p>The Serv-Ware SGF-40L 15.5 Stainless Steel 3 Tube Fryer is a high-performance commercial kitchen appliance designed to meet the demands of busy foodservice environments. This fryer is equipped with three powerful heat tubes, each delivering 30,000 BTU per hour, ensuring rapid heat recovery and consistent frying temperatures. The heat exchange tubes are strategically positioned to maximize heat transfer and efficiency, allowing for quicker cooking times and better fuel economy. The fryer features a large oil capacity, accommodating up to 40 pounds, making it suitable for high-volume frying applications. Constructed with a durable stainless steel body, the SGF-40L is built to withstand the rigors of daily use while being easy to clean and maintain. The precision-engineered temperature control system allows for accurate adjustments, ensuring that food is cooked to perfection every time. The fryer also includes safety features such as a high-limit thermostat that prevents overheating and a built-in drain valve for safe and easy oil removal. Additionally, the fryer comes with two heavy-duty fryer baskets, each with a cool-touch handle, to ensure safe handling during operation. This robust and reliable fryer is an excellent choice for restaurants, catering services, and other commercial kitchens that require efficient and consistent frying capabilities.</p>', '<p>Equipped with three tube burners, each delivering 30,000 BTU/H, providing a total heat output of 90,000 BTU/H for rapid and consistent frying performance.<br>The fryer has a 40-pound oil capacity, allowing for high-volume frying, making it ideal for busy commercial kitchens.<br>Features a millivolt thermostat with a temperature range of 200F to 400F, enabling precise control over frying temperatures for various food items.<br>Built with a heavy-duty stainless steel tank, door, front, and sides, ensuring durability, easy cleaning, and resistance to corrosion.<br>Includes a built-in high-limit safety thermostat and a temperature probe for accurate heat monitoring, preventing overheating and ensuring safe operation.</p>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/RR2-HC.webp\"]', 'SGF-40L', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 31, 0, 0, 1134.69, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 16.00, NULL, 47.00, NULL, 30.00, NULL, 161.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:55:29', '2024-12-16 08:19:19', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/RR2-HC.webp', 'physical', NULL, 691, 4, 0, 23, 0, '<p>Three year warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/xwm2DTtmSKTtMEkScM8sEkoK91zQhvyyU6XIpCPJ.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/YFwvUv7rpEzN9MxTZBBmTcEFCjjjcXOYqHA7PLlU.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/2wTbU49bCcprnxpbTWcwzLCmZ1vaVERNcGOF0g8y.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/TAUffIgIwoiGRDQUjqS3vLsGYoXgtt8w8bATkXI1.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB781\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
