(2474, 'Serv-Ware RF2-HC 53.9” Stainless Steel Two Door Reach-In Freezer, 49 cu.ft', '<p>The Serv-Ware RF2-HC is a robust 53.9 stainless steel two-door reach-in freezer with a substantial storage capacity of 49 cubic feet. This commercial-grade freezer is designed to meet the high demands of food service environments, featuring a heavy-duty stainless steel exterior and interior, ensuring durability and easy maintenance. The unit is equipped with two self-closing doors with a stay-open feature for convenience during loading and unloading. It also includes six adjustable, heavy-duty wire shelves that maximize storage space and provide flexibility to accommodate various products. This freezer operates with an environmentally friendly R290 hydrocarbon refrigerant, which is more efficient and has a lower environmental impact compared to traditional refrigerants. The digital temperature control system maintains consistent temperatures between -8F and 0F, ensuring that products remain frozen at the ideal temperature. The RF2-HC is also equipped with a powerful, bottom-mounted compressor that provides excellent cooling performance while being easy to service. Additionally, the unit features high-density polyurethane insulation for superior energy efficiency, contributing to lower operating costs.</p>', '<ul><li>Digital thermostat with a temperature range of -10F to 0F, ensuring precise and consistent freezing conditions.<br>Features a top-mounted, self-contained refrigeration system with environmentally friendly R290 hydrocarbon refrigerant for efficient and eco-friendly operation.</li><li>Durable stainless steel exterior and interior, offering long-lasting durability and easy cleaning while maintaining a professional appearance.</li><li>49 cubic feet of storage with six adjustable, heavy-duty wire shelves to accommodate a variety of products and organizational needs.</li><li>Equipped with two self-closing, lockable solid doors with heavy-duty handles, and high-density foamed-in-place polyurethane insulation for maximum energy efficiency and temperature retention.</li></ul>', 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/RF2-HC.webp\"]', 'RF2-HC', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 31, 0, 0, 4253.05, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 54.00, NULL, 82.00, NULL, 33.00, NULL, 488.00, 1, NULL, 2, '2024-12-13 12:55:30', '2024-12-27 12:23:09', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/RF2-HC.webp', 'physical', NULL, 2590, 4, 0, 23, 0, '<p>Three year warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"Manual\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/5Rs8Htz89u5OxkUE5cuIXhiQAdKX9PtlYqS4QtLE.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Specsheet\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/7JfZFxK5Ykf5nDrAoC7eOL7CKIIc2Tp8aXQJduZp.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB782\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2475, 'Midea 1025F0A 20.13\"  Commercial Microwave Oven with Manual Controls, Stainless Steel, 120v/1ph, 1000W, 0.9cu. ft.', '<p>The Midea 1025F0A 20.13\" Stainless Steel Commercial Microwave Oven is a durable and compact appliance tailored for light-duty commercial use. With a 0.9 cu. ft. interior capacity, it accommodates various food items, while its 1,000-watt output ensures efficient heating. Designed with manual controls and an AutoRest feature, it provides straightforward and reliable operation. Measuring 20-1/8\" wide, 17\" deep, and 12-1/4\" high, this microwave fits seamlessly into tight kitchen spaces, and its stainless steel construction adds durability and easy maintenance. It features a 15-amp power draw, operates at 120 volts and 60 Hz, and connects via a NEMA 5-15P plug, making it a practical choice for commercial environments.</p>', '<p>Dimensions: Measuring 20-1/8\" wide, 17\" deep, and 12-1/4\" high, this microwave is compact, making it ideal for limited countertop spaces in commercial kitchens, offices, and other professional settings.<br>Stainless Steel Construction: The exterior and interior are made of stainless steel, ensuring durability, easy cleaning, and resistance to rust or wear from frequent use.<br>Interior Size: With a 0.9 cubic foot chamber, the microwave accommodates small to medium-sized dishes, containers, or plates, suitable for quick food preparation in high-turnover environments.<br>Interior Dimensions: A spacious cavity with a width of 12-7/8\", depth of 13-5/8\", and height of 7-7/8\", provides flexibility to fit various cookware.<br>Cooking Power: Offers 1000 watts of output power, providing consistent and efficient cooking, reheating, or defrosting.<br>Bottom Energy Feed: Direct energy feed ensures faster and more even heating by placing the food closer to the source of microwaves, minimizing energy loss.<br>Simple Dial Operation: Manual controls allow for quick and intuitive operation, making it user-friendly and ideal for staff with varying skill levels.<br>No Complex Programming: Eliminates the need for complicated settings, streamlining the cooking process for busy kitchens.<br>AutoRest Technology: Automatically resets the microwave to a default ready state after each use, ensuring reliability and seamless operation in high-demand environments.<br>Voltage: Operates at 120 volts, compatible with standard outlets, requiring no special installation.<br>Plug Type: Equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug, allowing for easy setup in most commercial or residential spaces.<br>Amperage: Requires 15 amps, offering efficiency without overloading circuits.<br>Frequency: Designed to run on 60 Hertz, ensuring optimal performance in North American electrical systems.<br>Weight: Weighing only 32.4 lbs, the unit is relatively lightweight for its class, allowing for easy relocation or adjustments on countertops.<br>8. Commercial-Grade Build: Designed to withstand the rigors of heavy usage in restaurants, cafes, breakrooms, and other professional settings, maintaining performance and longevity.<br>Space-Saving: Compact design fits into tight spaces while still providing ample cooking capacity.<br>Durable and Easy to Clean: Stainless steel construction is both practical and aesthetically pleasing, simplifying maintenance.<br>User-Friendly: Manual dials and AutoRest functionality make it easy to use, even for those unfamiliar with advanced digital controls.<br>Efficient Cooking: Bottom energy feed and 1000W power reduces wait times and provides practicality, durability, and efficiency.</p>', 'published', '[\"products\\/1025f0a.webp\",\"products\\/1025f0a-2-1.webp\",\"products\\/1025f0a-3.webp\"]', '1025F0A', 0, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 29, 0, 0, 318.6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 20.00, NULL, 12.00, NULL, 17.00, NULL, 36.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-13 12:56:17', '2024-12-30 07:35:55', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'https://testhssite.com/storage/products/1025F0A.jpg', 'physical', NULL, 270, 4, 0, 21, 0, '<p>Three year warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, '', NULL, '', '', 0, NULL, 1, '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"invoice-INV-7 (1)\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/676ffd47ab481_invoice-INV-7 (1).pdf\"},{\"title\":\"invoice-INV-7 - Copy (2)\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/676ffd47abe96_invoice-INV-7 - Copy (2).pdf\"},{\"title\":\"invoice-INV-7 - Copy (3)\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/676ffd47ac587_invoice-INV-7 - Copy (3).pdf\"},{\"title\":\"invoice-INV-7 - Copy (4)\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/676ffd47acc93_invoice-INV-7 - Copy (4).pdf\"},{\"title\":\"invoice-INV-7 - Copy\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/676ffd47ad357_invoice-INV-7 - Copy.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"invoice-INV-7\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/676ffd47ada09_invoice-INV-7.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, '[{\"value\":\"64910K\"},{\"value\":\" SSTW-2424\"},{\"value\":\" C-RB783\"}]', '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, NULL, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2477, 'The Menumaster RCS511TS microwave delivers 1100W power with a 34L capacity and durable stainless-steel designperfect for small to medium kitchens.', '<p>The Menumaster microwave RCS511DSE offers a spacious 34L capacity with external dimensions of 352(H) x 559(W) x 483(D) mm and an internal cooking area of 216(H) x 368(W) x 381(D) mm, providing ample space for large, bulky loads, allowing you to cook more at once and save time. Made with durable stainless steel, this microwave operates with a power output of 1.55 kW, 230/240V, and 13A, and weighs 19 kg. The easy-to-clean, removable filters come with cleaning reminders to maintain peak efficiency, while the easy-open door provides simple and convenient access to food. The intuitive dial control makes it user-friendly for quick operation, and its stackable design helps maximize output without taking up additional workspace, with the stacking kit included. Built for long-lasting operation, this microwave is constructed with heavy-duty materials to withstand the demands of busy kitchens.</p>', '<ul><li>34L Capacity: Ideal for cooking large, bulky loads to save time. </li><li>Compact Size: External dimensions of 352(H) x 559(W) x 483(D) mm with a cooking area of 216(H) x 368(W) x 381(D) mm. </li><li>1.55 kW Power Output: Efficient cooking with 230/240V, 13A power. Durable Stainless Steel: Long-lasting and easy to clean. </li><li>Removable Filters: Includes cleaning reminders for efficient performance. </li><li>User-Friendly Dial Control: Easy to operate for quick cooking. </li><li>Stackable Design: Saves space and maximizes kitchen output with the stacking kit included.</li></ul>', 'published', '[\"products\\/menumaster-stainless-steel-electric-1100w-microwave-with-10-programmable-pads-and-34l-capacity-5-pow.webp\"]', '12345', 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 13, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 1, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, NULL, 0, '2024-12-27 13:14:45', '2024-12-30 06:31:41', 'in_stock', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', NULL, 'physical', NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '<p>1 Year Warranty</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"title\":\"invoice-INV-7\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/676ffd47aecd3_invoice-INV-7.pdf\"}]', NULL, '[]', 0, NULL, 'Kg', NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 0.00, 1, NULL, '[\"\"]', '[\"\"]', 'non-refundable', NULL, 1, 'Color', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
