('ar', 1514, 'Berjaya MIR11 Electric Mini Infrared Food Warmer, Power 510W, 61.5 X 33.5 X 42 cm', '<ul><li>Versatile stainless steel design offers durability and a contemporary aesthetic for diverse kitchens.</li><li>Compact dimensions of 61.5 x 33.5 cm and 42 cm height fit small spaces.</li><li>Efficient 510W electric power ensures gentle, consistent warmth for optimal food serving.</li><li>User-friendly with removable tempered glass doors, enhancing accessibility and seamless cleaning.</li><li>Ideal for buffets, catering, and small kitchens, maintaining culinary quality.</li></ul>', NULL),
