('ar', 1567, 'True STA1RPT-2HG-1S-HC 27 1/2\" Stainless Steel and Aluminum Spec Series One Section Pass Thru Refrigerator, 2 Glass Doors,1 Solid Door, Right Hinge, 115v', '', ''),
('ar', 1568, 'Everest Refrigeration EBB48-SS 49 Inch Stainless Steel Two Section Solid Door Back Bar Cooler 14 Cubic Feet', '', ''),
('ar', 1569, 'Arctic Air ABB48 48\" Double Door Solid Back Bar Refrigerator', '<p>The Arctic Air ABB48 Double Door Back Bar Refrigerator is designed for durability and efficiency, featuring a 1.5” thick solid foamed stainless steel top and a 24” depth to conserve workspace. Inside, the stainless steel duct system ensures even cooling, powered by a self-contained capillary tube system using eco-friendly R290 Hydrocarbon gas. The electronic thermostat with LED display provides precise control, while the LED lighting and bright stainless steel interior enhance visibility and cleanliness. Its black powder-coated exterior is built for longevity, and the front-accessible condensing unit simplifies maintenance. This refrigerator is NSF Standard 7 compliant for open food storage and comes with a two-year parts and labor warranty, plus a five-year compressor warranty. Equipped with easy-to-mount plate casters, locking doors, and removable magnetic gaskets, it offers convenience and security in busy bar environments. </p><p>Weight & Dimensions </p><p>Shipping Weight: 280 lb. </p><p>Width: 49 Inches </p><p>Depth: 24 Inches </p><p>Height: 39.5 Inches</p>', '<ul><li>Measures 49\" in width, 24\" in depth, and 39 1/2\" in height, providing 12.5 cubic feet of storage. It can hold up to 48 six-packs, making it ideal for high-volume beverage storage.<br> </li><li>Running at 4.3 amps with 60 Hz and 115V/1 phase, it is energy-efficient and compatible with standard electrical outlets using a NEMA 5-15P plug.<br> </li><li>Maintains a temperature range of 33°F to 41°F, ensuring beverages remain cool and fresh, with efficient front-breathing technology for optimal performance.<br> </li><li>Built with a black exterior finish, the unit is durable and visually appealing. The solid swing doors help maintain internal temperatures, while the LED lighting ensures easy visibility inside.<br> </li><li>Side-mounted, 1/3 HP compressor allows for convenient access and easy maintenance. Its front-breathing design requires no rear clearance, making it perfect for tight spaces.<br> </li><li>Equipped with casters, the refrigerator can be easily moved and repositioned, providing flexibility in busy environments.<br>It includes 4 adjustable shelves, allowing for flexible storage of items and maximizing the internal space.<br> </li><li>Uses R-290 refrigerant, which is environmentally responsible and energy-efficient, reducing the impact on the environment while ensuring high performance.<br> </li><li>Designed with a solid, black exterior and front-swinging doors, it ensures long-lasting use, and the LED lighting enhances interior visibility, making it easy to locate items quickly.<br> </li><li>Shipped with a weight of 280 lbs and is backed by a 1-year limited parts warranty, ensuring durability and reliability for commercial use.</li></ul>'),
('ar', 1570, 'Arctic Air 69436 Can Divider with Four Mounting Clips for AUB Models Only', 'The Arctic Air 69436 is a specialized can divider designed specifically for AUB models, offering enhanced organization and accessibility for canned goods. It contains one shelf along with four mounting clips, ensuring secure installation and stability. With a shipping weight of 6 lbs and a product weight of 6 lbs, it is lightweight and strong, making it a practical addition to your storage setup.\nCrafted to fit perfectly with the vertical divider system of AUB models, it optimizes space within refrigeration units, allowing for efficient storage and easy retrieval of cans. Its design promotes better organization, minimizing clutter and maximizing the use of vertical space. By incorporating this divider, users can streamline their food storage operations while maintaining a clean and professional appearance in their kitchens.\nWeight & Dimensions\nShipping Weight 6 lbs\nProduct Weight 6 lbs\n\n\n', '<li>Shipping weight of the can divider is 6 lbs, making it lightweight and easy to handle during transportation.<br></li><li>Poduct weight is also 6 lbs, ensuring that it is a compact and efficient addition to your refrigeration setup.<br></li><li>Set contains one shelf and four mounting clips, providing all necessary parts for installation and use.<br></li><li>Specifically designed to fit AUB models only, ensuring a perfect fit and optimal functionality.<br></li><li>Vertical divider design helps organize cans and other items efficiently, maximizing space within your refrigeration unit.<br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1571, 'Arctic Air ABB72G 73\" Triple Glass Door Back Bar Refrigerator', 'The Arctic Air ABB72G is a well-designed 73-inch triple glass door back bar refrigerator, constructed with a 1.59-inch solid foamed stainless steel top that adds durability and a professional appearance. It features a self-contained capillary tube system that utilizes environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant (R290), promoting a more sustainable operation. The front-accessible condensing unit allows for easy cleaning and maintenance, while the front-breathing design ensures optimal air circulation. Standard features include easy-to-mount lockable casters, an electronic thermostat with a digital LED display for precise temperature control, and removable magnetic gaskets on each door for easy cleaning.\nDesigned to conserve valuable workspace, it has a depth of 24 inches and includes interior LED lighting to enhance visibility. The interior showcases a mirror finish stainless steel with a high-grade coved corner floor for easy cleaning, while the exterior features a black powder-coated steel front and sides, ensuring both style and sturdiness. This model has been tested to meet NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage, making it an ideal choice for bars and restaurants that prioritize both functionality and compliance with health standards. The overall dimensions are 73.125 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39.625 inches in height.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 73.125”\nDepth: 24\"\nHeight: 39.625”\nShipping Weight 410 lbs\n', '<li>Shipping weight is 410 lbs, indicating a solid construction suitable for commercial use.<br></li><li>It has a width of 73 inches, a depth of 24 inches, and a height of 39 1/2 inches, making it a spacious option for storing beverages.<br></li><li>Nominal depth is classified as standard, ensuring compatibility with typical bar setups.<br></li><li>Operates on 3 amps, at 60 hertz, with a 1-phase power supply of 115 volts, making it efficient for bar environments.<br></li><li>Can accommodate up to 84 six-packs, with an overall capacity of 20.7 cubic feet, providing wide storage for various beverages.<br></li><li>It comes with casters, allowing for easy movement and positioning within your establishment.<br></li><li>Compressor is side-mounted and features front breathing, ensuring efficient airflow and easy access for maintenance.<br></li><li>Features three swing doors made of glass, providing visibility to the contents, while the exterior finish is rich black, complementing various bar aesthetics.<br></li><li>Includes LED lighting for enhanced visibility of stored items, contributing to a stylish presentation.<br></li><li>Operates on R-290 refrigerant and maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees Fahrenheit, ensuring optimal beverage storage conditions.<br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1572, 'Arctic Air AGF36 36\" Black Glass Froster with Sliding Lid', 'The Arctic Air AGF36 Black Glass Froster offers an efficient solution for keeping glasses and mugs chilled, ideal for busy bar environments. This 36-inch unit comes with a sliding lid for easy access, while its 6.7 cu. ft. capacity provides wide space. The froster features a bottom-mounted compressor for optimized airflow and quick cooling. Its durable black exterior finish complements modern setups, and the 1/5 horsepower compressor runs on R-290 refrigerant, an environmentally friendly option.\nDesigned for freestanding installation, this frosted runs on 120 volts with a NEMA 5-15P plug and includes casters for mobility. The sliding door style ensures quick access to contents, while the electric power type delivers consistent performance. Built for convenience, it is perfect for rapid glass frosting, ensuring beverages are served at ideal temperatures. The unit\'s compact size at 36 ¾\" wide, 27\" deep, and 36 ½\" high makes it a practical choice for bars with limited space.\nWeight & Dimensions\nShipping Weight: 195 lb.\nWidth: 36 3/4 Inches\nDepth: 27 Inches\nHeight: 36 1/2 Inches', '<li>Measures 36 3/4\" in width, 27\" in depth, and 36 1/2\" in height, offering 6.7 cubic feet of frosted glass storage, making it perfect for chilling glasses and mugs.<br></li><li>Operating at 120 volts and powered by a NEMA 5-15P plug, this froster is designed for efficient performance while connecting to standard electrical outlets.<br></li><li>Featuring a bottom-mounted, 1/5 HP compressor, it ensures consistent frost performance, keeping glasses cold while maximizing space for easy maintenance.<br></li><li>Uses R-290 refrigerant, an environmentally responsible option that enhances energy efficiency and helps reduce environmental impact.<br></li><li>Freestanding and comes equipped with casters, allowing for easy movement and repositioning, making it convenient for busy environments or relocating as needed.<br></li><li>Built with a rich black finish, this froster is visually appealing and designed to complement modern bar setups while providing durability for commercial use.<br></li><li>Sliding door style ensures easy access to the interior while minimizing the amount of space needed to open the froster, which is particularly helpful in tight areas.<br></li><li>Freestanding installation type offers versatility, making it easy to set up in various locations without requiring built-in installation, ideal for bars and restaurants.<br></li><li>Electric-powered, ensuring reliable and continuous operation, perfect for establishments that need to keep glassware frosted consistently throughout the day.<br></li><li>Ships with a weight of 195 lbs, making it solid enough to endure the demands of a commercial environment while being manageable for shipping and installation.</li>'),
('ar', 1573, 'Arctic Air AGF24 24\" Black Glass Froster with Sliding Lid', 'The Arctic Air AGF24 24\" Black Glass Froster is a compact, space-efficient unit perfect for bars and restaurants aiming to serve perfectly chilled glasses. With a 4.3 cu. ft. capacity and a sliding lid for easy access, it allows quick glass frosts in high-demand environments. The unit is designed for freestanding installation, runs on 120 volts, and includes casters for mobility. Its bottom-mounted compressor and 1/5 horsepower motor use R-290 refrigerant, making it an eco-friendly option. The durable black exterior offers a sleek, modern look.\nAt 24 inches wide, 27 inches deep, and 36 ½ inches high, this froster is ideal for smaller setups without sacrificing performance. Its NEMA 5-15P plug ensures easy connection, and the electric power type guarantees consistent operation. The froster\'s strong construction, combined with its sliding door design, makes it both practical and durable for long-term use. Its lightweight build and 155 lb. shipping weight further enhance its portability and ease of installation.\nWeight & Dimensions\nShipping Weight: 155 lbs\nWidth: 24 Inches\nDepth: 27 Inches\nHeight: 36 1/2 Inches', '<li>The Arctic Air AGF24 measures 24\" in width, 27\" in depth, and 36 1/2\" in height, with a storage capacity of 4.3 cubic feet, providing wide room for frosted glassware.<br></li><li>Operates on 120 volts and is equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug, allowing for easy connection to standard electrical outlets and ensuring efficient, reliable performance.<br></li><li>With a bottom-mounted, 1/5 HP compressor, it offers consistent and effective cooling, keeping your glasses perfectly frosted for any bar or restaurant needs.<br></li><li>Uses R-290 refrigerant, an eco-friendly choice that provides efficient cooling while being compliant with environmental standards, contributing to energy savings.<br></li><li>Equipped with casters, allowing for convenient mobility and repositioning. These casters make it easy to move the froster when necessary or clean around it.<br></li><li>Finished in a rich black exterior, the Arctic Air AGF24 provides a stylish, modern appearance while maintaining durability for commercial use in high-traffic environments.<br></li><li>The sliding door allows easy access to frosted glasses without needing extra space to open a hinged door, making it ideal for small or crowded bar areas.<br></li><li>Designed for freestanding installation, this froster does not require complex mounting, allowing it to be easily placed wherever needed.<br></li><li>Powered by electricity, the froster ensures reliable operation, maintaining the right temperature to keep glasses chilled at all times.<br></li><li>Ships with a weight of 155 lbs, ensuring it is solid enough to withstand the rigors of commercial environments while being manageable for installation.</li>'),
('ar', 1574, 'Arctic Air AUB65R 65\" Slide Top Bottle Cooler', 'The Arctic Air AUB65R 65\" Slide Top Bottle Cooler is designed for efficient beverage storage and display, featuring a generous 19 cu. ft. capacity that holds up to 22 cases of 12 oz. bottles. It operates within a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees Fahrenheit, ensuring beverages are kept at optimal serving temperatures. With a solid stainless steel lid, this cooler includes three lids and three dividers for organized storage, making it easy to access drinks.\nBuilt with a side-mounted compressor and a 1/2 horsepower motor, it runs on 120 volts, drawing 3 amps at 60 Hertz. The unit\'s black exterior finish gives it a sleek, professional appearance, while the front-breathing design allows for versatile placement. Casters provide mobility, facilitating easy relocation, and the construction is designed for durability, ensuring it withstands the rigors of a busy environment. The NEMA 5-15P plug and R-290 refrigerant contributes to its efficient and environmentally friendly operation. With a shipping weight of 365 lb., this cooler combines strong functionality with aesthetic appeal for any bar or restaurant setting.\nWeight & Dimensions\nShipping Weight: 365 lbs\nWidth: 49 1/2 Inches\nDepth: 27 Inches\nHeight: 36 1/2 Inches', '<li>The Arctic Air AUB65R measures 49 1/2\" in width, 27\" in depth, and 36 1/2\" in height, providing a generous 19 cubic feet of storage space for a substantial number of beverages.<br></li><li>Operating on 120 volts, this cooler is designed for a 1-phase system, drawing 3 amps at 60 hertz, making it compatible with standard commercial electrical setups.<br></li><li>Features a 1/2 HP compressor located on the side, ensuring effective and consistent cooling performance while maintaining a temperature range of 33°F to 41°F, ideal for keeping beverages at optimal serving temperatures.<br></li><li>Utilizing R-290 refrigerant, the cooler is environmentally friendly and energy-efficient, aligning with modern sustainability standards.<br></li><li>Equipped with casters, it is easy to move, allowing for flexible placement in any bar or restaurant setting, and making it convenient for cleaning or rearranging your space.<br></li><li>Cooler has a rich black exterior finish, ensuring it not only blends well in various settings but also withstands the wear and tear of a busy commercial environment.<br></li><li>Featuring slide-top doors, this design provides easy access to drinks, allowing quick service during busy hours. The cooler is constructed with stainless steel, ensuring durability and resistance to rust and corrosion.<br></li><li>Can hold up to 22 cases of 12 oz. bottles, making it an efficient solution for high-volume beverage service, perfect for bars, restaurants, or events.<br></li><li>It comes with 3 dividers that help organize different types of beverages, along with 3 solid lids to maintain temperature and minimize energy loss while enhancing accessibility. The unit uses a NEMA 5-15P plug type, ensuring compatibility with standard outlets.<br></li><li>Weighing in at 365 lbs, this strong unit is built to withstand heavy usage while providing wide storage for a variety of bottled beverages.</li>'),
('ar', 1575, 'Arctic Air AUB36R 36\" Slide Top Bottle Cooler', 'The Arctic Air AUB36R 36\" Slide Top Bottle Cooler is designed for efficient beverage storage, featuring a capacity of 9.3 cu. ft. to hold up to 11 cases of 12 oz. bottles. It operates within a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees Fahrenheit, ensuring optimal beverage cooling. The cooler includes a stainless steel solid lid with one lid for easy access and organization.\nMeasuring 37 inches in width, 27 inches in depth, and 36.5 inches in height, it is powered by a 3/8 horsepower compressor that runs on 120 volts with an amperage of 1.8 amps at 60 Hertz. The side-mounted compressor and front-breathing design enable flexible placement, while the black exterior finish ensures durability. With casters for mobility, the cooler weighs 260 lb., making it both practical and versatile for commercial use.\nWeight & Dimensions\nShipping Weight: 260 lbs\nWidth: 37 Inches\nDepth: 27 Inches\nHeight: 36 .5 Inches', '<li>The Arctic Air AUB36R measures 37\" in width, 27\" in depth, and 36 1/2\" in height, offering a spacious storage capacity of 9.3 cubic feet for a variety of bottled beverages.<br></li><li>Operates at 120 volts with a 1-phase system, drawing only 1.8 amps at 60 hertz, making it suitable for typical commercial electrical setups.<br></li><li>Powered by a 3/8 HP side-mounted compressor, it ensures efficient cooling while maintaining a temperature range of 33°F to 41°F, perfect for keeping drinks at optimal serving temperatures.<br></li><li>Utilizing R-290 refrigerant, known for its eco-friendly characteristics, this cooler is designed to be energy efficient while reducing its environmental impact.<br></li><li>Inclusion of casters allows for easy mobility, enabling flexible placement in bars, restaurants, or event venues while simplifying cleaning and maintenance routines.<br></li><li>Featuring a rich black exterior finish, the cooler not only looks professional but also provides durability against wear and tear in busy commercial environments.<br></li><li>With a slide-top door design, this cooler facilitates easy access to stored beverages, enhancing service efficiency. It is constructed from stainless steel, ensuring both strength and resistance to corrosion.<br></li><li>Capable of accommodating up to 11 cases of 12 oz. bottles, the unit provides wide storage for high-demand beverage service, making it ideal for establishments with a diverse drink selection.<br></li><li>Comes with 1 solid lid to help maintain temperature and minimize energy loss, and it utilizes a NEMA 5-15P plug type, ensuring compatibility with standard electrical outlets.<br></li><li>Weighing 260 lbs, this strong cooler is built to withstand frequent use while providing efficient storage solutions for a wide array of bottled beverages.</li>'),
('ar', 1576, 'Arctic Air ARCB72 72\" Four Drawer Refrigerated Chef Base', 'The Arctic Air ARCB72 is a strong 72-inch four-drawer refrigerated chef base designed to withstand the demands of a busy kitchen. It features a heavy-duty stainless steel top insulated with a ceramic fabric layer, effectively eliminating melting foam and preventing heat transfer to the cabinet\'s interior. The top includes a standard marine edge on all sides, providing a 19-inch extension on each side, allowing cooking equipment to sit flat. The exterior construction consists of full stainless steel for durability, complemented by easy-to-mount casters, including six casters with two that are lockable, facilitating easy mobility.\nThis model is front-breathing, making it ideal for tight spaces. The stainless steel drawer facings, linings, and frames are designed for longevity, with the top and bottom drawers capable of holding up to 69 deep pans. Each drawer is equipped with stainless steel hooked adapter bars and removable magnetic gaskets for easy cleaning. The heavy-duty Fulterer telescoping cartridge drawer system ensures smooth operation, while the self-contained capillary tube system uses environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant (R290). With an electronic thermostat featuring an external digital LED display for precise temperature control, the ARCB72 is designed for efficiency. The front-accessible condensing unit simplifies maintenance, and the evaporator coil is centered along the interior back of the cabinet. It meets NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage and comes with a full two-year parts and labor warranty, plus a five-year compressor warranty. The dimensions are 74 inches in width, 32 inches in depth, and 26 inches in height.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 74\"\nDepth: 32\"\nHeight: 26\"\nShipping Weight 355 lb.\n', '<li>Shipping weight of it is 355 lbs, indicating a strong construction suitable for heavy-duty use in commercial kitchens.<br></li><li>It features a width of 74 inches, a depth of 32 inches, and a height of 26 inches, providing wide workspace and storage for food preparation.<br></li><li>Operates on 6 amps, at 60 hertz, and requires a 1-phase power supply of 115 volts, ensuring compatibility with standard kitchen electrical systems.<br></li><li>Has a capacity for 1/6 size food pans, accommodating up to 6 pans in its spacious drawers, making it ideal for efficient ingredient storage.<br></li><li>It comes equipped with casters, allowing for easy movement and repositioning within the kitchen environment.<br></li><li>Compressor is side-mounted, optimizing the unit\'s design for compact kitchen spaces while ensuring efficient operation.<br></li><li>Uses a NEMA 5-15P plug type, facilitating straightforward electrical connections in commercial settings.<br></li><li>Utilizes R-290 refrigerant, which is environmentally friendly and efficient, contributing to the unit’s low operational costs.<br></li><li>It maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees Fahrenheit, ensuring optimal preservation of food items stored within.<br></li><li>Constructed from stainless steel and aluminum, providing durability and ease of cleaning, while the marine edge top design prevents spills and simplifies maintenance.<br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1577, 'Arctic Air ARCB60 60\" Two Drawers Refrigerated Chef Base', 'The Arctic Air ARCB60 is a 60-inch refrigerated chef base designed for high efficiency and durability in commercial kitchens. It features a heavy-duty stainless steel top insulated with a ceramic fabric layer that effectively eliminates melting foam and prevents heat transfer to the interior cabinet. The top includes a standard marine edge on all sides, with a 19-inch extension on each side to ensure that cooking equipment can sit flat. The exterior is constructed from full stainless steel, enhancing its strongness, while easy-to-mount casters (two of which are lockable) facilitate mobility. The unit is front-breathing, making it ideal for tight kitchen spaces.\nInside, the ARCB60 is equipped with stainless steel drawer facings, linings, and frames, with the top and bottom drawers designed to accommodate up to 69 deep pans. Each drawer includes stainless steel hooked adapter bars and removable magnetic gaskets for straightforward cleaning. The heavy-duty Fulterer telescoping cartridge drawer system ensures smooth operation, allowing for full extension without tipping during loading or unloading. It utilizes a self-contained capillary tube system with environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant (R290) and features an electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display for accurate temperature control. The front-accessible condensing unit simplifies maintenance, while the evaporator coil is centered along the interior back of the cabinet. It meets NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage and includes a full two-year parts and labor warranty, along with a five-year compressor warranty.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 62\"\nDepth: 32\"\nHeight: 26\"\nShipping Weight 270 lb.\n', '<li>The shipping weight of it is 270 lbs, reflecting its solid construction tailored for heavy-duty use in commercial kitchens.<br></li><li>It features a width of 62 inches, a depth of 32 inches, and a height of 26 inches, providing substantial workspace and storage for efficient food preparation.<br></li><li>Operates on 6 amps, at 60 hertz, and requires a 1-phase power supply of 115 volts, ensuring compatibility with standard electrical systems commonly found in commercial kitchens.<br></li><li>Holds 1/6 size food pans, with a total capacity of 6 pans, making it ideal for storing various ingredients in an organized manner.<br></li><li>Equipped with casters, this chef base allows for easy movement and flexibility in kitchen layout, facilitating optimal workflow.<br></li><li>Compressor is side-mounted, which enhances the unit\'s efficiency and saves valuable kitchen space while maintaining effective refrigeration.<br></li><li>Utilizes a NEMA 5-15P plug type, allowing for simple electrical connections in most commercial kitchen settings.<br></li><li>It uses R-290 refrigerant, known for its environmental friendliness and energy efficiency, contributing to lower operational costs.<br></li><li>Maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees Fahrenheit, ensuring that food items are kept at safe temperatures for storage.<br></li><li>Constructed from stainless steel and aluminum, it provides durability and ease of cleaning, while the marine edge top design helps prevent spills, making maintenance straightforward.<br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1578, 'Arctic Air ARCB48 48\" Two Drawers Refrigerated Chef Base', 'The Arctic Air ARCB48 is a 48-inch two-drawer refrigerated chef base, designed for efficiency and functionality in a commercial kitchen. With a shipping weight of 250 lbs, it has overall dimensions of 50 inches in width, 32 inches in depth, and 26 inches in height. It operates at 6 amps on a 115-volt power supply, functioning at 60 Hertz and in a 1-phase setup. It features a capacity for 1/6-size food pans and is equipped with side-mounted compressor technology powered by a 1/3 HP motor.\nThe temperature range of this chef base is maintained between 33 to 41 degrees Fahrenheit, making it ideal for keeping ingredients fresh. The marine edge top design enhances usability, while the two drawers provide easy access to contents. Constructed with stainless steel and aluminum, the unit is both durable and easy to clean. The chef base also includes casters for mobility and features a NEMA 5-15P plug type along with environmentally friendly R-290 refrigerant, ensuring it meets modern energy efficiency standards while offering a full-size food pan capacity of 4 pans.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth   50 inches\nDepth 32 inches\nHeight  26 inches\nShipping Weight 250 lbs\n\n\n', '<li>Has a shipping weight of 250 lbs, making it strong and durable for commercial kitchen environments.<br></li><li>It features a width of 50 inches, a depth of 32 inches, and a height of 26 inches, providing a compact and spacious storage solution for food preparation.<br></li><li>Operates at 6 Amps, with a frequency of 60 Hertz, designed for use in standard 1 Phase electrical systems, and requires a voltage of 115 Volts.<br></li><li>Specifically designed for 1/6 Size Food Pans, it allows for efficient storage and organization of various food items, with a total capacity of 4 pans.<br></li><li>Compressor is side-mounted, providing efficient cooling while maximizing usable space inside the unit.<br></li><li>It comes equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug type, ensuring compatibility with most standard electrical outlets for easy installation.<br></li><li>Utilizes R-290 refrigerant, which is environmentally friendly and provides efficient cooling performance.<br></li><li>It operates within a temperature range of 33 - 41 Degrees F, ensuring food safety and proper preservation of ingredients.<br></li><li>Made of high-quality stainless steel and aluminum, it is designed for durability and ease of cleaning, suitable for heavy-duty kitchen use.<br></li><li>Featuring a marine edge top type and drawers for easy access, it incorporates 2 drawers for convenient storage while maintaining a smooth and functional design.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1579, 'Arctic Air ARCB48 48\" Two Drawers Refrigerated Chef Base', '<p>The Arctic Air ARCB48 is a 48-inch two-drawer refrigerated chef base, designed for efficiency and functionality in a commercial kitchen. With a shipping weight of 250 lbs, it has overall dimensions of 50 inches in width, 32 inches in depth, and 26 inches in height. It operates at 6 amps on a 115-volt power supply, functioning at 60 Hertz and in a 1-phase setup. It features a capacity for 1/6-size food pans and is equipped with side-mounted compressor technology powered by a 1/3 HP motor.<br>The temperature range of this chef base is maintained between 33 to 41 degrees Fahrenheit, making it ideal for keeping ingredients fresh. The marine edge top design enhances usability, while the two drawers provide easy access to contents. Constructed with stainless steel and aluminum, the unit is both durable and easy to clean. The chef base also includes casters for mobility and features a NEMA 5-15P plug type along with environmentally friendly R-290 refrigerant, ensuring it meets modern energy efficiency standards while offering a full-size food pan capacity of 4 pans.<br>Weight & Dimensions<br>Width   50 inches<br>Depth 32 inches<br>Height  26 inches<br>Shipping Weight 250 lbs</p>', '<ul><li>Has a shipping weight of 250 lbs, making it strong and durable for commercial kitchen environments.<br>It features a width of 50 inches, a depth of 32 inches, and a height of 26 inches, providing a compact and spacious storage solution for food preparation.</li><li>Operates at 6 Amps, with a frequency of 60 Hertz, designed for use in standard 1 Phase electrical systems, and requires a voltage of 115 Volts.</li><li>Specifically designed for 1/6 Size Food Pans, it allows for efficient storage and organization of various food items, with a total capacity of 4 pans.</li><li>Compressor is side-mounted, providing efficient cooling while maximizing usable space inside the unit.<br>It comes equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug type, ensuring compatibility with most standard electrical outlets for easy installation.</li><li>Utilizes R-290 refrigerant, which is environmentally friendly and provides efficient cooling performance.<br>It operates within a temperature range of 33 - 41 Degrees F, ensuring food safety and proper preservation of ingredients.</li><li>Made of high-quality stainless steel and aluminum, it is designed for durability and ease of cleaning, suitable for heavy-duty kitchen use.</li><li><p>Featuring a marine edge top type and drawers for easy access, it incorporates 2 drawers for convenient storage while maintaining a smooth and functional design.</p><p> </p></li></ul>'),
('ar', 1580, 'Arctic Air ARCB36 36\" Two Drawers Refrigerated Chef Base', 'The Arctic Air ARCB36 is a 36-inch two-drawer refrigerated chef base designed to provide both refrigeration and a heavy-duty work surface. The stainless steel top is insulated with a ceramic fabric layer to prevent heat transfer and foam melting, and the top also includes a 19-inch extension on each side to accommodate cooking equipment. Its marine edge design ensures spills are contained. The exterior construction features full stainless steel, while the drawers are lined with stainless facings, frames, and linings, holding up to 6-inch deep pans. The drawers also include removable magnetic gaskets for easy cleaning.\nEquipped with a front-breathing refrigeration system, it has a self-contained capillary tube system using CFC-free R290 refrigerant, ensuring environmentally friendly operation. The drawers are fitted with a heavy-duty telescoping cartridge system, providing full extension for easy access without tipping pans. The electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display offers precise temperature control, while the front-access condensing unit makes cleaning and maintenance simple. Tested to NSF Standard 7, this chef base is designed for open food storage, ensuring compliance with safety standards.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 38\"\nDepth: 32\"\nHeight: 26\"\nWeight 230 lb.\n', '<li>Weighs 230 lbs, providing a solid foundation suitable for commercial kitchens while still being manageable for installation.<br></li><li>It measures 38 inches in width, 32 inches in depth, and 26 inches in height, making it compact enough for small spaces and spacious enough for storage and functionality.<br></li><li>Operates at 2.1 amps and is designed for 60 hertz power systems with 1 phase, requiring a standard 115-volt electrical connection.<br></li><li>Designed to hold 1/6 size food pans, offering a practical storage solution for frequently used ingredients or prepared items.<br></li><li>Equipped with casters, it is easily movable, allowing you to reposition it in the kitchen as needed without hassle.<br></li><li>It features a side-mounted compressor powered by a 1/3 HP motor, with a NEMA 5-15P plug, ensuring efficient cooling and energy use.<br></li><li>Utilizing R-290 refrigerant, it maintains a consistent temperature range of 33°F to 41°F, keeping stored food items fresh and safe.<br></li><li>Marine edge design on the top prevents spills from dripping over the edge, and the drawers provide easy access to refrigerated goods.<br></li><li>Built with stainless steel and aluminum, it holds 2 full-size food pans within its 2 drawers, ensuring reliability and wide storage.<br></li><li>Comes with a full two-year parts and labor warranty, along with a five-year warranty on the compressor, providing peace of mind and long-term support for your investment.<br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1581, 'Arctic Air ACP8SQ 28\" 8 Pan Countertop Compact Prep Unit', 'The Arctic Air ACP8SQ is a 28-inch, 8-pan countertop prep unit designed with a full stainless steel liner for its interior cabinet and a matching stainless steel shell for the exterior. It includes 1/6-size pans with covers, and its pan rail uses a “cold wall” heat transfer system instead of air cooling. The unit sits on plastic, non-scratch feet, providing durability and stability. The self-contained capillary tube system uses CFC-free refrigerant, making it environmentally friendly, and it meets NSF Standard 7 for open food storage.\nThis prep unit requires manual defrosting as it has no built-in defrost system and is classified as an “in-service” item, meaning it must be powered off for defrosting. The compact size of the unit allows for 6-inch deep pans in the back row and 4-inch deep pans in the front, making it ideal for fast-paced prep work while conserving counter space. The strong stainless steel construction and environmentally responsible design make it a durable and efficient solution for foodservice operations.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 28\"\nDepth: 25 3/4\"\nHeight: 9 1/8\"\nWeight 80 lb.\n', '<li>Weighing 80 lbs, this compact prep unit is lightweight enough for countertop placement and durable enough for daily commercial use.<br></li><li>Measures 28 inches in width, 25 3/4 inches in depth, and 9 1/8 inches in height, providing a convenient size for easy integration into any kitchen workspace.<br></li><li>It draws 1.4 amps of current and operates at 60 hertz with a 1-phase power supply, using standard 115 volts for optimal energy efficiency.<br></li><li>Rear-mounted compressor is rated at 1/5 HP, ensuring efficient cooling for maintaining freshness in the stored items.<br></li><li>It comes equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug, and uses electric power, featuring a 6-foot power cord for flexible installation.<br></li><li>Utilizing R-600A refrigerant, it efficiently maintains temperatures between 33°F and 41°F, ideal for keeping ingredients cool and fresh.<br></li><li>Designed to hold up to 8 pans of 1/6 size with a depth between 4 and 6 inches, making it versatile for various food items.<br></li><li>Operating at 161 watts, it is made from durable stainless steel, offering both reliability and ease of cleaning in a commercial setting.<br></li><li>It features 8 compartments, providing wide space for different food ingredients, which is perfect for sandwich or salad preparation.<br></li><li>Backed by a full one-year part and labor warranty, it ensures long-term performance and peace of mind for the user.<br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1582, 'Arctic Air ACP4SQ 15\" 4 Pan Countertop Compact Prep Unit', 'The Arctic Air ACP4SQ 15\" 4 Pan Countertop Compact Prep Unit features a strong design with a full stainless steel interior cabinet and exterior shell, ensuring durability and ease of cleaning. It is equipped with a “cold wall” pan rail, which provides efficient heat transfer without relying on air cooling. It includes 1/6 size pans and covers, with a configuration of four deep front pans and three deep back pans for versatile food storage and preparation. The unit is supported by plastic non-scratch feet to protect countertops.\nThis prep unit operates with a self-contained capillary tube system using environmentally friendly, CFC-free refrigerant. It is also designed to meet NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage, ensuring compliance with safety and health regulations. Notably, the ACP4SQ model does not incorporate a defrost system, as it is designated as an “in-service” item; therefore, it must be turned off to defrost, making it essential for users to manage its operation effectively.\nDimensions\nWidth: 15 Inches\nDepth: 25.75 Inches\nHeight: 9.13  Inches', '<li>The Arctic Air ACP4SQ is designed to fit in limited spaces with its compact size of 15 inches in width, 25.75 inches in depth, and a height of 9.13 inches, making it ideal for small kitchens or food prep stations.<br></li><li>It can hold 4 pans, providing a convenient and accessible solution for storing ingredients or garnishes in a compact space.<br></li><li>Operating at 60 Hertz, 1 Phase, and 115 Volts, it is compatible with most standard electrical setups, ensuring easy integration into your existing kitchen layout.<br></li><li>It comes equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug, allowing it to connect to standard 115-volt outlets for simple and quick installation.<br></li><li>Categorized as a standard unit, offering a balance between space-saving design and efficient ingredient storage.<br></li><li>Designed with an open front access configuration, it allows easy and quick access to ingredients during food preparation.<br></li><li>Stainless steel construction ensures durability and makes it easy to clean, keeping your kitchen environment hygienic and professional.<br></li><li>Although compact, it effectively maintains the appropriate temperature for your prepped ingredients, ensuring freshness and quality.<br></li><li>With its small size and countertop design, it is versatile enough to fit into any kitchen layout, including food trucks, cafés, and small restaurants.<br></li><li>It comes with a full one-year parts and labor warranty, providing peace of mind and ensuring reliable operation.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1583, 'Arctic Air ACP63 63\" Fourteen Pan Stainless Steel Counter Top Prep Station', 'The Arctic Air ACP63 is a 63-inch countertop prep station designed for efficiency and durability in food preparation environments. It features a stainless cover for the refrigerated area and utilizes a “cold wall” heat transfer system, eliminating the need for air cooling. The interior cabinet is fully lined with stainless steel, while the exterior shell is also constructed from stainless steel, ensuring a strong and easy-to-clean surface. Additionally, it is equipped with plastic non-scratch feet for stability and protection on countertops.\nThis prep station includes 1/6-size, 69-deep stainless pans with covers and stainless pan supports, facilitating organized and accessible food storage. An electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display allows precise temperature control, enhancing food safety. The self-contained capillary tube system employs CFC-free refrigerant (R290), making it an environmentally responsible choice. It has been tested to meet NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage. It is important to note that the ACP63 does not include a defrost system, as it is classified as an “in-service” item; therefore, it must be turned off for defrosting.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 63\"\nDepth: 15 1/2\"\nHeight: 11\"\nWeight 125 lb.\n', '<li>Has a shipping weight of 125 lbs, ensuring durability while remaining manageable for installation on countertops in any commercial kitchen.<br></li><li>Measures 63 inches in width, 15 1/2 inches in depth, and 11 inches in height, offering a spacious and compact footprint to maximize kitchen workspace.<br></li><li>Operating at 1.6 amps with a 60-hertz power supply, it runs on 1-phase electricity, requiring 115 volts for efficient operation.<br></li><li>Featuring a side-mounted compressor with a power of 1/4 HP, it provides reliable cooling performance to keep ingredients at the proper temperature.<br></li><li>Equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug, the unit runs on electric power with a power cord length of 8 feet, allowing flexibility in placement and ease of connection to power sources.<br></li><li>R-600A refrigerant ensures energy-efficient cooling, maintaining an optimal temperature range between 33°F and 41°F, ideal for keeping food items fresh.<br></li><li>Designed to hold up to 14 pans of 1/6 size, it offers wide space for storing a variety of food items, making it perfect for sandwiches, salads, or other prep tasks.<br></li><li>Operating at 161 watts, it is made from high-quality stainless steel, providing durability, corrosion resistance, and ease of cleaning for busy commercial environments.<br></li><li>Features 14 compartments with a hinged lid for easy access and secure coverage of food items, ensuring food safety and freshness during preparation.<br></li><li>A digital temperature control system allows precise monitoring and adjustment of cooling settings, while the station is backed by a full one-year part and labor warranty for added peace of mind.<br></li><li></li>');
INSERT INTO `ec_products_translations` (`lang_code`, `ec_products_id`, `name`, `description`, `content`) VALUES
('ar', 1584, 'Arctic Air ACP55 55\" Ten Pan Stainless Steel Counter Top Prep Unit', 'The Arctic Air ACP55 is a 55-inch countertop prep unit designed for efficiency in food preparation settings. It features a stainless cover that safeguards the refrigerated area while ensuring easy access. It employs a “cold wall” heat transfer system, which is more efficient than traditional air-cooled systems. Its interior cabinet is fully lined with stainless steel, enhancing durability and cleanliness, while the exterior cabinet is constructed from strong stainless steel. To protect countertops, it comes equipped with plastic non-scratch feet for stability.\nIt includes 1/6 size, 69-deep stainless pans, and covers, along with stainless pan supports for organized food storage. The self-contained capillary tube system utilizes environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant (R290), ensuring compliance with environmental standards. An electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display provides precise temperature control and easy readability. Tested to meet NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage, the ACP55 does not have a defrost system, meaning it must be turned off to defrost, as it is classified as an “in-service” item.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 55\"\nDepth: 15 1/2\"\nHeight: 11\"\nWeight 105 lb.\n', '<li>Has a shipping weight of 105 lbs, making it manageable for installation while ensuring durability in a commercial kitchen environment.<br></li><li>Features a width of 55 inches, a depth of 15 1/2 inches, and a height of 11 inches, providing a compact design that optimizes countertop space for food preparation.<br></li><li>Operating at 1.6 amps with a 60-hertz power supply, it runs on 1-phase electricity, requiring 115 volts for efficient operation.<br></li><li>Includes a side-mounted compressor with a power rating of 1/4 HP, ensuring reliable cooling performance for fresh ingredient storage.<br></li><li>Equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug, it operates on electric power and features a power cord length of 8 feet, allowing flexible installation options.<br></li><li>Utilizing R-600A refrigerant, it maintains a temperature range between 33°F and 41°F, ideal for keeping ingredients fresh and safe.<br></li><li>Designed to accommodate 10 pans of 1/6 size, it offers wide storage space for a variety of ingredients, making it suitable for sandwiches, salads, and other food prep tasks.<br></li><li>Operates at 161 watts and is constructed from high-quality stainless steel, ensuring durability, ease of cleaning, and resistance to corrosion.<br></li><li>Featuring 10 compartments with a hinged lid, the design allows for easy access to ingredients while maintaining food safety standards.<br></li><li>Includes a digital temperature control system for precise temperature management, and it is backed by a full one-year part and labor warranty for added peace of mind.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1585, 'Arctic Air ACP48 48\" Eight Pan Stainless Steel Counter Top Prep Unit', 'The Arctic Air ACP48 is a 48-inch countertop prep unit designed for optimal food preparation efficiency. It features a stainless cover that protects the refrigerated area, ensuring easy access while maintaining a clean workspace. Utilizing a “cold wall” heat transfer system, it is designed for superior cooling compared to traditional air-cooled options. Its interior cabinet is fully lined with stainless steel, offering durability and easy cleaning, while the exterior cabinet is also crafted from high-quality stainless steel. The addition of plastic non-scratch feet ensures stability and protects countertops from damage.\nThis prep unit comes with 1/6 size, 69-deep stainless pans, and covers, along with stainless pan supports for organized food storage. A self-contained capillary tube system utilizes environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant (R290), adhering to eco-friendly standards. It is equipped with an electronic thermostat featuring an external digital LED display for precise temperature control and easy readability. Tested to comply with NSF Standard 7 for open food storage, the ACP48 lacks a defrost system, meaning it needs to be turned off for defrosting, as it is designated as an “in-service” item.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 47 1/4\"\nDepth: 15 1/2\"\nHeight: 11\"\nWeight 100 lb.\n', '<li>Has a shipping weight of 100 lbs, allowing for easy transportation while maintaining a strong construction suitable for commercial kitchens.<br></li><li>Features a width of 47 1/4 inches, a depth of 15 1/2 inches, and a height of 11 inches, optimizing countertop space for efficient food preparation and ingredient access.<br></li><li>Operating at 1.4 amps with a 60-hertz power supply, it runs on 1-phase electricity and requires 115 volts for its operation, ensuring compatibility with standard outlets.<br></li><li>Includes a side-mounted compressor with a power rating of 1/4 HP, providing reliable cooling to keep ingredients fresh throughout busy service hours.<br></li><li>Equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug, it operates on electric power and features a power cord length of 8 feet, allowing for versatile placement in any kitchen layout.<br></li><li>Utilizing R-600A refrigerant, it maintains a temperature range between 33°F and 41°F, ideal for preserving the quality of perishable items.<br></li><li>Designed to accommodate 8 pans of 1/6 size, it offers wide storage space for various ingredients, perfect for salad and sandwich preparations.<br></li><li>Operates at 161 watts and is constructed from durable stainless steel, providing a smooth and easy-to-clean surface that resists corrosion and wear.<br></li><li>Featuring 8 compartments with a hinged lid, the design facilitates easy access to stored ingredients while helping to maintain food safety.<br></li><li>Includes a digital temperature control system for precise monitoring of internal temperatures, and it comes with a full one-year parts and labor warranty for added assurance.<br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1586, 'Arctic Air ACP40 40\" Six Pan Stainless Steel Counter Top Prep Unit', 'The Arctic Air ACP40 is a 40-inch countertop prep unit specifically designed for efficient food preparation. It features a stainless cover that protects the refrigerated area, allowing for quick access to ingredients while maintaining cleanliness. It employs a “cold wall” heat transfer system instead of traditional air cooling, providing consistent cooling performance. Its interior cabinet is fully lined with stainless steel for durability and easy cleaning, while the exterior shell is also made of stainless steel. To prevent damage to surfaces, the unit is equipped with plastic non-scratch feet.\nThis prep unit includes 1/6 size, 69-deep stainless pans, and covers, as well as stainless pan supports to facilitate organized food storage. It operates using a self-contained capillary tube system with CFC-free refrigerant (R290), ensuring environmental safety. The electronic thermostat features an external digital LED display for precise temperature control and ease of monitoring. The ACP40 is rigorously tested to meet NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage. It’s important to note that the Item does not have a defrost system, meaning it must be turned off for defrosting, as it is designated as an “in-service” item.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 39 1/2\"\nDepth: 15 1/2\"\nHeight: 11\"\nWeight 90 lb.\n', '<li>Has a shipping weight of 90 lbs, ensuring a strong design that is still manageable for transport to your kitchen setup.<br></li><li>Features a width of 39 1/2 inches, a depth of 15 1/2 inches, and a height of 11 inches, optimizing countertop space for efficient access to ingredients and preparation tasks.<br></li><li>Operating at 1.4 amps with a 60-hertz power supply, it runs on 1-phase electricity and requires 115 volts for its operation, making it suitable for standard kitchen outlets.<br></li><li>Includes a side-mounted compressor with a power rating of 1/4 HP, ensuring consistent cooling for keeping your ingredients fresh and safe.<br></li><li>Equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug, it operates on electric power and features a power cord length of 8 feet, providing flexibility for placement in any kitchen layout.<br></li><li>Utilizing R-600A refrigerant, it maintains a temperature range between 33°F and 41°F, ideal for preserving the quality of perishable items and ensuring food safety.<br></li><li>Designed to accommodate 6 pans of 1/6 size, this prep unit offers wide storage space for various ingredients, making it perfect for salad and sandwich preparations.<br></li><li>Operates at 161 watts and is constructed from durable stainless steel, which not only gives it a sleek appearance but also ensures long-lasting performance and easy maintenance.<br></li><li>Featuring 6 compartments with a hinged lid, the design facilitates easy access to stored ingredients while helping to maintain the appropriate temperature for freshness.<br></li><li>It includes a digital temperature control system for precise monitoring of internal temperatures, and it comes with a full one-year parts and labor warranty for added peace of mind.<br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1587, 'Arctic Air 64915K 94\" Two Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf For APP94', 'The Arctic Air 64915K is a 94-inch two-tier stainless steel overshelf designed for the APP94 model, boasting a strong construction that supports efficient food storage and preparation. With a shipping weight of 66 lbs, it measures 94 inches in width, 18 inches in depth, and 30 inches in height. It features a double deck design with two shelves, crafted from 22 gauge stainless steel, ensuring durability and resistance to corrosion. This construction not only enhances its strength but also makes it easy to clean, making it ideal for commercial kitchen environments.\nThe undershelf includes a reinforced full-length hat channel mounted for added support, promoting stability and load-bearing capacity. This feature is crucial for holding heavy items without compromising safety or performance. The double-tier design optimizes vertical storage space, allowing kitchen staff to maximize efficiency while keeping ingredients and equipment organized and accessible. The combination of its solid construction and functional design makes the Arctic Air 64915K overshelf an essential addition to any professional kitchen setup, ensuring reliable performance and longevity.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 94”\nDepth: 18”\nHeight: 30”\nWeight 66 lb.', '<li>Has a shipping weight of 66 lbs, ensuring it is solid and manageable for installation in your kitchen setup.<br></li><li>Features a width of 94 inches, a depth of 18 inches, and a height of 30 inches, providing wide space for storage and organization of kitchen supplies and equipment.<br></li><li>Designed with a double shelf configuration, it offers excellent vertical storage capacity for various kitchen items, maximizing the use of available space.<br></li><li>Constructed from stainless steel, it combines durability and a sleek finish, ensuring it withstands the rigors of a busy kitchen environment while remaining easy to clean.<br></li><li>This is classified as a double deck overshelf, making it ideal for storing a variety of kitchen essentials, from cooking supplies to display items.<br></li><li>Featuring a 22 gauge thickness, the material provides a strong and stable surface for holding heavy items without bending or warping.<br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1588, 'Arctic Air 64914K 71\" Two Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf For APP71', 'The Arctic Air 64914K is a 71-inch two-tier stainless steel overshelf designed specifically for the APP71 model, ensuring that your kitchen space is both functional and organized. With a shipping weight of 53 lbs, this overshelf measures 71 inches in width, 18 inches in depth, and 30 inches in height. It features a double deck design, allowing for wide storage and easy access to essential items. Crafted from 22 gauge stainless steel, it provides excellent durability and resistance to rust and corrosion, making it suitable for demanding kitchen environments.\nIt includes a reinforced full-length hat channel mounted to the underside of the stainless steel shelf, adding extra support to enhance stability and load-bearing capacity. The double-tier construction maximizes vertical storage, helping to keep ingredients, utensils, and equipment neatly organized. This design not only optimizes workspace efficiency but also facilitates quick access to frequently used items, ensuring a smoother workflow in busy kitchens. The combination of strength, stability, and thoughtful design makes the Arctic Air 64914K an invaluable asset for any commercial kitchen setup.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 71”\nDepth: 18”\nHeight: 30”\nWeight 53 lb.', '<li>Has a shipping weight of 53 lbs, making it manageable for transportation while ensuring a solid construction for heavy-duty use.<br></li><li>Features a width of 71 inches, a depth of 18 inches, and a height of 30 inches, providing wide storage space for kitchen supplies and equipment.<br></li><li>Designed with a double shelf configuration, it maximizes vertical storage capacity, allowing for organized placement of various kitchen essentials.<br></li><li>Made from stainless steel, it is durable, resistant to rust and corrosion, and easy to clean, maintaining a professional look in any kitchen setting.<br></li><li>Classified as a double deck overshelf, it is ideal for both storage and display purposes in commercial kitchens, ensuring efficient use of space.<br></li><li>Material has a thickness of 22 gauge, providing a solid and stable surface capable of supporting heavy items without bending or sagging.<br></li><li>It includes a reinforced full-length hat channel mounted to the underside of the stainless steel shelf, which adds significant support and stability for the stored items.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1589, 'Arctic Air 64913K 48\" Two Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf For APP48', 'The Arctic Air 64913K is a 48-inch, two-tier stainless steel overshelf designed for the APP48 model. It features a durable construction made from 22-gauge stainless steel, ensuring longevity and strongness in demanding kitchen environments. With dimensions of 48\" in length, 18\" in width, and 30\" in height, it provides wide space for organizing kitchen essentials. The double-deck design maximizes storage efficiency by offering two shelves for easy access to items. It weighs 38 lbs, making it solid and manageable to install and integrate into various kitchen setups.\nThis two-tier overshelf is ideal for professionals looking to increase storage while maintaining a streamlined workspace. Its stainless steel build not only enhances durability but also offers a smooth and modern appearance that complements various kitchen environments. The double-deck structure allows for additional organization, making it easier to keep tools, utensils, or ingredients within arm’s reach. Perfect for use with the APP48, this shelf ensures utility and style in any commercial kitchen.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 18\"\nLength: 48”\nHeight: 30\"\nWeight 38 lb.\n', '<li>Has a shipping weight of 38 lbs, making it lightweight and durable enough for commercial use.<br></li><li>Spans a length of 48 inches, offering wide space for additional storage and organization above your APP48 unit.<br></li><li>With an 18-inch width, it provides a balanced structure for holding items efficiently while maintaining a sleek profile.<br></li><li>Height of 30 inches ensures great space between tiers, accommodating various kitchen essentials comfortably.<br></li><li>Made from stainless steel, it is highly durable, corrosion-resistant, and easy to clean, making it ideal for the demands of a busy commercial kitchen.<br></li><li>It features two tiers, providing extra storage levels for kitchen tools, ingredients, or other necessities, and optimizing vertical space.<br></li><li>Constructed with 22-gauge stainless steel, it strikes a balance between durability and lightweight functionality, ensuring it withstands regular use.<br></li><li>Classified as a double-deck overshelf, it maximizes vertical storage space, giving you more room for storage without taking up additional floor space.<br></li><li>Designed to fit perfectly with the APP48 series, it enhances functionality without compromising kitchen space.<br></li><li>Strong stainless steel finish complements the design of any professional kitchen, adding both aesthetic appeal and practical storage to your equipment.<br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1590, 'Arctic Air 64911K 94\" Single Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf For APP94', 'The Arctic Air 64911K 94\" Single Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf is designed to enhance workspace organization and efficiency in commercial kitchen settings. With a shipping weight of 38 lbs, this strong overshelf measures 94 inches in width and 18 inches in depth, providing wide storage space above the food prep area. Its height of 20 inches is optimal for maximizing vertical space while ensuring easy accessibility for kitchen staff. Constructed entirely from stainless steel, this over-shelf is durable, easy to clean, and resistant to corrosion, making it ideal for food service environments.\nThis single-tier overshelf features a single-deck design that offers a straightforward and effective solution for storing ingredients, tools, and equipment within arm\'s reach. The streamlined construction ensures that it integrates perfectly with the Arctic Air APP94 pizza prep table, promoting an organized and efficient work environment. Its solid design supports various kitchen items, helping to keep the workspace tidy and enhancing overall productivity in fast-paced kitchen operations.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 94 Inches\nDepth: 18 Inches\nHeight: 20  Inches\nWeight: 38 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air 64911K weighs 38 lbs, making it manageable for installation while providing a solid overhead storage solution.<br></li><li>Measures 94 inches in width, 18 inches in depth, and 20 inches in height, allowing wide space for storing kitchen essentials above your APP94 prep table.<br></li><li>Its design features a single shelf, providing a spacious area for storing frequently used items, enhancing organization and accessibility in your workspace.<br></li><li>Crafted from stainless steel, it offers durability and resistance to rust and corrosion, ensuring longevity in demanding kitchen environments.<br></li><li>Classified as a single-deck unit, this overshelf maximizes overhead storage without taking up valuable floor space, making it ideal for busy kitchens.<br></li><li>Specifically designed for the APP94 prep table, it enhances functionality while maintaining a excellent look in your kitchen setup.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1591, 'Arctic Air 64910K 71\" Single Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf For APP71', 'The Arctic Air 64910K 71\" Single Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf is an essential addition to the APP71 series, designed to maximize workspace efficiency in commercial kitchens. Weighing 31 lbs, it provides a solid structure with a width of 71 inches and a depth of 18 inches, creating wide space for storage and organization of kitchen supplies. Its height of 20 inches allows for easy access while keeping items within reach, enhancing workflow efficiency.\nConstructed from durable stainless steel, this overshelf is built to withstand the rigors of a busy kitchen environment, ensuring longevity and resistance to corrosion. As a single deck shelf with one tier, it offers a straightforward design that provides sufficient surface area for storing ingredients, utensils, and equipment without taking up excessive vertical space. This practical addition not only helps in decluttering the workspace but also adheres to professional standards, contributing to an organized and efficient kitchen setup.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 71 Inches\nDepth: 18 Inches\nHeight: 20  Inches\nWeight: 31 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air 64910K has a shipping weight of 31 lbs, indicating a lightweight and solid design that facilitates easy installation and handling.<br></li><li>Measures 71 inches in width, providing wide space for additional storage and organization above the APP71, enhancing workspace efficiency.<br></li><li>With a depth of 18 inches, the overshelf offers a generous surface area for holding ingredients, utensils, and other kitchen essentials while remaining compact.<br></li><li>Its height is 20 inches, allowing for sufficient clearance to accommodate various items while maintaining a streamlined appearance.<br></li><li>Designed as a single shelf, this overshelf maximizes vertical space, making it an ideal solution for kitchens where space optimization is key.<br></li><li>Made from stainless steel, it is built for durability and longevity, resistant to rust and corrosion, ensuring it withstands the rigors of a busy kitchen environment.<br></li><li>Classified as a single deck overshelf, it offers a straightforward and functional design that simplifies organization and enhances accessibility to frequently used items.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1592, 'Arctic Air 64909K 48\" Single Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf For APP48', 'The Arctic Air 64909K 48\" Single Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf is designed specifically for use with the APP48 series, enhancing the functionality of commercial kitchen spaces. Weighing 25 lbs, it features a 48-inch width and an 18-inch depth, providing wide space for organizing kitchen supplies. With a height of 20 inches, it ensures easy access to items while keeping them within reach, thus improving operational efficiency in fast-paced environments.\nConstructed from strong stainless steel with a 22-gauge thickness, it is built to endure the demands of daily use in busy kitchens. It maximizes storage capabilities without occupying excessive vertical space, allowing for efficient organization of ingredients and tools. This practical design not only helps to maintain a clutter-free workspace but also adheres to professional standards, contributing to a streamlined and productive kitchen environment.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 48 Inches\nDepth: 18 Inches\nHeight: 20  Inches\nWeight: 25 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air 64909K has a shipping weight of 25 lbs, ensuring a lightweight design that allows for easy handling and installation in your kitchen setup.<br></li><li>Features a width of 48 inches, providing a spacious area for additional storage, and enhancing your kitchen organization above the APP48.<br></li><li>With a depth of 18 inches, it offers sufficient space for holding essential kitchen items while maintaining a compact footprint, making it ideal for tight spaces.<br></li><li>Its height is 20 inches, allowing for wide clearance to store and access various items without obstruction, optimizing workspace efficiency.<br></li><li>Designed as a single shelf, it effectively utilizes vertical space, offering a practical solution for kitchens that require efficient organization.<br></li><li>Made from stainless steel, it is built to withstand the demands of a busy kitchen, ensuring