('ar', 1593, 'Arctic Air 64908K 72â€ Two Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf For AST/AMT72', 'The Arctic Air 64908K 72” Two-Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf is engineered for use with the AST/AMT72 series, offering additional storage and organization for commercial kitchen environments. Weighing 52 lbs, this versatile overshelf features a generous 72-inch length and an 18-inch width, providing wide space to accommodate various kitchen tools and supplies. With a height of 30 inches, the double deck design enhances accessibility, allowing kitchen staff to efficiently utilize vertical space while keeping essential items within easy reach.\nConstructed from durable stainless steel with a 22-gauge thickness, this overshelf is designed for longevity and stability in high-demand settings. As a double-shelf item, it maximizes storage capacity without taking up excessive floor space, making it ideal for streamlining workflows in busy kitchens. This practical design not only helps maintain an organized workspace but also adheres to industry standards, supporting efficient operations and contributing to a more productive kitchen atmosphere.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 18 Inches\nLength: 72 Inches\nHeight: 30  Inches\nWeight: 52 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air 64908K has a shipping weight of 52 lbs, making it solid and manageable for transport and installation in your commercial kitchen.<br></li><li>Features a length of 72 inches, providing an expansive storage area to effectively utilize vertical space above your AST/AMT72 units.<br></li><li>With a width of 18 inches, the overshelf offers sufficient depth for storing kitchen essentials, ensuring easy access to frequently used items without consuming excessive floor space.<br></li><li>Its height is 30 inches, providing wide clearance for stacking items while ensuring easy visibility and accessibility from below.<br></li><li>Designed with a double shelf configuration, it maximizes storage potential by allowing the organization of more items within a compact area.<br></li><li>Constructed from stainless steel, it is durable and resistant to rust and corrosion, ensuring longevity and maintaining its appearance in a busy kitchen environment.<br></li><li>Classified as a double deck overshelf, it facilitates effective organization, allowing for versatile storage options for various kitchen supplies and equipment.<br></li><li>Features a strong 22 gauge stainless steel construction, ensuring strength and stability, which is crucial for supporting heavy kitchen items.<br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1594, 'Arctic Air 64907K 60â€ Two Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf For AST/AMT60', 'The Arctic Air 64907K 60” Two-Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf is a strong storage solution designed for use with the AST/AMT60 series, ideal for maximizing vertical space in commercial kitchens. With a height of 30 inches, a length of 60 inches, and a width of 18 inches, this double-deck overshelf provides wide storage area for kitchen tools and supplies, enhancing accessibility and organization. Weighing 40 lbs, its solid construction supports efficient kitchen operations while maintaining a clean and orderly workspace.\nCrafted from high-quality stainless steel with a 22-gauge thickness, it is built to withstand the rigors of a bustling kitchen environment. It allows for the strategic placement of items, optimizing space utilization without encroaching on floor areas. The durable design ensures long-lasting performance, making it a practical addition to any food service establishment focused on efficiency and organization.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 18 Inches\nLength: 60 Inches\nHeight: 30  Inches\nWeight: 40 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air 64907K features a height of 30 inches, allowing for substantial vertical storage while ensuring easy access to items stored on both tiers.<br></li><li>With a length of 60 inches, this overshelf provides wide space for organizing kitchen essentials and supplies above your AST/AMT60 units, optimizing your workspace.<br></li><li>Constructed from stainless steel, this overshelf is built for durability and strength, offering resistance against rust and corrosion, making it suitable for busy commercial kitchens.<br></li><li>Classified specifically as a shelf, it serves to increase your storage capacity effectively, accommodating various kitchen items within easy reach.<br></li><li>Designed as a double deck overshelf, it maximizes storage potential by providing two levels of organization, allowing for efficient use of vertical space.<br></li><li>Has a width of 18 inches, offering sufficient depth for storing items while not encroaching on the valuable workspace below.<br></li><li>Its construction features 22 gauge stainless steel, ensuring both sturdiness and resilience, which is critical for supporting heavier kitchen tools and supplies.<br></li><li>Weighing in at 40 lbs, this overshelf strikes a balance between being strong and manageable, facilitating easier installation and adjustment in your kitchen setup.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1595, 'Arctic Air 64906K 48â€ Two Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf For AST/AMT48', 'The Arctic Air 64906K 48” Two-Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf is designed for use with the AST/AMT48 series, offering an efficient storage solution that maximizes vertical space. This double-deck overshelf has a length of 48 inches, a width of 18 inches, and a height of 30 inches, providing two tiers of storage for kitchen supplies. Its solid stainless steel construction ensures durability in commercial kitchen environments, while its 22-gauge thickness adds strength and longevity, making it a practical and reliable addition to any kitchen.\nWeighing 38 lbs, its lightweight design makes it easy to install while still providing a solid platform for holding kitchen essentials. The double-deck layout enhances storage efficiency, offering a versatile solution for organizing frequently used items without taking up additional counter space. Built to high standards, this stainless steel unit ensures both functionality and durability, catering to the needs of busy commercial kitchens.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 18 Inches\nLength: 48 Inches\nHeight: 30  Inches\nWeight: 38 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air 64906K overshelf has a shipping weight of 38 lbs, making it lightweight and solid enough for easy handling and installation in your commercial kitchen.<br></li><li>48-inch length of the overshelf offers a compact and efficient storage solution, fitting perfectly above your AST/AMT48 models to provide extra space without taking up too much room.<br></li><li>With a width of 18 inches, it provides enough depth for storing items such as kitchen utensils, containers, or other food preparation tools, optimizing the space above your equipment.<br></li><li>Standing at 30 inches tall, the two-tier design ensures wide vertical storage, allowing you to keep frequently used items within reach while maximizing your workspace.<br></li><li>Features two shelves, providing a double deck structure to offer versatile storage and easy access to various kitchen essentials.<br></li><li>Made from stainless steel, it ensures long-lasting durability, resistance to corrosion, and easy cleaning qualities essential for commercial kitchen environments.<br></li><li>Classified as a double deck overshelf, it maximizes your storage capabilities by utilizing both tiers for improved organization and accessibility in tight spaces.<br></li><li>Constructed from 22-gauge stainless steel, it strikes a balance between strength and lightness, making it capable of supporting kitchen items while being easy to manage.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1596, 'Arctic Air 64903K 60â€ Single Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf For AST/AMT60', 'The Arctic Air 64903K 60\" Single Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf is a practical storage solution tailored for use with the AST/AMT60 series, offering effective organization in commercial kitchens. With a length of 60 inches, a width of 18 inches, and a height of 20 inches, this single-deck overshelf provides wide space for storing kitchen essentials. Crafted from stainless steel, it promises durability and resistance to wear and tear, while the 22-gauge thickness ensures strong support for various items.\nWeighing just 26 lbs, it is lightweight and easy to install, making it an efficient addition to any kitchen workspace. Its design maximizes vertical storage, keeping essential tools and ingredients within reach without taking up valuable counter space. The combination of solid construction and thoughtful design enhances workflow efficiency in busy kitchens, making this overshelf an ideal choice for professionals looking to streamline their operations and maintain an organized cooking environment.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 18 Inches\nLength: 60 Inches\nHeight: 20  Inches\nWeight: 26 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air 64903K overshelf has a shipping weight of 26 lbs, providing a balance of sturdiness and ease of transport, making it a practical addition to any commercial kitchen.<br></li><li>Measuring 60 inches in length, it is designed to enhance your storage capabilities, allowing for efficient organization above your AST/AMT60 units.<br></li><li>With a width of 18 inches, it provides wide space for storing kitchen essentials, making it easy to keep frequently used items within arm\'s reach.<br></li><li>Standing at 20 inches, it is positioned at a convenient height for quick access, optimizing vertical space without cluttering your workspace.<br></li><li>Featuring one shelf, this single-tier design simplifies storage and organization, allowing for easy visibility and access to items stored above your prep units.<br></li><li>Made from high-quality stainless steel, it is resistant to rust and corrosion, ensuring durability and easy maintenance in a fast-paced kitchen environment.<br></li><li>As a single deck overshelf, it offers a straightforward solution for additional storage without overwhelming your cooking area, making it ideal for compact kitchen setups.<br></li><li>Constructed from 22-gauge stainless steel, it provides excellent strength and durability while remaining lightweight enough for convenient handling and installation.<br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1597, 'Arctic Air 64902K 48â€ Single Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf For AST/AMT48', 'The Arctic Air 64902K 48” Single Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf is designed for the AST/AMT48 series, providing an effective solution for maximizing vertical storage in busy commercial kitchens. With a length of 48 inches, a width of 18 inches, and a height of 20 inches, this single-deck overshelf offers wide space for keeping essential kitchen supplies organized and easily accessible. Constructed from stainless steel, it ensures durability and resistance to corrosion, making it suitable for various kitchen environments. The 22-gauge thickness adds to its strength, allowing it to support a wide range of items.\nWeighing only 22 lbs, it is lightweight, facilitating easy installation and relocation as needed. Its design helps to free up valuable countertop space, allowing chefs and kitchen staff to work more efficiently. By providing a designated area for storing ingredients, utensils, and equipment, this overshelf contributes to maintaining a tidy workspace. The combination of solid construction and practical design makes the Arctic Air 64902K an essential addition for any professional kitchen looking to enhance organization and workflow efficiency.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 18 Inches\nLength: 48 Inches\nHeight: 20  Inches\nWeight: 22 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air 64902K overshelf has a shipping weight of 22 lbs, making it a lightweight and solid addition to enhance storage above your prep units.<br></li><li>Measures 48 inches in length, providing wide space for additional storage without taking up extra floor space in your kitchen.<br></li><li>With a width of 18 inches, it offers a wide surface for storing essential items, allowing easy access to frequently used tools and supplies.<br></li><li>Stands at 20 inches in height, offering a comfortable reach for users while optimizing vertical space.<br></li><li>It is a single-tier overshelf, featuring one shelf that provides a simple and efficient storage solution for your kitchen.<br></li><li>Built from durable stainless steel, it is designed to resist corrosion and withstand the rigors of daily kitchen use, ensuring longevity.<br></li><li>As a single deck overshelf, it offers an uncluttered storage solution that fits well in any commercial kitchen setting, maximizing overhead space.<br></li><li>Made from 22-gauge stainless steel, it strikes a balance between strength and weight, providing durability while remaining easy to install and maintain.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1598, 'Arctic Air 64901K  21\" Stainless Steel Sheet Pan Rack For AR23,AGR23,AF23,AR49,AGR49,AF49,APP48R,APP71R,APP94R', 'The Arctic Air 64901K 21\" Stainless Steel Sheet Pan Rack is expertly designed for use with a variety of models, including AR23, AGR23, AF23, AR49, AGR49, AF49, APP48R, APP71R, and APP94R. With a shipping weight of 25 lbs, it features dimensions of 21 inches in width, 22.5 inches in depth, and 22.5 inches in height, making it a compact and efficient solution for storing sheet and bun pans. Its open-top design allows for easy access to the pans, enhancing workflow in busy kitchens.\nThis rack holds six levels, providing wide space for organization while using a bottom-load slide type for convenient pan retrieval. Constructed from durable stainless steel, the Arctic Air 64901K ensures long-lasting performance and resistance to corrosion, making it ideal for food service environments. Its versatility and efficient design not only help in maximizing storage but also contribute to maintaining cleanliness and organization in any commercial kitchen.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 21 Inches\nLength: 22.5 Inches\nHeight: 22.5  Inches\nShipping Weight: 25 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air 64901K sheet pan rack has a shipping weight of 25 lbs, ensuring a strong structure while being manageable for installation.<br></li><li>With a width of 21 inches, this rack is designed to fit perfectly alongside your existing kitchen equipment, optimizing available space.<br></li><li>Measuring 22.5 inches in depth, it provides wide room for storing multiple sheet pans without compromising accessibility.<br></li><li>Height of 22.5 inches allows for easy access to pans and quick loading or unloading, enhancing workflow in busy kitchen environments.<br></li><li>Featuring an open top, the design facilitates easy loading of sheet pans and improves airflow, ensuring efficient cooling and storage.<br></li><li>Includes 6 levels, providing sufficient vertical space for organizing various sheet or bun pans, maximizing storage efficiency.<br></li><li>Designed for bottom load, it allows for straightforward placement and removal of pans, improving operational efficiency during meal prep.<br></li><li>It is specifically designed for sheet/bun pans, making it ideal for bakeries and food service operations that require versatile storage options.<br></li><li>Made from high-quality stainless steel, it offers durability and resistance to corrosion, ensuring long-term performance in a commercial kitchen setting.<br></li><li>Compatible with various models, including AR23, AGR23, AF23, AR49, AGR49, AF49, APP48R, APP71R, and APP94R, making it a versatile addition to your kitchen equipment lineup.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1599, 'Arctic Air 64900K 21\" Stainless Steel Sheet Pan Rack For AR23,AGR23,AF23,AR49,AGR49,AF49', 'The Arctic Air 64900K 21\" Stainless Steel Sheet Pan Rack is specifically designed for compatibility with models such as AR23, AGR23, AF23, AR49, AGR49, and AF49. This strong rack has a shipping weight of 32 lbs, and its dimensions are 21 inches in width, 22.5 inches in depth, and 48 inches in height, making it a space-efficient solution for food storage in commercial kitchens. The open-top design enhances accessibility, allowing for easy placement and retrieval of bun pans.\nConstructed from high-quality stainless steel, it is built for durability and longevity, ensuring it can withstand the rigors of a busy kitchen environment. It features an end load configuration and open sides, facilitating smooth pan access while optimizing space usage. This rack style is particularly suitable for organizing and storing bun pans, making it an essential tool for any food service operation looking to improve workflow and organization while maintaining hygiene and efficiency in food preparation areas.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 21 Inches\nLength: 22.5 Inches\nHeight: 48  Inches\nShipping Weight: 32 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air 64900K sheet pan rack has a shipping weight of 32 lbs, which indicates a solid construction suitable for commercial use.<br></li><li>With a width of 21 inches, it is designed to fit conveniently within various kitchen spaces, ensuring efficient organization.<br></li><li>Measuring 22.5 inches in depth, it provides wide space for multiple sheet pans, making it easy to store and access items.<br></li><li>Standing at 48 inches, it offers a substantial vertical storage solution, maximizing the use of space in your kitchen.<br></li><li>Featuring an open top, the design promotes easy loading and unloading of pans while ensuring proper ventilation.<br></li><li>Made from durable stainless steel, the rack is built to withstand the rigors of a commercial kitchen, providing longevity and ease of maintenance.<br></li><li>Designed for end load, it allows for efficient placement and removal of pans from the front, streamlining food preparation processes.<br></li><li>Open sides enhance accessibility, making it easy to grab pans from either side while ensuring a clear view of stored items.<br></li><li>Specifically designed for bun pans, this rack is perfect for bakeries and food service operations, optimizing storage for various baking needs.<br></li><li>Compatible with models such as AR23, AGR23, AF23, AR49, AGR49, and AF49, making it a versatile addition to your kitchen equipment.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1600, 'Arctic Air 70251K Merchandiser Shelf Kit with Four Mounting Clips For ARGDM49,AFGDM49', 'The Arctic Air 70251K Merchandiser Shelf Kit is designed specifically for the ARGDM49 and AFGDM49 models, providing an effective solution for maximizing display and storage space within these units. Measuring 23.5 inches in length and 24 inches in width, it enhances the visibility and accessibility of merchandise, allowing for better organization and presentation of products. It includes four mounting clips, ensuring secure and stable installation, which is essential for maintaining a professional appearance in retail settings.\nConstructed to meet the demands of a commercial environment, this shelf kit allows for easy adjustments and repositioning to accommodate various products. The design facilitates optimal airflow around displayed items, contributing to better preservation of perishable goods. Its solid construction guarantees durability, making it an ideal addition to any merchandising setup focused on efficiency and effective product showcasing. It not only enhances functionality but also improves the overall aesthetic of the refrigerated display unit.\nDimensions\nWidth: 24 Inches\nLength: 23.5 Inches', '<li>The Arctic Air 70251K merchandiser shelf kit measures 23.5 inches in length, providing a suitable surface area for displaying merchandise efficiently.<br></li><li>With a width of 24 inches, it offers wide space for products, allowing for organized presentation and easy access.<br></li><li>Designed specifically for use with models ARGDM49 and AFGDM49, ensuring a perfect fit and optimal performance in your merchandising setup.<br></li><li>Includes four mounting clips, facilitating secure and stable attachment to the designated display units, ensuring the shelf remains firmly in place.<br></li><li>Constructed from durable materials, it is designed to withstand the demands of a busy retail environment, ensuring long-lasting use.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1601, 'Arctic Air 70250K Merchandiser Shelf Kit with Four Mounting Clips For ARGDM23,AFGDM23', 'The Arctic Air 70250K Merchandiser Shelf Kit is an essential addition designed specifically for the ARGDM23 and AFGDM23 models, offering an efficient way to enhance product visibility and organization within refrigerated displays. It includes one standard shelf measuring 21.25 x 24.50 inches, providing wide space for displaying a variety of items. It not only supports the weight of numerous products but also features a label holder, making it easier to identify merchandise at a glance and ensuring a neat presentation.\nIncluded in the kit are four mounting clips, which facilitate straightforward installation and ensure the shelf is securely attached to the display unit. This setup allows for easy adjustments and repositioning of the shelf, catering to different product sizes and display preferences. The shelf\'s strong construction is designed to withstand the rigors of a commercial environment, making it an ideal choice for businesses looking to improve their merchandising strategies while maintaining a professional appearance.\nDimensions\n21.25 x 24.50 inches', '<li>Includes 1 shelf, specifically designed for effective merchandising, allowing for the organized display of products.<br></li><li>Comes with four mounting clips, ensuring secure installation and stability of the shelf on compatible display units.<br></li><li>Features standard dimensions of 21.25 inches in width and 24.50 inches in depth, providing wide space for product placement and visibility.<br></li><li>Designed for use with models ARGDM23 and AFGDM23, ensuring a precise fit for optimal performance in your merchandising setups.<br></li><li>Includes a label holder, allowing for easy identification and pricing of merchandise, enhancing the shopping experience for customers.</li>'),
('ar', 1602, 'Arctic Air 70119RK Right Shelf Kit with Four Mounting Clips For AGR49, AGDF490', 'The Arctic Air 70119RK Right Shelf Kit is designed to enhance storage and display capabilities for the AGR49 and AGDF490 models. It includes one standard shelf that measures 24.50 x 24.50 inches, providing a solid platform for displaying a variety of items, whether they are beverages, condiments, or other merchandise. The design ensures that the shelf can handle the demands of a commercial kitchen or merchandising environment, making it a practical addition to any food service operation.\nIn addition to the shelf, it comes with four mounting clips that facilitate easy installation and secure attachment to the refrigeration unit. These clips ensure stability and allow for quick adjustments if needed. The strong construction of the shelf and its mounting system are tailored to withstand daily use, making it an ideal solution for businesses aiming to optimize their space and improve product visibility. This shelf kit is essential for any establishment looking to maximize efficiency and organization in their refrigerated display units.\nDimensions\n24.50 x 24.50 inches', '<li>Includes one standard shelf measuring 24.50 inches in width and 24.50 inches in depth, providing a spacious area for displaying a variety of merchandise.<br></li><li>Comes equipped with four mounting clips, ensuring secure installation and stability of the shelf on compatible display units.<br></li><li>Designed for use with models AGR49 and AGDF490, it guarantees a precise fit for optimal performance in your merchandising setups.<br></li><li>Made from durable materials, it is built to withstand the demands of a retail environment, ensuring longevity and reliability.<br></li><li>Its practical design enhances product visibility, helping to attract customer attention and facilitate easy access to displayed items.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1603, 'Arctic Air 70119lk Left Shelf Kit with Four Mounting Clips For AGR49,AGDF49', 'The Arctic Air 70119LK Left Shelf Kit is specifically engineered for use with the AGR49 and AGDF49 models, offering an effective solution to expand storage and display options. It features one standard shelf, measuring 24.50 x 24 inches, ideal for organizing and showcasing a variety of products, including drinks and condiments. Its strong design ensures durability, making it suitable for the rigors of commercial kitchen environments where reliability is crucial.\nIncluded with the shelf are four mounting clips, which facilitate straightforward installation and ensure secure attachment to the refrigeration unit. These clips allow for easy adjustments, making the setup process efficient and user-friendly. The combination of the high-quality shelf and reliable mounting system provides an optimal balance of functionality and stability, making this shelf kit a valuable addition for businesses seeking to enhance their refrigerated display units and maximize operational efficiency.\nDimensions\n24.50 x 24 inches', '<li>Includes one standard shelf measuring 24.50 inches in width and 24 inches in depth, providing wide space for displaying a variety of merchandise.<br></li><li>Equipped with four mounting clips, ensuring secure installation and stability of the shelf on compatible display units.<br></li><li>Designed specifically for use with models AGR49 and AGDF49, this shelf kit guarantees a precise fit for optimal performance in your merchandising setups.<br></li><li>Made from durable materials, it is built to withstand the rigors of a retail environment, ensuring longevity and reliability in everyday use.<br></li><li>Its practical design enhances product visibility, helping to attract customer attention and facilitate easy access to displayed items.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>');
INSERT INTO `ec_products_translations` (`lang_code`, `ec_products_id`, `name`, `description`, `content`) VALUES
('ar', 1604, 'Arctic Air 70118K Refrigerator Shelf Kit with Four Mounting Clips For AGR23,AGDF23', 'The Arctic Air 70118K Refrigerator Shelf Kit is designed for use with the AGR23 and AGDF23 refrigeration models, offering an efficient solution for enhancing storage capacity within commercial settings. It includes one standard shelf that measures 21.25 x 23.50 inches, providing wide space for organizing various items such as beverages, condiments, or other food products. It is constructed from durable materials to withstand the demands of a busy kitchen, ensuring longevity and reliability in everyday use.\nAccompanying the shelf are four mounting clips, which simplify the installation process and secure the shelf firmly in place. These clips facilitate quick adjustments, allowing for customization of shelf height based on the user’s needs. The combination of a high-quality shelf and strong mounting hardware not only maximizes the efficiency of the refrigeration unit but also enhances the overall organization and presentation of stored items, making it a valuable addition to any food service operation.\nDimensions\n21.25 x 23.50 inches', '<li>Includes one standard shelf measuring 21.25 inches in width and 23.50 inches in depth, providing wide space for displaying a variety of items in your refrigerator.<br></li><li>Equipped with four mounting clips, ensuring a secure installation and stability of the shelf on compatible refrigerator units.<br></li><li>Specifically designed for use with models AGR23 and AGDF23, this shelf kit guarantees a precise fit for optimal performance and utility.<br></li><li>Made from durable materials, it is built to withstand the rigors of a refrigeration environment, ensuring reliability and longevity during everyday use.<br></li><li>Its practical design enhances product visibility and accessibility, helping to effectively organize and display a variety of refrigerated items.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1605, 'Arctic Air Refrigerator Shelf Kit with Four Mounting Clips For AMT60R,AST60R', 'The Arctic Air Refrigerator Shelf Kit is specifically designed for the AMT60R and AST60R models, enhancing storage flexibility within these refrigeration units. It includes one standard shelf measuring 27.75 inches in width and 16.75 inches in depth, providing a strong platform for organizing various food items and condiments. It is constructed to withstand the rigors of daily use in commercial kitchens, ensuring durability and reliability in holding a range of products.\nIncluded in the kit are four mounting clips, which allow for easy installation and secure attachment of the shelf to the refrigerator. These clips facilitate quick adjustments to shelf height, enabling users to customize the storage configuration according to their needs. This thoughtful design maximizes the available space in the refrigeration unit, promoting better organization and accessibility of items, making it an essential addition to any foodservice establishment.\nDimensions\nWidth: 27.75\"\nDepth: 16.75\"', '<li>Includes one standard shelf measuring 27.75 inches in width and 16.75 inches in depth, providing a spacious area for organizing various refrigerated items effectively.<br></li><li>Comes with four mounting clips, ensuring a secure installation of the shelf, which enhances stability during use.<br></li><li>Specifically designed for use with Arctic Air models AMT60R and AST60R, this shelf kit guarantees a perfect fit, optimizing the functionality of your refrigeration unit.<br></li><li>Made from durable materials, it is built to endure the demands of a refrigeration environment, ensuring reliability and long-lasting performance.<br></li><li>Its practical design allows for easy visibility and accessibility of items stored, helping to keep your refrigerator organized and user-friendly.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1606, 'Arctic Air 69214k 25\" Refrigerator Shelf Kit with Four Mounting Clips For AMT28R,AST28R', 'The Arctic Air 69214K Refrigerator Shelf Kit is designed for use with the AMT28R and AST28R refrigerator models, enhancing the storage capabilities of these units. It includes one standard shelf with dimensions of 25 inches in width and 17.5 inches in depth, providing wide space for organizing a variety of items, from ingredients to condiments. It is built to withstand daily wear and tear, ensuring durability in a busy commercial kitchen environment.\nIncluded with the shelf are four mounting clips, which facilitate easy installation and secure attachment to the refrigerator. These clips allow for convenient adjustments, enabling users to customize the height and arrangement of the shelf based on their specific storage needs. Maximizing the usable space within the refrigerator, it enhances organization and accessibility, making it an essential accessory for efficient kitchen operations.\nDimensions\nWidth: 25\"\nDepth: 17.5\"', '<li>Includes one standard shelf measuring 25 inches in width and 17.5 inches in depth, providing wide space for organizing and storing various refrigerated items efficiently.<br></li><li>Comes with four mounting clips that ensure a secure attachment to the shelf, promoting stability and preventing any potential wobbling during use.<br></li><li>Specifically designed for Arctic Air models AMT28R and AST28R, this shelf kit guarantees a perfect fit, optimizing the functionality of your refrigeration unit.<br></li><li>Crafted from durable materials, it is designed to withstand the rigors of a refrigeration environment, ensuring long-lasting performance and reliability.<br></li><li>Features a practical design that allows for easy visibility and accessibility of stored items, enhancing the organization of your refrigerator.<br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1607, 'Arctic Air 65500K 62\" - 67\" (Side - Side) Tempered Glass Top Cover for ACP63', 'The Arctic Air 65500K Tempered Glass Top Cover is an essential accessory for the ACP63, designed to enhance hygiene and food safety in commercial settings. This optional sneeze guard effectively maintains sanitary standards by providing a protective barrier around food products, reducing the risk of contamination. Made from durable tempered glass, it ensures both safety and clarity, allowing customers to view the food displayed while safeguarding it from external elements.\nAssembly and installation of the cover are straightforward, making it easy for operators to set up and use without requiring specialized tools or expertise. The adjustable design holds a range of widths from 62 to 67 inches, ensuring compatibility with various setups. By incorporating this glass top cover, businesses can not only comply with health regulations but also create an inviting presentation of their offerings, enhancing the overall dining experience for customers.\nDimensions\nWidth: 62 to 67 inches', '<li>Designed to fit ACP63 models, it is adjustable in width, accommodating sizes from 62 inches to 67 inches, providing versatility for various setups.<br></li><li>Constructed from tempered glass, it ensures durability and resilience, offering a clear view of the displayed food items while enhancing the aesthetic appeal of your food service area.<br></li><li>This top cover serves as an optional sneeze guard accessory, effectively maintaining sanitary standards by providing a protective barrier that prevents contamination from airborne particles.<br></li><li>Covering food products helps protect against external contaminants, ensuring that your offerings remain safe and hygienic for customers.<br></li><li>Designed for easy assembly and installation, allowing for quick setup without the need for specialized tools or skills, making it user-friendly.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1608, 'Arctic Air 65400K 44\" - 49\" (Side - Side) Tempered Glass Top Cover for ACP48', 'The Arctic Air 65400K Tempered Glass Top Cover is an invaluable accessory for the ACP48, designed as a single-sided sneeze guard that helps maintain sanitary standards while protecting food products. It is made from durable tempered glass, ensuring both safety and clarity. Measuring 48 inches in width, 15.3 inches in depth, and 7.5 inches in height, it fits perfectly with the unit to provide an unobstructed view of the displayed food while keeping it shielded from contaminants.\nWeighing 80 lbs, it is easy to assemble and install, allowing users to set it up quickly without needing specialized tools. This feature makes it accessible for various commercial environments, enhancing both hygiene and presentation. By using this sneeze guard, food establishments can comply with health regulations while creating an inviting display that attracts customers, ultimately improving their dining experience.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth  48 inches\nDepth 15.3 inches\nHeight 7.5 inches\nShipping Weight 80 lbs\n\n\n', '<li>Designed to fit ACP48 models, adjustable to widths ranging from 44 inches to 49 inches, ensuring a proper fit for various configurations.<br></li><li>Constructed from high-quality tempered glass, it provides excellent durability and visibility, showcasing the food items while enhancing the presentation of your display.<br></li><li>Serving as an optional sneeze guard accessory, this top cover is crucial for maintaining sanitary standards by offering a protective barrier against airborne contaminants.<br></li><li>By shielding food products, it helps to keep offerings safe from external contaminants, ensuring hygiene and safety for consumers.<br></li><li>Designed for easy assembly and installation, it can be set up quickly without the need for specialized tools, making it accessible to all users.<br></li><li>Its clear tempered glass construction allows for excellent visibility of displayed items, making it easier for customers to see what is available while still providing a protective barrier.<br></li><li>Tailored for ACP48 models, it ensures a suitable fit, optimizing both protection and presentation for your refrigeration unit.<br></li><li>Smooth surface of the tempered glass is straightforward to clean and maintain, promoting hygiene in busy food service environments.<br></li><li>With a single-sided design, this top cover is ideal for open food displays, allowing for easy access while maintaining a clean presentation.<br></li><li>Weighing 80 lbs, this tempered glass cover is strong and manageable, ensuring stability and reliability in high-traffic areas.<br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1609, 'Arctic Air 65300K 56\" - 61\" ((Side - Side) Tempered Glass Top Cover for ACP55', 'The Arctic Air 65300K 56\" - 61\" Tempered Glass Top Cover is designed specifically for the ACP55 series, enhancing the functionality and presentation of food items in commercial kitchen environments. With a shipping weight of 80 lbs, this durable cover features a width of 59 inches, ensuring a suitable fit for a variety of countertop setups. Its depth of 17 inches provides wide coverage for the food prep area, while the height of just 2 inches maintains an unobtrusive profile, facilitating easy access to contents.\nThis tempered glass top cover not only protects food from contaminants but also offers a clear view of displayed items, enhancing visibility and appealing presentation for customers. The strong construction ensures longevity and resistance to breakage, making it suitable for high-traffic kitchen environments. By keeping food items covered while allowing visibility, this cover helps maintain food safety standards while optimizing the workflow for kitchen staff, contributing to a more organized and efficient workspace.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 59 Inches\nDepth: 17 Inches\nHeight: 2  Inches\nShipping Weight: 80 lb.', '<li>Has a shipping weight of 80 lbs, ensuring a solid build that contributes to durability and stability in use.<br></li><li>Measures 59 inches in width, designed to fit the ACP55 and provide a sleek, professional appearance.<br></li><li>Depth of the cover is 17 inches, allowing wide coverage for the prep area while maintaining accessibility to the items below.<br></li><li>At just 2 inches in height, this cover is designed to provide a low-profile solution that minimizes space usage while still offering the benefits of protection and visibility.<br></li><li>Made from tempered glass, it is not only aesthetically pleasing but also provides enhanced strength and safety compared to regular glass.<br></li><li>Specifically designed for the ACP55, this top cover integrates perfectly with the unit, ensuring a suitable fit and optimal functionality.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1610, 'Arctic Air 69240K 25.75\" Refrigerator Shelf Kit with Four Mounting Clips For AWR25,AWF25', 'The Arctic Air 69240K Refrigerator Shelf Kit is designed for use with the AWR25 and AWF25 models, providing a practical storage solution with dimensions of 25 3/4 inches in width and 21 inches in depth. It has a shipping weight of 6 lbs, making it lightweight and easy to handle. Its white-coated wire construction ensures durability while allowing for excellent airflow, which is essential in a refrigeration environment, promoting even cooling and minimizing moisture retention.\nIt includes four mounting clips for secure installation, ensuring that the shelf remains firmly in place during use. The coated wire material not only adds to the aesthetic appeal with its clean, white finish but also contributes to the overall functionality by preventing rust and corrosion. With this shelf, users can maximize their storage capabilities while maintaining an organized and efficient refrigeration system, making it an ideal choice for commercial kitchens and food service operations.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth   25 3/4 inches\nDepth 21 inches\nShipping Weight 6 lbs\n\n\n', '<li>Features a width of 25 3/4 inches and a depth of 21 inches, providing wide space for storing various food items and beverages.<br></li><li>Total shipping weight of the kit is 6 lbs, making it lightweight and easy to handle during installation.<br></li><li>Finished in a clean white color, which not only enhances visibility but also blends well with most refrigerator interiors.<br></li><li>Constructed from coated wire, it is designed for durability and resistance to corrosion, ensuring it maintains its integrity in a refrigeration environment.<br></li><li>Includes a single shelf that maximizes vertical storage in your AWR25 or AWF25 units, optimizing space and organization.<br></li><li>Comes complete with four mounting clips, facilitating easy and secure installation, ensuring the shelf remains stable under load.<br></li><li>Specifically designed for use with AWR25 and AWF25 models, ensuring a perfect fit and optimal performance in your refrigeration unit.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1611, 'Arctic Air 65058K 21\" Refrigerator Shelf Kit with Four Mounting Clips For AUC48R,AUC48F', 'The Arctic Air 65058K is a 21-inch refrigerator shelf kit designed for specific models, including the AUC48R and AUC48F. With a shipping weight of 4.5 lbs, it measures 21 inches in width and 16.75 inches in depth, making it a practical addition to your refrigeration setup. Sold as a single unit, this shelf is available in a sleek silver color and is categorized as a shelf type.\nConstructed from epoxy-coated metal, it offers enhanced durability and resistance to corrosion, ensuring longevity even in high-humidity environments typical of commercial kitchens. The kit includes four mounting clips, providing all the necessary hardware for straightforward installation. This design not only maximizes storage efficiency within your refrigerator but also helps in maintaining organization, allowing for easy access to stored items. Whether you need extra space for ingredients or tools, the Arctic Air 65058K shelf kit is a reliable solution for enhancing your kitchen\'s functionality.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 21”\nDepth: 16.75”\nWeight 4.5 lb.', '<li>Has a shipping weight of 4.5 lbs, making it lightweight and easy to handle during installation.<br></li><li>Measures 21 inches in width and 16 3/4 inches in depth, providing wide space for organizing food items within the refrigerator.<br></li><li>Includes 1 shelf, which is sufficient for adding extra storage to your refrigerator setup.<br></li><li>Features a silver finish, enhancing its aesthetic appeal and ensuring it complements various refrigerator interiors.<br></li><li>Designed specifically to fit Arctic Air refrigerator models AUC48R and AUC48F.<br></li><li>Constructed from epoxy-coated metal, it offers excellent durability and resistance to corrosion, making it suitable for food storage.<br></li><li>Includes four mounting clips, ensuring easy installation and secure attachment of the shelf to the refrigerator.<br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1612, 'Arctic Air 65057K 22.25\" Refrigerator Shelf Kit with Four Mounting Clips For AUC27R,AUC27F', 'The Arctic Air 65057K is a 22.25-inch refrigerator shelf kit specifically designed for use with models AUC27R and AUC27F. It has a shipping weight of 6 lbs and dimensions of 22.25 inches in width and 16.75 inches in depth, making it an ideal choice for maximizing space in your refrigeration unit. It is finished in a sleek silver color, enhancing the aesthetic of any kitchen environment. This kit includes all necessary components, making installation straightforward and hassle-free.\nConstructed from epoxy-coated metal, it is designed for durability and resistance to corrosion, ensuring it withstands the rigors of a busy kitchen. The Arctic Air 65057K comes with four mounting clips, allowing for secure attachment within the refrigerator. This shelf type not only provides additional storage capacity but also contributes to better organization, allowing users to access ingredients and tools quickly. With its strong construction and thoughtful design, it is a practical addition to any food service operation, enhancing efficiency and functionality.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 22 1/4\"\nDepth: 16 3/4\"\nWeight 6 lb.', '<li>Has a shipping weight of 6 lbs, making it manageable for installation and transportation.<br></li><li>Measures 22 1/4 inches in width and 16 3/4 inches in depth, providing wide space for organizing and storing food items in your refrigerator.<br></li><li>Features a sleek silver finish, which not only looks appealing but also blends well with various refrigerator interiors.<br></li><li>Specifically designed to fit Arctic Air refrigerator models AUC27R and AUC27F.<br></li><li>Constructed from epoxy-coated metal, it is durable and resistant to corrosion, ensuring it remains functional and visually appealing over time.<br></li><li>Includes four mounting clips, allowing for easy installation and secure attachment to the refrigerator.<br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1613, 'Arctic Air 65056K 23.75\" Refrigerator Shelf Kit with Four Mounting Clips For AR49,AF49', 'The Arctic Air 65056K is a 23.75-inch refrigerator shelf kit designed for compatibility with the AR49 and AF49 models. With a shipping weight of 8 lbs, it offers a practical and solid option for enhancing storage capacity within your refrigeration system. Measuring 23.75 inches in width and 24.375 inches in depth, it effectively utilizes available space while accommodating various food items and supplies. Its white color provides a clean, professional look that complements any kitchen design.\nConstructed from coated wire, it is engineered for durability and easy cleaning, ensuring it can withstand the demanding conditions of commercial kitchens. The kit includes four mounting clips, facilitating straightforward installation and secure attachment within the refrigerator. This design not only maximizes vertical space but also promotes organization, allowing users to quickly access ingredients and supplies. The Arctic Air 65056K shelf kit combines functionality and efficiency, making it an essential addition for any food service operation looking to optimize storage solutions.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 23 3/4\"\nDepth: 24 3/8\"\nWeight 8 lb.', '<li>Has a shipping weight of 8 lbs, ensuring it\'s easy to handle and install.<br></li><li>Measures 23 3/4 inches in width and 24 3/8 inches in depth, providing wide space for organizing and storing various food items in your refrigerator.<br></li><li>Features a clean white finish, which enhances visibility and complements the interior of your refrigerator.<br></li><li>Specifically designed to fit Arctic Air refrigerator models AR49 and AF49.<br></li><li>Made from coated wire, it is lightweight and solid, ensuring reliable support for stored items while allowing for airflow.<br></li><li>Includes four mounting clips, facilitating easy installation and secure attachment to the refrigerator.<br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1614, 'Arctic Air 65055K 21.63\" Refrigerator Shelf Kit with Four Mounting Clips For AR23,AF23', 'The Arctic Air 65055K is a 21.63-inch refrigerator shelf kit tailored for the AR23 and AF23 models, providing an efficient solution for maximizing storage space in refrigeration units. With a shipping weight of 8 lbs, it measures 21.625 inches in width and 24.375 inches in depth, making it versatile for organizing various food items. Its coated wire construction ensures durability, allowing it to withstand the rigors of commercial kitchen environments while offering excellent airflow to maintain freshness.\nIncluded in the kit are four mounting clips that facilitate easy installation and secure attachment to the refrigerator, ensuring it remains stable during use. The coated wire design not only contributes to a clean and professional appearance but also allows for quick cleaning, making maintenance hassle-free. This combination of practicality and functionality makes the Arctic Air 65055K an ideal choice for food service operations seeking to optimize their storage solutions and enhance organization within their refrigeration systems.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 21 5/8\"\nDepth: 24 3/8\"\nWeight 8 lb.', '<li>Hs a shipping weight of 8 lbs, making it lightweight and easy to handle during installation.<br></li><li>Measures 21 5/8 inches in width and 24 3/8 inches in depth, providing wide storage space for organizing food items in your refrigerator.<br></li><li>Features a coated wire design, ensuring durability while maintaining a clean, professional appearance.<br></li><li>Specifically designed for use with Arctic Air refrigerator models AR23 and AF23.<br></li><li>Constructed from coated wire, it is both lightweight and strong, offering reliable support for a variety of items while promoting airflow.<br></li><li>Includes four mounting clips, which facilitate straightforward installation and secure attachment to the refrigerator.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1615, 'Arctic Air ADD72R-2 72\" Kegerator,  Direct Draw Double Door Beer Refrigerator', 'The Arctic Air ADD72R-2 72\" Kegerator is designed for efficient beer storage and dispensing, featuring a top made of 1.59-inch solid foamed stainless steel that ensures durability and easy maintenance. It utilizes an electronic thermostat with a digital LED display for accurate temperature control, conveniently located behind the front access panel. The self-contained capillary tube system employs environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant (R290), promoting eco-friendliness. Its front-breathing design and front-accessible condensing unit facilitate easy cleaning and maintenance, while the high-grade reinforced stainless steel coved corner floor enhances durability.\nThis kegerator maximizes workspace efficiency with a 249 depth and features an external drain mount for easy drainage. Its mounted 4-way air distributor and interior LED lighting ensure optimal cooling and visibility. The bright mirror finish stainless steel interior not only looks appealing but also simplifies cleaning. Each door is equipped with locks and removable magnetic gaskets to aid in maintenance. The exterior construction consists of black powder-coated steel for added durability, and it meets NSF Standard 7 for food safety, ensuring that it’s suitable for commercial use. With dimensions of 73 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39.5 inches in height, It is a practical addition to any bar or restaurant.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 73 Inches\nDepth: 24 Inches\nHeight: 39.5 Inches\nWeight: 375 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air ADD72R-2 kegerator measures 73 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39 1/2 inches in height, designed to fit perfectly in bar setups while providing wide space for keg storage.<br></li><li>With a shipping weight of 375 lbs, this strong kegerator is built to withstand the rigors of commercial use, ensuring stability and durability.<br></li><li>Operating at 6 Amps, 115 Volts, and 60 Hertz with a 1-phase electrical configuration, the kegerator is compatible with standard electrical systems commonly found in bars and restaurants.<br></li><li>Equipped with casters, it enhances mobility for easy relocation during cleaning or event setups, allowing staff to efficiently manage their service areas.<br></li><li>It features a side-mounted compressor designed for efficient operation, ensuring optimal cooling performance while maintaining a compact design.<br></li><li>Designed to accommodate 3 kegs and features 4 taps, providing versatility and convenience for serving various beers, making it ideal for busy establishments.<br></li><li>Comes with 3 solid doors, allowing easy access to the kegs while maintaining an energy-efficient environment for beer storage.<br></li><li>Designed to maintain a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, it ensures that beer is served at the perfect temperature for optimal flavor and quality.<br></li><li>Constructed with a rich black exterior finish, it not only looks professional but also includes LED lighting for improved visibility inside, enhancing both functionality and aesthetics.<br></li><li>Powered by a 1/3 HP compressor, the kegerator utilizes R-290 refrigerant for environmentally friendly cooling. It is equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug for easy electrical connections and comes with a full two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year compressor warranty, ensuring long-term reliability and peace of mind.</li>'),
('ar', 1616, 'Arctic Air ADD60R-2 60\" Kegerator, Direct Draw Double Door Beer Refrigerator', 'The Arctic Air ADD60R-2 60\" Kegerator is engineered for optimal beer storage and dispensing, featuring a top constructed from 1.59-inch solid foamed stainless steel, ensuring durability and ease of maintenance. It includes an electronic thermostat with a digital LED display for precise temperature control, conveniently located behind the front access panel. The kegerator utilizes a self-contained capillary tube system that employs environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant (R290), promoting eco-conscious operation. Its front-breathing design and front-accessible condensing unit allow for easy cleaning and maintenance, while the high-grade reinforced stainless steel coved corner floor enhances structural integrity.\nThis model is designed for efficiency with a 249 depth that conserves the workspace, complemented by an external drain mount for easy drainage. The kegerator features an easy-to-mount caster system with two lockable wheels, ensuring mobility and stability. It also includes a mounted 4-way air distributor and interior LED lighting for optimal cooling and visibility. The bright mirror finish stainless steel interior simplifies cleaning, while each door is equipped with locks and removable magnetic gaskets. Constructed from black powder-coated steel, the kegerator meets NSF Standard 7 for safety and is available with dimensions of 61 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39.5 inches in height, making it a valuable addition to any bar or restaurant setup.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 61 Inches\nDepth: 24 Inches\nHeight: 39.5 Inches\nWeight: 325 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air ADD60R-2 kegerator measures 61 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39 1/2 inches in height, offering a compact footprint suitable for various commercial settings.<br></li><li>With a shipping weight of 325 lbs, this strong kegerator is designed for durability and stability, making it ideal for high-traffic environments.<br></li><li>Operating at 6 Amps, 115 Volts, and 60 Hertz in a 1-phase configuration, the kegerator is compatible with standard electrical systems found in bars and restaurants.<br></li><li>Equipped with casters, it enhances mobility for easy movement during cleaning or setup, allowing staff to efficiently manage their service areas.<br></li><li>Featuring a side-mounted compressor, the kegerator ensures optimal cooling performance while maintaining a space-efficient design.<br></li><li>Designed to hold 2 kegs and equipped with 4 taps, this kegerator provides versatility and convenience, making it perfect for serving a variety of beers.<br></li><li>Comes with 2 solid doors, facilitating easy access to the kegs while promoting an energy-efficient environment for beer storage.<br></li><li>It maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, ensuring that beers are served at their ideal temperature for optimal taste and enjoyment.<br></li><li>The kegerator features a rich black exterior finish and includes LED lighting for improved visibility inside, enhancing both functionality and aesthetics.<br></li><li>Powered by a 1/3 HP compressor, the unit utilizes R-290 refrigerant for eco-friendly cooling. It is equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug for easy electrical connections and comes with a full two-year parts and labor warranty along with a five-year compressor warranty, ensuring reliability and peace of mind for users.</li>'),
('ar', 1617, 'Arctic Air ADD48R-2 48\" Kegerator Direct Draw Double Door Beer Refrigerator', 'The Arctic Air ADD48R-2 48\" Kegerator is designed for efficient beer storage and dispensing, featuring a top made from 1.59-inch solid foamed stainless steel for durability and thermal efficiency. Equipped with an electronic thermostat and a digital LED display, it allows for precise temperature control, easily accessed through the front panel. This kegerator operates using a self-contained capillary tube system with environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant (R290), ensuring eco-friendly operation. The front-breathing design allows for installation flexibility, while the front-accessible condensing unit simplifies maintenance and cleaning tasks.\nInternally, the kegerator has a high-grade reinforced stainless steel coved corner floor that is easy to clean, complemented by an external drain mount for quick drainage. It features easy-to-mount casters (two of which are lockable) for mobility and a mounted 4-way air distributor that enhances cooling efficiency. The interior is illuminated with LED lighting, and the bright mirror finish stainless steel interior adds aesthetic appeal while making maintenance straightforward. Each door is equipped with locks and removable magnetic gaskets for added security and convenience. Constructed from black powder-coated steel, it has dimensions of 49 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39.5 inches in height, and it meets NSF Standard 7 for food safety standards.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 49 Inches\nDepth: 24 Inches\nHeight: 39.5 Inches\nWeight: 290 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air ADD48R-2 kegerator features dimensions of 49 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39 1/2 inches in height, making it a compact and efficient solution for commercial beer dispensing.<br></li><li>Weighing 290 lbs, this solid kegerator is designed to withstand the rigors of daily use in high-demand environments.<br></li><li>Operates on 6 Amps at 115 Volts and 60 Hertz in a 1-phase system, ensuring compatibility with standard electrical setups commonly found in bars and restaurants.<br></li><li>Equipped with casters, it offers enhanced mobility, allowing staff to easily reposition it for cleaning or service adjustments.<br></li><li>Features a side-mounted compressor, which optimizes cooling efficiency while maintaining a space-saving design.<br></li><li>Designed to accommodate 2 kegs and equipped with 4 taps, this kegerator is perfect for serving a diverse selection of beers.<br></li><li>Includes 2 solid doors, providing easy access to kegs while contributing to energy efficiency and temperature maintenance.<br></li><li>It maintains an optimal temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, ensuring that beer is served at its ideal temperature for the best taste experience.<br></li><li>With a rich black exterior finish, the kegerator is both stylish and functional, featuring LED lighting to illuminate the interior, enhancing visibility for users.<br></li><li>Powered by a 1/3 HP compressor, it utilizes R-290 refrigerant, an environmentally friendly option. It is fitted with a NEMA 5-15P plug for easy electrical connections and comes with a full two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year compressor warranty, ensuring reliability and peace of mind for users.</li>'),
('ar', 1618, 'Arctic Air ABB60G 60\" Double Glass Door Back Bar Refrigerator', 'The Arctic Air ABB60G 60\" Double Glass Door Back Bar Refrigerator is designed for efficient beer storage and dispensing, featuring a top constructed from 1.59-inch solid foamed stainless steel for durability and thermal efficiency. It utilizes a self-contained capillary tube system with environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant (R290), ensuring eco-friendly operation. Its front-breathing design allows for installation in tight spaces, and the front-accessible condensing unit simplifies maintenance. Equipped with easy-to-mount casters (two lockable), this refrigerator is both mobile and practical for various environments.\nThe interior is well-lit with LED lighting, enhancing visibility while showcasing your products. It features a mirror-finish stainless steel interior complemented by a high-grade stainless steel coved corner floor, making cleaning easy. Each door includes removable magnetic gaskets, facilitating easy maintenance. It has a depth of 24 inches that conserves important workspace while providing a width of 61 inches and a height of 39.5 inches. Built with an exterior of black powder-coated steel, it meets NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage, ensuring safety and reliability in commercial settings.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 61 Inches\nDepth: 24 Inches\nHeight: 39.5 Inches\nWeight: 365 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air ABB60G measures 61 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39 1/2 inches in height, providing wide space for storing beverages while maintaining a compact design suitable for bar environments.<br></li><li>Weighing 365 lbs, it is well constructed to handle the demands of busy commercial settings.<br></li><li>Operating at 8 Amps with a voltage of 115 Volts and a frequency of 60 Hertz, it runs on a standard 1-phase electrical system, making it easy to integrate into existing setups.<br></li><li>Equipped with casters, facilitating easy movement for cleaning, maintenance, or repositioning within your establishment.<br></li><li>It features a side-mounted compressor and a front-breathing design, ensuring efficient cooling while allowing for flexible placement against walls or other surfaces.<br></li><li>Has a can capacity of 72 six-packs and a total capacity of 16.7 cu. ft., making it perfect for keeping a variety of beverages readily available for customers.<br></li><li>It comes with 2 swing glass doors, allowing for easy visibility and access to stored items, enhancing the customer experience in a bar setting.<br></li><li>With a rich black exterior finish, the unit is not only functional but also aesthetically pleasing. It includes LED lighting for improved visibility inside the refrigerator, showcasing its contents effectively.<br></li><li>Maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, ensuring that beverages are kept at optimal serving temperatures for freshness and flavor.<br></li><li>Powered by a 1/3 HP compressor, it uses R-290 refrigerant, which is eco-friendly. The unit includes 4 shelves for organized storage and has a NEMA 5-15P plug type for easy connectivity. It also comes with a full two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year compressor warranty, assuring quality and reliability.</li>'),
('ar', 1619, 'Arctic Air ABB72  72\" Double Door Solid Back Bar Refrigerator', 'The Arctic Air ABB72 72\" Double Door Solid Back Bar Refrigerator is designed for optimal performance and convenience, featuring a top constructed from 1.59-inch solid foamed stainless steel for enhanced insulation and durability. It operates on a self-contained capillary tube system that utilizes environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant (R290), aligning with eco-friendly practices. Its front-breathing design allows for versatile placement in tight spaces, while the front-accessible condensing unit facilitates straightforward cleaning and maintenance. Additionally, it includes easy-to-mount casters, two of which are lockable, ensuring mobility and stability.\nThe interior of the ABB72 is illuminated with LED lighting, which not only highlights the contents but also promotes energy efficiency. The mirror-finish stainless steel interior is complemented by a high-grade stainless steel coved corner floor, which is easy to clean and maintain. Each door is fitted with removable magnetic gaskets, simplifying the cleaning process. The refrigerator maintains a depth of 24 inches, conserving workspace while providing a generous width of 73 inches and a height of 39.5 inches. Constructed with a durable black powder-coated steel exterior, the ABB72 has been tested to meet NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage, making it an ideal choice for commercial use.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 73 Inches\nDepth: 24 Inches\nHeight: 39.5 Inches\nWeight: 360 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air ABB72 measures 73 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39 1/2 inches in height, providing a substantial storage solution while maintaining a compact footprint suitable for bars and restaurants.<br></li><li>With a shipping weight of 360 lbs, this back bar refrigerator is designed for durability and stability, ensuring it can handle the demands of a busy commercial environment.<br></li><li>Operates at 6 Amps with a voltage of 115 Volts and a frequency of 60 Hertz, making it compatible with standard electrical systems typically found in food service establishments. It is designed for a 1-phase power supply.<br></li><li>Equipped with casters, the refrigerator allows for easy movement, facilitating cleaning and repositioning within the bar area as needed.<br></li><li>Featuring a side-mounted compressor with a front-breathing design, the unit ensures optimal airflow and cooling efficiency, allowing it to be placed against walls or in confined spaces.<br></li><li>With a total can capacity of 84 six-packs and a total storage capacity of 20.7 cu. ft., this refrigerator provides wide space for keeping a wide selection of beverages easily accessible for service.<br></li><li>Includes 3 swing solid doors, providing secure storage while maintaining a professional appearance in the bar setting.<br></li><li>Has a rich black exterior finish, complemented by features such as LED lighting, which enhances the visibility and accessibility of the stored items.<br></li><li>Operates within a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, ensuring that beverages remain at optimal serving temperatures for freshness and quality.<br></li><li>Powered by a 1/3 HP compressor, it utilizes environmentally friendly R-290 refrigerant. It includes 6 shelves for organized storage and is equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug type for straightforward electrical connection. Additionally, it comes with a full two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year compressor warranty, assuring its quality and reliability.</li>'),
('ar', 1620, 'Arctic Air ABB60 60\" Double Door Solid Back Bar Refrigerator', 'The Arctic Air ABB60 60\" Double Door Solid Back Bar Refrigerator combines functionality with advanced features, making it an excellent addition to any commercial bar setting. The top is constructed from 1.59-inch solid foamed stainless steel, providing durability and ease of maintenance. This refrigerator employs a self-contained capillary tube system that utilizes environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant (R290), ensuring compliance with modern eco-friendly standards. Its front-accessible condensing unit simplifies cleaning and maintenance, while the front-breathing design enhances airflow and efficiency. It is equipped with easy-to-mount casters, two of which are lockable, ensuring mobility and stability.\nInternally, the refrigerator has interior LED lighting for improved visibility and a mirror-finish stainless steel interior, complete with a high-grade stainless steel coved corner floor for easy cleaning. The exterior features black powder-coated steel for a sleek, professional appearance. Each door includes removable magnetic gaskets that facilitate cleaning, and the electronic thermostat with a digital LED display allows for precise temperature control from the front access panel. With a compact design measuring 49 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39.5 inches in height, and meeting NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage, it is tailored to meet the demands of any busy bar environment while conserving valuable workspace.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 49  Inches\nDepth: 24 Inches\nHeight: 39.5 Inches\nWeight: 320 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air ABB60 measures 49 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39 1/2 inches in height, designed specifically to fit under counters while maximizing storage efficiency in bar environments.<br></li><li>With a shipping weight of 320 lbs, this solid refrigerator ensures stability and durability, making it suitable for the high demands of busy bars and restaurants.<br></li><li>Operating at 3 Amps, 115 Volts, and 60 Hertz with a 1-phase electrical configuration, the refrigerator is compatible with standard electrical setups found in commercial settings.<br></li><li>Has a total capacity of 12.5 cu. ft., allowing for efficient organization of beverages, with a canning capacity of up to 48 six-packs, making it ideal for bar operations.<br></li><li>The unit comes with casters, enhancing mobility for easy repositioning during cleaning or setup changes, while also facilitating accessibility to the compressor for maintenance.<br></li><li>It features a side-mounted compressor with front breathing, ensuring efficient airflow and operation while maintaining a compact design.<br></li><li>Has two swing-style glass doors, providing visibility to contents while ensuring easy access for staff during busy service hours.<br></li><li>Designed to maintain a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, it effectively preserves the freshness and quality of drinks and perishable items.<br></li><li>Constructed with a rich black exterior finish, it complements bar aesthetics while featuring LED lighting for improved visibility inside, enhancing both functionality and appeal.<br></li><li>Powered by a 1/3 HP compressor, it utilizes R-290 refrigerant for environmentally friendly cooling. The refrigerator includes 4 adjustable shelves for flexible storage solutions and is equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug for straightforward electrical connections. Additionally, it is backed by full two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year compressor warranty, ensuring long-term reliability.</li>'),
('ar', 1621, 'Arctic Air AMT72R 72\" Triple Door Mega-Top Sandwich/ Salad Prep Table', 'The Arctic Air AMT72R 72\" Triple Door Mega-Top Sandwich/Salad Prep Table is engineered for efficiency in food preparation, featuring added space for extra rows of pans, enhancing its utility in busy kitchen environments. Included with it are 1/6-size plastic pans, which are designed to fit perfectly into the preparation area. A full-length, heavy-duty cutting board provides wide space for slicing and assembling ingredients, while the self-closing doors, which remain open at 90 degrees, ensure easy access without compromising on safety. Constructed with solid door construction and a foamed-in-place recessed handle, this table is durable and user-friendly.\nThe exterior of the AMT72R consists of a full stainless steel front and sides, ensuring a smooth and professional appearance, while the interior features a bright white epoxy-coated aluminum sidewall liner complemented by a full high-grade stainless steel floor with coved corners, making it easy to clean and maintain. Magnetic door gaskets are designed for convenience, as they can be removed and replaced without tools. An electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display allows for precise temperature control and easy reading. Standard with all units, the easy-to-mount casters (two of which are locking) provide mobility, and the unit has been tested to NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage, confirming its reliability and safety in commercial use.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 71 1/2 Inches\nDepth: 34 1/2  Inches\nHeight: 43 5/16 Inches\nWeight: 450 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air AMT72R measures 71 1/2 inches in width, 34 1/2 inches in depth, and 43 5/16 inches in height, providing a spacious work surface that is ideal for sandwich and salad preparation in commercial kitchens.<br></li><li>This prep table has a shipping weight of 450 lb., indicating strong construction suitable for high-volume food service environments.<br></li><li>Operates at 4.3 Amps with a voltage of 120 Volts, designed to connect to standard electrical systems in restaurants and catering facilities.<br></li><li>Offering a total storage capacity of 18 cu. ft., this table is designed to efficiently store a wide variety of ingredients, keeping them organized and accessible during food preparation.<br></li><li>Featuring a side/rear breathing compressor, it ensures optimal airflow and cooling efficiency. The unit is powered by a 1/2 HP compressor, which provides strong and reliable refrigeration performance.<br></li><li>Includes 3 doors, allowing for easy access to stored ingredients while maintaining a streamlined workflow during busy service hours.<br></li><li>It is equipped with 3 shelves, providing wide space for organization and storage of various food items and supplies.<br></li><li>Utilizing environmentally friendly R-290 refrigerant, it supports efficient cooling while minimizing environmental impact.<br></li><li>Mega Top design holds 18 pans of 1/6 size, providing a versatile and easily accessible ingredient station. The nominal width of the prep area is 72 inches, with a cutting board depth of 11 1/2 inches, ideal for efficient food preparation.<br></li><li>Work surface is set at a height of 36 5/16 inches, ensuring ergonomic access for food preparation tasks. It is constructed from stainless steel, offering durability and ease of cleaning. Additionally, it comes with a full two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year compressor warranty, ensuring long-term reliability and service.</li>');
INSERT INTO `ec_products_translations` (`lang_code`, `ec_products_id`, `name`, `description`, `content`) VALUES
('ar', 1622, 'Arctic Air AMT60R 60\" Double Door Mega-Top Sandwich/ Salad Prep Table', 'The Arctic Air AMT60R 60\" Double Door Mega-Top Sandwich/Salad Prep Table is a highly functional unit designed to optimize food preparation, offering added space for extra rows of pans. It includes 1/6-size plastic pans for organizing ingredients and a full-length, heavy-duty cutting board for wide prep space. Its self-closing doors, which remain open at 90 degrees, provide ease of access. Built with solid door construction and a foamed-in-place recessed handle, the design ensures durability and user comfort. The stainless steel exterior gives it a modern look while the bright white epoxy-coated aluminum interior makes it easy to clean.\nThis prep table also features magnetic door gaskets, which are removable and replaceable without tools, ensuring hassle-free maintenance. The electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display allows precise temperature control for storing fresh ingredients. Mounted on easy-to-install casters (two of which are lockable), the unit offers mobility. Additionally, the single and double stainless steel overshelf systems offer added storage options. Tested to meet NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage, the AMT60R ensures safety and reliability in commercial kitchens. Its dimensions are 61 1/4\" in width, 34 1/2\" in depth, and 43 5/16\" in height.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 61 1/4 Inches\nDepth: 34 1/2  Inches\nHeight: 43 5/16 Inches\nWeight: 385 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air AMT60R has a width of 61 1/4 inches, a depth of 34 1/2 inches, and a height of 43 5/16 inches, designed to fit perfectly into commercial kitchen spaces while providing a generous work area for food preparation.<br></li><li>Has a shipping weight of 385 lb., reflecting its solid construction, which is suitable for the demands of high-volume food service environments.<br></li><li>Operating at 4.3 Amps with a frequency of 60 Hertz, it is compatible with standard electrical systems in most commercial kitchens, ensuring easy installation and operation.<br></li><li>Features a substantial capacity of 15.5 cu. ft., allowing wide space for various ingredients, condiments, and other items, keeping them organized and readily accessible.<br></li><li>Comes equipped with casters, enhancing mobility for easy repositioning within the kitchen or during cleaning.<br></li><li>Utilizing a side/rear breathing compressor, this model efficiently maintains temperature while providing optimal airflow. The 1/2 HP compressor ensures effective cooling performance for food safety.<br></li><li>Featuring 2 swing doors, the prep table allows for easy access to ingredients, facilitating a smooth workflow during meal preparation.<br></li><li>Includes 2 shelves, providing additional organization for food items and supplies, enhancing kitchen efficiency.<br></li><li>Utilizing eco-friendly R-290 refrigerant, it supports effective cooling while reducing environmental impact. The operating temperature range is maintained between 33 - 41 degrees F, ensuring food safety.<br></li><li>Constructed from stainless steel and aluminum, ensuring durability and easy cleaning. It holds 24 pans of 1/6 size, providing efficient access to ingredients and maximizing preparation space. Backed by a two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year warranty on the compressor, this prep table offers long-term reliability for commercial kitchen use.</li>'),
('ar', 1623, 'Arctic Air AMT28R 28\" Single Door Mega-Top Sandwich/ Salad Prep Table', 'The Arctic Air AMT28R 28\" Single Door Mega-Top Sandwich/Salad Prep Table provides added space to accommodate extra rows of pans, ensuring efficient preparation in busy kitchens. It comes with 1/6-size plastic pans and features a full-length, heavy-duty cutting board for enhanced functionality. The self-closing doors remain open at 90 degrees for ease of access. Its solid door construction with a foamed-in-place recessed handle and stainless steel exterior ensures durability and long-lasting performance.\nThe interior is built for easy maintenance with a bright white epoxy-coated aluminum sidewall liner and a high-grade stainless steel floor with coved corners. The magnetic door gaskets are removable and replaceable without tools, simplifying upkeep. The electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display provides accurate temperature control, while easy-to-mount casters (two of which lock) ensure mobility. Additional single and double stainless steel overshelf systems are available for added versatility. Certified to NSF Standard 7, it meets the requirements for open food storage. It measures 29\" in width, 34 1/2\" in depth, and 43 5/16\" in height.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 29 Inches\nDepth: 34 1/2  Inches\nHeight: 43 5/16 Inches\nWeight: 230 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air AMT28R features a compact design with a width of 29 inches, a depth of 34 1/2 inches, and a height of 43 5/16 inches, providing an efficient prep station for smaller kitchens or tight spaces.<br></li><li>Has a shipping weight of 230 lb., making it a relatively lightweight option for a commercial prep table, while still maintaining durability and strength.<br></li><li>Runs on 3 Amps, with a frequency of 60 Hertz and a 1 Phase electrical configuration. It operates with 115 Volts, making it compatible with standard kitchen power setups.<br></li><li>With a capacity of 6.5 cu. ft., the unit offers wide storage for food and ingredients, supporting efficient kitchen workflows during busy service times.<br></li><li>Comes with casters, allowing easy movement for cleaning or repositioning in the kitchen, ensuring flexibility in layout changes.<br></li><li>The bottom-mounted compressor is designed with a side/rear breathing system for optimal cooling performance. It uses a 3/8 HP compressor, ensuring the unit maintains consistent temperatures, crucial for food safety.<br></li><li>Features 1 swing door with a solid construction, providing excellent insulation and energy efficiency. The left/right hinge configuration allows for flexibility in door placement based on kitchen layout.<br></li><li>Has 1 adjustable shelf inside, giving flexibility to organize ingredients or containers as needed. The shelf is designed to accommodate a variety of storage needs.<br></li><li>Using R-290 refrigerant, the unit maintains a temperature range between 33 - 41 degrees F, ensuring food safety. The air-cooled refrigeration system ensures the internal environment remains consistent and energy efficient.<br></li><li>Mega Top design holds 12 pans of 1/6 size, with a nominal width of 27 inches and a cutting board depth of 9 inches for wide ingredient preparation space. It is made from stainless steel and aluminum and includes a two-year parts and labor warranty, plus a five-year compressor warranty.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1624, 'Arctic Air AST72R 72\" Triple Door Sandwich/ Salad Prep Table', 'The Arctic Air AST72R 72\" Triple Door Sandwich/Salad Prep Table is expertly designed for efficiency and functionality in food preparation environments, featuring 1/6 size 49 deep plastic pans included for quick access to ingredients. A full-length, heavy-duty cutting board is also provided to facilitate perfect food preparation. It has self-closing doors that remain open at 90 degrees for easy access, while the solid door construction features a foamed-in-place recessed handle for durability. The exterior cabinet is made of full stainless steel on the front and sides, enhancing its longevity and aesthetic appeal.\nInternally, the cabinet is equipped with a bright white epoxy-coated aluminum sidewall liner and a high-grade stainless steel floor with coved corners to facilitate easy cleaning. The magnetic door gaskets can be removed and replaced without tools, making maintenance straightforward. An electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display offers precise temperature control, and easy-to-mount casters (two locking) ensure mobility. The table also holds single and double stainless steel over-shelf systems, expanding storage options. This prep table is tested to meet NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage, making it ideal for commercial use. The dimensions are 71 1/2\" in width, 30\" in depth, and 43 5/16\" in height.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 71 1/2 Inches\nDepth: 30  Inches\nHeight: 43 5/16 Inches\nWeight: 425 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air AST72R features a spacious design with a width of 71 1/2 inches, a depth of 30 inches, and a height of 43 5/16 inches, providing an expansive work area for sandwich and salad preparation.<br></li><li>Has a shipping weight of 425 lb., ensuring solid construction suitable for high-volume commercial use while remaining manageable for installation.<br></li><li>It operates on 4.3 Amps, at a frequency of 60 Hertz, and is configured for 1 Phase electrical systems, running on 120 Volts, making it compatible with standard commercial kitchen power.<br></li><li>With a capacity of 18 cu. ft., the unit offers wide storage for fresh ingredients, allowing for efficient workflow in busy kitchens and food service environments.<br></li><li>Equipped with casters, facilitating easy mobility for cleaning, repositioning, or storage, enhancing versatility in kitchen arrangements.<br></li><li>Features a rear-mounted compressor that operates with a side/rear breathing design for efficient cooling. With a 1/2 HP compressor, it ensures reliable temperature control for food safety.<br></li><li>Three swing doors are designed with solid construction to provide excellent insulation, maintaining internal temperatures while allowing easy access to stored ingredients.<br></li><li>Interior includes 3 adjustable shelves, providing flexibility in organizing various ingredients or containers based on the needs of the kitchen.<br></li><li>Using R-290 refrigerant, the unit maintains a temperature range of 33 - 41 degrees F, essential for preserving the freshness of perishable items. The air-cooled refrigeration system supports consistent performance.<br></li><li>The standard top holds 18 pans of 1/6 size with a cutting board measuring 72 inches wide by 11 1/2 inches deep, and a work surface height of 35 5/16 inches. Built with stainless steel and aluminum, it comes with a two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year compressor warranty.<br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1625, 'Arctic Air AST60R 60\" Double Door Sandwich/ Salad Prep Table', 'The Arctic Air AST60R 60\" Double Door Sandwich/Salad Prep Table is expertly designed for commercial food preparation, featuring 1/6 size 49 deep plastic pans to optimize ingredient accessibility. It comes with a full-length, heavy-duty cutting board, enhancing food prep efficiency. It is equipped with self-closing doors that stay open at a 90-degree angle for easy access, and the solid door construction incorporates a foamed-in-place recessed handle for durability and a professional look.\nConstructed with a full stainless steel exterior, the cabinet provides longevity and easy maintenance. Inside, the bright white epoxy-coated aluminum sidewall liner complements the high-grade stainless steel floor with coved corners, ensuring easy cleaning. Magnetic door gaskets can be removed and replaced without tools for convenience. An electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display allows for precise temperature control, while easy-to-mount casters (with two lockable) facilitate mobility. This prep table also holds single and double stainless steel over-shelf systems for additional storage options. It meets NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage, making it an ideal choice for any commercial kitchen. The dimensions are 61 1/4\" in width, 30\" in depth, and 43 5/16\" in height.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 61 1/4 Inches\nDepth: 30  Inches\nHeight: 43 5/16 Inches\nWeight: 385 lb. ', '<li>The Arctic Air AST60R measures 61 1/4 inches wide, 30 inches deep, and 43 5/16 inches high, providing wide workspace for food preparation.<br></li><li>Has a shipping weight of 385 lb., ensuring durable construction for commercial kitchen use.<br></li><li>Operating on 4.3 Amps, 60 Hertz, 1 Phase, and 120 Volts, it’s compatible with standard commercial electrical systems.<br></li><li>Offers a generous 15.5 cu. ft. of storage capacity, allowing for efficient organization of ingredients.<br></li><li>Equipped with casters, this prep table provides easy mobility for cleaning and repositioning.<br></li><li>Features a rear-mounted compressor with a side/rear breathing design and operates with a 1/2 HP compressor for effective cooling.<br></li><li>Includes two solid swing doors that provide easy access to the refrigerated contents.<br></li><li>Comes with 2 adjustable shelves, allowing flexibility in storage organization.<br></li><li>Utilizing R-290 refrigerant, it maintains a temperature range of 33 - 41 degrees F, equipped with an air-cooled system.<br></li><li>Standard top holds 16 pans of 1/6 size, featuring a cutting board with a nominal width of 60 inches, depth of 30 inches, and a work surface height of 36 5/16 inches. Constructed with stainless steel and aluminum, it is backed by a two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year compressor warranty.<br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1626, 'Arctic Air AST48R 48\" Double Door Sandwich/ Salad Prep Table', 'The Arctic Air AST48R 48\" Double Door Sandwich/Salad Prep Table is meticulously designed to enhance food preparation efficiency in commercial kitchens. Included with it are 1/6 size 49 deep plastic pans, providing wide storage for ingredients. The full-length, heavy-duty cutting board is perfect for prepping meals. The self-closing doors are engineered to remain open at a 90-degree angle, allowing for quick access. Constructed with a solid door and foamed-in-place recessed handle, the durability and functionality of this prep table are paramount.\nThe exterior features a strong full stainless steel construction that ensures longevity and ease of maintenance, while the interior has a bright white epoxy-coated aluminum sidewall liner paired with a high-grade stainless steel floor that includes coved corners for simple cleaning. The magnetic door gaskets can be easily removed and replaced without the need for tools, enhancing usability. An electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display provides precise temperature control for optimal food storage. Standard easy-to-mount casters (two locking) ensure the unit is mobile, making it convenient to reposition as needed. This prep table also supports single and double stainless steel over-shelf systems for additional storage options. It meets the NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage, ensuring it is suitable for commercial use. The dimensions are 48 1/4 inches in width, 30 inches in depth, and 43 3/8 inches in height.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 48 1/4 Inches\nDepth: 30  Inches\nHeight: 43 3/8  Inches\nWeight: 300 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air AST48R measures 48 1/4 inches wide, 30 inches deep, and 43 3/8 inches high, providing a compact and functional workspace for food preparation.<br></li><li>It has a shipping weight of 300 lb., indicating its strong construction for commercial kitchen environments.<br></li><li>Operating on 4.3 Amps, 60 Hertz, 1 Phase, and 120 Volts, it is designed to meet standard commercial electrical requirements.<br></li><li>Offers a capacity of 12 cu. ft., allowing for efficient organization and easy access to ingredients.<br></li><li>Equipped with casters, this prep table enhances mobility for cleaning and repositioning within the kitchen.<br></li><li>Features a bottom-mounted compressor with a side/rear breathing design, ensuring optimal cooling performance with a 1/2 HP compressor.<br></li><li>Includes two solid swing doors for convenient access to refrigerated contents.<br></li><li>Comes with 2 adjustable shelves, providing flexibility in organizing storage space for various ingredients.<br></li><li>Utilizing R-290 refrigerant, it maintains a temperature range of 33 - 41 degrees F and is equipped with an air-cooled system.<br></li><li>Standard top holds12 pans of 1/6 size, with a nominal width of 48 inches, a cutting board depth of 11 1/2 inches, and a total height of 48 1/2 inches. Constructed with stainless steel and aluminum, it is backed by a two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year compressor warranty.<br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1627, 'Arctic Air APP48R 48\" Single Door Stainless Steel Pizza Prep Table', 'The Arctic Air APP48R 48\" Single Door Stainless Steel Pizza Prep Table is designed for efficiency and durability in commercial kitchens. With dimensions of 48 inches in width, 32.25 inches in depth, and 41 inches in height, this prep table offers a spacious work surface with a capacity of 12 cu. ft. It operates at 5 Amps and utilizes a 1/2 HP compressor, ensuring effective cooling within the 33 to 41 degrees Fahrenheit temperature range. Constructed from stainless steel and aluminum, it features a swing door style for easy access.\nThe side-mounted compressor is designed for side and rear breathing, enhancing airflow for optimal cooling. The table includes one shelf and is equipped with a mega top that holds six 1/3-size pans, providing wide space for ingredients. The NEMA 5-15P plug type allows for easy connection to standard outlets, making it a versatile addition to any kitchen. Weighing 310 lbs, this prep table is strong and built for the demands of high-traffic food preparation environments.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth:  48 Inches\nDepth: 32.5 Inches\nHeight: 41 Inches\nWeight:  310 lbs', '<li>The Arctic Air APP48R measures 48 inches in width, 32 1/4 inches in depth, and 41 inches in height, providing wide workspace for pizza preparation while ensuring a compact footprint suitable for various kitchen layouts.<br></li><li>Has a shipping weight of 310 lbs, indicating a solid construction designed to withstand the rigors of a busy kitchen environment.<br></li><li>Operating on 5 Amps at 60 Hertz, the unit is designed for 1 Phase power and requires a voltage of 120 Volts, making it compatible with standard electrical systems in most commercial settings.<br></li><li>With a total capacity of 12 cu. ft., this pizza prep table offers wide storage space for ingredients and toppings, helping streamline food preparation processes.<br></li><li>The side-mounted compressor ensures efficient cooling while saving valuable space, allowing for easy access and maintenance.<br></li><li>Featuring a cold wall refrigeration system, the APP48R provides consistent cooling throughout the unit, maintaining optimal temperature for perishable items.<br></li><li>The prep table is constructed from durable stainless steel and aluminum, ensuring longevity and ease of cleaning, which is essential in a fast-paced kitchen environment.<br></li><li>The table includes 1 swing door, providing easy access to the storage compartment, and facilitating quick retrieval of ingredients during busy service times.<br></li><li>Designed to accommodate 6 (1/3 size) pans in the mega top section, the APP48R allows for organized and accessible ingredient storage, improving workflow efficiency during pizza preparation.<br></li><li>Operates within a temperature range of 33 - 41 degrees F, ensuring that ingredients remain fresh and safe for use, while also complying with food safety standards.</li>'),
('ar', 1628, 'Arctic Air AUC48R 48.25\" Double Door Under-Counter Refrigerator', 'The Arctic Air AUC48R 48.25\" Double Door Under-Counter Refrigerator is designed for commercial use, offering a shipping weight of 265 lbs and compact dimensions of 48 1/4 inches in width, 30 inches in depth, and 35 5/8 inches in height. With a capacity of 12 cu. ft., it is powered by a 3 amp draw at 115 volts and features a 3/8 HP bottom-mounted compressor, ensuring efficient cooling with a side/rear breathing design that maximizes airflow.\nEquipped with two solid swing doors, the AUC48R features self-closing doors for enhanced energy efficiency. Inside, it includes two adjustable shelves, allowing for flexible storage configurations. It operates with environmentally friendly R-600A refrigerant and maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, ideal for perishable goods. The NEMA 5-15P plug type and left/right hinge location make it versatile for various kitchen setups, ensuring reliable performance in busy food service environments.\nWeight & Dimensions\nShipping weight: 265 lbs\nWidth: 48 1/4 Inches\nDepth: 30 Inches\nHeight: 35 5/8 Inches', '<li>The Arctic Air AUC48R measures 48.25 inches in width, 30 inches in depth, and 35.625 inches in height, designed to fit snugly under counters while providing wide refrigeration space.<br></li><li>With a shipping weight of 265 lbs, this refrigerator offers solid construction for durability and reliability in a commercial kitchen environment.<br></li><li>It operates on 115 volts and consumes 3 amps, making it energy-efficient and suitable for various kitchen setups without overloading circuits.<br></li><li>Has a total capacity of 12 cubic feet, providing sufficient storage for a variety of perishable items, making it ideal for busy food service operations.<br></li><li>Featuring a bottom-mounted compressor, it allows for easy access and maintenance while enhancing the unit\'s cooling efficiency by utilizing natural convection.<br></li><li>Side/rear breathing compressor-style optimizes airflow, ensuring efficient cooling and preventing overheating even in confined kitchen spaces.<br></li><li>Includes two solid swing doors that offer easy access to the refrigerated items, designed to close automatically for improved energy efficiency.<br></li><li>Has self-closing doors, enhancing convenience and ensuring that the refrigerator maintains optimal temperatures by minimizing cold air loss when doors are left ajar.<br></li><li>Equipped with a 3/8 HP compressor, the AUC48R delivers reliable cooling performance, maintaining consistent temperatures for the safe storage of perishables.<br></li><li>Using R-600A refrigerant, this refrigerator is environmentally friendly and operates within a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees Fahrenheit, ensuring that all stored items remain fresh and properly chilled.</li>'),
('ar', 1629, 'Arctic AUC27R 27.88\" Air Single Door Under-Counter Refrigerator', 'The Arctic Air AUC27R 27.88\" Single Door Under-Counter Refrigerator is engineered for efficiency in commercial settings, with a shipping weight of 185 lbs and dimensions of 27 7/8 inches in width, 30 inches in depth, and 35 5/8 inches in height. This under-counter refrigerator offers a capacity of 6.5 cu. ft., operating on 1.5 amps at 115 volts with a 3/8 HP bottom-mounted compressor, ensuring optimal cooling performance.\nDesigned for convenience, the unit features a solid swing door that is self-closing, enhancing energy efficiency. Inside, it includes one shelf for organized storage. The refrigerator utilizes R-600A refrigerant, maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, and comes equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug type for easy installation in various kitchen environments.\nWeight & Dimensions\nShipping weight: 185lbs\nWidth:  27 7/8 Inches\nDepth: 30 Inches\nHeight: 35 5/8 Inches', '<li>The Arctic Air AUC27R features a width of 27.88 inches, a depth of 30 inches, and a height of 35.625 inches, making it ideal for under-counter placement in commercial settings.<br></li><li>Has a shipping weight of 185 lbs, indicating its solid construction, suitable for heavy-duty use in busy kitchens.<br></li><li>Operating on 115 volts and drawing 1.5 amps, this refrigerator ensures efficient performance while minimizing energy consumption, and is equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug, allowing for easy and safe connectivity to standard electrical outlets.<br></li><li>With a total capacity of 6.5 cubic feet, the AUC27R provides wide storage space for perishable items, keeping them organized and easily accessible.<br></li><li>Bottom-mounted compressor design allows for better accessibility and maintenance, along with efficient temperature management.<br></li><li>Featuring a side/rear breathing compressor style, it is optimized for air circulation, making it suitable for placement in various kitchen configurations.<br></li><li>Comes with a solid swing door, facilitating convenient access to the refrigerator\'s contents while ensuring excellent temperature retention.<br></li><li>Designed with self-closing doors, this refrigerator enhances energy efficiency and convenience, ensuring that the door closes securely after each use.<br></li><li>Operates with a 3/8 HP compressor, providing strong performance for maintaining optimal refrigeration temperatures.<br></li><li>Utilizing R-600A refrigerant, the AUC27R is environmentally friendly and efficient, ensuring effective cooling with a reduced environmental footprint. It maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees Fahrenheit, making it suitable for a variety of perishable goods.</li>'),
('ar', 1630, 'Arctic Air ARGDM23 27\" Single Glass Door Reach-In Merchandiser Refrigerator', 'The Arctic Air ARGDM23 27\" Single Glass Door Reach-In Merchandiser Refrigerator is a smooth and efficient solution for displaying beverages and other perishable items. With a width of 27 inches, a depth of 40 inches, and a height of 81.5 inches, it is designed to fit perfectly into retail spaces while providing wide storage in a single section. Its swing door style allows for easy access, while the black exterior finish offers a modern aesthetic that complements any environment.\nPowered by a 1/5 HP compressor, this refrigerator features a self-contained, rear-mounted refrigeration system that enhances efficiency and makes maintenance straightforward. The unit is designed to maintain optimal temperatures for stored products, ensuring freshness and quality for customers. This combination of functionality and design makes the Arctic Air ARGDM23 an excellent choice for businesses looking to enhance their merchandising capabilities.\nDimensions\nWidth:  27 Inches\nDepth: 40 Inches\nHeight: 81.5 Inches', '<li>The Arctic Air ARGDM23 measures 27 inches in width, 40 inches in depth, and 81.5 inches in height, making it an ideal size for maximizing product display without taking up excessive floor space.<br></li><li>This refrigerator features a swing door design, allowing easy access to the interior while providing a clear view of the products displayed, enhancing customer engagement.<br></li><li>Finished in a rich black exterior, the ARGDM23 not only provides a modern aesthetic but also ensures durability and easy maintenance, fitting well in various retail environments.<br></li><li>Operates with a 1/5 HP compressor, offering efficient cooling performance while maintaining energy efficiency, ideal for busy commercial settings.<br></li><li>Designed as a 1-section unit, this refrigerator allows for organized storage of products, making it easy to keep items visible and accessible for customers and staff alike.<br></li><li>It features a self-contained, rear-mounted refrigeration system, which simplifies installation and maintenance while ensuring effective cooling throughout the unit.<br></li><li>The rear-mounted design optimizes airflow, ensuring even temperature distribution and enhancing the longevity of stored products.</li>'),
('ar', 1631, 'Arctic Air AGR49 54\" Double Glass Door Reach-In Refrigerator', 'The Arctic Air AGR49 54\" Double Glass Door Reach-In Refrigerator is meticulously designed for high performance and convenience in commercial settings, featuring dimensions of 54 inches in width, 31 1/4 inches in depth, and 83 1/4 inches in height. This refrigerator is equipped with an electronic thermostat alongside an external digital LED display, allowing for accurate temperature control and easy visibility. Inside, the cabinet showcases a bright stainless liner and a full high-grade stainless steel floor with coved corners for enhanced hygiene and maintenance. Each door includes three adjustable, heavy-duty epoxy-coated wire shelves, providing flexible storage solutions.\nThe unit employs a self-contained capillary tube system that utilizes environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerants, promoting sustainability while ensuring efficient cooling. Its exterior construction consists of full stainless steel for durability, and the built-in condensate heating element in the condensate pan facilitates efficient evaporation of excess water. The bottom-mounted compressor is strategically placed to operate in the coolest area of the kitchen, and the front-accessible, bottom-mounted condensing unit is mounted on a slide-out rack for simplified maintenance. Additional features include self-closing lockable doors, removable magnetic door gaskets for easy cleaning, and larger fan motors and blades that enhance airflow for faster recovery times. The refrigerator is equipped with easy-to-mount casters, including two lockable options, making it mobile. It meets NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage and is backed by a full two-year parts and labor warranty, along with a five-year compressor warranty, ensuring reliable operation.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth:  54 Inches\nDepth: 31 1/4 Inches\nHeight:  83 1/4 Inches\nWeight: 500 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air AGR49 measures 54 inches in width, 31 1/4 inches in depth, and 83 1/4 inches in height, providing a spacious interior that can accommodate a substantial amount of food and beverage products.<br></li><li>Has a shipping weight of 500 lbs, indicating a solid construction that is designed for durability in commercial environments.<br></li><li>Operating at 8 Amps and 115 Volts, the AGR49 is compatible with standard electrical systems, ensuring easy installation and operation in a variety of settings.<br></li><li>Maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, ideal for safely storing perishable items while ensuring they remain fresh and ready for service.<br></li><li>Featuring a bottom-mounted compressor design, the unit enhances efficiency and reduces noise levels, making it suitable for front-of-house applications while simplifying maintenance access.<br></li><li>Equipped with 2 swing glass doors, allowing for easy visibility and access to stored items, improving efficiency during busy service periods.<br></li><li>With a generous capacity of 49 cu. ft., the AGR49 provides wide storage space, accommodating various products and making it an excellent choice for restaurants, cafes, and catering services.<br></li><li>Equipped with 6 shelves, allowing for versatile storage options and efficient organization of food and beverage items.<br></li><li>Crafted from all stainless steel, the AGR49 offers a professional appearance while ensuring durability and ease of cleaning, making it a reliable addition to any kitchen.<br></li><li>Designed as a freestanding unit, the AGR49 can be placed conveniently within the kitchen layout, providing flexibility in design while accommodating various operational needs.</li>'),
('ar', 1632, 'Arctic Air AGR23 27\" Single Commercial Glass Door Reach-In Refrigerator', 'The Arctic Air AGR23 27\" Single Commercial Glass Door Reach-In Refrigerator is a compact and powerful refrigeration solution, ideal for commercial kitchens. With its electronic thermostat and external digital LED display, it ensures precise temperature control, while the bright stainless-steel interior and coved corner design enhance cleanliness and durability. Inside, it comes equipped with three adjustable, heavy-duty epoxy-coated wire shelves, allowing for flexible organization of contents. The self-contained capillary tube system uses CFC-free refrigerant, making it an eco-friendly choice.\nThis refrigerator features a bottom-mounted compressor, designed for efficiency by utilizing the cooler kitchen area. It also has a condensate heating element built into the pan for improved evaporation of excess water, and the bottom-mounted condensing unit is accessible via a slide-out rack, simplifying maintenance. Additional user-friendly features include self-closing lockable doors, easy-to-remove magnetic door gaskets, and large fan motors for superior airflow. It is mounted on casters, two of which are lockable for stability, and is NSF Standard 7 certified for safe food storage.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth:  27 Inches\nDepth: 31 1/4 Inches\nHeight:  83 1/4 Inches\nWeight: 330 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air AGR23 is 27 inches wide, 31 1/4 inches deep, and 83 1/4 inches high, providing a compact and spacious refrigeration solution for commercial kitchens.<br></li><li>Has a shipping weight of 330 lbs, which reflects its solid and durable construction, built to withstand the rigors of a busy kitchen environment.<br></li><li>Operating at 2.6 Amps, 115 Volts, and 60 Hertz in a 1-phase configuration, the AGR23 is designed for energy-efficient performance while being compatible with standard commercial electrical setups.<br></li><li>Maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, ensuring optimal preservation of food and beverages, and keeping items fresh and ready for service.<br></li><li>Bottom-mounted compressor enhances both energy efficiency and ease of access for maintenance while helping to keep the refrigerator cool in high-heat environments.<br></li><li>Features a single swing glass door, allowing for easy visibility of contents and quick access to stored items, enhancing operational efficiency.<br></li><li>With a capacity of 23 cu. ft., the AGR23 offers wide storage space, making it ideal for small to medium-sized operations, while maintaining a compact footprint.<br></li><li>Comes with 3 adjustable shelves, providing versatile storage options for organizing various types of food and beverage products within the refrigerator.<br></li><li>Featuring all stainless steel construction, the AGR23 is not only durable but also easy to clean, making it an attractive and functional addition to any commercial kitchen.<br></li><li>Freestanding with right-hinged doors and does not have Dutch half doors. It includes casters for easy mobility and operates with an R-290 refrigerant, which is environmentally friendly. Backed by a full two-year parts and labor warranty, and a five-year compressor warranty, it provides peace of mind for long-term use.</li>'),
('ar', 1633, 'Arctic Air AWR25 30.75\" Single Door Reach-In Refrigerator in White', 'The Arctic Air AWR25 30.75\" Single Door Reach-In Refrigerator in White is an efficient, commercial-grade unit, designed for temperature accuracy and durability. It features an electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display, allowing precise temperature control and easy monitoring. The interior has bright white ABS sidewalls paired with a high-grade stainless steel floor with coved corners for easy cleaning. Storage flexibility is provided through three adjustable, heavy-duty epoxy-coated wire shelves, while the self-contained capillary tube system uses environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant, aligning with modern sustainability standards.\nThe refrigerator\'s exterior is constructed from white epoxy-coated steel for a clean, professional look, with a bottom-mounted compressor for optimal efficiency in cooler areas of the kitchen. The condensate heating element built into the pan ensures effective water evaporation. It includes a field-reversible, lockable door with a foamed-in-place recessed handle for convenience and security. For smooth mobility, it is equipped with easy-to-mount casters (two lockable). Additionally, larger fan motors and blades increase airflow, speeding up temperature recovery. The refrigerator is NSF Standard 7 certified, ensuring it meets food storage safety requirements.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 30 3/4  Inches\nDepth: 29  Inches\nHeight: 78  Inches\nWeight: 310 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air AWR25 measures 30 3/4 inches wide, 29 inches deep, and 78 inches high, providing a compact and spacious design for commercial refrigeration needs.<br></li><li>With a shipping weight of 310 lbs, it is built to be durable and strong, suitable for various commercial kitchen environments.<br></li><li>Runs on 3 Amps, 115 Volts, and 60 Hertz in a 1-phase configuration, making it efficient and compatible with standard commercial electrical setups.<br></li><li>Offering a generous 25 cu. ft. of internal storage, the AWR25 provides plenty of space for storing refrigerated items, ideal for mid-size commercial kitchens or restaurants.<br></li><li>Bottom-mounted compressor ensures easy access for maintenance and offers improved cooling efficiency by keeping the compressor away from rising kitchen heat.<br></li><li>Features a single swing solid door, which is right-hinged, ensuring easy access while maintaining the internal temperature efficiently.<br></li><li>Capable of maintaining temperatures between 33 - 41 degrees F, ensuring consistent cooling for perishable goods, and meeting food safety standards.<br></li><li>Equipped with 3 adjustable shelves, the AWR25 offers flexibility in storage organization, allowing you to optimize space according to your needs.<br></li><li>Freestanding unit is easy to install and maneuver thanks to its casters, allowing for mobility while being solid enough for long-term use. The painted steel exterior ensures durability and ease of maintenance.<br></li><li>Uses R-290 refrigerant and is powered by a 1/4 HP compressor for reliable cooling performance. It includes a NEMA 5-15P plug type for standard commercial outlets. The AWR25 comes with full one-year parts and labor warranty along with a five-year compressor warranty, providing peace of mind for long-term operation.</li>'),
('ar', 1634, 'Arctic Air AR23 26.75\" Commercial Single Door Reach-In Stainless Steel Refrigerator', 'The Arctic Air AR23 26.75\" Commercial Single Door Reach-In Stainless Steel Refrigerator is built for efficiency and durability, offering a range of advanced features. The electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display ensures precise temperature control. The interior features a bright white epoxy-coated aluminum liner with a high-grade stainless steel floor and coved corners for easy cleaning and durability. The unit includes three adjustable heavy-duty epoxy-coated wire shelves to accommodate various storage needs, while the self-contained capillary tube system uses CFC-free refrigerant, making it environmentally friendly.\nThe refrigerator’s stainless steel front and sides provide a sleek, durable exterior. Its bottom-mounted compressor operates in the coolest area of the kitchen for greater efficiency, and the front-accessible condensing unit is mounted on a slide-out rack for easy maintenance. The self-closing door, which remains open at 90 degrees, features a magnetic gasket that is removable and replaceable without tools. Additional features include field-reversible lockable doors, larger fan motors and blades for improved airflow, and easy-to-mount casters (two lockable). Tested to NSF Standard 7 requirements for safe food storage, it measures 26 3/4 inches in width, 32 3/4 inches in depth, and 82 3/4 inches in height.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 26 3/4  Inches\nDepth: 32 3/4 Inches\nHeight: 82 3/4  Inches\nWeight: 320 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air AR23 measures 26 3/4 inches wide, 32 3/4 inches deep, and 82 3/4 inches high, providing a compact and spacious refrigeration solution for commercial kitchens.<br></li><li>Weighing in at 320 lbs, this refrigerator is solidly built, ensuring durability and the ability to withstand the heavy use typical in busy commercial environments.<br></li><li>Runs on 6 Amps, 115 Volts, and 60 Hertz, with a 1-phase electrical configuration, making it compatible with standard commercial power setups.<br></li><li>Has a total storage capacity of 23 cu. ft., offering wide space for storing refrigerated goods in an organized and accessible manner.<br></li><li>Bottom-mounted compressor aids in easy access for maintenance and improved efficiency. The unit is equipped with casters, providing easy mobility for cleaning or rearranging kitchen layouts.<br></li><li>Features a swing-style solid door with a right-hinged design. This door type ensures a tight seal, helping to maintain consistent internal temperatures.<br></li><li>Maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, which is ideal for safely storing perishable food items and beverages.<br></li><li>Inside the item, there are 3 adjustable shelves, allowing users to customize the storage layout to accommodate items of various sizes, optimizing space.<br></li><li>Designed as a freestanding unit, the refrigerator is constructed from stainless steel and aluminum, ensuring long-lasting durability and easy cleaning in a busy kitchen environment.<br></li><li>Powered by a 3/8 HP compressor and uses R-290 refrigerant. It comes with a NEMA 5-15P plug for a straightforward electrical connection. Additionally, the unit is backed by full two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year compressor warranty, ensuring long-term reliability.</li>'),
('ar', 1635, 'Arctic Air AR23 26.75 Commercial Single Door Reach-In Stainless Steel Refrigerator', 'The Arctic Air AR23 26.75 Commercial Single Door Reach-In Stainless Steel Refrigerator is built for efficiency and durability, offering a range of advanced features. The electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display ensures precise temperature control. The interior features a bright white epoxy-coated aluminum liner with a high-grade stainless steel floor and coved corners for easy cleaning and durability. The unit includes three adjustable heavy-duty epoxy-coated wire shelves to accommodate various storage needs, while the self-contained capillary tube system uses CFC-free refrigerant, making it environmentally friendly.\nThe refrigerator’s stainless steel front and sides provide a sleek, durable exterior. Its bottom-mounted compressor operates in the coolest area of the kitchen for greater efficiency, and the front-accessible condensing unit is mounted on a slide-out rack for easy maintenance. The self-closing door, which remains open at 90 degrees, features a magnetic gasket that is removable and replaceable without tools. Additional features include field-reversible lockable doors, larger fan motors and blades for improved airflow, and easy-to-mount casters (two lockable). Tested to NSF Standard 7 requirements for safe food storage, it measures 26 3/4 inches in width, 32 3/4 inches in depth, and 82 3/4 inches in height.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 26 3/4  Inches\nDepth: 32 3/4 Inches\nHeight: 82 3/4  Inches\nWeight: 320 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air AR23 measures 26 3/4 inches wide, 32 3/4 inches deep, and 82 3/4 inches high, providing a compact and spacious refrigeration solution for commercial kitchens.<br></li><li>Weighing in at 320 lbs, this refrigerator is solidly built, ensuring durability and the ability to withstand the heavy use typical in busy commercial environments.<br></li><li>Runs on 6 Amps, 115 Volts, and 60 Hertz, with a 1-phase electrical configuration, making it compatible with standard commercial power setups.<br></li><li>Has a total storage capacity of 23 cu. ft., offering wide space for storing refrigerated goods in an organized and accessible manner.<br></li><li>Bottom-mounted compressor aids in easy access for maintenance and improved efficiency. The unit is equipped with casters, providing easy mobility for cleaning or rearranging kitchen layouts.<br></li><li>Features a swing-style solid door with a right-hinged design. This door type ensures a tight seal, helping to maintain consistent internal temperatures.<br></li><li>Maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, which is ideal for safely storing perishable food items and beverages.<br></li><li>Inside the item, there are 3 adjustable shelves, allowing users to customize the storage layout to accommodate items of various sizes, optimizing space.<br></li><li>Designed as a freestanding unit, the refrigerator is constructed from stainless steel and aluminum, ensuring long-lasting durability and easy cleaning in a busy kitchen environment.<br></li><li>Powered by a 3/8 HP compressor and uses R-290 refrigerant. It comes with a NEMA 5-15P plug for a straightforward electrical connection. Additionally, the unit is backed by full two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year compressor warranty, ensuring long-term reliability.</li>'),
('ar', 1636, 'Arctic Air ACP40 40 Six Pan Stainless Steel Counter Top Prep Unit', 'The Arctic Air ACP40 is a 40-inch countertop prep unit specifically designed for efficient food preparation. It features a stainless cover that protects the refrigerated area, allowing for quick access to ingredients while maintaining cleanliness. It employs a “cold wall” heat transfer system instead of traditional air cooling, providing consistent cooling performance. Its interior cabinet is fully lined with stainless steel for durability and easy cleaning, while the exterior shell is also made of stainless steel. To prevent damage to surfaces, the unit is equipped with plastic non-scratch feet.\nThis prep unit includes 1/6 size, 69-deep stainless pans, and covers, as well as stainless pan supports to facilitate organized food storage. It operates using a self-contained capillary tube system with CFC-free refrigerant (R290), ensuring environmental safety. The electronic thermostat features an external digital LED display for precise temperature control and ease of monitoring. The ACP40 is rigorously tested to meet NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage. It’s important to note that the Item does not have a defrost system, meaning it must be turned off for defrosting, as it is designated as an “in-service” item.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 39 1/2\nDepth: 15 1/2\nHeight: 11\nWeight 90 lb.\n', '<li>Has a shipping weight of 90 lbs, ensuring a strong design that is still manageable for transport to your kitchen setup.<br></li><li>Features a width of 39 1/2 inches, a depth of 15 1/2 inches, and a height of 11 inches, optimizing countertop space for efficient access to ingredients and preparation tasks.<br></li><li>Operating at 1.4 amps with a 60-hertz power supply, it runs on 1-phase electricity and requires 115 volts for its operation, making it suitable for standard kitchen outlets.<br></li><li>Includes a side-mounted compressor with a power rating of 1/4 HP, ensuring consistent cooling for keeping your ingredients fresh and safe.<br></li><li>Equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug, it operates on electric power and features a power cord length of 8 feet, providing flexibility for placement in any kitchen layout.<br></li><li>Utilizing R-600A refrigerant, it maintains a temperature range between 33°F and 41°F, ideal for preserving the quality of perishable items and ensuring food safety.<br></li><li>Designed to accommodate 6 pans of 1/6 size, this prep unit offers wide storage space for various ingredients, making it perfect for salad and sandwich preparations.<br></li><li>Operates at 161 watts and is constructed from durable stainless steel, which not only gives it a sleek appearance but also ensures long-lasting performance and easy maintenance.<br></li><li>Featuring 6 compartments with a hinged lid, the design facilitates easy access to stored ingredients while helping to maintain the appropriate temperature for freshness.<br></li><li>It includes a digital temperature control system for precise monitoring of internal temperatures, and it comes with a full one-year parts and labor warranty for added peace of mind.<br></li><li></li>');
INSERT INTO `ec_products_translations` (`lang_code`, `ec_products_id`, `name`, `description`, `content`) VALUES
('ar', 1637, 'Arctic Air 64915K 94 Two Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf For APP94', 'The Arctic Air 64915K is a 94-inch two-tier stainless steel overshelf designed for the APP94 model, boasting a strong construction that supports efficient food storage and preparation. With a shipping weight of 66 lbs, it measures 94 inches in width, 18 inches in depth, and 30 inches in height. It features a double deck design with two shelves, crafted from 22 gauge stainless steel, ensuring durability and resistance to corrosion. This construction not only enhances its strength but also makes it easy to clean, making it ideal for commercial kitchen environments.\nThe undershelf includes a reinforced full-length hat channel mounted for added support, promoting stability and load-bearing capacity. This feature is crucial for holding heavy items without compromising safety or performance. The double-tier design optimizes vertical storage space, allowing kitchen staff to maximize efficiency while keeping ingredients and equipment organized and accessible. The combination of its solid construction and functional design makes the Arctic Air 64915K overshelf an essential addition to any professional kitchen setup, ensuring reliable performance and longevity.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 94”\nDepth: 18”\nHeight: 30”\nWeight 66 lb.', '<li>Has a shipping weight of 66 lbs, ensuring it is solid and manageable for installation in your kitchen setup.<br></li><li>Features a width of 94 inches, a depth of 18 inches, and a height of 30 inches, providing wide space for storage and organization of kitchen supplies and equipment.<br></li><li>Designed with a double shelf configuration, it offers excellent vertical storage capacity for various kitchen items, maximizing the use of available space.<br></li><li>Constructed from stainless steel, it combines durability and a sleek finish, ensuring it withstands the rigors of a busy kitchen environment while remaining easy to clean.<br></li><li>This is classified as a double deck overshelf, making it ideal for storing a variety of kitchen essentials, from cooking supplies to display items.<br></li><li>Featuring a 22 gauge thickness, the material provides a strong and stable surface for holding heavy items without bending or warping.<br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1638, 'Arctic Air 64914K 71 Two Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf For APP71', 'The Arctic Air 64914K is a 71-inch two-tier stainless steel overshelf designed specifically for the APP71 model, ensuring that your kitchen space is both functional and organized. With a shipping weight of 53 lbs, this overshelf measures 71 inches in width, 18 inches in depth, and 30 inches in height. It features a double deck design, allowing for wide storage and easy access to essential items. Crafted from 22 gauge stainless steel, it provides excellent durability and resistance to rust and corrosion, making it suitable for demanding kitchen environments.\nIt includes a reinforced full-length hat channel mounted to the underside of the stainless steel shelf, adding extra support to enhance stability and load-bearing capacity. The double-tier construction maximizes vertical storage, helping to keep ingredients, utensils, and equipment neatly organized. This design not only optimizes workspace efficiency but also facilitates quick access to frequently used items, ensuring a smoother workflow in busy kitchens. The combination of strength, stability, and thoughtful design makes the Arctic Air 64914K an invaluable asset for any commercial kitchen setup.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 71”\nDepth: 18”\nHeight: 30”\nWeight 53 lb.', '<li>Has a shipping weight of 53 lbs, making it manageable for transportation while ensuring a solid construction for heavy-duty use.<br></li><li>Features a width of 71 inches, a depth of 18 inches, and a height of 30 inches, providing wide storage space for kitchen supplies and equipment.<br></li><li>Designed with a double shelf configuration, it maximizes vertical storage capacity, allowing for organized placement of various kitchen essentials.<br></li><li>Made from stainless steel, it is durable, resistant to rust and corrosion, and easy to clean, maintaining a professional look in any kitchen setting.<br></li><li>Classified as a double deck overshelf, it is ideal for both storage and display purposes in commercial kitchens, ensuring efficient use of space.<br></li><li>Material has a thickness of 22 gauge, providing a solid and stable surface capable of supporting heavy items without bending or sagging.<br></li><li>It includes a reinforced full-length hat channel mounted to the underside of the stainless steel shelf, which adds significant support and stability for the stored items.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1639, 'Arctic Air 64913K 48 Two Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf For APP48', 'The Arctic Air 64913K is a 48-inch, two-tier stainless steel overshelf designed for the APP48 model. It features a durable construction made from 22-gauge stainless steel, ensuring longevity and strongness in demanding kitchen environments. With dimensions of 48 in length, 18 in width, and 30 in height, it provides wide space for organizing kitchen essentials. The double-deck design maximizes storage efficiency by offering two shelves for easy access to items. It weighs 38 lbs, making it solid and manageable to install and integrate into various kitchen setups.\nThis two-tier overshelf is ideal for professionals looking to increase storage while maintaining a streamlined workspace. Its stainless steel build not only enhances durability but also offers a smooth and modern appearance that complements various kitchen environments. The double-deck structure allows for additional organization, making it easier to keep tools, utensils, or ingredients within arm’s reach. Perfect for use with the APP48, this shelf ensures utility and style in any commercial kitchen.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 18\nLength: 48”\nHeight: 30\nWeight 38 lb.\n', '<li>Has a shipping weight of 38 lbs, making it lightweight and durable enough for commercial use.<br></li><li>Spans a length of 48 inches, offering wide space for additional storage and organization above your APP48 unit.<br></li><li>With an 18-inch width, it provides a balanced structure for holding items efficiently while maintaining a sleek profile.<br></li><li>Height of 30 inches ensures great space between tiers, accommodating various kitchen essentials comfortably.<br></li><li>Made from stainless steel, it is highly durable, corrosion-resistant, and easy to clean, making it ideal for the demands of a busy commercial kitchen.<br></li><li>It features two tiers, providing extra storage levels for kitchen tools, ingredients, or other necessities, and optimizing vertical space.<br></li><li>Constructed with 22-gauge stainless steel, it strikes a balance between durability and lightweight functionality, ensuring it withstands regular use.<br></li><li>Classified as a double-deck overshelf, it maximizes vertical storage space, giving you more room for storage without taking up additional floor space.<br></li><li>Designed to fit perfectly with the APP48 series, it enhances functionality without compromising kitchen space.<br></li><li>Strong stainless steel finish complements the design of any professional kitchen, adding both aesthetic appeal and practical storage to your equipment.<br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1640, 'Arctic Air 64911K 94 Single Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf For APP94', 'The Arctic Air 64911K 94 Single Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf is designed to enhance workspace organization and efficiency in commercial kitchen settings. With a shipping weight of 38 lbs, this strong overshelf measures 94 inches in width and 18 inches in depth, providing wide storage space above the food prep area. Its height of 20 inches is optimal for maximizing vertical space while ensuring easy accessibility for kitchen staff. Constructed entirely from stainless steel, this over-shelf is durable, easy to clean, and resistant to corrosion, making it ideal for food service environments.\nThis single-tier overshelf features a single-deck design that offers a straightforward and effective solution for storing ingredients, tools, and equipment within arm\'s reach. The streamlined construction ensures that it integrates perfectly with the Arctic Air APP94 pizza prep table, promoting an organized and efficient work environment. Its solid design supports various kitchen items, helping to keep the workspace tidy and enhancing overall productivity in fast-paced kitchen operations.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 94 Inches\nDepth: 18 Inches\nHeight: 20  Inches\nWeight: 38 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air 64911K weighs 38 lbs, making it manageable for installation while providing a solid overhead storage solution.<br></li><li>Measures 94 inches in width, 18 inches in depth, and 20 inches in height, allowing wide space for storing kitchen essentials above your APP94 prep table.<br></li><li>Its design features a single shelf, providing a spacious area for storing frequently used items, enhancing organization and accessibility in your workspace.<br></li><li>Crafted from stainless steel, it offers durability and resistance to rust and corrosion, ensuring longevity in demanding kitchen environments.<br></li><li>Classified as a single-deck unit, this overshelf maximizes overhead storage without taking up valuable floor space, making it ideal for busy kitchens.<br></li><li>Specifically designed for the APP94 prep table, it enhances functionality while maintaining a excellent look in your kitchen setup.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1641, 'Arctic Air 64910K 71 Single Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf For APP71', 'The Arctic Air 64910K 71 Single Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf is an essential addition to the APP71 series, designed to maximize workspace efficiency in commercial kitchens. Weighing 31 lbs, it provides a solid structure with a width of 71 inches and a depth of 18 inches, creating wide space for storage and organization of kitchen supplies. Its height of 20 inches allows for easy access while keeping items within reach, enhancing workflow efficiency.\nConstructed from durable stainless steel, this overshelf is built to withstand the rigors of a busy kitchen environment, ensuring longevity and resistance to corrosion. As a single deck shelf with one tier, it offers a straightforward design that provides sufficient surface area for storing ingredients, utensils, and equipment without taking up excessive vertical space. This practical addition not only helps in decluttering the workspace but also adheres to professional standards, contributing to an organized and efficient kitchen setup.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 71 Inches\nDepth: 18 Inches\nHeight: 20  Inches\nWeight: 31 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air 64910K has a shipping weight of 31 lbs, indicating a lightweight and solid design that facilitates easy installation and handling.<br></li><li>Measures 71 inches in width, providing wide space for additional storage and organization above the APP71, enhancing workspace efficiency.<br></li><li>With a depth of 18 inches, the overshelf offers a generous surface area for holding ingredients, utensils, and other kitchen essentials while remaining compact.<br></li><li>Its height is 20 inches, allowing for sufficient clearance to accommodate various items while maintaining a streamlined appearance.<br></li><li>Designed as a single shelf, this overshelf maximizes vertical space, making it an ideal solution for kitchens where space optimization is key.<br></li><li>Made from stainless steel, it is built for durability and longevity, resistant to rust and corrosion, ensuring it withstands the rigors of a busy kitchen environment.<br></li><li>Classified as a single deck overshelf, it offers a straightforward and functional design that simplifies organization and enhances accessibility to frequently used items.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1642, 'Arctic Air 64909K 48 Single Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf For APP48', 'The Arctic Air 64909K 48 Single Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf is designed specifically for use with the APP48 series, enhancing the functionality of commercial kitchen spaces. Weighing 25 lbs, it features a 48-inch width and an 18-inch depth, providing wide space for organizing kitchen supplies. With a height of 20 inches, it ensures easy access to items while keeping them within reach, thus improving operational efficiency in fast-paced environments.\nConstructed from strong stainless steel with a 22-gauge thickness, it is built to endure the demands of daily use in busy kitchens. It maximizes storage capabilities without occupying excessive vertical space, allowing for efficient organization of ingredients and tools. This practical design not only helps to maintain a clutter-free workspace but also adheres to professional standards, contributing to a streamlined and productive kitchen environment.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 48 Inches\nDepth: 18 Inches\nHeight: 20  Inches\nWeight: 25 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air 64909K has a shipping weight of 25 lbs, ensuring a lightweight design that allows for easy handling and installation in your kitchen setup.<br></li><li>Features a width of 48 inches, providing a spacious area for additional storage, and enhancing your kitchen organization above the APP48.<br></li><li>With a depth of 18 inches, it offers sufficient space for holding essential kitchen items while maintaining a compact footprint, making it ideal for tight spaces.<br></li><li>Its height is 20 inches, allowing for wide clearance to store and access various items without obstruction, optimizing workspace efficiency.<br></li><li>Designed as a single shelf, it effectively utilizes vertical space, offering a practical solution for kitchens that require efficient organization.<br></li><li>Made from stainless steel, it is built to withstand the demands of a busy kitchen, ensuring durability and resistance to rust and corrosion over time.<br></li><li>Classified as a single deck overshelf, it provides a straightforward design that simplifies access to stored items, making it a functional addition to any kitchen environment.<br></li><li>Features a 22 gauge stainless steel construction, ensuring strength and stability while maintaining a lightweight design suitable for everyday use.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1643, 'Arctic Air 64908K 72â€ Two Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf For AST/AMT72', 'The Arctic Air 64908K 72” Two-Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf is engineered for use with the AST/AMT72 series, offering additional storage and organization for commercial kitchen environments. Weighing 52 lbs, this versatile overshelf features a generous 72-inch length and an 18-inch width, providing wide space to accommodate various kitchen tools and supplies. With a height of 30 inches, the double deck design enhances accessibility, allowing kitchen staff to efficiently utilize vertical space while keeping essential items within easy reach.\nConstructed from durable stainless steel with a 22-gauge thickness, this overshelf is designed for longevity and stability in high-demand settings. As a double-shelf item, it maximizes storage capacity without taking up excessive floor space, making it ideal for streamlining workflows in busy kitchens. This practical design not only helps maintain an organized workspace but also adheres to industry standards, supporting efficient operations and contributing to a more productive kitchen atmosphere.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 18 Inches\nLength: 72 Inches\nHeight: 30  Inches\nWeight: 52 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air 64908K has a shipping weight of 52 lbs, making it solid and manageable for transport and installation in your commercial kitchen.<br></li><li>Features a length of 72 inches, providing an expansive storage area to effectively utilize vertical space above your AST/AMT72 units.<br></li><li>With a width of 18 inches, the overshelf offers sufficient depth for storing kitchen essentials, ensuring easy access to frequently used items without consuming excessive floor space.<br></li><li>Its height is 30 inches, providing wide clearance for stacking items while ensuring easy visibility and accessibility from below.<br></li><li>Designed with a double shelf configuration, it maximizes storage potential by allowing the organization of more items within a compact area.<br></li><li>Constructed from stainless steel, it is durable and resistant to rust and corrosion, ensuring longevity and maintaining its appearance in a busy kitchen environment.<br></li><li>Classified as a double deck overshelf, it facilitates effective organization, allowing for versatile storage options for various kitchen supplies and equipment.<br></li><li>Features a strong 22 gauge stainless steel construction, ensuring strength and stability, which is crucial for supporting heavy kitchen items.<br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1644, 'Arctic Air 64907K 60â€ Two Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf For AST/AMT60', 'The Arctic Air 64907K 60” Two-Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf is a strong storage solution designed for use with the AST/AMT60 series, ideal for maximizing vertical space in commercial kitchens. With a height of 30 inches, a length of 60 inches, and a width of 18 inches, this double-deck overshelf provides wide storage area for kitchen tools and supplies, enhancing accessibility and organization. Weighing 40 lbs, its solid construction supports efficient kitchen operations while maintaining a clean and orderly workspace.\nCrafted from high-quality stainless steel with a 22-gauge thickness, it is built to withstand the rigors of a bustling kitchen environment. It allows for the strategic placement of items, optimizing space utilization without encroaching on floor areas. The durable design ensures long-lasting performance, making it a practical addition to any food service establishment focused on efficiency and organization.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 18 Inches\nLength: 60 Inches\nHeight: 30  Inches\nWeight: 40 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air 64907K features a height of 30 inches, allowing for substantial vertical storage while ensuring easy access to items stored on both tiers.<br></li><li>With a length of 60 inches, this overshelf provides wide space for organizing kitchen essentials and supplies above your AST/AMT60 units, optimizing your workspace.<br></li><li>Constructed from stainless steel, this overshelf is built for durability and strength, offering resistance against rust and corrosion, making it suitable for busy commercial kitchens.<br></li><li>Classified specifically as a shelf, it serves to increase your storage capacity effectively, accommodating various kitchen items within easy reach.<br></li><li>Designed as a double deck overshelf, it maximizes storage potential by providing two levels of organization, allowing for efficient use of vertical space.<br></li><li>Has a width of 18 inches, offering sufficient depth for storing items while not encroaching on the valuable workspace below.<br></li><li>Its construction features 22 gauge stainless steel, ensuring both sturdiness and resilience, which is critical for supporting heavier kitchen tools and supplies.<br></li><li>Weighing in at 40 lbs, this overshelf strikes a balance between being strong and manageable, facilitating easier installation and adjustment in your kitchen setup.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1645, 'Arctic Air 64906K 48â€ Two Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf For AST/AMT48', 'The Arctic Air 64906K 48” Two-Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf is designed for use with the AST/AMT48 series, offering an efficient storage solution that maximizes vertical space. This double-deck overshelf has a length of 48 inches, a width of 18 inches, and a height of 30 inches, providing two tiers of storage for kitchen supplies. Its solid stainless steel construction ensures durability in commercial kitchen environments, while its 22-gauge thickness adds strength and longevity, making it a practical and reliable addition to any kitchen.\nWeighing 38 lbs, its lightweight design makes it easy to install while still providing a solid platform for holding kitchen essentials. The double-deck layout enhances storage efficiency, offering a versatile solution for organizing frequently used items without taking up additional counter space. Built to high standards, this stainless steel unit ensures both functionality and durability, catering to the needs of busy commercial kitchens.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 18 Inches\nLength: 48 Inches\nHeight: 30  Inches\nWeight: 38 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air 64906K overshelf has a shipping weight of 38 lbs, making it lightweight and solid enough for easy handling and installation in your commercial kitchen.<br></li><li>48-inch length of the overshelf offers a compact and efficient storage solution, fitting perfectly above your AST/AMT48 models to provide extra space without taking up too much room.<br></li><li>With a width of 18 inches, it provides enough depth for storing items such as kitchen utensils, containers, or other food preparation tools, optimizing the space above your equipment.<br></li><li>Standing at 30 inches tall, the two-tier design ensures wide vertical storage, allowing you to keep frequently used items within reach while maximizing your workspace.<br></li><li>Features two shelves, providing a double deck structure to offer versatile storage and easy access to various kitchen essentials.<br></li><li>Made from stainless steel, it ensures long-lasting durability, resistance to corrosion, and easy cleaning qualities essential for commercial kitchen environments.<br></li><li>Classified as a double deck overshelf, it maximizes your storage capabilities by utilizing both tiers for improved organization and accessibility in tight spaces.<br></li><li>Constructed from 22-gauge stainless steel, it strikes a balance between strength and lightness, making it capable of supporting kitchen items while being easy to manage.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1646, 'Arctic Air 64903K 60â€ Single Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf For AST/AMT60', 'The Arctic Air 64903K 60 Single Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf is a practical storage solution tailored for use with the AST/AMT60 series, offering effective organization in commercial kitchens. With a length of 60 inches, a width of 18 inches, and a height of 20 inches, this single-deck overshelf provides wide space for storing kitchen essentials. Crafted from stainless steel, it promises durability and resistance to wear and tear, while the 22-gauge thickness ensures strong support for various items.\nWeighing just 26 lbs, it is lightweight and easy to install, making it an efficient addition to any kitchen workspace. Its design maximizes vertical storage, keeping essential tools and ingredients within reach without taking up valuable counter space. The combination of solid construction and thoughtful design enhances workflow efficiency in busy kitchens, making this overshelf an ideal choice for professionals looking to streamline their operations and maintain an organized cooking environment.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 18 Inches\nLength: 60 Inches\nHeight: 20  Inches\nWeight: 26 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air 64903K overshelf has a shipping weight of 26 lbs, providing a balance of sturdiness and ease of transport, making it a practical addition to any commercial kitchen.<br></li><li>Measuring 60 inches in length, it is designed to enhance your storage capabilities, allowing for efficient organization above your AST/AMT60 units.<br></li><li>With a width of 18 inches, it provides wide space for storing kitchen essentials, making it easy to keep frequently used items within arm\'s reach.<br></li><li>Standing at 20 inches, it is positioned at a convenient height for quick access, optimizing vertical space without cluttering your workspace.<br></li><li>Featuring one shelf, this single-tier design simplifies storage and organization, allowing for easy visibility and access to items stored above your prep units.<br></li><li>Made from high-quality stainless steel, it is resistant to rust and corrosion, ensuring durability and easy maintenance in a fast-paced kitchen environment.<br></li><li>As a single deck overshelf, it offers a straightforward solution for additional storage without overwhelming your cooking area, making it ideal for compact kitchen setups.<br></li><li>Constructed from 22-gauge stainless steel, it provides excellent strength and durability while remaining lightweight enough for convenient handling and installation.<br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1647, 'Arctic Air 64902K 48â€ Single Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf For AST/AMT48', 'The Arctic Air 64902K 48” Single Tier Stainless Steel Overshelf is designed for the AST/AMT48 series, providing an effective solution for maximizing vertical storage in busy commercial kitchens. With a length of 48 inches, a width of 18 inches, and a height of 20 inches, this single-deck overshelf offers wide space for keeping essential kitchen supplies organized and easily accessible. Constructed from stainless steel, it ensures durability and resistance to corrosion, making it suitable for various kitchen environments. The 22-gauge thickness adds to its strength, allowing it to support a wide range of items.\nWeighing only 22 lbs, it is lightweight, facilitating easy installation and relocation as needed. Its design helps to free up valuable countertop space, allowing chefs and kitchen staff to work more efficiently. By providing a designated area for storing ingredients, utensils, and equipment, this overshelf contributes to maintaining a tidy workspace. The combination of solid construction and practical design makes the Arctic Air 64902K an essential addition for any professional kitchen looking to enhance organization and workflow efficiency.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 18 Inches\nLength: 48 Inches\nHeight: 20  Inches\nWeight: 22 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air 64902K overshelf has a shipping weight of 22 lbs, making it a lightweight and solid addition to enhance storage above your prep units.<br></li><li>Measures 48 inches in length, providing wide space for additional storage without taking up extra floor space in your kitchen.<br></li><li>With a width of 18 inches, it offers a wide surface for storing essential items, allowing easy access to frequently used tools and supplies.<br></li><li>Stands at 20 inches in height, offering a comfortable reach for users while optimizing vertical space.<br></li><li>It is a single-tier overshelf, featuring one shelf that provides a simple and efficient storage solution for your kitchen.<br></li><li>Built from durable stainless steel, it is designed to resist corrosion and withstand the rigors of daily kitchen use, ensuring longevity.<br></li><li>As a single deck overshelf, it offers an uncluttered storage solution that fits well in any commercial kitchen setting, maximizing overhead space.<br></li><li>Made from 22-gauge stainless steel, it strikes a balance between strength and weight, providing durability while remaining easy to install and maintain.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1648, 'Arctic Air 64901K  21 Stainless Steel Sheet Pan Rack For AR23,AGR23,AF23,AR49,AGR49,AF49,APP48R,APP71R,APP94R', 'The Arctic Air 64901K 21 Stainless Steel Sheet Pan Rack is expertly designed for use with a variety of models, including AR23, AGR23, AF23, AR49, AGR49, AF49, APP48R, APP71R, and APP94R. With a shipping weight of 25 lbs, it features dimensions of 21 inches in width, 22.5 inches in depth, and 22.5 inches in height, making it a compact and efficient solution for storing sheet and bun pans. Its open-top design allows for easy access to the pans, enhancing workflow in busy kitchens.\nThis rack holds six levels, providing wide space for organization while using a bottom-load slide type for convenient pan retrieval. Constructed from durable stainless steel, the Arctic Air 64901K ensures long-lasting performance and resistance to corrosion, making it ideal for food service environments. Its versatility and efficient design not only help in maximizing storage but also contribute to maintaining cleanliness and organization in any commercial kitchen.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 21 Inches\nLength: 22.5 Inches\nHeight: 22.5  Inches\nShipping Weight: 25 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air 64901K sheet pan rack has a shipping weight of 25 lbs, ensuring a strong structure while being manageable for installation.<br></li><li>With a width of 21 inches, this rack is designed to fit perfectly alongside your existing kitchen equipment, optimizing available space.<br></li><li>Measuring 22.5 inches in depth, it provides wide room for storing multiple sheet pans without compromising accessibility.<br></li><li>Height of 22.5 inches allows for easy access to pans and quick loading or unloading, enhancing workflow in busy kitchen environments.<br></li><li>Featuring an open top, the design facilitates easy loading of sheet pans and improves airflow, ensuring efficient cooling and storage.<br></li><li>Includes 6 levels, providing sufficient vertical space for organizing various sheet or bun pans, maximizing storage efficiency.<br></li><li>Designed for bottom load, it allows for straightforward placement and removal of pans, improving operational efficiency during meal prep.<br></li><li>It is specifically designed for sheet/bun pans, making it ideal for bakeries and food service operations that require versatile storage options.<br></li><li>Made from high-quality stainless steel, it offers durability and resistance to corrosion, ensuring long-term performance in a commercial kitchen setting.<br></li><li>Compatible with various models, including AR23, AGR23, AF23, AR49, AGR49, AF49, APP48R, APP71R, and APP94R, making it a versatile addition to your kitchen equipment lineup.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1649, 'Arctic Air 64900K 21 Stainless Steel Sheet Pan Rack For AR23,AGR23,AF23,AR49,AGR49,AF49', 'The Arctic Air 64900K 21 Stainless Steel Sheet Pan Rack is specifically designed for compatibility with models such as AR23, AGR23, AF23, AR49, AGR49, and AF49. This strong rack has a shipping weight of 32 lbs, and its dimensions are 21 inches in width, 22.5 inches in depth, and 48 inches in height, making it a space-efficient solution for food storage in commercial kitchens. The open-top design enhances accessibility, allowing for easy placement and retrieval of bun pans.\nConstructed from high-quality stainless steel, it is built for durability and longevity, ensuring it can withstand the rigors of a busy kitchen environment. It features an end load configuration and open sides, facilitating smooth pan access while optimizing space usage. This rack style is particularly suitable for organizing and storing bun pans, making it an essential tool for any food service operation looking to improve workflow and organization while maintaining hygiene and efficiency in food preparation areas.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 21 Inches\nLength: 22.5 Inches\nHeight: 48  Inches\nShipping Weight: 32 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air 64900K sheet pan rack has a shipping weight of 32 lbs, which indicates a solid construction suitable for commercial use.<br></li><li>With a width of 21 inches, it is designed to fit conveniently within various kitchen spaces, ensuring efficient organization.<br></li><li>Measuring 22.5 inches in depth, it provides wide space for multiple sheet pans, making it easy to store and access items.<br></li><li>Standing at 48 inches, it offers a substantial vertical storage solution, maximizing the use of space in your kitchen.<br></li><li>Featuring an open top, the design promotes easy loading and unloading of pans while ensuring proper ventilation.<br></li><li>Made from durable stainless steel, the rack is built to withstand the rigors of a commercial kitchen, providing longevity and ease of maintenance.<br></li><li>Designed for end load, it allows for efficient placement and removal of pans from the front, streamlining food preparation processes.<br></li><li>Open sides enhance accessibility, making it easy to grab pans from either side while ensuring a clear view of stored items.<br></li><li>Specifically designed for bun pans, this rack is perfect for bakeries and food service operations, optimizing storage for various baking needs.<br></li><li>Compatible with models such as AR23, AGR23, AF23, AR49, AGR49, and AF49, making it a versatile addition to your kitchen equipment.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1650, 'Arctic Air 70251K Merchandiser Shelf Kit with Four Mounting Clips For ARGDM49,AFGDM49', 'The Arctic Air 70251K Merchandiser Shelf Kit is designed specifically for the ARGDM49 and AFGDM49 models, providing an effective solution for maximizing display and storage space within these units. Measuring 23.5 inches in length and 24 inches in width, it enhances the visibility and accessibility of merchandise, allowing for better organization and presentation of products. It includes four mounting clips, ensuring secure and stable installation, which is essential for maintaining a professional appearance in retail settings.\nConstructed to meet the demands of a commercial environment, this shelf kit allows for easy adjustments and repositioning to accommodate various products. The design facilitates optimal airflow around displayed items, contributing to better preservation of perishable goods. Its solid construction guarantees durability, making it an ideal addition to any merchandising setup focused on efficiency and effective product showcasing. It not only enhances functionality but also improves the overall aesthetic of the refrigerated display unit.\nDimensions\nWidth: 24 Inches\nLength: 23.5 Inches', '<li>The Arctic Air 70251K merchandiser shelf kit measures 23.5 inches in length, providing a suitable surface area for displaying merchandise efficiently.<br></li><li>With a width of 24 inches, it offers wide space for products, allowing for organized presentation and easy access.<br></li><li>Designed specifically for use with models ARGDM49 and AFGDM49, ensuring a perfect fit and optimal performance in your merchandising setup.<br></li><li>Includes four mounting clips, facilitating secure and stable attachment to the designated display units, ensuring the shelf remains firmly in place.<br></li><li>Constructed from durable materials, it is designed to withstand the demands of a busy retail environment, ensuring long-lasting use.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1651, 'Arctic Air 70250K Merchandiser Shelf Kit with Four Mounting Clips For ARGDM23,AFGDM23', 'The Arctic Air 70250K Merchandiser Shelf Kit is an essential addition designed specifically for the ARGDM23 and AFGDM23 models, offering an efficient way to enhance product visibility and organization within refrigerated displays. It includes one standard shelf measuring 21.25 x 24.50 inches, providing wide space for displaying a variety of items. It not only supports the weight of numerous products but also features a label holder, making it easier to identify merchandise at a glance and ensuring a neat presentation.\nIncluded in the kit are four mounting clips, which facilitate straightforward installation and ensure the shelf is securely attached to the display unit. This setup allows for easy adjustments and repositioning of the shelf, catering to different product sizes and display preferences. The shelf\'s strong construction is designed to withstand the rigors of a commercial environment, making it an ideal choice for businesses looking to improve their merchandising strategies while maintaining a professional appearance.\nDimensions\n21.25 x 24.50 inches', '<li>Includes 1 shelf, specifically designed for effective merchandising, allowing for the organized display of products.<br></li><li>Comes with four mounting clips, ensuring secure installation and stability of the shelf on compatible display units.<br></li><li>Features standard dimensions of 21.25 inches in width and 24.50 inches in depth, providing wide space for product placement and visibility.<br></li><li>Designed for use with models ARGDM23 and AFGDM23, ensuring a precise fit for optimal performance in your merchandising setups.<br></li><li>Includes a label holder, allowing for easy identification and pricing of merchandise, enhancing the shopping experience for customers.</li>'),
('ar', 1652, 'Arctic Air 70119RK Right Shelf Kit with Four Mounting Clips For AGR49, AGDF490', 'The Arctic Air 70119RK Right Shelf Kit is designed to enhance storage and display capabilities for the AGR49 and AGDF490 models. It includes one standard shelf that measures 24.50 x 24.50 inches, providing a solid platform for displaying a variety of items, whether they are beverages, condiments, or other merchandise. The design ensures that the shelf can handle the demands of a commercial kitchen or merchandising environment, making it a practical addition to any food service operation.\nIn addition to the shelf, it comes with four mounting clips that facilitate easy installation and secure attachment to the refrigeration unit. These clips ensure stability and allow for quick adjustments if needed. The strong construction of the shelf and its mounting system are tailored to withstand daily use, making it an ideal solution for businesses aiming to optimize their space and improve product visibility. This shelf kit is essential for any establishment looking to maximize efficiency and organization in their refrigerated display units.\nDimensions\n24.50 x 24.50 inches', '<li>Includes one standard shelf measuring 24.50 inches in width and 24.50 inches in depth, providing a spacious area for displaying a variety of merchandise.<br></li><li>Comes equipped with four mounting clips, ensuring secure installation and stability of the shelf on compatible display units.<br></li><li>Designed for use with models AGR49 and AGDF490, it guarantees a precise fit for optimal performance in your merchandising setups.<br></li><li>Made from durable materials, it is built to withstand the demands of a retail environment, ensuring longevity and reliability.<br></li><li>Its practical design enhances product visibility, helping to attract customer attention and facilitate easy access to displayed items.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1653, 'Arctic Air 70119lk Left Shelf Kit with Four Mounting Clips For AGR49,AGDF49', 'The Arctic Air 70119LK Left Shelf Kit is specifically engineered for use with the AGR49 and AGDF49 models, offering an effective solution to expand storage and display options. It features one standard shelf, measuring 24.50 x 24 inches, ideal for organizing and showcasing a variety of products, including drinks and condiments. Its strong design ensures durability, making it suitable for the rigors of commercial kitchen environments where reliability is crucial.\nIncluded with the shelf are four mounting clips, which facilitate straightforward installation and ensure secure attachment to the refrigeration unit. These clips allow for easy adjustments, making the setup process efficient and user-friendly. The combination of the high-quality shelf and reliable mounting system provides an optimal balance of functionality and stability, making this shelf kit a valuable addition for businesses seeking to enhance their refrigerated display units and maximize operational efficiency.\nDimensions\n24.50 x 24 inches', '<li>Includes one standard shelf measuring 24.50 inches in width and 24 inches in depth, providing wide space for displaying a variety of merchandise.<br></li><li>Equipped with four mounting clips, ensuring secure installation and stability of the shelf on compatible display units.<br></li><li>Designed specifically for use with models AGR49 and AGDF49, this shelf kit guarantees a precise fit for optimal performance in your merchandising setups.<br></li><li>Made from durable materials, it is built to withstand the rigors of a retail environment, ensuring longevity and reliability in everyday use.<br></li><li>Its practical design enhances product visibility, helping to attract customer attention and facilitate easy access to displayed items.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1654, 'Arctic Air 70118K Refrigerator Shelf Kit with Four Mounting Clips For AGR23,AGDF23', 'The Arctic Air 70118K Refrigerator Shelf Kit is designed for use with the AGR23 and AGDF23 refrigeration models, offering an efficient solution for enhancing storage capacity within commercial settings. It includes one standard shelf that measures 21.25 x 23.50 inches, providing wide space for organizing various items such as beverages, condiments, or other food products. It is constructed from durable materials to withstand the demands of a busy kitchen, ensuring longevity and reliability in everyday use.\nAccompanying the shelf are four mounting clips, which simplify the installation process and secure the shelf firmly in place. These clips facilitate quick adjustments, allowing for customization of shelf height based on the user’s needs. The combination of a high-quality shelf and strong mounting hardware not only maximizes the efficiency of the refrigeration unit but also enhances the overall organization and presentation of stored items, making it a valuable addition to any food service operation.\nDimensions\n21.25 x 23.50 inches', '<li>Includes one standard shelf measuring 21.25 inches in width and 23.50 inches in depth, providing wide space for displaying a variety of items in your refrigerator.<br></li><li>Equipped with four mounting clips, ensuring a secure installation and stability of the shelf on compatible refrigerator units.<br></li><li>Specifically designed for use with models AGR23 and AGDF23, this shelf kit guarantees a precise fit for optimal performance and utility.<br></li><li>Made from durable materials, it is built to withstand the rigors of a refrigeration environment, ensuring reliability and longevity during everyday use.<br></li><li>Its practical design enhances product visibility and accessibility, helping to effectively organize and display a variety of refrigerated items.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1655, 'Arctic Air Refrigerator Shelf Kit with Four Mounting Clips For AMT60R,AST60R', 'The Arctic Air Refrigerator Shelf Kit is specifically designed for the AMT60R and AST60R models, enhancing storage flexibility within these refrigeration units. It includes one standard shelf measuring 27.75 inches in width and 16.75 inches in depth, providing a strong platform for organizing various food items and condiments. It is constructed to withstand the rigors of daily use in commercial kitchens, ensuring durability and reliability in holding a range of products.\nIncluded in the kit are four mounting clips, which allow for easy installation and secure attachment of the shelf to the refrigerator. These clips facilitate quick adjustments to shelf height, enabling users to customize the storage configuration according to their needs. This thoughtful design maximizes the available space in the refrigeration unit, promoting better organization and accessibility of items, making it an essential addition to any foodservice establishment.\nDimensions\nWidth: 27.75\nDepth: 16.75', '<li>Includes one standard shelf measuring 27.75 inches in width and 16.75 inches in depth, providing a spacious area for organizing various refrigerated items effectively.<br></li><li>Comes with four mounting clips, ensuring a secure installation of the shelf, which enhances stability during use.<br></li><li>Specifically designed for use with Arctic Air models AMT60R and AST60R, this shelf kit guarantees a perfect fit, optimizing the functionality of your refrigeration unit.<br></li><li>Made from durable materials, it is built to endure the demands of a refrigeration environment, ensuring reliability and long-lasting performance.<br></li><li>Its practical design allows for easy visibility and accessibility of items stored, helping to keep your refrigerator organized and user-friendly.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1656, 'Arctic Air 69214k 25 Refrigerator Shelf Kit with Four Mounting Clips For AMT28R,AST28R', 'The Arctic Air 69214K Refrigerator Shelf Kit is designed for use with the AMT28R and AST28R refrigerator models, enhancing the storage capabilities of these units. It includes one standard shelf with dimensions of 25 inches in width and 17.5 inches in depth, providing wide space for organizing a variety of items, from ingredients to condiments. It is built to withstand daily wear and tear, ensuring durability in a busy commercial kitchen environment.\nIncluded with the shelf are four mounting clips, which facilitate easy installation and secure attachment to the refrigerator. These clips allow for convenient adjustments, enabling users to customize the height and arrangement of the shelf based on their specific storage needs. Maximizing the usable space within the refrigerator, it enhances organization and accessibility, making it an essential accessory for efficient kitchen operations.\nDimensions\nWidth: 25\nDepth: 17.5', '<li>Includes one standard shelf measuring 25 inches in width and 17.5 inches in depth, providing wide space for organizing and storing various refrigerated items efficiently.<br></li><li>Comes with four mounting clips that ensure a secure attachment to the shelf, promoting stability and preventing any potential wobbling during use.<br></li><li>Specifically designed for Arctic Air models AMT28R and AST28R, this shelf kit guarantees a perfect fit, optimizing the functionality of your refrigeration unit.<br></li><li>Crafted from durable materials, it is designed to withstand the rigors of a refrigeration environment, ensuring long-lasting performance and reliability.<br></li><li>Features a practical design that allows for easy visibility and accessibility of stored items, enhancing the organization of your refrigerator.<br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1657, 'Arctic Air 65500K 62 - 67 (Side - Side) Tempered Glass Top Cover for ACP63', 'The Arctic Air 65500K Tempered Glass Top Cover is an essential accessory for the ACP63, designed to enhance hygiene and food safety in commercial settings. This optional sneeze guard effectively maintains sanitary standards by providing a protective barrier around food products, reducing the risk of contamination. Made from durable tempered glass, it ensures both safety and clarity, allowing customers to view the food displayed while safeguarding it from external elements.\nAssembly and installation of the cover are straightforward, making it easy for operators to set up and use without requiring specialized tools or expertise. The adjustable design holds a range of widths from 62 to 67 inches, ensuring compatibility with various setups. By incorporating this glass top cover, businesses can not only comply with health regulations but also create an inviting presentation of their offerings, enhancing the overall dining experience for customers.\nDimensions\nWidth: 62 to 67 inches', '<li>Designed to fit ACP63 models, it is adjustable in width, accommodating sizes from 62 inches to 67 inches, providing versatility for various setups.<br></li><li>Constructed from tempered glass, it ensures durability and resilience, offering a clear view of the displayed food items while enhancing the aesthetic appeal of your food service area.<br></li><li>This top cover serves as an optional sneeze guard accessory, effectively maintaining sanitary standards by providing a protective barrier that prevents contamination from airborne particles.<br></li><li>Covering food products helps protect against external contaminants, ensuring that your offerings remain safe and hygienic for customers.<br></li><li>Designed for easy assembly and installation, allowing for quick setup without the need for specialized tools or skills, making it user-friendly.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>');
INSERT INTO `ec_products_translations` (`lang_code`, `ec_products_id`, `name`, `description`, `content`) VALUES
('ar', 1658, 'Arctic Air 65400K 44 - 49 (Side - Side) Tempered Glass Top Cover for ACP48', 'The Arctic Air 65400K Tempered Glass Top Cover is an invaluable accessory for the ACP48, designed as a single-sided sneeze guard that helps maintain sanitary standards while protecting food products. It is made from durable tempered glass, ensuring both safety and clarity. Measuring 48 inches in width, 15.3 inches in depth, and 7.5 inches in height, it fits perfectly with the unit to provide an unobstructed view of the displayed food while keeping it shielded from contaminants.\nWeighing 80 lbs, it is easy to assemble and install, allowing users to set it up quickly without needing specialized tools. This feature makes it accessible for various commercial environments, enhancing both hygiene and presentation. By using this sneeze guard, food establishments can comply with health regulations while creating an inviting display that attracts customers, ultimately improving their dining experience.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth  48 inches\nDepth 15.3 inches\nHeight 7.5 inches\nShipping Weight 80 lbs\n\n\n', '<li>Designed to fit ACP48 models, adjustable to widths ranging from 44 inches to 49 inches, ensuring a proper fit for various configurations.<br></li><li>Constructed from high-quality tempered glass, it provides excellent durability and visibility, showcasing the food items while enhancing the presentation of your display.<br></li><li>Serving as an optional sneeze guard accessory, this top cover is crucial for maintaining sanitary standards by offering a protective barrier against airborne contaminants.<br></li><li>By shielding food products, it helps to keep offerings safe from external contaminants, ensuring hygiene and safety for consumers.<br></li><li>Designed for easy assembly and installation, it can be set up quickly without the need for specialized tools, making it accessible to all users.<br></li><li>Its clear tempered glass construction allows for excellent visibility of displayed items, making it easier for customers to see what is available while still providing a protective barrier.<br></li><li>Tailored for ACP48 models, it ensures a suitable fit, optimizing both protection and presentation for your refrigeration unit.<br></li><li>Smooth surface of the tempered glass is straightforward to clean and maintain, promoting hygiene in busy food service environments.<br></li><li>With a single-sided design, this top cover is ideal for open food displays, allowing for easy access while maintaining a clean presentation.<br></li><li>Weighing 80 lbs, this tempered glass cover is strong and manageable, ensuring stability and reliability in high-traffic areas.<br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1659, 'Arctic Air 65300K 56 - 61 ((Side - Side) Tempered Glass Top Cover for ACP55', 'The Arctic Air 65300K 56 - 61 Tempered Glass Top Cover is designed specifically for the ACP55 series, enhancing the functionality and presentation of food items in commercial kitchen environments. With a shipping weight of 80 lbs, this durable cover features a width of 59 inches, ensuring a suitable fit for a variety of countertop setups. Its depth of 17 inches provides wide coverage for the food prep area, while the height of just 2 inches maintains an unobtrusive profile, facilitating easy access to contents.\nThis tempered glass top cover not only protects food from contaminants but also offers a clear view of displayed items, enhancing visibility and appealing presentation for customers. The strong construction ensures longevity and resistance to breakage, making it suitable for high-traffic kitchen environments. By keeping food items covered while allowing visibility, this cover helps maintain food safety standards while optimizing the workflow for kitchen staff, contributing to a more organized and efficient workspace.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 59 Inches\nDepth: 17 Inches\nHeight: 2  Inches\nShipping Weight: 80 lb.', '<li>Has a shipping weight of 80 lbs, ensuring a solid build that contributes to durability and stability in use.<br></li><li>Measures 59 inches in width, designed to fit the ACP55 and provide a sleek, professional appearance.<br></li><li>Depth of the cover is 17 inches, allowing wide coverage for the prep area while maintaining accessibility to the items below.<br></li><li>At just 2 inches in height, this cover is designed to provide a low-profile solution that minimizes space usage while still offering the benefits of protection and visibility.<br></li><li>Made from tempered glass, it is not only aesthetically pleasing but also provides enhanced strength and safety compared to regular glass.<br></li><li>Specifically designed for the ACP55, this top cover integrates perfectly with the unit, ensuring a suitable fit and optimal functionality.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1660, 'Arctic Air 69240K 25.75 Refrigerator Shelf Kit with Four Mounting Clips For AWR25,AWF25', 'The Arctic Air 69240K Refrigerator Shelf Kit is designed for use with the AWR25 and AWF25 models, providing a practical storage solution with dimensions of 25 3/4 inches in width and 21 inches in depth. It has a shipping weight of 6 lbs, making it lightweight and easy to handle. Its white-coated wire construction ensures durability while allowing for excellent airflow, which is essential in a refrigeration environment, promoting even cooling and minimizing moisture retention.\nIt includes four mounting clips for secure installation, ensuring that the shelf remains firmly in place during use. The coated wire material not only adds to the aesthetic appeal with its clean, white finish but also contributes to the overall functionality by preventing rust and corrosion. With this shelf, users can maximize their storage capabilities while maintaining an organized and efficient refrigeration system, making it an ideal choice for commercial kitchens and food service operations.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth   25 3/4 inches\nDepth 21 inches\nShipping Weight 6 lbs\n\n\n', '<li>Features a width of 25 3/4 inches and a depth of 21 inches, providing wide space for storing various food items and beverages.<br></li><li>Total shipping weight of the kit is 6 lbs, making it lightweight and easy to handle during installation.<br></li><li>Finished in a clean white color, which not only enhances visibility but also blends well with most refrigerator interiors.<br></li><li>Constructed from coated wire, it is designed for durability and resistance to corrosion, ensuring it maintains its integrity in a refrigeration environment.<br></li><li>Includes a single shelf that maximizes vertical storage in your AWR25 or AWF25 units, optimizing space and organization.<br></li><li>Comes complete with four mounting clips, facilitating easy and secure installation, ensuring the shelf remains stable under load.<br></li><li>Specifically designed for use with AWR25 and AWF25 models, ensuring a perfect fit and optimal performance in your refrigeration unit.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1661, 'Arctic Air 65058K 21 Refrigerator Shelf Kit with Four Mounting Clips For AUC48R,AUC48F', 'The Arctic Air 65058K is a 21-inch refrigerator shelf kit designed for specific models, including the AUC48R and AUC48F. With a shipping weight of 4.5 lbs, it measures 21 inches in width and 16.75 inches in depth, making it a practical addition to your refrigeration setup. Sold as a single unit, this shelf is available in a sleek silver color and is categorized as a shelf type.\nConstructed from epoxy-coated metal, it offers enhanced durability and resistance to corrosion, ensuring longevity even in high-humidity environments typical of commercial kitchens. The kit includes four mounting clips, providing all the necessary hardware for straightforward installation. This design not only maximizes storage efficiency within your refrigerator but also helps in maintaining organization, allowing for easy access to stored items. Whether you need extra space for ingredients or tools, the Arctic Air 65058K shelf kit is a reliable solution for enhancing your kitchen\'s functionality.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 21”\nDepth: 16.75”\nWeight 4.5 lb.', '<li>Has a shipping weight of 4.5 lbs, making it lightweight and easy to handle during installation.<br></li><li>Measures 21 inches in width and 16 3/4 inches in depth, providing wide space for organizing food items within the refrigerator.<br></li><li>Includes 1 shelf, which is sufficient for adding extra storage to your refrigerator setup.<br></li><li>Features a silver finish, enhancing its aesthetic appeal and ensuring it complements various refrigerator interiors.<br></li><li>Designed specifically to fit Arctic Air refrigerator models AUC48R and AUC48F.<br></li><li>Constructed from epoxy-coated metal, it offers excellent durability and resistance to corrosion, making it suitable for food storage.<br></li><li>Includes four mounting clips, ensuring easy installation and secure attachment of the shelf to the refrigerator.<br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1662, 'Arctic Air 65057K 22.25 Refrigerator Shelf Kit with Four Mounting Clips For AUC27R,AUC27F', 'The Arctic Air 65057K is a 22.25-inch refrigerator shelf kit specifically designed for use with models AUC27R and AUC27F. It has a shipping weight of 6 lbs and dimensions of 22.25 inches in width and 16.75 inches in depth, making it an ideal choice for maximizing space in your refrigeration unit. It is finished in a sleek silver color, enhancing the aesthetic of any kitchen environment. This kit includes all necessary components, making installation straightforward and hassle-free.\nConstructed from epoxy-coated metal, it is designed for durability and resistance to corrosion, ensuring it withstands the rigors of a busy kitchen. The Arctic Air 65057K comes with four mounting clips, allowing for secure attachment within the refrigerator. This shelf type not only provides additional storage capacity but also contributes to better organization, allowing users to access ingredients and tools quickly. With its strong construction and thoughtful design, it is a practical addition to any food service operation, enhancing efficiency and functionality.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 22 1/4\nDepth: 16 3/4\nWeight 6 lb.', '<li>Has a shipping weight of 6 lbs, making it manageable for installation and transportation.<br></li><li>Measures 22 1/4 inches in width and 16 3/4 inches in depth, providing wide space for organizing and storing food items in your refrigerator.<br></li><li>Features a sleek silver finish, which not only looks appealing but also blends well with various refrigerator interiors.<br></li><li>Specifically designed to fit Arctic Air refrigerator models AUC27R and AUC27F.<br></li><li>Constructed from epoxy-coated metal, it is durable and resistant to corrosion, ensuring it remains functional and visually appealing over time.<br></li><li>Includes four mounting clips, allowing for easy installation and secure attachment to the refrigerator.<br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1663, 'Arctic Air 65056K 23.75 Refrigerator Shelf Kit with Four Mounting Clips For AR49,AF49', 'The Arctic Air 65056K is a 23.75-inch refrigerator shelf kit designed for compatibility with the AR49 and AF49 models. With a shipping weight of 8 lbs, it offers a practical and solid option for enhancing storage capacity within your refrigeration system. Measuring 23.75 inches in width and 24.375 inches in depth, it effectively utilizes available space while accommodating various food items and supplies. Its white color provides a clean, professional look that complements any kitchen design.\nConstructed from coated wire, it is engineered for durability and easy cleaning, ensuring it can withstand the demanding conditions of commercial kitchens. The kit includes four mounting clips, facilitating straightforward installation and secure attachment within the refrigerator. This design not only maximizes vertical space but also promotes organization, allowing users to quickly access ingredients and supplies. The Arctic Air 65056K shelf kit combines functionality and efficiency, making it an essential addition for any food service operation looking to optimize storage solutions.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 23 3/4\nDepth: 24 3/8\nWeight 8 lb.', '<li>Has a shipping weight of 8 lbs, ensuring it\'s easy to handle and install.<br></li><li>Measures 23 3/4 inches in width and 24 3/8 inches in depth, providing wide space for organizing and storing various food items in your refrigerator.<br></li><li>Features a clean white finish, which enhances visibility and complements the interior of your refrigerator.<br></li><li>Specifically designed to fit Arctic Air refrigerator models AR49 and AF49.<br></li><li>Made from coated wire, it is lightweight and solid, ensuring reliable support for stored items while allowing for airflow.<br></li><li>Includes four mounting clips, facilitating easy installation and secure attachment to the refrigerator.<br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1664, 'Arctic Air 65055K 21.63 Refrigerator Shelf Kit with Four Mounting Clips For AR23,AF23', 'The Arctic Air 65055K is a 21.63-inch refrigerator shelf kit tailored for the AR23 and AF23 models, providing an efficient solution for maximizing storage space in refrigeration units. With a shipping weight of 8 lbs, it measures 21.625 inches in width and 24.375 inches in depth, making it versatile for organizing various food items. Its coated wire construction ensures durability, allowing it to withstand the rigors of commercial kitchen environments while offering excellent airflow to maintain freshness.\nIncluded in the kit are four mounting clips that facilitate easy installation and secure attachment to the refrigerator, ensuring it remains stable during use. The coated wire design not only contributes to a clean and professional appearance but also allows for quick cleaning, making maintenance hassle-free. This combination of practicality and functionality makes the Arctic Air 65055K an ideal choice for food service operations seeking to optimize their storage solutions and enhance organization within their refrigeration systems.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 21 5/8\nDepth: 24 3/8\nWeight 8 lb.', '<li>Hs a shipping weight of 8 lbs, making it lightweight and easy to handle during installation.<br></li><li>Measures 21 5/8 inches in width and 24 3/8 inches in depth, providing wide storage space for organizing food items in your refrigerator.<br></li><li>Features a coated wire design, ensuring durability while maintaining a clean, professional appearance.<br></li><li>Specifically designed for use with Arctic Air refrigerator models AR23 and AF23.<br></li><li>Constructed from coated wire, it is both lightweight and strong, offering reliable support for a variety of items while promoting airflow.<br></li><li>Includes four mounting clips, which facilitate straightforward installation and secure attachment to the refrigerator.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1665, 'Arctic Air ADD72R-2 72 Kegerator,  Direct Draw Double Door Beer Refrigerator', 'The Arctic Air ADD72R-2 72 Kegerator is designed for efficient beer storage and dispensing, featuring a top made of 1.59-inch solid foamed stainless steel that ensures durability and easy maintenance. It utilizes an electronic thermostat with a digital LED display for accurate temperature control, conveniently located behind the front access panel. The self-contained capillary tube system employs environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant (R290), promoting eco-friendliness. Its front-breathing design and front-accessible condensing unit facilitate easy cleaning and maintenance, while the high-grade reinforced stainless steel coved corner floor enhances durability.\nThis kegerator maximizes workspace efficiency with a 249 depth and features an external drain mount for easy drainage. Its mounted 4-way air distributor and interior LED lighting ensure optimal cooling and visibility. The bright mirror finish stainless steel interior not only looks appealing but also simplifies cleaning. Each door is equipped with locks and removable magnetic gaskets to aid in maintenance. The exterior construction consists of black powder-coated steel for added durability, and it meets NSF Standard 7 for food safety, ensuring that it’s suitable for commercial use. With dimensions of 73 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39.5 inches in height, It is a practical addition to any bar or restaurant.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 73 Inches\nDepth: 24 Inches\nHeight: 39.5 Inches\nWeight: 375 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air ADD72R-2 kegerator measures 73 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39 1/2 inches in height, designed to fit perfectly in bar setups while providing wide space for keg storage.<br></li><li>With a shipping weight of 375 lbs, this strong kegerator is built to withstand the rigors of commercial use, ensuring stability and durability.<br></li><li>Operating at 6 Amps, 115 Volts, and 60 Hertz with a 1-phase electrical configuration, the kegerator is compatible with standard electrical systems commonly found in bars and restaurants.<br></li><li>Equipped with casters, it enhances mobility for easy relocation during cleaning or event setups, allowing staff to efficiently manage their service areas.<br></li><li>It features a side-mounted compressor designed for efficient operation, ensuring optimal cooling performance while maintaining a compact design.<br></li><li>Designed to accommodate 3 kegs and features 4 taps, providing versatility and convenience for serving various beers, making it ideal for busy establishments.<br></li><li>Comes with 3 solid doors, allowing easy access to the kegs while maintaining an energy-efficient environment for beer storage.<br></li><li>Designed to maintain a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, it ensures that beer is served at the perfect temperature for optimal flavor and quality.<br></li><li>Constructed with a rich black exterior finish, it not only looks professional but also includes LED lighting for improved visibility inside, enhancing both functionality and aesthetics.<br></li><li>Powered by a 1/3 HP compressor, the kegerator utilizes R-290 refrigerant for environmentally friendly cooling. It is equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug for easy electrical connections and comes with a full two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year compressor warranty, ensuring long-term reliability and peace of mind.</li>'),
('ar', 1666, 'Arctic Air ADD60R-2 60 Kegerator, Direct Draw Double Door Beer Refrigerator', 'The Arctic Air ADD60R-2 60 Kegerator is engineered for optimal beer storage and dispensing, featuring a top constructed from 1.59-inch solid foamed stainless steel, ensuring durability and ease of maintenance. It includes an electronic thermostat with a digital LED display for precise temperature control, conveniently located behind the front access panel. The kegerator utilizes a self-contained capillary tube system that employs environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant (R290), promoting eco-conscious operation. Its front-breathing design and front-accessible condensing unit allow for easy cleaning and maintenance, while the high-grade reinforced stainless steel coved corner floor enhances structural integrity.\nThis model is designed for efficiency with a 249 depth that conserves the workspace, complemented by an external drain mount for easy drainage. The kegerator features an easy-to-mount caster system with two lockable wheels, ensuring mobility and stability. It also includes a mounted 4-way air distributor and interior LED lighting for optimal cooling and visibility. The bright mirror finish stainless steel interior simplifies cleaning, while each door is equipped with locks and removable magnetic gaskets. Constructed from black powder-coated steel, the kegerator meets NSF Standard 7 for safety and is available with dimensions of 61 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39.5 inches in height, making it a valuable addition to any bar or restaurant setup.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 61 Inches\nDepth: 24 Inches\nHeight: 39.5 Inches\nWeight: 325 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air ADD60R-2 kegerator measures 61 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39 1/2 inches in height, offering a compact footprint suitable for various commercial settings.<br></li><li>With a shipping weight of 325 lbs, this strong kegerator is designed for durability and stability, making it ideal for high-traffic environments.<br></li><li>Operating at 6 Amps, 115 Volts, and 60 Hertz in a 1-phase configuration, the kegerator is compatible with standard electrical systems found in bars and restaurants.<br></li><li>Equipped with casters, it enhances mobility for easy movement during cleaning or setup, allowing staff to efficiently manage their service areas.<br></li><li>Featuring a side-mounted compressor, the kegerator ensures optimal cooling performance while maintaining a space-efficient design.<br></li><li>Designed to hold 2 kegs and equipped with 4 taps, this kegerator provides versatility and convenience, making it perfect for serving a variety of beers.<br></li><li>Comes with 2 solid doors, facilitating easy access to the kegs while promoting an energy-efficient environment for beer storage.<br></li><li>It maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, ensuring that beers are served at their ideal temperature for optimal taste and enjoyment.<br></li><li>The kegerator features a rich black exterior finish and includes LED lighting for improved visibility inside, enhancing both functionality and aesthetics.<br></li><li>Powered by a 1/3 HP compressor, the unit utilizes R-290 refrigerant for eco-friendly cooling. It is equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug for easy electrical connections and comes with a full two-year parts and labor warranty along with a five-year compressor warranty, ensuring reliability and peace of mind for users.</li>'),
('ar', 1667, 'Arctic Air ADD48R-2 48 Kegerator Direct Draw Double Door Beer Refrigerator', 'The Arctic Air ADD48R-2 48 Kegerator is designed for efficient beer storage and dispensing, featuring a top made from 1.59-inch solid foamed stainless steel for durability and thermal efficiency. Equipped with an electronic thermostat and a digital LED display, it allows for precise temperature control, easily accessed through the front panel. This kegerator operates using a self-contained capillary tube system with environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant (R290), ensuring eco-friendly operation. The front-breathing design allows for installation flexibility, while the front-accessible condensing unit simplifies maintenance and cleaning tasks.\nInternally, the kegerator has a high-grade reinforced stainless steel coved corner floor that is easy to clean, complemented by an external drain mount for quick drainage. It features easy-to-mount casters (two of which are lockable) for mobility and a mounted 4-way air distributor that enhances cooling efficiency. The interior is illuminated with LED lighting, and the bright mirror finish stainless steel interior adds aesthetic appeal while making maintenance straightforward. Each door is equipped with locks and removable magnetic gaskets for added security and convenience. Constructed from black powder-coated steel, it has dimensions of 49 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39.5 inches in height, and it meets NSF Standard 7 for food safety standards.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 49 Inches\nDepth: 24 Inches\nHeight: 39.5 Inches\nWeight: 290 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air ADD48R-2 kegerator features dimensions of 49 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39 1/2 inches in height, making it a compact and efficient solution for commercial beer dispensing.<br></li><li>Weighing 290 lbs, this solid kegerator is designed to withstand the rigors of daily use in high-demand environments.<br></li><li>Operates on 6 Amps at 115 Volts and 60 Hertz in a 1-phase system, ensuring compatibility with standard electrical setups commonly found in bars and restaurants.<br></li><li>Equipped with casters, it offers enhanced mobility, allowing staff to easily reposition it for cleaning or service adjustments.<br></li><li>Features a side-mounted compressor, which optimizes cooling efficiency while maintaining a space-saving design.<br></li><li>Designed to accommodate 2 kegs and equipped with 4 taps, this kegerator is perfect for serving a diverse selection of beers.<br></li><li>Includes 2 solid doors, providing easy access to kegs while contributing to energy efficiency and temperature maintenance.<br></li><li>It maintains an optimal temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, ensuring that beer is served at its ideal temperature for the best taste experience.<br></li><li>With a rich black exterior finish, the kegerator is both stylish and functional, featuring LED lighting to illuminate the interior, enhancing visibility for users.<br></li><li>Powered by a 1/3 HP compressor, it utilizes R-290 refrigerant, an environmentally friendly option. It is fitted with a NEMA 5-15P plug for easy electrical connections and comes with a full two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year compressor warranty, ensuring reliability and peace of mind for users.</li>'),
('ar', 1668, 'Arctic Air ABB60G 60 Double Glass Door Back Bar Refrigerator', 'The Arctic Air ABB60G 60 Double Glass Door Back Bar Refrigerator is designed for efficient beer storage and dispensing, featuring a top constructed from 1.59-inch solid foamed stainless steel for durability and thermal efficiency. It utilizes a self-contained capillary tube system with environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant (R290), ensuring eco-friendly operation. Its front-breathing design allows for installation in tight spaces, and the front-accessible condensing unit simplifies maintenance. Equipped with easy-to-mount casters (two lockable), this refrigerator is both mobile and practical for various environments.\nThe interior is well-lit with LED lighting, enhancing visibility while showcasing your products. It features a mirror-finish stainless steel interior complemented by a high-grade stainless steel coved corner floor, making cleaning easy. Each door includes removable magnetic gaskets, facilitating easy maintenance. It has a depth of 24 inches that conserves important workspace while providing a width of 61 inches and a height of 39.5 inches. Built with an exterior of black powder-coated steel, it meets NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage, ensuring safety and reliability in commercial settings.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 61 Inches\nDepth: 24 Inches\nHeight: 39.5 Inches\nWeight: 365 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air ABB60G measures 61 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39 1/2 inches in height, providing wide space for storing beverages while maintaining a compact design suitable for bar environments.<br></li><li>Weighing 365 lbs, it is well constructed to handle the demands of busy commercial settings.<br></li><li>Operating at 8 Amps with a voltage of 115 Volts and a frequency of 60 Hertz, it runs on a standard 1-phase electrical system, making it easy to integrate into existing setups.<br></li><li>Equipped with casters, facilitating easy movement for cleaning, maintenance, or repositioning within your establishment.<br></li><li>It features a side-mounted compressor and a front-breathing design, ensuring efficient cooling while allowing for flexible placement against walls or other surfaces.<br></li><li>Has a can capacity of 72 six-packs and a total capacity of 16.7 cu. ft., making it perfect for keeping a variety of beverages readily available for customers.<br></li><li>It comes with 2 swing glass doors, allowing for easy visibility and access to stored items, enhancing the customer experience in a bar setting.<br></li><li>With a rich black exterior finish, the unit is not only functional but also aesthetically pleasing. It includes LED lighting for improved visibility inside the refrigerator, showcasing its contents effectively.<br></li><li>Maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, ensuring that beverages are kept at optimal serving temperatures for freshness and flavor.<br></li><li>Powered by a 1/3 HP compressor, it uses R-290 refrigerant, which is eco-friendly. The unit includes 4 shelves for organized storage and has a NEMA 5-15P plug type for easy connectivity. It also comes with a full two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year compressor warranty, assuring quality and reliability.</li>'),
('ar', 1669, 'Arctic Air ABB72  72 Double Door Solid Back Bar Refrigerator', 'The Arctic Air ABB72 72 Double Door Solid Back Bar Refrigerator is designed for optimal performance and convenience, featuring a top constructed from 1.59-inch solid foamed stainless steel for enhanced insulation and durability. It operates on a self-contained capillary tube system that utilizes environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant (R290), aligning with eco-friendly practices. Its front-breathing design allows for versatile placement in tight spaces, while the front-accessible condensing unit facilitates straightforward cleaning and maintenance. Additionally, it includes easy-to-mount casters, two of which are lockable, ensuring mobility and stability.\nThe interior of the ABB72 is illuminated with LED lighting, which not only highlights the contents but also promotes energy efficiency. The mirror-finish stainless steel interior is complemented by a high-grade stainless steel coved corner floor, which is easy to clean and maintain. Each door is fitted with removable magnetic gaskets, simplifying the cleaning process. The refrigerator maintains a depth of 24 inches, conserving workspace while providing a generous width of 73 inches and a height of 39.5 inches. Constructed with a durable black powder-coated steel exterior, the ABB72 has been tested to meet NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage, making it an ideal choice for commercial use.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 73 Inches\nDepth: 24 Inches\nHeight: 39.5 Inches\nWeight: 360 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air ABB72 measures 73 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39 1/2 inches in height, providing a substantial storage solution while maintaining a compact footprint suitable for bars and restaurants.<br></li><li>With a shipping weight of 360 lbs, this back bar refrigerator is designed for durability and stability, ensuring it can handle the demands of a busy commercial environment.<br></li><li>Operates at 6 Amps with a voltage of 115 Volts and a frequency of 60 Hertz, making it compatible with standard electrical systems typically found in food service establishments. It is designed for a 1-phase power supply.<br></li><li>Equipped with casters, the refrigerator allows for easy movement, facilitating cleaning and repositioning within the bar area as needed.<br></li><li>Featuring a side-mounted compressor with a front-breathing design, the unit ensures optimal airflow and cooling efficiency, allowing it to be placed against walls or in confined spaces.<br></li><li>With a total can capacity of 84 six-packs and a total storage capacity of 20.7 cu. ft., this refrigerator provides wide space for keeping a wide selection of beverages easily accessible for service.<br></li><li>Includes 3 swing solid doors, providing secure storage while maintaining a professional appearance in the bar setting.<br></li><li>Has a rich black exterior finish, complemented by features such as LED lighting, which enhances the visibility and accessibility of the stored items.<br></li><li>Operates within a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, ensuring that beverages remain at optimal serving temperatures for freshness and quality.<br></li><li>Powered by a 1/3 HP compressor, it utilizes environmentally friendly R-290 refrigerant. It includes 6 shelves for organized storage and is equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug type for straightforward electrical connection. Additionally, it comes with a full two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year compressor warranty, assuring its quality and reliability.</li>'),
('ar', 1670, 'Arctic Air ABB60 60 Double Door Solid Back Bar Refrigerator', 'The Arctic Air ABB60 60 Double Door Solid Back Bar Refrigerator combines functionality with advanced features, making it an excellent addition to any commercial bar setting. The top is constructed from 1.59-inch solid foamed stainless steel, providing durability and ease of maintenance. This refrigerator employs a self-contained capillary tube system that utilizes environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant (R290), ensuring compliance with modern eco-friendly standards. Its front-accessible condensing unit simplifies cleaning and maintenance, while the front-breathing design enhances airflow and efficiency. It is equipped with easy-to-mount casters, two of which are lockable, ensuring mobility and stability.\nInternally, the refrigerator has interior LED lighting for improved visibility and a mirror-finish stainless steel interior, complete with a high-grade stainless steel coved corner floor for easy cleaning. The exterior features black powder-coated steel for a sleek, professional appearance. Each door includes removable magnetic gaskets that facilitate cleaning, and the electronic thermostat with a digital LED display allows for precise temperature control from the front access panel. With a compact design measuring 49 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39.5 inches in height, and meeting NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage, it is tailored to meet the demands of any busy bar environment while conserving valuable workspace.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 49  Inches\nDepth: 24 Inches\nHeight: 39.5 Inches\nWeight: 320 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air ABB60 measures 49 inches in width, 24 inches in depth, and 39 1/2 inches in height, designed specifically to fit under counters while maximizing storage efficiency in bar environments.<br></li><li>With a shipping weight of 320 lbs, this solid refrigerator ensures stability and durability, making it suitable for the high demands of busy bars and restaurants.<br></li><li>Operating at 3 Amps, 115 Volts, and 60 Hertz with a 1-phase electrical configuration, the refrigerator is compatible with standard electrical setups found in commercial settings.<br></li><li>Has a total capacity of 12.5 cu. ft., allowing for efficient organization of beverages, with a canning capacity of up to 48 six-packs, making it ideal for bar operations.<br></li><li>The unit comes with casters, enhancing mobility for easy repositioning during cleaning or setup changes, while also facilitating accessibility to the compressor for maintenance.<br></li><li>It features a side-mounted compressor with front breathing, ensuring efficient airflow and operation while maintaining a compact design.<br></li><li>Has two swing-style glass doors, providing visibility to contents while ensuring easy access for staff during busy service hours.<br></li><li>Designed to maintain a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, it effectively preserves the freshness and quality of drinks and perishable items.<br></li><li>Constructed with a rich black exterior finish, it complements bar aesthetics while featuring LED lighting for improved visibility inside, enhancing both functionality and appeal.<br></li><li>Powered by a 1/3 HP compressor, it utilizes R-290 refrigerant for environmentally friendly cooling. The refrigerator includes 4 adjustable shelves for flexible storage solutions and is equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug for straightforward electrical connections. Additionally, it is backed by full two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year compressor warranty, ensuring long-term reliability.</li>'),
('ar', 1671, 'Arctic Air AMT72R 72 Triple Door Mega-Top Sandwich/ Salad Prep Table', 'The Arctic Air AMT72R 72 Triple Door Mega-Top Sandwich/Salad Prep Table is engineered for efficiency in food preparation, featuring added space for extra rows of pans, enhancing its utility in busy kitchen environments. Included with it are 1/6-size plastic pans, which are designed to fit perfectly into the preparation area. A full-length, heavy-duty cutting board provides wide space for slicing and assembling ingredients, while the self-closing doors, which remain open at 90 degrees, ensure easy access without compromising on safety. Constructed with solid door construction and a foamed-in-place recessed handle, this table is durable and user-friendly.\nThe exterior of the AMT72R consists of a full stainless steel front and sides, ensuring a smooth and professional appearance, while the interior features a bright white epoxy-coated aluminum sidewall liner complemented by a full high-grade stainless steel floor with coved corners, making it easy to clean and maintain. Magnetic door gaskets are designed for convenience, as they can be removed and replaced without tools. An electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display allows for precise temperature control and easy reading. Standard with all units, the easy-to-mount casters (two of which are locking) provide mobility, and the unit has been tested to NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage, confirming its reliability and safety in commercial use.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 71 1/2 Inches\nDepth: 34 1/2  Inches\nHeight: 43 5/16 Inches\nWeight: 450 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air AMT72R measures 71 1/2 inches in width, 34 1/2 inches in depth, and 43 5/16 inches in height, providing a spacious work surface that is ideal for sandwich and salad preparation in commercial kitchens.<br></li><li>This prep table has a shipping weight of 450 lb., indicating strong construction suitable for high-volume food service environments.<br></li><li>Operates at 4.3 Amps with a voltage of 120 Volts, designed to connect to standard electrical systems in restaurants and catering facilities.<br></li><li>Offering a total storage capacity of 18 cu. ft., this table is designed to efficiently store a wide variety of ingredients, keeping them organized and accessible during food preparation.<br></li><li>Featuring a side/rear breathing compressor, it ensures optimal airflow and cooling efficiency. The unit is powered by a 1/2 HP compressor, which provides strong and reliable refrigeration performance.<br></li><li>Includes 3 doors, allowing for easy access to stored ingredients while maintaining a streamlined workflow during busy service hours.<br></li><li>It is equipped with 3 shelves, providing wide space for organization and storage of various food items and supplies.<br></li><li>Utilizing environmentally friendly R-290 refrigerant, it supports efficient cooling while minimizing environmental impact.<br></li><li>Mega Top design holds 18 pans of 1/6 size, providing a versatile and easily accessible ingredient station. The nominal width of the prep area is 72 inches, with a cutting board depth of 11 1/2 inches, ideal for efficient food preparation.<br></li><li>Work surface is set at a height of 36 5/16 inches, ensuring ergonomic access for food preparation tasks. It is constructed from stainless steel, offering durability and ease of cleaning. Additionally, it comes with a full two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year compressor warranty, ensuring long-term reliability and service.</li>'),
('ar', 1672, 'Arctic Air AMT60R 60 Double Door Mega-Top Sandwich/ Salad Prep Table', 'The Arctic Air AMT60R 60 Double Door Mega-Top Sandwich/Salad Prep Table is a highly functional unit designed to optimize food preparation, offering added space for extra rows of pans. It includes 1/6-size plastic pans for organizing ingredients and a full-length, heavy-duty cutting board for wide prep space. Its self-closing doors, which remain open at 90 degrees, provide ease of access. Built with solid door construction and a foamed-in-place recessed handle, the design ensures durability and user comfort. The stainless steel exterior gives it a modern look while the bright white epoxy-coated aluminum interior makes it easy to clean.\nThis prep table also features magnetic door gaskets, which are removable and replaceable without tools, ensuring hassle-free maintenance. The electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display allows precise temperature control for storing fresh ingredients. Mounted on easy-to-install casters (two of which are lockable), the unit offers mobility. Additionally, the single and double stainless steel overshelf systems offer added storage options. Tested to meet NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage, the AMT60R ensures safety and reliability in commercial kitchens. Its dimensions are 61 1/4 in width, 34 1/2 in depth, and 43 5/16 in height.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 61 1/4 Inches\nDepth: 34 1/2  Inches\nHeight: 43 5/16 Inches\nWeight: 385 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air AMT60R has a width of 61 1/4 inches, a depth of 34 1/2 inches, and a height of 43 5/16 inches, designed to fit perfectly into commercial kitchen spaces while providing a generous work area for food preparation.<br></li><li>Has a shipping weight of 385 lb., reflecting its solid construction, which is suitable for the demands of high-volume food service environments.<br></li><li>Operating at 4.3 Amps with a frequency of 60 Hertz, it is compatible with standard electrical systems in most commercial kitchens, ensuring easy installation and operation.<br></li><li>Features a substantial capacity of 15.5 cu. ft., allowing wide space for various ingredients, condiments, and other items, keeping them organized and readily accessible.<br></li><li>Comes equipped with casters, enhancing mobility for easy repositioning within the kitchen or during cleaning.<br></li><li>Utilizing a side/rear breathing compressor, this model efficiently maintains temperature while providing optimal airflow. The 1/2 HP compressor ensures effective cooling performance for food safety.<br></li><li>Featuring 2 swing doors, the prep table allows for easy access to ingredients, facilitating a smooth workflow during meal preparation.<br></li><li>Includes 2 shelves, providing additional organization for food items and supplies, enhancing kitchen efficiency.<br></li><li>Utilizing eco-friendly R-290 refrigerant, it supports effective cooling while reducing environmental impact. The operating temperature range is maintained between 33 - 41 degrees F, ensuring food safety.<br></li><li>Constructed from stainless steel and aluminum, ensuring durability and easy cleaning. It holds 24 pans of 1/6 size, providing efficient access to ingredients and maximizing preparation space. Backed by a two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year warranty on the compressor, this prep table offers long-term reliability for commercial kitchen use.</li>'),
('ar', 1673, 'Arctic Air AMT28R 28 Single Door Mega-Top Sandwich/ Salad Prep Table', 'The Arctic Air AMT28R 28 Single Door Mega-Top Sandwich/Salad Prep Table provides added space to accommodate extra rows of pans, ensuring efficient preparation in busy kitchens. It comes with 1/6-size plastic pans and features a full-length, heavy-duty cutting board for enhanced functionality. The self-closing doors remain open at 90 degrees for ease of access. Its solid door construction with a foamed-in-place recessed handle and stainless steel exterior ensures durability and long-lasting performance.\nThe interior is built for easy maintenance with a bright white epoxy-coated aluminum sidewall liner and a high-grade stainless steel floor with coved corners. The magnetic door gaskets are removable and replaceable without tools, simplifying upkeep. The electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display provides accurate temperature control, while easy-to-mount casters (two of which lock) ensure mobility. Additional single and double stainless steel overshelf systems are available for added versatility. Certified to NSF Standard 7, it meets the requirements for open food storage. It measures 29 in width, 34 1/2 in depth, and 43 5/16 in height.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 29 Inches\nDepth: 34 1/2  Inches\nHeight: 43 5/16 Inches\nWeight: 230 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air AMT28R features a compact design with a width of 29 inches, a depth of 34 1/2 inches, and a height of 43 5/16 inches, providing an efficient prep station for smaller kitchens or tight spaces.<br></li><li>Has a shipping weight of 230 lb., making it a relatively lightweight option for a commercial prep table, while still maintaining durability and strength.<br></li><li>Runs on 3 Amps, with a frequency of 60 Hertz and a 1 Phase electrical configuration. It operates with 115 Volts, making it compatible with standard kitchen power setups.<br></li><li>With a capacity of 6.5 cu. ft., the unit offers wide storage for food and ingredients, supporting efficient kitchen workflows during busy service times.<br></li><li>Comes with casters, allowing easy movement for cleaning or repositioning in the kitchen, ensuring flexibility in layout changes.<br></li><li>The bottom-mounted compressor is designed with a side/rear breathing system for optimal cooling performance. It uses a 3/8 HP compressor, ensuring the unit maintains consistent temperatures, crucial for food safety.<br></li><li>Features 1 swing door with a solid construction, providing excellent insulation and energy efficiency. The left/right hinge configuration allows for flexibility in door placement based on kitchen layout.<br></li><li>Has 1 adjustable shelf inside, giving flexibility to organize ingredients or containers as needed. The shelf is designed to accommodate a variety of storage needs.<br></li><li>Using R-290 refrigerant, the unit maintains a temperature range between 33 - 41 degrees F, ensuring food safety. The air-cooled refrigeration system ensures the internal environment remains consistent and energy efficient.<br></li><li>Mega Top design holds 12 pans of 1/6 size, with a nominal width of 27 inches and a cutting board depth of 9 inches for wide ingredient preparation space. It is made from stainless steel and aluminum and includes a two-year parts and labor warranty, plus a five-year compressor warranty.<br></li><li><br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1674, 'Arctic Air AST72R 72 Triple Door Sandwich/ Salad Prep Table', 'The Arctic Air AST72R 72 Triple Door Sandwich/Salad Prep Table is expertly designed for efficiency and functionality in food preparation environments, featuring 1/6 size 49 deep plastic pans included for quick access to ingredients. A full-length, heavy-duty cutting board is also provided to facilitate perfect food preparation. It has self-closing doors that remain open at 90 degrees for easy access, while the solid door construction features a foamed-in-place recessed handle for durability. The exterior cabinet is made of full stainless steel on the front and sides, enhancing its longevity and aesthetic appeal.\nInternally, the cabinet is equipped with a bright white epoxy-coated aluminum sidewall liner and a high-grade stainless steel floor with coved corners to facilitate easy cleaning. The magnetic door gaskets can be removed and replaced without tools, making maintenance straightforward. An electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display offers precise temperature control, and easy-to-mount casters (two locking) ensure mobility. The table also holds single and double stainless steel over-shelf systems, expanding storage options. This prep table is tested to meet NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage, making it ideal for commercial use. The dimensions are 71 1/2 in width, 30 in depth, and 43 5/16 in height.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 71 1/2 Inches\nDepth: 30  Inches\nHeight: 43 5/16 Inches\nWeight: 425 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air AST72R features a spacious design with a width of 71 1/2 inches, a depth of 30 inches, and a height of 43 5/16 inches, providing an expansive work area for sandwich and salad preparation.<br></li><li>Has a shipping weight of 425 lb., ensuring solid construction suitable for high-volume commercial use while remaining manageable for installation.<br></li><li>It operates on 4.3 Amps, at a frequency of 60 Hertz, and is configured for 1 Phase electrical systems, running on 120 Volts, making it compatible with standard commercial kitchen power.<br></li><li>With a capacity of 18 cu. ft., the unit offers wide storage for fresh ingredients, allowing for efficient workflow in busy kitchens and food service environments.<br></li><li>Equipped with casters, facilitating easy mobility for cleaning, repositioning, or storage, enhancing versatility in kitchen arrangements.<br></li><li>Features a rear-mounted compressor that operates with a side/rear breathing design for efficient cooling. With a 1/2 HP compressor, it ensures reliable temperature control for food safety.<br></li><li>Three swing doors are designed with solid construction to provide excellent insulation, maintaining internal temperatures while allowing easy access to stored ingredients.<br></li><li>Interior includes 3 adjustable shelves, providing flexibility in organizing various ingredients or containers based on the needs of the kitchen.<br></li><li>Using R-290 refrigerant, the unit maintains a temperature range of 33 - 41 degrees F, essential for preserving the freshness of perishable items. The air-cooled refrigeration system supports consistent performance.<br></li><li>The standard top holds 18 pans of 1/6 size with a cutting board measuring 72 inches wide by 11 1/2 inches deep, and a work surface height of 35 5/16 inches. Built with stainless steel and aluminum, it comes with a two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year compressor warranty.<br></li><li></li>');
INSERT INTO `ec_products_translations` (`lang_code`, `ec_products_id`, `name`, `description`, `content`) VALUES
('ar', 1675, 'Arctic Air AST60R 60 Double Door Sandwich/ Salad Prep Table', 'The Arctic Air AST60R 60 Double Door Sandwich/Salad Prep Table is expertly designed for commercial food preparation, featuring 1/6 size 49 deep plastic pans to optimize ingredient accessibility. It comes with a full-length, heavy-duty cutting board, enhancing food prep efficiency. It is equipped with self-closing doors that stay open at a 90-degree angle for easy access, and the solid door construction incorporates a foamed-in-place recessed handle for durability and a professional look.\nConstructed with a full stainless steel exterior, the cabinet provides longevity and easy maintenance. Inside, the bright white epoxy-coated aluminum sidewall liner complements the high-grade stainless steel floor with coved corners, ensuring easy cleaning. Magnetic door gaskets can be removed and replaced without tools for convenience. An electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display allows for precise temperature control, while easy-to-mount casters (with two lockable) facilitate mobility. This prep table also holds single and double stainless steel over-shelf systems for additional storage options. It meets NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage, making it an ideal choice for any commercial kitchen. The dimensions are 61 1/4 in width, 30 in depth, and 43 5/16 in height.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 61 1/4 Inches\nDepth: 30  Inches\nHeight: 43 5/16 Inches\nWeight: 385 lb. ', '<li>The Arctic Air AST60R measures 61 1/4 inches wide, 30 inches deep, and 43 5/16 inches high, providing wide workspace for food preparation.<br></li><li>Has a shipping weight of 385 lb., ensuring durable construction for commercial kitchen use.<br></li><li>Operating on 4.3 Amps, 60 Hertz, 1 Phase, and 120 Volts, it’s compatible with standard commercial electrical systems.<br></li><li>Offers a generous 15.5 cu. ft. of storage capacity, allowing for efficient organization of ingredients.<br></li><li>Equipped with casters, this prep table provides easy mobility for cleaning and repositioning.<br></li><li>Features a rear-mounted compressor with a side/rear breathing design and operates with a 1/2 HP compressor for effective cooling.<br></li><li>Includes two solid swing doors that provide easy access to the refrigerated contents.<br></li><li>Comes with 2 adjustable shelves, allowing flexibility in storage organization.<br></li><li>Utilizing R-290 refrigerant, it maintains a temperature range of 33 - 41 degrees F, equipped with an air-cooled system.<br></li><li>Standard top holds 16 pans of 1/6 size, featuring a cutting board with a nominal width of 60 inches, depth of 30 inches, and a work surface height of 36 5/16 inches. Constructed with stainless steel and aluminum, it is backed by a two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year compressor warranty.<br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1676, 'Arctic Air AST48R 48 Double Door Sandwich/ Salad Prep Table', 'The Arctic Air AST48R 48 Double Door Sandwich/Salad Prep Table is meticulously designed to enhance food preparation efficiency in commercial kitchens. Included with it are 1/6 size 49 deep plastic pans, providing wide storage for ingredients. The full-length, heavy-duty cutting board is perfect for prepping meals. The self-closing doors are engineered to remain open at a 90-degree angle, allowing for quick access. Constructed with a solid door and foamed-in-place recessed handle, the durability and functionality of this prep table are paramount.\nThe exterior features a strong full stainless steel construction that ensures longevity and ease of maintenance, while the interior has a bright white epoxy-coated aluminum sidewall liner paired with a high-grade stainless steel floor that includes coved corners for simple cleaning. The magnetic door gaskets can be easily removed and replaced without the need for tools, enhancing usability. An electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display provides precise temperature control for optimal food storage. Standard easy-to-mount casters (two locking) ensure the unit is mobile, making it convenient to reposition as needed. This prep table also supports single and double stainless steel over-shelf systems for additional storage options. It meets the NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage, ensuring it is suitable for commercial use. The dimensions are 48 1/4 inches in width, 30 inches in depth, and 43 3/8 inches in height.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 48 1/4 Inches\nDepth: 30  Inches\nHeight: 43 3/8  Inches\nWeight: 300 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air AST48R measures 48 1/4 inches wide, 30 inches deep, and 43 3/8 inches high, providing a compact and functional workspace for food preparation.<br></li><li>It has a shipping weight of 300 lb., indicating its strong construction for commercial kitchen environments.<br></li><li>Operating on 4.3 Amps, 60 Hertz, 1 Phase, and 120 Volts, it is designed to meet standard commercial electrical requirements.<br></li><li>Offers a capacity of 12 cu. ft., allowing for efficient organization and easy access to ingredients.<br></li><li>Equipped with casters, this prep table enhances mobility for cleaning and repositioning within the kitchen.<br></li><li>Features a bottom-mounted compressor with a side/rear breathing design, ensuring optimal cooling performance with a 1/2 HP compressor.<br></li><li>Includes two solid swing doors for convenient access to refrigerated contents.<br></li><li>Comes with 2 adjustable shelves, providing flexibility in organizing storage space for various ingredients.<br></li><li>Utilizing R-290 refrigerant, it maintains a temperature range of 33 - 41 degrees F and is equipped with an air-cooled system.<br></li><li>Standard top holds12 pans of 1/6 size, with a nominal width of 48 inches, a cutting board depth of 11 1/2 inches, and a total height of 48 1/2 inches. Constructed with stainless steel and aluminum, it is backed by a two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year compressor warranty.<br></li><li></li>'),
('ar', 1677, 'Arctic Air APP48R 48 Single Door Stainless Steel Pizza Prep Table', 'The Arctic Air APP48R 48 Single Door Stainless Steel Pizza Prep Table is designed for efficiency and durability in commercial kitchens. With dimensions of 48 inches in width, 32.25 inches in depth, and 41 inches in height, this prep table offers a spacious work surface with a capacity of 12 cu. ft. It operates at 5 Amps and utilizes a 1/2 HP compressor, ensuring effective cooling within the 33 to 41 degrees Fahrenheit temperature range. Constructed from stainless steel and aluminum, it features a swing door style for easy access.\nThe side-mounted compressor is designed for side and rear breathing, enhancing airflow for optimal cooling. The table includes one shelf and is equipped with a mega top that holds six 1/3-size pans, providing wide space for ingredients. The NEMA 5-15P plug type allows for easy connection to standard outlets, making it a versatile addition to any kitchen. Weighing 310 lbs, this prep table is strong and built for the demands of high-traffic food preparation environments.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth:  48 Inches\nDepth: 32.5 Inches\nHeight: 41 Inches\nWeight:  310 lbs', '<li>The Arctic Air APP48R measures 48 inches in width, 32 1/4 inches in depth, and 41 inches in height, providing wide workspace for pizza preparation while ensuring a compact footprint suitable for various kitchen layouts.<br></li><li>Has a shipping weight of 310 lbs, indicating a solid construction designed to withstand the rigors of a busy kitchen environment.<br></li><li>Operating on 5 Amps at 60 Hertz, the unit is designed for 1 Phase power and requires a voltage of 120 Volts, making it compatible with standard electrical systems in most commercial settings.<br></li><li>With a total capacity of 12 cu. ft., this pizza prep table offers wide storage space for ingredients and toppings, helping streamline food preparation processes.<br></li><li>The side-mounted compressor ensures efficient cooling while saving valuable space, allowing for easy access and maintenance.<br></li><li>Featuring a cold wall refrigeration system, the APP48R provides consistent cooling throughout the unit, maintaining optimal temperature for perishable items.<br></li><li>The prep table is constructed from durable stainless steel and aluminum, ensuring longevity and ease of cleaning, which is essential in a fast-paced kitchen environment.<br></li><li>The table includes 1 swing door, providing easy access to the storage compartment, and facilitating quick retrieval of ingredients during busy service times.<br></li><li>Designed to accommodate 6 (1/3 size) pans in the mega top section, the APP48R allows for organized and accessible ingredient storage, improving workflow efficiency during pizza preparation.<br></li><li>Operates within a temperature range of 33 - 41 degrees F, ensuring that ingredients remain fresh and safe for use, while also complying with food safety standards.</li>'),
('ar', 1678, 'Arctic Air AUC48R 48.25 Double Door Under-Counter Refrigerator', 'The Arctic Air AUC48R 48.25 Double Door Under-Counter Refrigerator is designed for commercial use, offering a shipping weight of 265 lbs and compact dimensions of 48 1/4 inches in width, 30 inches in depth, and 35 5/8 inches in height. With a capacity of 12 cu. ft., it is powered by a 3 amp draw at 115 volts and features a 3/8 HP bottom-mounted compressor, ensuring efficient cooling with a side/rear breathing design that maximizes airflow.\nEquipped with two solid swing doors, the AUC48R features self-closing doors for enhanced energy efficiency. Inside, it includes two adjustable shelves, allowing for flexible storage configurations. It operates with environmentally friendly R-600A refrigerant and maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, ideal for perishable goods. The NEMA 5-15P plug type and left/right hinge location make it versatile for various kitchen setups, ensuring reliable performance in busy food service environments.\nWeight & Dimensions\nShipping weight: 265 lbs\nWidth: 48 1/4 Inches\nDepth: 30 Inches\nHeight: 35 5/8 Inches', '<li>The Arctic Air AUC48R measures 48.25 inches in width, 30 inches in depth, and 35.625 inches in height, designed to fit snugly under counters while providing wide refrigeration space.<br></li><li>With a shipping weight of 265 lbs, this refrigerator offers solid construction for durability and reliability in a commercial kitchen environment.<br></li><li>It operates on 115 volts and consumes 3 amps, making it energy-efficient and suitable for various kitchen setups without overloading circuits.<br></li><li>Has a total capacity of 12 cubic feet, providing sufficient storage for a variety of perishable items, making it ideal for busy food service operations.<br></li><li>Featuring a bottom-mounted compressor, it allows for easy access and maintenance while enhancing the unit\'s cooling efficiency by utilizing natural convection.<br></li><li>Side/rear breathing compressor-style optimizes airflow, ensuring efficient cooling and preventing overheating even in confined kitchen spaces.<br></li><li>Includes two solid swing doors that offer easy access to the refrigerated items, designed to close automatically for improved energy efficiency.<br></li><li>Has self-closing doors, enhancing convenience and ensuring that the refrigerator maintains optimal temperatures by minimizing cold air loss when doors are left ajar.<br></li><li>Equipped with a 3/8 HP compressor, the AUC48R delivers reliable cooling performance, maintaining consistent temperatures for the safe storage of perishables.<br></li><li>Using R-600A refrigerant, this refrigerator is environmentally friendly and operates within a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees Fahrenheit, ensuring that all stored items remain fresh and properly chilled.</li>'),
('ar', 1679, 'Arctic AUC27R 27.88 Air Single Door Under-Counter Refrigerator', 'The Arctic Air AUC27R 27.88 Single Door Under-Counter Refrigerator is engineered for efficiency in commercial settings, with a shipping weight of 185 lbs and dimensions of 27 7/8 inches in width, 30 inches in depth, and 35 5/8 inches in height. This under-counter refrigerator offers a capacity of 6.5 cu. ft., operating on 1.5 amps at 115 volts with a 3/8 HP bottom-mounted compressor, ensuring optimal cooling performance.\nDesigned for convenience, the unit features a solid swing door that is self-closing, enhancing energy efficiency. Inside, it includes one shelf for organized storage. The refrigerator utilizes R-600A refrigerant, maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, and comes equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug type for easy installation in various kitchen environments.\nWeight & Dimensions\nShipping weight: 185lbs\nWidth:  27 7/8 Inches\nDepth: 30 Inches\nHeight: 35 5/8 Inches', '<li>The Arctic Air AUC27R features a width of 27.88 inches, a depth of 30 inches, and a height of 35.625 inches, making it ideal for under-counter placement in commercial settings.<br></li><li>Has a shipping weight of 185 lbs, indicating its solid construction, suitable for heavy-duty use in busy kitchens.<br></li><li>Operating on 115 volts and drawing 1.5 amps, this refrigerator ensures efficient performance while minimizing energy consumption, and is equipped with a NEMA 5-15P plug, allowing for easy and safe connectivity to standard electrical outlets.<br></li><li>With a total capacity of 6.5 cubic feet, the AUC27R provides wide storage space for perishable items, keeping them organized and easily accessible.<br></li><li>Bottom-mounted compressor design allows for better accessibility and maintenance, along with efficient temperature management.<br></li><li>Featuring a side/rear breathing compressor style, it is optimized for air circulation, making it suitable for placement in various kitchen configurations.<br></li><li>Comes with a solid swing door, facilitating convenient access to the refrigerator\'s contents while ensuring excellent temperature retention.<br></li><li>Designed with self-closing doors, this refrigerator enhances energy efficiency and convenience, ensuring that the door closes securely after each use.<br></li><li>Operates with a 3/8 HP compressor, providing strong performance for maintaining optimal refrigeration temperatures.<br></li><li>Utilizing R-600A refrigerant, the AUC27R is environmentally friendly and efficient, ensuring effective cooling with a reduced environmental footprint. It maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees Fahrenheit, making it suitable for a variety of perishable goods.</li>'),
('ar', 1680, 'Arctic Air ARGDM23 27 Single Glass Door Reach-In Merchandiser Refrigerator', 'The Arctic Air ARGDM23 27 Single Glass Door Reach-In Merchandiser Refrigerator is a smooth and efficient solution for displaying beverages and other perishable items. With a width of 27 inches, a depth of 40 inches, and a height of 81.5 inches, it is designed to fit perfectly into retail spaces while providing wide storage in a single section. Its swing door style allows for easy access, while the black exterior finish offers a modern aesthetic that complements any environment.\nPowered by a 1/5 HP compressor, this refrigerator features a self-contained, rear-mounted refrigeration system that enhances efficiency and makes maintenance straightforward. The unit is designed to maintain optimal temperatures for stored products, ensuring freshness and quality for customers. This combination of functionality and design makes the Arctic Air ARGDM23 an excellent choice for businesses looking to enhance their merchandising capabilities.\nDimensions\nWidth:  27 Inches\nDepth: 40 Inches\nHeight: 81.5 Inches', '<li>The Arctic Air ARGDM23 measures 27 inches in width, 40 inches in depth, and 81.5 inches in height, making it an ideal size for maximizing product display without taking up excessive floor space.<br></li><li>This refrigerator features a swing door design, allowing easy access to the interior while providing a clear view of the products displayed, enhancing customer engagement.<br></li><li>Finished in a rich black exterior, the ARGDM23 not only provides a modern aesthetic but also ensures durability and easy maintenance, fitting well in various retail environments.<br></li><li>Operates with a 1/5 HP compressor, offering efficient cooling performance while maintaining energy efficiency, ideal for busy commercial settings.<br></li><li>Designed as a 1-section unit, this refrigerator allows for organized storage of products, making it easy to keep items visible and accessible for customers and staff alike.<br></li><li>It features a self-contained, rear-mounted refrigeration system, which simplifies installation and maintenance while ensuring effective cooling throughout the unit.<br></li><li>The rear-mounted design optimizes airflow, ensuring even temperature distribution and enhancing the longevity of stored products.</li>'),
('ar', 1681, 'Arctic Air AGR49 54 Double Glass Door Reach-In Refrigerator', 'The Arctic Air AGR49 54 Double Glass Door Reach-In Refrigerator is meticulously designed for high performance and convenience in commercial settings, featuring dimensions of 54 inches in width, 31 1/4 inches in depth, and 83 1/4 inches in height. This refrigerator is equipped with an electronic thermostat alongside an external digital LED display, allowing for accurate temperature control and easy visibility. Inside, the cabinet showcases a bright stainless liner and a full high-grade stainless steel floor with coved corners for enhanced hygiene and maintenance. Each door includes three adjustable, heavy-duty epoxy-coated wire shelves, providing flexible storage solutions.\nThe unit employs a self-contained capillary tube system that utilizes environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerants, promoting sustainability while ensuring efficient cooling. Its exterior construction consists of full stainless steel for durability, and the built-in condensate heating element in the condensate pan facilitates efficient evaporation of excess water. The bottom-mounted compressor is strategically placed to operate in the coolest area of the kitchen, and the front-accessible, bottom-mounted condensing unit is mounted on a slide-out rack for simplified maintenance. Additional features include self-closing lockable doors, removable magnetic door gaskets for easy cleaning, and larger fan motors and blades that enhance airflow for faster recovery times. The refrigerator is equipped with easy-to-mount casters, including two lockable options, making it mobile. It meets NSF Standard 7 requirements for open food storage and is backed by a full two-year parts and labor warranty, along with a five-year compressor warranty, ensuring reliable operation.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth:  54 Inches\nDepth: 31 1/4 Inches\nHeight:  83 1/4 Inches\nWeight: 500 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air AGR49 measures 54 inches in width, 31 1/4 inches in depth, and 83 1/4 inches in height, providing a spacious interior that can accommodate a substantial amount of food and beverage products.<br></li><li>Has a shipping weight of 500 lbs, indicating a solid construction that is designed for durability in commercial environments.<br></li><li>Operating at 8 Amps and 115 Volts, the AGR49 is compatible with standard electrical systems, ensuring easy installation and operation in a variety of settings.<br></li><li>Maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, ideal for safely storing perishable items while ensuring they remain fresh and ready for service.<br></li><li>Featuring a bottom-mounted compressor design, the unit enhances efficiency and reduces noise levels, making it suitable for front-of-house applications while simplifying maintenance access.<br></li><li>Equipped with 2 swing glass doors, allowing for easy visibility and access to stored items, improving efficiency during busy service periods.<br></li><li>With a generous capacity of 49 cu. ft., the AGR49 provides wide storage space, accommodating various products and making it an excellent choice for restaurants, cafes, and catering services.<br></li><li>Equipped with 6 shelves, allowing for versatile storage options and efficient organization of food and beverage items.<br></li><li>Crafted from all stainless steel, the AGR49 offers a professional appearance while ensuring durability and ease of cleaning, making it a reliable addition to any kitchen.<br></li><li>Designed as a freestanding unit, the AGR49 can be placed conveniently within the kitchen layout, providing flexibility in design while accommodating various operational needs.</li>'),
('ar', 1682, 'Arctic Air AGR23 27 Single Commercial Glass Door Reach-In Refrigerator', 'The Arctic Air AGR23 27 Single Commercial Glass Door Reach-In Refrigerator is a compact and powerful refrigeration solution, ideal for commercial kitchens. With its electronic thermostat and external digital LED display, it ensures precise temperature control, while the bright stainless-steel interior and coved corner design enhance cleanliness and durability. Inside, it comes equipped with three adjustable, heavy-duty epoxy-coated wire shelves, allowing for flexible organization of contents. The self-contained capillary tube system uses CFC-free refrigerant, making it an eco-friendly choice.\nThis refrigerator features a bottom-mounted compressor, designed for efficiency by utilizing the cooler kitchen area. It also has a condensate heating element built into the pan for improved evaporation of excess water, and the bottom-mounted condensing unit is accessible via a slide-out rack, simplifying maintenance. Additional user-friendly features include self-closing lockable doors, easy-to-remove magnetic door gaskets, and large fan motors for superior airflow. It is mounted on casters, two of which are lockable for stability, and is NSF Standard 7 certified for safe food storage.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth:  27 Inches\nDepth: 31 1/4 Inches\nHeight:  83 1/4 Inches\nWeight: 330 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air AGR23 is 27 inches wide, 31 1/4 inches deep, and 83 1/4 inches high, providing a compact and spacious refrigeration solution for commercial kitchens.<br></li><li>Has a shipping weight of 330 lbs, which reflects its solid and durable construction, built to withstand the rigors of a busy kitchen environment.<br></li><li>Operating at 2.6 Amps, 115 Volts, and 60 Hertz in a 1-phase configuration, the AGR23 is designed for energy-efficient performance while being compatible with standard commercial electrical setups.<br></li><li>Maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, ensuring optimal preservation of food and beverages, and keeping items fresh and ready for service.<br></li><li>Bottom-mounted compressor enhances both energy efficiency and ease of access for maintenance while helping to keep the refrigerator cool in high-heat environments.<br></li><li>Features a single swing glass door, allowing for easy visibility of contents and quick access to stored items, enhancing operational efficiency.<br></li><li>With a capacity of 23 cu. ft., the AGR23 offers wide storage space, making it ideal for small to medium-sized operations, while maintaining a compact footprint.<br></li><li>Comes with 3 adjustable shelves, providing versatile storage options for organizing various types of food and beverage products within the refrigerator.<br></li><li>Featuring all stainless steel construction, the AGR23 is not only durable but also easy to clean, making it an attractive and functional addition to any commercial kitchen.<br></li><li>Freestanding with right-hinged doors and does not have Dutch half doors. It includes casters for easy mobility and operates with an R-290 refrigerant, which is environmentally friendly. Backed by a full two-year parts and labor warranty, and a five-year compressor warranty, it provides peace of mind for long-term use.</li>'),
('ar', 1683, 'Arctic Air AWR25 30.75 Single Door Reach-In Refrigerator in White', 'The Arctic Air AWR25 30.75 Single Door Reach-In Refrigerator in White is an efficient, commercial-grade unit, designed for temperature accuracy and durability. It features an electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display, allowing precise temperature control and easy monitoring. The interior has bright white ABS sidewalls paired with a high-grade stainless steel floor with coved corners for easy cleaning. Storage flexibility is provided through three adjustable, heavy-duty epoxy-coated wire shelves, while the self-contained capillary tube system uses environmentally friendly CFC-free refrigerant, aligning with modern sustainability standards.\nThe refrigerator\'s exterior is constructed from white epoxy-coated steel for a clean, professional look, with a bottom-mounted compressor for optimal efficiency in cooler areas of the kitchen. The condensate heating element built into the pan ensures effective water evaporation. It includes a field-reversible, lockable door with a foamed-in-place recessed handle for convenience and security. For smooth mobility, it is equipped with easy-to-mount casters (two lockable). Additionally, larger fan motors and blades increase airflow, speeding up temperature recovery. The refrigerator is NSF Standard 7 certified, ensuring it meets food storage safety requirements.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 30 3/4  Inches\nDepth: 29  Inches\nHeight: 78  Inches\nWeight: 310 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air AWR25 measures 30 3/4 inches wide, 29 inches deep, and 78 inches high, providing a compact and spacious design for commercial refrigeration needs.<br></li><li>With a shipping weight of 310 lbs, it is built to be durable and strong, suitable for various commercial kitchen environments.<br></li><li>Runs on 3 Amps, 115 Volts, and 60 Hertz in a 1-phase configuration, making it efficient and compatible with standard commercial electrical setups.<br></li><li>Offering a generous 25 cu. ft. of internal storage, the AWR25 provides plenty of space for storing refrigerated items, ideal for mid-size commercial kitchens or restaurants.<br></li><li>Bottom-mounted compressor ensures easy access for maintenance and offers improved cooling efficiency by keeping the compressor away from rising kitchen heat.<br></li><li>Features a single swing solid door, which is right-hinged, ensuring easy access while maintaining the internal temperature efficiently.<br></li><li>Capable of maintaining temperatures between 33 - 41 degrees F, ensuring consistent cooling for perishable goods, and meeting food safety standards.<br></li><li>Equipped with 3 adjustable shelves, the AWR25 offers flexibility in storage organization, allowing you to optimize space according to your needs.<br></li><li>Freestanding unit is easy to install and maneuver thanks to its casters, allowing for mobility while being solid enough for long-term use. The painted steel exterior ensures durability and ease of maintenance.<br></li><li>Uses R-290 refrigerant and is powered by a 1/4 HP compressor for reliable cooling performance. It includes a NEMA 5-15P plug type for standard commercial outlets. The AWR25 comes with full one-year parts and labor warranty along with a five-year compressor warranty, providing peace of mind for long-term operation.</li>'),
('ar', 1684, 'Arctic Air AR23 26.75 Commercial Single Door Reach-In Stainless Steel Refrigerator', 'The Arctic Air AR23 26.75 Commercial Single Door Reach-In Stainless Steel Refrigerator is built for efficiency and durability, offering a range of advanced features. The electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display ensures precise temperature control. The interior features a bright white epoxy-coated aluminum liner with a high-grade stainless steel floor and coved corners for easy cleaning and durability. The unit includes three adjustable heavy-duty epoxy-coated wire shelves to accommodate various storage needs, while the self-contained capillary tube system uses CFC-free refrigerant, making it environmentally friendly.\nThe refrigerator’s stainless steel front and sides provide a sleek, durable exterior. Its bottom-mounted compressor operates in the coolest area of the kitchen for greater efficiency, and the front-accessible condensing unit is mounted on a slide-out rack for easy maintenance. The self-closing door, which remains open at 90 degrees, features a magnetic gasket that is removable and replaceable without tools. Additional features include field-reversible lockable doors, larger fan motors and blades for improved airflow, and easy-to-mount casters (two lockable). Tested to NSF Standard 7 requirements for safe food storage, it measures 26 3/4 inches in width, 32 3/4 inches in depth, and 82 3/4 inches in height.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 26 3/4  Inches\nDepth: 32 3/4 Inches\nHeight: 82 3/4  Inches\nWeight: 320 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air AR23 measures 26 3/4 inches wide, 32 3/4 inches deep, and 82 3/4 inches high, providing a compact and spacious refrigeration solution for commercial kitchens.<br></li><li>Weighing in at 320 lbs, this refrigerator is solidly built, ensuring durability and the ability to withstand the heavy use typical in busy commercial environments.<br></li><li>Runs on 6 Amps, 115 Volts, and 60 Hertz, with a 1-phase electrical configuration, making it compatible with standard commercial power setups.<br></li><li>Has a total storage capacity of 23 cu. ft., offering wide space for storing refrigerated goods in an organized and accessible manner.<br></li><li>Bottom-mounted compressor aids in easy access for maintenance and improved efficiency. The unit is equipped with casters, providing easy mobility for cleaning or rearranging kitchen layouts.<br></li><li>Features a swing-style solid door with a right-hinged design. This door type ensures a tight seal, helping to maintain consistent internal temperatures.<br></li><li>Maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, which is ideal for safely storing perishable food items and beverages.<br></li><li>Inside the item, there are 3 adjustable shelves, allowing users to customize the storage layout to accommodate items of various sizes, optimizing space.<br></li><li>Designed as a freestanding unit, the refrigerator is constructed from stainless steel and aluminum, ensuring long-lasting durability and easy cleaning in a busy kitchen environment.<br></li><li>Powered by a 3/8 HP compressor and uses R-290 refrigerant. It comes with a NEMA 5-15P plug for a straightforward electrical connection. Additionally, the unit is backed by full two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year compressor warranty, ensuring long-term reliability.</li>'),
('ar', 1685, 'Arctic Air AR23 26.75 Commercial Single Door Reach-In Stainless Steel Refrigerator', 'The Arctic Air AR23 26.75 Commercial Single Door Reach-In Stainless Steel Refrigerator is built for efficiency and durability, offering a range of advanced features. The electronic thermostat with an external digital LED display ensures precise temperature control. The interior features a bright white epoxy-coated aluminum liner with a high-grade stainless steel floor and coved corners for easy cleaning and durability. The unit includes three adjustable heavy-duty epoxy-coated wire shelves to accommodate various storage needs, while the self-contained capillary tube system uses CFC-free refrigerant, making it environmentally friendly.\nThe refrigerator’s stainless steel front and sides provide a sleek, durable exterior. Its bottom-mounted compressor operates in the coolest area of the kitchen for greater efficiency, and the front-accessible condensing unit is mounted on a slide-out rack for easy maintenance. The self-closing door, which remains open at 90 degrees, features a magnetic gasket that is removable and replaceable without tools. Additional features include field-reversible lockable doors, larger fan motors and blades for improved airflow, and easy-to-mount casters (two lockable). Tested to NSF Standard 7 requirements for safe food storage, it measures 26 3/4 inches in width, 32 3/4 inches in depth, and 82 3/4 inches in height.\nWeight & Dimensions\nWidth: 26 3/4  Inches\nDepth: 32 3/4 Inches\nHeight: 82 3/4  Inches\nWeight: 320 lb.', '<li>The Arctic Air AR23 measures 26 3/4 inches wide, 32 3/4 inches deep, and 82 3/4 inches high, providing a compact and spacious refrigeration solution for commercial kitchens.<br></li><li>Weighing in at 320 lbs, this refrigerator is solidly built, ensuring durability and the ability to withstand the heavy use typical in busy commercial environments.<br></li><li>Runs on 6 Amps, 115 Volts, and 60 Hertz, with a 1-phase electrical configuration, making it compatible with standard commercial power setups.<br></li><li>Has a total storage capacity of 23 cu. ft., offering wide space for storing refrigerated goods in an organized and accessible manner.<br></li><li>Bottom-mounted compressor aids in easy access for maintenance and improved efficiency. The unit is equipped with casters, providing easy mobility for cleaning or rearranging kitchen layouts.<br></li><li>Features a swing-style solid door with a right-hinged design. This door type ensures a tight seal, helping to maintain consistent internal temperatures.<br></li><li>Maintains a temperature range of 33 to 41 degrees F, which is ideal for safely storing perishable food items and beverages.<br></li><li>Inside the item, there are 3 adjustable shelves, allowing users to customize the storage layout to accommodate items of various sizes, optimizing space.<br></li><li>Designed as a freestanding unit, the refrigerator is constructed from stainless steel and aluminum, ensuring long-lasting durability and easy cleaning in a busy kitchen environment.<br></li><li>Powered by a 3/8 HP compressor and uses R-290 refrigerant. It comes with a NEMA 5-15P plug for a straightforward electrical connection. Additionally, the unit is backed by full two-year parts and labor warranty and a five-year compressor warranty, ensuring long-term reliability.</li>'),
