('ar', 1689, 'Atosa ATRC-36 36\" Gas Countertop Radiant Broiler  105,000 BTU', '<p>The Atosa ATRC-36 36\" Gas Countertop Radiant Broiler is designed for high-performance cooking in commercial kitchens, offering a robust heating capability with its 105,000 BTU burner system. This broiler is ideal for grilling and searing a variety of foods quickly and efficiently. It features a durable stainless steel construction both on the exterior and interior, ensuring longevity and ease of cleaning, which is crucial in busy kitchen environments.</p>\n<p>Equipped with individual heavy-duty cast iron grates, the Atosa ATRC-36 provides even heat distribution and excellent heat retention, allowing chefs to achieve consistent cooking results across the entire cooking surface. The broiler includes adjustable multi-level top grates, giving flexibility in cooking different types of food at various heat intensities. Designed for reliability and efficiency, this countertop unit is suitable for restaurants, catering services, and other food establishments that require a powerful and versatile cooking appliance to handle high-volume cooking demands.</p>', 'ul>\n<li>Equipped with a powerful 105,000 BTU burner system, ideal for quick heating and high-temperature cooking applications such as searing and grilling.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Made with durable stainless steel for both exterior and interior surfaces, ensuring longevity and ease of cleaning in commercial kitchen environments.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Features individual, heavy-duty cast iron grates that provide even heat distribution and excellent heat retention, promoting consistent cooking results.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Includes adjustable multi-level top grates, allowing for flexible cooking configurations to accommodate different types of food and cooking preferences.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Designed for versatility, suitable for restaurants, catering services, and other food establishments needing a reliable and efficient countertop broiler to handle high-volume cooking demands.</li>\n</ul>'),
('ar', 1690, 'Atosa ATCB-24 24\" Heavy Duty Countertop Charbroiler 70,000 BTU', '<p>The Atosa ATCB-24 24\" Heavy Duty Countertop Charbroiler is designed to deliver high-performance grilling capabilities in commercial kitchen settings. With a robust 70,000 BTU output spread across its cooking surface, this charbroiler provides intense heat for searing and grilling various types of food quickly and efficiently. The unit features heavy-duty cast iron grates that ensure even heat distribution and retention, crucial for achieving consistent cooking results and creating distinct grill marks on meats, vegetables, and seafood.</p>\n<p>Constructed with a durable stainless steel body, the ATCB-24 is built to withstand the rigors of daily use while maintaining a professional appearance. Stainless steel not only enhances durability but also facilitates easy cleaning, essential for maintaining hygiene standards in busy kitchens. The charbroiler includes independent manual controls for each burner, allowing chefs to adjust heat levels precisely to meet different cooking needs. Its compact 24-inch width makes it suitable for countertops with limited space, providing a versatile grilling solution for restaurants, cafes, and other foodservice establishments aiming to enhance their menu offerings with grilled specialties.</p>', '<ul>\n<li>Robust 70,000 BTU output for efficient grilling and searing.</li>\n<li>Heavy-duty cast iron grates ensure even heat distribution and retention.</li>\n<li>Durable stainless steel construction for longevity and easy cleaning.</li>\n<li>Compact 24-inch width ideal for kitchens with limited space.</li>\n<li>Independent manual controls for precise heat adjustment per burner.</li>\n</ul>'),
('ar', 1691, 'Atosa ACHP-2 12\" Heavy Duty Countertop Range, Hot Plate with 2 Burners 64,000 BTU', '<p>The Atosa ACHP-2 12\" Heavy Duty Countertop Range or Hot Plate is designed to provide versatile cooking capabilities in compact spaces. With two burners delivering a total of 64,000 BTUs, this countertop range offers sufficient power for various cooking tasks, from boiling and simmering to sautÃ©ing and searing. Its durable stainless steel construction ensures durability and ease of cleaning, making it suitable for high-volume use in commercial kitchens, food trucks, or small restaurants.</p>\n<p>Each burner on the ACHP-2 features individual manual controls, allowing chefs to adjust heat levels independently for precise cooking control. The heavy-duty cast iron grates provide a stable cooking surface that retains heat effectively, ensuring consistent cooking results. Its compact 12-inch width makes it easy to place on countertops without occupying excessive space, making it ideal for establishments where space is limited but performance is crucial. Whether used as a primary cooking appliance or as an additional burner for busy kitchens, the Atosa ACHP-2 combines reliability, efficiency, and compact design to meet the demands of professional chefs and foodservice operators.</p>', '<ul>\n<li>2 Burners Each burner has its own manual control for precise heat adjustment tailored to specific cooking needs.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Constructed with stainless steel inside and out, ensuring durability, easy cleaning, and a professional appearance.<br>\n</li>\n<li>The full-width crumb tray collects debris, promoting cleanliness and simplifying maintenance in busy kitchen environments.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Powerful 32,000 BTU burners deliver high heat output, ideal for a variety of cooking tasks and efficient performance.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Designed with standing pilot lights, these heavy-duty burners ensure quick ignition and consistent heat for cooking.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Durable cast iron top grates provide excellent heat retention and even cooking, perfect for high-demand usage.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Independent controls for each burner enhance flexibility, allowing simultaneous cooking at different temperatures.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Standard stainless steel legs provide stability and durability, ensuring secure placement in commercial kitchen settings.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Features a standard 3/4â€³ NPT rear gas connection and regulator for easy installation and reliable gas flow.</li>\n</ul>'),
('ar', 1692, 'Atosa ATFS-40-LP 40 lb, CookRite Fryer Liquid Propane Gas Floor Model', '<p>The Atosa ATFS-40 Gas Floor Fryer is designed for commercial kitchens seeking efficiency and reliability in frying operations. With a capacity of 40 lbs, it\'s well-suited for medium to high-volume frying applications, making it ideal for restaurants, diners, and other food service establishments. This fryer features a durable stainless steel construction that not only enhances its longevity but also simplifies cleaning and maintenance, crucial in busy kitchen environments where hygiene and efficiency are paramount.</p>\n<p>Equipped with powerful 102,000 BTU burners, the ATFS-40 ensures quick heat-up times and efficient frying, enabling chefs to maintain consistent cooking temperatures for crispy and delicious results. The fryer includes two nickel-plated fry baskets with ergonomic handles, facilitating safe and convenient frying operations. Additionally, it features independent manual controls for each fryer tank, offering flexibility in managing different types of fried foods simultaneously. Overall, the Atosa ATFS-40 Gas Floor Fryer combines robust performance, user-friendly design, and durable construction to meet the demands of commercial frying applications. </p>', '<ul>\n<li>Holds up to 40 lbs of oil, suitable for medium to high-volume frying needs.<br>\n</li>\n<li>102,000 BTU total output ensures rapid heat-up and efficient frying.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Durable and easy to clean, enhances longevity and maintains hygiene standards.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Allows for simultaneous frying of different foods with independent manual controls.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Includes two nickel-plated fry baskets with ergonomic handles for safe handling and operation.</li>\n</ul>'),
('ar', 1693, 'Atosa ATFS-50-NG 50 lb CookRite Fryer Natural Gas Floor Model', '<p>Standing out for its ability to tackle high-volume food production with ease, the Atosa ATFS-50 Gas Floor Fryer is a workhorse ideally suited for restaurants, cafes, and other demanding commercial kitchens. Its generous 50-lb capacity oil tank allows you to confidently fry large batches of food, whether it\'s golden french fries, crispy chicken wings, or any other deep-fried menu item your customers crave. The Atosa ATFS-50 is crafted from durable, corrosion-resistant stainless steel, guaranteeing longevity and simplifying post-service cleaning routines for your busy kitchen staff.</p>\n<p>Ensuring optimal frying performance, the ATFS-50 incorporates three powerful gas burners with standing pilots for rapid ignition and consistent heat distribution throughout the cooking process. A high-precision thermostat affords you precise control over oil temperatures between 200Â°F and 400Â°F, essential for achieving perfectly cooked and consistently crisp results. An innovative oil cooling zone integrated within the tank astutely captures food particles, extending the lifespan of your cooking oil and reducing waste for overall operational cost-effectiveness. For the safety of your staff, the Atosa ATFS-50 comes equipped with a safety valve and automatic voltage stabilization. An additional safety feature includes a self-resetting high-temperature limiting device, providing peace of mind in even the most fast-paced kitchen environments.</p>', '<ul>\n<li>The 50-lb capacity oil tank allows for frying large batches of food, perfect for busy restaurants and cafes.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Made entirely from stainless steel, this fryer ensures longevity and simplifies cleaning.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Three gas burners with standing pilots provide quick ignition and even heat distribution for consistent results.<br>\n</li>\n<li>A high-precision thermostat allows you to control oil temperatures between 200Â°F and 400Â°F for perfectly cooked food.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Includes a safety valve, automatic voltage stabilization, and a self-resetting high-temperature limiting device for safe operation.</li>\n</ul>'),
('ar', 1694, 'Atosa AGR-24G-LP 24\" CookRite Range Liquid Propane Gas', '<p>The Atosa AGR-24G 24\" Gas Range with Griddle Tops is a compact yet powerful cooking appliance designed for commercial kitchens seeking efficient and versatile cooking solutions. Built with robust stainless steel, this gas range ensures durability and ease of cleaning, essential for maintaining hygiene standards in busy environments. The unit features two burners and a centrally located griddle top, providing chefs with flexibility to simultaneously cook a variety of dishes such as meats, vegetables, and breakfast items like pancakes and eggs.</p>\n<p>Each burner and the griddle top on the Atosa AGR-24G are equipped with individual manual controls, allowing precise adjustment of heat levels tailored to different cooking requirements. This setup enhances operational efficiency, enabling chefs to manage multiple cooking tasks efficiently. The griddle top is made from durable steel and features a smooth cooking surface that distributes heat evenly, ensuring consistent results across the entire cooking area. Overall, the Atosa AGR-24G gas range with griddle tops combines compact design, durable construction, and versatile cooking capabilities to meet the demands of commercial kitchen environments effectively.</p>', '<ul>\n<li>Durable stainless steel body ensures longevity and easy cleaning, suitable for commercial kitchen use.<br>\n</li>\n<li>24-inch width makes efficient use of kitchen space while offering versatile cooking capabilities.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Equipped with two powerful gas burners, ideal for boiling, simmering, and sautÃ©ing various dishes simultaneously.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Features a centrally located griddle top for cooking items like pancakes, eggs, and meats with even heat distribution.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Burners and griddle top have independent manual controls for precise heat adjustments tailored to specific cooking needs.</li>\n</ul>'),
('ar', 1695, 'Atosa AGR-10B-LP 60\" CookRite Range Liquid Propane Gas, 10 Burners', '<p>The Atosa AGR-10B is a robust 60-inch gas range designed for high-performance cooking in commercial kitchens. Featuring 10 burners and a standard oven, this range offers ample cooking capacity to handle large volumes of food preparation efficiently. Each burner is equipped with heavy-duty cast iron grates that provide stability for pots and pans while ensuring even heat distribution. This setup is ideal for busy kitchens where simultaneous cooking of multiple dishes is necessary.</p>\n<p>Constructed from durable stainless steel, both the exterior and interior of the Atosa AGR-10B are designed to withstand the rigors of daily use in a commercial environment. Stainless steel is not only resistant to corrosion and easy to clean but also presents a sleek and professional appearance that complements any kitchen decor. The oven below the burners is spacious and equipped with a thermostat control for precise temperature regulation, allowing chefs to bake, roast, or broil with consistency. Overall, the Atosa AGR-10B combines durability, functionality, and efficiency, making it a reliable choice for restaurants, hotels, and other foodservice establishments seeking a versatile gas range for their kitchen operations.</p>', '<ul>\n<li>Provides ample cooking space and flexibility for preparing multiple dishes simultaneously, ideal for high-volume kitchens.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Each burner is equipped with sturdy cast iron grates that ensure stability for pots and pans while allowing for even heat distribution.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Both the exterior and interior are constructed from stainless steel, offering durability, resistance to corrosion, and easy cleaning.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Spacious oven below the burners equipped with a thermostat control for precise temperature regulation during baking, roasting, or broiling.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Simple and intuitive manual controls for each burner and the oven, allowing for easy operation and adjustment of cooking settings.</li>\n</ul>');
INSERT INTO `ec_products_translations` (`lang_code`, `ec_products_id`, `name`, `description`, `content`) VALUES
('ar', 1696, 'Atosa AGR-4B-NG 24\" CookRite Range Natural Gas, 4 Burners', '<p>The Atosa AGR-4B 24\" Gas Range with 4 Burners and Standard Oven is a compact yet powerful appliance designed for efficiency and versatility in commercial kitchens. This gas range features four high-performance burners, each capable of delivering substantial BTU output to meet various cooking needs. The burners are arranged on a 24-inch wide cooktop, offering enough space for multiple pots and pans while maximizing kitchen workspace. Each burner is equipped with a durable cast iron grate, ensuring long-lasting performance and excellent heat distribution for consistent cooking results.</p>\n<p>Below the cooktop, the Atosa AGR-4B boasts a spacious standard oven, enhancing its versatility. The oven is perfect for baking, roasting, and broiling, with adjustable racks that can accommodate different dish sizes and cooking requirements. Constructed with high-quality stainless steel, both the oven interior and the range exterior are designed for easy cleaning and maintenance. The stainless steel exterior not only ensures durability but also adds a sleek, professional look to any kitchen setting. Additionally, the oven features a precise thermostat for accurate temperature control, ensuring optimal cooking outcomes. This combination of powerful burners and a versatile oven makes the Atosa AGR-4B an essential addition to any commercial kitchen, capable of handling a wide range of culinary tasks efficiently.</p>', '<ul>\n<li>Equipped with four powerful burners, providing ample BTU output for a variety of cooking tasks, including boiling, sautÃ©ing, simmering, and frying.<br>\n</li>\n<li>The burners feature heavy-duty cast iron grates that ensure excellent heat retention and durability for consistent cooking performance.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Includes a standard oven beneath the cooktop, perfect for baking, roasting, and broiling. The oven comes with adjustable racks to accommodate different dish sizes and cooking needs.<br>\n</li>\n<li>The range is made from high-quality stainless steel, ensuring durability and longevity in demanding commercial kitchen environments. The stainless steel exterior and oven interior are designed for easy cleaning and maintenance.<br>\n</li>\n<li>The oven features a reliable thermostat, providing accurate and consistent temperature control for optimal cooking results.</li>\n</ul>'),
('ar', 1697, 'Atosa AOM-40B 39.6\" Open Air Merchandiser, Black Exterior, 20.6 Cu. Ft', '<p>The Atosa AOM-40B is a 39.6\" Open Air Merchandiser designed to provide an appealing and accessible display solution for refrigerated products. With its sleek black exterior, this merchandiser adds a modern touch to any retail space, enhancing the visual appeal of the products inside. It offers 20.6 cubic feet of storage capacity, making it ideal for showcasing a variety of items such as beverages, dairy products, and prepared foods. The open-air design not only facilitates easy access for customers but also encourages impulse purchases by providing a clear and unobstructed view of the merchandise.</p>\n<p>Equipped with advanced refrigeration technology, the AOM-40B ensures consistent and reliable temperature control to maintain the freshness and safety of the displayed products. Its energy-efficient components help reduce operating costs while maintaining optimal performance. The unit\'s durable construction is designed to withstand the demands of a busy retail environment, ensuring long-lasting use. Overall, the Atosa AOM-40B combines functionality, efficiency, and aesthetic appeal, making it a valuable addition to grocery stores, convenience stores, and other retail establishments.</p>', '<ul>\n<li>Offers 20.6 cubic feet of storage, providing ample space for displaying a variety of refrigerated products.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Facilitates easy access and enhances product visibility, encouraging impulse purchases and making it convenient for customers to browse and select items.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Ensures consistent and reliable temperature control, keeping products fresh and safe for consumption.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Adds a modern and sophisticated appearance to the display, enhancing the aesthetic appeal of the retail environment.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Designed with energy-efficient components to reduce operating costs while maintaining optimal performance, making it a cost-effective choice for retailers.</li>\n</ul>'),
('ar', 1698, 'Atosa ATHC-18P 25.1\" Heated Insulated Cabinet Holds 18 Pans', '<p>The Atosa ATHC-18P 25.1\" Heated Insulated Cabinet is a highly efficient solution for maintaining the warmth and quality of food in commercial kitchens. Designed to accommodate up to 18 pans, this heated cabinet is ideal for high-volume food service establishments such as restaurants, catering services, and banquet halls. The insulated design ensures consistent temperature retention, providing even heat distribution to keep dishes warm and ready for serving. This feature is crucial for maintaining the taste and texture of food, ensuring that customers receive meals at their optimal quality.</p>\n<p>Constructed from durable stainless steel, the Atosa ATHC-18P is built to withstand the rigors of daily use in busy kitchen environments. The robust design not only enhances the cabinet\'s longevity but also simplifies cleaning and maintenance, contributing to improved kitchen hygiene. Despite its high capacity, the cabinet maintains a compact footprint of 25.1 inches, making it a space-efficient addition to any kitchen setup. User-friendly controls allow for precise temperature adjustments, giving chefs the flexibility to store a variety of dishes at their ideal serving temperatures. Overall, the Atosa ATHC-18P combines practicality, durability, and efficiency, making it an essential piece of equipment for any professional kitchen.</p>', '<ul>\n<li>Designed to hold up to 18 pans, making it suitable for high-volume food service operations.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Ensures consistent and uniform temperature retention, preventing heat loss and maintaining food quality.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Features a robust stainless steel exterior and interior, enhancing durability and simplifying cleaning and maintenance.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Despite its high capacity, the cabinet has a compact width of 25.1 inches, making it space-efficient for various kitchen layouts.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Equipped with intuitive controls for precise temperature adjustments, allowing chefs to store different dishes at their optimal serving temperatures.</li>\n</ul>'),
('ar', 1702, 'Atosa ACHP-2 12 Heavy Duty Countertop Range, Hot Plate with 2 Burners 64,000 BTU', '<p>The Atosa ACHP-2 12 Heavy Duty Countertop Range or Hot Plate is designed to provide versatile cooking capabilities in compact spaces. With two burners delivering a total of 64,000 BTUs, this countertop range offers sufficient power for various cooking tasks, from boiling and simmering to sautÃ©ing and searing. Its durable stainless steel construction ensures durability and ease of cleaning, making it suitable for high-volume use in commercial kitchens, food trucks, or small restaurants.</p>\n<p>Each burner on the ACHP-2 features individual manual controls, allowing chefs to adjust heat levels independently for precise cooking control. The heavy-duty cast iron grates provide a stable cooking surface that retains heat effectively, ensuring consistent cooking results. Its compact 12-inch width makes it easy to place on countertops without occupying excessive space, making it ideal for establishments where space is limited but performance is crucial. Whether used as a primary cooking appliance or as an additional burner for busy kitchens, the Atosa ACHP-2 combines reliability, efficiency, and compact design to meet the demands of professional chefs and foodservice operators.</p>', '<ul>\n<li>2 Burners Each burner has its own manual control for precise heat adjustment tailored to specific cooking needs.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Constructed with stainless steel inside and out, ensuring durability, easy cleaning, and a professional appearance.<br>\n</li>\n<li>The full-width crumb tray collects debris, promoting cleanliness and simplifying maintenance in busy kitchen environments.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Powerful 32,000 BTU burners deliver high heat output, ideal for a variety of cooking tasks and efficient performance.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Designed with standing pilot lights, these heavy-duty burners ensure quick ignition and consistent heat for cooking.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Durable cast iron top grates provide excellent heat retention and even cooking, perfect for high-demand usage.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Independent controls for each burner enhance flexibility, allowing simultaneous cooking at different temperatures.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Standard stainless steel legs provide stability and durability, ensuring secure placement in commercial kitchen settings.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Features a standard 3/4â€³ NPT rear gas connection and regulator for easy installation and reliable gas flow.</li>\n</ul>'),
('ar', 1703, 'Atosa ACHP-2 12 Heavy Duty Countertop Range, Hot Plate with 2 Burners 64,000 BTU', '<p>The Atosa ACHP-2 12 Heavy Duty Countertop Range or Hot Plate is designed to provide versatile cooking capabilities in compact spaces. With two burners delivering a total of 64,000 BTUs, this countertop range offers sufficient power for various cooking tasks, from boiling and simmering to sautÃ©ing and searing. Its durable stainless steel construction ensures durability and ease of cleaning, making it suitable for high-volume use in commercial kitchens, food trucks, or small restaurants.</p>\n<p>Each burner on the ACHP-2 features individual manual controls, allowing chefs to adjust heat levels independently for precise cooking control. The heavy-duty cast iron grates provide a stable cooking surface that retains heat effectively, ensuring consistent cooking results. Its compact 12-inch width makes it easy to place on countertops without occupying excessive space, making it ideal for establishments where space is limited but performance is crucial. Whether used as a primary cooking appliance or as an additional burner for busy kitchens, the Atosa ACHP-2 combines reliability, efficiency, and compact design to meet the demands of professional chefs and foodservice operators.</p>', '<ul>\n<li>2 Burners Each burner has its own manual control for precise heat adjustment tailored to specific cooking needs.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Constructed with stainless steel inside and out, ensuring durability, easy cleaning, and a professional appearance.<br>\n</li>\n<li>The full-width crumb tray collects debris, promoting cleanliness and simplifying maintenance in busy kitchen environments.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Powerful 32,000 BTU burners deliver high heat output, ideal for a variety of cooking tasks and efficient performance.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Designed with standing pilot lights, these heavy-duty burners ensure quick ignition and consistent heat for cooking.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Durable cast iron top grates provide excellent heat retention and even cooking, perfect for high-demand usage.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Independent controls for each burner enhance flexibility, allowing simultaneous cooking at different temperatures.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Standard stainless steel legs provide stability and durability, ensuring secure placement in commercial kitchen settings.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Features a standard 3/4â€³ NPT rear gas connection and regulator for easy installation and reliable gas flow.</li>\n</ul>'),
('ar', 1710, 'Arctic Air 69436 Can Divider with Four Mounting Clips for AUB Models Only', 'The Arctic Air 69436 is a specialized can divider designed specifically for AUB models, offering enhanced organization and accessibility for canned goods. It contains one shelf along with four mounting clips, ensuring secure installation and stability. With a shipping weight of 6 lbs and a product weight of 6 lbs, it is lightweight and strong, making it a practical addition to your storage setup.\nCrafted to fit perfectly with the vertical divider system of AUB models, it optimizes space within refrigeration units, allowing for efficient storage and easy retrieval of cans. Its design promotes better organization, minimizing clutter and maximizing the use of vertical space. By incorporating this divider, users can streamline their food storage operations while maintaining a clean and professional appearance in their kitchens.\nWeight & Dimensions\nShipping Weight 6 lbs\nProduct Weight 6 lbs\n\n\n', '<li>Shipping weight of the can divider is 6 lbs, making it lightweight and easy to handle during transportation.<br></li><li>Poduct weight is also 6 lbs, ensuring that it is a compact and efficient addition to your refrigeration setup.<br></li><li>Set contains one shelf and four mounting clips, providing all necessary parts for installation and use.<br></li><li>Specifically designed to fit AUB models only, ensuring a perfect fit and optimal functionality.<br></li><li>Vertical divider design helps organize cans and other items efficiently, maximizing space within your refrigeration unit.<br></li><li></li>'),
