INSERT INTO `ec_product_categories_translations` (`lang_code`, `ec_product_categories_id`, `name`, `description`) VALUES
('ar', 39, 'asdas', '<p>asdasd</p>'),
('ar', 40, 'Amir Testing 123', '<p>This is testing&nbsp;</p>'),
('ar', 41, 'Boiling Top', NULL),
('ar', 42, 'Anas Test 2', '<p>Test</p>'),
('ar', 43, 'Arctic Air', '<p>Since 1995, Arctic Air has been producing quality, affordable refrigeration products to the commercial equipment market in the United States and Canada. Arctic Air is a division of Broich Enterprises, Inc. and was created as a quality, lower cost alternative to the standard commercial refrigeration products offered at the time. Since that time, Arctic Air products have come to be known as very reliable alternatives for many common commercial applications.</p><p>In 2012, Arctic Air products underwent a major design change by upgrading our product line from a white painted steel exterior to a much higher grade stainless steel exterior. In addition, product operation and performance has been vastly improved in order to better meet the demands of the commercial foodservice industry. Arctic Air is now able to offer a commercial product line with better recovery times, greater reliability, and easier maintenance/repair at a truly incredible price.</p><p>In order to ensure the reliable performance that commercial foodservice operators demand, our products are subject to numerous quality control inspections throughout the manufacturing process and all units are operated &amp; monitored for a minimum of 13 hours before being packaged and shipped.</p><p>We hope you like the new Arctic Air! Stainless Design. Stellar Performance. Superior Value. Things have never looked better.</p>'),
('ar', 44, 'artic air', NULL),
('ar', 45, 'Refrigeration', '<p>Introducing our commercial refrigeration solutions, made to suit all kinds of foodservice businesses. Whether you run a café, bakery, corner shop, hotel or restaurant, our commercial refrigeration options are here to help you win over your clients and succeed your business.</p><p>From keeping perishables fresh to displaying tempting treats, our products ensure your kitchen runs smoothly. We offer a wide range of refrigeration products, including ice machines, milk coolers, soft-serve ice cream machines, salad counter top prep units, and more! If you can think of it, we have it!</p><p>We also make an effort to carefully select brands that are not only reliable but also long-lasting for our clients. Brands like Ice-o-matic, Hoshizaki, Southbend, Arctic Air are some of our major suppliers. Dive into our diverse variety of modern and innovative designs to make your display impactful, preserve natural food flavors, keep everything cool and fresh while giving you maximum storage!<br>&nbsp;</p>'),
('ar', 46, 'Commercial Refrigerator', '<p>Enhance your business with our wide range of commercial refrigerators from top brands like Hoshizaki, Beverage Air, True, and more. Choose from single and double-door options, including space-efficient undercounter units and classic upright models, tailored to meet your specific requirements and budget. Ensure your ingredients stay fresh and your operations run seamlessly with our durable refrigerators and chillers. Explore our selection today to find the ideal refrigeration system for your kitchen!</p>'),
