ing popular. They reflect hotels\' commitment to sustainability and guest well-being.&nbsp;</span></p><h2 style=\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:var(--heading-color);font-family:var(--font-heading-family);font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:24px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:1.4;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\"><b style=\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:24px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong>The Secret Stories Behind Hotel Amenities</strong></span></b><span style=\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></h2><p style=\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit