(32, 'Top 6 Juicer Machines For Cafes And Restaurant', '', '<figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:1200/468;\" src=\"https://admin.horecastore.sa/storage/best-citrus-juicers-copy.webp\" alt=\"best-citrus-juicers-copy.webp\" width=\"1200\" height=\"468\"></figure><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Montserrat;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:inherit;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;\">Who would not like to start their day with a glass of fresh orange juice? But, those store-bought and preserved fruit juices are not as healthy and fresh as you might think of them. So, in this scenario, squeezing the oranges and getting the fresh juice full of vitamin C sounds like a better option.</span>&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Montserrat;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:inherit;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;\">Whether you have to squeeze a lemon for your recipe or need to juice a bag full of oranges, you must have a citrus juicer. But, choosing the best citrus juicer for your kitchen is a challenging task as not all the juicers are made the same. Worry not; we have got the solution to your problem!</span>&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Montserrat;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:inherit;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;\">Below you can find the 8 best citrus juicers of 2024. All of these are easier to use, cleanup, and assures reliable performance. So, what are you waiting for? Let’s get into the details!</span>&nbsp;</span></p><h2 style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:24px;font-style:normal;line-height:1.4;margin:0px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:24px;\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;\"><strong>8 Best Citrus Juicers of 2024</strong></span>&nbsp;</span></h2><h3 style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-style:normal;line-height:1.4;margin:0px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;\"><strong>1. Santos Classic Citrus Juicer SAN11</strong></span>&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;\"><strong><img style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:20px;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;height:auto;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;max-width:100%;padding:0px;\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0701/5802/5015/files/santos-aluminium-base-electric-130w-heavy-duty-classic-citrus-juicer-w23-x-h35-cm_14_98b40a22-849d-46d9-a413-38c10aed33c9_480x480.webp?v=1727076543\" alt=\"\" width=\"287\" height=\"287\" loading=\"lazy\"></strong></span>&nbsp;</span><br>&nbsp;</h3><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Montserrat;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:inherit;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\"><a style=\"color:rgb(20,101,55);font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;\" href=\"https://horecastore.ae/products/santos-classic-citrus-juicer-11\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><span style=\"color:rgb(20,101,55);\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;\">Santos Classic Citrus Juicer SAN11</span>&nbsp;</span></a><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;\"> juicer is easier to assemble, dissemble, clean, and use. With its wide mouth design, the users can get most juice out of the whole fruit and vegetables. It features a non-drip spout which removable and adjustable. The juicer assures you no uneven mixing, oxidation, or clogging.</span>&nbsp;</span></p><h4 style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:18px;font-style:normal;line-height:1.4;margin:0px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong>Features:</strong></h4><ul style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Montserrat;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:inherit;list-style:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\"><li style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;list-style:disc;margin-bottom:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;\">Removable bowl</span>&nbsp;</span></li><li style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;list-style:disc;margin-bottom:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding:0px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-heigh