\">In simple terms, cheese is a dairy product made from curdled milk. The process involves coagulating the milk, separating the curds (solid parts) from the whey (liquid parts), and then aging the curds to develop flavor and texture. It can be made from cow, goat, sheep, or even buffalo&nbsp;</span><a style=\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:var(--link-color);font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;touch-action:manipulation;transition:0.25s;vertical-align:baseline;\" href=\"https://horecastore.ae/collections/milk\" aria-describedby=\"a11y-new-window-external-message\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-href=\"https://horecastore.ae/collections/milk\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">milk</span></a><span style=\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">, and the variety is truly mind blowing.</span></p><h2 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:var(--font-heading-family