it;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Housekeeping plays an important role in guaranteeing guests\' satisfaction and loyalty in the world of hotel accommodations. It surpasses the achievement of cleanliness and directly touches on the hotel\'s reputation and performance. Well-maintained and clean rooms and facilities are required for an excellent guest experience. The good housekeeping makes sure that guests are satisfied, and feel secure, and valued customers who come back with repeat business and favorable remarks. Room cleanliness</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Montserrat;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-emoji:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-position:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:inherit;margin:0px 0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">to the systematic arrangement of public areas all show to what level the quality of service performed is. For that reason, top-tier housekeeping care transactions can not be disregarded since they are the driver of guest pleasure, loyalty, and the very success of the hotel management.&nbsp;</span></p><h2 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:var(--font-heading-family);font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:24px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-emoji:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-position:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.4;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\"><span style=\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong>Core Responsibilities of Hotel Housekeeping: &nbsp;</strong></span></span></h2><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Montserrat;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-emoji:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-position:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:inherit;margin:0px 0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">&nbsp;<img style=\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;height:auto;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;max-width:100%;padding:0px;vertical-align:middle;\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0701/5802/5015/files/Core_Responsibilities_of_Hotel_Housekeeping_89dd7fe1-132b-4aef-ae51-888add94920b_480x480.jpg?v=1713852577\" alt=\"\" width=\"361\" height=\"195\" loading=\"lazy\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0701/5802/5015/files/Core_Responsibilities_of_Hotel_Housekeeping_89dd7fe1-132b-4aef-ae51-888add94920b_480x480.jpg?v=1713852577\"></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Montserrat;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-emoji:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-position:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:inherit;margin:0px 0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Firstly, the cleaning of the room and the upkeep require completing several basic tasks in order to satisfy the customers. The first thing is to make and disinfect everything such as floor, furniture, and fixtures of course. Add new inventory to the room minus the buy-in for these basic amenities which include toiletries, and towels, among others. Make sure bed linens as well as&nbsp;</span><a style=\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:var(--link-color);font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;touch-action:manipulation;transition:0.25s;vertical-align:baseline;\" href=\"https://horecastore.ae/collections/pillows\" aria-describedby=\"a11y-new-window-external-message\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-href=\"https://horecastore.ae/collections/pillows\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">pillows</span></a><span style=\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">&nbsp;and&nbsp;</span><a style=\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:var(--link-color);font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;touch-action:manipulation;transition:0.25s;vertical-align:baseline;\" href=\"https://horecastore.ae/collections/bath-towel\" aria-describedby=\"a11y-new-window-external-message\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-href=\"https://horecastore.ae/collections/bath-towel\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">towels</span></a><span style=\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">&nbsp;among others are changed at regular intervals. Vacuum carpet, scrub floors, and wipe walls. Remove all trash bins. Look for any maintenance issues and tell your boss about them as soon as possible so that a solution is found.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Montserrat;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-emoji:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-position:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:inherit;margin:0px 0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Linen management, as well as laundry matters, they are the key components that ensure a high level of cleanliness in the hotel. Making sure that linen is clean and flows smoothly is a substantial factor for guest wellbeing. Repeated use, washing, drying, and ironing linens is needed, always. Be very attentive to detail to make sure they are without spots, stains, or any possible wear styling them appropriately or replacing them. Shaping of storage and handling of linens is another factor to be taken into consideration to improve the sustainability of linens\' cleanliness and quality.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Montserrat;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-emoji:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-position:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:inherit;margin:0px 0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Maintaining public areas like parks or streets is the responsibility of all citizens. Their tasks range from keeping the spaces tidy to ensuring the areas are well sorted. Predawn and end-of-day clean-up protocol along with regular sanitization of all public spaces, particularly in lobbies, corridors, and restrooms. Clean and rinse dust, and wash furniture and accessories. A stock of additional supplies is needed in the form of brochures and reading materials. Ensure the area is clean, promptly wiping any spills and other messes that might have occurred. Thus, guests will have a reason to come back to a clean, welcoming environment for more experiences.&nbsp;</span></p><h2 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:var(--font-heading-family);font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:24px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-emoji:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-position:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.4;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\"><span style=\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong>Housekeeping Department Structure&nbsp;</strong></span></span></h2><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Montserrat;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-emoji:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-position:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:inherit;margin:0px 0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Room Attendant functions as the backbone of the hotel with each role fulfilling its duty that promote efficiency and quality of service. The organizational structure with the roles occupied within the department must be understood well by management&nbsp;</span></p><h2 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:var(--font-heading-family);font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:24px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-emoji:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-position:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.4;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\"><span style=\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong>Hierarchical Structure:&nbsp;</strong></span></span></h2><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Montserrat;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-emoji:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-position:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:inherit;margin:0px 0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">At the top of the hierarchy is the Housekeeping Manager. Another important role in the hotel management hierarchy is that of the Director of Housekeeping, who has the responsibility of overseeing the entire housekeeping department. Their duties cover staffing, budgeting, and ensuring all areas are coordinated with the established standards. They link up with other units and draft guidelines to see that all is working well under the housekeeping unit.&nbsp;</span></p><h3 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:var(--font-heading-family);font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:20px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-emoji:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-position:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.4;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong>Assistant Housekeeping Manager&nbsp;</strong></span></span></h3><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Montserrat;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-emoji:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-position:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:inherit;margin:0px 0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Housekeeper\'s support in terms of scheduling, training, and supervision of the people, engaging the head of the department as a link between the housekeeper and the manager. Floor Supervisors&nbsp; Housekeeping supervises the operation of a squad of cleaners, which includes the process of keeping rooms and public areas immaculate. They check on dorms, give tasks, and address issues that arise throughout the night.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Montserrat;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-emoji:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-position:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:inherit;margin:0px 0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:14px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Room Attendants/Housekeepers who work in hotels can be involved with cleaning and preparing guestrooms. They change sheets and make up the beds, vacuum carpets, sweep the halls, clean the bathrooms, and restock the amenities that are ready for the next guest to stay.&nbsp;</span></p><h2 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:var(--font-heading-family);font-feature-settings:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-optical-sizing:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-size:24px;font-stretch:inherit;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-emoji:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-position:inherit;font-variation-settings:inherit;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.4;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:i