(88, 'True STA1H-2HS 27 1/2\" Spec Series Full Height Insulated Mobile Heated Cabinet with 3 Pan Capacity,Silver, 208-230v/1ph', '<p>The True STA1H-2HS is a full-height, mobile heated cabinet designed for efficient food holding and transport in commercial kitchens. Measuring 27 1/2 inches wide, this cabinet features a robust stainless steel exterior with a sleek silver finish, providing durability and ease of cleaning. It is equipped with full insulation to maintain consistent temperatures, ensuring that food stays hot and ready for service. The cabinet\'s design includes a capacity for up to three full-size pans, making it versatile for various food items. Powered by a 208-230V/1PH electrical system, the STA1H-2HS utilizes an advanced heating system to provide reliable heat distribution. The cabinet features a built-in thermostat and an adjustable temperature range to accommodate different food holding requirements. Its mobile design, supported by heavy-duty casters, allows for easy maneuverability in a busy kitchen environment. The cabinet is an ideal solution for keeping large quantities of food at the perfect serving temperature, enhancing efficiency and service quality in foodservice operations.</p>', '<ul><li>The cabinet is constructed with a stainless steel exterior and an aluminum interior, ensuring durability and ease of cleaning. It features high-density, CFC-free polyurethane insulation, which enhances thermal efficiency and maintains consistent temperatures.<br>&nbsp;</li><li>Equipped with a forced-air heating system, the cabinet provides even heat distribution to keep food at the desired temperature. The heating element is designed to maintain a consistent temperature range, ensuring food safety and quality.<br>&nbsp;</li><li>The cabinet has a three-pan capacity, which allows for the storage of large quantities of food. The interior can accommodate standard-sized pans, making it versatile for various foodservice needs.<br>&nbsp;</li><li>It includes heavy-duty casters, which facilitate easy movement and positioning within a commercial kitchen. The cabinet also features hinged doors with a full-height design, allowing easy access to the interior and efficient loading and unloading.<br>&nbsp;</li><li>Operating on a 208-230V, 1-phase electrical system, this heated cabinet is suitable for high-demand environments. It is designed to deliver reliable performance and consistent heating, making it ideal for maintaining food temperatures during service.</li></ul>', 'published', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, 0.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '2024-10-15 10:20:52', '2024-10-15 10:20:52', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1565, 18, NULL, 'pending', NULL, 0),
(89, 'Cadco VKII-220 VariKwik High Speed Countertop Convection Oven, 220v/1ph55515', '<p>The Cadco VKII-220 VariKwik High Speed Countertop Convection Oven is engineered for rapid cooking and versatile food preparation in commercial kitchens. With its innovative combination of conduction, convection, and infrared heating technologies, this oven can significantly reduce cooking times while delivering consistent results. Its spacious cooking chamber, measuring 14 3/4 inches wide, 14 1/4 inches deep, and 7 1/2 inches high, allows for various culinary applications, from baking to broiling. The independent door design ensures easy access and efficient operation, making it an excellent choice for busy food service environments. Built with a robust stainless steel construction, the VKII-220 not only looks sleek but is also durable and easy to maintain.</p>', '<h2><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul><li>High Speed Cooking: Utilizes conduction, convection, and infrared heating.</li><li>Spacious Cooking Chamber: Measures 14 3/4\"\" W x 14 1/4\"\" D x 7 1/2\"\" H.</li><li>Independent Door Design: Facilitates easy access and operation.</li><li>Powerful Output: 4,200 watts for efficient cooking performance.</li><li>Stainless Steel Construction: Ensures durability and ease of cleaning.</li><li>Energy Efficient: Operates on 220V, 60 Hz, 1-phase electrical supply.</li><li>Compact Footprint: Overall dimensions of 23 1/4\"\" W x 26 3/4\"\" D x 12 1/2\"\" H.</li><li>CrisPlate Size: Fits a 14\"\" W x 14\"\" D cooking surface.</li><li>One-Year Warranty: Covers parts and labor for peace of mind.</li><li>NEMA 5-15P Plug: Standard plug type for easy connection.</li></ul>', 'published', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, 0.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '2024-11-29 13:27:48', '2024-11-29 13:27:48', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1719, 18, NULL, 'pending', NULL, 0),
