(92, 'Midea 1025F0A 20.13\"  Commercial Microwave Oven with Manual Controls, Stainless Steel, 120v/1ph, 1000W, 0.9cu. ft.', NULL, NULL, 'published', '[\"https:\\/\\/testhssite.com\\/storage\\/products\\/1025F0A.jpg\"]', '1025F0A', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, 0.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 18, NULL, '2024-12-16 08:59:33', '2024-12-16 08:59:33', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":{\"title\":\"Document 2\",\"path\":\"products\\/documents\\/7PlTJTyWISMwumPLhLhrtv58zNTZaOgndaYxpj9D.pdf\"}}', '[]', NULL, NULL, 2475, 19, NULL, 'in-process', NULL, 0),
(93, 'The Menumaster RCS511TS microwave delivers 1100W power with a 34L capacity and durable stainless-steel designperfect for small to medium kitchens.', '<p>The Menumaster microwave RCS511DSE offers a spacious 34L capacity with external dimensions of 352(H) x 559(W) x 483(D) mm and an internal cooking area of 216(H) x 368(W) x 381(D) mm, providing ample space for large, bulky loads, allowing you to cook more at once and save time. Made with durable stainless steel, this microwave operates with a power output of 1.55 kW, 230/240V, and 13A, and weighs 19 kg. The easy-to-clean, removable filters come with cleaning reminders to maintain peak efficiency, while the easy-open door provides simple and convenient access to food. The intuitive dial control makes it user-friendly for quick operation, and its stackable design helps maximize output without taking up additional workspace, with the stacking kit included. Built for long-lasting operation, this microwave is constructed with heavy-duty materials to withstand the demands of busy kitchens.12345</p>', '<ul><li>34L Capacity: Ideal for cooking large, bulky loads to save time.&nbsp;</li><li>Compact Size: External dimensions of 352(H) x 559(W) x 483(D) mm with a cooking area of 216(H) x 368(W) x 381(D) mm.&nbsp;</li><li>1.55 kW Power Output: Efficient cooking with 230/240V, 13A power. Durable Stainless Steel: Long-lasting and easy to clean.&nbsp;</li><li>Removable Filters: Includes cleaning reminders for efficient performance.&nbsp;</li><li>User-Friendly Dial Control: Easy to operate for quick cooking.&nbsp;</li><li>Stackable Design: Saves space and maximizes kitchen output with the stacking kit included.</li></ul>', 'published', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, 0.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 12, NULL, '2024-12-30 14:22:09', '2024-12-30 14:22:09', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2477, 18, NULL, 'pending', NULL, 0),
